M32 32 bits","Microcontrôleurs STM8 8 bits","MOSFETs de puissance","Régulateurs de tension linéaires","Amplificateurs opérationnels"],"de":["Mikrocontroller STM32 mit 32 Bit","Mikrocontroller STM8 mit 8 Bit","MOSFETs mit hoher Leistung","Lineare Spannungsregler","Operationsverstärker"],"pt":["Microcontroladores STM32 de 32 bits","Microcontroladores STM8 de 8 bits","MOSFETs de potência","Reguladores de tensão lineares L78/L79","Op-amps analógicos","Componentes para aplicações industriais e automotivas"],"ru":["32-разрядные микроконтроллеры STM32","8-разрядные микроконтроллеры STM8","МOSFETы мощности","Линейные стабилизаторы напряжения L78/L79","Аналоговые операционные усилители","Компоненты для промышленных и автомобильных приложений"],"ar":["ميكروكونترولر STM32 بت سعة 32","ميكروكونترولر STM8 بت سعة 8","موسفتات القدرة","مراقبات الجهد الخطية L78/L79","مضخمات تشغيلية مطابقة","مكونات للتطبيقات الصناعية والسيارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["STMicroelectronics","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","运算放大器","半导体制造商"],"ja":["STMicroelectronics","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","オペアンプ","半導体メーカー"],"ko":["STMicroelectronics","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","연산 증폭기","반도체 제조업체"],"es":["STMicroelectronics","microcontroladores","MOSFETs","reguladores de voltaje","amplificadores operacionales","componentes electrónicos","electrónica de potencia"],"fr":["STMicroelectronics","microcontrôleurs","MOSFETs","régulateurs de tension","amplificateurs opérationnels","composants électroniques","électronique de puissance"],"de":["STMicroelectronics","Mikrocontroller","MOSFETs","Spannungsregler","Operationsverstärker","elektronische Komponenten","Leistungselektronik"],"pt":["STMicroelectronics","microcontroladores","MOSFETs","reguladores de tensão","op-amps","componentes eletrônicos","aplicações industriais","aplicações automotivas","STM32","STM8"],"ru":["STMicroelectronics","микроконтроллеры","MOSFET","стабилизаторы напряжения","операционные усилители","электронные компоненты","промышленные применения","автомобильные применения","STM32","STM8"],"ar":["ستايميكروإلكترونيكس","ميكروكونترولر","موسفت","مراقب الجهد","مضخم تشغيلي","مكونات إلكترونية","تطبيقات صناعية","تطبيقات سيارات","STM32","STM8"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.394Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"st","description":"STMicroelectronics MPN encoding patterns, suffix decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, or L78/L79 regulators.","bodyPreview":"# STMicroelectronics (ST) Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Product Families\n\nSTMicroelectronics produces a wide range of components:\n- **STM32** - 32-bit ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers\n- **STM8** - 8-bit microcontrollers\n- **ST MOSFETs** - Power transistors (STF, STP, STD, STB, STW)\n- **L78/L79** - Linear voltage regulators\n- **Op-amps** - Various analog ICs\n\n---\n\n## STM32 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### MPN Structure\n\n```\nSTM32 F 1 03 C 8 T 6\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ │\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ └── Temperature range (6 =","body":"# STMicroelectronics (ST) Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Product Families\n\nSTMicroelectronics produces a wide range of components:\n- **STM32** - 32-bit ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers\n- **STM8** - 8-bit microcontrollers\n- **ST MOSFETs** - Power transistors (STF, STP, STD, STB, STW)\n- **L78/L79** - Linear voltage regulators\n- **Op-amps** - Various analog ICs\n\n---\n\n## STM32 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### MPN Structure\n\n```\nSTM32 F 1 03 C 8 T 6\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ │\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ └── Temperature range (6 = -40 to 85°C)\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ └── Package (T = LQFP)\n  │   │ │  │ │ └── Flash size (8 = 64KB)\n  │   │ │  │ └── Pin count (C = 48 pins)\n  │   │ │  └── Line (03 = access line)\n  │   │ └── Core (1 = Cortex-M3)\n  │   └── Type (F = Mainstream)\n  └── Family (STM32)\n```\n\n### Type Letters (after STM32)\n\n| Letter | Type | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| F | Mainstream | General purpose, good balance |\n| L | Low-power | Ultra-low-power modes |\n| H | High-performance | High clock speeds, more features |\n| G | General-purpose | Newer mainstream series |\n| W | Wireless | Integrated radio (BLE, LoRa) |\n| U | Ultra-low-power | Next-gen low-power |\n\n### Core Digit\n\n| Digit | Core | Notes |\n|-------|------|-------|\n| 0 | Cortex-M0/M0+ | Entry level |\n| 1 | Cortex-M3 | Mainstream |\n| 2 | Cortex-M3 | Performance |\n| 3 | Cortex-M4 | DSP instructions |\n| 4 | Cortex-M4 | With FPU |\n| 7 | Cortex-M7 | High performance |\n\n### Pin Count Codes\n\n| Code | Pins | Notes |\n|------|------|-------|\n| F | 20 | Smallest |\n| G | 28 | |\n| K | 32 | |\n| T | 36 | |\n| S | 44 | |\n| C | 48 | Common |\n| R | 64-66 | Popular |\n| V | 100 | |\n| Z | 144 | |\n| I | 176 | Largest |\n\n### Flash Size Codes\n\n| Code | Size | Notes |\n|------|------|-------|\n| 4 | 16 KB | |\n| 6 | 32 KB | |\n| 8 | 64 KB | Common |\n| B | 128 KB | |\n| C | 256 KB | |\n| D | 384 KB | |\n| E | 512 KB | |\n| F | 768 KB | |\n| G | 1024 KB | |\n| H | 1536 KB | |\n| I | 2048 KB | Largest |\n\n### Package Codes\n\n| Code | Package | Description |\n|------|---------|-------------|\n| T | LQFP | Low-profile Quad Flat Pack |\n| H | BGA | Ball Grid Array |\n| U | VFQFPN | Very thin Fine-pitch QFN |\n| Y | WLCSP | Wafer Level Chip Scale |\n| P | TSSOP | Thin Shrink SOP |\n\n### Temperature Range\n\n| Code | Range | Application |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 6 | -40 to +85°C | Industrial |\n| 7 | -40 to +105°C | Extended |\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nSTM32F103C8T6\n│     │  │││││\n│     │  ││││└── 6 = -40 to +85°C\n│     │  │││└── T = LQFP package\n│     │  ││└── 8 = 64KB Flash\n│     │  │└── C = 48 pins\n│     │  └── 03 = Access line (medium density)\n│     └── F1 = Mainstream Cortex-M3\n└── STM32 family\n\nResult: Mainstream M3 MCU, 48-pin LQFP, 64KB Flash, Industrial temp\nCommon Name: \"Blue Pill\" MCU\n```\n\n---\n\n## STM8 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nSTM8 S 003 F 3 P 6\n  │  │  │  │ │ │ │\n  │  │  │  │ │ │ └── Temperature range\n  │  │  │  │ │ └── Package\n  │  │  │  │ └── Flash size\n  │  │  │  └── Pin count\n  │  │  └── Line\n  │  └── Type (S=Standard, L=Low-power, A=Automotive)\n  └── STM8 family\n```\n\n---\n\n## ST Power MOSFET Naming\n\n### Package Prefix\n\n| Prefix | Package | Notes |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| STF | TO-220FP | Isolated tab |\n| STP | TO-220 | Standard |\n| STD | DPAK (TO-252) | Surface mount |\n| STB | D²PAK (TO-263) | High power SMD |\n| STW | TO-247 | High power through-hole |\n| VN | Various | N-channel series |\n| VP | Various | P-channel series |\n\n### Naming Pattern\n\n```\nST [Package] [Current] [Channel] [Voltage] [Suffix]\n│     │         │         │         │         │\n│     │         │         │         │         └── Technology (F, L, etc.)\n│     │         │         │         └── Voltage class (20=200V, 25=250V)\n│     │         │         └── Channel (N=N-ch, P=P-ch)\n│     │         └── Current rating (amps)\n│     └── Package code (F, P, D, B, W)\n└── ST prefix\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nSTF5N52U\n│││ │ ││\n│││ │ │└── U = technology suffix\n│││ │ └── 52 = 520V class\n│││ └── N = N-channel\n││└── 5 = ~5A rating\n│└── F = TO-220FP package\n└── ST prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## L78/L79 Voltage Regulator Naming\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nL 78 [Voltage] [Grade] [Package]\n│  │     │        │        │\n│  │     │        │        └── Package suffix\n│  │     │        └── Temperature grade (optional)\n│  │     └── Output voltage (05=5V, 12=12V, etc.)\n│  └── 78=Positive, 79=Negative\n└── L prefix (ST designation)\n```\n\n### Package Suffixes\n\n| Suffix | Package | Description |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| CV | TO-220 | Standard through-hole |\n| V | TO-220 | Alternate |\n| CP | TO-220FP | Isolated tab |\n| P | TO-220FP | Alternate |\n| CD2T | D²PAK | High power SMD |\n| D2T | D²PAK | Alternate |\n| CDT | DPAK | SMD |\n| DT | DPAK | Alternate |\n\n### Grade Codes\n\n| Grade | Temperature | Notes |\n|-------|-------------|-------|\n| (none) | 0 to +125°C | Standard |\n| C | 0 to +125°C | Commercial |\n| A | -40 to +125°C | Extended |\n| AB | -40 to +125°C | Extended |\n| AC | 0 to +125°C | Standard |\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nL7805CV\n│ ││ ││\n│ ││ │└── V = through-hole variant\n│ ││ └── C = Commercial grade\n│ │└── 05 = 5V output\n│ └── 78 = Positive regulator\n└── L prefix\n\nL7912ACD2T\n│ ││ │ │ │\n│ ││ │ │ └── T = tape packaging\n│ ││ │ └── D2 = D²PAK\n│ ││ └── AC = standard temp grade\n│ │└── 12 = -12V output\n│ └── 79 = Negative regulator\n└── L prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### STM32 Package Extraction (CRITICAL BUG)\n\nCurrent STHandler has a bug in `extractPackageCode()`:\n```java\n// WRONG - Tries to match last 2 chars as package+temp\nString lastTwo = upperMpn.substring(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n// For STM32F103C8T6: lastTwo = \"T6\"\n// Then validates: \"TUVRY\".indexOf(''T'') >= 0 && isDigit(''6'')\n// This passes but returns \"T6\" instead of just \"T\" (LQFP)\n```\n\n**Correct approach:**\n```java\n// STM32F103C8T6 → Package is second-to-last char: \"T\"\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\") && upperMpn.length() >= 2) {\n    char packageChar = upperMpn.charAt(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n    return switch (packageChar) {\n        case ''T'' -> \"LQFP\";\n        case ''H'' -> \"BGA\";\n        case ''U'' -> \"VFQFPN\";\n        case ''Y'' -> \"WLCSP\";\n        case ''P'' -> \"TSSOP\";\n        default -> String.valueOf(packageChar);\n    };\n}\n```\n\n### MOSFET Package Extraction\n\n```java\n// Extract from prefix: STF = TO-220FP, STP = TO-220, STD = DPAK\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STF\")) return \"TO-220FP\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STP\")) return \"TO-220\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STD\")) return \"DPAK\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STB\")) return \"D2PAK\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STW\")) return \"TO-247\";\n```\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// STM32F103C8T6 → Series: STM32F103 (or STM32F1)\n// For STM32: Extract up to and including line number\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\")) {\n    // STM32 + Type + Core + Line = STM32F103\n    // Match pattern: STM32[A-Z][0-9]{1,3}\n    Pattern p = Pattern.compile(\"^(STM32[A-Z][0-9]{1,3})\");\n    Matcher m = p.matcher(upperMpn);\n    if (m.find()) return m.group(1);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/STHandler.java`\n- Component types: `MICROCONTROLLER_ST`, `MCU_ST`, `MOSFET_ST`, `VOLTAGE_REGULATOR_LINEAR_ST`\n- Test: `handlers/STHandlerTest.java` (72 tests)\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Learnings (PR #81)\n\n### Fixed Issues\n\nAll issues discovered during analysis have been fixed:\n\n1. ~~HashSet in getSupportedTypes()~~ - Changed to `Set.of()`\n2. ~~Debug println statements~~ - Removed\n3. ~~Package extraction bug~~ - Now returns \"LQFP\" for STM32, \"TO-220\" for MOSFETs, etc.\n4. ~~Voltage regulator regex broken~~ - Fixed with proper prefix matching\n\n### Package Code Extraction (Fixed)\n\n```java\n// STM32/STM8: Package is second-to-last character\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\") || upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM8\")) {\n    char packageChar = upperMpn.charAt(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n    return switch (packageChar) {\n        case ''T'' -> \"LQFP\";\n        case ''H'' -> \"BGA\";\n        case ''U'' -> \"VFQFPN\";\n        // ...\n    };\n}\n\n// MOSFETs: Package is in prefix\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STF\")) return \"TO-220FP\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STP\")) return \"TO-220\";\n// ...\n\n// Voltage regulators: Strip prefix and grade, then match suffix\nString suffix = upperMpn.replaceFirst(\"^[LM]C?7[89]\\\\d{2}\", \"\")\n                       .replaceFirst(\"^[A-C]{1,2}\", \"\");\n// CV → TO-220, D2T → D2PAK, etc.\n```\n\n### Cross-Handler Pattern Matching Bug\n\nWhen handler A''s `matches()` falls through to `patterns.matches(mpn, type)`, it can accidentally match patterns registered by handler B.\n\n**Fix in AtmelHandler**: Don''t fall through to pattern matching for base `MICROCONTROLLER` type - return false if prefix check fails. This prevents AtmelHandler from matching STM32 MPNs.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **STM32 package code is NOT last 2 chars** - It''s the second-to-last char only\n- **Temperature is the last digit** - 6 or 7, not part of package\n- **MOSFET package is in PREFIX** - Unlike most components where it''s suffix\n- **L78/L79 have multiple suffix styles** - CV, V, D2T, DT, etc.\n- **STM32F4 naming differs slightly** - Some devices don''t follow standard pattern\n- **Pattern registry is shared across handlers** - Must use explicit prefix checks for base types to avoid cross-matching\n\n---\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Understanding STM32 Naming Conventions - DigiKey](https://www.digikey.com/en/maker/tutorials/2020/understanding-stm32-naming-conventions)\n- [STM32 Naming Scheme - Ziutek](https://ziutek.github.io/2018/05/07/stm32_naming_scheme.html)\n- [L78 Datasheet - STMicroelectronics](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/l78.pdf)\n- [Power MOSFETs - STMicroelectronics](https://www.st.com/en/power-transistors/power-mosfets.html)\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:07:27.569Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronics Agents needing detailed information on STMicroelectronics components such as STM32 microcontrollers and ST MOSFETs.","zh":"非常适合需要关于STMicroelectronics组件（如STM32微控制器和ST MOSFETs）详细信息的电子代理人。","ja":"STMicroelectronicsのコンポーネント（STM32マイクロコントローラやST MOSFETsなど）に関する詳細情報を必要とするエレクトロニクスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"STM32 마이크로컨트롤러 및 ST MOSFETs와 같은 STMicroelectronics 구성 요소에 대한 자세한 정보가 필요한 전자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de electrónica que necesitan información detallada sobre componentes de STMicroelectronics, como microcontroladores STM32 y MOSFETs de ST.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents électroniques ayant besoin d''informations détaillées sur les composants STMicroelectronics, tels que les microcontrôleurs STM32 et les MOSFETs ST.","de":"Perfekt für Elektronikagenten, die detaillierte Informationen über STMicroelectronics-Komponenten wie STM32-Mikrocontroller und ST-MOSFETs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Eletrônica que necessitam de informações detalhadas sobre componentes da STMicroelectronics, como microcontroladores STM32 e MOSFETs ST.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электроники, которым требуются подробные сведения о компонентах STMicroelectronics, таких как микроконтроллеры STM32 и MOSFET от ST.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإلكترونيات الذين يحتاجون إلى معلومات مفصلة حول مكونات شركة إس تي ميكروإلكترونكس مثل المسيطرات الدقيقة STM32 والموسفتات من إس تي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide technical specifications and datasheet information for STMicroelectronics product families, including STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, L78/L79, and Op-amps, utilizing knowledge of microcontroller naming structures and temperature ranges.","zh":"赋予代理人提供STMicroelectronics产品系列的技术规格和数据表信息的能力，包括STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79和运算放大器，利用对微控制器命名结构和温度范围的知识。","ja":"エージェントがSTMicroelectronics製品ファミリ（STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79、オペアンプなど）の技術的仕様とデータシート情報を提供できるようにし、マイクロコントローラの命名構造や温度範囲に関する知識を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, L78/L79 및 오퍼애플과 같은 STMicroelectronics 제품군의 기술 사양 및 데이터시트 정보를 제공할 수 있도록 하며, 마이크로컨트롤러 이름 구조 및 온도 범위에 대한 지식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar especificaciones técnicas y información de hojas de datos para familias de productos de STMicroelectronics, incluyendo STM32, STM8, MOSFETs de ST, L78/L79 y amplificadores operacionales, utilizando conocimientos de estructuras de nomenclatura de microcontroladores y rangos de temperatura.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des spécifications techniques et des informations de feuilles de données pour les familles de produits STMicroelectronics, notamment STM32, STM8, MOSFETs ST, L78/L79 et amplificateurs opérationnels, en utilisant des connaissances sur les structures de nomenclature des microcontrôleurs et les plages de température.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, technische Spezifikationen und Datenblattinformationen für STMicroelectronics-Produktfamilien bereitzustellen, einschließlich STM32, STM8, ST-MOSFETs, L78/L79 und Operationsverstärkern, unter Verwendung von Kenntnissen über Mikrocontroller-Benennungsstrukturen und Temperaturbereiche.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer especificações técnicas e informações de folha de dados para famílias de produtos da STMicroelectronics, incluindo STM32, STM8, MOSFETs ST, L78/L79 e amplificadores operacionais, utilizando o conhecimento das estruturas de nomenclatura de microcontroladores e faixas de temperatura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам предоставлять технические характеристики и информацию из справочных данных для семейств продуктов STMicroelectronics, включая STM32, STM8, MOSFET от ST, L78/L79 и операционные усилители, используя знания о структурах наименований микроконтроллеров и диапазонах температуры.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من تقديم المواصفات الفنية ومعلومات بيانات منتجات شركة إس تي ميكروإلكترونكس، بما في ذلك STM32 وSTM8 والموسفتات من إس تي و L78/L79 والمكبرات التشغيلية، باستخدام معرفة هيكل命名前ية المسيطرات الدقيقة ونطاقات درجة الحرارة."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying STM32 microcontroller models based on MPN structure","Providing datasheet information for ST MOSFETs and linear voltage regulators","Decoding temperature range specifications for STMicroelectronics components"],"zh":["根据MPN结构识别STM32微控制器型号","为ST MOSFETs和线性电压调节器提供数据表信息","解码STMicroelectronics组件的温度范围规格"],"ja":["MPN構造に基づいてSTM32マイクロコントローラモデルを識別する","ST MOSFETsと線形電圧レギュレータのデータシート情報を提供する","STMicroelectronicsコンポーネントの温度範囲規格を解析する"],"ko":["MPN구조를 기반으로 STM32 마이크로컨트롤러 모델 식별","ST MOSFETs 및 선형 전압 조정기의 데이터시트 정보 제공","STMicroelectronics 구성 요소의 온도 범위 사양 해석"],"es":["Identificar modelos de microcontroladores STM32 en función de la estructura del MPN","Proporcionar información de hojas de datos para MOSFETs de ST y reguladores de voltaje lineales","Decodificar especificaciones de rango de temperatura para componentes de STMicroelectronics"],"fr":["Identifier les modèles de microcontrôleurs STM32 en fonction de la structure du MPN","Fournir des informations de feuilles de données pour les MOSFETs ST et les régulateurs de tension linéaires","Décoder les spécifications de plage de température pour les composants STMicroelectronics"],"de":["Identifizieren von STM32-Mikrocontrollermodellen basierend auf der MPN-Struktur","Bereitstellen von Datenblattinformationen für ST-MOSFETs und lineare Spannungsregler","Dekodieren von Temperaturbereichsspezifikationen für STMicroelectronics-Komponenten"],"pt":["Identificar modelos de microcontroladores STM32 com base na estrutura do MPN","Fornecer informações de folha de dados para MOSFETs ST e reguladores de tensão linear","Decodificar especificações de faixa de temperatura para componentes da STMicroelectronics"],"ru":["Определение моделей микроконтроллеров STM32 на основе структуры MPN","Предоставление информации из справочных данных для MOSFET от ST и линейных стабилизаторов напряжения","Декодирование спецификаций диапазона температуры для компонентов STMicroelectronics"],"ar":["تحديد نماذج المسيطرات الدقيقة STM32 بالاعتماد على هيكل رقم الجزء","توفير معلومات بيانات للموسفتات من إس تي ومنظمات الجهد الكهربي الخطية","فك التشفير لمواصفات نطاق درجة الحرارة لمكونات شركة إس تي ميكروإلكترونكس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to STMicroelectronics product families","Requires knowledge of electronics and microcontroller terminology"],"zh":["仅限STMicroelectronics产品系列","需要电子和微控制器术语的知识"],"ja":["STMicroelectronics製品ファミリのみに限定される","電子とマイクロコントローラ用語に関する知識が必要"],"ko":["STMicroelectronics 제품군에만 제한됨","전자 및 마이크로컨트롤러 용어에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a las familias de productos de STMicroelectronics","Requiere conocimientos de terminología electrónica y de microcontroladores"],"fr":["Limité aux familles de produits STMicroelectronics","Nécessite des connaissances sur la terminologie électronique et les microcontrôleurs"],"de":["Begrenzt auf STMicroelectronics-Produktfamilien","Benötigt Kenntnisse über Elektronik- und Mikrocontroller-Terminologie"],"pt":["Limitado às famílias de produtos da STMicroelectronics","Exige conhecimento de terminologia de eletrônica e microcontroladores"],"ru":["Ограничен семействами продуктов STMicroelectronics","Требует знания терминологии электроники и микроконтроллеров"],"ar":["محدود بمنتجات شركة إس تي ميكروإلكترونكس","يتطلب معرفة مصطلحات الإلكترونيات والمسيطرات الدقيقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('holon-run/holon/ghx', 'community', 'holon-run', 'holon', 'holon-run/holon', 'ghx', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.394Z', '2026-02-18T02:07:08.559Z', NULL, '{"id":"holon-run/holon/ghx","name":"ghx","description":{"zh":"GHX 技术是 GitHub 操作的共享层，提供上下文收集和发布功能，支持开发者高效工作","ja":"GHX スキルは GitHub 操作用の共有レイヤーで、コンテキスト収集とパブリッシング機能を提供し、開発者の効率的な作業をサポート","ko":"GHX 기술은 깃허브 운영을 위한 공유 계층으로, 컨텍스트 수집 및 발행 기능을 제공하여 개발자의 효율적인 작업을 지원","es":"GHX es una capa de operaciones de GitHub que combina la recopilación de contexto y la publicación para agentes de codificación AI. Permite crear parches y resúmenes listos para PR de manera automática","fr":"GHX est une couche d''opérations GitHub qui combine la collecte de contexte et la publication pour les agents de codage AI. Elle permet de créer des correctifs et des résumés prêts pour PR de manière automatisée","de":"GHX ist eine GitHub-Operations-Schicht, die die Kontextsammlung und die Veröffentlichung für AI-Coding-Agents kombiniert. Sie ermöglicht die automatische Erstellung von Patches und Zusammenfassungen","pt":"O GHX é uma camada de operações do GitHub que combina coleta de contexto e publicação para melhorar o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento. Ele fornece capacidades de coleta de contexto e publicação","ru":"GHX - это слой операций GitHub, который объединяет сбор контекста и публикацию для улучшения потока разработки. Он обеспечивает возможности сбора контекста и публикации","ar":"GHX هو طبقة عمليات GitHub التي تجمع بين جمع السياق والنشرة لتحسين تدفق العمل التطويري. وهو يوفر قدرات جمع السياق والنشرة","en":"Holon runs AI coding agents headlessly to turn issues into PR-ready patches and summaries — locally or in CI, without babysitting the agent."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GHX 技术：GitHub 操作层","ja":"GHX スキル：GitHub オペレーション層","ko":"GHX 기술: 깃허브 운영 계층","es":"GHX: Capa de operaciones de Gi