s zu erhöhen","Ist kompatibel mit mehreren Inhaltstypen","Kann einfach implementiert werden"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade nos motores de busca","Fornece resultados ricos em busca","Estrutura dados para melhor entendimento","Compatível com vários formatos de dados","Facilita a indexação de conteúdo"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость в поисковых системах","Предоставляет богатые результаты поиска","Структурирует данные для лучшего понимания","Компатибельна с различными форматами данных","Облегчает индексацию контента"],"ar":["يحسن الرؤية في محركات البحث","يقدم نتائج غنية في البحث","ينظم البيانات لافهم أفضل","متوافق مع صيغ بيانات متعددة","يسهل فهرسة المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema Markup","JSON-LD","Microdata","RDFa","Google","Bing","SEO","Search Engine Optimization"],"ja":["Schema Markup","JSON-LD","Microdata","RDFa","Google","Bing","SEO","Search Engine Optimization"],"ko":["Schema Markup","JSON-LD","Microdata","RDFa","Google","Bing","SEO","Search Engine Optimization"],"es":["marcado de esquema","schema.org","etiquetas de estructura","resultados enriquecidos","optimización para motores de búsqueda","desarrollo web","SEO"],"fr":["balises de schéma","schema.org","balises de structure","résultats enrichis","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","développement web","SEO"],"de":["Schema-Markierung","schema.org","Strukturmarkierungen","erweiterte Ergebnisse","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Web-Entwicklung","SEO"],"pt":["schema markup","desenvolvimento web","otimização para motores de busca","estrutura de dados","resultados ricos em busca","visibilidade online"],"ru":["схема маркировки","веб-разработка","оптимизация для поисковых систем","структура данных","богатые результаты поиска","онлайн-видимость"],"ar":["تنسيق مخطط","تطوير الويب","تحسين محركات البحث","هيكلة البيانات","نتائج غنية في البحث","الظهور عبر الإنترنت"]}},"owner":"ashleytower","repo":"claude-code-workflow","repoPath":"ashleytower/claude-code-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.394Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:09:02.836Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO-focused Agents needing structured data implementation for rich search results.","zh":"非常适合需要为丰富搜索结果实现结构化数据的SEO专注代理","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたエージェントが構造化データの実装を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 위한 구조화된 데이터 구현이 필요한 SEO 중심 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en SEO que necesitan implementación de datos estructurados para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur le SEO ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre de données structurées pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-fokussierte Agenten, die eine Implementierung von strukturierten Daten für umfangreiche Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em SEO que necessitam de implementação de dados estruturados para resultados de pesquisa ricos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на SEO, которым необходимо реализовать структурированные данные для богатых результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التي تركز على تحسين محركات البحث وتحتاج إلى تنفيذ بيانات منظمة لنتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results, using protocols like JSON-LD and libraries for structured data handling.","zh":"赋予代理实现schema.org标记的能力，启用搜索引擎理解内容并显示丰富的结果，使用诸如JSON-LD的协议和结构化数据处理库","ja":"エージェントにschema.orgマークアップを実装する能力を与え、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な結果を表示できるようにし、JSON-LDなどのプロトコルや構造化データ処理ライブラリを使用","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 결과를 표시할 수 있도록 하며, JSON-LD와 같은 프로토콜 및 구조화된 데이터 처리 라이브러리를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la marca schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos, utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD y bibliotecas para el manejo de datos estructurados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la balise schema.org, ce qui permet aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches, en utilisant des protocoles comme JSON-LD et des bibliothèques pour la gestion de données structurées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Schema.org-Markup zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und umfangreiche Ergebnisse anzeigen können, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie JSON-LD und Bibliotheken zur Verarbeitung von strukturierten Daten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar marcação schema.org, permitindo que os mecanismos de pesquisa entendam o conteúdo e exibam resultados ricos, usando protocolos como JSON-LD e bibliotecas para manipulação de dados estruturados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать маркировку schema.org, что позволяет поисковым системам понимать контент и отображать богатые результаты, используя протоколы seperti JSON-LD и библиотеки для обработки структурированных данных.","ar":"تمكين الوسائل الإعلامية من تنفيذ علامات schema.org، مما يسمح لمحركات البحث بفهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج غنية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD ومكتبات لمعالجة البيانات المنظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating schema.org compliant JSON-LD scripts","Optimizing content for rich search results and improved SEO"],"zh":["为产品页面实现schema标记","生成符合schema.org的JSON-LD脚本","优化内容以获得丰富的搜索结果和改进的SEO"],"ja":["製品ページのスキーママークアップを実装","schema.orgに準拠したJSON-LDスクリプトを生成","コンテンツを最適化して豊富な検索結果と改善されたSEOを実現"],"ko":["제품 페이지를 위한 스키마 마크업 구현","schema.org 규격의 JSON-LD 스크립트 생성","콘텐츠를 최적화하여 풍부한 검색 결과와 개선된 SEO를 달성"],"es":["Implementar la marca de esquema para páginas de productos","Generar scripts JSON-LD compatibles con schema.org","Optimizar el contenido para resultados de búsqueda ricos y un mejor SEO"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la balise de schéma pour les pages de produits","Générer des scripts JSON-LD compatibles schema.org","Optimiser le contenu pour des résultats de recherche riches et un meilleur SEO"],"de":["Schema-Markup für Produktseiten implementieren","Schema.org-kompatible JSON-LD-Skripte generieren","Inhalte für umfangreiche Suchergebnisse und verbessertes SEO optimieren"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de esquema para páginas de produtos","Gerar scripts JSON-LD compatíveis com schema.org","Otimizar conteúdo para resultados de pesquisa ricos e SEO melhorado"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки схемы для страниц продуктов","Генерация скриптов JSON-LD, совместимых с schema.org","Оптимизация контента для богатых результатов поиска и улучшения SEO"],"ar":["تنفيذ علامات الخريطة لمواقع المنتجات","إنتاج نصوص JSON-LD متوافقة مع schema.org","تحسين المحتوى لنتائج بحث غنية وتحسين جودة تحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to website''s HTML structure for markup implementation"],"zh":["需要了解schema.org词汇","需要访问网站的HTML结构以实现标记"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙を理解する必要","マークアップを実装するためにウェブサイトのHTML構造にアクセスする必要"],"ko":["schema.org 용어를 이해해야 함","마크업을 구현하기 위해 웹사이트의 HTML 구조에 접근해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del vocabulario schema.org","Necesita acceso a la estructura HTML del sitio web para implementar la marca"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du vocabulaire schema.org","Nécessite un accès à la structure HTML du site Web pour la mise en œuvre de la balise"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des schema.org-Vokabulars","Benötigt Zugriff auf die HTML-Struktur der Website für die Implementierung der Markierung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do vocabulário schema.org","Necessita acesso à estrutura HTML do site para implementação da marcação"],"ru":["Требует знания словаря schema.org","Требует доступа к HTML-структуре сайта для реализации маркировки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة المفردات schema.org","يتطلب الوصول إلى هيكل HTML للموقع لتنفيذ العلامات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('seflless/dot-agents/schema-markup', 'community', 'seflless', 'dot-agents', 'seflless/dot-agents', 'schema-markup', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.394Z', '2026-02-18T02:08:56.148Z', NULL, '{"id":"seflless/dot-agents/schema-markup","name":"schema-markup","description":{"zh":"Schema 标记语言是结构化数据的标准，帮助搜索引擎理解内容并启用丰富的搜索结果","ja":"スキーママークアップは構造化データの標準であり、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な検索結果を実現する","ko":"스키마 마크업은 구조화된 데이터의 표준으로, 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 검색 결과를 가능하게 합니다","es":"El marcado de esquema es fundamental para que los motores de búsqueda entiendan el contenido y muestren resultados enriquecidos. Aprende a implementarlo de manera efectiva.","fr":"Les balises de schéma sont essentielles pour que les moteurs de recherche comprennent le contenu et affichent des résultats enrichis. Découvrez comment les mettre en œuvre de manière efficace","de":"Schema-Markup ist entscheidend, damit Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und erweiterte Ergebnisse anzeigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es effektiv implementieren","pt":"Schema markup é uma forma de estruturar dados para que os mecanismos de busca os entendam melhor. Isso ajuda a melhorar a visibilidade dos sites nos resultados de busca.","ru":"Schema markup — это способ структурировать данные, чтобы поисковые системы могли их лучше понять. Это помогает улучшить видимость сайтов в результатах поиска.","ar":"schema markup هو طريقة لتنظيم البيانات بحيث يتم فهمها بشكل أفضل من قبل محركات البحث. هذا يساعد على تحسين وضوح مواقع الويب في نتائج البحث.","en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Schema 标记语言实现","ja":"スキーママークアップの実装","ko":"스키마 마크업 구현","es":"Marcado de esquema para desarrolladores","fr":"Balises de schéma pour les développeurs","de":"Schema-Markup für Entwickler","pt":"Schema Markup: Otimização de Resultados de Busca","ru":"Schema Markup: Улучшение результатов поиска","a