ts enrichis","Amélioration de la compréhension des moteurs de recherche","Augmentation de la visibilité dans les résultats de recherche","Prise en charge de plusieurs types de contenu","Compatibilité avec les normes de schema.org"],"de":["Implementierung von Schema-Markup für erweiterte Ergebnisse","Verbesserung der Verständlichkeit von Suchmaschinen","Erhöhung der Sichtbarkeit in den Suchergebnissen","Unterstützung für mehrere Inhaltsarten","Kompatibilität mit den Standards von schema.org"],"pt":["Melhora a visibilidade nos resultados de busca","Aumenta a taxa de cliques","Fornece resultados ricos nos resultados de busca","Ajuda os mecanismos de busca a entender o conteúdo","Suporta várias plataformas de busca"],"ru":["Улучшает видимость в результатах поиска","Увеличивает коэффициент кликов","Предоставляет богатые результаты в результатах поиска","Помогает поисковым системам понять содержание","Поддерживает несколько поисковых платформ"],"ar":["يحسن وضوح موقعك على الويب في نتائج البحث","يزيد من معدل النقرات","يقدم نتائج غنية في نتائج البحث","يساعد محركات البحث على فهم محتوى موقعك","يدعم منصات بحث متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema 标记语言","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","丰富的搜索结果","网页内容理解","数据标准","搜索引擎结果页"],"ja":["スキーママークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン最適化","豊富な検索結果","Webページのコンテンツ理解","データ標準","検索エンジン結果ページ"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","풍부한 검색 결과","웹 페이지의 콘텐츠 이해","데이터 표준","검색 엔진 결과 페이지"],"es":["marcado de esquema","schema.org","resultados enriquecidos","optimización para motores de búsqueda","desarrollo web","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["balises de schéma","schema.org","résultats enrichis","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","développement web","SEO pour les développeurs"],"de":["Schema-Markup","schema.org","erweiterte Ergebnisse","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Web-Entwicklung","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["schema markup","otimização de resultados de busca","resultados ricos","taxa de cliques","visibilidade nos resultados de busca","mecanismos de busca"],"ru":["schema markup","улучшение результатов поиска","богатые результаты","коэффициент кликов","видимость в результатах поиска","поисковые системы"],"ar":["schema markup","تحسين نتائج البحث","نتائج غنية","معدل النقرات","وضوح موقعك على الويب في نتائج البحث","محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"seflless","repo":"dot-agents","repoPath":"seflless/dot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.394Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:08:56.148Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO optimization and rich search result capabilities via schema.org markup.","zh":"适合需要高级SEO优化和通过schema.org标记实现丰富搜索结果的Web开发代理。","ja":"Web開発エージェントが高度なSEO最適化とschema.orgマークアップによる豊富な検索結果の機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 SEO 최적화 및 schema.org 마크업을 통해 풍부한 검색 결과 기능이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una optimización de SEO avanzada y capacidades de resultados de búsqueda ricos a través de la marca schema.org.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une optimisation SEO avancée et des capacités de résultats de recherche riches via la balise schema.org.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte SEO-Optimierung und umfangreiche Suchergebnisfunktionen über schema.org-Markup benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO optimization and rich search result capabilities via schema.org markup.","ru":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO optimization and rich search result capabilities via schema.org markup.","ar":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO optimization and rich search result capabilities via schema.org markup."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, leveraging structured data and enhancing page visibility through protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","zh":"赋予代理实施schema.org标记的能力，允许搜索引擎理解内容并在搜索结果中显示丰富的结果，利用结构化数据并通过JSON-LD和Microdata等协议增强页面可见性。","ja":"エージェントがschema.orgマークアップを実装することを可能にし、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、検索結果に豊富な結果を表示できるようにし、構造化データを活用し、JSON-LDやMicrodataなどのプロトコルを使用してページの可視性を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 구현할 수 있도록 해주어 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 검색 결과에 풍부한 결과를 표시할 수 있도록 하며, 구조화된 데이터를 활용하고 JSON-LD 및 Microdata 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 페이지의 가시성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la marca schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos en la búsqueda, aprovechando los datos estructurados y mejorando la visibilidad de la página a través de protocolos como JSON-LD y Microdata.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la balise schema.org, permettant ainsi aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches dans les résultats de recherche, en exploitant les données structurées et en améliorant la visibilité de la page via des protocoles tels que JSON-LD et Microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schema.org-Markup zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen Inhalte verstehen und in der Suche reiche Ergebnisse anzeigen können, indem strukturierte Daten genutzt und die Seitenvisibilität durch Protokolle wie JSON-LD und Microdata verbessert wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, leveraging structured data and enhancing page visibility through protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","ru":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, leveraging structured data and enhancing page visibility through protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","ar":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search, leveraging structured data and enhancing page visibility through protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating rich snippets for blog posts","Enhancing search engine understanding of event calendars"],"zh":["为产品页面实施schema标记","为博客文章生成丰富的摘要","提高搜索引擎对事件日历的理解"],"ja":["製品ページにschemaマークアップを実装する","ブログ投稿のための豊富なスニペットを生成する","イベントカレンダーの検索エンジン理解を向上させる"],"ko":["제품 페이지에 schema 마크업을 구현하는 것","블로그 게시물에 대한 풍부한 스니펫을 생성하는 것","이벤트 캘린더에 대한 검색 엔진 이해를 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Implementar la marca de esquema para páginas de productos","Generar fragmentos de contenido rico para publicaciones de blog","Mejorar la comprensión de los calendarios de eventos por parte de los motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la balise de schéma pour les pages de produits","Générer des extraits de contenu riches pour les billets de blog","Améliorer la compréhension des calendriers d''événements par les moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Schema-Markup für Produktseiten implementieren","Reiche Snippets für Blog-Beiträge generieren","Die Verständlichkeit von Veranstaltungskalendern durch Suchmaschinen verbessern"],"pt":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating rich snippets for blog posts","Enhancing search engine understanding of event calendars"],"ru":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating rich snippets for blog posts","Enhancing search engine understanding of event calendars"],"ar":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating rich snippets for blog posts","Enhancing search engine understanding of event calendars"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content structure"],"zh":["需要schema.org词汇知识","依赖于页面类型和内容结构"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙の知識が必要","ページの種類やコンテンツ構造に依存する"],"ko":["schema.org 어휘 지식이 필요함","페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠 구조에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del vocabulario schema.org","Depende del tipo de página y la estructura del contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du vocabulaire schema.org","Dépend du type de page et de la structure du contenu"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des schema.org-Vokabulars","Hängt vom Seitentyp und der Inhaltsstruktur ab"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content structure"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content structure"],"ar":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","Dependent on page type and content structure"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
