expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:08:58.948Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation for rich search results.","zh":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation for rich search results.","ja":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation for rich search results.","ko":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing advanced schema markup implementation for rich search results.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan una implementación avanzada de marcado de esquema para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation SEO ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de balisage de schéma pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Schema-Markup-Implementierung für reiche Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de SEO que precisam de implementação avançada de marcação de schema para resultados de pesquisa ricos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации SEO, которым требуется продвинутая реализация разметки схемы для получения богатых результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين محركات البحث الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ متقدم لتعليمات مخطط لنتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search using structured data, and supporting protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","zh":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search using structured data, and supporting protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","ja":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search using structured data, and supporting protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","ko":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results in search using structured data, and supporting protocols like JSON-LD and Microdata.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar el marcado de schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos en la búsqueda utilizando datos estructurados, y soporta protocolos como JSON-LD y Microdata.","fr":"Habilite les agents à mettre en œuvre le balisage schema.org, ce qui permet aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches dans la recherche à l''aide de données structurées, et prend en charge des protocoles tels que JSON-LD et Microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das schema.org-Markup zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen Inhalte verstehen und reiche Ergebnisse in der Suche mithilfe strukturierter Daten anzeigen können, und unterstützt Protokolle wie JSON-LD und Microdata.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar a marcação schema.org, permitindo que os mecanismos de busca entendam o conteúdo e exibam resultados ricos na busca usando dados estruturados, e suporta protocolos como JSON-LD e Microdata.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать разметку schema.org, что позволяет поисковым системам понимать содержимое и отображать богатые результаты в поиске с использованием структурированных данных, а также поддерживает протоколы như JSON-LD и Microdata.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ تعليمات مخطط، مما يسمح لمحركات البحث بفهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج غنية في البحث باستخدام بيانات منسقة، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD و Microdata."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing product schema for e-commerce websites","Generating schema markup for blog posts and articles","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating schema"],"zh":["Implementing product schema for e-commerce websites","Generating schema markup for blog posts and articles","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating schema"],"ja":["Implementing product schema for e-commerce websites","Generating schema markup for blog posts and articles","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating schema"],"ko":["Implementing product schema for e-commerce websites","Generating schema markup for blog posts and articles","Enhancing search engine results with review and rating schema"],"es":["Implementar el esquema de producto para sitios web de comercio electrónico","Generar marcado de esquema para publicaciones de blog y artículos","Mejorar los resultados de los motores de búsqueda con esquema de reseñas y calificaciones"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le schéma de produit pour les sites web de commerce électronique","Générer le balisage de schéma pour les publications de blog et les articles","Améliorer les résultats des moteurs de recherche avec le schéma d''examen et de notation"],"de":["Implementierung des Produktschemas für E-Commerce-Websites","Generierung von Schemas-Markup für Blog-Beiträge und Artikel","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinenergebnisse mit Bewertungs- und Ratingschema"],"pt":["Implementar esquema de produto para sites de comércio eletrônico","Gerar marcação de esquema para posts de blog e artigos","Melhorar os resultados do mecanismo de busca com esquema de revisão e classificação"],"ru":["Реализация схемы продукта для электронных коммерческих сайтов","Генерация разметки схемы для постов в блоге и статей","Улучшение результатов поисковой системы с помощью схемы обзора и рейтинга"],"ar":["تنفيذ مخطط المنتج للمواقع التجارية الإلكترونية","генерация تعليمات مخطط للمشاركات في المدونة والمقالات","تحسين نتائج محرك البحث باستخدام مخطط المراجعة والتقييم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to website or page content for markup implementation"],"zh":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to website or page content for markup implementation"],"ja":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to website or page content for markup implementation"],"ko":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to website or page content for markup implementation"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del vocabulario de schema.org","Necesita acceso al contenido del sitio web o de la página para la implementación del marcado"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du vocabulaire de schema.org","Nécessite un accès au contenu du site web ou de la page pour la mise en œuvre du balisage"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis des schema.org-Vokabulars","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Website- oder Seiteninhalte für die Markup-Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer entendimento do vocabulário schema.org","Necessita acesso ao conteúdo do site ou página para implementação da marcação"],"ru":["Требует понимания словаря schema.org","Требует доступа к содержимому сайта или страницы для реализации разметки"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مصطلحات مخطط","يتطلب الوصول إلى محتوى الموقع أو الصفحة لتنفيذ التعليمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
