页性能进行审计，重点关注核心Web指标、网络优化和可访问性","ja":"このスキルはChrome DevToolsを使用してWebページのパフォーマンスを最適化します","ko":"이 기능은 Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 웹 페이지의 성능을 최적화합니다","es":"La herramienta de auditoría de rendimiento web de Claude Code ayuda a identificar y solucionar problemas de rendimiento en tus sitios web","fr":"L''outil d''audit de performance web de Claude Code aide à identifier et à résoudre les problèmes de performance sur vos sites web","de":"Das Web-Performance-Audit-Tool von Claude Code hilft bei der Identifizierung und Behebung von Leistungsproblemen auf Ihren Websites","pt":"A habilidade web-perf do Claude Code é uma ferramenta completa para auditoria de desempenho web, focada em Core Web Vitals e otimização de rede.","ru":"Навык web-perf от Claude Code - это полный инструмент для аудита веб-производительности, ориентированный на Core Web Vitals и оптимизацию сети.","ar":"المهارة web-perf من Claude Code هي أداة شاملة لتدقيق أداء الويب، تركز على Core Web Vitals وتحسين الشبكة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["使用Chrome DevTools进行网页性能审计","优化网络和可访问性","关注核心Web指标","提高网页加载速度","增强用户体验"],"ja":["Chrome DevToolsを使用してWebページのパフォーマンスを最適化","ネットワークとアクセシビリティの最適化","コアWeb指標の最適化","Webページの読み込み速度の向上","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["크롬 개발자 도구를 사용하여 웹 페이지 성능 최적화","네트워크와 접근성 최적화","핵심 웹 지표 최적화","웹 페이지 로딩 속도 향상","사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Análisis de Core Web Vitals","Optimización de la red","Identificación de brechas de accesibilidad","Uso de Chrome DevTools MCP","Verificación de herramientas MCP disponibles","Informes detallados de rendimiento"],"fr":["Analyse de Core Web Vitals","Optimisation du réseau","Identification des lacunes d''accessibilité","Utilisation de Chrome DevTools MCP","Vérification des outils MCP disponibles","Rapports détaillés de performance"],"de":["Analyse von Core Web Vitals","Optimierung des Netzwerks","Identifizierung von Zugänglichkeitslücken","Verwendung von Chrome DevTools MCP","Überprüfung der verfügbaren MCP-Tools","Detaillierte Leistungsberichte"],"pt":["Auditoria de desempenho web com Chrome DevTools","Otimização de rede","Análise de Core Web Vitals","Detecção de problemas de acessibilidade","Otimização de página","Uso de MCP tools"],"ru":["Аудит веб-производительности с помощью Chrome DevTools","Оптимизация сети","Анализ Core Web Vitals","Обнаружение проблем доступности","Оптимизация страницы","Использование инструментов MCP"],"ar":["تدقيق أداء الويب باستخدام Chrome DevTools","تحسين الشبكة","تحليل Core Web Vitals","كشف مشاكل الوصول","تحسين الصفحة","استخدام أدوات MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web性能优化","Chrome DevTools","网页性能审计","核心Web指标","网络优化","可访问性","用户体验"],"ja":["Webパフォーマンス最適化","Chrome DevTools","Webページのパフォーマンスを最適化","コアWeb指標","ネットワークの最適化","アクセシビリティ","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["웹 성능 최적화","크롬 개발자 도구","웹 페이지 성능 최적화","핵심 웹 지표","네트워크 최적화","접근성","사용자 경험"],"es":["auditoría de rendimiento web","Core Web Vitals","optimización de la red","accesibilidad web","Chrome DevTools MCP","herramientas de desarrollo web","rendimiento web","velocidad de carga","eficiencia web"],"fr":["audit de performance web","Core Web Vitals","optimisation du réseau","accessibilité web","Chrome DevTools MCP","outils de développement web","performance web","vitesse de chargement","efficacité web"],"de":["Web-Performance-Audit","Core Web Vitals","Netzwerkoptimierung","Web-Zugänglichkeit","Chrome DevTools MCP","Web-Entwicklungstools","Web-Leistung","Ladezeit","Web-Effizienz"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho web","auditoria de desempenho web","Core Web Vitals","otimização de rede","acessibilidade web","MCP tools","Chrome DevTools","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация веб-производительности","аудит веб-производительности","Core Web Vitals","оптимизация сети","веб-доступность","инструменты MCP","Chrome DevTools","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين أداء الويب","تدقيق أداء الويب","Core Web Vitals","تحسين الشبكة","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","أدوات MCP","Chrome DevTools","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-perf","description":"Analyzes web performance using Chrome DevTools MCP. Measures Core Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, TBT, CLS, Speed Index), identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, layout shifts, caching issues, and accessibility gaps. Use when asked to audit, profile, debug, or optimize page load performance, Lighthouse scores, or site speed.","bodyPreview":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\",","body":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\", \"chrome-devtools-mcp@latest\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Key Guidelines\n\n- **Be assertive**: Verify claims by checking network requests, DOM, or codebase—then state findings definitively.\n- **Verify before recommending**: Confirm something is unused before suggesting removal.\n- **Quantify impact**: Use estimated savings from insights. Don''t prioritize changes with 0ms impact.\n- **Skip non-issues**: If render-blocking resources have 0ms estimated impact, note but don''t recommend action.\n- **Be specific**: Say \"compress hero.png (450KB) to WebP\" not \"optimize images\".\n- **Prioritize ruthlessly**: A site with 200ms LCP and 0 CLS is already excellent—say so.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Call |\n|------|-----------|\n| Load page | `navigate_page(url: \"...\")` |\n| Start trace | `performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)` |\n| Analyze insight | `performance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"...\", insightName: \"...\")` |\n| List requests | `list_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", ...])` |\n| Request details | `get_network_request(reqid: <id>)` |\n| A11y snapshot | `take_snapshot(verbose: true)` |\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist to track progress:\n\n```\nAudit Progress:\n- [ ] Phase 1: Performance trace (navigate + record)\n- [ ] Phase 2: Core Web Vitals analysis (includes CLS culprits)\n- [ ] Phase 3: Network analysis\n- [ ] Phase 4: Accessibility snapshot\n- [ ] Phase 5: Codebase analysis (skip if third-party site)\n```\n\n### Phase 1: Performance Trace\n\n1. Navigate to the target URL:\n   ```\n   navigate_page(url: \"<target-url>\")\n   ```\n\n2. Start a performance trace with reload to capture cold-load metrics:\n   ```\n   performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)\n   ```\n\n3. Wait for trace completion, then retrieve results.\n\n**Troubleshooting:**\n- If trace returns empty or fails, verify the page loaded correctly with `navigate_page` first\n- If insight names don''t match, inspect the trace response to list available insights\n\n### Phase 2: Core Web Vitals Analysis\n\nUse `performance_analyze_insight` to extract key metrics.\n\n**Note:** Insight names may vary across Chrome DevTools versions. If an insight name doesn''t work, check the `insightSetId` from the trace response to discover available insights.\n\nCommon insight names:\n\n| Metric | Insight Name | What to Look For |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| LCP | `LCPBreakdown` | Time to largest contentful paint; breakdown of TTFB, resource load, render delay |\n| CLS | `CLSCulprits` | Elements causing layout shifts (images without dimensions, injected content, font swaps) |\n| Render Blocking | `RenderBlocking` | CSS/JS blocking first paint |\n| Document Latency | `DocumentLatency` | Server response time issues |\n| Network Dependencies | `NetworkRequestsDepGraph` | Request chains delaying critical resources |\n\nExample:\n```\nperformance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"<id-from-trace>\", insightName: \"LCPBreakdown\")\n```\n\n**Key thresholds (good/needs-improvement/poor):**\n- TTFB: < 800ms / < 1.8s / > 1.8s\n- FCP: < 1.8s / < 3s / > 3s\n- LCP: < 2.5s / < 4s / > 4s\n- INP: < 200ms / < 500ms / > 500ms\n- TBT: < 200ms / < 600ms / > 600ms\n- CLS: < 0.1 / < 0.25 / > 0.25\n- Speed Index: < 3.4s / < 5.8s / > 5.8s\n\n### Phase 3: Network Analysis\n\nList all network requests to identify optimization opportunities:\n```\nlist_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", \"Document\", \"Font\", \"Image\"])\n```\n\n**Look for:**\n\n1. **Render-blocking resources**: JS/CSS in `<head>` without `async`/`defer`/`media` attributes\n2. **Network chains**: Resources discovered late because they depend on other resources loading first (e.g., CSS imports, JS-loaded fonts)\n3. **Missing preloads**: Critical resources (fonts, hero images, key scripts) not preloaded\n4. **Caching issues**: Missing or weak `Cache-Control`, `ETag`, or `Last-Modified` headers\n5. **Large payloads**: Uncompressed or oversized JS/CSS bundles\n6. **Unused preconnects**: If flagged, verify by checking if ANY requests went to that origin. If zero requests, it''s definitively unused—recommend removal. If requests exist but loaded late, the preconnect may still be valuable.\n\nFor detailed request info:\n```\nget_network_request(reqid: <id>)\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Accessibility Snapshot\n\nTake an accessibility tree snapshot:\n```\ntake_snapshot(verbose: true)\n```\n\n**Flag high-level gaps:**\n- Missing or duplicate ARIA IDs\n- Elements with poor contrast ratios (check against WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text)\n- Focus traps or missing focus indicators\n- Interactive elements without accessible names\n\n## Phase 5: Codebase Analysis\n\n**Skip if auditing a third-party site without codebase access.**\n\nAnalyze the codebase to understand where improvements can be made.\n\n### Detect Framework & Bundler\n\nSearch for configuration files to identify the stack:\n\n| Tool | Config Files |\n|------|--------------|\n| Webpack | `webpack.config.js`, `webpack.*.js` |\n| Vite | `vite.config.js`, `vite.config.ts` |\n| Rollup | `rollup.config.js`, `rollup.config.mjs` |\n| esbuild | `esbuild.config.js`, build scripts with `esbuild` |\n| Parcel | `.parcelrc`, `package.json` (parcel field) |\n| Next.js | `next.config.js`, `next.config.mjs` |\n| Nuxt | `nuxt.config.js`, `nuxt.config.ts` |\n| SvelteKit | `svelte.config.js` |\n| Astro | `astro.config.mjs` |\n\nAlso check `package.json` for framework dependencies and build scripts.\n\n### Tree-Shaking & Dead Code\n\n- **Webpack**: Check for `mode: ''production''`, `sideEffects` in package.json, `usedExports` optimization\n- **Vite/Rollup**: Tree-shaking enabled by default; check for `treeshake` options\n- **Look for**: Barrel files (`index.js` re-exports), large utility libraries imported wholesale (lodash, moment)\n\n### Unused JS/CSS\n\n- Check for CSS-in-JS vs. static CSS extraction\n- Look for PurgeCSS/UnCSS configuration (Tailwind''s `content` config)\n- Identify dynamic imports vs. eager loading\n\n### Polyfills\n\n- Check for `@babel/preset-env` targets and `useBuiltIns` setting\n- Look for `core-js` imports (often oversized)\n- Check `browserslist` config for overly broad targeting\n\n### Compression & Minification\n\n- Check for `terser`, `esbuild`, or `swc` minification\n- Look for gzip/brotli compression in build output or server config\n- Check for source maps in production builds (should be external or disabled)\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent findings as:\n\n1. **Core Web Vitals Summary** - Table with metric, value, and rating (good/needs-improvement/poor)\n2. **Top Issues** - Prioritized list of problems with estimated impact (high/medium/low)\n3. **Recommendations** - Specific, actionable fixes with code snippets or config changes\n4. **Codebase Findings** - Framework/bundler detected, optimization opportunities (omit if no codebase access)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:10:21.137Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced web performance auditing capabilities using Chrome DevTools MCP tools.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Chrome DevTools MCP 工具进行高级 web 性能审计的性能优化代理。","ja":"Chrome DevTools MCP ツールを使用した高度な Web パフォーマンス監査機能が必要なパフォーマンス最適化エージェントに最適。","ko":"Chrome DevTools MCP 도구를 사용한 고급 웹 성능 감사 기능이 필요한 성능 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de auditoría de rendimiento web utilizando herramientas MCP de Chrome DevTools.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de performances nécessitant des capacités avancées d''audit de performances Web à l''aide d''outils MCP de Chrome DevTools.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungsoptimierungsagenten, die erweiterte Webleistungs-Auditfunktionen mit Chrome DevTools MCP-Tools benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de desempenho web usando ferramentas MCP do Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации производительности, которым требуются продвинутые возможности аудита веб-выступлений с использованием инструментов Chrome DevTools MCP.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحسين الأداء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمراجعة أداء الويب باستخدام أدوات Chrome DevTools MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive web performance audits, focusing on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps, utilizing Chrome DevTools MCP tools and protocols like HTTP/HTTPS.","zh":"赋予代理进行全面 Web 性能审计的能力，重点关注 Core Web Vitals、网络优化和高级可访问性差距，利用 Chrome DevTools MCP 工具和 HTTP/HTTPS 等协议。","ja":"Core Web Vitals、ネットワーク最適化、高レベルのアクセシビリティギャップに焦点を当てた包括的な Web パフォーマンス監査をエージェントが実施できるようにし、Chrome DevTools MCP ツールおよび HTTP/HTTPS などのプロトコルを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Core Web Vitals, 네트워크 최적화 및 고급 접근성 갭에 중점을 둔 웹 성능 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며 Chrome DevTools MCP 도구 및 HTTP/HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de rendimiento web integrales, centradas en Core Web Vitals, optimización de red y brechas de accesibilidad de alto nivel, utilizando herramientas y protocolos MCP de Chrome DevTools como HTTP/HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de performances Web complets, en se concentrant sur les Core Web Vitals, l''optimisation du réseau et les lacunes d''accessibilité de haut niveau, en utilisant les outils et les protocoles MCP de Chrome DevTools tels que HTTP/HTTPS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Webleistungs-Audits durchzuführen, die sich auf Core Web Vitals, Netzwerktopimierung und hochrangige Zugänglichkeitslücken konzentrieren, unter Verwendung von Chrome DevTools MCP-Tools und -Protokollen wie HTTP/HTTPS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias abrangentes de desempenho web, com foco em Core Web Vitals, otimização de rede e lacunas de acessibilidade de alto nível, utilizando ferramentas e protocolos do Chrome DevTools MCP, como HTTP/HTTPS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние аудиты веб-выступлений, сосредоточив внимание на Core Web Vitals, оптимизации сети и высокоуровневых пробелах в доступности, используя инструменты и протоколы Chrome DevTools MCP, такие как HTTP/HTTPS.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات شاملة لأداء الويب، مع التركيز على معايير الويب الأساسية، وتحسين الشبكة، والفراغات في إمكانية الوصول العالية المستوى، باستخدام أدوات وبروتوكولات Chrome DevTools MCP، مثل HTTP/HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing web page performance for Core Web Vitals optimization","Identifying network optimization opportunities using Chrome DevTools","Debugging high-level accessibility gaps in web applications"],"zh":["为 Core Web Vitals 优化审计网页性能","使用 Chrome DevTools 识别网络优化机会","调试 Web 应用程序中的高级可访问性差距"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals 最適化のために Web ページのパフォーマンスを監査する","Chrome DevTools を使用してネットワーク最適化の機会を特定する","Web アプリケーションの高レベルのアクセシビリティギャップをデバッグする"],"ko":["Core Web Vitals 최적화를 위한 웹 페이지 성능 감사","Chrome DevTools를 사용하여 네트워크 최적화 기회 식별","웹 애플리케이션의 고급 접근성 갭 디버깅"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de la página web para la optimización de Core Web Vitals","Identificación de oportunidades de optimización de red utilizando Chrome DevTools","Depuración de brechas de accesibilidad de alto nivel en aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Audit des performances de la page Web pour l''optimisation des Core Web Vitals","Identification des opportunités d''optimisation du réseau à l''aide de Chrome DevTools","Débogage des lacunes d''accessibilité de haut niveau dans les applications Web"],"de":["Auditing der Webseitenleistung für die Optimierung von Core Web Vitals","Identifizierung von Netzwerktopimierungsmöglichkeiten mit Chrome DevTools","Fehlerbehebung bei hochrangigen Zugänglichkeitslücken in Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Auditoria de desempenho de página web para otimização de Core Web Vitals","Identificação de oportunidades de otimização de rede usando o Chrome DevTools","Depuração de lacunas de acessibilidade de alto nível em aplicações web"],"ru":["Аудит веб-страниц для оптимизации Core Web Vitals","Определение возможностей оптимизации сети с помощью Chrome DevTools","Отладка высокоуровневых пробелах в доступности веб-приложений"],"ar":["مراجعة أداء صفحة الويب لتحسين معايير الويب الأساسية","تحديد فرص تحسين الشبكة باستخدام أداة Chrome DevTools","تصحيح الأخطاء في الفجوات العالية المستوى في إمكانية الوصول لتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome DevTools MCP server configuration","Needs ''navigate_page'' or ''performance_start_trace'' functionality available","Limited to web page performance auditing"],"zh":["需要 Chrome DevTools MCP 服务器配置","需要 ''navigate_page'' 或 ''performance_start_trace'' 功能可用","仅限于网页性能审计"],"ja":["Chrome DevTools MCP サーバーの設定が必要","''navigate_page'' または ''performance_start_trace'' 機能が利用できる必要がある","Web ページのパフォーマンス監査のみに限定"],"ko":["Chrome DevTools MCP 서버 구성 필요","''navigate_page'' 또는 ''performance_start_trace'' 기능 사용 가능 필요","웹 페이지 성능 감사만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor MCP de Chrome DevTools","Necesita la funcionalidad ''navigate_page'' o ''performance_start_trace'' disponible","Limitado a la auditoría de rendimiento de la página web"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur MCP de Chrome DevTools","Nécessite la fonctionnalité ''navigate_page'' ou ''performance_start_trace'' disponible","Limité à l''audit des performances de la page Web"],"de":["Benötigt Konfiguration des Chrome DevTools MCP-Servers","Benötigt die Funktionalität ''navigate_page'' oder ''performance_start_trace'', die verfügbar ist","Begrenzt auf die Leistungsaudits von Webseiten"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor MCP do Chrome DevTools","Necessita da funcionalidade ''navigate_page'' ou ''performance_start_trace'' disponível","Limitado à auditoria de desempenho de página web"],"ru":["Требуется конфигурация сервера Chrome DevTools MCP","Требуется функциональность ''navigate_page'' или ''performance_start_trace'', доступная","Ограничен аудитом веб-страниц"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين خادم أداة Chrome DevTools MCP","يحتاج إلى توافر وظيفة ''navigate_page'' أو ''performance_start_trace''","محدود بمراجعة أداء صفحة الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
