CLI de shadcn/ui"],"de":["Bibliothek von vorgefertigten Komponenten","Benutzerdefinierter Register für native IA-Anwendungen","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Schnelle und einfache Installation","Kompatibel mit der CLI von shadcn/ui"],"pt":["Componentes pré-construídos para conversas e mensagens","Integração com shadcn/ui","Instalação rápida via CLI","Personalização de componentes","Compatibilidade com aplicativos de IA"],"ru":["Предварительно построенные компоненты для разговоров и сообщений","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Быстрая установка через CLI","Настройка компонентов","Совместимость с приложениями ИИ"],"ar":["مكونات مسبقة البناء للتحادث والمحادثات","التكامل مع shadcn/ui","التثبيت السريع عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر","تخصيص المكونات","التوافق مع التطبيقات الذكية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI Elements","AI 原生应用","组件库","自定义注册表","shadcn/ui","快速安装"],"ja":["AI Elements","AI ネイティブ アプリケーション","コンポーネント ライブラリ","カスタム レジストリ","shadcn/ui","高速インストール"],"ko":["AI Elements","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션","컴포넌트 라이브러리","사용자 정의 레지스트리","shadcn/ui","高速 설치"],"es":["aplicaciones nativas de IA","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","shadcn/ui","desarrollo de aplicaciones","IA","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["applications natives IA","bibliothèque de composants","registre personnalisé","shadcn/ui","développement d''applications","IA","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["native IA-Anwendungen","Komponentenbibliothek","benutzerdefinierter Register","shadcn/ui","Anwendungsentwicklung","IA","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA","biblioteca de componentes","ai-elements","shadcn/ui","construção de aplicativos de IA","componentes pré-construídos","integração com CLI","personalização de componentes"],"ru":["разработка приложений ИИ","библиотека компонентов","ai-elements","shadcn/ui","построение приложений ИИ","предварительно построенные компоненты","интеграция с CLI","настройка компонентов"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات الذكية","مكتبة مكونات","ai-elements","shadcn/ui","بناء التطبيقات الذكية","مكونات مسبقة البناء","التكامل مع واجهة سطر الأوامر","تخصيص المكونات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:09:53.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused AI Agents seeking to rapidly build AI-native applications with pre-built conversation and message components.","zh":"适用于专注于 UI 的 AI 代理，旨在使用预建的对话和消息组件快速构建 AI 本地应用程序。","ja":"UI に焦点を当てた AI エージェントに適しています。事前に構築された会話およびメッセージ コンポーネントを使用して、AI ネイティブ アプリケーションを迅速に構築できます。","ko":"UI에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 미리 구축된 대화 및 메시지 구성 요소를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 신속하게 구축할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en la interfaz de usuario que buscan construir aplicaciones nativas de IA de forma rápida con componentes de conversación y mensaje preconstruidos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur l''interface utilisateur cherchant à construire rapidement des applications natives d''IA avec des composants de conversation et de message préconstruits.","de":"Ideal für UI-fokussierte KI-Agents, die schnell KI-native Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Konversations- und Nachrichtenkomponenten erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em UI que buscam construir aplicativos nativos de IA rapidamente com componentes de conversa e mensagem pré-construídos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на UI, которые стремятся быстро создавать родные приложения ИИ с помощью предварительно созданных компонентов разговора и сообщений.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم والسعي لإنشاء تطبيقات ذكية اصطناعية أصلية بسرعة باستخدام مكونات المحادثة والرسائل المسبقة البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-native applications faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging the shadcn/ui library and providing a custom registry for seamless integration, all while utilizing npm package management for straightforward installation.","zh":"赋予代理构建 AI 本地应用程序的能力，使用预构建的组件（如会话和消息），利用 shadcn/ui 库，并提供自定义注册表以实现无缝集成，同时利用 npm 包管理进行直观的安装。","ja":"エージェントが事前に構築されたコンポーネント（会話やメッセージなど）を使用して AI ネイティブ アプリケーションを迅速に構築できるようにします。shadcn/ui ライブラリを利用し、シームレスな統合のためのカスタム レジストリを提供し、npm パッケージ管理を使用してストレートフォワードなインストールを行います。","ko":"에이전트가 미리 구축된 구성 요소(대화 및 메시지 등)를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 신속하게 구축할 수 있도록 합니다. shadcn/ui 라이브러리를 활용하고, 무결점 통합을 위한 사용자 정의 레지스트리를 제공하며, npm 패키지 관리를 사용하여 직접적인 설치를 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes construir aplicaciones nativas de IA más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando la biblioteca shadcn/ui y proporcionando un registro personalizado para una integración sin problemas, todo mientras se utiliza la gestión de paquetes npm para una instalación sencilla.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications natives d''IA plus rapidement avec des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant la bibliothèque shadcn/ui et en fournissant un registre personnalisé pour une intégration transparente, le tout en utilisant la gestion de paquets npm pour une installation sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, KI-native Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten schneller zu erstellen, indem sie die shadcn/ui-Bibliothek nutzen und ein benutzerdefiniertes Register für eine nahtlose Integration bereitstellen, während sie gleichzeitig die npm-Paketverwaltung für eine einfache Installation verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos nativos de IA mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando a biblioteca shadcn/ui e fornecendo um registro personalizado para integração sem problemas, tudo isso utilizando o gerenciamento de pacotes npm para instalação direta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать родные приложения ИИ быстрее с помощью предварительно созданных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя библиотеку shadcn/ui и предоставляя пользовательский реестр для бесшовной интеграции, все это при использовании управления пакетами npm для простой установки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات ذكية اصطناعية أصلية بشكل أسرع مع مكونات مسبقة البناء مثل المحادثات والرسائل، وتحقيق ذلك من خلال استخدام مكتبة shadcn/ui وتوفير سجل مخصص لتعاون بدون مشاكل، وتتم كل ذلك باستخدام إدارة الحزم npm لتثبيت مباشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Building conversational interfaces with pre-designed components","Streamlining message display and interaction in AI applications","Rapidly prototyping AI-native UIs with shadcn/ui"],"zh":["使用预设计组件构建对话式接口","在 AI 应用程序中简化消息显示和交互","使用 shadcn/ui 快速原型化 AI 本地 UI"],"ja":["事前に設計されたコンポーネントを使用して会話型インターフェイスを構築する","AI アプリケーションにおけるメッセージ表示と相互作用の簡素化","shadcn/ui を使用して AI ネイティブ UI を迅速にプロトタイプ化する"],"ko":["미리 설계된 구성 요소를 사용하여 대화형 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","AI 애플리케이션에서 메시지 표시 및 상호 작용을 간소화하는 것","shadcn/ui를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 UI를 신속하게 프로토 타입화하는 것"],"es":["Construir interfaces conversacionales con componentes pre diseñados","Optimizar la visualización y la interacción de mensajes en aplicaciones de IA","Prototipar rápidamente interfaces de usuario nativas de IA con shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Construire des interfaces conversationnelles avec des composants préconçus","Optimiser l''affichage et l''interaction des messages dans les applications d''IA","Rapidement prototyper des interfaces utilisateur natives d''IA avec shadcn/ui"],"de":["Konversationsinterfaces mit vorgefertigten Komponenten erstellen","Anzeige und Interaktion von Nachrichten in KI-Anwendungen optimieren","Schnell Prototyping von KI-nativen Benutzeroberflächen mit shadcn/ui"],"pt":["Construir interfaces de conversação com componentes pré-projetados","Otimizar a exibição e interação de mensagens em aplicativos de IA","Prototipar rapidamente UIs nativas de IA com shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов разговора с предварительно спроектированными компонентами","Упрощение отображения и взаимодействия сообщений в приложениях ИИ","Быстрое прототипирование родных интерфейсов ИИ с помощью shadcn/ui"],"ar":["بناء واجهات محادثة مع مكونات محددة مسبقًا","تبسيط عرض وتفاعل الرسائل في تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء نماذج أولية سريعة لواجهات المستخدم الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام shadcn/ui"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm package installation","Dependent on shadcn/ui library"],"zh":["需要 npm 包安装","依赖于 shadcn/ui 库"],"ja":["npm パッケージのインストールが必要","shadcn/ui ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["npm 패키지 설치가 필요함","shadcn/ui 라이브러리에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere instalación de paquetes npm","Dependiente de la biblioteca shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de paquets npm","Dépend de la bibliothèque shadcn/ui"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von npm-Paketen","Abhängig von der shadcn/ui-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Exige instalação do pacote npm","Dependente da biblioteca shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Требует установки пакета npm","Зависит от библиотеки shadcn/ui"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت حزمة npm","يعتمد على مكتبة shadcn/ui"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
