ols","ar":"تحسين أداء الويب باستخدام Chrome DevTools","en":"web-perf"},"description":{"zh":"Web性能优化audit工具，使用Chrome DevTools MCP工具进行性能优化和可访问性检查","ja":"Webパフォーマンスオーディットツールは、Chrome DevTools MCPツールを使用してパフォーマンス最適化とアクセシビリティをチェックします","ko":"웹 성능 최적화도구는 Chrome DevTools MCP도구를 사용하여 성능 최적화와 접근성을 확인합니다","es":"El skill web-perf te permite auditar el rendimiento de tus páginas web utilizando Chrome DevTools y MCP, enfocándose en Core Web Vitals y optimización de red.","fr":"Le skill web-perf vous permet d''auditer les performances de vos pages web en utilisant Chrome DevTools et MCP, en se concentrant sur Core Web Vitals et l''opt...","de":"Das Skill web-perf ermöglicht es Ihnen, die Leistung Ihrer Webseiten mit Chrome DevTools und MCP zu auditen, wobei der Schwerpunkt auf Core Web Vitals und Ne...","pt":"O skill web-perf realiza auditorias de desempenho da página web utilizando Chrome DevTools, com foco em Core Web Vitals e otimização de rede","ru":"Навык web-perf выполняет аудит производительности веб-страницы с помощью Chrome DevTools, с фокусом на Core Web Vitals и оптимизацией сети","ar":"ي thựcي مهارة web-perf فحص أداء صفحة الويب باستخدام Chrome DevTools، مع التركيز علىCore Web Vitals و تحسين الشبكة","en":"Bobs autonomous workspace"},"definition":{"en":"Bobs autonomous workspace"},"features":{"zh":["使用Chrome DevTools MCP工具进行性能优化","检查Core Web Vitals","进行网络优化","检测高级可访问性问题","支持自动化测试"],"ja":["Chrome DevTools MCPツールを使用してパフォーマンス最適化","Core Web Vitalsをチェック","ネットワーク最適化を実行","ハイレベルアクセシビリティの問題を検出","自動テストをサポート"],"ko":["Chrome DevTools MCP도구를 사용하여 성능 최적화","Core Web Vitals 확인","네트워크 최적화","고급 접근성 문제 탐지","자동 테스트 지원"],"es":["Audit de rendimiento web con Chrome DevTools","Enfocado en Core Web Vitals","Optimización de red","Análisis de accesibilidad","Integración con MCP"],"fr":["Audit de performance web avec Chrome DevTools","Axé sur Core Web Vitals","Optimisation du réseau","Analyse d''accessibilité","Intégration avec MCP"],"de":["Web-Performance-Audit mit Chrome DevTools","Fokus auf Core Web Vitals","Netzwerktopimierung","Zugänglichkeitsanalyse","Integration mit MCP"],"pt":["Auditoria de desempenho da página web","Foco em Core Web Vitals","Otimização de rede","Análise de acessibilidade","Uso de Chrome DevTools"],"ru":["Аудит производительности веб-страницы","Фокус на Core Web Vitals","Оптимизация сети","Анализ доступности","Использование Chrome DevTools"],"ar":["فحص أداء صفحة الويب","التركيز على Core Web Vitals","تحسين الشبكة","تحليل إمكانية الوصول","استخدام Chrome DevTools"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web性能优化","Chrome DevTools","MCP工具","Core Web Vitals","网络优化","可访问性检查"],"ja":["Webパフォーマンスオーディット","Chrome DevTools","MCPツール","Core Web Vitals","ネットワーク最適化","アクセシビリティチェック"],"ko":["웹 성능 최적화","Chrome DevTools","MCP도구","Core Web Vitals","네트워크 최적화","접근성 확인"],"es":["rendimiento web","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","optimización de red","accesibilidad web","MCP","audit de rendimiento"],"fr":["performance web","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","optimisation du réseau","accessibilité web","MCP","audit de performance"],"de":["Web-Performance","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","Netzwerktopimierung","Web-Zugänglichkeit","MCP","Web-Performance-Audit"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho web","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","auditoria de desempenho","otimização de rede","acessibilidade web"],"ru":["оптимизация веб-производительности","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","аудит производительности","оптимизация сети","доступность веб-страницы"],"ar":["تحسين أداء الويب","Chrome DevTools","Core Web Vitals","فحص أداء","تحسين الشبكة","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب"]}},"owner":"Timmy6942025","repo":"bob-workspace","repoPath":"Timmy6942025/bob-workspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web-perf","description":"Analyzes web performance using Chrome DevTools MCP. Measures Core Web Vitals (FCP, LCP, TBT, CLS, Speed Index), identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, layout shifts, caching issues, and accessibility gaps. Use when asked to audit, profile, debug, or optimize page load performance, Lighthouse scores, or site speed.","bodyPreview":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\",","body":"# Web Performance Audit\n\nAudit web page performance using Chrome DevTools MCP tools. This skill focuses on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps.\n\n## FIRST: Verify MCP Tools Available\n\n**Run this before starting.** Try calling `navigate_page` or `performance_start_trace`. If unavailable, STOP—the chrome-devtools MCP server isn''t configured.\n\nAsk the user to add this to their MCP config:\n\n```json\n\"chrome-devtools\": {\n  \"type\": \"local\",\n  \"command\": [\"npx\", \"-y\", \"chrome-devtools-mcp@latest\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Key Guidelines\n\n- **Be assertive**: Verify claims by checking network requests, DOM, or codebase—then state findings definitively.\n- **Verify before recommending**: Confirm something is unused before suggesting removal.\n- **Quantify impact**: Use estimated savings from insights. Don''t prioritize changes with 0ms impact.\n- **Skip non-issues**: If render-blocking resources have 0ms estimated impact, note but don''t recommend action.\n- **Be specific**: Say \"compress hero.png (450KB) to WebP\" not \"optimize images\".\n- **Prioritize ruthlessly**: A site with 200ms LCP and 0 CLS is already excellent—say so.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Call |\n|------|-----------|\n| Load page | `navigate_page(url: \"...\")` |\n| Start trace | `performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)` |\n| Analyze insight | `performance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"...\", insightName: \"...\")` |\n| List requests | `list_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", ...])` |\n| Request details | `get_network_request(reqid: <id>)` |\n| A11y snapshot | `take_snapshot(verbose: true)` |\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist to track progress:\n\n```\nAudit Progress:\n- [ ] Phase 1: Performance trace (navigate + record)\n- [ ] Phase 2: Core Web Vitals analysis (includes CLS culprits)\n- [ ] Phase 3: Network analysis\n- [ ] Phase 4: Accessibility snapshot\n- [ ] Phase 5: Codebase analysis (skip if third-party site)\n```\n\n### Phase 1: Performance Trace\n\n1. Navigate to the target URL:\n   ```\n   navigate_page(url: \"<target-url>\")\n   ```\n\n2. Start a performance trace with reload to capture cold-load metrics:\n   ```\n   performance_start_trace(autoStop: true, reload: true)\n   ```\n\n3. Wait for trace completion, then retrieve results.\n\n**Troubleshooting:**\n- If trace returns empty or fails, verify the page loaded correctly with `navigate_page` first\n- If insight names don''t match, inspect the trace response to list available insights\n\n### Phase 2: Core Web Vitals Analysis\n\nUse `performance_analyze_insight` to extract key metrics.\n\n**Note:** Insight names may vary across Chrome DevTools versions. If an insight name doesn''t work, check the `insightSetId` from the trace response to discover available insights.\n\nCommon insight names:\n\n| Metric | Insight Name | What to Look For |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| LCP | `LCPBreakdown` | Time to largest contentful paint; breakdown of TTFB, resource load, render delay |\n| CLS | `CLSCulprits` | Elements causing layout shifts (images without dimensions, injected content, font swaps) |\n| Render Blocking | `RenderBlocking` | CSS/JS blocking first paint |\n| Document Latency | `DocumentLatency` | Server response time issues |\n| Network Dependencies | `NetworkRequestsDepGraph` | Request chains delaying critical resources |\n\nExample:\n```\nperformance_analyze_insight(insightSetId: \"<id-from-trace>\", insightName: \"LCPBreakdown\")\n```\n\n**Key thresholds (good/needs-improvement/poor):**\n- TTFB: < 800ms / < 1.8s / > 1.8s\n- FCP: < 1.8s / < 3s / > 3s\n- LCP: < 2.5s / < 4s / > 4s\n- INP: < 200ms / < 500ms / > 500ms\n- TBT: < 200ms / < 600ms / > 600ms\n- CLS: < 0.1 / < 0.25 / > 0.25\n- Speed Index: < 3.4s / < 5.8s / > 5.8s\n\n### Phase 3: Network Analysis\n\nList all network requests to identify optimization opportunities:\n```\nlist_network_requests(resourceTypes: [\"Script\", \"Stylesheet\", \"Document\", \"Font\", \"Image\"])\n```\n\n**Look for:**\n\n1. **Render-blocking resources**: JS/CSS in `<head>` without `async`/`defer`/`media` attributes\n2. **Network chains**: Resources discovered late because they depend on other resources loading first (e.g., CSS imports, JS-loaded fonts)\n3. **Missing preloads**: Critical resources (fonts, hero images, key scripts) not preloaded\n4. **Caching issues**: Missing or weak `Cache-Control`, `ETag`, or `Last-Modified` headers\n5. **Large payloads**: Uncompressed or oversized JS/CSS bundles\n6. **Unused preconnects**: If flagged, verify by checking if ANY requests went to that origin. If zero requests, it''s definitively unused—recommend removal. If requests exist but loaded late, the preconnect may still be valuable.\n\nFor detailed request info:\n```\nget_network_request(reqid: <id>)\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Accessibility Snapshot\n\nTake an accessibility tree snapshot:\n```\ntake_snapshot(verbose: true)\n```\n\n**Flag high-level gaps:**\n- Missing or duplicate ARIA IDs\n- Elements with poor contrast ratios (check against WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text)\n- Focus traps or missing focus indicators\n- Interactive elements without accessible names\n\n## Phase 5: Codebase Analysis\n\n**Skip if auditing a third-party site without codebase access.**\n\nAnalyze the codebase to understand where improvements can be made.\n\n### Detect Framework & Bundler\n\nSearch for configuration files to identify the stack:\n\n| Tool | Config Files |\n|------|--------------|\n| Webpack | `webpack.config.js`, `webpack.*.js` |\n| Vite | `vite.config.js`, `vite.config.ts` |\n| Rollup | `rollup.config.js`, `rollup.config.mjs` |\n| esbuild | `esbuild.config.js`, build scripts with `esbuild` |\n| Parcel | `.parcelrc`, `package.json` (parcel field) |\n| Next.js | `next.config.js`, `next.config.mjs` |\n| Nuxt | `nuxt.config.js`, `nuxt.config.ts` |\n| SvelteKit | `svelte.config.js` |\n| Astro | `astro.config.mjs` |\n\nAlso check `package.json` for framework dependencies and build scripts.\n\n### Tree-Shaking & Dead Code\n\n- **Webpack**: Check for `mode: ''production''`, `sideEffects` in package.json, `usedExports` optimization\n- **Vite/Rollup**: Tree-shaking enabled by default; check for `treeshake` options\n- **Look for**: Barrel files (`index.js` re-exports), large utility libraries imported wholesale (lodash, moment)\n\n### Unused JS/CSS\n\n- Check for CSS-in-JS vs. static CSS extraction\n- Look for PurgeCSS/UnCSS configuration (Tailwind''s `content` config)\n- Identify dynamic imports vs. eager loading\n\n### Polyfills\n\n- Check for `@babel/preset-env` targets and `useBuiltIns` setting\n- Look for `core-js` imports (often oversized)\n- Check `browserslist` config for overly broad targeting\n\n### Compression & Minification\n\n- Check for `terser`, `esbuild`, or `swc` minification\n- Look for gzip/brotli compression in build output or server config\n- Check for source maps in production builds (should be external or disabled)\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent findings as:\n\n1. **Core Web Vitals Summary** - Table with metric, value, and rating (good/needs-improvement/poor)\n2. **Top Issues** - Prioritized list of problems with estimated impact (high/medium/low)\n3. **Recommendations** - Specific, actionable fixes with code snippets or config changes\n4. **Codebase Findings** - Framework/bundler detected, optimization opportunities (omit if no codebase access)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:10:24.265Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced web page analysis capabilities using Chrome DevTools MCP tools.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Chrome DevTools MCP工具进行高级网页分析的性能优化代理","ja":"Chrome DevTools MCPツールを使用した高度なWebページ分析機能を必要とするパフォーマンス最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"크롬 개발자 도구 MCP 도구를 사용하여 고급 웹 페이지 분석 기능이 필요한 성능 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que necesitan capacidades de análisis de páginas web avanzadas utilizando las herramientas MCP de Chrome DevTools.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de performances ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse de pages web avancées en utilisant les outils MCP de Chrome DevTools.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungsoptimierungsagenten, die erweiterte Webseitenanalysefunktionen mit Chrome DevTools MCP-Tools benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de páginas da web usando as ferramentas MCP do Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации производительности, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа веб-страниц с помощью инструментов MCP Chrome DevTools.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الأداء الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل صفحات الويب باستخدام أدوات MCP من Chrome DevTools."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct web performance audits, focusing on Core Web Vitals, network optimization, and high-level accessibility gaps using Chrome DevTools'' MCP server and protocols like HTTP.","zh":"赋予代理进行Web性能审计的能力，关注核心Web指标、网络优化和高级可访问性差距，使用Chrome DevTools的MCP服务器和HTTP等协议","ja":"エージェントがCore Web Vitals、ネットワーク最適化、ハイレベルなアクセシビリティギャップに焦点を当てたWebパフォーマンス監査を実行する能力を提供する。Chrome DevToolsのMCPサーバーとHTTPなどのプロトコルを使用","ko":"에이전트가 코어 웹 비탈스, 네트워크 최적화, 고급 접근성 격차에 초점을 맞춘 웹 성능 감사를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여한다. 크롬 개발자 도구의 MCP 서버와 HTTP 등의 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar auditorías de rendimiento web, centrándose en Core Web Vitals, optimización de red y brechas de accesibilidad de alto nivel utilizando el servidor MCP y protocolos como HTTP de Chrome DevTools.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de performances web, en se concentrant sur Core Web Vitals, l''optimisation du réseau et les lacunes d''accessibilité de haut niveau en utilisant le serveur MCP et des protocoles comme HTTP de Chrome DevTools.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Web-Leistungsaudits durchzuführen, die sich auf Core Web Vitals, Netzwerkoptimierung und höhere Zugänglichkeitslücken konzentrieren, indem sie den MCP-Server und Protokolle wie HTTP von Chrome DevTools verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de desempenho da web, focalizando nos Vitais da Web Core, otimização de rede e lacunas de acessibilidade de alto nível usando o servidor MCP e protocolos como o HTTP do Chrome DevTools.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить аудиты веб-производительности, фокусируясь на основных веб-виталиях, оптимизации сети и высокоуровневых пробелах в доступности с помощью сервера MCP и протоколов, таких как HTTP, в Chrome DevTools.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إجراء عمليات تدقيق أداء الويب، مع التركيز على الجوانب الأساسية لأداء الويب وأoptimização الشبكة والثغرات في إمكانية الوصول إلى مستوى عال باستخدام خادم MCP وبروتوكولات مثل بروتوكول HTTP من Chrome DevTools."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing web page performance for Core Web Vitals","Optimizing network requests for faster page loads","Identifying high-level accessibility gaps in web applications"],"zh":["为核心Web指标审计网页性能","为加快页面加载优化网络请求","在Web应用中识别高级可访问性差距"],"ja":["Core Web Vitalsの監査のためのWebページパフォーマンス","ページロードの高速化のためのネットワークリクエストの最適化","Webアプリケーションにおけるハイレベルなアクセシビリティギャップの特定"],"ko":["코어 웹 비탈스를 위한 웹 페이지 성능 감사","페이지 로드 속도 향상을 위한 네트워크 요청 최적화","웹 애플리케이션에서 고급 접근성 격차 식별"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de la página web para Core Web Vitals","Optimización de solicitudes de red para cargas de página más rápidas","Identificación de brechas de accesibilidad de alto nivel en aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Audit des performances de la page web pour Core Web Vitals","Optimisation des requêtes réseau pour des chargements de page plus rapides","Identification des lacunes d''accessibilité de haut niveau dans les applications web"],"de":["Auditoría del rendimiento de la página web para Core Web Vitals","Optimierung von Netzwerkanfragen für schnellere Seitenaufbauzeiten","Identifizierung von höheren Zugänglichkeitslücken in Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Auditoria de desempenho de páginas da web para Vitais da Web Core","Otimização de solicitações de rede para carregamentos de página mais rápidos","Identificação de lacunas de acessibilidade de alto nível em aplicações da web"],"ru":["Аудит веб-страниц на производительность для основных веб-виталий","Оптимизация сетевых запросов для более быстрой загрузки страниц","Определение высокоуровневых пробелов в доступности веб-приложений"],"ar":["تدقيق أداء صفحات الويب لجوانب أداء الويب الأساسية","تحسين طلبات الشبكة للحصول على تحميل صفحة أسرع","تحديد الثغرات في إمكانية الوصول إلى مستوى عال في تطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires chrome-devtools MCP server configuration","Needs navigate_page or performance_start_trace functionality available"],"zh":["需要chrome-devtools MCP服务器配置","需要navigate_page或performance_start_trace功能可用"],"ja":["chrome-devtools MCPサーバーの構成が必要","navigate_pageまたはperformance_start_trace機能が使用可能である必要"],"ko":["크롬 개발자 도구 MCP 서버 구성이 필요","navigate_page 또는 performance_start_trace 기능이 사용 가능해야 함"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor MCP de chrome-devtools","Necesita la función navigate_page o performance_start_trace disponible"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur MCP de chrome-devtools","Nécessite la fonctionnalité navigate_page ou performance_start_trace disponible"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration des chrome-devtools-MCP-Servers","Benötigt die Funktion navigate_page oder performance_start_trace"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor MCP do chrome-devtools","Necessita da funcionalidade navigate_page ou performance_start_trace disponível"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера MCP chrome-devtools","Требует доступности функциональности navigate_page или performance_start_trace"],"ar":["يتطلب cấu hình خادم MCP لبرنامج Chrome DevTools","يحتاج إلى توافر وظائف navigate_page أو performance_start_trace"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/governance-checklist-generator', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'governance-checklist-generator', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z', '2026-02-18T02:10:35.250Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/governance-checklist-generator","name":"governance-checklist-generator","description":{"zh":"Governance Checklist Generator 为企业工作流提供自动化的治理检查清单任务，涵盖项目管理、合规性、治理和企业集成模式","ja":"ガバナンスチェックリストジェネレーターは、企業ワークフローに自動化されたガバナンスチェックリストタスクを提供し、プロジェクト管理、コンプライアンス、ガバナンス、エンタープライズ統合パターンをカバー","ko":"Governance Checklist Generator는 기업 워크플로에서 자동화된 治理 점검 목록 작업을 제공하며, 프로젝트 관리, 컴플라이언스, 治理, 기업 통합 패턴을 포함","es":"El generador de lista de verificación de gobernanza ofrece asistencia automatizada para tareas de gobernanza en flujos de trabajo empresariales.","fr":"Le générateur de checklist de gouvernance fournit une assistance automatisée pour les tâches de gouvernance dans les flux de travail d''entreprise.","de":"Der Governance-Checkliste-Generator bietet automatisierte Unterstützung für Governance-Aufgaben in Unternehmensworkflows.","pt":"O gerador de lista de verificação de governança fornece assistência automatizada para tarefas de governança. Ele ajuda a melhorar a conformidade e a gestão de projetos.","ru":"Генератор контрольного списка управления предоставляет автоматизированную помощь для задач управления. Он помогает улучшить соответствие и управление проектами.","ar":"مُولِد قَائِمَةِ اِحْتِرَازِ اَلحُكُومَة يُقَدِم اَلْمَسَاعَدَة اَلأُتْمَاتِيَّة لِمُهَام اَلحُكُومَة. يُسَاعَد فِي تَحْسِين اَلوَافَقِيَة وَإدَارَة اَلمَشَارِع","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Governance Checklist Generator - 企业工作流自动化","ja":"ガバナンスチェックリストジェネレーター - 企業ワ