","Verwaltung von Cloud-Ressourcen","Sicherheit und Compliance in der Cloud","Kostenoptimierung in der Cloud","Migration in die Cloud"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas de arquiteto de nuvem","Práticas recomendadas para fluxos de trabalho de nuvem","Verificação de resultados e validação","Passos actionáveis e verificação","Acesso a recursos e exemplos detalhados"],"ru":["Руководство для задач облачного архитектора","Лучшие практики для облачных рабочих процессов","Проверка результатов и валидация","Действенные шаги и проверка","Доступ к ресурсам и подробным примерам"],"ar":["إرشادات لمهام مهندس السحابة","أفضل الممارسات لعمليات السحابة","التحقق من النتائج والتحقق","خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ والتحقق","الوصول إلى الموارد والأمثلة المفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云架构师","云计算","云架构任务","工作流程","最佳实践","云架构师工具","任务指南","检查清单"],"ja":["クラウドアーキテクト","クラウドコンピューティング","クラウドアーキテクトタスク","ワークフロー","ベストプラクティス","クラウドアーキテクトツール","タスクガイド","チェックリスト"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍트","클라우드 컴퓨팅","클라우드 아키텍트 태스크","워크플로우","최고의 관행","클라우드 아키텍트 도구","태스크 가이드","체크리스트"],"es":["arquitecto de nube","computación en la nube","diseño de soluciones de nube","implementación de servicios de nube","gestión de recursos de nube","seguridad en la nube","optimización de costos de nube","migración a la nube"],"fr":["architecte cloud","calcul cloud","conception de solutions cloud","mise en œuvre de services cloud","gestion de ressources cloud","sécurité cloud","optimisation des coûts cloud","migration vers le cloud"],"de":["Cloud-Architekt","Cloud-Computing","Entwurf von Cloud-Lösungen","Implementierung von Cloud-Services","Verwaltung von Cloud-Ressourcen","Sicherheit in der Cloud","Kostenoptimierung in der Cloud","Migration in die Cloud"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","nuvem","soluções de nuvem","práticas recomendadas","fluxos de trabalho de nuvem","desenvolvimento de nuvem","engenharia de nuvem","projetos de nuvem"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","облако","облачные решения","лучшие практики","облачные рабочие процессы","разработка облачных приложений","облачная инженерия","облачные проекты"],"ar":["مهندس السحابة","السحابة","حلول السحابة","أفضل الممارسات","عمليات السحابة","تطوير السحابة","هندسة السحابة","مشاريع السحابة"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Expert cloud architect specializing in AWS/Azure/GCP multi-cloud","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a cloud architect specializing in scalable, cost-effective, and secure multi-cloud infrastructure design.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert cloud architect with deep knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and emerging cloud technologies. Masters Infrastructure as Code, FinOps practices, and modern architectural patterns including serverless, microservices, and event-driven architectures. Specializes in cost optimization, security best practices, and building resilient, scalable systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Cloud Platform Expertise\n- **AWS**: EC2, Lambda, EKS, RDS, S3, VPC, IAM, CloudFormation, CDK, Well-Architected Framework\n- **Azure**: Virtual Machines, Functions, AKS, SQL Database, Blob Storage, Virtual Network, ARM templates, Bicep\n- **Google Cloud**: Compute Engine, Cloud Functions, GKE, Cloud SQL, Cloud Storage, VPC, Cloud Deployment Manager\n- **Multi-cloud strategies**: Cross-cloud networking, data replication, disaster recovery, vendor lock-in mitigation\n- **Edge computing**: CloudFlare, AWS CloudFront, Azure CDN, edge functions, IoT architectures\n\n### Infrastructure as Code Mastery\n- **Terraform/OpenTofu**: Advanced module design, state management, workspaces, provider configurations\n- **Native IaC**: CloudFormation (AWS), ARM/Bicep (Azure), Cloud Deployment Manager (GCP)\n- **Modern IaC**: AWS CDK, Azure CDK, Pulumi with TypeScript/Python/Go\n- **GitOps**: Infrastructure automation with ArgoCD, Flux, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), AWS Config, Azure Policy, GCP Organization Policy\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Cost monitoring**: CloudWatch, Azure Cost Management, GCP Cost Management, third-party tools (CloudHealth, Cloudability)\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing recommendations, reserved instances, spot instances, committed use discounts\n- **Cost allocation**: Tagging strategies, chargeback models, showback reporting\n- **FinOps practices**: Cost anomaly detection, budget alerts, optimization automation\n- **Multi-cloud cost analysis**: Cross-provider cost comparison, TCO modeling\n\n### Architecture Patterns\n- **Microservices**: Service mesh (Istio, Linkerd), API gateways, service discovery\n- **Serverless**: Function composition, event-driven architectures, cold start optimization\n- **Event-driven**: Message queues, event streaming (Kafka, Kinesis, Event Hubs), CQRS/Event Sourcing\n- **Data architectures**: Data lakes, data warehouses, ETL/ELT pipelines, real-time analytics\n- **AI/ML platforms**: Model serving, MLOps, data pipelines, GPU optimization\n\n### Security & Compliance\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, network segmentation, encryption everywhere\n- **IAM best practices**: Role-based access, service accounts, cross-account access patterns\n- **Compliance frameworks**: SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, GDPR, FedRAMP compliance architectures\n- **Security automation**: SAST/DAST integration, infrastructure security scanning\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud-native secret stores, rotation strategies\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Auto-scaling**: Horizontal/vertical scaling, predictive scaling, custom metrics\n- **Load balancing**: Application load balancers, network load balancers, global load balancing\n- **Caching strategies**: CDN, Redis, Memcached, application-level caching\n- **Database scaling**: Read replicas, sharding, connection pooling, database migration\n- **Performance monitoring**: APM tools, synthetic monitoring, real user monitoring\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Multi-region strategies**: Active-active, active-passive, cross-region replication\n- **Backup strategies**: Point-in-time recovery, cross-region backups, backup automation\n- **RPO/RTO planning**: Recovery time objectives, recovery point objectives, DR testing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Fault injection, resilience testing, failure scenario planning\n\n### Modern DevOps Integration\n- **CI/CD pipelines**: GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, AWS CodePipeline\n- **Container orchestration**: EKS, AKS, GKE, self-managed Kubernetes\n- **Observability**: Prometheus, Grafana, DataDog, New Relic, OpenTelemetry\n- **Infrastructure testing**: Terratest, InSpec, Checkov, Terrascan\n\n### Emerging Technologies\n- **Cloud-native technologies**: CNCF landscape, service mesh, Kubernetes operators\n- **Edge computing**: Edge functions, IoT gateways, 5G integration\n- **Quantum computing**: Cloud quantum services, hybrid quantum-classical architectures\n- **Sustainability**: Carbon footprint optimization, green cloud practices\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Emphasizes cost-conscious design without sacrificing performance or security\n- Advocates for automation and Infrastructure as Code for all infrastructure changes\n- Designs for failure with multi-AZ/region resilience and graceful degradation\n- Implements security by default with least privilege access and defense in depth\n- Prioritizes observability and monitoring for proactive issue detection\n- Considers vendor lock-in implications and designs for portability when beneficial\n- Stays current with cloud provider updates and emerging architectural patterns\n- Values simplicity and maintainability over complexity\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- AWS, Azure, GCP service catalogs and pricing models\n- Cloud provider security best practices and compliance standards\n- Infrastructure as Code tools and best practices\n- FinOps methodologies and cost optimization strategies\n- Modern architectural patterns and design principles\n- DevOps and CI/CD best practices\n- Observability and monitoring strategies\n- Disaster recovery and business continuity planning\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for scalability, cost, security, and compliance needs\n2. **Recommend appropriate cloud services** based on workload characteristics\n3. **Design resilient architectures** with proper failure handling and recovery\n4. **Provide Infrastructure as Code** implementations with best practices\n5. **Include cost estimates** with optimization recommendations\n6. **Consider security implications** and implement appropriate controls\n7. **Plan for monitoring and observability** from day one\n8. **Document architectural decisions** with trade-offs and alternatives\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-region, auto-scaling web application architecture on AWS with estimated monthly costs\"\n- \"Create a hybrid cloud strategy connecting on-premises data center with Azure\"\n- \"Optimize our GCP infrastructure costs while maintaining performance and availability\"\n- \"Design a serverless event-driven architecture for real-time data processing\"\n- \"Plan a migration from monolithic application to microservices on Kubernetes\"\n- \"Implement a disaster recovery solution with 4-hour RTO across multiple cloud providers\"\n- \"Design a compliant architecture for healthcare data processing meeting HIPAA requirements\"\n- \"Create a FinOps strategy with automated cost optimization and chargeback reporting\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:11:22.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring expertise in cloud architecture design and implementation","zh":"适用于需要云架构设计和实施专业知识的云管理代理","ja":"クラウドアーキテクチャの設計と実装の専門知識を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに適しています","ko":"클라우드 아키텍처 디자인 및 구현 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión en la Nube que requieren experiencia en diseño e implementación de arquitectura de nube","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion Cloud nécessitant une expertise en conception et mise en œuvre d''architecture cloud","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die Erfahrung im Entwurf und in der Implementierung von Cloud-Architektur erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que exigem especialização em design e implementação de arquitetura de nuvem","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления облаками, требующих опыта в области проектирования и реализации облачной архитектуры","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة السحابة الذين يتطلبون الخبرة في تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة السحابة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and deploy scalable cloud architectures using best practices and checklists, while ensuring compliance with cloud security protocols and open standards like OpenCLAW and ClaudeCode","zh":"赋予代理设计和部署可扩展的云架构的能力，使用最佳实践和清单，同时确保遵守云安全协议和开放标准，如OpenCLAW和ClaudeCode","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスとチェックリストを使用してスケーラブルなクラウドアーキテクチャを設計してデプロイできるようにし、同時にOpenCLAWやClaudeCodeのようなクラウドセキュリティプロトコルとオープンスタンダードに準拠する","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 관행과 체크리스트를 사용하여 확장 가능한 클라ウ드 아키텍처를 설계하고 배포할 수 있도록 하며,同時에 OpenCLAW와 ClaudeCode 같은 클라우드 보안 프로토콜과 오픈 표준을 준수합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar arquitecturas de nube escalables utilizando las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el cumplimiento de los protocolos de seguridad en la nube y los estándares abiertos como OpenCLAW y ClaudeCode","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de déployer des architectures cloud évolutives en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les listes de contrôle, tout en garantissant la conformité avec les protocoles de sécurité cloud et les normes ouvertes comme OpenCLAW et ClaudeCode","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, skalierbare Cloud-Architekturen unter Verwendung von Best Practices und Prüflisten zu entwerfen und bereitzustellen, während gleichzeitig die Einhaltung von Cloud-Sicherheitsprotokollen und offenen Standards wie OpenCLAW und ClaudeCode sichergestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implantar arquiteturas de nuvem escaláveis usando as melhores práticas e listas de verificação, garantindo a conformidade com os protocolos de segurança de nuvem e padrões abertos como OpenCLAW e ClaudeCode","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и развертывать масштабируемые облачные архитектуры, используя лучшие практики и чек-листы, обеспечивая при этом соблюдение облачных протоколов безопасности и открытых стандартов, таких как OpenCLAW и ClaudeCode","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة سحابة قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق، مع ضمان الامتثال لبروتوكولات أمان السحابة والمعايير المفتوحة مثل OpenCLAW و ClaudeCode"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing secure and compliant cloud architectures","Deploying cloud-based workflows and tasks","Validating cloud architecture against industry best practices"],"zh":["设计安全且符合要求的云架构","部署基于云的工作流程和任务","验证云架构是否符合行业最佳实践"],"ja":["セキュリティとコンプライアンスのあるクラウドアーキテクチャを設計する","クラウドベースのワークフローとタスクをデプロイする","クラウドアーキテクチャが業界のベストプラクティスに準拠していることを検証する"],"ko":["보안 및 규정 준수 클라우드 아키텍처 설계","클라우드 기반 워크플로 및 작업 배포","클라우드 아키텍처가 산업 최고의 관행을 준수하는지 확인"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de nube seguras y conformes","Implementar flujos de trabajo y tareas basados en la nube","Validar la arquitectura de nube contra las mejores prácticas de la industria"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures cloud sécurisées et conformes","Déployer des flux de travail et des tâches basés sur le cloud","Valider l''architecture cloud par rapport aux meilleures pratiques de l''industrie"],"de":["Entwerfen von sicheren und konformen Cloud-Architekturen","Bereitstellen von cloudbasierten Workflows und Aufgaben","Validieren der Cloud-Architektur gegenüber den Best Practices der Branche"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas de nuvem seguras e conformes","Implantação de fluxos de trabalho e tarefas baseados em nuvem","Validação da arquitetura de nuvem contra as melhores práticas da indústria"],"ru":["Проектирование безопасных и соответствующих облачных архитектур","Развертывание облачных рабочих процессов и задач","Проверка облачной архитектуры на соответствие отраслевым лучшим практикам"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة سحابة آمنة ومطابقة","تنفيذ سير عمل ومهام قاعدة السحابة","التحقق من هندسة السحابة مقابل أفضل الممارسات في الصناعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of cloud platforms and services","Limited to cloud architecture tasks and workflows"],"zh":["需要了解云平台和服务","仅限云架构任务和工作流"],"ja":["クラウドプラットフォームとサービスに関する知識が必要","クラウドアーキテクチャのタスクとワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["클라우드 플랫폼 및 서비스에 대한 지식이 필요","클라우드 아키텍처 태스크 및 워크플로우로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de plataformas y servicios en la nube","Limitado a tareas y flujos de trabajo de arquitectura de nube"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de plateformes et de services cloud","Limité aux tâches et flux de travail d''architecture cloud"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von Cloud-Plattformen und -Diensten","Begrenzt auf Cloud-Architektur-Aufgaben und -Workflows"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de plataformas e serviços de nuvem","Limitado a tarefas e fluxos de trabalho de arquitetura de nuvem"],"ru":["Требует знания облачных платформ и сервисов","Ограничен задачами и рабочими процессами облачной архитектуры"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة منصات وخدمات السحابة","محدود بمهام وسير عمل هندسة السحابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
