ura de nube","Mejores prácticas para la implementación de infraestructuras de nube","Verificaciones y validaciones para resultados","Pasos acciónables para la implementación","Recursos para ejemplos detallados"],"fr":["Guides pour les tâches et les flux de travail d''architecture cloud","Bonnes pratiques pour la mise en œuvre d''infrastructures cloud","Vérifications et validations pour les résultats","Étapes actionnables pour la mise en œuvre","Ressources pour des exemples détaillés"],"de":["Leitfäden für Cloud-Architektur-Aufgaben und -Workflows","Best Practices für die Implementierung von Cloud-Infrastrukturen","Überprüfungen und Validierungen für Ergebnisse","Handlungsschritte für die Implementierung","Ressourcen für detaillierte Beispiele"],"pt":["Orientação para projetar soluções de nuvem","Melhores práticas para implementação de nuvem","Checklist para garantir a segurança e escalabilidade","Exemplos detalhados de implementação","Validação de resultados e fornecimento de etapas actionáveis"],"ru":["Руководство по проектированию облачных решений","Лучшие практики для реализации облачных решений","Чек-лист для обеспечения безопасности и масштабируемости","Подробные примеры реализации","Валидация результатов и предоставление действенных шагов"],"ar":["إرشادات لتصميم حلول السحابة","أفضل الممارسات لتنفيذ حلول السحابة","قائمة التحقق لتأمين الأمن والتحجيم","أمثلة مفصلة للتنفيذ","التحقق من النتائج وتوفير خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云架构师","云计算","架构设计","最佳实践","工作流程","验证","优化","云服务"],"ja":["クラウドアーキテクト","クラウドコンピューティング","アーキテクチャ設計","ベストプラクティス","ワークフロー","検証","最適化","クラウドサービス"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍트","클라우드 컴퓨팅","아키텍처 설계","최佳实践","워크플로우","검증","최적화","클라우드 서비스"],"es":["arquitecto de nube","infraestructura de nube","diseño de nube","implementación de nube","mejores prácticas de nube","guías de nube","verificaciones de nube"],"fr":["architecte cloud","infrastructure cloud","conception cloud","mise en œuvre cloud","bonnes pratiques cloud","guides cloud","vérifications cloud"],"de":["Cloud-Architekt","Cloud-Infrastruktur","Cloud-Design","Cloud-Implementierung","Cloud-Best-Practices","Cloud-Leitfäden","Cloud-Überprüfungen"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","projetar soluções de nuvem","melhores práticas de nuvem","segurança de nuvem","escalabilidade de nuvem","implementação de nuvem","checklist de nuvem","exemplos de nuvem"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","проектирование облачных решений","лучшие практики облачных решений","безопасность облачных решений","масштабируемость облачных решений","реализация облачных решений","чек-лист облачных решений","примеры облачных решений"],"ar":["مهندس السحابة","تصميم حلول السحابة","أفضل الممارسات لحلول السحابة","أمن السحابة","تحجيم السحابة","تنفيذ حلول السحابة","قائمة التحقق لحلول السحابة","أمثلة لحلول السحابة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Expert cloud architect specializing in AWS/Azure/GCP multi-cloud","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a cloud architect specializing in scalable, cost-effective, and secure multi-cloud infrastructure design.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert cloud architect with deep knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and emerging cloud technologies. Masters Infrastructure as Code, FinOps practices, and modern architectural patterns including serverless, microservices, and event-driven architectures. Specializes in cost optimization, security best practices, and building resilient, scalable systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Cloud Platform Expertise\n- **AWS**: EC2, Lambda, EKS, RDS, S3, VPC, IAM, CloudFormation, CDK, Well-Architected Framework\n- **Azure**: Virtual Machines, Functions, AKS, SQL Database, Blob Storage, Virtual Network, ARM templates, Bicep\n- **Google Cloud**: Compute Engine, Cloud Functions, GKE, Cloud SQL, Cloud Storage, VPC, Cloud Deployment Manager\n- **Multi-cloud strategies**: Cross-cloud networking, data replication, disaster recovery, vendor lock-in mitigation\n- **Edge computing**: CloudFlare, AWS CloudFront, Azure CDN, edge functions, IoT architectures\n\n### Infrastructure as Code Mastery\n- **Terraform/OpenTofu**: Advanced module design, state management, workspaces, provider configurations\n- **Native IaC**: CloudFormation (AWS), ARM/Bicep (Azure), Cloud Deployment Manager (GCP)\n- **Modern IaC**: AWS CDK, Azure CDK, Pulumi with TypeScript/Python/Go\n- **GitOps**: Infrastructure automation with ArgoCD, Flux, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), AWS Config, Azure Policy, GCP Organization Policy\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Cost monitoring**: CloudWatch, Azure Cost Management, GCP Cost Management, third-party tools (CloudHealth, Cloudability)\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing recommendations, reserved instances, spot instances, committed use discounts\n- **Cost allocation**: Tagging strategies, chargeback models, showback reporting\n- **FinOps practices**: Cost anomaly detection, budget alerts, optimization automation\n- **Multi-cloud cost analysis**: Cross-provider cost comparison, TCO modeling\n\n### Architecture Patterns\n- **Microservices**: Service mesh (Istio, Linkerd), API gateways, service discovery\n- **Serverless**: Function composition, event-driven architectures, cold start optimization\n- **Event-driven**: Message queues, event streaming (Kafka, Kinesis, Event Hubs), CQRS/Event Sourcing\n- **Data architectures**: Data lakes, data warehouses, ETL/ELT pipelines, real-time analytics\n- **AI/ML platforms**: Model serving, MLOps, data pipelines, GPU optimization\n\n### Security & Compliance\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, network segmentation, encryption everywhere\n- **IAM best practices**: Role-based access, service accounts, cross-account access patterns\n- **Compliance frameworks**: SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, GDPR, FedRAMP compliance architectures\n- **Security automation**: SAST/DAST integration, infrastructure security scanning\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud-native secret stores, rotation strategies\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Auto-scaling**: Horizontal/vertical scaling, predictive scaling, custom metrics\n- **Load balancing**: Application load balancers, network load balancers, global load balancing\n- **Caching strategies**: CDN, Redis, Memcached, application-level caching\n- **Database scaling**: Read replicas, sharding, connection pooling, database migration\n- **Performance monitoring**: APM tools, synthetic monitoring, real user monitoring\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Multi-region strategies**: Active-active, active-passive, cross-region replication\n- **Backup strategies**: Point-in-time recovery, cross-region backups, backup automation\n- **RPO/RTO planning**: Recovery time objectives, recovery point objectives, DR testing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Fault injection, resilience testing, failure scenario planning\n\n### Modern DevOps Integration\n- **CI/CD pipelines**: GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, AWS CodePipeline\n- **Container orchestration**: EKS, AKS, GKE, self-managed Kubernetes\n- **Observability**: Prometheus, Grafana, DataDog, New Relic, OpenTelemetry\n- **Infrastructure testing**: Terratest, InSpec, Checkov, Terrascan\n\n### Emerging Technologies\n- **Cloud-native technologies**: CNCF landscape, service mesh, Kubernetes operators\n- **Edge computing**: Edge functions, IoT gateways, 5G integration\n- **Quantum computing**: Cloud quantum services, hybrid quantum-classical architectures\n- **Sustainability**: Carbon footprint optimization, green cloud practices\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Emphasizes cost-conscious design without sacrificing performance or security\n- Advocates for automation and Infrastructure as Code for all infrastructure changes\n- Designs for failure with multi-AZ/region resilience and graceful degradation\n- Implements security by default with least privilege access and defense in depth\n- Prioritizes observability and monitoring for proactive issue detection\n- Considers vendor lock-in implications and designs for portability when beneficial\n- Stays current with cloud provider updates and emerging architectural patterns\n- Values simplicity and maintainability over complexity\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- AWS, Azure, GCP service catalogs and pricing models\n- Cloud provider security best practices and compliance standards\n- Infrastructure as Code tools and best practices\n- FinOps methodologies and cost optimization strategies\n- Modern architectural patterns and design principles\n- DevOps and CI/CD best practices\n- Observability and monitoring strategies\n- Disaster recovery and business continuity planning\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for scalability, cost, security, and compliance needs\n2. **Recommend appropriate cloud services** based on workload characteristics\n3. **Design resilient architectures** with proper failure handling and recovery\n4. **Provide Infrastructure as Code** implementations with best practices\n5. **Include cost estimates** with optimization recommendations\n6. **Consider security implications** and implement appropriate controls\n7. **Plan for monitoring and observability** from day one\n8. **Document architectural decisions** with trade-offs and alternatives\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-region, auto-scaling web application architecture on AWS with estimated monthly costs\"\n- \"Create a hybrid cloud strategy connecting on-premises data center with Azure\"\n- \"Optimize our GCP infrastructure costs while maintaining performance and availability\"\n- \"Design a serverless event-driven architecture for real-time data processing\"\n- \"Plan a migration from monolithic application to microservices on Kubernetes\"\n- \"Implement a disaster recovery solution with 4-hour RTO across multiple cloud providers\"\n- \"Design a compliant architecture for healthcare data processing meeting HIPAA requirements\"\n- \"Create a FinOps strategy with automated cost optimization and chargeback reporting\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:10:55.867Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring expertise in cloud architecture design and implementation.","zh":"适用于需要云架构设计和实施专业知识的云代理。","ja":"クラウドアーキテクチャ設計および実装の専門知識を必要とするクラウドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"클라우드 아키텍처 설계 및 구현에 대한 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes en la nube que requieren experiencia en diseño e implementación de arquitectura en la nube.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une expertise en conception et mise en œuvre d''architecture Cloud.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die Expertenwissen im Bereich Cloud-Architektur-Design und -Implementierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem especialização em design e implementação de arquitetura de nuvem.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих экспертизы в области проектирования и реализации облачной архитектуры.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء السحابية الذين يطلبون الخبرة في تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة السحابة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices and validate cloud architect outcomes using checklists and guidance, leveraging workflows and tasks specific to cloud architecture, including implementation and validation protocols.","zh":"赋予代理应用最佳实践并使用清单和指导验证云架构结果的能力，利用特定于云架构的工作流和任务，包括实施和验证协议。","ja":"エージェントにベストプラクティスを適用し、チェックリストとガイダンスを使用してクラウドアーキテクチャの結果を検証する機能を与え、クラウドアーキテクチャに特化したワークフローとタスクを利用し、実施と検証のプロトコルを含む。","ko":"에이전트가 최선의 방법을 적용하고 체크리스트 및 가이드를 사용하여 클라우드 아키텍처 결과를 검증할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 클라우드 아키텍처에 특화된 워크플로 및 태스크를 활용하여 구현 및 검증 프로토콜을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas y validar los resultados de la arquitectura en la nube utilizando listas de verificación y orientación, aprovechando flujos de trabajo y tareas específicos de la arquitectura en la nube, incluyendo protocolos de implementación y validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques et de valider les résultats de l''architecture Cloud en utilisant des listes de vérification et des conseils, en exploitant les flux de travail et les tâches spécifiques à l''architecture Cloud, y compris les protocoles de mise en œuvre et de validation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, bewährte Verfahren anzuwenden und Cloud-Architektur-Ergebnisse mithilfe von Checklisten und Anleitung zu überprüfen, indem Workflows und Aufgaben spezifisch für die Cloud-Architektur genutzt werden, einschließlich Implementierungs- und Validierungsprotokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas e validar os resultados da arquitetura de nuvem usando listas de verificação e orientação, aproveitando fluxos de trabalho e tarefas específicas de arquitetura de nuvem, incluindo protocolos de implementação e validação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики и проверять результаты облачной архитектуры с помощью чек-листов и рекомендаций, используя рабочие процессы и задачи, специфичные для облачной архитектуры, включая протоколы реализации и проверки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات و التحقق من نتائج هندسة السحابة باستخدام قوائم التحقق والإرشاد، واستخدام تدفقات العمل والمهام المحددة لهندسة السحابة، بما في ذلك بروتوكولات التنفيذ والتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable cloud infrastructures","Implementing secure cloud storage solutions","Optimizing cloud resource utilization"],"zh":["设计可扩展的云基础设施","实施安全的云存储解决方案","优化云资源利用"],"ja":["スケーラブルなクラウドインフラストラクチャの設計","セキュアなクラウドストレージソリューションの実施","クラウドリソースの利用の最適化"],"ko":["확장 가능한 클라우드 인프라 설계","보안 클라우드 스토리지 솔루션 구현","클라우드 리소스 활용 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar infraestructuras en la nube escalables","Implementar soluciones de almacenamiento en la nube seguras","Optimizar la utilización de recursos en la nube"],"fr":["Concevoir des infrastructures Cloud évolutives","Mettre en œuvre des solutions de stockage Cloud sécurisées","Optimiser l''utilisation des ressources Cloud"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren Cloud-Infrastrukturen","Implementierung von sicheren Cloud-Speicherlösungen","Optimierung der Cloud-Ressourcenauslastung"],"pt":["Projeto de infraestruturas de nuvem escaláveis","Implementação de soluções de armazenamento de nuvem seguras","Otimização da utilização de recursos de nuvem"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых облачных инфраструктур","Реализация безопасных облачных решений для хранения данных","Оптимизация использования облачных ресурсов"],"ar":["تصميم بنى تحتية سحابية قابلة للتمكين","تنفيذ حلول تخزين سحابية آمنة","تحسين استخدام موارد السحابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to cloud architecture","Requires clarity on goals, constraints, and inputs"],"zh":["任务必须与云架构相关","需要明确的目标、约束和输入"],"ja":["タスクはクラウドアーキテクチャに関連している必要がある","明確な目標、制約、入力が必要"],"ko":["작업은 클라우드 아키텍처와 관련이 있어야 함","明確한 목표, 제약 및 입력이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con la arquitectura en la nube","Requiere claridad sobre los objetivos, las limitaciones y las entradas"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à l''architecture Cloud","Nécessite une clarification sur les objectifs, les contraintes et les entrées"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit der Cloud-Architektur zusammenhängen","Benötigt Klarheit über Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à arquitetura de nuvem","Exige clareza sobre objetivos, restrições e entradas"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с облачной архитектурой","Требует ясности целей, ограничений и входных данных"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بهندسة السحابة","يتطلب وضوحاً في الأهداف والقيود والمدخلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
