ementación de cloud"],"fr":["architecte cloud","codage IA","développement cloud","architecture cloud","technologie cloud","outils de développement cloud","meilleures pratiques cloud","conception cloud","mise en œuvre cloud"],"de":["Cloud-Architekt","KI-Coding","Cloud-Entwicklung","Cloud-Architektur","Cloud-Technologie","Cloud-Entwicklungstools","Best Practices Cloud","Cloud-Design","Cloud-Implementierung"],"pt":["arquiteto de nuvem","código ai","ferramenta de código","nuvem","desenvolvimento de nuvem","soluções de nuvem","tecnologia de nuvem","cloud computing","ai coding assistant"],"ru":["облачный архитектор","ai-код","инструмент кода","облако","разработка облачных решений","облачные решения","облачные технологии","cloud computing","ai-ассистент кодирования"],"ar":["مهندس سحابي","كود الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة كود","السحابة","تطوير السحابة","حلول السحابة","تكنولوجيا السحابة","cloud computing","مساعد كود الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-architect","description":"Expert cloud architect specializing in AWS/Azure/GCP multi-cloud","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cloud architect tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cloud architect\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cloud architect\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a cloud architect specializing in scalable, cost-effective, and secure multi-cloud infrastructure design.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert cloud architect with deep knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and emerging cloud technologies. Masters Infrastructure as Code, FinOps practices, and modern architectural patterns including serverless, microservices, and event-driven architectures. Specializes in cost optimization, security best practices, and building resilient, scalable systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Cloud Platform Expertise\n- **AWS**: EC2, Lambda, EKS, RDS, S3, VPC, IAM, CloudFormation, CDK, Well-Architected Framework\n- **Azure**: Virtual Machines, Functions, AKS, SQL Database, Blob Storage, Virtual Network, ARM templates, Bicep\n- **Google Cloud**: Compute Engine, Cloud Functions, GKE, Cloud SQL, Cloud Storage, VPC, Cloud Deployment Manager\n- **Multi-cloud strategies**: Cross-cloud networking, data replication, disaster recovery, vendor lock-in mitigation\n- **Edge computing**: CloudFlare, AWS CloudFront, Azure CDN, edge functions, IoT architectures\n\n### Infrastructure as Code Mastery\n- **Terraform/OpenTofu**: Advanced module design, state management, workspaces, provider configurations\n- **Native IaC**: CloudFormation (AWS), ARM/Bicep (Azure), Cloud Deployment Manager (GCP)\n- **Modern IaC**: AWS CDK, Azure CDK, Pulumi with TypeScript/Python/Go\n- **GitOps**: Infrastructure automation with ArgoCD, Flux, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD\n- **Policy as Code**: Open Policy Agent (OPA), AWS Config, Azure Policy, GCP Organization Policy\n\n### Cost Optimization & FinOps\n- **Cost monitoring**: CloudWatch, Azure Cost Management, GCP Cost Management, third-party tools (CloudHealth, Cloudability)\n- **Resource optimization**: Right-sizing recommendations, reserved instances, spot instances, committed use discounts\n- **Cost allocation**: Tagging strategies, chargeback models, showback reporting\n- **FinOps practices**: Cost anomaly detection, budget alerts, optimization automation\n- **Multi-cloud cost analysis**: Cross-provider cost comparison, TCO modeling\n\n### Architecture Patterns\n- **Microservices**: Service mesh (Istio, Linkerd), API gateways, service discovery\n- **Serverless**: Function composition, event-driven architectures, cold start optimization\n- **Event-driven**: Message queues, event streaming (Kafka, Kinesis, Event Hubs), CQRS/Event Sourcing\n- **Data architectures**: Data lakes, data warehouses, ETL/ELT pipelines, real-time analytics\n- **AI/ML platforms**: Model serving, MLOps, data pipelines, GPU optimization\n\n### Security & Compliance\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, network segmentation, encryption everywhere\n- **IAM best practices**: Role-based access, service accounts, cross-account access patterns\n- **Compliance frameworks**: SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, GDPR, FedRAMP compliance architectures\n- **Security automation**: SAST/DAST integration, infrastructure security scanning\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud-native secret stores, rotation strategies\n\n### Scalability & Performance\n- **Auto-scaling**: Horizontal/vertical scaling, predictive scaling, custom metrics\n- **Load balancing**: Application load balancers, network load balancers, global load balancing\n- **Caching strategies**: CDN, Redis, Memcached, application-level caching\n- **Database scaling**: Read replicas, sharding, connection pooling, database migration\n- **Performance monitoring**: APM tools, synthetic monitoring, real user monitoring\n\n### Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity\n- **Multi-region strategies**: Active-active, active-passive, cross-region replication\n- **Backup strategies**: Point-in-time recovery, cross-region backups, backup automation\n- **RPO/RTO planning**: Recovery time objectives, recovery point objectives, DR testing\n- **Chaos engineering**: Fault injection, resilience testing, failure scenario planning\n\n### Modern DevOps Integration\n- **CI/CD pipelines**: GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, AWS CodePipeline\n- **Container orchestration**: EKS, AKS, GKE, self-managed Kubernetes\n- **Observability**: Prometheus, Grafana, DataDog, New Relic, OpenTelemetry\n- **Infrastructure testing**: Terratest, InSpec, Checkov, Terrascan\n\n### Emerging Technologies\n- **Cloud-native technologies**: CNCF landscape, service mesh, Kubernetes operators\n- **Edge computing**: Edge functions, IoT gateways, 5G integration\n- **Quantum computing**: Cloud quantum services, hybrid quantum-classical architectures\n- **Sustainability**: Carbon footprint optimization, green cloud practices\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Emphasizes cost-conscious design without sacrificing performance or security\n- Advocates for automation and Infrastructure as Code for all infrastructure changes\n- Designs for failure with multi-AZ/region resilience and graceful degradation\n- Implements security by default with least privilege access and defense in depth\n- Prioritizes observability and monitoring for proactive issue detection\n- Considers vendor lock-in implications and designs for portability when beneficial\n- Stays current with cloud provider updates and emerging architectural patterns\n- Values simplicity and maintainability over complexity\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- AWS, Azure, GCP service catalogs and pricing models\n- Cloud provider security best practices and compliance standards\n- Infrastructure as Code tools and best practices\n- FinOps methodologies and cost optimization strategies\n- Modern architectural patterns and design principles\n- DevOps and CI/CD best practices\n- Observability and monitoring strategies\n- Disaster recovery and business continuity planning\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for scalability, cost, security, and compliance needs\n2. **Recommend appropriate cloud services** based on workload characteristics\n3. **Design resilient architectures** with proper failure handling and recovery\n4. **Provide Infrastructure as Code** implementations with best practices\n5. **Include cost estimates** with optimization recommendations\n6. **Consider security implications** and implement appropriate controls\n7. **Plan for monitoring and observability** from day one\n8. **Document architectural decisions** with trade-offs and alternatives\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a multi-region, auto-scaling web application architecture on AWS with estimated monthly costs\"\n- \"Create a hybrid cloud strategy connecting on-premises data center with Azure\"\n- \"Optimize our GCP infrastructure costs while maintaining performance and availability\"\n- \"Design a serverless event-driven architecture for real-time data processing\"\n- \"Plan a migration from monolithic application to microservices on Kubernetes\"\n- \"Implement a disaster recovery solution with 4-hour RTO across multiple cloud providers\"\n- \"Design a compliant architecture for healthcare data processing meeting HIPAA requirements\"\n- \"Create a FinOps strategy with automated cost optimization and chargeback reporting\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:10:58.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot needing unified cloud architecture guidance and best practices","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、Cursor 和 Copilot 等 AI 编码助手，需要统一的云架构指导和最佳实践","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot などの AI コーディング アシスタントに適しており、統一されたクラウド アーキテクチャ ガイダンスとベスト プラクティスが必要","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot 와 같은 AI 코딩 도우미에 적합하며,統一된 클라우드 아키텍처 가이드와 모범 사례가 필요","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code, Cursor y Copilot que necesitan orientación sobre arquitectura en la nube unificada y las mejores prácticas","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage IA comme Claude Code, Cursor et Copilot ayant besoin d''orientations sur l''architecture cloud unifiée et les meilleures pratiques","de":"Idealer für AI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Copilot, die eine einheitliche Cloud-Architektur-Anleitung und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação de IA, como Claude Code, Cursor e Copilot, que precisam de orientação de arquitetura de nuvem unificada e de boas práticas","ru":"Идеально для помощников кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Copilot, которым необходима унифицированная архитектура облачного хранилища и рекомендации по лучшим практикам","ar":"مثالي لمساعدي التشفير بالذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot الذين يحتاجون إلى توجيه هندسة السحابة الموحدة وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement scalable cloud architectures using smart tech detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources, ensuring streamlined cloud workflows and adherence to industry standards","zh":"赋予代理设计和实施可扩展的云架构的能力，使用智能技术检测、每个项目安装和从上游源自动同步，确保流畅的云工作流和遵守行业标准","ja":"エージェントにスケーラブルなクラウド アーキテクチャを設計して実装する力を与え、スマート テクノロジー検出、プロジェクトごとのインストール、および上流ソースからの自動同期を使用し、クラウド ワークフローの円滑化と業界標準への準拠を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 클라우드 아키텍처를 설계하고 구현할 수 있도록 해주며, 스마트 기술 감지, 프로젝트별 설치 및 업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화를 사용하여 클라우드 워크플로우를 원활하게 하며 산업 표준을 준수","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar arquitecturas de nube escalables utilizando la detección de tecnología inteligente, la instalación por proyecto y la sincronización automática desde fuentes de origen, lo que garantiza flujos de trabajo de nube optimizados y el cumplimiento de los estándares de la industria","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des architectures cloud évolutives en utilisant la détection de technologie intelligente, l''installation par projet et la synchronisation automatique à partir de sources en amont, garantissant ainsi des flux de travail cloud rationalisés et le respect des normes du secteur","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare Cloud-Architekturen mithilfe intelligenter Technologie-Erkennung, projektspezifischer Installation und automatischer Synchronisierung aus Quellen zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, was zu optimierten Cloud-Workflows und der Einhaltung von Branchenstandards führt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar arquiteturas de nuvem escaláveis usando detecção de tecnologia inteligente, instalação por projeto e sincronização automática de fontes de upstream, garantindo fluxos de trabalho de nuvem otimizados e aderência aos padrões da indústria","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать масштабируемые облачные архитектуры с помощью умной детекции технологий, установки на уровне проекта и автоматической синхронизации из источников upstream, обеспечивая оптимизированные облачные рабочие процессы и соблюдение отраслевых стандартов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ هندسة سحابية قابلة للتوسع باستخدام اكتشاف التكنولوجيا الذكية والتركيب على مستوى المشروع والتنظيم التلقائي من مصادر المستوى العلوي، بما يضمن سلاسل عمل سحابية منظمة وامتثال لمعايير الصناعة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing cloud-based system architectures","Implementing cloud security and compliance protocols","Optimizing cloud resource allocation and cost management"],"zh":["基于云的系统架构设计","实现云安全和合规协议","优化云资源分配和成本管理"],"ja":["クラウドベースのシステム アーキテクチャの設計","クラウド セキュリティとコンプライアンス プロトコルの実装","クラウド リソースの割り当てとコスト管理の最適化"],"ko":["클라우드 기반 시스템 아키텍처 설계","클라우드 보안 및 규정 준수 프로토콜 구현","클라우드 리소스 할당 및 비용 관리 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de sistemas basadas en la nube","Implementar protocolos de seguridad y cumplimiento en la nube","Optimizar la asignación de recursos y la gestión de costos en la nube"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de systèmes basées sur le cloud","Mettre en œuvre des protocoles de sécurité et de conformité dans le cloud","Optimiser l''allocation des ressources et la gestion des coûts dans le cloud"],"de":["Entwerfen von Cloud-basierten Systemarchitekturen","Implementierung von Cloud-Sicherheits- und Compliance-Protokollen","Optimierung der Ressourcenzuweisung und der Kostenverwaltung in der Cloud"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas de sistemas baseadas em nuvem","Implementação de protocolos de segurança e conformidade em nuvem","Otimização da alocação de recursos de nuvem e gestão de custos"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектур облачных систем","Реализация протоколов безопасности и соответствия требованиям в облаке","Оптимизация распределения облачных ресурсов и управления затратами"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة أنظمة قائمة على السحابة","تنفيذ بروتوكولات أمن السحابة وملاءمتها","تحسين تخصيص موارد السحابة وإدارة التكاليف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires cloud architecture related tasks or workflows","Limited to cloud architect domain and tools"],"zh":["需要与云架构相关的任务或工作流","仅限于云架构师领域和工具"],"ja":["クラウド アーキテクチャに関連するタスクまたはワークフローが必要","クラウド アーキテクト ドメインとツールに限定"],"ko":["클라우드 아키텍처 관련 태스크 또는 워크플로가 필요","클라우드 아키텍트 도메인 및 툴로 제한"],"es":["Requiere tareas o flujos de trabajo relacionados con la arquitectura de la nube","Limitado al dominio y las herramientas del arquitecto de la nube"],"fr":["Nécessite des tâches ou des flux de travail liés à l''architecture cloud","Limité au domaine et aux outils de l''architecte cloud"],"de":["Benötigt Aufgaben oder Workflows im Zusammenhang mit der Cloud-Architektur","Begrenzt auf den Bereich und die Tools des Cloud-Architekten"],"pt":["Exige tarefas ou fluxos de trabalho relacionados à arquitetura de nuvem","Limitado ao domínio do arquiteto de nuvem e às ferramentas"],"ru":["Требует задач или рабочих процессов, связанных с облачной архитектурой","Ограничен областью облачного архитектора и инструментами"],"ar":["يتطلب مهام أو سلاسل عمل متعلقة بهندسة السحابة","محدود بنطاق مهندس السحابة والأدوات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
