 IAM est un service de gestion des identités et des accès qui permet le contrôle de sécurité pour les ressources AWS. Il fournit une authentification et u...","de":"AWS IAM ist ein Identity- und Access-Management-Service, der Sicherheitskontrolle für AWS-Ressourcen ermöglicht. Er bietet Authentifizierung und Autorisierun...","pt":"O AWS IAM é um serviço que permite o controle de acesso seguro aos serviços e recursos da AWS. Ele é fundamental para a segurança da AWS.","ru":"AWS IAM — это сервис, который обеспечивает безопасный контроль доступа к услугам и ресурсам AWS. Он является основой для безопасности AWS.","ar":"إدارة الهوية والوصول إلىAWS هي خدمة تتيح التحكم الآمن في الوصول إلى الخدمات والموارد. هي الأساس لتأمينAWS","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"es":["Autenticación y autorización para llamados a la API de AWS","Control de acceso granular para los recursos de AWS","Gestión de identidades y acceso para usuarios y grupos","Integración con otros servicios de AWS","Seguridad y cumplimiento normativo"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation pour les appels d''API AWS","Contrôle d''accès granulaire pour les ressources AWS","Gestion des identités et des accès pour les utilisateurs et les groupes","Intégration avec d''autres services AWS","Sécurité et conformité réglementaire"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung für AWS-API-Aufrufe","Feingranularer Zugriffskontrolle für AWS-Ressourcen","Verwaltung von Identitäten und Zugriff für Benutzer und Gruppen","Integration mit anderen AWS-Services","Sicherheit und Compliance"],"pt":["Controle de acesso seguro","Autenticação e autorização de API","Gerenciamento de identidade","Controle de acesso baseado em função","Integração com outros serviços da AWS"],"ru":["Безопасный контроль доступа","Аутентификация и авторизация API","Управление идентификацией","Контроль доступа на основе роли","Интеграция с другими сервисами AWS"],"ar":["التحكم الآمن في الوصول","التحقق والتصريح ل API","إدارة الهوية","التحكم في الوصول على أساس الدور","التكامل مع خدماتAWS الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"es":["AWS IAM","gestión de identidad y acceso","seguridad en la nube","control de acceso","autenticación y autorización","desarrollo de aplicaciones en la nube"],"fr":["AWS IAM","gestion des identités et des accès","sécurité cloud","contrôle d''accès","authentification et autorisation","développement d''applications cloud"],"de":["AWS IAM","Identitäts- und Zugriffsmanagement","Cloud-Sicherheit","Zugriffskontrolle","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Cloud-Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["AWS IAM","Gerenciamento de identidade","Controle de acesso","Segurança da AWS","Autenticação de API","Autorização de API"],"ru":["AWS IAM","Управление идентификацией","Контроль доступа","Безопасность AWS","Аутентификация API","Авторизация API"],"ar":["إدارة الهوية والوصول إلىAWS","إدارة الهوية","التحكم في الوصول","تأمينAWS","التحقق منAPI","التصريح منAPI"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iam","description":"AWS Identity and Access Management for users, roles, policies, and permissions. Use when creating IAM policies, configuring cross-account access, setting up service roles, troubleshooting permission errors, or managing access control.","bodyPreview":"# AWS IAM\n\nAWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) enables secure access control to AWS services and resources. IAM is foundational to AWS security—every AWS API call is authenticated and authorized through IAM.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Core Concepts](#core-concepts)\n- [Common Patterns](#common-patterns)\n- [CLI Reference](#cli-reference)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)\n- [References](#references)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Principals\n\nEntities that can mak","body":"# AWS IAM\n\nAWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) enables secure access control to AWS services and resources. IAM is foundational to AWS security—every AWS API call is authenticated and authorized through IAM.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Core Concepts](#core-concepts)\n- [Common Patterns](#common-patterns)\n- [CLI Reference](#cli-reference)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)\n- [References](#references)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Principals\n\nEntities that can make requests to AWS: IAM users, roles, federated users, and applications.\n\n### Policies\n\nJSON documents defining permissions. Types:\n- **Identity-based**: Attached to users, groups, or roles\n- **Resource-based**: Attached to resources (S3 buckets, SQS queues)\n- **Permission boundaries**: Maximum permissions an identity can have\n- **Service control policies (SCPs)**: Organization-wide limits\n\n### Roles\n\nIdentities with permissions that can be assumed by trusted entities. No permanent credentials—uses temporary security tokens.\n\n### Trust Relationships\n\nDefine which principals can assume a role. Configured via the role''s trust policy.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create a Service Role for Lambda\n\n**AWS CLI:**\n\n```bash\n# Create the trust policy\ncat > trust-policy.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Principal\": { \"Service\": \"lambda.amazonaws.com\" },\n      \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\n# Create the role\naws iam create-role \\\n  --role-name MyLambdaRole \\\n  --assume-role-policy-document file://trust-policy.json\n\n# Attach a managed policy\naws iam attach-role-policy \\\n  --role-name MyLambdaRole \\\n  --policy-arn arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole\n```\n\n**boto3:**\n\n```python\nimport boto3\nimport json\n\niam = boto3.client(''iam'')\n\ntrust_policy = {\n    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n    \"Statement\": [\n        {\n            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n            \"Principal\": {\"Service\": \"lambda.amazonaws.com\"},\n            \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n# Create role\niam.create_role(\n    RoleName=''MyLambdaRole'',\n    AssumeRolePolicyDocument=json.dumps(trust_policy)\n)\n\n# Attach managed policy\niam.attach_role_policy(\n    RoleName=''MyLambdaRole'',\n    PolicyArn=''arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole''\n)\n```\n\n### Create Custom Policy with Least Privilege\n\n```bash\ncat > policy.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"dynamodb:GetItem\",\n        \"dynamodb:PutItem\",\n        \"dynamodb:Query\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789012:table/MyTable\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\naws iam create-policy \\\n  --policy-name MyDynamoDBPolicy \\\n  --policy-document file://policy.json\n```\n\n### Cross-Account Role Assumption\n\n```bash\n# In Account B (trusted account), create role with trust for Account A\ncat > cross-account-trust.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Principal\": { \"AWS\": \"arn:aws:iam::111111111111:root\" },\n      \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\",\n      \"Condition\": {\n        \"StringEquals\": { \"sts:ExternalId\": \"unique-external-id\" }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\n# From Account A, assume the role\naws sts assume-role \\\n  --role-arn arn:aws:iam::222222222222:role/CrossAccountRole \\\n  --role-session-name MySession \\\n  --external-id unique-external-id\n```\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n### Essential Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `aws iam create-role` | Create a new IAM role |\n| `aws iam create-policy` | Create a customer managed policy |\n| `aws iam attach-role-policy` | Attach a managed policy to a role |\n| `aws iam put-role-policy` | Add an inline policy to a role |\n| `aws iam get-role` | Get role details |\n| `aws iam list-roles` | List all roles |\n| `aws iam simulate-principal-policy` | Test policy permissions |\n| `aws sts assume-role` | Assume a role and get temporary credentials |\n| `aws sts get-caller-identity` | Get current identity |\n\n### Useful Flags\n\n- `--query`: Filter output with JMESPath\n- `--output table`: Human-readable output\n- `--no-cli-pager`: Disable pager for scripting\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Security\n\n- **Never use root account** for daily tasks\n- **Enable MFA** for all human users\n- **Use roles** instead of long-term access keys\n- **Apply least privilege** — grant only required permissions\n- **Use conditions** to restrict access by IP, time, or MFA\n- **Rotate credentials** regularly\n- **Use permission boundaries** for delegated administration\n\n### Policy Design\n\n- Start with AWS managed policies, customize as needed\n- Use policy variables (`${aws:username}`) for dynamic policies\n- Prefer explicit denies for sensitive actions\n- Group related permissions logically\n\n### Monitoring\n\n- Enable **CloudTrail** for API auditing\n- Use **IAM Access Analyzer** to identify overly permissive policies\n- Review **credential reports** regularly\n- Set up alerts for root account usage\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Access Denied Errors\n\n**Symptom:** `AccessDeniedException` or `UnauthorizedAccess`\n\n**Debug steps:**\n1. Verify identity: `aws sts get-caller-identity`\n2. Check attached policies: `aws iam list-attached-role-policies --role-name MyRole`\n3. Simulate the action:\n   ```bash\n   aws iam simulate-principal-policy \\\n     --policy-source-arn arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/MyRole \\\n     --action-names dynamodb:GetItem \\\n     --resource-arns arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789012:table/MyTable\n   ```\n4. Check for explicit denies in SCPs or permission boundaries\n5. Verify resource-based policies allow the principal\n\n### Role Cannot Be Assumed\n\n**Symptom:** `AccessDenied` when calling `AssumeRole`\n\n**Causes:**\n- Trust policy doesn''t include the calling principal\n- Missing `sts:AssumeRole` permission on the caller\n- ExternalId mismatch (for cross-account roles)\n- Session duration exceeds maximum\n\n**Fix:** Review and update the role''s trust relationship.\n\n### Policy Size Limits\n\n- Managed policy: 6,144 characters\n- Inline policy: 2,048 characters (user), 10,240 characters (role/group)\n- Trust policy: 2,048 characters\n\n**Solution:** Use multiple policies, reference resources by prefix/wildcard, or use tags-based access control.\n\n## References\n\n- [IAM User Guide](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/)\n- [IAM API Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/APIReference/)\n- [IAM CLI Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cli/latest/reference/iam/)\n- [Policy Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_policies.html)\n- [boto3 IAM](https://boto3.amazonaws.com/v1/documentation/api/latest/reference/services/iam.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:12:50.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Security Agents needing fine-grained access control to AWS services and resources through AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM).","zh":"非常适合需要通过AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)对AWS服务和资源进行细粒度访问控制的Cloud Security Agents。","ja":"AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 経由で AWS サービスとリソースへの細粒度のアクセス制御が必要な Cloud Security エージェントに最適です。","ko":"AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)를 통해 AWS 서비스 및 리소스에 대한 세분화 된 액세스 제어가 필요한 Cloud Security 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad en la Nube que necesitan un control de acceso detallado a los servicios y recursos de AWS a través de AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité Cloud nécessitant un contrôle d''accès détaillé aux services et ressources AWS via AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM).","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die eine feingranulare Zugriffskontrolle auf AWS-Dienste und -Ressourcen über AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que necessitam de controle de acesso granular aos serviços e recursos da AWS por meio do AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности в облаке, которым необходим тонкий контроль доступа к сервисам и ресурсам AWS через AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أمنيين السحابي الذين يحتاجون إلى التحكم الدقيق في الوصول إلى خدمات و موارد AWS من خلال إدارة الهوية والوصول إلى AWS (IAM)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Principals, authenticate and authorize AWS API calls, and implement best practices for secure access control using AWS IAM Core Concepts, Common Patterns, and CLI Reference, ensuring compliance with AWS security protocols and troubleshooting guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理管理主体、身份验证和授权 AWS API 调用以及使用 AWS IAM 核心概念、常见模式和 CLI 参考来实施安全访问控制的最佳实践，确保遵守 AWS 安全协议和故障排除指南。","ja":"エージェントがプリンシパルを管理し、AWS API 呼び出しを認証および承認し、AWS IAM コア概念、一般的なパターン、および CLI リファレンスを使用して、セキュアなアクセス制御のベスト プラクティスを実装することを可能にし、AWS セキュリティ プロトコルおよびトラブルシューティング ガイドラインの遵守を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 주체를 관리하고 AWS API 호출을 인증 및 승인하고 AWS IAM 핵심 개념, 일반적인 패턴 및 CLI 참조를 사용하여 보안 액세스 제어의 모범 사례를 구현하여 AWS 보안 프로토콜 및 문제 해결 지침을 준수하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar entidades de seguridad, autenticar y autorizar llamadas a la API de AWS, e implementar las mejores prácticas para el control de acceso seguro utilizando Conceptos básicos de AWS IAM, Patrones comunes y Referencia de CLI, garantizando el cumplimiento de los protocolos de seguridad de AWS y las directrices de solución de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les entités de sécurité, d''authentifier et d''autoriser les appels d''API AWS, et de mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques pour le contrôle d''accès sécurisé en utilisant les Concepts de base d''AWS IAM, les Modèles courants et la Référence de CLI, garantissant ainsi la conformité aux protocoles de sécurité AWS et aux lignes directrices de dépannage.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sicherheitsprinzipale zu verwalten, AWS-API-Anrufe zu authentifizieren und zu autorisieren sowie beste Praktiken für sichere Zugriffskontrolle mithilfe von AWS IAM-Kernkonzepten, gängigen Mustern und CLI-Referenz zu implementieren, um die Einhaltung der AWS-Sicherheitsprotokolle und Fehlerbehebungsrichtlinien sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar Principais, autenticar e autorizar chamadas de API da AWS e implementar as melhores práticas para controle de acesso seguro usando Conceitos Principais da AWS IAM, Padrões Comuns e Referência da CLI, garantindo conformidade com os protocolos de segurança da AWS e diretrizes de solução de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять основными сущностями, аутентифицировать и авторизовывать вызовы API AWS, а также реализовывать лучшие практики для безопасного контроля доступа с использованием основных концепций AWS IAM, общих шаблонов и справки по CLI, обеспечивая соответствие протоколам безопасности AWS и рекомендациям по устранению неполадок.","ar":"يتوفر الوكلاء لإدارة المبادئ، وتحقق وتأليف مكالمات API من AWS، وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات للتحكم في الوصول الآمن باستخدام مفاهيم核心 AWS IAM، والأنماط الشائعة، ومرجع CLI، وضمان الامتثال لبروتوكولات أمان AWS وإرشادات تصحيح الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating AWS API calls","Authorizing access to AWS resources","Troubleshooting IAM-related issues"],"zh":["身份验证 AWS API 调用","授权访问 AWS 资源","解决 IAM 相关问题"],"ja":["AWS API 呼び出しの認証","AWS リソースへのアクセスの承認","IAM 関連の問題のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["AWS API 호출의 인증","AWS 리소스에 대한 액세스 승인","IAM 관련 문제 해결"],"es":["Autenticar llamadas a la API de AWS","Autorizar el acceso a los recursos de AWS","Solucionar problemas relacionados con IAM"],"fr":["Authentifier les appels d''API AWS","Autoriser l''accès aux ressources AWS","Résoudre les problèmes liés à IAM"],"de":["Authentifizieren von AWS-API-Anrufen","Autorisieren des Zugriffs auf AWS-Ressourcen","Beheben von IAM-bezogenen Problemen"],"pt":["Autenticar chamadas de API da AWS","Autorizar acesso a recursos da AWS","Solucionar problemas relacionados ao IAM"],"ru":["Аутентифицировать вызовы API AWS","Авторизовать доступ к ресурсам AWS","Устранять проблемы, связанные с IAM"],"ar":["التحقق من مكالمات API من AWS","التأليف للوصول إلى موارد AWS","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالهوية والوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AWS account and IAM configuration","Limited to AWS services and resources"],"zh":["需要 AWS 账户和 IAM 配置","仅限于 AWS 服务和资源"],"ja":["AWS アカウントと IAM 構成が必要","AWS サービスとリソースのみに制限"],"ko":["AWS 계정 및 IAM 구성이 필요","AWS 서비스 및 리소스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de AWS y configuración de IAM","Limitado a los servicios y recursos de AWS"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte AWS et une configuration IAM","Limité aux services et ressources AWS"],"de":["Benötigt ein AWS-Konto und IAM-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf AWS-Dienste und -Ressourcen"],"pt":["Exige conta da AWS e configuração do IAM","Limitado a serviços e recursos da AWS"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись AWS и конфигурация IAM","Ограничен сервисами и ресурсами AWS"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب AWS وتهيئة IAM","محدود بخدمات وموارد AWS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
