n de mise à jour automatique"],"de":["Leichtes virtuelles DOM von 4KB","Geschlossene Zustandsverwaltung","Komponentenmodi: Manuel und Light API","Kompatibilität mit JSX","Funktion zur automatischen Aktualisierung"],"pt":["Modo manual com controle explícito","Modo de API leve com reatividade automática","Gerenciamento de estado baseado em closure","DOM virtual leve","Dois modos de componentes"],"ru":["Ручной режим с явным контролем","Легкий API-режим с автоматической реактивностью","Управление состоянием на основе замыкания","Легкий виртуальный DOM","Два режима компонентов"],"ar":["نمط يدوي مع التحكم الصريح","نمط API الخفيف مع التفاعل التلقائي","إدارة الحالة المبنية على الإغلاق","DOM الافتراضي الخفيف","نمطي مكونين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Lithent","JSX","虚拟 DOM","轻量级","状态管理","手动模式","轻量级 API 模式"],"ja":["Lithent","JSX","仮想 DOM","軽量","状態管理","手動モード","軽量 API モード"],"ko":["Lithent","JSX","가상 DOM","경량","상태 관리","수동 모드","경량 API 모드"],"es":["Lithent","DOM virtual","gestión de estado","JSX","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bibliotecas de JavaScript","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Lithent","DOM virtuel","gestion d''état","JSX","développement d''applications","bibliothèques JavaScript","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Lithent","virtuelles DOM","Zustandsverwaltung","JSX","Anwendungsentwicklung","JavaScript-Bibliotheken","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Lithent","DOM virtual","gerenciamento de estado","closure","componentes","interface de usuário","biblioteca JavaScript"],"ru":["Lithent","виртуальный DOM","управление состоянием","замыкание","компоненты","пользовательский интерфейс","JavaScript-библиотека"],"ar":["Lithent","DOM الافتراضي","إدارة الحالة","الإغلاق","مكونات","واجهة المستخدم","مكتبة JavaScript"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lithent","description":"AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.","version":"{{VERSION}}","bodyPreview":"# Lithent Agent Skills\n\n> Version: {{VERSION}}\n\nThis file provides AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.\n\n## Overview\n\nLithent is a lightweight (~4KB) JSX-based virtual DOM library with closure-based state management. It offers two component modes:\n- **Manual Mode** (`mount`): Explicit control with `renew()` function\n- **Light API Mode** (`lmount`): Auto-reactive with `lstate`/`lstore`\n\n## Component Creation\n\n### Manual Mode (mount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, render } from ''lithent''","body":"# Lithent Agent Skills\n\n> Version: {{VERSION}}\n\nThis file provides AI agent skills for working with the Lithent library.\n\n## Overview\n\nLithent is a lightweight (~4KB) JSX-based virtual DOM library with closure-based state management. It offers two component modes:\n- **Manual Mode** (`mount`): Explicit control with `renew()` function\n- **Light API Mode** (`lmount`): Auto-reactive with `lstate`/`lstore`\n\n## Component Creation\n\n### Manual Mode (mount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Counter = mount<{ initial?: number }>((renew, props) => {\n  const count = state(props.initial ?? 0, renew);\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: {count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick={() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\nrender(<Counter initial={10} />, document.getElementById(''app'')!);\n```\n\n### Light API Mode (lmount)\n\n```tsx\nimport { lmount, render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { lstate } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Counter = lmount<{ initial?: number }>((props) => {\n  const count = lstate(props.initial ?? 0);\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: {count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick={() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\nrender(<Counter initial={10} />, document.getElementById(''app'')!);\n```\n\n## State Management\n\n### State (Manual Mode)\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state, computed, effect } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const firstName = state(''John'', renew);\n  const lastName = state(''Doe'', renew);\n\n  // Derived value\n  const fullName = computed(() => `${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}`);\n\n  // Side effect\n  effect(() => {\n    console.log(''Name changed:'', fullName.value);\n    return () => console.log(''Cleanup'');\n  });\n\n  return () => <p>{fullName.value}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n### State (Light API Mode)\n\n```tsx\nimport { lmount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { lstate, computed, effect } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Component = lmount(() => {\n  const firstName = lstate(''John'');\n  const lastName = lstate(''Doe'');\n\n  const fullName = computed(() => `${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}`);\n\n  effect(() => {\n    console.log(''Name changed:'', fullName.value);\n  });\n\n  return () => <p>{fullName.value}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n### Global Store\n\n```tsx\n// Manual Mode\nimport { store } from ''lithent/helper'';\nconst userStore = store({ name: '''', loggedIn: false });\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const user = userStore(renew);\n  return () => <p>{user.name}</p>;\n});\n\n// Light API Mode\nimport { lstore } from ''lithent/helper'';\nconst userStore = lstore({ name: '''', loggedIn: false });\n\nconst Component = lmount(() => {\n  const user = userStore();\n  return () => <p>{user.name}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n## Lifecycle Hooks\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, mountCallback, updateCallback, mountReadyCallback } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  // After mount (return cleanup function for unmount)\n  mountCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Mounted'');\n    return () => console.log(''Unmounted'');\n  });\n\n  // Before each update\n  updateCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Will update'');\n  });\n\n  // After initial render complete\n  mountReadyCallback(() => {\n    console.log(''Initial render done'');\n  });\n\n  return () => <div>Hello</div>;\n});\n```\n\n## DOM References\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, ref } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Component = mount((renew) => {\n  const inputRef = ref<HTMLInputElement>(null);\n\n  const focusInput = () => inputRef.value?.focus();\n\n  return () => (\n    <div>\n      <input ref={inputRef} type=\"text\" />\n      <button onClick={focusInput}>Focus</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## Context API\n\n```tsx\n// Manual Mode\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { createContext } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<{ theme: string }>();\n\nconst Provider = mount((renew, _props, children) => {\n  return () => (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={{ theme: ''dark'' }}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeContext.Provider>\n  );\n});\n\nconst Consumer = mount((renew) => {\n  const { theme } = ThemeContext.useContext(renew);\n  return () => <p>{theme}</p>;\n});\n\n// Light API Mode\nimport { lmount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { createLContext } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst ThemeContext = createLContext<{ theme: string }>();\n\nconst Consumer = lmount(() => {\n  const { theme } = ThemeContext.useContext();\n  return () => <p>{theme}</p>;\n});\n```\n\n## Portal\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount, portal } from ''lithent'';\n\nconst Modal = mount((renew, props: { onClose: () => void }) => {\n  return () => portal(\n    <div class=\"modal-overlay\" onClick={props.onClose}>\n      <div class=\"modal-content\" onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}>\n        <h2>Modal</h2>\n        <button onClick={props.onClose}>Close</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>,\n    document.body\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## List Rendering\n\nAlways use `key` prop for lists:\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst TodoList = mount((renew) => {\n  const todos = state([\n    { id: 1, text: ''Learn Lithent'', done: false },\n    { id: 2, text: ''Build app'', done: false },\n  ], renew);\n\n  const toggle = (id: number) => {\n    todos.value = todos.value.map(t =>\n      t.id === id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t\n    );\n  };\n\n  return () => (\n    <ul>\n      {todos.value.map(todo => (\n        <li key={todo.id} onClick={() => toggle(todo.id)}>\n          {todo.text} {todo.done && ''✓''}\n        </li>\n      ))}\n    </ul>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## SSR and Hydration\n\n```tsx\n// Server\nimport { renderToString } from ''lithent/ssr'';\nconst html = renderToString(<App />);\n\n// Client (hydrate existing DOM)\nimport { render } from ''lithent'';\nimport { hydration } from ''lithent/ssr'';\nrender(<App />, document.getElementById(''app'')!, hydration);\n```\n\n## FTags (No JSX)\n\n```ts\nimport { fTags, fMount } from ''lithent/ftags'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst { div, button, p } = fTags;\n\nconst Counter = fMount((renew) => {\n  const count = state(0, renew);\n  return () => div({},\n    p({}, `Count: ${count.value}`),\n    button({ onClick: () => count.value++ }, ''+1'')\n  );\n});\n```\n\n## HTM (Tagged Templates)\n\n```ts\nimport { lTag } from ''lithent/tag'';\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { state } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst html = lTag;\n\nconst Counter = mount((renew) => {\n  const count = state(0, renew);\n  return () => html`\n    <div>\n      <p>Count: ${count.value}</p>\n      <button onClick=${() => count.value++}>+1</button>\n    </div>\n  `;\n});\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n```tsx\nimport { cacheUpdate, nextTickRender } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\n// Batch multiple state updates into single render\ncacheUpdate(() => {\n  a.value = 1;\n  b.value = 2;\n  c.value = 3;\n});\n\n// Defer render to next tick\nnextTickRender(() => {\n  items.value = [...items.value, ...newItems];\n});\n```\n\n## Children Handling\n\n```tsx\nimport { mount } from ''lithent'';\nimport { unwrapChildren } from ''lithent/helper'';\n\nconst Card = mount((renew, props: { title: string }, children) => {\n  return () => (\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>{props.title}</h3>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">{unwrapChildren(children)}</div>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Usage\n<Card title=\"Title\"><p>Content</p></Card>\n```\n\n## Import Reference\n\n```tsx\n// Core\nimport {\n  mount, lmount, render, h, Fragment, portal,\n  ref, nextTick, mountCallback, updateCallback, mountReadyCallback\n} from ''lithent'';\n\n// Helper\nimport {\n  state, lstate,                    // Reactive state\n  computed, effect,                 // Derived values & side effects\n  store, lstore,                    // Global state\n  createContext, createLContext,   // Context API\n  cacheUpdate, nextTickRender,     // Performance\n  unwrapChildren                    // Utility\n} from ''lithent/helper'';\n\n// SSR\nimport { renderToString, hydration } from ''lithent/ssr'';\n\n// FTags\nimport { fTags, fFragment, fMount } from ''lithent/ftags'';\n\n// HTM\nimport { lTag } from ''lithent/tag'';\n```\n\n## Additional materials (optional)\n\n- `constraints/` (rules, mistakes, troubleshooting)\n- `reference/` (props types, children types, lstore inference)\n- `examples/` (quick examples)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:12:48.528Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing lightweight virtual DOM capabilities with JSX and closure-based state management.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级虚拟DOM功能的前端代理，支持JSX和基于闭包的状态管理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが軽量の仮想DOM機能を必要とする場合に最適で、JSXおよびクロージャーベースのステート管理をサポートしています。","ko":"프런트엔드 에이전트가 가벼운 가상 DOM 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합하며, JSX 및 클로저 기반 상태 관리를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de DOM virtual ligero con JSX y gestión de estado basada en cierre.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des capacités de DOM virtuel léger avec JSX et gestion d''état basée sur fermeture.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die leichte virtuelle DOM-Fähigkeiten mit JSX und schließungsbasierter Statusverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de DOM virtuais leves com JSX e gerenciamento de estado baseado em closure.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы лёгкие возможности виртуального DOM с JSX и управлением состоянием на основе замыкания.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات DOM الافتراضية الخفيفة مع JSX وإدارة الحالة القائمة على الإغلاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build efficient web interfaces using Lithent''s Manual Mode with explicit control via `renew()` function and Light API Mode with auto-reactive `lstate`/`lstore`, leveraging JSX-based virtual DOM library.","zh":"赋予代理构建高效网页接口的能力，使用Lithent的手动模式，通过`renew()`函数和轻量级API模式，具有自动反应的`lstate`/`lstore`，利用基于JSX的虚拟DOM库。","ja":"エージェントが効率的なWebインターフェイスを構築できるようにし、Lithentのマニュアルモードで`renew()`関数を使用し、軽量APIモードで自動反応する`lstate`/`lstore`を使用し、JSXベースの仮想DOMライブラリを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 웹 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있도록 하며, Lithent의 수동 모드에서 `renew()` 함수를 사용하고, 경량 API 모드에서 자동 반응하는 `lstate`/`lstore`를 사용하여 JSX 기반의 가상 DOM 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear interfaces web eficientes utilizando el modo manual de Lithent con control explícito a través de la función `renew()` y el modo de API ligero con `lstate`/`lstore` auto-reactivo, aprovechando la biblioteca de DOM virtual basada en JSX.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces web efficaces en utilisant le mode manuel de Lithent avec un contrôle explicite via la fonction `renew()` et le mode API léger avec `lstate`/`lstore` auto-réactif, en exploitant la bibliothèque de DOM virtuel basée sur JSX.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, effiziente Web-Oberflächen mit Lithents manuellem Modus mit expliziter Kontrolle über die `renew()`-Funktion und Light-API-Modus mit auto-reaktivem `lstate`/`lstore` zu erstellen, indem sie die auf JSX basierende virtuelle DOM-Bibliothek nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces web eficientes usando o Modo Manual da Lithent com controle explícito via função `renew()` e Modo de API Leve com `lstate`/`lstore` auto-reativo, aproveitando a biblioteca de DOM virtuais baseada em JSX.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные веб-интерфейсы, используя Ручной Режим Lithent с явным контролем через функцию `renew()` и Лёгкий Режим API с авто-реактивным `lstate`/`lstore`, используя библиотеку виртуального DOM на основе JSX.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء واجهات ويب فعالة باستخدام وضع Lithent اليدوي مع التحكم الصريح عبر دالة `renew()` ووضع API الخفيف مع `lstate`/`lstore` التفاعلي الآلي، واستخدام مكتبة DOM الافتراضية القائمة على JSX."},"useCases":{"en":["Building lightweight web applications with Manual Mode (`mount`) and `renew()`","Creating auto-reactive components with Light API Mode (`lmount`) and `lstate`/`lstore`","Optimizing web performance with Lithent''s ~4KB footprint"],"zh":["使用手动模式（`mount`）和`renew()`构建轻量级网页应用","使用轻量级API模式（`lmount`）和`lstate`/`lstore`创建自动反应组件","使用Lithent的~4KB占用空间优化网页性能"],"ja":["マニュアルモード（`mount`）と`renew()`を使用して軽量のWebアプリケーションを構築する","軽量APIモード（`lmount`）と`lstate`/`lstore`を使用して自動反応コンポーネントを作成する","Lithentの~4KBの占有サイズを使用してWebパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["수동 모드(`mount`)와 `renew()`를 사용하여 가벼운 웹 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","경량 API 모드(`lmount`)와 `lstate`/`lstore`를 사용하여 자동 반응 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","Lithent의 ~4KB 용량을 사용하여 웹 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones web ligeras con el modo manual (`mount`) y `renew()`","Creación de componentes auto-reactivos con el modo de API ligero (`lmount`) y `lstate`/`lstore`","Optimización del rendimiento web con la huella de ~4KB de Lithent"],"fr":["Création d''applications web légères avec le mode manuel (`mount`) et `renew()`","Création de composants auto-réactifs avec le mode API léger (`lmount`) et `lstate`/`lstore`","Optimisation des performances web avec l''empreinte de ~4KB de Lithent"],"de":["Erstellung leichter Webanwendungen mit manuellem Modus (`mount`) und `renew()`","Erstellung auto-reaktiver Komponenten mit Light-API-Modus (`lmount`) und `lstate`/`lstore`","Optimierung der Webleistung mit Lithents ~4KB-Fußabdruck"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações web leves com Modo Manual (`mount`) e `renew()`","Criação de componentes auto-reativos com Modo de API Leve (`lmount`) e `lstate`/`lstore`","Otimização do desempenho web com a pegada de ~4KB da Lithent"],"ru":["Построение лёгких веб-приложений с помощью Ручного Режима (`mount`) и `renew()`","Создание авто-реактивных компонентов с помощью Лёгкого Режима API (`lmount`) и `lstate`/`lstore`","Оптимизация веб-производительности с помощью отпечатка ~4КБ Lithent"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات ويب خفيفة باستخدام الوضع اليدوي (`mount`) و `renew()`","إنشاء مكونات تفاعلية ذاتية مع وضع API الخفيف (`lmount`) و `lstate`/`lstore`","تحسين أداء الويب مع بصمة ~4KB من Lithent"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of JSX and closure-based state management","Limited to web-based applications"],"zh":["需要理解JSX和基于闭包的状态管理","仅限于基于网页的应用"],"ja":["JSXとクロージャーベースのステート管理を理解する必要がある","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["JSX와 클로저 기반 상태 관리를 이해해야 함","웹 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de JSX y gestión de estado basada en cierre","Limitado a aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de JSX et de la gestion d''état basée sur fermeture","Limité aux applications web"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von JSX und schließungsbasierter Statusverwaltung","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de JSX e gerenciamento de estado baseado em closure","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web"],"ru":["Требует понимания JSX и управления состоянием на основе замыкания","Ограничен веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم JSX وإدارة الحالة القائمة على الإغلاق","محدود للتطبيقات القائمة على الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
