","GitHub Copilot","커스텀 명령","명령 개발","개발 효율성","확장 기능","코드 편집기"],"es":["comandos de extensión de VS Code","GitHub Copilot","extensiones de VS Code","productividad","desarrollo de software","personalización de VS Code"],"fr":["commandes d''extension VS Code","GitHub Copilot","extensions VS Code","productivité","développement de logiciels","personnalisation de VS Code"],"de":["VS Code-Erweiterungsbefehle","GitHub Copilot","VS Code-Erweiterungen","Produktivität","Softwareentwicklung","Anpassung von VS Code"],"pt":["vscode-ext-commands","comandos personalizados","extensões do VS Code","produtividade","desenvolvimento","comandos personalizados em extensões do VS Code"],"ru":["vscode-ext-commands","индивидуальные команды","расширения VS Code","производительность","разработка","индивидуальные команды для расширений VS Code"],"ar":["vscode-ext-commands","أوامر مخصصة","ملحقات Visual Studio Code","إنتاجية","تطوير","أوامر مخصصة في ملحقات Visual Studio Code"]}},"owner":"github","repo":"awesome-copilot","repoPath":"github/awesome-copilot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vscode-ext-commands","description":"Guidelines for contributing commands in VS Code extensions. Indicates naming convention, visibility, localization and other relevant attributes, following VS Code extension development guidelines, libraries and good practices","bodyPreview":"# VS Code extension command contribution\n\nThis skill helps you to contribute commands in VS Code extensions\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Add or update commands to your VS Code extension\n\n# Instructions\n\nVS Code commands must always define a `title`, independent of its category, visibility or location. We use a few patterns for each \"kind\" of command, with some characteristics, described below:\n\n* Regular commands: By default, all commands should be accessible in","body":"# VS Code extension command contribution\n\nThis skill helps you to contribute commands in VS Code extensions\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Add or update commands to your VS Code extension\n\n# Instructions\n\nVS Code commands must always define a `title`, independent of its category, visibility or location. We use a few patterns for each \"kind\" of command, with some characteristics, described below:\n\n* Regular commands: By default, all commands should be accessible in the Command Palette, must define a `category`, and don''t need an `icon`, unless the command will be used in the Side Bar.\n\n* Side Bar commands: Its name follows a special pattern, starting with underscore (`_`) and suffixed with `#sideBar`, like `_extensionId.someCommand#sideBar` for instance. Must define an `icon`, and may or may not have some rule for `enablement`. Side Bar exclusive commands should not be visible in the Command Palette. Contributing it to the `view/title` or `view/item/context`, we must inform _order/position_ that it will be displayed, and we can use terms \"relative to other command/button\" in order to you identify the correct `group` to be used. Also, it''s a good practice to define the condition (`when`) for the new command is visible.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:13:40.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing to extend VS Code functionality with custom commands and configurations.","zh":"非常适合需要通过自定义命令和配置来扩展VS Code功能的开发者代理。","ja":"VS Codeの機能をカスタムコマンドと設定で拡張する必要があるDeveloperエージェントに最適です。","ko":"VS Code 기능을 사용자 지정 명령 및 구성으로 확장해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan ampliar la funcionalidad de VS Code con comandos y configuraciones personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''étendre les fonctionnalités de VS Code avec des commandes et des configurations personnalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die die Funktionalität von VS Code mit benutzerdefinierten Befehlen und Konfigurationen erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam estender a funcionalidade do VS Code com comandos e configurações personalizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимо расширить функциональность VS Code с помощью пользовательских команд и конфигураций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى توسيع وظائف VS Code باستخدام أوامر وتكوينات مخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute commands in VS Code extensions, defining titles and utilizing patterns for regular commands, with support for GitHub Copilot configurations and community-contributed instructions.","zh":"赋予代理在VS Code扩展中贡献命令的能力，定义标题并利用模式进行常规命令，并支持GitHub Copilot配置和社区贡献的指令。","ja":"エージェントがVS Code拡張機能にコマンドを提供できるようにし、タイトルを定義し、定期的なコマンドのパターンを利用し、GitHub Copilotの設定やコミュニティからの指示もサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 VS Code 확장 기능에 명령을 기여할 수 있도록 하며, 제목을 정의하고 정기 명령에 대한 패턴을 활용하며 GitHub Copilot 설정 및 커뮤니티에서 기여한 지침도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a contribuir con comandos en extensiones de VS Code, definiendo títulos y utilizando patrones para comandos regulares, con soporte para configuraciones de GitHub Copilot y instrucciones contribuidas por la comunidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer des commandes dans les extensions VS Code, en définissant des titres et en utilisant des modèles pour les commandes régulières, avec un support pour les configurations GitHub Copilot et les instructions contribuées par la communauté.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Befehle in VS Code-Erweiterungen beizutragen, indem sie Titel definieren und Muster für reguläre Befehle verwenden, mit Unterstützung für GitHub Copilot-Konfigurationen und von der Community beigetragene Anweisungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a contribuir com comandos em extensões do VS Code, definindo títulos e utilizando padrões para comandos regulares, com suporte a configurações do GitHub Copilot e instruções contribuídas pela comunidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вносить вклад в команды расширений VS Code, определять названия и использовать шаблоны для регулярных команд, с поддержкой конфигураций GitHub Copilot и инструкций, вносящих вклад в сообщество.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على المساهمة في أوامر لمكملات VS Code ، وتحديد عناوين واستخدام أنماط للأوامر العادية ، مع دعم إعدادات GitHub Copilot والتعليمات التي ساهم فيها المجتمع."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding custom commands to VS Code extensions","Updating existing commands for better functionality","Configuring GitHub Copilot for enhanced development experience"],"zh":["向VS Code扩展添加自定义命令","更新现有命令以获得更好的功能","配置GitHub Copilot以增强开发体验"],"ja":["VS Code拡張機能にカスタムコマンドを追加する","既存のコマンドを更新して機能を向上させる","GitHub Copilotを構成して開発体験を強化する"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 기능에 사용자 지정 명령을 추가하는 것","기존 명령을 업데이트하여 기능을 개선하는 것","GitHub Copilot를 구성하여 개발 환경을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Agregar comandos personalizados a extensiones de VS Code","Actualizar comandos existentes para una mejor funcionalidad","Configurar GitHub Copilot para una experiencia de desarrollo mejorada"],"fr":["Ajouter des commandes personnalisées aux extensions VS Code","Mettre à jour des commandes existantes pour une meilleure fonctionnalité","Configurer GitHub Copilot pour une expérience de développement améliorée"],"de":["Hinzufügen von benutzerdefinierten Befehlen zu VS Code-Erweiterungen","Aktualisieren von bestehenden Befehlen für eine bessere Funktionalität","Konfigurieren von GitHub Copilot für eine verbesserte Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Adicionar comandos personalizados às extensões do VS Code","Atualizar comandos existentes para melhor funcionalidade","Configurar o GitHub Copilot para uma experiência de desenvolvimento aprimorada"],"ru":["Добавление пользовательских команд в расширения VS Code","Обновление существующих команд для лучшей функциональности","Настройка GitHub Copilot для улучшения опыта разработки"],"ar":["إضافة أوامر مخصصة إلى ملحقات VS Code","تحديث الأوامر الحالية لتحسين الوظيفة","تكوين GitHub Copilot لتحسين تجربة التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code extension development environment","Dependent on GitHub Copilot for full functionality"],"zh":["需要VS Code扩展开发环境","依赖于GitHub Copilot以实现全部功能"],"ja":["VS Code拡張機能開発環境が必要","全機能を実現するにはGitHub Copilotに依存"],"ko":["VS Code 확장 개발 환경이 필요함","전체 기능을 구현하려면 GitHub Copilot에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de extensiones de VS Code","Depende de GitHub Copilot para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement d''extensions VS Code","Dépend de GitHub Copilot pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benötigt eine Entwicklungsumgebung für VS Code-Erweiterungen","Ist von GitHub Copilot abhängig für die vollständige Funktionalität"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento de extensões do VS Code","Depende do GitHub Copilot para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки расширений VS Code","Зависит от GitHub Copilot для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير ملحقات VS Code","يعتمد على GitHub Copilot للوظائف الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kuboon/dotfiles/deno', 'community', 'kuboon', 'dotfiles', 'kuboon/dotfiles', 'deno', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z', '2026-02-18T02:12:58.011Z', NULL, '{"id":"kuboon/dotfiles/deno","name":"deno","description":{"zh":"Deno是一种现代的JavaScript和TypeScript运行环境，本文将介绍Deno的开发指南","ja":"DenoはモダンなJavaScriptとTypeScriptランタイム環境です。本稿ではDenoの開発ガイドを紹介します","ko":"Deno는 현대적인 JavaScript 및 TypeScript 런타임 환경입니다. 이 문서에서는 Deno 개발 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"Deno es un entorno de ejecución de JavaScript y TypeScript que permite desarrollar aplicaciones seguras y de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Deno est un environnement d''exécution JavaScript et TypeScript qui permet de développer des applications sécurisées et hautes performances.","de":"Deno ist eine Laufzeitumgebung für JavaScript und TypeScript, die es ermöglicht, sichere und hochleistungsstarke Anwendungen zu entwickeln.","pt":"Deno é um runtime JavaScript seguro e eficiente para desenvolver aplicativos. Aprenda a utilizar o Deno com as melhores práticas.","ru":"Deno - это безопасный и эффективный runtime JavaScript для разработки приложений. Узнайте, как использовать Deno с лучшими практиками.","ar":"دينو هو وقت تشغيل جافاسكريبت آمن وفعال لتطوير التطبيقات. تعلم كيفية استخدام دينو مع أفضل الممارسات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Deno开发指南","ja":"Deno開発ガイド","ko":"Deno 개발 가이드","es":"Deno: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Seguras","fr":"Deno: Développement d''Applications Sécurisées","de":"Deno: Entwicklung von Sicherer Anwendungen","pt":"Deno: Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos JavaScript","ru":"Deno: Разработка приложений JavaScript","ar":"دينو: تطوير تطبيقات جافاسكريبت","en":"deno"},"description":{"zh":"Deno是一种现代的JavaScript和TypeScript运行环境，本文将介绍Deno的开发指南","ja":"DenoはモダンなJavaScriptとTypeScriptランタイム環境です。本稿ではDenoの開発ガイドを紹介します","ko":"Deno는 현대적인 JavaScript 및 TypeScript 런타임 환경입니다. 이 문서에서는 Deno 개발 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"Deno es un entorno de ejecución de JavaScript y TypeScript que permite desarrollar aplicaciones seguras y de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Deno est un environnement d''exécution JavaScript et TypeScript qui permet de développer des applications sécurisées et hautes performances.","de":"Deno ist eine Laufzeitumgebung für JavaScript und TypeScript, die es ermöglicht, sichere und hochleistungsstarke Anwendungen zu entwickeln.","pt":"Deno é um runtime JavaScript seguro e eficiente para desenvolver aplicativos. Aprenda a utilizar o Deno com as melhores práticas.","ru":"Deno - это безопасный и эффективный runtime JavaScript для разработки приложений. Узнайте, как использовать Deno с лучшими практиками.","ar":"دينو هو وقت تشغيل جافاسكريبت آمن وفعال لتطوير التطبيقات. تعلم كيفية استخدام دينو مع أفضل الممارسات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["版本要求：始终使用Deno 2","测试：使用`deno test -P`运行测试","包管理：使用JSR（JavaScript Registry）","常用命令：添加依赖、运行测试等","支持JavaScript和TypeScript"],"ja":["バージョン要件：常にDeno 2を使用","テスト：`deno test -P`を使用してテストを実行","パッケージ管理：JSR（JavaScript Registry）を使用","コモンコマンド：依存関係の追加、テストの実行等","JavaScriptとTypeScriptをサポート"],"ko":["버전 요구 사항: Deno 2를 항상 사용","테스트: `deno test -P`를 사용하여 테스트를 실행","패키지 관리: JSR(JavaScript Registry)을 사용","일반적인 명령어: 의존성 추가, 테스트 실행 등","JavaScript 및 TypeScript 지원"],"es":["Soporte para JavaScript y TypeScript","Gestión de paquetes con JSR","Pruebas con permisos","Definición de permisos en deno.json","Uso de la bandera -P para pruebas con permisos"],"fr":["Prise en charge de JavaScript et TypeScript","Gestion des paquets avec JSR","Tests avec autorisations","Définition des autorisations dans deno.json","Utilisation du drapeau -P pour les tests avec autorisations"],"de":["Unterstützung für JavaScript und TypeScript","Paketverwaltung mit JSR","Tests mit Berechtigungen","Definition von Berechtigungen in deno.json","Verwendung der Flagge -P für Tests mit Berechtigungen"],"pt":["Suporte a JavaScript e TypeScript","Gerenciamento de pacotes com JSR","Testes com permissões grantidas","Definição de permissões em deno.json","Comandos comuns para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Поддержка JavaScript и TypeScript","Управление пакетами с JSR","Тестирование с предоставленными разрешениями","Определение разрешений в deno.json","Общие команды для разработки"],"ar":["دعم جافاسكريبت وتايبسكريبت","إدارة الحزم مع JSR","اختبارات بالسماح بالتصريح","تحديد التصاريح في deno.json","أوامر مشتركة للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Deno","Deno开发","JavaScript","TypeScript","JSR","包管理","测试"],"ja":["Deno","Deno開発","JavaScript","TypeScript","JSR","パッケージ管理","テスト"],"ko":["Deno","Deno 개발","JavaScript","TypeScript","JSR","패키지 관리","테스트"],"es":["Deno","desarrollo de aplicaciones","JavaScript","TypeScript","seguridad","pruebas","gestión de paquetes","JSR"],"fr":["Deno","développement d''applications","JavaScript","TypeScript","sécurité","tests","gestion des paquets","JSR"],"de":["Deno","Anwendungsentwicklung","JavaScript","TypeScript","Sicherheit","Tests","Paketverwaltung","JSR"],"pt":["Deno","JavaScript","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Segurança","JSR","Testes","deno.json"],"ru":["Deno","JavaScript","TypeScript","Разработка приложений","Безопасность","JSR","Тестирование","deno.json"],"ar":["دينو","جافاسكريبت","تايبسكريبت","تطوير التطبيقات","الأمان","JSR","الاختبارات","deno.json"]}},"owner":"kuboon","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"kuboon/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deno","description":"Deno 2 development workflow including testing with permissions and JSR package management. Use when working with Deno projects, setting up new Deno applications, or when the user mentions Deno, JSR, or modern JavaScript/TypeScript development.","bodyPreview":"# Deno Development\n\n## Version Requirements\n- Always use Deno 2\n\n## Testing\n- Use `deno test -P` for running tests with permissions granted\n- The `-P` flag allows permissions described in `deno.json` during testing.\n- Define test permissions in the `test` section of `deno.json`.\n\n## Package Management\n- Use JSR (JavaScript Registry) for package dependencies https://jsr.io/\n- JSR is the modern package registry for JavaScript and TypeScript\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Adding Dependencies\n```bash\n# Ad","body":"# Deno Development\n\n## Version Requirements\n- Always use Deno 2\n\n## Testing\n- Use `deno test -P` for running tests with permissions granted\n- The `-P` flag allows permissions described in `deno.json` during testing.\n- Define test permissions in the `test` section of `deno.json`.\n\n## Package Management\n- Use JSR (JavaScript Registry) for package dependencies https://jsr.io/\n- JSR is the modern package registry for JavaScript and TypeScript\n\n## Common Commands\n\n### Adding Dependencies\n```bash\n# Add from JSR\ndeno add jsr:@std/log\ndeno add jsr:@std/path\n\n# Add from npm (when necessary)\ndeno add npm:express\n```\n\n### Running Tests\n```bash\n# Run all tests with permissions\ndeno test -P\n\n# Run specific test file\ndeno test -P test/example.test.ts\n```\n\n### Running Applications\n```bash\n# Run with limited permissions - AVOID -A unless absolutely necessary\ndeno run --allow-read=. main.ts\ndeno run --allow-net --allow-read=./public server.ts\ndeno run --allow-env --allow-read=. config.ts\n\n# for `export default { fetch }`\ndeno serve serve.ts\n\n# Use permission sets from deno.json\ndeno run -P main.ts\n```\n\n## Configuration with deno.json\n\n### Permission Sets\nDefine permission sets in deno.json for consistent security:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"default\": {\n      \"read\": [\".\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"allow\": [\"NODE_ENV\", \"PORT\"],\n        \"deny\": [\"SECRET_KEY\"],\n        \"ignore\": [\"TEMP_*\"]\n      }\n    },\n    \"server\": {\n      \"read\": [\"./public\"],\n      \"net\": [\"localhost:8000\", \"deno.land\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"allow\": [\"DATABASE_URL\", \"API_KEY\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Test Permissions\nConfigure test permissions in deno.json:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"test\": {\n    \"permissions\": {\n      \"read\": [\".\"],\n      \"net\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n- NEVER use `-A` (all permissions) unless absolutely necessary\n- Always use the most restrictive permissions possible\n- Use `--allow-read=.` instead of `--allow-read` to limit to current directory\n- Use permission sets in deno.json for consistent security\n- Define test permissions in deno.json under the `test` section\n- Use `env.allow`, `env.deny`, and `env.ignore` for fine-grained environment variable control (`read.ignore` also available)\n- Do not use `import` statements with full URLs for external dependencies. Instead, use `deno add` first.\n- Leverage Deno''s built-in security features\n- Use JSR for package discovery and management\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:12:58.011Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing secure and efficient runtime environments with Deno 2","zh":"适用于需要安全高效运行环境的JavaScript代理，支持Deno 2","ja":"JavaScriptエージェントが安全で効率的なランタイム環境を必要とする場合に適しています。Deno 2をサポートしています","ko":"JavaScript 에이전트가 보안이 뛰어난 효율적인 런타임 환경을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. Deno 2를 지원합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de JavaScript que necesitan entornos de tiempo de ejecución seguros y eficientes con Deno 2","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant des environnements d''exécution sécurisés et efficaces avec Deno 2","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die sichere und effiziente Laufzeitumgebungen mit Deno 2 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes JavaScript que necessitam de ambientes de tempo de execução seguros e eficientes com Deno 2","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, требующих безопасных и эффективных сред выполнения с Deno 2","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا سكريبت الذي يحتاج إلى بيئات تشغيل آمنة وفعالة مع Deno 2"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run tests with granted permissions using `deno test -P`, manage dependencies with JSR, and define test permissions in `deno.json`, leveraging the modern JavaScript Registry for seamless package management","zh":"赋予代理运行测试的权限，使用`deno test -P`，管理JSR的依赖项，并在`deno.json`中定义测试权限，利用现代JavaScript注册表实现无缝的包管理","ja":"エージェントにテストを実行する権限を付与し、`deno test -P`を使用し、JSRの依存関係を管理し、`deno.json`でテスト権限を定義し、モダンなJavaScriptレジストリを利用してパッケージの管理を無秩序化する","ko":"에이전트에 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 권한을 부여하고 `deno test -P`를 사용하며 JSR의 의존성을 관리하고 `deno.json`에서 테스트 권한을 정의하며 현대적인 자바스크립트 레지스트리를 활용하여 패키지 관리를 원활하게 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas con permisos concedidos usando `deno test -P`, gestionar dependencias con JSR y definir permisos de prueba en `deno.json`, aprovechando el moderno Registro de JavaScript para una gestión de paquetes sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests avec des autorisations accordées en utilisant `deno test -P`, gérer les dépendances avec JSR et définir les autorisations de test dans `deno.json`, en tirant parti du Registre JavaScript moderne pour une gestion de paquets sans effort","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Tests mit erteilten Berechtigungen mit `deno test -P` auszuführen, Abhängigkeiten mit JSR zu verwalten und Testberechtigungen in `deno.json` zu definieren, wobei der moderne JavaScript-Registry für eine reibungslose Paketverwaltung genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes com permissões concedidas usando `deno test -P`, gerenciar dependências com JSR e definir permissões de teste em `deno.json`, aproveitando o Registro Moderno de JavaScript para gerenciamento de pacotes sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать тесты с предоставленными разрешениями с помощью `deno test -P`, управлять зависимостями с помощью JSR и определять разрешения тестирования в `deno.json`, используя современный JavaScript-регистр для бесперебойного управления пакетами","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل الاختبارات بأذونات منحها باستخدام `deno test -P`، وإدارة الإعتماديات مع JSR، وتحديد أذونات الاختبار في `deno.json`، واستخدام السجل الحديث لجافا سكريبت لإدارة الحزم بسلاسة"},"useCases":{"en":["Running secure tests with permissions","Managing dependencies with JSR","Defining test permissions in `deno.json`"],"zh":["使用权限运行安全测试","使用JSR管理依赖项","在`deno.json`中定义测试权限"],"ja":["権限を使用してセキュアテストを実行する","JSRを使用して依存関係を管理する","`deno.json`でテスト権限を定義する"],"ko":["권한을 사용하여 보안 테스트를 실행하는 것","JSR을 사용하여 의존성을 관리하는 것","`deno.json`에서 테스트 권한을 정의하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas seguras con permisos","Gestionar dependencias con JSR","Definir permisos de prueba en `deno.json`"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests sécurisés avec des autorisations","Gérer les dépendances avec JSR","Définir les autorisations de test dans `deno.json`"],"de":["Sichere Tests mit Berechtigungen ausführen","Abhängigkeiten mit JSR verwalten","Testberechtigungen in `deno.json` definieren"],"pt":["Execução de testes seguros com permissões","Gerenciamento de dependências com JSR","Definição de permissões de teste em `deno.json`"],"ru":["Запуск безопасных тестов с разрешениями","Управление зависимостями с помощью JSR","Определение разрешений тестирования в `deno.json`"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبارات آمنة بأذونات","إدارة الإعتماديات مع JSR","تحديد أذونات الاختبار في `deno.json`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Deno 2","Uses JSR for package dependencies"],"zh":["需要Deno 2","使用JSR进行包依赖"],"ja":["Deno 2が必要","JSRを使用してパッケージ依存関係を管理する"],"ko":["Deno 2가 필요","JSR을 사용하여 패키지 의존성을 관리"],"es":["Requiere Deno 2","Utiliza JSR para dependencias de paquetes"],"fr":["Nécessite Deno 2","Utilise JSR pour les dépendances de paquets"],"de":["Benötigt Deno 2","Verwendet JSR für Paketabhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige Deno 2","Utiliza JSR para dependências de pacotes"],"ru":["Требует Deno 2","Использует JSR для зависимостей пакетов"],"ar":["يتطلب Deno 2","يستخدم JSR لاعتماديات الحزم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
