té critique pour protéger vos tokens d''API"],"de":["Echtzeit-Inhalte von Tausenden von Quellen","Community-Validierung für garantierte Qualität","Strukturierte Taxonomie für präzise Entdeckung","Zugriff auf personalisierte Inhalte mit API-Token","Kritische Sicherheit zum Schutz Ihrer API-Tokens"],"pt":["Conteúdo em tempo real","Taxonomia estruturada","Validação pela comunidade","API para agentes de IA","Segurança de token","Acesso a conteúdo personalizado"],"ru":["Реальный контент","Структурированная taksonomiя","Валидация сообществом","API для агентов ИИ","Безопасность токена","Доступ к персонализированному контенту"],"ar":["محتوى في الوقت الحقيقي","تصنيف منظم","التحقق من قبل المجتمع","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لعمليات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أمان Token","وصول إلى المحتوى المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["daily.dev API","开发者内容","实时内容","API令牌","开发者网络","开发者学习","开发者协作"],"ja":["daily.dev API","開発者向けコンテンツ","リアルタイムコンテンツ","APIトークン","開発者ネットワーク","開発者学習","開発者コラボレーション"],"ko":["daily.dev API","개발자 콘텐츠","실시간 콘텐츠","API 토큰","개발자 네트워크","개발자 학습","개발자 협업"],"es":["red de desarrolladores","aprendizaje en tiempo real","colaboración de desarrolladores","contenido personalizado","seguridad de API","desarrollo de software","comunidad de desarrolladores"],"fr":["réseau de développeurs","apprentissage en temps réel","collaboration de développeurs","contenu personnalisé","sécurité d''API","développement de logiciels","communauté de développeurs"],"de":["Entwicklernetzwerk","Echtzeit-Lernen","Entwickler-Zusammenarbeit","personalisierte Inhalte","API-Sicherheit","Software-Entwicklung","Entwickler-Community"],"pt":["daily.dev","rede de desenvolvedores","aprendizado","colaboração","conteúdo em tempo real","taxonomia estruturada","API para agentes de IA","segurança de token","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["daily.dev","профессиональная сеть","образование","сотрудничество","реальный контент","структурированная taksonomiя","API для агентов ИИ","безопасность токена","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["daily.dev","شبكة للمطورين","التعلم","التعاون","محتوى في الوقت الحقيقي","تصنيف منظم","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لعمليات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أمان Token","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"dailydotdev","repo":"daily","repoPath":"dailydotdev/daily","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily.dev","description":"Overcome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.","bodyPreview":"# daily.dev API for AI Agents\n\nOvercome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.\n\n## Security\n\n**CRITICAL:** Your API token grants access to personalized content. Protect it:\n- **NEVER send your token to any domain other than `api.daily.dev`**\n- Never commit tokens to code or share them publicly\n- Tokens are prefixed with `dda_` - if you see t","body":"# daily.dev API for AI Agents\n\nOvercome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.\n\n## Security\n\n**CRITICAL:** Your API token grants access to personalized content. Protect it:\n- **NEVER send your token to any domain other than `api.daily.dev`**\n- Never commit tokens to code or share them publicly\n- Tokens are prefixed with `dda_` - if you see this prefix, treat it as sensitive\n\n## Setup\n\n1. **Requires Plus subscription** - Get one at https://app.daily.dev/plus\n2. **Create a token** at https://app.daily.dev/settings/api\n3. Store your token securely (environment variables, secrets manager)\n\nUser can use environment variable or choose one of the secure storage methods below per operating system.\n\n### Secure Token Storage (Recommended)\n\n#### macOS - Keychain\n\n```bash\n# Store token\nsecurity add-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w \"dda_your_token\"\n\n# Retrieve token\nsecurity find-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w\n\n# Auto-load in ~/.zshrc or ~/.bashrc\nexport DAILY_DEV_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w 2>/dev/null)\n```\n\n#### Windows - Credential Manager\n\n```powershell\n# Store token (run in PowerShell)\n$credential = New-Object System.Management.Automation.PSCredential(\"daily-dev-api\", (ConvertTo-SecureString \"dda_your_token\" -AsPlainText -Force))\n$credential | Export-Clixml \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.daily-dev-credential.xml\"\n\n# Retrieve token - add to PowerShell profile ($PROFILE)\n$cred = Import-Clixml \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.daily-dev-credential.xml\"\n$env:DAILY_DEV_TOKEN = $cred.GetNetworkCredential().Password\n```\n\nOr use the Windows Credential Manager GUI: Control Panel → Credential Manager → Windows Credentials → Add a generic credential\n\n#### Linux - Secret Service (GNOME Keyring / KWallet)\n\n```bash\n# Requires libsecret-tools\n# Ubuntu/Debian: sudo apt install libsecret-tools\n# Fedora: sudo dnf install libsecret\n\n# Store token\necho \"dda_your_token\" | secret-tool store --label=\"daily.dev API Token\" service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\"\n\n# Retrieve token\nsecret-tool lookup service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\"\n\n# Auto-load in ~/.bashrc or ~/.zshrc\nexport DAILY_DEV_TOKEN=$(secret-tool lookup service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\" 2>/dev/null)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer dda_your_token_here\n```\n\n## Base URL\n\n```\nhttps://api.daily.dev/public/v1\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\nFull OpenAPI spec: https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json\n\nTo fetch details for a specific endpoint (e.g. response schema):\n```bash\ncurl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq ''.paths[\"/feeds/foryou\"].get''\n```\n\nTo fetch a component schema (replace `def-17` with schema name from $ref):\n```bash\ncurl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq ''.components.schemas[\"def-17\"]''\n```\n\n### Available Endpoints\n!`curl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq -r ''.paths | to_entries | map(.key as $path | .value | to_entries | map(.key as $method | {tag: (.value.tags[0] // \"other\"), line: (\"\\(.key | ascii_upcase) \\($path)\" + (if .value.description then \" - \\(.value.description)\" else \"\" end) + (if (.value.parameters | length) > 0 then \"\\n  Params: \" + ([.value.parameters[] | \"\\(.name)(\\(.in)): \\(.description // .schema.type)\"] | join(\"; \")) else \"\" end) + (if .value.requestBody then \"\\n  Body: \" + (.value.requestBody.content[\"application/json\"].schema | if .properties then ([.properties | to_entries[] | \"\\(.key)\"] | join(\", \")) elif .\"$ref\" then (.\"$ref\" | split(\"/\") | last) else \"object\" end) else \"\" end))})) | flatten | group_by(.tag) | map(\"#### \\(.[0].tag)\\n\" + (map(.line) | join(\"\\n\\n\"))) | join(\"\\n\\n\")''`\n\n## Agent Use Cases\n\n**Why daily.dev for agents?** LLMs have knowledge cutoffs. daily.dev provides real-time, community-validated developer content with structured taxonomy across thousands of sources. Agents can use this to stay current, get diverse perspectives, and understand what the developer community actually cares about.\n\nThese examples show how AI agents can combine daily.dev APIs with external context to create powerful developer workflows.\n\n### 🔍 GitHub Repo → Personalized Feed\nScan a user''s GitHub repositories to detect their actual tech stack from `package.json`, `go.mod`, `Cargo.toml`, `requirements.txt`, etc. Then:\n- Fetch `/tags` to see all available tags for deterministic matching\n- Auto-follow matching tags via `/feeds/filters/tags/follow`\n- Create a custom feed tuned to their stack with `/feeds/custom/`\n- Surface trending articles about their specific dependencies\n\n**Trigger:** \"Set up daily.dev based on my GitHub projects\"\n\n### 🛠️ GitHub → Auto-fill Stack Profile\nAnalyze a user''s GitHub activity to build their daily.dev tech stack profile automatically:\n- Scan repositories for languages, frameworks, and tools actually used in code\n- Search `/profile/stack/search` to find matching technologies on daily.dev\n- Populate their stack via `POST /profile/stack/` organized by section (languages, frameworks, tools)\n- Update `/profile/` bio based on their primary technologies and contributions\n\n**Trigger:** \"Build my daily.dev profile from my GitHub\"\n\n### 🚀 New Project → Curated Onboarding\nWhen a user initializes a new project or clones a repo:\n- Analyze the tech choices from config files\n- Create a dedicated custom feed filtered to exactly those technologies\n- Build a \"Getting Started\" bookmark list with foundational articles\n- Block irrelevant tags to keep the feed focused on the project scope\n\n**Trigger:** \"Help me learn the stack for this project\"\n\n### 📊 Weekly Digest → Synthesized Briefing\nCompile a personalized weekly summary by:\n- Fetching `/feeds/foryou` and `/feeds/popular` filtered by user''s followed tags\n- Cross-referencing with their GitHub activity to prioritize relevant topics\n- Summarizing key articles and trending discussions\n- Delivering as a structured briefing with links to full posts\n\n**Trigger:** Scheduled, or \"Give me my weekly dev news\"\n\n### 📚 Research Project Workspace\nWhen a user wants to deep-dive into a topic (e.g., \"I want to learn Kubernetes\"):\n- Create a custom feed via `/feeds/custom/` filtered to that topic\n- Set up a matching bookmark list via `POST /bookmarks/lists` to collect the best finds\n- As the user reads, save articles to the list with `POST /bookmarks/`\n- Track learning progress: compare bookmarked posts vs. new feed items\n- Adjust feed filters over time as understanding deepens (beginner → advanced content)\n\n**Trigger:** \"Start a research project on [topic]\"\n\n### 🧠 Agent Self-Improvement Feed\nAgents can overcome their knowledge cutoff by maintaining their own custom feed:\n- Create a custom feed via `/feeds/custom/` for technologies the agent frequently assists with\n- Periodically fetch `/feeds/custom/{feedId}` to ingest recent articles\n- Use `/posts/{id}` to read full summaries and key points\n- Agent can now provide advice with current information: \"As of this week, the recommended approach is...\"\n- Continuously adapt the feed filters based on what users are asking about\n\n**Trigger:** Agent background process, or \"What''s new in [technology] since your training?\"\n\n### 🔀 Multi-Source Synthesis\nGet balanced perspectives by aggregating content across publishers:\n- Search `/search/posts` for a topic to find coverage from multiple sources\n- Use `/search/sources` to identify authoritative publishers on the topic\n- Fetch posts from different sources via `/feeds/source/{source}`\n- Synthesize diverse viewpoints into a balanced summary with citations\n- Surface where sources agree vs. disagree on best practices\n\n**Trigger:** \"What are the different perspectives on [topic]?\" or \"Compare approaches to [problem]\"\n\n### 📈 Trending Radar\nHelp users stay ahead by monitoring community signals:\n- Fetch `/feeds/popular` to detect what''s gaining traction right now\n- Cross-reference with user''s followed tags to surface relevant trends\n- Use `/feeds/discussed` to find topics sparking active debate\n- Alert users when technologies in their stack are trending (new releases, security issues, paradigm shifts)\n- Use `/tags` to fetch the full tag catalog and `/search/tags` to explore adjacent trending topics\n\n**Trigger:** \"What should I be paying attention to?\" or \"What''s trending in [area]?\"\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n* **60 requests per minute** per user\n\nCheck response headers:\n- `X-RateLimit-Limit` - Maximum requests allowed per window\n- `X-RateLimit-Remaining` - Requests remaining in current window\n- `X-RateLimit-Reset` - Unix timestamp when the window resets\n- `Retry-After` - Seconds to wait (only when rate limited)\n\n## Errors\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| 401  | Invalid or missing token |\n| 403  | Plus subscription required |\n| 404  | Resource not found |\n| 429  | Rate limit exceeded |\n\n**Error Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": \"error_code\",\n  \"message\": \"Human readable message\"\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:13:44.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Agents needing real-time developer content and overcoming LLM knowledge cutoffs.","zh":"非常适合需要实时开发内容并克服大语言模型知识截止的知识代理。","ja":"リアルタイムの開発者コンテンツが必要で、LLMの知識カットオフを克服する必要があるナレッジエージェントに最適です。","ko":"실시간 개발자 콘텐츠와 대규모 언어 모델 지식 단절을 극복해야 하는 지식 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Conocimiento que necesitan contenido de desarrolladores en tiempo real y superar las limitaciones de conocimiento de LLM.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Connaissance ayant besoin de contenu de développeurs en temps réel et surmontant les limites de connaissance de LLM.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensagenten, die Echtzeit-Entwicklerinhalt benötigen und die Wissenslücken von LLM überwinden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conhecimento que precisam de conteúdo de desenvolvedor em tempo real e superar limitações de conhecimento de LLM.","ru":"Идеально для агентов знаний, которым требуется контент разработчиков в режиме реального времени и преодоление ограничений знаний LLM.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعرفيين الذين يحتاجون إلى محتوى مبرمج في الوقت الفعلي وتجاوز قيود المعرفة LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to access personalized content with structured taxonomy for precise discovery, leveraging the daily.dev API for community-validated articles from thousands of sources, and protecting API tokens prefixed with ''dda_'' to ensure secure access.","zh":"赋予代理访问具有结构化分类法的个性化内容的能力，实现精确的发现，并利用daily.dev API获取社区验证的文章，从数千个来源获取，并保护以''dda_''为前缀的API令牌，以确保安全访问。","ja":"エージェントが構造化された分類法を持つパーソナライズされたコンテンツにアクセスする能力を与え、正確な検出を可能にし、daily.dev APIを使用してコミュニティ検証済みの記事を数千のソースから取得し、''dda_''で始まるAPIトークンを保護して安全なアクセスを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 분류법을 갖춘 개인화된 콘텐츠에 액세스할 수 있도록 하며, 정교한 발견을 가능하게 하고, daily.dev API를 사용하여 수천 개의 소스에서 커뮤니티 검증된 기사를 가져오고, ''dda_''로 시작하는 API 토큰을 보호하여 안전한 액세스를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a acceder a contenido personalizado con taxonomía estructurada para un descubrimiento preciso, aprovechando la API de daily.dev para artículos validados por la comunidad de miles de fuentes, y protegiendo tokens de API prefijados con ''dda_'' para garantizar un acceso seguro.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accéder à un contenu personnalisé avec une taxonomie structurée pour une découverte précise, en exploitant l''API daily.dev pour des articles validés par la communauté de milliers de sources, et en protégeant les jetons d''API préfixés par ''dda_'' pour assurer un accès sécurisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, auf personalisierten Inhalt mit strukturierter Taxonomie für präzise Entdeckung zuzugreifen, indem es die daily.dev-API für von der Gemeinschaft validierte Artikel aus Tausenden von Quellen nutzt und API-Tokens mit dem Präfix ''dda_'' schützt, um einen sicheren Zugriff zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acessar conteúdo personalizado com taxonomia estruturada para descoberta precisa, aproveitando a API daily.dev para artigos validados pela comunidade de milhares de fontes e protegendo tokens de API prefixados com ''dda_'' para garantir acesso seguro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью доступа к персонализированному контенту с структурированной таксономией для точного открытия, используя API daily.dev для статей, проверенных сообществом из тысяч источников, и защищая токены API, начинающиеся с ''dda_'', для обеспечения безопасного доступа.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من الوصول إلى محتوى مُخصّص مع تصنيف هيكلي لاكتشاف دقيق، مستفيداً من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات daily.dev للحصول على مقالات مصدقة من قبل المجتمع من آلاف المصادر وحماية رموز وصول واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تحمل بادئة ''dda_'' لضمان الوصول الآمن."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching real-time developer articles","Validating content with community engagement metrics","Discovering content with precise taxonomy"],"zh":["实时获取开发者文章","使用社区参与度指标验证内容","使用精确的分类法发现内容"],"ja":["リアルタイムの開発者記事の取得","コミュニティエンゲージメントメトリックを使用したコンテンツの検証","正確な分類法を使用したコンテンツの発見"],"ko":["실시간 개발자 기사의 가져오기","커뮤니티 참여 지표를 사용한 콘텐츠의 검증","정확한 분류법을 사용한 콘텐츠의 발견"],"es":["Recuperación de artículos de desarrolladores en tiempo real","Validación de contenido con métricas de compromiso de la comunidad","Descubrimiento de contenido con taxonomía precisa"],"fr":["Récupération d''articles de développeurs en temps réel","Validation de contenu avec des métriques d''engagement de la communauté","Découverte de contenu avec une taxonomie précise"],"de":["Abrufen von Echtzeit-Entwicklerartikeln","Validierung von Inhalten mit Community-Engagement-Metriken","Entdecken von Inhalten mit präziser Taxonomie"],"pt":["Recuperar artigos de desenvolvedor em tempo real","Validar conteúdo com métricas de engajamento da comunidade","Descobrir conteúdo com taxonomia precisa"],"ru":["Получать статьи разработчиков в режиме реального времени","Проверять контент с помощью метрик вовлеченности сообщества","Открывать контент с точной таксономией"],"ar":["استرجاع مقالات المبرمجين في الوقت الفعلي","التحقق من المحتوى باستخدام مقاييس مشاركة المجتمع","اكتشاف المحتوى بالتصنيف الدقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires daily.dev API token","Tokens must be protected and not shared publicly or committed to code"],"zh":["需要daily.dev API令牌","令牌必须被保护，不得公开共享或提交到代码"],"ja":["daily.dev APIトークンが必要","トークンは保護され、公開共有またはコードへのコミットは禁止"],"ko":["daily.dev API 토큰이 필요","토큰은 보호되어야 하며 공개적으로 공유되거나 코드에 커밋되어서는 안 됨"],"es":["Requiere token de API de daily.dev","Los tokens deben ser protegidos y no compartidos públicamente ni comprometidos en el código"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API daily.dev","Les jetons doivent être protégés et ne pas être partagés publiquement ou compromis dans le code"],"de":["Benötigt daily.dev-API-Token","Tokens müssen geschützt und nicht öffentlich geteilt oder im Code committet werden"],"pt":["Requer token de API daily.dev","Tokens devem ser protegidos e não compartilhados publicamente ou comprometidos no código"],"ru":["Требуется токен API daily.dev","Токены должны быть защищены и не должны быть опубликованы или зафиксированы в коде"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول واجهة برمجة تطبيقات daily.dev","يجب حماية الرموز وعدم مشاركتها علنا أو إيداعها في الكود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('heroui-inc/heroui/heroui-react', 'community', 'heroui-inc', 'heroui', 'heroui-inc/heroui', 'heroui-react', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z', '2026-02-18T02:13:48.536Z', NULL, '{"id":"heroui-inc/heroui/heroui-react","name":"heroui-react","description":{"zh":"HeroUI 是一个现代化的 React UI 库，提供可访问和可定制的 UI 组件，基于 Tailwind CSS v4 和 React Aria Components","ja":"HeroUI はモダンな React UI ライブラリで、アクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを提供、Tailwind CSS v4 と React Aria Components に基づく","ko":"HeroUI는 현대적인 React UI 라이브러리로서, 접근 가능하고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 제공하며, Tailwind CSS v4와 React Aria Components를 기반으로 함","es":"HeroUI v3 es una biblioteca de componentes UI para React, construida con Tailwind CSS v4 y React Aria Components, que ofrece componentes personalizables y accesibles","fr":"HeroUI v3 est une bibliothèque de composants UI pour React, construite avec Tailwind CSS v4 et React Aria Components, qui offre des composants personnalisables et accessibles","de":"HeroUI v3 ist eine Bibliothek von UI-Komponenten für React, die mit Tailwind CSS v4 und React Aria Components erstellt wurde und personalisierbare und zugängliche Komponenten bietet","pt":"A HeroUI v3 é uma biblioteca de componentes UI para React, construída com Tailwind CSS v4 e React Aria Components, oferecendo componentes acessíveis e personalizáveis","ru":"HeroUI v3 — это библиотека компонентов UI для React, построенная на Tailwind CSS v4 и React Aria Components, предлагающая доступные и настраиваемые компоненты","ar":"HeroUI v3 هي مكتبة مكونات واجهة مستخدم ل React، مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4 و React Aria Components، توفر مكونات يمكن الوصول إليها وقابلة للتعديل","en":"🚀 Beautiful, fast and modern React UI library. (Previously NextUI)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"HeroUI React UI 库 - 美观、快速、现代化","ja":"HeroUI React UI ライブラリ - 美しさ、高速、モダン","ko":"HeroUI React UI 라이브러리 - 아름답고, 빠르고, 현대적","es":"HeroUI React: Biblioteca de UI moderna y accesible","fr":"HeroUI React: Bibliothèque UI moderne et accessible","de":"HeroUI React: Moderne und zugängliche UI-Bibliothek","pt":"HeroUI React: Biblioteca de UI Moderna e Acessível","ru":"HeroUI React: Красивая и быстрая библиотека UI","ar":"HeroUI React: مكتبة واجهة مستخدم حديثة وسريعة","en":"heroui-react"},"description":{"zh":"HeroUI 是一个现代化的 React UI 库，提供可访问和可定制的 UI 组件，基于 Tailwind CSS v4 和 React Aria Components","ja":"HeroUI はモダンな React UI ライブラリで、アクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを提供、Tailwind CSS v4 と React Aria Components に基づく","ko":"HeroUI는 현대적인 React UI 라이브러리로서, 접근 가능하고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 제공하며, Tailwind CSS v4와 React Aria Components를 기반으로 함","es":"HeroUI v3 es una biblioteca de componentes UI para React, construida con Tailwind CSS v4 y React Aria Components, que ofrece componentes personalizables y ac...","fr":"HeroUI v3 est une bibliothèque de composants UI pour React, construite avec Tailwind CSS v4 et React Aria Components, qui offre des composants personnalisabl...","de":"HeroUI v3 ist eine Bibliothek von UI-Komponenten für React, die mit Tailwind CSS v4 und React Aria Components erstellt wurde und personalisierbare und zugäng...","pt":"A HeroUI v3 é uma biblioteca de componentes UI para React, construída com Tailwind CSS v4 e React Aria Components, oferecendo componentes acessíveis e person...","ru":"HeroUI v3 — это библиотека компонентов UI для React, построенная на Tailwind CSS v4 и React Aria Components, предлагающая доступные и настраиваемые компоненты","ar":"HeroUI v3 هي مكتبة مكونات واجهة مستخدم ل React، مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4 و React Aria Components، توفر مكونات يمكن الوصول إليها وقابلة للتعديل","en":"🚀 Beautiful, fast and modern React UI library. (Previously NextUI)"},"definition":{"en":"🚀 Beautiful, fast and modern React UI library. (Previously NextUI)"},"features":{"zh":["基于 Tailwind CSS v4","使用 React Aria Components","提供可访问和可定制的 UI 组件","支持现代化的 React 应用开发","高性能和快速渲染"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4 に基づく","React Aria Components を使用","アクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを提供","モダンな React アプリ開発をサポート","高性能と高速レンダリング"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4를 기반으로","React Aria Components를 사용","접근 가능하고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 제공","현대적인 React 애플리케이션 개발을 지원","고성능과 빠른 렌더링"],"es":["Componentes UI personalizables","Accesibilidad con React Aria Components","Construida con Tailwind CSS v4","Compatible con aplicaciones React","Documentación detallada para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Composants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité avec React Aria Components","Construite avec Tailwind CSS v4","Compatible avec les applications React","Documentation détaillée pour les développeurs"],"de":["Personalisierbare UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit mit React Aria Components","Erstellt mit Tailwind CSS v4","Kompatibel mit React-Anwendungen","Detaillierte Dokumentation für Entwickler"],"pt":["Baseada em Tailwind CSS v4","Construída com React Aria Components","Componentes acessíveis e personalizáveis","Desenvolvida para aplicações React","Oferece uma variedade de componentes UI"],"ru":["Основана на Tailwind CSS v4","Построена на React Aria Components","Доступные и настраиваемые компоненты","Разработана для приложений React","Предлагает разнообразные компоненты UI"],"ar":["مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4","مبنية على React Aria Components","مكونات يمكن الوصول إليها وقابلة للتعديل","تم تطويرها لتناسب التطبيقات React","توفر مجموعة متنوعة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React UI 库","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","可访问 UI","可定制 UI","现代化 React 开发","高性能 React"],"ja":["React UI ライブラリ","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","アクセス可能 UI","カスタマイズ可能 UI","モダンな React 開発","高性能 React"],"ko":["React UI 라이브러리","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","접근 가능 UI","사용자 정의 가능한 UI","현대적인 React 개발","고성능 React"],"es":["HeroUI React","Biblioteca de UI","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Desarrollo de aplicaciones React","Componentes UI personalizables","Accesibilidad en aplicaciones web"],"fr":["HeroUI React","Bibliothèque UI","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Développement d''applications React","Composants UI personnalisables","Accessibilité dans les applications web"],"de":["HeroUI React","UI-Bibliothek","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Entwicklung von React-Anwendungen","Personalisierbare UI-Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit in Webanwendungen"],"pt":["HeroUI React","Biblioteca de UI React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Componentes acessíveis","Desenvolvimento web","Aplicações React"],"ru":["HeroUI React","Библиотека UI React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Доступные компоненты","Веб-разработка","Приложения React"],"ar":["HeroUI React","مكتبة واجهة مستخدم React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","مكونات يمكن الوصول إليها","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات React"]}},"owner":"heroui-inc","repo":"heroui","repoPath":"heroui-inc/heroui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"heroui-react","description":"HeroUI v3 React component library (Tailwind CSS v4 + React Aria). Use when working with HeroUI components, installing HeroUI, customizing HeroUI themes, or accessing HeroUI component documentation. Keywords: HeroUI, Hero UI, heroui, @heroui/react, @heroui/styles.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------","body":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Provider      | `<HeroUIProvider>` required       | **No Provider needed**                      |\n| Animations    | `framer-motion` package           | CSS-based, no extra deps                    |\n| Component API | Flat props: `<Card title=\"x\">`    | Compound: `<Card><Card.Header>`             |\n| Styling       | Tailwind v3 + `@heroui/theme`     | Tailwind v4 + `@heroui/styles@beta`         |\n| Packages      | `@heroui/system`, `@heroui/theme` | `@heroui/react@beta`, `@heroui/styles@beta` |\n\n### WRONG (v2 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO NOT DO THIS - v2 pattern\nimport { HeroUIProvider } from \"@heroui/react\";\nimport { motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\n<HeroUIProvider>\n\t<Card title=\"Product\" description=\"A great product\" />\n</HeroUIProvider>;\n```\n\n### CORRECT (v3 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO THIS - v3 pattern (no provider, compound components)\nimport { Card } from \"@heroui/react@beta\";\n\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Product</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>A great product</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n</Card>;\n```\n\n**Always fetch v3 docs before implementing.** Do not assume v2 patterns work.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Semantic variants (`primary`, `secondary`, `tertiary`) over visual descriptions\n- Composition over configuration (compound components)\n- CSS variable-based theming with `oklch` color space\n- BEM naming convention for predictable styling\n\n---\n\n## Accessing Documentation & Component Information\n\n**For component details, examples, props, and implementation patterns, always fetch documentation:**\n\n### Using Scripts\n\n```bash\n# List all available components\nnode scripts/list_components.mjs\n\n# Get component documentation (MDX)\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button Card TextField\n\n# Get component source code\nnode scripts/get_source.mjs Button\n\n# Get component CSS styles (BEM classes)\nnode scripts/get_styles.mjs Button\n\n# Get theme variables\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n\n# Get non-component docs (guides, releases)\nnode scripts/get_docs.mjs /docs/react/getting-started/theming\n```\n\n### Direct MDX URLs\n\nComponent docs: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/{component-name}.mdx`\n\nExamples:\n\n- Button: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/button.mdx`\n- Modal: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/modal.mdx`\n- Form: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/form.mdx`\n\nGetting started guides: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/{topic}.mdx`\n\n**Important:** Always fetch component docs before implementing. The MDX docs include complete examples, props, anatomy, and API references.\n\n---\n\n## Installation Essentials\n\n**CRITICAL**: HeroUI v3 is currently in BETA. Always use `@beta` tag when installing packages.\n\n### Quick Install\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants\n```\n\n### Framework Setup (Next.js App Router - Recommended)\n\n1. **Install dependencies:**\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants tailwindcss @tailwindcss/postcss postcss\n```\n\n2. **Create/update `app/globals.css`:**\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind CSS v4 - Must be first */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n/* HeroUI v3 styles - Must be after Tailwind */\n@import \"@heroui/styles\";\n```\n\n3. **Import in `app/layout.tsx`:**\n\n```tsx\nimport \"./globals.css\";\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n\tchildren,\n}: {\n\tchildren: React.ReactNode;\n}) {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n\t\t\t<body>\n\t\t\t\t{/* No Provider needed in HeroUI v3! */}\n\t\t\t\t{children}\n\t\t\t</body>\n\t\t</html>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n4. **Configure PostCSS (`postcss.config.mjs`):**\n\n```js\nexport default {\n\tplugins: {\n\t\t\"@tailwindcss/postcss\": {},\n\t},\n};\n```\n\n### Critical Setup Requirements\n\n1. **Tailwind CSS v4 is MANDATORY** - HeroUI v3 will NOT work with Tailwind CSS v3\n2. **No Provider Required** - Unlike HeroUI v2, v3 components work directly without a Provider\n3. **Use Compound Components** - Components use compound structure (e.g., `Card.Header`, `Card.Content`)\n4. **Use onPress, not onClick** - For better accessibility, use `onPress` event handlers\n5. **Import Order Matters** - Always import Tailwind CSS before HeroUI styles\n\n---\n\n## Component Patterns\n\nHeroUI v3 uses **compound component patterns**. Each component has subcomponents accessed via dot notation.\n\n**Example - Card:**\n\n```tsx\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Title</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>Description</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n\t<Card.Content>{/* Content */}</Card.Content>\n\t<Card.Footer>{/* Actions */}</Card.Footer>\n</Card>\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Always use compound structure - don''t flatten to props\n- Subcomponents are accessed via dot notation (e.g., `Card.Header`)\n- Each subcomponent may have its own props\n- **Fetch component docs for complete anatomy and examples**\n\n---\n\n## Semantic Variants\n\nHeroUI uses semantic naming to communicate functional intent:\n\n| Variant     | Purpose                           | Usage          |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `primary`   | Main action to move forward       | 1 per context  |\n| `secondary` | Alternative actions               | Multiple       |\n| `tertiary`  | Dismissive actions (cancel, skip) | Sparingly      |\n| `danger`    | Destructive actions               | When needed    |\n| `ghost`     | Low-emphasis actions              | Minimal weight |\n| `outline`   | Secondary actions                 | Bordered style |\n\n**Don''t use raw colors** - semantic variants adapt to themes and accessibility.\n\n---\n\n## Theming\n\nHeroUI v3 uses CSS variables with `oklch` color space:\n\n```css\n:root {\n\t--accent: oklch(0.6204 0.195 253.83);\n\t--accent-foreground: var(--snow);\n\t--background: oklch(0.9702 0 0);\n\t--foreground: var(--eclipse);\n}\n```\n\n**Get current theme variables:**\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n```\n\n**Color naming:**\n\n- Without suffix = background (e.g., `--accent`)\n- With `-foreground` = text color (e.g., `--accent-foreground`)\n\n**Theme switching:**\n\n```html\n<html class=\"dark\" data-theme=\"dark\"></html>\n```\n\nFor detailed theming, fetch: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/theming.mdx`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:13:48.536Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring modern and accessible React UI components built with Tailwind CSS v4 and React Aria Components.","zh":"适用于需要现代且易访问的React UI组件的前端代理，使用Tailwind CSS v4和React Aria组件构建。","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4およびReact Ariaコンポーネントを使用して構築されたモダンでアクセス可能なReact UIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"모던하고 접근 가능한 React UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Tailwind CSS v4와 React Aria 컴포넌트로 빌드됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren componentes de interfaz de usuario modernos y accesibles de React construidos con Tailwind CSS v4 y componentes de React Aria.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des composants d''interface utilisateur modernes et accessibles de React construits avec Tailwind CSS v4 et des composants React Aria.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die moderne und zugängliche React-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die mit Tailwind CSS v4 und React-Aria-Komponenten erstellt wurden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem componentes de UI modernos e acessíveis do React construídos com Tailwind CSS v4 e componentes do React Aria.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, требующих современных и доступных компонентов React UI, построенных с помощью Tailwind CSS v4 и компонентов React Aria.","ar":"مثالية لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يتطلب مكونات واجهة المستخدم الحديثة والقابلة للوصول من React المحلية مع Tailwind CSS v4 ومكونات React Aria."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create beautiful, fast, and customizable UI components for React applications using HeroUI v3, leveraging the power of Tailwind CSS and React Aria for enhanced accessibility and styling.","zh":"赋予代理创建美观、快速、可定制的UI组件的能力，用于React应用程序，利用HeroUI v3的强大功能，并结合Tailwind CSS和React Aria增强可访问性和样式。","ja":"HeroUI v3の強力な機能を利用し、Tailwind CSSおよびReact Ariaを使用してアクセシビリティとスタイリングを強化することで、Reactアプリケーション用に美しく、高速で、カスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"HeroUI v3의 강력한 기능을 활용하여 React 애플리케이션용으로 아름답고, 빠르고, 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Tailwind CSS와 React Aria를 사용하여 접근성과 스타일을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de interfaz de usuario hermosos, rápidos y personalizables para aplicaciones de React utilizando HeroUI v3, aprovechando el poder de Tailwind CSS y React Aria para una mayor accesibilidad y estilo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants d''interface utilisateur beaux, rapides et personnalisables pour les applications React en utilisant HeroUI v3, en exploitant le pouvoir de Tailwind CSS et de React Aria pour une accessibilité et un style améliorés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schöne, schnelle und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für React-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie HeroUI v3 verwenden und die Leistungsfähigkeit von Tailwind CSS und React Aria für eine verbesserte Zugänglichkeit und Stilierung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes de UI bonitos, rápidos e personalizáveis para aplicações React usando HeroUI v3, aproveitando o poder do Tailwind CSS e do React Aria para acessibilidade e estilização aprimoradas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать красивые, быстрые и настраиваемые компоненты интерфейса пользователя для приложений React с помощью HeroUI v3, используя возможности Tailwind CSS и React Aria для улучшения доступности и стилизации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم الجميلة والسريعة والقابلة للتعديل لتطبيقات React باستخدام HeroUI v3، واستخدام قوة Tailwind CSS و React Aria لتحسين سهولة الوصول والتأثيرات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and accessible hero sections","Customizing UI components with Tailwind CSS classes","Developing modern React applications with pre-built HeroUI components"],"zh":["构建响应式和可访问的英雄区块","使用Tailwind CSS类自定义UI组件","使用预构建的HeroUI组件开发现代React应用程序"],"ja":["レスポンシブでアクセス可能なヒーローセクションの構築","Tailwind CSSクラスを使用したUIコンポーネントのカスタマイズ","事前に構築されたHeroUIコンポーネントを使用したモダンなReactアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["반응형 및 접근 가능한 영웅 섹션 구축","Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트 사용자 지정","사전 구축된 HeroUI 컴포넌트를 사용하여 모던한 React 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Creación de secciones de héroe responsivas y accesibles","Personalización de componentes de interfaz de usuario con clases de Tailwind CSS","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de React modernas con componentes preconstruidos de HeroUI"],"fr":["Création de sections de héros réactives et accessibles","Personnalisation de composants d''interface utilisateur avec des classes de Tailwind CSS","Développement d''applications React modernes avec des composants préconstruits HeroUI"],"de":["Erstellung von responsiven und zugänglichen Hero-Abschnitten","Anpassung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen","Entwicklung von modernen React-Anwendungen mit vordefinierten HeroUI-Komponenten"],"pt":["Construir seções de heróis responsivas e acessíveis","Personalizar componentes de UI com classes do Tailwind CSS","Desenvolver aplicações React modernas com componentes pré-construídos do HeroUI"],"ru":["Построение отзывчивых и доступных секций героев","Настройка компонентов интерфейса пользователя с помощью классов Tailwind CSS","Разработка современных приложений React с предварительно построенными компонентами HeroUI"],"ar":["بناء مقاطع البطل المستجيبة والقابلة للوصول","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS","تنمية تطبيقات React الحديثة مع مكونات HeroUI المسبقة البناء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to HeroUI v3, ignoring prior knowledge of HeroUI v2","Requires React and Tailwind CSS v4 compatibility"],"zh":["特定于HeroUI v3，忽略了对HeroUI v2的先前知识","需要React和Tailwind CSS v4兼容性"],"ja":["HeroUI v3に特有で、HeroUI v2の先行知識を無視する","ReactおよびTailwind CSS v4の互換性が必要"],"ko":["HeroUI v3에 특정되어 있으며 HeroUI v2에 대한 이전 지식을 무시한다","React 및 Tailwind CSS v4 호환성이 필요함"],"es":["Específico para HeroUI v3, ignorando el conocimiento previo de HeroUI v2","Requiere compatibilidad con React y Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Spécifique à HeroUI v3, ignorant les connaissances antérieures de HeroUI v2","Nécessite la compatibilité avec React et Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Spezifisch für HeroUI v3, wobei das vorherige Wissen über HeroUI v2 ignoriert wird","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit React und Tailwind CSS v4"],"pt":["Específico para o HeroUI v3, ignorando conhecimentos anteriores do HeroUI v2","Exige compatibilidade com React e Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Конкретно для HeroUI v3, игнорируя предыдущие знания о HeroUI v2","Требует совместимости с React и Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["محدد لبرنامج HeroUI v3، مع تجاهل المعرفة السابقة لبرنامج HeroUI v2","يتطلب توافقًا مع React و Tailwind CSS v4"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
