 플랫폼을 포함","JSON 형식의 컴플라이언스 프레임워크","체크를 컴플라이언스 컨트롤에 매핑"],"es":["Automatización de la seguridad y el cumplimiento","Soporte para múltiples proveedores de nube","Frameworks de cumplimiento personalizables","Integración con AWS, Azure y GCP","Informes de cumplimiento detallados","Actualizaciones de seguridad automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la sécurité et de la conformité","Prise en charge de plusieurs fournisseurs de cloud","Cadres de conformité personnalisables","Intégration avec AWS, Azure et GCP","Rapports de conformité détaillés","Mises à jour de sécurité automatisées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheit und Compliance","Unterstützung für mehrere Cloud-Anbieter","Anpassbare Compliance-Frameworks","Integration mit AWS, Azure und GCP","Detaillierte Compliance-Berichte","Automatisierte Sicherheitsupdates"],"pt":["Automação de segurança em nuvem","Cumprimento das normas em qualquer ambiente de nuvem","Suporte a múltiplos provedores de nuvem","Frameworks de conformidade personalizáveis","Verificação de controles de conformidade"],"ru":["Автоматизация безопасности облака","Соответствие требованиям в любой облачной среде","Поддержка нескольких облачных провайдеров","Настраиваемые рамки соответствия","Проверка контроля соответствия"],"ar":["آليﺔ أمن السحابة","الامتثال للوائح في أي بيئة سحابية","دعم مزودي السحابة المتعددين","إطارات الامتثال القابلة للتعديل","فحص مراقبة الامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prowler","云安全","合规性","自动化","AWS","Azure","GCP","JSON","合规性框架"],"ja":["Prowler","クラウドセキュリティ","コンプライアンス","自動化","AWS","Azure","GCP","JSON","コンプライアンス フレームワーク"],"ko":["Prowler","클라우드 보안","컴플라이언스","자동화","AWS","Azure","GCP","JSON","컴플라이언스 프레임워크"],"es":["seguridad en la nube","cumplimiento normativo","Prowler","plataforma de seguridad en la nube","automatización de la seguridad","proveedores de nube","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"fr":["sécurité dans le cloud","conformité réglementaire","Prowler","plateforme de sécurité cloud","automatisation de la sécurité","fournisseurs de cloud","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"de":["Cloud-Sicherheit","Compliance","Prowler","Cloud-Sicherheitsplattform","Sicherheitsautomatisierung","Cloud-Anbieter","AWS","Azure","GCP"],"pt":["segurança em nuvem","cumprimento das normas","Prowler Compliance","plataforma de segurança em nuvem","automação de segurança","provedores de nuvem"],"ru":["безопасность облака","соответствие требованиям","Prowler Compliance","платформа безопасности облака","автоматизация безопасности","облачные провайдеры"],"ar":["أمن السحابة","الامتثال للوائح","بروولر للامتثال","منصة أمن السحابة","آليﺔ أمن","مزودي السحابة"]}},"owner":"prowler-cloud","repo":"prowler","repoPath":"prowler-cloud/prowler","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prowler-compliance","description":">","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating a new compliance framework for any provider\n- Adding requirements to existing frameworks\n- Mapping checks to compliance controls\n- Understanding compliance framework structures and attributes\n\n## Compliance Framework Location\n\nFrameworks are JSON files located in: `prowler/compliance/{provider}/{framework_name}_{provider}.json`\n\n**Supported Providers:**\n- `aws` - Amazon Web Services\n- `azure` - Microsoft Azure\n- `gcp` - Google Cloud Platform\n- `kub","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating a new compliance framework for any provider\n- Adding requirements to existing frameworks\n- Mapping checks to compliance controls\n- Understanding compliance framework structures and attributes\n\n## Compliance Framework Location\n\nFrameworks are JSON files located in: `prowler/compliance/{provider}/{framework_name}_{provider}.json`\n\n**Supported Providers:**\n- `aws` - Amazon Web Services\n- `azure` - Microsoft Azure\n- `gcp` - Google Cloud Platform\n- `kubernetes` - Kubernetes\n- `github` - GitHub\n- `m365` - Microsoft 365\n- `alibabacloud` - Alibaba Cloud\n- `cloudflare` - Cloudflare\n- `oraclecloud` - Oracle Cloud\n- `oci` - Oracle Cloud Infrastructure\n- `nhn` - NHN Cloud\n- `mongodbatlas` - MongoDB Atlas\n- `iac` - Infrastructure as Code\n- `llm` - Large Language Models\n\n## Base Framework Structure\n\nAll compliance frameworks share this base structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Framework\": \"FRAMEWORK_NAME\",\n  \"Name\": \"Full Framework Name with Version\",\n  \"Version\": \"X.X\",\n  \"Provider\": \"PROVIDER\",\n  \"Description\": \"Framework description...\",\n  \"Requirements\": [\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"requirement_id\",\n      \"Description\": \"Requirement description\",\n      \"Name\": \"Optional requirement name\",\n      \"Attributes\": [...],\n      \"Checks\": [\"check_name_1\", \"check_name_2\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Framework-Specific Attribute Structures\n\nEach framework type has its own attribute model. Below are the exact structures used by Prowler:\n\n### CIS (Center for Internet Security)\n\n**Framework ID format:** `cis_{version}_{provider}` (e.g., `cis_5.0_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"1.1\",\n  \"Description\": \"Maintain current contact details\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"account_maintain_current_contact_details\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Section\": \"1 Identity and Access Management\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"Optional subsection\",\n      \"Profile\": \"Level 1\",\n      \"AssessmentStatus\": \"Automated\",\n      \"Description\": \"Detailed attribute description\",\n      \"RationaleStatement\": \"Why this control matters\",\n      \"ImpactStatement\": \"Impact of implementing this control\",\n      \"RemediationProcedure\": \"Steps to fix the issue\",\n      \"AuditProcedure\": \"Steps to verify compliance\",\n      \"AdditionalInformation\": \"Extra notes\",\n      \"DefaultValue\": \"Default configuration value\",\n      \"References\": \"https://docs.example.com/reference\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Profile values:** `Level 1`, `Level 2`, `E3 Level 1`, `E3 Level 2`, `E5 Level 1`, `E5 Level 2`\n**AssessmentStatus values:** `Automated`, `Manual`\n\n---\n\n### ISO 27001\n\n**Framework ID format:** `iso27001_{year}_{provider}` (e.g., `iso27001_2022_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"A.5.1\",\n  \"Description\": \"Policies for information security should be defined...\",\n  \"Name\": \"Policies for information security\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"securityhub_enabled\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Category\": \"A.5 Organizational controls\",\n      \"Objetive_ID\": \"A.5.1\",\n      \"Objetive_Name\": \"Policies for information security\",\n      \"Check_Summary\": \"Summary of what is being checked\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** `Objetive_ID` and `Objetive_Name` use this exact spelling (not \"Objective\").\n\n---\n\n### ENS (Esquema Nacional de Seguridad - Spain)\n\n**Framework ID format:** `ens_rd2022_{provider}` (e.g., `ens_rd2022_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"op.acc.1.aws.iam.2\",\n  \"Description\": \"Proveedor de identidad centralizado\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"iam_check_saml_providers_sts\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"IdGrupoControl\": \"op.acc.1\",\n      \"Marco\": \"operacional\",\n      \"Categoria\": \"control de acceso\",\n      \"DescripcionControl\": \"Detailed control description in Spanish\",\n      \"Nivel\": \"alto\",\n      \"Tipo\": \"requisito\",\n      \"Dimensiones\": [\"trazabilidad\", \"autenticidad\"],\n      \"ModoEjecucion\": \"automatico\",\n      \"Dependencias\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Nivel values:** `opcional`, `bajo`, `medio`, `alto`\n**Tipo values:** `refuerzo`, `requisito`, `recomendacion`, `medida`\n**Dimensiones values:** `confidencialidad`, `integridad`, `trazabilidad`, `autenticidad`, `disponibilidad`\n\n---\n\n### MITRE ATT&CK\n\n**Framework ID format:** `mitre_attack_{provider}` (e.g., `mitre_attack_aws`)\n\nMITRE uses a different requirement structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Name\": \"Exploit Public-Facing Application\",\n  \"Id\": \"T1190\",\n  \"Tactics\": [\"Initial Access\"],\n  \"SubTechniques\": [],\n  \"Platforms\": [\"Containers\", \"IaaS\", \"Linux\", \"Network\", \"Windows\", \"macOS\"],\n  \"Description\": \"Adversaries may attempt to exploit a weakness...\",\n  \"TechniqueURL\": \"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"guardduty_is_enabled\", \"inspector2_is_enabled\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"AWSService\": \"Amazon GuardDuty\",\n      \"Category\": \"Detect\",\n      \"Value\": \"Minimal\",\n      \"Comment\": \"Explanation of how this service helps...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**For Azure:** Use `AzureService` instead of `AWSService`\n**For GCP:** Use `GCPService` instead of `AWSService`\n**Category values:** `Detect`, `Protect`, `Respond`\n**Value values:** `Minimal`, `Partial`, `Significant`\n\n---\n\n### NIST 800-53\n\n**Framework ID format:** `nist_800_53_revision_{version}_{provider}` (e.g., `nist_800_53_revision_5_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"ac_2_1\",\n  \"Name\": \"AC-2(1) Automated System Account Management\",\n  \"Description\": \"Support the management of system accounts...\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"iam_password_policy_minimum_length_14\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"ItemId\": \"ac_2_1\",\n      \"Section\": \"Access Control (AC)\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"Account Management (AC-2)\",\n      \"SubGroup\": \"AC-2(3) Disable Accounts\",\n      \"Service\": \"iam\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Generic Compliance (Fallback)\n\nFor frameworks without specific attribute models:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"requirement_id\",\n  \"Description\": \"Requirement description\",\n  \"Name\": \"Optional name\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"check_name\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"ItemId\": \"item_id\",\n      \"Section\": \"Section name\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"Subsection name\",\n      \"SubGroup\": \"Subgroup name\",\n      \"Service\": \"service_name\",\n      \"Type\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### AWS Well-Architected Framework\n\n**Framework ID format:** `aws_well_architected_framework_{pillar}_pillar_aws`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"SEC01-BP01\",\n  \"Description\": \"Establish common guardrails...\",\n  \"Name\": \"Establish common guardrails\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"account_part_of_organizations\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Name\": \"Establish common guardrails\",\n      \"WellArchitectedQuestionId\": \"securely-operate\",\n      \"WellArchitectedPracticeId\": \"sec_securely_operate_multi_accounts\",\n      \"Section\": \"Security\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"Security foundations\",\n      \"LevelOfRisk\": \"High\",\n      \"AssessmentMethod\": \"Automated\",\n      \"Description\": \"Detailed description\",\n      \"ImplementationGuidanceUrl\": \"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### KISA ISMS-P (Korea)\n\n**Framework ID format:** `kisa_isms_p_{year}_{provider}` (e.g., `kisa_isms_p_2023_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"1.1.1\",\n  \"Description\": \"Requirement description\",\n  \"Name\": \"Requirement name\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"check_name\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Domain\": \"1. Management System\",\n      \"Subdomain\": \"1.1 Management System Establishment\",\n      \"Section\": \"1.1.1 Section Name\",\n      \"AuditChecklist\": [\"Checklist item 1\", \"Checklist item 2\"],\n      \"RelatedRegulations\": [\"Regulation 1\"],\n      \"AuditEvidence\": [\"Evidence type 1\"],\n      \"NonComplianceCases\": [\"Non-compliance example\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### C5 (Germany Cloud Computing Compliance Criteria Catalogue)\n\n**Framework ID format:** `c5_{provider}` (e.g., `c5_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"BCM-01\",\n  \"Description\": \"Requirement description\",\n  \"Name\": \"Requirement name\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"check_name\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Section\": \"BCM Business Continuity Management\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"BCM-01\",\n      \"Type\": \"Basic Criteria\",\n      \"AboutCriteria\": \"Description of criteria\",\n      \"ComplementaryCriteria\": \"Additional criteria\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### CCC (Cloud Computing Compliance)\n\n**Framework ID format:** `ccc_{provider}` (e.g., `ccc_aws`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"CCC.C01\",\n  \"Description\": \"Requirement description\",\n  \"Name\": \"Requirement name\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"check_name\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"FamilyName\": \"Cryptography & Key Management\",\n      \"FamilyDescription\": \"Family description\",\n      \"Section\": \"CCC.C01\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"Key Management\",\n      \"SubSectionObjective\": \"Objective description\",\n      \"Applicability\": [\"IaaS\", \"PaaS\", \"SaaS\"],\n      \"Recommendation\": \"Recommended action\",\n      \"SectionThreatMappings\": [{\"threat\": \"T1190\"}],\n      \"SectionGuidelineMappings\": [{\"guideline\": \"NIST\"}]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Prowler ThreatScore\n\n**Framework ID format:** `prowler_threatscore_{provider}` (e.g., `prowler_threatscore_aws`)\n\nProwler ThreatScore is a custom security scoring framework developed by Prowler that evaluates AWS account security based on **four main pillars**:\n\n| Pillar | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **1. IAM** | Identity and Access Management controls (authentication, authorization, credentials) |\n| **2. Attack Surface** | Network exposure, public resources, security group rules |\n| **3. Logging and Monitoring** | Audit logging, threat detection, forensic readiness |\n| **4. Encryption** | Data at rest and in transit encryption |\n\n**Scoring System:**\n- **LevelOfRisk** (1-5): Severity of the security issue\n  - `5` = Critical (e.g., root MFA, public S3 buckets)\n  - `4` = High (e.g., user MFA, public EC2)\n  - `3` = Medium (e.g., password policies, encryption)\n  - `2` = Low\n  - `1` = Informational\n- **Weight**: Impact multiplier for score calculation\n  - `1000` = Critical controls (root security, public exposure)\n  - `100` = High-impact controls (user authentication, monitoring)\n  - `10` = Standard controls (password policies, encryption)\n  - `1` = Low-impact controls (best practices)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Id\": \"1.1.1\",\n  \"Description\": \"Ensure MFA is enabled for the ''root'' user account\",\n  \"Checks\": [\"iam_root_mfa_enabled\"],\n  \"Attributes\": [\n    {\n      \"Title\": \"MFA enabled for ''root''\",\n      \"Section\": \"1. IAM\",\n      \"SubSection\": \"1.1 Authentication\",\n      \"AttributeDescription\": \"The root user account holds the highest level of privileges within an AWS account. Enabling MFA enhances security by adding an additional layer of protection.\",\n      \"AdditionalInformation\": \"Enabling MFA enhances console security by requiring the authenticating user to both possess a time-sensitive key-generating device and have knowledge of their credentials.\",\n      \"LevelOfRisk\": 5,\n      \"Weight\": 1000\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Available for providers:** AWS, Kubernetes, M365\n\n---\n\n## Available Compliance Frameworks\n\n### AWS (41 frameworks)\n| Framework | File Name |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| CIS 1.4, 1.5, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0 | `cis_{version}_aws.json` |\n| ISO 27001:2013, 2022 | `iso27001_{year}_aws.json` |\n| NIST 800-53 Rev 4, 5 | `nist_800_53_revision_{version}_aws.json` |\n| NIST 800-171 Rev 2 | `nist_800_171_revision_2_aws.json` |\n| NIST CSF 1.1, 2.0 | `nist_csf_{version}_aws.json` |\n| PCI DSS 3.2.1, 4.0 | `pci_{version}_aws.json` |\n| HIPAA | `hipaa_aws.json` |\n| GDPR | `gdpr_aws.json` |\n| SOC 2 | `soc2_aws.json` |\n| FedRAMP Low/Moderate | `fedramp_{level}_revision_4_aws.json` |\n| ENS RD2022 | `ens_rd2022_aws.json` |\n| MITRE ATT&CK | `mitre_attack_aws.json` |\n| C5 Germany | `c5_aws.json` |\n| CISA | `cisa_aws.json` |\n| FFIEC | `ffiec_aws.json` |\n| RBI Cyber Security | `rbi_cyber_security_framework_aws.json` |\n| AWS Well-Architected | `aws_well_architected_framework_{pillar}_pillar_aws.json` |\n| AWS FTR | `aws_foundational_technical_review_aws.json` |\n| GxP 21 CFR Part 11, EU Annex 11 | `gxp_{standard}_aws.json` |\n| KISA ISMS-P 2023 | `kisa_isms_p_2023_aws.json` |\n| NIS2 | `nis2_aws.json` |\n\n### Azure (15+ frameworks)\n| Framework | File Name |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| CIS 2.0, 2.1, 3.0, 4.0 | `cis_{version}_azure.json` |\n| ISO 27001:2022 | `iso27001_2022_azure.json` |\n| ENS RD2022 | `ens_rd2022_azure.json` |\n| MITRE ATT&CK | `mitre_attack_azure.json` |\n| PCI DSS 4.0 | `pci_4.0_azure.json` |\n| NIST CSF 2.0 | `nist_csf_2.0_azure.json` |\n\n### GCP (15+ frameworks)\n| Framework | File Name |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| CIS 2.0, 3.0, 4.0 | `cis_{version}_gcp.json` |\n| ISO 27001:2022 | `iso27001_2022_gcp.json` |\n| HIPAA | `hipaa_gcp.json` |\n| MITRE ATT&CK | `mitre_attack_gcp.json` |\n| PCI DSS 4.0 | `pci_4.0_gcp.json` |\n| NIST CSF 2.0 | `nist_csf_2.0_gcp.json` |\n\n### Kubernetes (6 frameworks)\n| Framework | File Name |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| CIS 1.8, 1.10, 1.11 | `cis_{version}_kubernetes.json` |\n| ISO 27001:2022 | `iso27001_2022_kubernetes.json` |\n| PCI DSS 4.0 | `pci_4.0_kubernetes.json` |\n\n### Other Providers\n- **GitHub:** `cis_1.0_github.json`\n- **M365:** `cis_4.0_m365.json`, `iso27001_2022_m365.json`\n- **NHN:** `iso27001_2022_nhn.json`\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Requirement IDs**: Follow the original framework numbering exactly (e.g., \"1.1\", \"A.5.1\", \"T1190\", \"ac_2_1\")\n2. **Check Mapping**: Map to existing checks when possible. Use `Checks: []` for manual-only requirements\n3. **Completeness**: Include all framework requirements, even those without automated checks\n4. **Version Control**: Include framework version in `Name` and `Version` fields\n5. **File Naming**: Use format `{framework}_{version}_{provider}.json`\n6. **Validation**: Prowler validates JSON against Pydantic models at startup - invalid JSON will cause errors\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n# List available frameworks for a provider\nprowler {provider} --list-compliance\n\n# Run scan with specific compliance framework\nprowler aws --compliance cis_5.0_aws\n\n# Run scan with multiple frameworks\nprowler aws --compliance cis_5.0_aws pci_4.0_aws\n\n# Output compliance report in multiple formats\nprowler aws --compliance cis_5.0_aws -M csv json html\n```\n\n## Code References\n\n- **Compliance Models:** `prowler/lib/check/compliance_models.py`\n- **Compliance Processing:** `prowler/lib/check/compliance.py`\n- **Compliance Output:** `prowler/lib/outputs/compliance/`\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Templates:** See [assets/](assets/) for framework JSON templates\n- **Documentation:** See [references/compliance-docs.md](references/compliance-docs.md) for additional resources\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:14:20.101Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring automated compliance audits across AWS, Azure, and GCP environments","zh":"适用于需要在 AWS、Azure 和 GCP 环境中自动执行合规性审计的云安全代理的理想选择","ja":"AWS、Azure、および GCP 環境で自動化されたコンプライアンス監査を必要とするクラウド セキュリティ エージェントに最適","ko":"AWS, Azure 및 GCP 환경에서 자동화된 컴플라이언스 감사가 필요한 클라우드 보안 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad en la Nube que requieren auditorías de cumplimiento automatizadas en entornos de AWS, Azure y GCP","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant des audits de conformité automatisés dans des environnements AWS, Azure et GCP","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die automatisierte Compliance-Audits in AWS-, Azure- und GCP-Umgebungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que necessitam de auditorias de conformidade automatizadas em ambientes AWS, Azure e GCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов облачной безопасности, требующих автоматизированных аудитов соответствия в средах AWS, Azure и GCP","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء أمن السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات تدقيق امتثال مؤتمتة عبر بيئات AWS وAzure وGCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate security and compliance checks using JSON-based compliance frameworks, mapping checks to controls and understanding framework structures and attributes, leveraging Prowler''s open-source cloud security platform","zh":"赋予代理使用基于 JSON 的合规性框架自动执行安全性和合规性检查，映射检查到控制并理解框架结构和属性，利用 Prowler 的开源云安全平台","ja":"エージェントが JSON ベースのコンプライアンス フレームワークを使用してセキュリティとコンプライアンスのチェックを自動化できるようにし、チェックをコントロールにマッピングし、フレームワーク構造と属性を理解し、Prowler のオープンソース クラウド セキュリティ プラットフォームを活用","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 기반의 컴플라이언스 프레임워크를 사용하여 보안 및 컴플라이언스 체크를 자동화할 수 있도록하며, 체크를 제어에 매핑하고, 프레임워크 구조 및 속성을 이해하며, Prowler의 오픈소스 클라우드 보안 플랫폼을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las comprobaciones de seguridad y cumplimiento utilizando marcos de cumplimiento basados en JSON, asignando comprobaciones a controles y comprendiendo estructuras y atributos de marcos, aprovechando la plataforma de seguridad en la nube de código abierto de Prowler","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les vérifications de sécurité et de conformité en utilisant des cadres de conformité basés sur JSON, en affectant des vérifications à des contrôles et en comprenant les structures et les attributs des cadres, en exploitant la plate-forme de sécurité cloud open source de Prowler","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sicherheits- und Compliance-Prüfungen mithilfe von JSON-basierten Compliance-Frameworks zu automatisieren, Prüfungen zuzuweisen und Framework-Strukturen und -Attribute zu verstehen, indem es die Open-Source-Cloud-Sicherheitsplattform von Prowler nutzt","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar verificações de segurança e conformidade usando estruturas de conformidade baseadas em JSON, mapeando verificações para controles e compreendendo estruturas e atributos de estruturas, aproveitando a plataforma de segurança em nuvem de código aberto Prowler","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать проверки безопасности и соответствия с использованием JSON-совместимых структур соответствия, сопоставляя проверки с элементами управления и понимая структуры и атрибуты структур, используя открытую облачную платформу безопасности Prowler","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أتمتة عمليات التحقق من الأمان والامتثال باستخدام أطر الامتثال القائمة على JSON، ورسم خرائط للفحوصات على عناصر التحكم وفهم هياكل الأطر والسمات، والاستفادة من منصة أمن السحابة مفتوحة المصدر Prowler"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating customized compliance frameworks for multiple cloud providers","Mapping security checks to compliance controls for existing frameworks","Automating compliance audits across AWS, Azure, and GCP environments","Understanding and navigating complex compliance framework structures"],"zh":["为多个云提供商创建自定义的合规性框架","将安全性检查映射到现有框架的合规性控制","在 AWS、Azure 和 GCP 环境中自动执行合规性审计","理解和导航复杂的合规性框架结构"],"ja":["複数のクラウド プロバイダー用にカスタマイズされたコンプライアンス フレームワークを作成","セキュリティ チェックを既存のフレームワークのコンプライアンス コントロールにマッピング","AWS、Azure、および GCP 環境でコンプライアンス監査を自動化","複雑なコンプライアンス フレームワーク構造を理解してナビゲート"],"ko":["여러 클라우드 제공업체를 위한 사용자 정의 컴플라이언스 프레임워크 생성","보안 체크를 기존 프레임워크의 컴플라이언스 제어에 매핑","AWS, Azure 및 GCP 환경에서 컴플라이언스 감사 자동화","복잡한 컴플라이언스 프레임워크 구조 이해 및 탐색"],"es":["Crear marcos de cumplimiento personalizados para varios proveedores de nube","Asignar comprobaciones de seguridad a controles de cumplimiento para marcos existentes","Automatizar auditorías de cumplimiento en entornos de AWS, Azure y GCP","Comprender y navegar estructuras de marcos de cumplimiento complejos"],"fr":["Créer des cadres de conformité personnalisés pour plusieurs fournisseurs de cloud","Affecter des vérifications de sécurité à des contrôles de conformité pour des cadres existants","Automatiser les audits de conformité dans des environnements AWS, Azure et GCP","Comprendre et naviguer dans des structures de cadres de conformité complexes"],"de":["Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Compliance-Frameworks für mehrere Cloud-Anbieter","Zuweisen von Sicherheitsprüfungen zu Compliance-Steuerungen für bestehende Frameworks","Automatisieren von Compliance-Audits in AWS-, Azure- und GCP-Umgebungen","Verstehen und Navigieren in komplexen Compliance-Framework-Strukturen"],"pt":["Criar estruturas de conformidade personalizadas para vários provedores de nuvem","Mapear verificações de segurança para controles de conformidade em estruturas existentes","Automatizar auditorias de conformidade em ambientes AWS, Azure e GCP","Compreender e navegar por estruturas complexas de conformidade"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских структур соответствия для нескольких облачных провайдеров","Сопоставление проверок безопасности с элементами управления соответствием для существующих структур","Автоматизация аудитов соответствия в средах AWS, Azure и GCP","Понимание и навигация по сложным структурам структур соответствия"],"ar":["إنشاء أطر امتثال مخصصة لموفري سحابة متعددين","رسم خرائط لفحوصات الأمان على ضوابط الامتثال للأطر الحالية","أتمتة عمليات تدقيق الامتثال عبر بيئات AWS وAzure وGCP","فهم هياكل أطر الامتثال المعقدة والتنقل فيها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prowler installation and configuration","Limited to supported providers: AWS, Azure, GCP, and Kubernetes","Compliance frameworks must be in JSON format"],"zh":["需要 Prowler 安装和配置","仅限支持的提供商：AWS、Azure、GCP 和 Kubernetes","合规性框架必须是 JSON 格式"],"ja":["Prowler のインストールと構成が必要","サポートされているプロバイダーに限定：AWS、Azure、GCP、および Kubernetes","コンプライアンス フレームワークは JSON 形式でなければならない"],"ko":["Prowler 설치 및 구성 필요","지원되는 제공업체에 한정: AWS, Azure, GCP 및 Kubernetes","컴플라이언스 프레임워크는 JSON 형식이어야 함"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Prowler","Limitado a proveedores compatibles: AWS, Azure, GCP y Kubernetes","Los marcos de cumplimiento deben estar en formato JSON"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Prowler","Limité aux fournisseurs pris en charge : AWS, Azure, GCP et Kubernetes","Les cadres de conformité doivent être au format JSON"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Prowler","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Anbieter: AWS, Azure, GCP und Kubernetes","Compliance-Frameworks müssen im JSON-Format vorliegen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Prowler","Limitado aos provedores suportados: AWS, Azure, GCP e Kubernetes","As estruturas de conformidade devem estar no formato JSON"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Prowler","Ограничено поддерживаемыми провайдерами: AWS, Azure, GCP и Kubernetes","Структуры соответствия должны быть в формате JSON"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Prowler","مقتصر على الموفرين المدعومين: AWS وAzure وGCP وKubernetes","يجب أن تكون أطر الامتثال بتنسيق JSON"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
