,"description":{"zh":"WhatsApp ","ja":"WhatsApp","ko":"WhatsApp ","es":"La automatización de WhatsApp permite a los desarrolladores optimizar operaciones de negocio a través de Rube MCP y el toolkit de Composio.","fr":"L''automatisation de WhatsApp permet aux développeurs d''optimiser les opérations commerciales via Rube MCP et le toolkit Composio.","de":"Die Automatisierung von WhatsApp ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Geschäftsbetriebe über Rube MCP und das Composio-Toolkit zu optimieren.","pt":"A automatização de negócios do WhatsApp via Rube MCP permite melhorar a eficiência das operações. Conheça os pré-requisitos e a configuração necessários.","ru":"Автоматизация бизнеса WhatsApp с помощью Rube MCP позволяет повысить эффективность операций. Ознакомьтесь с предпосылками и настройкой.","ar":"تحرير أعمال WhatsApp مع Rube MCP يسمح بتحسين الكفاءة في العمليات. تعرف على المتطلبات الأساسية والإعدادات اللازمة.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official sk..."},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp ","API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ja":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp ","API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ko":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp ","API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Herramienta de WhatsApp para operaciones de negocio","API de WhatsApp Business","Automatización de tareas","Integración con RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Optimización de procesos"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Outil de WhatsApp pour les opérations commerciales","API de WhatsApp Business","Automatisation des tâches","Intégration avec RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Optimisation des processus"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP","WhatsApp-Toolkit für Geschäftsbetriebe","WhatsApp Business-API","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Optimierung von Prozessen"],"pt":["Integração com Rube MCP","Automação de operações de negócios do WhatsApp","Melhoria da eficiência com o toolkit de Rube MCP","Requisitos de configuração e pré-requisitos claros","Suporte à API do WhatsApp Business"],"ru":["Интеграция с Rube MCP","Автоматизация операций бизнеса WhatsApp","Повышение эффективности с помощью инструмента Rube MCP","Ясные требования к настройке и предпосылки","Поддержка API бизнеса WhatsApp"],"ar":["التكامل مع Rube MCP","تحرير عمليات أعمال WhatsApp","تحسين الكفاءة باستخدام أداة Rube MCP","متطلبات واضحة للتهيئة والأساسيات","دعم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال WhatsApp"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","Automation","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ja":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","Automation","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ko":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","Automation","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"es":["automatización de whatsapp","rube mcp","whatsapp business api","desarrollo de whatsapp","herramientas de whatsapp","integración de whatsapp","optimización de procesos","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["automatisation de whatsapp","rube mcp","whatsapp business api","développement de whatsapp","outils de whatsapp","intégration de whatsapp","optimisation des processus","automatisation des tâches"],"de":["whatsapp-automatisierung","rube mcp","whatsapp business api","entwicklung von whatsapp","whatsapp-tools","integration von whatsapp","optimierung von prozessen","automatisierung von aufgaben"],"pt":["automatização de negócios do WhatsApp","Rube MCP","toolkit de WhatsApp","API do WhatsApp Business","automação de operações","eficiência em negócios","tecnologia de automação","soluções de automação"],"ru":["автоматизация бизнеса WhatsApp","Rube MCP","инструмент WhatsApp","API бизнеса WhatsApp","автоматизация операций","эфективность в бизнесе","технология автоматизации","решения для автоматизации"],"ar":["تحرير أعمال WhatsApp","Rube MCP","أداة WhatsApp","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال WhatsApp","تحرير عمليات","كفاءة في الأعمال","تكنولوجيا التحرير","حلول التحرير"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"whatsapp-automation","description":"Automate WhatsApp Business tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): send messages, manage templates, upload media, and handle contacts. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server i","body":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete WhatsApp Business setup\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Send a Text Message\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send a text message to a WhatsApp contact\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List available business phone numbers [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE` - Send a text message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number in international format (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- `body`: Message text content\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID to send from\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Phone numbers must be in international E.164 format with country code\n- Messages outside the 24-hour window require approved templates\n- The 24-hour window starts when the customer last messaged you\n- Business-initiated conversations require template messages first\n\n### 2. Send Template Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send pre-approved template messages for outbound communication\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List available templates [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS` - Check template approval status [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` - Send the template message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `template_name`: Name of the approved template\n- `language_code`: Template language (e.g., ''en_US'')\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `components`: Template variable values and parameters\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Templates must be approved by Meta before use\n- Template variables must match the expected count and format\n- Sending unapproved or rejected templates returns errors\n- Language code must match an approved translation of the template\n\n### 3. Send Media Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send images, documents, or other media\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA` - Upload media to WhatsApp servers [Required]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID` - Send media using the uploaded media ID [Required]\n   OR\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA` - Send media using a public URL [Alternative]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `media_url`: Public URL of the media (for SEND_MEDIA)\n- `media_id`: ID from upload response (for SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID)\n- `type`: Media type (''image'', ''document'', ''audio'', ''video'', ''sticker'')\n- `caption`: Optional caption for the media\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Uploaded media IDs are temporary and expire after a period\n- Media size limits vary by type (images: 5MB, videos: 16MB, documents: 100MB)\n- Supported formats: images (JPEG, PNG), videos (MP4, 3GPP), documents (PDF, etc.)\n- SEND_MEDIA requires a publicly accessible HTTPS URL\n\n### 4. Reply to Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to reply to an incoming WhatsApp message\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY` - Send a reply to a specific message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `message_id`: ID of the message being replied to\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `body`: Reply text content\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- message_id must be from a message received within the 24-hour window\n- Replies appear as quoted messages in the conversation\n- The original message must still exist (not deleted) for the quote to display\n\n### 5. Manage Business Profile and Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or manage their WhatsApp Business profile\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE` - Get business profile details [Optional]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List registered phone numbers [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER` - Get details for a specific number [Optional]\n4. `WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE` - Create a new template [Optional]\n5. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List all templates [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID\n- `template_name`: Name for the new template\n- `category`: Template category (MARKETING, UTILITY, AUTHENTICATION)\n- `language`: Template language code\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- New templates require Meta review before they can be used\n- Template names must be lowercase with underscores (no spaces)\n- Category affects pricing and approval criteria\n- Templates have specific formatting requirements for headers, body, and buttons\n\n### 6. Share Contacts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send contact information via WhatsApp\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS` - Send contact cards [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `contacts`: Array of contact objects with name, phone, email details\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Contact objects must follow the WhatsApp Business API contact schema\n- At least a name field is required for each contact\n- Phone numbers in contacts should include country codes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 24-Hour Messaging Window\n\n- Customers must message you first to open a conversation window\n- Within 24 hours of their last message, you can send free-form messages\n- After 24 hours, only approved template messages can be sent\n- Template messages can re-open the conversation window\n\n### Phone Number Resolution\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS\n2. Extract phone_number_id for your business number\n3. Use phone_number_id in all send operations\n```\n\n### Media Upload Flow\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA with the file\n2. Extract media_id from response\n3. Call WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID with media_id\n4. OR use WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA with a public URL directly\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Phone Number Format**:\n- Always use E.164 format: +[country code][number] (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- Do not include dashes, spaces, or parentheses\n- Country code is required; local numbers without it will fail\n\n**Messaging Restrictions**:\n- Business-initiated messages require templates outside the 24-hour window\n- Template messages cost money per conversation\n- Rate limits apply per phone number and per account\n\n**Media Handling**:\n- Uploaded media expires; use promptly after upload\n- Media URLs must be publicly accessible HTTPS\n- Stickers have specific requirements (WebP format, 512x512 pixels)\n\n**Template Management**:\n- Template review can take up to 24 hours\n- Rejected templates need to be fixed and resubmitted\n- Template variables use double curly braces: {{1}}, {{2}}, etc.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Send message | WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE | to, body |\n| Send template | WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE | template_name, to, language_code |\n| Upload media | WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA | (file params) |\n| Send media by ID | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID | media_id, to, type |\n| Send media by URL | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA | media_url, to, type |\n| Reply to message | WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY | message_id, to, body |\n| Send contacts | WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS | to, contacts |\n| Get media | WHATSAPP_GET_MEDIA | media_id |\n| List phone numbers | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS | (none) |\n| Get phone number | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER | phone_number_id |\n| Get business profile | WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE | phone_number_id |\n| Create template | WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE | template_name, category, language |\n| List templates | WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES | (none) |\n| Check template status | WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS | template_id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:01.431Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Customer Service Agents needing advanced WhatsApp Business automation capabilities via Rube MCP and Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit.","zh":"Perfect for Customer Service Agents needing advanced WhatsApp Business automation capabilities via Rube MCP and Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit.","ja":"Perfect for Customer Service Agents needing advanced WhatsApp Business automation capabilities via Rube MCP and Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit.","ko":"Perfect for Customer Service Agents needing advanced WhatsApp Business automation capabilities via Rube MCP and Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de servicio al cliente que necesitan capacidades de automatización avanzadas de WhatsApp Business a través de Rube MCP y la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de service client qui ont besoin de capacités d''automatisation avancées de WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP et l''outil WhatsApp de Composio.","de":"Perfekt für Kunden-service-Agenten, die erweiterte WhatsApp Business-Automatisierungsfunktionen über Rube MCP und Composios WhatsApp-Toolkit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Serviço ao Cliente que precisam de capacidades avançadas de automação do WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP e da ferramenta do WhatsApp da Composio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов службы поддержки клиентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности автоматизации WhatsApp Business через Rube MCP и набор инструментов WhatsApp от Composio.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل عملاء الخدمة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تلقائية متقدمة لشركة WhatsApp عبر Rube MCP و أدوات WhatsApp من Composio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations using Rube MCP, providing seamless integration with WhatsApp''s Business API and enabling efficient management of customer interactions via WhatsApp connection and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","zh":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations using Rube MCP, providing seamless integration with WhatsApp''s Business API and enabling efficient management of customer interactions via WhatsApp connection and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ja":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations using Rube MCP, providing seamless integration with WhatsApp''s Business API and enabling efficient management of customer interactions via WhatsApp connection and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ko":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations using Rube MCP, providing seamless integration with WhatsApp''s Business API and enabling efficient management of customer interactions via WhatsApp connection and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de WhatsApp Business utilizando Rube MCP, proporcionando una integración sin problemas con la API de negocios de WhatsApp y permitiendo una gestión eficiente de las interacciones con los clientes a través de la conexión de WhatsApp y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de WhatsApp Business en utilisant Rube MCP, fournissant une intégration transparente avec l''API commerciale de WhatsApp et permettant une gestion efficace des interactions avec les clients via la connexion WhatsApp et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, WhatsApp Business-Operationen mithilfe von Rube MCP zu automatisieren, bietet eine nahtlose Integration mit der WhatsApp Business-API und ermöglicht eine effiziente Verwaltung von Kundeninteraktionen über die WhatsApp-Verbindung und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações do WhatsApp Business usando Rube MCP, fornecendo integração sem interrupções com a API de Negócios do WhatsApp e permitindo a gestão eficiente das interações do cliente via conexão do WhatsApp e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции WhatsApp Business с помощью Rube MCP, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с бизнес-API WhatsApp и позволяя эффективно управлять взаимодействиями с клиентами через соединение WhatsApp и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تلقائية عمليات WhatsApp Business باستخدام Rube MCP ، و يقدم دمجًا بدون انقطاع مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال من WhatsApp و يسمح بإدارة فعالة للتفاعلات مع العملاء عبر الاتصال بـ WhatsApp و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses","Streamlining customer support workflows via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrating WhatsApp Business API with existing customer service infrastructure"],"zh":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses","Streamlining customer support workflows via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrating WhatsApp Business API with existing customer service infrastructure"],"ja":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses","Streamlining customer support workflows via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrating WhatsApp Business API with existing customer service infrastructure"],"ko":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses","Streamlining customer support workflows via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrating WhatsApp Business API with existing customer service infrastructure"],"es":["Automatizar respuestas de WhatsApp Business","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de soporte al cliente a través de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrar la API de WhatsApp Business con la infraestructura de servicio al cliente existente"],"fr":["Automatiser les réponses de WhatsApp Business","Optimiser les flux de travail de support client via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Intégrer l''API commerciale de WhatsApp avec l''infrastructure de service client existante"],"de":["WhatsApp Business-Antworten automatisieren","Kundensupport-Workflows über RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS optimieren","WhatsApp Business-API in bestehende Kunden-Service-Infrastruktur integrieren"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas do WhatsApp Business","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de suporte ao cliente via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Integrar API do WhatsApp Business com infraestrutura de serviço ao cliente existente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы WhatsApp Business","Оптимизировать рабочие потоки поддержки клиентов через RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Интегрировать бизнес-API WhatsApp с существующей инфраструктурой обслуживания клиентов"],"ar":["تلقائية استجابات WhatsApp Business","تحسين سير عمل الدعم الفني للعملاء عبر RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","دمج واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال من WhatsApp مع بنية تحتية للخدمة العميلية الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection and RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability","Active WhatsApp Business API account necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not compatible with regular WhatsApp accounts"],"zh":["Requires Rube MCP connection and RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability","Active WhatsApp Business API account necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not compatible with regular WhatsApp accounts"],"ja":["Requires Rube MCP connection and RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability","Active WhatsApp Business API account necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not compatible with regular WhatsApp accounts"],"ko":["Requires Rube MCP connection and RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability","Active WhatsApp Business API account necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not compatible with regular WhatsApp accounts"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP y disponibilidad de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business activa necesaria","Se requiere cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business, no compatible con cuentas de WhatsApp regulares"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP et la disponibilité de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Compte API commerciale de WhatsApp actif nécessaire","Compte API de WhatsApp Business requis, non compatible avec les comptes WhatsApp réguliers"],"de":["Benötigt Rube MCP-Verbindung und Verfügbarkeit von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktives WhatsApp Business-API-Konto erforderlich","WhatsApp Business-API-Konto erforderlich, nicht kompatibel mit regulären WhatsApp-Konten"],"pt":["Exige conexão Rube MCP e disponibilidade de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Conta de API de Negócios do WhatsApp ativa necessária","Conta de API de Negócios do WhatsApp necessária, não compatível com contas regulares do WhatsApp"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP и доступность RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Необходимо активировать учетную запись бизнес-API WhatsApp","Требуется учетная запись бизнес-API WhatsApp, не совместима с обычными учетными записями WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بـ Rube MCP و توافر RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","مطلوب حساب نشط لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال من WhatsApp","مطلوب حساب لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال من WhatsApp ، لا يتوافق مع حسابات WhatsApp العادية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
