],"ja":["メールマーケティングの自動化を実現","800 個以上の Agentic スキルを提供","公式スキルを含む","Rube MCP を使用して実現","メールマーケティングの効率を向上","メールマーケティング操作を簡素化"],"ko":["이메일 마케팅 자동화를 구현","800개 이상의 Agentic 스킬을 제공","공식 스킬 포함","Rube MCP를 사용하여 구현","이메일 마케팅 효율성을 높임","이메일 마케팅 작동을 단순화"],"es":["Conexión a ConvertKit a través de Rube MCP","Automatización de operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico","Uso de la herramienta Kit de Composio","Optimización de flujos de trabajo","Integración con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"fr":["Connexion à ConvertKit via Rube MCP","Automatisation des opérations de marketing par e-mail","Utilisation de l''outil Kit de Composio","Optimisation des flux de travail","Intégration avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"de":["Verbindung mit ConvertKit über Rube MCP","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen","Verwendung des Kit-Tools von Composio","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Integration mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"pt":["Integração com Rube MCP","Automação de operações de marketing por e-mail","Melhoria da eficiência","Ferramenta de automação personalizável","Integração com Kit"],"ru":["Интеграция с Rube MCP","Автоматизация операций по маркетингу электронной почты","Повышение эффективности","Настраиваемый инструмент автоматизации","Интеграция с Kit"],"ar":["التكامل مع Rube MCP","أتمتة عمليات التسويق بالبريد الإلكتروني","تحسين الكفاءة","أداة أتمتة قابلة للتعديل","التكامل مع كيت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ConvertKit 自动化","电子邮件营销自动化","Rube MCP","Agentic 技能","官方技能","电子邮件营销效率","电子邮件营销操作","自动化集成"],"ja":["ConvertKit オートメーション","メールマーケティング自動化","Rube MCP","Agentic スキル","公式スキル","メールマーケティング効率","メールマーケティング操作","自動化統合"],"ko":["ConvertKit 자동화","이메일 마케팅 자동화","Rube MCP","Agentic 스킬","공식 스킬","이메일 마케팅 효율성","이메일 마케팅 작동","자동화 통합"],"es":["automatización de ConvertKit","Rube MCP","marketing por correo electrónico","herramienta Kit de Composio","optimización de flujos de trabajo","integración con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"fr":["automatisation ConvertKit","Rube MCP","marketing par e-mail","outil Kit de Composio","optimisation des flux de travail","intégration avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"de":["Automatisierung von ConvertKit","Rube MCP","E-Mail-Marketing","Kit-Tool von Composio","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Integration mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"pt":["automatize kit","rube mcp","marketing por e-mail","automação de marketing","kit automation","rube mcp kit"],"ru":["автоматизируйте кит","rube mcp","маркетинг электронной почты","автоматизация маркетинга","kit автоматизация","rube mcp кит"],"ar":["أتمتة كيت","rube mcp","تسويق البريد الإلكتروني","أتمتة التسويق","كيت أتمتة","rube mcp كيت"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convertkit-automation","description":"Automate ConvertKit (Kit) tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): manage subscribers, tags, broadcasts, and broadcast stats. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — ju","body":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Kit authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Subscribers\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse, search, or filter email subscribers\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers with filters and pagination [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `status`: Filter by status (''active'' or ''inactive'')\n- `email_address`: Exact email to search for\n- `created_after`/`created_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `updated_after`/`updated_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `sort_field`: Sort by ''id'', ''cancelled_at'', or ''updated_at''\n- `sort_order`: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n- `per_page`: Results per page (min 1)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' to get total subscriber count\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- If `sort_field` is ''cancelled_at'', the `status` must be set to ''cancelled''\n- Date filters use YYYY-MM-DD format (no time component)\n- `email_address` is an exact match; partial email search is not supported\n- Pagination uses cursor-based approach with `after`/`before` cursor strings\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean\n\n### 2. Manage Subscriber Tags\n\n**When to use**: User wants to tag subscribers for segmentation\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID by email [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER` - Associate a subscriber with a tag [Required]\n3. `KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers for a specific tag [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for tagging**:\n- `tag_id`: Numeric tag ID (required)\n- `subscriber_id`: Numeric subscriber ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Both `tag_id` and `subscriber_id` must be positive integers\n- Tag IDs must reference existing tags; tags are created via the Kit web UI\n- Tagging an already-tagged subscriber is idempotent (no error)\n- Subscriber IDs are returned from LIST_SUBSCRIBERS; use `email_address` filter to find specific subscribers\n\n### 3. Unsubscribe a Subscriber\n\n**When to use**: User wants to unsubscribe a subscriber from all communications\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER` - Unsubscribe the subscriber [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Subscriber ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This permanently unsubscribes the subscriber from ALL email communications\n- The subscriber''s historical data is retained but they will no longer receive emails\n- Operation is idempotent; unsubscribing an already-unsubscribed subscriber succeeds without error\n- Returns empty response (HTTP 204 No Content) on success\n- Subscriber ID must exist; non-existent IDs return 404\n\n### 4. List and View Broadcasts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse email broadcasts or get details of a specific one\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - List all broadcasts with pagination [Required]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Get detailed information for a specific broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS` - Get performance statistics for a broadcast [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-500)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' for total count\n\n**Key parameters for details**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `per_page` max is 500 for broadcasts\n- Broadcast stats are only available for sent broadcasts\n- Draft broadcasts will not have stats\n- Broadcast IDs are numeric integers\n\n### 5. Delete a Broadcast\n\n**When to use**: User wants to permanently remove a broadcast\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - Find the broadcast to delete [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Verify it is the correct broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST` - Permanently delete the broadcast [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone\n- Deleting a sent broadcast removes it but does not unsend the emails\n- Confirm the broadcast ID before deleting\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Subscriber Lookup by Email\n\n```\n1. Call KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS with email_address=''user@example.com''\n2. Extract subscriber ID from the response\n3. Use ID for tagging, unsubscribing, or other operations\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\nKit uses cursor-based pagination:\n- Check response for `after` cursor value\n- Pass cursor as `after` parameter in next request\n- Continue until no more cursor is returned\n- Use `include_total_count: ''true''` to track progress\n\n### Tag-Based Segmentation\n\n```\n1. Create tags in Kit web UI\n2. Use KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER to assign tags to subscribers\n3. Use KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS to view subscribers per tag\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Subscriber IDs: positive integers (e.g., 3887204736)\n- Tag IDs: positive integers\n- Broadcast IDs: positive integers\n- All IDs are numeric, not strings\n\n**Status Values**:\n- Subscriber statuses: ''active'', ''inactive'', ''cancelled''\n- Some operations are restricted by status (e.g., sorting by cancelled_at requires status=''cancelled'')\n\n**String vs Boolean Parameters**:\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean true\n- `sort_order` is a string enum: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Kit API has per-account rate limits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n- Bulk operations should be paced appropriately\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Cursor values are opaque strings; use exactly as returned\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List subscribers | KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS | status, email_address, per_page |\n| Tag subscriber | KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER | tag_id, subscriber_id |\n| List tag subscribers | KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS | tag_id |\n| Unsubscribe | KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER | id |\n| List broadcasts | KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS | per_page, after |\n| Get broadcast | KIT_GET_BROADCAST | id |\n| Get broadcast stats | KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS | id |\n| Delete broadcast | KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST | id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:16.156Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing operations through ConvertKit via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过 ConvertKit 和 Rube MCP 进行高级电子邮件营销操作的营销自动化代理","ja":"ConvertKit と Rube MCP を使用した高度な電子メールマーケティング操作が必要なマーケティングオートメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"ConvertKit 및 Rube MCP를 통해 고급 이메일 마케팅 운영이 필요한 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Marketing que necesitan operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico avanzadas a través de ConvertKit via Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation du marketing nécessitant des opérations de marketing par e-mail avancées via ConvertKit via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über ConvertKit via Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que necessitam de operações avançadas de marketing por e-mail através do ConvertKit via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально для агентов по автоматизации маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые операции по электронному маркетингу через ConvertKit с помощью Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقائي للتسويق الذي يحتاج إلى عمليات تسويق بريد إلكتروني متقدمة من خلال ConvertKit عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations via Composio''s Kit toolkit, leveraging Rube MCP for seamless integration, and utilizing protocols like HTTPS for secure connections","zh":"赋予代理人通过 Composio 的 Kit 工具包自动化 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销操作的能力，利用 Rube MCP 实现无缝集成，并使用 HTTPS 等协议确保安全连接","ja":"Composio の Kit ツールキットを使用して ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティング操作を自動化し、Rube MCP を使用してシームレスに統合し、HTTPS などのプロトコルを使用してセキュアな接続を実現するエージェントの能力を提供する","ko":"Composio의 Kit 도구를 사용하여 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 운영을 자동화하고 Rube MCP를 사용하여 无缝한 통합을 thực現하며 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 보안 연결을 обеспеч하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico de ConvertKit a través de la herramienta Kit de Composio, aprovechando Rube MCP para una integración sin problemas y utilizando protocolos como HTTPS para conexiones seguras","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de marketing par e-mail de ConvertKit via la boîte à outils Kit de Composio, en exploitant Rube MCP pour une intégration sans accroc et en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTPS pour des connexions sécurisées","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über das Composio-Kit-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem Rube MCP für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt wird und Protokolle wie HTTPS für sichere Verbindungen verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit por meio da caixa de ferramentas Composio''s Kit, utilizando o Rube MCP para integração sem problemas e utilizando protocolos como HTTPS para conexões seguras","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции по электронному маркетингу ConvertKit с помощью набора инструментов Composio''s Kit, используя Rube MCP для бесшовной интеграции и используя протоколы, такие как HTTPS, для безопасных соединений","ar":"يمنح العميل التلقائي صلاحية تلقين عمليات تسويق البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit من خلال صندوق أدوات Composio''s Kit، واستخدام Rube MCP من أجل التكامل السلس، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS من أجل الاتصالات الآمنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ConvertKit email campaigns","Managing Kit connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Searching tool schemas with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"zh":["自动化 ConvertKit 电子邮件活动","通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 管理 Kit 连接","使用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 搜索工具模式"],"ja":["ConvertKit 電子メールキャンペーンの自動化","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用して Kit 接続を管理する","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS を使用してツールスキーマを検索する"],"ko":["ConvertKit 이메일 캠페인 자동화","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 Kit 연결 관리","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하여 툴 스키마 검색"],"es":["Automatizar campañas de correo electrónico de ConvertKit","Gestionar conexiones de Kit a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Buscar esquemas de herramientas con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"fr":["Automatiser les campagnes de marketing par e-mail de ConvertKit","Gérer les connexions Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Rechercher les schémas d''outils avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"de":["ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Kampagnen automatisieren","Kit-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS verwalten","Werkzeugschemata mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS suchen"],"pt":["Automatizar campanhas de e-mail do ConvertKit","Gerenciar conexões de Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Pesquisar esquemas de ferramentas com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать кампании электронной почты ConvertKit","Управлять соединениями Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Поиск схем инструментов с помощью RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ar":["تلقين حملات البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit","إدارة الاتصالات الخاصة ب Kit من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","البحث عن مخططات الأدوات باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 激活 Kit 连接","必须先调用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 来获取当前工具模式"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用して Kit 接続をアクティブにする必要がある","現在のツールスキーマを取得するために RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS を最初に呼び出す必要がある"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 Kit 연결 활성화 필요","현재 툴 스키마를 가져오기 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP","Conexión de Kit activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS debe llamarse primero para obtener los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion Kit active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS doit être appelé en premier pour obtenir les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Kit-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS muss zuerst aufgerufen werden, um die aktuellen Werkzeugschemata zu erhalten"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa de Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS deve ser chamado primeiro para obter os esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Необходимо активное подключение Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS должен быть вызван первым, чтобы получить текущие схемы инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بـ Rube MCP","الاتصال النشط بـ Kit من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS ضروري","يجب استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS أولاً للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
