o y recepción de eventos","Compatibilidad con checkpointing","Autenticación segura","Integración con Azure Storage"],"fr":["Diffusion d''événements haute performance","Envoi et réception d''événements","Prise en charge du checkpointing","Authentification sécurisée","Intégration avec Azure Storage"],"de":["Ereignis-Streaming mit hoher Leistung","Senden und Empfangen von Ereignissen","Unterstützung für Checkpointing","Sichere Authentifizierung","Integration mit Azure Storage"],"pt":["Streaming de eventos de alta performance","Envio e recebimento de eventos via Azure Event Hubs","Suporte a autenticação com Azure Identity","Checkpointing com Azure Storage"],"ru":["Потоковая передача событий с высокой производительностью","Отправка и получение событий через Azure Event Hubs","Поддержка аутентификации с Azure Identity","Checkpointing с Azure Storage"],"ar":["بث الأحداث عالية الأداء","إرسال واستلام الأحداث عبر Azure Event Hubs","دعم التحقق من الهوية مع Azure Identity","نقطة تحقق مع Azure Storage"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Event Hubs .NET SDK","Azure .NET",".NET","Azure Event Hubs","Event Hubs .NET","Azure .NET SDK"],"ja":["Azure Event Hubs .NET SDK","Azure .NET",".NET","Azure Event Hubs","Event Hubs .NET","Azure .NET SDK"],"ko":["Azure Event Hubs .NET SDK","Azure .NET",".NET","Azure Event Hubs","Event Hubs .NET","Azure .NET SDK"],"es":["Azure Event Hubs","SDK de .NET","transmisión de eventos","envío de eventos","recepción de eventos","checkpointing","autenticación segura"],"fr":["Azure Event Hubs","SDK .NET","diffusion d''événements","envoi d''événements","réception d''événements","checkpointing","authentification sécurisée"],"de":["Azure Event Hubs","SDK .NET","Ereignis-Streaming","Senden von Ereignissen","Empfangen von Ereignissen","Checkpointing","sichere Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Azure Event Hubs","Streaming de eventos",".NET","Alta performance","Autenticação","Checkpointing"],"ru":["Azure Event Hubs","Потоковая передача событий",".NET","Высокая производительность","Аутентификация","Checkpointing"],"ar":["Azure Event Hubs","بث الأحداث",".NET","أداء عالي","التحقق من الهوية","نقطة تحقق"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-eventhub-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.Messaging.EventHubs (.NET)\n\nHigh-throughput event streaming SDK for sending and receiving events via Azure Event Hubs.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core package (sending and simple receiving)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs\n\n# Processor package (production receiving with checkpointing)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor\n\n# Authentication\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n\n# For checkpointing (required by EventProcessorClient)\ndotnet add package Azure.Stora","body":"# Azure.Messaging.EventHubs (.NET)\n\nHigh-throughput event streaming SDK for sending and receiving events via Azure Event Hubs.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core package (sending and simple receiving)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs\n\n# Processor package (production receiving with checkpointing)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor\n\n# Authentication\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n\n# For checkpointing (required by EventProcessorClient)\ndotnet add package Azure.Storage.Blobs\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Azure.Messaging.EventHubs v5.12.2, Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor v5.12.2\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nEVENTHUB_FULLY_QUALIFIED_NAMESPACE=<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net\nEVENTHUB_NAME=<event-hub-name>\n\n# For checkpointing (EventProcessorClient)\nBLOB_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=<storage-connection-string>\nBLOB_CONTAINER_NAME=<checkpoint-container>\n\n# Alternative: Connection string auth (not recommended for production)\nEVENTHUB_CONNECTION_STRING=Endpoint=sb://<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net/;SharedAccessKeyName=...\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\n// Always use DefaultAzureCredential for production\nvar credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();\n\nvar fullyQualifiedNamespace = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"EVENTHUB_FULLY_QUALIFIED_NAMESPACE\");\nvar eventHubName = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"EVENTHUB_NAME\");\n\nvar producer = new EventHubProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    credential);\n```\n\n**Required RBAC Roles**:\n- **Sending**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Sender`\n- **Receiving**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Receiver`\n- **Both**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Owner`\n\n## Client Types\n\n| Client | Purpose | When to Use |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| `EventHubProducerClient` | Send events immediately in batches | Real-time sending, full control over batching |\n| `EventHubBufferedProducerClient` | Automatic batching with background sending | High-volume, fire-and-forget scenarios |\n| `EventHubConsumerClient` | Simple event reading | Prototyping only, NOT for production |\n| `EventProcessorClient` | Production event processing | **Always use this for receiving in production** |\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Send Events (Batch)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\nawait using var producer = new EventHubProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\n// Create a batch (respects size limits automatically)\nusing EventDataBatch batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n\n// Add events to batch\nvar events = new[]\n{\n    new EventData(BinaryData.FromString(\"{\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"message\\\": \\\"Hello\\\"}\")),\n    new EventData(BinaryData.FromString(\"{\\\"id\\\": 2, \\\"message\\\": \\\"World\\\"}\"))\n};\n\nforeach (var eventData in events)\n{\n    if (!batch.TryAdd(eventData))\n    {\n        // Batch is full - send it and create a new one\n        await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n        batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n        \n        if (!batch.TryAdd(eventData))\n        {\n            throw new Exception(\"Event too large for empty batch\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Send remaining events\nif (batch.Count > 0)\n{\n    await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Send Events (Buffered - High Volume)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\nvar options = new EventHubBufferedProducerClientOptions\n{\n    MaximumWaitTime = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1)\n};\n\nawait using var producer = new EventHubBufferedProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential(),\n    options);\n\n// Handle send success/failure\nproducer.SendEventBatchSucceededAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Batch sent: {args.EventBatch.Count} events\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\nproducer.SendEventBatchFailedAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Batch failed: {args.Exception.Message}\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\n// Enqueue events (sent automatically in background)\nfor (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++)\n{\n    await producer.EnqueueEventAsync(new EventData($\"Event {i}\"));\n}\n\n// Flush remaining events before disposing\nawait producer.FlushAsync();\n```\n\n### 3. Receive Events (Production - EventProcessorClient)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Consumer;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor;\nusing Azure.Storage.Blobs;\n\n// Blob container for checkpointing\nvar blobClient = new BlobContainerClient(\n    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"BLOB_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING\"),\n    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"BLOB_CONTAINER_NAME\"));\n\nawait blobClient.CreateIfNotExistsAsync();\n\n// Create processor\nvar processor = new EventProcessorClient(\n    blobClient,\n    EventHubConsumerClient.DefaultConsumerGroup,\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\n// Handle events\nprocessor.ProcessEventAsync += async args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Partition: {args.Partition.PartitionId}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Data: {args.Data.EventBody}\");\n    \n    // Checkpoint after processing (or batch checkpoints)\n    await args.UpdateCheckpointAsync();\n};\n\n// Handle errors\nprocessor.ProcessErrorAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {args.Exception.Message}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Partition: {args.PartitionId}\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\n// Start processing\nawait processor.StartProcessingAsync();\n\n// Run until cancelled\nawait Task.Delay(Timeout.Infinite, cancellationToken);\n\n// Stop gracefully\nawait processor.StopProcessingAsync();\n```\n\n### 4. Partition Operations\n\n```csharp\n// Get partition IDs\nstring[] partitionIds = await producer.GetPartitionIdsAsync();\n\n// Send to specific partition (use sparingly)\nvar options = new SendEventOptions\n{\n    PartitionId = \"0\"\n};\nawait producer.SendAsync(events, options);\n\n// Use partition key (recommended for ordering)\nvar batchOptions = new CreateBatchOptions\n{\n    PartitionKey = \"customer-123\"  // Events with same key go to same partition\n};\nusing var batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync(batchOptions);\n```\n\n## EventPosition Options\n\nControl where to start reading:\n\n```csharp\n// Start from beginning\nEventPosition.Earliest\n\n// Start from end (new events only)\nEventPosition.Latest\n\n// Start from specific offset\nEventPosition.FromOffset(12345)\n\n// Start from specific sequence number\nEventPosition.FromSequenceNumber(100)\n\n// Start from specific time\nEventPosition.FromEnqueuedTime(DateTimeOffset.UtcNow.AddHours(-1))\n```\n\n## ASP.NET Core Integration\n\n```csharp\n// Program.cs\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.Azure;\n\nbuilder.Services.AddAzureClients(clientBuilder =>\n{\n    clientBuilder.AddEventHubProducerClient(\n        builder.Configuration[\"EventHub:FullyQualifiedNamespace\"],\n        builder.Configuration[\"EventHub:Name\"]);\n    \n    clientBuilder.UseCredential(new DefaultAzureCredential());\n});\n\n// Inject in controller/service\npublic class EventService\n{\n    private readonly EventHubProducerClient _producer;\n    \n    public EventService(EventHubProducerClient producer)\n    {\n        _producer = producer;\n    }\n    \n    public async Task SendAsync(string message)\n    {\n        using var batch = await _producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n        batch.TryAdd(new EventData(message));\n        await _producer.SendAsync(batch);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use `EventProcessorClient` for receiving** — Never use `EventHubConsumerClient` in production\n2. **Checkpoint strategically** — After N events or time interval, not every event\n3. **Use partition keys** — For ordering guarantees within a partition\n4. **Reuse clients** — Create once, use as singleton (thread-safe)\n5. **Use `await using`** — Ensures proper disposal\n6. **Handle `ProcessErrorAsync`** — Always register error handler\n7. **Batch events** — Use `CreateBatchAsync()` to respect size limits\n8. **Use buffered producer** — For high-volume scenarios with automatic batching\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\n\ntry\n{\n    await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex) when (ex.Reason == EventHubsException.FailureReason.ServiceBusy)\n{\n    // Retry with backoff\n    await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex) when (ex.IsTransient)\n{\n    // Transient error - safe to retry\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Transient error: {ex.Message}\");\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex)\n{\n    // Non-transient error\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {ex.Reason} - {ex.Message}\");\n}\n```\n\n## Checkpointing Strategies\n\n| Strategy | When to Use |\n|----------|-------------|\n| Every event | Low volume, critical data |\n| Every N events | Balanced throughput/reliability |\n| Time-based | Consistent checkpoint intervals |\n| Batch completion | After processing a logical batch |\n\n```csharp\n// Checkpoint every 100 events\nprivate int _eventCount = 0;\n\nprocessor.ProcessEventAsync += async args =>\n{\n    // Process event...\n    \n    _eventCount++;\n    if (_eventCount >= 100)\n    {\n        await args.UpdateCheckpointAsync();\n        _eventCount = 0;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.Messaging.EventHubs` | Core sending/receiving | `dotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs` |\n| `Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor` | Production processing | `dotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor` |\n| `Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs` | Management plane (create hubs) | `dotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs` |\n| `Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.EventHubs` | Azure Functions binding | `dotnet add package Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.EventHubs` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:30.095Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for .NET-based Data Processing Agents handling high-throughput Azure event streaming pipelines.","zh":"适用于基于 .NET 的数据处理代理，处理高吞吐量的 Azure 事件流管道。","ja":".NET ベースのデータ処理エージェントが、高スループットの Azure イベント ストリーミング パイプラインを処理するために不可欠です。","ko":".NET 기반 데이터 처리 에이전트가 높은 처리량의 Azure 이벤트 스트리밍 파이프라인을 처리하는 데 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de procesamiento de datos basados en .NET que manejan tuberías de transmisión de eventos de Azure de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de traitement de données basés sur .NET qui gèrent des pipelines de diffusion d''événements Azure à haut débit.","de":"Wesentlich für .NET-basierte Datenverarbeitungsagenten, die Azure-Ereignis-Streaming-Pipelines mit hoher Durchsatzleistung verarbeiten.","pt":"Essential for .NET-based Data Processing Agents handling high-throughput Azure event streaming pipelines.","ru":"Essential for .NET-based Data Processing Agents handling high-throughput Azure event streaming pipelines.","ar":"Essential for .NET-based Data Processing Agents handling high-throughput Azure event streaming pipelines."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to ingest and process massive-scale event streams from Azure Event Hubs using production-ready checkpointing via Azure Storage. Provides secure authentication through Azure.Identity integration for enterprise-grade event processing workflows.","zh":"使代理能够通过 Azure Storage 中的生产就绪检查点从 Azure 事件中心使用大规模事件流，并通过 Azure.Identity 集成提供安全的身份验证，用于企业级事件处理工作流。","ja":"エージェントが Azure Storage を介したプロダクションレディのチェックポイントを使用して Azure Event Hubs から大規模なイベント ストリームを取得および処理できるようにし、Azure.Identity 統合を介したセキュアな認証を提供して、エンタープライズ グレードのイベント処理ワークフローを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Azure Storage를 통해 프로덕션 준비 체크포인트를 사용하여 Azure Event Hubs에서 대규모 이벤트 스트림을 摂取 및 처리할 수 있도록 하며, Azure.Identity 통합을 통해 보안 인증을 제공하여 기업급 이벤트 처리 워크플로우를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ingerir y procesar flujos de eventos a gran escala desde Azure Event Hubs utilizando puntos de control de producción listos mediante Azure Storage. Proporciona autenticación segura a través de la integración de Azure.Identity para flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de eventos de nivel empresarial.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''ingérer et de traiter des flux d''événements à grande échelle à partir d''Azure Event Hubs en utilisant des points de contrôle de production prêts via Azure Storage. Fournit une authentification sécurisée via l''intégration d''Azure.Identity pour des flux de travail de traitement d''événements de niveau entreprise.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, massive Ereignisströme von Azure Event Hubs zu erfassen und zu verarbeiten, indem es produktionsbereite Prüfpunkte über Azure Storage verwendet. Bietet sichere Authentifizierung durch Azure.Identity-Integration für unternehmensgrade Ereignisverarbeitungsworkflows.","pt":"Enables agents to ingest and process massive-scale event streams from Azure Event Hubs using production-ready checkpointing via Azure Storage. Provides secure authentication through Azure.Identity integration for enterprise-grade event processing workflows.","ru":"Enables agents to ingest and process massive-scale event streams from Azure Event Hubs using production-ready checkpointing via Azure Storage. Provides secure authentication through Azure.Identity integration for enterprise-grade event processing workflows.","ar":"Enables agents to ingest and process massive-scale event streams from Azure Event Hubs using production-ready checkpointing via Azure Storage. Provides secure authentication through Azure.Identity integration for enterprise-grade event processing workflows."},"useCases":{"en":["Processing real-time telemetry streams from IoT devices","Implementing event-driven microservices architectures","Building high-throughput data ingestion pipelines","Managing partitioned event consumption with checkpointing"],"zh":["处理来自 IoT 设备的实时遥测流","实现事件驱动的微服务架构","构建高吞吐量的数据摄取管道","使用检查点管理分区事件消费"],"ja":["IoT デバイスからのリアルタイム テレメトリ ストリームの処理","イベント ドリブン マイクロサービスのアーキテクチャの実装","高スループットのデータ取得パイプラインの構築","チェックポイントを使用したパーティション分割イベント消費の管理"],"ko":["IoT 디바이스의 실시간 원격 측정 스트림 처리","이벤트 주도 미クロ 서비스 아키텍처 구현","높은 처리량의 데이터 수집 파이프라인 구축","체크포인트를 사용한 분할 이벤트 소비 관리"],"es":["Procesamiento de flujos de telemetría en tiempo real desde dispositivos IoT","Implementación de arquitecturas de microservicios orientadas a eventos","Creación de tuberías de ingesta de datos de alto rendimiento","Administración del consumo de eventos particionados con puntos de control"],"fr":["Traitement de flux de télémétrie en temps réel à partir de dispositifs IoT","Mise en œuvre d''architectures de microservices orientées événements","Création de pipelines d''ingestion de données à haut débit","Gestion de la consommation d''événements partitionnés avec des points de contrôle"],"de":["Verarbeitung von Echtzeit-Telemetrie-Strömen von IoT-Geräten","Implementierung von ereignisgesteuerten Mikrodienstarchitekturen","Erstellung von Hochdurchsatz-Dateningestionspipelines","Verwaltung des partitionierten Ereignisverbrauchs mit Prüfpunkten"],"pt":["Processing real-time telemetry streams from IoT devices","Implementing event-driven microservices architectures","Building high-throughput data ingestion pipelines","Managing partitioned event consumption with checkpointing"],"ru":["Processing real-time telemetry streams from IoT devices","Implementing event-driven microservices architectures","Building high-throughput data ingestion pipelines","Managing partitioned event consumption with checkpointing"],"ar":["Processing real-time telemetry streams from IoT devices","Implementing event-driven microservices architectures","Building high-throughput data ingestion pipelines","Managing partitioned event consumption with checkpointing"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Storage package for checkpointing functionality","Needs Azure.Identity package for authentication",".NET-specific implementation only","Dependent on Azure Event Hubs infrastructure"],"zh":["需要 Azure Storage 包来实现检查点功能","需要 Azure.Identity 包来进行身份验证","仅 .NET 特定实现","依赖于 Azure 事件中心基础设施"],"ja":["チェックポイント機能を実現するために Azure Storage パッケージが必要","認証を行うために Azure.Identity パッケージが必要",".NET 固有の実装のみ","Azure Event Hubs インフラストラクチャに依存"],"ko":["체크포인트 기능을 구현하기 위해 Azure Storage 패키지가 필요","인증을 수행하기 위해 Azure.Identity 패키지가 필요",".NET 전용 구현","Azure Event Hubs 인프라에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el paquete Azure Storage para la funcionalidad de punto de control","Necesita el paquete Azure.Identity para la autenticación","Implementación específica de .NET solamente","Dependiente de la infraestructura de Azure Event Hubs"],"fr":["Nécessite le package Azure Storage pour la fonctionnalité de point de contrôle","A besoin du package Azure.Identity pour l''authentification","Implémentation spécifique à .NET uniquement","Dépendant de l''infrastructure Azure Event Hubs"],"de":["Benötigt das Azure Storage-Paket für die Prüfpunktfunktion","Benötigt das Azure.Identity-Paket für die Authentifizierung","Nur .NET-spezifische Implementierung","Abhängig von der Azure Event Hubs-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Requires Azure Storage package for checkpointing functionality","Needs Azure.Identity package for authentication",".NET-specific implementation only","Dependent on Azure Event Hubs infrastructure"],"ru":["Requires Azure Storage package for checkpointing functionality","Needs Azure.Identity package for authentication",".NET-specific implementation only","Dependent on Azure Event Hubs infrastructure"],"ar":["Requires Azure Storage package for checkpointing functionality","Needs Azure.Identity package for authentication",".NET-specific implementation only","Dependent on Azure Event Hubs infrastructure"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
