l desarrollo"],"fr":["Génération de tests automatisés en échec","Suivi des principes de la phase rouge de TDD","Couverture des cas de bordure avant la mise en œuvre","Définition du comportement attendu","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Generierung von automatisierten fehlschlagenden Tests","Einhalten der Grundsätze der roten Phase von TDD","Abdeckung von Randfällen vor der Implementierung","Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens","Verbesserung der Effizienz der Entwicklung"],"pt":["Escreva testes abrangentes de falha","Siga os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD","Melhore a produtividade com habilidades de agente de código de ponta","Cobertura de casos de bordo antes da implementação","Testes que capturam o comportamento esperado"],"ru":["Пишите всесторонние тесты на отказ","Следуйте принципам красной фазы TDD","Повысьте свою производительность с помощью передовых навыков кодового агента","Покрытие краевых случаев до реализации","Тесты, которые захватывают ожидаемое поведение"],"ar":["اكتب اختبارات شاملة للفشل","اتبع مبادئ المرحلة الحمراء من TDD","تحسين إنتاجيتك مع مهارات وكيل الشفرة المتقدمة","تغطية الحالات الحدية قبل التنفيذ","الاختبارات التي تحدد السلوك المتوقع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD","TDD Red","TDD"," Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","TDD","TDD Red","TDD"],"ja":["TDD","TDD Red","TDD"," Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","TDD","TDD Red","TDD"],"ko":["TDD","TDD Red","TDD"," Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","TDD","TDD Red","TDD"],"es":["TDD","desarrollo de software","pruebas fallidas","fase roja","automatización de pruebas","eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["TDD","développement de logiciels","tests en échec","phase rouge","automatisation des tests","efficacité du développement"],"de":["TDD","Softwareentwicklung","fehlschlagende Tests","rote Phase","Automatisierung von Tests","Effizienz der Entwicklung"],"pt":["TDD","Desenvolvimento de software","Testes de unidade","Fase vermelha","Agente de código","Produtividade","Cobertura de casos de bordo"],"ru":["TDD","Разработка программного обеспечения","Юнит-тесты","Красная фаза","Кодовый агент","Производительность","Покрытие краевых случаев"],"ar":["TDD","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة","المرحلة الحمراء","وكيل الشفرة","الإنتاجية","تغطية الحالات الحدية"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":"Generate failing tests for the TDD red phase to define expected behavior and edge cases.","bodyPreview":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against p","body":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against production systems\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify behaviors, constraints, and edge cases.\n2. Generate failing tests that define expected outcomes.\n3. Ensure failures are due to missing behavior, not setup errors.\n4. Document how to run tests and verify failures.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Keep test data isolated and avoid production environments.\n- Avoid flaky external dependencies in the red phase.\n\n## Role\n\nGenerate failing tests using Task tool with subagent_type=\"unit-testing::test-automator\".\n\n## Prompt Template\n\n\"Generate comprehensive FAILING tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n1. **Test Structure**\n   - Framework-appropriate setup (Jest/pytest/JUnit/Go/RSpec)\n   - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n   - should_X_when_Y naming convention\n   - Isolated fixtures with no interdependencies\n\n2. **Behavior Coverage**\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases (empty, null, boundary values)\n   - Error handling and exceptions\n   - Concurrent access (if applicable)\n\n3. **Failure Verification**\n   - Tests MUST fail when run\n   - Failures for RIGHT reasons (not syntax/import errors)\n   - Meaningful diagnostic error messages\n   - No cascading failures\n\n4. **Test Categories**\n   - Unit: Isolated component behavior\n   - Integration: Component interaction\n   - Contract: API/interface contracts\n   - Property: Mathematical invariants\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript (Jest/Vitest)**\n- Mock dependencies with `vi.fn()` or `jest.fn()`\n- Use `@testing-library` for React components\n- Property tests with `fast-check`\n\n**Python (pytest)**\n- Fixtures with appropriate scopes\n- Parametrize for multiple test cases\n- Hypothesis for property-based tests\n\n**Go**\n- Table-driven tests with subtests\n- `t.Parallel()` for parallel execution\n- Use `testify/assert` for cleaner assertions\n\n**Ruby (RSpec)**\n- `let` for lazy loading, `let!` for eager\n- Contexts for different scenarios\n- Shared examples for common behavior\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- Readable test names documenting intent\n- One behavior per test\n- No implementation leakage\n- Meaningful test data (not ''foo''/''bar'')\n- Tests serve as living documentation\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Tests passing immediately\n- Testing implementation vs behavior\n- Complex setup code\n- Multiple responsibilities per test\n- Brittle tests tied to specifics\n\n## Edge Case Categories\n\n- **Null/Empty**: undefined, null, empty string/array/object\n- **Boundaries**: min/max values, single element, capacity limits\n- **Special Cases**: Unicode, whitespace, special characters\n- **State**: Invalid transitions, concurrent modifications\n- **Errors**: Network failures, timeouts, permissions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Complete test files with imports\n- Documentation of test purpose\n- Commands to run and verify failures\n- Metrics: test count, coverage areas\n- Next steps for green phase\"\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generation:\n1. Run tests - confirm they fail\n2. Verify helpful failure messages\n3. Check test independence\n4. Ensure comprehensive coverage\n\n## Example (Minimal)\n\n```typescript\n// auth.service.test.ts\ndescribe(''AuthService'', () => {\n  let authService: AuthService;\n  let mockUserRepo: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    mockUserRepo = { findByEmail: jest.fn() } as any;\n    authService = new AuthService(mockUserRepo);\n  });\n\n  it(''should_return_token_when_valid_credentials'', async () => {\n    const user = { id: ''1'', email: ''test@example.com'', passwordHash: ''hashed'' };\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(user);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''test@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(true);\n    expect(result.token).toBeDefined();\n  });\n\n  it(''should_fail_when_user_not_found'', async () => {\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(null);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''none@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(false);\n    expect(result.error).toBe(''INVALID_CREDENTIALS'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\nTest requirements: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:50.022Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents requiring automated test generation and validation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化测试生成和验证的测试驱动开发（TDD）智能体。","ja":"自動テスト生成と検証を必要とするテスト駆動開発（TDD）エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 테스트 생성과 검증이 필요한 테스트 주도 개발(TDD) 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que requieren generación y validación de pruebas automatizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de Développement Piloté par les Tests nécessitant une génération et une validation de tests automatisés.","de":"Ideal für Testgetriebene Entwicklung-Agenten, die automatisierte Testgenerierung und -validierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que requerem geração e validação de testes automatizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, управляемой тестированием, требующих автоматизированного создания и проверки тестов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير القائم على الاختبار الذي يتطلب توليد اختبارات وتأكيد آليين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles, utilizing test-automator agents for edge case coverage and defining expected behavior, all while adhering to TDD best practices and principles.","zh":"赋能智能体遵循TDD红阶段原则编写全面的失败测试，利用测试自动化智能体实现边界情况覆盖并定义预期行为，同时严格遵守TDD最佳实践和原则。","ja":"TDDのレッドフェーズ原則に従って包括的な失敗テストを作成するエージェントを強化し、エッジケースのカバレッジと期待される動作を定義するためにテスト自動化エージェントを利用し、すべてTDDのベストプラクティスと原則に従います。","ko":"TDD 레드 단계 원칙에 따라 포괄적인 실패 테스트를 작성하도록 에이전트를 지원하며, 경계 조건 커버리지를 위한 테스트 자동화 에이전트를 활용하고 예상 동작을 정의하며, TDD 최선의实践과 원칙을 모두 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas integrales con fallos siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD, utilizando agentes automatizadores de pruebas para la cobertura de casos límite y definiendo el comportamiento esperado, todo ello siguiendo las mejores prácticas y principios de TDD.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests complets avec des échecs en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD, en utilisant des agents automatisés de tests pour la couverture des cas limites et en définissant le comportement attendu, tout en respectant les meilleures pratiques et les principes de TDD.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende fehlerhafte Tests nach TDD-Rot-Phasen-Prinzipien zu schreiben, indem Testautomatisierungsagenten für die Abdeckung von Randfällen und die Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens verwendet werden, und zwar unter Einhaltung der TDD-Best-Practices und -Prinzipien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes abrangentes que falham, seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD, utilizando agentes de automação de testes para cobertura de casos limite e definindo comportamento esperado, tudo isso enquanto adere às melhores práticas e princípios do TDD.","ru":"Направляет агентов на написание комплексных неудачных тестов, следующих принципам красной фазы TDD, использующих агентов-автоматизаторов тестов для покрытия граничных случаев и определения ожидаемого поведения, все это при соблюдении лучших практик и принципов TDD.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من كتابة اختبارات شاملة تفشل في المرحلة الحمراء لتطوير الاختبار القائم، باستخدام وكلاء آليين لاختبار الحالات القصوى وتحديد السلوك المتوقع، كل ذلك مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات والمبادئ لتطوير الاختبار القائم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test generation for new behavior","Creating failing tests for edge case coverage","Defining expected behavior through comprehensive test suites"],"zh":["为新行为自动化生成测试","为边界情况覆盖创建失败测试","通过全面的测试套件定义预期行为"],"ja":["新しい動作のための自動テスト生成","エッジケースカバレッジのための失敗テストの作成","包括的なテストスイートによる期待される動作の定義"],"ko":["새로운 동작을 위한 자동화된 테스트 생성","경계 조건 커버리지를 위한 실패 테스트 생성","포괄적인 테스트 스위트를 통한 예상 동작 정의"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de pruebas para nuevo comportamiento","Creación de pruebas con fallos para la cobertura de casos límite","Definición del comportamiento esperado a través de suites de pruebas integrales"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de tests pour un nouveau comportement","Création de tests avec des échecs pour la couverture des cas limites","Définition du comportement attendu à travers des suites de tests complètes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Testgenerierung für neues Verhalten","Erstellung von fehlerhaften Tests für die Abdeckung von Randfällen","Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens durch umfassende Test-Suiten"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de testes para novo comportamento","Criar testes que falham para cobertura de casos limite","Definir comportamento esperado por meio de conjuntos de testes abrangentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание тестов для нового поведения","Создавать неудачные тесты для покрытия граничных случаев","Определять ожидаемое поведение через комплексные наборы тестов"],"ar":["توليد اختبارات آلي لتصرف جديد","إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة لتغطية الحالات القصوى","تحديد السلوك المتوقع من خلال مجموعات اختبارات شاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to TDD red phase","Not applicable for performance benchmarks","Tests must be designed to fail initially to validate subsequent implementation"],"zh":["仅限于TDD红阶段","不适用于性能基准测试","测试必须设计为初始失败以验证后续实现"],"ja":["TDDレッドフェーズに限定","パフォーマンスベンチマークには適用不可","後続の実装を検証するために、テストは最初に失敗するように設計する必要がある"],"ko":["TDD 레드 단계로 제한됨","성능 벤치마크에는 적용되지 않음","후속 구현을 검증하기 위해 테스트는 처음에 실패하도록 설계되어야 함"],"es":["Limitado a la fase roja de TDD","No aplicable para benchmarks de rendimiento","Las pruebas deben estar diseñadas para fallar inicialmente para validar la implementación posterior"],"fr":["Limité à la phase rouge de TDD","Non applicable pour les benchmarks de performance","Les tests doivent être conçus pour échouer initialement pour valider la mise en œuvre ultérieure"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die TDD-Rot-Phase","Nicht anwendbar für Leistungsbenchmarks","Tests müssen so konzipiert sein, dass sie zunächst fehlschlagen, um die anschließende Implementierung zu validieren"],"pt":["Limitado à fase vermelha do TDD","Não aplicável para benchmarks de desempenho","Os testes devem ser projetados para falhar inicialmente para validar a implementação subsequente"],"ru":["Ограничен красной фазой TDD","Не применимо для оценки производительности","Тесты должны быть спроектированы так, чтобы изначально терпеть неудачу для проверки последующей реализации"],"ar":["محدود بالمرحلة الحمراء لتطوير الاختبار القائم","لا ي適用 لقياس الأداء","يجب تصميم الاختبارات على أن تفشل في البداية لتأكيد التنفيذ اللاحق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
