s de programación","Gestión de eventos","Administración de operaciones de Calendly","Consulta de disponibilidad","Gestión de invitados"],"fr":["Création de liens de planification","Gestion des événements","Administration des opérations Calendly","Consultation de disponibilité","Gestion des invités"],"de":["Erstellung von Terminierungslinks","Veranstaltungsverwaltung","Verwaltung von Calendly-Operationen","Verfügbarkeitsabfrage","Gästeverwaltung"],"pt":["Gestão de eventos","Gerenciamento de convites","Criação de links de agendamento","Consultas de disponibilidade","Administração de organização"],"ru":["Управление событиями","Управление приглашениями","Создание ссылок на планирование","Запросы на доступность","Администрирование организации"],"ar":["إدارة الفعاليات","إدارة الدعوات","إنشاء روابط جدولة","استفسارات عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","Composio","Rube MCP","事件列表管理","邀请者管理","日程安排链接创建"],"ja":["Calendly オートメーション","Composio","Rube MCP","イベントリスト管理","招待者管理","スケジュールリンク作成"],"ko":["Calendly 자동화","Composio","Rube MCP","이벤트 목록 관리","초대자 관리","일정 링크 생성"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","Rube MCP","desarrollo de software","gestión de eventos","programación de eventos","Calendly API"],"fr":["automation de Calendly","Rube MCP","développement de logiciels","gestion des événements","planification d''événements","Calendly API"],"de":["Calendly-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Softwareentwicklung","Veranstaltungsverwaltung","Terminplanung","Calendly-API"],"pt":["automação calendly","desenvolvedores calendly","ferramentas de programação calendly","gestão de eventos calendly","gerenciamento de convites calendly","calendly para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["автоматизация calendly","разработчики calendly","инструменты программирования calendly","управление событиями calendly","управление приглашениями calendly","calendly для разработчиков"],"ar":["أتمتة كالنديلي","مطوري كالنديلي","أدوات البرمجة كالنديلي","إدارة الفعاليات كالنديلي","إدارة الدعوات كالنديلي","كالنديلي لمطوري البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:02.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scheduling Agents needing seamless Calendly integration and automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝Calendly集成和自动化能力的调度代理。","ja":"スケジューリングエージェントがシームレスなCalendly統合と自動化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"무결점한 Calendly 통합 및 자동화 기능이 필요한 스케줄링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de programación que necesitan una integración y automatización de Calendly sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de planification nécessitant une intégration et une automatisation de Calendly sans heurts.","de":"Perfekt für Scheduling-Agents, die eine nahtlose Calendly-Integration und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Agendamento que necessitam de integração sem interrupções com o Calendly e capacidades de automação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов планирования, которым требуется бесперебойная интеграция с Calendly и возможности автоматизации.","ar":" مثالي لعميل جدولة بحاجة إلى تكامل سلس مع Calendly وقدرات أتمتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations via Composio''s Calendly toolkit, including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation using RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","zh":"通过Composio的Calendly工具包，赋予代理自动化Calendly操作的能力，包括事件列表、受邀者管理和使用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS创建调度链接。","ja":"ComposioのCalendlyツールキットを使用して、イベントリスト、受邀者管理、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用したスケジューリングリンクの作成など、Calendly操作の自動化をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"Composio의 Calendly 툴킷을 통해 에이전트가 Calendly 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 함으로써, 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리 및 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 스케줄링 링크 생성 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de Calendly a través de la herramienta de Calendly de Composio, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de Calendly via la boîte à outils de Calendly de Composio, y compris la liste des événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Calendly-Operationen über Composios Calendly-Toolkit zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Invitee-Management und Erstellung von Scheduling-Links unter Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly por meio da ferramenta Calendly da Composio, incluindo lista de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento usando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly с помощью инструмента Calendly Composio, включая перечень событий, управление приглашениями и создание ссылок на планирование с использованием RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ar":"يتمكن الوكيل من أتمتة عمليات Calendly من خلال أداة Calendly الخاصة بشركة Composio، بما في ذلك قائمة بالأحداث وإدارة المدعوين وإنشاء روابط جدولة باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and organization administration","Generating scheduling links and managing invitee interactions","Querying availability and managing Calendly connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化事件调度和组织管理","生成调度链接和管理受邀者交互","使用RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS查询可用性和管理Calendly连接"],"ja":["イベントスケジューリングと組織管理の自動化","スケジューリングリンクの生成と受邀者とのやり取りの管理","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用した可用性の照会とCalendly接続の管理"],"ko":["이벤트 스케줄링 및 조직 관리 자동화","스케줄링 링크 생성 및 초대자 상호 작용 관리","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 가용성 조회 및 Calendly 연결 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de eventos y administración de organizaciones","Generación de enlaces de programación y gestión de interacciones de invitados","Consulta de disponibilidad y gestión de conexiones de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''événements et d''administration d''organisations","Génération de liens de planification et gestion des interactions des invités","Recherche de disponibilité et gestion des connexions de Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisplanung und Organisationsverwaltung","Erstellung von Scheduling-Links und Verwaltung von Invitee-Interaktionen","Abfrage der Verfügbarkeit und Verwaltung von Calendly-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar agendamento de eventos e administração de organizações","Gerar links de agendamento e gerenciar interações de convidados","Consultar disponibilidade e gerenciar conexões Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизация планирования событий и администрирования организаций","Генерация ссылок на планирование и управление взаимодействиями приглашенных","Запрос наличия и управление подключениями Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["أتمتة جدولة الأحداث وإدارة المنظمات","توليد روابط جدولة وإدارة تفاعلات المدعوين","استعلام عن التوفر وإدارة الاتصالات في Calendly من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit calendly","Many operations require the user''s Calendly credentials"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Calendly连接且工具包为calendly","许多操作需要用户的Calendly凭据"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能なRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用したアクティブなCalendly接続とツールキットcalendlyが必要","多くの操作にはユーザーのCalendly資格情報が必要"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용할 수 있는 Rube MCP 연결이 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 활성 Calendly 연결 및 툴킷 calendly 필요","많은 작업에는 사용자의 Calendly 자격 증명이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Conexión de Calendly activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta de calendly","Muchas operaciones requieren las credenciales de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Connexion de Calendly active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec la boîte à outils de calendly","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent les informations d''identification de Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit der Calendly-Toolkit","Viele Operationen erfordern die Calendly-Anmeldeinformationen des Benutzers"],"pt":["Exige conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão Calendly ativa via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit calendly","Muitas operações requerem as credenciais Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с инструментом calendly","Многие операции требуют учетных данных Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP مع أدوات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","اتصال Calendly نشط عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة calendly","تحتاج العديد من العمليات إلى بيانات اعتماد Calendly للمستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
