Chain es un marco de trabajo para construir aplicaciones LLM avanzadas. Aprende a utilizar agentes, cadenas, memoria y herramientas para ...","fr":"L''architecture LangChain est un cadre de travail pour développer des applications LLM avancées. Apprenez à utiliser des agents, des chaînes, une mémoire et d...","de":"Die LangChain-Architektur ist ein Rahmenwerk für die Entwicklung von LLM-Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Agenten, Ketten, Speicher und Werkzeuge verwenden...","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official sk..."},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["代理","链","内存","工具集成","高性能","可扩展性"],"ja":["エージェント","チェーン","メモリ","ツール統合","高性能","スケーラビリティ"],"ko":["에이전트","체인","메모리","도구 통합","고성능","확장성"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM avanzadas","Uso de agentes y cadenas para procesar tareas","Integración de memoria y herramientas para mejorar el rendimiento","Aplicación de prácticas recomendadas para validar resultados","Proporcionar pasos y verificación para garantizar la calidad"],"fr":["Développement d''applications LLM avancées","Utilisation d''agents et de chaînes pour traiter des tâches","Intégration de la mémoire et des outils pour améliorer les performances","Application de pratiques recommandées pour valider les résultats","Fournir des étapes et une vérification pour garantir la qualité"],"de":["Entwicklung von LLM-Anwendungen","Verwendung von Agenten und Ketten zur Aufgabenverarbeitung","Integration von Speicher und Werkzeugen zur Leistungssteigerung","Anwendung von bewährten Praktiken zur Ergebnisvalidierung","Bereitstellung von Schritten und Überprüfung zur Qualitätssicherung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","LLM","代理","链","内存","工具集成","高性能","可扩展性"],"ja":["LangChain","LLM","エージェント","チェーン","メモリ","ツール統合","高性能","スケーラビリティ"],"ko":["LangChain","LLM","에이전트","체인","메모리","도구 통합","고성능","확장성"],"es":["arquitectura LangChain","desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM","agentes y cadenas","integración de memoria y herramientas","prácticas recomendadas","validación de resultados","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["architecture LangChain","développement d''applications LLM","agents et chaînes","intégration de la mémoire et des outils","pratiques recommandées","validation des résultats","développement de logiciels","technologies d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["LangChain-Architektur","Entwicklung von LLM-Anwendungen","Agenten und Ketten","Integration von Speicher und Werkzeugen","bewährte Praktiken","Ergebnisvalidierung","Software-Entwicklung","Künstliche-Intelligenz-Technologien"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-architecture","description":"Design LLM applications using the LangChain framework with agents, memory, and tool integration patterns. Use when building LangChain applications, implementing AI agents, or creating complex LLM workflows.","bodyPreview":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, ope","body":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building autonomous AI agents with tool access\n- Implementing complex multi-step LLM workflows\n- Managing conversation memory and state\n- Integrating LLMs with external data sources and APIs\n- Creating modular, reusable LLM application components\n- Implementing document processing pipelines\n- Building production-grade LLM applications\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Agents\nAutonomous systems that use LLMs to decide which actions to take.\n\n**Agent Types:**\n- **ReAct**: Reasoning + Acting in interleaved manner\n- **OpenAI Functions**: Leverages function calling API\n- **Structured Chat**: Handles multi-input tools\n- **Conversational**: Optimized for chat interfaces\n- **Self-Ask with Search**: Decomposes complex queries\n\n### 2. Chains\nSequences of calls to LLMs or other utilities.\n\n**Chain Types:**\n- **LLMChain**: Basic prompt + LLM combination\n- **SequentialChain**: Multiple chains in sequence\n- **RouterChain**: Routes inputs to specialized chains\n- **TransformChain**: Data transformations between steps\n- **MapReduceChain**: Parallel processing with aggregation\n\n### 3. Memory\nSystems for maintaining context across interactions.\n\n**Memory Types:**\n- **ConversationBufferMemory**: Stores all messages\n- **ConversationSummaryMemory**: Summarizes older messages\n- **ConversationBufferWindowMemory**: Keeps last N messages\n- **EntityMemory**: Tracks information about entities\n- **VectorStoreMemory**: Semantic similarity retrieval\n\n### 4. Document Processing\nLoading, transforming, and storing documents for retrieval.\n\n**Components:**\n- **Document Loaders**: Load from various sources\n- **Text Splitters**: Chunk documents intelligently\n- **Vector Stores**: Store and retrieve embeddings\n- **Retrievers**: Fetch relevant documents\n- **Indexes**: Organize documents for efficient access\n\n### 5. Callbacks\nHooks for logging, monitoring, and debugging.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Request/response logging\n- Token usage tracking\n- Latency monitoring\n- Error handling\n- Custom metrics collection\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import AgentType, initialize_agent, load_tools\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\n\n# Initialize LLM\nllm = OpenAI(temperature=0)\n\n# Load tools\ntools = load_tools([\"serpapi\", \"llm-math\"], llm=llm)\n\n# Add memory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n\n# Create agent\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    memory=memory,\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Run agent\nresult = agent.run(\"What''s the weather in SF? Then calculate 25 * 4\")\n```\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: RAG with LangChain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import TextLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitter import CharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# Load and process documents\nloader = TextLoader(''documents.txt'')\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\ntext_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\ntexts = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# Create vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(texts, embeddings)\n\n# Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=llm,\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What is the main topic?\"})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Agent with Tools\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import Tool, AgentExecutor\nfrom langchain.agents.react.base import ReActDocstoreAgent\nfrom langchain.tools import tool\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\"\"\"\n    # Your database search logic\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef send_email(recipient: str, content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Send an email to specified recipient.\"\"\"\n    # Email sending logic\n    return f\"Email sent to {recipient}\"\n\ntools = [search_database, send_email]\n\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Step Chain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import LLMChain, SequentialChain\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\n\n# Step 1: Extract key information\nextract_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    template=\"Extract key entities from: {text}\\n\\nEntities:\"\n)\nextract_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=extract_prompt, output_key=\"entities\")\n\n# Step 2: Analyze entities\nanalyze_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\"],\n    template=\"Analyze these entities: {entities}\\n\\nAnalysis:\"\n)\nanalyze_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=analyze_prompt, output_key=\"analysis\")\n\n# Step 3: Generate summary\nsummary_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\"],\n    template=\"Summarize:\\nEntities: {entities}\\nAnalysis: {analysis}\\n\\nSummary:\"\n)\nsummary_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=summary_prompt, output_key=\"summary\")\n\n# Combine into sequential chain\noverall_chain = SequentialChain(\n    chains=[extract_chain, analyze_chain, summary_chain],\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    output_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\", \"summary\"],\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n## Memory Management Best Practices\n\n### Choosing the Right Memory Type\n```python\n# For short conversations (< 10 messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n# For long conversations (summarize old messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationSummaryMemory\nmemory = ConversationSummaryMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For sliding window (last N messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferWindowMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferWindowMemory(k=5)\n\n# For entity tracking\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationEntityMemory\nmemory = ConversationEntityMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For semantic retrieval of relevant history\nfrom langchain.memory import VectorStoreRetrieverMemory\nmemory = VectorStoreRetrieverMemory(retriever=retriever)\n```\n\n## Callback System\n\n### Custom Callback Handler\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.base import BaseCallbackHandler\n\nclass CustomCallbackHandler(BaseCallbackHandler):\n    def on_llm_start(self, serialized, prompts, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM started with prompts: {prompts}\")\n\n    def on_llm_end(self, response, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM ended with response: {response}\")\n\n    def on_llm_error(self, error, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM error: {error}\")\n\n    def on_chain_start(self, serialized, inputs, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Chain started with inputs: {inputs}\")\n\n    def on_agent_action(self, action, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Agent taking action: {action}\")\n\n# Use callback\nagent.run(\"query\", callbacks=[CustomCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Testing Strategies\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\ndef test_agent_tool_selection():\n    # Mock LLM to return specific tool selection\n    mock_llm = Mock()\n    mock_llm.predict.return_value = \"Action: search_database\\nAction Input: test query\"\n\n    agent = initialize_agent(tools, mock_llm, agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION)\n\n    result = agent.run(\"test query\")\n\n    # Verify correct tool was selected\n    assert \"search_database\" in str(mock_llm.predict.call_args)\n\ndef test_memory_persistence():\n    memory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n    memory.save_context({\"input\": \"Hi\"}, {\"output\": \"Hello!\"})\n\n    assert \"Hi\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n    assert \"Hello!\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Caching\n```python\nfrom langchain.cache import InMemoryCache\nimport langchain\n\nlangchain.llm_cache = InMemoryCache()\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Processing\n```python\n# Process multiple documents in parallel\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'')\ndocs = loader.load()\n\ndef process_doc(doc):\n    return text_splitter.split_documents([doc])\n\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:\n    split_docs = list(executor.map(process_doc, docs))\n```\n\n### 3. Streaming Responses\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.streaming_stdout import StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler\n\nllm = OpenAI(streaming=True, callbacks=[StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/agents.md**: Deep dive on agent architectures\n- **references/memory.md**: Memory system patterns\n- **references/chains.md**: Chain composition strategies\n- **references/document-processing.md**: Document loading and indexing\n- **references/callbacks.md**: Monitoring and observability\n- **assets/agent-template.py**: Production-ready agent template\n- **assets/memory-config.yaml**: Memory configuration examples\n- **assets/chain-example.py**: Complex chain examples\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Memory Overflow**: Not managing conversation history length\n2. **Tool Selection Errors**: Poor tool descriptions confuse agents\n3. **Context Window Exceeded**: Exceeding LLM token limits\n4. **No Error Handling**: Not catching and handling agent failures\n5. **Inefficient Retrieval**: Not optimizing vector store queries\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add request/response logging\n- [ ] Monitor token usage and costs\n- [ ] Set timeout limits for agent execution\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Add input validation\n- [ ] Test with edge cases\n- [ ] Set up observability (callbacks)\n- [ ] Implement fallback strategies\n- [ ] Version control prompts and configurations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:17:01.145Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced LangChain framework integration for building sophisticated LLM applications","zh":"适合需要高级LangChain框架集成以构建复杂LLM应用程序的AI代理","ja":"LangChainフレームワークの高度な統合が必要なLLMアプリケーションを構築するためのAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 고급 LangChain 프레임워크 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una integración avanzada del marco LangChain para construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée du cadre LangChain pour construire des applications LLM sophistiquées","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte LangChain-Framework-Integration für den Bau von anspruchsvollen LLM-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam de integração avançada do framework LangChain para construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция с фреймворком LangChain для построения сложных приложений LLM","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إدماج متقدم لإطار العمل LangChain لبناء تطبيقات LLM متطورة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master the LangChain architecture, leveraging chains, memory, and tool integration for high-performance skills, including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel, and utilizing protocols like agent-tool interaction and LLM application development","zh":"使代理能够掌握LangChain架构，利用链、内存和工具集成来实现高性能技能，包括来自Anthropic和Vercel的官方技能，并利用诸如代理工具交互和LLM应用程序开发等协议","ja":"エージェントがLangChainアーキテクチャをマスターできるようにし、チェーン、メモリ、ツールの統合を利用して、高パフォーマンスのスキルを実現します。AnthropicとVercelからの公式スキルや、エージェントツールの相互作用、LLMアプリケーションの開発などのプロトコルを利用します","ko":"에이전트가 LangChain 아키텍처를 마스터할 수 있도록 하며, 체인, 메모리 및 도구 통합을 사용하여 Anthropic 및 Vercel의 공식 스킬을 포함한 고성능 스킬을 구현하며, 에이전트 도구 상호 작용 및 LLM 애플리케이션 개발과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar la arquitectura LangChain, aprovechando cadenas, memoria e integración de herramientas para habilidades de alto rendimiento, incluyendo habilidades oficiales de Anthropic y Vercel, y utilizando protocolos como la interacción entre agentes y herramientas y el desarrollo de aplicaciones LLM","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser l''architecture LangChain, en exploitant les chaînes, la mémoire et l''intégration d''outils pour des compétences hautes performances, y compris des compétences officielles d''Anthropic et Vercel, et en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''interaction entre agents et outils et le développement d''applications LLM","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die LangChain-Architektur zu meistern, indem es Ketten, Speicher und Toolintegration für Hochleistungs-Fähigkeiten nutzt, einschließlich offizieller Fähigkeiten von Anthropic und Vercel, und Protokolle wie Agent-Tool-Interaktion und LLM-Anwendungs-Entwicklung verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar a arquitetura LangChain, aproveitando cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas para habilidades de alto desempenho, incluindo habilidades oficiais da Anthropic e Vercel, e utilizando protocolos como interação entre agente e ferramenta e desenvolvimento de aplicações LLM","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить архитектуру LangChain, используя цепочки, память и интеграцию инструментов для высокопроизводительных навыков, включая официальные навыки от Anthropic и Vercel, и использует протоколы, такие как взаимодействие агента и инструмента, и разработку приложений LLM","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إتقان بنية LangChain ، واستخدام السلاسل والذاكرة وإدماج الأدوات لمهارات الأداء العالي ، بما في ذلك المهارات الرسمية من Anthropic و Vercel ، واستخدام البروتوكولات مثل تفاعل الوكيل والأداة وتطوير تطبيقات LLM"},"useCases":{"en":["Building sophisticated LLM applications with agents and chains","Integrating memory and tooling for advanced AI capabilities","Validating outcomes and providing actionable steps for LangChain-based projects"],"zh":["使用代理和链构建复杂的LLM应用程序","集成内存和工具以实现高级AI功能","验证结果并为基于LangChain的项目提供可执行步骤"],"ja":["エージェントとチェーンを使用して高度なLLMアプリケーションを構築する","メモリとツールを統合して高度なAI機能を実現する","結果を検証し、LangChainベースのプロジェクトに実行可能なステップを提供する"],"ko":["에이전트와 체인을 사용하여 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","메모리와 도구를 통합하여 고급 AI 기능을 구현하는 것","결과를 검증하고 LangChain 기반 프로젝트에 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas con agentes y cadenas","Integrar memoria y herramientas para capacidades de IA avanzadas","Validar resultados y proporcionar pasos acciones para proyectos basados en LangChain"],"fr":["Construire des applications LLM sophistiquées avec des agents et des chaînes","Intégrer la mémoire et les outils pour des capacités d''IA avancées","Valider les résultats et fournir des étapes d''actions pour les projets basés sur LangChain"],"de":["Anspruchsvolle LLM-Anwendungen mit Agents und Ketten aufbauen","Speicher und Werkzeuge für erweiterte KI-Fähigkeiten integrieren","Ergebnisse überprüfen und handhabbare Schritte für LangChain-basierte Projekte bereitstellen"],"pt":["Construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas com agentes e cadeias","Integrar memória e ferramentas para capacidades de IA avançadas","Validar resultados e fornecer etapas concretas para projetos baseados em LangChain"],"ru":["Построение сложных приложений LLM с агентами и цепочками","Интеграция памяти и инструментов для продвинутых возможностей ИИ","Проверка результатов и предоставление конкретных шагов для проектов на основе LangChain"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات LLM متطورة مع وكلاء وسلاسل","دمج الذاكرة والأدوات لتعزيز قدرات الذكاء الاصطناعي"," التحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات ملموسة لمشاريع مبنية على LangChain"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LangChain framework knowledge","Limited to LangChain architecture scope","Unsuitable for tasks unrelated to LangChain or requiring different domains/tools"],"zh":["需要LangChain框架知识","仅限于LangChain架构范围","不适用于与LangChain无关或需要不同域/工具的任务"],"ja":["LangChainフレームワークの知識が必要","LangChainアーキテクチャの範囲に限定される","LangChainや異なるドメイン/ツールを必要とするタスクとは無関係"],"ko":["LangChain 프레임워크 지식이 필요합니다","LangChain 아키텍처 범위에만 제한됩니다","LangChain 또는 다른 도메인/도구가 필요한 작업과 관련이 없습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del marco LangChain","Limitado al alcance de la arquitectura LangChain","No adecuado para tareas no relacionadas con LangChain o que requieren diferentes dominios/herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur le cadre LangChain","Limité à la portée de l''architecture LangChain","Inapproprié pour les tâches non liées à LangChain ou nécessitant différents domaines/outils"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des LangChain-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der LangChain-Architektur","Ungeeignet für Aufgaben, die nicht mit LangChain oder anderen Bereichen/Tools zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do framework LangChain","Limitado ao escopo da arquitetura LangChain","Inadequado para tarefas não relacionadas ao LangChain ou que exigem domínios/ferramentas diferentes"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка LangChain","Ограничен объемом архитектуры LangChain","Неподходит для задач, не связанных с LangChain или требующих разных доменов/инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار العمل LangChain","محدود بنطاق بنية LangChain","غير مناسب لمهام غير متعلقة بإطار العمل LangChain أو التي تتطلب مجالات وأدوات مختلفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
