ropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["压缩策略","掩码技术","缓存优化","分区管理","上下文窗口优化"],"ja":["圧縮戦略","マスキング技術","キャッシング最適化","パーティショニング管理","コンテキストウィンドウ最適化"],"ko":["압축 전략","마스킹 기술","캐싱 최적화","파티셔닝 관리","컨텍스트 윈도우 최적화"],"es":["Técnicas de compresión para reducir el tamaño del contexto","Enmascaramiento para ocultar información irrelevante","Almacenamiento en caché para mejorar el acceso a la información","Particionado para organizar el contexto de manera eficiente","Mejora del rendimiento de los agentes de IA","Compatibilidad con Claude Code, Antigravity y Cursor"],"fr":["Techniques de compression pour réduire la taille du contexte","Masquage pour cacher les informations non pertinentes","Mise en cache pour améliorer l''accès à l''information","Partitionnement pour organiser le contexte de manière efficace","Amélioration des performances des agents IA","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, Antigravity et Cursor"],"de":["Komprimierungstechniken, um die Größe des Kontexts zu reduzieren","Maskierung, um irrelevante Informationen zu verbergen","Caching, um den Zugriff auf Informationen zu verbessern","Partitionierung, um den Kontext effizient zu organisieren","Leistungsverbesserung von KI-Agentsen","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, Antigravity und Cursor"],"pt":["Técnicas de compactação e mascaramento","Estratégias de cache e partitionamento","Melhoria do desempenho e eficiência","Compatibilidade com agentes de IA","Técnicas de otimização de contexto"],"ru":["Техники сжатия и маскирования","Стратегии кэширования и разделения","Улучшение производительности и эффективности","Совместимость с агентами ИИ","Техники оптимизации контекста"],"ar":["تقنيات الضغط والإخفاء","استراتيجيات تخزين البيانات المؤقتة والتقسيم","تحسين الأداء والكفاءة","التوافق مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات تحسين سياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","AI代理性能","压缩策略","掩码技术","缓存优化","分区管理"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","AIエージェントパフォーマンス","圧縮戦略","マスキング技術","キャッシング最適化","パーティショニング管理"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","AI 에이전트 성능","압축 전략","마스킹 기술","캐싱 최적화","파티셔닝 관리"],"es":["optimización de contexto","técnicas de compresión","enmascaramiento","almacenamiento en caché","particionado","agentes de IA","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","techniques de compression","masquage","mise en cache","partitionnement","agents IA","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor"],"de":["Kontextoptimierung","Komprimierungstechniken","Maskierung","Caching","Partitionierung","KI-Agentsen","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","agentes de IA","compactação","mascaramento","cache","partitionamento","desempenho","eficiência","técnicas de otimização"],"ru":["оптимизация контекста","агенты ИИ","сжатие","маскирование","кэширование","разделение","производительность","эффективность","техники оптимизации"],"ar":["تحسين سياق","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","الضغط","الإخفاء","تخزين البيانات المؤقتة","التقسيم","الأداء","الكفاءة","تقنيات تحسين"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:16:05.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring strategic context window management through compaction, masking, and caching techniques.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等需要通过压缩、掩码和缓存技术进行战略性上下文窗口管理的 AI 代理。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの戦略的なコンテキストウィンドウ管理を圧縮、 マスキング、キャッシング技術を通じて実行する必要がある AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 오토지피티 같은 전략적인 콘텍스트 윈도우 관리를 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 기술을 통해 수행해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren un manejo estratégico de la ventana de contexto a través de técnicas de compactación, enmascaramiento y almacenamiento en caché.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une gestion stratégique de la fenêtre de contexte via des techniques de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die ein strategisches Kontextfenster-Management durch Compact-, Maskier- und Cachetechniken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem gerenciamento estratégico de janela de contexto por meio de técnicas de compactação, mascaramento e cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих стратегического управления контекстным окном посредством техник компактации, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تتطلب إدارة سياق استراتيجية من خلال تقنيات الضغط والتخفيء والتخزين المؤقت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend effective context capacity via strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning, effectively doubling or tripling available context window capacity using techniques like apply compaction and caching strategies.","zh":"赋予代理扩大有效上下文容量的能力，通过战略性的压缩、掩码、缓存和分区，使用诸如应用压缩和缓存策略等技术，有效地将可用的上下文窗口容量加倍或三倍。","ja":"エージェントに、戦略的な圧縮、 マスキング、キャッシング、パーティショニングを通じて、有効なコンテキスト容量を拡大する能力を与え、適用圧縮とキャッシング戦略などの技術を使用して、利用可能なコンテキストウィンドウ容量を効果的に2倍または3倍にします。","ko":"에이전트에게 효과적인 콘텍스트容量을 확장하는 능력을 부여하며, 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱, 분할을 통해, 적용 압축 및 캐싱 전략과 같은 기술을 사용하여, 이용 가능한 콘텍스트 윈도우容量을 효과적으로 2배 또는 3배로 늘립니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ampliar la capacidad de contexto efectiva a través de la compresión estratégica, el enmascaramiento, el almacenamiento en caché y la partición, lo que efectivamente duplica o triplica la capacidad de la ventana de contexto disponible utilizando técnicas como la aplicación de estrategias de compactación y almacenamiento en caché.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la capacité de contexte effective via une compression stratégique, un masquage, une mise en cache et une partition, ce qui double ou triple effectivement la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte disponible en utilisant des techniques comme l''application de stratégies de compactage et de mise en cache.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die effektive Kontextkapazität durch strategische Komprimierung, Maskierung, Caching und Partitionierung zu erweitern, was die verfügbare Kontextfensterkapazität effektiv verdoppelt oder verdreifacht, indem Techniken wie die Anwendung von Compact- und Cachestrategien verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a capacidade de contexto eficaz por meio da compressão estratégica, mascaramento, cache e particionamento, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a capacidade da janela de contexto disponível usando técnicas como aplicar estratégias de compactação e cache.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять эффективную емкость контекста посредством стратегического сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения, эффективно удваивая или утраивая доступную емкость контекстного окна с помощью техник, таких как применение стратегий компактации и кэширования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توسيع سعة السياق الفعال من خلال الضغط الاستراتيجي والتخفيء والتخزين المؤقت والتقسيم، وزيادة سعة النافذة السياقية المتاحة بشكل فعال إلى الضعف أو الثلاثة أضعاف باستخدام تقنيات مثل تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط والتخزين المؤقت."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to optimize context windows","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context data","Utilizing caching to reduce redundant computations and enhance performance"],"zh":["应用压缩策略来优化上下文窗口","实施掩码技术来关注相关上下文数据","利用缓存来减少冗余计算和提高性能"],"ja":["コンテキストウィンドウを最適化するための圧縮戦略の適用","関連するコンテキストデータに焦点を当てるためのマスキング技術の実装","冗長な計算を減らし、パフォーマンスを向上させるためのキャッシングの利用"],"ko":["콘텍스트 윈도우를 최적화하기 위한 압축 전략의 적용","관련 콘텍스트 데이터에 초점을 맞추기 위한 마스킹 기술의 구현","冗余계산을 줄이고 성능을 향상시키기 위한 캐싱의 활용"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para optimizar las ventanas de contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en los datos de contexto relevantes","Utilizar el almacenamiento en caché para reducir cálculos redundantes y mejorar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour optimiser les fenêtres de contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur les données de contexte pertinentes","Utiliser la mise en cache pour réduire les calculs redondants et améliorer les performances"],"de":["Compact-Strategien anwenden, um Kontextfenster zu optimieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf relevante Kontextdaten zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um redundante Berechnungen zu reduzieren und die Leistung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para otimizar janelas de contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para se concentrar em dados de contexto relevantes","Utilizar cache para reduzir computações redundantes e melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Применение стратегий компактации для оптимизации контекстных окон","Реализация техник маскирования для сосредоточения внимания на релевантных контекстных данных","Использование кэша для снижения избыточных вычислений и повышения производительности"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتحسين نوافذ السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفيء لتركيز الانتباه على بيانات السياق ذات الصلة","استخدام التخزين المؤقت لتقليل الحسابات الزائدة وتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to available context window capacity","Requires strategic application of optimization techniques"],"zh":["仅限于可用的上下文窗口容量","需要战略性的优化技术的应用"],"ja":["利用可能なコンテキストウィンドウ容量に限定される","最適化技術の戦略的な適用が必要"],"ko":["이용 가능한 콘텍스트 윈도우容量으로 제한됨","최적화 기술의 전략적인 적용이 필요"],"es":["Limitado a la capacidad de la ventana de contexto disponible","Requiere una aplicación estratégica de técnicas de optimización"],"fr":["Limité à la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte disponible","Nécessite une application stratégique de techniques d''optimisation"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die verfügbare Kontextfensterkapazität","Erfordert eine strategische Anwendung von Optimierungstechniken"],"pt":["Limitado à capacidade de janela de contexto disponível","Exige aplicação estratégica de técnicas de otimização"],"ru":["Ограничен доступной емкостью контекстного окна","Требует стратегического применения техник оптимизации"],"ar":["محدود بسعة نافذة السياق المتاحة","يتطلب تطبيق استراتيجي لتقنيات التحسين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
