sation de Freshservice permet d''accélérer les opérations de gestion de services IT via l''outil de Composio et Rube MCP.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Freshservice ermöglicht die Beschleunigung von IT-Service-Management-Operationen über das Composio-Tool und Rube MCP.","pt":"Automatize operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI do Freshservice com o toolkit da Composio via Rube MCP.","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции управления сервисами IT Freshservice с помощью инструмента Composio через Rube MCP.","ar":"تأتمتة عمليات إدارة خدمات تي　i Freshservice باستخدام أداة Composio عبر Rube MCP.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official sk..."},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"es":["Automatización de operaciones de gestión de servicios IT","Integración con Rube MCP","Herramienta de Composio para Freshservice","Configuración sencilla","Mejora de la eficiencia"],"fr":["Automatisation des opérations de gestion de services IT","Intégration avec Rube MCP","Outil de Composio pour Freshservice","Configuration simple","Amélioration de l''efficacité"],"de":["Automatisierung von IT-Service-Management-Operationen","Integration mit Rube MCP","Composio-Tool für Freshservice","Einfache Konfiguration","Effizienzsteigerung"],"pt":["Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração com o Freshservice via toolkit da Composio","Uso da plataforma Rube MCP para gerenciar operações","Conexão ativa com o Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Uso do RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para obter esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций управления сервисами IT","Интеграция с Freshservice через инструмент Composio","Использование платформы Rube MCP для управления операциями","Активное подключение к Freshservice через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Использование RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для получения текущих схем инструментов"],"ar":["تأتمتة عمليات إدارة خدمات تي　i","التكامل مع Freshservice من خلال أداة Composio","استخدام منصة Rube MCP لإدارة العمليات","التوصيل الفعّال بالـ Freshservice من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","استخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"keywords":{"es":["automatización Freshservice","Rube MCP","herramienta de Composio","gestión de servicios IT","automatización de operaciones","integración con Rube MCP"],"fr":["automatisation Freshservice","Rube MCP","outil de Composio","gestion de services IT","automatisation des opérations","intégration avec Rube MCP"],"de":["Freshservice-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Composio-Tool","IT-Service-Management","Automatisierung von Operationen","Integration mit Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automatização de serviços de TI","Freshservice","Rube MCP","Gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Automação de operações","Integração com Freshservice"],"ru":["Автоматизация сервисов IT","Freshservice","Rube MCP","Управление сервисами IT","Автоматизация операций","Интеграция с Freshservice"],"ar":["تأتمتة خدمات تي　i","Freshservice","Rube MCP","إدارة خدمات تي　i","تأتمتة العمليات","التكامل مع Freshservice"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"freshservice-automation","description":"Automate Freshservice ITSM tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create/update tickets, bulk operations, service requests, and outbound emails. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys","body":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Freshservice authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find, list, or search for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with optional filtering and pagination [Required]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET` - Get detailed information for a specific ticket [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `filter`: Predefined filter (''all_tickets'', ''deleted'', ''spam'', ''watching'')\n- `updated_since`: ISO 8601 timestamp to get tickets updated after this time\n- `order_by`: Sort field (''created_at'', ''updated_at'', ''status'', ''priority'')\n- `order_type`: Sort direction (''asc'' or ''desc'')\n- `page`: Page number (1-indexed)\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-100, default 30)\n- `include`: Additional fields (''requester'', ''stats'', ''description'', ''conversations'', ''assets'')\n\n**Key parameters for get**:\n- `ticket_id`: Unique ticket ID or display_id\n- `include`: Additional fields to include\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- By default, only tickets created within the past 30 days are returned\n- Use `updated_since` to retrieve older tickets\n- Each `include` value consumes additional API credits\n- `page` is 1-indexed; minimum value is 1\n- `per_page` max is 100; default is 30\n- Ticket IDs can be the internal ID or the display_id shown in the UI\n\n### 2. Create a Ticket\n\n**When to use**: User wants to log a new incident or request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET` - Create a new ticket [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `subject`: Ticket subject line (required)\n- `description`: HTML description of the ticket (required)\n- `status`: Ticket status - 2 (Open), 3 (Pending), 4 (Resolved), 5 (Closed) (required)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Urgent) (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (provide either email or requester_id)\n- `requester_id`: User ID of the requester\n- `type`: Ticket type (''Incident'' or ''Service Request'')\n- `source`: Channel - 1 (Email), 2 (Portal), 3 (Phone), 4 (Chat), 5 (Twitter), 6 (Facebook)\n- `impact`: Impact level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High)\n- `urgency`: Urgency level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Critical)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `subject`, `description`, `status`, and `priority` are all required\n- Either `email` or `requester_id` must be provided to identify the requester\n- Status and priority use numeric codes, not string names\n- Description supports HTML formatting\n- If email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created\n\n### 3. Bulk Update Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to update multiple tickets at once\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - Find tickets to update [Prerequisite]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS` - Update multiple tickets [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `ids`: Array of ticket IDs to update (required)\n- `update_fields`: Dictionary of fields to update (required)\n  - Allowed keys: ''subject'', ''description'', ''status'', ''priority'', ''responder_id'', ''group_id'', ''type'', ''tags'', ''custom_fields''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Bulk update performs sequential updates internally; large batches may take time\n- All specified tickets receive the same field updates\n- If one ticket update fails, others may still succeed; check response for individual results\n- Cannot selectively update different fields per ticket in a single call\n- Custom fields must use their internal field names, not display names\n\n### 4. Create Ticket via Outbound Email\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a ticket by sending an outbound email notification\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL` - Create ticket with email notification [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (required)\n- `subject`: Email subject / ticket subject (required)\n- `description`: HTML email body content\n- `status`: Ticket status (2=Open, 3=Pending, 4=Resolved, 5=Closed)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority (1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High, 4=Urgent)\n- `cc_emails`: Array of CC email addresses\n- `email_config_id`: Email configuration ID for the sender address\n- `name`: Requester name\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This creates a standard ticket via the /api/v2/tickets endpoint while sending an email\n- If the email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created with the provided name\n- `email_config_id` determines which email address the notification appears to come from\n\n### 5. Create Service Requests\n\n**When to use**: User wants to submit a service catalog request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST` - Create a service request for a catalog item [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `item_display_id`: Display ID of the catalog item (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address\n- `quantity`: Number of items to request (default: 1)\n- `custom_fields`: Custom field values for the service item form\n- `parent_ticket_id`: Display ID of a parent ticket (for child requests)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `item_display_id` can be found in Admin > Service Catalog > item URL (e.g., /service_catalog/items/1)\n- Custom fields keys must match the service item form field names\n- Quantity defaults to 1 if not specified\n- Service requests follow the approval workflow defined for the catalog item\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Status Code Reference\n\n| Code | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| 2 | Open |\n| 3 | Pending |\n| 4 | Resolved |\n| 5 | Closed |\n\n### Priority Code Reference\n\n| Code | Priority |\n|------|----------|\n| 1 | Low |\n| 2 | Medium |\n| 3 | High |\n| 4 | Urgent |\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Use `page` (1-indexed) and `per_page` (max 100) parameters\n- Increment `page` by 1 each request\n- Continue until returned results count < `per_page`\n- Default page size is 30\n\n### Finding Tickets by Date Range\n\n```\n1. Call FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS with updated_since=''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z''\n2. Optionally add order_by=''updated_at'' and order_type=''desc''\n3. Paginate through results\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Numeric Codes**:\n- Status and priority use numeric values, not strings\n- Source channel uses numeric codes (1-6)\n- Impact and urgency use numeric codes (1-3 or 1-4)\n\n**Date Filtering**:\n- Default returns only tickets from the last 30 days\n- Use `updated_since` parameter for older tickets\n- Date format is ISO 8601 (e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z'')\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Freshservice API has per-account rate limits\n- Each `include` option consumes additional API credits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are numeric integers\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS | filter, updated_since, page, per_page |\n| Get ticket | FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET | ticket_id, include |\n| Create ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET | subject, description, status, priority, email |\n| Bulk update | FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS | ids, update_fields |\n| Outbound email ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL | email, subject, description |\n| Service request | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST | item_display_id, email, quantity |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:17:23.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IT Automation Agents requiring enterprise-grade Freshservice integration through Rube MCP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Rube MCP实现企业级Freshservice集成的IT自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCPを介してエンタープライズグレードのFreshservice統合を必要とするITオートメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 엔터프라이즈급 Freshservice 통합을 필요로 하는 IT 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de TI que requieren integración de Freshservice de nivel empresarial a través de Rube MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de TI nécessitant une intégration Freshservice de niveau entreprise via Rube MCP.","de":"Ideal für IT-Automationsagenten, die eine Unternehmens-Grade-Freshservice-Integration über Rube MCP erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de automação de TI que exigem integração de nível empresarial do Freshservice por meio do Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации ИТ, требующих интеграции с системой Freshservice на уровне предприятия через Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомاتيزيتی لتقنیة المعلومات الذي يتطلب دمجًا على مستوى المؤسسة مع Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct automation of Freshservice IT Service Management operations via Composio''s toolkit integration. Provides battle-tested workflows for ticket management, user provisioning, and service catalog operations through standardized MCP protocols.","zh":"通过Composio的工具包集成，实现Freshservice IT服务管理操作的直接自动化。为票务管理、用户配置和服务目录操作提供了经过实战考验的工作流，通过标准化的MCP协议","ja":"Composioのツールキット統合を通じて、Freshservice ITサービスマネジメント操作の直接自動化を可能にします。チケット管理、ユーザープロビジョニング、サービスカタログ操作のバトルテスト済みワークフローを提供し、標準化されたMCPプロトコルで提供します","ko":"Composio의 툴킷 통합을 통해 Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 운영의 직접 자동화를 가능하게 함. 표준화된 MCP 프로토콜을 통해 티켓 관리, 사용자 프로비저닝, 서비스 카탈로그 운영을 위한 검증된 워크플로를 제공","es":"Permite la automatización directa de las operaciones de gestión de servicios de TI de Freshservice a través de la integración de la herramienta de Composio. Proporciona flujos de trabajo probados en combate para la gestión de tickets, la provisión de usuarios y las operaciones del catálogo de servicios a través de protocolos MCP estandarizados.","fr":"Permet l''automatisation directe des opérations de gestion des services de TI Freshservice via l''intégration de l''outil Composio. Fournit des flux de travail éprouvés pour la gestion des tickets, la provision des utilisateurs et les opérations du catalogue de services via des protocoles MCP standardisés.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Automatisierung von Freshservice-IT-Service-Management-Operationen über die Integration des Composio-Toolkits. Bietet kampferprobte Workflows für Ticket-Management, Benutzerbereitstellung und Servicekatalog-Operationen über standardisierte MCP-Protokolle.","pt":"Permite a automação direta das operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI do Freshservice por meio da integração da ferramenta do Composio. Fornece fluxos de trabalho testados em batalha para gerenciamento de tickets, provisionamento de usuários e operações de catálogo de serviços por meio de protocolos MCP padronizados.","ru":"Позволяет直接 автоматизировать операции управления ИТ-услугами Freshservice через интеграцию инструментария Composio. Предоставляет протестированные в бою рабочие процессы для управления тикетами, обеспечения пользователей и операций по каталогу услуг через стандартизированные протоколы MCP.","ar":"يمكّن من أتمتة مباشرة لعمليات إدارة خدمة تكنولوجيا المعلومات من Freshservice من خلال دمج أداة Composio. يوفر سلاسل عمل محكمة من خلال المعركة لإدارة التذاكر وتزويد المستخدمين وعمليات فهرس الخدمات من خلال بروتوكولات MCP معيارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ticket creation and assignment workflows","Managing user onboarding/offboarding processes","Updating service catalog items and categories","Synchronizing asset management records","Generating service desk performance reports"],"zh":["自动化票务创建和分配工作流","管理用户入职/离职流程","更新服务目录项目和类别","同步资产管理记录","生成服务台性能报告"],"ja":["チケット作成と割り当てワークフローの自動化","ユーザーの入社/退社プロセスの管理","サービスカタログアイテムとカテゴリの更新","資産管理レコードの同期","サービスデスクのパフォーマンスレポートの生成"],"ko":["티켓 생성 및 할당 워크플로 자동화","사용자 입사/퇴사 프로세스 관리","서비스 카탈로그 항목 및 카테고리 업데이트","자산 관리 레코드 동기화","서비스 데스크 성능 보고서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de creación y asignación de tickets","Gestión de procesos de incorporación y desincorporación de usuarios","Actualización de elementos y categorías del catálogo de servicios","Sincronización de registros de gestión de activos","Generación de informes de rendimiento de escritorio de servicio"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de création et d''affectation de tickets","Gestion des processus d''intégration et de désintégration des utilisateurs","Mise à jour des éléments et des catégories du catalogue de services","Synchronisation des enregistrements de gestion des actifs","Génération de rapports de performance du bureau de service"],"de":["Automatisierung von Ticket-Erstellungs- und Zuweisungs-Workflows","Verwaltung von Benutzer-Onboarding-/Offboarding-Prozessen","Aktualisierung von Servicekatalog-Artikeln und -Kategorien","Synchronisierung von Asset-Management-Aufzeichnungen","Erstellung von Service-Desk-Leistungsberichten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de criação e atribuição de tickets","Gerenciar processos de onboarding/offboarding de usuários","Atualizar itens e categorias do catálogo de serviços","Sincronizar registros de gerenciamento de ativos","Gerar relatórios de desempenho da mesa de serviço"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы создания и назначения тикетов","Управлять процессами настройки/снятия пользователей","Обновлять элементы и категории каталога услуг","Синхронизировать записи управления активами","Генерировать отчеты о производительности службы поддержки"],"ar":["أتمتة سلاسل عمل إنشاء التذاكر وتحديدها","إدارة عمليات التسجيل/الإلغاء للمستخدمين","تحديث عناصر وفئات فهرس الخدمات","مزامنة سجلات إدارة الأصول","генерировать تقارير أداء مكتب الخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP server connection","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability for schema discovery"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP服务器连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Freshservice连接","依赖于RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS的可用性以进行模式发现"],"ja":["Rube MCPサーバーの接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS経由でのアクティブなFreshservice接続が必要","スキーマの検出のためにRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSの可用性に依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 서버 연결 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 활성 Freshservice 연결 필요","스키마 발견을 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión al servidor Rube MCP","Necesita una conexión activa a Freshservice a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Depende de la disponibilidad de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para el descubrimiento de esquemas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion au serveur Rube MCP","Nécessite une connexion active à Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Dépend de la disponibilité de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour la découverte de schémas"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung zum Rube-MCP-Server","Benötigt eine aktive Verbindung zu Freshservice über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für die Schemenentdeckung ab"],"pt":["Exige conexão com servidor Rube MCP","Necessita conexão ativa com Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Depende da disponibilidade de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para descoberta de esquema"],"ru":["Требует соединения с сервером Rube MCP","Требует активного соединения с Freshservice через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Зависит от доступности RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS дл