SMB","Suporte a cenários cloud-native e lift-and-shift","Instalação via pip","Autenticação via connection string ou URL de conta","Gerenciamento de serviços de compartilhamento de arquivos"],"ru":["Управление общими ресурсами файлов SMB","Поддержка облачных и гибридных сценариев","Установка через pip","Аутентификация через connection string или URL учетной записи","Управление службами общих ресурсов файлов"],"ar":["إدارة المشاركة الملفات SMB","دعم السيناريوهات السحابية والأлевيت-أند-شفت","التثبيت عبر pip","التحقق من الصحة عبر السلسلة الاتصال أو URL الحساب","إدارة خدمات المشاركة الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Python","Azure Storage","Python SDK","SMB","Azure","Cloud Native","Lift-and-Shift"],"ja":["Azure Python","Azure Storage","Python SDK","SMB","Azure","Cloud Native","Lift-and-Shift"],"ko":["Azure Python","Azure Storage","Python SDK","SMB","Azure","Cloud Native","Lift-and-Shift"],"es":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Python","SMB","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","autenticación","instalación"],"fr":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Python","SMB","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","authentification","installation"],"de":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Python","SMB","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","Authentifizierung","Installation"],"pt":["Azure Storage File Share Python","SDK Azure Storage","Compartilhamento de arquivos SMB","Cloud-native","Lift-and-shift","Autenticação Azure","Gerenciamento de serviços de compartilhamento de arquivos"],"ru":["Azure Storage File Share Python","SDK Azure Storage","Общие ресурсы файлов SMB","Облачные сценарии","Гибридные сценарии","Аутентификация Azure","Управление службами общих ресурсов файлов"],"ar":["Azure Storage File Share Python","SDK Azure Storage","مشاركة الملفات SMB","السيناريوهات السحابية","السيناريوهات الأлевيت-أند-شفت","التحقق من الصحة Azure","إدارة خدمات المشاركة الملفات"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-storage-file-share-py","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice","body":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient.from_connection_string(\n    os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING\"]\n)\n```\n\n### Entra ID\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient(\n    account_url=os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL\"],\n    credential=DefaultAzureCredential()\n)\n```\n\n## Share Operations\n\n### Create Share\n\n```python\nshare = service.create_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### List Shares\n\n```python\nfor share in service.list_shares():\n    print(f\"{share.name}: {share.quota} GB\")\n```\n\n### Get Share Client\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### Delete Share\n\n```python\nservice.delete_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n## Directory Operations\n\n### Create Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory\")\n\n# Nested directory\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory/sub-directory\")\n```\n\n### List Directories and Files\n\n```python\ndirectory_client = share_client.get_directory_client(\"my-directory\")\n\nfor item in directory_client.list_directories_and_files():\n    if item[\"is_directory\"]:\n        print(f\"[DIR] {item[''name'']}\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"[FILE] {item[''name'']} ({item[''size'']} bytes)\")\n```\n\n### Delete Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client.delete_directory(\"my-directory\")\n```\n\n## File Operations\n\n### Upload File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# From string\nfile_client.upload_file(\"Hello, World!\")\n\n# From file\nwith open(\"local-file.txt\", \"rb\") as f:\n    file_client.upload_file(f)\n\n# From bytes\nfile_client.upload_file(b\"Binary content\")\n```\n\n### Download File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# To bytes\ndata = file_client.download_file().readall()\n\n# To file\nwith open(\"downloaded.txt\", \"wb\") as f:\n    data = file_client.download_file()\n    data.readinto(f)\n\n# Stream chunks\ndownload = file_client.download_file()\nfor chunk in download.chunks():\n    process(chunk)\n```\n\n### Get File Properties\n\n```python\nproperties = file_client.get_file_properties()\nprint(f\"Size: {properties.size}\")\nprint(f\"Content type: {properties.content_settings.content_type}\")\nprint(f\"Last modified: {properties.last_modified}\")\n```\n\n### Delete File\n\n```python\nfile_client.delete_file()\n```\n\n### Copy File\n\n```python\nsource_url = \"https://account.file.core.windows.net/share/source.txt\"\ndest_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"destination.txt\")\ndest_client.start_copy_from_url(source_url)\n```\n\n## Range Operations\n\n### Upload Range\n\n```python\n# Upload to specific range\nfile_client.upload_range(data=b\"content\", offset=0, length=7)\n```\n\n### Download Range\n\n```python\n# Download specific range\ndownload = file_client.download_file(offset=0, length=100)\ndata = download.readall()\n```\n\n## Snapshot Operations\n\n### Create Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot = share_client.create_snapshot()\nprint(f\"Snapshot: {snapshot[''snapshot'']}\")\n```\n\n### Access Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot_client = service.get_share_client(\n    \"my-share\",\n    snapshot=snapshot[\"snapshot\"]\n)\n```\n\n## Async Client\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare.aio import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity.aio import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nasync def upload_file():\n    credential = DefaultAzureCredential()\n    service = ShareServiceClient(account_url, credential=credential)\n    \n    share = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n    file_client = share.get_file_client(\"test.txt\")\n    \n    await file_client.upload_file(\"Hello!\")\n    \n    await service.close()\n    await credential.close()\n```\n\n## Client Types\n\n| Client | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `ShareServiceClient` | Account-level operations |\n| `ShareClient` | Share operations |\n| `ShareDirectoryClient` | Directory operations |\n| `ShareFileClient` | File operations |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use connection string** for simplest setup\n2. **Use Entra ID** for production with RBAC\n3. **Stream large files** using chunks() to avoid memory issues\n4. **Create snapshots** before major changes\n5. **Set quotas** to prevent unexpected storage costs\n6. **Use ranges** for partial file updates\n7. **Close async clients** explicitly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:17:30.551Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Storage Agents needing secure Azure file share management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要安全的 Azure 文件共享管理功能的云存储代理。","ja":"Azure ファイル共有の管理機能を安全に必要とするクラウドストレージエージェントに最適です。","ko":"안전한 Azure 파일 공유 관리 기능이 필요한 클라우드 스토리지 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Almacenamiento en la Nube que necesitan capacidades de administración de recursos compartidos de archivos de Azure seguras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de stockage cloud ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de partage de fichiers Azure sécurisées.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Speicher-Agents, die sichere Azure-Dateifreigabeverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Armazenamento em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de compartilhamento de arquivos do Azure seguras.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачного хранилища, которым необходимы функции безопасного управления общими папками Azure.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تخزين السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة مشاركة ملفات Azure آمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios using the Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python, handling authentication via connection strings or account URLs, and leveraging environment variables like AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python 管理 SMB 文件共享，用于云原生和提升转移场景，通过连接字符串或帐户 URL 处理身份验证，并利用环境变量如 AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING。","ja":"Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python を使用して、クラウドネイティブおよびリフトアンドシフトのシナリオで SMB ファイル共有を管理できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、接続文字列またはアカウント URL を介して認証を処理し、AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING などの環境変数を活用します。","ko":"Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python을 사용하여 에이전트가 클라우드 네이티브 및 리프트 앤 시프트 시나리오에서 SMB 파일 공유를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 연결 문자열 또는 계정 URL을 통해 인증을 처리하고, AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING과 같은 환경 변수를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar acciones de recursos compartidos de archivos SMB para escenarios de cloud-native y lift-and-shift utilizando el SDK de recursos compartidos de archivos de Azure Storage para Python, controlando la autenticación a través de cadenas de conexión o direcciones URL de cuenta, y aprovechando variables de entorno como AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les partages de fichiers SMB pour les scénarios cloud-native et lift-and-shift en utilisant le SDK de partage de fichiers Azure Storage pour Python, en gérant l''authentification via des chaînes de connexion ou des URL de compte, et en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, SMB-Dateifreigaben für cloud-native- und lift-and-shift-Szenarien zu verwalten, indem sie das Azure Storage File Share SDK für Python verwenden, die Authentifizierung über Verbindungscodes oder Kontourls steuern und Umgebungsvariablen wie AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar compartilhamentos de arquivos SMB para cenários nativos de nuvem e de elevação e transferência usando o SDK de Compartilhamento de Arquivos de Armazenamento do Azure para Python, tratando a autenticação por meio de cadeias de conexão ou URLs de conta e aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять общими папками SMB для облачных и подъемно-перемещаемых сценариев с помощью SDK общих папок хранилища Azure для Python, обрабатывая аутентификацию через строки подключения или URL-адреса учетных записей и использует переменные среды, такие как AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة مشاركات الملفات SMB لسيناريوهات السحابة الأصلية ورفع وانتقال باستخدام SDK مشاركة ملفات تخزين Azure لPYTHON ، ومعالجة المصادقة من خلال سلاسل الاتصال أو عناوين URL لل حساب ، واستخدام متغيرات البيئة مثل AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating file share creation and deletion","Managing file share access and permissions","Integrating Azure Storage with Python applications"],"zh":["自动化文件共享创建和删除","管理文件共享访问和权限","将 Azure 存储与 Python 应用程序集成"],"ja":["ファイル共有の作成と削除の自動化","ファイル共有へのアクセスとアクセス許可の管理","Azure Storage と Python アプリケーションの統合"],"ko":["파일 공유 생성 및 삭제 자동화","파일 공유 접근 및 권한 관리","Azure 스토리지와 Python 애플리케이션 통합"],"es":["Automatizar la creación y eliminación de recursos compartidos de archivos","Administrar el acceso y permisos de recursos compartidos de archivos","Integrar Azure Storage con aplicaciones de Python"],"fr":["Automatiser la création et la suppression de partages de fichiers","Gérer l''accès et les autorisations de partage de fichiers","Intégrer Azure Storage avec des applications Python"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung und Löschung von Dateifreigaben","Verwalten des Zugriffs und der Berechtigungen für Dateifreigaben","Integrieren von Azure Storage in Python-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação e exclusão de compartilhamentos de arquivos","Gerenciar o acesso e permissões de compartilhamento de arquivos","Integrar o Armazenamento do Azure com aplicações Python"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание и удаление общих папок файлов","Управлять доступом и разрешениями общих папок файлов","Интегрировать хранилище Azure с приложениями Python"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء وحذف مشاركة الملفات","إدارة الوصول وأذونات مشاركة الملفات","دمج تخزين Azure مع تطبيقات Python"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Storage account credentials","Python 3.x compatibility required","Dependent on azure-storage-file-share library installation"],"zh":["需要 Azure 存储帐户凭据","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性","依赖于 azure-storage-file-share 库安装"],"ja":["Azure Storage アカウントの資格情報が必要","Python 3.x との互換性が必要","azure-storage-file-share ライブラリのインストールに依存"],"ko":["Azure 스토리지 계정 자격 증명이 필요","Python 3.x 호환성이 필요","azure-storage-file-share 라이브러리 설치에 의존"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de cuenta de Azure Storage","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x","Dependiente de la instalación de la biblioteca azure-storage-file-share"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification de compte de stockage Azure","La compatibilité Python 3.x est requise","Dépend de l''installation de la bibliothèque azure-storage-file-share"],"de":["Benötigt Azure Storage-Konten-Anmeldeinformationen","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Abhängig von der Installation der Bibliothek azure-storage-file-share"],"pt":["Requer credenciais da conta de armazenamento do Azure","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária","Dependente da instalação da biblioteca azure-storage-file-share"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных учетной записи хранилища Azure","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x","Зависит от установки библиотеки azure-storage-file-share"],"ar":["يتطلب أوراق اعتماد حساب تخزين Azure","مطلوب توافق مع Python 3.x","يعتمد على تثبيت مكتبة azure-storage-file-share"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
