atibilidad con .NET","Voz en tiempo real","Asistentes de voz bidireccionales","Integración con Azure AI","Captura y reproducción de audio con NAudio"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec .NET","Voix en temps réel","Assistants vocaux bidirectionnels","Intégration avec Azure AI","Capture et lecture audio avec NAudio"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit .NET","Echtzeit-Sprachfunktion","Bidirektionale Sprachassistenten","Integration mit Azure AI","Audio-Aufnahme und -Wiedergabe mit NAudio"],"pt":["SDK de voz em tempo real","Assistentes de voz bidirecionais","Captura e reprodução de áudio","Integração com Azure AI","Suporte a versões estáveis e de visualização"],"ru":["Реальное время SDK голоса","Двусторонние голосовые помощники","Захват и воспроизведение аудио","Интеграция с Azure AI","Поддержка стабильных и предварительных версий"],"ar":["إطار عمل SDK الصوت في الوقت الفعلي","مساعدين صوتيين ثنائيي الاتجاه","التقاط و تشغيل الصوت","التكامل مع Azure AI","دعم الإصدارات المستقرة و المعاينة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Azure AI","Voice AI","GPT-4","NAudio",".NET","AI"],"ja":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Azure AI","Voice AI","GPT-4","NAudio",".NET","AI"],"ko":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Azure AI","Voice AI","GPT-4","NAudio",".NET","AI"],"es":["Azure AI","SDK de voz en tiempo real","Desarrollo de asistentes de voz",".NET","Voz en tiempo real","Asistentes de voz bidireccionales","Azure AI VoiceLive"],"fr":["Azure AI","SDK de voix en temps réel","Développement d''assistants vocaux",".NET","Voix en temps réel","Assistants vocaux bidirectionnels","Azure AI VoiceLive"],"de":["Azure AI","Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK","Entwicklung von Sprachassistenten",".NET","Echtzeit-Sprachfunktion","Bidirektionale Sprachassistenten","Azure AI VoiceLive"],"pt":["Azure AI VoiceLive .NET","SDK de voz em tempo real","Assistentes de voz","Desenvolvimento de voz","Azure AI","Captura de áudio","Reprodução de áudio"],"ru":["Azure AI VoiceLive .NET","Реальное время SDK голоса","Голосовые помощники","Разработка голоса","Azure AI","Захват аудио","Воспроизведение аудио"],"ar":["Azure AI VoiceLive .NET","إطار عمل SDK الصوت في الوقت الفعلي","مساعدين صوتيين","تطوير الصوت","Azure AI","التقاط الصوت","تشغيل الصوت"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-ai-voicelive-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE","body":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_VOICE=en-US-AvaNeural\n# Optional: API key if not using Entra ID\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_API_KEY=<your-api-key>\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Microsoft Entra ID (Recommended)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nDefaultAzureCredential credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n**Required Role**: `Cognitive Services User` (assign in Azure Portal → Access control)\n\n### API Key\n\n```csharp\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nAzureKeyCredential credential = new AzureKeyCredential(\"your-api-key\");\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n## Client Hierarchy\n\n```\nVoiceLiveClient\n└── VoiceLiveSession (WebSocket connection)\n    ├── ConfigureSessionAsync()\n    ├── GetUpdatesAsync() → SessionUpdate events\n    ├── AddItemAsync() → UserMessageItem, FunctionCallOutputItem\n    ├── SendAudioAsync()\n    └── StartResponseAsync()\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Start Session and Configure\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nvar endpoint = new Uri(Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"AZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT\"));\nvar client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\nvar model = \"gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview\";\n\n// Start session\nusing VoiceLiveSession session = await client.StartSessionAsync(model);\n\n// Configure session\nVoiceLiveSessionOptions sessionOptions = new()\n{\n    Model = model,\n    Instructions = \"You are a helpful AI assistant. Respond naturally.\",\n    Voice = new AzureStandardVoice(\"en-US-AvaNeural\"),\n    TurnDetection = new AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection()\n    {\n        Threshold = 0.5f,\n        PrefixPadding = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(300),\n        SilenceDuration = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(500)\n    },\n    InputAudioFormat = InputAudioFormat.Pcm16,\n    OutputAudioFormat = OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16\n};\n\n// Set modalities (both text and audio for voice assistants)\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Clear();\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Text);\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Audio);\n\nawait session.ConfigureSessionAsync(sessionOptions);\n```\n\n### 2. Process Events\n\n```csharp\nawait foreach (SessionUpdate serverEvent in session.GetUpdatesAsync())\n{\n    switch (serverEvent)\n    {\n        case SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta audioDelta:\n            byte[] audioData = audioDelta.Delta.ToArray();\n            // Play audio via NAudio or other audio library\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta textDelta:\n            Console.Write(textDelta.Delta);\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall:\n            // Handle function call (see Function Calling section)\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateError error:\n            Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseDone:\n            Console.WriteLine(\"\\n--- Response complete ---\");\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Send User Message\n\n```csharp\nawait session.AddItemAsync(new UserMessageItem(\"Hello, can you help me?\"));\nawait session.StartResponseAsync();\n```\n\n### 4. Function Calling\n\n```csharp\n// Define function\nvar weatherFunction = new VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition(\"get_current_weather\")\n{\n    Description = \"Get the current weather for a given location\",\n    Parameters = BinaryData.FromString(\"\"\"\n        {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"location\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"The city and state or country\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\"location\"]\n        }\n        \"\"\")\n};\n\n// Add to session options\nsessionOptions.Tools.Add(weatherFunction);\n\n// Handle function call in event loop\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall)\n{\n    if (functionCall.Name == \"get_current_weather\")\n    {\n        var parameters = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, string>>(functionCall.Arguments);\n        string location = parameters?[\"location\"] ?? \"\";\n        \n        // Call external service\n        string weatherInfo = $\"The weather in {location} is sunny, 75°F.\";\n        \n        // Send response\n        await session.AddItemAsync(new FunctionCallOutputItem(functionCall.CallId, weatherInfo));\n        await session.StartResponseAsync();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Voice Options\n\n| Voice Type | Class | Example |\n|------------|-------|---------|\n| Azure Standard | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-AvaNeural\"` |\n| Azure HD | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-Ava:DragonHDLatestNeural\"` |\n| Azure Custom | `AzureCustomVoice` | Custom voice with endpoint ID |\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Model | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `gpt-4o-realtime-preview` | GPT-4o with real-time audio |\n| `gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview` | Lightweight, fast interactions |\n| `phi4-mm-realtime` | Cost-effective multimodal |\n\n## Key Types Reference\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `VoiceLiveClient` | Main client for creating sessions |\n| `VoiceLiveSession` | Active WebSocket session |\n| `VoiceLiveSessionOptions` | Session configuration |\n| `AzureStandardVoice` | Standard Azure voice provider |\n| `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection` | Voice activity detection |\n| `VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition` | Function tool definition |\n| `UserMessageItem` | User text message |\n| `FunctionCallOutputItem` | Function call response |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta` | Audio chunk event |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta` | Text chunk event |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always set both modalities** — Include `Text` and `Audio` for voice assistants\n2. **Use `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection`** — Provides natural conversation flow\n3. **Configure appropriate silence duration** — 500ms typical to avoid premature cutoffs\n4. **Use `using` statement** — Ensures proper session disposal\n5. **Handle all event types** — Check for errors, audio, text, and function calls\n6. **Use DefaultAzureCredential** — Never hardcode API keys\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateError error)\n{\n    if (error.Error.Message.Contains(\"Cancellation failed: no active response\"))\n    {\n        // Benign error, can ignore\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Audio Configuration\n\n- **Input Format**: `InputAudioFormat.Pcm16` (16-bit PCM)\n- **Output Format**: `OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16`\n- **Sample Rate**: 24kHz recommended\n- **Channels**: Mono\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.AI.VoiceLive` | Real-time voice (this SDK) | `dotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive` |\n| `Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` | Speech-to-text, text-to-speech | `dotnet add package Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` |\n| `NAudio` | Audio capture/playback | `dotnet add package NAudio` |\n\n## Reference Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| NuGet Package | https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| API Reference | https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.ai.voicelive |\n| GitHub Source | https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/tree/main/sdk/ai/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| Quickstart | https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/speech-service/voice-live-quickstart |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:17:26.780Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Voice Assistant Agents requiring real-time voice AI capabilities with Azure AI and .NET integration.","zh":"Ideal for Voice Assistant Agents requiring real-time voice AI capabilities with Azure AI and .NET integration.","ja":"Ideal for Voice Assistant Agents requiring real-time voice AI capabilities with Azure AI and .NET integration.","ko":"Ideal for Voice Assistant Agents requiring real-time voice AI capabilities with Azure AI and .NET integration.","es":"Ideal para agentes de asistentes de voz que requieren capacidades de voz de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real con integración de Azure AI y .NET.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assistants vocaux nécessitant des capacités de voix d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel avec une intégration Azure AI et .NET.","de":"Ideal für Sprachassistenten-Agenten, die Echtzeit-Sprach-KI-Fähigkeiten mit Azure-KI- und .NET-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Assistente de Voz que exigem capacidades de IA de voz em tempo real com integração do Azure AI e .NET.","ru":"Идеально для агентов голосовых помощников, требующих возможностей голосовой ИИ в реальном времени с интеграцией Azure AI и .NET.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مساعد الصوت الذي يتطلب قدرات الاصطناع الاصطلاحي للصوت في الوقت الفعلي مع دمج Azure AI و .NET."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build bidirectional voice assistants using Azure.AI.VoiceLive, leveraging real-time voice AI SDK with Azure Identity for secure authentication and NAudio for seamless audio capture and playback.","zh":"Empowers agents to build bidirectional voice assistants using Azure.AI.VoiceLive, leveraging real-time voice AI SDK with Azure Identity for secure authentication and NAudio for seamless audio capture and playback.","ja":"Empowers agents to build bidirectional voice assistants using Azure.AI.VoiceLive, leveraging real-time voice AI SDK with Azure Identity for secure authentication and NAudio for seamless audio capture and playback.","ko":"Empowers agents to build bidirectional voice assistants using Azure.AI.VoiceLive, leveraging real-time voice AI SDK with Azure Identity for secure authentication and NAudio for seamless audio capture and playback.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear asistentes de voz bidireccionales utilizando Azure.AI.VoiceLive, aprovechando el SDK de voz de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real con Azure Identity para autenticación segura y NAudio para captura y reproducción de audio sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des assistants vocaux bidirectionnels en utilisant Azure.AI.VoiceLive, en exploitant le SDK de voix d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel avec Azure Identity pour une authentification sécurisée et NAudio pour une capture et une lecture audio sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bidirektionale Sprachassistenten mit Azure.AI.VoiceLive zu erstellen, indem sie das Echtzeit-Sprach-KI-SDK mit Azure Identity für sichere Authentifizierung und NAudio für nahtlose Audioaufnahme und -wiedergabe nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir assistentes de voz bidirecionais usando Azure.AI.VoiceLive, aproveitando o SDK de IA de voz em tempo real com Azure Identity para autenticação segura e NAudio para captura e reprodução de áudio sem interrupção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать двунаправленные голосовые помощники, используя Azure.AI.VoiceLive, используя SDK голосовой ИИ в реальном времени с Azure Identity для безопасной аутентификации и NAudio для бесперебойной записи и воспроизведения аудио.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء مساعدين صوتيين ثنائي الاتجاه باستخدام Azure.AI.VoiceLive، واستخدام SDK الاصطناع الاصطلاحي للصوت في الوقت الفعلي مع Azure Identity للتحقق من الهوية بشكل آمن و NAudio للقبض والتشغيل الصوتي بدون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing voice-controlled interfaces with Azure AI","Integrating real-time voice AI into .NET applications","Building conversational voice assistants with gpt-4o-realtime-preview models"],"zh":["Developing voice-controlled interfaces with Azure AI","Integrating real-time voice AI into .NET applications","Building conversational voice assistants with gpt-4o-realtime-preview models"],"ja":["Developing voice-controlled interfaces with Azure AI","Integrating real-time voice AI into .NET applications","Building conversational voice assistants with gpt-4o-realtime-preview models"],"ko":["Developing voice-controlled interfaces with Azure AI","Integrating real-time voice AI into .NET applications","Building conversational voice assistants with gpt-4o-realtime-preview models"],"es":["Desarrollar interfaces de control de voz con Azure AI","Integrar la inteligencia artificial de voz en tiempo real en aplicaciones .NET","Crear asistentes de voz conversacionales con modelos gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"fr":["Développer des interfaces de contrôle vocal avec Azure AI","Intégrer l''intelligence artificielle vocale en temps réel dans les applications .NET","Créer des assistants vocaux conversationnels avec des modèles gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"de":["Entwicklung von sprachgesteuerten Schnittstellen mit Azure KI","Integration von Echtzeit-Sprach-KI in .NET-Anwendungen","Erstellung von konversationellen Sprachassistenten mit gpt-4o-realtime-preview-Modellen"],"pt":["Desenvolver interfaces controladas por voz com Azure AI","Integrar IA de voz em tempo real em aplicações .NET","Construir assistentes de voz conversacionais com modelos gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"ru":["Разработка голосовых интерфейсов с помощью Azure AI","Интеграция голосовой ИИ в реальном времени в приложениях .NET","Создание разговорных голосовых помощников с моделями gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات تحكم صوتية مع Azure AI","دمج الاصطناع الاصطلاحي للصوت في الوقت الفعلي في تطبيقات .NET","بناء مساعدين صوتيين محادثين مع نماذج gpt-4o-realtime-preview"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT environment variable setup","Needs Azure Identity and NAudio packages for full functionality","Compatible with .NET, specific versions may have limitations"],"zh":["Requires Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT environment variable setup","Needs Azure Identity and NAudio packages for full functionality","Compatible with .NET, specific versions may have limitations"],"ja":["Requires Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT environment variable setup","Needs Azure Identity and NAudio packages for full functionality","Compatible with .NET, specific versions may have limitations"],"ko":["Requires Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT environment variable setup","Needs Azure Identity and NAudio packages for full functionality","Compatible with .NET, specific versions may have limitations"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de la variable de entorno Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Necesita los paquetes Azure Identity y NAudio para la funcionalidad completa","Compatible con .NET, versiones específicas pueden tener limitaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de la variable d''environnement Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Nécessite les packages Azure Identity et NAudio pour la fonctionnalité complète","Compatible avec .NET, des versions spécifiques peuvent avoir des limitations"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung der Umgebungsvariable Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Benötigt die Pakete Azure Identity und NAudio für die vollständige Funktionalität","Kompatibel mit .NET, spezifische Versionen können Einschränkungen haben"],"pt":["Requer configuração da variável de ambiente Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Necessita de pacotes Azure Identity e NAudio para funcionalidade completa","Compatível com .NET, versões específicas podem ter limitações"],"ru":["Требует настройки переменной среды Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Требует пакетов Azure Identity и NAudio для полной функциональности","Совместимо с .NET, определенные версии могут иметь ограничения"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد متغير بيئة Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","يحتاج إلى حزم Azure Identity و NAudio للوظائف الكاملة","متوافق مع .NET، قد يكون هناك قيود على الإصدارات المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
