بحث: تحسين أداء البحث","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEO 审计技能帮助您识别网站的 SEO 问题并提供改进建议，以提高搜索引擎排名和用户体验","ja":"SEO オーディットスキルは、ウェブサイトの SEO 問題を特定し、検索エンジンランキングとユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるための改善提案を提供します","ko":"SEO 감사 스킬은 웹사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 검색 엔진 순위와 사용자 경험을 개선하는 위한 개선 제안을 제공합니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica. Proporciona recomendaciones para optimizar el sitio web","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche organique. Il fournit des recommandations pour optimiser le site web","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und der Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung. Es liefert Empfehlungen zur Optimierung der Website","pt":"A auditoria de SEO é um processo que identifica problemas de SEO e fornece recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс, который выявляет проблемы SEO и предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска","ar":"فحص تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية تحدد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقدم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي","en":"Marketing skills for Claude Code and AI agents. CRO, copywriting, SEO, analytics, and growth engineering."},"definition":{"en":"Marketing skills for Claude Code and AI agents. CRO, copywriting, SEO, analytics, and growth engineering."},"features":{"zh":["网站结构分析","关键词研究","内容优化","技术 SEO 审计","性能优化"],"ja":["ウェブサイト構造分析","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化","テクニカル SEO オーディット","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["웹사이트 구조 분석","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화","기술 SEO 감사","성능 최적화"],"es":["Análisis de contexto del sitio","Identificación de problemas de SEO","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento","Optimización de la estructura del sitio","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Analyse du contexte du site","Identification des problèmes de SEO","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances","Optimisation de la structure du site","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Analyse des Kontexts der Website","Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Leistung","Optimierung der Website-Struktur","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de SEO","Análise de desempenho de busca orgânica","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de site context","Verificação de marketing de produto"],"ru":["Выявление проблем SEO","Анализ результатов поиска","Рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска","Анализ контекста сайта","Проверка маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل أداء البحث العضوي","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل سياق الموقع","التحقق من تسويق المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站优化","关键词研究","内容优化","技术 SEO"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト最適化","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化","テクニカル SEO"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 최적화","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화","기술 SEO"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora de rendimiento","recomendaciones de SEO","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site web","amélioration des performances","recommandations SEO","expérience utilisateur","développement web"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Website-Optimierung","Leistungsverbesserung","SEO-Empfehlungen","Benutzererfahrung","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["auditoria de SEO","otimização de SEO","desempenho de busca orgânica","marketing de produto","análise de site","recomendações de SEO"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация SEO","результаты поиска","маркетинг продукта","анализ сайта","рекомендации SEO"],"ar":["فحص تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين محركات البحث","أداء البحث العضوي","تسويق المنتج","تحليل الموقع","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"coreyhaines31","repo":"marketingskills","repoPath":"coreyhaines31/marketingskills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:17:40.105Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 SEO 分析和优化能力的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析と最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan análisis y capacidades de optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التسويق التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context analysis, product marketing context, and growth engineering strategies, leveraging technologies like analytics and CRO.","zh":"赋予代理商通过网站上下文分析、产品营销上下文和增长工程策略等手段识别SEO问题并提供可行建议的能力，利用分析和CRO等技术。","ja":"サイトコンテキスト分析、製品マーケティングコンテキスト、成長エンジニアリング戦略などの技術を利用して、SEOの問題を特定し、実行可能な推奨事項を提供するエージェントをEmpowerする。","ko":"사이트 컨텍스트 분석, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트, 성장 엔지니어링 전략 등을 활용하여 SEO 문제를 식별하고 실행 가능한 추천을 제공하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones acciones utilizando el análisis de contexto del sitio, el contexto de marketing de productos y las estrategias de ingeniería de crecimiento, aprovechando tecnologías como analítica y CRO.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant l''analyse de contexte du site, le contexte de marketing de produits et les stratégies d''ingénierie de croissance, en exploitant des technologies comme l''analyse et la CRO.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen unter Verwendung der Analyse des Seitenkontexts, des Produktmarketings-Kontexts und der Wachstumsingenieurstrategien zu geben, indem Technologien wie Analytik und CRO genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando análise de contexto do site, contexto de marketing de produtos e estratégias de engenharia de crescimento, aproveitando tecnologias como análise e CRO.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с использованием анализа контекста сайта, контекста продуктивного маркетинга и стратегий инженерии роста, используя технологии như аналитика и CRO.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تحليل سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج و استراتيجيات هندسة النمو، واستخدام تقنيات مثل التحليل وتحسين نسبة التحويل."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating actionable recommendations for improvement","Analyzing site context for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成可行的改进建议","分析网站上下文以寻找优化机会"],"ja":["WebサイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","改善のための実行可能な推奨事項を生成する","最適化の機会を探すためのサイトコンテキストを分析する"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능 감사","개선 위한 실행 가능한 추천 생성","최적화 기회를 찾아 사이트 컨텍스트 분석"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones acciones para la mejora","Análisis del contexto del sitio para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Audit des performances de SEO du site web","Génération de recommandations actionnables pour l''amélioration","Analyse du contexte du site pour les opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Prüfung der SEO-Leistung der Website","Erzeugung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen für die Verbesserung","Analyse des Seitenkontexts für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações eficazes para melhoria","Análise do contexto do site para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация действенных рекомендаций для улучшения","Анализ контекста сайта для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["فحص أداء تحسين محركات البحث للموقع","توليد توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين الأداء","تحليل سياق الموقع لفرص تحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Limited to organic search performance optimization"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文信息","仅限于有机搜索性能优化"],"ja":["サイトコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","有機検索パフォーマンスの最適化のみ"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","유기적 검색 성능 최적화에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información de contexto del sitio","Limitado a la optimización del rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''information de contexte du site","Limité à l''optimisation des performances de recherche organique"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Informationen des Seitenkontexts","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der organischen Suchleistung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a informações de contexto do site","Limitado à otimização do desempenho de pesquisa orgânica"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта","Ограничен оптимизацией производительности органического поиска"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","محدود بتحسين أداء البحث العضوي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
