orar la eficacia de los popups","Integración con herramientas de marketing y analytics"],"fr":["Optimisation de popups pour améliorer la conversion","Techniques de CRO pour développeurs","Création de popups qui n''agacent pas les utilisateurs","Analyse de données pour améliorer l''efficacité des popups","Intégration avec des outils de marketing et d''analyse"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups, um die Konvertierung zu verbessern","CRO-Techniken für Entwickler","Erstellung von Popups, die Benutzer nicht stören","Datenanalyse, um die Effektivität von Popups zu verbessern","Integration mit Marketing- und Analyse-Tools"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Criação de popups personalizados","Análise de desempenho de popups","Integração com ferramentas de marketing","Melhorias de UX para popups"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Анализ производительности попапов","Интеграция с маркетинговыми инструментами","Улучшение UX для попапов"],"ar":["تحسين پنجات النافذة للتحويل","إنشاء پنجات نافذة مخصصة","تحليل أداء پنجات النافذة","التكامل مع أدوات التسويق","تحسين UX لپنجات النافذة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹出式转化率优化","模态窗口设计","转化率优化","用户体验优化","A/B测试","弹出式设计","模态窗口优化"],"ja":["ポップアップコンバージョン率最適化","モーダルウィンドウデザイン","コンバージョン率最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化","A/Bテスト","ポップアップデザイン","モーダルウィンドウ最適化"],"ko":["팝업 전환율 최적화","모달 창 디자인","전환율 최적화","사용자 경험 최적화","A/B 테스트","팝업 디자인","모달 창 최적화"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","CRO para desarrolladores","marketing de popups","análisis de datos de popups","integración de herramientas de marketing"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation de popups","CRO pour développeurs","marketing de popups","analyse de données de popups","intégration d''outils de marketing"],"de":["Popup-CRO","Optimierung von Popups","CRO für Entwickler","Marketing von Popups","Datenanalyse von Popups","Integration von Marketing-Tools"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popups","conversão de popups","desenvolvedores de marketing","ferramentas de marketing","análise de desempenho"],"ru":["попап CRO","оптимизация попапов","конверсия попапов","разработчики маркетинга","маркетинговые инструменты","анализ производительности"],"ar":["پنجات النافذة CRO","تحسين پنجات النافذة","تحويل پنجات النافذة","مطورو التسويق","أدوات التسويق","تحليل الأداء"]}},"owner":"coreyhaines31","repo":"marketingskills","repoPath":"coreyhaines31/marketingskills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:18:04.844Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced popup and modal optimization capabilities for CRO and SEO.","zh":"非常适合需要高级弹出窗口和模态优化功能的营销代理，以提高转化率优化（CRO）和搜索引擎优化（SEO）","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なポップアップとモーダル最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。CROとSEOの機能を向上させます","ko":"마케팅 에이전트가 고급 팝업 및 모달 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. CRO 및 SEO 기능을 향상시킵니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales para CRO y SEO.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et modales pour CRO et SEO.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Popup- und Modal-Optimierungsfunktionen für CRO und SEO benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de popups e modais para CRO e SEO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон для CRO и SEO.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التسويق التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين النافذة المنبثقة و Modal لتحسين تحويلات و تحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-converting popups using modal optimization techniques, leveraging product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and technical keywords like CRO, copywriting, and analytics to enhance brand perception without annoying users.","zh":"赋予代理创建高转化率弹出窗口的能力，使用模态优化技术，利用`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`中的产品营销背景和技术关键词，如CRO、文案撰写和分析来增强品牌认知而不打扰用户","ja":"エージェントが、高い轉換率のポップアップを作成する能力を与えます。モーダル最適化技術を使用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`からの製品マーケティングコンテキストと、CRO、コピーライティング、分析などの技術キーワードを利用して、ユーザーを邪魔せずにブランド認知を高めます","ko":"에이전트가 높은 전환률의 팝업을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 모달 최적화 기술을 사용하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트와 기술 키워드인 CRO, 복사 작성 및 분석을 활용하여 사용자를 방해하지 않고 브랜드 인식을 향상시킵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes de alta conversión utilizando técnicas de optimización de modales, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y palabras clave técnicas como CRO, redacción publicitaria y análisis para mejorar la percepción de la marca sin molestar a los usuarios.","fr":"Autorise les agents à créer des fenêtres contextuelles à forte conversion en utilisant des techniques d''optimisation de modales, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et des mots-clés techniques tels que CRO, copie publicitaire et analyse pour améliorer la perception de la marque sans déranger les utilisateurs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Popups mit hoher Konvertierungsrate zu erstellen, indem sie Modal-Optimierungstechniken verwenden, die den Produktmarketing-Kontext von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` und technische Schlüsselwörter wie CRO, Werbetext und Analyse nutzen, um die Markenwahrnehmung zu verbessern, ohne Benutzer zu stören.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem popups de alta conversão usando técnicas de otimização de modais, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e palavras-chave técnicas como CRO, redação publicitária e análise para melhorar a percepção da marca sem irritar os usuários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокоэффективные всплывающие окна с помощью методов оптимизации модальных окон, используя контекст маркетинга продукта из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и технические ключевые слова, такие как CRO, копирайтинг и анализ, чтобы повысить восприятие бренда без раздражения пользователей.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء نافذة منبثقة عالية التحويل باستخدام تقنيات تحسين Modal ، واستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` والمفاهيم الفنية مثل CRO وكتابة الإعلانات والتحليل لتعزيز تصور العلامة التجارية دون إزعاج المستخدمين."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing email/newsletter capture popups for maximum conversion","Generating data-driven copywriting for effective popup messaging","Analyzing user behavior to inform growth engineering strategies"],"zh":["优化电子邮件/新闻稿弹出窗口以实现最大转化率","生成数据驱动的文案撰写以实现有效的弹出消息传递","分析用户行为以指导增长工程策略"],"ja":["電子メール/ニュースレターのポップアップを最大の転換率で最適化する","効果的なポップアップメッセージングのためのデータ駆動型コピーライティングを生成する","成長エンジニアリング戦略に情報を提供するためのユーザーの行動を分析する"],"ko":["전자우편/뉴스레터 팝업을 최대 전환률로 최적화합니다","효과적인 팝업 메시지 전달을 위한 데이터驱리븐 복사 작성 생성","성장 엔지니어링 전략에 정보를 제공하기 위한 사용자 행동 분석"],"es":["Optimización de ventanas emergentes de captura de correo electrónico / boletín para una conversión máxima","Generación de redacción publicitaria basada en datos para mensajes de ventanas emergentes efectivos","Análisis del comportamiento del usuario para informar las estrategias de ingeniería de crecimiento"],"fr":["Optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles de capture d''e-mail / newsletter pour une conversion maximale","Génération de copie publicitaire basée sur des données pour des messages de fenêtres contextuelles efficaces","Analyse du comportement de l''utilisateur pour éclairer les stratégies d''ingénierie de croissance"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups zur E-Mail-/Newsletter-Erfassung für eine maximale Konvertierung","Erstellung von datengetriebener Werbetext für effektive Popup-Mitteilungen","Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens, um Wachstumsingenieurstategien zu unterstützen"],"pt":["Otimização de popups de captura de email / boletim para máximo conversão","Geração de redação publicitária baseada em dados para mensagens de popup eficazes","Análise do comportamento do usuário para informar estratégias de engenharia de crescimento"],"ru":["Оптимизация всплывающих окон для захвата электронной почты / новостей для максимального преобразования","Генерация копирайтинга на основе данных для эффективных сообщений всплывающих окон","Анализ поведения пользователей для информирования стратегий роста инженерии"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة لتحقيق أقصى تحويل من خلال البريد الإلكتروني / النشرة الإخبارية","إنشاء نص إعلاني مبني على البيانات لرسائل نافذة منبثقة فعالة","تحليل سلوك المستخدم لتحديد استراتيجيات هندسة النمو"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for optimal performance","Dependent on accurate popup purpose definition, such as email/newsletter capture"],"zh":["需要`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`中的产品营销背景以实现最佳性能","依赖于准确的弹出窗口目的定义，例如电子邮件/新闻稿捕获"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するには、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`からの製品マーケティングコンテキストが必要です","ポップアップの目的の定義が正確であること、たとえば電子メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャなどに依存しています"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트가 필요합니다","팝업 목적의 정의가 정확해야 하며, 예를 들어 전자우편/뉴스레터 캡처 등에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para un rendimiento óptimo","Dependiente de una definición precisa del propósito de la ventana emergente, como la captura de correo electrónico / boletín"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour des performances optimales","Dépend d''une définition précise de l''objectif de la fenêtre contextuelle, telle que la capture d''e-mail / newsletter"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für optimale Leistung","Abhängig von einer genauen Definition des Zwecks des Popups, wie z.B. der Erfassung von E-Mail-/Newsletter-Adressen"],"pt":["Requer contexto de marketing de produtos de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para desempenho ótimo","Dependente de definição precisa do propósito do popup, como captura de email / boletim"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукта из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для оптимальной производительности","Зависит от точного определения цели всплывающего окна, например, захвата электронной почты / новостей"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لأداء مثالي","يعتمد على تعريف دقيق لغرض نافذة منبثقة، مثل 捕获 البريد الإلكتروني / النشرة الإخبارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills/context-management-context-save', 'community', 'sickn33', 'antigravity-awesome-skills', 'sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills', 'context-management-context-save', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z', '2026-02-18T02:18:13.200Z', NULL, '{"id":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills/context-management-context-save","name":"context-management-context-save","description":{"zh":"Context Save 工具是为开发者提供的上下文管理解决方案，帮助开发者高效管理上下文","ja":"Context Save ツールは開発者向けのコンテキスト管理ソリューションであり、開発者が効率的にコンテキストを管理できるように支援","ko":"컨텍스트 저장 도구는 개발자를 위한 컨텍스트 관리 솔루션으로, 개발자가 효율적으로 컨텍스트를 관리할 수 있도록 지원","es":"La herramienta de contexto es un especialista en gestión de contexto que ayuda a mejorar los flujos de trabajo. Aprende a utilizarla para tus tareas de gestión de contexto","fr":"L''outil de contexte est un spécialiste de la gestion de contexte qui aide à améliorer les flux de travail. Apprenez à l''utiliser pour vos tâches de gestion de contexte","de":"Das Kontext-Tool ist ein Spezialist für die Kontextverwaltung, der bei der Verbesserung der Arbeitsabläufe hilft. Lernen Sie, wie Sie es für Ihre Kontextverwaltungsaufgaben verwenden","pt":"A ferramenta de salvar contexto inteligente é uma habilidade de gerenciamento de contexto que ajuda a melhorar a produtividade. Ela fornece orientação e práticas recomendadas para tarefas de gerenciamento de contexto.","ru":"Интеллектуальный инструмент сохранения контекста является способностью управления контекстом, которая помогает повысить производительность. Он предоставляет руководство и рекомендованные практики для задач управления контекстом.","ar":"أداة حفظ السياق الذكية هي قدرة إدارة سياق تساعد على تحسين الإنتاجية. توفر إرشادات وأفضل الممارسات للtasks إدارة السياق.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"上下文管理专家： Context Save 工具","ja":"コンテキスト管理スペシャリスト：Context Save ツール","ko":"컨텍스트 관리 전문가：컨텍스트 저장 도구","es":"Herramienta de contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto","fr":"Outil de contexte: spécialiste de gestion de contexte","de":"Kontext-Tool: Spezialist für Kontextverwaltung","pt":"Gerenciamento de Contexto: Ferramenta de Salvar Contexto ...","ru":"Управление контекстом: Интеллектуальный инструмент сохран...","ar":"إدارة السياق: أداة حفظ السياق الذكية","en":"context-management-context-save"},"description":{"zh":"Context Save 工具是为开发者提供的上下文管理解决方案，帮助开发者高效管理上下文","ja":"Context Save ツールは開発者向けのコンテキスト管理ソリューションであり、開発者が効率的にコンテキストを管理できるように支援","ko":"컨텍스트 저장 도구는 개발자를 위한 컨텍스트 관리 솔루션으로, 개발자가 효율적으로 컨텍스트를 관리할 수 있도록 지원","es":"La herramienta de contexto es un especialista en gestión de contexto que ayuda a mejorar los flujos de trabajo. Aprende a utilizarla para tus tareas de gesti...","fr":"L''outil de contexte est un spécialiste de la gestion de contexte qui aide à améliorer les flux de travail. Apprenez à l''utiliser pour vos tâches de gestion d...","de":"Das Kontext-Tool ist ein Spezialist für die Kontextverwaltung, der bei der Verbesserung der Arbeitsabläufe hilft. Lernen Sie, wie Sie es für Ihre Kontextverw...","pt":"A ferramenta de salvar contexto inteligente é uma habilidade de gerenciamento de contexto que ajuda a melhorar a produtividade. Ela fornece orientação e prát...","ru":"Интеллектуальный инструмент сохранения контекста является способностью управления контекстом, которая помогает повысить производительность. Он предоставляет ...","ar":"أداة حفظ السياق الذكية هي قدرة إدارة سياق تساعد على تحسين الإنتاجية. توفر إرشادات وأفضل الممارسات للtasks إدارة السياق.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official sk..."},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["高效的上下文管理","智能的上下文保存","开发者友好的界面","支持多种开发语言","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["効率的なコンテキスト管理","智能的なコンテキスト保存","開発者向けのインターフェース","複数の開発言語をサポート","簡単な統合と拡張"],"ko":["효율적인 컨텍스트 관리","지능적인 컨텍스트 저장","개발자 친화적인 인터페이스","다중 개발 언어 지원","쉽게 통합 및 확장"],"es":["Gestión de contexto avanzada","Herramienta de contexto para especialistas","Mejora de los flujos de trabajo","Compatibilidad con Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor","Colección de 800+ habilidades de agente"],"fr":["Gestion de contexte avancée","Outil de contexte pour les spécialistes","Amélioration des flux de travail","Compatibilité avec Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor","Collection de 800+ compétences d''agent"],"de":["Erweiterte Kontextverwaltung","Kontext-Tool für Spezialisten","Verbesserung der Arbeitsabläufe","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor","Sammlung von 800+ Agentenfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas de gerenciamento de contexto","Práticas recomendadas para gerenciamento de contexto","Ferramenta de salvar contexto inteligente","Melhoria da produtividade","Gerenciamento de contexto eficaz"],"ru":["Руководство для задач управления контекстом","Рекомендованные практики для управления контекстом","Интеллектуальный инструмент сохранения контекста","Повышение производительности","Эффективное управление контекстом"],"ar":["الإرشاد للمهام إدارة السياق","أفضل الممارسات لإدارة السياق","أداة حفظ السياق الذكية","تحسين الإنتاجية","إدارة سياق فعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文管理","Context Save","软件开发","开发者工具","效率管理","智能保存"],"ja":["コンテキスト管理","Context Save","ソフトウェア開発","開発者ツール","効率管理","智能保存"],"ko":["컨텍스트 관리","컨텍스트 저장","소프트웨어 개발","개발자 도구","효율 관리","지능형 저장"],"es":["herramienta de contexto","gestión de contexto","especialista en gestión de contexto","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","desarrollo de software","gestión de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["outil de contexte","gestion de contexte","spécialiste de la gestion de contexte","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","développement de logiciels","gestion de flux de travail"],"de":["Kontext-Tool","Kontextverwaltung","Spezialist für Kontextverwaltung","Claude Code","Antigravity","Cursor","Softwareentwicklung","Arbeitsablaufverwaltung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de contexto","ferramenta de salvar contexto","inteligente","produtividade","tarefas de gerenciamento de contexto","práticas recomendadas","orientação"],"ru":["управление контекстом","инструмент сохранения контекста","интеллектуальный","производительность","задачи управления контекстом","рекомендованные практики","руководство"],"ar":["إدارة السياق","أداة حفظ السياق","ذكية","الإنتاجية","مهام إدارة السياق","أفضل الممارسات","الإرشاد"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-management-context-save","description":"Use when working with context management context save","bodyPreview":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify","body":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Role and Purpose\nAn elite context engineering specialist focused on comprehensive, semantic, and dynamically adaptable context preservation across AI workflows. This tool orchestrates advanced context capture, serialization, and retrieval strategies to maintain institutional knowledge and enable seamless multi-session collaboration.\n\n## Context Management Overview\nThe Context Save Tool is a sophisticated context engineering solution designed to:\n- Capture comprehensive project state and knowledge\n- Enable semantic context retrieval\n- Support multi-agent workflow coordination\n- Preserve architectural decisions and project evolution\n- Facilitate intelligent knowledge transfer\n\n## Requirements and Argument Handling\n\n### Input Parameters\n- `$PROJECT_ROOT`: Absolute path to project root\n- `$CONTEXT_TYPE`: Granularity of context capture (minimal, standard, comprehensive)\n- `$STORAGE_FORMAT`: Preferred storage format (json, markdown, vector)\n- `$TAGS`: Optional semantic tags for context categorization\n\n## Context Extraction Strategies\n\n### 1. Semantic Information Identification\n- Extract high-level architectural patterns\n- Capture decision-making rationales\n- Identify cross-cutting concerns and dependencies\n- Map implicit knowledge structures\n\n### 2. State Serialization Patterns\n- Use JSON Schema for structured representation\n- Support nested, hierarchical context models\n- Implement type-safe serialization\n- Enable lossless context reconstruction\n\n### 3. Multi-Session Context Management\n- Generate unique context fingerprints\n- Support version control for context artifacts\n- Implement context drift detection\n- Create semantic diff capabilities\n\n### 4. Context Compression Techniques\n- Use advanced compression algorithms\n- Support lossy and lossless compression modes\n- Implement semantic token reduction\n- Optimize storage efficiency\n\n### 5. Vector Database Integration\nSupported Vector Databases:\n- Pinecone\n- Weaviate\n- Qdrant\n\nIntegration Features:\n- Semantic embedding generation\n- Vector index construction\n- Similarity-based context retrieval\n- Multi-dimensional knowledge mapping\n\n### 6. Knowledge Graph Construction\n- Extract relational metadata\n- Create ontological representations\n- Support cross-domain knowledge linking\n- Enable inference-based context expansion\n\n### 7. Storage Format Selection\nSupported Formats:\n- Structured JSON\n- Markdown with frontmatter\n- Protocol Buffers\n- MessagePack\n- YAML with semantic annotations\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### 1. Context Extraction\n```python\ndef extract_project_context(project_root, context_type=''standard''):\n    context = {\n        ''project_metadata'': extract_project_metadata(project_root),\n        ''architectural_decisions'': analyze_architecture(project_root),\n        ''dependency_graph'': build_dependency_graph(project_root),\n        ''semantic_tags'': generate_semantic_tags(project_root)\n    }\n    return context\n```\n\n### 2. State Serialization Schema\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"project_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"context_fingerprint\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"captured_at\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"},\n    \"architectural_decisions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"decision_type\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"impact_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Context Compression Algorithm\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, compression_level=''standard''):\n    strategies = {\n        ''minimal'': remove_redundant_tokens,\n        ''standard'': semantic_compression,\n        ''comprehensive'': advanced_vector_compression\n    }\n    compressor = strategies.get(compression_level, semantic_compression)\n    return compressor(context)\n```\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Project Onboarding Context Capture\n1. Analyze project structure\n2. Extract architectural decisions\n3. Generate semantic embeddings\n4. Store in vector database\n5. Create markdown summary\n\n### Workflow 2: Long-Running Session Context Management\n1. Periodically capture context snapshots\n2. Detect significant architectural changes\n3. Version and archive context\n4. Enable selective context restoration\n\n## Advanced Integration Capabilities\n- Real-time context synchronization\n- Cross-platform context portability\n- Compliance with enterprise knowledge management standards\n- Support for multi-modal context representation\n\n## Limitations and Considerations\n- Sensitive information must be explicitly excluded\n- Context capture has computational overhead\n- Requires careful configuration for optimal performance\n\n## Future Roadmap\n- Improved ML-driven context compression\n- Enhanced cross-domain knowledge transfer\n- Real-time collaborative context editing\n- Predictive context recommendation systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:18:13.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring advanced context management and saving capabilities.","zh":"适合于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等需要高级上下文管理和保存能力的 AI 代理。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの高度なコンテキスト管理と保存機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 고급 컨텍스트 관리 및 저장 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades avanzadas de gestión y guarda de contexto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une gestion et une sauvegarde de contexte avancées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Kontextverwaltungs- und Speicherfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e salvamento de contexto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих расширенных возможностей управления контекстом и сохранения.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب إدارة سياق متقدمة وقدرات حفظ"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently manage and save context using battle-tested, high-performance skills, including official tools from Anthropic and Vercel, enabling seamless workflow integration and optimized task performance through protocols like context save tool: intelligent context management specialist.","zh":"赋予代理使用经过实战考验的、高性能的技能，包括来自 Anthropic 和 Vercel 的官方工具，实现与工作流的无缝集成和通过诸如上下文保存工具：智能上下文管理专家的协议优化任务性能。","ja":"Anthropic と Vercel からの公式ツールを含む、実戦で検証された、高パフォーマンスのスキルを使用して、エージェントがコンテキストを賢く管理および保存できるようにし、コンテキスト保存ツール：コンテキスト管理スペシャリストなどのプロトコルを介してワークフローとシームレスに統合し、タスクのパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Anthropic 및 Vercel 의 공식 툴을 포함한 실제 전투에서 검증 된 고성능 스킬을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 지능적으로 관리 및 저장할 수 있도록 하여 작업 흐름과 컨텍스트 저장 도구 : 지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가 등의 프로토콜을 통해 무縫으로 통합되며 작업 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar y guardar inteligentemente el contexto utilizando habilidades de alto rendimiento y probadas en combate, incluyendo herramientas oficiales de Anthropic y Vercel, lo que permite una integración de flujo de trabajo sin problemas y un rendimiento de tarea optimizado a través de protocolos como la herramienta de guardar contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et de sauvegarder intelligemment le contexte en utilisant des compétences de haute performance et éprouvées, notamment des outils officiels d''Anthropic et Vercel, ce qui permet une intégration de flux de travail sans heurts et une performance de tâche optimisée via des protocoles tels que l''outil de sauvegarde de contexte : spécialiste de gestion de contexte intelligente.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kontext intelligent zu verwalten und zu speichern, indem sie hochleistungsstarke und erprobte Fähigkeiten nutzen, einschließlich offizieller Tools von Anthropic und Vercel, was eine nahtlose Integration von Workflows und eine optimierte Aufgabendurchführung durch Protokolle wie das Kontextspeichertool: Spezialist für intelligente Kontextverwaltung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar e salvar o contexto de forma inteligente, utilizando habilidades de alto desempenho testadas em batalha, incluindo ferramentas oficiais da Anthropic e Vercel, permitindo uma integração de fluxo de trabalho sem interrupções e um desempenho de tarefa otimizado por meio de protocolos como a ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально управлять и сохранять контекст с помощью протестированных, высокопроизводительных навыков, включая официальные инструменты от Anthropic и Vercel, что позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию рабочих процессов и оптимизированное выполнение задач через протоколы, такие как инструмент сохранения контекста: специалист по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة السياق وحفظه بذكاء باستخدام مهارات أداء عالية تم اختبارها في المعركة، بما في ذلك أدوات رسمية من Anthropic و Vercel، مما يسمح بالتكامل السلس للتدفقات العملية والأداء المثالي للمهام من خلال بروتوكولات مثل أداة حفظ السياق: أخصائي إدارة السياق الذكي"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating context save tasks for enhanced workflow efficiency","Generating best practices and checklists for intelligent context management","Debugging context-related issues in complex AI workflows"],"zh":["自动化上下文保存任务以提高工作流效率","生成智能上下文管理的最佳实践和清单","调试复杂 AI 工作流中的上下文相关问题"],"ja":["ワークフロー効率の向上のためのコンテキスト保存タスクの自動化","賢いコンテキスト管理のベストプラクティスとチェックリストの生成","複雑な AI ワークフローのコンテキスト関連の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["작업 흐름 효율성을 향상시키기 위한 컨텍스트 저장 태스크의 자동화","지능형 컨텍스트 관리의 모범 사례 및 체크 리스트 생성","복잡한 AI 작업 흐름의 컨텍스트 관련 문제의 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de guarda de contexto para mejorar la eficiencia del flujo de trabajo","Generar las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación para la gestión de contexto inteligente","Depurar problemas relacionados con el contexto en flujos de trabajo de IA complejos"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de sauvegarde de contexte pour améliorer l''efficacité du flux de travail","Générer les meilleures pratiques et les listes de vérification pour la gestion de contexte intelligente","Déboguer les problèmes liés au contexte dans les flux de travail d''IA complexes"],"de":["Automatisieren von Kontextspeicheraufgaben zur Verbesserung der Workflow-Effizienz","Erstellen von Best-Practice-Leitfäden und Prüflisten für die intelligente Kontextverwaltung","Fehlerbehebung bei kontextbezogenen Problemen in komplexen KI-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de salvamento de contexto para uma eficiência de fluxo de trabalho aprimorada","Gerar as melhores práticas e listas de verificação para gerenciamento de contexto inteligente","Depurar problemas relacionados ao contexto em fluxos de trabalho de IA complexos"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач сохранения контекста для повышения эффективности рабочих процессов","Генерация лучших практик и проверочных списков для интеллектуального управления контекстом","Отладка проблем, связанных с контекстом, в сложных рабочих потоках ИИ"],"ar":["أتمتة مهام حفظ السياق لتعزيز كفاءة تدفق العمل","генерация أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق لإدارة السياق الذكي","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالسياق في تدفقات العمل المعقدة للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist","Requires compatibility with Claude Code, Antigravity, or Cursor ecosystems"],"zh":["任务必须与上下文保存工具：智能上下文管理专家相关","需要与 Claude Code、Antigravity 或 Cursor 生态系统兼容"],"ja":["タスクはコンテキスト保存ツール：コンテキスト管理スペシャリストに関連している必要がある","Claude Code、Antigravity、または Cursor エコシステムとの互換性が必要"],"ko":["태스크는 컨텍스트 저장 도구 : 컨텍스트 관리 전문가와 관련되어야 함","Claude Code, Antigravity 또는 Cursor 에코システム과 호환성이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con la herramienta de guarda de contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente","Requiere compatibilidad con los ecosistemas Claude Code, Antigravity o Cursor"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à l''outil de sauvegarde de contexte : spécialiste de gestion de contexte intelligente","Nécessite une compatibilité avec les écosystèmes Claude Code, Antigravity ou Cursor"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit dem Kontextspeichertool: Spezialist für intelligente Kontextverwaltung zusammenhängen","Erfordert Kompatibilität mit den Ökosystemen Claude Code, Antigravity oder Cursor"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente","Exige compatibilidade com os ecossistemas Claude Code, Antigravity ou Cursor"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с инструментом сохранения контекста: специалистом по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом","Требует совместимости с экосистемами Claude Code, Antigravity или Cursor"],"ar":["المراد يجب أن يتعلق بأداة حفظ السياق: أخصائي إدارة السياق الذكي","يتطلب التوافق مع النظم البيئية Claude Code و Antigravity و Cursor"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
