ない","開発効率の向上","Claude Code をサポート"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 병렬 실행","스마트 모델 라우팅","독립적인 태스크의 병렬 실행","영속화, 검증 루프 또는 상태 관리를 포함하지 않음","개발 효율의 향상","Claude Code 지원"],"es":["Ejecución paralela de tareas independientes","Orquestación de múltiples agentes","Enrutamiento de modelos inteligentes","Paralelismo para mejorar el rendimiento","Compatibilidad con Claude Code"],"fr":["Exécution parallèle de tâches indépendantes","Orchestration de plusieurs agents","Routage de modèles intelligents","Parallélisme pour améliorer les performances","Compatibilité avec Claude Code"],"de":["Parallele Ausführung von unabhängigen Aufgaben","Orchestrierung von mehreren Agenten","Intelligente Modellverteilung","Parallelismus für verbesserte Leistung","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Execução paralela de tarefas independentes","Delegação de trabalho a vários agentes","Roteamento de modelos inteligentes","Paralelismo para melhor desempenho","Suporte a tarefas concorrentes"],"ru":["Параллельное выполнение независимых задач","Делегирование работы нескольким агентам","Умное маршрутизация моделей","Параллелизм для лучшей производительности","Поддержка конкурирующих задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ متوازي للمهام المستقلة","تفويض العمل إلى عدة وكلاء","توجيه نموذج ذكي","متوازي لتحسين الأداء","دعم المهام المتوالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ultrawork","多代理并行执行","Claude Code","并行执行","智能模型路由","开发效率","多代理","并行执行引擎"],"ja":["Ultrawork","マルチエージェント並列実行","Claude Code","並列実行","スマート モデル ルーティング","開発効率","マルチエージェント","並列実行エンジン"],"ko":["Ultrawork","멀티 에이전트 병렬 실행","Claude Code","병렬 실행","스마트 모델 라우팅","개발 효율","멀티 에이전트","병렬 실행 엔진"],"es":["Ultrawork","orquestación de agentes","ejecución paralela","tareas independientes","Claude Code","paralelismo","modelos inteligentes","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Ultrawork","orchestration d''agents","exécution parallèle","tâches indépendantes","Claude Code","parallélisme","modèles intelligents","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Ultrawork","Orchestrierung von Agenten","parallele Ausführung","unabhängige Aufgaben","Claude Code","Parallelismus","intelligente Modelle","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["Ultrawork","execução paralela","tarefas independentes","delegação de trabalho","roteamento de modelos","paralelismo","desempenho","concorrente"],"ru":["Ultrawork","параллельное выполнение","независимые задачи","делегирование работы","умное маршрутизация","параллелизм","производительность","конкурирующие задачи"],"ar":["Ultrawork","تنفيذ متوازي","المهام المستقلة","تفويض العمل","توجيه نموذج","متوازي","أداء","مهام متوالية"]}},"owner":"Yeachan-Heo","repo":"oh-my-claudecode","repoPath":"Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ultrawork","description":"Parallel execution engine for high-throughput task completion","bodyPreview":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurre","body":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurrent execution but the user will manage completion themselves\n</Use_When>\n\n<Do_Not_Use_When>\n- Task requires guaranteed completion with verification -- use `ralph` instead (ralph includes ultrawork)\n- Task requires a full autonomous pipeline -- use `autopilot` instead (autopilot includes ralph which includes ultrawork)\n- There is only one sequential task with no parallelism opportunity -- delegate directly to an executor agent\n- User needs session persistence for resume -- use `ralph` which adds persistence on top of ultrawork\n</Do_Not_Use_When>\n\n<Why_This_Exists>\nSequential task execution wastes time when tasks are independent. Ultrawork enables firing multiple agents simultaneously and routing each to the right model tier, reducing total execution time while controlling token costs. It is designed as a composable component that ralph and autopilot layer on top of.\n</Why_This_Exists>\n\n<Execution_Policy>\n- Fire all independent agent calls simultaneously -- never serialize independent work\n- Always pass the `model` parameter explicitly when delegating\n- Read `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` before first delegation for agent selection guidance\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for operations over ~30 seconds (installs, builds, tests)\n- Run quick commands (git status, file reads, simple checks) in the foreground\n</Execution_Policy>\n\n<Steps>\n1. **Read agent reference**: Load `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` for tier selection\n2. **Classify tasks by independence**: Identify which tasks can run in parallel vs which have dependencies\n3. **Route to correct tiers**:\n   - Simple lookups/definitions: LOW tier (Haiku)\n   - Standard implementation: MEDIUM tier (Sonnet)\n   - Complex analysis/refactoring: HIGH tier (Opus)\n4. **Fire independent tasks simultaneously**: Launch all parallel-safe tasks at once\n5. **Run dependent tasks sequentially**: Wait for prerequisites before launching dependent work\n6. **Background long operations**: Builds, installs, and test suites use `run_in_background: true`\n7. **Verify when all tasks complete** (lightweight):\n   - Build/typecheck passes\n   - Affected tests pass\n   - No new errors introduced\n</Steps>\n\n<Tool_Usage>\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", ...)` for simple changes\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", ...)` for standard work\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-high\", model=\"opus\", ...)` for complex work\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for package installs, builds, and test suites\n- Use foreground execution for quick status checks and file operations\n</Tool_Usage>\n\n<Examples>\n<Good>\nThree independent tasks fired simultaneously:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Add missing type export for Config interface\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Implement the /api/users endpoint with validation\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Add integration tests for the auth middleware\")\n```\nWhy good: Independent tasks at appropriate tiers, all fired at once.\n</Good>\n\n<Good>\nCorrect use of background execution:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"npm install && npm run build\", run_in_background=true)\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-low\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Update the README with new API endpoints\")\n```\nWhy good: Long build runs in background while short task runs in foreground.\n</Good>\n\n<Bad>\nSequential execution of independent work:\n```\nresult1 = Task(executor-low, \"Add type export\")  # wait...\nresult2 = Task(executor, \"Implement endpoint\")     # wait...\nresult3 = Task(executor, \"Add tests\")              # wait...\n```\nWhy bad: These tasks are independent. Running them sequentially wastes time.\n</Bad>\n\n<Bad>\nWrong tier selection:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor-high\", model=\"opus\", prompt=\"Add a missing semicolon\")\n```\nWhy bad: Opus is expensive overkill for a trivial fix. Use executor-low with Haiku instead.\n</Bad>\n</Examples>\n\n<Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n- When ultrawork is invoked directly (not via ralph), apply lightweight verification only -- build passes, tests pass, no new errors\n- For full persistence and comprehensive architect verification, recommend switching to `ralph` mode\n- If a task fails repeatedly across retries, report the issue rather than retrying indefinitely\n- Escalate to the user when tasks have unclear dependencies or conflicting requirements\n</Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n\n<Final_Checklist>\n- [ ] All parallel tasks completed\n- [ ] Build/typecheck passes\n- [ ] Affected tests pass\n- [ ] No new errors introduced\n</Final_Checklist>\n\n<Advanced>\n## Relationship to Other Modes\n\n```\nralph (persistence wrapper)\n \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n     \\-- provides: parallel execution only\n\nautopilot (autonomous execution)\n \\-- includes: ralph\n     \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n\n (token efficiency)\n \\-- modifies: ultrawork''s model selection\n```\n\nUltrawork is the parallelism layer. Ralph adds persistence and verification. Autopilot adds the full lifecycle pipeline. Ecomode adjusts ultrawork''s model routing to favor cheaper models.\n</Advanced>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:18:30.143Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-agent Ecosystems needing parallel execution and smart model routing for tasks like Claude Code orchestration.","zh":"非常适合需要并行执行和智能模型路由的多代理生态系统，例如 Claude Code 编排等任务。","ja":"マルチエージェント生態系に適しており、Claude Code のオーケストレーションなどのタスクで並列実行とスマートモデルのルーティングが必要です。","ko":"병렬 실행과 스마트 모델 라우팅이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 생태계에 적합하며 Claude Code 오케스트레이션과 같은 작업에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para ecosistemas de multiagentes que necesitan ejecución paralela y enrutamiento de modelos inteligentes para tareas como la orquestación de Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les écosystèmes multi-agents nécessitant une exécution parallèle et un routage de modèles intelligents pour des tâches telles que l''orchestration de Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agenten-Ökosysteme, die eine parallele Ausführung und eine intelligente Modellverteilung für Aufgaben wie die Orchestrierung von Claude Code benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Ecossistemas de Multiagentes que necessitam de execução paralela e roteamento de modelo inteligente para tarefas como orquestração de Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для экосистем многокомпонентных агентов, требующих параллельного выполнения и умного маршрутизации модели для задач, таких как оркестровка Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي للنظم المتعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متوازي وتوجيه نموذج ذكي للمهام مثل أوركسترا كلود كود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute multiple independent tasks simultaneously using parallel execution engines, providing concurrence benefits and delegation to multiple agents at once through smart model routing and multi-agent orchestration protocols.","zh":"使代理能够使用并行执行引擎同时执行多个独立任务，提供并发性好处，并通过智能模型路由和多代理编排协议将任务委托给多个代理。","ja":"エージェントが並列実行エンジンを使用して複数の独立したタスクを同時に実行できるようにし、並行性の利点を提供し、スマートモデルのルーティングとマルチエージェントオーケストレーションプロトコルを介して複数のエージェントにタスクを委託します。","ko":"에이전트가 병렬 실행 엔진을 사용하여 여러 개의 독립적인 작업을 동시에 실행할 수 있도록 하여 병렬性的 이점을 제공하고 스마트 모델 라우팅 및 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프로토콜을 통해 여러 에이전트에 작업을 위임합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar varias tareas independientes simultáneamente mediante motores de ejecución paralela, proporcionando beneficios de concurrencia y delegación a varios agentes a la vez a través de enrutamiento de modelos inteligentes y protocolos de orquestación multiagente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter plusieurs tâches indépendantes simultanément à l''aide de moteurs d''exécution parallèle, offrant des avantages de concurrence et de délégation à plusieurs agents à la fois grâce au routage de modèles intelligents et aux protocoles d''orchestration multi-agents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere unabhängige Aufgaben gleichzeitig mithilfe von parallelen Ausführungsmotoren auszuführen, wodurch Konkurrenzvorteile und Delegation an mehrere Agenten auf einmal durch intelligente Modellverteilung und Multi-Agenten-Orchestrierungsprotokolle bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar várias tarefas independentes simultaneamente usando motores de execução paralela, fornecendo benefícios de concorrência e delegação a vários agentes de uma vez por meio de roteamento de modelo inteligente e protocolos de orquestração de multiagentes.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выполнять несколько независимых задач одновременно с помощью параллельных двигателей выполнения, обеспечивая преимущества конкуренции и делегирование нескольким агентам одновременно посредством умного маршрутизации модели и протоколов оркестровки многокомпонентных агентов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مهام مستقلة متعددة في نفس الوقت باستخدام محركات التنفيذ المتوازي، وتوفير فوائد التزامن والتفويض إلى عدة وكلاء في نفس الوقت من خلال توجيه نموذج ذكي وبروتوكولات أوركسترا متعددة الوكلاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing multiple Claude Code instances in parallel","Delegating independent tasks to multiple agents concurrently","Optimizing task execution through concurrence and smart routing"],"zh":["并行执行多个 Claude Code 实例","同时将独立任务委托给多个代理","通过并发和智能路由优化任务执行"],"ja":["複数の Claude Code インスタンスを並列実行する","複数のエージェントに同時に独立したタスクを委託する","並行性とスマートルーティングを使用してタスクの実行を最適化する"],"ko":["여러 Claude Code 인스턴스를 병렬로 실행하는 것","여러 에이전트에 독립적인 작업을 동시에 위임하는 것","병렬성과 스마트 라우팅을 사용하여 작업 실행을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar múltiples instancias de Claude Code en paralelo","Delegar tareas independientes a varios agentes de forma concurrente","Optimizar la ejecución de tareas a través de la concurrencia y el enrutamiento inteligente"],"fr":["Exécuter plusieurs instances de Claude Code en parallèle","Déléguer des tâches indépendantes à plusieurs agents de manière concurrente","Optimiser l''exécution de tâches grâce à la concurrence et au routage intelligent"],"de":["Mehrere Instanzen von Claude Code parallel ausführen","Unabhängige Aufgaben an mehrere Agenten gleichzeitig delegieren","Die Ausführung von Aufgaben durch Konkurrenz und intelligente Verteilung optimieren"],"pt":["Executando várias instâncias de Claude Code em paralelo","Delegando tarefas independentes a vários agentes concorrentemente","Otimizando a execução de tarefas por meio de concorrência e roteamento inteligente"],"ru":["Выполнение нескольких экземпляров Claude Code параллельно","Делегирование независимых задач нескольким агентам одновременно","Оптимизация выполнения задач посредством конкуренции и умного маршрутизации"],"ar":["تشغيل عدة مثيلات من كلود كود في نفس الوقت","تفويض مهام مستقلة إلى عدة وكلاء في نفس الوقت","تحسين تنفيذ المهام من خلال التزامن والتوجيه الذكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not provide persistence","Does not include verification loops","Does not manage state"],"zh":["不提供持久性","不包括验证循环","不管理状态"],"ja":["永続性を提供しない","検証ループを含まない","状態を管理しない"],"ko":["지속성을 제공하지 않음","검증 루프를 포함하지 않음","상태를 관리하지 않음"],"es":["No proporciona persistencia","No incluye bucles de verificación","No gestiona el estado"],"fr":["Ne fournit pas de persistance","N''inclut pas de boucles de vérification","Ne gère pas l''état"],"de":["Bietet keine Persistenz","Enthält keine Überprüfungsschleifen","Verwaltet keinen Zustand"],"pt":["Não fornece persistência","Não inclui loops de verificação","Não gerencia estado"],"ru":["Не обеспечивает сохранность","Не включает в себя петли проверки","Не управляет состоянием"],"ar":["لا يوفر استمرارية","لا يتضمن حلقات التحقق","لا يدير الحالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
