应用性能监控","管理应用程序洞察资源","高性能 SDK","支持 Azure 资源管理","支持 .NET Core 和 .NET Framework"],"ja":["アプリのパフォーマンスを監視","Application Insights リソースを管理","高パフォーマンスの SDK","Azure リソース管理に対応",".NET Core と .NET Framework に対応"],"ko":["애플리케이션 성능 모니터링 지원","애플리케이션 인사이트 리소스 관리","고성능 SDK","Azure 리소스 관리 지원",".NET Core 및 .NET Framework 지원"],"es":["Gestión de recursos de Application Insights","Monitoreo de rendimiento de aplicaciones","Integración con Azure Resource Manager","Soporte para autenticación de Azure","Compatibilidad con .NET","Documentación detallada"],"fr":["Gestion des ressources Application Insights","Suivi des performances des applications","Intégration avec Azure Resource Manager","Prise en charge de l''authentification Azure","Compatibilité avec .NET","Documentation détaillée"],"de":["Verwaltung von Application Insights-Ressourcen","Leistungsüberwachung von Anwendungen","Integration mit Azure Resource Manager","Unterstützung für Azure-Authentifizierung","Kompatibilität mit .NET","Detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de recursos de Application Insights","Monitoramento de desempenho do aplicativo","Integração com o Azure Resource Manager","Suporte a identidade do Azure","Versão estável v1.0.0 (GA)","API Version 2022-06-15"],"ru":["Управление ресурсами Application Insights","Мониторинг производительности приложения","Интеграция с Azure Resource Manager","Поддержка идентификации Azure","Стабильная версия v1.0.0 (GA)","API Version 2022-06-15"],"ar":["إدارة موارد Application Insights","مراقبة أداء التطبيق","التكامل مع Azure Resource Manager","دعم الهوية من Azure","الإصدار المستقر v1.0.0 (GA)","API Version 2022-06-15"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure 应用程序洞察","应用性能监控",".NET SDK","Azure 资源管理","应用程序洞察资源管理","高性能 SDK","Azure 云服务"],"ja":["Azure Application Insights","アプリのパフォーマンスを監視",".NET SDK","Azure リソース管理","Application Insights リソース管理","高パフォーマンスの SDK","Azure クラウドサービス"],"ko":["Azure 애플리케이션 인사이트","애플리케이션 성능 모니터링",".NET SDK","Azure 리소스 관리","애플리케이션 인사이트 리소스 관리","고성능 SDK","Azure 클라우드 서비스"],"es":["Azure SDK","Application Insights","monitoreo de rendimiento","gestión de recursos","Azure Resource Manager","autenticación de Azure",".NET","desarrollo de aplicaciones","análisis de rendimiento"],"fr":["SDK Azure","Application Insights","suivi des performances","gestion des ressources","Azure Resource Manager","authentification Azure",".NET","développement d''applications","analyse de performances"],"de":["Azure-SDK","Application Insights","Leistungsüberwachung","Ressourcenverwaltung","Azure Resource Manager","Azure-Authentifizierung",".NET","Anwendungsentwicklung","Leistungsanalyse"],"pt":["Azure Application Insights .NET","Gerenciamento de desempenho","Monitoramento de aplicativos","Azure Resource Manager","Identidade do Azure","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Bibliotecas .NET","Application Insights"],"ru":["Azure Application Insights .NET","Управление производительностью","Мониторинг приложений","Azure Resource Manager","Идентификация Azure","Разработка приложений","Библиотеки .NET","Application Insights"],"ar":["Azure Application Insights .NET","إدارة الأداء","مراقبة التطبيقات","Azure Resource Manager","الهوية من Azure","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبات .NET","Application Insights"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-mgmt-applicationinsights-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights (.NET)\n\nAzure Resource Manager SDK for managing Application Insights resources for application performance monitoring.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n```\n\n**Current Version**: v1.0.0 (GA)  \n**API Version**: 2022-06-15\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=<your-subscription-id>\nAZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP=<your-resource-group>\nAZURE_APPINSIGHTS_NAME=<y","body":"# Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights (.NET)\n\nAzure Resource Manager SDK for managing Application Insights resources for application performance monitoring.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n```\n\n**Current Version**: v1.0.0 (GA)  \n**API Version**: 2022-06-15\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=<your-subscription-id>\nAZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP=<your-resource-group>\nAZURE_APPINSIGHTS_NAME=<your-appinsights-component>\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights;\n\nArmClient client = new ArmClient(new DefaultAzureCredential());\n```\n\n## Resource Hierarchy\n\n```\nSubscription\n└── ResourceGroup\n    └── ApplicationInsightsComponent          # App Insights resource\n        ├── ApplicationInsightsComponentApiKey  # API keys for programmatic access\n        ├── ComponentLinkedStorageAccount      # Linked storage for data export\n        └── (via component ID)\n            ├── WebTest                        # Availability tests\n            ├── Workbook                       # Workbooks for analysis\n            ├── WorkbookTemplate               # Workbook templates\n            └── MyWorkbook                     # Private workbooks\n```\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create Application Insights Component (Workspace-based)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights.Models;\n\nResourceGroupResource resourceGroup = await client\n    .GetDefaultSubscriptionAsync()\n    .Result\n    .GetResourceGroupAsync(\"my-resource-group\");\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentCollection components = resourceGroup.GetApplicationInsightsComponents();\n\n// Workspace-based Application Insights (recommended)\nApplicationInsightsComponentData data = new ApplicationInsightsComponentData(\n    AzureLocation.EastUS,\n    ApplicationInsightsApplicationType.Web)\n{\n    Kind = \"web\",\n    WorkspaceResourceId = new ResourceIdentifier(\n        \"/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/<workspace-name>\"),\n    IngestionMode = IngestionMode.LogAnalytics,\n    PublicNetworkAccessForIngestion = PublicNetworkAccessType.Enabled,\n    PublicNetworkAccessForQuery = PublicNetworkAccessType.Enabled,\n    RetentionInDays = 90,\n    SamplingPercentage = 100,\n    DisableIPMasking = false,\n    ImmediatePurgeDataOn30Days = false,\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { \"environment\", \"production\" },\n        { \"application\", \"mywebapp\" }\n    }\n};\n\nArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await components\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", data);\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = operation.Value;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Component created: {component.Data.Name}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Instrumentation Key: {component.Data.InstrumentationKey}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Connection String: {component.Data.ConnectionString}\");\n```\n\n### 2. Get Connection String and Keys\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\n// Get connection string for SDK configuration\nstring connectionString = component.Data.ConnectionString;\nstring instrumentationKey = component.Data.InstrumentationKey;\nstring appId = component.Data.AppId;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Connection String: {connectionString}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Instrumentation Key: {instrumentationKey}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"App ID: {appId}\");\n```\n\n### 3. Create API Key\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyCollection apiKeys = component.GetApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeys();\n\n// API key for reading telemetry\nApplicationInsightsApiKeyContent keyContent = new ApplicationInsightsApiKeyContent\n{\n    Name = \"ReadTelemetryKey\",\n    LinkedReadProperties =\n    {\n        $\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/{component.Data.Name}/api\",\n        $\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/{component.Data.Name}/agentconfig\"\n    }\n};\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyResource apiKey = await apiKeys\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, keyContent);\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"API Key Name: {apiKey.Data.Name}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"API Key: {apiKey.Data.ApiKey}\"); // Only shown once!\n```\n\n### 4. Create Web Test (Availability Test)\n\n```csharp\nWebTestCollection webTests = resourceGroup.GetWebTests();\n\n// URL Ping Test\nWebTestData urlPingTest = new WebTestData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    Kind = WebTestKind.Ping,\n    SyntheticMonitorId = \"webtest-ping-myapp\",\n    WebTestName = \"Homepage Availability\",\n    Description = \"Checks if homepage is available\",\n    IsEnabled = true,\n    Frequency = 300, // 5 minutes\n    Timeout = 120,   // 2 minutes\n    WebTestKind = WebTestKind.Ping,\n    IsRetryEnabled = true,\n    Locations =\n    {\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-ca-sjc-azr\" },  // West US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-tx-sn1-azr\" },  // South Central US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-il-ch1-azr\" },  // North Central US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"emea-gb-db3-azr\" }, // UK South\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"apac-sg-sin-azr\" }  // Southeast Asia\n    },\n    Configuration = new WebTestConfiguration\n    {\n        WebTest = \"\"\"\n            <WebTest Name=\"Homepage\" Enabled=\"True\" Timeout=\"120\" \n                     xmlns=\"http://microsoft.com/schemas/VisualStudio/TeamTest/2010\">\n                <Items>\n                    <Request Method=\"GET\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"120\" ParseDependentRequests=\"False\" \n                             FollowRedirects=\"True\" RecordResult=\"True\" Cache=\"False\" \n                             ResponseTimeGoal=\"0\" Encoding=\"utf-8\" ExpectedHttpStatusCode=\"200\" />\n                </Items>\n            </WebTest>\n        \"\"\"\n    },\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { $\"hidden-link:/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/my-appinsights\", \"Resource\" }\n    }\n};\n\nArmOperation<WebTestResource> operation = await webTests\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"webtest-homepage\", urlPingTest);\n\nWebTestResource webTest = operation.Value;\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Web test created: {webTest.Data.Name}\");\n```\n\n### 5. Create Multi-Step Web Test\n\n```csharp\nWebTestData multiStepTest = new WebTestData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    Kind = WebTestKind.MultiStep,\n    SyntheticMonitorId = \"webtest-multistep-login\",\n    WebTestName = \"Login Flow Test\",\n    Description = \"Tests login functionality\",\n    IsEnabled = true,\n    Frequency = 900, // 15 minutes\n    Timeout = 300,   // 5 minutes\n    WebTestKind = WebTestKind.MultiStep,\n    IsRetryEnabled = true,\n    Locations =\n    {\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-ca-sjc-azr\" }\n    },\n    Configuration = new WebTestConfiguration\n    {\n        WebTest = \"\"\"\n            <WebTest Name=\"LoginFlow\" Enabled=\"True\" Timeout=\"300\"\n                     xmlns=\"http://microsoft.com/schemas/VisualStudio/TeamTest/2010\">\n                <Items>\n                    <Request Method=\"GET\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com/login\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"60\" />\n                    <Request Method=\"POST\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com/api/auth\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"60\">\n                        <Headers>\n                            <Header Name=\"Content-Type\" Value=\"application/json\" />\n                        </Headers>\n                        <Body>{\"username\":\"testuser\",\"password\":\"{{TestPassword}}\"}</Body>\n                    </Request>\n                </Items>\n            </WebTest>\n        \"\"\"\n    },\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { $\"hidden-link:/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/my-appinsights\", \"Resource\" }\n    }\n};\n\nawait webTests.CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"webtest-login-flow\", multiStepTest);\n```\n\n### 6. Create Workbook\n\n```csharp\nWorkbookCollection workbooks = resourceGroup.GetWorkbooks();\n\nWorkbookData workbookData = new WorkbookData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    DisplayName = \"Application Performance Dashboard\",\n    Category = \"workbook\",\n    Kind = WorkbookSharedTypeKind.Shared,\n    SerializedData = \"\"\"\n    {\n        \"version\": \"Notebook/1.0\",\n        \"items\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": 1,\n                \"content\": {\n                    \"json\": \"# Application Performance\\n\\nThis workbook shows application performance metrics.\"\n                },\n                \"name\": \"header\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": 3,\n                \"content\": {\n                    \"version\": \"KqlItem/1.0\",\n                    \"query\": \"requests\\n| summarize count() by bin(timestamp, 1h)\\n| render timechart\",\n                    \"size\": 0,\n                    \"title\": \"Requests per Hour\",\n                    \"timeContext\": {\n                        \"durationMs\": 86400000\n                    },\n                    \"queryType\": 0,\n                    \"resourceType\": \"microsoft.insights/components\"\n                },\n                \"name\": \"requestsChart\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"isLocked\": false\n    }\n    \"\"\",\n    SourceId = component.Id,\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { \"environment\", \"production\" }\n    }\n};\n\n// Note: Workbook ID should be a new GUID\nstring workbookId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n\nArmOperation<WorkbookResource> operation = await workbooks\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, workbookId, workbookData);\n\nWorkbookResource workbook = operation.Value;\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Workbook created: {workbook.Data.DisplayName}\");\n```\n\n### 7. Link Storage Account\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\nComponentLinkedStorageAccountCollection linkedStorage = component.GetComponentLinkedStorageAccounts();\n\nComponentLinkedStorageAccountData storageData = new ComponentLinkedStorageAccountData\n{\n    LinkedStorageAccount = new ResourceIdentifier(\n        \"/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/<storage-account>\")\n};\n\nArmOperation<ComponentLinkedStorageAccountResource> operation = await linkedStorage\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, StorageType.ServiceProfiler, storageData);\n```\n\n### 8. List and Manage Components\n\n```csharp\n// List all Application Insights components in resource group\nawait foreach (ApplicationInsightsComponentResource component in \n    resourceGroup.GetApplicationInsightsComponents())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Component: {component.Data.Name}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  App ID: {component.Data.AppId}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Type: {component.Data.ApplicationType}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Ingestion Mode: {component.Data.IngestionMode}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Retention: {component.Data.RetentionInDays} days\");\n}\n\n// List web tests\nawait foreach (WebTestResource webTest in resourceGroup.GetWebTests())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Web Test: {webTest.Data.WebTestName}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Enabled: {webTest.Data.IsEnabled}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Frequency: {webTest.Data.Frequency}s\");\n}\n\n// List workbooks\nawait foreach (WorkbookResource workbook in resourceGroup.GetWorkbooks())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Workbook: {workbook.Data.DisplayName}\");\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Update Component\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\n// Update using full data (PUT operation)\nApplicationInsightsComponentData updateData = component.Data;\nupdateData.RetentionInDays = 180;\nupdateData.SamplingPercentage = 50;\nupdateData.Tags[\"updated\"] = \"true\";\n\nArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponents()\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", updateData);\n```\n\n### 10. Delete Resources\n\n```csharp\n// Delete Application Insights component\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\nawait component.DeleteAsync(WaitUntil.Completed);\n\n// Delete web test\nWebTestResource webTest = await resourceGroup.GetWebTestAsync(\"webtest-homepage\");\nawait webTest.DeleteAsync(WaitUntil.Completed);\n```\n\n## Key Types Reference\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentResource` | App Insights component |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentData` | Component configuration |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentCollection` | Collection of components |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyResource` | API key for programmatic access |\n| `WebTestResource` | Availability/web test |\n| `WebTestData` | Web test configuration |\n| `WorkbookResource` | Analysis workbook |\n| `WorkbookData` | Workbook configuration |\n| `ComponentLinkedStorageAccountResource` | Linked storage for exports |\n\n## Application Types\n\n| Type | Enum Value |\n|------|------------|\n| Web Application | `Web` |\n| iOS Application | `iOS` |\n| Java Application | `Java` |\n| Node.js Application | `NodeJS` |\n| .NET Application | `MRT` |\n| Other | `Other` |\n\n## Web Test Locations\n\n| Location ID | Region |\n|-------------|--------|\n| `us-ca-sjc-azr` | West US |\n| `us-tx-sn1-azr` | South Central US |\n| `us-il-ch1-azr` | North Central US |\n| `us-va-ash-azr` | East US |\n| `emea-gb-db3-azr` | UK South |\n| `emea-nl-ams-azr` | West Europe |\n| `emea-fr-pra-edge` | France Central |\n| `apac-sg-sin-azr` | Southeast Asia |\n| `apac-hk-hkn-azr` | East Asia |\n| `apac-jp-kaw-edge` | Japan East |\n| `latam-br-gru-edge` | Brazil South |\n| `emea-au-syd-edge` | Australia East |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use workspace-based** — Workspace-based App Insights is the current standard\n2. **Link to Log Analytics** — Store data in Log Analytics for better querying\n3. **Set appropriate retention** — Balance cost vs. data availability\n4. **Use sampling** — Reduce costs for high-volume applications\n5. **Store connection string securely** — Use Key Vault or managed identity\n6. **Enable multiple test locations** — For accurate availability monitoring\n7. **Use workbooks** — For custom dashboards and analysis\n8. **Set up alerts** — Based on availability tests and metrics\n9. **Tag resources** — For cost allocation and organization\n10. **Use private endpoints** — For secure data ingestion\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure;\n\ntry\n{\n    ArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await components\n        .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", data);\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex) when (ex.Status == 409)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(\"Component already exists\");\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex) when (ex.Status == 400)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Invalid configuration: {ex.Message}\");\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Azure error: {ex.Status} - {ex.Message}\");\n}\n```\n\n## SDK Integration\n\nUse the connection string with Application Insights SDK:\n\n```csharp\n// Program.cs in ASP.NET Core\nbuilder.Services.AddApplicationInsightsTelemetry(options =>\n{\n    options.ConnectionString = configuration[\"ApplicationInsights:ConnectionString\"];\n});\n\n// Or set via environment variable\n// APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING=InstrumentationKey=...;IngestionEndpoint=...\n```\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights` | Resource management (this SDK) | `dotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights` |\n| `Microsoft.ApplicationInsights` | Telemetry SDK | `dotnet add package Microsoft.ApplicationInsights` |\n| `Microsoft.ApplicationInsights.AspNetCore` | ASP.NET Core integration | `dotnet add package Microsoft.ApplicationInsights.AspNetCore` |\n| `Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter` | OpenTelemetry export | `dotnet add package Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter` |\n\n## Reference Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| NuGet Package | https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights |\n| API Reference | https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.resourcemanager.applicationinsights |\n| Product Documentation | https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/app/app-insights-overview |\n| GitHub Source | https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/tree/main/sdk/applicationinsights/Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:18:55.323Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring advanced Azure Resource Manager capabilities for Application Insights resource management.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Azure 资源管理器功能以管理 Application Insights 资源的云管理代理。","ja":"Azure リソース マネージャーの高度な機能を使用して Application Insights リソースを管理する必要があるクラウド管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Application Insights 리소스 관리를 위해 Azure Resource Manager의 고급 기능이 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de la nube que requieren capacidades avanzadas de Azure Resource Manager para la administración de recursos de Application Insights.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion cloud nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées d''Azure Resource Manager pour la gestion des ressources Application Insights.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Azure Resource Manager-Funktionen für die Ressourcenverwaltung von Application Insights erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de gerenciamento de nuvem que exigem capacidades avançadas do Azure Resource Manager para gerenciamento de recursos do Application Insights.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облаком, требующих расширенных возможностей Azure Resource Manager для управления ресурсами Application Insights.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة الذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لمدير الموارد Azure من أجل إدارة موردات Application Insights."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Application Insights resources using the Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights .NET SDK, leveraging Azure Identity for secure authentication and authorization, and providing seamless integration with Azure Resource Manager for application performance monitoring.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights .NET SDK 管理 Application Insights 资源的能力，利用 Azure Identity 进行安全的身份验证和授权，并提供与 Azure 资源管理器的无缝集成以进行应用程序性能监控。","ja":"Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights .NET SDK を使用して Application Insights リソースを管理し、Azure Identity を使用してセキュアな認証と承認を行い、Azure リソース マネージャーとのシームレスな統合を提供してアプリケーションのパフォーマンス モニタリングを行えるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights .NET SDK를 사용하여 Application Insights 리소스를 관리하고 Azure Identity를 사용하여 보안 인증 및 인가 처리하며 Azure Resource Manager와의 무중단 통합을 제공하여 애플리케이션 성능 모니터링을 수행할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar recursos de Application Insights mediante el SDK de .NET de Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, aprovechando Azure Identity para una autenticación y autorización seguras, y proporcionando una integración fluida con Azure Resource Manager para el monitoreo del rendimiento de aplicaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les ressources Application Insights à l''aide du SDK .NET d''Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, en exploitant Azure Identity pour une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées, et en fournissant une intégration fluide avec Azure Resource Manager pour le suivi des performances des applications.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Application Insights-Ressourcen mithilfe des Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights .NET SDK zu verwalten, Azure Identity für sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung nutzt und eine nahtlose Integration mit Azure Resource Manager für die Anwendungsleistungsüberwachung bietet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar recursos do Application Insights usando o SDK .NET do Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, aproveitando a Azure Identity para autenticação e autorização seguras e fornecendo integração perfeita com o Azure Resource Manager para monitoramento de desempenho de aplicativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять ресурсами Application Insights с помощью пакета SDK .NET Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, используя Azure Identity для безопасной аутентификации и авторизации, и обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Azure Resource Manager для мониторинга производительности приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة موردات Application Insights باستخدام SDK .NET الخاص بـ Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights، ويفعل هوية Azure من أجل التحقق والتصريح بشكل آمن، ويقدم تكاملًا سلسًا مع مدير الموارد Azure لمراقبة أداء التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Application Insights resource provisioning","Configuring application performance monitoring using Azure Resource Manager","Integrating Azure Identity for secure authentication and authorization"],"zh":["自动化 Application Insights 资源提供","使用 Azure 资源管理器配置应用程序性能监控","集成 Azure Identity 进行安全身份验证和授权"],"ja":["Application Insights リソースのプロビジョニングを自動化する","Azure リソース マネージャーを使用してアプリケーションのパフォーマンス モニタリングを構成する","Azure Identity を統合してセキュアな認証と承認を行う"],"ko":["Application Insights 리소스 프로비저닝 자동화","Azure Resource Manager를 사용하여 애플리케이션 성능 모니터링 구성","Azure Identity 통합을 통한 보안 인증 및 인가"],"es":["Automatización de la provisión de recursos de Application Insights","Configuración del monitoreo del rendimiento de aplicaciones mediante Azure Resource Manager","Integración de Azure Identity para autenticación y autorización seguras"],"fr":["Automatisation de la provision de ressources Application Insights","Configuration du suivi des performances des applications à l''aide d''Azure Resource Manager","Intégration d''Azure Identity pour une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées"],"de":["Automatisierung der Bereitstellung von Application Insights-Ressourcen","Konfiguration der Anwendungsleistungsüberwachung mithilfe von Azure Resource Manager","Integration von Azure Identity für sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a provisionamento de recursos do Application Insights","Configurar o monitoramento de desempenho de aplicativos usando o Azure Resource Manager","Integrar a Azure Identity para autenticação e autorização seguras"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выделение ресурсов Application Insights","Настроить мониторинг производительности приложений с помощью Azure Resource Manager","Интегрировать Azure Identity для безопасной аутентификации и авторизации"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لموردات Application Insights","تكوين مراقبة أداء التطبيقات باستخدام مدير الموارد Azure","دمج هوية Azure للتحقق والتصريح بشكل آمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure subscription and resource group","Dependent on Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights and Azure.Identity packages","Limited to .NET environment"],"zh":["需要 Azure 订阅和资源组","依赖于 Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights 和 Azure.Identity 包","仅限 .NET 环境"],"ja":["Azure サブスクリプションとリソース グループが必要","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights と Azure.Identity パッケージに依存",".NET 環境のみ"],"ko":["Azure订阅 및 리소스 그룹이 필요합니다","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights 및 Azure.Identity 패키지에 의존합니다",".NET 환경에서만 작동"],"es":["Requiere una suscripción y un grupo de recursos de Azure","Depende de los paquetes Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights y Azure.Identity","Limitado al entorno .NET"],"fr":["Nécessite un abonnement et un groupe de ressources Azure","Dépend des packages Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights et Azure.Identity","Limité à l''environnement .NET"],"de":["Benötigt ein Azure-Abonnement und eine Ressourcengruppe","Hängt von den Paketen Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights und Azure.Identity ab","Begrenzt auf die .NET-Umgebung"],"pt":["Exige assinatura do Azure e grupo de recursos","Dependente dos pacotes Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights e Azure.Identity","Limitado ao ambiente .NET"],"ru":["Требуется подписка Azure и группа ресурсов","Зависит от пакетов Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights и Azure.Identity","Ограничен средой .NET"],"ar":["يتطلب اشتراكًا في Azure ومجموعة موردات","يعتمد على حزم Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights و Azure.Identity ","محدود بالبيئة .NET"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp/idapython', 'community', 'mrexodia', 'ida-pro-mcp', 'mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp', 'idapython', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z', '2026-02-18T02:18:17.299Z', NULL, '{"id":"mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp/idapython","name":"idapython","description":{"zh":"IDAPython 是一个 AI 驱动的逆向工程助手，通过 MCP 将 IDA Pro 与语言模型连接起来。使用现代 ida_* 模块可以提高开发效率","ja":"IDAPython は、MCP を介して IDA Pro を言語モデルと接続する AI ドリブンの逆向きエンジニアリング アシスタントです。モダンな ida_* モジュールを使用することで開発効率が向上します","ko":"IDAPython은 MCP를 통해 IDA Pro와 언어 모델을 연결하는 AI 기반의 역공학 도우미입니다. 최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용하면 개발 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"idapython es un asistente de ingeniería inversa que conecta IDA Pro con modelos de lenguaje a través de MCP. Utiliza módulos modernos como ida_* para evitar la herencia de idc.","fr":"idapython est un assistant d''ingénierie inverse qui relie IDA Pro aux modèles de langage via MCP. Utilisez des modules modernes tels que ida_* pour éviter l''héritage de idc.","de":"idapython ist ein KI-basierter Reverse-Engineering-Assistent, der IDA Pro mit Sprachmodellen über MCP verbindet. Verwenden Sie moderne Module wie ida_*, um die Vererbung von idc zu vermeiden.","pt":"O IDAPython é um assistente de engenharia reversa que combina IDA Pro com modelos de linguagem, permitindo análises avançadas.","ru":"IDAPython - это помощник обратного инжиниринга, который объединяет IDA Pro с языковыми моделями, позволяя проводить углубленный анализ.","ar":"IDAPython هو مساعد هندسة عكسية يجمع بين IDA Pro و نماذج اللغة، مما يسمح بالتحليل المتقدم.","en":"AI-powered reverse engineering assistant that bridges IDA Pro with language models through MCP."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"IDAPython 技术专家指南","ja":"IDAPython 技術エキスパートガイド","ko":"IDAPython 기술 전문가 가이드","es":"idapython: Asistente de ingeniería inversa con IDA Pro","fr":"idapython : Assistant d''ingénierie inverse avec IDA Pro","de":"idapython: KI-basierter Reverse-Engineering-Assistent mit...","pt":"IDAPython: Assistente de Engenharia Reversa Avançado","ru":"IDAPython: Продвинутый помощник обратного инжиниринга","ar":"IDAPython: مساعد هندسة عكسية متقدم","en":"idapython"},"description":{"zh":"IDAPython 是一个 AI 驱动的逆向工程助手，通过 MCP 将 IDA Pro 与语言模型连接起来。使用现代 ida_* 模块可以提高开发效率","ja":"IDAPython は、MCP を介して IDA Pro を言語モデルと接続する AI ドリブンの逆向きエンジニアリング アシスタントです。モダンな ida_* モジュールを使用することで開発効率が向上します","ko":"IDAPython은 MCP를 통해 IDA Pro와 언어 모델을 연결하는 AI 기반의 역공학 도우미입니다. 최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용하면 개발 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"idapython es un asistente de ingeniería inversa que conecta IDA Pro con modelos de lenguaje a través de MCP. Utiliza módulos modernos como ida_* para evitar ...","fr":"idapython est un assistant d''ingénierie inverse qui relie IDA Pro aux modèles de langage via MCP. Utilisez des modules modernes tels que ida_* pour éviter l''...","de":"idapython ist ein KI-basierter Reverse-Engineering-Assistent, der IDA Pro mit Sprachmodellen über MCP verbindet. Verwenden Sie moderne Module wie ida_*, um d...","pt":"O IDAPython é um assistente de engenharia reversa que combina IDA Pro com modelos de linguagem, permitindo análises avançadas.","ru":"IDAPython - это помощник обратного инжиниринга, который объединяет IDA Pro с языковыми моделями, позволяя проводить углубленный анализ.","ar":"IDAPython هو مساعد هندسة عكسية يجمع بين IDA Pro و نماذج اللغة، مما يسمح بالتحليل المتقدم.","en":"AI-powered reverse engineering assistant that bridges IDA Pro with language models through MCP."},"definition":{"en":"AI-powered reverse engineering assistant that bridges IDA Pro with language models through MCP."},"features":{"zh":["使用现代 ida_* 模块","避免使用遗留 idc 模块","支持 bytes/memory、functions、names、types 和 decompiler 功能"],"ja":["モダンな ida_* モジュールを使用","レガシ idc モジュールの使用を避ける","bytes/memory、functions、names、types、decompiler 機能をサポート"],"ko":["최신 ida_* 모듈 사용","레거시 idc 모듈 사용 피하기","bytes/memory, 함수, 이름, 유형 및 디컴파일러 기능 지원"],"es":["Módulos modernos como ida_*","Conexión con IDA Pro a través de MCP","Soporte para bytes y memoria","Funcionalidades de descompilación","Gestión de nombres y tipos"],"fr":["Modules modernes tels que ida_*","Connexion à IDA Pro via MCP","Prise en charge des octets et de la mémoire","Fonctionnalités de décompilation","Gestion des noms et des types"],"de":["Moderne Module wie ida_*","Verbindung mit IDA Pro über MCP","Unterstützung für Bytes und Speicher","Decompilierfunktionen","Verwaltung von Namen und Typen"],"pt":["Módulos modernos de IDA","Análise de bytes e memória","Trabalho com funções e nomes","Decompilador avançado","Suporte a tipos e informações de tipo"],"ru":["Современные модули IDA","Анализ байтов и памяти","Работа с функциями и именами","Продвинутый декомпилятор","Поддержка типов и информации о типах"],"ar":["مكونات حديثة من IDA","تحليل البايتات و الذاكرة","العمل مع الوظائف و الأسماء","مفكك متقدم","دعم الأنواع و معلومات النوع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["IDAPython","逆向工程","IDA Pro","语言模型","MCP","ida_* 模块"],"ja":["IDAPython","逆向きエンジニアリング","IDA Pro","言語モデル","MCP","ida_* モジュール"],"ko":["IDAPython","역공학","IDA Pro","언어 모델","MCP","ida_* 모듈"],"es":["idapython","ingeniería inversa","IDA Pro","modelos de lenguaje","MCP","descompilación","análisis de bytes","gestión de nombres"],"fr":["idapython","ingénierie inverse","IDA Pro","modèles de langage","MCP","décompilation","analyse d''octets","gestion des noms"],"de":["idapython","Reverse-Engineering","IDA Pro","Sprachmodelle","MCP","Decompilierung","Byte-Analyse","Namensverwaltung"],"pt":["IDAPython","Engenharia Reversa","IDA Pro","Modelos de Linguagem","Análise de Código","Desenvolvimento de Software","Segurança de Software","Inteligência Artificial"],"ru":["IDAPython","Обратный Инжиниринг","IDA Pro","Языковые Модели","Анализ Кодa","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Безопасность Программного Обеспечения","Искусственный Интеллект"],"ar":["IDAPython","هندسة عكسية","IDA Pro","نماذج اللغة","تحليل الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","أمن البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"mrexodia","repo":"ida-pro-mcp","repoPath":"mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"idapython","description":"IDA Pro Python scripting for reverse engineering. Use when writing IDAPython scripts, analyzing binaries, working with IDAs API for disassembly, decompilation (Hex-Rays), type systems, cross-references, functions, segments, or any IDA database manipulation. Covers ida_* modules (50+), idautils iterators, and common patterns.","bodyPreview":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `","body":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `lvar_t`, ctree visitor |\n| Segments | `ida_segment` | `segment_t`, `getseg`, `add_segm` |\n| Xrefs | `ida_xref` | `xrefblk_t`, `add_cref`, `add_dref` |\n| Instructions | `ida_ua` | `insn_t`, `op_t`, `decode_insn` |\n| Stack frames | `ida_frame` | `get_frame`, `define_stkvar` |\n| Iteration | `idautils` | `Functions()`, `Heads()`, `XrefsTo()`, `Strings()` |\n| UI/dialogs | `ida_kernwin` | `msg`, `ask_*`, `jumpto`, `Choose` |\n| Database info | `ida_ida` | `inf_get_*`, `inf_is_64bit()` |\n| Analysis | `ida_auto` | `auto_wait`, `plan_and_wait` |\n| Flow graphs | `ida_gdl` | `FlowChart`, `BasicBlock` |\n| Register tracking | `ida_regfinder` | `find_reg_value`, `reg_value_info_t` |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Iterate functions\n```python\nfor ea in idautils.Functions():\n    name = ida_funcs.get_func_name(ea)\n    func = ida_funcs.get_func(ea)\n```\n\n### Iterate instructions in function\n```python\nfor head in idautils.FuncItems(func_ea):\n    insn = ida_ua.insn_t()\n    if ida_ua.decode_insn(insn, head):\n        print(f\"{head:#x}: {insn.itype}\")\n```\n\n### Cross-references\n```python\nfor xref in idautils.XrefsTo(ea):\n    print(f\"{xref.frm:#x} -> {xref.to:#x} type={xref.type}\")\n```\n\n### Read/write bytes\n```python\ndata = ida_bytes.get_bytes(ea, size)\nida_bytes.patch_bytes(ea, b\"\\x90\\x90\")\n```\n\n### Names\n```python\nname = ida_name.get_name(ea)\nida_name.set_name(ea, \"new_name\", ida_name.SN_NOCHECK)\n```\n\n### Decompile function\n```python\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nif cfunc:\n    print(cfunc)  # pseudocode\n    for lvar in cfunc.lvars:\n        print(f\"{lvar.name}: {lvar.type()}\")\n```\n\n### Walk ctree (decompiled AST)\n```python\nclass MyVisitor(ida_hexrays.ctree_visitor_t):\n    def visit_expr(self, e):\n        if e.op == ida_hexrays.cot_call:\n            print(f\"Call at {e.ea:#x}\")\n        return 0\n\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nMyVisitor().apply_to(cfunc.body, None)\n```\n\n### Apply type\n```python\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\nif ida_typeinf.parse_decl(tif, None, \"int (*)(char *, int)\", 0):\n    ida_typeinf.apply_tinfo(ea, tif, ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE)\n```\n\n### Create structure\n```python\nudt = ida_typeinf.udt_type_data_t()\nm = ida_typeinf.udm_t()\nm.name = \"field1\"\nm.type = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t(ida_typeinf.BTF_INT32)\nm.offset = 0\nm.size = 4\nudt.push_back(m)\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\ntif.create_udt(udt, ida_typeinf.BTF_STRUCT)\ntif.set_named_type(ida_typeinf.get_idati(), \"MyStruct\")\n```\n\n### Strings list\n```python\nfor s in idautils.Strings():\n    print(f\"{s.ea:#x}: {str(s)}\")\n```\n\n### Wait for analysis\n```python\nida_auto.auto_wait()  # Block until autoanalysis completes\n```\n\n## Key Constants\n\n| Constant | Value/Use |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `BADADDR` | Invalid address sentinel |\n| `ida_name.SN_NOCHECK` | Skip name validation |\n| `ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE` | Force type application |\n| `o_reg`, `o_mem`, `o_imm`, `o_displ`, `o_near` | Operand types |\n| `dt_byte`, `dt_word`, `dt_dword`, `dt_qword` | Data types |\n| `fl_CF`, `fl_CN`, `fl_JF`, `fl_JN`, `fl_F` | Code xref types |\n| `dr_R`, `dr_W`, `dr_O` | Data xref types |\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **NEVER convert hex/decimal manually** — use `int_convert` MCP tool\n2. **Wait for analysis**: Call `ida_auto.auto_wait()` before reading results\n3. **Thread safety**: IDA SDK calls must run on main thread (use `@idasync`)\n4. **64-bit addresses**: Always assume `ea_t` can be 64-bit\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| `idc.*` functions | Use `ida_*` modules |\n| Hardcoded addresses | Use names, patterns, or xrefs |\n| Manual hex conversion | Use `int_convert` tool |\n| Blocking main thread | Use `execute_sync()` for long ops |\n| Guessing at types | Derive from disassembly/decompilation |\n\n## Detailed API Reference\n\nFor comprehensive documentation on any module, read `docs/<module>.md`:\n- **High-use**: `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs`, `ida_hexrays`, `ida_typeinf`, `ida_name`, `idautils`\n- **Medium-use**: `ida_segment`, `ida_xref`, `ida_ua`, `ida_frame`, `ida_kernwin`\n- **Specialized**: `ida_dbg` (debugger), `ida_nalt` (netnode storage), `ida_regfinder` (register tracking)\n\nFull RST sources from hex-rays.com available at `docs/<module>.rst`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:18:17.299Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced IDA Pro integration with Python scripting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级IDA Pro集成和Python脚本编写能力的逆向工程代理。","ja":"IDA Proの高度な統合とPythonスクリプトの作成能力が必要な逆アセンブリエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 IDA Pro 통합 및 Python 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 역공학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingeniería inversa que necesitan una integración avanzada de IDA Pro con capacidades de scripting de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie inverse nécessitant une intégration avancée d''IDA Pro avec des capacités de scripting Python.","de":"Perfekt für Reverse-Engineering-Agents, die eine erweiterte IDA-Pro-Integration mit Python-Scripting-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia Reversa que necessitam de integração avançada do IDA Pro com capacidades de script em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обратного инжиниринга, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция IDA Pro с возможностями скриптинга на Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل هندسة معكوسة يحتاج إلى دمج متقدم من IDA Pro مع إمكانيات برمجة بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to bridge IDA Pro with language models through MCP, utilizing modern `ida_*` modules such as `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs`, and `ida_hexrays` for tasks like bytes/memory manipulation, function analysis, and decompilation.","zh":"赋予代理通过MCP将IDA Pro与语言模型连接起来的能力，利用诸如`ida_bytes`、`ida_funcs`和`ida_hexrays`的现代`ida_*`模块来执行字节/内存操作、函数分析和反编译等任务。","ja":"MCPを介してIDA Proと言語モデルを接続する機能をエージェントに提供することで、バイト/メモリ操作、関数解析、デコンパイルなどのタスクを実行するために、`ida_bytes`、`ida_funcs`、`ida_hexrays`などのモダンな`ida_*`モジュールを利用します。","ko":"MCP를 통해 IDA Pro와 언어 모델을 연결하는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하여 `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs`, `ida_hexrays` 등의 최신 `ida_*` 모듈을 사용하여 바이트/메모리 조작, 함수 분석 및 디컴파일 등의 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes conectar IDA Pro con modelos de lenguaje a través de MCP, utilizando módulos modernos `ida_*` como `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs` y `ida_hexrays` para tareas como la manipulación de bytes/memoria, el análisis de funciones y la descompilación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de relier IDA Pro à des modèles de langage via MCP, en utilisant des modules modernes `ida_*` tels que `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs` et `ida_hexrays` pour des tâches comme la manipulation de bytes/mémoire, l''analyse de fonctions et la désassemblage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, IDA Pro mit Sprachmodellen über MCP zu verbinden, indem moderne `ida_*`-Module wie `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs` und `ida_hexrays` für Aufgaben wie Byte-/Speicher-Manipulation, Funktionsanalyse und Dekompilierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ligar o IDA Pro a modelos de linguagem por meio do MCP, utilizando módulos modernos `ida_*` como `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs` e `ida_hexrays` para tarefas como manipulação de bytes/memória, análise de funções e descompilação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью соединить IDA Pro с языковыми моделями через MCP, используя современные модули `ida_*`, такие как `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs` и `ida_hexrays`, для задач, таких как манипуляция байтами/памятью, анализ функций и декомпиляция.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من ربط IDA Pro بنماذج اللغة من خلال MCP، باستخدام وحدات حديثة `ida_*` مثل `ida_bytes` و `ida_funcs` و `ida_hexrays` لمهام مثل تعديل البايتات / الذاكرة وتحليل الوظائف والتحليل العكسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating reverse engineering workflows using `ida_bytes` and `ida_funcs` modules","Generating function signatures and analyzing code structures with `ida_funcs` and `ida_hexrays`","Decompiling binaries and analyzing decompiled code using `ida_hexrays`"],"zh":["使用`ida_bytes`和`ida_funcs`模块自动化逆向工程工作流程","使用`ida_funcs`和`ida_hexrays`生成函数签名和分析代码结构","使用`ida_hexrays`进行二进制反编译和反编译代码分析"],"ja":["エージェントが`ida_bytes`モジュールと`ida_funcs`モジュールを使用して逆アセンブリのワークフローを自動化する","`ida_funcs`モジュールと`ida_hexrays`モジュールを使用して関数シグネチャを生成し、コード構造を分析する","`ida_hexrays`モジュールを使用してバイナリをデコンパイルし、デコンパイルされたコードを分析する"],"ko":["`ida_bytes` 및 `ida_funcs` 모듈을 사용하여 역공학 워크플로를 자동화하는 에이전트","`ida_funcs` 및 `ida_hexrays` 모듈을 사용하여 함수 시그니처를 생성하고 코드 구조를 분석하는 에이전트","`ida_hexrays` 모듈을 사용하여 바이너리 디컴파일 및 디컴파일된 코드 분석"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de ingeniería inversa utilizando los módulos `ida_bytes` y `ida_funcs`","Generar firmas de función y analizar estructuras de código con `ida_funcs` y `ida_hexrays`","Deshacer la compilación de binarios y analizar el código descompilado utilizando `ida_hexrays`"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''ingénierie inverse en utilisant les modules `ida_bytes` et `ida_funcs`","Générer des signatures de fonction et analyser les structures de code avec `ida_funcs` et `ida_hexrays`","Désassembler des binaires et analyser le code désassemblé en utilisant `ida_hexrays`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Reverse-Engineering-Workflows unter Verwendung der Module `ida_bytes` und `ida_funcs`","Erzeugen von Funktions-Signaturen und Analysieren von Code-Strukturen mit `ida_funcs` und `ida_hexrays`","Dekompilieren von Binärdateien und Analysieren des dekompilierten Codes unter Verwendung von `ida_hexrays`"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de engenharia reversa usando módulos `ida_bytes` e `ida_funcs`","Gerar assinaturas de funções e analisar estruturas de código com `ida_funcs` e `ida_hexrays`","Descompilar binários e analisar código descompilado usando `ida_hexrays`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы обратного инжиниринга с использованием модулей `ida_bytes` и `ida_funcs`","Генерировать сигнатуры функций и анализировать структуры кода с помощью `ida_funcs` и `ida_hexrays`","Декомпилировать бинарные файлы и анализировать декомпилированный код с помощью `ida_hexrays`"],"ar":["تحويل سير عمل هندسة معكوسة تلقائيًا باستخدام وحدات `ida_bytes` و `ida_funcs`","توليد التوقيعات الدالة وتحليل هياكل الكود باستخدام `ida_funcs` و `ida_hexrays`","فك التشفير الثنائي وتحليل الكود المفكك باستخدام `ida_hexrays`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IDA Pro installation and MCP setup","Python scripting knowledge required for effective usage","Avoids legacy `idc` module, requiring use of modern `ida_*` modules"],"zh":["需要IDA Pro安装和MCP设置","需要Python脚本编写知识才能有效使用","避免使用遗留的`idc`模块，需要使用现代的`ida_*`模块"],"ja":["IDA ProのインストールとMCPの設定が必要です","有効に使用するにはPythonスクリプトの作成知識が必要です","レガシーの`idc`モジュールの使用を避け、モダンな`ida_*`モジュールの使用が必要です"],"ko":["IDA Pro 설치 및 MCP 설정이 필요합니다","효과적으로 사용하려면 Python 스크립팅 지식이 필요합니다","레거시 `idc` 모듈을 피하고 최신 `ida_*` 모듈을 사용해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de IDA Pro y la configuración de MCP","Se requiere conocimiento de scripting de Python para un uso efectivo","Evita el módulo heredado `idc`, lo que requiere el uso de módulos modernos `ida_*`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''IDA Pro et la configuration de MCP","Connaissances de scripting Python requises pour une utilisation efficace","Évite le module hérité `idc`, ce qui nécessite l''utilisation de modules modernes `ida_*`"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von IDA Pro und die Einrichtung von MCP","Python-Scripting-Kenntnisse sind für eine effektive Verwendung erforderlich","Vermeidet das veraltete `idc`-Modul, was die Verwendung moderner `ida_*`-Module erfordert"],"pt":["Requer instalação do IDA Pro e configuração do MCP","Conhecimento de script em Python é necessário para uso eficaz","Evita o módulo legado `idc`, exigindo o uso de módulos modernos `ida_*`"],"ru":["Требуется установка IDA Pro и настройка MCP","Знание скриптинга на Python необходимо для эффективного использования","Избегает устаревшего модуля `idc`, требуя использования современных модулей `ida_*`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت IDA Pro وإعداد MCP","معارف برمجة بايثون ضرورية للاستخدام الفعال","يتجنب وحدة `idc` القديمة، مما يتطلب استخدام وحدات حديثة `ida_*`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
