on":{"zh":"baoyu-url-to-markdown技能可以通过Chrome CDP获取URL并转换为干净的Markdown。","ja":"baoyu-url-to-markdownスキルは、Chrome CDPを使用してURLを取得し、クリーンなMarkdownに変換します。","ko":"baoyu-url-to-markdown 스킬은 Chrome CDP를 사용하여 URL을 가져와 깨끗한 Markdown로 변환합니다.","es":"El agente baoyu-url-to-markdown utiliza Chrome CDP para convertir HTML en markdown limpio. Los scripts se encuentran en el subdirectorio scripts/.","fr":"L''agent baoyu-url-to-markdown utilise Chrome CDP pour convertir le HTML en markdown propre. Les scripts se trouvent dans le sous-répertoire scripts/.","de":"Der Agent baoyu-url-to-markdown verwendet Chrome CDP, um HTML in sauberen Markdown zu konvertieren. Die Skripte befinden sich im Unterordner scripts/.","pt":"O baoyu-url-to-markdown é uma skill que converte HTML em markdown limpo via Chrome CDP. Ele executa scripts em TypeScript.","ru":"Baoyu-url-to-markdown - это навык, который преобразует HTML в чистый markdown через Chrome CDP. Он выполняет скрипты на TypeScript.","ar":"baoyu-url-to-markdown هو مهارة تحول HTML إلى markdown نظيف عبر Chrome CDP. وهو ينفذ سكريبتات في TypeScript.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["通过Chrome CDP获取URL","转换为干净的Markdown","支持多种脚本","易于使用和集成","提高开发效率","支持多语言"],"ja":["Chrome CDPを使用してURLを取得","クリーンなMarkdownに変換","複数のスクリプトをサポート","使用と統合が容易","開発効率を向上","複数の言語をサポート"],"ko":["Chrome CDP를 사용하여 URL을 가져옴","깨끗한 Markdown로 변환","다수의 스크립트를 지원","사용과 통합이容易","개발 효율을 향상","다수의 언어를 지원"],"es":["Conversión de URLs en markdown limpio","Utiliza Chrome CDP para la conversión","Scripts personalizables en el subdirectorio scripts/","Código abierto y editable","Compatibilidad con varios formatos de entrada"],"fr":["Conversion d''URL en markdown propre","Utilise Chrome CDP pour la conversion","Scripts personnalisables dans le sous-répertoire scripts/","Code open source et éditable","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats d''entrée"],"de":["Konvertierung von URLs in sauberen Markdown","Verwenden von Chrome CDP für die Konvertierung","Anpassbare Skripte im Unterordner scripts/","Open-Source-Code und editierbar","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Eingabeformaten"],"pt":["Conversão de HTML em markdown limpo","Uso do Chrome CDP para fetch de URLs","Execução de scripts em TypeScript","Suporte a múltiplas URLs","Saída em formato markdown"],"ru":["Преобразование HTML в чистый markdown","Использование Chrome CDP для получения URL","Выполнение скриптов на TypeScript","Поддержка нескольких URL","Вывод в формате markdown"],"ar":["تحويل HTML إلى markdown نظيف","استخدام Chrome CDP لجلب URLs","تنفيذ سكريبتات في TypeScript","دعم متعدد URLs","إخراج في تنسيق markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["URL转换","Markdown","Chrome CDP","开发工具","脚本","集成","开发效率","多语言支持"],"ja":["URL変換","Markdown","Chrome CDP","開発ツール","スクリプト","統合","開発効率","多言語対応"],"ko":["URL 변환","Markdown","Chrome CDP","개발 도구","스크립트","통합","개발 효율","다국어 지원"],"es":["conversor url a markdown","chrome cdp","markdown limpio","agente baoyu-url-to-markdown","desarrollo web","productividad"],"fr":["convertisseur url en markdown","chrome cdp","markdown propre","agent baoyu-url-to-markdown","développement web","productivité"],"de":["url zu markdown konverter","chrome cdp","sauberer markdown","agent baoyu-url-to-markdown","webentwicklung","produktivität"],"pt":["conversão de url para markdown","chrome cdp","typescript","markdown limpo","ferramenta de conversão","desenvolvimento web","seo"],"ru":["преобразование url в markdown","chrome cdp","typescript","чистый markdown","инструмент преобразования","веб-разработка","seo"],"ar":["تحويل url إلى markdown","chrome cdp","typescript","markdown نظيف","أداة تحويل","تطوير الويب","seo"]}},"owner":"JimLiu","repo":"baoyu-skills","repoPath":"JimLiu/baoyu-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.395Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":"Fetch any URL and convert to markdown using Chrome CDP. Supports two modes - auto-capture on page load, or wait for user signal (for pages requiring login). Use when user wants to save a webpage as markdown.","bodyPreview":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.t","body":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for URL fetching |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default output directory | Default capture mode | Timeout settings\n\n## Features\n\n- Chrome CDP for full JavaScript rendering\n- Two capture modes: auto or wait-for-user\n- Clean markdown output with metadata\n- Handles login-required pages via wait mode\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto mode (default) - capture when page loads\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url>\n\n# Wait mode - wait for user signal before capture\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> --wait\n\n# Save to specific file\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> -o output.md\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<url>` | URL to fetch |\n| `-o <path>` | Output file path (default: auto-generated) |\n| `--wait` | Wait for user signal before capturing |\n| `--timeout <ms>` | Page load timeout (default: 30000) |\n\n## Capture Modes\n\n| Mode | Behavior | Use When |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Auto (default) | Capture on network idle | Public pages, static content |\n| Wait (`--wait`) | User signals when ready | Login-required, lazy loading, paywalls |\n\n**Wait mode workflow**:\n1. Run with `--wait` → script outputs \"Press Enter when ready\"\n2. Ask user to confirm page is ready\n3. Send newline to stdin to trigger capture\n\n## Output Format\n\nYAML front matter with `url`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `published`, `captured_at` fields, followed by converted markdown content.\n\n## Output Directory\n\n```\nurl-to-markdown/<domain>/<slug>.md\n```\n\n- `<slug>`: From page title or URL path (kebab-case, 2-6 words)\n- Conflict resolution: Append timestamp `<slug>-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `URL_CHROME_PATH` | Custom Chrome executable path |\n| `URL_DATA_DIR` | Custom data directory |\n| `URL_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Custom Chrome profile directory |\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Chrome not found → set `URL_CHROME_PATH`. Timeout → increase `--timeout`. Complex pages → try `--wait` mode.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:19:02.663Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing to convert HTML content to clean markdown via Chrome CDP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Chrome CDP将HTML内容转换为干净markdown的Web Scraping Agents","ja":"Chrome CDPを使用してHTMLコンテンツをクリーンなMarkdownに変換する必要があるWeb Scrapingエージェントに最適","ko":"Chrome CDP를 사용하여 HTML 콘텐츠를 깨끗한 마크다운으로 변환해야 하는 웹 스크레이핑 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Web Scraping que necesitan convertir contenido HTML a markdown limpio a través de Chrome CDP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Web Scraping qui ont besoin de convertir le contenu HTML en markdown propre via Chrome CDP.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Scraping-Agents, die HTML-Inhalte in sauberes Markdown über Chrome CDP umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Web Scraping que precisam converter conteúdo HTML para markdown limpo via Chrome CDP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-скраппинга, которым необходимо преобразовывать содержимое HTML в чистый markdown через Chrome CDP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل خلاल الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحويل المحتوى HTML إلى markdown نظيف عبر Chrome CDP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch URLs and convert HTML to markdown, utilizing Chrome CDP for seamless content processing and providing clean markdown output, supporting advanced text analysis and processing capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理程序获取URL和将HTML转换为Markdown的能力，利用Chrome CDP实现无缝的内容处理，并提供干净的Markdown输出，支持高级文本分析和处理能力","ja":"エージェントにURLを取得し、HTMLをMarkdownに変換する機能を提供し、Chrome CDPを使用してシームレスなコンテンツ処理を行い、クリーンなMarkdown出力を提供し、高度なテキスト分析および処理機能をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 URL을 가져오고 HTML을 마크다운으로 변환할 수 있도록 하며 Chrome CDP를 사용하여 무결점의 콘텐츠 처리를 수행하고 깨끗한 마크다운 출력을 제공하며 고급 텍스트 분석 및 처리 기능을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar URLs y convertir HTML a markdown, utilizando Chrome CDP para un procesamiento de contenido sin problemas y proporcionando una salida de markdown limpia, que admite capacidades de análisis y procesamiento de texto avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des URL et de convertir le HTML en markdown, en utilisant Chrome CDP pour un traitement de contenu sans interruption et en fournissant une sortie markdown propre, qui prend en charge des capacités de traitement et d''analyse de texte avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, URLs abzurufen und HTML in Markdown umzuwandeln, indem Chrome CDP für eine nahtlose Inhaltsverarbeitung verwendet wird und eine saubere Markdown-Ausgabe bereitgestellt wird, die erweiterte Textanalyse- und Verarbeitungsfunktionen unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar URLs e converter HTML para markdown, utilizando o Chrome CDP para processamento de conteúdo sem interrupções e fornecendo saída de markdown limpo, suportando capacidades avançadas de análise e processamento de texto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать URL-адреса и преобразовывать HTML в markdown, используя Chrome CDP для бесшовной обработки контента и обеспечивая чистый вывод markdown, поддерживая расширенные возможности анализа и обработки текста.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استخراج URLs وتحويل HTML إلى markdown، مستخدماً Chrome CDP لمعالجة المحتوى بشكل متواصل وتوفير مخرجات markdown نظيفة، وداعمة لميزات متقدمة لتحليل النصوص ومعالجتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting web pages to markdown for text analysis","Fetching and processing HTML content from URLs for data extraction","Generating markdown documents from web-based resources"],"zh":["将网页转换为Markdown进行文本分析","从URL获取和处理HTML内容以进行数据提取","从基于Web的资源生成Markdown文档"],"ja":["テキスト分析のためにWebページをMarkdownに変換","データ抽出のためにURLからHTMLコンテンツを取得し処理","WebベースのリソースからMarkdown文書を生成"],"ko":["텍스트 분석을 위해 웹 페이지를 마크다운으로 변환","데이터 추출을 위해 URL에서 HTML 콘텐츠를 가져오고 처리","웹 기반 리소스에서 마크다운 문서 생성"],"es":["Conversión de páginas web a markdown para análisis de texto","Recuperación y procesamiento de contenido HTML desde URLs para extracción de datos","Generación de documentos markdown a partir de recursos basados en web"],"fr":["Conversion de pages web en markdown pour l''analyse de texte","Récupération et traitement de contenu HTML à partir d''URL pour l''extraction de données","Génération de documents markdown à partir de ressources basées sur le web"],"de":["Umwandlung von Webseiten in Markdown für Textanalyse","Abrufen und Verarbeiten von HTML-Inhalten von URLs für Datenextraktion","Erzeugung von Markdown-Dokumenten aus webbasierten Ressourcen"],"pt":["Conversão de páginas da web para markdown para análise de texto","Busca e processamento de conteúdo HTML de URLs para extração de dados","Geração de documentos markdown a partir de recursos baseados na web"],"ru":["Преобразование веб-страниц в markdown для анализа текста","Получение и обработка содержимого HTML из URL-адресов для извлечения данных","Генерация документов markdown из веб-ресурсов"],"ar":["تحويل صفحات الويب إلى markdown لتحليل النص","استخراج ومعالجة المحتوى HTML من URLs لاستخراج البيانات","توليد وثائق markdown من موارد قاعدة الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome CDP setup and configuration","Limited to HTML content conversion to markdown"],"zh":["需要Chrome CDP设置和配置","仅限HTML内容转换为Markdown"],"ja":["Chrome CDPの設定と構成が必要","HTMLコンテンツをMarkdownに変換することのみに限定"],"ko":["Chrome CDP 설정 및 구성이 필요","HTML 콘텐츠를 마크다운으로 변환하는 것만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración y setup de Chrome CDP","Limitado a la conversión de contenido HTML a markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et un setup de Chrome CDP","Limité à la conversion de contenu HTML en markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Chrome-CDP-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von HTML-Inhalten in Markdown"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Chrome CDP","Limitado à conversão de conteúdo HTML para markdown"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Chrome CDP","Ограничен преобразованием содержимого HTML в markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين Chrome CDP","محدود بتحويل المحتوى HTML إلى markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
