multivueltas","Script d''exécution de l''agent","Répertoire de scripts personnalisable"],"de":["Generierung von Text und Bild über die Gemini Web API","Unterstützung für Referenzbilder","Multivueltige Konversationen","Skript zur Ausführung des Agents","Anpassbares Skriptverzeichnis"],"pt":["Geração de texto e imagem via API","Suporte a imagens de referência","Conversas multi-turno","Utiliza a API Gemini Web","Scripts localizados em subdiretório scripts/","Suporte a execução de scripts em TypeScript"],"ru":["Генерация текста и изображений через API","Поддержка réféренческих изображений","Мульти-турнирные разговоры","Использует API Gemini Web","Скрипты расположены в подкаталоге scripts/","Поддержка выполнения скриптов на TypeScript"],"ar":["إنشاء نصوص وصور عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم للصور المرجعية","محادثات متعددة الدورات","استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Gemini Web","السكрипطات موجودة في زیر الدليل scripts/","دعم لتنفيذ السكрипطات بلغة TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gemini Web","文本生成","图像生成","AI 对话","开发工具","智能交互"],"ja":["Gemini Web","テキスト生成","画像生成","AI 会話","開発ツール","智能インタラクション"],"ko":["Gemini Web","텍스트 생성","이미지 생성","AI 대화","개발 도구","지능형 상호작용"],"es":["Gemini Web Client","generación de texto e imagen","API de Gemini Web","conversaciones multivueltas","script de ejecución de agente","desarrollo de habilidades","IA y machine learning"],"fr":["Gemini Web Client","génération de texte et d''image","API de Gemini Web","conversations multivueltas","script d''exécution de l''agent","développement de compétences","IA et apprentissage automatique"],"de":["Gemini Web Client","Generierung von Text und Bild","Gemini Web API","multivueltige Konversationen","Skript zur Ausführung des Agents","Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten","KI und maschinelles Lernen"],"pt":["Gemini Web Client","Geração de texto e imagem","API Gemini Web","Imagens de referência","Conversas multi-turno","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Клиент Gemini Web","Генерация текста и изображений","API Gemini Web","Референтные изображения","Мульти-турнирные разговоры","TypeScript","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["عميل Gemini Web","إنشاء نصوص وصور","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Gemini Web","الصور المرجعية","المحادثات متعددة الدورات","TypeScript","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"JimLiu","repo":"baoyu-skills","repoPath":"JimLiu/baoyu-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web","description":"Generates images and text via reverse-engineered Gemini Web API. Supports text generation, image generation from prompts, reference images for vision input, and multi-turn conversations. Use when other skills need image generation backend, or when user requests generate image with Gemini, Gemini text generation, or needs vision-capable AI generation.","bodyPreview":"# Gemini Web Client\n\nText/image generation via Gemini Web API. Supports reference images and multi-turn conversations.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|-----","body":"# Gemini Web Client\n\nText/image generation via Gemini Web API. Supports reference images and multi-turn conversations.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for text/image generation |\n| `scripts/gemini-webapi/*` | TypeScript port of `gemini_webapi` (GeminiClient, types, utils) |\n\n## Consent Check (REQUIRED)\n\nBefore first use, verify user consent for reverse-engineered API usage.\n\n**Consent file locations**:\n- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/baoyu-skills/gemini-web/consent.json`\n- Linux: `~/.local/share/baoyu-skills/gemini-web/consent.json`\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%\\baoyu-skills\\gemini-web\\consent.json`\n\n**Flow**:\n1. Check if consent file exists with `accepted: true` and `disclaimerVersion: \"1.0\"`\n2. If valid consent exists → print warning with `acceptedAt` date, proceed\n3. If no consent → show disclaimer, ask user via `AskUserQuestion`:\n   - \"Yes, I accept\" → create consent file with ISO timestamp, proceed\n   - \"No, I decline\" → output decline message, stop\n4. Consent file format: `{\"version\":1,\"accepted\":true,\"acceptedAt\":\"<ISO>\",\"disclaimerVersion\":\"1.0\"}`\n\n---\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                           Path                           │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default model | Proxy settings | Custom data directory\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Text generation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Your prompt\"\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Your prompt\" --model gemini-2.5-pro\n\n# Image generation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"A cute cat\" --image cat.png\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --promptfiles system.md content.md --image out.png\n\n# Vision input (reference images)\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Describe this\" --reference image.png\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Create variation\" --reference a.png --image out.png\n\n# Multi-turn conversation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Remember: 42\" --sessionId session-abc\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"What number?\" --sessionId session-abc\n\n# JSON output\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Hello\" --json\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--prompt`, `-p` | Prompt text |\n| `--promptfiles` | Read prompt from files (concatenated) |\n| `--model`, `-m` | Model: gemini-3-pro (default), gemini-2.5-pro, gemini-2.5-flash |\n| `--image [path]` | Generate image (default: generated.png) |\n| `--reference`, `--ref` | Reference images for vision input |\n| `--sessionId` | Session ID for multi-turn conversation |\n| `--list-sessions` | List saved sessions |\n| `--json` | Output as JSON |\n| `--login` | Refresh cookies, then exit |\n| `--cookie-path` | Custom cookie file path |\n| `--profile-dir` | Chrome profile directory |\n\n## Models\n\n| Model | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `gemini-3-pro` | Default, latest |\n| `gemini-2.5-pro` | Previous pro |\n| `gemini-2.5-flash` | Fast, lightweight |\n\n## Authentication\n\nFirst run opens browser for Google auth. Cookies cached automatically.\n\nSupported browsers (auto-detected): Chrome, Chrome Canary/Beta, Chromium, Edge.\n\nForce refresh: `--login` flag. Override browser: `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PATH` env var.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `GEMINI_WEB_DATA_DIR` | Data directory |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_COOKIE_PATH` | Cookie file path |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Chrome profile directory |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PATH` | Chrome executable path |\n| `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` | Proxy for Google access (set inline with command) |\n\n## Sessions\n\nSession files stored in data directory under `sessions/<id>.json`.\n\nContains: `id`, `metadata` (Gemini chat state), `messages` array, timestamps.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:19:23.256Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents seeking advanced text and image generation capabilities via the Gemini Web API","zh":"适用于寻求通过Gemini Web API实现高级文本和图像生成能力的对话式AI代理","ja":"Gemini Web APIを介して高度なテキストと画像生成機能を求める会話型AIエージェントに最適","ko":"Gemini Web API를 통해 고급 텍스트 및 이미지 생성 기능을 찾는 대화형 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA conversacional que buscan capacidades avanzadas de generación de texto e imagen a través de la API web Gemini","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA conversationnels qui recherchent des capacités avancées de génération de texte et d''image via l''API Web Gemini","de":"Ideal für Conversational-AI-Agents, die erweiterte Text- und Bildgenerierungsfunktionen über die Gemini-Web-API suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que buscam capacidades avançadas de geração de texto e imagem via a API Web Gemini","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных ИИ-агентов, ищущих расширенные возможности генерации текста и изображений через веб-API Gemini","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثي الذي يسعى لاستخدام إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء النص والصورة من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini الويب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to engage in multi-turn conversations and generate content using reference images, leveraging the Gemini Web API for enhanced text and image generation capabilities, supporting both conversational flow and visual content creation","zh":"赋予代理在多回合对话中进行互动并使用参考图像生成内容的能力，利用Gemini Web API增强文本和图像生成功能，支持对话流程和视觉内容创建","ja":"エージェントが参照画像を使用してコンテンツを生成し、マルチターンディアログを通じてユーザーとのやり取りを行うことを可能にし、Gemini Web APIを活用してテキストと画像生成機能を強化し、会話の流れと視覚コンテンツの作成をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 참조 이미지에 따라 콘텐츠를 생성하고 다중 턴 대화를 통해 사용자와 상호 작용할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Gemini Web API를 활용하여 텍스트 및 이미지 생성 기능을 강화하여 대화 흐름과 시각적 콘텐츠 생성을 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes participar en conversaciones de varias vueltas y generar contenido utilizando imágenes de referencia, aprovechando la API web Gemini para mejorar las capacidades de generación de texto e imagen, y apoyar tanto el flujo conversacional como la creación de contenido visual","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''engager dans des conversations à plusieurs tours et de générer du contenu en utilisant des images de référence, en exploitant l''API Web Gemini pour améliorer les capacités de génération de texte et d''image, et en soutenant à la fois le flux conversationnel et la création de contenu visuel","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, an Mehrfachgesprächen teilzunehmen und Inhalte mit Referenzbildern zu generieren, indem die Gemini-Web-API für erweiterte Text- und Bildgenerierungsfunktionen genutzt wird, und sowohl den Gesprächsfluss als auch die Erstellung visueller Inhalte unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se envolverem em conversas de várias voltas e gerar conteúdo usando imagens de referência, aproveitando a API Web Gemini para capacidades de geração de texto e imagem aprimoradas, suportando tanto o fluxo de conversa quanto a criação de conteúdo visual","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вести многоходовые разговоры и генерировать контент на основе эталонных изображений, используя веб-API Gemini для улучшения возможностей генерации текста и изображений, поддерживая как поток разговора, так и создание визуального контента","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من الانخراط في محادثات متعددة الدورات وتوليد المحتوى باستخدام الصور المرجعية، واستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini الويب لتحسين إمكانيات إنشاء النص والصورة، ودعم كل من تدفق المحادثة وإنشاء المحتوى المرئي"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating text responses based on reference images","Engaging in multi-turn conversations for enhanced user experience","Creating visual content to supplement text-based interactions"],"zh":["基于参考图像生成文本响应","进行多回合对话以增强用户体验","创建视觉内容以补充基于文本的交互"],"ja":["参照画像に基づいてテキスト応答を生成する","マルチターンディアログを通じてユーザー体験を強化する","テキストベースのインタラクションを補完するための視覚コンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["참조 이미지에 따라 텍스트 응답을 생성","다중 턴 대화를 통해 사용자 경험을 향상","텍스트 기반 상호 작용을 보완하기 위한 시각적 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Generar respuestas de texto basadas en imágenes de referencia","Participar en conversaciones de varias vueltas para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Crear contenido visual para complementar las interacciones basadas en texto"],"fr":["Générer des réponses de texte basées sur des images de référence","S''engager dans des conversations à plusieurs tours pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Créer du contenu visuel pour compléter les interactions basées sur le texte"],"de":["Generieren von Textantworten basierend auf Referenzbildern","Teilnahme an Mehrfachgesprächen zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Erstellen visueller Inhalte zur Ergänzung textbasierter Interaktionen"],"pt":["Gerar respostas de texto com base em imagens de referência","Engajar-se em conversas de várias voltas para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Criar conteúdo visual para complementar interações baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Генерировать текстовые ответы на основе эталонных изображений","Вести многоходовые разговоры для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Создавать визуальный контент для дополнения текстовых взаимодействий"],"ar":["توليد استجابات نصية تعتمد على الصور المرجعية","الانخراط في محادثات متعددة الدورات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","إنشاء محتوى مرئي لدعم التفاعلات القائمة على النص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Gemini Web API","Dependent on script execution from the scripts/ subdirectory"],"zh":["需要访问Gemini Web API","依赖于脚本执行从scripts/子目录"],"ja":["Gemini Web APIへのアクセスが必要","scripts/サブディレクトリからのスクリプト実行に依存"],"ko":["Gemini Web API에 액세스해야 함","scripts/ 하위 디렉토리에서 스크립트 실행에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API web Gemini","Depende de la ejecución de scripts desde el subdirectorio scripts/"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Web Gemini","Dépend de l''exécution de scripts à partir du sous-répertoire scripts/"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Gemini-Web-API","Hängt von der Skriptausführung aus dem Skript-Unterverzeichnis ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API Web Gemini","Dependente da execução de scripts do subdiretório scripts/"],"ru":["Требует доступа к веб-API Gemini","Зависит от выполнения скриптов из поддиректории scripts/"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini الويب","يعتمد على تشغيل البرامج النصية من المجلد الفرعي scripts/"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mitsuhiko/agent-stuff/openscad', 'community', 'mitsuhiko', 'agent-stuff', 'mitsuhiko/agent-stuff', 'openscad', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:19:20.079Z', NULL, '{"id":"mitsuhiko/agent-stuff/openscad","name":"openscad","description":{"zh":"OpenSCAD技能允许开发者创建、验证和导出3D模型，支持多角度预览和STL导出","ja":"OpenSCADスキルにより、開発者は3Dモデルを作成、検証、エクスポートできます。多角度からのプレビューとSTLのエクスポートをサポート","ko":"OpenSCAD 기술을 통해 개발자는 3D 모델을 생성, 확인 및 내보내기할 수 있으며 다중 角度预览 및 STL 내보내기 지원","es":"OpenSCAD es una herramienta para crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D. Soporta personalización de parámetros y vista previa.","fr":"OpenSCAD est un outil pour créer, valider et exporter des modèles 3D. Il prend en charge la personnalisation des paramètres et la prévisualisation.","de":"OpenSCAD ist ein Tool zum Erstellen, Validieren und Exportieren von 3D-Modellen. Es unterstützt die Anpassung von Parametern und die Vorschau.","pt":"OpenSCAD é uma ferramenta para criar e personalizar modelos 3D. Ele suporta pré-visualização e exportação para impressão 3D.","ru":"OpenSCAD — это инструмент для создания и настройки 3D-моделей. Он поддерживает предварительный просмотр и экспорт для 3D-печати.","ar":"OpenSCAD هو أداة لإنشاء ونشر نماذج 3D. يدعم معاينة وتصدير لطباعة 3D.","en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenSCAD技能：创建和导出3D模型","ja":"OpenSCADスキル：3Dモデルを作成してエクスポート","ko":"OpenSCAD 기술: 3D 모델 생성 및 내보내기","es":"OpenSCAD: Crea y Exporta Modelos 3D","fr":"OpenSCAD : Créez et Exportez des Modèles 3D","de":"OpenSCAD: Erstellen und Exportieren von 3D-Modellen","pt":"OpenSCAD: Crie Modelos 3D Personalizados","ru":"OpenSCAD: Создание Пользовательских 3D-Моделей","ar":"OpenSCAD: إنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة","en":"openscad"},"description":{"zh":"OpenSCAD技能允许开发者创建、验证和导出3D模型，支持多角度预览和STL导出","ja":"OpenSCADスキルにより、開発者は3Dモデルを作成、検証、エクスポートできます。多角度からのプレビューとSTLのエクスポートをサポート","ko":"OpenSCAD 기술을 통해 개발자는 3D 모델을 생성, 확인 및 내보내기할 수 있으며 다중 角度预览 및 STL 내보내기 지원","es":"OpenSCAD es una herramienta para crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D. Soporta personalización de parámetros y vista previa.","fr":"OpenSCAD est un outil pour créer, valider et exporter des modèles 3D. Il prend en charge la personnalisation des paramètres et la prévisualisation.","de":"OpenSCAD ist ein Tool zum Erstellen, Validieren und Exportieren von 3D-Modellen. Es unterstützt die Anpassung von Parametern und die Vorschau.","pt":"OpenSCAD é uma ferramenta para criar e personalizar modelos 3D. Ele suporta pré-visualização e exportação para impressão 3D.","ru":"OpenSCAD — это инструмент для создания и настройки 3D-моделей. Он поддерживает предварительный просмотр и экспорт для 3D-печати.","ar":"OpenSCAD هو أداة لإنشاء ونشر نماذج 3D. يدعم معاينة وتصدير لطباعة 3D.","en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"definition":{"en":"These are commands I use with agents, mostly Claude"},"features":{"zh":["参数自定义","多角度预览","STL导出","支持MakerWorld平台","命令行工具集成"],"ja":["パラメータのカスタマイズ","多角度からのプレビュー","STLのエクスポート","MakerWorldプラットフォームのサポート","コマンドラインツールの統合"],"ko":["매개 변수 사용자 지정","다중 角度预览","STL 내보내기","MakerWorld 플랫폼 지원","명령줄 도구 통합"],"es":["Creación de modelos 3D personalizados","Vista previa desde múltiples ángulos","Exportación a STL para plataformas de impresión 3D","Personalización de parámetros","Generación de imágenes de vista previa"],"fr":["Création de modèles 3D personnalisés","Prévisualisation depuis plusieurs angles","Exportation vers STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D","Personnalisation des paramètres","Génération d''images de prévisualisation"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen","Vorschau aus mehreren Perspektiven","Export in STL für 3D-Druckplattformen","Anpassung von Parametern","Generierung von Vorschaubildern"],"pt":["Criação de modelos 3D personalizados","Pré-visualização de modelos 3D","Exportação para impressão 3D","Suporte a parâmetros personalizados","Ferramentas para pré-visualização e edição"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских 3D-моделей","Предварительный просмотр 3D-моделей","Экспорт для 3D-печати","Поддержка настраиваемых параметров","Инструменты для предварительного просмотра и редактирования"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة","معاينة نماذج 3D","تصدير لطباعة 3D","دعم المعلمات المخصصة","أدوات لمعاينة وتنقيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSCAD","3D建模","STL导出","MakerWorld","参数自定义","多角度预览"],"ja":["OpenSCAD","3Dモデリング","STLエクスポート","MakerWorld","パラメータのカスタマイズ","多角度からのプレビュー"],"ko":["OpenSCAD","3D 모델링","STL 내보내기","MakerWorld","매개 변수 사용자 지정","다중 角度预览"],"es":["OpenSCAD","modelado 3D","impresión 3D","STL","personalización de parámetros","vista previa","scripting"],"fr":["OpenSCAD","modélisation 3D","impression 3D","STL","personnalisation des paramètres","prévisualisation","scripting"],"de":["OpenSCAD","3D-Modellierung","3D-Druck","STL","Parameteranpassung","Vorschau","Skripting"],"pt":["OpenSCAD","modelos 3D","impressão 3D","criação de modelos 3D","pré-visualização 3D","exportação 3D","parâmetros personalizados","ferramentas de pré-visualização"],"ru":["OpenSCAD","3D-модели","3D-печать","создание 3D-моделей","предварительный просмотр 3D","экспорт 3D","настраиваемые параметры","инструменты предварительного просмотра"],"ar":["OpenSCAD","نماذج 3D","طباعة 3D","إنشاء نماذج 3D","معاينة 3D","تصدير 3D","معلمات مخصصة","أدوات معاينة"]}},"owner":"mitsuhiko","repo":"agent-stuff","repoPath":"mitsuhiko/agent-stuff","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openscad","description":"Create and render OpenSCAD 3D models. Generate preview images from multiple angles, extract customizable parameters, validate syntax, and export STL files for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,","body":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,tz,dist] [--size=800x600]\n\n# Generate multi-angle preview (front, back, left, right, top, iso)\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad output_dir/\n```\n\n### STL Export\n```bash\n# Export to STL for 3D printing\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl [-D ''param=value'']\n```\n\n### Parameter Extraction\n```bash\n# Extract customizable parameters from an OpenSCAD file\n./tools/extract-params.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### Validation\n```bash\n# Check for syntax errors and warnings\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n## Visual Validation (Required)\n\n**Always validate your OpenSCAD models visually after creating or modifying them.**\n\nAfter writing or editing any OpenSCAD file:\n\n1. **Generate multi-angle previews** using `multi-preview.sh`\n2. **View each generated image** using the `read` tool\n3. **Check for issues** from multiple perspectives:\n   - Front/back: Verify symmetry, features, and proportions\n   - Left/right: Check depth and side profiles\n   - Top: Ensure top features are correct\n   - Isometric: Overall shape validation\n4. **Iterate if needed**: If something looks wrong, fix the code and re-validate\n\nThis catches issues that syntax validation alone cannot detect:\n- Inverted normals or inside-out geometry\n- Misaligned features or incorrect boolean operations\n- Proportions that don''t match the intended design\n- Missing or floating geometry\n- Z-fighting or overlapping surfaces\n\n**Never deliver an OpenSCAD model without visually confirming it looks correct from multiple angles.**\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Creating an OpenSCAD Model\n\nWrite OpenSCAD code with customizable parameters at the top:\n\n```openscad\n// Customizable parameters\nwall_thickness = 2;        // [1:0.5:5] Wall thickness in mm\nwidth = 50;                // [20:100] Width in mm\nheight = 30;               // [10:80] Height in mm\nrounded = true;            // Add rounded corners\n\n// Model code below\nmodule main_shape() {\n    if (rounded) {\n        minkowski() {\n            cube([width - 4, width - 4, height - 2]);\n            sphere(r = 2);\n        }\n    } else {\n        cube([width, width, height]);\n    }\n}\n\ndifference() {\n    main_shape();\n    translate([wall_thickness, wall_thickness, wall_thickness])\n        scale([1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1])\n        main_shape();\n}\n```\n\nParameter comment format:\n- `// [min:max]` - numeric range\n- `// [min:step:max]` - numeric range with step\n- `// [opt1, opt2, opt3]` - dropdown options\n- `// Description text` - plain description\n\n### 2. Validate the Model\n```bash\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### 3. Generate Previews\n\nGenerate preview images to visually validate the model:\n```bash\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad ./previews/\n```\n\nThis creates PNG images from multiple angles. Use the `read` tool to view them.\n\n### 4. Export to STL\n```bash\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl\n# With custom parameters:\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl -D ''width=60'' -D ''height=40''\n```\n\n## Camera Positions\n\nCommon camera angles for previews:\n- **Isometric**: `--camera=0,0,0,45,0,45,200`\n- **Front**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,0,200`\n- **Top**: `--camera=0,0,0,0,0,0,200`\n- **Right**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,90,200`\n\nFormat: `x,y,z,rotx,roty,rotz,distance`\n\n## MakerWorld Publishing\n\nFor MakerWorld, you typically need:\n1. STL file(s) exported via `export-stl.sh`\n2. Preview images (at least one good isometric view)\n3. A description of customizable parameters\n\nConsider creating a `model.json` with metadata:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Model Name\",\n  \"description\": \"Description for MakerWorld\",\n  \"parameters\": [...],\n  \"tags\": [\"functional\", \"container\", \"organizer\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Example: Full Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create the model (write .scad file)\n\n# 2. Validate syntax\n./tools/validate.sh box.scad\n\n# 3. Generate multi-angle previews\n./tools/multi-preview.sh box.scad ./previews/\n\n# 4. IMPORTANT: View and validate ALL preview images\n#    Use the read tool on each PNG file to visually inspect:\n#    - previews/box_front.png\n#    - previews/box_back.png\n#    - previews/box_left.png\n#    - previews/box_right.png\n#    - previews/box_top.png\n#    - previews/box_iso.png\n#    Look for geometry issues, misalignments, or unexpected results.\n#    If anything looks wrong, go back to step 1 and fix it!\n\n# 5. Extract and review parameters\n./tools/extract-params.sh box.scad\n\n# 6. Export STL with default parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box.stl\n\n# 7. Export STL with custom parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box_large.stl -D ''width=80'' -D ''height=60''\n```\n\n**Remember**: Never skip the visual validation step. Many issues (wrong dimensions, boolean operation errors, inverted geometry) are only visible when you actually look at the rendered model.\n\n## OpenSCAD Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Shapes\n```openscad\ncube([x, y, z]);\nsphere(r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r1 = bottom_r, r2 = top_r);  // cone\n```\n\n### Transformations\n```openscad\ntranslate([x, y, z]) object();\nrotate([rx, ry, rz]) object();\nscale([sx, sy, sz]) object();\nmirror([x, y, z]) object();\n```\n\n### Boolean Operations\n```openscad\nunion() { a(); b(); }        // combine\ndifference() { a(); b(); }   // subtract b from a\nintersection() { a(); b(); } // overlap only\n```\n\n### Advanced\n```openscad\nlinear_extrude(height) 2d_shape();\nrotate_extrude() 2d_shape();\nhull() { objects(); }        // convex hull\nminkowski() { a(); b(); }    // minkowski sum (rounding)\n```\n\n### 2D Shapes\n```openscad\ncircle(r = radius);\nsquare([x, y]);\npolygon(points = [[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]);\ntext(\"string\", size = 10);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:19:20.079Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Modeling Agents needing advanced OpenSCAD capabilities for custom 3D model creation and STL export.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 OpenSCAD 功能的 3D 建模代理，用于创建自定义 3D 模型和 STL 导出。","ja":"OpenSCAD の高度な機能を必要とする 3D モデリング エージェントに最適で、カスタム 3D モデルの作成と STL 出力に利用できます。","ko":"고급 OpenSCAD 기능이 필요한 3D 모델링 에이전트에게 적합하며, 사용자 지정 3D 모델 생성 및 STL 내보내기용으로 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado 3D que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de OpenSCAD para la creación de modelos 3D personalizados y la exportación de STL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation 3D ayant besoin de fonctionnalités OpenSCAD avancées pour la création de modèles 3D personnalisés et l''exportation de STL.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Modellierungsagenten, die erweiterte OpenSCAD-Funktionen für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen und den Export von STL benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem 3D que necessitam de capacidades avançadas do OpenSCAD para criação personalizada de modelos 3D e exportação para STL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-моделирования, которым требуются расширенные возможности OpenSCAD для создания пользовательских 3D-моделей и экспорта в формат STL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء نمذجة 3D الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности متقدمة من OpenSCAD لإنشاء نموذج 3D مخصص وتصدير STL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models with parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld, utilizing Homebrew for installation and supporting multiple camera views for preview generation.","zh":"赋予代理创建、验证和导出 OpenSCAD 3D 模型的能力，具有参数自定义、多角度可视化预览和 STL 导出功能，支持 MakerWorld 等 3D 打印平台，并利用 Homebrew 进行安装，支持多摄像头视图用于预览生成。","ja":"エージェントに OpenSCAD 3D モデルの作成、検証、エクスポートを可能にし、パラメータのカスタマイズ、複数の角度からのビジュアル プレビュー、STL 出力など MakerWorld などの 3D プリント プラットフォームをサポートし、Homebrew を使用してインストールし、プレビュー生成用の複数のカメラ ビューをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenSCAD 3D 모델을 생성, 검증 및 내보내기할 수 있도록 해주며, 파라미터 사용자 지정, 여러 각도에서 시각적 미리 보기, STL 내보내기 등의 기능을 제공하여 MakerWorld 등의 3D 프린팅 플랫폼을 지원하며, Homebrew를 사용하여 설치하고, 미리 보기 생성을 위한 여러 카메라 뷰를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D de OpenSCAD con personalización de parámetros, vista previa visual desde múltiples ángulos y exportación de STL para plataformas de impresión 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando Homebrew para la instalación y admitiendo varias vistas de cámara para la generación de vistas previas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, valider et d''exporter des modèles 3D OpenSCAD avec une personnalisation des paramètres, un aperçu visuel depuis plusieurs angles et une exportation de STL pour les plates-formes d''impression 3D comme MakerWorld, en utilisant Homebrew pour l''installation et en prenant en charge plusieurs vues de caméra pour la génération d''aperçus.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, OpenSCAD-3D-Modelle mit Parameteranpassung, visueller Vorschau aus mehreren Winkeln und STL-Export für 3D-Druckplattformen wie MakerWorld zu erstellen, zu validieren und zu exportieren, wobei Homebrew für die Installation verwendet wird und mehrere Kameraperspektiven für die Vorschau-Generierung unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar, validar e exportar modelos 3D do OpenSCAD com personalização de parâmetros, pré-visualização visual de múltiplos ângulos e exportação STL para plataformas de impressão 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando Homebrew para instalação e suportando várias vistas de câmera para geração de pré-visualização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, проверять и экспортировать 3D-модели OpenSCAD с настройкой параметров, визуальным просмотром с нескольких углов и экспортом в формат STL для платформ 3D-печати, таких как MakerWorld, используя Homebrew для установки и поддержку нескольких видов камер для генерации предварительного просмотра.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وتصديق وتصدير نماذج 3D من OpenSCAD مع تخصيص المعلمات والتنبؤ المرئي من زوايا متعددة وتصدير STL لمنصات الطباعة 3D مثل MakerWorld، باستخدام Homebrew للتثبيت ودعم عدة مناظير الكاميرا لتنبؤ الإنتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D model previews from SCAD files","Customizing model parameters for personalized 3D printing","Exporting STL files for MakerWorld and other 3D printing platforms"],"zh":["从 SCAD 文件生成 3D 模型预览","为个性化 3D 打印自定义模型参数","为 MakerWorld 和其他 3D 打印平台导出 STL 文件"],"ja":["SCAD ファイルから 3D モデル プレビューを生成する","個別化 3D プリント用にモデル パラメータをカスタマイズする","MakerWorld やその他の 3D プリント プラットフォーム向けに STL ファイルをエクスポートする"],"ko":["SCAD 파일에서 3D 모델 미리 보기 생성하기","개인화된 3D 프린팅을 위한 모델 파라미터 사용자 지정","MakerWorld 및 기타 3D 프린팅 플랫폼을 위한 STL 파일 내보내기"],"es":["Generar vistas previas de modelos 3D a partir de archivos SCAD","Personalizar parámetros de modelo para la impresión 3D personalizada","Exportar archivos STL para MakerWorld y otras plataformas de impresión 3D"],"fr":["Générer des aperçus de modèles 3D à partir de fichiers SCAD","Personnaliser les paramètres de modèle pour l''impression 3D personnalisée","Exporter des fichiers STL pour MakerWorld et d''autres plates-formes d''impression 3D"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Modellvorschauen aus SCAD-Dateien","Anpassen von Modellparametern für personalisierten 3D-Druck","Exportieren von STL-Dateien für MakerWorld und andere 3D-Druckplattformen"],"pt":["Gerar pré-visualizações de modelos 3D a partir de arquivos SCAD","Personalizar parâmetros do modelo para impressão 3D personalizada","Exportar arquivos STL para MakerWorld e outras plataformas de impressão 3D"],"ru":["Генерировать предварительные просмотры 3D-моделей из файлов SCAD","Настроить параметры модели для индивидуальной 3D-печати","Экспортировать файлы STL для MakerWorld и других платформ 3D-печати"],"ar":["إنشاء معاينات للمواد 3D من الملفات SCAD","تخصيص معلمات النموذج للطباعة 3D المخصصة","تصدير ملفات STL لمنصة MakerWorld ومنصات الطباعة 3D الأخرى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSCAD installation via Homebrew","Limited to OpenSCAD file format (.scad)"],"zh":["需要通过 Homebrew 安装 OpenSCAD","仅限 OpenSCAD 文件格式 (.scad)"],"ja":["Homebrew 経由で OpenSCAD をインストールする必要がある","OpenSCAD ファイル形式 (.scad) 限定"],"ko":["Homebrew를 통해 OpenSCAD를 설치해야 함","OpenSCAD 파일 형식 (.scad)만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de OpenSCAD a través de Homebrew","Limitado al formato de archivo OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limité au format de fichier OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von OpenSCAD über Homebrew","Begrenzt auf das OpenSCAD-Dateiformat (.scad)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limitado ao formato de arquivo OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"ru":["Требует установки OpenSCAD через Homebrew","Ограничен форматом файла OpenSCAD (.scad)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت OpenSCAD عبر Homebrew","محدود بformat الملف OpenSCAD (.scad)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
