ة","هندسة تطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنيات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Jeffallan","repo":"claude-skills","repoPath":"Jeffallan/claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:19:59.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Developer Agents needing advanced .NET Core capabilities for building cloud-native applications.","zh":"适合需要高级 .NET Core 功能的全栈开发人员代理构建云原生应用程序。","ja":".NET Core の高度な機能を使用してクラウドネイティブアプリケーションを構築する必要があるフルスタック開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 .NET Core 기능을 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 구축하는 풀스택 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador de Pila Completa que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de .NET Core para construir aplicaciones nativas de la nube.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur full-stack nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées .NET Core pour construire des applications cloud-native.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Entwickler-Agents, die erweiterte .NET-Core-Fähigkeiten für die Erstellung von cloudbasierten Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor Full-Stack que necessitam de recursos avançados do .NET Core para construir aplicações nativas em nuvem.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков Full-Stack, которым необходимы расширенные возможности .NET Core для создания облачных приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء مطور البرمجيات الكاملة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة من .NET Core لإنشاء تطبيقات السحابية الأصلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance, scalable applications using .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns, enabling the creation of robust and efficient enterprise applications.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序的能力，使用 .NET 8、现代 C#、最小 API、实体框架 Core 和云原生模式，实现构建强大高效的企业应用程序。","ja":".NET 8、モダン C#、最小 API、Entity Framework Core、クラウドネイティブ パターンを使用して、高パフォーマンスでスケーラブルなアプリケーションを構築するエージェントを可能にし、強固で効率的なエンタープライズ アプリケーションの作成を可能にします。","ko":".NET 8, 최신 C#, 최소 API, 엔티티 프레임워크 코어 및 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 사용하여 고성능, 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하여, 강력하고 효율적인 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션의 생성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones de alto rendimiento y escalables utilizando .NET 8, C# moderno, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core y patrones nativos de la nube, lo que permite la creación de aplicaciones empresariales robustas y eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications haute performance et évolutives en utilisant .NET 8, C# moderne, API minimales, Entity Framework Core et des modèles cloud-native, permettant la création d''applications d''entreprise robustes et efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, leistungsstarke und skalierbare Anwendungen mit .NET 8, modernem C#, minimalen APIs, Entity Framework Core und cloudbasierten Mustern zu erstellen, wodurch die Erstellung robuster und effizienter Unternehmensanwendungen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de alto desempenho, escaláveis, usando .NET 8, C# moderno, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core e padrões de aplicativos nativos em nuvem, permitindo a criação de aplicações empresariais robustas e eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные, масштабируемые приложения, используя .NET 8, современный C#, минимальные API, Entity Framework Core и облачные шаблоны, что позволяет создавать надежные и эффективные корпоративные приложения.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات أداء عالية والمتوسعة باستخدام .NET 8 ، C# الحديثة ، APIs الدنيا ، Entity Framework Core و أنماط تطبيقات السحابية الأصلية ، مما يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات مؤسسية قوية و فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for rapid application development","Developing cloud-native applications with clean architecture and Entity Framework Core","Optimizing application performance using .NET 8 and C# 12 features"],"zh":["使用 .NET 8 构建最小 API 以实现快速应用程序开发","使用干净的架构和实体框架 Core 开发云原生应用程序","使用 .NET 8 和 C# 12 功能优化应用程序性能"],"ja":[".NET 8 を使用して最小 API を構築し、迅速なアプリケーション開発を実現する","クリーンなアーキテクチャと Entity Framework Core を使用してクラウドネイティブ アプリケーションを開発する",".NET 8 と C# 12 の機能を使用してアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":[".NET 8을 사용하여 최소 API를 구축하여 빠른 애플리케이션 개발을实现하는 것","클린 아키텍처와 엔티티 프레임워크 코어를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것",".NET 8 및 C# 12 기능을 사용하여 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construcción de APIs mínimas con .NET 8 para un desarrollo de aplicaciones rápido","Desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube con arquitectura limpia y Entity Framework Core","Optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación utilizando características de .NET 8 y C# 12"],"fr":["Conception d''API minimales avec .NET 8 pour un développement d''applications rapide","Développement d''applications cloud-native avec une architecture propre et Entity Framework Core","Optimisation des performances de l''application en utilisant les fonctionnalités de .NET 8 et C# 12"],"de":["Erstellung von minimalen APIs mit .NET 8 für eine schnelle Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklung von cloudbasierten Anwendungen mit sauberer Architektur und Entity Framework Core","Optimierung der Anwendungsleistung mit .NET 8- und C# 12-Features"],"pt":["Construção de APIs mínimas com .NET 8 para desenvolvimento rápido de aplicações","Desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem com arquitetura limpa e Entity Framework Core","Otimização do desempenho da aplicação usando recursos do .NET 8 e C# 12"],"ru":["Создание минимальных API с помощью .NET 8 для быстрой разработки приложений","Разработка облачных приложений с чистой архитектурой и Entity Framework Core","Оптимизация производительности приложения с помощью функций .NET 8 и C# 12"],"ar":["بناء APIs الدنيا مع .NET 8 لتطوير التطبيقات السريع","تطوير تطبيقات السحابية الأصلية مع هندسة نظيفة و Entity Framework Core","تحسين أداء التطبيق باستخدام ميزات .NET 8 و C# 12"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 8 and C# 12 expertise","Limited to cloud-native application development","Entity Framework Core required for database operations"],"zh":[".NET 8 和 C# 12 的专业知识是必需的","仅限于云原生应用程序开发","需要实体框架 Core 进行数据库操作"],"ja":[".NET 8 と C# 12 の専門知識が必要","クラウドネイティブ アプリケーション開発のみに限定される","データベース操作には Entity Framework Core が必要"],"ko":[".NET 8 및 C# 12 전문 지식이 필요합니다","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한됩니다","데이터베이스 작업을 위해 엔티티 프레임워크 코어가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de .NET 8 y C# 12","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Se requiere Entity Framework Core para operaciones de base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en .NET 8 et C# 12","Limité au développement d''applications cloud-native","Entity Framework Core est requis pour les opérations de base de données"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von .NET 8 und C# 12","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von cloudbasierten Anwendungen","Entity Framework Core ist für Datenbankoperationen erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento em .NET 8 e C# 12","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem","Entity Framework Core necessário para operações de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требуется знание .NET 8 и C# 12","Ограничен разработкой облачных приложений","Требуется Entity Framework Core для операций с базой данных"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة .NET 8 و C# 12","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات السحابية الأصلية","مطلوب Entity Framework Core للتعامل مع قواعد البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('flutter-it/get_it/flutter-architecture-expert', 'community', 'flutter-it', 'get_it', 'flutter-it/get_it', 'flutter-architecture-expert', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:20:27.649Z', NULL, '{"id":"flutter-it/get_it/flutter-architecture-expert","name":"flutter-architecture-expert","description":{"zh":"Flutter 应用架构专家提供了使用 Get It 的简单直接的服务定位器来解耦接口和具体实现。该解决方案允许您从应用中的任何位置访问具体实现","ja":"Flutter アプリケーションアーキテクチャ専門家は、Get It を使用してシンプルなサービスロケーターを作成し、インターフェイスと具体的な実装を解除します。このソリューションにより、アプリケーション内のどこからでも具体的な実装にアクセスできます","ko":"플러터 애플리케이션 아키텍처 전문가는 Get It을 사용하여 간단한 서비스 로케이터를 생성하여 인터페이스와 구체적인 구현을 분리합니다. 이 솔루션을 사용하면 애플리케이션의どこ에서でも 구체적인 구현에 액세스할 수 있습니다","es":"El experto en arquitectura Flutter proporciona orientación sobre la estructura y los patrones de las aplicaciones Flutter utilizando el conjunto de construcción flutter_it.","fr":"L''expert en architecture Flutter fournit des conseils sur la structure et les modèles des applications Flutter en utilisant l''ensemble de construction flutter_it.","de":"Der Flutter-Architektur-Experte bietet Anleitungen zur Struktur und den Mustern von Flutter-Anwendungen unter Verwendung des flutter_it-Bausteins.","pt":"O especialista em arquitetura Flutter fornece orientação sobre como estruturar aplicativos Flutter usando o conjunto de construção flutter_it.","ru":"Эксперт по архитектуре Flutter предоставляет рекомендации по структурированию приложений Flutter с помощью набора инструментов flutter_it.","ar":"خبير في هندسة Flutter يقدم إرشادات حول كيفية بناء تطبيقات Flutter باستخدام مجموعة البناء flutter_it.","en":"Get It - Simple direct Service Locator that allows to decouple the interface from a concrete implementation and to access the concrete implementation from everywhere in your App. Maintainer: @escamoteur"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Flutter 应用架构专家 - 简单直接的服务定位器","ja":"