ür die automatische Refactoring und Codegenerierung","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Leistungseffekt","Kompatibilität mit React und Next.js","Optimierung von Bundles und Datenladeverhalten"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","45 regras em 8 categorias","Guia para refatoração automática","Otimização de bundles","Melhoria de padrões de carregamento de dados"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","45 правил в 8 категориях","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга","Оптимизация пакетов","Улучшение шаблонов загрузки данных"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","45 قاعدة في 8 فئات","دليل لتحسين الترميز التلقائي","تحسين الحزم","تحسين نمط تحميل البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React 优化","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["Vercel React","최상의 실천","성능 최적화","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","optimización de bundles","patrones de carga de datos"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","optimisation des bundles","modèles de chargement de données"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Optimierung von Bundles","Datenladeverhalten"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Melhores práticas"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Лучшие практики"],"ar":["ري액ت فيركل","تحسين الأداء","ري액ت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"CloudAI-X","repo":"claude-workflow-v2","repoPath":"CloudAI-X/claude-workflow-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\n### When to Load\n\n- **Trigger**: React or Next.js development, component writing, data fetching patterns, bundle optimization\n- **Skip**: Project does not use React or Next.js\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React com","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\n### When to Load\n\n- **Trigger**: React or Next.js development, component writing, data fetching patterns, bundle optimization\n- **Skip**: Project does not use React or Next.js\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded and detailed code examples, see: `AGENTS.md`\n\nEach rule contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:20:20.415Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents focused on React and Next.js development needing automated performance optimization and code refactoring","zh":"非常适合专注于 React 和 Next.js 开发的前端代理，需要自动化性能优化和代码重构","ja":"React と Next.js 開発に注力しているフロントエンド エージェントにとって最適で、自動化されたパフォーマンス最適化とコードリファクタリングが必要","ko":"React와 Next.js 개발에 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며 자동화된 성능 최적화와 코드 리팩토링이 필요","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend centrados en el desarrollo de React y Next.js que necesitan una optimización del rendimiento automatizada y una refactorización de código","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend axés sur le développement React et Next.js nécessitant une optimisation des performances automatisée et une refactoring de code","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die auf React- und Next.js-Entwicklung fokussiert sind und eine automatisierte Leistungsoptimierung und Code-Refaktorierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend focados em desenvolvimento React e Next.js que precisam de otimização de desempenho automatizada e refatoração de código","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на разработку React и Next.js, которым требуется автоматизированная оптимизация производительности и рефакторинг кода","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يركزون على تطوير React و Next.js الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين الأداء التلقائي وإعادة هيكلة الكود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply 45 rules across 8 categories for bundle optimization, data fetching patterns, and component writing, leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive guidelines for automated refactoring and code generation with React and Next.js","zh":"赋予代理应用 45 条规则，跨 8 个类别用于包优化、数据获取模式和组件编写，利用 Vercel 的综合指南进行自动化重构和代码生成，支持 React 和 Next.js","ja":"エージェントに 45 のルールを適用し、8 つのカテゴリにわたってバンドル最適化、データ取得パターン、コンポーネントの書き方を行い、Vercel の包括的なガイドラインを使用して React と Next.js の自動リファクタリングとコード生成を行う","ko":"에이전트에게 45개의 규칙을 적용하여 8개의 카테고리를跨越하여 번들 최적화, 데이터 가져오기 패턴, 컴포넌트 작성 등을 지원하며, Vercel의 포괄적인 가이드라인을 사용하여 React와 Next.js의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar 45 reglas en 8 categorías para la optimización de paquetes, patrones de obtención de datos y escritura de componentes, aprovechando las directrices integrales de Vercel para la refactorización y generación automática de código con React y Next.js","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour l''optimisation de bundles, les modèles de récupération de données et l''écriture de composants, en exploitant les directives complètes de Vercel pour la refactoring et la génération automatique de code avec React et Next.js","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für Bundle-Optimierung, Datenabrufmuster und Komponenten-Schreiben anzuwenden, indem sie die umfassenden Richtlinien von Vercel für automatisierte Refaktorierung und Code-Generierung mit React und Next.js nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de pacotes, padrões de busca de dados e escrita de componentes, aproveitando as diretrizes abrangentes da Vercel para refatoração automatizada e geração de código com React e Next.js","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять 45 правил в 8 категориях для оптимизации пакетов, шаблонов извлечения данных и написания компонентов, используя комплексные рекомендации Vercel для автоматизированной рефакторинга и генерации кода с React и Next.js","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الحزم ونمط استرجاع البيانات وكتابة المكونات، مستفيدة من إرشادات Vercel الشاملة لتحسين و生成 الكود التلقائي مع React و Next.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React component optimization","Generating optimized Next.js code","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"zh":["自动化 React 组件优化","生成优化的 Next.js 代码","调试 React 应用程序中的性能问题"],"ja":["React コンポーネントの自動最適化","最適化された Next.js コードの生成","React アプリケーションのパフォーマンス問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트 자동 최적화","최적화된 Next.js 코드 생성","React 애플리케이션의 성능 