イブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用してPDFのテキスト、テーブル、結合、分割、フォームの入力を実行する方法を紹介します","ko":"본 가이드에서는 Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF 텍스트, 테이블, 결합, 분할, 양식填充 등 수행하는 방법을紹介합니다","es":"Guía para procesar PDF con Python, incluyendo extracción de texto y tablas, creación y manipulación de archivos.","fr":"Guide pour traiter les PDF avec Python, y compris l''extraction de texte et de tableaux, la création et la manipulation de fichiers.","de":"Anleitung zum Verarbeiten von PDF mit Python, einschließlich Text- und Tabellenextraktion, Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Dateien.","pt":"O processamento de PDF permite extrair texto e tabelas, criar e mesclar arquivos PDF usando Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Обработка PDF позволяет извлекать текст и таблицы, создавать и объединять файлы PDF с помощью Python и командной строки.","ar":"معالجة ملفات PDF تسمح باستخراج النص والجداول، وإنشاء ودمج ملفات PDF باستخدام Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر.","en":"A general purpose scientific writer"},"definition":{"en":"A general purpose scientific writer"},"features":{"zh":["提取PDF文本和表格","创建和合并PDF文件","拆分PDF文件","填充PDF表单","使用Python库和命令行工具"],"ja":["PDFのテキストとテーブルを抽出","PDFファイルの作成と結合","PDFファイルの分割","PDFフォームの入力","Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用"],"ko":["PDF 텍스트와 테이블 추출","PDF 파일 생성과 결합","PDF 파일 분할","PDF 양식填充","Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구 사용"],"es":["Extracción de texto y tablas de archivos PDF","Creación y manipulación de archivos PDF","Unión y división de archivos PDF","Relleno de formularios PDF","Análisis de documentos PDF con Python"],"fr":["Extraction de texte et de tableaux de fichiers PDF","Création et manipulation de fichiers PDF","Fusion et division de fichiers PDF","Remplissage de formulaires PDF","Analyse de documents PDF avec Python"],"de":["Text- und Tabellenextraktion aus PDF-Dateien","Erstellung und Bearbeitung von PDF-Dateien","Zusammenführung und Aufteilung von PDF-Dateien","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen","Analyse von PDF-Dokumenten mit Python"],"pt":["Extração de texto e tabelas de arquivos PDF","Criação e mesclagem de arquivos PDF","Preenchimento de formulários em arquivos PDF","Análise de documentos PDF com Python","Uso de ferramentas de linha de comando para processamento de PDF"],"ru":["Извлечение текста и таблиц из файлов PDF","Создание и объединение файлов PDF","Заполнение форм в файлах PDF","Анализ документов PDF с помощью Python","Использование командной строки для обработки PDF"],"ar":["استخراج النص والجداول من ملفات PDF","إنشاء ودمج ملفات PDF","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات PDF","تحليل مستندات PDF باستخدام Python","استخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة ملفات PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","PDF文本提取","PDF表格提取","PDF合并","PDF拆分","PDF表单填充"],"ja":["PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDFテキスト抽出","PDFテーブル抽出","PDF結合","PDF分割","PDFフォーム入力"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 텍스트 추출","PDF 테이블 추출","PDF 결합","PDF 분할","PDF 양식填充"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","herramientas pdf","extracción de texto pdf","creación de pdf","manipulación de pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","bibliothèques pdf","outils pdf","extraction de texte pdf","création de pdf","manipulation de pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-bibliotheken","pdf-tools","textextraktion pdf","pdf-erstellung","pdf-bearbeitung"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando para pdf","extração de texto de pdf","criação de pdf","mesclagem de pdf","preenchimento de formulários em pdf","análise de documentos pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","командная строка для pdf","извлечение текста из pdf","создание pdf","объединение pdf","заполнение форм в pdf","анализ документов pdf"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","python pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة ملفات pdf","استخراج النص من ملفات pdf","إنشاء ملفات pdf","دمج ملفات pdf","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات pdf","تحليل مستندات pdf"]}},"owner":"K-Dense-AI","repo":"claude-scientific-writer","repoPath":"K-Dense-AI/claude-scientific-writer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"PDF manipulation toolkit. Extract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split, fill forms, for programmatic document processing and analysis.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does not already contain schematics or diagrams:\n- Use the **scientific-schematics** skill to generate AI-powered publication-quality diagrams\n- Simply describe your desired diagram in natural language\n- Nano Banana Pro will automatically generate, review, and refine the schematic\n\n**For new documents:** Scientific schematics should be generated by default to visually represent key concepts, workflows, architectures, or relationships described in the text.\n\n**How to generate schematics:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_schematic.py \"your diagram description\" -o figures/output.png\n```\n\nThe AI will automatically:\n- Create publication-quality images with proper formatting\n- Review and refine through multiple iterations\n- Ensure accessibility (colorblind-friendly, high contrast)\n- Save outputs in the figures/ directory\n\n**When to add schematics:**\n- PDF processing workflow diagrams\n- Document manipulation flowcharts\n- Form processing visualizations\n- Data extraction pipeline diagrams\n- Any complex concept that benefits from visualization\n\nFor detailed guidance on creating schematics, refer to the scientific-schematics skill documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:20:41.703Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF处理功能的文档分析代理。","ja":"ドキュメント分析エージェントが高度なPDF処理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, требующих передовых возможностей обработки PDF.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء ذوي تحليل الوثائق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة PDF."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, merge and split PDF files, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with features like command-line tools and reference documentation.","zh":"通过Python库赋予代理提取文本和表格、合并和拆分PDF文件、填写表单的能力，增强程序化文档处理和分析，并配备命令行工具和参考文档等功能。","ja":"Pythonライブラリを使用して、テキストと表の抽出、PDFファイルの結合と分割、フォームの入力を可能にし、コマンドラインツールやリファレンスドキュメントなどの機能でプログラムによる文書処理と分析を強化します。","ko":"Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 및 표 추출, PDF 파일 결합 및 분할, 양식 작성 등의 기능을 제공하고, 명령줄 도구 및 참조 문서 등의 기능으로 프로그램 방식의 문서 처리 및 분석을 강화합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, merge and split PDF files, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with features like command-line tools and reference documentation.","fr":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, merge and split PDF files, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with features like command-line tools and reference documentation.","de":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, merge and split PDF files, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with features like command-line tools and reference documentation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto e tabelas, mesclar e dividir arquivos PDF e preencher formulários usando bibliotecas Python, melhorando o processamento e análise de documentos programáticos com recursos como ferramentas de linha de comando e documentação de referência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст и таблицы, объединять и разделять файлы PDF, а также заполнять формы с помощью библиотек Python, повышая программную обработку и анализ документов с функциями, такими как инструменты командной строки и справочная документация.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء باستخراج النص والجداول ودمج ملفات PDF و تقسيمها وملء الاستمارات باستخدام مكتبات بايثون، مما يعزز معالجة وتحليل الوثائق البرمجية مع الميزات مثل أدوات سطر الأوامر وتوثيق المراجع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PDF document processing","Generating reports with filled forms","Merging and splitting large PDF files"],"zh":["自动化PDF文档处理","使用填充表单生成报告","合并和拆分大型PDF文件"],"ja":["PDF文書処理の自動化","入力済みフォームを使用したレポート生成","大規模なPDFファイルの結合と分割"],"ko":["PDF 문서 처리 자동화","작성된 양식을 사용한 보고서 생성","대형 PDF 파일 결합 및 분할"],"es":["Automating PDF document processing","Generating reports with filled forms","Merging and splitting large PDF files"],"fr":["Automating PDF document processing","Generating reports with filled forms","Merging and splitting large PDF files"],"de":["Automating PDF document processing","Generating reports with filled forms","Merging and splitting large PDF files"],"pt":["Automatizar o processamento de documentos PDF","Gerar relatórios com formulários preenchidos","Mesclar e dividir arquivos PDF grandes"],"ru":["Автоматизация обработки документов PDF","Генерация отчетов с заполненными формами","Объединение и разделение крупных файлов PDF"],"ar":["أتمتة معالجة مستندات PDF","генерация تقارير باستخدام استمارات مملوءة","دمج و تقسيم ملفات PDF كبيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python libraries and command-line tools","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"zh":["需要Python库和命令行工具","高级功能需要参考reference.md和forms.md"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールが必要","高度な機能を使用するにはreference.mdとforms.mdを参照する必要がある"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리 및 명령줄 도구가 필요","고급 기능을 사용하려면 reference.md 및 forms.md를 참조해야 함"],"es":["Requires Python libraries and command-line tools","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"fr":["Requires Python libraries and command-line tools","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"de":["Requires Python libraries and command-line tools","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"pt":["Requer bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando","Recursos avançados requerem consulta de reference.md e forms.md"],"ru":["Требует библиотек Python и инструментов командной строки","Передовые функции требуют консультации reference.md и forms.md"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبات بايثون وأدوات سطر الأوامر","الميزات المتقدمة تتطلب استشارة reference.md و forms.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
