зличия шаблонов через Upgrade Helper","Обновления зависимостей","Шаг SDK Expo","Распространенные ошибки"],"ar":["تدفق عمل تحديث كامل","فروق القوالب عبر Upgrade Helper","تحديثات التبعيات","خطوة SDK Expo","أخطاء شائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","Upgrade Helper","Expo SDK","Native ","Release Notes","Breaking Changes","React Native","React Native "],"ja":["React Native","Upgrade Helper","Expo SDK","Native ","Release Notes","Breaking Changes","React Native","React Native "],"ko":["React Native","Upgrade Helper","Expo SDK","Native ","Release Notes","Breaking Changes","React Native","React Native "],"es":["actualización de React Native","migración de aplicaciones","Upgrade Helper","SDK de Expo","dependencias","react native upgrade","guía de actualización"],"fr":["mise à niveau de React Native","migration d''applications","Upgrade Helper","SDK Expo","dépendances","react native mise à niveau","guide de mise à niveau"],"de":["React Native Upgrade","Anwendungs-Migration","Upgrade Helper","Expo-SDK","Abhängigkeiten","React Native-Aktualisierung","Upgrade-Anleitung"],"pt":["atualização react native","migração react native","upgrade helper","expo sdk","react native desenvolvimento","atualização de dependências"],"ru":["обновление react native","миграция react native","upgrade helper","expo sdk","разработка react native","обновление зависимостей"],"ar":["ترقية ريكت نيتيف","هجرة ريكت نيتيف","upgrade helper","expo sdk","تطوير ريكت نيتيف","تحديث التبعيات"]}},"owner":"callstackincubator","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"callstackincubator/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrading-react-native","description":"React Native upgrade workflow covering updated templates, dependencies, and common pitfalls. Use when migrating a React Native app to a newer release.","tags":"react-native, upgrade, upgrade-helper, npm, changelog, cocoapods, ios, android","bodyPreview":"# Upgrading React Native\n\n## Overview\n\nCovers the full React Native upgrade workflow: template diffs via Upgrade Helper, dependency updates, Expo SDK steps, and common pitfalls.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Moving a React Native app to a newer version\n- Reconciling native config changes from Upgrade Helper\n- Validating release notes for breaking changes\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [upgrading-react-native.md][upgrading-react-native","body":"# Upgrading React Native\n\n## Overview\n\nCovers the full React Native upgrade workflow: template diffs via Upgrade Helper, dependency updates, Expo SDK steps, and common pitfalls.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Moving a React Native app to a newer version\n- Reconciling native config changes from Upgrade Helper\n- Validating release notes for breaking changes\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [upgrading-react-native.md][upgrading-react-native] | Router: choose the right upgrade path |\n| [upgrade-helper-core.md][upgrade-helper-core] | Core Upgrade Helper workflow and reliability gates |\n| [upgrading-dependencies.md][upgrading-dependencies] | Dependency compatibility checks and migration planning |\n| [react.md][react] | React and React 19 upgrade alignment rules |\n| [expo-sdk-upgrade.md][expo-sdk-upgrade] | Expo SDK-specific upgrade layer (conditional) |\n| [upgrade-verification.md][upgrade-verification] | Manual post-upgrade verification checklist |\n| [monorepo-singlerepo-targeting.md][monorepo-singlerepo-targeting] | Monorepo and single-repo app targeting and command scoping |\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| Need to upgrade React Native | [upgrade-helper-core.md][upgrade-helper-core] |\n| Need dependency risk triage and migration options | [upgrading-dependencies.md][upgrading-dependencies] |\n| Need React/React 19 package alignment | [react.md][react] |\n| Need workflow routing first | [upgrading-react-native.md][upgrading-react-native] |\n| Need Expo SDK-specific steps | [expo-sdk-upgrade.md][expo-sdk-upgrade] |\n| Need manual regression validation | [upgrade-verification.md][upgrade-verification] |\n| Need repo/app command scoping | [monorepo-singlerepo-targeting.md][monorepo-singlerepo-targeting] |\n\n[upgrading-react-native]: references/upgrading-react-native.md\n[upgrade-helper-core]: references/upgrade-helper-core.md\n[upgrading-dependencies]: references/upgrading-dependencies.md\n[react]: references/react.md\n[expo-sdk-upgrade]: references/expo-sdk-upgrade.md\n[upgrade-verification]: references/upgrade-verification.md\n[monorepo-singlerepo-targeting]: references/monorepo-singlerepo-targeting.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:21:16.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents needing streamlined React Native upgrade workflows and Expo SDK management.","zh":"适用于需要简化React Native升级工作流和Expo SDK管理的移动代理。","ja":"React NativeのアップグレードワークフローとExpo SDKの管理を簡素化する必要があるモバイルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Native 업그레이드 워크플로 및 Expo SDK 관리를 간소화해야 하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Móviles que necesitan flujos de trabajo de actualización de React Native optimizados y administración de SDK de Expo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles ayant besoin de flux de travail de mise à niveau React Native simplifiés et de gestion de SDK Expo.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agenten, die optimierte React Native-Upgrade-Workflows und Expo-SDK-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de atualização do React Native otimizados e gerenciamento do SDK Expo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, которым необходимы оптимизированные рабочие процессы обновления React Native и управление SDK Expo.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى تيارات عمل محسنة لترقية React Native وإدارة SDK Expo."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate the full React Native upgrade process, including template diffs via Upgrade Helper, dependency updates, and identifying common pitfalls, ensuring seamless native config changes and release note validation for breaking changes.","zh":"赋予代理导航整个React Native升级过程的能力，包括通过升级助手进行模板差异、依赖项更新和识别常见陷阱，确保原生配置更改和破坏性更改的发布说明验证无缝进行。","ja":"アップグレードヘルパーを介したテンプレートの差分、依存関係の更新、一般的な落とし穴の特定など、React Nativeのアップグレードプロセス全体をエージェントがナビゲートできるようにし、破壊的な変更のリリースノートの検証を含むネイティブ構成の変更を無 摩擦で行う。","ko":"업그레이드 헬퍼를 통한 템플릿의 차이, 의존성 업데이트, 일반적인 함정 식별 등을 포함하여 React Native 업그레이드 프로세스 전체를 에이전트가 탐색할 수 있도록 하며,破壊적인 변경의 릴리스 노트 검증을 포함하여 네이티브 구성 변경을 무마찰로 진행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por el proceso completo de actualización de React Native, incluyendo diferencias de plantillas a través de Upgrade Helper, actualizaciones de dependencias e identificación de trampas comunes, garantizando cambios de configuración nativa sin problemas y validación de notas de lanzamiento para cambios que rompen la compatibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans le processus complet de mise à niveau React Native, y compris les différences de modèles via Upgrade Helper, les mises à jour des dépendances et l''identification des pièges courants, garantissant des modifications de configuration native sans problème et une validation des notes de version pour les changements qui cassent la compatibilité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den gesamten React Native-Upgrade-Prozess zu durchlaufen, einschließlich Template-Diffs über Upgrade Helper, Abhängigkeitsupdates und Identifizierung häufiger Fallstricke, um nahtlose native Konfigurationsänderungen und Validierung von Versionshinweisen für inkrementelle Änderungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pelo processo completo de atualização do React Native, incluindo diferenças de modelo por meio do Upgrade Helper, atualizações de dependência e identificação de armadilhas comuns, garantindo alterações de configuração nativa sem problemas e validação de notas de lançamento para alterações de quebra.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью пройти полный процесс обновления React Native, включая различия шаблонов через Upgrade Helper, обновления зависимостей и определение распространенных ловушек, обеспечивая беспроблемные изменения настроек и проверку заметок о выпуске для критических изменений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التنقل في عملية ترقية React Native الكاملة ، بما في ذلك اختلافات القوالب عبر Upgrade Helper و تحديثات التبعيات وتحديد الفخاخ الشائعة ، مما يضمن تغييرات تكوين الأصل دون مشاكل و التحقق من ملاحظات الإصدار لتغييرات الكسر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React Native app upgrades to newer versions","Reconciling native config changes from Upgrade Helper","Validating release notes for breaking changes and Expo SDK updates"],"zh":["自动化React Native应用程序到新版本的升级","协调升级助手的原生配置更改","验证破坏性更改和Expo SDK更新的发布说明"],"ja":["新しいバージョンへのReact Nativeアプリのアップグレードを自動化する","アップグレードヘルパーのネイティブ構成の変更を調整する","破壊的な変更とExpo SDKの更新のリリースノートを検証する"],"ko":["새로운 버전으로의 React Native 애플리케이션 업그레이드를 자동화하는 것","업그레이드 헬퍼의 네이티브 구성 변경을 조정하는 것","파괴적인 변경 및 Expo SDK 업데이트에 대한 릴리스 노트를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de aplicaciones React Native a versiones más recientes","Reconciliación de cambios de configuración nativa desde Upgrade Helper","Validación de notas de lanzamiento para cambios que rompen la compatibilidad y actualizaciones de SDK de Expo"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à niveau d''applications React Native vers des versions plus récentes","Réconciliation des modifications de configuration native à partir de Upgrade Helper","Validation des notes de version pour les changements qui cassent la compatibilité et les mises à jour de SDK Expo"],"de":["Automatisierung von React Native-App-Updates auf neuere Versionen","Abstimmung von nativen Konfigurationsänderungen von Upgrade Helper","Validierung von Versionshinweisen für inkrementelle Änderungen und Expo-SDK-Updates"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de aplicativos React Native para versões mais recentes","Reconciliar alterações de configuração nativa do Upgrade Helper","Validar notas de lançamento para alterações de quebra e atualizações do SDK Expo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления приложений React Native до более новых версий","Согласовывать изменения настроек из Upgrade Helper","Проверять заметки о выпуске для критических изменений и обновлений SDK Expo"],"ar":["أتمتة ترقية تطبيقات React Native إلى إصدارات أحدث","التوفيق بين تغييرات التكوين الأصلي من Upgrade Helper","التحقق من ملاحظات الإصدار لتغييرات الكسر و تحديثات SDK Expo"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native project setup","Expo SDK compatibility needed for certain features","Upgrade Helper availability necessary for template diffs"],"zh":["需要React Native项目设置","需要Expo SDK兼容性以使用某些功能","需要升级助手可用性以进行模板差异"],"ja":["React Nativeプロジェクトの設定が必要","一部の機能を使用するにはExpo SDKの互換性が必要","テンプレートの差分を行うにはアップグレードヘルパーの可用性が必要"],"ko":["React Native 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","일부 기능을 사용하기 위해서는 Expo SDK의 호환성이 필요함","템플릿의 차이를 수행하기 위해서는 업그레이드 헬퍼의 가용성이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React Native","Se requiere compatibilidad con SDK de Expo para ciertas características","Disponibilidad de Upgrade Helper necesaria para diferencias de plantillas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React Native","Une compatibilité avec le SDK Expo est nécessaire pour certaines fonctionnalités","La disponibilité de Upgrade Helper est nécessaire pour les différences de modèles"],"de":["Benötigt React Native-Projektsetup","Expo-SDK-Kompatibilität wird für bestimmte Funktionen benötigt","Verfügbarkeit von Upgrade Helper ist für Template-Diffs erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto React Native","Compatibilidade do SDK Expo necessária para recursos específicos","Disponibilidade do Upgrade Helper necessária para diferenças de modelo"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта React Native","Необходима совместимость SDK Expo для определенных функций","Необходима доступность Upgrade Helper для различий шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React Native","مطلوب توافق SDK Expo لميزات معينة","مطلوب توافر Upgrade Helper لاختلافات القوالب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mims-harvard/ToolUniverse/tooluniverse-infectious-disease', 'community', 'mims-harvard', 'ToolUniverse', 'mims-harvard/ToolUniverse', 'tooluniverse-infectious-disease', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:21:16.352Z', NULL, '{"id":"mims-harvard/ToolUniverse/tooluniverse-infectious-disease","name":"tooluniverse-infectious-disease","description":{"zh":"ToolUniverse传染病智能系统为开发者提供快速应对新兴传染病的解决方案，通过taxonomy分析、靶点识别、结构预测和计算药物再利用","ja":"ToolUniverse感染症インテリジェンスは、開発者が新興感染症に対応できるように分類分析、ターゲット識別、構造予測、計算薬物再利用を提供する","ko":"ToolUniverse 감염병 인텔리전스는 개발자들이 새로운 감염병에 대응할 수 있도록 분류 분석, 표적 식별, 구조 예측 및 계산 약물 재사용을 제공합니다","es":"El Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease ofrece inteligencia de brotes de enfermedades infecciosas para una respuesta rápida a patógenos emergentes","fr":"Le Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease propose une intelligence sur les épidémies de maladies infectieuses pour une réponse rapide aux pathogènes émergents","de":"Der Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease bietet Intelligenz für Ausbrüche von Infektionskrankheiten für eine schnelle Reaktion auf neu auftretende Krankheitserreger","pt":"A ToolUniverse oferece uma solução de inteligência de doenças infecciosas para combater surtos de patógenos emergentes. Nossa plataforma utiliza análise taxonômica, identificação de alvos, previsão de estruturas e reutilização computacional de medicamentos.","ru":"ToolUniverse предлагает решение для интеллекта по инфекционным заболеваниям для борьбы с вспышками новых патогенов. Наша платформа использует таксономический анализ, выявление мишеней, прогнозирование структур и компьютерную переработку лекарств.","ar":"تقدم ToolUniverse حلول الاستخبارات للأمراض المعدية لمكافحة تفشي المرض الجديدة. تستخدم منصتنا تحليل التصنيف، وتحديد الأهداف، وتوقع البنية، وإعادة استخدام الأدوية بشكل حسابي.","en":"Democratizing AI scientists with ToolUniverse"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ToolUniverse传染病智能系统","ja":"ToolUniverse感染症インテリジェンス","ko":"ToolUniverse 감염병 인텔리전스","es":"Inteligencia de brotes de enfermedades infecciosas","fr":"Intelligence sur les épidémies de maladies infectieuses","de":"Intelligenz für Ausbrüche von Infektionskrankheiten","pt":"Inteligência de Doenças Infecciosas - ToolUniverse","ru":"Интеллект по инфекционным заболеваниям - ToolUniverse","ar":"استخبارات الأمراض المعدية - ToolUniverse","en":"tooluniverse-infectious-disease"},"description":{"zh":"ToolUniverse传染病智能系统为开发者提供快速应对新兴传染病的解决方案，通过taxonomy分析、靶点识别、结构预测和计算药物再利用","ja":"ToolUniverse感染症インテリジェンスは、開発者が新興感染症に対応できるように分類分析、ターゲット識別、構造予測、計算薬物再利用を提供する","ko":"ToolUniverse 감염병 인텔리전스는 개발자들이 새로운 감염병에 대응할 수 있도록 분류 분석, 표적 식별, 구조 예측 및 계산 약물 재사용을 제공합니다","es":"El Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease ofrece inteligencia de brotes de enfermedades infecciosas para una respuesta rápida a patógenos emergentes","fr":"Le Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease propose une intelligence sur les épidémies de maladies infectieuses pour une réponse rapide aux pathogènes émergents","de":"Der Skill tooluniverse-infectious-disease bietet Intelligenz für Ausbrüche von Infektionskrankheiten für eine schnelle Reaktion auf neu auftretende Krankheit...","pt":"A ToolUniverse oferece uma solução de inteligência de doenças infecciosas para combater surtos de patógenos emergentes. Nossa plataforma utiliza análise taxo...","ru":"ToolUniverse предлагает решение для интеллекта по инфекционным заболеваниям для борьбы с вспышками новых патогенов. Наша платформа использует таксономический...","ar":"تقدم ToolUniverse حلول الاستخبارات للأمراض المعدية لمكافحة تفشي المرض الجديدة. تستخدم منصتنا تحليل التصنيف، وتحديد الأهداف، وتوقع البنية، وإعادة استخدام الأد...","en":"Democratizing AI scientists with ToolUniverse"},"definition":{"en":"Democratizing AI scientists with ToolUniverse"},"features":{"zh":["速度至关重要","靶向基本蛋白","利用现有药物","结构引导"],"ja":["スピードが重要","基本的なタンパク質をターゲットにする","既存の薬を利用す