едача шаблонов LaTeX","Поддержка научных документов","Пользовательская конфигурация","Быстрая и легкая документация","Поддержка API"],"ar":["نقل ذكي للقوالب LaTeX","دعم المستندات العلمية","تكوين مخصص","توثيق سريع وسهل","دعم API"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LaTeX模板迁移","中国科研LaTeX模板","LaTeX模板集","一键迁移","配置中心","LaTeX工具"],"ja":["LaTeXテンプレート移行","中国の研究LaTeXテンプレート","LaTeXテンプレート集","一键移行","設定センター","LaTeXツール"],"ko":["LaTeX 템플릿 마이그레이션","중국 연구 LaTeX 템플릿","LaTeX 템플릿 집합","일키 마이그레이션","설정 센터","LaTeX 도구"],"es":["migración de plantillas LaTeX","investigación científica","documentos de investigación","formatos de documento","herramientas de migración","LaTeX para investigaciones"],"fr":["migration de modèles LaTeX","recherche scientifique","documents de recherche","formats de document","outils de migration","LaTeX pour la recherche"],"de":["Migration von LaTeX-Vorlagen","wissenschaftliche Forschung","Dokumente der Forschung","Dokumentformate","Migrationswerkzeuge","LaTeX für die Forschung"],"pt":["migração de modelos latex","pesquisa científica","documentos latex","transferência de modelos","ferramenta de transferência","latex para pesquisa"],"ru":["перенос шаблонов latex","научные исследования","документы latex","передача шаблонов","система передачи","latex для исследований"],"ar":["نقل قوالب latex","بحث علمي","مستندات latex","نقل قوالب","أداة نقل","latex للبحث"]}},"owner":"huangwb8","repo":"ChineseResearchLaTeX","repoPath":"huangwb8/ChineseResearchLaTeX","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"migrating-latex-templates","description":"当用户明确要求迁移标书升级模板跨版本迁移旧标书转新模板时使用。智能迁移NSFC LaTeX标书到新版模板，基于五阶段工作流（分析→映射→规划→执行→验证），自动处理结构变化、内容重组、引用更新；支持AI驱动语义匹配与启发式回退，并提供 runs 输出隔离与一键迁移脚本。","version":"1.4.1","bodyPreview":"# LaTeX 标书智能迁移器\n\n> **核心入口**：`python skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py --help`\n>\n> **一键迁移**：`bash skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/migrate.sh --old ... --new ...`\n>\n> **配置中心**：[config.yaml](config.yaml)\n>\n> **参考文档**：[references/](references/)\n>\n> **拆分文档**：\n> [references/quickstart.md](references/quickstart.md) /\n> [references/config_guide.md](references/config_guide.md) /\n> [references/api_reference.md](references/api_reference.md) /\n> [references/troubleshooting.md](referen","body":"# LaTeX 标书智能迁移器\n\n> **核心入口**：`python skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py --help`\n>\n> **一键迁移**：`bash skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/migrate.sh --old ... --new ...`\n>\n> **配置中心**：[config.yaml](config.yaml)\n>\n> **参考文档**：[references/](references/)\n>\n> **拆分文档**：\n> [references/quickstart.md](references/quickstart.md) /\n> [references/config_guide.md](references/config_guide.md) /\n> [references/api_reference.md](references/api_reference.md) /\n> [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) /\n> [references/faq.md](references/faq.md) /\n> [references/case_study_2025_to_2026.md](references/case_study_2025_to_2026.md)\n\n---\n\n## 快速开始\n\n```bash\n# 一键分析（生成结构差异报告）\npython skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py analyze \\\n  --old /path/to/NSFC_2025 \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026\n\n# 一键应用（执行迁移，apply前自动快照）\npython skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py apply \\\n  --old /path/to/NSFC_2025 \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026 \\\n  --run-id <上一步输出的run_id>\n\n# 一键编译（验证迁移结果）\npython skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py compile \\\n  --run-id <run_id> \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026\n\n# 一键恢复（回滚到apply前状态）\npython skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py restore \\\n  --run-id <run_id> \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026\n```\n\n### 一键迁移（推荐）\n\n```bash\nbash skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/migrate.sh \\\n  --old /path/to/NSFC_2025 \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026\n```\n\n### runs 输出隔离（强烈建议：测试/批处理）\n\n```bash\npython skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/scripts/run.py analyze \\\n  --old /path/to/NSFC_2025 \\\n  --new /path/to/NSFC_2026 \\\n  --runs-root /path/to/runs\n```\n\n**输出目录**：默认 `skills/transfer_old_latex_to_new/runs/<run_id>/`；指定 `--runs-root` 则输出到该目录。\n\n```\nruns/<run_id>/\n├── input_snapshot/     # 旧新项目输入快照\n├── analysis/           # 结构分析JSON（sections_map_*.json, structure_diff.json）\n├── plan/               # 迁移计划（migration_plan.json）\n├── backup/             # Apply前新项目快照（用于restore）\n├── logs/               # 执行日志与编译输出\n│   ├── apply_result.json        # 迁移执行结果\n│   ├── compile_summary.json     # 编译摘要\n│   ├── compile_*_*.out.txt      # 编译标准输出\n│   ├── compile_*_*.err.txt      # 编译标准错误\n│   └── latex_aux/               # LaTeX 中间文件隔离目录\n│       ├── main.aux             # 辅助文件\n│       ├── main.log             # 编译日志\n│       ├── main.bbl             # BibTeX 输出\n│       ├── main.blg             # BibTeX 日志\n│       ├── main.out             # hyperref 输出\n│       ├── main.toc             # 目录文件\n│       └── *.aux                # 其他辅助文件\n└── deliverables/       # 交付物（PDF、报告、指南）\n```\n\n**中间文件隔离**: 所有 LaTeX 编译中间文件(.aux/.log/.bbl等)自动保存在 `logs/latex_aux/` 目录,避免在项目目录产生\"垃圾\"文件。最终 PDF 自动复制回项目根目录。\n\n---\n\n## 前置约束（铁律）\n\n### 修改范围白名单\n\n**✅ 可修改**:\n- `extraTex/*.tex` 内容文件（**排除** `@config.tex`）\n- 新项目 `references/*.bib`（如需更新引用格式）\n- 本技能运行产物：`runs/<run_id>/`（日志、分析、备份、交付物）\n\n**❌ 禁止修改**:\n- `main.tex` 模板结构文件\n- `extraTex/@config.tex` 配置文件\n- `.cls`、`.sty` 样式文件\n- 任何影响编译环境的系统文件\n\n更完整的流程说明、配置与排障文档已拆分到 `references/`：\n\n- [references/quickstart.md](references/quickstart.md)\n- [references/config_guide.md](references/config_guide.md)\n- [references/api_reference.md](references/api_reference.md)\n- [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md)\n\n## 📋 版本与变更\n\n**当前版本**: v1.4.0（与 [config.yaml](config.yaml) 同步）\n\n**变更记录**: 见根级 [CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md)\n\n**优化计划**: 质量评估与优化计划见 `plans/v202601081355.md`（仓库根级）\n\n---\n\n**最后更新**: 2026-01-08\n**维护者**: Bensz Conan\n**许可证**: MIT\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:22:01.081Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Academic Agents requiring automated LaTeX template migration and configuration management.","zh":"适合需要自动化 LaTeX 模板迁移和配置管理的学术代理","ja":"学術エージェントが自動化されたLaTeXテンプレートの移行と設定管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 LaTeX 템플릿 마이그레이션 및 구성 관리가 필요한 학술 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes académicos que requieren una migración y gestión de configuración de plantillas LaTeX automatizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents académiques nécessitant une migration et une gestion de configuration de modèles LaTeX automatisées.","de":"Ideal für akademische Agenten, die eine automatisierte LaTeX-Vorlagenmigration und Konfigurationsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for Academic Agents requiring automated LaTeX template migration and configuration management.","ru":"Ideal for Academic Agents requiring automated LaTeX template migration and configuration management.","ar":"Ideal for Academic Agents requiring automated LaTeX template migration and configuration management."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently migrate old LaTeX templates to new ones using Python scripts and config.yaml files, streamlining the process with bash scripts like migrate.sh for one-click migrations, while referencing comprehensive guides and API documentation.","zh":"使代理能够使用Python脚本和config.yaml文件高效地将旧的LaTeX模板迁移到新的模板，使用像migrate.sh这样的bash脚本来简化流程，并参考综合指南和API文档","ja":"エージェントがPythonスクリプトとconfig.yamlファイルを使用して古いLaTeXテンプレートを新しいものに効率的に移行できるようにし、migrate.shなどのbashスクリプトを使用してプロセスを簡素化し、包括的なガイドとAPIドキュメントを参照","ko":"에이전트가 Python 스크립트와 config.yaml 파일을 사용하여 오래된 LaTeX 템플릿을 새로운 템플릿으로 효율적으로 마이그레이션할 수 있도록 하며, migrate.sh와 같은 bash 스크립트를 사용하여 프로세스를 단순화하고, 포괄적인 가이드와 API 문서를 참조","es":"Habilita a los agentes a migrar eficientemente plantillas LaTeX antiguas a nuevas utilizando scripts de Python y archivos config.yaml, simplificando el proceso con scripts de bash como migrate.sh para migraciones de un solo clic, mientras se hacen referencia a guías y documentación de API completas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de migrer efficacement les anciens modèles LaTeX vers les nouveaux en utilisant des scripts Python et des fichiers config.yaml, en simplifiant le processus avec des scripts bash comme migrate.sh pour des migrations en un seul clic, tout en faisant référence à des guides et une documentation d''API complète.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, alte LaTeX-Vorlagen effizient auf neue zu migrieren, indem sie Python-Skripte und config.yaml-Dateien verwenden, und vereinfacht den Prozess mit Bash-Skripten wie migrate.sh für One-Click-Migrationen, während umfassende Anleitungen und API-Dokumentationen referenziert werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to efficiently migrate old LaTeX templates to new ones using Python scripts and config.yaml files, streamlining the process with bash scripts like migrate.sh for one-click migrations, while referencing comprehensive guides and API documentation.","ru":"Empowers agents to efficiently migrate old LaTeX templates to new ones using Python scripts and config.yaml files, streamlining the process with bash scripts like migrate.sh for one-click migrations, while referencing comprehensive guides and API documentation.","ar":"Empowers agents to efficiently migrate old LaTeX templates to new ones using Python scripts and config.yaml files, streamlining the process with bash scripts like migrate.sh for one-click migrations, while referencing comprehensive guides and API documentation."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating outdated LaTeX templates to modern formats","Automating template configuration using config.yaml files","Debugging LaTeX template migration issues with troubleshooting guides"],"zh":["将过时的LaTeX模板迁移到现代格式","使用config.yaml文件自动化模板配置","使用故障排除指南调试LaTeX模板迁移问题"],"ja":["古いLaTeXテンプレートを最新の形式に移行","config.yamlファイルを使用してテンプレート設定を自動化","トラブルシューティングガイドを使用してLaTeXテンプレート移行の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["오래된 LaTeX 템플릿을 현대적인 형식으로 마이그레이션","config.yaml 파일을 사용하여 템플릿 구성 자동화","트러블슈팅 가이드를 사용하여 LaTeX 템플릿 마이그레이션 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Migrar plantillas LaTeX obsoletas a formatos modernos","Automatizar la configuración de plantillas utilizando archivos config.yaml","Depurar problemas de migración de plantillas L