on file structures"],"ru":["Requires Python environment","Limited to LaTeX template migration","Dependent on specific script and configuration file structures"],"ar":["Requires Python environment","Limited to LaTeX template migration","Dependent on specific script and configuration file structures"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
