SuperDoc CLI\n\nEdit Word documents from the command line. Use instead of python-docx.\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search <pattern> <files...>` | Find text across documents |\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace <find> <to> <files...>` | Find and replace text |\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest read <file>` | Extract plain text |\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse superdoc when the user asks to:\n- Search text in .docx files\n- Find and repl","body":"# SuperDoc CLI\n\nEdit Word documents from the command line. Use instead of python-docx.\n\n## Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search <pattern> <files...>` | Find text across documents |\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace <find> <to> <files...>` | Find and replace text |\n| `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest read <file>` | Extract plain text |\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse superdoc when the user asks to:\n- Search text in .docx files\n- Find and replace text in Word documents\n- Extract text content from .docx files\n- Bulk edit multiple Word documents\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Search across documents\nnpx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search \"indemnification\" ./contracts/*.docx\n\n# Find and replace\nnpx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace \"ACME Corp\" \"Globex Inc\" ./merger/*.docx\n\n# Extract text\nnpx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest read ./proposal.docx\n\n# JSON output for scripting\nnpx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search \"Article 7\" ./**/*.docx --json\n```\n\n## Options\n\n- `--json` — Machine-readable output\n- `--help` — Show help\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:22:10.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced .docx editing capabilities via the command line.","zh":"适合需要通过命令行进行高级 .docx 编辑的文档分析代理。","ja":"コマンドライン経由の高度な .docx 編集機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"명령줄을 통해 고급 .docx 편집 기능을 필요로 하는 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced .docx editing capabilities via the command line.","fr":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced .docx editing capabilities via the command line.","de":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced .docx editing capabilities via the command line.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que exigem capacidades avançadas de edição .docx via linha de comando.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа документов, требующих расширенных возможностей редактирования .docx через командную строку.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الوثائق الذين يتطلبون مهارات متقدمة في تحرير .docx عبر سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to search, replace, and extract text from .docx files using the SuperDoc CLI, leveraging commands like `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` and `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` for efficient document processing.","zh":"赋予代理通过 SuperDoc CLI 搜索、替换和从 .docx 文件中提取文本的能力，利用诸如 `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` 和 `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` 的命令进行高效的文档处理。","ja":"SuperDoc CLI を使用してエージェントが .docx ファイルからテキストを検索、置換、抽出できるようにし、`npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` および `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` のようなコマンドを使用して効率的なドキュメント処理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 SuperDoc CLI를 사용하여 .docx 파일에서 텍스트를 검색, 교체 및 추출할 수 있도록 하며, `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` 및 `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 효율적인 문서 처리를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Empowers agents to search, replace, and extract text from .docx files using the SuperDoc CLI, leveraging commands like `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` and `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` for efficient document processing.","fr":"Empowers agents to search, replace, and extract text from .docx files using the SuperDoc CLI, leveraging commands like `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` and `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` for efficient document processing.","de":"Empowers agents to search, replace, and extract text from .docx files using the SuperDoc CLI, leveraging commands like `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` and `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` for efficient document processing.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a procurar, substituir e extrair texto de arquivos .docx usando o SuperDoc CLI, aproveitando comandos como `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` e `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` para processamento de documentos eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью искать, заменять и извлекать текст из файлов .docx с помощью SuperDoc CLI, используя команды zoals `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` и `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` для эффективной обработки документов.","ar":"يُمنح الوكيل القدرة على البحث والاستبدال والاستخراج النص من الملفات .docx باستخدام SuperDoc CLI، واستخدام أوامر مثل `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest search` و `npx @superdoc-dev/cli@latest replace` لمعالجة الوثائق بكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching text patterns across multiple .docx files","Automating find and replace operations in Word documents","Extracting plain text from .docx files for further analysis"],"zh":["跨多个 .docx 文件搜索文本模式","自动执行 Word 文档中的查找和替换操作","从 .docx 文件中提取纯文本以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["複数の .docx ファイル全体でテキストパターンを検索する","Word 文書での検索と置換操作を自動化する",".docx ファイルからプレーンテキストを抽出してさらに分析する"],"ko":["여러 개의 .docx 파일에서 텍스트 패턴을 검색하는 것","워드 문서에서 찾기 및 바꾸기 작업을 자동화하는 것",".docx 파일에서 평문 텍스트를 추출하여 추가 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Searching text patterns across multiple .docx files","Automating find and replace operations in Word documents","Extracting plain text from .docx files for further analysis"],"fr":["Searching text patterns across multiple .docx files","Automating find and replace operations in Word documents","Extracting plain text from .docx files for further analysis"],"de":["Searching text patterns across multiple .docx files","Automating find and replace operations in Word documents","Extracting plain text from .docx files for further analysis"],"pt":["Pesquisar padrões de texto em vários arquivos .docx","Automatizar operações de encontrar e substituir em documentos do Word","Extrair texto simples de arquivos .docx para análise adicional"],"ru":["Поиск текстовых шаблонов в нескольких файлах .docx","Автоматизация операций поиска и замены в документах Word","Извлечение простого текста из файлов .docx для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["بحث أنماط النص عبر عدة ملفات .docx","تأهيل عمليات العثور والاستبدال في وثائق وورد","استخراج نص عادي من ملفات .docx لتحليل إضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment for SuperDoc CLI execution","Limited to .docx file format","Dependent on @superdoc-dev/cli package"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境来执行 SuperDoc CLI","仅限 .docx 文件格式","依赖于 @superdoc-dev/cli 包"],"ja":["SuperDoc CLI の実行には Node.js 環境が必要",".docx ファイル形式のみ","@superdoc-dev/cli パッケージに依存"],"ko":["SuperDoc CLI를 실행하기 위해 Node.js 환경이 필요",".docx 파일 형식만 지원","@superdoc-dev/cli 패키지에 의존"],"es":["Requires Node.js environment for SuperDoc CLI execution","Limited to .docx file format","Dependent on @superdoc-dev/cli package"],"fr":["Requires Node.js environment for SuperDoc CLI execution","Limited to .docx file format","Dependent on @superdoc-dev/cli package"],"de":["Requires Node.js environment for SuperDoc CLI execution","Limited to .docx file format","Dependent on @superdoc-dev/cli package"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js para execução do SuperDoc CLI","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .docx","Dependente do pacote @superdoc-dev/cli"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js для выполнения SuperDoc CLI","Ограничен форматом файла .docx","Зависит от пакета @superdoc-dev/cli"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js لتنفيذ SuperDoc CLI","محدود بتنسيق الملف .docx","يعتمد على حزمة @superdoc-dev/cli"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
