nalisation cloud","GCP","Cloud Logging","orchestration","tutoriels interactifs","Jupyter Notebooks","plate-forme Google Cloud"],"de":["Cloud-Logging-Sink-Setup","GCP","Cloud-Logging","Orchestrierung","interaktive Tutorials","Jupyter-Notebooks","Google Cloud-Plattform"],"pt":["configuração de sink de log de nuvem","GCP","gestão de logs","orquestração de produção","tutoriais interativos","suporte a múltiplos serviços","otimização de desempenho","logs de aplicativos","nuvem computacional"],"ru":["настройка приема логов в облаке","GCP","управление журналами","оркестровка производства","интерактивные уроки","поддержка нескольких сервисов","оптимизация производительности","логи приложений","облачные вычисления"],"ar":["إعداد sink تسجيل السحابي","GCP","إدارة السجلات","أوركسترية الإنتاج","دروس تفاعلية","دعم خدمات متعددة","تحسين الأداء","سجلات التطبيقات","حوسبة سحابية"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloud-logging-sink-setup","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Cloud Logging Sink Setup\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for cloud logging sink setup tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"cloud logging sink setup\" in your request\n- Ask about cloud logging sink setup patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance f","body":"# Cloud Logging Sink Setup\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for cloud logging sink setup tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"cloud logging sink setup\" in your request\n- Ask about cloud logging sink setup patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for cloud logging sink setup\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with cloud logging sink setup\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of gcp skills concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **GCP Skills** skill category.\nTags: gcp, bigquery, vertex-ai, cloud-run, firebase\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:22:21.651Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated Google Cloud Platform logging setup and configuration.","zh":"适用于需要自动化谷歌云平台日志记录设置和配置的云管理代理。","ja":"Google Cloud Platform のログ設定と構成の自動化が必要なクラウド管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"구글 클라우드 플랫폼 로깅 설정 및 구성 자동화가 필요한 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de cloud que requieren una configuración y setup automatizados de registro de la plataforma de Google Cloud.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de cloud nécessitant une configuration et une installation automatisées de la journalisation de la plate-forme Google Cloud.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Einrichtung und Konfiguration der Google Cloud Platform-Protokollierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que exigem configuração e instalação automatizada de registro em plataforma do Google Cloud.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления облачными вычислениями, требующих автоматизированной настройки и конфигурации журнала платформы Google Cloud.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة الذي يتطلب إعداد وتكوين سجل منصة جوجل كلاود أوتوماتيكيا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline cloud logging sink setup tasks using Google Cloud Platform skills, including compute, storage, BigQuery, Vertex AI, and GCP-specific services, with step-by-step guidance and interactive tutorials.","zh":"赋予代理使用谷歌云平台技能简化云日志接收器设置任务的能力，包括计算、存储、BigQuery、Vertex AI 和 GCP 特定服务，并提供分步指南和交互式教程。","ja":"エージェントが Google Cloud Platform スキルを使用してクラウド ロギング シンクの設定タスクを簡素化することを可能にします。計算、ストレージ、BigQuery、Vertex AI、および GCP 固有のサービスが含まれ、ステップバイステップのガイダンスとインタラクティブなチュートリアルが提供されます。","ko":"에이전트가 구글 클라우드 플랫폼 스킬을 사용하여 클라우드 로깅 싱크 설정 작업을 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다. 컴퓨팅, 스토리지, BigQuery, Vertex AI 및 GCP 특정 서비스를 포함하며, 단계별 지침과 상호작용형 자습서가 제공됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar las tareas de configuración de sumideros de registro en la nube utilizando habilidades de la plataforma de Google Cloud, incluyendo computación, almacenamiento, BigQuery, Vertex AI y servicios específicos de GCP, con orientación paso a paso y tutoriales interactivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier les tâches de configuration des récepteurs de journalisation de cloud en utilisant les compétences de la plate-forme Google Cloud, y compris le calcul, le stockage, BigQuery, Vertex AI et les services spécifiques à GCP, avec une guidance étape par étape et des didacticiels interactifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Cloud-Logging-Senken-Setup-Aufgaben mithilfe von Google Cloud Platform-Fähigkeiten zu vereinfachen, einschließlich Computing, Speicher, BigQuery, Vertex AI und GCP-spezifischen Diensten, mit Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung und interaktiven Tutorien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a agilizar tarefas de configuração de sink de registro de nuvem usando habilidades da plataforma Google Cloud, incluindo computação, armazenamento, BigQuery, Vertex AI e serviços específicos do GCP, com orientação passo a passo e tutoriais interativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать задачи настройки приемника облачного журнала с помощью навыков платформы Google Cloud, включая вычисления, хранилище, BigQuery, Vertex AI и сервисы, специфичные для GCP, с пошаговым руководством и интерактивными уроками.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تسريع مهام إعداد مصارف سجلات السحابة باستخدام مهارات منصة جوجل كلاود، بما في ذلك الحوسبة و تخزين البيانات و BigQuery و Vertex AI وخدمات محددة لجوجل كلاود، مع توجيه خطوة بخطوة ودروس تفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cloud logging sink setup for Google Cloud projects","Configuring logging patterns and best practices for GCP services","Debugging cloud logging issues with interactive Jupyter notebooks"],"zh":["为谷歌云项目自动设置云日志接收器","为 GCP 服务配置日志模式和最佳实践","使用交互式 Jupyter 笔记本调试云日志问题"],"ja":["Google Cloud プロジェクトのクラウド ロギング シンクの自動設定","GCP サービスのログ パターンとベスト プラクティスの構成","インタラクティブな Jupyter ノートブックを使用したクラウド ロギングの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["구글 클라우드 프로젝트를 위한 클라우드 로깅 싱크 자동 설정","GCP 서비스를 위한 로깅 패턴 및 최선의 방법 구성","상호작용형 주피터 노트북을 사용한 클라우드 로깅 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración del sumidero de registro en la nube para proyectos de Google Cloud","Configuración de patrones y mejores prácticas de registro para servicios de GCP","Depuración de problemas de registro en la nube con cuadernos interactivos Jupyter"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration du récepteur de journalisation de cloud pour les projets Google Cloud","Configuration des modèles et des meilleures pratiques de journalisation pour les services GCP","Débogage des problèmes de journalisation de cloud avec des cahiers interactifs Jupyter"],"de":["Automatisierung der Einrichtung des Cloud-Logging-Senken für Google Cloud-Projekte","Konfiguration von Protokollmustern und Best Practices für GCP-Dienste","Fehlerbehebung von Cloud-Logging-Problemen mit interaktiven Jupyter-Notebooks"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração de sink de registro de nuvem para projetos do Google Cloud","Configurar padrões e práticas recomendadas de registro para serviços do GCP","Depurar problemas de registro de nuvem com notebooks interativos Jupyter"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку приемника облачного журнала для проектов Google Cloud","Настроить шаблоны и лучшие практики журналирования для сервисов GCP","Отладить проблемы облачного журнала с помощью интерактивных ноутбуков Jupyter"],"ar":["تحسين إعداد مصارف سجلات السحابة للأمشير جوجل كلاود","تكوين أنماط وأفضل الممارسات لتسجيل خدمات جوجل كلاود","تصحيح أخطاء سجلات السحابة باستخدام دفاتر جupyter التفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Cloud Platform account and credentials","Limited to Google Cloud Platform services and skills"],"zh":["需要谷歌云平台账户和凭据","仅限谷歌云平台服务和技能"],"ja":["Google Cloud Platform アカウントと資格情報が必要","Google Cloud Platform サービスとスキルに限定される"],"ko":["구글 클라우드 플랫폼 계정 및 자격 증명이 필요","구글 클라우드 플랫폼 서비스 및 스킬로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y credenciales de la plataforma de Google Cloud","Limitado a servicios y habilidades de la plataforma de Google Cloud"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et des informations d''identification de la plate-forme Google Cloud","Limité aux services et aux compétences de la plate-forme Google Cloud"],"de":["Benötigt ein Konto und Anmeldeinformationen für die Google Cloud Platform","Begrenzt auf Google Cloud Platform-Dienste und -Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige conta e credenciais da plataforma Google Cloud","Limitado a serviços e habilidades da plataforma Google Cloud"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и учетных данных платформы Google Cloud","Ограничен сервисами и навыками платформы Google Cloud"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب وبيانات اعتماد لمنصة جوجل كلاود","محدود بخدمات ومهارات منصة جوجل كلاود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WordPress/agent-skills/wp-block-development', 'community', 'WordPress', 'agent-skills', 'WordPress/agent-skills', 'wp-block-development', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:22:13.719Z', NULL, '{"id":"WordPress/agent-skills/wp-block-development","name":"wp-block-development","description":{"zh":"WordPress 块开发专家知识，用于创建和更新块，包括块的最佳实践","ja":"WordPress ブロック開発のエキスパート知識。ブロックの作成、更新、ベストプラクティス","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발 전문 지식. 블록 생성, 업데이트, 최적화","es":"El desarrollo de bloques de WordPress implica crear y personalizar bloques para mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Nuestra guía experta cubre todos los aspectos del desarrollo de bloques.","fr":"Le développement de blocs WordPress consiste à créer et personnaliser des blocs pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Notre guide expert couvre tous les aspects du développement de blocs.","de":"Die WordPress-Block-Entwicklung umfasst die Erstellung und Anpassung von Blöcken, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Unsere Experten-Anleitung deckt alle Aspekte der Block-Entwicklung ab.","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade essencial para criadores de temas e plugins. Aprenda a criar e personalizar blocos para melhorar a eficiência dos seus projetos.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP - это необходимый навык для создателей тем и плагинов. Изучите создание и настройку блоков для улучшения эффективности ваших проектов.","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP هو مهارة أساسية لمصممي السمات والإضافات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء وتخصيص الكتل لتحسين كفاءة مشاريعك.","en":"Expert-level WordPress knowledge for AI coding assistants - blocks, themes, plugins, and best practices"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WordPress 块开发专家知识","ja":"WordPress ブロック開発のエキスパート知識","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발 전문 지식","es":"Desarrollo de bloques de WordPress","fr":"Développement de blocs WordPress","de":"WordPress-Block-Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Blocos WP - Otimização de Temas e Plugins","ru":"Разработка блоков WP - Оптимизация тем и плагинов","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP - تحسين السمات والإضافات","en":"wp-block-development"},"description":{"zh":"WordPress 块开发专家知识，用于创建和更新块，包括块的最佳实践","ja":"WordPress ブロック開発のエキスパート知識。ブロックの作成、更新、ベストプラクティス","ko":"워드프레스 블록 개발 전문 지식. 블록 생성, 업데이트, 최적화","es":"El desarrollo de bloques de WordPress implica crear y personalizar bloques para mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Nuestra guía experta cubre todos los aspe...","fr":"Le développement de blocs WordPress consiste à créer et personnaliser des blocs pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Notre guide expert couvre tous les a...","de":"Die WordPress-Block-Entwicklung umfasst die Erstellung und Anpassung von Blöcken, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Unsere Experten-Anleitung deckt all...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade essencial para criadores de temas e plugins. Aprenda a criar e personalizar blocos para melhorar a eficiência...","ru":"Разработка блоков WP - это необходимый навык для создателей тем и плагинов. Изучите создание и настройку блоков для улучшения эффективности ваших проектов.","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP هو مهارة أساسية لمصممي السمات والإضافات. تعلم كيفية إنشاء وتخصيص الكتل لتحسين كفاءة مشاريعك.","en":"Expert-level WordPress knowledge for AI coding assistants - blocks, themes, plugins, and best practices"},"definition":{"en":"Expert-level WordPress knowledge for AI coding assistants - blocks, themes, plugins, and best practices"},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新 WordPress 块","修复块无效、无法保存或属性未持久化的问题","添加动态渲染","块废弃和迁移","构建工具支持"],"ja":["WordPress ブロックの作成と更新","ブロックの不正、保存できない、属性が持続しない問題の修正","動的レンダリングの追加","ブロックの廃止と移行","ビルドツールのサポート"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 생성 및 업데이트","블록 무효, 저장 안됨, 속성 유지 안됨 문제 해결","동적 렌더링 추가","블록 폐기 및 마이그레이션","빌드 툴 지원"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques","Personalización de bloques existentes","Edición de archivos block.json","Implementación de renderizado dinámico","Uso de herramientas de creación de bloques como @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block","Gestión de deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs","Personnalisation de blocs existants","Édition de fichiers block.json","Mise en œuvre de rendu dynamique","Utilisation d''outils de création de blocs tels que @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block","Gestion des dépréciations et des migrations de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Anpassung von bestehenden Blöcken","Bearbeitung von block.json-Dateien","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendern","Verwendung von Block-Erstellungstools wie @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block","Verwaltung von Veraltungen und Migrationen von Blöcken"],"pt":["Criação de blocos personalizados","Otimização de temas e plugins","Uso de ferramentas de build como @wordpress/scripts","Implementação de renderização dinâmica","Gerenciamento de depreciações e migrações de blocos","Uso de wp-env para testes e depuração"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских блоков","Оптимизация тем и плагинов","Использование инструментов сборки như @wordpress/scripts","Реализация динамической отрисовки","Управление устареванием и миграцией блоков","Использование wp-env для тестирования и отладки"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل مخصصة","تحسين السمات والإضافات","استخدام أدوات البناء مثل @wordpress/scripts","تنفيذ العرض الديناميكي","إدارة الإصدارات القديمة والهجرة للكتل","استخدام wp-env للاختبار والتصحيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 块开发","块创建","块更新","块修复","动态渲染","块废弃","构建工具"],"ja":["WordPress ブロック開発","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","ブロック修正","動的レンダリング","ブロック廃止","ビルドツール"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 개발","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","블록 수정","동적 렌더링","블록 폐기","빌드 툴"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques de WordPress","creación de bloques","personalización de bloques","block.json","renderizado dinámico","herramientas de creación de bloques","deprecaciones de bloques","migraciones de bloques","WordPress"],"fr":["développement de blocs WordPress","création de blocs","personnalisation de blocs","block.json","rendu dynamique","outils de création de blocs","dépréciations de blocs","migrations de blocs","WordPress"],"de":["WordPress-Block-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Blöcken","Anpassung von Blöcken","block.json","dynamisches Rendern","Block-Erstellungstools","Veraltungen von Blöcken","Migrationen von Blöcken","WordPress"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress","temas","plugins","blocos personalizados","otimização de desempenho","ferramentas de build","renderização dinâmica","depreciações e migrações de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","wordpress","темы","плагины","пользовательские блоки","оптимизация производительности","инструменты сборки","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание и миграция блоков"],"ar":["تطوير الكتل wp","ووردبريس","السمات","الإضافات","الكتل المخصصة","تحسين الأداء","أدوات البناء","العرض الديناميكي","الإصدارات القديمة والهجرة للكتل"]}},"owner":"WordPress","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"WordPress/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:22:13.719Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress-focused AI Agents requiring advanced block development capabilities for custom themes and plugins.","zh":"适用于需要高级块开发功能的WordPress专注AI代理，以创建自定义主题和插件。","ja":"WordPressに特化したAIエージェントが高度なブロック開発機能を必要とする場合に最適です。カスタムテーマとプラグインを作成するために。","ko":"고급 블록 개발 기능이 필요한 워드프레스에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 사용자 지정 테마 및 플러그인을 생성하는 데에 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en WordPress que requieren capacidades de desarrollo de bloques avanzadas para temas y plugins personalizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur WordPress nécessitant des capacités de développement de blocs avancées pour les thèmes et les plugins personnalisés.","de":"Ideal für WordPress-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Blockentwicklungsfunktionen für benutzerdefinierte Themen und Plugins benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados no WordPress que exigem capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de blocos para temas e plugins personalizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на WordPress, требующих расширенных возможностей разработки блоков для пользовательских тем и плагинов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي ذي التركيز على ووردبريس الذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير الكتلة للسمات و الإضافات المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage WordPress blocks with precision, utilizing tools like `@wordpress/scripts` and `@wordpress/create-block` for efficient development, and handling block deprecations and migrations with ease, while also leveraging `block.json` for customized scripts, styles, and attributes.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理WordPress块的能力，利用工具如`@wordpress/scripts`和`@wordpress/create-block`进行高效开发，并轻松处理块弃用和迁移，同时利用`block.json`进行自定义脚本、样式和属性。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressブロックを作成して管理できるようにし、`@wordpress/scripts`や`@wordpress/create-block`などのツールを使用して効率的な開発を行い、ブロックの非推奨や移行を簡単に処理し、`block.json`を使用してカスタムスクリプト、スタイル、属性を利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 워드프레스 블록을 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `@wordpress/scripts` 및 `@wordpress/create-block`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 효율적인 개발을 수행하고 블록의 비 推奨 및 마이그레이션을 쉽게 처리하며, `block.json`를 사용하여 사용자 지정 스크립트, 스타일 및 속성을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar bloques de WordPress con precisión, utilizando herramientas como `@wordpress/scripts` y `@wordpress/create-block` para un desarrollo eficiente, y manejo de deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques con facilidad, y también aprovechando `block.json` para scripts, estilos y atributos personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des blocs WordPress avec précision, en utilisant des outils tels que `@wordpress/scripts` et `@wordpress/create-block` pour un développement efficace, et en gérant les dépréciations et les migrations de blocs avec facilité, tout en exploitant `block.json` pour des scripts, des styles et des attributs personnalisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, WordPress-Blöcke mit Präzision zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Tools wie `@wordpress/scripts` und `@wordpress/create-block` für eine effiziente Entwicklung verwendet werden, und Block-Abonnements und -Migrationen mühelos gehandhabt werden, während auch `block.json` für benutzerdefinierte Skripte, Stile und Attribute genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem e gerenciarem blocos do WordPress com precisão, utilizando ferramentas como `@wordpress/scripts` e `@wordpress/create-block` para desenvolvimento eficiente, e lidando com depreciações e migrações de blocos com facilidade, além de aproveitar `block.json` para scripts, estilos e atributos personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять блоками WordPress с точностью, используя инструменты как `@wordpress/scripts` и `@wordpress/create-block` для эффективной разработки, и обрабатывая устаревание и миграции блоков с легкостью, а также используя `block.json` для настраиваемых скриптов, стилей и атрибутов.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من إنشاء وإدارة كتل ووردبريس بدقة، باستخدام أدوات مثل `@wordpress/scripts` و `@wordpress/create-block` من أجل التطوير الفعال، ومعالجة إهمال الكتل وترحيلها بسهولة، بالإضافة إلى استخدام `block.json` من أجل البرامج النصية و الأساليب و السمات المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom WordPress blocks with dynamic rendering using `render.php` and `render_callback`","Troubleshooting block issues such as invalid blocks, saving problems, or attribute persistence","Building and managing block tooling with `wp-env` for streamlined development and testing"],"zh":["使用`render.php`和`render_callback`进行动态渲染的自定义WordPress块开发","解决块问题，例如无效块、保存问题或属性持久性","使用`wp-env`构建和管理块工具，以实现流畅的开发和测试"],"ja":["`render.php`と`render_callback`を使用して動的なレンダリングを行うカスタムWordPressブロックの開発","ブロックの問題（無効なブロック、保存の問題、または属性の永続性）を解決する","`wp-env`を使用してブロックツールを構築して管理し、開発とテストをスムーズに行う"],"ko":["`render.php` 및 `render_callback`를 사용하여 동적 렌더링을 수행하는 사용자 지정 워드프레스 블록 개발","블록 문제(유효하지 않은 블록, 저장 문제 또는 속성 영속성)를 해결하는 것","`wp-env`를 사용하여 블록 툴을 구축하고 관리하여 개발 및 테스트를 원활하게 진행하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar bloques personalizados de WordPress con renderizado dinámico utilizando `render.php` y `render_callback`","Solucionar problemas de bloques como bloques no válidos, problemas de guardado o persistencia de atributos","Crear y gestionar herramientas de bloque con `wp-env` para un desarrollo y pruebas optimizados"],"fr":["Développer des blocs WordPress personnalisés avec un rendu dynamique en utilisant `render.php` et `render_callback`","Résoudre les problèmes de blocs tels que des blocs non valides, des problèmes de sauvegarde ou de persistance d''attributs","Construire et gérer des outils de bloc avec `wp-env` pour un développement et des tests rationalisés"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Blöcke mit dynamischer Rendering unter Verwendung von `render.php` und `render_callback` entwickeln","Blockprobleme wie ungültige Blöcke, Speicherprobleme oder Attributpersistence beheben","Block-Tooling mit `wp-env` für optimiertes Entwicklung und Testen erstellen und verwalten"],"pt":["Desenvolver blocos personalizados do WordPress com renderização dinâmica usando `render.php` e `render_callback`","Solucionar problemas de blocos, como blocos inválidos, problemas de salvamento ou persistência de atributos","Construir e gerenciar ferramentas de bloco com `wp-env` para desenvolvimento e teste otimizados"],"ru":["Разрабатывать пользовательские блоки WordPress с динамическим рендерингом с помощью `render.php` и `render_callback`","Устранять неполадки с блоками, такие как недействительные блоки, проблемы сохранения или сохранение атрибутов","Создавать и управлять инструментами блока с помощью `wp-env` для оптимизированного разработки и тестирования"],"ar":["تطوير كتل ووردبريس مخصصة مع عرض ديناميكي باستخدام `render.php` و `render_callback`","معالجة مشاكل الكتل مثل الكتل غير صالحة أو مشاكل الحفظ أو استمرار السمات","بناء وإدارة أدوات الكتلة باستخدام `wp-env` من أجل التطوير والاختبار المُتَوَقَن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment setup","Limited to WordPress block development"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境设置","仅限WordPress块开发"],"ja":["WordPress環境の設定が必要","WordPressブロック開発のみ"],"ko":["워드프레스 환경 설정이 필요합니다.","워드프레스 블록 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración de entorno de WordPress","Limitado al desarrollo de bloques de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''environnement WordPress","Limité au développement de blocs WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt WordPress-Umgebungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf die WordPress-Blockentwicklung"],"pt":["Exige configuração de ambiente do WordPress","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de blocos do WordPress"],"ru":["Требует настройки среды WordPress","Ограничен разработкой блоков WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة ووردبريس","محدود بتطوير كتل ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
