,"Produktionsoptimierung","Automatisierung der Konfiguration der Streaming-Inferenz"],"pt":["inferência em streaming","implantação de ML","orquestração de produção","tutoriais interativos","gerenciamento de pacotes CCPI","automatização de tarefas de ML"],"ru":["потоковая инференция","развертывание ML","оркестровка производства","интерактивные уроки","управление пакетами CCPI","автоматизация задач ML"],"ar":["الاستدلال المتدفق","نشر ML","توجيه الإنتاج","دروس تفاعلية","إدارة حزم CCPI","أتمتة مهام ML"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"streaming-inference-setup","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Streaming Inference Setup\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for streaming inference setup tasks within the ML Deployment domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"streaming inference setup\" in your request\n- Ask about streaming inference setup patterns or best practices\n- Need help with machine learning deployment skills covering model serving, mlops pipelines, monitoring, and production optimization.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides ste","body":"# Streaming Inference Setup\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for streaming inference setup tasks within the ML Deployment domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"streaming inference setup\" in your request\n- Ask about streaming inference setup patterns or best practices\n- Need help with machine learning deployment skills covering model serving, mlops pipelines, monitoring, and production optimization.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for streaming inference setup\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with streaming inference setup\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of ml deployment concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **ML Deployment** skill category.\nTags: mlops, serving, inference, monitoring, production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:23:07.023Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Machine Learning Agents needing automated streaming inference setup and production orchestration capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化流式推理设置和生产编排功能的机器学习代理。","ja":"自動化されたストリーミング推論設定とプロダクションオーケストレーション機能が必要なマシンラーニングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 스트리밍 추론 설정 및 프로덕션 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요한 머신 러닝 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aprendizaje Automático que necesitan una configuración de inferencia de streaming automatizada y capacidades de orquestación de producción.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Apprentissage Automatique ayant besoin d''une configuration d''inférence de streaming automatisée et de capacités d''orchestration de production.","de":"Perfekt für Machine-Learning-Agents, die eine automatisierte Streaming-Inferenz-Einrichtung und Produktions-Orchestrierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aprendizado de Máquina que necessitam de configuração de inferência de streaming automatizada e capacidades de orquestração de produção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов машинного обучения, которым необходима автоматизированная настройка потоковой инференции и возможности оркестровки производства.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تعلم الآلة الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد استدلال تدفق آلي وقدرات تحكم الإنتاج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline model serving, mlops pipelines, monitoring, and production optimization using over 270 Claude Code plugins and 739 agent skills, with support for interactive tutorials and the CCPI package manager.","zh":"赋予代理简化模型服务、mlops管道、监控和生产优化的能力，使用超过270个克劳德代码插件和739个代理技能，并支持交互式教程和CCPI包管理器。","ja":"モデルサービング、mlopsパイプライン、監視、生产最適化を簡素化する機能をエージェントに付与し、270以上のクラウドコードプラグインと739のエージェントスキルを使用し、インタラクティブなチュートリアルとCCPIパッケージマネージャーをサポートします。","ko":"모델 서비스, mlops 파이프라인, 모니터링 및 프로덕션 최적화를 단순화하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하며, 270개 이상의 클라우드 코드 플러그인 및 739개의 에이전트 스킬을 사용하며, 대화형 튜토리얼 및 CCPI 패키지 관리자를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar el servicio de modelos, las tuberías de mlops, el monitoreo y la optimización de producción utilizando más de 270 plugins de Claude Code y 739 habilidades de agente, con soporte para tutoriales interactivos y el administrador de paquetes CCPI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le service de modèles, les pipelines mlops, la surveillance et l''optimisation de production en utilisant plus de 270 plugins Claude Code et 739 compétences d''agent, avec un support pour les tutoriels interactifs et le gestionnaire de paquets CCPI.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Modellbereitstellung, die MLOps-Pipelines, die Überwachung und die Produktionsoptimierung zu rationalisieren, indem sie mehr als 270 Claude-Code-Plugins und 739 Agentenfähigkeiten nutzen, mit Unterstützung für interaktive Tutorien und den CCPI-Paketmanager.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simplificar a entrega de modelos, pipelines mlops, monitoramento e otimização de produção usando mais de 270 plugins Claude Code e 739 habilidades de agente, com suporte a tutoriais interativos e o gerenciador de pacotes CCPI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить обслуживание моделей, конвейеры mlops, мониторинг и оптимизацию производства с помощью более 270 плагинов Claude Code и 739 навыков агентов, с поддержкой интерактивных уроков и менеджера пакетов CCPI.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط خدمة النماذج وخطوط أنابيب mlops والمراقبة وتحسين الإنتاج باستخدام أكثر من 270 مكون إضافي Claude Code و739 مهارة وكيل، مع دعم التutorials التفاعلية ومدير حزمة CCPI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating streaming inference setup tasks","Generating production-ready mlops pipelines","Optimizing model serving for low-latency applications","Monitoring and debugging machine learning deployments"],"zh":["自动化流式推理设置任务","生成生产就绪的mlops管道","优化低延迟应用的模型服务","监控和调试机器学习部署"],"ja":["ストリーミング推論設定タスクの自動化","生产就绪のmlopsパイプラインの生成","低遅延アプリケーションのモデルサービングの最適化","マシンラーニングデプロイの監視とデバッグ"],"ko":["스트리밍 추론 설정 작업 자동화","프로덕션 준비 mlops 파이프라인 생성","저지연 애플리케이션의 모델 서비스 최적화","머신 러닝 배포 모니터링 및 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de configuración de inferencia de streaming","Generar pipelines de mlops listos para producción","Optimizar el servicio de modelos para aplicaciones de baja latencia","Supervisar y depurar implementaciones de aprendizaje automático"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de configuration d''inférence de streaming","Générer des pipelines mlops prêts pour la production","Optimiser le service de modèles pour les applications à faible latence","Surveiller et déboguer les déploiements d''apprentissage automatique"],"de":["Automatisieren von Streaming-Inferenz-Einrichtungsaufgaben","Erzeugen von produktionsbereiten MLOps-Pipelines","Optimieren der Modellbereitstellung für Anwendungen mit geringer Latenz","Überwachen und Debuggen von Machine-Learning-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de configuração de inferência de streaming","Gerar pipelines mlops prontos para produção","Otimizar a entrega de modelos para aplicações de baixa latência","Monitorar e depurar implantações de aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи настройки потоковой инференции","Генерировать конвейеры mlops, готовые к производству","Оптимизировать обслуживание моделей для приложений с низкой задержкой","Мониторить и отлаживать развертывания машинного обучения"],"ar":["توفير مهام إعداد استدلال التدفق الآلي","إنتاج خطوط أنابيب mlops جاهزة للإنتاج","تحسين خدمة النماذج لتطبيقات منخفضة التأخير","مراقبة وتصحيح أخطاء توزيعات تعلم الآلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Limited to ML Deployment domain","Version 4.13.0 or higher required"],"zh":["需要克劳德代码集成","仅限ML部署域","版本4.13.0或更高版本要求"],"ja":["クラウドコードの統合が必要","MLデプロイドメインに限定","バージョン4.13.0以上が必要"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 통합이 필요함","ML 배포 도메인에 한정됨","버전 4.13.0 이상 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Limitado al dominio de implementación de ML","Se requiere la versión 4.13.0 o superior"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Limité au domaine de déploiement de ML","La version 4.13.0 ou supérieure est requise"],"de":["Erfordert Claude-Code-Integration","Begrenzt auf das ML-Deploy-Domain","Version 4.13.0 oder höher erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer integração com Claude Code","Limitado ao domínio de implantação de ML","Versão 4.13.0 ou superior necessária"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Ограничен доменом развертывания ML","Требуется версия 4.13.0 или выше"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع Claude Code","محدود بنطاق توزيع ML","يتطلب الإصدار 4.13.0 أو أعلى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
