words":{"zh":["C/C++","","C/C++","GPU","","C/C++"],"ja":["C/C++","","C/C++","GPU","","C/C++"],"ko":["C/C++","","C/C++","GPU","","C/C++"],"es":["C/C++","hoja de trucos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","recursos de desarrollo","ejemplos en vivo","documentación local","programación de GPU"],"fr":["C/C++","feuille de triches","développement d''applications","ressources de développement","exemples en direct","documentation locale","programmation GPU"],"de":["C/C++","Cheat-Sheet","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungsressourcen","Live-Beispiele","lokale Dokumentation","GPU-Programmierung"],"pt":["C/C++","Desenvolvimento de sistema","Programação de GPU","Linguagem de programação","Folha de dicas","Referência completa","cppcheatsheet.com","Exemplos ao vivo"],"ru":["C/C++","Системное развитие","Программирование GPU","Язык программирования","Справочная таблица","Полная справка","cppcheatsheet.com","Примеры из жизни"],"ar":["سي/سي ++","تطوير النظام","برمجة وحدة معالجة الرسومات","لغة البرمجة","ورقة المرجع","مرجع شامل","cppcheatsheet.com","أمثلة مباشرة"]}},"owner":"crazyguitar","repo":"cppcheatsheet","repoPath":"crazyguitar/cppcheatsheet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp","description":"Comprehensive C/C++ programming reference covering everything from C11-C23 and C++11-C++23, system programming, CUDA GPU computing, debugging tools, Rust interop, and advanced topics. Use for: C/C++ questions, modern language features, RAII/memory management, templates/generics, CUDA programming, system programming, debugging/profiling, performance optimization, cross-platform development, build systems, assembly, shell scripting, and any C/C++/CUDA development tasks.","bodyPreview":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available","body":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available sources\n\n## Coverage Areas\n\n### Modern C Programming (C11-C23)\n**Core Language:** Syntax, types, memory management, preprocessor macros\n**GNU Extensions:** Compiler-specific features and optimizations\n**Build Systems:** Makefiles, compilation, linking\n**Assembly:** X86 assembly integration and inline assembly\n\n### Modern C++ Programming (C++11-C++23)\n**Core Features:** RAII, templates, STL containers, iterators, algorithms\n**Modern Standards:** Move semantics, constexpr, lambdas, concepts, coroutines, modules\n**Memory Management:** Smart pointers, resource management, optimization (RVO)\n**Build Systems:** CMake, package management, cross-platform builds\n\n### System Programming\n**Process Management:** POSIX processes, signals, process communication\n**File Systems:** File I/O, directory operations, filesystem monitoring\n**Networking:** Sockets, protocols, network programming patterns\n**Threading:** Multithreading, synchronization, parallel programming\n**IPC:** Inter-process communication, shared memory, message queues\n\n### CUDA Programming\n**GPU Computing:** CUDA kernels, memory hierarchy, performance optimization\n**Advanced CUDA:** libcu++, Thrust library, cooperative groups\n**Multi-GPU:** GPU-GPU communication, hardware topology, NVSHMEM\n**Async Programming:** CUDA pipelines, memory visibility, asynchronous execution\n\n### Debugging & Profiling\n**Debug Tools:** GDB debugging, Valgrind memory analysis, sanitizers, binary inspection (nm, readelf, objdump, otool)\n**Performance:** Perf profiling, tracing, performance optimization\n**GPU Debugging:** Nsight Systems, CUDA debugging and profiling\n\n### System Tools & Automation\n**Shell Scripting:** Bash programming, system administration\n**System Tools:** OS utilities, networking tools, hardware inspection\n**Service Management:** Systemd, process management, system monitoring\n\n### Cross-Language Development\n**Rust Interop:** Rust for C++ developers, FFI, memory safety comparison\n**Language Bridging:** C/C++ integration, foreign function interfaces\n\n### Advanced Topics\n**Blog Content:** Deep-dive articles, RDMA networking, GPU-initiated communication\n**Low-Level Programming:** Hardware interfaces, performance tuning\n**Architecture:** System design, scalable applications\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed information, I can access:\n- **[Structure](references/structure.md)** - Complete topic-to-URL reference map\n- **[Guidelines](references/guidelines.md)** - Code quality and best practices\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n### C/C++ Core\n- \"Modern C++23 features with examples\" → Latest language standards\n- \"RAII and smart pointer patterns\" → Memory management best practices\n- \"Template metaprogramming techniques\" → Advanced generic programming\n\n### System Programming\n- \"POSIX socket programming examples\" → Network programming patterns\n- \"Multithreading with std::thread and synchronization\" → Concurrent programming\n- \"Signal handling and process management\" → System-level programming\n\n### CUDA & GPU Programming\n- \"CUDA kernel optimization techniques\" → GPU performance programming\n- \"Multi-GPU communication with NVSHMEM\" → Distributed GPU computing\n- \"CUDA memory hierarchy and optimization\" → Memory-efficient GPU code\n\n### Debugging & Tools\n- \"GDB debugging C++ applications\" → Interactive debugging techniques\n- \"Valgrind memory leak detection\" → Memory analysis and debugging\n- \"Performance profiling with perf\" → System performance analysis\n\n### Build & Development\n- \"CMake cross-platform build systems\" → Modern C++ project setup\n- \"Makefile patterns and best practices\" → C build automation\n- \"Cross-compilation and toolchain setup\" → Multi-platform development"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:23:31.624Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing comprehensive C/C++ development references and live examples from cppcheatsheet.com","zh":"非常适合需要全面C/C++开发参考和cppcheatsheet.com实例的编码代理","ja":"C/C++開発の参考とcppcheatsheet.comからの実例が必要なコーディングエージェントに最適","ko":"전반적인 C/C++ 개발 참조와 cppcheatsheet.com의 라이브 예제가 필요한 코딩 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación que necesitan referencias de desarrollo de C/C++ completas y ejemplos en vivo de cppcheatsheet.com","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage ayant besoin de références de développement C/C++ complètes et d''exemples en direct de cppcheatsheet.com","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten, die umfassende C/C++-Entwicklungsreferenzen und Live-Beispiele von cppcheatsheet.com benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de referências abrangentes de desenvolvimento em C/C++ e exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования, которым необходимы всеобъемлющие справочные материалы по разработке на C/C++ и живые примеры с cppcheatsheet.com","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الترميز التي تحتاج إلى مراجع شاملة لتطوير برمجة سي/سي++ وأمثلة مباشرة من cppcheatsheet.com"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide current, comprehensive answers to C/C++ questions, leveraging live examples from cppcheatsheet.com and enhancing with local documentation for advanced GPU programming and system-level development using C/C++ syntax","zh":"赋予代理提供当前、全面C/C++问题答案的能力，利用cppcheatsheet.com的实例，并结合本地文档增强高级GPU编程和使用C/C++语法的系统级开发","ja":"cppcheatsheet.comからの実例とローカルドキュメントを使用して、高度なGPUプログラミングとC/C++構文を使用したシステムレベルの開発を強化することで、現在の包括的なC/C++質問に回答するエージェントの能力を提供する","ko":"cppcheatsheet.com의 라이브 예제와 로컬 문서를 사용하여 고급 GPU 프로그래밍 및 C/C++ 구문을 사용한 시스템 수준 개발을 강화함으로써 현재 및 전반적인 C/C++ 질문에 답변할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공한다","es":"Permite a los agentes proporcionar respuestas actuales y completas a preguntas de C/C++, aprovechando ejemplos en vivo de cppcheatsheet.com y mejorando con documentación local para programación de GPU avanzada y desarrollo a nivel de sistema utilizando la sintaxis C/C++","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des réponses actuelles et complètes aux questions C/C++, en exploitant les exemples en direct de cppcheatsheet.com et en améliorant avec la documentation locale pour la programmation GPU avancée et le développement au niveau du système en utilisant la syntaxe C/C++","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, aktuelle und umfassende Antworten auf C/C++-Fragen zu liefern, indem sie Live-Beispiele von cppcheatsheet.com nutzen und mit lokaler Dokumentation für erweiterte GPU-Programmierung und Systementwicklung mit C/C++-Syntax ergänzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer respostas atuais e abrangentes para perguntas de C/C++, utilizando exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com e melhorando com documentação local para programação de GPU avançada e desenvolvimento em nível de sistema usando sintaxe C/C++","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять актуальные и всеобъемлющие ответы на вопросы по C/C++, используя живые примеры с cppcheatsheet.com и дополняя их локальной документацией для продвинутой программирования GPU и системного развития с использованием синтаксиса C/C++","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من توفير إجابات حديثة وشاملة للأسئلة المتعلقة بلغة سي/سي++، مستفيداً من الأمثلة المباشرة من cppcheatsheet.com وتحسين الوثائق المحلية لبرمجة وحدة معالجة الرسومات المتقدمة وتطوير التطبيقات على مستوى النظام باستخدام بناء جملة سي/سي++"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating C/C++ code snippets for basic syntax and data types","Debugging GPU programming issues with live examples","Developing system-level applications using C/C++"],"zh":["为基本语法和数据类型生成C/C++代码片段","使用实例调试GPU编程问题","使用C/C++开发系统级应用"],"ja":["基本的な構文とデータ型のC/C++コードスニペットを生成する","実例を使用してGPUプログラミングの問題をデバッグする","C/C++を使用してシステムレベルのアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["기본 구문 및 데이터 타입을 위한 C/C++ 코드 조각 생성","라이브 예제를 사용하여 GPU 프로그래밍 문제 디버깅","C/C++를 사용한 시스템 수준 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Generación de fragmentos de código C/C++ para sintaxis básica y tipos de datos","Depuración de problemas de programación de GPU con ejemplos en vivo","Desarrollo de aplicaciones a nivel de sistema utilizando C/C++"],"fr":["Génération de fragments de code C/C++ pour la syntaxe de base et les types de données","Débogage des problèmes de programmation GPU avec des exemples en direct","Développement d''applications au niveau du système en utilisant C/C++"],"de":["Generierung von C/C++-Code-Snippets für grundlegende Syntax und Datentypen","Fehlerbehebung bei GPU-Programmierproblemen mit Live-Beispielen","Entwicklung von Systemanwendungen mit C/C++"],"pt":["Geração de trechos de código C/C++ para sintaxe básica e tipos de dados","Depuração de problemas de programação de GPU com exemplos ao vivo","Desenvolvimento de aplicações em nível de sistema usando C/C++"],"ru":["Генерация фрагментов кода C/C++ для базовой синтаксиса и типов данных","Отладка проблем программирования GPU с помощью живых примеров","Разработка системных приложений с использованием C/C++"],"ar":["إنشاء شفرات برمجة سي/سي++ لأغراض بناء الجملة الأساسية وأنواع البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء برمجة وحدة معالجة الرسومات باستخدام الأمثلة المباشرة","تطوير التطبيقات على مستوى النظام باستخدام لغة سي/سي++"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for live examples from cppcheatsheet.com","Limited to C/C++ programming language"],"zh":["需要互联网访问cppcheatsheet.com的实例","仅限C/C++编程语言"],"ja":["cppcheatsheet.comからの実例にアクセスするためのインターネット接続が必要","C/C++プログラミング言語のみ"],"ko":["cppcheatsheet.com의 라이브 예제에 액세스하기 위한 인터넷 연결 필요","C/C++ 프로그래밍 언어만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para ejemplos en vivo de cppcheatsheet.com","Limitado al lenguaje de programación C/C++"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour des exemples en direct de cppcheatsheet.com","Limité au langage de programmation C/C++"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang für Live-Beispiele von cppcheatsheet.com","Begrenzt auf die C/C++-Programmiersprache"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com","Limitado à linguagem de programação C/C++"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для живых примеров с cppcheatsheet.com","Ограничен языком программирования C/C++"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لاستخدام الأمثلة المباشرة من cppcheatsheet.com","محدود بلغة برمجة سي/سي++"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
