 d''orchestration de production","Tutoriels interactifs","Gestionnaire de paquets CCPI","Intégration avec Jira"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflow-Erstellungsaufgaben","Produktions-Orchestrierungsmuster","Interaktive Tutorien","CCPI-Paket-Manager","Integration mit Jira"],"pt":["Criação de fluxos de trabalho Jira personalizados","Automatização de tarefas de criação de fluxos de trabalho","Integração com o domínio de Fluxos de Trabalho Empresariais","Suporte a padrões de criação de fluxos de trabalho","Ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos e conformidade"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских потоков работы Jira","Автоматизация задач создания потоков работы","Интеграция с областью корпоративных потоков работы","Поддержка шаблонов создания потоков работы","Инструменты управления проектами и соответствия требованиям"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفقات عمل جيرا مخصصة","تشغيل مهام إنشاء تدفقات العمل","التكامل مع مجال تدفقات العمل المؤسسية","دعم أنماط إنشاء تدفقات العمل","أدوات إدارة المشاريع والامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira ","Claude Code","Jupyter ","CCPI","Enterprise Workflows","Project Management"],"ja":["Jira","Claude Code","Jupyter ","CCPI","Enterprise Workflows","Project Management"],"ko":["Jira ","Claude Code","Jupyter ","CCPI","Enterprise Workflows","Project Management"],"es":["creador de flujos de trabajo de Jira","automatización de flujos de trabajo","orquestación de producción","tutoriales interactivos","gestor de paquetes CCPI","integración con Jira","flujos de trabajo empresariales"],"fr":["créateur de flux de travail Jira","automatisation de flux de travail","orchestration de production","tutoriels interactifs","gestionnaire de paquets CCPI","intégration avec Jira","flux de travail d''entreprise"],"de":["Jira-Workflow-Ersteller","Automatisierung von Workflows","Produktions-Orchestrierung","interaktive Tutorien","CCPI-Paket-Manager","Integration mit Jira","Unternehmens-Workflows"],"pt":["criador de fluxos de trabalho Jira","fluxos de trabalho Jira","automatização de tarefas","fluxos de trabalho empresariais","gerenciamento de projetos","conformidade","integração de sistemas"],"ru":["создатель потоков работы Jira","потоки работы Jira","автоматизация задач","корпоративные потоки работы","управление проектами","соответствие требованиям","интеграция систем"],"ar":["مبدع تدفقات العمل جيرا","تدفقات العمل جيرا","تشغيل المهام","تدفقات العمل المؤسسية","إدارة المشاريع","الامتثال","التكامل بين الأنظمة"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-workflow-creator","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Jira Workflow Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for jira workflow creator tasks within the Enterprise Workflows domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"jira workflow creator\" in your request\n- Ask about jira workflow creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with enterprise workflow skills covering project management, compliance, governance, and enterprise integration patterns.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step","body":"# Jira Workflow Creator\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for jira workflow creator tasks within the Enterprise Workflows domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"jira workflow creator\" in your request\n- Ask about jira workflow creator patterns or best practices\n- Need help with enterprise workflow skills covering project management, compliance, governance, and enterprise integration patterns.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for jira workflow creator\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with jira workflow creator\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of enterprise workflows concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **Enterprise Workflows** skill category.\nTags: enterprise, governance, compliance, project-management, integration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:24:03.408Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Enterprise Workflow Agents needing automated Jira workflow creation and management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化Jira工作流创建和管理功能的企业工作流代理。","ja":"Jiraワークフローの自動化された作成と管理機能が必要なエンタープライズワークフローエージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 Jira 워크플로 생성 및 관리 기능이 필요한 엔터프라이즈 워크플로 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de flujo de trabajo empresarial que necesitan capacidades de creación y administración de flujos de trabajo de Jira automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de workflow d''entreprise ayant besoin de capacités de création et de gestion de flux de travail Jira automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Enterprise-Workflow-Agents, die automatisierte Erstellung und Verwaltung von Jira-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Empresarial que precisam de capacidades de criação e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do Jira automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рабочего процесса предприятия, которым необходимы автоматизированные возможности создания и управления рабочим процессом Jira.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تدفق العمل التجاري الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات إنشاء وتحكم تدفق العمل Jira أوتوماتيكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Jira workflow tasks using Claude Code plugins, providing production orchestration patterns and interactive tutorials through Jupyter notebooks, leveraging the CCPI package manager for seamless integration.","zh":"通过Claude Code插件和Jupyter笔记本中的交互式教程，赋予代理人使用生产编排模式自动化Jira工作流任务的能力，并利用CCPI包管理器实现无缝集成。","ja":"Claude CodeプラグインとJupyterノートブックを介したインタラクティブなチュートリアルを使用して、エージェントが生産オーケストレーションパターンを使用してJiraワークフロータスクを自動化する能力を提供し、CCPIパッケージマネージャーを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"클로드 코드 플러그인 및 주피터 노트북을 통한 상호작용형 튜토리얼을 통해 에이전트가 생산 오케스트레이션 패턴을 사용하여 지라 워크플로우 태스크를 자동화하는 능력을 제공하며, CCPI 패키지 관리자를 사용하여 무중단 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas de flujo de trabajo de Jira utilizando plugins de Claude Code, proporcionando patrones de orquestación de producción y tutoriales interactivos a través de cuadernos de Jupyter, aprovechando el administrador de paquetes CCPI para una integración perfecta.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches de workflow Jira en utilisant des plugins Claude Code, fournissant des modèles d''orchestration de production et des didacticiels interactifs via des cahiers Jupyter, en exploitant le gestionnaire de packages CCPI pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Jira-Workflow-Aufgaben mit Hilfe von Claude-Code-Plugins zu automatisieren, produziert Orchestrierungsmuster und interaktive Tutorials über Jupyter-Notebooks bereitzustellen, die den CCPI-Paketmanager für eine nahtlose Integration nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas de fluxo de trabalho do Jira usando plugins do Claude Code, fornecendo padrões de orquestração de produção e tutoriais interativos por meio de notebooks Jupyter, aproveitando o gerenciador de pacotes CCPI para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи рабочего процесса Jira с помощью плагинов Claude Code, предоставляя производственные оркестровочные шаблоны и интерактивные уроки через ноутбуки Jupyter, используя менеджер пакетов CCPI для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة مهام تدفق العمل Jira باستخدام إضافات Claude Code ، مع توفير أنماط الأوركسترا الإنتاجية والدروس التفاعلية من خلال دفاتر Jupyter ، وتسهيل مدير حزمة CCPI لتكامل بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira workflow creation for project management","Generating enterprise workflow skills for compliance and governance","Debugging Jira workflow issues using interactive tutorials"],"zh":["为项目管理自动化Jira工作流创建","为合规性和治理生成企业工作流技能","使用交互式教程调试Jira工作流问题"],"ja":["プロジェクト管理のためのJiraワークフローの自動化された作成","コンプライアンスとガバナンスのためのエンタープライズワークフロースキルの生成","インタラクティブなチュートリアルを使用したJiraワークフローの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["프로젝트 관리를 위한 지라 워크플로우 자동화 생성","준수 및 거버넌스 위한 엔터프라이즈 워크플로우 스킬 생성","상호작용형 튜토리얼을 사용한 지라 워크플로우 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de flujos de trabajo de Jira para la gestión de proyectos","Generación de habilidades de flujo de trabajo empresarial para el cumplimiento y la gobernanza","Depuración de problemas de flujo de trabajo de Jira mediante tutoriales interactivos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de flux de travail Jira pour la gestion de projets","Génération de compétences de flux de travail d''entreprise pour la conformité et la gouvernance","Débogage des problèmes de flux de travail Jira à l''aide de didacticiels interactifs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Jira-Workflows für das Projektmanagement","Generierung von Unternehmens-Workflow-Fähigkeiten für Compliance und Governance","Fehlerbehebung bei Jira-Workflow-Problemen mithilfe interaktiver Tutorials"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de fluxo de trabalho do Jira para gerenciamento de projetos","Gerar habilidades de fluxo de trabalho empresarial para conformidade e governança","Depurar problemas de fluxo de trabalho do Jira usando tutoriais interativos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание рабочего процесса Jira для управления проектами","Генерировать навыки рабочего процесса предприятия для соответствия и управления","Отладить проблемы рабочего процесса Jira с помощью интерактивных уроков"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء تدفق العمل Jira لإدارة المشاريع","إنشاء مهارات تدفق العمل التجاري للامتثال والحوكمة","تصحيح أخطاء تدفق العمل Jira باستخدام الدروس التفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code plugins and CCPI package manager","Limited to Jira workflow creation and management"],"zh":["需要Claude Code插件和CCPI包管理器","仅限Jira工作流创建和管理"],"ja":["Claude CodeプラグインとCCPIパッケージマネージャーが必要","Jiraワークフローの作成と管理のみ"],"ko":["클로드 코드 플러그인 및 CCPI 패키지 관리자가 필요","지라 워크플로우 생성 및 관리만"],"es":["Requiere plugins de Claude Code y administrador de paquetes CCPI","Limitado a la creación y administración de flujos de trabajo de Jira"],"fr":["Nécessite des plugins Claude Code et un gestionnaire de packages CCPI","Limité à la création et à la gestion de flux de travail Jira"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Code-Plugins und CCPI-Paketmanager","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Jira-Workflows"],"pt":["Requer plugins do Claude Code e gerenciador de pacotes CCPI","Limitado à criação e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do Jira"],"ru":["Требует плагинов Claude Code и менеджера пакетов CCPI","Ограничен созданием и управлением рабочим процессом Jira"],"ar":["يتطلب إضافات Claude Code ومدير حزمة CCPI","محدود بإنشاء وتحكم تدفق العمل Jira"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor/readme-updater', 'community', 'alirezarezvani', 'claude-code-tresor', 'alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor', 'readme-updater', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:23:59.986Z', NULL, '{"id":"alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor/readme-updater","name":"readme-updater","description":{"zh":"README 更新器 Skill 可以自动更新项目的 README 文档，确保开发人员能够快速获取最新的项目信息","ja":"README アップデーター スキルは、プロジェクトの README ドキュメントを自動的に更新し、開発者が最新のプロジェクト情報にアクセスできるようにします","ko":"README 업데이터 스킬은 프로젝트의 README 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하여 개발자가 최신 프로젝트 정보에 빠르게 액세스할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El actualizador de README es una herramienta que mantiene tu archivo README actualizado con los cambios de proyecto, incluyendo nuevas características y dependencias","fr":"La mise à jour de README est un outil qui garde votre fichier README à jour avec les changements de projet, y compris les nouvelles fonctionnalités et dépendances","de":"Der README-Updater ist ein Tool, das Ihre README-Datei auf dem neuesten Stand hält mit Projektänderungen, einschließlich neuer Funktionen und Abhängigkeiten","pt":"O skill readme-updater é uma coleção de utilitários para manter seu arquivo README atualizado com as alterações do projeto. Ele atualiza seções como instalação, recursos e uso","ru":"Умение readme-updater - это коллекция утилит для поддержания файла README в актуальном состоянии с изменениями проекта. Он обновляет разделы, такие как установка, функции и использование","ar":"مهارة محدث ملف README هي مجموعة من الأدوات المساعدة للاحتفاظ بملف README محدثًا مع التغييرات التي تطرأ على المشروع. وهي تحدث أقسام مثل التثبيت والميزات والاستخدام","en":"A world-class collection of Claude Code utilities: autonomous skills, expert agents, slash commands, and prompts that supercharge your development workflow"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"README 更新器 - 自动化项目文档","ja":"README アップデーター - プロジェクトドキュメントの自動化","ko":"README 업데이터 - 프로젝트 문서 자동화","es":"Actualizador de README: Mantén tu archivo actualizado","fr":"Mise à jour de README: Gardez votre fichier à jour","de":"README-Updater: Halten Sie Ihre Datei auf dem neuesten Stand","pt":"Atualizador de README: Mantenha Seu Projeto Atualizado","ru":"Обновлятор README: Держите Ваш Проект в Текущем Состоянии","ar":"محدث ملف README: احتفظ بمشروعك محدثًا","en":"readme-updater"},"description":{"zh":"README 更新器 Skill 可以自动更新项目的 README 文档，确保开发人员能够快速获取最新的项目信息","ja":"README アップデーター スキルは、プロジェクトの README ドキュメントを自動的に更新し、開発者が最新のプロジェクト情報にアクセスできるようにします","ko":"README 업데이터 스킬은 프로젝트의 README 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하여 개발자가 최신 프로젝트 정보에 빠르게 액세스할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El actualizador de README es una herramienta que mantiene tu archivo README actualizado con los cambios de proyecto, incluyendo nuevas características y depe...","fr":"La mise à jour de README est un outil qui garde votre fichier README à jour avec les changements de projet, y compris les nouvelles fonctionnalités et dépend...","de":"Der README-Updater ist ein Tool, das Ihre README-Datei auf dem neuesten Stand hält mit Projektänderungen, einschließlich neuer Funktionen und Abhängigkeiten","pt":"O skill readme-updater é uma coleção de utilitários para manter seu arquivo README atualizado com as alterações do projeto. Ele atualiza seções como instalaç...","ru":"Умение readme-updater - это коллекция утилит для поддержания файла README в актуальном состоянии с изменениями проекта. Он обновляет разделы, такие как устан...","ar":"مهارة محدث ملف README هي مجموعة من الأدوات المساعدة للاحتفاظ بملف README محدثًا مع التغييرات التي تطرأ على المشروع. وهي تحدث أقسام مثل التثبيت والميزات والاس...","en":"A world-class collection of Claude Code utilities: autonomous skills, expert agents, slash commands, and prompts that supercharge your development workflow"},"definition":{"en":"A world-class collection of Claude Code utilities: autonomous skills, expert agents, slash commands, and prompts that supercharge your development workflow"},"features":{"zh":["自动更新 README 文档","支持新功能和依赖项的添加","支持项目结构和设置指南的修改","支持用户提及 README 或文档时的更新"],"ja":["README ドキュメントの自動更新","新機能と依存関係の追加のサポート","プロジェクト構造と設定ガイドの変更のサポート","README またはドキュメントのユーザー提起時に更新"],"ko":["README 문서 자동 업데이트","새 기능 및 종속성 추가 지원","프로젝트 구조 및 설정 가이드 변경 지원","README 또는 문서에 대한 사용자 언급 시 업데이트됨"],"es":["Actualiza la sección de instalación con nuevas dependencias","Mantiene la sección de características actualizada con nuevas funcionalidades","Actualiza la sección de uso con instrucciones de configuración","Notifica cuando se menciona el README o la documentación","Actualiza la sección de configuración con cambios en los archivos de configuración"],"fr":["Met à jour la section d''installation avec de nouvelles dépendances","Maintient la section de fonctionnalités à jour avec de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Met à jour la section d''utilisation avec des instructions de configuration","Notifie lorsque le README ou la documentation est mentionné","Met à jour la section de configuration avec des changements dans les fichiers de configuration"],"de":["Aktualisiert den Installationsabschnitt mit neuen Abhängigkeiten","Hält den Funktionsabschnitt auf dem neuesten Stand mit neuen Funktionen","Aktualisiert den Nutzungsabschnitt mit Konfigurationsanweisungen","Benachrichtigt, wenn das README oder die Dokumentation erwähnt wird","Aktualisiert den Konfigurationsabschnitt mit Änderungen in den Konfigurationsdateien"],"pt":["Atualização automática do arquivo README","Suporte a novas funcionalidades e alterações de projeto","Atualização de seções como instalação e uso","Integração com configurações de projeto e dependências","Notificação quando o README ou documentação é mencionado"],"ru":["Автоматическое обновление файла README","Поддержка новых функций и изменений проекта","Обновление разделов, таких как установка и использование","Интеграция с настройками проекта и зависимостями","Уведомление, когда README или документация упоминается"],"ar":["تحديث تلقائي لملف README","دعم الميزات الجديدة والتغييرات في المشروع","تحديث أقسام مثل التثبيت والاستخدام","التكامل مع إعدادات المشروع والاعتماديات","إخطار عند ذكر ملف README أو الوثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["README 更新器","自动化项目文档","开发效率","项目管理","文档更新","自动化工具"],"ja":["README アップデーター","プロジェクトドキュメントの自動化","開発効率","プロジェクト管理","ドキュメント更新","自動化ツール"],"ko":["README 업데이터","프로젝트 문서 자동화","개발 효율성","프로젝트 관리","문서 업데이트","자동화 도구"],"es":["actualizador de README","herramienta de desarrollo","documento de proyecto","dependencias de proyecto","configuración de proyecto","documentación de proyecto","actualización automática","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["mise à jour de README","outils de développement","document de projet","dépendances de projet","configuration de projet","documentation de projet","mise à jour automatique","développement de logiciels"],"de":["README-Updater","Entwicklertools","Projektdatei","Projektabhängigkeiten","Projektkonfiguration","Projektdokumentation","automatische Aktualisierung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["atualizador de README","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de projeto","documentação de projeto","automatização de tarefas"],"ru":["обновлятор README","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление проектом","документация проекта","автоматизация задач"],"ar":["محدث ملف README","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة المشروع","وثائق المشروع","تأتمة المهام"]}},"owner":"alirezarezvani","repo":"claude-code-tresor","repoPath":"alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-updater","description":"Keep README files current with project changes. Use when project structure changes, features added, or setup instructions modified. Suggests README updates based on code changes. Triggers on significant project changes, new features, dependency changes.","bodyPreview":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage","body":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage:**\n- API changes\n- New examples\n- Updated screenshots\n\n**Configuration:**\n- New options\n- Environment variables\n- Config file changes\n\n## Examples\n\n### New Feature Addition\n\n```bash\n# You add authentication:\ngit diff\n# + auth.service.ts\n# + login.component.tsx\n# + JWT middleware\n\n# I suggest README update:\n## Features\n- ✨ User authentication with JWT  # NEW\n- 🔐 Role-based access control    # NEW\n- User management\n- Dashboard\n```\n\n### New Dependency\n\n```bash\n# You add: npm install stripe\n\n# I suggest:\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm install stripe  # Added for payment processing\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_key  # Required for payments\n```\n```\n\n### Setup Instructions\n\n```bash\n# You modify docker-compose.yml\n\n# I update README:\n## Development Setup\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone [url]\n\n# 2. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 3. Start services (UPDATED)\ndocker-compose up -d  # Now includes Redis cache\n\n# 4. Run migrations\nnpm run migrate\n```\n```\n\n## Detection Logic\n\n### Change Analysis\n\nI detect these changes automatically:\n- **package.json** → Update dependencies section\n- **New routes** → Update API documentation\n- **.env.example** → Update environment variables\n- **docker-compose.yml** → Update setup instructions\n- **New features** → Update features list\n\n### Section Mapping\n\n```yaml\nCode Change → README Section:\n  - New API endpoint → Usage / API Reference\n  - New dependency → Installation\n  - New env var → Configuration\n  - New feature → Features list\n  - Architecture change → Architecture section\n```\n\n## Intelligent Updates\n\n### Keep Structure\n\nI maintain your README structure:\n- Preserve emoji style\n- Keep formatting consistent\n- Maintain tone and voice\n- Respect existing organization\n\n### Add Missing Sections\n\n```markdown\n# Suggested additions:\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Node.js 18+\n- Docker (for development)\n- PostgreSQL 14+\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost/mydb\nAPI_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## Testing\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n```\n\n### Update Examples\n\n```markdown\n# Before:\n```javascript\nconst result = api.getUsers();\n```\n\n# After (API changed):\n```javascript\nconst result = await api.getUsers({ page: 1, limit: 10 });\n```\n```\n\n## Version Compatibility\n\nI track version-specific documentation:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ (updated from 16+)\n- TypeScript 5.0+ (new requirement)\n- React 18+ (unchanged)\n```\n\n## Changelog Integration\n\nI can sync with CHANGELOG.md:\n\n```markdown\n## Recent Changes\n\nSee [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for detailed version history.\n\n### Latest (v2.1.0)\n- ✨ Added user authentication\n- 🔧 Fixed memory leak in data processing\n- 📝 Updated API documentation\n```\n\n## Screenshot Management\n\n```markdown\n# I suggest when UI changes:\n## Screenshots\n\n![Dashboard](screenshots/dashboard.png)\n*Updated: 2025-10-24 - New authentication panel*\n\n![User Profile](screenshots/profile.png)\n*New feature - user profile management*\n```\n\n## Relationship with @docs-writer\n\n**Me (Skill):** Keep README current with code changes\n**@docs-writer (Sub-Agent):** Comprehensive documentation strategy\n\n### Workflow\n1. I detect changes\n2. I suggest README updates\n3. For full docs → Invoke **@docs-writer** sub-agent\n4. Sub-agent creates complete documentation\n\n## Sandboxing Compatibility\n\n**Works without sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n**Works with sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n\n- **Filesystem**: Writes to README.md\n- **Network**: None required\n- **Configuration**: None required\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep it current** - Update README with every feature\n2. **Be specific** - Include version numbers, prerequisites\n3. **Add examples** - Show actual usage, not just API\n4. **Include troubleshooting** - Common issues and solutions\n5. **Badge status** - Keep build/coverage badges current\n\n## README Templates\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description\n\n## Features\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Installation\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Usage\n```javascript\n// Example\n```\n\n## Configuration\nEnvironment variables needed\n\n## Contributing\nHow to contribute\n\n## License\nMIT\n```\n\n### Comprehensive Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n> Tagline\n\n[Badges]\n\n## Table of Contents\n- Features\n- Installation\n- Usage\n- API Reference\n- Configuration\n- Development\n- Testing\n- Deployment\n- Contributing\n- License\n\n[Sections with detailed content]\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n### With /docs-gen Command\n\n```bash\n/docs-gen --format markdown\n\n# Generates:\n# 1. README.md (via me)\n# 2. Full documentation site (via @docs-writer)\n# 3. API reference (via api-documenter)\n```\n\n### With CI/CD\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/docs.yml\n- name: Update README\n  run: |\n    # Skill suggests updates based on changes\n    # Review and commit\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nAdd company-specific README standards:\n\n```bash\ncp -r ~/.claude/skills/documentation/readme-updater \\\n      ~/.claude/skills/documentation/company-readme-updater\n\n# Edit to add:\n# - Company README template\n# - Required sections\n# - Badge standards\n```\n\n## Related Tools\n\n- **api-documenter skill**: API documentation\n- **@docs-writer sub-agent**: Comprehensive docs\n- **git-commit-helper skill**: Commit messages for updates\n- **/docs-gen command**: Full documentation generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:23:59.986Z","qualityScore":80}');
