과","모델 리팩토링하여 코드 품질 향상"],"es":["Creación de modelos de forma eficiente","Seguimiento del enfoque de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas","Mejora de la calidad del código","Automatización de tareas repetitivas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de Rails"],"fr":["Création de modèles de manière efficace","Suivi de l''approche de Développement Piloté par les Tests","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Automatisation de tâches répétitives","Intégration avec les outils de développement de Rails"],"de":["Effiziente Erstellung von Modellen","Verfolgung des Ansatzes des testgetriebenen Entwicklungsprozesses","Verbesserung der Codequalität","Automatisierung wiederkehrender Aufgaben","Integration mit Rails-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Criação de modelos de forma automatizada","Seguimento das melhores práticas de TDD","Definição de requisitos e validações","Criação de especificações de modelo e fábricas de teste","Geração de migrações e implementação de modelos"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание моделей","Следование лучшим практикам TDD","Определение требований и валидаций","Создание спецификаций моделей и фабрик тестирования","Генерация миграций и реализация моделей"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج بطريقة آلية","اتباع أفضل الممارسات للاختبارات الموجهة","تحديد المتطلبات والتحقق","إنشاء مواصفات النماذج ومصانع الاختبار","توليد الهجرات وتنفيذ النماذج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rails 模型生成器","TDD","模型创建","代码生成","开发工具","Rails 开发","代码质量","开发效率"],"ja":["Rails モデルジェネレーター","TDD","モデル作成","コード生成","開発ツール","Rails 開発","コード品質","開発効率"],"ko":["Rails 모델 생성기","TDD","모델 생성","코드 생성","개발 도구","Rails 개발","코드 품질","개발 효율성"],"es":["generador de modelos Rails","desarrollo dirigido por pruebas","TDD","Rails 8.1","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","eficiencia en el desarrollo","calidad del código"],"fr":["générateur de modèles Rails","développement piloté par les tests","TDD","Rails 8.1","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","efficacité dans le développement","qualité du code"],"de":["Rails-Modell-Generator","testgetriebener Entwicklungsprozess","TDD","Rails 8.1","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Effizienz in der Entwicklung","Codequalität"],"pt":["gerador de modelos rails","desenvolvimento dirigido por testes","tdd","rails 8.1","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["генератор моделей rails","разработка, управляемая тестами","tdd","rails 8.1","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","автоматизация разработки"],"ar":["مولد نموذج ريلز","تطوير موجه بواسطة الاختبارات","tdd","ريلز 8.1","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أتمتة التطوير"]}},"owner":"ThibautBaissac","repo":"rails_ai_agents","repoPath":"ThibautBaissac/rails_ai_agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rails-model-generator","description":"Creates Rails models using TDD approach - spec first, then migration, then model. Use when creating new models, adding model validations, defining associations, or setting up database tables.","bodyPreview":"# Rails Model Generator (TDD Approach)\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill creates models the TDD way:\n1. Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n2. Write model spec with expected behavior (RED)\n3. Create factory for test data\n4. Generate migration\n5. Implement model to pass specs (GREEN)\n6. Refactor if needed\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\n```\nModel Creation Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n- [ ] Step 2: Create model spec (RED)\n- [ ] Step 3:","body":"# Rails Model Generator (TDD Approach)\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill creates models the TDD way:\n1. Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n2. Write model spec with expected behavior (RED)\n3. Create factory for test data\n4. Generate migration\n5. Implement model to pass specs (GREEN)\n6. Refactor if needed\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\n```\nModel Creation Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n- [ ] Step 2: Create model spec (RED)\n- [ ] Step 3: Create factory\n- [ ] Step 4: Run spec (should fail - no model/table)\n- [ ] Step 5: Generate migration\n- [ ] Step 6: Run migration\n- [ ] Step 7: Create model file (empty)\n- [ ] Step 8: Run spec (should fail - no validations)\n- [ ] Step 9: Add validations and associations\n- [ ] Step 10: Run spec (GREEN)\n```\n\n## Step 1: Requirements Template\n\nBefore writing code, define the model:\n\n```markdown\n## Model: [ModelName]\n\n### Table: [table_name]\n\n### Attributes\n| Name | Type | Constraints | Default |\n|------|------|-------------|---------|\n| name | string | required, unique | - |\n| email | string | required, unique, email format | - |\n| status | integer | enum | 0 (pending) |\n| organization_id | bigint | foreign key | - |\n\n### Associations\n- belongs_to :organization\n- has_many :posts, dependent: :destroy\n- has_one :profile, dependent: :destroy\n\n### Validations\n- name: presence, uniqueness, length(max: 100)\n- email: presence, uniqueness, format(email)\n- status: inclusion in enum values\n\n### Scopes\n- active: status = active\n- recent: ordered by created_at desc\n- by_organization(org): where organization_id = org.id\n\n### Instance Methods\n- full_name: combines first_name and last_name\n- active?: checks if status is active\n\n### Callbacks\n- before_save :normalize_email\n- after_create :send_welcome_email\n```\n\n## Step 2: Create Model Spec\n\nLocation: `spec/models/[model_name]_spec.rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nrequire ''rails_helper''\n\nRSpec.describe ModelName, type: :model do\n  subject { build(:model_name) }\n\n  # === Associations ===\n  describe ''associations'' do\n    it { is_expected.to belong_to(:organization) }\n    it { is_expected.to have_many(:posts).dependent(:destroy) }\n  end\n\n  # === Validations ===\n  describe ''validations'' do\n    it { is_expected.to validate_presence_of(:name) }\n    it { is_expected.to validate_uniqueness_of(:email).case_insensitive }\n    it { is_expected.to validate_length_of(:name).is_at_most(100) }\n  end\n\n  # === Scopes ===\n  describe ''.active'' do\n    let!(:active_record) { create(:model_name, status: :active) }\n    let!(:inactive_record) { create(:model_name, status: :inactive) }\n\n    it ''returns only active records'' do\n      expect(described_class.active).to include(active_record)\n      expect(described_class.active).not_to include(inactive_record)\n    end\n  end\n\n  # === Instance Methods ===\n  describe ''#full_name'' do\n    subject { build(:model_name, first_name: ''John'', last_name: ''Doe'') }\n\n    it ''returns combined name'' do\n      expect(subject.full_name).to eq(''John Doe'')\n    end\n  end\nend\n```\n\nSee [templates/model_spec.erb](templates/model_spec.erb) for full template.\n\n## Step 3: Create Factory\n\nLocation: `spec/factories/[model_name_plural].rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nFactoryBot.define do\n  factory :model_name do\n    sequence(:name) { |n| \"Name #{n}\" }\n    sequence(:email) { |n| \"user#{n}@example.com\" }\n    status { :pending }\n    association :organization\n\n    trait :active do\n      status { :active }\n    end\n\n    trait :with_posts do\n      after(:create) do |record|\n        create_list(:post, 3, model_name: record)\n      end\n    end\n  end\nend\n```\n\nSee [templates/factory.erb](templates/factory.erb) for full template.\n\n## Step 4: Run Spec (Verify RED)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nExpected: Failure because model/table doesn''t exist.\n\n## Step 5: Generate Migration\n\n```bash\nbin/rails generate migration CreateModelNames \\\n  name:string \\\n  email:string:uniq \\\n  status:integer \\\n  organization:references\n```\n\nReview the generated migration and add:\n- Null constraints: `null: false`\n- Defaults: `default: 0`\n- Indexes: `add_index :table, :column`\n\n```ruby\n# db/migrate/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_create_model_names.rb\nclass CreateModelNames < ActiveRecord::Migration[8.0]\n  def change\n    create_table :model_names do |t|\n      t.string :name, null: false\n      t.string :email, null: false\n      t.integer :status, null: false, default: 0\n      t.references :organization, null: false, foreign_key: true\n\n      t.timestamps\n    end\n\n    add_index :model_names, :email, unique: true\n    add_index :model_names, :status\n  end\nend\n```\n\n## Step 6: Run Migration\n\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate\n```\n\nVerify with:\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate:status\n```\n\n## Step 7: Create Model File\n\nLocation: `app/models/[model_name].rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nclass ModelName < ApplicationRecord\nend\n```\n\n## Step 8: Run Spec (Still RED)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nExpected: Failures for missing validations/associations.\n\n## Step 9: Add Validations & Associations\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nclass ModelName < ApplicationRecord\n  # === Associations ===\n  belongs_to :organization\n  has_many :posts, dependent: :destroy\n\n  # === Enums ===\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, active: 1, suspended: 2 }\n\n  # === Validations ===\n  validates :name, presence: true,\n                   uniqueness: true,\n                   length: { maximum: 100 }\n  validates :email, presence: true,\n                    uniqueness: { case_sensitive: false },\n                    format: { with: URI::MailTo::EMAIL_REGEXP }\n\n  # === Scopes ===\n  scope :active, -> { where(status: :active) }\n  scope :recent, -> { order(created_at: :desc) }\n\n  # === Instance Methods ===\n  def full_name\n    \"#{first_name} #{last_name}\".strip\n  end\nend\n```\n\n## Step 10: Run Spec (GREEN)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nAll specs should pass.\n\n## References\n\n- See [templates/model_spec.erb](templates/model_spec.erb) for spec template\n- See [templates/factory.erb](templates/factory.erb) for factory template\n- See [reference/validations.md](reference/validations.md) for validation patterns\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Enum with Validation\n\n```ruby\nenum :status, { draft: 0, published: 1, archived: 2 }\nvalidates :status, inclusion: { in: statuses.keys }\n```\n\n### Polymorphic Association\n\n```ruby\nbelongs_to :commentable, polymorphic: true\n```\n\n### Counter Cache\n\n```ruby\nbelongs_to :organization, counter_cache: true\n# Add: organization.posts_count column\n```\n\n### Soft Delete\n\n```ruby\nscope :active, -> { where(deleted_at: nil) }\nscope :deleted, -> { where.not(deleted_at: nil) }\n\ndef soft_delete\n  update(deleted_at: Time.current)\nend\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:24:20.097Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby on Rails Agents needing automated model generation and TDD best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要自动模型生成和TDD最佳实践的Ruby on Rails代理。","ja":"Ruby on Railsエージェントが自動モデル生成とTDDベストプラクティスを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 모델 생성 및 TDD 모범 사례가 필요한 Ruby on Rails 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Ruby on Rails que necesitan generación de modelos automatizada y las mejores prácticas de TDD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Ruby on Rails ayant besoin d''une génération de modèles automatisée et des meilleures pratiques de TDD.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-on-Rails-Agents, die eine automatisierte Modellgenerierung und die besten TDD-Praktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Ruby on Rails que necessitam de geração automática de modelos e práticas recomendadas de TDD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Ruby on Rails, которым необходима автоматическая генерация моделей и соблюдение лучших практик TDD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل روبي على سكايز الذي يحتاج إلى توليد نموذج تلقائي وتطبيق أفضل الممارسات لآداب التطوير الموجه بالاختبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create models following the TDD approach, utilizing attributes, validations, and associations, while generating migrations and implementing models to pass specs, all within the Rails 8.1 framework.","zh":"赋予代理根据TDD方法创建模型的能力，利用属性、验证和关联，同时生成迁移并实现模型以通过规格，所有这些都在Rails 8.1框架内。","ja":"エージェントがTDDアプローチに従ってモデルを作成する能力を与え、属性、バリデーション、関連付けを利用し、スペックにパスするモデルを実装し、マイグレーションを生成するすべての機能を、Rails 8.1フレームワーク内で提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 TDD 접근 방식을 따라 모델을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 속성, 유효성 검사 및 연관성을 활용하고 규격에 통과하는 모델을 구현하며 마이그레이션을 생성하여 모든 것을 Rails 8.1 프레임워크 내에서 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear modelos siguiendo el enfoque TDD, utilizando atributos, validaciones y asociaciones, mientras genera migraciones e implementa modelos para pasar las especificaciones, todo dentro del marco de Rails 8.1.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modèles suivant l''approche TDD, en utilisant des attributs, des validations et des associations, tout en générant des migrations et en implementant des modèles pour passer les spécifications, le tout dans le cadre de Rails 8.1.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Modelle nach dem TDD-Ansatz zu erstellen, indem sie Attribute, Validierungen und Assoziationen verwenden, während sie Migrationen generieren und Modelle implementieren, um Spezifikationen zu bestehen, alles innerhalb des Rails-8.1-Frameworks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar modelos seguindo a abordagem TDD, utilizando atributos, validações e associações, enquanto gera migrações e implementa modelos para passar em specs, tudo dentro do framework Rails 8.1.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать модели в соответствии с подходом TDD, используя атрибуты, валидации и ассоциации, а также генерируя миграции и реализуя модели для прохождения тестов, все trong рамках фреймворка Rails 8.1.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء نماذج تتبع نهج آداب التطوير الموجه بالاختبار، باستخدام السمات والتحقق من الصحة والترابط، مع توليد الهجرات وتنفيذ النماذج لتجاوز المواصفات، كل ذلك داخل إطار العمل روبي على سكايز 8.1."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating model creation with defined requirements and expected behavior","Generating factory data for test-driven development","Implementing models to pass specs and refactoring as needed"],"zh":["使用定义的要求和预期行为自动创建模型","为测试驱动开发生成工厂数据","实现模型以通过规格，并根据需要重构"],"ja":["定義された要件と期待される動作で自動モデル作成","テスト駆動開発のためのファクトリーデータの生成","スペックにパスするモデルを実装し、必要に応じてリファクタリング"],"ko":["정의된 요구 사항 및 예상 동작으로 자동 모델 생성","테스트 주도 개발을 위한 팩토리 데이터 생성","규격에 통과하는 모델을 구현하고 필요한 경우 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de modelos con requisitos y comportamiento esperado definidos","Generación de datos de fábrica para el desarrollo dirigido por pruebas","Implementación de modelos para pasar las especificaciones y refactorizar según sea necesario"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de modèles avec des exigences et un comportement attendu définis","Génération de données de factory pour le développement piloté par les tests","Mise en œuvre de modèles pour passer les spécifications et réorganiser si nécessaire"],"de":["Automatisierung der Modellerstellung mit definierten Anforderungen und erwartetem Verhalten","Generierung von Fabrikdaten für die testgetriebene Entwicklung","Implementierung von Modellen, um Spezifikationen zu bestehen und nach Bedarf umzustrukturieren"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de modelos com requisitos e comportamento esperado definidos","Gerar dados de fábrica para desenvolvimento orientado a testes","Implementar modelos para passar em specs e refatorar conforme necessário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание моделей с определенными требованиями и ожидаемым поведением","Генерировать фабричные данные для разработки, ориентированной на тестирование","Реализовывать модели для прохождения тестов и рефакторить по мере необходимости"],"ar":["توليد نماذج تلقائي مع متطلبات وسلوك متوقع محددين","توليد بيانات مصنع لآداب التطوير الموجه بالاختبار","تنفيذ نماذج لتجاوز المواصفات وإعادة الهيكلة حسب الحاجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rails 8.1 environment","Limited to TDD approach for model generation"],"zh":["需要Rails 8.1环境","仅限TDD方法进行模型生成"],"ja":["Rails 8.1環境が必要","モデル生成はTDDアプローチのみに限定"],"ko":["Rails 8.1 환경이 필요함","모델 생성은 TDD 접근 방식만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Rails 8.1","Limitado al enfoque TDD para la generación de modelos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Rails 8.1","Limité à l''approche TDD pour la génération de modèles"],"de":["Benötigt Rails-8.1-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf TDD-Ansatz für Modellgenerierung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Rails 8.1","Limitado à abordagem TDD para geração de modelos"],"ru":["Требует среды Rails 8.1","Ограничен подходом TDD для генерации моделей"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة روبي على سكايز 8.1","محدود bằng نهج آداب التطوير الموجه بالاختبار لتوليد النماذج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
