ions de traits et de structures"],"de":["Entdecken Sie Trait-Implementierungen","Verstehen Sie polymorphe Designs","Indexierung von Rust-Trait-Knowledge","Unterstützung für LSP-Operationen","Suche nach Trait-Implementierungen und Strukturen"],"pt":["Descubra implementações de traits","Entenda designs polimórficos","Encontre todos os implementadores de um trait","Encontre todos os traits implementados por uma estrutura","Operações LSP para ir para a implementação","Suporte à pesquisa de traits e estruturas"],"ru":["Найдите реализации трейтов","Поймите полиморфные дизайны","Найдите всех реализаторов трейта","Найдите все трейты, реализованные структурой","Операции LSP для перехода к реализации","Поддержка поиска трейтов и структур"],"ar":["اكتشف تنفيذ سمات","افهم التصاميم المتعددة الشكل","ابحث عن جميع المنفذين لسمة","ابحث عن جميع السمات المنفذة من قبل هيكل","عمليات LSP للذهاب إلى التنفيذ","دعم البحث عن سمات وهياكل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust","特征","多态","LSP","开发工具","代码搜索","特征实现"],"ja":["Rust","トレイト","多相","LSP","開発ツール","コード検索","トレイトの実装"],"ko":["Rust","특성","다형성","LSP","개발 도구","코드 검색","특성 구현"],"es":["Rust","Traits","Polimorfismo","Desarrollo de software","Asistencia de desarrollo","Indexación de conocimientos","LSP","Búsqueda de implementaciones"],"fr":["Rust","Traits","Polymorphisme","Développement de logiciels","Assistance de développement","Indexation des connaissances","LSP","Recherche d''implémentations"],"de":["Rust","Traits","Polymorphismus","Software-Entwicklung","Entwickler-AI","Indexierung von Knowledge","LSP","Suche nach Implementierungen"],"pt":["Rust","Trait Explorer","Desenvolvimento de Software","Programação","Linguagem de Programação","Rust Traits","Polimorfismo","Desenvolvedor Rust"],"ru":["Rust","Трейт Эксплорер","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Программирование","Язык Программирования","Rust Трейты","Полиморфизм","Разработчик Rust"],"ar":["الرست","مستكشف السمات","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","لغة البرمجة","سمات الرست","التعددية الشكل","مطور الرست"]}},"owner":"actionbook","repo":"rust-skills","repoPath":"actionbook/rust-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rust-trait-explorer","description":"Explore Rust trait implementations using LSP. Triggers on: /trait-impl, find implementations, who implements, trait 实现, 谁实现了, 实现了哪些trait","bodyPreview":"# Rust Trait Explorer\n\nDiscover trait implementations and understand polymorphic designs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n- `/rust-trait-explorer Handler` - Find all implementors of Handler trait\n- `/rust-trait-explorer MyStruct` - Find all traits implemented by MyStruct\n\n## LSP Operations\n\n### Go to Implementation\n\nFind all implementations of a trait.\n\n```\nLSP(\n  operation: \"goToImplementation\",\n  filePath: \"src/traits.rs\",\n  line: 10,\n  character:","body":"# Rust Trait Explorer\n\nDiscover trait implementations and understand polymorphic designs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n- `/rust-trait-explorer Handler` - Find all implementors of Handler trait\n- `/rust-trait-explorer MyStruct` - Find all traits implemented by MyStruct\n\n## LSP Operations\n\n### Go to Implementation\n\nFind all implementations of a trait.\n\n```\nLSP(\n  operation: \"goToImplementation\",\n  filePath: \"src/traits.rs\",\n  line: 10,\n  character: 11\n)\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- Trait name is known\n- Want to find all implementors\n- Understanding polymorphic code\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Find Trait Implementors\n\n```\nUser: \"Who implements the Handler trait?\"\n    │\n    ▼\n[1] Find trait definition\n    LSP(goToDefinition) or workspaceSymbol\n    │\n    ▼\n[2] Get implementations\n    LSP(goToImplementation)\n    │\n    ▼\n[3] For each impl, get details\n    LSP(documentSymbol) for methods\n    │\n    ▼\n[4] Generate implementation map\n```\n\n### Find Traits for a Type\n\n```\nUser: \"What traits does MyStruct implement?\"\n    │\n    ▼\n[1] Find struct definition\n    │\n    ▼\n[2] Search for \"impl * for MyStruct\"\n    Grep pattern matching\n    │\n    ▼\n[3] Get trait details for each\n    │\n    ▼\n[4] Generate trait list\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Trait Implementors\n\n```\n## Implementations of `Handler`\n\n**Trait defined at:** src/traits.rs:15\n\n​```rust\npub trait Handler {\n    fn handle(&self, request: Request) -> Response;\n    fn name(&self) -> &str;\n}\n​```\n\n### Implementors (4)\n\n| Type | Location | Notes |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| AuthHandler | src/handlers/auth.rs:20 | Handles authentication |\n| ApiHandler | src/handlers/api.rs:15 | REST API endpoints |\n| WebSocketHandler | src/handlers/ws.rs:10 | WebSocket connections |\n| MockHandler | tests/mocks.rs:5 | Test mock |\n\n### Implementation Details\n\n#### AuthHandler\n​```rust\nimpl Handler for AuthHandler {\n    fn handle(&self, request: Request) -> Response {\n        // Authentication logic\n    }\n\n    fn name(&self) -> &str {\n        \"auth\"\n    }\n}\n​```\n\n#### ApiHandler\n​```rust\nimpl Handler for ApiHandler {\n    fn handle(&self, request: Request) -> Response {\n        // API routing logic\n    }\n\n    fn name(&self) -> &str {\n        \"api\"\n    }\n}\n​```\n```\n\n### Traits for a Type\n\n```\n## Traits implemented by `User`\n\n**Struct defined at:** src/models/user.rs:10\n\n### Standard Library Traits\n| Trait | Derived/Manual | Notes |\n|-------|----------------|-------|\n| Debug | #[derive] | Auto-generated |\n| Clone | #[derive] | Auto-generated |\n| Default | manual | Custom defaults |\n| Display | manual | User-friendly output |\n\n### Serde Traits\n| Trait | Location |\n|-------|----------|\n| Serialize | #[derive] |\n| Deserialize | #[derive] |\n\n### Project Traits\n| Trait | Location | Methods |\n|-------|----------|---------|\n| Entity | src/db/entity.rs:30 | id(), created_at() |\n| Validatable | src/validation.rs:15 | validate() |\n\n### Implementation Hierarchy\n\n​```\nUser\n├── derive\n│   ├── Debug\n│   ├── Clone\n│   ├── Serialize\n│   └── Deserialize\n└── impl\n    ├── Default (src/models/user.rs:50)\n    ├── Display (src/models/user.rs:60)\n    ├── Entity (src/models/user.rs:70)\n    └── Validatable (src/models/user.rs:85)\n​```\n```\n\n## Trait Hierarchy Visualization\n\n```\n## Trait Hierarchy\n\n                    ┌─────────────┐\n                    │    Error    │ (std)\n                    └──────┬──────┘\n                           │\n              ┌────────────┼────────────┐\n              │            │            │\n      ┌───────▼───────┐ ┌──▼──┐ ┌───────▼───────┐\n      │  AppError     │ │ ... │ │  DbError      │\n      └───────┬───────┘ └─────┘ └───────┬───────┘\n              │                         │\n      ┌───────▼───────┐         ┌───────▼───────┐\n      │ AuthError     │         │ QueryError    │\n      └───────────────┘         └───────────────┘\n```\n\n## Analysis Features\n\n### Coverage Check\n\n```\n## Trait Implementation Coverage\n\nTrait: Handler (3 required methods)\n\n| Implementor | handle() | name() | priority() | Complete |\n|-------------|----------|--------|------------|----------|\n| AuthHandler | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Yes |\n| ApiHandler | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ default | Yes |\n| MockHandler | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Yes |\n```\n\n### Blanket Implementations\n\n```\n## Blanket Implementations\n\nThe following blanket impls may apply to your types:\n\n| Trait | Blanket Impl | Applies To |\n|-------|--------------|------------|\n| From<T> | `impl<T> From<T> for T` | All types |\n| Into<U> | `impl<T, U> Into<U> for T where U: From<T>` | Types with From |\n| ToString | `impl<T: Display> ToString for T` | Types with Display |\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n| User Says | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| \"Who implements X?\" | goToImplementation on trait |\n| \"What traits does Y impl?\" | Grep for `impl * for Y` |\n| \"Show trait hierarchy\" | Find super-traits recursively |\n| \"Is X: Send + Sync?\" | Check std trait impls |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Navigate to impl | rust-code-navigator |\n| Call relationships | rust-call-graph |\n| Project structure | rust-symbol-analyzer |\n| Safe refactoring | rust-refactor-helper |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:17.812Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust Developer Agents needing advanced trait implementation discovery and polymorphic design understanding.","zh":"非常适合需要高级特征实现发现和多态设计理解的Rust开发者代理。","ja":"Rust開発者エージェントが高度なトレイト実装の発見と多相的設計の理解を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 특성 구현 발견 및 다형성 디자인 이해가 필요한 러스트 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollador de Rust que necesitan descubrir implementaciones de rasgos avanzados y comprender diseños polimórficos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur Rust nécessitant une découverte d''implémentation de traits avancée et une compréhension de conception polymorphique.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-Entwickler-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Entdeckung von Trait-Implementierungen und ein Verständnis von polymorphen Designs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Rust que necessitam de descoberta avançada de implementação de traits e compreensão de design polimórfico.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков Rust, которым необходима продвинутая реализация обнаружения трейтов и понимание полиморфного дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مطورو رست الذين يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف متقدم لتنفيذ السمات وفهم التصميم متعدد الأشكال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate Rust codebases by discovering trait implementations and understanding polymorphic designs using LSP operations like ''goToImplementation'', facilitating efficient trait and struct analysis with commands like ''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>''","zh":"赋予代理导航Rust代码库的能力，通过发现特征实现和理解多态设计，使用类似''goToImplementation''的LSP操作，并通过类似''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>''的命令实现高效的特征和结构分析。","ja":"エージェントがRustコードベースをナビゲートする能力を付与し、トレイトの実装を発見し、多相的設計を理解し、''goToImplementation''のようなLSP操作や''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>''のようなコマンドを使用して効率的なトレイトと構造体の分析を実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 러스트 코드베이스를 탐색할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 트레이트 구현을 발견하고, 다형성 설계를 이해하며, ''goToImplementation'' 같은 LSP 연산이나 ''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>'' 같은 명령어를 사용하여 효율적인 트레이트와 구조체 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes navegar por las bases de código de Rust descubriendo implementaciones de traits y comprendiendo diseños polimórficos utilizando operaciones LSP como ''goToImplementation'', lo que facilita un análisis eficiente de traits y structs con comandos como ''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>''","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les bases de code Rust en découvrant les implémentations de traits et en comprenant les conceptions polymorphiques en utilisant des opérations LSP comme ''goToImplementation'', ce qui facilite une analyse efficace de traits et de structs avec des commandes comme ''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>''","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Rust-Codebases zu durchsuchen, indem sie Trait-Implementierungen entdecken und polymorphe Designs mit LSP-Operationen wie ''goToImplementation'' verstehen, was eine effiziente Analyse von Traits und Structs mit Befehlen wie ''/rust-trait-explorer <TraitName|StructName>'' ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pelas bases de código Rust, descobrindo implementações de traits e entendendo projetos polimórficos usando operações LSP como ''goToImplementation'', facilitando uma análise eficiente de traits e structs com comandos como ''/rust-trait-explorer <NomeDoTrait|NomeDaStruct>''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться в базах кода Rust, обнаруживая реализации трейтов и понимая полиморфные дизайны с помощью операций LSP, таких как ''goToImplementation'', что облегчает эффективный анализ трейтов и структур с помощью команд, таких как ''/rust-trait-explorer <НазваниеТрейта|НазваниеСтруктуры>''","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التنقل في قواعد بيانات رست، عن طريق اكتشاف تنفيذ السمات وفهم التصاميم متعددة الأشكال باستخدام عمليات بروتوكول خادم اللغة مثل ''goToImplementation''، مما يسهل تحليل كفء للسمات والهياكل باستخدام أوامر مثل ''/rust-trait-explorer <اسم السمة|اسم الهيكل>''"},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering implementors of specific traits","Finding all traits implemented by a given struct","Debugging polymorphic designs through trait implementation analysis"],"zh":["发现特定特征的实现者","找到给定结构体实现的所有特征","通过特征实现分析调试多态设计"],"ja":["特定のトレイトの実装者を発見する","与えられた構造体が実装するすべてのトレイトを探す","トレイト実装の分析を通じて多相的設計をデバッグする"],"ko":["특정 특성의 구현자를 발견","주어진 구조체가 구현하는 모든 특성을 찾기","트레이트 구현 분석을 통해 다형성 설계를 디버깅"],"es":["Descubrir implementadores de traits específicos","Encontrar todos los traits implementados por un struct determinado","Depurar diseños polimórficos a través del análisis de implementaciones de traits"],"fr":["Découvrir les implémentateurs de traits spécifiques","Trouver tous les traits implémentés par un struct donné","Déboguer les conceptions polymorphiques à travers l''analyse d''implémentations de traits"],"de":["Entdecken von Implementierungen spezifischer Traits","Finden aller Traits, die von einem bestimmten Struct implementiert werden","Debuggen polymorpher Designs durch Trait-Implementierungsanalyse"],"pt":["Descobrir implementadores de traits específicos","Encontrar todos os traits implementados por uma struct dada","Depurar projetos polimórficos por meio da análise de implementação de traits"],"ru":["Обнаружение реализаторов конкретных трейтов","Поиск всех трейтов, реализованных заданной структурой","Отладка полиморфных дизайнов посредством анализа реализации трейтов"],"ar":["اكتشاف منفذين لسمات محددة","العثور على جميع السمات المنفذة بواسطة هيكل معين","تصحيح الأخطاء في التصاميم متعددة الأشكال من خلال تحليل تنفيذ السمات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust codebase access","Limited to Rust programming language","Dependent on Language Server Protocol (LSP) operations"],"zh":["需要访问Rust代码库","仅限于Rust编程语言","依赖于语言服务器协议（LSP）操作"],"ja":["Rustコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Rustプログラミング言語に限定される","言語サーバープロトコル（LSP）操作に依存する"],"ko":["러스트 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","러스트 프로그래밍 언어로 제한","언어 서버 프로토콜(LSP) 연산에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Rust","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Rust","Dependiente de las operaciones del Protocolo de Servidor de Lenguaje (LSP)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Rust","Limité au langage de programmation Rust","Dépendant des opérations du Protocole de Serveur de Langage (LSP)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Rust-Codebasis","Begrenzt auf die Rust-Programmiersprache","Abhängig von Language-Server-Protocol-(LSP)-Operationen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código Rust","Limitado à linguagem de programação Rust","Dependente de operações do Protocolo do Servidor de Linguagem (LSP)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода Rust","Ограничен языком программирования Rust","Зависит от операций Протокола языковых серверов (LSP)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات رست","محدود بلغة برمجة رست","يعتمد على عمليات بروتوكول خادم اللغة (LSP)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
