"},"description":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能通过交互式访谈生成每日站立会议/会议更新，扩展 AI 编码代理的能力。","ja":"デイリーミーティングアップデートスキルは、インタラクティブなインタビューを通じてデイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデートを生成し、AI コーディングエージェントの能力を拡張します。","ko":"일일 회의 업데이트 스킬은 대화형 인터뷰를 통해 일일 스탠드업/회의 업데이트를 생성하며, AI 코딩 에이전트의 능력을 확장합니다.","es":"La habilidad de actualización de reuniones diarias genera informes de reuniones a través de una entrevista interactiva","fr":"La compétence de mise à jour de réunions quotidiennes génère des rapports de réunions via un entretien interactif","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur täglichen Besprechungsaktualisierung erstellt Besprechungsberichte durch ein interaktives Interview","pt":"Habilidade de agente de IA para geração de atualizações de reunião diária através de entrevista interativa.","ru":"Возможность агента ИИ для генерации ежедневных обновлений встреч через интерактивное интервью.","ar":"خادم وكلاء ذكية لتحديث اجتماع يومي من خلال مقابلة تفاعلية.","en":"A curated collection of skills for AI coding agents. Skills are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, document..."},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of skills for AI coding agents. Skills are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities across development, documentation, planning, and professional workflows."},"features":{"zh":["交互式访谈","检测和提供集成","生成每日站立会议/会议更新","扩展 AI 编码代理的能力","支持 GitHub 和 Jira 集成"],"ja":["インタラクティブなインタビュー","検出と統合の提供","デイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデートの生成","AI コーディングエージェントの能力の拡張","GitHub と Jira 統合のサポート"],"ko":["대화형 인터뷰","검출 및 통합 제공","일일 스탠드업/회의 업데이트 생성","AI 코딩 에이전트의 능력 확장","GitHub 및 Jira 통합 지원"],"es":["Entrevista interactiva para generar informes de reuniones","Integración con herramientas como GitHub y Jira"," Selección de elementos relevantes a través de multiSelect","Generación de informes de reuniones personalizados","Optimización del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Entretien interactif pour générer des rapports de réunions","Intégration avec des outils tels que GitHub et Jira","Sélection d''éléments pertinents via multiSelect","Génération de rapports de réunions personnalisés","Optimisation du flux de travail"],"de":["Interaktives Interview zur Erstellung von Besprechungsberichten","Integration mit Tools wie GitHub und Jira","Auswahl von relevanten Elementen über multiSelect","Erstellung von individuellen Besprechungsberichten","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios de reunião diária","Entrevista interativa para coleta de informações","Integração com GitHub e Jira","Suporte a múltiplas seleções de itens","Histórico de sessões do Claude Code"],"ru":["Генерация отчетов о встречах","Интерактивное интервью для сбора информации","Интеграция с GitHub и Jira","Поддержка多选ки элементов","История сессий Claude Code"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير اجتماع يومي","مقابلة تفاعلية لجمع المعلومات","التكامل مع جيت هاب وجيرا","دعم متعدد اختيار العناصر","سجل جلسات كلود كود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 编码代理","每日会议更新","交互式访谈","开发工作流程","文档工作流程","规划工作流程","专业工作流程"],"ja":["AI コーディングエージェント","デイリーミーティングアップデート","インタラクティブなインタビュー","開発ワークフロー","ドキュメントワークフロー","計画ワークフロー","プロフェッショナルワークフロー"],"ko":["AI 코딩 에이전트","일일 회의 업데이트","대화형 인터뷰","개발 워크플로우","문서 워크플로우","계획 워크플로우","전문 워크플로우"],"es":["actualización de reuniones diarias","entrevista interactiva","informes de reuniones","integración con GitHub","integración con Jira","optimización del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["mise à jour de réunions quotidiennes","entretien interactif","rapports de réunions","intégration avec GitHub","intégration avec Jira","optimisation du flux de travail"],"de":["tägliche Besprechungsaktualisierung","interaktives Interview","Besprechungsberichte","Integration mit GitHub","Integration mit Jira","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs"],"pt":["atualização de reunião diária","agente de IA","desenvolvedores","reunião diária","relatórios de reunião","integração com GitHub","integração com Jira"],"ru":["ежедневное обновление встречи","агент ИИ","разработчики","встреча","отчеты о встречах","интеграция с GitHub","интеграция с Jira"],"ar":["تحديث اجتماع يومي","خادم وكلاء ذكية","مطورين","اجتماع يومي","تقارير اجتماع","التكامل مع جيت هاب","التكامل مع جيرا"]}},"owner":"softaworks","repo":"agent-toolkit","repoPath":"softaworks/agent-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily-meeting-update","description":"Interactive daily standup/meeting update generator. Use when user says daily, standup, scrum update, status update, what did I do yesterday, prepare for meeting, morning update, or team sync. Pulls activity from GitHub, Jira, and Claude Code session history. Conducts 4-question interview (yesterday, today, blockers, discussion topics) and generates formatted Markdown update.","bodyPreview":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if","body":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if approved          │\n│ • Pull data NOW (before interview)                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 2: INTERVIEW (with insights)                  │\n│ • Show pulled data as context                       │\n│ • Yesterday: \"I see you merged PR #123, what else?\" │\n│ • Today: What will you work on?                     │\n│ • Blockers: Anything blocking you?                  │\n│ • Topics: Anything to discuss at end of meeting?    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 3: GENERATE UPDATE                            │\n│ • Combine interview answers + tool data             │\n│ • Format as clean Markdown                          │\n│ • Present to user                                   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Detect & Offer Integrations\n\n### Step 1: Silent Detection\n\nCheck for available integrations **silently** (suppress errors, don''t show to user):\n\n| Integration | Detection |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| **Claude Code History** | `~/.claude/projects` directory exists with `.jsonl` files |\n| GitHub CLI | `gh auth status` succeeds |\n| Jira CLI | `jira` command exists |\n| Atlassian MCP | `mcp__atlassian__*` tools available |\n| Git | Inside a git repository |\n\n### Step 2: Offer GitHub/Jira Integrations (if available)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for all questions in this phase.\n\n**GitHub/Git:**\n\nIf `HAS_GH` or `HAS_GIT`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have GitHub/Git configured. Want me to pull your recent activity (commits, PRs, reviews)?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull the info\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\nIf yes:\n\n```\n\"Which repositories/projects should I check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Just the current directory\" (if in a git repo)\n- \"I''ll list the repos\" → user provides list\n```\n\n**Jira:**\n\nIf `HAS_JIRA_CLI` or `HAS_ATLASSIAN_MCP`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have Jira configured. Want me to pull your tickets?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my tickets\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pull GitHub/Jira Data (if approved)\n\n**GitHub/Git** — For each approved repo:\n- Commits by user since yesterday\n- PRs opened/merged by user\n- Reviews done by user\n\n**Jira** — Tickets assigned to user, updated in last 24h\n\n**Key insight**: Store results to use as context in Phase 2 interview.\n\n### Step 4: Offer Claude Code History\n\nThis integration captures everything you worked on with Claude Code — useful for recalling work that isn''t in git or Jira.\n\n**Detection:**\n```bash\nls ~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1\n```\n\n**If Claude Code history exists, ask:**\n\n```\n\"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. This can help recall work that isn''t in git/Jira (research, debugging, planning). Want me to check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my Claude Code sessions\"\n- \"No, I have everything I need\"\n```\n\n**If yes, run the digest script:**\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n```\n\n**Then present sessions with multiSelect:**\n\nUse `AskUserQuestionTool` with `multiSelect: true` to let user pick relevant items:\n\n```\n\"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n\nOptions (multiSelect):\n- \"Fix authentication bug (backend-api)\"\n- \"Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\"\n- \"Update homepage styles (frontend-app)\"\n- \"Research payment providers (docs)\"\n```\n\n**Key insight:** User selects which sessions are work-related. Personal projects or experiments can be excluded.\n\n**Do NOT run digest script when:**\n- User explicitly says \"No\" to Claude Code history\n- User says they''ll provide everything manually\n- `~/.claude/projects` directory doesn''t exist\n\n**If digest script fails:**\n- Fallback: Skip Claude Code integration silently, proceed with interview\n- Common issues: Python not installed, no sessions from yesterday, permission errors\n- Do NOT block the standup flow — the script is supplemental, not required\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Interview (with insights)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool to conduct the interview. This provides a better UX with structured options.\n\n**Use pulled data as context** to make questions smarter.\n\n### Question 1: Yesterday\n\n**If data was pulled**, show it first:\n\n```\n\"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #123: fix login timeout\n- 3 commits in backend-api\n- Reviewed PR #456 (approved)\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\n```\n\n**If no data pulled:**\n\n```\n\"What did you work on yesterday/since the last standup?\"\n```\n\nIf user response is vague, ask follow-up:\n- \"Can you give more details about X?\"\n- \"Did you complete anything specific?\"\n\n### Question 2: Today\n\n```\n\"What will you work on today?\"\n\nOptions:\n- [Text input - user types freely]\n```\n\n**If Jira data was pulled**, you can suggest:\n\n```\n\"I see you have these tickets assigned:\n- PROJ-123: Implement OAuth flow (In Progress)\n- PROJ-456: Fix payment bug (To Do)\n\nWill you work on any of these today?\"\n```\n\n### Question 3: Blockers\n\n```\n\"Do you have any blockers or impediments?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No blockers\"\n- \"Yes, I have blockers\" → follow-up for details\n```\n\n### Question 4: Topics for Discussion\n\n```\n\"Any topic you want to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No, nothing to discuss\"\n- \"Yes\" → follow-up for details\n\nExamples of topics:\n- Technical decision that needs input\n- Alignment with another team\n- Question about prioritization\n- Announcement or info for the team\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Generate Update\n\nCombine all information into clean Markdown:\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - [DATE]\n\n## Yesterday\n- [Items from interview]\n- [Items from GitHub/Jira if pulled]\n\n## Today\n- [Items from interview]\n\n## Blockers\n- [Blockers or \"No blockers\"]\n\n## PRs & Reviews (if pulled from GitHub)\n- [PRs opened]\n- [PRs merged]\n- [Reviews done]\n\n## Jira (if pulled from Jira)\n- [Tickets updated]\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- [Topics or \"None\"]\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- [PR links]\n- [Ticket links]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Interview is primary** — Tools supplement, they don''t replace human context\n2. **Consent before access** — Always ask before pulling from any integration\n3. **Context-aware questions** — Show pulled data during interview to trigger memory (\"I see you merged PR #123...\")\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Action | Tool |\n|-------|--------|------|\n| 1. Detect & Offer | Check gh/jira/claude history, ask user, pull data | Bash (silent), AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 2. Interview | Ask 4 questions with insights | AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 3. Generate | Format Markdown | Output text |\n\n*Claude Code only: Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for structured questions.\n\n### Claude Code Digest Script\n\n```bash\n# Get yesterday''s sessions as JSON\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n\n# Get today''s sessions\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --date today --format json\n\n# Filter to specific project\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --project ~/my-app --format json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nClaude: \"Let''s prepare your daily! I detected GitHub configured. Want me to pull your recent activity?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\nClaude: \"Which repos should I check?\"\nUser: \"backend-api and frontend-app\"\n\n[Claude pulls GitHub data silently]\n\nClaude: \"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. Want me to check?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\n[Claude runs digest script, gets 5 sessions]\n\nClaude: \"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n  ☑ Fix authentication timeout bug (backend-api)\n  ☑ Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\n  ☐ Update personal blog (blog) - [user unchecks personal project]\n  ☑ Research payment providers (docs)\n  ☐ Debugging test failures (experiments)\n\nUser: [selects 3 relevant items]\n\nClaude: \"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #120: fix login timeout\n- Opened PR #125: feat: add OAuth flow\n- Reviewed PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n- 5 commits in backend-api\n- [From Claude Code] Fix authentication timeout bug\n- [From Claude Code] Implement OAuth flow\n- [From Claude Code] Research payment providers\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\nUser: \"No, that covers it\"\n\nClaude: \"What will you work on today?\"\nUser: \"Continue the OAuth feature and deploy to staging\"\n\nClaude: \"Any blockers?\"\nUser: \"No\"\n\nClaude: \"Any topic to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\nUser: \"Yes, I want to discuss the architecture of the new payments module\"\n\n[Claude generates update]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Example\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - 2026-01-22\n\n## Yesterday\n- Worked on authentication feature\n- Research on payment providers\n- Merged PR #120 (fix: login timeout)\n- Opened PR #125 (feat: add OAuth flow)\n\n## Today\n- Continue OAuth feature\n- Deploy to staging\n\n## Blockers\n- No blockers\n\n## PRs & Reviews\n- **Opened:** PR #125 - feat: add OAuth flow\n- **Merged:** PR #120 - fix: login timeout\n- **Reviews:** PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- Architecture of the new payments module\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/125\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/120\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why (Expert Knowledge) | Instead |\n|-------|------------------------|---------|\n| Run gh/jira without asking | Users may have personal repos visible, or be in a sensitive project context they don''t want exposed | Always ask first, let user choose repos |\n| Assume current directory is the only project | Developers often work on 2-5 repos simultaneously (frontend, backend, infra) | Ask \"Which projects are you working on?\" |\n| Skip interview even with tool data | Tools capture WHAT happened but miss WHY and context (research, meetings, planning) | Interview is primary, tools supplement |\n| Generate update before all 4 questions | User might have critical blocker or discussion topic that changes the narrative | Complete interview, then generate |\n| Include raw commit messages | Commit messages are often cryptic (\"fix\", \"wip\") and don''t tell the story | Summarize into human-readable outcomes |\n| Ask for data after interview | Showing insights during interview makes questions smarter (\"I see you merged PR #123, anything else?\") | Pull data first, then interview with context |\n\n---\n\n## NEVER\n\n- **NEVER assume tools are configured** — Many devs have gh installed but not authenticated, or jira CLI pointing to wrong instance\n- **NEVER skip the \"Topics for Discussion\" question** — This is often the most valuable part of standup that tools can''t capture\n- **NEVER generate more than 15 bullets** — Standup should be <2 minutes to read; long updates lose the audience\n- **NEVER include ticket/PR numbers without context** — \"PROJ-123\" means nothing; always include title or summary\n- **NEVER pull data from repos user didn''t explicitly approve** — Even if you can see other repos, respect boundaries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:09.607Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing automated daily standup meeting updates through interactive interviews.","zh":"适合于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等 AI 编码代理，需要通过交互式访谈自动更新每日站立会议。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの AI コーディング エージェントに適しています。インタラクティブなインタビューを通じて毎日のスタンドアップ ミーティングの更新を自動化する必要があります。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다. 상호 작용형 인터뷰를 통해 매일 스탠드업 미팅 업데이트를 자동화하는 데 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan actualizaciones automatizadas de reuniones diarias a través de entrevistas interactivas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin de mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes automatisées via des entretiens interactifs.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die automatisierte tägliche Standup-Meeting-Updates durch interaktive Interviews benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam de atualizações de reuniões diárias automatizadas por meio de entrevistas interativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимы автоматические ежедневные обновления встреч через интерактивные интервью.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإداريين لبرمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات اجتماعات يومية آلية من خلال مقابلات تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate daily meeting updates by leveraging multiSelect for relevant item selection, pulling yesterday''s session digest from Claude Code history, and integrating with GitHub and Jira CLI for seamless workflow management.","zh":"使代理能够通过利用多选项选择相关项目、从 Claude Code 历史记录中拉取昨天的会话摘要，并与 GitHub 和 Jira CLI 集成以实现无缝的工作流管理来生成每日会议更新。","ja":"エージェントが、マルチセレクトを使用して関連アイテムを選択し、Claude Code の履歴から昨日のセッションのダイジェストを取得し、GitHub と Jira CLI と統合してワークフローの管理を簡素化することで、毎日のミーティング更新を生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 선택을 사용하여 관련 항목을 선택하고 Claude Code의 기록에서 어제의 세션 요약을 가져오고 GitHub 및 Jira CLI와 통합하여 워크플로우 관리를 원활하게 하여 매일 미팅 업데이트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar actualizaciones de reuniones diarias aprovechando multiSelect para la selección de elementos relevantes, extrayendo el resumen de la sesión de ayer de la historia de Claude Code e integrándose con GitHub y Jira CLI para una gestión de flujo de trabajo sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes en exploitant multiSelect pour la sélection d''éléments pertinents, en extrayant le résumé de la session de la veille de l''historique de Claude Code et en s''intégrant à GitHub et Jira CLI pour une gestion de flux de travail sans accroc.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, tägliche Meeting-Updates zu generieren, indem sie multiSelect für die Auswahl relevanter Elemente nutzen, den Sitzungsverlauf von gestern aus der Claude Code-Historie abrufen und sich in GitHub und Jira CLI für eine nahtlose Workflow-Verwaltung integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar atualizações de reuniões diárias aproveitando o multiSelect para seleção de itens relevantes, extrair o resumo da sessão de ontem do histórico do Claude Code e integrar com GitHub e Jira CLI para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать ежедневные обновления встреч, используя multiSelect для выбора соответствующих элементов, извлекая сводку вчерашней сессии из истории Claude Code и интегрируя с GitHub и Jira CLI для бесперебойного управления рабочим процессом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 تحديثات اجتماعات يومية من خلال استخدام multiSelect لتحديد العناصر ذات الصلة، واستخراج ملخص جلسة الأمس من تاريخ Claude Code، وتكامل GitHub و Jira CLI لإدارة تدفق العمل دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily standup meeting updates","Generating interactive meeting summaries","Integrating with GitHub and Jira for streamlined workflow management"],"zh":["自动化每日站立会议更新","生成交互式会议摘要","与 GitHub 和 Jira 集成以实现流畅的工作流管理"],"ja":["毎日のスタンドアップ ミーティングの更新を自動化する","インタラクティブなミーティングのまとめを生成する","GitHub と Jira と統合してワークフローの管理を簡素化する"],"ko":["매일 스탠드업 미팅 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","상호 작용형 미팅 요약을 생성하는 것","GitHub 및 Jira와 통합하여 워크플로우 관리를 원활하게 하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de reuniones diarias","Generación de resúmenes de reuniones interactivos","Integración con GitHub y Jira para una gestión de flujo de trabajo optimizada"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes","Génération de résumés de réunions interactifs","Intégration à GitHub et Jira pour une gestion de flux de travail rationalisée"],"de":["Automatisierung von täglichen Meeting-Updates","Erstellung interaktiver Meeting-Zusammenfassungen","Integration mit GitHub und Jira für eine optimierte Workflow-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de reuniões diárias","Gerar resumos de reuniões interativos","Integrar com GitHub e Jira para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho otimizado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневные обновления встреч","Генерировать интерактивные сводки встреч","Интегрироваться с GitHub и Jira для оптимизированного управления рабочим процессом"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات اجتماعات يومية آلية","توليد ملخصات اجتماعات تفاعلية","التكامل مع GitHub و Jira لإدارة تدفق العمل المُثلى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code history, gh CLI, or jira CLI configuration","Needs user input for integration and item selection"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 历史记录、gh CLI 或 jira CLI 配置","需要用户输入以实现集成和项目选择"],"ja":["Claude Code の履歴、gh CLI、または jira CLI の設定が必要","統合とアイテムの選択のためにユーザーの入力が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 기록, gh CLI 또는 jira CLI 구성이 필요합니다.","통합 및 항목 선택을 위해 사용자 입력이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de historia de Claude Code, gh CLI o jira CLI","Necesita entrada de usuario para integración y selección de elementos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''historique de Claude Code, gh CLI ou jira CLI","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour l''intégration et la sélection d''éléments"],"de":["Benötigt Konfiguration von Claude Code-Historie, gh CLI oder jira CLI","Benötigt Benutzereingabe für Integration und Elementauswahl"],"pt":["Requer configuração do histórico do Claude Code, gh CLI ou jira CLI","Necessita de entrada de usuário para integração e seleção de itens"],"ru":["Требует конфигурации истории Claude Code, gh CLI или jira CLI","Требует ввода пользователя для интеграции и выбора элементов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين تاريخ Claude Code، أو gh CLI أو jira CLI","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم للدمج واختيار العناصر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rohitg00/manim-video-generator/math-visualizer', 'community', 'rohitg00', 'manim-video-generator', 'rohitg00/manim-video-generator', 'math-visualizer', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:25:24.122Z', NULL, '{"id":"rohitg00/manim-video-generator/math-visualizer","name":"math-visualizer","description":{"zh":"Math Visualizer, OpenAI GPT, Manim","ja":"Math Visualizer, OpenAI GPT, Manim","ko":"Math Visualizer, OpenAI GPT, Manim","es":"El Visualizador de Matemáticas utiliza OpenAI''s GPT para convertir descripciones en código Manim y crear animaciones matemáticas precisas","fr":"Le Visualiseur de Mathématiques utilise OpenAI''s GPT pour convertir les descriptions en code Manim et créer des animations mathématiques précises","de":"Der Mathematische Visualisierer verwendet OpenAI''s GPT, um Beschreibungen in Manim-Code umzuwandeln und präzise mathematische Animationen zu erstellen","pt":"O Math Visualizer é uma aplicação que gera animações matemáticas a partir de descrições em linguagem natural, utilizando o modelo GPT da OpenAI","ru":"Математический Визуализатор - это приложение, которое генерирует математические анимации из описаний на естественном языке, используя модель GPT от OpenAI","ar":"مؤشر رياضي هو تطبيق يولد رسومًا متحركة رياضية من описات لغة طبيعية، باستخدام نموذج GPT من OpenAI","en":"This application allows you to generate mathematical animations using natural language descriptions. It uses OpenAI''s GPT model to convert your descriptions into Manim code, which is then used to create beautiful mathematical animations."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Math Visualizer - ","ja":"Math Visualizer - ","ko":"Math Visualizer - ","es":"Visualizador de Matemáticas: Animaciones con Lenguaje Nat...","fr":"Visualiseur de Mathématiques: Animations avec Langage Nat...","de":"Mathematischer Visualisierer: Ani