escripciones de lenguaje natural a código Manim","Creación de animaciones matemáticas precisas y hermosas","Uso de OpenAI''s GPT para el procesamiento de lenguaje natural","Compatibilidad con múltiples dominios matemáticos"],"fr":["Prise en charge de l''algèbre, du calcul, de la géométrie, de la trigonométrie et de l''algèbre linéaire","Conversion de descriptions de langage naturel en code Manim","Création d''animations mathématiques précises et beautés","Utilisation de OpenAI''s GPT pour le traitement de langage naturel","Compatibilité avec plusieurs domaines mathématiques"],"de":["Unterstützung für Algebra, Analysis, Geometrie, Trigonometrie und Lineare Algebra","Umwandlung von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen in Manim-Code","Erstellung präziser und schöner mathematischer Animationen","Verwendung von OpenAI''s GPT für die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache","Kompatibilität mit mehreren mathematischen Domänen"],"pt":["Geração de animações matemáticas precisas","Suporte a várias áreas da matemática, incluindo Álgebra, Cálculo e Geometria","Utilização do modelo GPT da OpenAI para processar descrições em linguagem natural","Código Manim para criação de animações personalizadas","Suporte a funções trigonométricas e álgebra linear"],"ru":["Генерация точных математических анимаций","Поддержка нескольких областей математики, включая Алгебру, Высшую Математику и Геометрию","Использование модели GPT от OpenAI для обработки описаний на естественном языке","Код Manim для создания пользовательских анимаций","Поддержка тригонометрических функций и линейной алгебры"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة رياضية دقيقة","دعم مجالات رياضية متعددة، بما في ذلك الجبر والتفاضل والتكامل والهندسة","استخدام نموذج GPT من OpenAI لمعالجة الوصف بلغة طبيعية","كود Manim لإنشاء رسوم متحركة مخصصة","دعم للدوال المثلثية والجبر الخطي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Math Visualizer","OpenAI GPT","Manim","Math","Algebra","Calculus","Geometry","Trigonometry","Linear Algebra"],"ja":["Math Visualizer","OpenAI GPT","Manim","Math","Algebra","Calculus","Geometry","Trigonometry","Linear Algebra"],"ko":["Math Visualizer","OpenAI GPT","Manim","Math","Algebra","Calculus","Geometry","Trigonometry","Linear Algebra"],"es":["visualizador de matemáticas","animaciones matemáticas","lenguaje natural","OpenAI''s GPT","Manim","álgebra","cálculo","geometría","trigonometría","álgebra lineal"],"fr":["visualiseur de mathématiques","animations mathématiques","langage naturel","OpenAI''s GPT","Manim","algèbre","calcul","géométrie","trigonométrie","algèbre linéaire"],"de":["mathematischer Visualisierer","mathematische Animationen","natürliche Sprache","OpenAI''s GPT","Manim","Algebra","Analysis","Geometrie","Trigonometrie","Lineare Algebra"],"pt":["Math Visualizer","animações matemáticas","IA","GPT","Manim","Álgebra","Cálculo","Geometria","Trigonometria","Álgebra Linear"],"ru":["Математический Визуализатор","математические анимации","ИИ","GPT","Manim","Алгебра","Высшая Математика","Геометрия","Тригонометрия","Линейная Алгебра"],"ar":["مؤشر رياضي","رسوم متحركة رياضية","ذكاء اصطناعي","GPT","Manim","الجبر","التفاضل والتكامل","الهندسة","الدوال المثلثية","الجبر الخطي"]}},"owner":"rohitg00","repo":"manim-video-generator","repoPath":"rohitg00/manim-video-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"math-visualizer","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Math Visualizer Skill\n\nThe Math Visualizer brings mathematical concepts to life through precise, beautiful animations that reveal the structure and relationships within mathematics.\n\n## Mathematical Domains\n\n### Supported Areas\n- **Algebra**: Equations, inequalities, polynomials\n- **Calculus**: Derivatives, integrals, limits, series\n- **Geometry**: Shapes, transformations, proofs\n- **Trigonometry**: Functions, identities, unit circle\n- **Linear Algebra**: Vectors, matrices, transformations\n- *","body":"# Math Visualizer Skill\n\nThe Math Visualizer brings mathematical concepts to life through precise, beautiful animations that reveal the structure and relationships within mathematics.\n\n## Mathematical Domains\n\n### Supported Areas\n- **Algebra**: Equations, inequalities, polynomials\n- **Calculus**: Derivatives, integrals, limits, series\n- **Geometry**: Shapes, transformations, proofs\n- **Trigonometry**: Functions, identities, unit circle\n- **Linear Algebra**: Vectors, matrices, transformations\n- **Complex Analysis**: Complex numbers, transformations\n- **Number Theory**: Primes, sequences, patterns\n\n## Rules\n\n### [rules/equation-presentation.md](rules/equation-presentation.md)\nHow to present equations with proper pacing and emphasis.\n\n### [rules/color-coding-math.md](rules/color-coding-math.md)\nConsistent color schemes for mathematical elements.\n\n### [rules/graphing-best-practices.md](rules/graphing-best-practices.md)\nCreating clear, informative function graphs.\n\n### [rules/proof-visualization.md](rules/proof-visualization.md)\nStep-by-step proof animations that build understanding.\n\n## Color Coding Standard\n\n| Element | Color | Hex |\n|---------|-------|-----|\n| Variables (x, y) | BLUE | #58C4DD |\n| Constants | YELLOW | #FFFF00 |\n| Operators | WHITE | #FFFFFF |\n| Key Terms | GREEN | #83C167 |\n| Equals/Results | GOLD | #FFD700 |\n| Negative/Subtract | RED | #FC6255 |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Equation Derivation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass EquationDerivation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Initial equation\n        eq1 = MathTex(r\"x^2 + 2x + 1 = 0\")\n        self.play(Write(eq1))\n        self.wait()\n\n        # Transform step by step\n        eq2 = MathTex(r\"(x + 1)^2 = 0\")\n        eq3 = MathTex(r\"x + 1 = 0\")\n        eq4 = MathTex(r\"x = -1\")\n\n        # Show each transformation\n        for new_eq in [eq2, eq3, eq4]:\n            self.play(TransformMatchingTex(eq1, new_eq))\n            self.wait()\n            eq1 = new_eq\n\n        # Highlight final answer\n        box = SurroundingRectangle(eq4, color=GREEN, buff=0.2)\n        self.play(Create(box))\n```\n\n### Color-Coded Equation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass ColorCodedEquation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Equation with color-coded parts\n        equation = MathTex(\n            r\"f(\", r\"x\", r\") = \", r\"a\", r\"x^2\", r\" + \", r\"b\", r\"x\", r\" + \", r\"c\"\n        )\n\n        # Color code\n        equation[1].set_color(BLUE)   # x\n        equation[3].set_color(YELLOW) # a\n        equation[4].set_color(BLUE)   # x^2\n        equation[6].set_color(YELLOW) # b\n        equation[7].set_color(BLUE)   # x\n        equation[9].set_color(YELLOW) # c\n\n        self.play(Write(equation))\n\n        # Explain each part\n        labels = [\n            (equation[3], \"coefficient\"),\n            (equation[1], \"variable\"),\n            (equation[9], \"constant\")\n        ]\n\n        for part, label_text in labels:\n            self.play(Indicate(part))\n            label = Text(label_text, font_size=24).next_to(part, DOWN)\n            self.play(Write(label))\n            self.wait()\n            self.play(FadeOut(label))\n```\n\n### Function Graph with Animation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass FunctionGraph(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create axes\n        axes = Axes(\n            x_range=[-4, 4, 1],\n            y_range=[-2, 8, 1],\n            x_length=8,\n            y_length=5,\n            axis_config={\"include_tip\": True}\n        )\n        labels = axes.get_axis_labels(x_label=\"x\", y_label=\"y\")\n\n        self.play(Create(axes), Write(labels))\n\n        # Function\n        func = axes.plot(lambda x: x**2, color=BLUE)\n        func_label = MathTex(r\"f(x) = x^2\", color=BLUE).to_corner(UR)\n\n        self.play(Create(func), Write(func_label))\n\n        # Show derivative\n        deriv = axes.plot(lambda x: 2*x, color=GREEN)\n        deriv_label = MathTex(r\"f''(x) = 2x\", color=GREEN).next_to(func_label, DOWN)\n\n        self.play(Create(deriv), Write(deriv_label))\n\n        # Tangent line demonstration\n        x_tracker = ValueTracker(-2)\n\n        tangent = always_redraw(lambda: axes.get_secant_slope_group(\n            x=x_tracker.get_value(),\n            graph=func,\n            dx=0.01,\n            secant_line_color=YELLOW,\n            secant_line_length=4\n        ))\n\n        dot = always_redraw(lambda: Dot(\n            axes.c2p(x_tracker.get_value(), x_tracker.get_value()**2),\n            color=RED\n        ))\n\n        self.play(Create(tangent), Create(dot))\n        self.play(x_tracker.animate.set_value(2), run_time=4)\n```\n\n### 3D Mathematical Surface\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass Surface3D(ThreeDScene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Set up camera\n        self.set_camera_orientation(phi=75 * DEGREES, theta=-45 * DEGREES)\n\n        # Create axes\n        axes = ThreeDAxes(\n            x_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n            y_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n            z_range=[-2, 2, 1]\n        )\n\n        # Create surface\n        surface = Surface(\n            lambda u, v: axes.c2p(u, v, np.sin(u) * np.cos(v)),\n            u_range=[-PI, PI],\n            v_range=[-PI, PI],\n            resolution=(30, 30),\n            fill_opacity=0.7\n        )\n        surface.set_fill_by_value(\n            axes=axes,\n            colorscale=[(RED, -1), (YELLOW, 0), (GREEN, 1)]\n        )\n\n        # Animate\n        self.play(Create(axes))\n        self.play(Create(surface), run_time=3)\n        self.begin_ambient_camera_rotation(rate=0.2)\n        self.wait(5)\n```\n\n### Geometric Proof\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass PythagoreanProof(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create right triangle\n        triangle = Polygon(\n            ORIGIN, RIGHT * 3, RIGHT * 3 + UP * 4,\n            color=WHITE, fill_opacity=0.3\n        )\n\n        # Labels\n        a_label = MathTex(\"a\").next_to(triangle, DOWN)\n        b_label = MathTex(\"b\").next_to(triangle, RIGHT)\n        c_label = MathTex(\"c\").move_to(\n            (ORIGIN + RIGHT * 3 + UP * 4) / 2 + LEFT * 0.5 + UP * 0.3\n        )\n\n        self.play(Create(triangle))\n        self.play(Write(a_label), Write(b_label), Write(c_label))\n\n        # Show squares on each side\n        sq_a = Square(side_length=3, color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        sq_a.next_to(triangle, DOWN, buff=0)\n\n        sq_b = Square(side_length=4, color=GREEN, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        sq_b.next_to(triangle, RIGHT, buff=0)\n\n        self.play(Create(sq_a), Create(sq_b))\n\n        # Area labels\n        area_a = MathTex(r\"a^2\", color=BLUE).move_to(sq_a)\n        area_b = MathTex(r\"b^2\", color=GREEN).move_to(sq_b)\n\n        self.play(Write(area_a), Write(area_b))\n\n        # Conclusion\n        theorem = MathTex(r\"a^2 + b^2 = c^2\").to_edge(UP)\n        box = SurroundingRectangle(theorem, color=GOLD)\n\n        self.play(Write(theorem), Create(box))\n```\n\n## LaTeX Quick Reference\n\n### Common Expressions\n```latex\n% Fractions\n\\frac{a}{b}\n\n% Square root\n\\sqrt{x}  \\sqrt[n]{x}\n\n% Summation\n\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\n\n% Integral\n\\int_{a}^{b} f(x) \\, dx\n\n% Limit\n\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} f(x)\n\n% Matrix\n\\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{pmatrix}\n\n% Partial derivative\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\n```\n\n### Greek Letters\n```latex\n\\alpha \\beta \\gamma \\delta \\epsilon\n\\theta \\lambda \\mu \\pi \\sigma \\omega\n\\Gamma \\Delta \\Theta \\Lambda \\Sigma \\Omega\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Reveal equations gradually** - Build up complex equations piece by piece\n2. **Use consistent notation** - Same symbol = same meaning throughout\n3. **Annotate meaningfully** - Labels should clarify, not clutter\n4. **Show, don''t just state** - Animate the mathematical relationships\n5. **Connect to intuition** - Bridge abstract math to visual understanding\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:24.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Educational Agents needing advanced mathematical animation capabilities through natural language descriptions.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数学动画功能的教育代理，通过自然语言描述实现动画。","ja":"教育エージェントが高度な数学アニメーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。自然言語の説明を通じてアニメーション機能を実現します。","ko":"고급 수학 애니메이션 기능을 필요로 하는 교육 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 자연어 설명을 통해 애니메이션 기능을 구현합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes educativos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de animación matemática a través de descripciones de lenguaje natural.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents éducatifs ayant besoin de capacités d''animation mathématique avancées via des descriptions de langage naturel.","de":"Perfekt für Bildungsagenten, die erweiterte mathematische Animationsfähigkeiten durch natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Educacionais que precisam de capacidades avançadas de animação matemática por meio de descrições em linguagem natural.","ru":"Идеально для образовательных агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности математической анимации через описания на естественном языке.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل التعليمية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة الرياضية من خلال_descriptions بلغة طبيعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate beautiful mathematical animations using OpenAI''s GPT model and Manim code, supporting various mathematical domains such as Algebra, Calculus, and Geometry, and handling file formats compatible with mathematical visualization.","zh":"赋予代理生成漂亮的数学动画的能力，使用OpenAI的GPT模型和Manim代码，支持多种数学领域，如代数、微积分和几何，并处理兼容数学可视化的文件格式。","ja":"エージェントに美しい数学アニメーションを生成する能力を与えます。OpenAIのGPTモデルとManimコードを使用し、代数、微積分、幾何学などのさまざまな数学分野をサポートし、数学的可視化と互換性のあるファイル形式を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 아름다운 수학 애니메이션을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. OpenAI의 GPT 모델과 Manim 코드를 사용하여, 대수학, 미적분학, 기하학 등의 다양한 수학 분야를 지원하며, 수학적 시각화와 호환되는 파일 형식을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar hermosas animaciones matemáticas utilizando el modelo GPT de OpenAI y el código Manim, que admiten varios dominios matemáticos como Álgebra, Cálculo y Geometría, y que manejan formatos de archivo compatibles con la visualización matemática.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer de belles animations mathématiques en utilisant le modèle GPT d''OpenAI et le code Manim, qui prennent en charge divers domaines mathématiques tels que l''Algèbre, le Calcul et la Géométrie, et qui gèrent des formats de fichiers compatibles avec la visualisation mathématique.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schöne mathematische Animationen unter Verwendung des GPT-Modells von OpenAI und des Manim-Codes zu generieren, der verschiedene mathematische Bereiche wie Algebra, Analysis und Geometrie unterstützt und Dateiformate zur mathematischen Visualisierung verarbeitet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar belas animações matemáticas usando o modelo GPT da OpenAI e o código Manim, suportando vários domínios matemáticos, como Álgebra, Cálculo e Geometria, e lidando com formatos de arquivo compatíveis com a visualização matemática.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать красивые математические анимации с помощью модели GPT от OpenAI и кода Manim, поддерживая различные математические области, такие как Алгебра, Исчисление и Геометрия, и обрабатывая форматы файлов, совместимые с математической визуализацией.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء رسوم متحركة رياضية جميلة باستخدام نموذج GPT من OpenAI ورمز Manim ، ودعم مجالات رياضية متعددة مثل الجبر والتفاضل والتكامل والهندسة ، ومعالجة صيغ الملفات المتوافقة مع التصور الرياضي."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive calculus animations for educational content","Visualizing algebraic equations and inequalities for student engagement","Creating geometric transformations and proofs for advanced mathematics courses"],"zh":["为教育内容生成交互式微积分动画","可视化代数方程和不等式以增强学生参与度","为高级数学课程创建几何变换和证明"],"ja":["教育コンテンツ用のインタラクティブな微積分アニメーションを生成する","学生の関与を高めるために代数方程式と不等式を視覚化する","高度な数学コース用の幾何学的変換と証明を生成する"],"ko":["교육 콘텐츠를 위한 상호작용 미적분 애니메이션 생성","학생 참여도를 높이기 위해 대수 방정식과 부등식을 시각화","고급 수학 강의를 위한 기하학적 변환과 증명 생성"],"es":["Generar animaciones interactivas de cálculo para contenido educativo","Visualizar ecuaciones y desigualdades algebraicas para la participación de los estudiantes","Crear transformaciones geométricas y pruebas para cursos avanzados de matemáticas"],"fr":["Générer des animations interactives de calcul pour le contenu éducatif","Visualiser les équations et les inégalités algébriques pour l''engagement des étudiants","Créer des transformations géométriques et des preuves pour les cours avancés de mathématiques"],"de":["Interaktive Kalkulationsanimationen für Bildungsinhalte generieren","Algebraische Gleichungen und Ungleichungen für die Beteiligung der Schüler visualisieren","Geometrische Transformationen und Beweise für Fortgeschrittenenkurse in Mathematik erstellen"],"pt":["Gerar animações interativas de cálculo para conteúdo educacional","Visualizar equações e desigualdades algébricas para engajamento dos alunos","Criar transformações geométricas e provas para cursos avançados de matemática"],"ru":["Генерировать интерактивные анимации исчисления для образовательного контента","Визуализировать алгебраические уравнения и неравенства для вовлечения студентов","Создавать геометрические преобразования и доказательства для продвинутых математических курсов"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة تفاضلية وتكاملية تفاعلية لمحتوى تعليمي","تصوير المعادلات والتفاوتات الجبرية لتثقيف الطلاب","إنشاء تحويلات هندسية وبراهين لدورات رياضية متقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key for GPT model access","Limited to mathematical domains supported by Manim code","Dependent on natural language description accuracy for animation generation"],"zh":["需要OpenAI API密钥来访问GPT模型","仅限Manim代码支持的数学领域","依赖于自然语言描述的准确性来生成动画"],"ja":["GPTモデルにアクセスするためにOpenAI APIキーが必要","Manimコードでサポートされている数学分野のみ","アニメーション生成には自然言語の説明の精度に依存"],"ko":["GPT 모델에 접근하기 위해 OpenAI API 키가 필요","Manim 코드에서 지원하는 수학 분야만 해당","애니메이션 생성에는 자연어 설명의 정확도에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de OpenAI para acceder al modelo GPT","Limitado a los dominios matemáticos admitidos por el código Manim","Dependiente de la precisión de la descripción del lenguaje natural para la generación de animaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API OpenAI pour accéder au modèle GPT","Limité aux domaines mathématiques pris en charge par le code Manim","Dépend de la précision de la description du langage naturel pour la génération d''animations"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel für den Zugriff auf das GPT-Modell","Begrenzt auf die von dem Manim-Code unterstützten mathematischen Bereiche","Abhängig von der Genauigkeit der natürlichen Sprachbeschreibung für die Generierung von Animationen"],"pt":["Requer Chave de API da OpenAI para acesso ao modelo GPT","Limitado aos domínios matemáticos suportados pelo código Manim","Dependente da precisão da descrição em linguagem natural para geração de animação"],"ru":["Требует ключа API OpenAI для доступа к модели GPT","Ограничен математическими областями, поддерживаемыми кодом Manim","Зависит от точности описания на естественном языке для генерации анимации"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API من OpenAI للوصول إلى نموذج GPT","محدود بالمناطق الرياضية التي يدعمها رمز Manim","يعتمد على دقة الوصف اللغوي الطبيعي لإنشاء الرسوم المتحركة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('notedit/happy-skills/video-producer', 'community', 'notedit', 'happy-skills', 'notedit/happy-skills', 'video-producer', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:25:36.696Z', NULL, '{"id":"notedit/happy-skills/video-producer","name":"video-producer","description":{"zh":"视频制作技能是一种AI工具，帮助开发者创建多场景视频和动画。使用此技能创建专业的视频，例如促销视频、产品演示和社交媒体动画","ja":"ビデオ制作スキルは、開発者がマルチシーンのビデオとアニメーションを作成するのを支援するAIツールです。このスキルを使用して、プロのビデオを作成しましょう。例えば、プロモーションビデオ、製品デモ、ソーシャルメディアのアニメーションなど","ko":"영상 制作 스킬은 개발자가 다중 장면의 영상을 만들고 애니메이션을 생성하는 것을 지원하는 AI 도구입니다. 이 스킬을 사용하여 전문가급 영상을 만들 수 있습니다. 예를 들어, 프로모션 영상, 제품 데모, 소셜 미디어 애니메이션 등","es":"El skill de video-producer te permite crear vídeos con múltiples escenas o narrativa, ideal para promociones, demos de productos y animaciones para redes sociales.","fr":"Le skill de producteur vidéo vous permet de créer des vidéos avec plusieurs scènes ou une narrative, idéal pour les promotions, les démos de produits et les animations pour les réseaux sociaux.","de":"Das Video-Producer-Skill ermöglicht es Ihnen, Videos mit mehreren Szenen oder einer Erzählung zu erstellen, ideal für Promotionen, Produkt-Demos und Social-Media-Animationen.","pt":"A habilidade de vídeo-producer permite criar vídeos com múltiplas cenas ou narrativa, ideal para briefs de vídeo","ru":"Навык видеопроизводителя позволяет создавать видео с несколькими сценами или нарративом, идеально подходящий для видеобрифов","ar":"تمكن مهارة مُنتج الفيديو من إنشاء مقاطع فيديو مع مشاهد متعددة أو سرد قصصي، مثالية لمذكرات الفيديو","en":"happy coding  agent"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"视频制作技能 - 为开发者提供的AI视频生产工具","ja":"ビデオ制作スキル - 開発者向けのAIビデオ生成ツール","ko":"영상 제작 스킬 - 개발자를 위한 AI 비디오 제작 도구","es":"Generador de Vídeos: Crea Vídeos con Fines Específicos","fr":"Producteur Vidéo: Créez des Vidéos sur Mesure","de":"Video-Producer: Erstelle Zielgerichtete Videos","pt":"Criador de Vídeo: Ferramenta de Produção de Conteúdo","ru":"Видеопроизводитель: Инструмент для Создания Контента","ar":"مُنتج الفيديو: أداة لإنتاج المحتوى","en":"video-producer"},"description":{"zh":"视频制作技能是一种AI工具，帮助开发者创建多场景视频和动画。使用此技能创建专业的视频，例如促销视频、产品演示和社交媒体动画","ja":"ビデオ制作スキルは、開発者がマルチシーンのビデオとアニメーションを作成するのを支援するAIツールです。このスキルを使用して、プロのビデオを作成しましょう。例えば、プロモーションビデオ、製品デモ、ソーシャルメディアのアニメーションなど","ko":"영상 制作 스킬은 개발자가 다중 장면의 영상을 만들고 애니메이션을 생성하는 것을 지원하는 AI 도구입니다. 이 스킬을 사용하여 전문가급 영상을 만들 수 있습니다. 예를 들어, 프로모션 영상, 제품 데모, 소셜 미디어 애니메이션 등","es":"El skill de video-producer te permite crear vídeos con múltiples escenas o narrativa, ideal para promociones, demos de productos y animaciones para redes soc...","fr":"Le skill de producteur vidéo vous permet de créer des vidéos avec plusieurs scènes ou une narrative, idéal pour les promotions, les démos de produits et les ...","de":"Das Video-Producer-Skill ermöglicht es Ihnen, Videos mit mehreren Szenen oder einer Erzählung zu erstellen, ideal für Promotionen, Produkt-Demos und Social-M...","pt":"A habilidade de vídeo-producer permite criar vídeos com múltiplas cenas ou narrativa, ideal para briefs de vídeo","ru":"Навык видеопроизводителя позволяет создавать видео с несколькими сценами или нарративом, идеально подходящий для видеобрифов","ar":"تمكن مهارة مُنتج الفيديو من إنشاء مقاطع فيديو مع مشاهد متعددة أو سرد قصصي، مثالية لمذكرات الفيديو","en":"happy coding  agent"},"definition":{"en":"happy coding  agent"},"features":{"zh":["创建多场景视频","生成动画","支持促销视频、产品演示和社交媒体动画","易于使用的AI工具","提高视频制作效率"],"ja":["マルチシーンのビデオを作成","アニメーションを生成","プロモーションビデオ、製品デモ、ソーシャルメディアのアニメーションをサポート","使いやすいAIツール","ビデオ制作の効率を向上"],"ko":["다중 장면의 영상을 만들기","애니메이션을 생성하기","프로모션 영상, 제품 데모, 소셜 미디어 애니메이션을 지원하기","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 AI 도구","영상 제작 효율을 향상시키기"],"es":["Crea vídeos promocionales","Genera demos de productos","Desarrolla animaciones para redes sociales","Utiliza guiones o descripciones detalladas","Permite múltiples escenas o narrativa"],"fr":["Crée des vidéos de promotion","Génère des démos de produits","Développe des animations pour les réseaux sociaux","Utilise des scénarios ou des descriptions détaillées","Permet plusieurs scènes ou une narrative"],"de":["Erstellt Promo-Videos","Generiert Produkt-Demos","Entwickelt Social-Media-Animationen","Verwendet Drehbücher oder detaillierte Beschreibungen","Ermöglicht mehrere Szenen oder eine Erzählung"],"pt":["Criação de vídeos promocionais","Desenvolvimento de demos de produtos","Animações para mídias sociais","Vídeos com múltiplas cenas","Narrativa personalizada"],"ru":["Создание промо-видео","Разработка демонстраций продуктов","Анимации для социальных сетей","Видео с несколькими сценами","Персонализированная нарратив"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاطع فيديو ترويجية","تطوير دُمى للمنتجات","الرسوم المتحركة لمواقع التواصل الاجتماعي","مقاطع فيديو مع مشاهد متعددة","السرد القصصي المُخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视频制作","AI视频生成","多场景视频","动画生成","促销视频","产品演示","社交媒体动画"],"ja":["ビデオ制作","AIビデオ生成","マルチシーンのビデオ","アニメーション生成","プロモーションビデオ","製品デモ","ソーシャルメディアのアニメーション"],"ko":["영상 제작","AI 비디오 생성","다중 장면의 영상","애니메이션 생성","프로모션 영상","제품 데모","소셜 미디어 애니메이션"],"es":["video-producer","generador de vídeos","creador de contenido de video","vídeos promocionales","demos de productos","animaciones para redes sociales"],"fr":["producteur vidéo","générateur de vidéos","créateur de contenu vidéo","vidéos de promotion","démos de produits","animations pour les réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Video-Producer","Video-Generator","Inhalts-Ersteller für Videos","Promo-Videos","Produkt-Demos","Social-Media-Animationen"],"pt":["vídeo producer","criação de vídeos","vídeos promocionais","demos de produtos","animações para mídias sociais","vídeos com múltiplas cenas"],"ru":["видеопроизводитель","создание видео","промо-видео","демонстрации продуктов","анимации для социальных сетей","видео с несколькими сценами"],"ar":["مُنتج الفيديو","إنشاء مقاطع فيديو","مقاطع فيديو ترويجية","دُمى للمنتجات","الرسوم المتحركة لمواقع التواصل الاجتماعي","مقاطع فيديو مع مشاهد متعددة"]}},"owner":"notedit","repo":"happy-skills","repoPath":"notedit/happy-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"video-producer","description":">","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when the user provides a **video brief** — a description of a complete video with multiple scenes or a narrative arc.\n\n**Triggers:** \"create a promo video\", \"make a product demo\", \"I need a 30-second ad\", \"build a social media animation\", or any prompt describing a multi-scene video.\n\n**Do NOT use for:**\n- Single animation effects → use `gsap-animation`\n- Visual background components → use `react-animation`\n- Non-video tasks\n\n## Skill Relationships\n\n```\nvideo-produ","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when the user provides a **video brief** — a description of a complete video with multiple scenes or a narrative arc.\n\n**Triggers:** \"create a promo video\", \"make a product demo\", \"I need a 30-second ad\", \"build a social media animation\", or any prompt describing a multi-scene video.\n\n**Do NOT use for:**\n- Single animation effects → use `gsap-animation`\n- Visual background components → use `react-animation`\n- Non-video tasks\n\n## Skill Relationships\n\n```\nvideo-producer (this skill)       ← orchestration: what story, which scenes\n├── gsap-animation                ← animation: text splits, SVG drawing, timeline orchestration\n├── spring-animation              ← physics: bouncy entrances, elastic trails, organic motion\n├── react-animation               ← visuals: Aurora, Silk, particles, grain\n└── Remotion                      ← engine: rendering, composition, sequences\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nInitial request: $ARGUMENTS\n\n### Phase 1: Brief Intake\n\nExtract from the user''s request. Use AskUserQuestion for any missing **required** fields.\n\n| Field | Required | Default | Example |\n|-------|:--------:|---------|---------|\n| Product / brand name | Yes | — | \"Topview\" |\n| Video type | Yes | SaaS Promo | SaaS Promo / Typographic / Social Overlay |\n| Core messages (2-4) | Yes | — | \"AI-powered editing\", \"No coding required\" |\n| Emotional tone | Yes | — | Urgent / Reassuring / Exciting / Professional / Rebellious / Warm / Playful |\n| Memory anchor | Yes | — | \"The single image viewers will remember 30s later\" |\n| Target audience | No | General | \"Developers\", \"Marketers\" |\n| Duration | No | Template default | \"25 seconds\" |\n| Resolution | No | 1920x1080 | 1080x1080 for square |\n| FPS | No | 30 | 60 for social media |\n| Visual style | No | Apple Minimal | Apple Minimal / Bold Typography / Dark Tech / Warm Organic / Retro Pop / Editorial Mono |\n| CTA text | No | None | \"Start Creating →\" |\n| Color accent | No | From style preset | \"#FF7D00\" |\n\n**Emotional tone** drives animation technique selection, spring config, and pacing:\n- **Urgent** → `SPRING.stiff` + GSAP hard cuts, fast stagger (2-3 frames), `power3.out` for GSAP scenes\n- **Reassuring** → `SPRING.smooth` / `SPRING.gentle`, high damping, slow reveals, warm palette\n- **Exciting** → `SPRING.bouncy` / `SPRING.pop`, low damping, saturated colors, SpringTrail pop-ins\n- **Professional** → `SPRING.snappy` / `SPRING.smooth`, measured timing, clean motion, generous holds\n- **Rebellious** → `SPRING.stiff` + `SPRING.rubber` mix, GSAP glitch effects, irregular stagger\n- **Warm** → `SPRING.gentle` / `SPRING.molasses`, warm gradients, rounded shapes, slow stagger (6-8 frames)\n- **Playful** → `SPRING.wobbly` / `SPRING.rubber`, extreme overshoot, GridStagger center-out, bright accents\n\n**Memory anchor** — the ONE visual moment viewers will screenshot or recall. Every production decision should reinforce this anchor. Ask: \"If someone describes this video to a friend, what image do they describe?\"\n\n### Phase 2: Planning\n\n1. **Select narrative template** based on video type → see `rules/narrative-templates.md`\n2. **Select visual style** → see `rules/style-presets.md`\n3. **Map user''s messages to scene slots** in the selected template\n4. **Select animation pattern** for each scene → see `rules/scene-patterns.md`\n5. Present the plan as a table to the user:\n\n```\nScene | Duration | Pattern        | Content\n1     | 3s       | TitleCard      | \"Topview is powerful\"\n2     | 3s       | CardFlip3D     | CLI pain → AI solution\n...\n```\n\nWait for user confirmation before proceeding.\n\n### Phase 3: Project Scaffold\n\nGenerate the standard Remotion project structure → see `rules/project-scaffold.md`:\n\n1. `src/config.ts` — all parameters (colors, typography, scene frames)\n2. `src/Root.tsx` — composition registration\n3. `src/Composition.tsx` — TransitionSeries with all scenes\n4. `src/components/` — shared components (background, etc.)\n5. `src/scenes/` — one file per scene\n\n**Frame calculation:** `sceneFrames = Math.ceil(sceneDurationSeconds * fps)`\n\n### Phase 4: Scene Implementation + Evaluation\n\nImplement scenes in order. Each scene goes through a **build → verify → fix** loop before moving to the next. → see `rules/scene-evaluator.md` for the full scoring rubric and auto-fix rules.\n\nFor each scene:\n\n**Step 4a: Implement scene**\n\n1. Create `src/scenes/SceneN_Name.tsx`\n2. Select the right technique:\n   - Text splitting / SVG drawing / complex timelines → `useGSAPTimeline` or `useGSAPWithFonts` (from gsap-animation skill)\n   - Bouncy/elastic entrances / spring trails / overshoot effects → `spring()` + presets (from spring-animation skill)\n   - Simple fades / slides / linear counters → Remotion native `interpolate()`\n   - Visual backgrounds → react-animation components\n3. Apply the selected animation pattern from the plan\n4. Wire into `Composition.tsx` and register preview in `Root.tsx`\n\n**Step 4b: Render stills**\n\nCapture two key frames for visual inspection:\n\n```bash\n# Entry frame — catches early layout, initial positions\nnpx remotion still src/index.ts SceneN-Preview /tmp/sceneN_entry.png --frame={floor(SCENE_FRAMES.sceneN * 0.15)}\n\n# Peak frame — hero moment, all entrances settled\nnpx remotion still src/index.ts SceneN-Preview /tmp/sceneN_peak.png --frame={floor(SCENE_FRAMES.sceneN * 0.60)}\n```\n\n**Step 4c: Evaluate**\n\nRead the scene code + `config.ts` + rendered screenshots. Score across 7 weighted dimensions (anti-pattern compliance, typography, color & contrast, motion design, composition, narrative coherence, technical correctness).\n\n- **Score >= 7.0** and no instant-fails → **PASS**, proceed to next scene\n- **Score < 7.0** or instant-fail triggered → proceed to Step 4d\n\n**Step 4d: Auto-fix** (max 2 iterations)\n\nApply targeted fixes from the deduction → fix mapping table in `rules/scene-evaluator.md`. Each deduction maps to a concrete code change — not a vague suggestion. After fixing:\n\n- Return to **Step 4b** (re-render stills, re-score)\n- After **iteration 2**, if still below threshold: emit **WARNING** and proceed to next scene\n\n**Cross-scene tracking:** Maintain a running context of accent colors, spring presets, entrance directions, and techniques used per scene. At scene 3+, check for variety issues (same preset 3x in a row, same entrance direction, etc.).\n\n**After all scenes complete:** Output a full **Evaluation Summary Table** showing per-scene scores, iteration counts, and cross-scene notes before proceeding to Phase 5.\n\n**Pattern selection principle:** Use `spring()` for physics-driven motion with bounce/overshoot. Use GSAP for SplitText, DrawSVG, MorphSVG, and complex timeline orchestration. Use `interpolate()` for simple linear/eased motion.\n\n### Phase 5: Rendering\n\n```bash\n# Standard MP4\nnpx remotion render src/index.ts MainVideo --output out/video.mp4\n\n# High quality\nnpx remotion render src/index.ts MainVideo --codec h264 --crf 15\n\n# Transparent background (social overlays)\nnpx remotion render src/index.ts MainVideo --codec prores --prores-profile 4444\nnpx remotion render src/index.ts MainVideo --codec vp9 --output out/overlay.webm\n```\n\n| Format | Alpha | Use Case |\n|--------|:-----:|----------|\n| MP4 H.264 | No | Universal playback |\n| ProRes 4444 | Yes | Professional compositing |\n| WebM VP9 | Yes | Web overlays |\n\n## Complexity Calibration\n\nMatch implementation complexity to the emotional tone and visual style. The effort invested in animation must serve the creative vision — not exceed or undercut it.\n\n| Tone × Style | Pacing | Spring Preset | GSAP Usage | Hold Duration |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Urgent + Bold Typography | Fast (1.5-2.5s scenes) | `stiff` (stagger: 2f) | charCascade, hard cut transitions | Short (0.5s) |\n| Exciting + Dark Tech | Medium-fast (2-3s) | `bouncy` / `pop` (stagger: 3f) | circleReveal transitions, DrawSVG | Medium (0.8s) |\n| Professional + Apple Minimal | Measured (3-4s) | `smooth` / `snappy` (stagger: 5f) | textReveal, SplitScreenComparison | Long (1.2s) |\n| Warm + Warm Organic | Slow (3-5s) | `gentle` / `molasses` (stagger: 8f) | Minimal GSAP, prefer spring-only | Long (1.5s) |\n| Rebellious + Retro Pop | Irregular | `stiff` + `rubber` alternating | ScrambleText, glitch effects | Variable |\n| Playful + any | Bouncy (2-3s) | `wobbly` / `pop` (stagger: 3f) | Minimal GSAP, SpringTrail + GridStagger | Medium (0.8s) |\n\n**Principle:** One signature transition executed perfectly creates more impact than six mediocre effects. Invest animation budget in the memory anchor moment.\n\n**Anti-bloat rule:** Each scene should use ONE dominant animation technique:\n- Spring-dominant: `spring()` + `interpolate()` for all motion (bouncy entrances, trails, counters)\n- GSAP-dominant: `useGSAPTimeline` for text splits, SVG operations, complex orchestration\n- Mixed: Spring for element entrances, GSAP for text splitting within that element (acceptable)\n- NEVER: GSAP timeline + spring physics + react-animation background + complex interpolations in one scene\n\n**Spring-first principle:** Default to `spring()` for all entrances, exits, and stagger animations. Only add GSAP when you specifically need SplitText, DrawSVG, MorphSVG, ScrambleText, or complex timeline labels. Spring is lighter, requires no additional dependency, and produces naturally organic motion.\n\n## Creative Direction Principles\n\n**Every video must have a point of view.** A \"clean, professional\" video without a strong aesthetic commitment is just a generic video. Commit to specific, bold choices:\n\n- A **color** that dominates (not 5 equally-weighted pastels)\n- A **font** that has character (not the first Google Font result)\n- A **motion signature** that repeats across scenes (the same easing curve, the same entrance direction, the same hold rhythm)\n- A **spatial rule** that breaks expectations (all text left-aligned at 20%, asymmetric panels, diagonal grid)\n\n**The Memorability Test:** Before finalizing the plan, ask: \"If I showed this next to 10 other AI-generated promo videos, would mine look distinctly different?\" If no, push the aesthetic further.\n\n## Quick Decision Reference\n\n| \"I need...\" | Use |\n|-------------|-----|\n| Bold text entrance (split chars) | gsap: charCascade / textReveal effect |\n| Bold text entrance (bouncy words) | spring: WordTrail / CharacterTrail |\n| Side-by-side comparison | gsap: SplitScreenComparison template |\n| Card flip reveal (smooth) | gsap: CardFlip3D template |\n| Card flip reveal (spring physics) | spring: SpringCardFlip |\n| Elements from both sides | gsap: PerspectiveEntrance template |\n| Word highlighting | gsap: TextHighlightBox pattern |\n| UI click simulation | gsap: CursorClick pattern |\n| Text swap animation | gsap: RotateXTextSwap pattern |\n| Flowing background | react-animation: Aurora / Silk |\n| Film grain overlay | react-animation: NoiseOverlay |\n| Simple fade / slide | Remotion: interpolate() |\n| Number counter (linear) | Remotion: interpolate() |\n| Number counter (overshoot) | spring: SpringCounter |\n| Bouncy scale entrance | spring: ScalePop |\n| Staggered list/grid reveal | spring: SpringTrail / GridStagger |\n| Enter + exit animation | spring: useSpringEnterExit |\n| Sequential orchestration | spring: useSpringChain |\n| Typing effect | Remotion: .slice() + interpolate() |\n| Scene transition (wipe/iris) | gsap: circleReveal / wipeIn effect |\n| Scene transition (spring slide) | spring: SpringSlide / SpringCrossfade |\n| Logo stroke draw | gsap: DrawSVG + drawIn effect |\n| Feature grid pop-in | spring: SpringFeatureGrid |\n\n---\n\n## Variability Enforcement\n\nNEVER produce the same aesthetic twice across different videos. Each production must feel like a unique creative work, not a template fill-in.\n\n- **Rotate fonts:** Never use the same display font in consecutive videos. If you used Space Grotesk last time, pick Clash Display or Cabinet Grotesk this time.\n- **Rotate color temperature:** Alternate between warm (orange/coral/gold) and cool (blue/violet/emerald) dominant palettes.\n- **Rotate spatial composition:** If the last video was center-aligned symmetrical, make this one left-anchored asymmetrical.\n- **Rotate motion signatures:** Vary between spring-heavy, linear-mechanical, and organic-fluid animation philosophies.\n- **Rotate background treatments:** Cycle through solid, gradient blob, aurora, grain texture, geometric pattern.\n\n**The Divergence Rule:** Before starting Phase 3, mentally compare the planned aesthetic to a \"default AI video\" — white background, centered Inter text, fade-in transitions, blue accent. If your plan shares more than ONE of these traits, push further from the default.\n\n---\n\n## Creative Ambition\n\nEvery video should make viewers want to screenshot a frame and share it. This is motion graphics as a craft — not template assembly.\n\nPush beyond \"functional\" toward \"remarkable.\" Use unexpected font pairings. Try color combinations that feel risky. Let one scene break the grid. Give the memory anchor moment 2x the animation investment of other scenes.\n\nThe gap between a forgettable promo and a memorable one is not technical complexity — it''s creative courage. Make bold choices and execute them with precision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:36.696Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with multi-scene video briefs.","zh":"非常适合需要高级视频制作能力的创意代理，具有多场景视频简报功能。","ja":"高度なビデオ制作機能とマルチシーンのビデオブリーフを必要とするクリエイティブエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 비디오 제작 기능과 멀티신 비디오 브리핑이 필요한 크리에이티브 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes creativos que necesitan capacidades de producción de video avanzadas con descripciones de video de varias escenas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents créatifs ayant besoin de capacités de production vidéo avancées avec des descriptions de vidéo à plusieurs scènes.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die erweiterte Videoproduktionsfähigkeiten mit mehrszenigen Video-Beschreibungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with multi-scene video briefs.","ru":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with multi-scene video briefs.","ar":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with multi-scene video briefs."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complex video narratives using brief descriptions, supporting triggers like ''create a promo video'' and handling multiple scenes or narrative arcs with ease, utilizing video briefs and compatible with protocols like HTTP for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理生成复杂视频叙事的能力，使用简短的描述，支持诸如''创建促销视频''的触发器，并轻松处理多个场景或叙事弧线，利用视频简报，并兼容HTTP等协议以实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが簡単な説明を使用して複雑なビデオナレッジを生成する能力を与え、''プロモーションビデオを作成''などのトリガーをサポートし、複数のシーンや物語のアークを容易に処理し、ビデオブリーフを利用し、HTTPなどのプロトコルと互換性があり、シームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 간단한 설명을 사용하여 복잡한 비디오 내러티브를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, ''프로모션 비디오 생성''과 같은 트리거를 지원하며, 여러 장면이나 이야기 아크를 쉽게 처리하며, 비디오 브리핑을 활용하며, HTTP와 같은 프로토콜과 호환되어 無縫な統合을実現합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar narrativas de video complejas utilizando descripciones breves, admitiendo desencadenadores como ''crear un video promocional'' y manejando múltiples escenas o arcos narrativos con facilidad, utilizando descripciones de video y compatible con protocolos como HTTP para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des narrations vidéo complexes à l''aide de descriptions brèves, en prenant en charge des déclencheurs tels que ''créer une vidéo de promotion'' et en gérant plusieurs scènes ou arcs narratifs avec facilité, en utilisant des descriptions de vidéo et compatible avec des protocoles comme HTTP pour une intégration sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Videoerzählungen unter Verwendung von Kurzbeschreibungen zu generieren, unterstützt Auslöser wie ''Erstellen Sie ein Promo-Video'' und kann mehrere Szenen oder Erzählbögen mühelos handhaben, indem es Video-Beschreibungen verwendet und mit Protokollen wie HTTP für eine nahtlose Integration kompatibel ist.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate complex video narratives using brief descriptions, supporting triggers like ''create a promo video'' and handling multiple scenes or narrative arcs with ease, utilizing video briefs and compatible with protocols like HTTP for seamless integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate complex video narratives using brief descriptions, supporting triggers like ''create a promo video'' and handling multiple scenes or narrative arcs with ease, utilizing video briefs and compatible with protocols like HTTP for seamless integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate complex video narratives using brief descriptions, supporting triggers like ''create a promo video'' and handling multiple scenes or narrative arcs with ease, utilizing video briefs and compatible with protocols like HTTP for seamless integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating promotional videos from brief descriptions","Generating product demos with multi-scene narratives","Building social media animations based on user input"],"zh":["根据简短的描述创建促销视频","生成具有多场景叙事的产品演示","根据用户输入创建基于社交媒体的动画"],"ja":["簡単な説明からプロモーションビデオを作成する","マルチシーンの物語を備えた製品デモを生成する","ユーザーの入力に基づいてソーシャルメディア向けのアニメーションを作成する"],"ko":["간단한 설명에서 프로모션 비디오 생성","멀티 신의 내러티브를 갖춘 제품 데모 생성","사용자의 입력을 기반으로 소셜 미디어 애니메이션 생성"],"es":["Crear videos promocionales a partir de descripciones breves","Generar demos de productos con narrativas de varias escenas","Crear animaciones de redes sociales en función de la entrada del usuario"],"fr":["Créer des vidéos de promotion à partir de descriptions brèves","Générer des démos de produits avec des narrations à plusieurs scènes","Construire des animations de réseaux sociaux en fonction de la saisie de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellen von Promo-Videos aus Kurzbeschreibungen","Generieren von Produkt-Demos mit mehrszenigen Erzählungen","Erstellen von Social-Media-Animationen auf der Grundlage der Benutzereingabe"],"pt":["Creating promotional videos from brief descriptions","Generating product demos with multi-scene narratives","Building social media animations based on user input"],"ru":["Creating promotional videos from brief descriptions","Generating product demos with multi-scene narratives","Building social media animations based on user input"],"ar":["Creating promotional videos from brief descriptions","Generating product demos with multi-scene narratives","Building social media animations based on user input"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires detailed video briefs for optimal performance","Not suitable for single animation effects or visual background components","Limited to video-related tasks"],"zh":["需要详细的视频简报才能实现最佳性能","不适合单个动画效果或视觉背景组件","仅限于视频相关任务"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するには詳細なビデオブリーフが必要","単一のアニメーション効果や視覚的背景コンポーネントには不適切","ビデオ関連のタスクのみに限定される"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해詳細한 비디오 브리핑이 필요","단일 애니메이션 효과 또는 시각적 배경 구성 요소에 적합하지 않음","비디오 관련 작업에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere descripciones de video detalladas para un rendimiento óptimo","No es adecuado para efectos de animación únicos o componentes de fondo visual","Limitado a tareas relacionadas con video"],"fr":["Nécessite des descriptions de vidéo détaillées pour des performances optimales","Non adapté aux effets d''animation uniques ou aux composants de fond visuel","Limité aux tâches liées à la vidéo"],"de":["Benötigt detaillierte Video-Beschreibungen für optimale Leistung","Nicht geeignet für einzelne Animationseffekte oder visuelle Hintergrundkomponenten","Begrenzt auf videobezogene Aufgaben"],"pt":["Requires detailed video briefs for optimal performance","Not suitable for single animation effects or visual background components","Limited to video-related tasks"],"ru":["Requires detailed video briefs for optimal performance","Not suitable for single animation effects or visual background components","Limited to video-related tasks"],"ar":["Requires detailed video briefs for optimal performance","Not suitable for single animation effects or visual background components","Limited to video-related tasks"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Language', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Language', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:25:28.384Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Language","name":"Language","description":{"zh":"本文介绍了编程语言标准和最佳实践，包括Golang语言标准，帮助开发者提高代码质量","ja":"本文では、プログラミング言語の標準とベストプラクティス、特にGolang言語の標準について紹介し、開発者がコードの品質を向上させることができます","ko":"본 문서는 프로그래밍 언어 표준 및 모범 사례를介绍하며, Golang 언어 표준을 포함하여 개발자가 코드 품질을 향상시킬 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Nuestros estándares de lenguaje de programación ofrecen pautas para escribir código limpio y eficiente en diferentes lenguajes y frameworks","fr":"Nos normes de langage de programmation offrent des lignes directrices pour écrire du code propre et efficace dans différents langages et frameworks","de":"Unsere Programmiersprachen-Standards bieten Richtlinien für das Schreiben von sauberem und effizientem Code in verschiedenen Sprachen und Frameworks","pt":"Este guia apresenta as melhores práticas para programação em Golang, incluindo padrões de nomeação e tratamento de erros.","ru":"Этот гид представляет лучшие практики программирования на Golang, включая стандарты именования и обработки ошибок.","ar":"يقدم هذا الدليل أفضل الممارسات لبرمجة جولانج، بما في ذلك معايير التسمية ومعالجة الأخطاء.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"编程语言标准及最佳实践","ja":"プログラミング言語の標準とベストプラクティス","ko":"프로그래밍 언어 표준 및 모범 사례","es":"Estándares de lenguaje de programación para desarrolladores","fr":"Normes de langage de programmation pour développeurs","de":"Programmiersprachen-Standards für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões de Linguagem Golang","ru":"Стандарты языка Golang","ar":"معايير لغة جولانج","en":"Language"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍了编程语言标准和最佳实践，包括Golang语言标准，帮助开发者提高代码质量","ja":"本文では、プログラミング言語の標準とベストプラクティス、特にGolang言語の標準について紹介し、開発者がコードの品質を向上させることができます","ko":"본 문서는 프로그래밍 언어 표준 및 모범 사례를介绍하며, Golang 언어 표준을 포함하여 개발자가 코드 품질을 향상시킬 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Nuestros estándares de lenguaje de programación ofrecen pautas para escribir código limpio y eficiente en diferentes lenguajes y frameworks","fr":"Nos normes de langage de programmation offrent des lignes directrices pour écrire du code propre et efficace dans différents langages et frameworks","de":"Unsere Programmiersprachen-Standards bieten Richtlinien für das Schreiben von sauberem und effizientem Code in verschiedenen Sprachen und Frameworks","pt":"Este guia apresenta as melhores práticas para programação em Golang, incluindo padrões de nomeação e tratamento de erros.","ru":"Этот гид представляет лучшие практики программирования на Golang, включая стандарты именования и обработки ошибок.","ar":"يقدم هذا الدليل أفضل الممارسات لبرمجة جولانج، بما في ذلك معايير التسمية ومعالجة الأخطاء.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["Golang语言标准","命名规范","包管理","接口定义","错误处理"],"ja":["Golang言語の標準","命名規則","パッケージ管理","インターフェイスの定義","エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["Golang 언어 표준","命名 규칙","패키지 관리","인터페이스 정의","오류 처리"],"es":["Estándares para Golang y otros lenguajes de programación","Pautas para escribir código limpio y eficiente","Mejores prácticas para frameworks y bibliotecas","Consejos para la gestión de errores y excepciones","Recomendaciones para la organización y estructura del código"],"fr":["Normes pour Golang et d''autres langages de programmation","Lignes directrices pour écrire du code propre et efficace","Meilleures pratiques pour les frameworks et les bibliothèques","Conseils pour la gestion des erreurs et des exceptions","Recommandations pour l''organisation et la structure du code"],"de":["Standards für Golang und andere Programmiersprachen","Richtlinien für das Schreiben von sauberem und effizientem Code","Beste Praktiken für Frameworks und Bibliotheken","Tipps für die Fehler- und Ausnahmehandhabung","Empfehlungen für die Organisation und Struktur des Codes"],"pt":["Padrões de nomeação para variáveis e funções","Uso de pacotes curtos e singulares","Definição de interfaces pequenas e bem definidas","Tratamento de erros imediato e consistente","Uso de gofmt e goimports para formatação de código"],"ru":["Стандарты именования для переменных и функций","Использование коротких и единственных пакетов","Определение небольших и хорошо определенных интерфейсов","Обработка ошибок сразу и последовательно","Использование gofmt и goimports для форматирования кода"],"ar":["معايير التسمية для المتغيرات والدوال","استخدام حزم قصيرة و مفردة","تعريف واجهات صغيرة و محددة جيدًا","معالجة الأخطاء على الفور و بشكل متسق","استخدام gofmt و goimports لتنسيق الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Golang语言标准","编程语言最佳实践","代码质量","可维护性","命名规范","包管理"],"ja":["Golang言語の標準","プログラミング言語のベストプラクティス","コードの品質","メンテナンス性","命名規則","パッケージ管理"],"ko":["Golang 언어 표준","프로그래밍 언어 모범 사례","코드 품질","유지 보수성","命名 규칙","패키지 관리"],"es":["estándares de lenguaje de programación","mejores prácticas de programación","Golang","frameworks","bibliotecas","gestión de errores","organización de código"],"fr":["normes de langage de programmation","meilleures pratiques de programmation","Golang","frameworks","bibliothèques","gestion des erreurs","organisation de code"],"de":["Programmiersprachen-Standards","beste Praktiken der Programmierung","Golang","Frameworks","Bibliotheken","Fehlerhandhabung","Code-Organisation"],"pt":["Golang","programação","padrões de linguagem","nomeação","pacotes","tratamento de erros","gofmt","goimports"],"ru":["Golang","программирование","стандарты языка","именование","пакеты","обработка ошибок","gofmt","goimports"],"ar":["جولانج","برمجة","معايير لغة","تسمية","حزم","معالجة الأخطاء","gofmt","goimports"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Language","description":"Core idioms, style guides, and best practices for writing idiomatic Go code.","bodyPreview":"# Golang Language Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Fmt**: Run `gofmt` or `goimports` on save.\n- **Naming**: Use `camelCase` for internal, `PascalCase` for exported.\n- **Packages**: Short, lowercase, singular, no underscores (e.g., `net/http` not `net_http`).\n- **Interfaces**: Define where used, not where implemented. Small interfaces (1-2 methods).\n- **Errors**: Return error as last return value. Handle immediately.\n- **Variables**: Short names for small scope (`i`,","body":"# Golang Language Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Fmt**: Run `gofmt` or `goimports` on save.\n- **Naming**: Use `camelCase` for internal, `PascalCase` for exported.\n- **Packages**: Short, lowercase, singular, no underscores (e.g., `net/http` not `net_http`).\n- **Interfaces**: Define where used, not where implemented. Small interfaces (1-2 methods).\n- **Errors**: Return error as last return value. Handle immediately.\n- **Variables**: Short names for small scope (`i`, `ctx`), descriptive for large scope.\n- **Slices**: Prefer slices over arrays. Use `make()` for capacity.\n- **Const**: Use `iota` for enums.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No `init`**: Use constructors, not `init()`.\n- **No Globals**: Use DI, not global mutable state.\n- **No `panic`**: Return errors, don''t panic.\n- **No `_` ignored errors**: Always check and handle errors.\n- **No stutter**: `log.Error`, not `log.LogError`.\n\n## references\n\n- [Idioms](references/idioms.md)\n- [Effective Go Summary](references/effective-go-summary.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:28.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing adherence to Golang language standards and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要遵守Golang语言标准和最佳实践的代码生成代理。","ja":"Golang言語の標準とベストプラクティスに従うコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Golang 언어 표준 및 모범 사례를 준수해야 하는 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Código que necesitan adherirse a los estándares y las mejores prácticas del lenguaje Golang.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Code ayant besoin de se conformer aux normes et aux meilleures pratiques du langage Golang.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die die Einhaltung der Golang-Sprachstandards und -bestpraktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de aderência aos padrões e às melhores práticas da linguagem Golang.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, которым требуется соблюдение стандартов и лучших практик языка Golang.","ar":"مثالي لعميل генера代码 الذي يحتاج إلى اتباع معايير وافضل الممارسات لمعايير لغة Golang."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards using gofmt or goimports, adhere to naming conventions like camelCase and PascalCase, and handle errors effectively by returning them as last return values, all while utilizing packages like net/http and defining small interfaces with 1-2 methods.","zh":"赋予代理使用gofmt或goimports强制执行编码标准、遵循camelCase和PascalCase等命名约定，并通过将错误作为最后返回值有效处理错误，同时利用net/http等包并定义只有1-2个方法的小接口。","ja":"gofmtまたはgoimportsを使用してコード規範を強制実施し、camelCaseやPascalCaseなどの命名規約に従い、エラーを最後の戻り値として返すことでエラーを効果的に処理し、net/httpなどのパッケージを利用し、小さなインターフェースを1〜2つのメソッドで定義する機能をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"gofmt 또는 goimports를 사용하여 코드 표준을 강제로 적용하고, camelCase 및 PascalCase와 같은命명 규칙을 따르며, 오류를 마지막으로 반환되는 값으로 처리하여 오류를 효과적으로 처리하고, net/http와 같은 패키지를 사용하며, 1~2개의 메서드만 있는 작은 인터페이스를 정의할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación utilizando gofmt o goimports, a adherirse a convenciones de nomenclatura como camelCase y PascalCase, y a manejar errores de manera efectiva devolviéndolos como últimos valores de retorno, todo mientras se utilizan paquetes como net/http y se definen pequeñas interfaces con 1-2 métodos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les normes de codage à l''aide de gofmt ou goimports, de se conformer aux conventions de dénomination comme camelCase et PascalCase, et de gérer les erreurs de manière efficace en les renvoyant comme dernières valeurs de retour, le tout en utilisant des packages comme net/http et en définissant de petites interfaces avec 1-2 méthodes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Codierungsstandards mithilfe von gofmt oder goimports durchzusetzen, sich an Namenskonventionen wie camelCase und PascalCase zu halten und Fehler effektiv zu handhaben, indem sie als letzte Rückgabewerte zurückgegeben werden, und zwar unter Verwendung von Paketen wie net/http und durch die Definition kleiner Schnittstellen mit 1-2 Methoden.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a impor padrões de codificação usando gofmt ou goimports, aderir a convenções de nomenclatura como camelCase e PascalCase, e lidar com erros de forma eficaz retornando-os como últimos valores de retorno, tudo isso utilizando pacotes como net/http e definindo pequenas interfaces com 1-2 métodos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования с помощью gofmt или goimports, следовать соглашениям об именах, таким как camelCase и PascalCase, и эффективно обрабатывать ошибки, возвращая их в качестве последних возвращаемых значений, все это при использовании пакетов, таких как net/http, и определении небольших интерфейсов с 1-2 методами.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من فرض معايير التشفير باستخدام gofmt أو goimports ، والامتثال لاتفاقيات التسمية مثل camelCase و PascalCase ، ومعالجة الأخطاء بشكل فعال من خلال إرجاعها كقيم إرجاع أخيرة ، كل ذلك باستخدام حزم مثل net/http وتحديد واجهات صغيرة مع 1-2 طريقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing Golang coding standards","Automating code formatting with gofmt","Defining interfaces for error handling and package management"],"zh":["执行Golang编码标准","使用gofmt自动化代码格式化","为错误处理和包管理定义接口"],"ja":["Golangコード規範の実施","gofmtを使用したコードの自動フォーマット","エラー処理およびパッケージ管理のためのインターフェース定義"],"ko":["Golang 코드 표준 강제 적용","gofmt를 사용한 코드 자동 포맷팅","오류 처리 및 패키지 관리를 위한 인터페이스 정의"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación de Golang","Automatizar el formato de código con gofmt","Definir interfaces para el manejo de errores y la gestión de paquetes"],"fr":["Faire respecter les normes de codage Golang","Automatiser le formatage de code avec gofmt","Définir des interfaces pour la gestion des erreurs et la gestion des packages"],"de":["Durchsetzen der Golang-Codierungsstandards","Automatisieren des Code-Formatierens mit gofmt","Definieren von Schnittstellen für die Fehlerbehandlung und Paketverwaltung"],"pt":["Impor padrões de codificação Golang","Automatizar formatação de código com gofmt","Definir interfaces para tratamento de erros e gerenciamento de pacotes"],"ru":["Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов кодирования Golang","Автоматизация форматирования кода с помощью gofmt","Определение интерфейсов для обработки ошибок и управления пакетами"],"ar":["فرض معايير التشفير Golang","توفير تنسيق التشفير تلقائيًا مع gofmt","تحديد واجهات لتعامل الأخطاء وإدارة الحزم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Golang programming language","Requires gofmt or goimports installation"],"zh":["特定于Golang编程语言","需要gofmt或goimports安装"],"ja":["Golangプログラミング言語に特有のもの","gofmtまたはgoimportsのインストールが必要"],"ko":["Golang 프로그래밍 언어에 특정된 것","gofmt 또는 goimports 설치가 필요"],"es":["Específico del lenguaje de programación Golang","Requiere la instalación de gofmt o goimports"],"fr":["Spécifique au langage de programmation Golang","Nécessite l''installation de gofmt ou goimports"],"de":["Spezifisch für die Golang-Programmiersprache","Benötigt die Installation von gofmt oder goimports"],"pt":["Específico para a linguagem de programação Golang","Exige instalação do gofmt ou goimports"],"ru":["Относится конкретно к языку программирования Golang","Требует установки gofmt или goimports"],"ar":["محدد لغة البرمجة Golang","يتطلب تثبيت gofmt أو goimports"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/iOS Performance', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'iOS Performance', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:25:46.157Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/iOS Performance","name":"iOS Performance","description":{"zh":"iOS 性能优化是指一系列的技术和最佳实践，用于提高 iOS 应用程序的速度和效率","ja":"iOS パフォーマンス最適化は、iOS アプリの速度と効率を向上させる一連の技術とベストプラクティスです","ko":"iOS 성능 최적화는 iOS 애플리케이션의 속도와 효율성을 향상시키기 위한 일련의 기술과最佳实践입니다","es":"Optimiza el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones iOS con nuestras guías de implementación y herramientas de diagnóstico","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications iOS avec nos guides d''implémentation et outils de diagnostic","de":"Optimieren Sie die Leistung Ihrer iOS-Anwendungen mit unseren Implementierungsleitfäden und Diagnose-Tools","pt":"Otimização de desempenho iOS é uma coleção de habilidades e práticas recomendadas para melhorar a eficiência dos aplicativos iOS","ru":"Оптимизация производительности iOS - это коллекция навыков и рекомендованных практик для улучшения эффективности приложений iOS","ar":"تحسين أداء آي أو إس هو مجموعة من المهارات وأفضل الممارسات لتحسين كفاءة تطبيقات آي أو إس","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iOS 性能优化","ja":"iOS パフォーマンス最適化","ko":"iOS 성능 최적화","es":"Mejora del Rendimiento en iOS","fr":"Améliorer les Performances sur iOS","de":"iOS Leistungsverbesserung","pt":"Otimização de Desempenho iOS","ru":"Оптимизация Производительности iOS","ar":"تحسين أداء آي أو إس","en":"iOS Performance"},"description":{"zh":"iOS 性能优化是指一系列的技术和最佳实践，用于提高 iOS 应用程序的速度和效率","ja":"iOS パフォーマンス最適化は、iOS アプリの速度と効率を向上させる一連の技術とベストプラクティスです","ko":"iOS 성능 최적화는 iOS 애플리케이션의 속도와 효율성을 향상시키기 위한 일련의 기술과最佳实践입니다","es":"Optimiza el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones iOS con nuestras guías de implementación y herramientas de diagnóstico","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications iOS avec nos guides d''implémentation et outils de diagnostic","de":"Optimieren Sie die Leistung Ihrer iOS-Anwendungen mit unseren Implementierungsleitfäden und Diagnose-Tools","pt":"Otimização de desempenho iOS é uma coleção de habilidades e práticas recomendadas para melhorar a eficiência dos aplicativos iOS","ru":"Оптимизация производительности iOS - это коллекция навыков и рекомендованных практик для улучшения эффективности приложений iOS","ar":"تحسين أداء آي أو إس هو مجموعة من المهارات وأفضل الممارسات لتحسين كفاءة تطبيقات آي أو إس","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Instruments 诊断工具","优化 Table/Collection Views","使用 SDWebImage 或 Kingfisher 进行图片缓存","分析网络请求负载和频率","识别重度 CPU 任务和主线程阻塞"],"ja":["Instruments 診断ツールを使用する","Table/Collection Views を最適化する","SDWebImage または Kingfisher を使用して画像をキャッシュする","ネットワーク要求のペイロードサイズと頻度を分析する","重度 CPU タスクとメインスレッドのブロックを識別する"],"ko":["Instruments 진단 도구 사용","Table/Collection Views 최적화","SDWebImage 또는 Kingfisher를 사용한 이미지 캐싱","네트워크 요청 페이로드 크기와 빈도 분석","CPU 태스크와 메인 스레드 블록 식별"],"es":["Herramientas de diagnóstico como Instruments y Time Profiler","Optimización de Table/Collection Views","Uso de Image Caching con SDWebImage o Kingfisher","Análisis de request payload sizes y frequency","Identificación de tareas pesadas de CPU y bloqueos del Main Thread"],"fr":["Outils de diagnostic tels que Instruments et Time Profiler","Optimisation de Table/Collection Views","Utilisation de Image Caching avec SDWebImage ou Kingfisher","Analyse des tailles et fréquences de payload de requête","Identification des tâches lourdes de CPU et des blocages du Main Thread"],"de":["Diagnose-Tools wie Instruments und Time Profiler","Optimierung von Table/Collection Views","Verwendung von Image Caching mit SDWebImage oder Kingfisher","Analyse von Request-Payload-Größen und -Häufigkeit","Identifizierung von CPU-intensiven Aufgaben und Main-Thread-Blockierungen"],"pt":["Uso de Instruments para detectar problemas de memória","Otimização de Table/Collection Views","Uso de Image Caching com SDWebImage ou Kingfisher","Análise de request payload sizes e frequency com Network instrument","Identificação de tarefas pesadas de CPU e Main Thread stalls com Time Profiler"],"ru":["Использование Instruments для обнаружения проблем с памятью","Оптимизация Table/Collection Views","Использование кэширования изображений с SDWebImage или Kingfisher","Анализ размеров и частоты запросов с помощью Network instrument","Определение задач с высокой нагрузкой на CPU и Main Thread stalls с помощью Time Profiler"],"ar":["استخدام Instruments لاكتشاف مشاكل الذاكرة","تحسين Table/Collection Views","استخدام ذاكرة التخزين الصور مع SDWebImage أو Kingfisher","تحليل أحجام وتصفح طلبات الشبكة مع Network instrument","تحديد المهام الثقيلة ل CPU و Main Thread stalls مع Time Profiler"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS 性能优化","Instruments","Table/Collection Views","图片缓存","网络请求优化","CPU 任务优化"],"ja":["iOS パフォーマンス最適化","Instruments","Table/Collection Views","画像キャッシュ","ネットワーク要求最適化","CPU タスク最適化"],"ko":["iOS 성능 최적화","Instruments","Table/Collection Views","이미지 캐싱","네트워크 요청 최적화","CPU 태스크 최적화"],"es":["rendimiento en iOS","optimización de aplicaciones","herramientas de diagnóstico","Image Caching","Table/Collection Views","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["performances sur iOS","optimisation d''applications","outils de diagnostic","Image Caching","Table/Collection Views","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Leistung in iOS","Optimierung von Anwendungen","Diagnose-Tools","Image Caching","Table/Collection Views","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho ios","desenvolvimento de aplicativos ios","instruments","sdwebimage","kingfisher","table/collection views","image caching"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности ios","разработка приложений ios","instruments","sdwebimage","kingfisher","table/collection views","кэширование изображений"],"ar":["تحسين أداء آي أو إس","تطوير تطبيقات آي أو إس","instruments","sdwebimage","kingfisher","table/collection views","ذاكرة التخزين الصور"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iOS Performance","description":"Standards for Instruments, Memory Management, and Optimization.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Performance Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Diagnostic Tools\n\n- **Instruments**: Regularly use **Allocations** and **Leaks** to detect memory issues.\n- **Time Profiler**: Identify heavy CPU tasks and Main Thread stalls.\n- **Network instrument**: Analyze request payload sizes and frequency.\n\n### Optimization\n\n- **Table/Collection Views**: Always use `dequeueReusableCell` and keep `cellForRowAt` logic lightweight.\n- **Image Caching**: Use `SDWebImage` or `Ki","body":"# iOS Performance Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Diagnostic Tools\n\n- **Instruments**: Regularly use **Allocations** and **Leaks** to detect memory issues.\n- **Time Profiler**: Identify heavy CPU tasks and Main Thread stalls.\n- **Network instrument**: Analyze request payload sizes and frequency.\n\n### Optimization\n\n- **Table/Collection Views**: Always use `dequeueReusableCell` and keep `cellForRowAt` logic lightweight.\n- **Image Caching**: Use `SDWebImage` or `Kingfisher` for remote assets to prevent redundant fetching and main-thread decoding. (Note: `AsyncImage` lacks built-in caching; prioritize third-party for lists).\n- **Background threads**: Offload expensive work (parsing, encryption) from the Main thread using GCD or Tasks.\n\n### Diagnostics\n\n- **Compiler Warnings**: Enable `SWIFT_TREAT_WARNINGS_AS_ERRORS` in Release builds.\n- **Static Analyzer**: Use Xcode''s \"Analyze\" (Product > Analyze) to find logic errors.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **CPU work on Main Thread**: `**No parsing/processing on Main**: Use background thread.`\n- **Force Cache Flushes**: `**No redundant cache clears**: Let the system handle low-memory warnings via AppDelegate.`\n- **Retain Cycles**: `**Check for cycles in Instruments**: Use the Leaks instrument frequently.`\n\n## References\n\n- [Profiling & Optimization](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:46.157Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents focused on optimizing iOS applications for better performance and user experience.","zh":"非常适合专注于优化iOS应用以获得更好性能和用户体验的移动代理。","ja":"iOSアプリケーションのパフォーマンスとユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化することに焦点を当てたモバイルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"iOS 애플리케이션의 성능과 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 데 중점을 둔 모바일 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes móviles centrados en optimizar aplicaciones de iOS para un mejor rendimiento y experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles axés sur l''optimisation des applications iOS pour de meilleures performances et une expérience utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agents, die sich auf die Optimierung von iOS-Anwendungen für bessere Leistung und Benutzererfahrung konzentrieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis focados na otimização de aplicativos iOS para melhor desempenho e experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений iOS для лучшей производительности и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول المركز على تحسين تطبيقات iOS من أجل أداء أفضل وتجربة مستخدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify memory leaks and heavy CPU tasks using Instruments and Time Profiler, while optimizing table and collection views with dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier and leveraging image caching libraries like SDWebImage.","zh":"使代理能够使用Instruments和Time Profiler识别内存泄漏和繁重的CPU任务，同时使用dequeueReusableCellForIdentifier优化表格和集合视图，并利用像SDWebImage这样的图像缓存库。","ja":"エージェントがInstrumentsおよびTime Profilerを使用してメモリーリークや重いCPUタスクを識別できるようにし、dequeueReusableCellForIdentifierを使用してテーブルおよびコレクションビューを最適化し、SDWebImageなどのイメージキャッシュライブラリを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 인스트루먼트와 타임 프로파일러를 사용하여 메모리 누수와 무거운 CPU 작업을 식별할 수 있도록 하며, dequeueReusableCellForIdentifier를 사용하여 테이블 및 컬렉션 뷰를 최적화하고 SDWebImage와 같은 이미지 캐싱 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar fugas de memoria y tareas de CPU intensivas utilizando Instruments y Time Profiler, al mismo tiempo que optimiza las vistas de tabla y colección con dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier y aprovecha las bibliotecas de caché de imágenes como SDWebImage.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les fuites de mémoire et les tâches CPU lourdes en utilisant Instruments et Time Profiler, tout en optimisant les vues de tableau et de collection avec dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier et en exploitant les bibliothèques de mise en cache d''images comme SDWebImage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Speicherlecks und CPU-intensiven Aufgaben mit Instruments und Time Profiler zu identifizieren, während es gleichzeitig Tabellen- und Sammlungsansichten mit dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier optimiert und Bildcachelibs wie SDWebImage nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar vazamentos de memória e tarefas pesadas de CPU usando Instruments e Time Profiler, enquanto otimiza table e collection views com dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier e aproveita bibliotecas de cache de imagem como SDWebImage.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выявлять утечки памяти и тяжелые задачи CPU с помощью Instruments и Time Profiler, а также оптимизировать таблицы и коллекционные представления с помощью dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier и использования библиотек кэширования изображений, таких как SDWebImage.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحديد تسربات الذاكرة والمهام الكبيرة لCPU باستخدام أدوات و时间 Profiler، في حين تحسين عرض الجدول والمجموعة مع dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier وتفعيل مكتبات ذاكرة التخزين الصورة مثل SDWebImage."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging memory issues with Allocations and Leaks","Optimizing table and collection views for smoother scrolling","Analyzing network requests with Network instrument for payload size reduction"],"zh":["使用分配和泄漏调试内存问题","优化表格和集合视图以实现更平滑的滚动","使用网络仪表分析网络请求以减少有效载荷大小"],"ja":["割り当てとリークを使用してメモリの問題をデバッグする","テーブルとコレクションビューを最適化してスムーズなスクロールを実現する","ネットワークインストルメントを使用してネットワークリクエストを分析してペイロードサイズを削減する"],"ko":["할당 및 누수를 사용하여 메모리 문제를 디버깅합니다.","테이블 및 컬렉션 뷰를 최적화하여 더 매끄러운 스크롤링을 구현합니다.","네트워크 인스트루먼트를 사용하여 네트워크 요청을 분석하여 페이로드 크기를 줄입니다."],"es":["Depuración de problemas de memoria con Allocations y Leaks","Optimización de vistas de tabla y colección para un desplazamiento más suave","Análisis de solicitudes de red con Network instrument para la reducción del tamaño de la carga útil"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de mémoire avec Allocations et Leaks","Optimisation des vues de tableau et de collection pour un défilement plus fluide","Analyse des requêtes réseau avec Network instrument pour la réduction de la taille de la charge utile"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Speicherproblemen mit Allocations und Leaks","Optimierung von Tabellen- und Sammlungsansichten für ein reibungsloseres Scrollen","Analyse von Netzwerkanfragen mit Network instrument für die Reduzierung der Nutzlastgröße"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de memória com Allocations e Leaks","Otimização de table e collection views para rolagem mais suave","Análise de solicitações de rede com Network instrument para redução do tamanho da carga útil"],"ru":["Отладка проблем с памятью с помощью Allocations и Leaks","Оптимизация таблиц и коллекционных представлений для более гладкой прокрутки","Анализ сетевых запросов с помощью Network instrument для уменьшения размера полезной нагрузки"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الذاكرة مع التخصيص والتسربات","تحسين عرض الجدول والمجموعة من أجل التمرير الأملس","تحليل طلبات الشبكة مع أداة الشبكة لتقليل حجم الحمولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Xcode and iOS development environment","Limited to iOS platform","Familiarity with Swift or Objective-C programming languages recommended"],"zh":["需要Xcode和iOS开发环境","仅限于iOS平台","建议熟悉Swift或Objective-C编程语言"],"ja":["XcodeおよびiOS開発環境が必要","iOSプラットフォームのみ","SwiftまたはObjective-Cプログラミング言語の知識が推奨される"],"ko":["Xcode 및 iOS 개발 환경이 필요합니다.","iOS 플랫폼만 해당합니다.","Swift 또는 Objective-C 프로그래밍 언어에 익숙해지는 것이 좋습니다."],"es":["Requiere Xcode y entorno de desarrollo de iOS","Limitado a la plataforma iOS","Se recomienda familiaridad con los lenguajes de programación Swift o Objective-C"],"fr":["Nécessite Xcode et un environnement de développement iOS","Limité à la plate-forme iOS","Il est recommandé d''avoir une connaissance des langages de programmation Swift ou Objective-C"],"de":["Benötigt Xcode und iOS-Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die iOS-Plattform","Vertrautheit mit den Programmiersprachen Swift oder Objective-C wird empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer Xcode e ambiente de desenvolvimento iOS","Limitado à plataforma iOS","Recomenda-se familiaridade com as linguagens de programação Swift ou Objective-C"],"ru":["Требуется Xcode и среда разработки iOS","Ограниченная платформа iOS","Рекомендуется знакомство с языками программирования Swift или Objective-C"],"ar":["يتطلب Xcode وبيئة تطوير iOS","محدود بالمنصة iOS","ينصح بالاطلاع على لغات البرمجة Swift أو Objective-C"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('guanyang/antigravity-skills/skill-creator', 'community', 'guanyang', 'antigravity-skills', 'guanyang/antigravity-skills', 'skill-creator', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:26:02.501Z', NULL, '{"id":"guanyang/antigravity-skills/skill-creator","name":"skill-creator","description":{"zh":"Skill Creator50-80","ja":"Skill Creator50-80","ko":"Skill Creator50-80","es":"El Creador de Habilidades permite a los agentes desarrollar capacidades profesionales en campos específicos, resolviendo problemas complejos de manera sistemática","fr":"Le Créateur de Compétences permet aux agents de développer des capacités professionnelles dans des domaines spécifiques, résolvant des problèmes complexes de manière systématique","de":"Der Skill-Ersteller ermöglicht es Agenten, professionelle Fähigkeiten in bestimmten Bereichen zu entwickeln, komplexe Probleme systematisch zu lösen","pt":"O Skill Creator permite criar habilidades modulares para agentes, estendendo suas capacidades em desenvolvimento full-stack e lógica complexa.","ru":"Skill Creator позволяет создавать модульные навыки для агентов, расширяя их возможности в полном стеке разработки и сложной логике.","ar":"يسمح Skill Creator بإنشاء مهارات مُقَطَّعة لتقديم دعم لمهارات الوكلاء، وتوسيع قدراتهم في تطوير البرمجيات الشاملة والمنطق المعقد.","en":"Empower agents with professional capabilities in specific fields (such as full-stack development, complex logic planning, multimedia processing, etc.) through modular Skills definitions, allowing agents to solve complex problems systematically like human experts."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Skill Creator - ","ja":"Skill Creator - ","ko":"Skill Creator - ","es":"Creador de Habilidades: Desarrollo de Agentes Especializados","fr":"Créateur de Compétences: Développement d''Agents Spécialisés","de":"Skill-Ersteller: Entwicklung Spezialisierter Agenten","pt":"Crie Habilidades Profissionais com Skill Creator","ru":"Создавайте профессиональные навыки с Skill Creator","ar":"انشئ مهارات محترفة مع Skill Creator","en":"skill-creator"},"description":{"zh":"Skill Creator50-80","ja":"Skill Creator50-80","ko":"Skill Creator50-80","es":"El Creador de Habilidades permite a los agentes desarrollar capacidades profesionales en campos específicos, resolviendo problemas complejos de manera sistem...","fr":"Le Créateur de Compétences permet aux agents de développer des capacités professionnelles dans des domaines spécifiques, résolvant des problèmes complexes de...","de":"Der Skill-Ersteller ermöglicht es Agenten, professionelle Fähigkeiten in bestimmten Bereichen zu entwickeln, komplexe Probleme systematisch zu lösen","pt":"O Skill Creator permite criar habilidades modulares para agentes, estendendo suas capacidades em desenvolvimento full-stack e lógica complexa.","ru":"Skill Creator позволяет создавать модульные навыки для агентов, расширяя их возможности в полном стеке разработки и сложной логике.","ar":"يسمح Skill Creator بإنشاء مهارات مُقَطَّعة لتقديم دعم لمهارات الوكلاء، وتوسيع قدراتهم في تطوير البرمجيات الشاملة والمنطق المعقد.","en":"Empower agents with professional capabilities in specific fields (such as full-stack development, complex logic planning, multimedia processing, etc.) throug..."},"definition":{"en":"Empower agents with professional capabilities in specific fields (such as full-stack development, complex logic planning, multimedia processing, etc.) through modular Skills definitions, allowing agents to solve complex problems systematically like human experts."},"features":{"zh":["Skill Creator","50-80","Skill","Skill Creator","Skill"],"ja":["Skill Creator","50-80","Skill","Skill Creator","Skill"],"ko":["Skill Creator","50-80","Skill","Skill Creator","Skill"],"es":["Desarrollo de habilidades especializadas","Conocimientos en desarrollo full-stack","Lógica compleja y planificación","Procesamiento de multimedia","Resolución de problemas complejos"],"fr":["Développement de compétences spécialisées","Connaissances en développement full-stack","Logique complexe et planification","Traitement de multimédia","Résolution de problèmes complexes"],"de":["Entwicklung spezialisierter Fähigkeiten","Kenntnisse in Full-Stack-Entwicklung","Komplexe Logik und Planung","Multimedia-Verarbeitung","Lösung komplexer Probleme"],"pt":["Habilidades modulares para agentes","Desenvolvimento full-stack","Lógica complexa","Processamento de mídia","Extensão de capacidades de agentes","Conhecimento especializado"],"ru":["Модульные навыки для агентов","Полный стек разработки","Сложная логика","Обработка мультимедиа","Расширение возможностей агентов","Специализированные знания"],"ar":["مهارات مُقَطَّعة للوكلاء","تطوير البرمجيات الشاملة","المنطق المعقد","معالجة الوسائط المتعددة","توسيع قدرات الوكلاء","المعرفة المتخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Skill Creator","Skill","AI","Full-stack","Skill","Claude"],"ja":["Skill Creator","Skill","AI","Full-stack","Skill","Claude"],"ko":["Skill Creator","Skill","AI","Full-stack","Skill","Claude"],"es":["desarrollo de habilidades","agentes especializados","full-stack development","lógica compleja","procesamiento de multimedia","resolución de problemas complejos"],"fr":["développement de compétences","agents spécialisés","développement full-stack","logique complexe","traitement de multimédia","résolution de problèmes complexes"],"de":["Fähigkeitsentwicklung","spezialisierte Agenten","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","komplexe Logik","Multimedia-Verarbeitung","Lösung komplexer Probleme"],"pt":["desenvolvimento full-stack","lógica complexa","processamento de mídia","habilidades modulares","conhecimento especializado","extensão de capacidades de agentes","Skill Creator","agentes de software","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["полный стек разработки","сложная логика","обработка мультимедиа","модульные навыки","специализированные знания","расширение возможностей агентов","Skill Creator","агенты программного обеспечения","разработка навыков"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات الشاملة","المنطق المعقد","معالجة الوسائط المتعددة","مهارات مُقَطَّعة","المعرفة المتخصصة","توسيع قدرات الوكلاء","Skill Creator","وكلاء البرمجيات","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"guanyang","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"guanyang/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-creator","description":"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Claudes capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills\n\nSkills are modular, self-contained packages that extend Claude''s capabilities by providing\nspecialized knowledge, workflows, and tools. Think of them as \"onboarding guides\" for specific\ndomains or tasks—they transform Claude from a general-purpose agent into a specialized agent\nequipped with procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess.\n\n### What Skills Provide\n\n1. Specialized workflows - Multi","body":"# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills\n\nSkills are modular, self-contained packages that extend Claude''s capabilities by providing\nspecialized knowledge, workflows, and tools. Think of them as \"onboarding guides\" for specific\ndomains or tasks—they transform Claude from a general-purpose agent into a specialized agent\nequipped with procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess.\n\n### What Skills Provide\n\n1. Specialized workflows - Multi-step procedures for specific domains\n2. Tool integrations - Instructions for working with specific file formats or APIs\n3. Domain expertise - Company-specific knowledge, schemas, business logic\n4. Bundled resources - Scripts, references, and assets for complex and repetitive tasks\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nThe context window is a public good. Skills share the context window with everything else Claude needs: system prompt, conversation history, other Skills'' metadata, and the actual user request.\n\n**Default assumption: Claude is already very smart.** Only add context Claude doesn''t already have. Challenge each piece of information: \"Does Claude really need this explanation?\" and \"Does this paragraph justify its token cost?\"\n\nPrefer concise examples over verbose explanations.\n\n### Set Appropriate Degrees of Freedom\n\nMatch the level of specificity to the task''s fragility and variability:\n\n**High freedom (text-based instructions)**: Use when multiple approaches are valid, decisions depend on context, or heuristics guide the approach.\n\n**Medium freedom (pseudocode or scripts with parameters)**: Use when a preferred pattern exists, some variation is acceptable, or configuration affects behavior.\n\n**Low freedom (specific scripts, few parameters)**: Use when operations are fragile and error-prone, consistency is critical, or a specific sequence must be followed.\n\nThink of Claude as exploring a path: a narrow bridge with cliffs needs specific guardrails (low freedom), while an open field allows many routes (high freedom).\n\n### Anatomy of a Skill\n\nEvery skill consists of a required SKILL.md file and optional bundled resources:\n\n```\nskill-name/\n├── SKILL.md (required)\n│   ├── YAML frontmatter metadata (required)\n│   │   ├── name: (required)\n│   │   ├── description: (required)\n│   │   └── compatibility: (optional, rarely needed)\n│   └── Markdown instructions (required)\n└── Bundled Resources (optional)\n    ├── scripts/          - Executable code (Python/Bash/etc.)\n    ├── references/       - Documentation intended to be loaded into context as needed\n    └── assets/           - Files used in output (templates, icons, fonts, etc.)\n```\n\n#### SKILL.md (required)\n\nEvery SKILL.md consists of:\n\n- **Frontmatter** (YAML): Contains `name` and `description` fields (required), plus optional fields like `license`, `metadata`, and `compatibility`. Only `name` and `description` are read by Claude to determine when the skill triggers, so be clear and comprehensive about what the skill is and when it should be used. The `compatibility` field is for noting environment requirements (target product, system packages, etc.) but most skills don''t need it.\n- **Body** (Markdown): Instructions and guidance for using the skill. Only loaded AFTER the skill triggers (if at all).\n\n#### Bundled Resources (optional)\n\n##### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\nExecutable code (Python/Bash/etc.) for tasks that require deterministic reliability or are repeatedly rewritten.\n\n- **When to include**: When the same code is being rewritten repeatedly or deterministic reliability is needed\n- **Example**: `scripts/rotate_pdf.py` for PDF rotation tasks\n- **Benefits**: Token efficient, deterministic, may be executed without loading into context\n- **Note**: Scripts may still need to be read by Claude for patching or environment-specific adjustments\n\n##### References (`references/`)\n\nDocumentation and reference material intended to be loaded as needed into context to inform Claude''s process and thinking.\n\n- **When to include**: For documentation that Claude should reference while working\n- **Examples**: `references/finance.md` for financial schemas, `references/mnda.md` for company NDA template, `references/policies.md` for company policies, `references/api_docs.md` for API specifications\n- **Use cases**: Database schemas, API documentation, domain knowledge, company policies, detailed workflow guides\n- **Benefits**: Keeps SKILL.md lean, loaded only when Claude determines it''s needed\n- **Best practice**: If files are large (>10k words), include grep search patterns in SKILL.md\n- **Avoid duplication**: Information should live in either SKILL.md or references files, not both. Prefer references files for detailed information unless it''s truly core to the skill—this keeps SKILL.md lean while making information discoverable without hogging the context window. Keep only essential procedural instructions and workflow guidance in SKILL.md; move detailed reference material, schemas, and examples to references files.\n\n##### Assets (`assets/`)\n\nFiles not intended to be loaded into context, but rather used within the output Claude produces.\n\n- **When to include**: When the skill needs files that will be used in the final output\n- **Examples**: `assets/logo.png` for brand assets, `assets/slides.pptx` for PowerPoint templates, `assets/frontend-template/` for HTML/React boilerplate, `assets/font.ttf` for typography\n- **Use cases**: Templates, images, icons, boilerplate code, fonts, sample documents that get copied or modified\n- **Benefits**: Separates output resources from documentation, enables Claude to use files without loading them into context\n\n#### What to Not Include in a Skill\n\nA skill should only contain essential files that directly support its functionality. Do NOT create extraneous documentation or auxiliary files, including:\n\n- README.md\n- INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md\n- QUICK_REFERENCE.md\n- CHANGELOG.md\n- etc.\n\nThe skill should only contain the information needed for an AI agent to do the job at hand. It should not contain auxilary context about the process that went into creating it, setup and testing procedures, user-facing documentation, etc. Creating additional documentation files just adds clutter and confusion.\n\n### Progressive Disclosure Design Principle\n\nSkills use a three-level loading system to manage context efficiently:\n\n1. **Metadata (name + description)** - Always in context (~100 words)\n2. **SKILL.md body** - When skill triggers (<5k words)\n3. **Bundled resources** - As needed by Claude (Unlimited because scripts can be executed without reading into context window)\n\n#### Progressive Disclosure Patterns\n\nKeep SKILL.md body to the essentials and under 500 lines to minimize context bloat. Split content into separate files when approaching this limit. When splitting out content into other files, it is very important to reference them from SKILL.md and describe clearly when to read them, to ensure the reader of the skill knows they exist and when to use them.\n\n**Key principle:** When a skill supports multiple variations, frameworks, or options, keep only the core workflow and selection guidance in SKILL.md. Move variant-specific details (patterns, examples, configuration) into separate reference files.\n\n**Pattern 1: High-level guide with references**\n\n```markdown\n# PDF Processing\n\n## Quick start\n\nExtract text with pdfplumber:\n[code example]\n\n## Advanced features\n\n- **Form filling**: See [FORMS.md](FORMS.md) for complete guide\n- **API reference**: See [REFERENCE.md](REFERENCE.md) for all methods\n- **Examples**: See [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md) for common patterns\n```\n\nClaude loads FORMS.md, REFERENCE.md, or EXAMPLES.md only when needed.\n\n**Pattern 2: Domain-specific organization**\n\nFor Skills with multiple domains, organize content by domain to avoid loading irrelevant context:\n\n```\nbigquery-skill/\n├── SKILL.md (overview and navigation)\n└── reference/\n    ├── finance.md (revenue, billing metrics)\n    ├── sales.md (opportunities, pipeline)\n    ├── product.md (API usage, features)\n    └── marketing.md (campaigns, attribution)\n```\n\nWhen a user asks about sales metrics, Claude only reads sales.md.\n\nSimilarly, for skills supporting multiple frameworks or variants, organize by variant:\n\n```\ncloud-deploy/\n├── SKILL.md (workflow + provider selection)\n└── references/\n    ├── aws.md (AWS deployment patterns)\n    ├── gcp.md (GCP deployment patterns)\n    └── azure.md (Azure deployment patterns)\n```\n\nWhen the user chooses AWS, Claude only reads aws.md.\n\n**Pattern 3: Conditional details**\n\nShow basic content, link to advanced content:\n\n```markdown\n# DOCX Processing\n\n## Creating documents\n\nUse docx-js for new documents. See [DOCX-JS.md](DOCX-JS.md).\n\n## Editing documents\n\nFor simple edits, modify the XML directly.\n\n**For tracked changes**: See [REDLINING.md](REDLINING.md)\n**For OOXML details**: See [OOXML.md](OOXML.md)\n```\n\nClaude reads REDLINING.md or OOXML.md only when the user needs those features.\n\n**Important guidelines:**\n\n- **Avoid deeply nested references** - Keep references one level deep from SKILL.md. All reference files should link directly from SKILL.md.\n- **Structure longer reference files** - For files longer than 100 lines, include a table of contents at the top so Claude can see the full scope when previewing.\n\n## Skill Creation Process\n\nSkill creation involves these steps:\n\n1. Understand the skill with concrete examples\n2. Plan reusable skill contents (scripts, references, assets)\n3. Initialize the skill (run init_skill.py)\n4. Edit the skill (implement resources and write SKILL.md)\n5. Package the skill (run package_skill.py)\n6. Iterate based on real usage\n\nFollow these steps in order, skipping only if there is a clear reason why they are not applicable.\n\n### Step 1: Understanding the Skill with Concrete Examples\n\nSkip this step only when the skill''s usage patterns are already clearly understood. It remains valuable even when working with an existing skill.\n\nTo create an effective skill, clearly understand concrete examples of how the skill will be used. This understanding can come from either direct user examples or generated examples that are validated with user feedback.\n\nFor example, when building an image-editor skill, relevant questions include:\n\n- \"What functionality should the image-editor skill support? Editing, rotating, anything else?\"\n- \"Can you give some examples of how this skill would be used?\"\n- \"I can imagine users asking for things like ''Remove the red-eye from this image'' or ''Rotate this image''. Are there other ways you imagine this skill being used?\"\n- \"What would a user say that should trigger this skill?\"\n\nTo avoid overwhelming users, avoid asking too many questions in a single message. Start with the most important questions and follow up as needed for better effectiveness.\n\nConclude this step when there is a clear sense of the functionality the skill should support.\n\n### Step 2: Planning the Reusable Skill Contents\n\nTo turn concrete examples into an effective skill, analyze each example by:\n\n1. Considering how to execute on the example from scratch\n2. Identifying what scripts, references, and assets would be helpful when executing these workflows repeatedly\n\nExample: When building a `pdf-editor` skill to handle queries like \"Help me rotate this PDF,\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Rotating a PDF requires re-writing the same code each time\n2. A `scripts/rotate_pdf.py` script would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nExample: When designing a `frontend-webapp-builder` skill for queries like \"Build me a todo app\" or \"Build me a dashboard to track my steps,\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Writing a frontend webapp requires the same boilerplate HTML/React each time\n2. An `assets/hello-world/` template containing the boilerplate HTML/React project files would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nExample: When building a `big-query` skill to handle queries like \"How many users have logged in today?\" the analysis shows:\n\n1. Querying BigQuery requires re-discovering the table schemas and relationships each time\n2. A `references/schema.md` file documenting the table schemas would be helpful to store in the skill\n\nTo establish the skill''s contents, analyze each concrete example to create a list of the reusable resources to include: scripts, references, and assets.\n\n### Step 3: Initializing the Skill\n\nAt this point, it is time to actually create the skill.\n\nSkip this step only if the skill being developed already exists, and iteration or packaging is needed. In this case, continue to the next step.\n\nWhen creating a new skill from scratch, always run the `init_skill.py` script. The script conveniently generates a new template skill directory that automatically includes everything a skill requires, making the skill creation process much more efficient and reliable.\n\nUsage:\n\n```bash\nscripts/init_skill.py <skill-name> --path <output-directory>\n```\n\nThe script:\n\n- Creates the skill directory at the specified path\n- Generates a SKILL.md template with proper frontmatter and TODO placeholders\n- Creates example resource directories: `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/`\n- Adds example files in each directory that can be customized or deleted\n\nAfter initialization, customize or remove the generated SKILL.md and example files as needed.\n\n### Step 4: Edit the Skill\n\nWhen editing the (newly-generated or existing) skill, remember that the skill is being created for another instance of Claude to use. Include information that would be beneficial and non-obvious to Claude. Consider what procedural knowledge, domain-specific details, or reusable assets would help another Claude instance execute these tasks more effectively.\n\n#### Learn Proven Design Patterns\n\nConsult these helpful guides based on your skill''s needs:\n\n- **Multi-step processes**: See references/workflows.md for sequential workflows and conditional logic\n- **Specific output formats or quality standards**: See references/output-patterns.md for template and example patterns\n\nThese files contain established best practices for effective skill design.\n\n#### Start with Reusable Skill Contents\n\nTo begin implementation, start with the reusable resources identified above: `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/` files. Note that this step may require user input. For example, when implementing a `brand-guidelines` skill, the user may need to provide brand assets or templates to store in `assets/`, or documentation to store in `references/`.\n\nAdded scripts must be tested by actually running them to ensure there are no bugs and that the output matches what is expected. If there are many similar scripts, only a representative sample needs to be tested to ensure confidence that they all work while balancing time to completion.\n\nAny example files and directories not needed for the skill should be deleted. The initialization script creates example files in `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/` to demonstrate structure, but most skills won''t need all of them.\n\n#### Update SKILL.md\n\n**Writing Guidelines:** Always use imperative/infinitive form.\n\n##### Frontmatter\n\nWrite the YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description`:\n\n- `name`: The skill name\n- `description`: This is the primary triggering mechanism for your skill, and helps Claude understand when to use the skill.\n  - Include both what the Skill does and specific triggers/contexts for when to use it.\n  - Include all \"when to use\" information here - Not in the body. The body is only loaded after triggering, so \"When to Use This Skill\" sections in the body are not helpful to Claude.\n  - Example description for a `docx` skill: \"Comprehensive document creation, editing, and analysis with support for tracked changes, comments, formatting preservation, and text extraction. Use when Claude needs to work with professional documents (.docx files) for: (1) Creating new documents, (2) Modifying or editing content, (3) Working with tracked changes, (4) Adding comments, or any other document tasks\"\n\nDo not include any other fields in YAML frontmatter.\n\n##### Body\n\nWrite instructions for using the skill and its bundled resources.\n\n### Step 5: Packaging a Skill\n\nOnce development of the skill is complete, it must be packaged into a distributable .skill file that gets shared with the user. The packaging process automatically validates the skill first to ensure it meets all requirements:\n\n```bash\nscripts/package_skill.py <path/to/skill-folder>\n```\n\nOptional output directory specification:\n\n```bash\nscripts/package_skill.py <path/to/skill-folder> ./dist\n```\n\nThe packaging script will:\n\n1. **Validate** the skill automatically, checking:\n\n   - YAML frontmatter format and required fields\n   - Skill naming conventions and directory structure\n   - Description completeness and quality\n   - File organization and resource references\n\n2. **Package** the skill if validation passes, creating a .skill file named after the skill (e.g., `my-skill.skill`) that includes all files and maintains the proper directory structure for distribution. The .skill file is a zip file with a .skill extension.\n\nIf validation fails, the script will report the errors and exit without creating a package. Fix any validation errors and run the packaging command again.\n\n### Step 6: Iterate\n\nAfter testing the skill, users may request improvements. Often this happens right after using the skill, with fresh context of how the skill performed.\n\n**Iteration workflow:**\n\n1. Use the skill on real tasks\n2. Notice struggles or inefficiencies\n3. Identify how SKILL.md or bundled resources should be updated\n4. Implement changes and test again\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:02.501Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents like Claude, needing specialized knowledge and workflows in full-stack development, complex logic planning, and multimedia processing.","zh":"非常适合像 Claude 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要在全栈开发、复杂逻辑规划和多媒体处理中具有专门的知识和工作流程。","ja":"Claude のような高度な AI エージェントに最適で、フルスタック開発、複雑なロジック計画、そしてマルチメディア処理で専門の知識とワークフローが必要です。","ko":"클로드와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하여 풀스택 개발, 복잡한 논리 계획 및 멀티미디어 처리를 위한 전문 지식과 워크플로가 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude, que necesitan conocimientos y flujos de trabajo especializados en desarrollo de pilas completas, planificación de lógica compleja y procesamiento de multimedia.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA Avancés comme Claude, nécessitant des connaissances et des flux de travail spécialisés dans le développement full-stack, la planification de la logique complexe et le traitement multimédia.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Claude, die spezialisierte Kenntnisse und Workflows in der Full-Stack-Entwicklung, der komplexen Logikplanung und der Multimedia-Verarbeitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude, que necessitam de conhecimento especializado e fluxos de trabalho em desenvolvimento full-stack, planejamento de lógica complexa e processamento de multimídia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, требующих специализированных знаний и рабочих процессов в полном стеке разработки, сложного логического планирования и обработки мультимедиа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل كلود، الذي يحتاج إلى معرفة متخصصة وعمليات عمل في تطوير الويب الكامل وتخطيط المنطق المعقد ومعالجة الوسائط المتعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to solve complex problems systematically with modular Skills definitions, providing specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools for specific domains or tasks, leveraging procedural knowledge that no model can fully possess, including multi-step workflows and domain-specific tools.","zh":"使代理能够系统地解决复杂问题，具有模块化的技能定义，提供专门的知识、工作流程和工具，用于特定领域或任务，利用程序化知识，这是任何模型都无法完全具备的，包括多步骤工作流程和领域特定工具。","ja":"エージェントが複雑な問題を体系的に解決できるようにし、モジュラーなスキル定義を提供し、特定のドメインまたはタスクに特化した知識、ワークフロー、ツールを提供し、プログラム化された知識を活用し、モデルが完全に備えていることができないものを含む、複数ステップのワークフローとドメイン特有のツール。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 문제를 체계적으로 해결할 수 있도록 하며, 모듈화된 기술 정의를 제공하고, 특정 도메인 또는 작업을 위한 전문 지식, 워크플로 및 도구를 제공하며, 프로그램화된 지식을 활용하여, 모델이 완전히 소유할 수 없는 것을 포함하여, 여러 단계의 워크플로 및 도메인 특정 도구를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver problemas complejos de manera sistemática con definiciones de Habilidades modulares, proporcionando conocimientos especializados, flujos de trabajo y herramientas para dominios o tareas específicos, aprovechando el conocimiento procedural que ningún modelo puede poseer completamente, incluyendo flujos de trabajo multietapa y herramientas específicas del dominio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre des problèmes complexes de manière systématique avec des définitions de Compétences modulaires, fournissant des connaissances spécialisées, des flux de travail et des outils pour des domaines ou des tâches spécifiques, en exploitant les connaissances procédurales que aucun modèle ne peut posséder entièrement, y compris des flux de travail multietapas et des outils spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Probleme systematisch mit modularen Fähigkeitsdefinitionen zu lösen, indem es spezialisierte Kenntnisse, Workflows und Tools für bestimmte Domänen oder Aufgaben bereitstellt, die prozedurale Kenntnisse nutzt, die kein Modell vollständig besitzen kann, einschließlich mehrstufiger Workflows und domänen-spezifischer Tools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver problemas complexos de forma sistemática com definições de Habilidades modulares, fornecendo conhecimento especializado, fluxos de trabalho e ferramentas para domínios ou tarefas específicos, utilizando conhecimento procedural que nenhum modelo pode possuir completamente, incluindo fluxos de trabalho em várias etapas e ferramentas específicas de domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически решать сложные проблемы с помощью модульных определений навыков, предоставляя специализированные знания, рабочие процессы и инструменты для конкретных областей или задач, используя процедурные знания, которых не может полностью обладать ни одна модель, включая многоступенчатые рабочие процессы и инструменты, специфичные для домена.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من حل المشكلات المعقدة بشكل منهجي مع تعريفات المهارات المُجزّئة، وتوفير المعرفة المتخصصة والعمليات والادوات لمجالات او مهام محددة، واستخدام المعرفة الإجرائية التي لا يمكن لأي نموذج امتلاكها بشكل كامل، بما في ذلك سلاسل العمل المتعددة والادوات الخاصة بالمجال."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating modular Skills for full-stack development","Generating complex logic plans for problem-solving","Processing multimedia content with specialized workflows"],"zh":["为全栈开发创建模块化技能","为问题解决生成复杂逻辑计划","使用专门的工作流程处理多媒体内容"],"ja":["フルスタック開発のためのモジュラーなスキルを作成する","問題解決のための複雑なロジック計画を生成する","特化したワークフローを使用してマルチメディアコンテンツを処理する"],"ko":["풀스택 개발을 위한 모듈화된 기술を作成하는 것","문제 해결을 위한 복잡한 논리 계획을 생성하는 것","전문 워크플로를 사용하여 멀티미디어 콘텐츠를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Crear Habilidades modulares para el desarrollo de pilas completas","Generar planes de lógica compleja para la resolución de problemas","Procesar contenido multimedia con flujos de trabajo especializados"],"fr":["Créer des Compétences modulaires pour le développement full-stack","Générer des plans de logique complexe pour la résolution de problèmes","Traiter du contenu multimédia avec des flux de travail spécialisés"],"de":["Modulare Fähigkeiten für die Full-Stack-Entwicklung erstellen","Komplexe Logikpläne für die Problemlösung generieren","Multimedia-Inhalte mit spezialisierten Workflows verarbeiten"],"pt":["Criar Habilidades modulares para desenvolvimento full-stack","Gerar planos de lógica complexa para resolução de problemas","Processar conteúdo de multimídia com fluxos de trabalho especializados"],"ru":["Создание модульных навыков для полного стека разработки","Генерация сложных логических планов для решения проблем","Обработка мультимедийного контента с помощью специализированных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات مُجزّئة لتطوير الويب الكامل","توليد خطط منطقية معقدة لحل المشكلات","معالجة المحتوى المتعدد الوسائط باستخدام سلاسل عمل متخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude or compatible agent architecture","Modular Skills definitions needed for specific domains or tasks"],"zh":["需要 Claude 或兼容的代理架构","需要模块化技能定义以适应特定领域或任务"],"ja":["Claude または互換性のあるエージェントアーキテクチャが必要","特定のドメインまたはタスクに適合するモジュラーなスキル定義が必要"],"ko":["클로드 또는 호환 에이전트 아키텍처가 필요","특정 도메인 또는 작업에 적합한 모듈화된 기술 정의가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Claude o una arquitectura de agente compatible","Definiciones de Habilidades modulares necesarias para dominios o tareas específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite Claude ou une architecture d''agent compatible","Des définitions de Compétences modulaires sont nécessaires pour des domaines ou des tâches spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Claude oder eine kompatible Agenten-Architektur","Modulare Fähigkeitsdefinitionen sind für bestimmte Domänen oder Aufgaben erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer Claude ou arquitetura de agente compatível","Definições de Habilidades modulares necessárias para domínios ou tarefas específicos"],"ru":["Требуется Claude или совместимая архитектура агента","Модульные определения навыков необходимы для конкретных областей или задач"],"ar":["يتطلب كلود أو هيكل وكيل متوافق","تعريفات المهارات المُجزّئة ضرورية لمجالات او مهام محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Configuration', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Configuration', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:26:12.600Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Configuration","name":"Configuration","description":{"zh":"Golang 配置标准提供了配置应用程序的最佳实践，包括环境变量和类型化配置","ja":"Golang 構成標準は、環境変数と型付き構成を含む、アプリケーションの構成に関するベストプラクティスを提供する","ko":"Golang 구성 표준은 환경 변수 및 유형화된 구성과 같은 애플리케이션 구성에 대한 모범 사례를 제공합니다","es":"Nuestro conjunto de habilidades de agente para la configuración de Golang proporciona estándares y mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","fr":"Notre ensemble de compétences d''agent pour la configuration Golang fournit des normes et des meilleures pratiques pour le développement d''applications","de":"Unsere Sammlung von Agentenfähigkeiten für die Golang-Konfiguration bietet Standards und Best Practices für die Anwendungsentwicklung","pt":"Padrões de configuração em Golang para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a usar 12-Factor App, Typed Config e bibliotecas como Viper para melhorar a segurança e escalabilidade dos seus aplicativos.","ru":"Стандарты конфигурации Golang для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать 12-Factor App, Typed Config и библиотеки như Viper для улучшения безопасности и масштабируемости ваших приложений.","ar":"معايير التكوين في جولانج للمطورين. تعلم كيفية استخدام 12-Factor App و Typed Config ومكتبات مثل Viper لتحسين أمان وتوسعة تطبيقاتك.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Golang 配置标准","ja":"Golang 構成標準","ko":"Golang 구성 표준","es":"Estándares de configuración de Golang","fr":"Normes de configuration Golang","de":"Golang Konfigurationsstandards","pt":"Padrões de Configuração em Golang","ru":"Стандарты конфигурации Golang","ar":"معايير التكوين في جولانج","en":"Configuration"},"description":{"zh":"Golang 配置标准提供了配置应用程序的最佳实践，包括环境变量和类型化配置","ja":"Golang 構成標準は、環境変数と型付き構成を含む、アプリケーションの構成に関するベストプラクティスを提供する","ko":"Golang 구성 표준은 환경 변수 및 유형화된 구성과 같은 애플리케이션 구성에 대한 모범 사례를 제공합니다","es":"Nuestro conjunto de habilidades de agente para la configuración de Golang proporciona estándares y mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","fr":"Notre ensemble de compétences d''agent pour la configuration Golang fournit des normes et des meilleures pratiques pour le développement d''applications","de":"Unsere Sammlung von Agentenfähigkeiten für die Golang-Konfiguration bietet Standards und Best Practices für die Anwendungsentwicklung","pt":"Padrões de configuração em Golang para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a usar 12-Factor App, Typed Config e bibliotecas como Viper para melhorar a segurança e escal...","ru":"Стандарты конфигурации Golang для разработчиков. Узнайте, как использовать 12-Factor App, Typed Config и библиотеки như Viper для улучшения безопасности и ма...","ar":"معايير التكوين في جولانج للمطورين. تعلم كيفية استخدام 12-Factor App و Typed Config ومكتبات مثل Viper لتحسين أمان وتوسعة تطبيقاتك.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["12 因素应用","类型化配置","环境变量","Viper 库","标准库","秘钥管理"],"ja":["12 因子アプリ","型付き構成","環境変数","Viper ライブラリ","標準ライブラリ","シークレット管理"],"ko":["12 요소 애플리케이션","유형화된 구성","환경 변수","Viper 라이브러리","표준 라이브러리","비밀 키 관리"],"es":["Seguimiento de los 12 factores de la aplicación","Carga de configuración en una estructura de datos","Uso de variables de entorno para secretos","Inyección de dependencias para la configuración","Soporte para bibliotecas como Viper"],"fr":["Suivi des 12 facteurs de l''application","Chargement de la configuration dans une structure de données","Utilisation de variables d''environnement pour les secrets","Injection de dépendances pour la configuration","Prise en charge des bibliothèques comme Viper"],"de":["Verfolgung der 12 Faktoren der Anwendung","Laden der Konfiguration in eine Datenstruktur","Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen für Geheimnisse","Injektion von Abhängigkeiten für die Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Bibliotheken wie Viper"],"pt":["12-Factor App para configuração de ambiente","Typed Config para validação de configuração","Uso de bibliotecas como Viper para configuração complexa","Armazenamento de segredos com variáveis de ambiente ou gerenciadores de segredos","Injeção de configuração com structs"],"ru":["12-Factor App для конфигурации окружения","Typed Config для проверки конфигурации","Использование библиотек như Viper для сложной конфигурации","Хранение секретов с помощью переменных окружения или менеджеров секретов","Внедрение конфигурации с помощью структур"],"ar":["12-Factor App لتهيئة البيئة","Typed Config لتأكيد التكوين","استخدام مكتبات مثل Viper لتكوين معقد","تخزين الأسرار باستخدام متغيرات البيئة أو مديري الأسرار","الحقن التكوين باستخدام الهياكل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Golang 配置","12 因素应用","类型化配置","环境变量","Viper","Golang 开发","配置最佳实践","Golang 应用配置"],"ja":["Golang 構成","12 因子アプリ","型付き構成","環境変数","Viper","Golang 開発","構成ベストプラクティス","Golang アプリ構成"],"ko":["Golang 구성","12 요소 애플리케이션","유형화된 구성","환경 변수","Viper","Golang 개발","구성 모범 사례","Golang 애플리케이션 구성"],"es":["Golang configuración","estándares de configuración","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","Viper biblioteca","12 factores de la aplicación","inyección de dependencias","variables de entorno","secretos de aplicación"],"fr":["Golang configuration","normes de configuration","meilleures pratiques de développement","bibliothèque Viper","12 facteurs de l''application","injection de dépendances","variables d''environnement","secrets d''application"],"de":["Golang Konfiguration","Konfigurationsstandards","Best Practices für die Entwicklung","Viper Bibliothek","12 Faktoren der Anwendung","Injektion von Abhängigkeiten","Umgebungsvariablen","Anwendungsgeheimnisse"],"pt":["Golang configuração","12-Factor App","Typed Config","Viper","segredos em Golang","injeção de configuração","desenvolvimento de aplicativos em Golang"],"ru":["Golang конфигурация","12-Factor App","Typed Config","Viper","секреты в Golang","внедрение конфигурации","разработка приложений на Golang"],"ar":["جولانج تكوين","12-Factor App","Typed Config","Viper","أسرار في جولانج","حقن التكوين","تطوير التطبيقات على جولانج"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Configuration","description":"Standards for application configuration using environment variables and libraries.","bodyPreview":"# Golang Configuration Standards\n\n## **Priority: P1 (STANDARD)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **12-Factor App**: Store config in environment variables.\n- **Typed Config**: Load config into a struct, validate it immediately.\n- **Secrets**: Never commit secrets. Use env vars or secret managers.\n- **No Globals**: Return a Config struct and inject it.\n\n## Libraries\n\n- **Standard Lib**: `os.Getenv` for simple apps.\n- **Viper**: Industry standard for complex configs (supports env, config files, remote config).\n-","body":"# Golang Configuration Standards\n\n## **Priority: P1 (STANDARD)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **12-Factor App**: Store config in environment variables.\n- **Typed Config**: Load config into a struct, validate it immediately.\n- **Secrets**: Never commit secrets. Use env vars or secret managers.\n- **No Globals**: Return a Config struct and inject it.\n\n## Libraries\n\n- **Standard Lib**: `os.Getenv` for simple apps.\n- **Viper**: Industry standard for complex configs (supports env, config files, remote config).\n- **Koanf**: Lighter, cleaner alternative to Viper.\n- **Caarlos0/env**: Good for strict struct tagging.\n\n## Pattern\n\n1. Define `Config` struct.\n2. Load from defaults.\n3. Override from file (optional).\n4. Override from Env (priority).\n5. Validate.\n\n## References\n\n- [Config Pattern](references/config-patterns.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:12.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Golang Agents needing standardized configuration management with environment variables and secret managers.","zh":"适用于需要标准化配置管理的Golang代理，包括环境变量和密钥管理器。","ja":"Golangエージェントに標準化された設定管理が必要な場合に適しています。環境変数とシークレットマネージャーを使用した設定管理に対応しています。","ko":"환경 변수와 시크릿 관리자를 사용한 표준화된 구성 관리가 필요한 Golang 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Golang que necesitan una gestión de configuración estandarizada con variables de entorno y administradores de secretos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Golang ayant besoin d''une gestion de configuration standardisée avec des variables d''environnement et des gestionnaires de secrets.","de":"Perfekt für Golang-Agents, die eine standardisierte Konfigurationsverwaltung mit Umgebungsvariablen und Geheimnisverwaltern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Golang que necessitam de gerenciamento de configuração padronizado com variáveis de ambiente e gerenciadores de segredos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Golang, которым требуется стандартизированное управление конфигурацией с помощью переменных среды и менеджеров секретов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Golang الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تكوين معيارية باستخدام متغيرات البيئة ومديري الأسرار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to follow 12-Factor App principles, utilizing typed config with libraries like Viper, and securely handling secrets through env vars or secret managers, while avoiding globals by injecting Config structs.","zh":"赋予代理遵循12因素应用程序原则的能力，利用类型化配置和类似Viper的库，并通过环境变量或密钥管理器安全地处理密钥，同时通过注入配置结构来避免全局变量。","ja":"12ファクターアプリの原則に従うことができるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、Viperのようなライブラリを使用した型付けされた設定を利用し、環境変数やシークレットマネージャーを通じてシークレットを安全に扱い、Config構造体を注入することでグローバル変数を避けます。","ko":"에이전트가 12요소 애플리케이션의 원칙을 따를 수 있도록Empower하며, Viper와 같은 라이브러리를 사용한 유형화된 구성 및 환경 변수 또는 시크릿 관리자를 통해 시크릿을 안전하게 처리하고, Config 구조체를注入하여 전역 변수를 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir los principios de la aplicación de 12 factores, utilizando una configuración con tipos con bibliotecas como Viper, y manejar secretos de forma segura a través de variables de entorno o administradores de secretos, evitando las variables globales al inyectar estructuras de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les principes de l''application 12 Facteur, en utilisant une configuration typée avec des bibliothèques comme Viper, et en gérant de manière sécurisée les secrets via des variables d''environnement ou des gestionnaires de secrets, tout en évitant les variables globales en injectant des structures de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die 12-Factor-App-Prinzipien zu befolgen, indem sie eine typisierte Konfiguration mit Bibliotheken wie Viper verwenden und Geheimnisse sicher über Umgebungsvariablen oder Geheimnisverwalter handhaben, während sie Globale durch die Injektion von Konfigurationsstrukturen vermeiden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes sigam os princípios do aplicativo de 12 fatores, utilizando configuração tipada com bibliotecas como Viper, e lidando com segredos de forma segura por meio de variáveis de ambiente ou gerenciadores de segredos, evitando globais ao injetar estruturas de configuração.","ru":"Позволяет агентам следовать принципам 12-факторного приложения, используя типизированную конфигурацию с библиотеками như Viper, и безопасно обрабатывать секреты через переменные среды или менеджеры секретов, избегая глобальных переменных путем инъекции структур конфигурации.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اتباع مبدأ تطبيق 12 عامل، باستخدام تكوين من النوع مع مكتبات مثل Viper، ومعالجة الأسرار بأمان من خلال متغيرات البيئة أو مديري الأسرار، وتجنب المتغيرات العالمية عن طريق حقن هياكل التكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing 12-Factor App configuration standards","Validating and loading config into structs with Viper","Securing sensitive data with secret managers and environment variables"],"zh":["实现12因素应用程序配置标准","使用Viper验证和加载配置到结构体中","使用密钥管理器和环境变量保护敏感数据"],"ja":["12ファクターアプリの設定標準を実装する","Viperを使用して設定を検証して構造体にロードする","シークレットマネージャーと環境変数を使用して機密データを保護する"],"ko":["12요소 애플리케이션 구성 표준 구현","Viper를 사용하여 구성 확인 및 구조체 로드","시크릿 관리자 및 환경 변수를 사용한 민감한 데이터 보호"],"es":["Implementar estándares de configuración de aplicaciones de 12 factores","Validar y cargar la configuración en estructuras con Viper","Proteger datos sensibles con administradores de secretos y variables de entorno"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des normes de configuration d''applications 12 Facteur","Valider et charger la configuration dans des structures avec Viper","Protéger les données sensibles avec des gestionnaires de secrets et des variables d''environnement"],"de":["Implementierung von 12-Factor-App-Konfigurationsstandards","Validieren und Laden von Konfigurationen in Strukturen mit Viper","Sichere sensible Daten mit Geheimnisverwaltern und Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Implementar padrões de configuração do aplicativo de 12 fatores","Validar e carregar configuração em estruturas com Viper","Proteger dados sensíveis com gerenciadores de segredos e variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Реализовать стандарты конфигурации 12-факторного приложения","Проверить и загрузить конфигурацию в структуры с помощью Viper","Защитить конфиденциальные данные с помощью менеджеров секретов и переменных среды"],"ar":["تنفيذ معايير تكوين تطبيق 12 عامل","التحقق من صحة وحمل التكوين في الهياكل باستخدام Viper","حماية البيانات الحساسة باستخدام مديري الأسرار ومتغيرات البيئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Golang environment","Limited to Viper and standard library for configuration management","Needs careful handling of secrets and environment variables"],"zh":["需要Golang环境","仅限于Viper和标准库进行配置管理","需要仔细处理密钥和环境变量"],"ja":["Golang環境が必要","設定管理はViperと標準ライブラリに限定される","シークレットと環境変数の慎重な取り扱いが必要"],"ko":["Golang 환경 필요","구성 관리는 Viper 및 표준 라이브러리에限定","시크릿 및 환경 변수의慎重한 처리 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Golang","Limitado a Viper y la biblioteca estándar para la gestión de configuración","Requiere un manejo cuidadoso de secretos y variables de entorno"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Golang","Limité à Viper et à la bibliothèque standard pour la gestion de la configuration","Nécessite une manipulation prudente des secrets et des variables d''environnement"],"de":["Benötigt eine Golang-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Viper und Standardbibliothek für die Konfigurationsverwaltung","Benötigt eine sorgfältige Handhabung von Geheimnissen und Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Golang","Limitado ao Viper e à biblioteca padrão para gerenciamento de configuração","Necessita de manipulação cuidadosa de segredos e variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Требуется среда Golang","Ограничен использованием Viper и стандартной библиотеки для управления конфигурацией","Требует осторожного обращения с секретами и переменными среды"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Golang","محدود باستخدام Viper والمكتبة القياسية لإدارة التكوين","يحتاج إلى التعامل بحذر مع الأسرار ومتغيرات البيئة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Android Persistence', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Android Persistence', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:26:37.950Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Android Persistence","name":"Android Persistence","description":{"zh":"Android 持久化标准是一套针对 Android 应用的数据存储和管理的最佳实践","ja":"Android パーシステンス標準は、Android アプリのデータストレージと管理のためのベストプラクティスです","ko":"안드로이드 영속성 표준은 안드로이드 애플리케이션의 데이터 저장소 및 관리를 위한 표준입니다","es":"La persistencia en Android se refiere a la capacidad de almacenar y recuperar datos de manera efectiva. Room y DataStore son dos opciones populares.","fr":"La persistence Android fait référence à la capacité de stocker et de récupérer des données de manière efficace. Room et DataStore sont deux options populaires.","de":"Die Persistenz in Android bezieht sich auf die Fähigkeit, Daten effektiv zu speichern und wiederzuerlangen. Room und DataStore sind zwei beliebte Optionen.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Android 持久化标准","ja":"Android パーシステンス標準","ko":"안드로이드 영속성 표준","es":"Mejores prácticas de persistencia en Android","fr":"Meilleures pratiques de persistence Android","de":"Best Practices für Android-Persistenz","en":"Android Persistence"},"description":{"zh":"Android 持久化标准是一套针对 Android 应用的数据存储和管理的最佳实践","ja":"Android パーシステンス標準は、Android アプリのデータストレージと管理のためのベストプラクティスです","ko":"안드로이드 영속성 표준은 안드로이드 애플리케이션의 데이터 저장소 및 관리를 위한 표준입니다","es":"La persistencia en Android se refiere a la capacidad de almacenar y recuperar datos de manera efectiva. Room y DataStore son dos opciones populares.","fr":"La persistence Android fait référence à la capacité de stocker et de récupérer des données de manière efficace. Room et DataStore sont deux options populaires.","de":"Die Persistenz in Android bezieht sich auf die Fähigkeit, Daten effektiv zu speichern und wiederzuerlangen. Room und DataStore sind zwei beliebte Optionen.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["Room 持久化库","DataStore 替代 SharedPreferences","异步查询和事务支持","实体类和领域模型映射","类型安全的 ProtoDataStore"],"ja":["Room パーシステンスライブラリ","DataStore を使用した SharedPreferences の置き換え","非同期クエリとトランザクションのサポート","エンティティクラスとドメインモデルマッピング","型安全の ProtoDataStore"],"ko":["Room 영속성 라이브러리","DataStore를 사용한 SharedPreferences 대체","비동기 쿼리 및 트랜잭션 지원","엔티티 클래스 및 도메인 모델 매핑","타입 안전한 ProtoDataStore"],"es":["Uso de Room para consultas asíncronas","Implementación de DataStore para reemplazar SharedPreferences","Uso de @Transaction para consultas multi-tabla","Mapeo de entidades a modelos de dominio en el repositorio","Inyección de instancias singleton de DataStore","Uso de Flow para consultas de lista"],"fr":["Utilisation de Room pour les requêtes asynchrones","Mise en œuvre de DataStore pour remplacer SharedPreferences","Utilisation de @Transaction pour les requêtes multi-table","Mappage des entités aux modèles de domaine dans le référentiel","Injection d''instances singleton de DataStore","Utilisation de Flow pour les requêtes de liste"],"de":["Verwendung von Room für asynchrone Abfragen","Implementierung von DataStore zum Ersetzen von SharedPreferences","Verwendung von @Transaction für Abfragen über mehrere Tabellen","Zuordnung von Entitäten zu Domänenmodellen im Repository","Einjektion von Singleton-Instanzen von DataStore","Verwendung von Flow für Listenabfragen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Android 持久化","Room 持久化库","DataStore","异步查询","事务支持","实体类","领域模型","类型安全"],"ja":["Android パーシステンス","Room パーシステンスライブラリ","DataStore","非同期クエリ","トランザクションサポート","エンティティクラス","ドメインモデル","型安全"],"ko":["안드로이드 영속성","Room 영속성 라이브러리","DataStore","비동기 쿼리","트랜잭션 지원","엔티티 클래스","도메인 모델","타입 안전"],"es":["persistencia en Android","Room","DataStore","SharedPreferences","consultas asíncronas","entidades","modelos de dominio","repositorio","inyección de dependencias"],"fr":["persistence Android","Room","DataStore","SharedPreferences","requêtes asynchrones","entités","modèles de domaine","référentiel","injection de dépendances"],"de":["Persistenz in Android","Room","DataStore","SharedPreferences","asynchrone Abfragen","Entitäten","Domänenmodelle","Repository","Abhängigkeitseinjektion"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Android Persistence","description":"Standards for Room Database and DataStore","bodyPreview":"# Android Persistence Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Room\n\n- **Async**: Return `Flow<List<T>>` for queries, use `suspend` for Write/Insert.\n- **Entities**: Keep simple `@Entity` data classes. Map to Domain models in Repository.\n- **Transactions**: Use `@Transaction` for multi-table queries (Relations).\n\n### DataStore\n\n- **Usage**: Replace `SharedPreferences` with `ProtoDataStore` (Type-safe) or `PreferencesDataStore`.\n- **Scope**: Inject singleton instance via","body":"# Android Persistence Standards\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Room\n\n- **Async**: Return `Flow<List<T>>` for queries, use `suspend` for Write/Insert.\n- **Entities**: Keep simple `@Entity` data classes. Map to Domain models in Repository.\n- **Transactions**: Use `@Transaction` for multi-table queries (Relations).\n\n### DataStore\n\n- **Usage**: Replace `SharedPreferences` with `ProtoDataStore` (Type-safe) or `PreferencesDataStore`.\n- **Scope**: Inject singleton instance via Hilt.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Main Thread**: `**No IO on Main**: Use Dispatchers.IO (Room helper does this, but verify flow collection).`\n- **Domain Leak**: `**No Entities in UI**: Map to Domain/UI Models.`\n\n## References\n\n- [DAO Templates](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:37.950Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Android-focused Code Agents requiring modern persistence layer implementation.","zh":"对于需要现代持久层实现的Android专注代码代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"モダンな永続層の実装が必要なAndroid中心のコードエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"현대적인 영속성 계층 구현이 필요한 안드로이드 중심의 코드 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de código centrados en Android que requieren una implementación de capa de persistencia moderna.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de code axés sur Android nécessitant une mise en œuvre de couche de persistance moderne.","de":"Wesentlich für Android-fokussierte Code-Agents, die eine moderne Persistenzschicht-Implementierung erfordern.","pt":"Essential for Android-focused Code Agents requiring modern persistence layer implementation.","ru":"Essential for Android-focused Code Agents requiring modern persistence layer implementation.","ar":"Essential for Android-focused Code Agents requiring modern persistence layer implementation."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement Room with Flow<List<T>> for reactive queries and suspend functions for writes, while replacing SharedPreferences with type-safe ProtoDataStore. Provides structured guidance on entity design and @Transaction annotations for complex operations.","zh":"使代理能够使用Room和Flow<List<T>>实现反应式查询和写入的suspend函数，同时用类型安全的ProtoDataStore替换SharedPreferences。为实体设计和@Transaction注释提供结构化的指导，以进行复杂的操作。","ja":"RoomとFlow<List<T>>を使用してリアクティブなクエリと書き込みのサスペンド関数を実装し、SharedPreferencesを型安全のProtoDataStoreに置き換えることができるようにします。エンティティ設計と@Transactionアノテーションについて、複雑な操作を行うための構造化されたガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"Room과 Flow<List<T>>를 사용하여 반응형 쿼리와 쓰기 suspend 함수를 구현하고, SharedPreferences를 유형 안전 ProtoDataStore로 대체할 수 있도록 합니다. 엔티티 설계와 @Transaction 주석에 대한 구조화된 지침을 제공하여 복잡한 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar Room con Flow<List<T>> para consultas reactivas y funciones suspendidas para escrituras, mientras reemplaza SharedPreferences con ProtoDataStore de tipo seguro. Proporciona orientación estructurada sobre el diseño de entidades y anotaciones @Transaction para operaciones complejas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre Room avec Flow<List<T>> pour des requêtes réactives et des fonctions suspendues pour les écritures, tout en remplaçant SharedPreferences par ProtoDataStore de type sécurisé. Fournit des conseils structurés sur la conception d''entités et les annotations @Transaction pour les opérations complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Room mit Flow<List<T>> für reaktive Abfragen und suspendierte Funktionen für Schreibvorgänge zu implementieren, während SharedPreferences durch type-sicheren ProtoDataStore ersetzt wird. Bietet strukturierte Anleitung zur Entitätsdesign und @Transaction-Anmerkungen für komplexe Operationen.","pt":"Enables agents to implement Room with Flow<List<T>> for reactive queries and suspend functions for writes, while replacing SharedPreferences with type-safe ProtoDataStore. Provides structured guidance on entity design and @Transaction annotations for complex operations.","ru":"Enables agents to implement Room with Flow<List<T>> for reactive queries and suspend functions for writes, while replacing SharedPreferences with type-safe ProtoDataStore. Provides structured guidance on entity design and @Transaction annotations for complex operations.","ar":"Enables agents to implement Room with Flow<List<T>> for reactive queries and suspend functions for writes, while replacing SharedPreferences with type-safe ProtoDataStore. Provides structured guidance on entity design 