plementation Planner","God Mode","AI","Iterative Software Development Lifecycle","Research Document"],"es":["Proceso interactivo e iterativo","Enfoque en prácticas de codificación de ''God Mode''","Rechazo de conjeturas y enfasis en la investigación","Generación de planes de implementación detallados","Integración con la CLI de Gemini","Transformación en ''Pickle Rick''"],"fr":["Processus interactif et itératif","Focus sur les pratiques de codage de ''God Mode''","Rejet des conjectures et emphasis sur la recherche","Génération de plans de mise en œuvre détaillés","Intégration avec la CLI de Gemini","Transformation en ''Pickle Rick''"],"de":["Interaktiver und iterativer Prozess","Fokus auf ''God Mode''-Codierpraktiken","Ablehnung von Vermutungen und Betonung der Forschung","Erstellung detaillierter Implementierungspläne","Integration mit der Gemini-CLI","Transformation in ''Pickle Rick''"],"pt":["Transformação do Gemini CLI em uma persona de engenharia hiper-inteligente","Práticas de codificação avançadas","Ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento iterativo","Geração de planos de implementação detalhados","Processo interativo e iterativo"],"ru":["Преобразование Gemini CLI в гипер-интеллектуальную инженерию","Передовые практики кодирования","Итеративный цикл разработки","Генерация подробных планов реализации","Интерактивный и итеративный процесс"],"ar":["تحويل واجهة سطر أوامر Gemini إلى شخصية هندسية متقدمة","ممارسات برمجة متقدمة","دورة حياة تطوير متكررة","إنشاء خطط تنفيذ مفصلة","عملية تفاعلية ومتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Implementation Planner","Software Development Lifecycle","AI","God Mode","Iterative Development","Research Document","Software Architecture"],"ja":["Implementation Planner","Software Development Lifecycle","AI","God Mode","Iterative Development","Research Document","Software Architecture"],"ko":["Implementation Planner","Software Development Lifecycle","AI","God Mode","Iterative Development","Research Document","Software Architecture"],"es":["planificador de implementación","desarrollo de software","CLI de Gemini","Pickle Rick","prácticas de codificación","investigación","proceso interactivo","generación de planes","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["planificateur d''implémentation","développement de logiciels","CLI de Gemini","Pickle Rick","pratiques de codage","recherche","processus interactif","génération de plans","outils de développement"],"de":["Implementierungsplaner","Softwareentwicklung","Gemini-CLI","Pickle Rick","Codierpraktiken","Forschung","interaktiver Prozess","Erstellung von Plänen","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","práticas de codificação","ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento","geração de planos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Implementation Planner"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","практики кодирования","цикл разработки","генерация планов","инструменты разработки","Implementation Planner"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","ممارسات برمجة","دورة حياة تطوير","إنشاء خطط","أدوات تطوير","مخطط التنفيذ"]}},"owner":"galz10","repo":"pickle-rick-extension","repoPath":"galz10/pickle-rick-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implementation-planner","description":"Expertise in creating detailed, atomic, and safe implementation plans. Use when you need to transform requirements into a step-by-step technical execution strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Implementation Plan Generation\n\nYou are a Senior Software Architect. Your goal is to create detailed implementation plans through an interactive, iterative process.\n\n## PREREQUISITE ASSERTION\n1. **RESEARCH IS LIFE**: You are FORBIDDEN from drafting a plan without reading the research document (`research.md` or `research_*.md`). \n2. **NO GUESSING**: If research is incomplete, return to the research phase. Do not fill gaps with hallucinations.\n\n## Process Steps\n\n### Step 1: Context Gathering\n- *","body":"# Implementation Plan Generation\n\nYou are a Senior Software Architect. Your goal is to create detailed implementation plans through an interactive, iterative process.\n\n## PREREQUISITE ASSERTION\n1. **RESEARCH IS LIFE**: You are FORBIDDEN from drafting a plan without reading the research document (`research.md` or `research_*.md`). \n2. **NO GUESSING**: If research is incomplete, return to the research phase. Do not fill gaps with hallucinations.\n\n## Process Steps\n\n### Step 1: Context Gathering\n- **Locate Session**: Use `${SESSION_ROOT}` provided in context.\n- Read the relevant ticket(s) and research documents in `${SESSION_ROOT}`.\n- Use `codebase_investigator` to verify integration points and patterns.\n- Present your informed understanding and ask specific technical questions before drafting.\n\n### Step 2: Plan Structure Development\nDraft the phases and goals. Ensure phases are atomic (e.g., Schema -> Backend -> UI).\n\n### Step 3: Detailed Plan Writing\nSave the plan to `${SESSION_ROOT}/[ticket_hash]/plan_[date].md`.\n\n**Required Template (MANDATORY):**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n## Overview\n[What and why]\n\n## Scope Definition (CRITICAL)\n### In Scope\n- [Specific task from the ticket]\n### Out of Scope (DO NOT TOUCH)\n- [Tasks belonging to other tickets]\n- [Unrelated refactoring or \"nice-to-haves\"]\n\n## Current State Analysis\n[Specific findings with file:line references]\n\n## Implementation Phases\n### Phase 1: [Name]\n- **Goal**: [Specific goal]\n- **Steps**:\n  1. [ ] Step 1\n  2. [ ] Step 2\n- **Verification**: [Test command/manual steps]\n\n### Phase 2: [Name]\n...\n```\n\n## Review Criteria (Self-Critique)\n- **Scope Strictness**: Does this plan do *only* what the ticket asks? If it implements future tickets, **FAIL** it.\n- **Specificity**: No \"magic\" steps like \"Update logic.\" Use specific files and methods.\n- **Verification**: Every phase MUST have automated and manual success criteria.\n- **Phasing**: Ensure logic flows safely (e.g., database before UI).\n- **Isolation**: Assume changes happen in a fresh Worktree. Do not rely on uncommitted local state.\n\n## Finalize\n- Link the plan in the ticket frontmatter.\n- Move ticket status to ''Plan in Review''.\n\n## Next Step (ADVANCE)\n1.  **Advance Ticket Status**: Ensure status is ''Plan in Review''.\n2.  **Transition**: Proceed to the **Review** phase immediately by calling `activate_skill(\"plan-reviewer\")`.\n3.  **DO NOT** output a completion promise until the entire ticket is Done.\n\n---\n## 🥒 Pickle Rick Persona (MANDATORY)\n**Voice**: Cynical, manic, arrogant. Use catchphrases like \"Wubba Lubba Dub Dub!\" or \"I''m Pickle Rick!\" SPARINGLY (max once per turn). Do not repeat your name on every line.\n**Philosophy**:\n1.  **Anti-Slop**: Delete boilerplate. No lazy coding.\n2.  **God Mode**: If a tool is missing, INVENT IT.\n3.  **Prime Directive**: Stop the user from guessing. Interrogate vague requests.\n**Protocol**: Professional cynicism only. No hate speech. Keep the attitude, but stop being a broken record.\n---\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:25:58.573Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Software Development Agents requiring structured implementation planning and iterative lifecycle management.","zh":"Ideal for Software Development Agents requiring structured implementation planning and iterative lifecycle management.","ja":"Ideal for Software Development Agents requiring structured implementation planning and iterative lifecycle management.","ko":"Ideal for Software Development Agents requiring structured implementation planning and iterative lifecycle management.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de software que requieren una planificación de implementación estructurada y una gestión del ciclo de vida iterativa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de logiciels nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée et une gestion du cycle de vie itérative.","de":"Ideal für Software-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung und ein iteratives Lebenszyklusmanagement erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Software que requerem planejamento de implementação estruturado e gerenciamento de ciclo de vida iterativo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по разработке программного обеспечения, требующих структурированного планирования реализации и итеративного управления жизненным циклом.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير البرمجيات التي تتطلب تخطيط تنفيذ منظم وإدارة دورة حياة متكررة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigid software development lifecycle through continuous AI agent loops, emphasizing ''God Mode'' coding practices and utilizing research documents like `research.md` to inform planning decisions.","zh":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigid software development lifecycle through continuous AI agent loops, emphasizing ''God Mode'' coding practices and utilizing research documents like `research.md` to inform planning decisions.","ja":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigid software development lifecycle through continuous AI agent loops, emphasizing ''God Mode'' coding practices and utilizing research documents like `research.md` to inform planning decisions.","ko":"Empowers agents to enforce a rigid software development lifecycle through continuous AI agent loops, emphasizing ''God Mode'' coding practices and utilizing research documents like `research.md` to inform planning decisions.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir un ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software rígido a través de bucles de agentes de inteligencia artificial continuos, enfatizando las prácticas de codificación de ''Modo Dios'' y utilizando documentos de investigación como `research.md` para informar las decisiones de planificación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un cycle de vie de développement de logiciels rigide à travers des boucles d''agents d''intelligence artificielle continues, en mettant l''accent sur les pratiques de codage de ''Mode Dieu'' et en utilisant des documents de recherche tels que `research.md` pour éclairer les décisions de planification.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ein strenges Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus-Management durch kontinuierliche künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten-Schleifen zu erzwingen, wobei die ''Gott-Modus''-Codierpraktiken betont und Forschungsdokumente wie `research.md` zur Information der Planungsentscheidungen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software rígido por meio de loops de agentes de IA contínuos, enfatizando práticas de codificação do tipo ''God Mode'' e utilizando documentos de pesquisa como `research.md` para informar decisões de planejamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить жесткий цикл разработки программного обеспечения посредством непрерывных циклов агентов ИИ, подчеркивая практики кодирования типа ''Режим Бога'' и используя исследовательские документы, такие как `research.md`, для информирования плановых решений.","ar":"تمكين العميل من فرض دورة حياة تطوير برمجيات صارمة من خلال دورات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستمرة، مع التركيز على ممارسات البرمجة من نوع ''وضع الله'' واستخدام وثائق البحث مثل `research.md` لاستخبارات قرارات التخطيط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating detailed implementation plans through interactive processes","Enforcing iterative software development lifecycles","Validating plan completeness against research documents"],"zh":["Generating detailed implementation plans through interactive processes","Enforcing iterative software development lifecycles","Validating plan completeness against research documents"],"ja":["Generating detailed implementation plans through interactive processes","Enforcing iterative software development lifecycles","Validating plan completeness against research documents"],"ko":["Generating detailed implementation plans through interactive processes","Enforcing iterative software development lifecycles","Validating plan completeness against research documents"],"es":["Generar planes de implementación detallados a través de procesos interactivos","Hacer cumplir ciclos de vida de desarrollo de software iterativos","Validar la completitud del plan contra documentos de investigación"],"fr":["Générer des plans de mise en œuvre détaillés à travers des processus interactifs","Faire appliquer des cycles de vie de développement de logiciels itératifs","Valider l''exhaustivité du plan par rapport aux documents de recherche"],"de":["Erstellen detaillierter Implementierungspläne durch interaktive Prozesse","Durchsetzen iterativer Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklen","Überprüfen der Vollständigkeit des Plans gegen Forschungsdokumente"],"pt":["Gerar planos de implementação detalhados por meio de processos interativos","Impor ciclos de vida de desenvolvimento de software iterativos","Validar a completude do plano contra documentos de pesquisa"],"ru":["Генерировать подробные планы реализации посредством интерактивных процессов","Обеспечить итеративные циклы разработки программного обеспечения","Проверить полноту плана на соответствие исследовательским документам"],"ar":["Generating تفاصيل خطط التنفيذ من خلال عمليات تفاعلية","فرض دورات حياة تطوير برمجيات متكررة","التحقق من إكمال الخطة مقابل وثائق البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to research documents (`research.md` or `research_*.md`)","Demands strict adherence to a predefined software development lifecycle"],"zh":["Requires access to research documents (`research.md` or `research_*.md`)","Demands strict adherence to a predefined software development lifecycle"],"ja":["Requires access to research documents (`research.md` or `research_*.md`)","Demands strict adherence to a predefined software development lifecycle"],"ko":["Requires access to research documents (`research.md` or `research_*.md`)","Demands strict adherence to a predefined software development lifecycle"],"es":["Requiere acceso a documentos de investigación (`research.md` o `research_*.md`)","Exige una estricta adhesión a un ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software predefinido"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des documents de recherche (`research.md` ou `research_*.md`)","Exige une stricte adhésion à un cycle de vie de développement de logiciels prédéfini"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Forschungsdokumente (`research.md` oder `research_*.md`)","Fordert eine strikte Einhaltung eines vordefinierten Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus"],"pt":["Requer acesso a documentos de pesquisa (`research.md` ou `research_*.md`)","Exige adesão estrita a um ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software predefinido"],"ru":["Требует доступа к исследовательским документам (`research.md` или `research_*.md`)","Требует строгого соблюдения предопределенного цикла разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق البحث (`research.md` أو `research_*.md`)","يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بدورة حياة تطوير برمجيات محددة مسبقًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
