管理のサポート","設定の簡素化"],"ko":["자동화 API 문서 생성","OpenAPI 표준 구현","50%의 보일러 플레이트 코드削減","버전 관리 지원","설정 간소화"],"es":["Documentación automatizada de API","Reducción del código boilerplate en un 50%","Uso de Nest CLI Plugin para la generación de documentación","Mantenimiento de documentos Swagger separados para versiones","Compatibilidad con versiones de API"],"fr":["Documentation automatisée des API","Réduction du code boilerplate de 50%","Utilisation du plugin Nest CLI pour la génération de documentation","Maintenance de documents Swagger séparés pour les versions","Compatibilité avec les versions d''API"],"de":["Automatisierte API-Dokumentation","Reduzierung des Boilerplate-Codes um 50%","Verwendung des Nest-CLI-Plugins für die Dokumentenerstellung","Wartung von separaten Swagger-Dokumenten für Versionen","Kompatibilität mit API-Versionen"],"pt":["Documentação automatizada com Nest CLI Plugin","Geração automática de @ApiProperty para DTOs e tipos de resposta","Redução de boilerplate em 50%","Manutenção de documentos Swagger separados para versões diferentes","Compatibilidade com o padrão OpenAPI"],"ru":["Автоматическая документация с помощью плагина Nest CLI","Автоматическая генерация @ApiProperty для DTO и типов ответа","Уменьшение boilerplate на 50%","Ведение отдельных документов Swagger для разных версий","Совместимость со стандартом OpenAPI"],"ar":["توثيق آلي مع إضافة Nest CLI","توليد آلي @ApiProperty ل DTO و أنواع الاستجابة","تقليل Boilerplate بنسبة 50%","صيانة وثائق Swagger منفصلة لنسخ مختلفة","التوافق مع معيار OpenAPI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NestJS","OpenAPI","自动化API文档","编程语言标准","API开发","开发效率","样板代码","版本控制"],"ja":["NestJS","OpenAPI","自動化APIドキュメント","プログラミング言語標準","API開発","開発効率","ボイラープレートコード","バージョン管理"],"ko":["NestJS","OpenAPI","자동화 API 문서","프로그래밍 언어 표준","API 개발","개발 효율성","보일러 플레이트 코드","버전 관리"],"es":["NestJS OpenAPI","Documentación automatizada de API","Nest CLI Plugin","Swagger","API documentation","Desarrollo de API","Mejores prácticas de API"],"fr":["NestJS OpenAPI","Documentation automatisée des API","Plugin Nest CLI","Swagger","Documentation d''API","Développement d''API","Meilleures pratiques d''API"],"de":["NestJS OpenAPI","Automatisierte API-Dokumentation","Nest-CLI-Plugin","Swagger","API-Dokumentation","API-Entwicklung","Beste Praktiken für API"],"pt":["NestJS OpenAPI","Documentação automatizada","OpenAPI","NestJS","Swagger","Boilerplate","DTO","Resposta","Versões"],"ru":["NestJS OpenAPI","Автоматическая документация","OpenAPI","NestJS","Swagger","Boilerplate","DTO","Ответ","Версии"],"ar":["NestJS OpenAPI","توثيق آلي","OpenAPI","NestJS","Swagger","Boilerplate","DTO","استجابة","نسخ"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"NestJS OpenAPI","description":"Swagger automation and Generic response documentation.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAPI & Documentation\n\n## **Priority: P2 (MAINTENANCE)**\n\nAutomated API documentation and OpenAPI standards.\n\n- **Automation**: **ALWAYS** use the Nest CLI Plugin (`@nestjs/swagger/plugin`).\n  - **Benefit**: Auto-generates `@ApiProperty` for DTOs and response types. Reduces boilerplate by 50%.\n  - **Config**: `nest-cli.json` -> `\"plugins\": [\"@nestjs/swagger\"]`.\n- **Versioning**: Maintain separate Swagger docs for `v1`, `v2` if breaking changes occur.\n\n## Response Documentation\n\n- **Strictnes","body":"# OpenAPI & Documentation\n\n## **Priority: P2 (MAINTENANCE)**\n\nAutomated API documentation and OpenAPI standards.\n\n- **Automation**: **ALWAYS** use the Nest CLI Plugin (`@nestjs/swagger/plugin`).\n  - **Benefit**: Auto-generates `@ApiProperty` for DTOs and response types. Reduces boilerplate by 50%.\n  - **Config**: `nest-cli.json` -> `\"plugins\": [\"@nestjs/swagger\"]`.\n- **Versioning**: Maintain separate Swagger docs for `v1`, `v2` if breaking changes occur.\n\n## Response Documentation\n\n- **Strictness**: Every controller method must have `@ApiResponse({ status: 200, type: UserDto })`.\n- **Generic Wrappers**: Define `ApiPaginatedResponse<T>` decorators to document generic `PageDto<T>` returns properly (Swagger doesn''t handle generics well by default).\n  - **Technique**: Use `ApiExtraModels` + `getSchemaPath()` in the custom decorator to handle the generic `T` ref.\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n- **Polymorphism**: Use `@ApiExtraModels` and `getSchemaPath` for `oneOf`/`anyOf` union types.\n- **File Uploads**: Document `multipart/form-data` explicitly.\n  - **Decorator**: `@ApiConsumes(''multipart/form-data'')`.\n  - **Body**: `@ApiBody({ schema: { type: ''object'', properties: { file: { type: ''string'', format: ''binary'' } } } })`.\n- **Authentication**: Specify granular security schemes per route/controller.\n  - **Types**: `@ApiBearerAuth()` or `@ApiSecurity(''api-key'')` (Must match `DocumentBuilder().addBearerAuth()`).\n- **Enums**: Force named enums for reusable schema references.\n  - **Code**: `@ApiProperty({ enum: MyEnum, enumName: ''MyEnum'' })`.\n\n## Operation Grouping\n\n- **Tags**: Mandatory `@ApiTags(''domains'')` on every Controller to group endpoints logically.\n- **Multiple Docs**: generate separate docs for different audiences (e.g. Public vs Internal).\n\n  ```typescript\n  SwaggerModule.createDocument(app, config, { include: [PublicModule] }); // /api/docs\n  SwaggerModule.createDocument(app, adminConfig, { include: [AdminModule] }); // /admin/docs\n  ```\n\n## Self-Documentation\n\n- **Compodoc**: Use `@compodoc/compodoc` to generate static documentation of the module graph, services, and dependencies.\n  - **Use Case**: New developer onboarding and architectural review.\n\n## Advanced OpenAPI\n\n- **Polymorphism**: Use `@ApiExtraModels` and `getSchemaPath` for `oneOf`/`anyOf` union types.\n  - **Pattern**: Register generic/sub-types in controller, refer via schema `$ref`.\n- **File Uploads**: Document `multipart/form-data` explicitly.\n  - **Decorator**: `@ApiConsumes(''multipart/form-data'')`.\n  - **Body**: `@ApiBody({ schema: { type: ''object'', properties: { file: { type: ''string'', format: ''binary'' } } } })`.\n- **Authentication**: Specify granular security schemes per route/controller.\n  - **Types**: `@ApiBearerAuth()` or `@ApiSecurity(''api-key'')`. Match setup in `DocumentBuilder`.\n- **Enums**: Force named enums for reusable schema references.\n  - **Code**: `@ApiProperty({ enum: MyEnum, enumName: ''MyEnum'' })`.\n- **Grouping**: Segregate public vs. internal docs.\n  - **Setup**: `SwaggerModule.createDocument(app, config, { include: [AdminModule] })`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:11.790Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API Development Agents requiring automated API documentation and OpenAPI standards with NestJS","zh":"适用于需要自动化 API 文档和 OpenAPI 标准的 API 开发代理，特别是使用 NestJS","ja":"NestJS を使用して自動化 API ドキュメントと OpenAPI 標準を必要とする API 開発エージェントに最適","ko":"NestJS를 사용하여 자동화된 API 문서와 OpenAPI 표준이 필요한 API 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de API que requieren documentación de API automatizada y estándares de OpenAPI con NestJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement d''API nécessitant une documentation d''API automatisée et des normes OpenAPI avec NestJS","de":"Ideal für API-Entwicklungsagenten, die automatisierte API-Dokumentation und OpenAPI-Standards mit NestJS erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de API que exigem documentação de API automatizada e padrões OpenAPI com NestJS","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки API, требующих автоматизированной документации API и стандартов OpenAPI с NestJS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تتطلب توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآلي ومعايير OpenAPI مع NestJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to auto-generate API documentation using the Nest CLI Plugin, reducing boilerplate by 50% and maintaining OpenAPI standards with @nestjs/swagger/plugin, while also supporting versioning for separate Swagger docs","zh":"赋予代理自动生成 API 文档的能力，使用 Nest CLI 插件，减少 50% 的样板代码，并使用 @nestjs/swagger/plugin 维护 OpenAPI 标准，同时支持版本控制以生成单独的 Swagger 文档","ja":"エージェントに API ドキュメントを自動生成する能力を与え、Nest CLI プラグインを使用して 50% のボイラープレートを削減し、@nestjs/swagger/plugin を使用して OpenAPI 標準を維持し、バージョニングのために個別の Swagger ドキュメントをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 API 문서를 자동으로 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Nest CLI 플러그인을 사용하여 50%의 보일러 플레이트를 줄이고 @nestjs/swagger/plugin을 사용하여 OpenAPI 표준을 유지하며 버저닝을 위해 별도의 Swagger 문서를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a auto-generar la documentación de la API utilizando el complemento de Nest CLI, reduciendo la configuración repetitiva en un 50% y manteniendo los estándares de OpenAPI con @nestjs/swagger/plugin, y también admitiendo la gestión de versiones para documentos de Swagger separados","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer automatiquement la documentation de l''API en utilisant le plugin Nest CLI, en réduisant les tâches répétitives de 50% et en maintenant les normes OpenAPI avec @nestjs/swagger/plugin, tout en prenant en charge la gestion de versions pour des documents Swagger distincts","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die API-Dokumentation mithilfe des Nest-CLI-Plugins automatisch zu generieren, die Boilerplate-Code um 50% reduziert und die OpenAPI-Standards mit @nestjs/swagger/plugin aufrechterhält und auch die Versionierung für separate Swagger-Dokumente unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a auto-gerar documentação de API usando o Plug-in do Nest CLI, reduzindo boilerplate em 50% e mantendo padrões OpenAPI com @nestjs/swagger/plugin, além de suportar controle de versão para documentos Swagger separados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически генерировать документацию API с помощью плагина Nest CLI, сокращая boilerplate на 50% и поддерживая стандарты OpenAPI с @nestjs/swagger/plugin, а также поддерживая управление версиями для отдельных документов Swagger","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات تلقائيًا باستخدام إضافة Nest CLI، وقص بويلر بلايت بنسبة 50٪ والحفاظ على معايير OpenAPI مع @nestjs/swagger/plugin، بالإضافة إلى دعم إدارة الإصدارات لتوثيقات Swagger المنفصلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API documentation with Nest CLI Plugin","Maintaining separate Swagger docs for versioning","Generating @ApiProperty for DTOs and response types"],"zh":["使用 Nest CLI 插件自动化 API 文档","维护单独的 Swagger 文档以进行版本控制","为 DTO 和响应类型生成 @ApiProperty"],"ja":["Nest CLI プラグインを使用して API ドキュメントを自動化","バージョニングのために個別の Swagger ドキュメントを維持","DTO とレスポンス タイプの @ApiProperty を生成"],"ko":["Nest CLI 플러그인을 사용하여 API 문서 자동화","버전 관리를 위해 별도의 Swagger 문서 유지","DTO 및 응답 유형에 대한 @ApiProperty 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la documentación de la API con el plugin de Nest CLI","Mantener documentos de Swagger separados para la gestión de versiones","Generar @ApiProperty para DTO y tipos de respuesta"],"fr":["Automatiser la documentation de l''API avec le plugin Nest CLI","Maintenir des documents Swagger distincts pour la gestion de versions","Générer @ApiProperty pour les DTO et les types de réponse"],"de":["Automatisieren der API-Dokumentation mit dem Nest-CLI-Plugin","Separate Swagger-Dokumente für die Versionierung aufrechterhalten","Generieren von @ApiProperty für DTOs und Antworttypen"],"pt":["Automatizar documentação de API com Plug-in do Nest CLI","Manter documentos Swagger separados para controle de versão","Gerar @ApiProperty para DTOs e tipos de resposta"],"ru":["Автоматизировать документацию API с помощью плагина Nest CLI","Сохранять отдельные документы Swagger для управления версиями","Генерировать @ApiProperty для DTO и типов ответа"],"ar":["توليد توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات تلقائيًا بإضافة Nest CLI","الحفاظ على توثيق Swagger منفصل لإدارة الإصدارات","توليد @ApiProperty ل DTOs وأنواع الاستجابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NestJS framework","Needs configuration in nest-cli.json"],"zh":["需要 NestJS 框架","需要在 nest-cli.json 中进行配置"],"ja":["NestJS フレームワークが必要","nest-cli.json で構成が必要"],"ko":["NestJS 프레임워크 필요","nest-cli.json에서 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere el framework de NestJS","Necesita configuración en nest-cli.json"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework NestJS","Nécessite une configuration dans nest-cli.json"],"de":["Benötigt das NestJS-Framework","Benötigt eine Konfiguration in nest-cli.json"],"pt":["Exige estrutura NestJS","Necessita de configuração em nest-cli.json"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка NestJS","Требует конфигурации в nest-cli.json"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار عمل NestJS","يحتاج إلى تكوين في nest-cli.json"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
