,"iOS"],"es":["Uso del framework UserNotifications","Implementación del delegado UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","Solicitud de permisos para notificaciones","Registro para notificaciones remotas en AppDelegate","Gestión de iconos de aplicaciones con badges"],"fr":["Utilisation du framework UserNotifications","Implémentation du délégué UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","Demande d''autorisations pour les notifications","Enregistrement pour les notifications à distance dans AppDelegate","Gestion des icônes d''applications avec des badges"],"de":["Verwendung des Frameworks UserNotifications","Implementierung des Delegaten UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","Anforderung von Berechtigungen für Benachrichtigungen","Registrierung für Remote-Benachrichtigungen in AppDelegate","Verwaltung von App-Symbolen mit Badges"],"pt":["Implementação do framework UserNotifications","Gerenciamento de permissões de notificação","Registro de notificações remotas via APNs","Manipulação de ícones de aplicativos","Implementação do delegate UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"],"ru":["Реализация фреймворка UserNotifications","Управление разрешениями на уведомления","Регистрация удаленных уведомлений через APNs","Управление иконками приложений","Реализация делегата UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"],"ar":["تنفيذ إطار UserNotifications","التعامل مع الأذونات لإشعارات","التسجيل لإشعارات عن بعد عبر APNs","التعامل مع أيقونات التطبيقات","تنفيذ تفويض UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","UserNotifications","APNs","iOS","iOS","iOS"],"ja":["iOS","UserNotifications","APNs","iOS","iOS","iOS"],"ko":["iOS","UserNotifications","APNs","iOS","iOS","iOS"],"es":["notificaciones iOS","UserNotifications","APNs","desarrollo de aplicaciones iOS","programación de notificaciones","mejores prácticas para notificaciones"],"fr":["notifications iOS","UserNotifications","APNs","développement d''applications iOS","programmation de notifications","meilleures pratiques pour les notifications"],"de":["iOS-Benachrichtigungen","UserNotifications","APNs","Entwicklung von iOS-Anwendungen","Programmierung von Benachrichtigungen","Best Practices für Benachrichtigungen"],"pt":["notificações ios","usernotifications","apns","desenvolvimento ios","notificações push","permissões de notificação","ícones de aplicativos"],"ru":["уведомления ios","usernotifications","apns","разработка ios","push-уведомления","разрешения на уведомления","иконки приложений"],"ar":["إشعارات ios","usernotifications","apns","تطوير ios","إشعارات push","أذونات إشعارات","أيقونات التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iOS Notifications","description":"Push notifications for iOS using UserNotifications framework and APNS.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Notifications\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nPush notifications using UserNotifications framework and APNs.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Framework**: Use `UserNotifications` for all notification handling.\n- **Delegate**: Implement `UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate` for foreground & tap handling.\n- **Permissions**: Request `.alert`, `.badge`, `.sound` after priming the user.\n- **APNs**: Register for remote notifications in `AppDelegate`.\n- **Badges**: Manage app icon badges manually (set to 0 to c","body":"# iOS Notifications\n\n## **Priority: P2 (OPTIONAL)**\n\nPush notifications using UserNotifications framework and APNs.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Framework**: Use `UserNotifications` for all notification handling.\n- **Delegate**: Implement `UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate` for foreground & tap handling.\n- **Permissions**: Request `.alert`, `.badge`, `.sound` after priming the user.\n- **APNs**: Register for remote notifications in `AppDelegate`.\n- **Badges**: Manage app icon badges manually (set to 0 to clear).\n\n[Implementation Details](references/implementation.md)\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No Unconditional Requests**: Explain value proposition before system dialog.\n- **No Missing Delegate**: Notifications won''t trigger foreground callbacks without it.\n- **No Forgotten Badge Clear**: User frustration increases if badges persist.\n\n## Related Topics\n\nios-navigation | ios-design-system | mobile-ux-core\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:37.004Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","zh":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","ja":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","ko":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","es":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","fr":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","de":"Ideal for iOS Development Agents tasked with implementing robust push notification systems.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS encarregados de implementar sistemas de notificações por push robustos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS, задачей которых является реализация надежных систем push-уведомлений.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التطوير لآي أو إس المكلفين بتنفيذ أنظمة الإشعارات القوية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","zh":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","ja":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","ko":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","es":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","fr":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","de":"Enables direct implementation of the UserNotifications framework, handling APNs registration, delegate setup for foreground and tap interactions, and proper badge management. Provides the agent with the complete technical workflow for iOS notification integration.","pt":"Permite a implementação direta do framework UserNotifications, tratando o registro do APNs, configuração de delegado para interações em primeiro plano e toque, e gerenciamento adequado de distintivos. Fornece ao agente o fluxo de trabalho técnico completo para integração de notificação do iOS.","ru":"Позволяет直接 реализовать фреймворк UserNotifications, обрабатывая регистрацию APNs, настройку делегата для взаимодействий в foreground и tap, и надлежащее управление значками. Предоставляет агенту полный технический рабочий процесс для интеграции уведомлений iOS.","ar":"تمكن من تنفيذ إطار=UserNotifications مباشرة، معالجة التسجيل في خدمة APNs، وإعداد تفويض للتفاعلات في الأمام وتفاعلات اللمس، وإدارة شارات مناسبة. يوفر للوكيل تدفق العمل التقني الكامل لتكامل الإشعارات في نظام آي أو إس."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"zh":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"ja":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"ko":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"es":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"fr":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"de":["Implementing UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate methods","Requesting user notification permissions (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registering for remote notifications in AppDelegate"],"pt":["Implementar métodos do UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","Solicitar permissões de notificação do usuário (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Registrar notificações remotas no AppDelegate"],"ru":["Реализация методов UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","Запрос разрешений на уведомления пользователя (.alert, .badge, .sound)","Регистрация удаленных уведомлений в AppDelegate"],"ar":["تنفيذ أساليب UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","طلب разрешات إشعار المستخدم (.alert, .badge, .sound)","تسجيل الإشعارات عن بعد في AppDelegate"]},"limitations":{"en":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"zh":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"ja":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"ko":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"es":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"fr":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"de":["iOS platform only","Requires manual badge count management","Depends on APNs (Apple Push Notification service)"],"pt":["Plataforma iOS apenas","Exige gerenciamento manual de contagem de distintivos","Depende do serviço de notificação por push da Apple (APNs)"],"ru":["Только платформа iOS","Требует ручного управления счетчиком значков","Зависит от сервиса push-уведомлений Apple (APNs)"],"ar":["منصة آي أو إس فقط","يتطلب إدارة يدوية لعدد الشارات","يعتمد على خدمة الإشعارات القوية من آبل (APNs)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Next.js Authentication', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Next.js Authentication', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:26:33.841Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Next.js Authentication","name":"Next.js Authentication","description":{"zh":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","ja":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","ko":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","es":"La autenticación en Next.js es crucial para la seguridad de tus aplicaciones. Aprende a hacerlo correctamente.","fr":"L''authentification dans Next.js est essentielle pour la sécurité de vos applications. Apprenez à le faire correctement.","de":"Die Authentifizierung in Next.js ist für die Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen von entscheidender Bedeutung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es richtig machen.","pt":"Autenticação Next.js é uma coleção de habilidades e práticas recomendadas para segurança e desenvolvimento de aplicações web. Aprenda a proteger suas aplicações com autenticação segura.","ru":"Аутентификация Next.js — это коллекция навыков и рекомендуемых практик для безопасности и разработки веб-приложений. Узнайте, как защитить свои приложения с помощью безопасной аутентификации.","ar":"التحقق من الصحة في Next.js هو مجموعة من المهارات والممارسات الموصى بها لأمان وتطوير تطبيقات الويب. تعلم كيف تحمي تطبيقاتك بالتحقق من الصحة الآمن","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Next.js ","ja":"Next.js","ko":"Next.js ","es":"Autenticación en Next.js","fr":"Authentification Next.js","de":"Next.js Authentifizierung","pt":"Autenticação Next.js: Melhores Práticas","ru":"Аутентификация Next.js: Лучшие Практики","ar":"التحقق من الصحة في Next.js: أفضل الممارسات","en":"Next.js Authentication"},"description":{"zh":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","ja":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","ko":"Next.js, HttpOnly Cookies, ","es":"La autenticación en Next.js es crucial para la seguridad de tus aplicaciones. Aprende a hacerlo correctamente.","fr":"L''authentification dans Next.js est essentielle pour la sécurité de vos applications. Apprenez à le faire correctement.","de":"Die Authentifizierung in Next.js ist für die Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen von entscheidender Bedeutung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es richtig machen.","pt":"Autenticação Next.js é uma coleção de habilidades e práticas recomendadas para segurança e desenvolvimento de aplicações web. Aprenda a proteger suas aplicaç...","ru":"Аутентификация Next.js — это коллекция навыков и рекомендуемых практик для безопасности и разработки веб-приложений. Узнайте, как защитить свои приложения с ...","ar":"التحقق من الصحة في Next.js هو مجموعة من المهارات والممارسات الموصى بها لأمان وتطوير تطبيقات الويب. تعلم كيف تحمي تطبيقاتك بالتحقق من الصحة الآمن","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure"],"ja":["HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure"],"ko":["HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure"],"es":["Almacenamiento de tokens con cookies HttpOnly","Protección de rutas con middleware","Lectura de tokens en componentes del servidor","Configuración de cookies seguras","Implementación de autenticación en Next.js"],"fr":["Stockage de jetons avec des cookies HttpOnly","Protection des routes avec du middleware","Lecture de jetons dans les composants serveur","Configuration de cookies sécurisés","Mise en œuvre de l''authentification dans Next.js"],"de":["Token-Speicherung mit HttpOnly-Cookies","Schutz von Routen mit Middleware","Lese-Token in Server-Komponenten","Konfiguration von sicheren Cookies","Implementierung der Authentifizierung in Next.js"],"pt":["Uso de cookies HttpOnly para armazenamento de tokens","Leitura de tokens em componentes do servidor via cookies().get()","Proteção de rotas em middleware","Implementação de autenticação segura com Next.js","Melhores práticas para desenvolvimento de aplicações web seguras"],"ru":["Использование файлов cookie HttpOnly для хранения токенов","Чтение токенов в серверных компонентах через cookies().get()","Защита маршрутов в middleware","Реализация безопасной аутентификации с помощью Next.js","Лучшие практики для разработки безопасных веб-приложений"],"ar":["استخدام ملفات تعريف الارتباط HttpOnly لتخزين الرموز","قراءة الرموز في مكونات الخادم عبر cookies().get()","حماية المسارات في middleware","تنفيذ التحقق من الصحة الآمن باستخدام Next.js","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات الويب الآمنة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","Next.js","HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure","Next.js"],"ja":["Next.js","Next.js","HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure","Next.js"],"ko":["Next.js","Next.js","HttpOnly Cookies","cookies().set()","cookies().get()","middleware","sameSite","secure","Next.js"],"es":["autenticación next.js","seguridad en next.js","cookies httpOnly","middleware en next.js","protección de rutas","lectura de tokens","configuración de cookies seguras"],"fr":["authentification next.js","sécurité dans next.js","cookies httpOnly","middleware dans next.js","protection des routes","lecture de jetons","configuration de cookies sécurisés"],"de":["authentifizierung next.js","sicherheit in next.js","httpOnly-cookies","middleware in next.js","schutz von routen","lese-token","konfiguration von sicheren cookies"],"pt":["autenticação next.js","segurança de aplicações web","armazenamento de tokens","cookies httpOnly","desenvolvimento de aplicações web seguras","melhores práticas de segurança"],"ru":["аутентификация next.js","безопасность веб-приложений","хранение токенов","файлы cookie httpOnly","разработка безопасных веб-приложений","лучшие практики безопасности"],"ar":["التحقق من الصحة في next.js","أمان تطبيقات الويب","تخزين الرموز","ملفات تعريف الارتباط httpOnly","تطوير تطبيقات الويب الآمنة","أفضل الممارسات للأمان"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Next.js Authentication","description":"Secure token storage (HttpOnly Cookies) and Middleware patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Authentication & Token Management\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\nUse **HttpOnly Cookies** for token storage. **Never** use LocalStorage.\n\n## Key Rules\n\n1. **Storage**: Use `cookies().set()` with `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true`, `sameSite: ''lax''`. (Reference: [Setting Tokens](references/auth-implementation.md))\n2. **Access**: Read tokens in Server Components via `cookies().get()`. (Reference: [Reading Tokens](references/auth-implementation.md))\n3. **Protection**: Guard routes in `middleware.","body":"# Authentication & Token Management\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\nUse **HttpOnly Cookies** for token storage. **Never** use LocalStorage.\n\n## Key Rules\n\n1. **Storage**: Use `cookies().set()` with `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true`, `sameSite: ''lax''`. (Reference: [Setting Tokens](references/auth-implementation.md))\n2. **Access**: Read tokens in Server Components via `cookies().get()`. (Reference: [Reading Tokens](references/auth-implementation.md))\n3. **Protection**: Guard routes in `middleware.ts` before rendering. (Reference: [Middleware Protection](references/auth-implementation.md))\n\n## Anti-Pattern: LocalStorage\n\n- **Security Risk**: Vulnerable to XSS.\n- **Performance Hit**: Incompatible with Server Components (RSC). Forces client hydration and causes layout shift.\n\n## Related Topics\n\ncommon/security-standards | server-components | app-router\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:26:33.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents requiring secure Next.js authentication and token management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要安全的Next.js身份验证和令牌管理功能的Web开发代理。","ja":"Next.jsの安全な認証およびトークン管理機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"보안이 필요한 Next.js 인증 및 토큰 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Web que requieren autenticación segura de Next.js y capacidades de administración de tokens.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une authentification sécurisée Next.js et des capacités de gestion de jetons.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine sichere Next.js-Authentifizierung und Token-Management-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento web que exigem autenticação segura do Next.js e capacidades de gerenciamento de tokens.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих безопасной аутентификации Next.js и возможностей управления токенами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الويب الذي يتطلب مصادقة Next.js آمنة وقدرات إدارة الرموز"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely store tokens using HttpOnly Cookies with `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true`, and `sameSite: ''lax''` settings, while protecting routes with middleware and accessing tokens via `cookies().get()` in Server Components.","zh":"赋予代理安全地使用HttpOnly Cookies存储令牌的能力，使用`httpOnly: true`、`secure: true`和`sameSite: ''lax''`设置，同时使用中间件保护路由并通过`cookies().get()`在服务器组件中访问令牌。","ja":"エージェントがHttpOnly Cookiesを使用してトークンを安全に保存できるようにし、`httpOnly: true`、`secure: true`、`sameSite: ''lax''`設定を使用して、ミドルウェアでルートを保護し、サーバーコンポーネントで`cookies().get()`を介してトークンにアクセスします。","ko":"에이전트가 HttpOnly 쿠키를 사용하여 토큰을 안전하게 저장할 수 있도록 하며, `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true`, `sameSite: ''lax''` 설정을 사용하여 미들웨어로 라우트를 보호하고 서버 컴포넌트에서 `cookies().get()`을 통해 토큰에 액세스합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a almacenar tokens de forma segura utilizando Cookies HttpOnly con configuraciones `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true` y `sameSite: ''lax''`, mientras protege las rutas con middleware y accede a los tokens a través de `cookies().get()` en componentes del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker des jetons de manière sécurisée en utilisant des cookies HttpOnly avec des paramètres `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true` et `sameSite: ''lax''`, tout en protégeant les routes avec un middleware et en accédant aux jetons via `cookies().get()` dans les composants serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Token sicher mithilfe von HttpOnly-Cookies mit den Einstellungen `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true` und `sameSite: ''lax''` zu speichern, während Routen mit Middleware geschützt und Token über `cookies().get()` in Serverkomponenten zugegriffen werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar tokens de forma segura usando Cookies HttpOnly com configurações `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true` e `sameSite: ''lax''`, enquanto protege rotas com middleware e acessa tokens via `cookies().get()` em Componentes de Servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно хранить токены, используя Cookies HttpOnly с настройками `httpOnly: true`, `secure: true` и `sameSite: ''lax''`, при этом защищая маршруты с помощью middleware и получая доступ к токенам через `cookies().get()` в серверных компонентах.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تخزين الرموز بشكل آمن باستخدام ملفات تعريف الارتباط HttpOnly مع إعدادات `httpOnly: true` و `secure: true` و `sameSite: ''lax''` ، في حين يحمي المسارات باستخدام middleware ويصل إلى الرموز عبر `cookies().get()` في مكونات الخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure token storage with HttpOnly Cookies","Guarding routes with middleware for protected access","Reading tokens in Server Components for authenticated requests"],"zh":["使用HttpOnly Cookies实现安全的令牌存储","使用中间件保护路由以实现受保护的访问","在服务器组件中读取令牌以进行身份验证请求"],"ja":["HttpOnly Cookiesを使用した安全なトークンストレージの実装","ミドルウェアでルートを保護して保護されたアクセスを実現","サーバーコンポーネントでトークンを読み取って認証済みリクエストを実行"],"ko":["HttpOnly 쿠키를 사용하여 보안 토큰 저장을 구현하는 것","미들웨어로 라우트를 보호하여 보호된 액세스를 구현하는 것","서버 컴포넌트에서 토큰을 읽어 인증된 요청을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Implementar un almacenamiento de tokens seguro con Cookies HttpOnly","Proteger rutas con middleware para un acceso protegido","Leer tokens en componentes del servidor para solicitudes autenticadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un stockage de jetons sécurisé avec des cookies HttpOnly","Protéger les routes avec un middleware pour un accès protégé","Lire les jetons dans les composants serveur pour des requêtes authentifiées"],"de":["Ein sicheres Token-Speichern mit HttpOnly-Cookies implementieren","Routen mit Middleware für einen geschützten Zugriff schützen","Token in Serverkomponenten für authentifizierte Anfragen lesen"],"pt":["Implementar armazenamento de token seguro com Cookies HttpOnly","Proteger rotas com middleware para acesso protegido","Ler tokens em Componentes de Servidor para solicitações autenticadas"],"ru":["Реализация безопасного хранения токенов с помощью Cookies HttpOnly","Охрана маршрутов с помощью middleware для защищенного доступа","Чтение токенов в серверных компонентах для аутентифицированных запросов"],"ar":["تنفيذ تخزين رموز آمن باستخدام ملفات تعريف الارتباط HttpOnly","حماية المسارات باستخدام middleware للوصول المحمي","قراءة الرموز في مكونات الخادم لطلبات مصادقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js framework","Must use HttpOnly Cookies for token storage","LocalStorage cannot be used for token storage"],"zh":["需要Next.js框架","必须使用HttpOnly Cookies进行令牌存储","无法使用LocalStorage进行令牌存储"],"ja":["Next.jsフレームワークを必要とする","トークン保存にHttpOnly Cookiesを使用する必要がある","ローカルストレージを使用してトークンを保存できない"],"ko":["Next.js 프레임워크가 필요함","토큰 저장에 HttpOnly 쿠키를 사용해야 함","로컬 스토리지를 사용하여 토큰을 저장할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere el framework Next.js","Debe utilizar Cookies HttpOnly para el almacenamiento de tokens","No se puede utilizar LocalStorage para el almacenamiento de tokens"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Next.js","Doit utiliser des cookies HttpOnly pour le stockage de jetons","Le LocalStorage ne peut pas être utilisé pour le stockage de jetons"],"de":["Benötigt das Next.js-Framework","Muss HttpOnly-Cookies für die Token-Speicherung verwenden","LocalStorage kann nicht für die Token-Speicherung verwendet werden"],"pt":["Exige framework Next.js","Deve usar Cookies HttpOnly para armazenamento de token","LocalStorage não pode ser usado para armazenamento de token"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Next.js","Должен использовать Cookies HttpOnly для хранения токенов","LocalStorage не может быть использован для хранения токенов"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Next.js","يجب استخدام ملفات تعريف الارتباط HttpOnly لتخزين الرموز","لا يمكن استخدام المحلية للخزن لتخزين الرموز"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('axiomhq/cli/explore-dataset', 'community', 'axiomhq', 'cli', 'axiomhq/cli', 'explore-dataset', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:27:23.652Z', NULL, '{"id":"axiomhq/cli/explore-dataset","name":"explore-dataset","description":{"es":"El sistema de exploración de conjuntos de datos de Axiom te permite entender la estructura y el contenido de tus datos. Descubre cómo funciona.","fr":"Le système d''exploration de jeux de données d''Axiom vous permet de comprendre la structure et le contenu de vos données. Découvrez comment cela fonctionne.","de":"Das Datenmengen-Explorationssystem von Axiom ermöglicht es Ihnen, die Struktur und den Inhalt Ihrer Daten zu verstehen. Erfahren Sie, wie es funktioniert.","pt":"O explore-dataset é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para explorar conjuntos de dados Axiom, descobrindo sua estrutura e conteúdo.","ru":"Explore-dataset - это инструмент командной строки для изучения наборов данных Axiom, позволяющий обнаружить их структуру и содержание.","ar":"استكشاف-مجموعة-البيانات هو أداة سطر أوامر لاستكشاف مجموعات بيانات إكسوم، لاكتشاف بنيتها ومحتواها.","en":"The power of Axiom on the command line."},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Explorar Conjuntos de Datos con Axiom","fr":"Explorer les Jeux de Données avec Axiom","de":"Datenmengen mit Axiom erkunden","pt":"Explorar Conjunto de Dados Axiom","ru":"Изучение набора данных Axiom","ar":"استكشاف مجموعة بيانات إكسوم","en":"explore-dataset"},"description":{"es":"El sistema de exploración de conjuntos de datos de Axiom te permite entender la estructura y el contenido de tus datos. Descubre cómo funciona.","fr":"Le système d''exploration de jeux de données d''Axiom vous permet de comprendre la structure et le contenu de vos données. Découvrez comment cela fonctionne.","de":"Das Datenmengen-Explorationssystem von Axiom ermöglicht es Ihnen, die Struktur und den Inhalt Ihrer Daten zu verstehen. Erfahren Sie, wie es funktioniert.","pt":"O explore-dataset é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para explorar conjuntos de dados Axiom, descobrindo sua estrutura e conteúdo.","ru":"Explore-dataset - это инструмент командной строки для изучения наборов данных Axiom, позволяющий обнаружить их структуру и содержание.","ar":"استكشاف-مجموعة-البيانات هو أداة سطر أوامر لاستكشاف مجموعات بيانات إكسوم، لاكتشاف بنيتها ومحتواها.","en":"The power of Axiom on the command line."},"definition":{"en":"The power of Axiom on the command line."},"features":{"es":["Exploración sistemática de conjuntos de datos","Descubrimiento de esquemas de datos","Lista de conjuntos de datos disponibles","Interfaz de línea de comandos para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Exploration systématique de jeux de données","Découverte de schémas de données","Liste de jeux de données disponibles","Interface de ligne de commande pour une plus grande efficacité"],"de":["Systematische Erkundung von Datenmengen","Entdeckung von Datenmengen-Schemata","Liste der verfügbaren Datenmengen","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Listagem de conjuntos de dados disponíveis","Descoberta de esquema de dados","Exploração de campos e tipos de dados","Comando de linha de comando para facilitar a exploração","Suporte a formato JSON para saída de dados"],"ru":["Список доступных наборов данных","Обнаружение схемы данных","Изучение полей и типов данных","Команда командной строки для упрощения изучения","Поддержка формата JSON для вывода данных"],"ar":["قائمة بالمجموعات المتاحة من البيانات","اكتشاف مخطط بيانات","استكشاف حقول وأنواع البيانات","أمر سطر الأوامر لتسهيل الاستكشاف","دعم تنسيق JSON لإخراج البيانات"]},"keywords":{"es":["exploración de conjuntos de datos","axiom","desarrollo de datos","análisis de datos","ciencia de datos","ingeniería de datos"],"fr":["exploration de jeux de données","axiom","développement de données","analyse de données","science des données","ingénierie de données"],"de":["Datenmengen-Erkundung","axiom","Datenentwicklung","Datenanalyse","Datenwissenschaft","Dateningenieurwesen"],"pt":["explorar conjunto de dados","axiom dataset","comando de linha de comando","descoberta de esquema","exploração de dados","ferramenta de desenvolvedor"],"ru":["изучение набора данных","набор данных axiom","команда командной строки","обнаружение схемы","изучение данных","инструмент для разработчиков"],"ar":["استكشاف مجموعة بيانات","مجموعة بيانات إكسوم","أمر سطر الأوامر","اكتشاف مخطط","استكشاف البيانات","أداة المطور"]}},"owner":"axiomhq","repo":"cli","repoPath":"axiomhq/cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"explore-dataset","description":"Explore an Axiom dataset to understand its schema, fields, volume, and patterns. Use when discovering a new dataset, investigating data structure, or understanding what data is available.","bodyPreview":"# Dataset Exploration\n\nSystematically explore an Axiom dataset to understand its structure, content, and potential use cases.\n\n## Arguments\n\nWhen invoked with a dataset name (e.g., `/explore-dataset logs`), the name is available as `$ARGUMENTS`.\n\n## Exploration Protocol\n\n### 1. List Available Datasets\n\nIf no dataset specified, list what''s available:\n\n```bash\naxiom dataset list -f json\n```\n\n### 2. Schema Discovery\n\n**Always start here.** Discover actual field names and types:\n\n```bash\naxiom query","body":"# Dataset Exploration\n\nSystematically explore an Axiom dataset to understand its structure, content, and potential use cases.\n\n## Arguments\n\nWhen invoked with a dataset name (e.g., `/explore-dataset logs`), the name is available as `$ARGUMENTS`.\n\n## Exploration Protocol\n\n### 1. List Available Datasets\n\nIf no dataset specified, list what''s available:\n\n```bash\naxiom dataset list -f json\n```\n\n### 2. Schema Discovery\n\n**Always start here.** Discover actual field names and types:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | getschema\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Field names and types\n- Dotted fields requiring bracket notation\n- Timestamp fields\n- Key dimensions (service, status, level)\n\n**OTel trace data:** If schema contains `trace_id`, `span_id`, `attributes.*`, note that:\n- Service fields are promoted: use `[''service.name'']` not `[''resource.service.name'']`\n- Custom attributes: `[''attributes.custom''][''field'']` with `tostring()` for aggregations\n- See `axiom-apl` skill''s [OTel reference](../axiom-apl/references/otel.md) for field mappings\n\n### 3. Sample Data\n\nExamine actual values:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | limit 10\" --start-time -1h -f json\n```\n\nLook for:\n- Data structure and relationships\n- Field value formats\n- Data quality issues\n\n### 4. Volume Analysis\n\nUnderstand data volume patterns:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count() by bin(_time, 1h) | sort by _time asc\" --start-time -24h\n```\n\nAnalyze:\n- Event volume over time\n- Data freshness\n- Collection gaps\n\n### 5. Categorical Field Analysis\n\nFor each key categorical field (status, level, service):\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count() by <field> | top 20 by count_\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Value distributions\n- Cardinality\n- Key dimensions for filtering\n\n### 6. Numerical Field Statistics\n\nFor numeric fields (duration, bytes, count):\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count(), min(<field>), max(<field>), avg(<field>), percentiles(<field>, 50, 95, 99)\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\n### 7. Error Pattern Detection\n\nSearch for error indicators:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"search in ([''<dataset>'']) ''error'' or ''fail'' or ''exception'' | limit 20\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide a summary including:\n\n```markdown\n## Dataset Summary: <name>\n\n### Purpose\n<What system generated this data, what it represents>\n\n### Key Fields\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| ... | ... | ... |\n\n### Volume\n- Events per hour: ~X\n- Data freshness: last event at X\n\n### Key Dimensions\n- `status`: 200, 400, 500, ...\n- `service.name`: api, web, worker, ...\n\n### Recommended Queries\n<Common queries for this dataset>\n\n### Monitoring Opportunities\n<What could be alerted on>\n```\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- **Known datasets**: If you already understand the schema, skip exploration and query directly\n- **Quick field check**: Use `getschema` directly for single field lookups\n- **Production queries**: Exploration uses expensive operations (`search`); extract patterns then optimize\n- **Repeated analysis**: Once explored, document findings and reuse—don''t re-explore\n\n## APL Reference\n\nFor query syntax, invoke the `axiom-apl` skill which provides comprehensive documentation on operators, functions, and patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:27:23.652Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing systematic dataset exploration and discovery capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化数据集探索和发现能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが体系的にデータセットを探索し、発見する機能が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 체계적으로 데이터셋을 탐색하고 발견하는 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan capacidades de exploración y descubrimiento de conjuntos de datos sistemáticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin de capacités d''exploration et de découverte de jeux de données systématiques.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die systematische Dataset-Explorations- und Entdeckungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades de exploração e descoberta de conjuntos de dados sistemáticos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы системные возможности поиска и открытия наборов данных.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكالات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات استكشافية ومكتشفة لمجموعات البيانات المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically explore Axiom datasets, discovering their structure and content through commands like `axiom dataset list -f json` and schema discovery using `axiom query`, enabling advanced data understanding and potential use case identification.","zh":"赋予代理系统地探索 Axiom 数据集的能力，通过命令如 `axiom dataset list -f json` 和使用 `axiom query` 的模式发现来发现其结构和内容，从而实现高级数据理解和潜在用例识别。","ja":"エージェントが Axiom データセットを体系的に探索できるようにし、`axiom dataset list -f json` や `axiom query` などのコマンドを使用してその構造と内容を発見し、高度なデータ理解と潜在的なユースケースの特定を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Axiom 데이터셋을 체계적으로 탐색할 수 있도록 하여, `axiom dataset list -f json` 및 `axiom query`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 데이터셋의 구조와 내용을 발견하여 고급 데이터 이해와 잠재적인 사용 사례 식별을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar sistemáticamente los conjuntos de datos de Axiom, descubriendo su estructura y contenido a través de comandos como `axiom dataset list -f json` y descubrimiento de esquemas mediante `axiom query`, lo que permite una comprensión avanzada de los datos y la identificación potencial de casos de uso.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer systématiquement les jeux de données Axiom, en découvrant leur structure et leur contenu grâce à des commandes comme `axiom dataset list -f json` et à la découverte de schémas à l''aide de `axiom query`, ce qui permet une compréhension avancée des données et l''identification potentielle de cas d''utilisation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Axiom-Datensätze systematisch zu erkunden, ihre Struktur und ihren Inhalt durch Befehle wie `axiom dataset list -f json` und Schemenentdeckung mit `axiom query` zu entdecken, was ein erweitertes Datenverständnis und die potenzielle Identifizierung von Einsatzfällen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorarem sistematicamente os conjuntos de dados do Axiom, descobrindo sua estrutura e conteúdo por meio de comandos como `axiom dataset list -f json` e descoberta de esquema usando `axiom query`, permitindo uma compreensão avançada dos dados e identificação potencial de casos de uso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью системного исследования наборов данных Axiom, открывая их структуру и содержание с помощью команд типа `axiom dataset list -f json` и обнаружения схемы с помощью `axiom query`, что позволяет получить углубленное понимание данных и потенциальное определение случаев использования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من استكشاف مجموعات بيانات أكسيوم بشكل منظم، واكتشاف هيكلها ومحتواها من خلال أوامر مثل `axiom dataset list -f json` واكتشاف مخطط باستخدام `axiom query`، مما يسمح بفهم متقدم للبيانات وتحديد حالات استخدام محتملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Exploring available datasets for potential analysis","Discovering field names and types for informed data modeling","Identifying potential use cases for Axiom datasets"],"zh":["探索可用的数据集以进行潜在分析","发现字段名称和类型以进行知情数据建模","识别 Axiom 数据集的潜在用例"],"ja":["利用可能なデータセットを分析するための潜在的な探索","フィールド名とタイプを発見して情報に基づいたデータモデリングを行う","Axiom データセットの潜在的なユースケースを特定する"],"ko":["잠재적인 분석을 위한 사용 가능한 데이터셋 탐색","필드 이름 및 유형을 발견하여 정보에 기반한 데이터 모델링","Axiom 데이터셋의 잠재적인 사용 사례 식별"],"es":["Explorar los conjuntos de datos disponibles para un análisis potencial","Descubrir nombres y tipos de campos para un modelado de datos informado","Identificar casos de uso potenciales para los conjuntos de datos de Axiom"],"fr":["Explorer les jeux de données disponibles pour une analyse potentielle","Découvrir les noms et les types de champs pour un modelage de données éclairé","Identifier les cas d''utilisation potentiels pour les jeux de données Axiom"],"de":["Verfügbare Datensätze für eine potenzielle Analyse erkunden","Feldnamen und -typen für ein informiertes Datenmodellieren entdecken","Potenzielle Einsatzfälle für Axiom-Datensätze identifizieren"],"pt":["Explorar conjuntos de dados disponíveis para análise potencial","Descobrir nomes e tipos de campos para modelagem de dados informada","Identificar casos de uso potenciais para conjuntos de dados do Axiom"],"ru":["Изучение доступных наборов данных для потенциального анализа","Обнаружение имен и типов полей для информированного моделирования данных","Определение потенциальных случаев использования наборов данных Axiom"],"ar":["استكشاف مجموعات البيانات المتاحة للتحليل المحتمل","اكتشاف أسماء وأنواع الحقول لتوجيه نمذجة البيانات","تحديد حالات استخدام محتملة لمجموعات بيانات أكسيوم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Axiom dataset access","Command-line interface dependency"],"zh":["需要 Axiom 数据集访问","依赖于命令行接口"],"ja":["Axiom データセットへのアクセスが必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスへの依存"],"ko":["Axiom 데이터셋 액세스가 필요함","명령줄 인터페이스 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los conjuntos de datos de Axiom","Dependencia de la interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux jeux de données Axiom","Dépendance de l''interface en ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Axiom-Datensätze","Abhängigkeit von der Kommandozeilenoberfläche"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao conjunto de dados do Axiom","Dependência da interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к набору данных Axiom","Зависимость от командной строки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مجموعة بيانات أكسيوم","اعتماد واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rohunj/claude-build-workflow/prd', 'community', 'rohunj', 'claude-build-workflow', 'rohunj/claude-build-workflow', 'prd', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:27:35.438Z', NULL, '{"id":"rohunj/claude-build-workflow/prd","name":"prd","description":{"zh":"prd自动化工作流是一个用于生成详细产品需求文档的工具，通过提问和回答来创建结构化的文档","ja":"prd自動化ワークフローは、詳細な製品要件文書を生成するツールです。質問と回答を通じて構造化された文書を作成","ko":"prd 자동화 워크플로는 자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성하는 도구입니다. 질문과 답변을 통해 구조화된 문서를 생성","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos para implementación. Automatiza flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con Claude Code","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis pour mise en œuvre. Automatisez les flux de travail de développement avec Claude Code","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt klare und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente für Implementierung. Automatisiert Entwicklungsworkflows mit Claude Code","pt":"O gerador de PRD da Claude Code cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e açãoaveis para implementação. Basta descrever o que você deseja e responder a perguntas essenciais","ru":"Генератор ПРД от Claude Code создает подробные и действенные документы требований продукта для реализации. Просто опишите, что вы хотите, и ответьте на важные вопросы","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج من كلود كود ينشئ مستندات متطلبات المنتج مفصلة وقابلة للتنفيذ. اخبرنا ما تريد وانشئ مستندات متطلبات المنتج بسهولة","en":"Automated workflow for building apps with Claude Code. Describe what you want, answer questions, let it build autonomously."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"prd自动化工作流","ja":"prd自動化ワークフロー","ko":"prd 자동화 워크플로","es":"Generador de PRD: Automatiza flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","fr":"Générateur de PRD : Automatisez les flux de travail de dé...","de":"PRD-Generator: Automatisieren Sie Entwicklungsworkflows","pt":"Gerador de PRD: Crie Documentos de Requisitos de Produto ...","ru":"Генератор ПРД: Создавайте автоматические документы требов...","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج: انشئ مستندات متطلبات المنتج تلقائيا","en":"prd"},"description":{"zh":"prd自动化工作流是一个用于生成详细产品需求文档的工具，通过提问和回答来创建结构化的文档","ja":"prd自動化ワークフローは、詳細な製品要件文書を生成するツールです。質問と回答を通じて構造化された文書を作成","ko":"prd 자동화 워크플로는 자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성하는 도구입니다. 질문과 답변을 통해 구조화된 문서를 생성","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos para implementación. Automatiza flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con Claude Code","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis pour mise en œuvre. Automatisez les flux de travail de développement av...","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt klare und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente für Implementierung. Automatisiert Entwicklungsworkflows mit Claude Code","pt":"O gerador de PRD da Claude Code cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e açãoaveis para implementação. Basta descrever o que você deseja e respo...","ru":"Генератор ПРД от Claude Code создает подробные и действенные документы требований продукта для реализации. Просто опишите, что вы хотите, и ответьте на важны...","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج من كلود كود ينشئ مستندات متطلبات المنتج مفصلة وقابلة للتنفيذ. اخبرنا ما تريد وانشئ مستندات متطلبات المنتج بسهولة","en":"Automated workflow for building apps with Claude Code. Describe what you want, answer questions, let it build autonomously."},"definition":{"en":"Automated workflow for building apps with Claude Code. Describe what you want, answer questions, let it build autonomously."},"features":{"zh":["自动化工作流","详细产品需求文档","结构化文档","快速生成","自主构建"],"ja":["自動化ワークフロー","詳細な製品要件文書","構造化された文書","迅速な生成","自主的な構築"],"ko":["자동화 워크플로","자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서","구조화된 문서","빠른 생성","자율적인 구축"],"es":["Crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados","Automatiza flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con Claude Code","Preguntas de aclaración para garantizar la precisión","Genera documentos en formato Markdown","Guarda documentos en una ubicación especificada"],"fr":["Crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés","Automatisez les flux de travail de développement avec Claude Code","Questions de clarification pour garantir la précision","Génère des documents au format Markdown","Enregistre les documents dans un emplacement spécifié"],"de":["Erstellt detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente","Automatisiert Entwicklungsworkflows mit Claude Code","Klärungsfragen für die Gewährleistung der Genauigkeit","Erstellt Dokumente im Markdown-Format","Speichert Dokumente an einem bestimmten Speicherort"],"pt":["Criação de documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados","Perguntas essenciais para esclarecer requisitos","Geração de PRD automatizada","Salvar em formato Markdown","Integração com a plataforma Claude Code"],"ru":["Создание подробных документов требований продукта","Важные вопросы для уточнения требований","Автоматическая генерация ПРД","Сохранение в формате Markdown","Интеграция с платформой Claude Code"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج مفصلة","أسئلة أساسية لتوضيح المتطلبات","إنشاء تلقائي لمواصفات المنتج","حفظ بالتنسيق Markdown","التكامل مع منصة كلود كود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["prd","自动化工作流","产品需求文档","结构化文档","快速生成","自主构建","软件开发"],"ja":["prd","自動化ワークフロー","製品要件文書","構造化された文書","迅速な生成","自主的な構築","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["prd","자동화 워크플로","제품 요구 사항 문서","구조화된 문서","빠른 생성","자율적인 구축","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["generador de PRD","automatización de flujos de trabajo","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Claude Code","documentos de requisitos de producto","Markdown"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","automatisation des flux de travail","développement d''applications","Claude Code","documents de spécifications de produit","Markdown"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Automatisierung von Entwicklungsworkflows","Anwendungsentwicklung","Claude Code","Produktanforderungsdokumente","Markdown"],"pt":["gerador de PRD","documentos de requisitos de produto","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Claude Code","automatização de processos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["генератор ПРД","документы требований продукта","разработка приложений","Claude Code","автоматизация процессов","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مولد مواصفات المنتج","مستندات متطلبات المنتج","تطوير التطبيقات","كلود كود","أتمتة العمليات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"rohunj","repo":"claude-build-workflow","repoPath":"rohunj/claude-build-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt i","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:27:35.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated Product Requirements Document generation with Claude Code.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Claude Code 自动生成产品需求文档的开发代理","ja":"Claude Code を使用して自動的に製品要件文書を生成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Claude Code를 사용하여 제품 요구 사항 문서를 자동 생성해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una generación automática de documentos de requisitos de producto con Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de documents de spécifications de produit avec Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Produktanforderungsdokumenten mit Claude Code benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração automática de Documento de Requisitos de Produto com Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация документа требований к продукту с использованием Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى توليد تلقائي لوثائق متطلبات المنتج باستخدام Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on user input, utilizing Markdown formatting and generating files in the `.md` format, all while ensuring clarity and actionability through essential clarifying questions.","zh":"赋予代理创建详细的产品需求文档的能力，基于用户输入，利用 Markdown 格式，并生成 `.md` 格式的文件，同时通过必要的澄清问题确保清晰度和可行性","ja":"ユーザーの入力に基づいて詳細な製品要件文書を作成し、Markdown 形式を使用し、`.md` 形式のファイルを生成し、同時に重要なクリアリング質問を通じて明確性と実行可能性を確保する","ko":"사용자 입력을 기반으로 자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Markdown 형식을 사용하고 `.md` 형식의 파일을 생성하며, 동시에 필수적인澄清 질문을 통해 명확성과 실행 가능성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear PRD detallados en función de la entrada del usuario, utilizando formato Markdown y generando archivos en el formato `.md`, asegurando al mismo tiempo claridad y capacidad de actuación a través de preguntas esenciales de aclaración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des PRD détaillés en fonction de la saisie utilisateur, en utilisant le formatage Markdown et en générant des fichiers au format `.md`, tout en assurant la clarté et la capacité d''action grâce à des questions essentielles de clarification.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, detaillierte PRD auf der Grundlage der Benutzereingabe zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Formatierung und Erstellung von Dateien im `.md`-Format, während gleichzeitig durch wesentliche Klärungsfragen Klarheit und Handhabbarkeit sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar PRDs detalhados com base na entrada do usuário, utilizando formatação Markdown e gerando arquivos no formato `.md`, garantindo clareza e capacidade de ação por meio de perguntas essenciais de esclarecimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные документы требований к продукту на основе ввода пользователя, используя форматирование Markdown и генерируя файлы в формате `.md`, обеспечивая при этом ясность и возможность действий благодаря вопросам, уточняющим суть.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة بناءً على مدخلات المستخدم، باستخدام تنسيق Markdown وتوليد الملفات بامتداد `.md`، مع ضمان الوضوح وقابلية العمل من خلال أسئلة توضيح أساسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new app features","Automating workflow for building apps with Claude Code","Creating structured documents for development teams"],"zh":["为新应用功能生成产品需求文档","使用 Claude Code 构建应用程序的自动化工作流","为开发团队创建结构化文档"],"ja":["新しいアプリ機能の製品要件文書を生成","Claude Code を使用してアプリケーションを構築する自動化ワークフロー","開発チームのための構造化ドキュメントを作成"],"ko":["새로운 애플리케이션 기능에 대한 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","Claude Code를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 자동화된 워크플로","개발 팀을 위한 구조화된 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de PRD para nuevas características de aplicaciones","Automatización del flujo de trabajo para la creación de aplicaciones con Claude Code","Creación de documentos estructurados para equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Génération de PRD pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités d''applications","Automatisation du workflow pour la création d''applications avec Claude Code","Création de documents structurés pour les équipes de développement"],"de":["Generierung von PRD für neue App-Funktionen","Automatisierung des Arbeitsablaufs für die Erstellung von Apps mit Claude Code","Erstellung von strukturierten Dokumenten für Entwicklungsteams"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para recursos de aplicativos novos","Automação do fluxo de trabalho para construção de aplicativos com Claude Code","Criação de documentos estruturados para equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для новых функций приложений","Автоматизация рабочего процесса по созданию приложений с использованием Claude Code","Создание структурированных документов для команд разработки"],"ar":["توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج لملحقات التطبيقات الجديدة","تحسين سير العمل لإنشاء التطبيقات باستخدام Claude Code","إنشاء وثائق منسقة للفرق التطويرية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not implement features, only generates PRD","Requires user input for feature description and answering clarifying questions"],"zh":["不实现功能，只生成产品需求文档","需要用户输入以描述功能并回答澄清问题"],"ja":["機能を実装せず、製品要件文書のみを生成","機能の説明とクリアリング質問に回答するためにユーザーの入力が必要"],"ko":["기능을 구현하지 않고 제품 요구 사항 문서만 생성","기능을 설명하고 澄清 질문에 답변하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요"],"es":["No implementa características, solo genera PRD","Requiere la entrada del usuario para la descripción de las características y la respuesta a preguntas de aclaración"],"fr":["N''implémente pas les fonctionnalités, ne génère que le PRD","Nécessite la saisie utilisateur pour la description des fonctionnalités et la réponse aux questions de clarification"],"de":["Implementiert keine Funktionen, generiert nur PRD","Benötigt die Benutzereingabe für die Funktionsbeschreibung und die Beantwortung von Klärungsfragen"],"pt":["Não implementa recursos, gera apenas PRD","Requer entrada do usuário para descrição de recursos e resposta a perguntas de esclarecimento"],"ru":["Не реализует функции, только генерирует документ требований к продукту","Требует ввода пользователя для описания функций и ответов на вопросы, уточняющие суть"],"ar":["لا يطبق الميزات، بل يولد فقط وثائق متطلبات المنتج","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصف الميزات والاستجابة للأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
