a DAGs e plugins personalizados","Integração com ambientes locais","Suporte a testes e configurações"],"ru":["Инициализация проектов Airflow с помощью Astro CLI","Создание структуры проекта","Поддержка пользовательских DAG и плагинов","Интеграция с локальными средами","Поддержка тестирования и конфигураций"],"ar":["التحديث الأولي لمشاريع Airflow باستخدام Astro CLI","إنشاء هيكل المشروع","دعم DAGs والملحقات المخصصة","التكامل مع البيئات المحلية","دعم الاختبارات والتعريفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Astro 项目设置","Airflow 项目初始化","数据工程工作流","Astro CLI","DAG 文件管理","自定义 Airflow 插件","测试文件管理","数据工程工具"],"ja":["Astro プロジェクト設定","Airflow プロジェクト初期化","データエンジニアリングのワークフロー","Astro CLI","DAG ファイル管理","カスタム Airflow プラグイン","テストファイル管理","データエンジニアリングツール"],"ko":["Astro 프로젝트 설정","Airflow 프로젝트 초기화","데이터 엔지니어링 워크플로우","Astro CLI","DAG 파일 관리","사용자 정의 Airflow 플러그인","테스트 파일 관리","데이터 엔지니어링 도구"],"es":["astro project","airflow","ingeniería de datos","cli","proyectos de airflow","configuración de proyectos","dags","plugins","entornos locales"],"fr":["astro project","airflow","ingénierie de données","cli","projets airflow","configuration de projets","dags","plugins","environnements locaux"],"de":["astro project","airflow","datenengineering","cli","airflow-projekte","projektKonfiguration","dags","plugins","lokale umgebungen"],"pt":["Astro","Airflow","Engenharia de dados","Projeto Astro","Astro CLI","DAGs","Plugins personalizados","Ambientes locais"],"ru":["Astro","Airflow","Инженерия данных","Проект Astro","Astro CLI","DAG","Пользовательские плагины","Локальные среды"],"ar":["Astro","Airflow","هندسة البيانات","مشروع Astro","Astro CLI","DAGs","الملحقات المخصصة","البيئات المحلية"]}},"owner":"astronomer","repo":"agents","repoPath":"astronomer/agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setting-up-astro-project","description":"Initialize and configure Astro/Airflow projects. Use when the user wants to create a new project, set up dependencies, configure connections/variables, or understand project structure. For running the local environment, see managing-astro-local-env.","bodyPreview":"# Astro Project Setup\n\nThis skill helps you initialize and configure Airflow projects using the Astro CLI.\n\n> **To run the local environment**, see the **managing-astro-local-env** skill.\n> **To write DAGs**, see the **authoring-dags** skill.\n\n---\n\n## Initialize a New Project\n\n```bash\nastro dev init\n```\n\nCreates this structure:\n```\nproject/\n├── dags/                # DAG files\n├── include/             # SQL, configs, supporting files\n├── plugins/             # Custom Airflow plugins\n├── tests/","body":"# Astro Project Setup\n\nThis skill helps you initialize and configure Airflow projects using the Astro CLI.\n\n> **To run the local environment**, see the **managing-astro-local-env** skill.\n> **To write DAGs**, see the **authoring-dags** skill.\n\n---\n\n## Initialize a New Project\n\n```bash\nastro dev init\n```\n\nCreates this structure:\n```\nproject/\n├── dags/                # DAG files\n├── include/             # SQL, configs, supporting files\n├── plugins/             # Custom Airflow plugins\n├── tests/               # Unit tests\n├── Dockerfile           # Image customization\n├── packages.txt         # OS-level packages\n├── requirements.txt     # Python packages\n└── airflow_settings.yaml # Connections, variables, pools\n```\n\n---\n\n## Adding Dependencies\n\n### Python Packages (requirements.txt)\n\n```\napache-airflow-providers-snowflake==5.3.0\npandas==2.1.0\nrequests>=2.28.0\n```\n\n### OS Packages (packages.txt)\n\n```\ngcc\nlibpq-dev\n```\n\n### Custom Dockerfile\n\nFor complex setups (private PyPI, custom scripts):\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM quay.io/astronomer/astro-runtime:12.4.0\n\nRUN pip install --extra-index-url https://pypi.example.com/simple my-package\n```\n\n**After modifying dependencies:** Run `astro dev restart`\n\n---\n\n## Configuring Connections & Variables\n\n### airflow_settings.yaml\n\nLoaded automatically on environment start:\n\n```yaml\nairflow:\n  connections:\n    - conn_id: my_postgres\n      conn_type: postgres\n      host: host.docker.internal\n      port: 5432\n      login: user\n      password: pass\n      schema: mydb\n\n  variables:\n    - variable_name: env\n      variable_value: dev\n\n  pools:\n    - pool_name: limited_pool\n      pool_slot: 5\n```\n\n### Export/Import\n\n```bash\n# Export from running environment\nastro dev object export --connections --file connections.yaml\n\n# Import to environment\nastro dev object import --connections --file connections.yaml\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validate Before Running\n\nParse DAGs to catch errors without starting the full environment:\n\n```bash\nastro dev parse\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **managing-astro-local-env**: Start, stop, and troubleshoot the local environment\n- **authoring-dags**: Write and validate DAGs (uses MCP tools)\n- **testing-dags**: Test DAGs (uses MCP tools)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:27:47.302Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Engineering Agents needing streamlined Airflow project setup and configuration using the Astro CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Astro CLI 进行 Airflow 项目设置和配置的数据工程 Agent。","ja":"Astro CLI を使用して Airflow プロジェクトを設定および構成する必要があるデータエンジニアリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Astro CLI를 사용하여 Airflow 프로젝트를 설정하고 구성해야 하는 데이터 엔지니어링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Ingeniería de Datos que necesitan una configuración y configuración de proyectos de Airflow simplificadas utilizando la CLI de Astro.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie de données ayant besoin d''une configuration et d''une installation de projets Airflow simplifiées à l''aide de la CLI Astro.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Engineering-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Airflow-Projektinstallation und -konfiguration mit der Astro-CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia de Dados que precisam de configuração e instalação de projetos Airflow simplificados usando o Astro CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инженерии данных, которым требуется упрощенная настройка и конфигурация проектов Airflow с использованием Astro CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل هندسة البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد مشاريع Airflow المبسطة وتكوينها باستخدام Astro CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initialize and configure Airflow projects, creating a structured environment with DAG files, SQL configurations, and custom plugins, all managed through the Astro CLI and compatible with Airflow workflows.","zh":"赋予代理初始化和配置 Airflow 项目的能力，创建一个结构化的环境，包括 DAG 文件、SQL 配置和自定义插件，所有这些都通过 Astro CLI 管理，并与 Airflow 工作流兼容。","ja":"エージェントに Airflow プロジェクトを初期化および構成する能力を与え、DAG ファイル、SQL 構成、カスタム プラグインを含む構造化された環境を作成し、すべてを Astro CLI で管理し、Airflow ワークフローと互換性があります。","ko":"에이전트가 Airflow 프로젝트를 초기화하고 구성할 수 있도록 해주며, DAG 파일, SQL 구성 및 사용자 정의 플러그인을 포함하는 구조화된 환경을 생성하여 Astro CLI에서 관리하고 Airflow 워크플로와 호환됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inicializar y configurar proyectos de Airflow, creando un entorno estructurado con archivos DAG, configuraciones SQL y plugins personalizados, todos gestionados a través de la CLI de Astro y compatibles con flujos de trabajo de Airflow.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initialiser et de configurer des projets Airflow, créant un environnement structuré avec des fichiers DAG, des configurations SQL et des plug-ins personnalisés, tous gérés via la CLI Astro et compatibles avec les flux de travail Airflow.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Airflow-Projekte zu initialisieren und zu konfigurieren, und erstellt so eine strukturierte Umgebung mit DAG-Dateien, SQL-Konfigurationen und benutzerdefinierten Plug-ins, die alle über die Astro-CLI verwaltet werden und mit Airflow-Workflows kompatibel sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inicializar e configurar projetos Airflow, criando um ambiente estruturado com arquivos DAG, configurações SQL e plugins personalizados, todos gerenciados por meio do Astro CLI e compatíveis com fluxos de trabalho Airflow.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициализации и конфигурации проектов Airflow, создавая структурированную среду с файлами DAG, конфигурациями SQL и пользовательскими плагинами, все управляемые через Astro CLI и совместимые с рабочими процессами Airflow.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من 초기ته وتكوين مشاريع Airflow، مما يخلق بيئة منظمة مع ملفات DAG وضبط SQL والإضافات المخصصة، وكلها يتم إدارتها من خلال Astro CLI ومتوافقة مع سير عمل Airflow."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new Airflow projects with predefined structures","Configuring local environments for Astro project development","Setting up custom Airflow plugins and workflows"],"zh":["使用预定义结构初始化新的 Airflow 项目","配置 Astro 项目开发的本地环境","设置自定义 Airflow 插件和工作流"],"ja":["事前に定義された構造を使用して新しい Airflow プロジェクトを初期化する","Astro プロジェクト開発のローカル環境を構成する","カスタム Airflow プラグインとワークフローを設定する"],"ko":["사전에 정의된 구조를 사용하여新的 Airflow 프로젝트를 초기화하는 것","Astro 프로젝트 개발을 위한 로컬 환경을 구성하는 것","사용자 정의 Airflow 플러그인 및 워크플ロー 설정"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos de Airflow con estructuras predefinidas","Configuración de entornos locales para el desarrollo de proyectos Astro","Configuración de plugins y flujos de trabajo personalizados de Airflow"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets Airflow avec des structures prédéfinies","Configuration d''environnements locaux pour le développement de projets Astro","Configuration de plug-ins et de flux de travail personnalisés Airflow"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Airflow-Projekte mit vordefinierten Strukturen","Konfiguration von lokalen Umgebungen für die Entwicklung von Astro-Projekten","Einrichtung benutzerdefinierter Airflow-Plugins und Workflows"],"pt":["Inicialização de novos projetos Airflow com estruturas predefinidas","Configuração de ambientes locais para desenvolvimento de projetos Astro","Configuração de plugins e fluxos de trabalho Airflow personalizados"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов Airflow с предопределенными структурами","Настройка локальных сред для разработки проектов Astro","Настройка пользовательских плагинов и рабочих процессов Airflow"],"ar":["تchází مشاريع Airflow الجديدة مع الهياكل المحددة مسبقا","ضبط البيئات المحلية لتطوير مشاريع Astro","تكوين الإضافات وسير عمل Airflow المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Astro CLI installation","Airflow project compatibility only","Dependent on managing-astro-local-env and authoring-dags skills for full functionality"],"zh":["需要安装 Astro CLI","仅兼容 Airflow 项目","需要管理 astro 本地环境和编写 DAG 的技能来实现全部功能"],"ja":["Astro CLI のインストールが必要","Airflow プロジェクトのみとの互換性","全機能を実現するには、astro ローカル環境の管理と DAG の作成スキルが必要"],"ko":["Astro CLI 설치가 필요합니다","Airflow 프로젝트와의 호환성만 지원","전체 기능을 구현하려면 로컬 환경 관리 및 DAG 작성 기술이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de Astro","Compatibilidad solo con proyectos de Airflow","Dependiente de las habilidades managing-astro-local-env y authoring-dags para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI Astro","Compatibilité uniquement avec les projets Airflow","Dépend des compétences managing-astro-local-env et authoring-dags pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der Astro-CLI","Kompatibilität nur mit Airflow-Projekten","Abhängig von den Fähigkeiten managing-astro-local-env und authoring-dags für die vollständige Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Astro CLI","Compatibilidade de projeto Airflow apenas","Dependente das habilidades managing-astro-local-env e authoring-dags para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требуется установка Astro CLI","Совместимость только с проектами Airflow","Зависит от навыков managing-astro-local-env и authoring-dags для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Astro CLI","متوافق مع مشاريع Airflow فقط","يعتمد على مهارات managing-astro-local-env و authoring-dags للوظيفة الكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('astronomer/agents/tracing-upstream-lineage', 'community', 'astronomer', 'agents', 'astronomer/agents', 'tracing-upstream-lineage', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z', '2026-02-18T02:27:53.122Z', NULL, '{"id":"astronomer/agents/tracing-upstream-lineage","name":"tracing-upstream-lineage","description":{"zh":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 是一种 AI 工具，用于追溯数据源，优化数据工程工作流","ja":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage はデータ源を追跡する AI ツールです。データエンジニアリングワークフローを最適化","ko":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 는 데이터 원천을 추적하는 AI 도구로 데이터 엔지니어링 워크플ロー 최적화","es":"El rastreo de linaje ascendente es una herramienta de ingeniería de datos que ayuda a identificar el origen de los datos","fr":"La traçabilité de la lignée amont est un outil d''ingénierie de données qui aide à identifier l''origine des données","de":"Die Nachverfolgung der Ursprungslinie ist ein Datenengineering-Tool, das hilft, den Ursprung der Daten zu identifizieren","pt":"O tracing-upstream-lineage é uma ferramenta de engenharia de dados que ajuda a investigar a origem dos dados, permitindo identificar as fontes e a linhagem de dados","ru":"Tracing-upstream-lineage - это инструмент для инженерии данных, который помогает расследовать происхождение данных, позволяя определить источники и происхождение данных","ar":"tracing-upstream-lineage هو أداة هندسة بيانات تساعد في التحقيق في مصدر البيانات، مما يسمح بالتحديد مصادر وأصل البيانات","en":"AI agent tooling for data engineering workflows."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"数据源追溯：Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 技术","ja":"データの源流を追跡：Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","ko":"데이터 원천 추적: Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 기술","es":"Rastreo de linaje ascendente: Herramientas de ingeniería ...","fr":"Traçage de la lignée amont : Outils d''ingénierie de données","de":"Nachverfolgung der Ursprungslinie: Datenengineering-Tools","pt":"Rastreando Linhagem de Dados com Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","ru":"Отслеживание Происхождения Данных с Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","ar":"تتبع مصدر البيانات مع Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","en":"tracing-upstream-lineage"},"description":{"zh":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 是一种 AI 工具，用于追溯数据源，优化数据工程工作流","ja":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage はデータ源を追跡する AI ツールです。データエンジニアリングワークフローを最適化","ko":"Tracing-Upstream-Lineage 는 데이터 원천을 추적하는 AI 도구로 데이터 엔지니어링 워크플ロー 최적화","es":"El rastreo de linaje ascendente es una herramienta de ingeniería de datos que ayuda a identificar el origen de los datos","fr":"La traçabilité de la lignée amont est un outil d''ingénierie de données qui aide à identifier l''origine des données","de":"Die Nachverfolgung der Ursprungslinie ist ein Datenengineering-Tool, das hilft, den Ursprung der Daten zu identifizieren","pt":"O tracing-upstream-lineage é uma ferramenta de engenharia de dados que ajuda a investigar a origem dos dados, permitindo identificar as fontes e a linhagem d...","ru":"Tracing-upstream-lineage - это инструмент для инженерии данных, который помогает расследовать происхождение данных, позволяя определить источники и происхожд...","ar":"tracing-upstream-lineage هو أداة هندسة بيانات تساعد في التحقيق في مصدر البيانات، مما يسمح بالتحديد مصادر وأصل البيانات","en":"AI agent tooling for data engineering workflows."},"definition":{"en":"AI agent tooling for data engineering workflows."},"features":{"zh":["追溯数据源","优化数据工程工作流","支持表、列、DAG 跟踪","提供数据源信息","支持 Airflow DAG"],"ja":["データの源流を追跡","データエンジニアリングワークフローを最適化","テーブル、列、DAG の追跡をサポート","データ源情報を提供","Airflow DAG をサポート"],"ko":["데이터 원천 추적","데이터 엔지니어링 워크플ロー 최적화","테이블, 열, DAG 추적 지원","데이터 원천 정보 제공","Airflow DAG 지원"],"es":["Identificación del tipo de objeto a rastrear","Búsqueda de DAGs por nombre","Análisis de la linaje ascendente de tablas y columnas","Integración con Airflow","Seguimiento de la linaje ascendente de DAGs"],"fr":["Identification du type d''objet à traçer","Recherche de DAGs par nom","Analyse de la lignée amont des tables et des colonnes","Intégration avec Airflow","Suivi de la lignée amont des DAGs"],"de":["Identifizierung des zu verfolgenden Objekttyps","Suche nach DAGs nach Namen","Analyse der Ursprungslinie von Tabellen und Spalten","Integration mit Airflow","Verfolgung der Ursprungslinie von DAGs"],"pt":["Identificação da origem dos dados","Investigação da linhagem de dados","Rastreamento de tabelas e colunas","Integração com Airflow DAGs","Pesquisa de DAGs por nome","Análise de dados para identificar fontes"],"ru":["Определение происхождения данных","Расследование происхождения данных","Отслеживание таблиц и столбцов","Интеграция с Airflow DAGs","Поиск DAGs по имени","Анализ данных для определения источников"],"ar":["تحديد مصدر البيانات","التحقيق في أصل البيانات","تتبع الجداول والأعمدة","التكامل مع Airflow DAGs","البحث عن DAGs بالاسم","تحليل البيانات لتحديد المصادر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据源追溯","Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","数据工程","AI 工具","数据源信息","Airflow DAG"],"ja":["データの源流","Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","データエンジニアリング","AI ツール","データ源情報","Airflow DAG"],"ko":["데이터 원천 추적","Tracing-Upstream-Lineage","데이터 엔지니어링","AI 도구","데이터 원천 정보","Airflow DAG"],"es":["rastreo de linaje ascendente","ingeniería de datos","Airflow","DAGs","linaje de datos","orígenes de datos","análisis de datos","herramientas de datos"],"fr":["traçage de la lignée amont","ingénierie de données","Airflow","DAGs","lignée de données","origines de données","analyse de données","outils de données"],"de":["Nachverfolgung der Ursprungslinie","Datenengineering","Airflow","DAGs","Datenlinie","Ursprünge von Daten","Datenanalyse","Daten-Tools"],"pt":["tracing-upstream-lineage","engenharia de dados","linha de dados","rastreamento de dados","Airflow DAGs","investigação de dados","análise de dados","fontes de dados","data engineering"],"ru":["tracing-upstream-lineage","инженерия данных","происхождение данных","отслеживание данных","Airflow DAGs","расследование данных","анализ данных","источники данных","data engineering"],"ar":["tracing-upstream-lineage","هندسة البيانات","مصدر البيانات","تتبع البيانات","Airflow DAGs","تحقيق في البيانات","تحليل البيانات","مصادر البيانات","data engineering"]}},"owner":"astronomer","repo":"agents","repoPath":"astronomer/agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tracing-upstream-lineage","description":"Trace upstream data lineage. Use when the user asks where data comes from, what feeds a table, upstream dependencies, data sources, or needs to understand data origins.","bodyPreview":"# Upstream Lineage: Sources\n\nTrace the origins of data - answer \"Where does this data come from?\"\n\n## Lineage Investigation\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Target Type\n\nDetermine what we''re tracing:\n- **Table**: Trace what populates this table\n- **Column**: Trace where this specific column comes from\n- **DAG**: Trace what data sources this DAG reads from\n\n### Step 2: Find the Producing DAG\n\nTables are typically populated by Airflow DAGs. Find the connection:\n\n1. **Search DAGs by name**: Use `af dags l","body":"# Upstream Lineage: Sources\n\nTrace the origins of data - answer \"Where does this data come from?\"\n\n## Lineage Investigation\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Target Type\n\nDetermine what we''re tracing:\n- **Table**: Trace what populates this table\n- **Column**: Trace where this specific column comes from\n- **DAG**: Trace what data sources this DAG reads from\n\n### Step 2: Find the Producing DAG\n\nTables are typically populated by Airflow DAGs. Find the connection:\n\n1. **Search DAGs by name**: Use `af dags list` and look for DAG names matching the table name\n   - `load_customers` -> `customers` table\n   - `etl_daily_orders` -> `orders` table\n\n2. **Explore DAG source code**: Use `af dags source <dag_id>` to read the DAG definition\n   - Look for INSERT, MERGE, CREATE TABLE statements\n   - Find the target table in the code\n\n3. **Check DAG tasks**: Use `af tasks list <dag_id>` to see what operations the DAG performs\n\n### Step 3: Trace Data Sources\n\nFrom the DAG code, identify source tables and systems:\n\n**SQL Sources** (look for FROM clauses):\n```python\n# In DAG code:\nSELECT * FROM source_schema.source_table  # <- This is an upstream source\n```\n\n**External Sources** (look for connection references):\n- `S3Operator` -> S3 bucket source\n- `PostgresOperator` -> Postgres database source\n- `SalesforceOperator` -> Salesforce API source\n- `HttpOperator` -> REST API source\n\n**File Sources**:\n- CSV/Parquet files in object storage\n- SFTP drops\n- Local file paths\n\n### Step 4: Build the Lineage Chain\n\nRecursively trace each source:\n\n```\nTARGET: analytics.orders_daily\n    ^\n    +-- DAG: etl_daily_orders\n            ^\n            +-- SOURCE: raw.orders (table)\n            |       ^\n            |       +-- DAG: ingest_orders\n            |               ^\n            |               +-- SOURCE: Salesforce API (external)\n            |\n            +-- SOURCE: dim.customers (table)\n                    ^\n                    +-- DAG: load_customers\n                            ^\n                            +-- SOURCE: PostgreSQL (external DB)\n```\n\n### Step 5: Check Source Health\n\nFor each upstream source:\n- **Tables**: Check freshness with the **checking-freshness** skill\n- **DAGs**: Check recent run status with `af dags stats`\n- **External systems**: Note connection info from DAG code\n\n## Lineage for Columns\n\nWhen tracing a specific column:\n\n1. Find the column in the target table schema\n2. Search DAG source code for references to that column name\n3. Trace through transformations:\n   - Direct mappings: `source.col AS target_col`\n   - Transformations: `COALESCE(a.col, b.col) AS target_col`\n   - Aggregations: `SUM(detail.amount) AS total_amount`\n\n## Output: Lineage Report\n\n### Summary\nOne-line answer: \"This table is populated by DAG X from sources Y and Z\"\n\n### Lineage Diagram\n```\n[Salesforce] --> [raw.opportunities] --> [stg.opportunities] --> [fct.sales]\n                        |                        |\n                   DAG: ingest_sfdc         DAG: transform_sales\n```\n\n### Source Details\n\n| Source | Type | Connection | Freshness | Owner |\n|--------|------|------------|-----------|-------|\n| raw.orders | Table | Internal | 2h ago | data-team |\n| Salesforce | API | salesforce_conn | Real-time | sales-ops |\n\n### Transformation Chain\nDescribe how data flows and transforms:\n1. Raw data lands in `raw.orders` via Salesforce API sync\n2. DAG `transform_orders` cleans and dedupes into `stg.orders`\n3. DAG `build_order_facts` joins with dimensions into `fct.orders`\n\n### Data Quality Implications\n- Single points of failure?\n- Stale upstream sources?\n- Complex transformation chains that could break?\n\n### Related Skills\n- Check source freshness: **checking-freshness** skill\n- Debug source DAG: **debugging-dags** skill\n- Trace downstream impacts: **tracing-downstream-lineage** skill\n- Add manual lineage annotations: **annotating-task-lineage** skill\n- Build custom lineage extractors: **creating-openlineage-extractors** skill\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:27:53.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Engineering Agents needing advanced upstream lineage tracing capabilities for Airflow DAGs and data sources","zh":"非常适合需要高级上游血统追踪功能的数据工程代理，用于Airflow DAG和数据源","ja":"Airflow DAGおよびデータソースの高度な上流ライナンス追跡機能を必要とするデータエンジニアリングエージェントに最適","ko":"Airflow DAG 및 데이터 소스에 대한 고급 업스트림 계보 추적 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터 엔지니어링 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Ingeniería de Datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de trazado de linaje ascendente para DAGs de Airflow y fuentes de datos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie de données nécessitant des capacités de traçage de lignée ascendante avancées pour les DAGs Airflow et les sources de données","de":"Perfekt für Data-Engineering-Agents, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Nachverfolgung der Herkunft von Airflow-DAGs und Datenquellen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia de Dados que precisam de capacidades avançadas de rastreamento de linhagem upstream para DAGs do Airflow e fontes de dados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инженерии данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности отслеживания происхождения данных вверх по потоку для DAG Airflow и источников данных","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسيين للبيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتتبع النسب المتبقية لجداول وعمليات DAGs في Airflow ومصادر البيانات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate data origins by tracing table, column, and DAG lineage, utilizing Airflow DAG connections and search functionality to identify producing DAGs and data sources","zh":"使代理能够通过追踪表、列和DAG血统，利用Airflow DAG连接和搜索功能来识别产生DAG和数据源","ja":"エージェントがテーブル、列、DAGのライナンスを追跡し、Airflow DAG接続と検索機能を利用してデータを生成するDAGとデータソースを識別できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 테이블, 열 및 DAG 계보를 추적하여 Airflow DAG 연결 및 검색 기능을 사용하여 데이터를 생성하는 DAG 및 데이터 소스를 식별할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a investigar los orígenes de los datos trazando la linaje de tablas, columnas y DAGs, utilizando las conexiones de DAGs de Airflow y la funcionalidad de búsqueda para identificar los DAGs y fuentes de datos productores","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enquêter sur les origines des données en traçant la lignée des tables, des colonnes et des DAGs, en utilisant les connexions DAG Airflow et la fonctionnalité de recherche pour identifier les DAGs et les sources de données producteurs","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Ursprünge der Daten zu untersuchen, indem sie die Herkunft von Tabellen, Spalten und DAGs nachverfolgen, wobei sie die Airflow-DAG-Verbindungen und die Suchfunktion nutzen, um die produzierenden DAGs und Datenquellen zu identifizieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar as origens dos dados, rastreando a linhagem de tabelas, colunas e DAGs, utilizando as conexões do DAG do Airflow e a funcionalidade de pesquisa para identificar os DAGs e fontes de dados produtoras","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расследовать происхождение данных путем отслеживания происхождения таблиц, столбцов и DAG, используя соединения DAG Airflow и функцию поиска для определения производящих DAG и источников данных","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقيق في مصادر البيانات عن طريق تتبع نسب الجداول والأعمدة و DAGs، باستخدام الاتصالات DAGs في Airflow ووظيفة البحث لتحديد DAGs ومصادر البيانات المنتجة"},"useCases":{"en":["Tracing data sources for tables and columns","Identifying producing Airflow DAGs for data lineage","Debugging data pipelines by investigating upstream data origins"],"zh":["追踪表和列的数据源","识别数据血统的产生Airflow DAG","通过调查上游数据起源来调试数据管道"],"ja":["テーブルと列のデータソースを追跡する","データライナンスの生成DAGを識別する","データパイプラインをデバッグするために上游のデータ起源を調査する"],"ko":["테이블 및 열의 데이터 소스를 추적","데이터 계보의 생성 DAG 식별","데이터 파이프라인을 디버깅하기 위해 업스트림 데이터 起源을 조사"],"es":["Trazar las fuentes de datos para tablas y columnas","Identificar los DAGs de Airflow productores para la linaje de datos","Depurar las tuberías de datos investigando los orígenes de datos ascendentes"],"fr":["Traçer les sources de données pour les tables et les colonnes","Identifier les DAGs Airflow producteurs pour la lignée des données","Déboguer les pipelines de données en enquêtant sur les origines de données ascendantes"],"de":["Nachverfolgung der Datenquellen für Tabellen und Spalten","Identifizierung der produzierenden Airflow-DAGs für die Datenherkunft","Fehlersuche in Datenpipelines durch Untersuchung der Datenursprünge"],"pt":["Rastrear fontes de dados para tabelas e colunas","Identificar DAGs do Airflow produtoras para linhagem de dados","Depurar pipelines de dados, investigando as origens de dados upstream"],"ru":["Отслеживать источники данных для таблиц и столбцов","Определить производящие DAG Airflow для происхождения данных","Отладить конвейеры данных, расследуя происхождение данных вверх по потоку"],"ar":["تتبع مصادر البيانات للجداول والأعمدة","تحديد DAGs في Airflow التي تنتج بيانات لنسب البيانات","تصحيح خطأ أنابيب البيانات عن طريق التحقيق في مصادر البيانات المتبقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Airflow DAG access and search functionality","Limited to tracing lineage for tables, columns, and DAGs"],"zh":["需要Airflow DAG访问和搜索功能","仅限于追踪表、列和DAG的血统"],"ja":["Airflow DAGアクセスと検索機能が必要","テーブル、列、DAGのライナンスの追跡のみ"],"ko":["Airflow DAG 액세스 및 검색 기능이 필요","테이블, 열 및 DAG의 계보 추적만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a DAGs de Airflow y funcionalidad de búsqueda","Limitado al trazado de linaje para tablas, columnas y DAGs"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux DAGs Airflow et une fonctionnalité de recherche","Limité au traçage de la lignée pour les tables, les colonnes et les DAGs"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Airflow-DAGs und Suchfunktion","Begrenzt auf die Nachverfolgung der Herkunft für Tabellen, Spalten und DAGs"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao DAG do Airflow e funcionalidade de pesquisa","Limitado ao rastreamento de linhagem para tabelas, colunas e DAGs"],"ru":["Требует доступа к DAG Airflow и функции поиска","Ограничен отслеживанием происхождения для таблиц, столбцов и DAG"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى DAGs في Airflow ووظيفة البحث","محدود لتتبع النسب للجداول والأعمدة و DAGs"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
