 acceso a datos en Spring Boot con JPA, Hibernate y técnicas de consulta avanzadas","fr":"Apprenez à optimiser l''accès aux données dans Spring Boot avec JPA, Hibernate et des techniques de requête avancées","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Datenzugriff in Spring Boot mit JPA, Hibernate und erweiterten Abfrage-Techniken optimieren","pt":"Acesso a dados eficiente com Spring Boot, utilizando JPA, Hibernate e técnicas de otimização de consultas","ru":"Эффективный доступ к данным с помощью Spring Boot, используя JPA, Hibernate и методы оптимизации запросов","ar":"وصول فعال إلى البيانات باستخدام سبرينج بوت، باستخدام JPA و Hibernate وتقنيات تحسين الاستعلامات","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["JPA & Hibernate","","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"ja":["JPA & Hibernate","","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"ko":["JPA & Hibernate","","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"es":["Implementación de JPA y Hibernate","Uso de Java Records para consultas de solo lectura","Paginación con Pageable","Detección de problemas de carga diferida con Open-In-View","Optimización de consultas para evitar el problema N+1"],"fr":["Implémentation de JPA et Hibernate","Utilisation de Java Records pour les requêtes en lecture seule","Pagination avec Pageable","Détection des problèmes de chargement différé avec Open-In-View","Optimisation des requêtes pour éviter le problème N+1"],"de":["Implementierung von JPA und Hibernate","Verwendung von Java Records für Lese-Abfragen","Seitenaufteilung mit Pageable","Früherkennung von Lazy-Loading-Problemen mit Open-In-View","Optimierung von Abfragen zur Vermeidung des N+1-Problems"],"pt":["Utilização de JPA e Hibernate","Otimização de consultas com JOIN e pagination","Uso de Java Records para consultas somente leitura","Desabilitação de open-in-view para detectar problemas de lazy loading","Uso de @Transactional para controlar transações"],"ru":["Использование JPA и Hibernate","Оптимизация запросов с JOIN и pagination","Использование Java Records для запросов только для чтения","Отключение open-in-view для обнаружения проблем с lazy loading","Использование @Transactional для управления транзакциями"],"ar":["استخدام JPA و Hibernate","تحسين الاستعلامات باستخدام JOIN و pagination","استخدام سجلات Java للاستعلامات القراءة فقط","تعطيل open-in-view للكشف عن مشاكل تحميل الكسول","استخدام @Transactional للتحكم في المعاملات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Java Records"],"ja":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Java Records"],"ko":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Java Records"],"es":["Spring Boot","acceso a datos","JPA","Hibernate","optimización de consultas","Java Records","Pageable","Open-In-View","problema N+1"],"fr":["Spring Boot","accès aux données","JPA","Hibernate","optimisation des requêtes","Java Records","Pageable","Open-In-View","problème N+1"],"de":["Spring Boot","Datenzugriff","JPA","Hibernate","Abfrage-Optimierung","Java Records","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1-Problem"],"pt":["Spring Boot","Acesso a dados","JPA","Hibernate","Otimização de consultas","Java Records","Transactional","Lazy loading"],"ru":["Spring Boot","Доступ к данным","JPA","Hibernate","Оптимизация запросов","Java Records","Transactional","Lazy loading"],"ar":["سبرينج بوت","وصول بيانات","JPA","Hibernate","تحسين الاستعلامات","سجلات Java","Transactional","تحميل الكسول"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Spring Boot Data Access","description":"Best practices for JPA, Hibernate, and Database interactions in Spring Boot","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Data Access\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### JPA & Hibernate\n\n- **Read-Only**: Default to `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` on Services. Override only on write methods.\n- **Projections**: Use Java Records for read-only queries. Avoid fetching full Entities.\n- **Pagination**: ALWAYS use `Pageable` for collections.\n- **Open-In-View**: Set `spring.jpa.open-in-view=false` to detect lazy loading issues early.\n\n### Query Optimization\n\n- **N+1 Problem**: Use `JOIN F","body":"# Spring Boot Data Access\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### JPA & Hibernate\n\n- **Read-Only**: Default to `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` on Services. Override only on write methods.\n- **Projections**: Use Java Records for read-only queries. Avoid fetching full Entities.\n- **Pagination**: ALWAYS use `Pageable` for collections.\n- **Open-In-View**: Set `spring.jpa.open-in-view=false` to detect lazy loading issues early.\n\n### Query Optimization\n\n- **N+1 Problem**: Use `JOIN FETCH` (JPQL) or `@EntityGraph` for relationships.\n- **Bulk Operations**: Use `@Modifying` for batch updates/deletes to bypass Entity overhead.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **N+1 Selects**: `**No loops in loops**: Fetch eagerly or use graphs.`\n- **Logic in Queries**: `**No complex JPQL**: Use Service logic.`\n- **Returning Streams**: `**No raw Streams**: Use Lists or Page.`\n\n## References\n\n- [Implementation Examples](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:01.208Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based AI Agents requiring efficient data access and management using Spring Boot","zh":"适用于需要使用Spring Boot进行高效数据访问和管理的Java基于AI代理","ja":"Spring Bootを使用して効率的なデータアクセスと管理を必要とするJavaベースのAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"스프링 부트를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 액세스 및 관리가 필요한 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Java que requieren un acceso y gestión de datos eficientes utilizando Spring Boot","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java nécessitant un accès et une gestion de données efficaces à l''aide de Spring Boot","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die einen effizienten Datenzugriff und Datenmanagement mit Spring Boot benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Java que exigem acesso e gerenciamento de dados eficientes usando Spring Boot","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих эффективного доступа и управления данными с помощью Spring Boot","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية القائمة على جافا التي تتطلب الوصول والتحكم الفعّالين في البيانات باستخدام Spring Boot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize data retrieval using JPA and Hibernate, with features like read-only transactions, Java Records for projections, and pagination with Pageable, while detecting lazy loading issues early by setting spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","zh":"赋予代理优化数据检索的能力，使用JPA和Hibernate，具有只读事务、Java Records用于投影以及分页功能，并通过设置spring.jpa.open-in-view=false提早检测懒加载问题","ja":"エージェントにデータの取得を最適化する能力を与え、JPAとHibernateを使用し、読み取り専用トランザクション、投影用のJava Records、ページ化機能などを提供し、spring.jpa.open-in-view=falseを設定して遅延ロードの問題を早期に検出します","ko":"에이전트에 데이터 검색을 최적화 할 수있는 기능을 부여하여 JPA 및 Hibernate를 사용하고 읽기 전용 트랜잭션, 프로젝션용 자바 레코드, 페이지 기능 등을 제공하며 spring.jpa.open-in-view=false를 설정하여 지연 로딩 문제를 조기에 탐지합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar la recuperación de datos utilizando JPA y Hibernate, con características como transacciones de solo lectura, registros de Java para proyecciones y paginación con Pageable, mientras se detectan problemas de carga diferida temprano estableciendo spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser la récupération de données en utilisant JPA et Hibernate, avec des fonctionnalités comme des transactions en lecture seule, des enregistrements Java pour les projections et la pagination avec Pageable, tout en détectant les problèmes de chargement différé tôt en définissant spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Datenerfassung mithilfe von JPA und Hibernate zu optimieren, mit Funktionen wie schreibgeschützten Transaktionen, Java-Records für Projektionen und Paginierung mit Pageable, während Probleme mit der verzögerten Laden frühzeitig erkannt werden, indem spring.jpa.open-in-view=false festgelegt wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem a recuperação de dados usando JPA e Hibernate, com recursos como transações somente leitura, Registros Java para projeções e paginação com Pageable, enquanto detecta problemas de carregamento lento precocemente definindo spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать извлечение данных с помощью JPA и Hibernate, с функциями, такими как операции только для чтения, записи Java для проекций и постраничный вывод с помощью Pageable, а также обнаруживает проблемы с ленивой загрузкой на ранней стадии, задавая spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين استرجاع البيانات باستخدام JPA و Hibernate، مع ميزات مثل المعاملات القرائية فقط، وسجلات جافا للمسودات، وتنقّل الصفحات مع Pageable، في حين يكتشف مشاكل التحميل الكسول مبكرًا عن طريق تعيين spring.jpa.open-in-view=false"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing read-only transactions with @Transactional(readOnly = true) for services","Optimizing queries using JOIN FETCH to avoid the N+1 problem","Improving data access performance by using Java Records for read-only queries"],"zh":["使用@Transactional(readOnly = true)为服务实现只读事务","使用JOIN FETCH优化查询以避免1 + N问题","使用Java Records优化读取数据的性能"],"ja":["サービスに@Transactional(readOnly = true)を使用して読み取り専用トランザクションを実装する","JOIN FETCHを使用してクエリを最適化し、1 + N問題を回避する","Java Recordsを使用して読み取りデータのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["서비스에 @Transactional(readOnly = true)를 사용하여 읽기 전용 트랜잭션을 구현한다","JOIN FETCH를 사용하여 쿼리를 최적화하여 1 + N 문제를 피한다","자바 레코드를 사용하여 읽기 전용 쿼리의 성능을 개선한다"],"es":["Implementar transacciones de solo lectura con @Transactional(readOnly = true) para servicios","Optimizar consultas utilizando JOIN FETCH para evitar el problema N+1","Mejorar el rendimiento de acceso a datos utilizando registros de Java para consultas de solo lectura"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des transactions en lecture seule avec @Transactional(readOnly = true) pour les services","Optimiser les requêtes en utilisant JOIN FETCH pour éviter le problème N+1","Améliorer les performances d''accès aux données en utilisant des enregistrements Java pour les requêtes en lecture seule"],"de":["Implementieren von schreibgeschützten Transaktionen mit @Transactional(readOnly = true) für Dienste","Optimieren von Abfragen unter Verwendung von JOIN FETCH, um das N+1-Problem zu vermeiden","Verbesserung der Datenzugriffsleistung durch Verwendung von Java-Records für schreibgeschützte Abfragen"],"pt":["Implementação de transações somente leitura com @Transactional(readOnly = true) para serviços","Otimização de consultas usando JOIN FETCH para evitar o problema N+1","Melhoria do desempenho de acesso a dados usando Registros Java para consultas somente leitura"],"ru":["Реализация операций только для чтения с помощью @Transactional(readOnly = true) для сервисов","Оптимизация запросов с помощью JOIN FETCH для избежания проблемы N+1","Улучшение производительности доступа к данным с помощью записей Java для операций только для чтения"],"ar":["تنفيذ معاملات قرائية فقط باستخدام @Transactional(readOnly = true) للخدمات","تحسين الاستفسارات باستخدام JOIN FETCH لتجنب مشكلة N+1","تحسين أداء الوصول إلى البيانات باستخدام سجلات جافا للاستفسارات القرائية فقط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Spring Boot framework","Limited to Java-based agents","Needs proper configuration of spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"zh":["需要Spring Boot框架","仅限于Java基于代理","需要正确配置spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"ja":["Spring Bootフレームワークが必要","Javaベースのエージェントのみ","spring.jpa.open-in-viewの正しい構成が必要"],"ko":["스프링 부트 프레임워크가 필요합니다","자바 기반 에이전트만 해당됩니다","스프링.jpa.open-in-view의 올바른 구성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere el marco de Spring Boot","Limitado a agentes basados en Java","Necesita una configuración adecuada de spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Spring Boot","Limité aux agents basés sur Java","Nécessite une configuration appropriée de spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"de":["Erfordert das Spring-Boot-Framework","Begrenzt auf Java-basierte Agents","Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Konfiguration von spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"pt":["Exige o framework Spring Boot","Limitado a agentes baseados em Java","Exige configuração adequada de spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Spring Boot","Ограничен агентами на основе Java","Требует правильной конфигурации spring.jpa.open-in-view"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Spring Boot","محدود بالوكلاء القائمين على جافا","يتطلب تكوينًا مناسبًا لـ spring.jpa.open-in-view"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
