ation","Accès aux ressources et exemples"],"de":["Prozessverbesserung","Leitfaden für Best Practices","Ergebnisverifizierung","Bietet Schritte und Verifizierung","Zugriff auf Ressourcen und Beispiele"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas de análise de negócios","Melhores práticas para tomada de decisões","Validação de resultados e fornecimento de etapas concretas","Acesso a recursos e exemplos detalhados","Aplicação de métodos e ferramentas de análise de negócios","Desenvolvimento de habilidades de análise e resolução de problemas"],"ru":["Руководство для задач бизнес-анализа","Лучшие практики для принятия решений","Валидация результатов и предоставление конкретных шагов","Доступ к ресурсам и подробным примерам","Применение методов и инструментов бизнес-анализа","Развитие навыков анализа и решения проблем"],"ar":["الإرشاد للوظائف التحليلية التجارية","أفضل الممارسات لاتخاذ القرارات","التحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات ملموسة","الوصول إلى الموارد والأمثلة المفصلة","تطبيق الأساليب وأدوات التحليل التجاري","تنمية مهارات التحليل ومعالجة المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Business Analyst","业务分析","Agent技能","谷歌反重力","业务分析任务","工作流","最佳实践","检查清单"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリスト","ビジネス分析","エージェントスキル","Google Antigravity","ビジネスアナリストタスク","ワークフロー","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가","비즈니스 분석","에이전트 기술","구글 안티그라비티","비즈니스 분석 작업","워크플로우","모범 사례","체크리스트"],"es":["analista de negocios","mejora de procesos","guía para analistas","verificación de resultados","procesos de negocio","optimización de procesos"],"fr":["analyste commercial","amélioration des processus","guide pour analystes","vérification des résultats","processus d''entreprise","optimisation des processus"],"de":["Business-Analyst","Prozessverbesserung","Leitfaden für Analysten","Ergebnisverifizierung","Unternehmensprozesse","Prozessoptimierung"],"pt":["analista de negócios","análise de negócios","melhores práticas","tomada de decisões","validação de resultados","recursos de análise","desenvolvimento de habilidades","ferramentas de análise","processos de negócios","otimização de processos"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","бизнес-анализ","лучшие практики","принятие решений","валидация результатов","ресурсы анализа","развитие навыков","инструменты анализа","бизнес-процессы","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["محلل الأعمال","التحليل التجاري","أفضل الممارسات","اتخاذ القرارات","التحقق من النتائج","موارد التحليل","تنمية المهارات","أدوات التحليل","العمليات التجارية","تحسين العمليات"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:27.050Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Strategy Agents requiring structured business analysis and workflow optimization","zh":"适用于需要结构化业务分析和工作流优化的策略代理","ja":"構造化されたビジネス分析とワークフロー最適化を必要とする戦略エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 비즈니스 분석 및 워크플로 최적화를 요구하는 전략 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de estrategia que requieren análisis de negocios estructurado y optimización de flujo de trabajo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de stratégie nécessitant une analyse commerciale structurée et une optimisation du flux de travail","de":"Ideal für Strategie-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Geschäftsanalyse und eine Workflow-Optimierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Estratégia que requerem análise de negócios estruturada e otimização de fluxo de trabalho","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов стратегии, требующих структурированного бизнес-анализа и оптимизации рабочих процессов","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإستراتيجي التي تتطلب تحليل أعمال منظم وتحسين تدفق العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using relevant checklists and guidance for business analyst tasks, leveraging workflows and domain-specific tools","zh":"赋予代理应用最佳实践、验证结果并提供可执行步骤，使用相关的清单和业务分析任务的指导，利用工作流和特定领域的工具","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、関連するチェックリストとビジネスアナリストのタスクのガイダンスを使用して実行可能なステップを提供し、ワークフローとドメイン固有のツールを利用することを可能に","ko":"에이전트가 최선의 관행을 적용하고 결과를 검증하고 관련된 체크리스트와 비즈니스 분석 작업의 가이드를 사용하여 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하며, 워크플로와 특정 도메인의 도구를 활용할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas, validar resultados y proporcionar pasos acciónables utilizando listas de verificación y orientación relevantes para tareas de analista de negocios, aprovechando flujos de trabajo y herramientas específicas del dominio","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes actionnables en utilisant des listes de contrôle et des conseils pertinents pour les tâches d''analyste commercial, en exploitant les flux de travail et les outils spécifiques au domaine","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bewährte Verfahren anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und handhabbare Schritte bereitzustellen, indem relevante Checklisten und Anleitungen für Geschäftsanalysten-Aufgaben verwendet werden, die Workflows und domänen-spezifische Tools nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas, validar resultados e fornecer etapas ação utilizando listas de verificação e orientação relevantes para tarefas de analista de negócios, aproveitando fluxos de trabalho e ferramentas específicas de domínio","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики, проверять результаты и предоставлять пошаговые рекомендации с использованием соответствующих чек-листов и руководств для задач бизнес-аналитика, используя рабочие процессы и инструменты, специфичные для области","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات ، التحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات ملموسة باستخدام قوائم التحقق والإرشاد المناسبة لمهام محلل الأعمال ، واستغلال سير العمل والأدوات المحددة للنطاق"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing business processes","Generating actionable steps for improvement","Validating business analyst outcomes"],"zh":["分析业务流程","生成改进的可执行步骤","验证业务分析结果"],"ja":["ビジネスプロセスの分析","改善のための実行可能なステップの生成","ビジネスアナリストの結果の検証"],"ko":["비즈니스 프로세스 분석","개선의 실행 가능한 단계 생성","비즈니스 분석 결과 검증"],"es":["Análisis de procesos comerciales","Generación de pasos acciónables para la mejora","Validación de resultados del analista de negocios"],"fr":["Analyse de processus commerciaux","Génération d''étapes actionnables pour l''amélioration","Validation des résultats de l''analyste commercial"],"de":["Analyse von Geschäftsprozessen","Erzeugung handhabbarer Schritte zur Verbesserung","Validierung der Ergebnisse des Geschäftsanalysten"],"pt":["Análise de processos de negócios","Geração de etapas ação para melhoria","Validação de resultados de analista de negócios"],"ru":["Анализ бизнес-процессов","Генерация пошаговых рекомендаций для улучшения","Проверка результатов бизнес-аналитика"],"ar":["تحليل عمليات الأعمال","توليد خطوات ملموسة للتحسين","التحقق من نتائج محلل الأعمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to business analyst domain","Requires clear goals and constraints"],"zh":["仅限于业务分析领域","需要明确的目标和约束"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのドメインに限定","明確な目標と制約が必要"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석 도메인에 한정","명확한 목표와 제약이 필요"],"es":["Limitado al dominio del analista de negocios","Requiere objetivos y restricciones claras"],"fr":["Limité au domaine de l''analyste commercial","Nécessite des objectifs et des contraintes clairs"],"de":["Begrenzt auf den Bereich des Geschäftsanalysten","Benötigt klare Ziele und Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Limitado ao domínio do analista de negócios","Requer metas e restrições claras"],"ru":["Ограничен областью бизнес-аналитика","Требует четких целей и ограничений"],"ar":["محدود بنطاق محلل الأعمال","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا واضحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('github/gh-aw/documentation', 'community', 'github', 'gh-aw', 'github/gh-aw', 'documentation', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:28:21.901Z', NULL, '{"id":"github/gh-aw/documentation","name":"documentation","description":{"zh":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 的文档使用 Diátaxis 框架组织，提供 tutorials、如何、参考和操作指南","ja":"GitHub Agentic Workflows のドキュメントは Diátaxis フレームワークを使用して構造化されています。チュートリアル、ハウツー、リファレンス、操作ガイドを提供","ko":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 문서는 Diátaxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화되어 있습니다. 튜토리얼, 방법, 참조, 작동 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"La documentación de GitHub Agentic Workflows utiliza Astro Starlight y sigue el marco de Diátaxis para proporcionar una guía sistemática para los desarrolladores","fr":"La documentation de GitHub Agentic Workflows utilise Astro Starlight et suit le cadre de Diátaxis pour fournir un guide systématique pour les développeurs","de":"Die Dokumentation von GitHub Agentic Workflows verwendet Astro Starlight und folgt dem Rahmen von Diátaxis, um eine systematische Anleitung für Entwickler zu bieten","pt":"A documentação do projeto está disponível no diretório docs/, utilizando markdown do GitHub e seguindo o framework Diátaxis.","ru":"Документация проекта доступна в директории docs/, использующая markdown от GitHub и следующая фреймворку Diátaxis.","ar":"توثيق المشروع متاح في الدليل docs/، ويستخدم markdown من جيت هاب ويتبع إطار Diátaxis.","en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 文档指南","ja":"GitHub Agentic Workflows ドキュメントガイド","ko":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 문서 가이드","es":"Documentación de GitHub Agentic Workflows","fr":"Documentation de GitHub Agentic Workflows","de":"Dokumentation von GitHub Agentic Workflows","pt":"Documentação de Fluxos de Trabalho do GitHub","ru":"Документация рабочих процессов GitHub","ar":"توثيق سير عمل جيت هاب","en":"documentation"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 的文档使用 Diátaxis 框架组织，提供 tutorials、如何、参考和操作指南","ja":"GitHub Agentic Workflows のドキュメントは Diátaxis フレームワークを使用して構造化されています。チュートリアル、ハウツー、リファレンス、操作ガイドを提供","ko":"GitHub Agentic Workflows 문서는 Diátaxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화되어 있습니다. 튜토리얼, 방법, 참조, 작동 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"La documentación de GitHub Agentic Workflows utiliza Astro Starlight y sigue el marco de Diátaxis para proporcionar una guía sistemática para los desarrollad...","fr":"La documentation de GitHub Agentic Workflows utilise Astro Starlight et suit le cadre de Diátaxis pour fournir un guide systématique pour les développeurs","de":"Die Dokumentation von GitHub Agentic Workflows verwendet Astro Starlight und folgt dem Rahmen von Diátaxis, um eine systematische Anleitung für Entwickler zu...","pt":"A documentação do projeto está disponível no diretório docs/, utilizando markdown do GitHub e seguindo o framework Diátaxis.","ru":"Документация проекта доступна в директории docs/, использующая markdown от GitHub и следующая фреймворку Diátaxis.","ar":"توثيق المشروع متاح في الدليل docs/، ويستخدم markdown من جيت هاب ويتبع إطار Diátaxis.","en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"definition":{"en":"GitHub Agentic Workflows"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Diátaxis 框架组织文档","提供 tutorials、如何、参考和操作指南","使用 Astro Starlight 渲染文档","支持 GitHub-flavored markdown","文档结构清晰、易于理解"],"ja":["Diátaxis フレームワークを使用してドキュメントを構造化","チュートリアル、ハウツー、リファレンス、操作ガイドを提供","Astro Starlight を使用してドキュメントをレンダリング","GitHub-flavored markdown をサポート","ドキュメント構造が明確で、理解しやすい"],"ko":["Diátaxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 문서를 구조화","튜토리얼, 방법, 참조, 작동 가이드를 제공","Astro Starlight를 사용하여 문서를 렌더링","GitHub-flavored markdown를 지원","문서 구조가明確で, 이해하기 쉬움"],"es":["Utiliza Astro Starlight para renderizar la documentación","Sigue el marco de Diátaxis para la organización de la documentación","Incluye tutoriales para principiantes","Proporciona una guía sistemática para los desarrolladores","Utiliza markdown de GitHub para la documentación"],"fr":["Utilise Astro Starlight pour rendre la documentation","Suit le cadre de Diátaxis pour l''organisation de la documentation","Inclut des tutoriels pour les débutants","Fournit un guide systématique pour les développeurs","Utilise le markdown de GitHub pour la documentation"],"de":["Verwendet Astro Starlight für die Rendering der Dokumentation","Folgt dem Rahmen von Diátaxis für die Organisation der Dokumentation","Enthält Tutorials für Anfänger","Bietet eine systematische Anleitung für Entwickler","Verwendet GitHub-Markdown für die Dokumentation"],"pt":["Utiliza markdown do GitHub","Segue o framework Diátaxis","Renderização com Astro Starlight","Organização em quatro tipos de documentação","Inclui tutoriais para iniciantes"],"ru":["Использует markdown от GitHub","Следует фреймворку Diátaxis","Рендеринг с Astro Starlight","Организация в четыре типа документации","Включает учебные пособия для начинающих"],"ar":["يستخدم markdown من جيت هاب","يتبع إطار Diátaxis","ترndering مع Astro Starlight","تنظيم في أربعة أنواع من التوثيق","يتضمن دروسًا للمبتدئين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Agentic Workflows","Diátaxis 框架","Astro Starlight","GitHub-flavored markdown","文档组织","系统文档","开发者文档"],"ja":["GitHub Agentic Workflows","Diátaxis フレームワーク","Astro Starlight","GitHub-flavored markdown","ドキュメント構造","体系的なドキュメント","開発者ドキュメント"],"ko":["GitHub Agentic Workflows","Diátaxis 프레임워크","Astro Starlight","GitHub-flavored markdown","문서 구조","체계적인 문서","개발자 문서"],"es":["documentación de GitHub","Astro Starlight","Diátaxis","tutoriales para desarrolladores","guías de GitHub","markdown de GitHub","desarrollo de software","documentación técnica"],"fr":["documentation de GitHub","Astro Starlight","Diátaxis","tutoriels pour développeurs","guides de GitHub","markdown de GitHub","développement de logiciels","documentation technique"],"de":["Dokumentation von GitHub","Astro Starlight","Diátaxis","Tutorials für Entwickler","GitHub-Anleitungen","GitHub-Markdown","Software-Entwicklung","technische Dokumentation"],"pt":["documentação de fluxos de trabalho","GitHub","Diátaxis","Astro Starlight","markdown","renderização","tutoriais","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["документация рабочих процессов","GitHub","Diátaxis","Astro Starlight","markdown","рендеринг","учебные пособия","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توثيق سير عمل","جيت هاب","Diátaxis","Astro Starlight","markdown","ترndering","دروس","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"github","repo":"gh-aw","repoPath":"github/gh-aw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"documentation","description":"Documentation Brief description for SEO and navigation","bodyPreview":"### Documentation\n\nThe documentation for this project is available in the `docs/` directory. It uses GitHub-flavored markdown with Astro Starlight for rendering and follows the Diátaxis framework for systematic documentation.\n\n## Diátaxis Framework\n\nDocumentation must be organized into four distinct types, each serving a specific purpose:\n\n### 1. Tutorials (Learning-Oriented)\n**Purpose**: Guide beginners through achieving a specific outcome to build confidence.\n\n- Start with what the user will b","body":"### Documentation\n\nThe documentation for this project is available in the `docs/` directory. It uses GitHub-flavored markdown with Astro Starlight for rendering and follows the Diátaxis framework for systematic documentation.\n\n## Diátaxis Framework\n\nDocumentation must be organized into four distinct types, each serving a specific purpose:\n\n### 1. Tutorials (Learning-Oriented)\n**Purpose**: Guide beginners through achieving a specific outcome to build confidence.\n\n- Start with what the user will build or achieve\n- Provide a clear, step-by-step path from start to finish\n- Include concrete examples and working code\n- Assume minimal prior knowledge\n- Focus on the happy path (avoid edge cases and alternatives)\n- End with a working result the user can see and use\n- Use imperative mood: \"Create a file\", \"Run the command\"\n\n**Avoid**: Explaining concepts in depth, multiple options, troubleshooting\n\n### 2. How-to Guides (Goal-Oriented)\n**Purpose**: Show how to solve a specific real-world problem or accomplish a particular task.\n\n- Title format: \"How to [accomplish specific goal]\"\n- Assume the user knows the basics\n- Focus on practical steps to solve one problem\n- Include necessary context but stay focused\n- Show multiple approaches only when genuinely useful\n- End when the goal is achieved\n- Use imperative mood: \"Configure the setting\", \"Add the following\"\n\n**Avoid**: Teaching fundamentals, explaining every detail, being exhaustive\n\n### 3. Reference (Information-Oriented)\n**Purpose**: Provide accurate, complete technical descriptions of the system.\n\n- Organized by structure (CLI commands, configuration options, API endpoints)\n- Comprehensive and authoritative\n- Consistent format across all entries\n- Technical accuracy is paramount\n- Include all parameters, options, and return values\n- Use descriptive mood: \"The command accepts\", \"Returns a string\"\n- Minimal narrative or explanation\n\n**Avoid**: Instructions, tutorials, opinions on usage\n\n### 4. Explanation (Understanding-Oriented)\n**Purpose**: Clarify and illuminate topics to deepen understanding.\n\n- Discuss why things are the way they are\n- Explain design decisions and tradeoffs\n- Provide context and background\n- Connect concepts to help form mental models\n- Discuss alternatives and their implications\n- Use indicative mood: \"This approach provides\", \"The engine uses\"\n\n**Avoid**: Step-by-step instructions, exhaustive reference material\n\n## General Style Guidelines\n\n- **Tone**: Neutral, technical, not promotional\n- **Voice**: Avoid \"we\", \"our\", \"us\" (use \"the tool\", \"this command\")\n- **Headings**: Use markdown heading syntax, not bold text as headings\n- **Lists**: Avoid long bullet point lists; prefer prose with structure\n- **Code samples**: Minimal and focused; exclude optional fields unless relevant\n- **Language tag**: Use `aw` for agentic workflow snippets with YAML frontmatter\n\n**Example workflow code block**:\n```aw wrap\non: push\n# Your workflow steps here\n```\n\n## GitHub-Flavored Markdown Syntax\n\nDocumentation files use GitHub-flavored markdown with Astro Starlight for rendering. Key syntax elements:\n\n### Frontmatter\nEvery documentation page must have frontmatter:\n```markdown\ntitle: Page Title\ndescription: Brief description for SEO and navigation\n```\n\n### GitHub Alerts\nUse GitHub''s alert syntax for notes, tips, warnings, and cautions:\n```markdown\n> [!NOTE]\n> Important information the reader should notice.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Helpful advice for the reader.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Warning about potential issues or pitfalls.\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Critical warning about dangerous operations.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Key information users need to know.\n```\n\n### Code Blocks\n- Use syntax highlighting with language tags\n- Add `title` attribute for file names: ` ```yaml title=\".github/workflows/example.yml\" `\n- Use `aw` language for agentic workflow files with YAML frontmatter\n- Add `wrap` for line wrapping: ` ```aw wrap `\n\n### Links\n- Internal links: Use relative paths between documentation pages\n- External links: Open in new tab automatically\n- Link text: Use descriptive text, avoid \"click here\"\n\n### Tabs\nUse tabs for showing alternatives (e.g., different languages, platforms):\n```markdown\nimport { Tabs, TabItem } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<Tabs>\n  <TabItem label=\"npm\">\n    ```bash\n    npm install package\n    ```\n  </TabItem>\n  <TabItem label=\"yarn\">\n    ```bash\n    yarn add package\n    ```\n  </TabItem>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n### Cards\nUse cards for navigation or highlighting multiple options:\n```markdown\nimport { Card, CardGrid } from ''@astrojs/starlight/components'';\n\n<CardGrid>\n  <Card title=\"Getting Started\" icon=\"rocket\">\n    Quick introduction to the basics.\n  </Card>\n  <Card title=\"Advanced Usage\" icon=\"setting\">\n    Deep dive into advanced features.\n  </Card>\n</CardGrid>\n```\n\n**Remember**: Keep components minimal. Prefer standard markdown when possible.\n\n## Content to Avoid\n\n- \"Key Features\" sections\n- Marketing language or selling points\n- Excessive bullet points (prefer structured prose)\n- Overly verbose examples with all optional parameters\n- Mixing documentation types (e.g., tutorials that become reference)\n\n## Avoiding Documentation Bloat\n\nDocumentation bloat reduces clarity and makes content harder to navigate. Common types of bloat include:\n\n### Types of Documentation Bloat\n\n1. **Duplicate content**: Same information repeated in different sections\n2. **Excessive bullet points**: Long lists that could be condensed into prose or tables\n3. **Redundant examples**: Multiple examples showing the same concept\n4. **Verbose descriptions**: Overly wordy explanations that could be more concise\n5. **Repetitive structure**: The same \"What it does\" / \"Why it''s valuable\" pattern overused\n\n### Writing Concise Documentation\n\nWhen editing documentation, focus on:\n\n**Consolidate bullet points**: \n- Convert long bullet lists into concise prose or tables\n- Remove redundant points that say the same thing differently\n\n**Eliminate duplicates**:\n- Remove repeated information\n- Consolidate similar sections\n\n**Condense verbose text**:\n- Make descriptions more direct and concise\n- Remove filler words and phrases\n- Keep technical accuracy while reducing word count\n\n**Standardize structure**:\n- Reduce repetitive \"What it does\" / \"Why it''s valuable\" patterns\n- Use varied, natural language\n\n**Simplify code samples**:\n- Remove unnecessary complexity from code examples\n- Focus on demonstrating the core concept clearly\n- Eliminate boilerplate or setup code unless essential for understanding\n- Keep examples minimal yet complete\n- Use realistic but simple scenarios\n\n### Example: Before and After\n\n**Before (Bloated)**:\n```markdown\n### Tool Name\nDescription of the tool.\n\n- **What it does**: This tool does X, Y, and Z\n- **Why it''s valuable**: It''s valuable because A, B, and C\n- **How to use**: You use it by doing steps 1, 2, 3, 4, 5\n- **When to use**: Use it when you need X\n- **Benefits**: Gets you benefit A, benefit B, benefit C\n- **Learn more**: [Link](url)\n```\n\n**After (Concise)**:\n```markdown\n### Tool Name\nDescription of the tool that does X, Y, and Z to achieve A, B, and C.\n\nUse it when you need X by following steps 1-5. [Learn more](url)\n```\n\n### Documentation Quality Guidelines\n\n1. **Preserve meaning**: Never lose important information\n2. **Be surgical**: Make precise edits, don''t rewrite everything\n3. **Maintain tone**: Keep the neutral, technical tone\n4. **Test locally**: Verify links and formatting are still correct\n\n## Structure by File Type\n\n- **Getting Started**: Tutorial format\n- **How-to Guides**: Goal-oriented, one task per guide\n- **CLI Reference**: Reference format, complete command documentation\n- **Concepts**: Explanation format, building understanding\n- **API Reference**: Reference format, complete API documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:21.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Documentation Agents tasked with maintaining structured, user-focused technical content.","zh":"适用于负责维护结构化、面向用户的技术文档的文档代理。","ja":"構造化されたユーザー向けの技術文書を維持するドキュメント エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"구조화되고 사용자 중심의 기술 문서를 유지하는 문서 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los Agentes de Documentación encargados de mantener contenido técnico estructurado y centrado en el usuario.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de documentation chargés de maintenir un contenu technique structuré et axé sur l''utilisateur.","de":"Wesentlich für Dokumentationsagenten, die für die Wartung von strukturierten, benutzerorientierten technischen Inhalten verantwortlich sind.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Documentação responsáveis por manter conteúdo técnico estruturado e focado no usuário.","ru":"Необходим для Агентов Документации, ответственных за поддержание структурированного, ориентированного на пользователя технического контента.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء وثائق معنيين bằng الحفاظ على المحتوى الفني المنظم والمتوجه للمستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables systematic documentation management following the Diátaxis framework, using GitHub-flavored markdown and Astro Starlight for rendering. This ensures content is organized into four distinct, purpose-driven categories for optimal user experience.","zh":"通过使用 GitHub 风格的 markdown 和 Astro Starlight 渲染，实现系统化的文档管理，遵循 Diátaxis 框架。这确保内容被组织成四个不同的、有目的的类别，以获得最佳的用户体验。","ja":"GitHub フラバードのマークダウンと Astro Starlight のレンダリングを使用して、Diátaxis フレームワークに従った体系的なドキュメント管理を可能にします。これにより、コンテンツが最適なユーザー エクスペリエンスのために 4 つの異なる目的を持ったカテゴリに整理されます。","ko":"GitHub风格의 markdown와 Astro Starlight 렌더링을 사용하여 Diátaxis 프레임워크를 따르는 체계적인 문서 관리를 가능하게 함으로써, 콘텐츠가 최적의 사용자 경험을 위해 4개의 서로 다른 목적을 가진 카테고리로 구성되도록 합니다.","es":"Permite la gestión sistemática de la documentación siguiendo el marco Diátaxis, utilizando markdown con sabor a GitHub y Astro Starlight para la renderización. Esto garantiza que el contenido se organice en cuatro categorías distintas y con un propósito definido para una experiencia de usuario óptima.","fr":"Permet la gestion systématique de la documentation en suivant le cadre Diátaxis, en utilisant le markdown parfumé GitHub et Astro Starlight pour le rendu. Cela garantit que le contenu est organisé en quatre catégories distinctes et à but défini pour une expérience utilisateur optimale.","de":"Ermöglicht systematisches Dokumentationsmanagement unter Verwendung des Diátaxis-Frameworks, GitHub-geschmacktem Markdown und Astro Starlight für die Rendering. Dies stellt sicher, dass der Inhalt in vier unterschiedliche, zweckorientierte Kategorien für ein optimales Benutzererlebnis organisiert wird.","pt":"Permite a gestão sistemática da documentação seguindo o framework Diátaxis, utilizando markdown com sabor GitHub e Astro Starlight para renderização. Isso garante que o conteúdo seja organizado em quatro categorias distintas e orientadas para propósito para uma experiência do usuário ótima.","ru":"Позволяет обеспечить систематическое управление документацией в соответствии с фреймворком Diátaxis, используя markdown от GitHub и Astro Starlight для рендеринга. Это гарантирует, что контент организован в четыре различных,目的-ориентированных категории для оптимального пользовательского опыта.","ar":"يسمح بإدارة وثائق منهجية متابعة لإطار Diátaxis، باستخدام markdown 맛 GitHub و Astro Starlight للتصيير. هذا يضمن أن المحتوى منظم في أربعة فئات متميزة ومتوجهة للغرض من أجل تجربة المستخدم المثلى."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating learning-oriented tutorials for beginners","Creating task-oriented how-to guides for specific outcomes","Producing reference-oriented material for technical details","Organizing explanation-oriented content for understanding"],"zh":["为初学者生成学习导向的教程","为特定结果创建任务导向的操作指南","为技术细节生成参考导向的材料","组织解释导向的内容以获得理解"],"ja":["初心者向けの学習指向のチュートリアルを生成する","特定の成果向けのタスク指向のハウツー ガイドを作成する","技術的な詳細向けの参考指向の資料を生成する","理解のために説明指向のコンテンツを整理する"],"ko":["초보자를 위한 학습 지향형 튜토리얼 생성","특정 결과를 위한 작업 지향형 방법 가이드 생성","기술 세부 정보를 위한 참조 지향형 자료 생성","이해를 위한 설명 지향형 콘텐츠 구성"],"es":["Generar tutoriales orientados al aprendizaje para principiantes","Crear guías paso a paso orientadas a tareas para resultados específicos","Producir material de referencia orientado a detalles técnicos","Organizar contenido orientado a la explicación para la comprensión"],"fr":["Générer des didacticiels orientés vers l''apprentissage pour les débutants","Créer des guides étape par étape orientés vers les tâches pour des résultats spécifiques","Produire du matériel de référence orienté vers les détails techniques","Organiser du contenu orienté vers l''explication pour la compréhension"],"de":["Lernorientierte Tutorials für Anfänger generieren","Aufgabenorientierte Anleitungen für bestimmte Ergebnisse erstellen","Referenzorientiertes Material für technische Details produzieren","Erklärungsorientierten Inhalt für das Verständnis organisieren"],"pt":["Geração de tutoriais orientados para aprendizado para iniciantes","Criação de guias de tarefas orientados para resultados específicos","Produção de material de referência orientado para detalhes técnicos","Organização de conteúdo orientado para explicação para compreensão"],"ru":["Генерация обучающих пособий для начинающих","Создание руководств по задачам для конкретных результатов","Производство справочного материала для технических деталей","Организация объяснительного контента для понимания"],"ar":["توليد دروس تعليمية متوجة للتعلم للمبتدئين","إنشاء دلائل حول المهام لمخرجات محددة","إنتاج مواد مرجعية متوجهة للتفاصيل الفنية","تنظيم المحتوى الموجه للتفسير للفهم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires docs/ directory structure","Dependent on Astro Starlight for rendering","Follows Diátaxis framework conventions"],"zh":["需要 docs/ 目录结构","依赖于 Astro Starlight 渲染","遵循 Diátaxis 框架约定"],"ja":["docs/ ディレクトリ構造が必要","Astro Starlight のレンダリングに依存","Diátaxis フレームワークの規約に従う"],"ko":["docs/ 디렉토리 구조가 필요","Astro Starlight 렌더링에 의존","Diátaxis 프레임워크 규약을 따름"],"es":["Requiere estructura de directorio docs/","Dependiente de Astro Starlight para la renderización","Sigue las convenciones del marco Diátaxis"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de répertoire docs/","Dépendant d''Astro Starlight pour le rendu","Suit les conventions du cadre Diátaxis"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verzeichnisstruktur docs/","Abhängig von Astro Starlight für die Rendering","Folgt den Konventionen des Diátaxis-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de diretório docs/","Dependente de Astro Starlight para renderização","Sigue convenções do framework Diátaxis"],"ru":["Требует структуры директории docs/","Зависит от Astro Starlight для рендеринга","Следует соглашениям фреймворка Diátaxis"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلا لمجلد وثائق /","يعتمد على Astro Starlight للتصيير","يتبع اتفاقيات إطار Diátaxis"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
