ion de résumés exécutifs et de balises de clauses","Prise en charge des perspectives de destinataire ou de divulgateur","Production d''un rapport détaillé"],"de":["Überprüfung von Vertraulichkeitsvereinbarungen","Identifizierung von Problemen und Risiken","Erstellung von Executive-Zusammenfassungen und Klausel-Markierungen","Unterstützung für Empfänger- oder Offenlegungsperspektiven","Erstellung eines detaillierten Berichts"],"pt":["Revisão automatizada de NDA","Identificação de questões e riscos","Sugestões de alterações","Suporte para perspectivas de destinatário ou divulgador","Resumo executivo e orientação de marcação por cláusula"],"ru":["Автоматический обзор НДА","Выявление вопросов и рисков","Предложения по изменениям","Поддержка перспектив получателя или разглашателя","Исполнительный обзор и руководство по маркировке по пунктам"],"ar":["استعراض آلي للنموذج القانوني للاتفاقية","تحديد المشاكل والمخاطر","اقتراحات للتعديلات","دعم لمواقف المستلم أو المصرح","ملخص تنفيذي وتوجيهات لتحديد المواضع بالفقرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NDA审查","自动化法律工作","合同审查","风险管理","合规建议","保密协议"],"ja":["NDAレビュー","法律業務の自動化","契約の審査","リスク管理","コンプライアンスの提案","保密契約"],"ko":["NDA 리뷰","법률 업무 자동화","계약审查","리스크 관리","컴플라이언스의 제안","보안协议"],"es":["revisión de NDA","automatización de trabajo legal","acuerdos de confidencialidad","identificación de riesgos","generación de informes","soporte para receptor o divulgador"],"fr":["révision de NDA","automatisation du travail juridique","accords de confidentialité","identification des risques","génération de rapports","prise en charge du destinataire ou du divulgateur"],"de":["NDA-Überprüfung","Automatisierung von Rechtsarbeit","Vertraulichkeitsvereinbarungen","Identifizierung von Risiken","Erstellung von Berichten","Unterstützung für Empfänger oder Offenlegung"],"pt":["revisão de NDA","automatização de NDA","acordos de não divulgação","análise de riscos","sugestões de alterações","perspectivas de destinatário ou divulgador"],"ru":["обзор НДА","автоматизация НДА","соглашения о неразглашении","анализ рисков","предложения по изменениям","перспективы получателя или разглашателя"],"ar":["استعراض النموذج القانوني للاتفاقية","أتمتة النموذج القانوني للاتفاقية","اتفاقيات عدم الإفصاح","تحليل المخاطر","اقتراحات للتعديلات","مواقف المستلم أو المصرح"]}},"owner":"lawvable","repo":"awesome-legal-skills","repoPath":"lawvable/awesome-legal-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nda-review-jamie-tso","description":"Guide to review incoming one-way (unilateral) commercial NDAs in a jurisdiction-agnostic way, from either a Recipient or Discloser perspective (user-selected), producing a clause-by-clause issue log with preferred redlines, fallbacks, rationales, owners, and deadlines.","version":"2025.12.30","bodyPreview":"# NDA Review Playbook (Commercial, Jurisdiction-Agnostic)\n\n## Overview\n\n| What this skill does | What it does not do |\n|---|---|\n| Reviews an NDA and outputs issues, risks, and suggested redlines | Provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions |\n| Supports *Recipient* or *Discloser* perspectives (user-chosen) | Guarantee enforceability |\n| Produces an executive summary + clause-by-clause markup guidance | Replace counsel for complex deals |\n\n**Scope limitation (important):** this playbook supp","body":"# NDA Review Playbook (Commercial, Jurisdiction-Agnostic)\n\n## Overview\n\n| What this skill does | What it does not do |\n|---|---|\n| Reviews an NDA and outputs issues, risks, and suggested redlines | Provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions |\n| Supports *Recipient* or *Discloser* perspectives (user-chosen) | Guarantee enforceability |\n| Produces an executive summary + clause-by-clause markup guidance | Replace counsel for complex deals |\n\n**Scope limitation (important):** this playbook supports **one-way (unilateral) commercial NDAs only**.\n\nIf the NDA is **mutual**, stop: this playbook is **out of scope** and you should escalate to counsel or use a separate mutual-NDA review approach.\n\n> **Variation callouts** appear throughout:\n> - **M&A / Due diligence**\n> - **Employment / contractor**\n> - **Investor / VC**\n\n## LEGAL DISCLAIMER\n\n**THIS IS NOT LEGAL ADVICE.** This skill is provided for informational and educational purposes only. Laws vary by jurisdiction and individual circumstances, and only a licensed attorney can provide advice tailored to your specific situation. When the NDA is high-risk, high-value, cross-border, or otherwise sensitive, escalate to qualified counsel.\n\n**Remember:** All outputs from this skill must be reviewed by a qualified legal professional before being used for any legal purposes.\n\n---\n\n## Inputs to collect (ask before reviewing)\n\n### A. Role and deal context (required)\n- [ ] Are we reviewing as **Recipient** (we receive confidential info) or **Discloser** (we disclose confidential info)?\n- [ ] Confirm the NDA is **one-way (unilateral)**. If it is **mutual**, stop: this playbook cannot be used.\n- [ ] What is the **purpose** / permitted use (e.g., evaluation of partnership, vendor RFP, diligence)?\n- [ ] What are the **parties** (legal names) and any **affiliates** that should be covered?\n- [ ] What information types are expected (tech, pricing, customer data, product roadmap, source code)?\n- [ ] Desired **timeline**: when do we need to sign?\n\n### B. Practical constraints (recommended)\n- [ ] Do we need to share with **affiliates**, advisors, contractors, auditors, or potential acquirers?\n- [ ] Will we need to **export** data across borders or store in cloud tools?\n- [ ] Will any **personal data** be shared? If yes, are there separate data-processing terms?\n\n> **Jurisdiction-agnostic note:** avoid asserting “this clause is invalid” without the governing law details; focus on *commercial risk*, *operational feasibility*, and *market norms*.\n\n## Deliverables (output format)\n\n### Quick start (default output template)\n\nALWAYS output:\n1) **Executive summary**\n2) **Clause-by-clause issue log** (single table)\n\n### A. Executive summary (1 page)\n- [ ] Party role (Recipient or Discloser) and confirmation it is one-way (unilateral)\n- [ ] Top 5 negotiation points (ranked)\n- [ ] “Sign as-is” / “Sign with changes” / “Escalate” recommendation\n\n### B. Clause-by-clause issue log (lawyer-style, thorough)\nUse a single table so counsel and business owners can track issues, owners, and deadlines.\n\n| Clause | Issue (1 line) | Risk (H/M/L) | Preferred redline | Fallback | Rationale (1–2 sentences) | Owner | Deadline |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Definition | Overbroad; includes unmarked info with no reasonableness |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Term & survival | Perpetual confidentiality for all information |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Use restriction | Purpose too broad; blocks internal evaluation |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Disclosures | Representatives undefined; strict liability |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Return/destruction | No backup carve-out |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Remedies | One-way fees + automatic injunction |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Liability | Indemnity + unlimited consequential damages |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Boilerplate | Assignment prohibits change of control |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n### Example (compact)\n\n**Executive summary (example skeleton):**\n- Role: Recipient (one-way NDA)\n- Recommendation: Sign with changes\n- Top 5 points: definition scope; term/survival; representatives; backup carve-out; remedies/fees\n\n**Issue log (example rows):**\n\n| Clause | Issue (1 line) | Risk (H/M/L) | Preferred redline | Fallback | Rationale (1–2 sentences) | Owner | Deadline |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Term & survival | Perpetual confidentiality for all information | H | Add 2–5 year survival; trade secret carve-out only | 5-year survival for all | Reduces indefinite operational burden while protecting truly sensitive info | Legal | Before signature |\n| Return/destruction | No backup carve-out | M | Add backup/legal hold exception + continued confidentiality | Allow retention in immutable backups only | Required for standard IT operations; avoids impossible compliance | Security + Legal | Before signature |\n\n## 5-step workflow\n\n### Step 1 — Identify stance (Recipient vs Discloser)\n- [ ] Confirm which side we are on for *this specific NDA* (titles are often misleading).\n- [ ] Confirm the NDA is **one-way (unilateral)**. If it is mutual, stop (out of scope).\n\n**Quick heuristic:**\n- If we are being asked to keep their info secret → we are **Recipient**.\n- If we are sharing our sensitive info → we are **Discloser** (if the NDA is mutual, stop: out of scope).\n\n### Step 2 — Triage the NDA (fast risk scan)\nFlag these immediately:\n- [ ] **Perpetual** confidentiality for *all* information (no trade secret distinction)\n- [ ] **Residuals clause** allowing use of “memory” or generalized knowledge\n- [ ] **Injunctive relief** + **attorneys’ fees** one-way against Recipient\n- [ ] **Indemnity** for breach or broad third-party claims\n- [ ] **No carve-outs** for compelled disclosure or prior knowledge\n- [ ] **Overbroad definition**: “all information, whether marked or not” with no reasonableness\n- [ ] **Affiliate coverage** missing when we must share internally\n\n> If any are present and the NDA matters, proceed with full review and consider escalation.\n\n### Step 3 — Clause-by-clause review (use the reference modules)\nUse these references while reviewing:\n- [Key clauses](references/KEY_CLAUSES.md)\n- [Party obligations](references/PARTY_OBLIGATIONS.md)\n- [Duration & scope](references/DURATION_SCOPE.md)\n- [Remedies & liability](references/REMEDIES_LIABILITY.md)\n- [Standard exceptions](references/STANDARD_EXCEPTIONS.md)\n\n### Step 4 — Draft redlines and negotiation positions\nFor each issue, produce:\n- **Preferred redline** (best risk outcome)\n- **Fallback position** (acceptable compromise)\n- **Rationale** (1–2 sentences: business + operational feasibility)\n- **Owner** (who needs to approve / negotiate: Legal, Sales, Security, Product)\n- **Deadline** (by when the counterparty needs the change)\n\n**Negotiation discipline:** do not propose 20 changes. Focus on the 5–10 that materially change risk.\n\n### Step 5 — Finalize the package\n- [ ] Ensure consistency (definitions used the same way everywhere)\n- [ ] Confirm operational feasibility (can we actually comply?)\n- [ ] Re-scan the Step 2 triage list and ensure each flagged item is represented in the issue log\n- [ ] Provide a short “what we changed and why” summary\n\n## Perspective-specific checklists\n\n### A. Recipient checklist (incoming NDA — typical case)\n\n| Topic | Red flags | Typical ask |\n|---|---|---|\n| Definition of Confidential Information | Overbroad; includes independently developed info; no marking/identification standard | Add reasonableness + identification standard; add exclusions |\n| Purpose / Permitted Use | Any use restriction beyond evaluation; bans on internal sharing | Tie to stated purpose; allow internal need-to-know |\n| Representatives | We are liable for any representative breach without control | Limit to those under written confidentiality; commercially reasonable care |\n| Term & survival | Perpetual for everything; unclear start date | Fixed term; longer only for trade secrets |\n| Return / destruction | Requires deletion of backups immediately | Add practical backup carve-out |\n| Remedies | One-way fees + broad injunction language | Mutuality or reasonableness; clarify equitable relief scope |\n| Liability / indemnity | Indemnity; unlimited damages; consequential damages | Cap or exclude categories; remove indemnity |\n| Residuals | Allows use of “retained in memory” | Delete or narrow heavily |\n\n> **M&A / Due diligence:** ensure diligence sharing (advisors, financing, affiliates) is permitted and that data room exports/notes are covered.\n\n### B. Discloser checklist (when we are sharing sensitive info)\n\n| Topic | Red flags | Typical ask |\n|---|---|---|\n| Definition | Too narrow; requires marking only; excludes oral disclosures | Add oral confirmation mechanism; broaden categories reasonably |\n| Security standard | Only “reasonable” with no baseline | Add minimum safeguards, or align with internal policy |\n| Exclusions | Too broad (e.g., “independently developed” with no proof) | Require written evidence of prior knowledge/independent development |\n| Term & survival | Too short | Extend for sensitive categories; trade secret survival |\n| Remedies | No equitable relief, no fees | Add equitable relief and/or fees (carefully) |\n\n> **Investor / VC:** watch for standstill, solicitation, and “no contact” provisions—these are not standard in plain NDAs and may need separate agreement.\n\n## Risk rating guide\n\n| Rating | Meaning | Example |\n|---:|---|---|\n| High | Creates material, uncapped, or operationally impossible risk | Broad indemnity + unlimited damages for any breach |\n| Medium | Risk is real but manageable with process controls | Strict notice deadlines for compelled disclosure |\n| Low | Mostly cosmetic or market-standard | Minor notice method issues |\n\n## Common pitfalls (issue → risk → fix)\n\n| Issue | Risk | Suggested fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| “All information is confidential forever” | Operational burden; unfair risk allocation | Add fixed term + trade secret carve-out |\n| No compelled disclosure carve-out | Breach if subpoenaed | Add “required by law” disclosure path |\n| Return/destruction requires purge of backups | Impossible to comply | Add backup and system integrity exception |\n| Recipient indemnifies discloser | Open-ended exposure | Remove indemnity; use direct damages only |\n| Residuals clause | Allows de facto use of confidential info | Delete or restrict to non-trade-secret, non-source-code |\n\n## Review prompts (copy/paste)\n\n### A. Minimal prompt (fast)\n- Role: Recipient/Discloser\n- NDA type: one-way (unilateral)\n- Purpose: …\n- Please produce (1) exec summary, (2) clause-by-clause issue log table with: Clause, Issue, Risk, Preferred redline, Fallback, Rationale, Owner, Deadline, (3) top 5 negotiation points.\n\n### B. Deep prompt (recommended)\n- Add constraints: affiliates, advisors, contractors, cross-border sharing, personal data, cloud tools.\n- Ask for: preferred redline + fallback + rationale per issue.\n\n## Ownership & timing defaults (if the user does not specify)\n\nUse these defaults to populate **Owner** and **Deadline** in the issue log:\n\n| Topic | Default owner | Default deadline |\n|---|---|---|\n| Confidentiality scope/definition, exceptions, term/survival | Legal | Before signature |\n| Security standards / audit rights | Security + Legal | Before signature |\n| Return/destruction and backups | Security + IT + Legal | Before signature |\n| Liability cap / damages / indemnity / fees | Legal + Finance | Before signature |\n| Operational constraints (representatives, affiliates, tooling) | Legal + Business owner | Before signature |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:27.476Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Contract Analysis Agents requiring advanced NDA review and redline suggestion capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级非披露协议（NDA）审查和红线建议能力的合同分析代理","ja":"高度なNDAレビューと赤線提案機能を必要とする契約分析エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 NDA 리뷰 및 빨간선 제안 기능이 필요한 계약 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de contratos que requieren una revisión avanzada de acuerdos de confidencialidad y capacidades de sugerencia de modificaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de contrats nécessitant une revue avancée d''accords de non-divulgation et des capacités de suggestion de modifications.","de":"Ideal für Vertragsanalyseagenten, die eine erweiterte Prüfung von Geheimhaltungsvereinbarungen und Vorschlagfunktionen für Änderungsvorschläge erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Contrato que exigem revisão avançada de NDA e capacidades de sugestão de redline.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа контрактов, требующих передового обзора НДА и возможностей предложения красных строк.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل العقد الذي يتطلب مراجعة متقدمة لاتفاقية النда وميزات اقتراح خط أحمر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review NDAs, output issues and risks, and suggest redlines from both Recipient and Discloser perspectives, utilizing clause-by-clause markup guidance and executive summaries, all while supporting jurisdiction-agnostic commercial reviews.","zh":"赋予代理商审查非披露协议、输出问题和风险、并从接受者和披露者两个角度提出红线建议的能力，利用逐条子句标记指导和执行摘要，同时支持管辖权无关的商业审查","ja":"エージェントがNDAをレビューし、問題やリスクを出力し、受領者と開示者の両方の視点から赤線提案を行う機能を提供する。また、条項ごとのマークアップガイダンスとエグゼクティブサマリーを利用し、管轄区域に依存しない商業レビューを支援する","ko":"에이전트가 NDA를 검토하고 문제와 위험을 출력하며 수신자와 공개자의 두 관점에서 빨간선 제안을 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고 조항별 마크업 가이드와 이사회 요약을 사용하며 관할구역에 구애받지 않는 商業 검토를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar acuerdos de confidencialidad, emitir problemas y riesgos, y sugerir modificaciones desde las perspectivas del destinatario y del divulgador, utilizando una guía de marcaje cláusula por cláusula y resúmenes ejecutivos, todo mientras apoya las revisiones comerciales agnósticas de jurisdicción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les accords de non-divulgation, de sortir les problèmes et les risques, et de suggérer des modifications du point de vue du destinataire et du divulgateur, en utilisant une guidance de marquage clause par clause et des résumés exécutifs, le tout tout en soutenant les examens commerciaux agnostiques de juridiction.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Geheimhaltungsvereinbarungen zu überprüfen, Probleme und Risiken auszugeben und Änderungsvorschläge aus der Sicht des Empfängers und des Offenlegers zu machen, unter Verwendung einer Klausel-für-Klausel-Markierungsanleitung und Zusammenfassungen für die Geschäftsleitung, und unterstützt gleichzeitig jurisdiktionsunabhängige Handelsprüfungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar NDAs, saída de questões e riscos e sugerir redlines tanto da perspectiva do Recipient quanto do Discloser, utilizando orientação de marcação cláusula a cláusula e resumos executivos, tudo isso enquanto suporta revisões comerciais agnósticas de jurisdição.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать НДА, выводить проблемы и риски и предлагать красные строки как с точки зрения Получателя, так и с точки зрения Раскрывающего, используя руководство по маркировке пункт за пунктом и исполнительные резюме, все это при поддержке коммерческих обзоров, независимых от юрисдикции.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من مراجعة اتفاقيات الندا وإخراج القضايا والمخاطر واقتراح خطوط حمراء من منظور المتلقي والكاشف ، باستخدام إرشادات وضع العلامات البند تلو البند والملخصات التنفيذية ، كل ذلك مع دعم المراجعات التجارية غير الحساسة للولاية القضائية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating NDA reviews for commercial agreements","Generating executive summaries for legal teams","Identifying potential risks and issues in NDAs","Producing suggested redlines for contractual negotiations"],"zh":["商业协议的自动化NDA审查","为法律团队生成执行摘要","在NDA中识别潜在风险和问题","为合同谈判生成建议的红线"],"ja":["商業 契約の自動化NDAレビュー","法務チームのためのエグゼクティブサマリーの生成","NDA内での潜在的なリスクと問題の特定","契約交渉のための提案赤線の生成"],"ko":["상업계약을 위한 자동화된 NDA 검토","법률팀을 위한 이사회 요약 생성","NDA에서 잠재적인 위험 및 문제 식별","계약 협상을 위한 제안 빨간선 생성"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de acuerdos de confidencialidad para acuerdos comerciales","Generar resúmenes ejecutivos para equipos legales","Identificar posibles riesgos y problemas en acuerdos de confidencialidad","Producir modificaciones sugeridas para negociaciones contractuales"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens d''accords de non-divulgation pour les accords commerciaux","Générer des résumés exécutifs pour les équipes juridiques","Identifier les risques et les problèmes potentiels dans les accords de non-divulgation","Produire des modifications suggérées pour les négociations contractuelles"],"de":["Automatisieren von Prüfungen von Geheimhaltungsvereinbarungen für Handelsvereinbarungen","Erstellen von Zusammenfassungen für die Geschäftsleitung für Rechtsabteilungen","Identifizieren von potenziellen Risiken und Problemen in Geheimhaltungsvereinbarungen","Erzeugen von vorgeschlagenen Änderungen für Vertragsverhandlungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de NDA para acordos comerciais","Gerar resumos executivos para equipes jurídicas","Identificar riscos e questões potenciais em NDAs","Produzir redlines sugeridas para negociações contratuais"],"ru":["Автоматизация обзоров НДА для коммерческих соглашений","Генерация исполнительных резюме для юридических команд","Определение потенциальных рисков и проблем в НДА","Производство предложенных красных строк для контрактных переговоров"],"ar":["تحسين مراجعات اتفاقية الندا للاتفاقيات التجارية","إنتاج ملخصات تنفيذية للفرق القانونية","تحديد المخاطر والقضايا المحتملة في اتفاقيات الندا","إنتاج خطوط حمراء مقترحة لمفاوضات العقد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions","Does not guarantee enforceability of contracts","Cannot replace counsel for complex legal deals"],"zh":["不提供管辖权特定的法律结论","不保证合同的强制执行","无法替代复杂法律交易中的律师"],"ja":["管轄区域に特有の法律的結論を提供しない","契約の強制執行を保証しない","複雑な法的取引における弁護士の代替として機能しない"],"ko":["관할구역 특정 법적 결론을 제공하지 않음","계약의 강제執行을 보장하지 않음","복잡한 법적 거래에서 변호사의 교체로 기능하지 않음"],"es":["No proporciona conclusiones legales específicas de la jurisdicción","No garantiza la ejecución de contratos","No puede reemplazar el asesoramiento para tratos legales complejos"],"fr":["Ne fournit pas de conclusions juridiques spécifiques à la juridiction","Ne garantit pas l''exécution des contrats","Ne peut pas remplacer le conseil pour les transactions juridiques complexes"],"de":["Stellt keine jurisdiktionspezifischen rechtlichen Schlussfolgerungen bereit","Garantiert nicht die Durchsetzbarkeit von Verträgen","Kann den Rat für komplexe Rechtsgeschäfte nicht ersetzen"],"pt":["Não fornece conclusões jurídicas específicas da jurisdição","Não garante a executoriedade dos contratos","Não pode substituir o aconselhamento para negócios jurídicos complexos"],"ru":["Не предоставляет юрисдикционно-специфические юридические выводы","Не гарантирует принудительное исполнение контрактов","Не может заменить консультации для сложных юридических сделок"],"ar":["لا يوفر استنتاجات قانونية محددة للولاية القضائية","لا يضمن القوة التنفيذية للعقود","لا يمكن أن ي 取代 المشورة للصفقات القانونية المعقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('flutter-it/watch_it/feed-datasource-expert', 'community', 'flutter-it', 'watch_it', 'flutter-it/watch_it', 'feed-datasource-expert', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:28:35.934Z', NULL, '{"id":"flutter-it/watch_it/feed-datasource-expert","name":"feed-datasource-expert","description":{"zh":"Feed 数据源专家模式用于创建分页的响应式列表和无限滚动，集成实体生命周期管理","ja":"フィード データソース エキスパート パターンは、ページングされたレスポンシブ リストと無限スクロールを作成し、エンティティのライフサイクル管理を統合する","ko":"피드 데이터 소스 전문가 패턴은 페이지 목록 및 무한 스크롤을 생성하고 엔티티 라이프 사이클 관리를 통합합니다","es":"El patrón de fuente de alimentación de datos experto proporciona una forma eficiente de implementar listas paginadas y desplazamiento infinito. Utiliza ValueNotifiers y Comandos para gestionar el ciclo de vida de las entidades.","fr":"Le pattern de source de données d''expert alimentation fournit un moyen efficace de mettre en œuvre des listes paginées et un défilement infini. Il utilise ValueNotifiers et Commandes pour gérer le cycle de vie des entités.","de":"Das Datenquellen-Experten-Muster bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, paginierte Listen und unendliches Scrollen zu implementieren. Es verwendet ValueNotifiers und Befehle zur Verwaltung des Lebenszyklus von Entitäten.","pt":"O Feed DataSource Expert é um padrão para listas reativas paginadas que integra ValueNotifiers e Comandos para gerenciar o ciclo de vida de entidades","ru":"Эксперт по источникам данных - это шаблон для постраничной загрузки реактивных списков, который интегрирует ValueNotifiers и Команды для управления жизненным циклом сущностей","ar":"خبير مصدر البيانات هو نمط لقائمة تفاعلية متواصلة يدمج ValueNotifiers والأوامر لإدارة دورة حياة الكيانات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Feed 数据源专家 - 分页列表和无限滚动","ja":"フィード データソース エキスパート - ページング リストと無限スクロール","ko":"피드 데이터 소스 전문가 - 페이지 목록 및 무한 스크롤","es":"Experto en Fuente de Alimentación de Datos - Listas Pagin...","fr":"Expert en Source de Données d''Alimentation - Listes Paginées","de":"Datenquellen-Experte - Paginierte Listen","pt":"Especialista em Feed de Dados - Paginação e Scroll Infinito","ru":"Эксперт по источникам данных - постраничная загрузка и бе...","ar":"خبير مصدر البيانات - قوائم منفصلة وتمرير لا نهاية له","en":"feed-datasource-expert"},"description":{"zh":"Feed 数据源专家模式用于创建分页的响应式列表和无限滚动，集成实体生命周期管理","ja":"フィード データソース エキスパート パターンは、ページングされたレスポンシブ リストと無限スクロールを作成し、エンティティのライフサイクル管理を統合する","ko":"피드 데이터 소스 전문가 패턴은 페이지 목록 및 무한 스크롤을 생성하고 엔티티 라이프 사이클 관리를 통합합니다","es":"El patrón de fuente de alimentación de datos experto proporciona una forma eficiente de implementar listas paginadas y desplazamiento infinito. Utiliza Value...","fr":"Le pattern de source de données d''expert alimentation fournit un moyen efficace de mettre en œuvre des listes paginées et un défilement infini. Il utilise Va...","de":"Das Datenquellen-Experten-Muster bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, paginierte Listen und unendliches Scrollen zu implementieren. Es verwendet ValueNotifier...","pt":"O Feed DataSource Expert é um padrão para listas reativas paginadas que integra ValueNotifiers e Comandos para gerenciar o ciclo de vida de entidades","ru":"Эксперт по источникам данных - это шаблон для постраничной загрузки реактивных списков, который интегрирует ValueNotifiers и Команды для управления жизненным...","ar":"خبير مصدر البيانات هو نمط لقائمة تفاعلية متواصلة يدمج ValueNotifiers والأوامر لإدارة دورة حياة الكيانات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分页列表","无限滚动","实体生命周期管理","响应式列表","自动分页"],"ja":["ページングされたリスト","無限スクロール","エンティティのライフサイクル管理","レスポンシブ リスト","自動ページング"],"ko":["페이지 목록","무한 스크롤","엔티티 라이프 사이클 관리","반응형 목록","자동 페이지"],"es":["Listas paginadas y desplazamiento infinito","Uso de ValueNotifiers y Comandos","Gestión del ciclo de vida de entidades","Integración con patrón de proxy","Auto-paginación configurable"],"fr":["Listes paginées et défilement infini","Utilisation de ValueNotifiers et Commandes","Gestion du cycle de vie des entités","Intégration avec le pattern de proxy","Auto-paginación configurable"],"de":["Paginierte Listen und unendliches Scrollen","Verwendung von ValueNotifiers und Befehlen","Lebenszyklusverwaltung von Entitäten","Integration mit Proxy-Muster","Konfigurierbare Auto-Paginierung"],"pt":["Paginação automática","Integração com proxy para gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de entidades","Uso de ValueNotifiers e Comandos","Carregamento inicial e atualização de dados","Separação de comandos para paginção e atualização"],"ru":["Автоматическая постраничная загрузка","Интеграция с прокси для управления жизненным циклом сущностей","Использование ValueNotifiers и Команд","Первоначальная загрузка и обновление данных","Разделение команд для постраничной загрузки и обновления"],"ar":["التنقل التلقائي للصفحات","التكامل مع البروكسي لإدارة دورة حياة الكيانات","استخدام ValueNotifiers والأوامر","تحميل البيانات الأولي وتحديثها","فصل الأوامر للتنقل للصفحات وتحديثها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Feed 数据源","分页列表","无限滚动","响应式列表","实体生命周期管理","自动分页","ValueNotifiers","Commands"],"ja":["フィード データソース","ページングされたリスト","無限スクロール","レスポンシブ リスト","エンティティのライフサイクル管理","自動ページング","ValueNotifiers","Commands"],"ko":["피드 데이터 소스","페이지 목록","무한 스크롤","반응형 목록","엔티티 라이프 사이클 관리","자동 페이지","ValueNotifiers","Commands"],"es":["listas paginadas","desplazamiento infinito","ValueNotifiers","Comandos","gestión de ciclo de vida","patrón de proxy","auto-paginación","reactividad"],"fr":["listes paginées","défilement infini","ValueNotifiers","Commandes","gestion du cycle de vie","pattern de proxy","auto-paginación","réactivité"],"de":["paginierte Listen","unendliches Scrollen","ValueNotifiers","Befehle","Lebenszyklusverwaltung","Proxy-Muster","Auto-Paginierung","Reaktivität"],"pt":["Feed de Dados","Paginação","Scroll Infinito","ValueNotifiers","Comandos","Gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de entidades","Desenvolvimento de software","Padrões de design"],"ru":["Источники данных","Постраничная загрузка","Бесконечный скролл","ValueNotifiers","Команды","Управление жизненным циклом сущностей","Разработка программного обеспечения","Шаблоны проектирования"],"ar":["مصدر البيانات","التنقل للصفحات","التمرير اللانهاية","ValueNotifiers","الأوامر","إدارة دورة حياة الكيانات","تطوير البرمجيات","أنماط التصميم"]}},"owner":"flutter-it","repo":"watch_it","repoPath":"flutter-it/watch_it","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"feed-datasource-expert","description":"Expert guidance on implementing paginated feeds and infinite scroll in Flutter using FeedDataSource and PagedFeedDataSource patterns. Covers base feed data source, cursor-based pagination, auto-pagination at length-3, proxy lifecycle with reference counting, feed widget implementation, filtered feeds, event bus integration, and creation with createOnce. Use when building paginated lists, infinite scroll, feed views, or managing proxy lifecycle in feeds.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Feed DataSource Expert - Paged Lists & Infinite Scroll\n\n**What**: Pattern for paginated, reactive list/feed widgets using ValueNotifiers and Commands. Integrates with proxy pattern for entity lifecycle management.\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n- Auto-pagination triggers at `items.length - 3` (not at the last item)\n- `updateDataCommand` for initial/refresh loads, `requestNextPageCommand` for pagination - separate commands\n- When refreshing with proxies: release OLD proxies AFTER replacing with new ones (","body":"# Feed DataSource Expert - Paged Lists & Infinite Scroll\n\n**What**: Pattern for paginated, reactive list/feed widgets using ValueNotifiers and Commands. Integrates with proxy pattern for entity lifecycle management.\n\n## CRITICAL RULES\n\n- Auto-pagination triggers at `items.length - 3` (not at the last item)\n- `updateDataCommand` for initial/refresh loads, `requestNextPageCommand` for pagination - separate commands\n- When refreshing with proxies: release OLD proxies AFTER replacing with new ones (delay release for animations)\n- `itemCount` is a ValueNotifier - watch it to rebuild the list widget\n- Feed data sources are typically created with `createOnce` in widgets, NOT registered in get_it\n- `getItemAtIndex(index)` both returns the item AND triggers auto-pagination\n\n## Base FeedDataSource\n\nNon-paged feed for finite data sets:\n\n```dart\nabstract class FeedDataSource<TItem> {\n  FeedDataSource({List<TItem>? initialItems})\n      : items = initialItems ?? [];\n\n  final List<TItem> items;\n  final _itemCount = CustomValueNotifier<int>(0);\n  ValueListenable<int> get itemCount => _itemCount;\n  bool updateWasCalled = false;\n\n  late final updateDataCommand = Command.createAsyncNoParamNoResult(\n    () async {\n      await updateFeedData();\n      updateWasCalled = true;\n      refreshItemCount();\n    },\n    errorFilter: const LocalOnlyErrorFilter(),\n  );\n\n  ValueListenable<bool> get isFetchingNextPage => updateDataCommand.isRunning;\n  ValueListenable<CommandError?> get commandErrors => updateDataCommand.errors;\n\n  /// Subclasses implement - fetch data and populate items list\n  Future<void> updateFeedData();\n\n  /// Subclasses implement - compare items for deduplication\n  bool itemsAreEqual(TItem item1, TItem item2);\n\n  TItem getItemAtIndex(int index) {\n    assert(index >= 0 && index < items.length);\n    return items[index];\n  }\n\n  void refreshItemCount() {\n    _itemCount.value = items.length;\n  }\n\n  void addItemAtStart(TItem item) {\n    items.insert(0, item);\n    refreshItemCount();\n  }\n\n  void removeObject(TItem itemToRemove) {\n    items.removeWhere((item) => itemsAreEqual(item, itemToRemove));\n    refreshItemCount();\n  }\n\n  void reset() {\n    items.clear();\n    updateWasCalled = false;\n    refreshItemCount();\n  }\n\n  void dispose() {\n    _itemCount.dispose();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## PagedFeedDataSource\n\nExtends FeedDataSource with cursor-based pagination:\n\n```dart\nabstract class PagedFeedDataSource<TItem> extends FeedDataSource<TItem> {\n  String? nextPageUrl;\n  bool? datasetExpired;\n\n  bool get hasNextPage => nextPageUrl != null && datasetExpired != true;\n\n  late final requestNextPageCommand = Command.createAsyncNoParamNoResult(\n    () async {\n      await requestNextPage();\n      refreshItemCount();\n    },\n    errorFilter: const LocalOnlyErrorFilter(),\n  );\n\n  /// Subclasses implement - fetch next page and append to items\n  Future<void> requestNextPage();\n\n  /// Call after parsing API response to store next page URL\n  void extractNextPageParams(String? url) {\n    nextPageUrl = url;\n  }\n\n  /// Auto-pagination: triggers when scrolling near the end\n  @override\n  TItem getItemAtIndex(int index) {\n    if (index >= items.length - 3 &&\n        commandErrors.value == null &&\n        hasNextPage &&\n        !requestNextPageCommand.isRunning.value) {\n      requestNextPageCommand.run();\n    }\n    return super.getItemAtIndex(index);\n  }\n\n  // Merged loading/error state from both commands\n  late final ValueNotifier<bool> _isFetchingNextPage = ValueNotifier(false);\n  @override\n  ValueListenable<bool> get isFetchingNextPage => _isFetchingNextPage;\n\n  // Listen to both commands and merge their isRunning states\n  // _isFetchingNextPage.value = updateDataCommand.isRunning.value ||\n  //                              requestNextPageCommand.isRunning.value;\n\n  @override\n  void reset() {\n    nextPageUrl = null;\n    datasetExpired = null;\n    super.reset();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Concrete Implementation with Proxies\n\n```dart\nclass PostsFeedSource extends PagedFeedDataSource<PostProxy> {\n  PostsFeedSource(this.feedType);\n  final PostFeedType feedType;\n\n  @override\n  bool itemsAreEqual(PostProxy a, PostProxy b) => a.id == b.id;\n\n  @override\n  Future<void> updateFeedData() async {\n    final api = PostApi(di<ApiClient>());\n    final response = await api.getPosts(type: feedType);\n    if (response == null) return;\n\n    // Release old proxies (delay for exit animations)\n    final oldItems = List<PostProxy>.from(items);\n    items.clear();\n\n    // Create new proxies via manager (increments ref count)\n    final proxies = di<PostsManager>().createProxies(response.data);\n    items.addAll(proxies);\n    extractNextPageParams(response.links?.next);\n\n    // Release old proxies after animations complete\n    Future.delayed(const Duration(milliseconds: 1000), () {\n      di<PostsManager>().releaseProxies(oldItems);\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Future<void> requestNextPage() async {\n    if (nextPageUrl == null) return;\n    final response = await callNextPageWithUrl<PostListResponse>(nextPageUrl!);\n    if (response == null) return;\n\n    final proxies = di<PostsManager>().createProxies(response.data);\n    items.addAll(proxies);\n    extractNextPageParams(response.links?.next);\n  }\n\n  // Override to manage reference counting on individual operations\n  @override\n  void addItemAtStart(PostProxy item) {\n    item.incrementReferenceCount();\n    super.addItemAtStart(item);\n  }\n\n  @override\n  void removeObject(PostProxy item) {\n    super.removeObject(item);\n    di<PostsManager>().releaseProxy(item);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Feed Widget\n\n```dart\nclass FeedView<TItem> extends WatchingWidget {\n  const FeedView({\n    required this.feedSource,\n    required this.itemBuilder,\n    this.emptyListWidget,\n  });\n\n  final FeedDataSource<TItem> feedSource;\n  final Widget Function(BuildContext, TItem) itemBuilder;\n  final Widget? emptyListWidget;\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    final itemCount = watch(feedSource.itemCount).value;\n    final isFetching = watch(feedSource.isFetchingNextPage).value;\n\n    // Trigger initial load\n    callOnce((_) => feedSource.updateDataCommand.run());\n\n    // Error handler\n    registerHandler(\n      target: feedSource.commandErrors,\n      handler: (context, error, _) {\n        showErrorSnackbar(context, error.error);\n      },\n    );\n\n    // Error state with retry\n    if (feedSource.commandErrors.value != null && itemCount == 0) {\n      return ErrorWidget(\n        onRetry: () => feedSource.updateDataCommand.run(),\n      );\n    }\n\n    // Initial loading\n    if (!feedSource.updateWasCalled && isFetching) {\n      return Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());\n    }\n\n    // Empty state\n    if (itemCount == 0 && feedSource.updateWasCalled) {\n      return emptyListWidget ?? Text(''No items'');\n    }\n\n    // List with pull-to-refresh\n    return RefreshIndicator(\n      onRefresh: () => feedSource.updateDataCommand.runAsync(),\n      child: ListView.builder(\n        itemCount: itemCount + (isFetching ? 1 : 0),\n        itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n          if (index >= itemCount) {\n            return Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());\n          }\n          // getItemAtIndex auto-triggers pagination near end\n          final item = feedSource.getItemAtIndex(index);\n          return itemBuilder(context, item);\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Creation Pattern\n\n```dart\n// Create with createOnce in the widget that owns the feed\nclass PostsFeedPage extends WatchingWidget {\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    final feedSource = createOnce(\n      () => PostsFeedSource(PostFeedType.latest),\n      dispose: (source) => source.dispose(),\n    );\n\n    return FeedView<PostProxy>(\n      feedSource: feedSource,\n      itemBuilder: (context, post) => PostCard(post: post),\n      emptyListWidget: Text(''No posts yet''),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Filtered Feeds\n\nSame data, different views via filter functions:\n\n```dart\nclass ChatsListSource extends PagedFeedDataSource<ChatProxy> {\n  ChatFilterType _filter = ChatFilterType.ALL;\n  String _query = '''';\n\n  void setTypeFilter(ChatFilterType filter) {\n    _filter = filter;\n    updateDataCommand.run();  // Re-fetch with new filter\n  }\n\n  void setSearchQuery(String query) {\n    _query = query;\n    updateDataCommand.run();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Event Bus Integration\n\nFeeds can react to events from other parts of the app:\n\n```dart\n// In FeedDataSource constructor\ndi<EventBus>().on<FeedEvent>().listen((event) {\n  if (event.feedsToApply.contains(feedId)) {\n    switch (event.action) {\n      case FeedEventActions.update:\n        updateDataCommand.run();\n      case FeedEventActions.addItem:\n        addItemAtStart(event.data as TItem);\n      case FeedEventActions.removeItem:\n        removeObject(event.data as TItem);\n    }\n  }\n});\n\n// Trigger from anywhere in the app\ndi<EventBus>().fire(FeedEvent(\n  action: FeedEventActions.addItem,\n  data: newPostProxy,\n  feedsToApply: [FeedIds.latestPostsFeed, FeedIds.followingPostsFeed],\n));\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n```dart\n// ❌ Releasing proxies immediately on refresh (breaks exit animations)\nitems.clear();\ndi<Manager>().releaseProxies(oldItems);  // Widgets still animating!\nitems.addAll(newProxies);\n\n// ✅ Delay release for animations\nfinal oldItems = List.from(items);\nitems.clear();\nitems.addAll(newProxies);\nFuture.delayed(Duration(milliseconds: 1000), () {\n  di<Manager>().releaseProxies(oldItems);\n});\n\n// ❌ Registering feed in get_it as singleton\ndi.registerSingleton<PostsFeed>(PostsFeedSource());\n// ✅ Create with createOnce in the widget that owns it\nfinal feed = createOnce(() => PostsFeedSource());\n\n// ❌ Manually checking scroll position for pagination\nscrollController.addListener(() {\n  if (scrollController.position.pixels >= ...) loadMore();\n});\n// ✅ Auto-pagination via getItemAtIndex triggers at length - 3\n\n// ❌ Single command for both initial load and pagination\n// ✅ Separate commands: updateDataCommand + requestNextPageCommand\n//    Allows independent loading/error states and restrictions\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:35.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced paginated list and feed widget management using ValueNotifiers and Commands.","zh":"非常适合需要高级分页列表和信息流小部件管理的前端代理，使用ValueNotifiers和Commands。","ja":"フロントエンド エージェントが高度なページングされたリストとフィード ウィジェットの管理を必要とする場合に最適です。ValueNotifiers とコマンドを使用します。","ko":"고급 paginate된 목록 및 피드 위젯 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. ValueNotifiers 및 Commands를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una gestión avanzada de listas paginadas y widgets de feeds utilizando ValueNotifiers y Comandos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée de listes paginées et de widgets de flux en utilisant des ValueNotifiers et des Commandes.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Verwaltung von paginierten Listen und Feed-Widgets mit ValueNotifiers und Befehlen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gestão avançada de listas paginadas e widgets de feed usando ValueNotifiers e Comandos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая система управления постраничными списками и виджетами ленты с помощью ValueNotifiers и Команд.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لقوائم الصفحات والمكونات الإضافية للوجة باستخدام ValueNotifiers والأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage reactive list/feed widgets with auto-pagination triggers, leveraging separate commands for initial loads and pagination, and integrating with proxy patterns for entity lifecycle management using updateDataCommand and requestNextPageCommand.","zh":"使代理能够高效地管理具有自动分页触发器的反应性列表/信息流小部件，利用单独的命令进行初始加载和分页，并使用updateDataCommand和requestNextPageCommand与代理模式集成以进行实体生命周期管理。","ja":"エージェントが自動ページング トリガーを備えたリアクティブなリスト/フィード ウィジェットを効率的に管理できるようにします。初期ロードとページングに別々のコマンドを使用し、updateDataCommand と requestNextPageCommand を使用してエンティティのライフサイクル管理のためのプロキシ パターンに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 자동 paginate 트리거가 있는 반응형 목록/피드 위젯을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 초기 로드 및 paginate에 별도의 명령을 사용하며, updateDataCommand 및 requestNextPageCommand를 사용하여 엔티티 수명 주기 관리를 위한 프록시 패턴에 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de forma eficiente los widgets de lista/flujo reactivos con desencadenadores de autopaginación, aprovechando comandos separados para cargas iniciales y paginación, e integrándose con patrones de proxy para la gestión del ciclo de vida de entidades utilizando updateDataCommand y requestNextPageCommand.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière efficace les widgets de liste/flux réactifs avec des déclencheurs d''auto-paginación, en exploitant des commandes séparées pour les chargements initiaux et la paginación, et en s''intégrant avec des modèles de proxy pour la gestion du cycle de vie des entités en utilisant updateDataCommand et requestNextPageCommand.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, reaktive Liste/Feed-Widgets mit Auto-Paginierungstriggern effizient zu verwalten, indem separate Befehle für erste Ladevorgänge und Paginierung genutzt und sich mit Proxy-Mustern für die Lebenszyklusverwaltung von Entitäten unter Verwendung von updateDataCommand und requestNextPageCommand integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente os widgets de lista/fluxo reativos com gatilhos de paginação automática, utilizando comandos separados para carregamentos iniciais e paginação, e integrando com padrões de proxy para gerenciamento do ciclo de vida de entidades usando updateDataCommand e requestNextPageCommand.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять реактивными виджетами списка/ленты с автоматическими триггерами страниц, используя отдельные команды для первоначальных загрузок и страниц, и интегрируя с шаблонами прокси для управления жизненным циклом сущностей с помощью updateDataCommand и requestNextPageCommand.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إدارة Widgets القائمة/التيار بشكل فعال مع أجهزة الحماية أوتوماتيكية للصفحات، باستخدام أوامر منفصلة للتحميل الأولي والتنقل بين الصفحات، وتكامل مع أنماط الوكيل لإدارة دورة حياة الكيانات باستخدام updateDataCommand و requestNextPageCommand."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing infinite scroll for dynamic content loading","Managing paginated lists with auto-pagination triggers at items.length - 3","Refreshing feed widgets with proxies while releasing old proxies after replacement"],"zh":["为动态内容加载实现无限滚动","使用项目.length - 3的自动分页触发器管理分页列表","使用代理刷新信息流小部件，同时在替换后释放旧代理"],"ja":["動的なコンテンツ ロードのための無限スクロールの実装","項目.length - 3の自動ページング トリガーを使用したページングされたリストの管理","プロキシを使用したフィード ウィジェットのリフレッシュ、および置き換え後の古いプロキシの解放"],"ko":["동적인 콘텐츠 로딩을 위한 무한 스크롤 구현","아이템.length - 3의 자동 paginate 트리거를 사용한 paginate된 목록 관리","프록시를 사용한 피드 위젯 새로고침 및 교체 후 오래된 프록시 해제"],"es":["Implementar la función de desplazamiento infinito para la carga de contenido dinámico","Gestionar listas paginadas con desencadenadores de autopaginación en items.length - 3","Actualizar widgets de feeds con proxies mientras se liberan los proxies antiguos después del reemplazo"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le défilement infini pour le chargement de contenu dynamique","Gérer des listes paginées avec des déclencheurs d''auto-paginación à items.length - 3","Rafraîchir les widgets de flux avec des proxies tout en libérant les anciens proxies après remplacement"],"de":["Implementierung des unendlichen Scrollens für die dynamische Ladevorgang","Verwalten von paginierten Listen mit Auto-Paginierungstriggern bei items.length - 3","Aktualisieren von Feed-Widgets mit Proxys, während alte Proxys nach dem Ersetzen freigegeben werden"],"pt":["Implementar rolagem infinita para carregamento de conteúdo dinâmico","Gerenciar listas paginadas com gatilhos de paginação automática em items.length - 3","Atualizar widgets de feed com proxies enquanto libera proxies antigos após substituição"],"ru":["Реализация бесконечной прокрутки для динамической загрузки контента","Управление постраничными списками с автоматическими триггерами страницы при items.length - 3","Обновление виджетов ленты с помощью прокси, освобождая старые прокси после замены"],"ar":["تنفيذ التمرير اللانهائي لتحميل المحتوى الديناميكي","إدارة القوائم المتنقلة مع أجهزة الحماية أوتوماتيكية للصفحات عند items.length - 3","تحديث مكونات الإضافية للوجة باستخدام الوكلاء أثناء إطلاق الوكلاء القدامى بعد الاستبدال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with proxy pattern for entity lifecycle management","Auto-pagination triggers at items.length - 3, which may not be suitable for all use cases"],"zh":["需要与代理模式集成以进行实体生命周期管理","自动分页触发器位于项目.length - 3处，这可能不适合所有使用场景"],"ja":["エンティティのライフサイクル管理のためのプロキシ パターンとの統合が必要","項目.length - 3にある自動ページング トリガー。これはすべての使用ケースに適さない場合がある"],"ko":["엔티티 수명 주기 관리를 위한 프록시 패턴과 통합이 필요함","아이템.length - 3에 있는 자동 paginate 트리거. 이는 모든 사용 사례에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere integración con patrón de proxy para la gestión del ciclo de vida de entidades","Los desencadenadores de autopaginación en items.length - 3, que pueden no ser adecuados para todos los casos de uso"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec un modèle de proxy pour la gestion du cycle de vie des entités","Les déclencheurs d''auto-paginación à items.length - 3, qui peuvent ne pas convenir à tous les cas d''utilisation"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration mit einem Proxy-Muster für die Lebenszyklusverwaltung von Entitäten","Die Auto-Paginierungstrigger bei items.length - 3, die möglicherweise nicht für alle Anwendungsfälle geeignet sind"],"pt":["Exige integração com padrão de proxy para gerenciamento do ciclo de vida de entidades","Gatilhos de paginação automática em items.length - 3, o que pode não ser adequado para todos os casos de uso"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с шаблоном прокси для управления жизненным циклом сущностей","Автоматические триггеры страницы при items.length - 3, что может быть не подходящим для всех случаев использования"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع نمط الوكيل لإدارة دورة حياة الكيانات","أجهزة الحماية أوتوماتيكية للصفحات عند items.length - 3، والتي قد لا تكون مناسبة لجميع حالات الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
