ten.","pt":"O Git Avançado oferece recursos como worktrees para melhorar a produtividade","ru":"Продвинутый Git предлагает функции, такие как worktrees, для повышения производительности","ar":"يقدم جيت المتقدم ميزات مثل worktrees لتحسين الإنتاجية","en":"The most comprehensive toolkit for Claude Code -- 135 agents, 35 curated skills (+15,000 via SkillKit), 42 commands, 120 plugins, 19 hooks, 15 rules, 7 templ..."},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive toolkit for Claude Code -- 135 agents, 35 curated skills (+15,000 via SkillKit), 42 commands, 120 plugins, 19 hooks, 15 rules, 7 templates, 6 MCP configs, and more."},"features":{"zh":["工作树","分支管理","提交管理","工作树列表","工作树删除"],"ja":["ワークツリー","ブランチ管理","コミット管理","ワークツリーの一覧","ワークツリーの削除"],"ko":["작업 트리","브랜치 관리","커밋 관리","작업 트리 목록","작업 트리 삭제"],"es":["Creación de worktrees para ramas de características","Creación de worktrees con nuevas ramas","Lista de todos los worktrees","Eliminación de worktrees después de la fusión","Trabajo en múltiples ramas simultáneamente","Evitación de stashing o compromiso de trabajo en curso"],"fr":["Création de worktrees pour les branches de fonctionnalités","Création de worktrees avec de nouvelles branches","Liste de tous les worktrees","Suppression de worktrees après fusion","Travail sur plusieurs branches simultanément","Évitement du stashing ou de l''engagement de travail en cours"],"de":["Erstellung von Worktrees für Feature-Branches","Erstellung von Worktrees mit neuen Branches","Liste aller Worktrees","Entfernen von Worktrees nach dem Merge","Arbeiten an mehreren Branches gleichzeitig","Vermeidung von Stashing oder Commit von Arbeitsfortschritten"],"pt":["Crie worktrees para branches de recursos","Trabalhe em múltiplos branches simultaneamente","Evite stash e commits de trabalho em andamento","Liste e remova worktrees facilmente","Crie branches novos com worktrees"],"ru":["Создавайте worktrees для функциональных веток","Работайте с несколькими ветками одновременно","Избегайте stash и коммитов незавершенной работы","Легко список и удаляйте worktrees","Создавайте новые ветки с worktrees"],"ar":["أنشئ worktrees لفروع الميزات","العمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","تجنب stash و commits للعمل قيد التقدم","قائمة وازالة worktrees بسهولة","أنشئ فروع جديدة مع worktrees"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 高级技巧","工作树","分支管理","提交管理","Git 开发","版本控制"],"ja":["Git アドバンスド","ワークツリー","ブランチ管理","コミット管理","Git 開発","バージョン管理"],"ko":["Git 고급 기능","작업 트리","브랜치 관리","커밋 관리","Git 개발","버전 관리"],"es":["git avanzado","worktrees","ramas de git","trabajo en equipo","desarrollo de software","herramientas de git","git para desarrolladores","control de versiones"],"fr":["git avancé","worktrees","branches git","travail d''équipe","développement de logiciels","outils git","git pour les développeurs","contrôle de version"],"de":["erweitertes git","worktrees","git-branchen","teamarbeit","software-entwicklung","git-tools","git für entwickler","versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Git Avançado","Worktrees","Branches","Produtividade","Desenvolvimento de Software","Controle de Versão"],"ru":["Продвинутый Git","Worktrees","Ветки","Производительность","Разработка программного обеспечения","Контроль версий"],"ar":["جيت المتقدم","worktrees","الفروع","الإنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"rohitg00","repo":"awesome-claude-code-toolkit","repoPath":"rohitg00/awesome-claude-code-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced","description":"Advanced git workflows including worktrees, bisect, interactive rebase, hooks, and recovery techniques","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but sh","body":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but shares the same `.git` repository.\n\n## Bisect\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect, mark current as bad and known good commit\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v1.5.0\n\n# Git checks out a midpoint commit. Test it, then mark:\ngit bisect good   # if this commit works\ngit bisect bad    # if this commit is broken\n\n# Automate with a test script\ngit bisect start HEAD v1.5.0\ngit bisect run npm test\n\n# When done, reset\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\nBisect performs binary search across commits to find which commit introduced a bug. Automated bisect with `run` is the fastest approach.\n\n## Interactive Rebase\n\n```bash\n# Rebase last 5 commits interactively\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Common operations in the editor:\n# pick   - keep commit as-is\n# reword - change commit message\n# edit   - stop to amend the commit\n# squash - merge into previous commit, keep both messages\n# fixup  - merge into previous commit, discard this message\n# drop   - remove the commit entirely\n\n# Rebase feature branch onto latest main\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Continue after resolving conflicts\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Abort if things go wrong\ngit rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-commit\n\n# Run linter on staged files only\nSTAGED_FILES=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=d | grep -E ''\\.(ts|tsx|js|jsx)$'')\nif [ -n \"$STAGED_FILES\" ]; then\n  npx eslint $STAGED_FILES --fix\n  git add $STAGED_FILES\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/commit-msg\n\n# Enforce conventional commit format\nCOMMIT_MSG=$(cat \"$1\")\nPATTERN=\"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore)(\\(.+\\))?: .{1,72}$\"\n\nif ! echo \"$COMMIT_MSG\" | head -1 | grep -qE \"$PATTERN\"; then\n  echo \"Error: Commit message must follow Conventional Commits format\"\n  echo \"Example: feat(auth): add OAuth2 login flow\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-push\n\n# Run tests before pushing\nnpm test\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"Tests failed. Push aborted.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n## Recovery Techniques\n\n```bash\n# Undo last commit but keep changes staged\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# Recover a deleted branch using reflog\ngit reflog\ngit checkout -b recovered-branch HEAD@{3}\n\n# Recover a file from a specific commit\ngit checkout abc1234 -- path/to/file.ts\n\n# Find lost commits (dangling after reset or rebase)\ngit fsck --lost-found\ngit show <dangling-commit-sha>\n\n# Undo a rebase\ngit reflog\ngit reset --hard HEAD@{5}  # point before rebase started\n```\n\n## Useful Aliases\n\n```bash\n# ~/.gitconfig\n[alias]\n  lg = log --graph --oneline --decorate --all\n  st = status -sb\n  co = checkout\n  unstage = reset HEAD --\n  last = log -1 HEAD --stat\n  branches = branch -a --sort=-committerdate\n  stash-all = stash push --include-untracked\n  conflicts = diff --name-only --diff-filter=U\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Force-pushing to shared branches without `--force-with-lease`\n- Rebasing commits that have already been pushed and shared\n- Committing large binary files without Git LFS\n- Using `git add .` without reviewing `git diff --staged`\n- Not using `.gitignore` for build artifacts, dependencies, and secrets\n- Keeping long-lived feature branches instead of merging frequently\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Worktrees used for parallel branch work instead of stashing\n- [ ] `git bisect run` automates bug-finding with a test command\n- [ ] Interactive rebase cleans up commits before merging to main\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks run linting on staged files\n- [ ] Commit message format enforced via commit-msg hook\n- [ ] `--force-with-lease` used instead of `--force` when force-pushing\n- [ ] Reflog consulted before any destructive operation\n- [ ] `.gitignore` covers build outputs, dependencies, and environment files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:28:48.482Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Development Agents requiring sophisticated multi-branch repository management without workflow interruption.","zh":"适合需要复杂多分支仓库管理而不中断工作流程的代码开发代理。","ja":"ワークフローの断絶なく複雑なマルチブランチリポジトリ管理を必要とするコード開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"작업 흐름을 중단하지 않고 복잡한 멀티 브랜치 리포지토리 관리가 필요한 코드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de código que requieren una gestión de repositorio multi-rama sofisticada sin interrupción del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de code nécessitant une gestion de référentiel multi-branchage sophistiquée sans interruption du workflow.","de":"Ideal für Code-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine sophisticatedes Multi-Branch-Repository-Management ohne Workflow-Unterbrechung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Código que exigem gerenciamento de repositório multi-ramificação sofisticado sem interrupção do fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки кода, требующих сложного управления репозиториями с несколькими ветками без прерывания рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الشفرة الذي يتطلب إدارة مستودع متعدد الفروع المتقدمة دون انقطاع في تدفق العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables simultaneous work on multiple feature branches through Git worktree management, eliminating the need for stashing or committing work-in-progress. Provides direct access to 42 Git commands, 120 plugins, and 19 hooks for comprehensive repository control.","zh":"通过Git工作树管理，实现多个功能分支的同时工作，无需暂存或提交工作进度。提供对42个Git命令、120个插件和19个钩子的直接访问，以实现对仓库的全面控制。","ja":"Gitワークツリ管理を通じて、複数の機能ブランチを同時に作業可能とし、作業中の変更を一時保存またはコミットする必要を排除します。42のGitコマンド、120のプラグイン、19のフックに直接アクセスし、リポジトリの包括的な管理を提供します。","ko":"Git 작업 트리 관리를 통해 여러 기능 브랜치를 동시에 작업할 수 있으며, 작업 중인 변경 사항을 일시적으로 저장하거나 커밋할 필요가 없습니다. 42개의 Git 명령어, 120개의 플러그인, 19개의 후크에 직접 액세스하여 리포지토리의 종합적인 제어를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite trabajar simultáneamente en varias ramas de características a través de la gestión de Git worktree, eliminando la necesidad de almacenar o confirmar el trabajo en progreso. Proporciona acceso directo a 42 comandos Git, 120 plugins y 19 hooks para un control de repositorio integral.","fr":"Permet de travailler simultanément sur plusieurs branches de fonctionnalités grâce à la gestion de Git worktree, éliminant la nécessité de mettre en cache ou de valider le travail en cours. Fournit un accès direct à 42 commandes Git, 120 plugins et 19 hooks pour un contrôle de référentiel complet.","de":"Ermöglicht die simultane Arbeit an mehreren Feature-Branches durch Git-Worktree-Management, wodurch die Notwendigkeit zum Zwischenspeichern oder Bestätigen des laufenden Arbeitsprozesses eliminiert wird. Bietet direkten Zugriff auf 42 Git-Befehle, 120 Plugins und 19 Hooks für eine umfassende Repository-Kontrolle.","pt":"Permite o trabalho simultâneo em várias ramificações de recursos por meio do gerenciamento de Git worktree, eliminando a necessidade de armazenar ou comprometer o trabalho em andamento. Fornece acesso direto a 42 comandos Git, 120 plugins e 19 ganchos para controle abrangente do repositório.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять работу одновременно над несколькими ветками функций посредством управления Git worktree, исключая необходимостьstash или commit работы в процессе. Предоставляет прямой доступ к 42 командам Git, 120 плагинам и 19 хукам для полного контроля репозитория.","ar":"يمكن العمل المتزامن على عدة فروع ميزة من خلال إدارة Git worktree ، وهو ما يلغي الحاجة إلى تخزين أو الالتزام بالعمل قيد التنفيذ. يوفر الوصول المباشر إلى 42 أمر Git و 120 إضافة و 19 خطاف لمراقبة المستودع الشاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing parallel feature development using worktrees","Creating hotfix branches from specific upstream branches","Automating worktree cleanup after branch merging","Listing and monitoring all active worktrees across projects"],"zh":["使用工作树管理并行功能开发","从特定上游分支创建热修复分支","自动清理分支合并后的工作树","列出并监视所有项目中的活动工作树"],"ja":["ワークツリーを使用した並行機能開発の管理","特定のアップストリームブランチからのホットフィックスブランチの作成","ブランチのマージ後のワークツリーの自動クリーンアップ","すべてのプロジェクトのアクティブなワークツリーのリストと監視"],"ko":["작업 트리를 사용한 병렬 기능 개발 관리","특정 업스트림 브랜치에서 핫픽스 브랜치를 생성","브랜치 병합 후 작업 트리 자동 정리","모든 프로젝트에서 활성 작업 트리 목록 및 모니터링"],"es":["Gestión del desarrollo de características paralelas utilizando worktrees","Creación de ramas de corrección de errores a partir de ramas upstream específicas","Automatización de la limpieza de worktrees después de la fusión de ramas","Listado y seguimiento de todos los worktrees activos en los proyectos"],"fr":["Gestion du développement de fonctionnalités parallèles à l''aide de worktrees","Création de branches de correction de bogues à partir de branches upstream spécifiques","Automatisation du nettoyage des worktrees après fusion de branches","Liste et surveillance de tous les worktrees actifs dans les projets"],"de":["Verwaltung der parallelen Feature-Entwicklung mithilfe von Worktrees","Erstellung von Hotfix-Branches aus bestimmten Upstream-Branches","Automatisierung der Worktree-Reinigung nach Branch-Zusammenführung","Auflistung und Überwachung aller aktiven Worktrees in den Projekten"],"pt":["Gerenciar desenvolvimento de recursos paralelo usando worktrees","Criar branches de hotfix a partir de branches upstream específicos","Automatizar limpeza de worktree após mesclagem de branch","Listar e monitorar todos os worktrees ativos em projetos"],"ru":["Управление параллельной разработкой функций с помощью worktree","Создание веток hotfix из определенных веток upstream","Автоматизация очистки worktree после слияния ветки","Перечисление и мониторинг всех активных worktree в проектах"],"ar":["إدارة تطوير الميزات الموازية باستخدام worktrees","إنشاء فروع حرة من فروع محددة بالضبط","توفير تنظيف تلقائي للعمل بعد دمج الفرع","قائمة بجميع العملاء النشطين والمراقبة عبر المشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git worktree support (Git 2.5+)","Needs filesystem access for worktree directories","Dependent on proper Git configuration setup"],"zh":["需要Git工作树支持（Git 2.5+）","需要文件系统访问工作树目录","依赖适当的Git配置设置"],"ja":["Gitワークツリーのサポートが必要（Git 2.5+）","ワークツリーディレクトリへのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","適切なGit設定の構成に依存"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리 지원 필요(Git 2.5+)","작업 트리 디렉토리에 대한 파일 시스템 액세스 필요","적절한 Git 구성 설정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere soporte para Git worktree (Git 2.5+)","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para los directorios de worktree","Depende de la configuración adecuada de Git"],"fr":["Nécessite la prise en charge de Git worktree (Git 2.5+)","A besoin d''un accès au système de fichiers pour les répertoires de worktree","Dépend de la configuration correcte de Git"],"de":["Benötigt Unterstützung für Git-Worktree (Git 2.5+)","Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff für Worktree-Verzeichnisse","Hängt von der ordnungsgemäßen Git-Konfiguration ab"],"pt":["Exige suporte a Git worktree (Git 2.5+)","Necessita acesso ao sistema de arquivos para diretórios de worktree","Dependente de configuração adequada do Git"],"ru":["Требует поддержки Git worktree (Git 2.5+)","Требует доступа к файловой системе для директорий worktree","Зависит от правильной настройки Git"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم Git worktree (Git 2.5+)","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لأدلة worktree","يعتمد على إعدادات Git المناسبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
