ntorno configuradas para la autenticación y la configuración del índice de búsqueda"],"fr":["Nécessite un point de terminaison du service de recherche Azure et une clé d''administration","Dépend des bibliothèques @azure/search-documents et @azure/identity","Nécessite des variables d''environnement configurées pour l''authentification et la configuration de l''index de recherche"],"de":["Benötigt einen Endpunkt des Azure-Suchdienstes und einen Administratorschlüssel","Hängt von den Bibliotheken @azure/search-documents und @azure/identity ab","Benötigt konfigurierte Umgebungsvariablen für die Authentifizierung und die Suchindexeinstellungen"],"pt":["Requires Azure Search service endpoint and admin key","Dependent on @azure/search-documents and @azure/identity libraries","Needs environment variables configured for authentication and search index settings"],"ru":["Requires Azure Search service endpoint and admin key","Dependent on @azure/search-documents and @azure/identity libraries","Needs environment variables configured for authentication and search index settings"],"ar":["Requires Azure Search service endpoint and admin key","Dependent on @azure/search-documents and @azure/identity libraries","Needs environment variables configured for authentication and search index settings"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
