CP configs, and more."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"数据工程工具包","ja":"データエンジニアリングツールキット","ko":"데이터 엔지니어링 툴킷","es":"Ingeniería de Datos: ETL y Pipelines","fr":"Ingénierie de Données: ETL et Pipelines","de":"Datenengineering: ETL und Pipelines","pt":"Engenharia de Dados: Ferramentas e Técnicas","ru":"Инженерия данных: инструменты и методы","ar":"هندسة البيانات: أدوات وتقنيات","en":"data-engineering"},"description":{"zh":"数据工程是指使用技术和方法从各种来源提取、转换和加载数据","ja":"データエンジニアリングとは、様々なソースからのデータを抽出、変換、読み込みするために使用される技術と方法","ko":"데이터 엔지니어링은 다양한 소스에서 데이터를 추출, 변환, 로드하기 위한 기술과 방법","es":"La ingeniería de datos es el proceso de diseñar y construir sistemas para almacenar y procesar grandes cantidades de datos. Claude Code ofrece una herramient...","fr":"L''ingénierie de données est le processus de conception et de construction de systèmes pour stocker et traiter de grandes quantités de données. Claude Code pr...","de":"Datenengineering ist der Prozess des Entwurfs und des Baus von Systemen zur Speicherung und Verarbeitung großer Datenmengen. Claude Code bietet ein umfassend...","pt":"A engenharia de dados é uma disciplina que combina técnicas de processamento de dados e armazenamento para fornecer insights valiosos. Com Claude Code, você ...","ru":"Инженерия данных - это дисциплина, которая объединяет методы обработки и хранения данных для предоставления ценных сведений. С Claude Code вы можете создават...","ar":"هندسة البيانات هي تخصص يجمع بين تقنيات معالجة البيانات وتخزينها لتوفير رؤى قيمة. مع Claude Code ، يمكنك إنشاء خطوط أنابيب ETL مخصصة.","en":"The most comprehensive toolkit for Claude Code -- 135 agents, 35 curated skills (+15,000 via SkillKit), 42 commands, 120 plugins, 19 hooks, 15 rules, 7 templ..."},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive toolkit for Claude Code -- 135 agents, 35 curated skills (+15,000 via SkillKit), 42 commands, 120 plugins, 19 hooks, 15 rules, 7 templates, 6 MCP configs, and more."},"features":{"zh":["ETL管道","数据处理","数据分析","数据仓库","数据可视化"],"ja":["ETLパイプライン","データ処理","データ分析","データウェアハウス","データ可視化"],"ko":["ETL 파이프라인","데이터 처리","데이터 분석","데이터 웨어하우스","데이터 시각화"],"es":["Creación de pipelines ETL","Transformación y carga de datos","Integración con bases de datos","Gestión de errores y registros","Optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["Création de pipelines ETL","Transformation et chargement de données","Intégration avec des bases de données","Gestion des erreurs et des journaux","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Erstellung von ETL-Pipelines","Transformierung und Laden von Daten","Integration mit Datenbanken","Fehler- und Protokollverwaltung","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Criação de pipelines de ETL personalizados","Integração com bancos de dados e armazenamento de dados","Processamento de dados em batch e em tempo real","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python","Ferramentas de monitoramento e depuração"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых конвейеров ETL","Интеграция с базами данных и хранилищами данных","Обработка данных пакетной и реальной обработки","Поддержка языков программирования, таких как Python","Инструменты мониторинга и отладки"],"ar":["إنشاء خطوط أنابيب ETL مخصصة","التكامل مع قواعد البيانات وتخزين البيانات","معالجة البيانات بشكل دستي ووقت حقيقي","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python","أدوات مراقبة وتصحيح الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据工程","ETL","数据处理","数据分析","数据仓库","数据可视化"],"ja":["データエンジニアリング","ETL","データ処理","データ分析","データウェアハウス","データ可視化"],"ko":["데이터 엔지니어링","ETL","데이터 처리","데이터 분석","데이터 웨어하우스","데이터 시각화"],"es":["ingeniería de datos","ETL","pipelines","transformación de datos","carga de datos","bases de datos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["ingénierie de données","ETL","pipelines","transformation de données","chargement de données","bases de données","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Datenengineering","ETL","Pipelines","Datentransformierung","Datenladen","Datenbanken","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["engenharia de dados","ETL","pipeline de dados","processamento de dados","armazenamento de dados","bancos de dados","Python","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["инженерия данных","ETL","конвейер данных","обработка данных","хранилище данных","базы данных","Python","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["هندسة البيانات","ETL","خط أنابيب البيانات","معالجة البيانات","تخزين البيانات","قواعد البيانات","Python","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"rohitg00","repo":"awesome-claude-code-toolkit","repoPath":"rohitg00/awesome-claude-code-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-engineering","description":"Data engineering patterns for ETL pipelines, data warehousing, Apache Spark, and data quality validation","bodyPreview":"# Data Engineering\n\n## ETL Pipeline Pattern\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass PipelineResult:\n    records_extracted: int\n    records_transformed: int\n    records_loaded: int\n    errors: list[str]\n    duration_seconds: float\n\nclass OrderPipeline:\n    def __init__(self, source_db, warehouse_db):\n        self.source = source_db\n        self.warehouse = warehouse_db\n\n    def extract(self, since: datetime) -> list[dict]:\n        query = \"\"\"","body":"# Data Engineering\n\n## ETL Pipeline Pattern\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass PipelineResult:\n    records_extracted: int\n    records_transformed: int\n    records_loaded: int\n    errors: list[str]\n    duration_seconds: float\n\nclass OrderPipeline:\n    def __init__(self, source_db, warehouse_db):\n        self.source = source_db\n        self.warehouse = warehouse_db\n\n    def extract(self, since: datetime) -> list[dict]:\n        query = \"\"\"\n            SELECT o.*, c.name as customer_name, c.segment\n            FROM orders o\n            JOIN customers c ON o.customer_id = c.id\n            WHERE o.updated_at > %s\n        \"\"\"\n        return self.source.fetch_all(query, [since])\n\n    def transform(self, records: list[dict]) -> list[dict]:\n        transformed = []\n        for record in records:\n            transformed.append({\n                \"order_id\": record[\"id\"],\n                \"customer_name\": record[\"customer_name\"],\n                \"segment\": record[\"segment\"].upper(),\n                \"total_amount\": float(record[\"total\"]),\n                \"order_date\": record[\"created_at\"].date(),\n                \"fiscal_quarter\": get_fiscal_quarter(record[\"created_at\"]),\n                \"is_high_value\": float(record[\"total\"]) > 1000,\n                \"loaded_at\": datetime.utcnow(),\n            })\n        return transformed\n\n    def load(self, records: list[dict]) -> int:\n        return self.warehouse.upsert_batch(\n            table=\"fact_orders\",\n            records=records,\n            conflict_keys=[\"order_id\"],\n            batch_size=5000,\n        )\n\n    def run(self, since: datetime) -> PipelineResult:\n        start = datetime.utcnow()\n        raw = self.extract(since)\n        clean = self.transform(raw)\n        loaded = self.load(clean)\n        return PipelineResult(\n            records_extracted=len(raw),\n            records_transformed=len(clean),\n            records_loaded=loaded,\n            errors=[],\n            duration_seconds=(datetime.utcnow() - start).total_seconds(),\n        )\n```\n\n## Apache Spark Processing\n\n```python\nfrom pyspark.sql import SparkSession\nfrom pyspark.sql import functions as F\nfrom pyspark.sql.window import Window\n\nspark = SparkSession.builder \\\n    .appName(\"sales-analytics\") \\\n    .config(\"spark.sql.adaptive.enabled\", \"true\") \\\n    .config(\"spark.sql.shuffle.partitions\", \"200\") \\\n    .getOrCreate()\n\norders = spark.read.parquet(\"s3://data-lake/orders/\")\ncustomers = spark.read.parquet(\"s3://data-lake/customers/\")\n\ndaily_revenue = (\n    orders\n    .filter(F.col(\"status\") == \"completed\")\n    .withColumn(\"order_date\", F.to_date(\"created_at\"))\n    .groupBy(\"order_date\", \"product_category\")\n    .agg(\n        F.sum(\"total_amount\").alias(\"revenue\"),\n        F.count(\"id\").alias(\"order_count\"),\n        F.avg(\"total_amount\").alias(\"avg_order_value\"),\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"revenue_7d_avg\",\n        F.avg(\"revenue\").over(\n            Window.partitionBy(\"product_category\")\n            .orderBy(\"order_date\")\n            .rowsBetween(-6, 0)\n        )\n    )\n)\n\ndaily_revenue.write \\\n    .partitionBy(\"order_date\") \\\n    .mode(\"overwrite\") \\\n    .parquet(\"s3://data-warehouse/daily_revenue/\")\n```\n\n## Data Quality Checks\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass\nclass QualityCheck:\n    name: str\n    query: str\n    threshold: float\n    severity: str\n\nCHECKS = [\n    QualityCheck(\n        name=\"null_customer_ids\",\n        query=\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM fact_orders WHERE customer_id IS NULL\",\n        threshold=0,\n        severity=\"critical\",\n    ),\n    QualityCheck(\n        name=\"negative_amounts\",\n        query=\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM fact_orders WHERE total_amount < 0\",\n        threshold=0,\n        severity=\"critical\",\n    ),\n    QualityCheck(\n        name=\"duplicate_orders\",\n        query=\"SELECT COUNT(*) - COUNT(DISTINCT order_id) FROM fact_orders\",\n        threshold=0,\n        severity=\"warning\",\n    ),\n    QualityCheck(\n        name=\"freshness\",\n        query=\"SELECT EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM NOW() - MAX(loaded_at))/3600 FROM fact_orders\",\n        threshold=2.0,\n        severity=\"warning\",\n    ),\n]\n\ndef run_quality_checks(db, checks: list[QualityCheck]) -> list[dict]:\n    results = []\n    for check in checks:\n        value = db.fetch_scalar(check.query)\n        passed = value <= check.threshold\n        results.append({\n            \"name\": check.name,\n            \"value\": value,\n            \"threshold\": check.threshold,\n            \"passed\": passed,\n            \"severity\": check.severity,\n        })\n        if not passed and check.severity == \"critical\":\n            raise DataQualityError(f\"Critical check failed: {check.name} = {value}\")\n    return results\n```\n\n## Data Warehouse Schema (Star Schema)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE dim_customers (\n    customer_key    BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,\n    customer_id     VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\n    name            VARCHAR(200),\n    segment         VARCHAR(50),\n    country         VARCHAR(100),\n    valid_from      TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,\n    valid_to        TIMESTAMP,\n    is_current      BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE dim_products (\n    product_key     BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,\n    product_id      VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\n    name            VARCHAR(200),\n    category        VARCHAR(100),\n    subcategory     VARCHAR(100)\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE fact_orders (\n    order_key       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,\n    order_id        VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n    customer_key    BIGINT REFERENCES dim_customers(customer_key),\n    product_key     BIGINT REFERENCES dim_products(product_key),\n    order_date_key  INT,\n    quantity        INT,\n    unit_price      DECIMAL(10,2),\n    total_amount    DECIMAL(12,2),\n    loaded_at       TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Processing data row-by-row instead of in batches or sets\n- Not partitioning large tables by date or category\n- Missing data quality checks between pipeline stages\n- Loading raw data directly into the warehouse without transformation\n- Using full table scans when incremental loads would suffice\n- Not tracking data lineage (where data came from, when it was processed)\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Pipelines follow Extract-Transform-Load with clear stage separation\n- [ ] Incremental processing based on watermarks or change data capture\n- [ ] Data quality checks run after each pipeline stage\n- [ ] Warehouse uses star or snowflake schema with dimension and fact tables\n- [ ] Spark jobs use adaptive query execution and appropriate partitioning\n- [ ] Idempotent loads (re-running produces the same result)\n- [ ] Data freshness monitored with automated alerts\n- [ ] Schema evolution handled gracefully (additive changes preferred)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:30:12.948Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced ETL pipeline management and data processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级ETL管道管理和数据处理能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"高度なETLパイプライン管理とデータ処理機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 ETL 파이프라인 관리 및 데이터 처리 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced ETL pipeline management and data processing capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced ETL pipeline management and data processing capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced ETL pipeline management and data processing capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de pipeline ETL e capacidades de processamento de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления конвейером ETL и обработки данных.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة متقدمة لخط أنابيب ETL وقدرات معالجة البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and execute efficient data pipelines using Python, leveraging libraries like dataclasses for structured data handling and datetime for timestamped data extraction, all while utilizing ETL pipeline patterns for seamless data integration.","zh":"赋予代理设计和执行高效的数据管道的能力，利用Python，并利用像数据类这样的库进行结构化数据处理和datetime进行时间戳数据提取，同时利用ETL管道模式实现无缝的数据集成。","ja":"Pythonを利用し、データクラスなどのライブラリを使用して構造化されたデータの処理を行い、datetimeを使用してタイムスタンプ付きのデータを抽出し、同時にETLパイプラインパターンを使用してシームレスなデータ統合を実現する、効率的なデータパイプラインの設計と実行をエージェントに可能にする。","ko":"파이썬을 활용하여 효율적인 데이터 파이프라인을 설계하고 실행할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하며, 데이터 클래스와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 구조화된 데이터 처리와 datetime을 사용하여 타임스탬프가 있는 데이터 추출을，同时 ETL 파이프라인 패턴을 사용하여 무결점의 데이터 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to design and execute efficient data pipelines using Python, leveraging libraries like dataclasses for structured data handling and datetime for timestamped data extraction, all while utilizing ETL pipeline patterns for seamless data integration.","fr":"Empowers agents to design and execute efficient data pipelines using Python, leveraging libraries like dataclasses for structured data handling and datetime for timestamped data extraction, all while utilizing ETL pipeline patterns for seamless data integration.","de":"Empowers agents to design and execute efficient data pipelines using Python, leveraging libraries like dataclasses for structured data handling and datetime for timestamped data extraction, all while utilizing ETL pipeline patterns for seamless data integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e executar pipelines de dados eficientes usando Python, aproveitando bibliotecas como dataclasses para manipulação de dados estruturados e datetime para extração de dados com carimbo de data/hora, tudo isso utilizando padrões de pipeline ETL para integração de dados sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и выполнять эффективные конвейеры данных с использованием Python, используя библиотеки như dataclasses для обработки структурированных данных и datetime для извлечения данных с меткой времени, все это при использовании шаблонов конвейера ETL для бесшовной интеграции данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتشغيل خطوط أنابيب بيانات فعالة باستخدام Python، واستخدام مكتبات مثل dataclasses لمعالجة البيانات المنظمة وdatetime لاستخراج البيانات المطابقة للتاريخ والزمان، مع استخدام أنماط خط أنابيب ETL для دمج البيانات دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable ETL pipelines for large datasets","Automating data extraction from source databases","Transforming and loading data into warehouse databases for analysis"],"zh":["为大型数据集构建可扩展的ETL管道","自动从源数据库中提取数据","将数据转换和加载到仓库数据库中进行分析"],"ja":["大規模なデータセットのためのスケーラブルなETLパイプラインの構築","ソースデータベースからのデータの自動抽出","分析のための倉庫データベースへのデータの変換とロード"],"ko":["대규모 데이터 세트를 위한 확장 가능한 ETL 파이프라인 구축","소스 데이터베이스에서 데이터 자동 추출","분석을 위한 데이터仓库에 데이터 변환 및 로드"],"es":["Building scalable ETL pipelines for large datasets","Automating data extraction from source databases","Transforming and loading data into warehouse databases for analysis"],"fr":["Building scalable ETL pipelines for large datasets","Automating data extraction from source databases","Transforming and loading data into warehouse databases for analysis"],"de":["Building scalable ETL pipelines for large datasets","Automating data extraction from source databases","Transforming and loading data into warehouse databases for analysis"],"pt":["Construir pipelines ETL escaláveis para grandes conjuntos de dados","Automatizar a extração de dados de bancos de dados de origem","Transformar e carregar dados em bancos de dados de armazenamento para análise"],"ru":["Построение масштабируемых конвейеров ETL для больших наборов данных","Автоматизация извлечения данных из баз данных-источников","Преобразование и загрузка данных в базы данных-хранилища для анализа"],"ar":["بناء خطوط أنابيب ETL قابلة للتحجيم لكميات كبيرة من البيانات","تأتمتة استخراج البيانات من قواعد البيانات المصدر","تحويل وتحميل البيانات في قواعد بيانات التخزين للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x compatibility","Dependent on database connections for source and warehouse databases"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x兼容性","依赖于源数据库和仓库数据库的数据库连接"],"ja":["Python 3.xの互換性が必要","ソースデータベースと倉庫データベースのデータベース接続に依存"],"ko":["파이썬 3.x 호환성이 필요함","소스 데이터베이스 및 데이터倉庫의 데이터베이스 연결에 의존"],"es":["Requires Python 3.x compatibility","Dependent on database connections for source and warehouse databases"],"fr":["Requires Python 3.x compatibility","Dependent on database connections for source and warehouse databases"],"de":["Requires Python 3.x compatibility","Dependent on database connections for source and warehouse databases"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Python 3.x","Dependente de conexões de banco de dados para bancos de dados de origem e armazenamento"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Python 3.x","Зависит от подключений к базам данных для баз данных-источников и хранилищ"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Python 3.x","يعتمد على اتصالات قواعد البيانات لقواعد البيانات المصدر والتخزين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
