de manera automatizada con scripts de Python","fr":"Testez vos applications web de manière automatisée avec des scripts Python","de":"Testen Sie Ihre Webanwendungen automatisiert mit Python-Skripten","pt":"O teste de aplicativos web é fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a confiabilidade do seu aplicativo. Descubra como testar tudo de forma automática","ru":"Тестирование веб-приложений имеет важное значение для обеспечения качества и надежности вашего приложения. Узнайте, как автоматизировать тестирование","ar":"اختبار تطبيقات الويب ضروري لضمان جودة وموثوقية تطبيقك. تعلم كيفية اختبار كل شيء تلقائيًا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化浏览器测试","截图功能","无障碍检查","支持多种浏览器","易于使用的脚本"],"ja":["自動化ブラウザーテスト","スクリーンショット機能","アクセシビリティチェック","複数ブラウザ対応","使いやすいスクリプト"],"ko":["자동화 브라우저 테스트","스크린샷 기능","접근성 확인","다중 브라우저 지원","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 스크립트"],"es":["Ejecución automática de pruebas de navegador","Captura de pantalla para análisis visual","Comprobación de accesibilidad para cumplir con los estándares","Personalización de scripts para adaptarse a necesidades específicas","Soporte para múltiples URLs y parámetros de configuración"],"fr":["Exécution automatisée des tests de navigateur","Capture d''écran pour l''analyse visuelle","Vérification de l''accessibilité pour respecter les normes","Personnalisation des scripts pour s''adapter à des besoins spécifiques","Prise en charge de plusieurs URL et paramètres de configuration"],"de":["Automatisierte Ausführung von Browser-Tests","Bildschirmaufnahme für visuelle Analyse","Überprüfung der Zugänglichkeit, um Standards einzuhalten","Anpassung von Skripten an spezifische Anforderungen","Unterstützung für mehrere URLs und Konfigurationsparameter"],"pt":["Testes de navegador automático","Captura de tela","Verificação de acessibilidade","Execução de scripts de runtime","Testes de funcionalidade"],"ru":["Автоматизированное тестирование браузера","Создание скриншотов","Проверка доступности","Выполнение скриптов runtime","Тестирование функциональности"],"ar":["اختبار المتصفح التلقائي","التقاط الشاشة","فحص الإمكانية","تشغيل سكريبتات وقت التشغيل","اختبار الوظيفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["web应用测试","自动化浏览器测试","截图功能","无障碍检查","浏览器测试工具","web开发工具"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","自動化ブラウザーテスト","スクリーンショット機能","アクセシビリティチェック","ブラウザーテストツール","Web開発ツール"],"ko":["웹애플리케이션 테스트","자동화 브라우저 테스트","스크린샷 기능","접근성 확인","브라우저 테스트 도구","웹개발 도구"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","automatización de pruebas","testing web","script de python","pruebas de navegador","accesibilidad web","desarrollo web","testing automático"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","automatisation des tests","testing web","script python","tests de navigateur","accessibilité web","développement web","testing automatique"],"de":["webanwendungstests","automatisierung von tests","web testing","python skript","browser tests","zugänglichkeit web","webentwicklung","automatisiertes testing"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","automatização de testes","script de runtime","captura de tela","verificação de acessibilidade","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","автоматизация тестирования","скрипт runtime","создание скриншотов","проверка доступности","разработка веб-приложений"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","الآليّة في الاختبار","سكريبت وقت التشغيل","التقاط الشاشة","فحص الإمكانية","تطوير تطبيقات الويب"]}},"owner":"xenitV1","repo":"Antigravity-Workflows","repoPath":"xenitV1/Antigravity-Workflows","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Web application testing principles. E2E, Playwright, deep audit strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `","body":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `pip install playwright && playwright install chromium`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Deep Audit Approach\n\n### Discovery First\n\n| Target | How to Find |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Routes | Scan app/, pages/, router files |\n| API endpoints | Grep for HTTP methods |\n| Components | Find component directories |\n| Features | Read documentation |\n\n### Systematic Testing\n\n1. **Map** - List all routes/APIs\n2. **Scan** - Verify they respond\n3. **Test** - Cover critical paths\n\n---\n\n## 2. Testing Pyramid for Web\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical user flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, data flow\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Component (Many)\n                    Individual UI pieces\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. E2E Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Priority | Tests |\n|----------|-------|\n| 1 | Happy path user flows |\n| 2 | Authentication flows |\n| 3 | Critical business actions |\n| 4 | Error handling |\n\n### E2E Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| Use data-testid | Stable selectors |\n| Wait for elements | Avoid flaky tests |\n| Clean state | Independent tests |\n| Avoid implementation details | Test user behavior |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Playwright Principles\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Page Object Model | Encapsulate page logic |\n| Fixtures | Reusable test setup |\n| Assertions | Built-in auto-wait |\n| Trace Viewer | Debug failures |\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Setting | Recommendation |\n|---------|----------------|\n| Retries | 2 on CI |\n| Trace | on-first-retry |\n| Screenshots | on-failure |\n| Video | retain-on-failure |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Visual Testing\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Design system | High |\n| Marketing pages | High |\n| Component library | Medium |\n| Dynamic content | Lower |\n\n### Strategy\n\n- Baseline screenshots\n- Compare on changes\n- Review visual diffs\n- Update intentional changes\n\n---\n\n## 6. API Testing Principles\n\n### Coverage Areas\n\n| Area | Tests |\n|------|-------|\n| Status codes | 200, 400, 404, 500 |\n| Response shape | Matches schema |\n| Error messages | User-friendly |\n| Edge cases | Empty, large, special chars |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── e2e/           # Full user flows\n├── integration/   # API, data\n├── component/     # UI units\n└── fixtures/      # Shared data\n```\n\n### Naming Convention\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Feature-based | `login.spec.ts` |\n| Descriptive | `user-can-checkout.spec.ts` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. CI Integration\n\n### Pipeline Steps\n\n1. Install dependencies\n2. Install browsers\n3. Run tests\n4. Upload artifacts (traces, screenshots)\n\n### Parallelization\n\n| Strategy | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Per file | Playwright default |\n| Sharding | Large suites |\n| Workers | Multiple browsers |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Hardcode waits | Use auto-wait |\n| Skip cleanup | Isolate tests |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** E2E tests are expensive. Use them for critical paths only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:30:13.999Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Testing Agents requiring advanced browser automation and accessibility checks using Playwright","zh":"适用于需要高级浏览器自动化和使用 Playwright 进行可访问性检查的自动化测试代理","ja":"Playwright を使用した高度なブラウザ自動化とアクセシビリティチェックを必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용한 고급 브라우저 자동화 및 접근성 확인이 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Pruebas Automatizadas que requieren automatización avanzada del navegador y verificaciones de accesibilidad utilizando Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Test Automatisés nécessitant une automatisation avancée du navigateur et des vérifications d''accessibilité utilisant Playwright","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Testagenten, die eine erweiterte Browserautomatisierung und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de teste automatizados que exigem automação avançada de navegador e verificações de acessibilidade usando Playwright","ru":"Идеально подходит для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, требующих продвинутой автоматизации браузера и проверок доступности с помощью Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعمليات اختبار آلي تتطلب آلية متقدمة للمتصفح واختبارات سهولة الوصول باستخدام Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute automated browser tests with screenshot capabilities and accessibility checks using Python scripts, leveraging Playwright for seamless browser interaction and a11y audits","zh":"赋予代理执行自动浏览器测试的能力，具有截图功能和使用 Python 脚本的可访问性检查，利用 Playwright 实现无缝的浏览器交互和 a11y 审计","ja":"Python スクリプトを使用したスクリーンショット機能とアクセシビリティチェックを備えた自動ブラウザテストの実行をエージェントに可能にし、Playwright を使用して無摩擦のブラウザインタラクションと a11y 監査を実現","ko":"Python 스크립트를 사용한 스크린샷 기능 및 접근성 확인을 갖춘 자동 브라우저 테스트를 에이전트가 실행하도록 하는 것과 Playwright를 사용한 무결점 브라우저 상호작용 및 a11y 감사를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de navegador automatizadas con capacidades de captura de pantalla y verificaciones de accesibilidad utilizando scripts de Python, aprovechando Playwright para una interacción de navegador sin problemas y auditorías de accesibilidad","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests de navigateur automatisés avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran et des vérifications d''accessibilité en utilisant des scripts Python, en exploitant Playwright pour une interaction de navigateur transparente et des audits d''accessibilité","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Browser-Tests mit Screenshot-Funktionen und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten durchzuführen, indem Python-Skripte verwendet werden, die Playwright für eine nahtlose Browser-Interaktion und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes automatizados de navegador com capacidades de captura de tela e verificações de acessibilidade usando scripts Python, aproveitando o Playwright para interação de navegador transparente e auditorias de acessibilidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять автоматизированные тесты браузера со способностями захвата экрана и проверок доступности с помощью скриптов Python, используя Playwright для бесшовного взаимодействия с браузером и аудитов доступности","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل الاختبارات الآلية للمتصفح مع إمكانات لالتقاط الشاشة واختبارات سهولة الوصول باستخدام البرامج النصية Python، مستفيداً من Playwright للتفاعل السلس مع المتصفح وعمليات التدقيق من حيث سهولة الوصول"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser tests for web applications","Generating screenshots for visual regression testing","Performing accessibility checks for compliance"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序自动化浏览器测试","为视觉回归测试生成截图","执行符合规定的可访问性检查"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションの自動ブラウザテストの自動化","視覚的回帰テストのスクリーンショットの生成","コンプライアンスのためのアクセシビリティチェックの実行"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 브라우저 자동화 테스트","시각적 회귀 테스트를 위한 스크린샷 생성","준수 확인을 위한 접근성 확인 수행"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de navegador para aplicaciones web","Generar capturas de pantalla para pruebas de regresión visual","Realizar verificaciones de accesibilidad para cumplimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de navigateur pour les applications web","Générer des captures d''écran pour les tests de régression visuelle","Effectuer des vérifications d''accessibilité pour le respect de la réglementation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Tests für Webanwendungen","Erstellung von Screenshots für visuelle Regressionsprüfungen","Durchführung von Zugriffsmöglichkeiten für die Einhaltung von Vorschriften"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de navegador para aplicações web","Gerar capturas de tela para testes de regressão visual","Realizar verificações de acessibilidade para conformidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты браузера для веб-приложений","Генерировать снимки экрана для визуальных тестов регрессии","Выполнять проверки доступности для соответствия"],"ar":["آليّة اختبارات المتصفح لتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء لقطات شاشة لاختبارات الانحدار المرئي","إجراء اختبارات سهولة الوصول للامتثال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Playwright dependency needed","Limited to browser testing"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","需要 Playwright 依赖","仅限浏览器测试"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","Playwright 依存関係が必要","ブラウザテストに限定"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","Playwright 종속성 필요","브라우저 테스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita dependencia de Playwright","Limitado a pruebas de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépendance de Playwright requise","Limité aux tests de navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Playwright-Abhängigkeit erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Browser-Tests"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Dependência do Playwright necessária","Limitado a testes de navegador"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Необходима зависимость от Playwright","Ограничен тестированием браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","تحتاج إلى تبعية لبرنامج Playwright","محدود باختبارات المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vargHQ/sdk/varg-video-generation', 'community', 'vargHQ', 'sdk', 'vargHQ/sdk', 'varg-video-generation', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:30:09.433Z', NULL, '{"id":"vargHQ/sdk/varg-video-generation","name":"varg-video-generation","description":{"zh":"varg视频生成是一个AI原生SDK，使用declarative JSX语法生成AI视频，具有自动缓存和并行生成","ja":"vargビデオ生成はAIネイティブSDKであり、宣言的なJSX構文を使用してAIビデオを生成し、自動キャッシュと並列生成を実現","ko":"varg 비디오 생성은 AI 네이티브 SDK로 선언적 JSX 구문을 사용하여 AI 비디오를 생성하며 자동 캐싱 및 병렬 생성을 지원","es":"varg es un SDK de herramientas de video nativo de IA que permite generar videos personalizados con declarative JSX syntax y caché automático.","fr":"varg est un SDK d''outils de vidéo natif de l''IA qui permet de générer des vidéos personnalisées avec une syntaxe JSX déclarative et un cache automatique.","de":"varg ist ein AI-natives SDK für Video-Tools, das die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Videos mit deklarativer JSX-Syntax und automatischem Caching ermöglicht.","pt":"O varg é um SDK nativo de IA para ferramentas de vídeo, permitindo a geração de vídeos em AI com syntax JSX declarativa","ru":"Varg - это родной SDK ИИ для видеоинструментов, позволяющий генерировать видео в ИИ с помощью синтаксиса JSX","ar":"varg هو SDK أصلي للذكاء الاصطناعي لأدوات الفيديو، يسمح بتوليد الفيديوهات باستخدام بنية JSX الإعلانية","en":"AI-native SDK for video tooling"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"varg视频生成：AI原生SDK","ja":"vargビデオ生成：AIネイティブSDK","ko":"varg 비디오 생성: AI 네이티브 SDK","es":"Generación de videos con varg: SDK de herramientas de vid...","fr":"Génération de vidéos avec varg : SDK d''outils de vidéo na...","de":"Video-Generierung mit varg: AI-natives SDK für Video-Tools","pt":"Geração de Vídeo com varg: SDK Nativo de IA","ru":"Генерация Видео с varg: Родной SDK ИИ","ar":"توليد الفيديو مع varg: SDK أصلي للذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"varg-video-generation"},"d