mémoire de Matrix pour Claude Code.","de":"Das Tool Matrix-Liste ermöglicht es Entwicklern, den Matrix-Speicherinhalt und -Statistiken für Claude-Code anzuzeigen und zu exportieren.","en":"Claude on Rails - Tooling System for Claude Code."},"definition":{"en":"Claude on Rails - Tooling System for Claude Code."},"features":{"zh":["显示 Matrix 内存内容","导出 Matrix 内存内容","显示统计数据","显示范围细分","显示最近解决方案","显示顶级执行者"],"ja":["Matrix メモリ内容を表示","Matrix メモリ内容をエクスポート","統計データを表示","範囲の細分を表示","最近の解決策を表示","トップパフォーマーを表示"],"ko":["Matrix 메모리 내용 표시","Matrix 메모리 내용导出","통계 데이터 표시","범위 세분화 표시","최근 해결方案 표시","최상위 실행자 표시"],"es":["Exhibición de estadísticas y contenido de memoria de Matrix","Exportación de datos de Matrix","Visualización de soluciones y errores","Filtrado de estadísticas y contenido","Compatibilidad con Claude Code"],"fr":["Affichage des statistiques et du contenu de mémoire de Matrix","Exportation des données de Matrix","Visualisation des solutions et des erreurs","Filtrage des statistiques et du contenu","Compatibilité avec Claude Code"],"de":["Anzeige von Matrix-Speicherinhalt und -Statistiken","Exportieren von Matrix-Daten","Anzeige von Lösungen und Fehlern","Filtern von Statistiken und Inhalt","Kompatibilität mit Claude-Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Matrix List","Claude 代码工具系统","Matrix 内存内容","统计数据","导出数据","代码工具","开发工具","软件开发"],"ja":["Matrix List","Claude コードツールシステム","Matrix メモリ内容","統計データ","データエクスポート","コードツール","開発ツール","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["Matrix List","Claude 코드 도구 시스템","Matrix 메모리 내용","통계 데이터","데이터导出","코드 도구","개발 도구","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["Lista de Matrices","Claude Code","Herramienta de sistema","Estadísticas de Matrix","Contenido de memoria de Matrix","Exportación de datos","Desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Liste de Matrices","Claude Code","Outil de système","Statistiques de Matrix","Contenu de mémoire de Matrix","Exportation de données","Développement de logiciels"],"de":["Matrix-Liste","Claude-Code","Tooling-System","Matrix-Statistiken","Matrix-Speicherinhalt","Datenexport","Software-Entwicklung"]}},"owner":"ojowwalker77","repo":"Claude-Matrix","repoPath":"ojowwalker77/Claude-Matrix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Matrix List","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to list matrix solutions, show matrix stats, display memory contents, view matrix status, show failures, list warnings, export matrix data, backup matrix, export solutions, or needs to see or export Matrix memory.","bodyPreview":"# Matrix List & Export\n\nDisplay or export Matrix memory contents and statistics.\n\n## List (default)\n\nUse `matrix_status` to retrieve information and present it to the user.\n\n- **No arguments**: Show statistics, scope breakdown, recent solutions, top performers\n- **\"stats\"**: Focus on statistics only\n- **\"failures\"**: Focus on recorded failures\n- **\"warnings\"**: Use `matrix_warn` with action \"list\" to show warnings\n- **\"solutions\"**: Show detailed solutions list\n\n## Export\n\nWhen the user says \"ex","body":"# Matrix List & Export\n\nDisplay or export Matrix memory contents and statistics.\n\n## List (default)\n\nUse `matrix_status` to retrieve information and present it to the user.\n\n- **No arguments**: Show statistics, scope breakdown, recent solutions, top performers\n- **\"stats\"**: Focus on statistics only\n- **\"failures\"**: Focus on recorded failures\n- **\"warnings\"**: Use `matrix_warn` with action \"list\" to show warnings\n- **\"solutions\"**: Show detailed solutions list\n\n## Export\n\nWhen the user says \"export\" or \"backup\":\n\n1. Use `matrix_status` to get all data\n2. Format as JSON\n3. Use `Write` to save to the specified path (or default to `matrix-export.json`)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:31:51.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Claude Code agents requiring deep introspection into their Matrix memory system for debugging and optimization.","zh":"对于需要深度内省其 Matrix 内存系统以进行调试和优化的 Claude Code 智能体而言至关重要。","ja":"Matrix メモリシステムのデバッグと最適化のために深い内省を必要とする Claude Code エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"Matrix 메모리 시스템에 대한 디버깅 및 최적화를 위해 깊은 내성(introspection)이 필요한 Claude Code 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes Claude Code que requieren una introspección profunda en su sistema de memoria Matrix para depuración y optimización.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents Claude Code nécessitant une introspection approfondie dans leur système de mémoire Matrix pour le débogage et l''optimisation.","de":"Wichtig für Claude Code-Agents, die eine tiefe Introspektion in ihr Matrix-Speichersystem für Debugging und Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Essential for Claude Code agents requiring deep introspection into their Matrix memory system for debugging and optimization.","ru":"Essential for Claude Code agents requiring deep introspection into their Matrix memory system for debugging and optimization.","ar":"Essential for Claude Code agents requiring deep introspection into their Matrix memory system for debugging and optimization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides direct access to Matrix memory analytics including scope breakdowns, solution performance metrics, and failure diagnostics. Enables agents to retrieve statistics, analyze recent solutions, identify top performers, and export memory contents using matrix_status and matrix_warn commands.","zh":"提供对 Matrix 内存分析的直接访问，包括作用域细分、解决方案性能指标和故障诊断。使智能体能够使用 matrix_status 和 matrix_warn 命令检索统计数据、分析最近的解决方案、识别表现最佳者以及导出内存内容。","ja":"スコープの内訳、ソリューションのパフォーマンスメトリクス、障害診断を含む Matrix メモリ分析への直接アクセスを提供します。matrix_status および matrix_warn コマンドを使用して、統計情報の取得、最近のソリューションの分析、トップパフォーマーの特定、メモリ内容のエクスポートをエージェントが行えるようにします。","ko":"범위 분해(scope breakdowns), 솔루션 성능 메트릭, 실패 진단을 포함한 Matrix 메모리 분석에 대한 직접적인 접근을 제공합니다. matrix_status 및 matrix_warn 명령어를 사용하여 에이전트가 통계를 검색하고, 최근 솔루션을 분석하며, 최고 성능자를 식별하고, 메모리 내용을 내보낼 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Proporciona acceso directo a las analíticas de memoria Matrix, incluyendo desglose de alcance, métricas de rendimiento de soluciones y diagnósticos de fallos. Permite a los agentes recuperar estadísticas, analizar soluciones recientes, identificar a los mejores rendimientos y exportar el contenido de la memoria utilizando los comandos matrix_status y matrix_warn.","fr":"Fournit un accès direct aux analyses de mémoire Matrix, y compris la ventilation de la portée, les métriques de performance des solutions et les diagnostics de défaillance. Permet aux agents de récupérer des statistiques, d''analyser des solutions récentes, d''identifier les meilleures performances et d''exporter le contenu de la mémoire à l''aide des commandes matrix_status et matrix_warn.","de":"Bietet direkten Zugriff auf Matrix-Speicheranalysen, einschließlich Umfangsverteilung, Lösungsleistungsmetriken und Fehlerschuberätung. Ermöglicht es Agenten, Statistiken abzurufen, kürzliche Lösungen zu analysieren, Spitzenleister zu identifizieren und Speicherinhalte mithilfe der Befehle matrix_status und matrix_warn zu exportieren.","pt":"Provides direct access to Matrix memory analytics including scope breakdowns, solution performance metrics, and failure diagnostics. Enables agents to retrieve statistics, analyze recent solutions, identify top performers, and export memory contents using matrix_status and matrix_warn commands.","ru":"Provides direct access to Matrix memory analytics including scope breakdowns, solution performance metrics, and failure diagnostics. Enables agents to retrieve statistics, analyze recent solutions, identify top performers, and export memory contents using matrix_status and matrix_warn commands.","ar":"Provides direct access to Matrix memory analytics including scope breakdowns, solution performance metrics, and failure diagnostics. Enables agents to retrieve statistics, analyze recent solutions, identify top performers, and export memory contents using matrix_status and matrix_warn commands."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging recorded failures in Matrix memory","Analyzing solution performance statistics","Exporting memory contents for external analysis","Monitoring system warnings through matrix_warn listings","Reviewing scope breakdowns for memory optimization"],"zh":["调试 Matrix 内存中记录的故障","分析解决方案性能统计","导出内存内容以供外部分析","通过 matrix_warn 列表监控系统警告","审查用于内存优化的作用域细分"],"ja":["Matrix メモリに記録された障害のデバッグ","ソリューションのパフォーマンス統計の分析","外部分析のためのメモリ内容のエクスポート","matrix_warn リストを通じたシステム警告の監視","メモリ最適化のためのスコープ内訳のレビュー"],"ko":["Matrix 메모리에 기록된 실패 사항 디버깅","솔루션 성능 통계 분석","외부 분석을 위한 메모리 내용 내보내기","matrix_warn 목록을 통한 시스템 경고 모니터링","메모리 최적화를 위한 범위 분해(scope breakdowns) 검토"],"es":["Depuración de fallos grabados en la memoria Matrix","Análisis de estadísticas de rendimiento de soluciones","Exportación de contenidos de memoria para análisis externo","Monitoreo de advertencias del sistema a través de listados matrix_warn","Revisión de desglose de alcance para optimización de memoria"],"fr":["Débogage des défaillances enregistrées dans la mémoire Matrix","Analyse des statistiques de performance des solutions","Exportation du contenu de la mémoire pour analyse externe","Supervision des avertissements du système via les listes matrix_warn","Révision de la ventilation de la portée pour l''optimisation de la mémoire"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung für aufgezeichnete Fehler im Matrix-Speicher","Analyse von Lösungsleistungsstatistiken","Export von Speicherinhalten für externe Analyse","Überwachung von Systemwarnungen über matrix_warn-Listen","Überprüfung der Umfangsverteilung für die Speicheroptimierung"],"pt":["Debugging recorded failures in Matrix memory","Analyzing solution performance statistics","Exporting memory contents for external analysis","Monitoring system warnings through matrix_warn listings","Reviewing scope breakdowns for memory optimization"],"ru":["Debugging recorded failures in Matrix memory","Analyzing solution performance statistics","Exporting memory contents for external analysis","Monitoring system warnings through matrix_warn listings","Reviewing scope breakdowns for memory optimization"],"ar":["Debugging recorded failures in Matrix memory","Analyzing solution performance statistics","Exporting memory contents for external analysis","Monitoring system warnings through matrix_warn listings","Reviewing scope breakdowns for memory optimization"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Matrix memory system integration","Dependent on matrix_status command availability","Export functionality appears incomplete based on preview"],"zh":["需要 Matrix 内存系统集成","依赖于 matrix_status 命令的可用性","根据预览，导出功能似乎不完整"],"ja":["Matrix メモリシステムの統合が必要","matrix_status コマンドの可用性に依存","プレビューに基づくとエクスポート機能は不完全と思われる"],"ko":["Matrix 메모리 시스템 통합 필요","matrix_status 명령어 가용성에 의존","미리보기 기준 내보내기 기능이 불완전해 보임"],"es":["Requiere integración con el sistema de memoria Matrix","Dependiente de la disponibilidad del comando matrix_status","La funcionalidad de exportación parece incompleta según la vista previa"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le système de mémoire Matrix","Dépend de la disponibilité de la commande matrix_status","La fonctionnalité d''exportation semble incomplète selon l''aperçu"],"de":["Benötigt Integration in das Matrix-Speichersystem","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit des Befehls matrix_status","Die Exportfunktion scheint aufgrund der Vorschau unvollständig zu sein"],"pt":["Requires Matrix memory system integration","Dependent on matrix_status command availability","Export functionality appears incomplete based on preview"],"ru":["Requires Matrix memory system integration","Dependent on matrix_status command availability","Export functionality appears incomplete based on preview"],"ar":["Requires Matrix memory system integration","Dependent on matrix_status command availability","Export functionality appears incomplete based on preview"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
