sateur naturelle et fluide"],"de":["Minimierung der kognitiven Belastung","Intuitive Interaktionen","Respekt für die menschliche Psychologie und Verhaltensmuster","Unsichtbares Design","Natürliche und flüssige Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Minimização da carga cognitiva","Design intuitivo","Respeito à psicologia humana","Padrões comportamentais","Interactions naturais","Simplicidade na experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Минимизация когнитивной нагрузки","Интуитивный дизайн","Уважение к человеческой психологии","Поведенческие паттерны","Естественные взаимодействия","Простота в пользовательском опыте"],"ar":["تقليل التحميل المعرفي","تصميم直وقي","احترام علم النفس البشري","الأنماط السلوكية","التفاعلات الطبيعية","البساطة في تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计系统","用户体验","交互设计","人类心理学","行为模式","设计原则","用户界面","用户参与度","认知负担"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザインシステム","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","インタラクティブデザイン","人間の心理学","行動パターン","設計原則","ユーザーインターフェース","ユーザー参加度","認知負担"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인 시스템","사용자 경험","상호 작용 디자인","인간의 심리학","행동 패턴","디자인 원칙","사용자 인터페이스","사용자 참여도","인지 부하"],"es":["diseño frontend","filosofía del diseño","experiencia del usuario","interacciones intuitivas","carga cognitiva","psicología y diseño"],"fr":["conception frontend","philosophie de la conception","expérience utilisateur","interactions intuitives","charge cognitive","psychologie et conception"],"de":["frontend-design","designphilosophie","benutzererfahrung","intuitive interaktionen","kognitive belastung","psychologie und design"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","design de interface","experiência do usuário","psicologia humana","padrões comportamentais","interações intuitivas","carga cognitiva","design de frontend"],"ru":["фронтенд-разработка","дизайн интерфейса","пользовательский опыт","человеческая психология","поведенческие паттерны","интуитивные взаимодействия","когнитивная нагрузка","фронтенд-дизайн"],"ar":["تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","تصميم الواجهة","تجربة المستخدم","علم النفس البشري","الأنماط السلوكية","التفاعلات直وقية","التحميل المعرفي","تصميم الواجهة الأمامية"]}},"owner":"xenitV1","repo":"claude-code-maestro","repoPath":"xenitV1/claude-code-maestro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Elite Tier Web UI standards, including pixel-perfect retro aesthetics, immersive layouts, and UX psychology protocols.","bodyPreview":"<domain_overview>\n# Frontend Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Minimize cognitive load and make interactions intuitive. Every design decision should respect human psychology, behavioral patterns, and cognitive limitations. The designer bears complexity so the user experiences simplicity.\n> **Core Principle:** Good design is invisible - users should accomplish their goals without noticing the design itself. Design should feel effortless and natural, aligning with how humans naturally think and beh","body":"<domain_overview>\n# Frontend Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Minimize cognitive load and make interactions intuitive. Every design decision should respect human psychology, behavioral patterns, and cognitive limitations. The designer bears complexity so the user experiences simplicity.\n> **Core Principle:** Good design is invisible - users should accomplish their goals without noticing the design itself. Design should feel effortless and natural, aligning with how humans naturally think and behave.\n\n## ⚠️ Core Protocols & Standards\n**ANTI-AI AESTHETIC MANDATE (CRITICAL):** Never use generic aesthetics that give the impression of being AI-generated. This includes overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliché color schemes (especially purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts, and repetitive component patterns.\n**ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN:** The \"Cyberpunk\" aesthetic is strictly prohibited. Do NOT use neon glows, matrix rain, glitch effects, or \"high-tech\" dark modes unless explicitly requested for a specific context. This cliché is the hallmark of lazy AI generation.\nSpecifically avoid template-driven designs that lack context-specific character. This skill aims to create distinctive, original, and production-level frontends. Realize functional, high-fidelity code by paying extraordinary attention to aesthetic details and creative decisions.\n\n**CRITICAL PROTOCOL:** The detailed rules are stored in separate reference files. You **MUST** use the `Read` tool to load these files into your context **BEFORE** starting any design work. Do not assume you know the contents.\n\n- **[frontend_reference.md](frontend_reference.md)**: Contains Technical Standards, Aesthetic Signatures, and Creative Protocols.\n- **[animation_reference.md](animation_reference.md)**: Contains 2025 Motion Standards, Physics-based animation rules, and Micro-interactions.\n- **[css_art_reference.md](css_art_reference.md)**: **FOR VISUAL OBJECTS.** Use this when asked to \"draw\" or \"create\" complex items (Swords, Logos, Icons) using code. Defines Geometric Composition & LCH Materials.\n- **[security-protocols.md](security-protocols.md)**: Contains critical Frontend Security rules.\n\n## 🎬 Core Animation Principles\n> **Motion Mandate:** Animation must be **Physics-Based** (Springs), **Continuous** (No Teleportation), and **Meaningful** (Storytelling).\n\n- **Continuity:** State changes must morph, not cut (View Transitions).\n- **Weight:** Objects must feel like they have mass (Use Spring Animations).\n- **Focus:** Animation guides attention; it does not distract.\n- **Narrative:** Every motion tells a story about where an element came from and where it is going.\n*(See `animation_reference.md` for the full 12-Principle Framework)*\n\n## 🔗 Related & Required Skills\nWhen executing Frontend tasks, you **MUST** integrate these complementary skills to ensure architectural integrity:\n\n| Skill | Purpose in Frontend Context |\n|-------|-----------------------------|\n| **`brainstorming`** | **MANDATORY PRE-REQUISITE.** Before ANY design work, use this to interrogate the user''s vague instructions and crystallize the \"Screenplay/Narrative\" defined in `frontend_reference.md`. |\n| **`clean-code`** | **MANDATORY.** Ensures component modularity, cleaner hooks/state logic, and security compliance. Prevents \"spaghetti UI code\". |\n| **`tdd-mastery`** | **MANDATORY.** \"Iron Law\" applies to components too. Use for visual regression tests and logic verification before coding UI. |\n| **`optimization-mastery`** | Use for Performance Audits (Lighthouse, Core Web Vitals), reducing bundle size, and optimizing re-renders. |\n| **`backend-design`** | Consult this when defining API data shapes, error handling states, and ensuring type safety across the network boundary. |\n| **`planning-mastery`** | Use this to break down complex UI implementations into \"Atomic\" deliverables (Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms). |\n\n## 🛠️ Automation Scripts\nUse the following script to audit your implementation:\n- **`scripts/js/ux-audit.js`**: Run this to perform a heuristic analysis of the UI for consistency, accessibility (contrast/spacing), and compliance with the design tokens.\n  - *Usage:* `node scripts/js/ux-audit.js`\n</domain_overview>"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:31:19.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI/UX-focused Agents aiming to create intuitive and minimalist interfaces with a deep understanding of human psychology and behavioral patterns.","zh":"非常适合专注于UI/UX的智能体，旨在创建直观且极简的界面，并深入理解人类心理学和行为模式。","ja":"人間の心理学と行動パターンを深く理解し、直感的でミニマリストなインターフェースの作成を目指すUI/UX重視のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"인간의 심리학과 행동 패턴에 대한 깊은 이해를 바탕으로 직관적이고 미니멀한 인터페이스를 만들고자 하는 UI/UX 중심 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes centrados en UI/UX que buscan crear interfaces intuitivas y minimalistas con una comprensión profunda de la psicología humana y los patrones de comportamiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents axés sur l''UI/UX visant à créer des interfaces intuitives et minimalistes avec une compréhension approfondie de la psychologie humaine et des schémas comportementaux.","de":"Ideal für UI/UX-fokussierte Agents, die intuitive und minimalistische Schnittstellen mit einem tiefen Verständnis der menschlichen Psychologie und Verhaltensmuster erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes focados em UI/UX que visam criar interfaces intuitivas e minimalistas com uma compreensão profunda da psicologia humana e dos padrões comportamentais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI/UX, целью которых является создание интуитивных и минималистических интерфейсов с глубоким пониманием человеческой психологии и поведенческих паттернов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوسائط المتعددة/التجربة المستخدم التي تهدف إلى إنشاء واجهات مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام وتصاميم بسيطة مع فهم عميق للنفسية البشرية وأنماط السلوك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design invisible and effortless user experiences by respecting cognitive limitations, utilizing principles of human-centered design, and leveraging technologies like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to create seamless interactions.","zh":"通过尊重认知局限、运用以人为本的设计原则，并利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript等技术创建无缝交互，使智能体能够设计出无形且轻松的用户体验。","ja":"認知的限界を尊重し、人間中心設計の原則を利用し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptなどの技術を活用してシームレスなインタラクションを作り出すことで、目に見えず労力を要しないユーザー体験をエージェントが設計できるようにします。","ko":"인지적 한계를 존중하고 인간 중심 디자인 원칙을 활용하며 HTML, CSS, JavaScript와 같은 기술을 활용하여 원활한 상호작용을 만들어냄으로써, 에이전트가 보이지 않고 노력이 필요 없는 사용자 경험을 설계할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar experiencias de usuario invisibles y sin esfuerzo respetando las limitaciones cognitivas, utilizando principios de diseño centrado en el ser humano y aprovechando tecnologías como HTML, CSS y JavaScript para crear interacciones fluidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des expériences utilisateur invisibles et sans effort en respectant les limitations cognitives, en utilisant les principes de la conception centrée sur l''humain et en exploitant des technologies comme HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour créer des interactions transparentes.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, unsichtbare und mühelose Benutzererfahrungen zu gestalten, indem kognitive Einschränkungen respektiert werden, Prinzipien des humanzentrierten Designs genutzt werden und Technologien wie HTML, CSS und JavaScript eingesetzt werden, um nahtlose Interaktionen zu schaffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar experiências do usuário invisíveis e sem esforço, respeitando as limitações cognitivas, utilizando princípios de design centrado no ser humano e aproveitando tecnologias como HTML, CSS e JavaScript para criar interações sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать невидимые и безусильные пользовательские trải nghiệm, уважая когнитивные ограничения, используя принципы человеко-ориентированного дизайна и использую технологии như HTML, CSS и JavaScript для создания бесперебойных взаимодействий.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تصميم تجارب المستخدم غير مرئية وبلا جهد من خلال احترام القيود المعرفية، واستخدام مبادئ تصميم مركز على الإنسان، وتحقيق التكنولوجيات مثل HTML و CSS و JavaScript لإنشاء تفاعلات بدون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Crafting responsive and adaptive layouts for cross-device compatibility","Developing accessible and inclusive design systems with clear typography and color schemes","Optimizing user flows and wireframing for enhanced usability and conversion rates"],"zh":["为跨设备兼容性打造响应式和自适应布局","开发具有清晰排版和配色方案的无障碍和包容性设计系统","优化用户流程和线框图以提高可用性和转化率"],"ja":["クロスデバイス互換性のためのレスポンシブおよび適応レイアウトの構築","明確なタイポグラフィとカラースキームを備えたアクセシブルで包括的なデザインシステムの開発","ユーザーフローとワイヤーフレーミングの最適化によるユーザビリティとコンバージョン率の向上"],"ko":["크로스 디바이스 호환성을 위한 반응형 및 적응형 레이아웃 제작","명확한 타이포그래피와 컬러 체계를 갖춘 접근성 있고 포용적인 디자인 시스템 개발","향상된 사용성과 전환율을 위한 사용자 흐름 및 와이어프레이밍 최적화"],"es":["Creación de diseños responsivos y adaptativos para la compatibilidad multiplataforma","Desarrollo de sistemas de diseño accesibles e inclusivos con tipografía y esquemas de color claros","Optimización de flujos de usuario y wireframing para mejorar la usabilidad y las tasas de conversión"],"fr":["Conception de mises en page réactives et adaptatives pour une compatibilité multi-appareils","Développement de systèmes de conception accessibles et inclusifs avec une typographie et des schémas de couleurs clairs","Optimisation des flux utilisateur et de la création de maquettes pour améliorer la convivialité et les taux de conversion"],"de":["Entwicklung responsiver und adaptiver Layouts für geräteübergreifende Kompatibilität","Entwicklung zugänglicher und inklusiver Designsysteme mit klarer Typografie und Farbschemata","Optimierung von User Flows und Wireframing für verbesserte Usability und Konversionsraten"],"pt":["Criação de layouts responsivos e adaptáveis para compatibilidade entre dispositivos","Desenvolvimento de sistemas de design acessíveis e inclusivos com tipografia e esquemas de cores claros","Otimização de fluxos de usuário e wireframing para usabilidade e taxas de conversão aprimoradas"],"ru":["Создание адаптивных и отзывчивых макетов для совместимости между устройствами","Разработка доступных и инклюзивных систем дизайна с четкой типографией и цветовыми схемами","Оптимизация потоков пользователя и wireframing для улучшения удобства использования и коэффициентов конверсии"],"ar":["إنشاء تخطيطات مستجيب ومتكيف للتوافق بين الأجهزة","تطوير أنظمة التصميم المتوافرة والشاملة ذات الطباعة واضحة ومخططات الألوان","تحسين تدفقات المستخدم وwireframing لتحسين سهولة الاستخدام ومعدلات التحويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of front-end development frameworks and libraries","Dependent on design principles and human psychology knowledge","May need additional tools for prototyping and usability testing"],"zh":["需要理解前端开发框架和库","依赖于设计原则和人类心理学知识","可能还需要其他工具进行原型设计和可用性测试"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発フレームワークとライブラリの理解が必要","デザイン原則と人間の心理学の知識に依存","プロトタイピングとユーザビリティテストには追加のツールが必要な場合がある"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 프레임워크 및 라이브러리에 대한 이해 필요","디자인 원칙과 인간 심리학 지식에 의존","프로토타이핑과 사용성 테스트를 위해 추가 도구가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de frameworks y bibliotecas de desarrollo front-end","Depende de los principios de diseño y el conocimiento de la psicología humana","Puede necesitar herramientas adicionales para prototipado y pruebas de usabilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des frameworks et bibliothèques de développement front-end","Dépend des principes de conception et des connaissances en psychologie humaine","Peut nécessiter des outils supplémentaires pour le prototypage et les tests d''utilisabilité"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von Front-End-Entwicklungsframeworks und Bibliotheken","Abhängig von Designprinzipien und Kenntnissen der menschlichen Psychologie","Kann zusätzliche Tools für Prototyping und Usability-Tests benötigen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de frameworks e bibliotecas de desenvolvimento front-end","Depende de princípios de design e conhecimento de psicologia humana","Pode precisar de ferramentas adicionais para prototipagem e testes de usabilidade"],"ru":["Требует понимания фреймворков и библиотек фронтенд-разработки","Зависит от принципов дизайна и знаний человеческой психологии","Может потребовать дополнительных инструментов для прототипирования и тестирования на удобство использования"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الإطارات والمرافق لتطوير واجهة المستخدم","يعتمد على مبادئ التصميم ومعرفة النفسية البشرية","قد يحتاج إلى أدوات إضافية لإنشاء النماذج الأولية واختبار سهولة الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lee-to/ai-factory/ai-factory.review', 'community', 'lee-to', 'ai-factory', 'lee-to/ai-factory', 'ai-factory.review', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:31:44.517Z', NULL, '{"id":"lee-to/ai-factory/ai-factory.review","name":"ai-factory.review","description":{"zh":"AI 代码审查助手是一种可以进行彻底代码审查的工具，帮助开发者提高代码质量","ja":"AI コードレビューアシスタントは、コードの品質を向上させるために徹底的なコードレビューを実行するツールです","ko":"AI 코드 리뷰 어시스턴트는 코드 품질을 향상시키기 위해 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행하는 도구입니다","es":"El asistente de revisión de código AI Factory realiza una revisión exhaustiva de los cambios de código, centrándose en la corrección, seguridad, rendimiento y mantenibilidad.","fr":"L''assistant de révision de code AI Factory effectue une révision approfondie des modifications de code, en se concentrant sur la correction, la sécurité, les performances et la maintenabilité.","de":"Der AI-Factory-Code-Review-Assistent führt eine gründliche Überprüfung der Code-Änderungen durch, wobei Korrektheit, Sicherheit, Leistung und Wartbarkeit im Mittelpunkt stehen.","pt":"O assistente de revisão de código AI-Factory executa uma revisão completa do código, focando em correção, segurança, desempenho e manutenção.","ru":"Помощник обзора кода AI-Factory выполняет полный обзор кода, фокусируясь на исправлении, безопасности, производительности и поддержке.","ar":"مساعد مراجعة الكود AI-Factory يقوم بمراجعة شاملة للكود، يركز على التصحيح والأمان والأداء والصيانة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 代码审查助手","ja":"AI コードレビューアシスタント","ko":"AI 코드 리뷰 어시스턴트","es":"Asistente de revisión de código AI Factory","fr":"Assistant de révision de code AI Factory","de":"AI-Factory-Code-Review-Assistent","pt":"Assistente de Revisão de Código AI-Factory","ru":"Помощник обзора кода AI-Factory","ar":"مساعد مراجعة الكود AI-Factory","en":"ai-factory.review"},"description":{"zh":"AI 代码审查助手是一种可以进行彻底代码审查的工具，帮助开发者提高代码质量","ja":"AI コードレビューアシスタントは、コードの品質を向上させるために徹底的なコードレビューを実行するツールです","ko":"AI 코드 리뷰 어시스턴트는 코드 품질을 향상시키기 위해 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행하는 도구입니다","es":"El asistente de revisión de código AI Factory realiza una revisión exhaustiva de los cambios de código, centrándose en la corrección, seguridad, rendimiento ...","fr":"L''assistant de révision de code AI Factory effectue une révision approfondie des modifications de code, en se concentrant sur la correction, la sécurité, les...","de":"Der AI-Factory-Code-Review-Assistent führt eine gründliche Überprüfung der Code-Änderungen durch, wobei Korrektheit, Sicherheit, Leistung und Wartbarkeit im ...","pt":"O assistente de revisão de código AI-Factory executa uma revisão completa do código, focando em correção, segurança, desempenho e manutenção.","ru":"Помощник обзора кода AI-Factory выполняет полный обзор кода, фокусируясь на исправлении, безопасности, производительности и поддержке.","ar":"مساعد مراجعة الكود AI-Factory يقوم بمراجعة شاملة للكود، يركز على التصحيح والأمان والأداء والصيانة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持代码正确性检查","支持代码安全性检查","支持代码性能优化","支持代码维护性检查","支持 Git 代码库集成","支持 PR 代码审查"],"ja":["コードの正しさの確認をサポート","コードのセキュリティの確認をサポート","コードのパフォーマンスの最適化をサポート","コードのメンテナンス性の確認をサポート","Git コードリポジトリの統合をサポート","PR コードレビューをサポート"],"ko":["코드 정확성 확인 지원","코드 보안성 확인 지원","코드 성능 최적화 지원","코드 유지 보수성 확인 지원","Git 코드 저장소 통합 지원","PR 코드 리뷰 지원"],"es":["Revisión de cambios de código","Análisis de corrección y seguridad","Evaluación del rendimiento","Verificación de la mantenibilidad","Compatibilidad con GitHub"],"fr":["Révision des modifications de code","Analyse de la correction et de la sécurité","Évaluation des performances","Vérification de la maintenabilité","Compatibilité avec GitHub"],"de":["Überprüfung von Code-Änderungen","Analyse von Korrektheit und Sicherheit","Bewertung der Leistung","Überprüfung der Wartbarkeit","Kompatibilität mit GitHub"],"pt":["Análise de alterações no código","Revisão de PRs para garantir a qualidade","Foco em correção, segurança, desempenho e manutenção","Integração com o Git para revisão de alterações","Suporte a revisão de código em diferentes linguagens"],"ru":["Анализ изменений в коде","Обзор PR для обеспечения качества","Фокус на исправлении, безопасности, производительности и поддержке","Интеграция с Git для обзора изменений","Поддержка обзора кода на разных языках"],"ar":["تحليل التغييرات في الكود","مراجعة الطلبات سحب لضمان الجودة","التركيز على التصحيح والأمان والأداء والصيانة","التكامل مع جيت لمراجعة التغييرات","دعم مراجعة الكود بلغات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 代码审查","代码审查工具","代码质量","代码安全性","代码性能","代码维护性","Git 代码库","PR 代码审查"],"ja":["AI コードレビュー","コードレビューツール","コード品質","コードセキュリティ","コードパフォーマンス","コードメンテナンス性","Git コードリポジトリ","PR コードレビュー"],"ko":["AI 코드 리뷰","코드 리뷰 도구","코드 품질","코드 보안","코드 성능","코드 유지 보수","Git 코드 저장소","PR 코드 리뷰"],"es":["revisión de código","asistente de revisión de código","análisis de código","calidad de código","seguridad de código","rendimiento de código","mantenibilidad de código","GitHub"],"fr":["révision de code","assistant de révision de code","analyse de code","qualité de code","sécurité de code","performances de code","maintenabilité de code","GitHub"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Review-Assistent","Code-Analyse","Code-Qualität","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Leistung","Code-Wartbarkeit","GitHub"],"pt":["revisão de código","assistente de revisão de código","qualidade de código","segurança de código","desempenho de código","manutenção de código","git","pr","revisão de pr"],"ru":["обзор кода","помощник обзора кода","качество кода","безопасность кода","производительность кода","поддержка кода","git","pr","обзор pr"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","مساعد مراجعة الكود","جودة الكود","أمان الكود","أداء الكود","صيانة الكود","جيت","طلب سحب","مراجعة الطلبات سحب"]}},"owner":"lee-to","repo":"ai-factory","repoPath":"lee-to/ai-factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-factory.review","description":"Perform code review on staged changes or a pull request. Checks for bugs, security issues, performance problems, and best practices. Use when user says review code, check my code, review PR, or is this code okay.","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Assistant\n\nPerform thorough code reviews focusing on correctness, security, performance, and maintainability.\n\n## Behavior\n\n### Without Arguments (Review Staged Changes)\n\n1. Run `git diff --cached` to get staged changes\n2. If nothing staged, run `git diff` for unstaged changes\n3. Analyze each file''s changes\n\n### With PR Number/URL\n\n1. Use `gh pr view <number> --json` to get PR details\n2. Use `gh pr diff <number>` to get the diff\n3. Review all changes in the PR\n\n## Review Checklist","body":"# Code Review Assistant\n\nPerform thorough code reviews focusing on correctness, security, performance, and maintainability.\n\n## Behavior\n\n### Without Arguments (Review Staged Changes)\n\n1. Run `git diff --cached` to get staged changes\n2. If nothing staged, run `git diff` for unstaged changes\n3. Analyze each file''s changes\n\n### With PR Number/URL\n\n1. Use `gh pr view <number> --json` to get PR details\n2. Use `gh pr diff <number>` to get the diff\n3. Review all changes in the PR\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Correctness\n- [ ] Logic errors or bugs\n- [ ] Edge cases handling\n- [ ] Null/undefined checks\n- [ ] Error handling completeness\n- [ ] Type safety (if applicable)\n\n### Security\n- [ ] SQL injection vulnerabilities\n- [ ] XSS vulnerabilities\n- [ ] Command injection\n- [ ] Sensitive data exposure\n- [ ] Authentication/authorization issues\n- [ ] CSRF protection\n- [ ] Input validation\n\n### Performance\n- [ ] N+1 query problems\n- [ ] Unnecessary re-renders (React)\n- [ ] Memory leaks\n- [ ] Inefficient algorithms\n- [ ] Missing indexes (database)\n- [ ] Large payload sizes\n\n### Best Practices\n- [ ] Code duplication\n- [ ] Dead code\n- [ ] Magic numbers/strings\n- [ ] Proper naming conventions\n- [ ] SOLID principles\n- [ ] DRY principle\n\n### Testing\n- [ ] Test coverage for new code\n- [ ] Edge cases tested\n- [ ] Mocking appropriateness\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Code Review Summary\n\n**Files Reviewed:** [count]\n**Risk Level:** 🟢 Low / 🟡 Medium / 🔴 High\n\n### Critical Issues\n[Must be fixed before merge]\n\n### Suggestions\n[Nice to have improvements]\n\n### Questions\n[Clarifications needed]\n\n### Positive Notes\n[Good patterns observed]\n```\n\n## Review Style\n\n- Be constructive, not critical\n- Explain the \"why\" behind suggestions\n- Provide code examples when helpful\n- Acknowledge good code\n- Prioritize feedback by importance\n- Ask questions instead of making assumptions\n\n## Examples\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.review`\nReview staged changes in current repository.\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.review 123`\nReview PR #123 using GitHub CLI.\n\n**User:** `/ai-factory.review https://github.com/org/repo/pull/123`\nReview PR from URL.\n\n## Integration\n\nIf GitHub MCP is configured, can:\n- Post review comments directly to PR\n- Request changes or approve\n- Add labels based on review outcome\n\n> **Tip:** Context is heavy after code review. Consider `/clear` or `/compact` before continuing with other tasks.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:31:44.517Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Workflow Agents needing automated code quality assessment across staged changes or GitHub pull requests.","zh":"非常适合需要跨暂存变更或GitHub拉取请求进行自动化代码质量评估的开发工作流代理。","ja":"ステージングされた変更またはGitHubプルリクエストにわたる自動化されたコード品質評価を必要とする開発ワークフローエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스테이징된 변경 사항이나 GitHub 풀 리퀘스트에 걸쳐 자동화된 코드 품질 평가가 필요한 개발 워크플로우 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de flujo de trabajo de desarrollo que necesitan una evaluación automática de la calidad del código en cambios por etapas o solicitudes de extracción de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de workflow de développement nécessitant une évaluation automatisée de la qualité du code sur les changements étagés ou les demandes d''extraction GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklung-Workflow-Agents, die eine automatisierte Code-Qualitätsbewertung über gestufte Änderungen oder GitHub-Pull-Requests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento que necessitam de avaliação automatizada da qualidade do código em alterações em estágios ou solicitações de pull do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рабочего процесса разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная оценка качества кода на различных стадиях или запросах на включение в GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل تدفق العمل التطويرية التي تحتاج إلى تقييم آلي لجودة الكود عبر التغييرات المرحلية أو طلبات السحب من GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive code review automation using git diff analysis for staged changes or GitHub CLI integration for PR reviews. Focuses on four critical dimensions: correctness, security, performance, and maintainability with structured checklist-based evaluation.","zh":"通过git差异分析（用于暂存变更）或GitHub CLI集成（用于PR审查）实现全面的代码审查自动化。专注于四个关键维度：正确性、安全性、性能和可维护性，并提供基于结构化清单的评估。","ja":"ステージングされた変更のためのgit diff分析、またはPRレビューのためのGitHub CLI統合を使用して、包括的なコードレビュー自動化を実現します。正確性、セキュリティ、パフォーマンス、保守性という4つの重要な次元に焦点を当て、構造化されたチェックリストベースの評価を提供します。","ko":"스테이징된 변경 사항에 대한 git diff 분석이나 PR 리뷰를 위한 GitHub CLI 통합을 사용하여 포괄적인 코드 리뷰 자동화를 가능하게 합니다. 정확성, 보안, 성능, 유지보수성이라는 네 가지 중요한 차원에 초점을 맞추고 구조화된 체크리스트 기반 평가를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite una automatización integral de la revisión de código utilizando el análisis de git diff para cambios por etapas o la integración de GitHub CLI para revisiones de PR. Se centra en cuatro dimensiones críticas: corrección, seguridad, rendimiento y mantenibilidad con una evaluación basada en lista de verificación estructurada.","fr":"Permet une automatisation complète de l''examen de code en utilisant l''analyse de git diff pour les changements étagés ou l''intégration de GitHub CLI pour les examens de PR. Se concentre sur quatre dimensions critiques : correction, sécurité, performance et maintenabilité avec une évaluation basée sur une liste de vérification structurée.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende Automatisierung der Code-Überprüfung unter Verwendung der git-Diff-Analyse für gestufte Änderungen oder der GitHub-CLI-Integration für PR-Überprüfungen. Konzentriert sich auf vier kritische Dimensionen: Korrektheit, Sicherheit, Leistung und Wartbarkeit mit einer strukturierten Checklist-basierten Bewertung.","pt":"Permite a automação abrangente da revisão de código usando análise de git diff para alterações em estágios ou integração do GitHub CLI para revisões de PR. Concentra-se em quatro dimensões críticas: correção, segurança, desempenho e manutenibilidade com avaliação baseada em lista de verificação estruturada.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять комплексную автоматизацию проверки кода с использованием анализа git diff для изменений на различных стадиях или интеграции GitHub CLI для проверок PR. Сосредоточен на четырех критических измерениях: правильности, безопасности, производительности и поддерживаемости с оценкой на основе структурированного чек-листа.","ar":"يمكن Automating عمليات مراجعة الشفرة الشاملة باستخدام تحليل git diff للتعديلات المرحلية أو دمج GitHub CLI لمراجعات PR. يركز على أربعة أبعاد حرجة: الصحة والأمان والأداء والصيانة مع تقييم قائمة التحقق المهيكلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-commit code quality checks","Reviewing GitHub pull requests via CLI integration","Analyzing git diff outputs for security vulnerabilities","Providing maintainability assessments for code changes"],"zh":["自动化预提交代码质量检查","通过CLI集成审查GitHub拉取请求","分析git差异输出以发现安全漏洞","为代码变更提供可维护性评估"],"ja":["コミット前のコード品質チェックの自動化","CLI統合によるGitHubプルリクエストのレビュー","セキュリティ脆弱性のためのgit diff出力の分析","コード変更に対する保守性評価の提供"],"ko":["커밋 전 코드 품질 검사 자동화","CLI 통합을 통한 GitHub 풀 리퀘스트 검토","보안 취약점에 대한 git diff 출력 분석","코드 변경 사항에 대한 유지보수성 평가 제공"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de calidad de código pre-commit","Revisar solicitudes de extracción de GitHub a través de la integración de CLI","Analizar salidas de git diff para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Proporcionar evaluaciones de mantenibilidad para cambios de código"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de qualité de code pré-commit","Réviser les demandes d''extraction GitHub via l''intégration de CLI","Analyser les sorties de git diff pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Fournir des évaluations de maintenabilité pour les modifications de code"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Qualitätsprüfungen vor dem Commit","Überprüfen von GitHub-Pull-Requests über die CLI-Integration","Analysieren von git-Diff-Ausgaben auf Sicherheitsverletzungen","Bereitstellen von Wartbarkeitsbewertungen für Code-Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de qualidade de código pré-commit","Revisar solicitações de pull do GitHub via integração do CLI","Analizar saídas de git diff para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Fornecer avaliações de manutenibilidade para alterações de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки качества кода до фиксации","Просматривать запросы на включение в GitHub через интеграцию CLI","Анализировать выходные данные git diff для уязвимостей безопасности","Предоставлять оценки поддерживаемости для изменений кода"],"ar":["تأتمة فحص جودة الكود قبل الالتزام","مراجعة طلبات السحب من GitHub من خلال دمج CLI","تحليل مخرجات git diff للثغرات الأمنية","تقديم تقييمات الصيانة للتغييرات في الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository context","Depends on GitHub CLI (gh) for PR reviews","Limited to code changes detectable through diff analysis"],"zh":["需要git仓库上下文","PR审查依赖于GitHub CLI (gh)","仅限于可通过差异分析检测到的代码变更"],"ja":["gitリポジトリコンテキストが必要","PRレビューはGitHub CLI (gh)に依存","差分分析で検出可能なコード変更に限定"],"ko":["git 저장소 컨텍스트 필요","PR 리뷰는 GitHub CLI(gh)에 의존","diff 분석을 통해 감지 가능한 코드 변경 사항으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un contexto de repositorio git","Depende de GitHub CLI (gh) para revisiones de PR","Limitado a cambios de código detectables a través del análisis de diff"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de référentiel git","Dépend de GitHub CLI (gh) pour les examens de PR","Limité aux modifications de code détectables via l''analyse de diff"],"de":["Benötigt einen git-Repository-Kontext","Hängt von GitHub CLI (gh) für PR-Überprüfungen ab","Begrenzt auf Code-Änderungen, die durch Diff-Analyse erfassbar sind"],"pt":["Exige contexto de repositório git","Depende do GitHub CLI (gh) para revisões de PR","Limitado a alterações de código detectáveis por meio da análise de diff"],"ru":["Требует контекста репозитория git","Зависит от GitHub CLI (gh) для проверок PR","Ограничен изменением кода, обнаруживаемым путем анализа diff"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مستودع جيت","يعتمد على GitHub CLI (gh) لمراجعات PR","محدود بالتغييرات في الكود التي يمكن الكشف عنها من خلال تحليل diff"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
