enido y presentación","Mantenimiento de coherencia en documentos múltiples","Creación automatizada de plantillas documentales","Soporte para estructuras complejas de Word"],"fr":["Extraction complète des styles et de la mise en forme DOCX","Génération de nouveaux documents avec un format identique","Séparation du contenu et de la présentation","Maintien de la cohérence des documents multiples","Création automatisée de modèles de documents","Prise en charge des structures Word complexes"],"de":["Umfassende Extraktion von DOCX-Stilen und -Formatierungen","Erstellung neuer Dokumente mit identischer Formatierung","Trennung von Inhalt und Darstellung","Wahrung der Konsistenz bei mehreren Dokumenten","Automatisierte Erstellung von Dokumentvorlagen","Unterstützung für komplexe Word-Strukturen"],"pt":["Extraia formatação de documentos Word existentes","Crie documentos com formatação idêntica, mas conteúdo diferente","Mantenha a consistência de formatação em vários documentos","Replica estruturas complexas de documentos Word","Crie modelos de documentos com facilidade"],"ru":["Извлеките форматирование из существующих документов Word","Создайте документы с идентичным форматированием, но разным содержимым","Поддерживайте последовательность форматирования в нескольких документах","Реплицируйте сложные структуры документов Word","Создайте шаблоны документов с легкостью"],"ar":["استخرج التنسيق من مستندات Word الحالية","أنشئ مستندات ذات تنسيق متشابه، ولكن محتوى مختلف","احتفظ بالاتساق في التنسيق عبر عدة مستندات","اكرر الهياكل المعقدة لمستندات Word","أنشئ قوالب مستندات بسهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DOCX格式复制器","Word文档格式","文档模板","格式一致性","文档创建","文档编辑","自动化"],"ja":["DOCXフォーマットレプリカター","ワード文書のフォーマット","文書テンプレート","フォーマットの一貫性","文書の作成","文書の編集","自動化"],"ko":["DOCX 포맷 복제기","워드 문서 형식","문서 템플릿","형식 일관성","문서 생성","문서 편집","자동화"],"es":["extraer formato docx","replicar estilos word","plantillas documento word","automatizar documentos","mantener formato consistente","generar docx con mismo estilo","clonar formato documento","separar contenido y formato"],"fr":["extraire format docx","répliquer styles word","modèles document word","automatiser documents","maintenir format cohérent","générer docx même style","cloner format document","séparer contenu et format"],"de":["docx formatierung extrahieren","word styles replizieren","word dokumentvorlagen","dokumente automatisieren","konsistentes format beibehalten","docx mit gleichem stil generieren","dokumentformat klonen","inhalt und format trennen"],"pt":["replicador de formato docx","formatação de documentos word","criação de documentos","modelos de documentos","consistência de formatação","estruturas complexas de documentos"],"ru":["репликатор формата docx","форматирование документов word","создание документов","шаблоны документов","последовательность форматирования","сложные структуры документов"],"ar":["مكرر تنسيق docx","تنسيق مستندات word","إنشاء مستندات","قوالب مستندات","اتساق التنسيق","هياكل معقدة لمستندات"]}},"owner":"iamzhihuix","repo":"happy-claude-skills","repoPath":"iamzhihuix/happy-claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docx-format-replicator","description":"Extract formatting from existing Word documents and generate new documents with the same format but different content. Use this skill when users need to create multiple documents with consistent formatting, replicate document templates, or maintain corporate document standards across different content.","bodyPreview":"# DOCX Format Replicator\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx) and use it to generate new documents with identical formatting but different content. This skill enables creating document templates, maintaining consistent formatting across multiple documents, and replicating complex Word document structures.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to extract formatting from an existing Word document\n- Needs to create multiple do","body":"# DOCX Format Replicator\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx) and use it to generate new documents with identical formatting but different content. This skill enables creating document templates, maintaining consistent formatting across multiple documents, and replicating complex Word document structures.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to extract formatting from an existing Word document\n- Needs to create multiple documents with the same format\n- Has a template document and wants to generate similar documents with new content\n- Asks to \"replicate\", \"copy format\", \"use the same style\", or \"create a document like\"\n- Mentions document templates, corporate standards, or format consistency\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Extract Format from Template\n\nExtract formatting information from an existing Word document to create a reusable format configuration.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py <template.docx> <output.json>\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py \"HY研制任务书.docx\" format_template.json\n```\n\n**What Gets Extracted**:\n- Style definitions (fonts, sizes, colors, alignment)\n- Paragraph and character styles\n- Numbering schemes (1, 1.1, 1.1.1, etc.)\n- Table structures and styles\n- Header and footer configurations\n\n**Output**: JSON file containing all format information (see `references/format_config_schema.md` for details)\n\n### Step 2: Prepare Content Data\n\nCreate a JSON file with the actual content for the new document. The content must follow the structure defined in `references/content_data_schema.md`.\n\n**Content Structure**:\n```json\n{\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"title\": \"Document Title\",\n    \"author\": \"Author Name\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-01-15\"\n  },\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"heading\",\n      \"content\": \"Section Title\",\n      \"level\": 1,\n      \"number\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"content\": \"Paragraph text content.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"table\",\n      \"rows\": 3,\n      \"cells\": [\n        [\"Header 1\", \"Header 2\"],\n        [\"Data 1\", \"Data 2\"]\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Supported Section Types**:\n- `heading` - Headings with optional numbering\n- `paragraph` - Text paragraphs\n- `table` - Tables with configurable rows and columns\n- `page_break` - Page breaks\n\nSee `assets/example_content.json` for a complete example.\n\n### Step 3: Generate New Document\n\nGenerate a new Word document using the extracted format and prepared content.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py <format.json> <content.json> <output.docx>\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py format_template.json new_content.json output_document.docx\n```\n\n**Result**: A new .docx file with the format from the template applied to the new content.\n\n## Complete Example Workflow\n\nUser asks: \"I have a research task document. I need to create 5 more documents with the same format but different content.\"\n\n1. **Extract the format**:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py research_task_template.docx template_format.json\n```\n\n2. **Create content files** for each new document (content1.json, content2.json, etc.)\n\n3. **Generate documents**:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py template_format.json content1.json document1.docx\npython scripts/generate_document.py template_format.json content2.json document2.docx\n# ... repeat for all documents\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### Corporate Document Templates\n\nExtract format from a company template and generate reports, proposals, or specifications with consistent branding.\n\n```bash\n# One-time: Extract company template\npython scripts/extract_format.py \"Company Template.docx\" company_format.json\n\n# For each new document:\npython scripts/generate_document.py company_format.json new_report.json \"Monthly Report.docx\"\n```\n\n### Technical Documentation Series\n\nCreate multiple technical documents (specifications, test plans, manuals) with identical formatting.\n\n```bash\n# Extract from specification template\npython scripts/extract_format.py spec_template.docx spec_format.json\n\n# Generate multiple specs\npython scripts/generate_document.py spec_format.json product_a_spec.json \"Product A Spec.docx\"\npython scripts/generate_document.py spec_format.json product_b_spec.json \"Product B Spec.docx\"\n```\n\n### Research Task Documents\n\nThe included example template (`assets/hy_template_format.json`) demonstrates a complete research task document format with:\n- Approval/review table in header\n- Multi-level numbering (1, 1.1, 1.1.1)\n- Technical specification tables\n- Structured sections\n\nUse this as a starting point for similar technical documents.\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Customizing Extraction\n\nModify `scripts/extract_format.py` to extract additional properties not covered by default:\n- Custom XML elements\n- Advanced table features (merged cells, borders)\n- Embedded objects\n- Custom properties\n\n### Extending Content Types\n\nAdd new section types in `scripts/generate_document.py`:\n- Images with captions\n- Bulleted or numbered lists\n- Footnotes and endnotes\n- Custom content blocks\n\nSee `references/content_data_schema.md` for extension guidelines.\n\n### Batch Processing\n\nCreate a wrapper script to generate multiple documents:\n\n```python\nimport json\nimport subprocess\n\nformat_file = \"template_format.json\"\ncontent_files = [\"content1.json\", \"content2.json\", \"content3.json\"]\n\nfor i, content_file in enumerate(content_files, 1):\n    output = f\"document_{i}.docx\"\n    subprocess.run([\n        \"python\", \"scripts/generate_document.py\",\n        format_file, content_file, output\n    ])\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\nThe scripts require:\n- Python 3.7+\n- `python-docx` library: `pip install python-docx`\n\nNo additional dependencies are needed for the core functionality.\n\n## Resources\n\n### scripts/\n\n- **extract_format.py** - Extract formatting from Word documents\n- **generate_document.py** - Generate new documents from format + content\n\nBoth scripts include built-in help:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py --help\npython scripts/generate_document.py --help\n```\n\n### references/\n\n- **format_config_schema.md** - Complete schema for format configuration files\n- **content_data_schema.md** - Complete schema for content data files\n\nRead these for detailed information on file structures and available options.\n\n### assets/\n\n- **hy_template_format.json** - Example extracted format from a technical research task document\n- **example_content.json** - Example content data showing all section types\n\nUse these as references when creating your own format and content files.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Missing styles in output**: Ensure style IDs in content data match those in format config. Check `format.json` for available style IDs.\n\n**Table formatting issues**: Verify table dimensions (rows/columns) match between content data and format config. See `format_config_schema.md` for table structure.\n\n**Font not displaying correctly**: Some fonts may not be available on all systems. Check that referenced fonts are installed.\n\n**Dependencies missing**: Install required Python packages:\n```bash\npip install python-docx\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Test with examples first**: Use the included `hy_template_format.json` and `example_content.json` to understand the workflow before extracting your own formats.\n\n2. **Start simple**: Begin with basic headings and paragraphs, then add tables and complex formatting.\n\n3. **Validate JSON**: Use a JSON validator to check content data files before generating documents.\n\n4. **Keep format configs**: Store extracted format configurations for reuse across multiple projects.\n\n5. **Version control**: Track both format configs and content data in version control for reproducible document generation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:32:22.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Document Processing Agents requiring precise Word document formatting replication and template creation.","zh":"适合需要精确复制 Word 文档格式和创建模板的文档处理代理。","ja":"ワード文書のフォーマットを正確に複製し、テンプレートを作成する必要があるドキュメント処理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"정확한 워드 문서 형식 복제 및 템플릿 생성이 필요한 문서 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de procesamiento de documentos que requieren una replicación precisa del formato de documentos de Word y la creación de plantillas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de traitement de documents nécessitant une réplication précise du formatage de documents Word et la création de modèles.","de":"Ideal für Dokumentenverarbeitungsagenten, die eine präzise Replication des Word-Dokumenten-Formatierungs und eine Vorlagen-Erstellung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Documentos que exigem replicação precisa de formatação de documentos do Word e criação de modelos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки документов, требующих точной репликации форматирования документов Word и создания шаблонов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات معالجة الوثائق التي تتطلب نسخًا دقيقًا لتنسيق مستندات Word وإنشاء قوالب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract formatting information from existing .docx files and generate new documents with identical formatting, leveraging advanced template creation and maintaining consistent formatting across multiple documents using .docx file format.","zh":"使代理能够从现有的 .docx 文件中提取格式信息，并生成具有相同格式的新文档，利用高级模板创建和在多个文档中保持一致的格式，使用 .docx 文件格式。","ja":"エージェントが既存の .docx ファイルからフォーマット情報を抽出し、同一のフォーマットを持つ新しい文書を生成することを可能にし、高度なテンプレート作成と複数の文書間で一貫したフォーマットを維持することを可能にし、.docx ファイル形式を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 기존의 .docx 파일에서 서식 정보를 추출하여 동일한 서식을 가진 새로운 문서를 생성할 수 있게 하며, 고급 템플릿 생성과 여러 문서에서 일관된 서식을 유지하는 것을 가능하게 하고, .docx 파일 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer información de formato de archivos .docx existentes y generar nuevos documentos con un formato idéntico, aprovechando la creación avanzada de plantillas y manteniendo un formato coherente en varios documentos utilizando el formato de archivo .docx.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des informations de formatage à partir de fichiers .docx existants et de générer de nouveaux documents avec un formatage identique, en exploitant la création de modèles avancée et en maintenant un formatage cohérent sur plusieurs documents à l''aide du format de fichier .docx.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Formatierungsinformationen aus vorhandenen .docx-Dateien zu extrahieren und neue Dokumente mit identischem Formatierungs zu generieren, indem sie die erweiterte Vorlagen-Erstellung nutzen und ein konsistentes Formatierungs über mehrere Dokumente mithilfe des .docx-Dateiformats beibehalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam informações de formatação de arquivos .docx existentes e gerem novos documentos com formatação idêntica, aproveitando a criação avançada de modelos e mantendo a formatação consistente em vários documentos usando o formato de arquivo .docx.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать информацию о форматировании из существующих файлов .docx и создавать новые документы с идентичным форматированием, используя продвинутую создание шаблонов и поддерживая последовательное форматирование во множестве документов с использованием формата файла .docx.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من استخراج معلومات التنسيق من ملفات .docx الحالية وإنشاء مستندات جديدة بنفس التنسيق، مستفيدين من إنشاء قوالب متقدم ومaintenance التنسيق الثابت عبر مستندات متعددة باستخدام تنسيق ملف .docx."},"useCases":{"en":["Replicating complex Word document structures","Creating document templates with consistent formatting","Automating document formatting for bulk content generation"],"zh":["复制复杂的 Word 文档结构","创建具有一致格式的文档模板","自动化文档格式化以进行批量内容生成"],"ja":["複雑なワード文書構造の複製","一貫したフォーマットを持つ文書テンプレートの作成","バルクコンテンツ生成のための文書フォーマットの自動化"],"ko":["복잡한 워드 문서 구조의 복제","일관된 형식을 가진 문서 템플릿 생성","대량 콘텐츠 생성을 위한 문서 형식 자동화"],"es":["Replicar estructuras complejas de documentos de Word","Crear plantillas de documentos con un formato coherente","Automatizar el formato de documentos para la generación de contenido a granel"],"fr":["Répliquer des structures de documents Word complexes","Créer des modèles de documents avec un formatage cohérent","Automatiser le formatage des documents pour la génération de contenu en vrac"],"de":["Komplexe Word-Dokumenten-Strukturen replizieren","Dokumentenvorlagen mit konsistentem Formatierungs erstellen","Dokumentenformatierungs für die Masseninhaltsgenerierung automatisieren"],"pt":["Replicar estruturas complexas de documentos do Word","Criar modelos de documentos com formatação consistente","Automatizar a formatação de documentos para geração de conteúdo em massa"],"ru":["Реплицировать сложные структуры документов Word","Создавать шаблоны документов с последовательным форматированием","Автоматизировать форматирование документов для массового создания контента"],"ar":["نسخ هيكل مستندات Word المعقدة","إنشاء قوالب وثائق ذات تنسيق موحد","أتمتة تنسيق المستندات لتوليد المحتوى الكثيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to existing .docx files for formatting extraction",".docx file format compatibility only"],"zh":["需要访问现有的 .docx 文件以提取格式信息","仅兼容 .docx 文件格式"],"ja":["フォーマット情報の抽出のために既存の .docx ファイルへのアクセスが必要",".docx ファイル形式のみとの互換性"],"ko":["서식 정보 추출을 위해 기존의 .docx 파일에 접근할 필요가 있음",".docx 파일 형식만과 호환"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos .docx existentes para la extracción de formato","Compatibilidad solo con el formato de archivo .docx"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des fichiers .docx existants pour l''extraction de formatage","Compatibilité uniquement avec le format de fichier .docx"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf vorhandene .docx-Dateien für die Formatierungs-Extraktion","Kompatibilität nur mit dem .docx-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos .docx existentes para extração de formatação","Compatibilidade apenas com o formato de arquivo .docx"],"ru":["Требует доступа к существующим файлам .docx для извлечения форматирования","Совместимость только с форматом файла .docx"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات .docx الحالية لاستخراج التنسيق","التوافق مع تنسيق ملف .docx فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
