e full Containers category index with:\n- Detailed skill descriptions\n- Usage triggers for each skill\n- Common workflow combinations\n- Cross-references to related skills\n\n### Load Specific Skills\n\nLoad individual skills as needed:\n\nRead <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/container-networking.md\nRead <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/container-registry-management.md\nRead <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/container-security.md\nRead <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/docker-compose-development.md\nRead <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/dockerfile-optimization.md\n\n\n## Progressive Loading\n\nThis gateway skill enables progressive loading:\n- **Level 1**: Gateway loads automatically (you''re here now)\n- **Level 2**: Load category INDEX.md for full overview\n- **Level 3**: Load specific skills as needed\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\n1. **Auto-activation**: This skill loads automatically when Claude Code detects containers work\n2. **Browse skills**: Run `Read <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/INDEX.md` for full category overview\n3. **Load specific skills**: Use bash commands above to load individual skills\n\n\n**Next Steps**: Run `Read <cc-polymath-root>/skills/containers/INDEX.md` to see full category details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:32:55.851Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing automated container management and security capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing automated container management and security capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing automated container management and security capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing automated container management and security capabilities.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de infraestructura en la nube que necesitan administración de contenedores automatizada y capacidades de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud nécessitant une g