to para Next.js 16 utilizando Firecrawl MCP.","fr":"Le skill ''clone-website'' permet de transformer n''importe quel site web en code de production prêt pour Next.js 16 en utilisant Firecrawl MCP.","de":"Das ''clone-website''-Skill ermöglicht die Transformation jeder Website in produktionsbereiten Next.js 16-Code mithilfe von Firecrawl MCP.","pt":"O clone-website é uma habilidade que transforma qualquer site em código Next.js 16 pronto para produção usando Firecrawl MCP.","ru":"Клонирование сайта - это навык, который преобразует любой сайт в код Next.js 16, готовый к производству, с помощью Firecrawl MCP.","ar":"استنساخ الموقع هو مهارة تتحول إلى أي موقع إلى رمز Next.js 16 جاهز للانتاج باستخدام Firecrawl MCP.","en":"Claude Code, Droid, etc. Skills Ability"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code, Droid, etc. Skills Ability"},"features":{"zh":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","URL","Markdown","HTML","onlyMainContent"],"ja":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","URL","Markdown","HTML","onlyMainContent"],"ko":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","URL","Markdown","HTML","onlyMainContent"],"es":["Transformación de sitios web en código de producción listo para Next.js 16","Uso de Firecrawl MCP para el scrapeo de sitios web","Filtrado de secciones específicas del sitio web","Compatibilidad con formatos markdown y html","Fallback a firecrawl- en caso de fallo del scrapeo"],"fr":["Transformation de sites web en code de production prêt pour Next.js 16","Utilisation de Firecrawl MCP pour le scraping de sites web","Filtrage de sections spécifiques du site web","Compatibilité avec les formats markdown et html","Fallback à firecrawl- en cas d''échec du scraping"],"de":["Transformation von Websites in produktionsbereiten Next.js 16-Code","Verwendung von Firecrawl MCP für das Scraping von Websites","Filterung spezifischer Abschnitte der Website","Kompatibilität mit den Formaten markdown und html","Fallback zu firecrawl- im Falle eines Scraping-Fehlers"],"pt":["Transformação de sites em código Next.js 16","Uso do Firecrawl MCP para clonar sites","3 fases para clonar sites","Filtro de seções para clonar apenas o conteúdo necessário","Suporte a markdown e html"],"ru":["Преобразование сайтов в код Next.js 16","Использование Firecrawl MCP для клонирования сайтов","3 фазы для клонирования сайтов","Фильтр разделов для клонирования только необходимого контента","Поддержка markdown и html"],"ar":["تحويل المواقع إلى رمز Next.js 16","استخدام Firecrawl MCP لاستنساخ المواقع","3 مراحل لاستنساخ المواقع","مرشح الأقسام لاستنساخ المحتوى فقط","دعم markdown و html"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","clone website","web development","SEO","Front-end","Back-end","Full-stack","Web scraping"],"ja":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","clone website","web development","SEO","Front-end","Back-end","Full-stack","Web scraping"],"ko":["Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","clone website","web development","SEO","Front-end","Back-end","Full-stack","Web scraping"],"es":["clonar sitio web","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","scrapeo de sitios web","desarrollo web","producción de código","transformación de sitios web"],"fr":["cloner un site web","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","scraping de sites web","développement web","production de code","transformation de sites web"],"de":["Website klonen","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","Scraping von Websites","Webentwicklung","Codeproduktion","Transformation von Websites"],"pt":["clone-website","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","clonar sites","transformar sites","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["клонирование сайта","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","клонировать сайты","преобразовать сайты","веб-разработка"],"ar":["استنساخ الموقع","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","استنساخ المواقع","تحويل المواقع","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"julianromli","repo":"ai-skills","repoPath":"julianromli/ai-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clone-website","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Clone Website Skill\n\nTransform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these 3 phases in order. **Never skip Phase 2.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scrape\n\n1. Extract URL from user request\n2. Identify section filter if specified (e.g., \"hero only\", \"just the pricing\")\n3. Scrape using Firecrawl:\n\n```\nfirecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_scrape:\n  url: [TARGET_URL]\n  formats: [\"markdown\", \"html\"]\n  onlyMainContent: true\n```\n\n4. If scrape fails, fallback to `firecrawl-","body":"# Clone Website Skill\n\nTransform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these 3 phases in order. **Never skip Phase 2.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scrape\n\n1. Extract URL from user request\n2. Identify section filter if specified (e.g., \"hero only\", \"just the pricing\")\n3. Scrape using Firecrawl:\n\n```\nfirecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_scrape:\n  url: [TARGET_URL]\n  formats: [\"markdown\", \"html\"]\n  onlyMainContent: true\n```\n\n4. If scrape fails, fallback to `firecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_crawl`\n\n### Phase 2: Analysis (MANDATORY)\n\n**STOP. Present analysis to user before ANY code generation.**\n\nRead [references/analysis-template.md](references/analysis-template.md) and fill out the template with:\n- Detected sections and component breakdown\n- Extracted design tokens (colors, typography, spacing)\n- Image inventory with download/fallback status\n- Proposed file structure\n\nAsk user: \"Ready to proceed? (y/n or request modifications)\"\n\n**Do not generate code until user confirms.**\n\n### Phase 3: Code Generation\n\nAfter user confirmation, generate files in this order:\n\n1. `app/globals.css` - Design tokens as CSS variables\n2. `app/layout.tsx` - Root layout with SEO metadata\n3. `components/landing/[Section].tsx` - Each component\n4. `app/page.tsx` - Main page composing components\n5. Download images to `public/images/`\n\nReference [references/tech-stack.md](references/tech-stack.md) for Next.js 16 conventions.\nReference [references/component-patterns.md](references/component-patterns.md) for component structure.\n\n## Tech Stack (Fixed)\n\n| Layer | Technology |\n|-------|------------|\n| Framework | Next.js 16 (App Router) |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict) |\n| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |\n| Components | Shadcn UI |\n| Icons | Lucide React |\n| Font | Geist Sans (default) or extracted |\n\n## Image Handling\n\n1. Extract all image URLs from scraped content\n2. Attempt download via fetch\n3. On failure, use Unsplash fallback:\n   - Hero: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-[id]?w=1920&h=1080`\n   - Avatars: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-[id]?w=100&h=100`\n   - Features: Prefer Lucide icons over images\n4. Save to `public/images/` with descriptive kebab-case names\n\n## Partial Cloning\n\nParse user request for section filters:\n\n| Request | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"clone the hero from X\" | Generate only Hero.tsx |\n| \"clone pricing and footer\" | Generate Pricing.tsx + Footer.tsx |\n| \"clone X\" (no filter) | Full page clone |\n\n## Code Standards\n\n- Mobile-first responsive design\n- Use Tailwind arbitrary values for pixel-perfection: `w-[347px]`\n- Extract repeated colors to CSS variables\n- Use `cn()` utility for conditional classes\n- Add brief comments only for non-obvious patterns\n- Prefer `gap-*` over margins for flex/grid spacing\n- Use `size-*` over `w-* h-*` when values match\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:32:51.499Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing rapid website cloning and Next.js 16 code generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要快速进行网站克隆和Next.js 16代码生成的Web开发代理。","ja":"Web開発エージェントが急速にウェブサイトのクローンを作成し、Next.js 16コード生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 빠른 웹사이트 클로닝과 Next.js 16 코드 생성 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan clonar sitios web rápidamente y capacidades de generación de código Next.js 16.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant un clonage rapide de sites Web et des capacités de génération de code Next.js 16.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine schnelle Website-Klonung und Next.js 16-Codegenerierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de clonagem rápida de sites e capacidades de geração de código Next.js 16.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы быстрое клонирование сайтов и возможности генерации кода Next.js 16.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات التطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى استنساخ موقع ويب سريع وقدرات توليد كود Next.js 16."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP, supporting formats like markdown and html, and enabling efficient website scraping with section filtering.","zh":"使代理能够使用Firecrawl MCP将任何网站转换为生产就绪的Next.js 16代码，支持markdown和html等格式，并实现高效的网站抓取和部分过滤。","ja":"Firecrawl MCPを使用して、任意のWebサイトをプロダクションレディのNext.js 16コードに変換し、MarkdownやHTMLなどの形式をサポートし、セクションフィルタリングを使用した効率的なWebスクレイピングを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Firecrawl MCP를 사용하여任意의 웹사이트를 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 Next.js 16 코드로 변환하고 마크다운 및 HTML 등의 형식을 지원하며 효율적인 웹사이트 스크레이핑과 섹션 필터링을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar cualquier sitio web en código Next.js 16 listo para producción utilizando Firecrawl MCP, que admite formatos como markdown y html, y permite un scraping de sitios web eficiente con filtrado de secciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer n''importe quel site Web en code Next.js 16 prêt pour la production à l''aide de Firecrawl MCP, prenant en charge des formats tels que markdown et html, et permettant un scraping de site Web efficace avec un filtrage de sections.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, jede Website in produktionsbereiten Next.js 16-Code mithilfe von Firecrawl MCP umzuwandeln, das Formate wie Markdown und HTML unterstützt und effizientes Website-Scraping mit Sectionsfilterung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar qualquer site em código Next.js 16 pronto para produção usando Firecrawl MCP, suportando formatos como markdown e html, e permitindo raspagem eficiente de sites com filtragem de seções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать любой сайт в код Next.js 16, готовый к производству, используя Firecrawl MCP, поддерживающий форматы seperti markdown и html, и обеспечивающий эффективную сборку сайтов с фильтрацией разделов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيلات من تحويل أي موقع ويب إلى كود Next.js 16 جاهز للانتاج باستخدام Firecrawl MCP، ودعم صيغ مثل markdown وhtml، وتمكين حفر موقع ويب فعال مع مرشح أقسام."},"useCases":{"en":["Cloning existing websites for rapid prototyping","Generating production-ready Next.js 16 code from scraped website content","Scraping specific website sections using Firecrawl MCP"],"zh":["用于快速原型设计的现有网站克隆","从抓取的网站内容生成生产就绪的Next.js 16代码","使用Firecrawl MCP抓取特定网站部分"],"ja":["急速なプロトタイピングのための既存サイトのクローン作成","スクレイピングされたWebサイトコンテンツからプロダクションレディのNext.js 16コードを生成","Firecrawl MCPを使用した特定のWebサイトセクションのスクレイピング"],"ko":["빠른 프로토 타이핑을 위한 기존 웹사이트 클로닝","스크레이핑된 웹사이트 내용으로부터 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 Next.js 16 코드 생성","Firecrawl MCP를 사용한 특정 웹사이트 섹션의 스크레이핑"],"es":["Clonación de sitios web existentes para prototipado rápido","Generación de código Next.js 16 listo para producción a partir de contenido de sitios web extraído","Extracción de secciones específicas de sitios web utilizando Firecrawl MCP"],"fr":["Clonage de sites Web existants pour un prototypage rapide","Génération de code Next.js 16 prêt pour la production à partir de contenu de site Web extrait","Extraction de sections spécifiques de sites Web à l''aide de Firecrawl MCP"],"de":["Klonen bestehender Websites für schnelles Prototyping","Erzeugen von produktionsbereitem Next.js 16-Code aus extrahiertem Website-Inhalt","Scraping spezifischer Website-Sectionen mithilfe von Firecrawl MCP"],"pt":["Clonagem de sites existentes para prototipagem rápida","Geração de código Next.js 16 pronto para produção a partir de conteúdo de site raspado","Raspagem de seções específicas de sites usando Firecrawl MCP"],"ru":["Клонирование существующих сайтов для быстрой прототипизации","Генерация кода Next.js 16, готового к производству, из содержимого сайта с помощью сбора","Сбор конкретных разделов сайтов с помощью Firecrawl MCP"],"ar":["استنساخ مواقع الويب الحالية لأغراض الإنموذج السريع","توليد كود Next.js 16 جاهز للانتاج من محتوى موقع ويب محفور","حفر أقسام محددة من مواقع الويب باستخدام Firecrawl MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firecrawl MCP for scraping and code generation","May fail if website scraping is unsuccessful, requiring fallback mechanisms"],"zh":["需要Firecrawl MCP进行抓取和代码生成","如果网站抓取不成功，可能会失败，需要备用机制"],"ja":["スクレイピングとコード生成にはFirecrawl MCPが必要","Webサイトのスクレイピングが失敗した場合、フォールバックメカニズムが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["스크레이핑과 코드 생성을 위해 Firecrawl MCP가 필요","웹사이트 스크레이핑에 실패할 경우 장애가 발생하며, 대체 메커니즘이 필요"],"es":["Requiere Firecrawl MCP para extracción y generación de código","Puede fallar si la extracción del sitio web no es exitosa, lo que requiere mecanismos de reserva"],"fr":["Nécessite Firecrawl MCP pour l''extraction et la génération de code","Peut échouer si l''extraction du site Web n''est pas réussie, ce qui nécessite des mécanismes de secours"],"de":["Benötigt Firecrawl MCP für Scraping und Codegenerierung","Kann fehlschlagen, wenn das Website-Scraping nicht erfolgreich ist, was Ausfallmechanismen erfordert"],"pt":["Requer Firecrawl MCP para raspagem e geração de código","Pode falhar se a raspagem do site for malsucedida, exigindo mecanismos de fallback"],"ru":["Требует Firecrawl MCP для сбора и генерации кода","Может не сработать, если сбор сайта будет неудачным, требуя механизмов резервного копирования"],"ar":["يتطلب Firecrawl MCP لحفر و توليد الكود","قد يفشل إذا كانت عملية حفر الموقع غير ناجحة، مما يتطلب آليات سبل بديلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
