eibungen"],"pt":["Criação e gerenciamento de issues","Rastreamento de tarefas e bugs de desenvolvimento","Automação de workflows de projetos de engenharia","Integração com projetos e equipes","Priorização de issues"],"ru":["Создание и управление задачами","Отслеживание задач и ошибок разработки","Автоматизация рабочих процессов инженерных проектов","Интеграция с проектами и командами","Приоритизация задач"],"ar":["إنشاء وإدارة المشكلات","تتبع المهام وعيوب البرمجة","تسريع سير عمل المشاريع الهندسية","دمج مع المشاريع والفرق","تحديد أولويات المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Linear Skill","issue跟踪","工作流自动化","开发团队","效率提高","JSON输入","优先级设置","工程项目"],"ja":["Linear Skill","issue追跡","ワークフロー自動化","開発チーム","効率向上","JSON入力","優先度設定","エンジニアリングプロジェクト"],"ko":["Linear Skill","이슈 추적","워크플로 자동화","개발 팀","효율성 향상","JSON 입력","우선순위 설정","엔지니어링 프로젝트"],"es":["Linear","seguimiento de problemas","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software","automatización de flujos de trabajo","integración con Linear","proyectos de ingeniería"],"fr":["Linear","suivi de problèmes","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels","automatisation des flux de travail","intégration avec Linear","projets d''ingénierie"],"de":["Linear","Problemmgmt","Projektverwaltung","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Workflows","Integration mit Linear","Engineering-Projekte"],"pt":["Linear","rastreamento de issues","gerenciamento de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","automação de workflows"],"ru":["Linear","отслеживание задач","управление задачами","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","автоматизация рабочих процессов"],"ar":["Linear","تتبع المشكلات","إدارة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","تسريع سير العمل"]}},"owner":"refly-ai","repo":"refly-skills","repoPath":"refly-ai/refly-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"linear","description":"Integrate with Linear for issue tracking. Use when you need to: (1) create and manage Linear issues, (2) track development tasks and bugs, or (3) automate engineering project workflows.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Linear\n\nIntegrate with Linear for issue tracking. Use when you need to: (1) create and manage Linear issues, (2) track development tasks and bugs, or (3) automate engineering project workflows.\n\n## Input\n\nProvide input as JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_name\": \"Name of the Linear project or team to work with\",\n  \"issue_title\": \"Title for the new issue to create\",\n  \"issue_description\": \"Detailed description of the issue\",\n  \"issue_priority\": \"Priority level for the issue (e.g., urgent, high, mediu","body":"# Linear\n\nIntegrate with Linear for issue tracking. Use when you need to: (1) create and manage Linear issues, (2) track development tasks and bugs, or (3) automate engineering project workflows.\n\n## Input\n\nProvide input as JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_name\": \"Name of the Linear project or team to work with\",\n  \"issue_title\": \"Title for the new issue to create\",\n  \"issue_description\": \"Detailed description of the issue\",\n  \"issue_priority\": \"Priority level for the issue (e.g., urgent, high, medium, low)\",\n  \"assignee_email\": \"Email address of the team member to assign the issue to\"\n}\n```\n\n## Execution (Pattern C: Action)\n\n### Step 1: Run the Skill and Get Run ID\n\n```bash\nRESULT=$(refly skill run --id skpi-igoaqxgoy7waoxcesfq2l0sc --input ''{\n  \"title\": \"Bug fix: Login page error\",\n  \"description\": \"Users unable to login on mobile devices\",\n  \"team\": \"Engineering\"\n}'')\nRUN_ID=$(echo \"$RESULT\" | jq -r ''.payload.workflowExecutions[0].id'')\n# RUN_ID is we-xxx format, use this for workflow commands\n```\n\n### Step 2: Open Workflow in Browser and Wait for Completion\n\n```bash\nopen \"https://refly.ai/workflow/c-ijjrk8c5aqb5dp3z0nih7xfk\"\nrefly workflow status \"$RUN_ID\" --watch --interval 30000\n```\n\n### Step 3: Confirm Action Status\n\n```bash\n# Confirm issue created\nSTATUS=$(refly workflow detail \"$RUN_ID\" | jq -r ''.payload.status'')\necho \"Action completed with status: $STATUS\"\n```\n\n## Expected Output\n\n- **Type**: API Response\n- **Format**: JSON issue data (issue ID, link)\n- **Action**: Confirm issue created successfully\n\n## Rules\n\nFollow base skill workflow: `~/.claude/skills/refly/SKILL.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:32:57.365Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring streamlined issue tracking and project management through Linear integration.","zh":"适合需要通过 Linear 集成简化问题跟踪和项目管理的开发代理。","ja":"Linear 統合を通じて問題の追跡とプロジェクト管理をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Linear 통합을 통해 문제 추적 및 프로젝트 관리를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un seguimiento de problemas y gestión de proyectos simplificados a través de la integración con Linear.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de problèmes et une gestion de projets rationalisées via l''intégration Linear.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsspezialisten, die ein vereinfachtes Problem- und Projektmanagement durch die Linear-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem acompanhamento de problemas e gerenciamento de projetos simplificados por meio da integração Linear.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих упрощенного отслеживания проблем и управления проектами через интеграцию Linear.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب تتبعًا متدفقًا للمشكلات وإدارة المشاريع من خلال التكامل الخطي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Linear issues, track development tasks and bugs, and automate engineering project workflows using JSON input for project_name, issue_title, issue_description, and issue_priority.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理 Linear 问题、跟踪开发任务和 bug，以及使用 project_name、issue_title、issue_description 和 issue_priority 的 JSON 输入自动化工程项目工作流的能力。","ja":"エージェントが Linear の問題を作成して管理し、開発タスクとバグを追跡し、project_name、issue_title、issue_description、issue_priority の JSON 入力でエンジニアリング プロジェクトのワークフローを自動化する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Linear 문제를 생성 및 관리하고 개발 태스크 및 버그를 추적하며 project_name, issue_title, issue_description 및 issue_priority의 JSON 입력을 사용하여 엔지니어링 프로젝트 워크플ロー 자동화를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y gestionar problemas de Linear, realizar un seguimiento de tareas de desarrollo y errores, y automatizar flujos de trabajo de proyectos de ingeniería utilizando entrada JSON para project_name, issue_title, issue_description e issue_priority.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des problèmes Linear, de suivre les tâches de développement et les bogues, et d''automatiser les flux de travail de projets d''ingénierie en utilisant une entrée JSON pour project_name, issue_title, issue_description et issue_priority.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Linear-Probleme zu erstellen und zu verwalten, Entwicklungsaufgaben und Fehler zu verfolgen und Ingenieurprojekt-Workflows mithilfe von JSON-Eingabe für project_name, issue_title, issue_description und issue_priority zu automatisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar problemas Linear, rastrear tarefas de desenvolvimento e bugs, e automatizar fluxos de trabalho de projetos de engenharia usando entrada JSON para project_name, issue_title, issue_description e issue_priority.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять проблемами Linear, отслеживать задачи разработки и ошибки, а также автоматизировать рабочие процессы инженерных проектов с использованием входных данных JSON для project_name, issue_title, issue_description и issue_priority.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảABILITY لإنشاء مشكلات Linear وإدارتها، وتتبع المهام التطويرية والأخطاء، وتحسين سير عمل المشاريع الهندسية باستخدام إدخال JSON لمشروع_الاسم، عنوان_المشكلة، وصف_المشكلة، وأولوية_المشكلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and assigning new issues in Linear projects","Automating task tracking and bug reporting","Managing issue priorities and workflows"],"zh":["在 Linear 项目中创建和分配新问题","自动化任务跟踪和 bug 报告","管理问题优先级和工作流"],"ja":["Linear プロジェクトで新しい問題を作成して割り当てる","タスクの追跡とバグの報告を自動化する","問題の優先順位とワークフローを管理する"],"ko":["Linear 프로젝트에서 새로운 문제를 생성하고 할당함","작업 추적 및 버그 보고 자동화","문제 우선 순위 및 워크플로 관리"],"es":["Creación y asignación de nuevos problemas en proyectos de Linear","Automatización del seguimiento de tareas y la generación de informes de errores","Gestión de prioridades de problemas y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Création et assignation de nouveaux problèmes dans les projets Linear","Automatisation du suivi des tâches et de la déclaration de bogues","Gestion des priorités de problèmes et des flux de travail"],"de":["Erstellung und Zuweisung neuer Probleme in Linear-Projekten","Automatisierung der Aufgabenverfolgung und Fehlerberichterstattung","Verwaltung von ProblemPrioritäten und Workflows"],"pt":["Criar e atribuir novos problemas em projetos Linear","Automatizar o acompanhamento de tarefas e relatórios de bugs","Gerenciar prioridades de problemas e fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["Создание и назначение новых проблем в проектах Linear","Автоматизация отслеживания задач и отчетов об ошибках","Управление приоритетами проблем и рабочими процессами"],"ar":["إنشاء مشكلات جديدة وتحديدها في مشاريع Linear","تutomatizar تتبع المهام وتقارير الأخطاء","إدارة أولويات المشكلات وسير العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear project or team setup","JSON input format mandatory","Limited to issue tracking and project management features"],"zh":["需要 Linear 项目或团队设置","JSON 输入格式是必需的","仅限问题跟踪和项目管理功能"],"ja":["Linear プロジェクトまたはチームの設定が必要","JSON 入力形式は必須","問題の追跡とプロジェクト管理機能のみに限定"],"ko":["Linear 프로젝트 또는 팀 설정이 필요함","JSON 입력 형식이 필수임","문제 추적 및 프로젝트 관리 기능만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto o equipo de Linear","Formato de entrada JSON obligatorio","Limitado a características de seguimiento de problemas y gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet ou d''équipe Linear","Format d''entrée JSON obligatoire","Limité aux fonctionnalités de suivi de problèmes et de gestion de projets"],"de":["Erfordert Linear-Projekt- oder Teamkonfiguration","JSON-Eingabeformat obligatorisch","Begrenzt auf Problemverfolgungs- und Projektmanagementfunktionen"],"pt":["Exige configuração de projeto ou equipe Linear","Formato de entrada JSON obrigatório","Limitado a recursos de acompanhamento de problemas e gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта или команды Linear","Обязательный формат входных данных JSON","Ограничен функциями отслеживания проблем и управления проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع أو فريق Linear","تنسيق إدخال JSON إلزامي","محدود بميزات تتبع المشكلات وإدارة المشاريع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gannonh/kata-orchestrator/kata-help', 'community', 'gannonh', 'kata-orchestrator', 'gannonh/kata-orchestrator', 'kata-help', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:33:20.778Z', NULL, '{"id":"gannonh/kata-orchestrator/kata-help","name":"kata-help","description":{"zh":"Kata 帮助框架是一种用于规范驱动开发的代理编排框架","ja":"Kata ヘルプ フレームワークは、仕様駆動開発のためのエージェント オーケストレーション フレームワークです","ko":"Kata 도움말 프레임워크는仕様 주도 개발을 위한 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크입니다","en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kata 帮助框架 - 规范驱动开发","ja":"Kata ヘルプ フレームワーク -仕様駆動開発","ko":"Kata 도움말 프레임워크 -仕様 주도 개발","en":"kata-help"},"description":{"zh":"Kata 帮助框架是一种用于规范驱动开发的代理编排框架","ja":"Kata ヘルプ フレームワークは、仕様駆動開発のためのエージェント オーケストレーション フレームワークです","ko":"Kata 도움말 프레임워크는仕様 주도 개발을 위한 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크입니다","en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"definition":{"en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"features":{"zh":["代理编排","规范驱动开发","显示完整的 Kata 技能参考","版本信息","插件根目录"],"ja":["エージェント オーケストレーション","仕様駆動開発","完全な Kata スキル リファレンスの表示","バージョン情報","プラグイン ルート ディレクトリ"],"ko":["에이전트 오케스트레이션","仕様 주도 개발","완전한 Kata 스킬 참조의 표시","버전 정보","플러그인 루트 디렉토리"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kata 帮助框架","规范驱动开发","代理编排","Kata 技能参考","版本信息","插件根目录","开发框架"],"ja":["Kata ヘルプ フレームワーク","仕様駆動開発","エージェント オーケストレーション","Kata スキル リファレンス","バージョン情報","プラグイン ルート ディレクトリ","開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Kata 도움말 프레임워크","仕様 주도 개발","에이전트 오케스트레이션","Kata 스킬 참조","버전 정보","플러그인 루트 디렉토리","개발 프레임워크"]}},"owner":"gannonh","repo":"kata-orchestrator","repoPath":"gannonh/kata-orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kata-help","description":"Show available Kata skills, displaying the usage guide, explaining skill reference, or when the user asks for help with Kata. Triggers include help, show skills, list skills, what skills, kata skills, and usage guide.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nDisplay the complete Kata skill reference with version info.\n\nFirst, read the installed version:\n\n```bash\nif [ -n \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT\" ]; then\n  cat \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/VERSION\" 2>/dev/null\nelse\n  echo \"unknown\"\nfi\n```\n\nThen output the reference content below, inserting the version at the top. Do NOT add:\n\n- Project-specific analysis\n- Git status or file context\n- Next-step suggestions\n- Any commentary beyond the reference\n  </objective>\n\n<reference>\n# Kata Skill Reference\n\n**Versi","body":"<objective>\nDisplay the complete Kata skill reference with version info.\n\nFirst, read the installed version:\n\n```bash\nif [ -n \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT\" ]; then\n  cat \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/VERSION\" 2>/dev/null\nelse\n  echo \"unknown\"\nfi\n```\n\nThen output the reference content below, inserting the version at the top. Do NOT add:\n\n- Project-specific analysis\n- Git status or file context\n- Next-step suggestions\n- Any commentary beyond the reference\n  </objective>\n\n<reference>\n# Kata Skill Reference\n\n**Version:** {version from bash above}\n\n**Kata** is a spec-driven development framework for Claude Code. It creates hierarchical project plans optimized for agentic development.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. `/kata-new-project` - Initialize project (includes research, requirements, roadmap)\n2. `/kata-plan-phase 1` - Create detailed plan for first phase\n3. `/kata-execute-phase 1` - Execute the phase\n\n## Staying Updated\n\nKata evolves fast. Check for updates periodically:\n\n```\n/kata-whats-new\n```\n\nShows what changed since your installed version and how to update.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```\n/kata-new-project → /kata-plan-phase → /kata-execute-phase → repeat\n```\n\n### Project Initialization\n\n**`/kata-new-project`**\nInitialize new project through unified flow.\n\nOne skill takes you from idea to ready-for-planning:\n\n- Deep questioning to understand what you''re building\n- Optional domain research (spawns 4 parallel researcher agents)\n- Requirements definition with v1/v2/out-of-scope scoping\n- Roadmap creation with phase breakdown and success criteria\n\nCreates all `.planning/` artifacts:\n\n- `PROJECT.md` — vision and requirements\n- `config.json` — workflow mode (interactive/yolo)\n- `research/` — domain research (if selected)\n- `REQUIREMENTS.md` — scoped requirements with REQ-IDs\n- `ROADMAP.md` — phases mapped to requirements\n- `STATE.md` — project memory\n\nUsage: `/kata-new-project`\n\n**`/kata-map-codebase`**\nMap an existing codebase for brownfield projects.\n\n- Analyzes codebase with parallel Explore agents\n- Creates `.planning/codebase/` with 7 focused documents\n- Covers stack, architecture, structure, conventions, testing, integrations, concerns\n- Use before `/kata-new-project` on existing codebases\n\nUsage: `/kata-map-codebase`\n\n### Phase Planning\n\n**`/kata-discuss-phase <number>`**\nHelp articulate your vision for a phase before planning.\n\n- Captures how you imagine this phase working\n- Creates CONTEXT.md with your vision, essentials, and boundaries\n- Use when you have ideas about how something should look/feel\n\nUsage: `/kata-discuss-phase 2`\n\n**`/kata-research-phase <number>`**\nComprehensive ecosystem research for niche/complex domains.\n\n- Discovers standard stack, architecture patterns, pitfalls\n- Creates RESEARCH.md with \"how experts build this\" knowledge\n- Use for 3D, games, audio, shaders, ML, and other specialized domains\n- Goes beyond \"which library\" to ecosystem knowledge\n\nUsage: `/kata-research-phase 3`\n\n**`/kata-listing-phase-assumptions <number>`**\nSee what Claude is planning to do before it starts.\n\n- Shows Claude''s intended approach for a phase\n- Lets you course-correct if Claude misunderstood your vision\n- No files created - conversational output only\n\nUsage: `/kata-listing-phase-assumptions 3`\n\n**`/kata-plan-phase <number>`**\nCreate detailed execution plan for a specific phase.\n\n- Generates `.planning/phases/pending/XX-phase-name/XX-YY-PLAN.md`\n- Breaks phase into concrete, actionable tasks\n- Includes verification criteria and success measures\n- Multiple plans per phase supported (XX-01, XX-02, etc.)\n\nUsage: `/kata-plan-phase 1`\nResult: Creates `.planning/phases/pending/01-foundation/01-01-PLAN.md`\n\n### Execution\n\n**`/kata-execute-phase <phase-number>`**\nExecute all plans in a phase.\n\n- Moves phase from `pending/` → `active/` → `completed/`\n- Groups plans by wave (from frontmatter), executes waves sequentially\n- Plans within each wave run in parallel via Task tool\n- Verifies phase goal after all plans complete\n- Updates REQUIREMENTS.md, ROADMAP.md, STATE.md\n\nUsage: `/kata-execute-phase 5`\n\n### Quick Mode\n\n**`/kata-execute-quick-task`**\nExecute small, ad-hoc tasks with Kata guarantees but skip optional agents.\n\nQuick mode uses the same system with a shorter path:\n\n- Spawns planner + executor (skips researcher, checker, verifier)\n- Quick tasks live in `.planning/quick/` separate from planned phases\n- Updates STATE.md tracking (not ROADMAP.md)\n\nUse when you know exactly what to do and the task is small enough to not need research or verification.\n\nUsage: `/kata-execute-quick-task`\nResult: Creates `.planning/quick/NNN-slug/PLAN.md`, `.planning/quick/NNN-slug/SUMMARY.md`\n\n### Roadmap Management\n\n**`/kata-add-phase <description>`**\nAdd new phase to end of current milestone.\n\n- Appends to ROADMAP.md\n- Uses next sequential number\n- Creates phase directory in `pending/`\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-phase \"Add admin dashboard\"`\n\n**`/kata-insert-phase <after> <description>`**\nInsert urgent work as decimal phase between existing phases.\n\n- Creates intermediate phase (e.g., 7.1 between 7 and 8)\n- Useful for discovered work that must happen mid-milestone\n- Maintains phase ordering\n\nUsage: `/kata-insert-phase 7 \"Fix critical auth bug\"`\nResult: Creates Phase 7.1\n\n**`/kata-remove-phase <number>`**\nRemove a future phase and renumber subsequent phases.\n\n- Deletes phase directory and all references\n- Renumbers all subsequent phases to close the gap\n- Only works on future (unstarted) phases\n- Git commit preserves historical record\n\nUsage: `/kata-remove-phase 17`\nResult: Phase 17 deleted, phases 18-20 become 17-19\n\n**`/kata-move-phase <phase> <operation>`**\nMove a phase between milestones or reorder within a milestone.\n\n- Cross-milestone: moves phase to target milestone, renumbers both\n- Reorder: changes phase position within milestone, renumbers all\n- Only pending phases can be moved\n\nUsage: `/kata-move-phase 3 to v1.6.0` (cross-milestone)\nUsage: `/kata-move-phase 3 before 1` (reorder within milestone)\n\n### Milestone Management\n\n**`/kata-add-milestone <name>`**\nStart a new milestone through unified flow.\n\n- Deep questioning to understand what you''re building next\n- Optional domain research (spawns 4 parallel researcher agents)\n- Requirements definition with scoping\n- Roadmap creation with phase breakdown\n\nMirrors `/kata-new-project` flow for brownfield projects (existing PROJECT.md).\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-milestone \"v2.0 Features\"`\n\n**`/kata-complete-milestone <version>`**\nArchive completed milestone and prepare for next version.\n\n- Creates MILESTONES.md entry with stats\n- Archives full details to milestones/ directory\n- Creates git tag for the release\n- Prepares workspace for next version\n\nUsage: `/kata-complete-milestone 1.0.0`\n\n### Progress Tracking\n\n**`/kata-track-progress`**\nCheck project status and intelligently route to next action.\n\n- Shows visual progress bar and completion percentage\n- Summarizes recent work from SUMMARY files\n- Displays current position and what''s next\n- Lists key decisions and open issues\n- Offers to execute next plan or create it if missing\n- Detects 100% milestone completion\n\nUsage: `/kata-track-progress`\n\n### Session Management\n\n**`/kata-resume-work`**\nResume work from previous session with full context restoration.\n\n- Reads STATE.md for project context\n- Shows current position and recent progress\n- Offers next actions based on project state\n\nUsage: `/kata-resume-work`\n\n**`/kata-pause-work`**\nCreate context handoff when pausing work mid-phase.\n\n- Creates .continue-here file with current state\n- Updates STATE.md session continuity section\n- Captures in-progress work context\n\nUsage: `/kata-pause-work`\n\n### Debugging\n\n**`/kata-debug [issue description]`**\nSystematic debugging with persistent state across context resets.\n\n- Gathers symptoms through adaptive questioning\n- Creates `.planning/debug/[slug].md` to track investigation\n- Investigates using scientific method (evidence → hypothesis → test)\n- Survives `/clear` — run `/kata-debug` with no args to resume\n- Archives resolved issues to `.planning/debug/resolved/`\n\nUsage: `/kata-debug \"login button doesn''t work\"`\nUsage: `/kata-debug` (resume active session)\n\n### Issue Management\n\n**`/kata-add-issue [description]`**\nCapture idea or task as issue from current conversation.\n\n- Extracts context from conversation (or uses provided description)\n- Creates structured issue file in `.planning/issues/open/`\n- Infers area from file paths for grouping\n- Checks for duplicates before creating\n- Updates STATE.md issue count\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-issue` (infers from conversation)\nUsage: `/kata-add-issue Add auth token refresh`\n\n**`/kata-check-issues [area]`**\nList pending issues and select one to work on.\n\n- Lists all pending issues with title, area, age\n- Optional area filter (e.g., `/kata-check-issues api`)\n- Loads full context for selected issue\n- Routes to appropriate action (work now, add to phase, brainstorm)\n- Moves issue to done/ when work begins\n\nUsage: `/kata-check-issues`\nUsage: `/kata-check-issues api`\n\n### User Acceptance Testing\n\n**`/kata-verify-work [phase]`**\nValidate built features through conversational UAT.\n\n- Extracts testable deliverables from SUMMARY.md files\n- Presents tests one at a time (yes/no responses)\n- Automatically diagnoses failures and creates fix plans\n- Ready for re-execution if issues found\n\nUsage: `/kata-verify-work 3`\n\n### Milestone Auditing\n\n**`/kata-audit-milestone [version]`**\nAudit milestone completion against original intent.\n\n- Reads all phase VERIFICATION.md files\n- Checks requirements coverage\n- Spawns integration checker for cross-phase wiring\n- Creates MILESTONE-AUDIT.md with gaps and tech debt\n\nUsage: `/kata-audit-milestone`\n\n**`/kata-plan-milestone-gaps`**\nCreate phases to close gaps identified by audit.\n\n- Reads MILESTONE-AUDIT.md and groups gaps into phases\n- Prioritizes by requirement priority (must/should/nice)\n- Adds gap closure phases to ROADMAP.md\n- Ready for `/kata-plan-phase` on new phases\n\nUsage: `/kata-plan-milestone-gaps`\n\n### Configuration\n\n**`/kata-customize`**\nManage template overrides for customizing Kata output formats.\n\n- List all customizable templates with override status\n- Copy a default template for local editing\n- Edit an override with conversational changes\n- Validate overrides against required schemas\n\nUsage: `/kata-customize`\nUsage: `/kata-customize list`\nUsage: `/kata-customize copy summary-template.md`\nUsage: `/kata-customize validate`\n\n**`/kata-configure-settings`**\nConfigure workflow toggles and model profile interactively.\n\n- Toggle researcher, plan checker, verifier agents\n- Select model profile (quality/balanced/budget)\n- Updates `.planning/config.json`\n\nUsage: `/kata-configure-settings`\n\n**`/kata-set-profile <profile>`**\nQuick switch model profile for Kata agents.\n\n- `quality` — Opus everywhere except verification\n- `balanced` — Opus for planning, Sonnet for execution (default)\n- `budget` — Sonnet for writing, Haiku for research/verification\n\nUsage: `/kata-set-profile budget`\n\n### Utility Skills\n\n**`/kata-help`**\nShow this skill reference.\n\n**`/kata-whats-new`**\nSee what''s changed since your installed version.\n\n- Shows installed vs latest version comparison\n- Displays changelog entries for versions you''ve missed\n- Highlights breaking changes\n- Provides update instructions when behind\n\nUsage: `/kata-whats-new`\n\n## Files & Structure\n\n```\n.planning/\n├── PROJECT.md            # Project vision\n├── REQUIREMENTS.md       # Scoped requirements with REQ-IDs\n├── ROADMAP.md            # Current phase breakdown\n├── STATE.md              # Project memory & context\n├── MILESTONES.md         # Completed milestone history\n├── config.json           # Workflow mode & gates\n├── templates/            # Template overrides (customized output formats)\n├── research/             # Domain research (from project init)\n├── issues/               # Captured ideas and tasks\n│   ├── open/             # Issues waiting to be worked on\n│   └── done/             # Completed issues\n├── debug/                # Active debug sessions\n│   └── resolved/         # Archived resolved issues\n├── codebase/             # Codebase map (brownfield projects)\n│   ├── STACK.md          # Languages, frameworks, dependencies\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md   # Patterns, layers, data flow\n│   ├── STRUCTURE.md      # Directory layout, key files\n│   ├── CONVENTIONS.md    # Coding standards, naming\n│   ├── TESTING.md        # Test setup, patterns\n│   ├── INTEGRATIONS.md   # External services, APIs\n│   └── CONCERNS.md       # Tech debt, known issues\n├── milestones/           # Archived milestone details\n├── quick/                # Quick task plans and summaries\n│   └── NNN-slug/\n│       ├── PLAN.md\n│       └── SUMMARY.md\n└── phases/\n    ├── pending/          # Phases not yet started\n    │   └── 03-next-phase/\n    │       └── 03-01-PLAN.md\n    ├── active/           # Phase currently being executed\n    │   └── 02-in-progress/\n    │       ├── 02-01-PLAN.md\n    │       └── 02-01-SUMMARY.md\n    └── completed/        # Finished phases\n        └── 01-foundation/\n            ├── 01-01-PLAN.md\n            └── 01-01-SUMMARY.md\n```\n\n## Workflow Modes\n\nSet during `/kata-new-project`:\n\n**Interactive Mode**\n\n- Confirms each major decision\n- Pauses at checkpoints for approval\n- More guidance throughout\n\n**YOLO Mode**\n\n- Auto-approves most decisions\n- Executes plans without confirmation\n- Only stops for critical checkpoints\n\nChange anytime by editing `.planning/config.json`\n\n## Planning Configuration\n\nConfigure how planning artifacts are managed in `.planning/config.json`:\n\n**`planning.commit_docs`** (default: `true`)\n\n- `true`: Planning artifacts committed to git (standard workflow)\n- `false`: Planning artifacts kept local-only, not committed\n\nWhen `commit_docs: false`:\n\n- Add `.planning/` to your `.gitignore`\n- Useful for OSS contributions, client projects, or keeping planning private\n- All planning files still work normally, just not tracked in git\n\n**`planning.search_gitignored`** (default: `false`)\n\n- `true`: Add `--no-ignore` to broad ripgrep searches\n- Only needed when `.planning/` is gitignored and you want project-wide searches to include it\n\nExample config:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"planning\": {\n    \"commit_docs\": false,\n    \"search_gitignored\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n**Starting a new project:**\n\n```\n/kata-new-project        # Unified flow: questioning → research → requirements → roadmap\n/clear\n/kata-plan-phase 1       # Create plans for first phase\n/clear\n/kata-execute-phase 1    # Execute all plans in phase\n```\n\n**Resuming work after a break:**\n\n```\n/kata-track-progress  # See where you left off and continue\n```\n\n**Adding urgent mid-milestone work:**\n\n```\n/kata-insert-phase 5 \"Critical security fix\"\n/kata-plan-phase 5.1\n/kata-execute-phase 5.1\n```\n\n**Completing a milestone:**\n\n```\n/kata-complete-milestone 1.0.0\n/clear\n/kata-add-milestone  # Start next milestone (questioning → research → requirements → roadmap)\n```\n\n**Capturing ideas during work:**\n\n```\n/kata-add-issue                    # Capture from conversation context\n/kata-add-issue Fix modal z-index  # Capture with explicit description\n/kata-check-issues                 # Review and work on issues\n/kata-check-issues api             # Filter by area\n```\n\n**Debugging an issue:**\n\n```\n/kata-debug \"form submission fails silently\"  # Start debug session\n# ... investigation happens, context fills up ...\n/clear\n/kata-debug                                    # Resume from where you left off\n```\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- Read `.planning/PROJECT.md` for project vision\n- Read `.planning/STATE.md` for current context\n- Check `.planning/ROADMAP.md` for phase status\n- Run `/kata-track-progress` to check where you''re up to\n  </reference>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:20.778Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing spec-driven development and agent orchestration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要基于规格驱动开发和代理编排能力的开发者代理。","ja":"仕様駆動開発とエージェントオーケストレーションの機能が必要な開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"仕様 驱動 개발 및 에이전트 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan desarrollo basado en especificaciones y capacidades de orquestación de agentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant un développement piloté par des spécifications et des capacités d''orchestration d''agents.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung und Agenten-Orchestrierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de desenvolvimento baseado em especificações e capacidades de orquestração de agentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимы возможности разработки, основанные на спецификациях, и оркестровки агентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات وقدرات أوركسترا الوكيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage spec-driven development using agent orchestration frameworks, facilitating version control and reference content management through protocols like bash scripting and file formats such as VERSION files.","zh":"赋予代理使用基于规格驱动开发的能力，通过代理编排框架，实现版本控制和参考内容管理，通过诸如bash脚本和VERSION文件等协议。","ja":"エージェントに仕様駆動開発を使用する能力を与え、エージェントオーケストレーションフレームワークを使用してバージョン管理とリファレンスコンテンツ管理を容易にし、bashスクリプトやVERSIONファイルなどのプロトコルを通じて利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게仕様 驱動 개발을 사용하는 능력을 부여하고, 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크를 사용하여 버전 관리 및 참조 컨텐츠 관리를 용이하게 하며, bash 스크립트나 VERSION 파일 등의 프로토콜을 통해 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el desarrollo basado en especificaciones utilizando frameworks de orquestación de agentes, facilitando el control de versiones y la gestión de contenido de referencia a través de protocolos como scripting de bash y formatos de archivo como archivos VERSION.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le développement piloté par des spécifications en utilisant des frameworks d''orchestration d''agents, facilitant la gestion des versions et la gestion de contenu de référence via des protocoles tels que le scripting bash et des formats de fichiers tels que les fichiers VERSION.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung mithilfe von Agenten-Orchestrierungsframeworks zu nutzen, wodurch die Versionskontrolle und die Verwaltung von Referenzinhalten durch Protokolle wie Bash-Scripting und Dateiformate wie VERSION-Dateien erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o desenvolvimento baseado em especificações usando estruturas de orquestração de agentes, facilitando o controle de versão e o gerenciamento de conteúdo de referência por meio de protocolos como script de bash e formatos de arquivo como arquivos VERSION.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать разработку на основе спецификаций с помощью фреймворков оркестровки агентов, облегчая управление версиями и управление справочным контентом через протоколы, такие как скрипты bash, и форматы файлов, такие как файлы VERSION.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات باستخدام إطارات أوركسترا الوكيل، وتبسيط التحكم في الإصدار وإدارة المحتوى المرجعي من خلال بروتوكولات مثل البرمجة النصية bash وتنسيقات الملفات مثل ملفات VERSION."},"useCases":{"en":["Displaying version information","Outputting reference content","Managing agent plugins"],"zh":["显示版本信息","输出参考内容","管理代理插件"],"ja":["バージョン情報の表示","リファレンスコンテンツの出力","エージェントプラグインの管理"],"ko":["버전 정보 표시","참조 컨텐츠 출력","에이전트 플러그인 관리"],"es":["Mostrar información de versión","Salida de contenido de referencia","Administración de plugins de agente"],"fr":["Afficher les informations de version","Sortie de contenu de référence","Gestion des plugins d''agent"],"de":["Anzeigen von Versionsinformationen","Ausgabe von Referenzinhalten","Verwaltung von Agenten-Plug-ins"],"pt":["Exibir informações de versão","Saída de conteúdo de referência","Gerenciamento de plugins de agente"],"ru":["Отображение информации о версии","Вывод справочного контента","Управление плагинами агента"],"ar":["عرض معلومات الإصدار","إخراج المحتوى المرجعي","إدارة ملحقات الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT environment variable","Limited to displaying version and reference content"],"zh":["需要CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT环境变量","仅限显示版本和参考内容"],"ja":["CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT環境変数が必要","バージョンとリファレンスコンテンツの表示のみ"],"ko":["CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT 환경 변수가必要","버전 및 참조 컨텐츠 표시만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la variable de entorno CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","Limitado a mostrar la versión y el contenido de referencia"],"fr":["Nécessite la variable d''environnement CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","Limité à l''affichage de la version et du contenu de référence"],"de":["Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","Begrenzt auf die Anzeige von Version und Referenzinhalt"],"pt":["Requer a variável de ambiente CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","Limitado a exibir a versão e o conteúdo de referência"],"ru":["Требует переменной среды CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","Ограничен отображением версии и справочного контента"],"ar":["يتطلب متغير بيئة CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT","محدود بعرض الإصدار والمحتوى المرجعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sammcj/agentic-coding/code-simplification', 'community', 'sammcj', 'agentic-coding', 'sammcj/agentic-coding', 'code-simplification', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:33:12.266Z', NULL, '{"id":"sammcj/agentic-coding/code-simplification","name":"code-simplification","description":{"zh":"代码简化是系统架构和开发的关键原则，旨在消除不必要的复杂性","ja":"コードの簡素化はシステムアーキテクチャと開発の重要な原則であり、不要な複雑さを排除することを目的とする","ko":"코드 단순화는 시스템 아키텍처와 개발의 핵심 원칙으로, 불필요한 복잡성을 제거하는 것을 목표로 함","es":"La simplificación de código es fundamental para crear soluciones elegantes y mantenibles. Nuestros principios y técnicas te ayudarán a lograrlo","fr":"La simplification de code est essentielle pour créer des solutions élégantes et maintenables. Nos principes et techniques vous aideront à y parvenir","de":"Die Code-Vereinfachung ist entscheidend für die Erstellung eleganter und wartbarer Lösungen. Unsere Prinzipien und Techniken helfen Ihnen dabei","pt":"Simplifique seu código e se torne um arquiteto de sistemas e desenvolvedor experiente.","ru":"Упростите свой код и становитесь опытным системным архитектором и разработчиком.","ar":"تبسط شفرتك واصبح مهندس أنظمة ومطور خبير.","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码简化技巧","ja":"コードの簡素化","ko":"코드 단순화 기법","es":"Simplificación de código para desarrolladores","fr":"Simplification de code pour les développeurs","de":"Code-Vereinfachung für Entwickler","pt":"Simplificação de Código para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Упрощение Кодa для Разработчиков","ar":"تبسيط الشفرة للمطورين","en":"code-simplification"},"description":{"zh":"代码简化是系统架构和开发的关键原则，旨在消除不必要的复杂性","ja":"コードの簡素化はシステムアーキテクチャと開発の重要な原則であり、不要な複雑さを排除することを目的とする","ko":"코드 단순화는 시스템 아키텍처와 개발의 핵심 원칙으로, 불필요한 복잡성을 제거하는 것을 목표로 함","es":"La simplificación de código es fundamental para crear soluciones elegantes y mantenibles. Nuestros principios y técnicas te ayudarán a lograrlo","fr":"La simplification de code est essentielle pour créer des solutions élégantes et maintenables. Nos principes et techniques vous aideront à y parvenir","de":"Die Code-Vereinfachung ist entscheidend für die Erstellung eleganter und wartbarer Lösungen. Unsere Prinzipien und Techniken helfen Ihnen dabei","pt":"Simplifique seu código e se torne um arquiteto de sistemas e desenvolvedor experiente.","ru":"Упростите свой код и становитесь опытным системным архитектором и разработчиком.","ar":"تبسط شفرتك واصبح مهندس أنظمة ومطور خبير.","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"definition":{"en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"features":{"zh":["遵循简单性原则","消除不必要的复杂性","提高代码可维护性","增强系统性能","简化代码结构"],"ja":["シンプルさの原則を遵守","不要な複雑さを排除","コードのメンテナンス性を高める","システムのパフォーマンスを向上させる","コードの構造を簡素化"],"ko":["단순성 원칙을 따름","불필요한 복잡성을 제거","코드 유지 보수성을 향상","시스템 성능을 향상","코드 구조를 단순화"],"es":["Principio de simplicidad","Eliminación de complejidad innecesaria","Código mantenible","Soluciones elegantes","Arquitectura de sistema experta"],"fr":["Principe de simplicité","Élimination de la complexité inutile","Code maintenable","Solutions élégantes","Architecture de système experte"],"de":["Prinzip der Einfachheit","Beseitigung unnötiger Komplexität","Wartbarer Code","Elegante Lösungen","Experten-Systemarchitektur"],"pt":["Simplicidade em primeiro lugar","Código elegante e manutenível","Eliminação de complexidade desnecessária","Princípios de codificação claros","Arquitetura de sistemas eficaz"],"ru":["Простота прежде всего","Элегантный и поддерживаемый код","Удаление ненужной сложности","Ясные принципы кодирования","Эффективная архитектура систем"],"ar":["البساطة أولا","شفرة أنيقة وقابلة للصيانة","إزالة التعقيد غير الضروري","مبادئ التشفير الواضحة","هندسة أنظمة فعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码简化","系统架构","开发原则","代码可维护性","系统性能","代码结构"],"ja":["コードの簡素化","システムアーキテクチャ","開発原則","コードのメンテナンス性","システムのパフォーマンス","コードの構造"],"ko":["코드 단순화","시스템 아키텍처","개발 원칙","코드 유지 보수성","시스템 성능","코드 구조"],"es":["simplificación de código","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de sistema","código mantenible","soluciones elegantes","principio de simplicidad","eliminación de complejidad","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["simplification de code","développement de logiciels","architecture de système","code maintenable","solutions élégantes","principe de simplicité","élimination de la complexité","développement d''applications"],"de":["Code-Vereinfachung","Software-Entwicklung","Systemarchitektur","wartbarer Code","elegante Lösungen","Prinzip der Einfachheit","Beseitigung unnötiger Komplexität","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["simplificação de código","desenvolvimento de software","arquitetura de sistemas","codificação eficaz","princípios de codificação","desenvolvedor experiente"],"ru":["упрощение кода","разработка программного обеспечения","архитектура систем","эффективное кодирование","принципы кодирования","опытный разработчик"],"ar":["تبسيط الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة الأنظمة","تشفير فعال","مبادئ التشفير","مطور خبير"]}},"owner":"sammcj","repo":"agentic-coding","repoPath":"sammcj/agentic-coding","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-simplification","description":"Use this skill when you need to review and refactor code to make it simpler, more maintainable, and easier to understand. Helps with identifying overly complex solutions, unnecessary abstractions.","bodyPreview":"The information outlined here aims to help you become an expert system architect and developer with an unwavering commitment to code simplicity.\n\nWhen focusing on code simplification it is your mission to identify and eliminate unnecessary complexity wherever it exists, transforming convoluted solutions into elegant, maintainable code.\n\nYour core principles:\n- **Simplicity First**: Every line of code should have a clear purpose. If it doesn''t contribute directly to solving the problem, it should","body":"The information outlined here aims to help you become an expert system architect and developer with an unwavering commitment to code simplicity.\n\nWhen focusing on code simplification it is your mission to identify and eliminate unnecessary complexity wherever it exists, transforming convoluted solutions into elegant, maintainable code.\n\nYour core principles:\n- **Simplicity First**: Every line of code should have a clear purpose. If it doesn''t contribute directly to solving the problem, it shouldn''t exist.\n- **Readability Over Cleverness**: Code is read far more often than it''s written. Optimise for human understanding, not for showing off technical prowess.\n- **Minimal Abstractions**: Only introduce abstractions when they genuinely reduce complexity. Premature abstraction is a form of complexity.\n- **Clear Intent**: Code should express what it does, not how it does it. The ''why'' should be obvious from reading the code.\n\nWhen reviewing code, you will:\n\n1. **Identify Complexity Hotspots**:\n   - Deeply nested conditionals or loops\n   - Functions doing too many things\n   - Unnecessary design patterns or abstractions\n   - Overly generic solutions for specific problems\n   - Complex boolean logic that could be simplified\n   - Redundant code or repeated patterns\n\n2. **Propose Simplifications**:\n   - Break down complex functions into smaller, focused ones\n   - Replace nested conditionals with early returns or guard clauses\n   - Eliminate intermediate variables that don''t add clarity\n   - Simplify data structures when possible\n   - Remove unused parameters, methods, or classes\n   - Convert complex boolean expressions to well-named functions\n\n3. **Maintain Functionality**:\n   - Ensure all simplifications preserve the original behaviour\n   - Consider edge cases and error handling\n   - Maintain or improve performance characteristics\n   - Keep necessary complexity that serves a real purpose\n\n4. **Provide Clear Refactoring Steps**:\n   - Explain why each change improves simplicity\n   - Show before/after comparisons\n   - Prioritise changes by impact\n   - Suggest incremental refactoring when dealing with large changes\n\n5. **Consider Context**:\n   - Respect project-specific patterns from CLAUDE.md files\n   - Align with established coding standards\n   - Consider the skill level of the team maintaining the code\n   - Balance simplicity with other requirements like performance or security\n\n6. **Consider requirements**:\n   - Don''t remove essential requirements for the proposed or implemented solution.\n   - Ensure that no functionality is lost. If you want to remove functionality, ask for feedback whether that is required.\n\nYour communication style:\n- Be direct and specific about complexity issues\n- Provide concrete examples of simplified code\n- Explain the benefits of each simplification\n- Acknowledge when complexity is necessary and justified\n- Focus on actionable improvements, not criticism\n\nRemember: The best code is not the code that does the most, but the code that does exactly what''s needed with the least cognitive overhead. Every simplification you suggest should make the codebase more approachable for the next developer who reads it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:12.266Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Coding Agents seeking to refine their development skills with a focus on simplicity and maintainability","zh":"适合于寻求改进开发技能并注重简单性和可维护性的编码代理","ja":"シンプルさとメンテナンス性に焦点を当てた開発スキルを磨くことを目指すコーディングエージェントに最適","ko":"단순성과 유지 보수의焦点을두고 개발 스킬을 다듬으려는 코딩 에이전트에게 이상적","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificación que buscan refinar sus habilidades de desarrollo con un enfoque en la simplicidad y la mantenibilidad","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Codage cherchant à affiner leurs compétences de développement avec un focus sur la simplicité et la maintenabilité","de":"Ideal für Codieragenten, die ihre Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit Fokus auf Einfachheit und Wartbarkeit verfeinern möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação que buscam aprimorar suas habilidades de desenvolvimento com foco em simplicidade e manutenibilidade","ru":"Идеально для Кодировочных Агентов, стремящихся усовершенствовать свои навыки разработки с упором на простоту и поддерживаемость","ar":"مثالي ليعاملات الترميز التي تسعى لتحسين مهارات التطوير مع التركيز على البساطة والصيانة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply Agentic Coding Rules, simplifying complex solutions into elegant, maintainable code by eliminating unnecessary complexity and adhering to the Simplicity First principle, ensuring every line of code has a clear purpose","zh":"赋予代理应用代理编码规则的能力，通过消除不必要的复杂性和遵循先求简单的原则，将复杂的解决方案简化为优雅、可维护的代码，确保每行代码都有明确的目的","ja":"エージェントにAgenticコーディングルールを適用する能力を与え、複雑な解決策を、不要な複雑さを排除し、シンプルさ第一の原則に従うことで、優雅で維持可能なコードに簡略化することを可能にし、各行のコードに明確な目的を持たせる","ko":"에이전트에게 에이전틱 코딩 규칙을 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 불필요한 복잡성을 제거하고, 단순성 우선의 원칙을 준수함으로써, 복잡한 해결책을 우아하고 유지 보수 가능한 코드로 단순화하고, 각 줄의 코드가 명확한 목적을 갖도록 함","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar las Reglas de Codificación de Agente, simplificando soluciones complejas en código elegante y mantenible, eliminando la complejidad innecesaria y ajustándose al principio de Simplicidad Primero, asegurando que cada línea de código tenga un propósito claro","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les Règles de Codage d''Agent, simplifiant les solutions complexes en code élégant et maintenable, en éliminant la complexité inutile et en respectant le principe de Simplicité d''abord, en assurant que chaque ligne de code ait un but clair","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Agentic-Coding-Regeln anzuwenden, komplexe Lösungen in elegantes, wartbares Code zu vereinfachen, indem unnötige Komplexität eliminiert und das Prinzip Einfachheit zuerst eingehalten wird, um sicherzustellen, dass jede Codezeile einen klaren Zweck hat","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar Regras de Codificação de Agente, simplificando soluções complexas em código elegante e mantido, eliminando complexidade desnecessária e aderindo ao princípio da Simplicidade Primeiro, garantindo que cada linha de código tenha um propósito claro","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять Кодировочные Правила Агента, упрощая сложные решения до элегантного, поддерживаемого кода, исключая ненужную сложность и придерживаясь принципа Простоты Сначала, гарантируя, что каждая строка кода имеет четкую цель","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق قواعد الترميز العميلة، مبسطاً الحلول المعقدة في رمز أنيق ومدروس، بإزالة التعقيد غير الضروري والالتزام بمبدأ البساطة أولاً، مما يضمن أن يكون لكل سطر من الشفرة غرض واضح"},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying convoluted codebases","Transforming legacy code into modern, readable formats","Implementing coding templates for streamlined development"],"zh":["简化复杂的代码库","将遗留代码转换为现代、可读的格式","为流畅的开发实现编码模板"],"ja":["複雑なコードベースを簡略化する","レガシーコードを現代的で読みやすい形式に変換する","スムーズな開発のためのコーディングテンプレートを実装する"],"ko":["복잡한 코드베이스를 단순화하는 것","레거시 코드를 현대적이고 읽기 쉬운 형식으로 변환하는 것","스무스한 개발을 위한 코딩 템플릿을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Simplificar bases de código enrevesadas","Transformar código heredado en formatos modernos y legibles","Implementar plantillas de codificación para un desarrollo optimizado"],"fr":["Simplifier les bases de code complexes","Transformer le code hérité en formats modernes et lisibles","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de codage pour un développement optimisé"],"de":["Verwickelte Codebasen vereinfachen","Legacy-Code in moderne, lesbare Formate umwandeln","Codierungsvorlagen für optimiertes Entwicklung implementieren"],"pt":["Simplificando bases de código complicadas","Transformando código legado em formatos modernos e legíveis","Implementando modelos de codificação para desenvolvimento otimizado"],"ru":["Упрощая запутанные базы кода","Преобразуя устаревший код в современные, читаемые форматы","Реализуя шаблоны кодирования для оптимизированной разработки"],"ar":["مبسطة قواعد الترميز المتشابكة","تحويل رمز تراثي إلى صيغ حديثة وقابلة للقراءة","تنفيذ قوالب الترميز من أجل تطوير مبسط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to core principles like Simplicity First","May necessitate significant refactoring of existing code"],"zh":["需要遵循先求简单等核心原则","可能需要对现有代码进行大量的重构"],"ja":["シンプルさ第一などの核心原則に従う必要がある","既存のコードの大量なリファクタリングが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["단순성 우선 등의 핵심 원칙을 준수해야 함","既存 코드의大量 리팩토링이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a principios básicos como Simplicidad Primero","Puede necesitar un refactorizado significativo del código existente"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à des principes fondamentaux comme la Simplicité d''abord","Peut nécessiter un refactoring important du code existant"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung von Grundprinzipien wie Einfachheit zuerst","Kann ein erhebliches Refaktorisieren des bestehenden Codes erfordern"],"pt":["Exige adesão a princípios básicos como Simplicidade Primeiro","Pode necessitar de refatoração significativa de código existente"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения основных принципов, таких как Простота Сначала","Может потребовать значительной переработки существующего кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمبادئ أساسية مثل البساطة أولاً","قد يحتاج إلى إعادة هيكلة كبيرة للشفرة الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('intellectronica/agent-skills/youtube-transcript', 'community', 'intellectronica', 'agent-skills', 'intellectronica/agent-skills', 'youtube-transcript', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:32:54.711Z', NULL, '{"id":"intellectronica/agent-skills/youtube-transcript","name":"youtube-transcript","description":{"zh":"YouTube ","ja":"YouTube","ko":"YouTube ","es":"La transcripción de YouTube permite extraer texto de vídeos utilizando la API youtube-transcript. Se puede utilizar con o sin marcas de tiempo.","fr":"La transcription YouTube permet d''extraire du texte à partir de vidéos en utilisant l''API youtube-transcript. Elle peut être utilisée avec ou sans horodatages.","de":"Die YouTube-Transkription ermöglicht das Extrahieren von Text aus Videos mithilfe der youtube-transcript-API. Sie kann mit oder ohne Zeitstempel verwendet werden.","pt":"A youtube-transcript é uma ferramenta que permite extrair transcrições de vídeos do YouTube. Ela é útil para desenvolvedores que precisam trabalhar com conteúdo de vídeo.","ru":"Транскрипция видео YouTube - это инструмент, который позволяет извлекать транскрипции видео YouTube. Он полезен для разработчиков, которым необходимо работать с видеоконтентом.","ar":"نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب هو أداة تسمح بنسخ نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب. وهي مفيدة للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى العمل مع محتوى الفيديو.","en":"@intellectronica''s agent skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"YouTube ","ja":"YouTube","ko":"YouTube ","es":"Transcripción de YouTube: Extrae texto de vidéos","fr":"Transcription YouTube: Extraire du texte à partir de vidéos","de":"YouTube-Transkription: Text aus Videos extrahieren","pt":"Transcrição de Vídeos do YouTube","ru":"Транскрипция видео YouTube","ar":"نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب","en":"youtube-transcript"},"description":{"zh":"YouTube ","ja":"YouTube","ko":"YouTube ","es":"La transcripción de YouTube permite extraer texto de vídeos utilizando la API youtube-transcript. Se puede utilizar con o sin marcas de tiempo.","fr":"La transcription YouTube permet d''extraire du texte à partir de vidéos en utilisant l''API youtube-transcript. Elle peut être utilisée avec ou sans horodatages.","de":"Die YouTube-Transkription ermöglicht das Extrahieren von Text aus Videos mithilfe der youtube-transcript-API. Sie kann mit oder ohne Zeitstempel verwendet we...","pt":"A youtube-transcript é uma ferramenta que permite extrair transcrições de vídeos do YouTube. Ela é útil para desenvolvedores que precisam trabalhar com conte...","ru":"Транскрипция видео YouTube - это инструмент, который позволяет извлекать транскрипции видео YouTube. Он полезен для разработчиков, которым необходимо работат...","ar":"نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب هو أداة تسمح بنسخ نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب. وهي مفيدة للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى العمل مع محتوى الفيديو.","en":"@intellectronica''s agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"@intellectronica''s agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["YouTube","API","URL","ID",""],"ja":["YouTube","API","URL","ID",""],"ko":["YouTube","API","URL","ID",""],"es":["Extrae transcripciones de vídeos de YouTube","Utiliza la API youtube-transcript para obtener texto","Puede utilizarse con o sin marcas de tiempo","Soporta formato de texto plano y con horodatages","Fácil de utilizar con scripts y parámetros"],"fr":["Extrait des transcriptions de vidéos YouTube","Utilise l''API youtube-transcript pour obtenir du texte","Peut être utilisée avec ou sans horodatages","Prend en charge le format de texte plat et avec horodatages","Facile à utiliser avec des scripts et des paramètres"],"de":["Extrahiert Transkriptionen aus YouTube-Videos","Verwendet die youtube-transcript-API, um Text zu erhalten","Kann mit oder ohne Zeitstempel verwendet werden","Unterstützt Plain-Text-Format und Format mit Zeitstempeln","Einfach zu verwenden mit Skripten und Parametern"],"pt":["Extraia transcrições de vídeos do YouTube","Use a youtube-transcript-api para melhorar sua produtividade","Opção para incluir ou excluir timestamps","Formato de saída personalizável","Fácil de usar e integrar em projetos"],"ru":["Извлекайте транскрипции видео YouTube","Используйте youtube-transcript-api для повышения производительности","Вариант включения или исключения таймстампов","Настраиваемый формат вывода","Легко использовать и интегрировать в проекты"],"ar":["استخراج نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب","استخدم youtube-transcript-api لتحسين إنتاجيتك","خيار لتشمل أو استبعاد التوقيت","تنسيق مخرج قابل للتخصيص","سهل الاستخدام والتكامل في المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["YouTube","API","Python","JavaScript","Node.js","YouTube"],"ja":["YouTube","API","Python","JavaScript","Node.js","YouTube"],"ko":["YouTube","API","Python","JavaScript","Node.js","YouTube"],"es":["transcripción de YouTube","API youtube-transcript","extraer texto de vídeos","marcas de tiempo","texto plano","desarrollo de aplicaciones","programación"],"fr":["transcription YouTube","API youtube-transcript","extraire du texte à partir de vidéos","horodatages","texte plat","développement d''applications","programmation"],"de":["YouTube-Transkription","youtube-transcript-API","Text aus Videos extrahieren","Zeitstempel","Plain-Text","Anwendungsentwicklung","Programmierung"],"pt":["transcrição de vídeos do YouTube","youtube-transcript-api","desenvolvimento de software","extração de texto","vídeo","YouTube","produtividade","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["транскрипция видео YouTube","youtube-transcript-api","разработка программного обеспечения","извлечение текста","видео","YouTube","производительность","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["نصوص فيديوهات يوتيوب","youtube-transcript-api","تطوير البرمجيات","استخراج النص","فيديو","يوتيوب","إنتاجية","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"intellectronica","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"intellectronica/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"youtube-transcript","description":"Extract transcripts from YouTube videos. Use when the user asks for a transcript, subtitles, or captions of a YouTube video and provides a YouTube URL (youtube.com/watch?v=, youtu.be/, or similar). Supports output with or without timestamps.","bodyPreview":"# YouTube Transcript\n\nExtract transcripts from YouTube videos using the youtube-transcript-api.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun the script with a YouTube URL or video ID:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/get_transcript.py \"VIDEO_URL_OR_ID\"\n```\n\nWith timestamps:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/get_transcript.py \"VIDEO_URL_OR_ID\" --timestamps\n```\n\n## Defaults\n\n- **Without timestamps** (default): Plain text, one line per caption segment\n- **With timestamps**: `[MM:SS] text` format (or `[HH:MM:SS]` for longer videos)\n\n## Supported U","body":"# YouTube Transcript\n\nExtract transcripts from YouTube videos using the youtube-transcript-api.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun the script with a YouTube URL or video ID:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/get_transcript.py \"VIDEO_URL_OR_ID\"\n```\n\nWith timestamps:\n\n```bash\nuv run scripts/get_transcript.py \"VIDEO_URL_OR_ID\" --timestamps\n```\n\n## Defaults\n\n- **Without timestamps** (default): Plain text, one line per caption segment\n- **With timestamps**: `[MM:SS] text` format (or `[HH:MM:SS]` for longer videos)\n\n## Supported URL Formats\n\n- `https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID`\n- `https://youtu.be/VIDEO_ID`\n- `https://youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID`\n- Raw video ID (11 characters)\n\n## Output\n\n- CRITICAL: YOU MUST NEVER MODIFY THE RETURNED TRANSCRIPT\n- If the transcript is without timestamps, you SHOULD clean it up so that it is arranged by complete paragraphs and the lines don''t cut in the middle of sentences.\n- If you were asked to save the transcript to a specific file, save it to the requested file.\n- If no output file was specified, use the YouTube video ID with a `-transcript.txt` suffix.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fetches auto-generated or manually added captions (whichever is available)\n- Requires the video to have captions enabled\n- Falls back to auto-generated captions if manual ones aren''t available\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:32:54.711Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Analysis Agents requiring automated YouTube video transcript extraction.","zh":"适用于需要自动化YouTube视频转录的媒体分析代理。","ja":"YouTube動画の自動トランスクリプト抽出を必要とするメディア分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 유튜브 비디오 자막 추출이 필요한 미디어 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Medios que requieren extracción automática de transcripciones de videos de YouTube.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse des médias nécessitant l''extraction automatique de transcripts de vidéos YouTube.","de":"Ideal für Media-Analyse-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Extraktion von YouTube-Video-Transkripten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Mídia que exigem extração automática de transcritos de vídeos do YouTube.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа медиа, требующих автоматизированного извлечения транскриптов видео YouTube.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الوسائط التي تتطلب استخراج النصوص الأوتوماتيكية لمقاطع فيديو يوتيوب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract transcripts from YouTube videos using the youtube-transcript-api, supporting both plain text and timestamped formats, enabling advanced video content analysis and processing capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理从YouTube视频中提取转录的能力，使用youtube-transcript-api支持纯文本和时间戳格式，实现高级视频内容分析和处理功能。","ja":"youtube-transcript-apiを使用して、YouTube動画からトランスクリプトを抽出するエージェントの機能を強化します。プレーンテキストとタイムスタンプの両方の形式をサポートし、動画コンテンツの高度な分析と処理機能を可能にします。","ko":"유튜브 비디오에서 자막을 추출할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 강화하여 youtube-transcript-api를 사용하여 평문과 타임스탬프 형식을 지원하고 고급 비디오 콘텐츠 분석 및 처리 기능을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer transcripciones de vídeos de YouTube utilizando la youtube-transcript-api, que admite tanto texto plano como formatos con marca de tiempo, lo que permite capacidades de análisis y procesamiento de contenido de video avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des transcripts de vidéos YouTube en utilisant la youtube-transcript-api, qui prend en charge à la fois le texte brut et les formats avec horodatage, permettant ainsi des capacités d''analyse et de traitement de contenu vidéo avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Transkripte von YouTube-Videos mithilfe der youtube-transcript-api zu extrahieren, die sowohl Plain-Text als auch Zeitstempel-Formate unterstützt, wodurch erweiterte Videoinhaltsanalyse- und Verarbeitungsfunktionen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam transcritos de vídeos do YouTube usando a api de transcrição do youtube, suportando tanto texto simples quanto formatos com carimbo de data e hora, possibilitando capacidades avançadas de análise e processamento de conteúdo de vídeo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать транскрипты видео YouTube с помощью youtube-transcript-api, поддерживая как простой текст, так и форматы с меткой времени, что обеспечивает расширенные возможности анализа и обработки видеоконтента.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية استخراج النصوص من مقاطع فيديو يوتيوب باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب-نص، مع دعم كل من النص العادي والتنسيقات المزودة بطابع زمني، مما يتيح إمكانيات متقدمة لتحليل ومعالجة محتوى الفيديو."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating YouTube video transcript generation for subtitles","Extracting relevant quotes with timestamps for content summarization","Debugging video content using transcript output for quality assurance"],"zh":["自动化YouTube视频字幕生成","使用时间戳提取相关引语进行内容摘要","使用转录输出进行视频内容调试以确保质量"],"ja":["YouTube動画の字幕生成の自動化","タイムスタンプを使用した関連引用の抽出によるコンテンツの要約","トランスクリプトの出力による動画コンテンツのデバッグによる品質保証"],"ko":["자막 생성을 위한 유튜브 비디오 자막 자동화","내용 요약을 위한 타임스탬프를 사용한 관련 인용문 추출","품질 보증을 위한 비디오 콘텐츠 디버깅을 위한 자막 출력"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de transcripciones de videos de YouTube para subtítulos","Extraer citas relevantes con marcas de tiempo para la resumen de contenido","Depurar el contenido de video utilizando la salida de transcripción para la garantía de calidad"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de transcripts de vidéos YouTube pour les sous-titres","Extraire des citations pertinentes avec des horodatages pour la synthèse de contenu","Déboguer le contenu vidéo en utilisant la sortie de transcript pour l''assurance qualité"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von Transkripten von YouTube-Videos für Untertitel","Extrahieren von relevanten Zitaten mit Zeitstempeln für die Inhaltszusammenfassung","Debuggen von Videoinhalten mithilfe der Transkriptausgabe für die Qualitätsicherung"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de transcritos de vídeos do YouTube para legendas","Extrair citações relevantes com carimbos de data e hora para resumo de conteúdo","Depurar conteúdo de vídeo usando saída de transcrição para garantia de qualidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию транскриптов видео YouTube для субтитров","Извлекать релевантные цитаты с меткой времени для суммирования контента","Отлаживать видеоконтент с помощью вывода транскрипта для обеспечения качества"],"ar":["تأتمتة توليد نصوص مقاطع فيديو يوتيوب للتعليقات","استخراج الاقتباسات ذات الصلة مع توقيعات زمنية لملخص المحتوى","تصحيح أخطاء محتوى الفيديو باستخدام إخراج النص للتحقق من الجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires YouTube URL or video ID","Dependent on youtube-transcript-api availability and compatibility","Limited to YouTube video transcripts only"],"zh":["需要YouTube URL或视频ID","依赖于youtube-transcript-api的可用性和兼容性","仅限于YouTube视频转录"],"ja":["YouTube URLまたは動画IDが必要","youtube-transcript-apiの可用性と互換性に依存","YouTube動画トランスクリプトのみに限られる"],"ko":["유튜브 URL 또는 비디오 ID가 필요합니다.","youtube-transcript-api의 가용성 및 호환성에 의존합니다.","유튜브 비디오 자막만으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere URL de YouTube o ID de video","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y compatibilidad de la youtube-transcript-api","Limitado a transcripciones de videos de YouTube solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une URL YouTube ou un ID de vidéo","Dépend de la disponibilité et de la compatibilité de la youtube-transcript-api","Limité aux transcripts de vidéos YouTube uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt YouTube-URL oder Video-ID","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und Kompatibilität der youtube-transcript-api","Begrenzt auf Transkripte von YouTube-Videos nur"],"pt":["Exige URL do YouTube ou ID do vídeo","Dependente da disponibilidade e compatibilidade da api de transcrição do youtube","Limitado a transcritos de vídeos do YouTube apenas"],"ru":["Требует URL-адреса YouTube или идентификатора видео","Зависит от наличия и совместимости youtube-transcript-api","Ограничен только транскриптами видео YouTube"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL ل يوتيوب أو معرف الفيديو","يعتمد على توفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب-نص ومتانةها","محدود بنصوص مقاطع فيديو يوتيوب فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YeSongYun/openclaw-cn/coding-agent', 'community', 'YeSongYun', 'openclaw-cn', 'YeSongYun/openclaw-cn', 'coding-agent', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:33:29.464Z', NULL, '{"id":"YeSongYun/openclaw-cn/coding-agent","name":"coding-agent","description":{"zh":"Coding Agent 是一个交互式终端应用，需要 PTY 模式来正确工作","ja":"Coding Agent はインタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションで、PTY モードが必要です","ko":"코딩 에이전트는 PTY 모드가 필요한 인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션입니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una solución efectiva para desarrolladores que necesitan una herramienta interactiva para su trabajo.","fr":"L''agent de codage est une solution efficace pour les développeurs qui ont besoin d''un outil interactif pour leur travail.","de":"Der Codieragent ist eine effiziente Lösung für Entwickler, die ein interaktives Werkzeug für ihre Arbeit benötigen.","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma ferramenta interativa de terminal que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente","ru":"Агент кодирования - это интерактивное терминальное приложение, которое требует псевдотерминала для правильной работы","ar":"وكيل الترميز هو تطبيق طرفية تفاعلي يتطلب طرفًا زائفًا للعمل بشكل صحيح","en":"clawdbot-dmxapi汉化版本"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"编码代理 - Coding Agent","ja":"コードエージェント - Coding Agent","ko":"코딩 에이전트 - Coding Agent","es":"Agente de codificación: solución eficaz para desarrolladores","fr":"Agent de codage : solution efficace pour les développeurs","de":"Codieragent: effiziente Lösung für Entwickler","pt":"Agente de Codificação: Otimização de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Агент Кодирования: Оптимизация Разработки","ar":"وكيل الترميز: تحسين التطوير","en":"coding-agent"},"description":{"zh":"Coding Agent 是一个交互式终端应用，需要 PTY 模式来正确工作","ja":"Coding Agent はインタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションで、PTY モードが必要です","ko":"코딩 에이전트는 PTY 모드가 필요한 인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션입니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una solución efectiva para desarrolladores que necesitan una herramienta interactiva para su trabajo.","fr":"L''agent de codage est une solution efficace pour les développeurs qui ont besoin d''un outil interactif pour leur travail.","de":"Der Codieragent ist eine effiziente Lösung für Entwickler, die ein interaktives Werkzeug für ihre Arbeit benötigen.","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma ferramenta interativa de terminal que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente","ru":"Агент кодирования - это интерактивное терминальное приложение, которое требует псевдотерминала для правильной работы","ar":"وكيل الترميز هو تطبيق طرفية تفاعلي يتطلب طرفًا زائفًا للعمل بشكل صحيح","en":"clawdbot-dmxapi汉化版本"},"definition":{"en":"clawdbot-dmxapi汉化版本"},"features":{"zh":["支持 PTY 模式","与 bash 集成","交互式终端应用","简单有效","支持背景模式"],"ja":["PTY モードをサポート","bash と統合","インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーション","シンプルで効果的","バックグラウンドモードをサポート"],"ko":["PTY 모드를 지원","bash와 통합","인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션","간단하고 효과적","백그라운드 모드를 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con pseudo-terminales (PTY)","Modo de fondo opcional","Uso de bash para todo el trabajo del agente de codificación","Salida de colores y formato","Compatibilidad con agentes de codificación como Codex y Claude Code"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec les pseudo-terminaux (PTY)","Mode d''arrière-plan optionnel","Utilisation de bash pour tout le travail de l''agent de codage","Sortie de couleurs et de format","Compatibilité avec les agents de codage tels que Codex et Claude Code"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Pseudo-Terminals (PTY)","Optionaler Hintergrundmodus","Verwendung von bash für alle Arbeiten des Codieragenten","Farbausgabe und Formatierung","Kompatibilität mit Codieragenten wie Codex und Claude Code"],"pt":["Requer PTY para funcionar corretamente","Modo de segundo plano opcional","Uso de bash para todas as tarefas de agente de codificação","Saída quebrada ou faltando cores sem PTY","Agente pode travar sem PTY"],"ru":["Требует PTY для правильной работы","Необязательный фон","Использование bash для всех задач агента кодирования","Неполная или отсутствующая цветовая схема без PTY","Агент может зависнуть без PTY"],"ar":["يتطلب طرفًا زائفًا للعمل بشكل صحيح","وضع خلفية اختياري","استخدام bash لجميع مهام وكيل الترميز","إخراج مكسور أو فاقد ألوان بدون طرف زائف","يمكن لوكيل الترميز أن يعلق بدون طرف زائف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Coding Agent","PTY 模式","bash","交互式终端应用","编码代理","终端应用"],"ja":["Coding Agent","PTY モード","bash","インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーション","コードエージェント","ターミナルアプリケーション"],"ko":["코딩 에이전트","PTY 모드","bash","인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션","코딩 에이전트","터미널 애플리케이션"],"es":["agente de codificación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de codificación","pseudo-terminales","bash","Codex","Claude Code"],"fr":["agent de codage","développement de logiciels","outils de codage","pseudo-terminaux","bash","Codex","Claude Code"],"de":["Codieragent","Software-Entwicklung","Codierungstools","Pseudo-Terminals","bash","Codex","Claude Code"],"pt":["agente de codificação","desenvolvimento de código","PTY","modo de segundo plano","bash","terminal interativo","produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["агент кодирования","разработка кода","PTY","фон","bash","интерактивное терминальное приложение","производительность разработки"],"ar":["وكيل الترميز","تطوير الشفرة","PTY","وضع الخلفية","bash","تطبيق طرفية تفاعلي","إنتاجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"YeSongYun","repo":"openclaw-cn","repoPath":"YeSongYun/openclaw-cn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent","description":"Run Codex CLI, Claude Code, OpenCode, or Pi Coding Agent via background process for programmatic control.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n#","body":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n# ❌ Wrong - no PTY, agent may break\nbash command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n```\n\n### Bash Tool Parameters\n\n| Parameter    | Type    | Description                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command`    | string  | The shell command to run                                                    |\n| `pty`        | boolean | **Use for coding agents!** Allocates a pseudo-terminal for interactive CLIs |\n| `workdir`    | string  | Working directory (agent sees only this folder''s context)                   |\n| `background` | boolean | Run in background, returns sessionId for monitoring                         |\n| `timeout`    | number  | Timeout in seconds (kills process on expiry)                                |\n| `elevated`   | boolean | Run on host instead of sandbox (if allowed)                                 |\n\n### Process Tool Actions (for background sessions)\n\n| Action      | Description                                          |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list`      | List all running/recent sessions                     |\n| `poll`      | Check if session is still running                    |\n| `log`       | Get session output (with optional offset/limit)      |\n| `write`     | Send raw data to stdin                               |\n| `submit`    | Send data + newline (like typing and pressing Enter) |\n| `send-keys` | Send key tokens or hex bytes                         |\n| `paste`     | Paste text (with optional bracketed mode)            |\n| `kill`      | Terminate the session                                |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: One-Shot Tasks\n\nFor quick prompts/chats, create a temp git repo and run:\n\n```bash\n# Quick chat (Codex needs a git repo!)\nSCRATCH=$(mktemp -d) && cd $SCRATCH && git init && codex exec \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Or in a real project - with PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/Projects/myproject command:\"codex exec ''Add error handling to the API calls''\"\n```\n\n**Why git init?** Codex refuses to run outside a trusted git directory. Creating a temp repo solves this for scratch work.\n\n---\n\n## The Pattern: workdir + background + pty\n\nFor longer tasks, use background mode with PTY:\n\n```bash\n# Start agent in target directory (with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a snake game''\"\n# Returns sessionId for tracking\n\n# Monitor progress\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# Check if done\nprocess action:poll sessionId:XXX\n\n# Send input (if agent asks a question)\nprocess action:write sessionId:XXX data:\"y\"\n\n# Submit with Enter (like typing \"yes\" and pressing Enter)\nprocess action:submit sessionId:XXX data:\"yes\"\n\n# Kill if needed\nprocess action:kill sessionId:XXX\n```\n\n**Why workdir matters:** Agent wakes up in a focused directory, doesn''t wander off reading unrelated files (like your soul.md 😅).\n\n---\n\n## Codex CLI\n\n**Model:** `gpt-5.2-codex` is the default (set in ~/.codex/config.toml)\n\n### Flags\n\n| Flag            | Effect                                             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exec \"prompt\"` | One-shot execution, exits when done                |\n| `--full-auto`   | Sandboxed but auto-approves in workspace           |\n| `--yolo`        | NO sandbox, NO approvals (fastest, most dangerous) |\n\n### Building/Creating\n\n```bash\n# Quick one-shot (auto-approves) - remember PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a dark mode toggle''\"\n\n# Background for longer work\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo ''Refactor the auth module''\"\n```\n\n### Reviewing PRs\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Never review PRs in OpenClaw''s own project folder!**\nClone to temp folder or use git worktree.\n\n```bash\n# Clone to temp for safe review\nREVIEW_DIR=$(mktemp -d)\ngit clone https://github.com/user/repo.git $REVIEW_DIR\ncd $REVIEW_DIR && gh pr checkout 130\nbash pty:true workdir:$REVIEW_DIR command:\"codex review --base origin/main\"\n# Clean up after: trash $REVIEW_DIR\n\n# Or use git worktree (keeps main intact)\ngit worktree add /tmp/pr-130-review pr-130-branch\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/pr-130-review command:\"codex review --base main\"\n```\n\n### Batch PR Reviews (parallel army!)\n\n```bash\n# Fetch all PR refs first\ngit fetch origin ''+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*''\n\n# Deploy the army - one Codex per PR (all with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #86. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/86''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #87. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/87''\"\n\n# Monitor all\nprocess action:list\n\n# Post results to GitHub\ngh pr comment <PR#> --body \"<review content>\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Claude Code\n\n```bash\n# With PTY for proper terminal output\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n\n# Background\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## OpenCode\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"opencode run ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pi Coding Agent\n\n```bash\n# Install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"pi ''Your task''\"\n\n# Non-interactive mode (PTY still recommended)\nbash pty:true command:\"pi -p ''Summarize src/''\"\n\n# Different provider/model\nbash pty:true command:\"pi --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini -p ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n**Note:** Pi now has Anthropic prompt caching enabled (PR #584, merged Jan 2026)!\n\n---\n\n## Parallel Issue Fixing with git worktrees\n\nFor fixing multiple issues in parallel, use git worktrees:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create worktrees for each issue\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-78 /tmp/issue-78 main\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-99 /tmp/issue-99 main\n\n# 2. Launch Codex in each (background + PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-78 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #78: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-99 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #99: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\n\n# 3. Monitor progress\nprocess action:list\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# 4. Create PRs after fixes\ncd /tmp/issue-78 && git push -u origin fix/issue-78\ngh pr create --repo user/repo --head fix/issue-78 --title \"fix: ...\" --body \"...\"\n\n# 5. Cleanup\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-78\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-99\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Rules\n\n1. **Always use pty:true** - coding agents need a terminal!\n2. **Respect tool choice** - if user asks for Codex, use Codex.\n   - Orchestrator mode: do NOT hand-code patches yourself.\n   - If an agent fails/hangs, respawn it or ask the user for direction, but don''t silently take over.\n3. **Be patient** - don''t kill sessions because they''re \"slow\"\n4. **Monitor with process:log** - check progress without interfering\n5. **--full-auto for building** - auto-approves changes\n6. **vanilla for reviewing** - no special flags needed\n7. **Parallel is OK** - run many Codex processes at once for batch work\n8. **NEVER start Codex in ~/clawd/** - it''ll read your soul docs and get weird ideas about the org chart!\n9. **NEVER checkout branches in ~/Projects/openclaw/** - that''s the LIVE OpenClaw instance!\n\n---\n\n## Progress Updates (Critical)\n\nWhen you spawn coding agents in the background, keep the user in the loop.\n\n- Send 1 short message when you start (what''s running + where).\n- Then only update again when something changes:\n  - a milestone completes (build finished, tests passed)\n  - the agent asks a question / needs input\n  - you hit an error or need user action\n  - the agent finishes (include what changed + where)\n- If you kill a session, immediately say you killed it and why.\n\nThis prevents the user from seeing only \"Agent failed before reply\" and having no idea what happened.\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Notify on Completion\n\nFor long-running background tasks, append a wake trigger to your prompt so OpenClaw gets notified immediately when the agent finishes (instead of waiting for the next heartbeat):\n\n```\n... your task here.\n\nWhen completely finished, run this command to notify me:\nopenclaw system event --text \"Done: [brief summary of what was built]\" --mode now\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo exec ''Build a REST API for todos.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \\\"Done: Built todos REST API with CRUD endpoints\\\" --mode now''\"\n```\n\nThis triggers an immediate wake event — Skippy gets pinged in seconds, not 10 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings (Jan 2026)\n\n- **PTY is essential:** Coding agents are interactive terminal apps. Without `pty:true`, output breaks or agent hangs.\n- **Git repo required:** Codex won''t run outside a git directory. Use `mktemp -d && git init` for scratch work.\n- **exec is your friend:** `codex exec \"prompt\"` runs and exits cleanly - perfect for one-shots.\n- **submit vs write:** Use `submit` to send input + Enter, `write` for raw data without newline.\n- **Sass works:** Codex responds well to playful prompts. Asked it to write a haiku about being second fiddle to a space lobster, got: _\"Second chair, I code / Space lobster sets the tempo / Keys glow, I follow\"_ 🦞\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:29.464Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Codex, Claude Code, and Pi requiring interactive terminal applications with pseudo-terminal support","zh":"适用于 Codex、Claude Code 和 Pi 等需要交互式终端应用程序且支持伪终端的 AI Agents","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Pi などのインタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションと偽の端末をサポートすることを必要とする AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"Codex, Claude Code, Pi 등과 같은 대화형 터미널 애플리케이션 및 유사 터미널 지원이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Codex, Claude Code y Pi que requieren aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con soporte de pseudo-terminal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Codex, Claude Code et Pi nécessitant des applications de terminal interactif avec prise en charge du pseudo-terminal","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Codex, Claude Code und Pi, die interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit Pseudo-Terminal-Unterstützung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Codex, Claude Code e Pi que exigem aplicações de terminal interativo com suporte a pseudoterminal","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Pi, требующих интерактивных терминальных приложений с поддержкой псевдотерминала","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Codex و Claude Code و Pi الذين يتطلبون تطبيقات محطة işات تفاعلية مع دعم محطة işات وهمية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute complex coding tasks using bash with optional background mode, ensuring simple and effective interactions via pseudo-terminals, and supports PTY mode for correct output and color rendering","zh":"赋予代理执行使用 bash 的复杂编码任务的能力，具有可选的后台模式，确保通过伪终端进行简单有效的交互，并支持 PTY 模式以获得正确的输出和颜色渲染","ja":"エージェントがバックグラウンドモードをオプションとするbashを使用した複雑なコーディングタスクを実行する能力を付与し、疑似端末を介したシンプルで有効なインタラクションを保証し、正しい出力と色のレンダリングのためにPTYモードをサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 백그라운드 모드를 옵션으로 하는 bash를 사용하여 복잡한 코딩 작업을 수행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, 유사 터미널을 통해 간단하고 효과적인 상호 작용을 보장하며, 올바른 출력 및 색상 렌더링을 위한 PTY 모드를 지원합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar tareas de codificación complejas utilizando bash con modo de fondo opcional, garantizando interacciones simples y efectivas a través de pseudo-terminales y admite el modo PTY para una salida correcta y representación de colores","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches de codage complexes en utilisant bash avec un mode d''arrière-plan optionnel, garantissant des interactions simples et efficaces via des pseudo-terminaux, et prend en charge le mode PTY pour une sortie correcte et un rendu des couleurs","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, komplexe Codierungsaufgaben mit bash und optionaler Hintergrundmodus auszuführen, wodurch einfache und effektive Interaktionen über Pseudo-Terminals gewährleistet werden und PTY-Modus für korrekte Ausgabe und Farbdarstellung unterstützt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar tarefas de codificação complexas usando bash com modo de segundo plano opcional, garantindo interações simples e eficazes por meio de pseudoterminal, e suporta o modo PTY para saída correta e renderização de cores","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять сложные задачи кодирования с помощью bash с опциональным фоновым режимом, обеспечивая простые и эффективные взаимодействия через псевдотерминал, и поддерживает режим PTY для правильного вывода и отображения цветов","ar":"تمكن العملاء من تنفيذ مهام تعبئة رموز معقدة باستخدام bash مع режим الخلفية الاختياري، مما يضمن التفاعلات البسيطة والفعالة من خلال محطة işات وهمية، ودعم وضع PTY للخرج الصحيح وتصيير الألوان"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating coding workflows with bash scripts","Debugging interactive terminal applications","Generating code snippets using Codex or Claude Code"],"zh":["使用 bash 脚本自动化编码工作流程","调试交互式终端应用程序","使用 Codex 或 Claude Code 生成代码片段"],"ja":["bashスクリプトを使用したコーディングワークフローの自動化","インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションのデバッグ","CodexまたはClaude Codeを使用したコードスニペットの生成"],"ko":["bash 스크립트를 사용한 코딩 워크플로 자동화","대화형 터미널 애플리케이션 디버깅","Codex 또는 Claude Code를 사용한 코드 스니펫 생성"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de codificación con scripts de bash","Depurar aplicaciones de terminal interactivas","Generar fragmentos de código utilizando Codex o Claude Code"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de codage avec des scripts bash","Déboguer des applications de terminal interactif","Générer des extraits de code en utilisant Codex ou Claude Code"],"de":["Automatisieren von Codierungsworkflows mit bash-Skripten","Interaktive Terminalanwendungen debuggen","Code-Snippets mit Codex oder Claude Code generieren"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de codificação com scripts bash","Depurar aplicações de terminal interativo","Gerar trechos de código usando Codex ou Claude Code"],"ru":["Автоматизация потоков кодирования с помощью скриптов bash","Отладка интерактивных терминальных приложений","Генерация фрагментов кода с помощью Codex или Claude Code"],"ar":["تأتمتة تدفقات العمل الترميز باستخدام نصوص bash","تصحيح الأخطاء في تطبيقات المحطة işات التفاعلية","генерация شظايا من الرموز باستخدام Codex أو Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pseudo-terminal (PTY) support","PTY mode must be enabled with ''pty:true''"],"zh":["需要伪终端 (PTY) 支持","PTY 模式必须通过 ''pty:true'' 启用"],"ja":["疑似端末（PTY）サポートが必要","PTYモードは ''pty:true'' で有効にする必要があります"],"ko":["유사 터미널 (PTY) 지원이 필요합니다","PTY 모드는 ''pty:true''로 활성화해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere soporte de pseudo-terminal (PTY)","El modo PTY debe estar habilitado con ''pty:true''"],"fr":["Nécessite une prise en charge du pseudo-terminal (PTY)","Le mode PTY doit être activé avec ''pty:true''"],"de":["Benötigt Pseudo-Terminal- (PTY-) Unterstützung","Der PTY-Modus muss mit ''pty:true'' aktiviert werden"],"pt":["Exige suporte a pseudoterminal (PTY)","O modo PTY deve ser ativado com ''pty:true''"],"ru":["Требует поддержки псевдотерминала (PTY)","Режим PTY должен быть включен с ''pty:true''"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم محطة işات وهمية (PTY)","يجب تمكين وضع PTY مع ''pty:true''"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('raphaelsalaja/userinterface-wiki/morphing-icons', 'community', 'raphaelsalaja', 'userinterface-wiki', 'raphaelsalaja/userinterface-wiki', 'morphing-icons', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z', '2026-02-18T02:33:09.190Z', NULL, '{"id":"raphaelsalaja/userinterface-wiki/morphing-icons","name":"morphing-icons","description":{"zh":"Morphing Icons是一种通过三条SVG线实现图标变形的技术，能够打造更流畅的界面体验","ja":"Morphing Iconsは、3つのSVG線を使用してアイコンを変形する技術であり、よりスムーズなインターフェース体験を実現します","ko":"Morphing Icons는 3개의 SVG선으로 아이콘을 변형하여 더 나은 인터페이스 경험을 제공하는 기술입니다","es":"Morphing-icons es una técnica para crear íconos que se transforman mediante la modificación de formas. Cada ícono se compone de exactamente tres líneas SVG, lo que permite una transición suave entre íconos","fr":"Morphing-icons est une technique pour créer des icônes qui se transforment en modifiant des formes. Chaque icône est composé de trois lignes SVG exactes, ce qui permet une transition fluide entre les icônes","de":"Morphing-icons ist eine Technik zum Erstellen von Symbolen, die sich durch Formänderung verändern. Jedes Symbol besteht aus genau drei SVG-Linien, was einen nahtlosen Übergang zwischen Symbolen ermöglicht","pt":"Morfing de ícones permite a transformação de ícones através de alterações reais de forma, não crossfades. Qualquer ícone pode se transformar em outro devido à estrutura de três linhas SVG compartilhada.","ru":"Морфинг иконок позволяет изменять иконки через реальные изменения формы, а не перекрестные затухания. Любая иконка может измениться в другую благодаря общей структуре из трех линий SVG.","ar":"تتيح تقنية التغيير الشكلي للأيقونات تحويل الأيقونات من خلال تغييرات حقيقية في الشكل، وليس عبر التعتيم المتقاطع. يمكن لأي أيقونة أن تتغير إلى أخرى بسبب الهيكل المكون من ثلاثة خطوط SVG المشترك.","en":"A Living Manual for Better Interfaces"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"变形图标 - 为界面带来更好的体验","ja":"モーフィングアイコン - インターフェースをより良くする","ko":"모핑 아이콘 - 더 나은 인터페이스를 위한解决方案","es":"Íconos Morfables: Mejora la Interfaz de Usuario","fr":"Icônes Morphing: Améliorer l''Interface Utilisateur","de":"Morphing-Icons: Bessere Benutzeroberfläche","pt":"Ícones Morfáveis: Construa Interfaces Dinâmicas","ru":"Морфинг иконок: Создавайте динамические интерфейсы","ar":"أيقونات متغيرة الشكل: بناء واجهات ديناميكية","en":"morphing-icons"},"description":{"zh":"Morphing Icons是一种通过三条SVG线实现图标变形的技术，能够打造更流畅的界面体验","ja":"Morphing Iconsは、3つのSVG線を使用してアイコンを変形する技術であり、よりスムーズなインターフェース体験を実現します","ko":"Morphing Icons는 3개의 SVG선으로 아이콘을 변형하여 더 나은 인터페이스 경험을 제공하는 기술입니다","es":"Morphing-icons es una técnica para crear íconos que se transforman mediante la modificación de formas. Cada ícono se compone de exactamente tres líneas SVG, ...","fr":"Morphing-icons est une technique pour créer des icônes qui se transforment en modifiant des formes. Chaque icône est composé de trois lignes SVG exactes, ce ...","de":"Morphing-icons ist eine Technik zum Erstellen von Symbolen, die sich durch Formänderung verändern. Jedes Symbol besteht aus genau drei SVG-Linien, was einen ...","pt":"Morfing de ícones permite a transformação de ícones através de alterações reais de forma, não crossfades. Qualquer ícone pode se transformar em outro devido ...","ru":"Морфинг иконок позволяет изменять иконки через реальные изменения формы, а не перекрестные затухания. Любая иконка может измениться в другую благодаря общей ...","ar":"تتيح تقنية التغيير الشكلي للأيقونات تحويل الأيقونات من خلال تغييرات حقيقية في الشكل، وليس عبر التعتيم المتقاطع. يمكن لأي أيقونة أن تتغير إلى أخرى بسبب الهيكل...","en":"A Living Manual for Better Interfaces"},"definition":{"en":"A Living Manual for Better Interfaces"},"features":{"zh":["通过三条SVG线实现图标变形","支持任意两个图标之间的变形","图标变形无需crossfades","所有图标共享相同的三条SVG线结构","支持图标的透明度和坐标设置"],"ja":["3つのSVG線を使用してアイコンを変形","任意の2つのアイコン間の変形をサポート","アイコンの変形にcrossfadesは不要","すべてのアイコンが同じ3つのSVG線構造を共有","アイコンの透明度と座標の設定をサポート"],"ko":["3개의 SVG선으로 아이콘을 변형","任意 두 개의 아이콘 사이의 변형을 지원","아이콘 변형에 crossfades 필요 없음","모든 아이콘이 동일한 3개의 SVG선 구조를 공유","아이콘의 투명도와 좌표 설정 지원"],"es":["Creación de íconos que se transforman mediante la modificación de formas","Transición suave entre íconos","Cada ícono se compone de exactamente tres líneas SVG","Permite la creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Mejora la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Création d''icônes qui se transforment en modifiant des formes","Transition fluide entre les icônes","Chaque icône est composé de trois lignes SVG exactes","Permet la création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Améliore l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von Symbolen, die sich durch Formänderung verändern","Nahtloser Übergang zwischen Symbolen","Jedes Symbol besteht aus genau drei SVG-Linien","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Verbessert die Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Transformação de ícones suave e realista","Estrutura de três linhas SVG compartilhada","Qualquer ícone pode se transformar em outro","Tecnologia de morfing avançada","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Плавное и реалистичное преобразование иконок","Общая структура из трех линий SVG","Любая иконка может измениться в другую","Продвинутая технология морфинга","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تحويل أيقونات سلس ومتاقع","هيكل مكون من ثلاثة خطوط SVG مشترك","يمكن لأي أيقونة أن تتغير إلى أخرى","تقنية متقدمة للتغيير الشكلي","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["变形图标","SVG线变形","图标变形","界面设计","用户体验","前端开发","SVG图标","图标设计"],"ja":["モーフィングアイコン","SVG線変形","アイコン変形","インターフェース設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","フロントエンド開発","SVGアイコン","アイコン設計"],"ko":["모핑 아이콘","SVG선 변형","아이콘 변형","인터페이스 디자인","사용자 경험","프론트엔드 개발","SVG 아이콘","아이콘 디자인"],"es":["morphing-icons","diseño de interfaz de usuario","íconos que se transforman","transición suave","SVG","experiencia del usuario","interfaces de usuario personalizadas"],"fr":["morphing-icons","conception d''interface utilisateur","icônes qui se transforment","transition fluide","SVG","expérience utilisateur","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées"],"de":["morphing-icons","Benutzeroberflächendesign","Symbole, die sich verändern","nahtloser Übergang","SVG","Benutzererfahrung","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["morfing de ícones","ícones dinâmicos","interfaces de usuário","experiência do usuário","tecnologia de morfing","desenvolvimento web","design de interface"],"ru":["морфинг иконок","динамические иконки","интерфейсы пользователя","пользовательский опыт","технология морфинга","веб-разработка","дизайн интерфейса"],"ar":["تغيير شكلي للأيقونات","أيقونات ديناميكية","واجهات المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","تقنية التغيير الشكلي","تطوير الويب","تصميم الواجهة"]}},"owner":"raphaelsalaja","repo":"userinterface-wiki","repoPath":"raphaelsalaja/userinterface-wiki","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"morphing-icons","description":"Build icon components where any icon morphs into any other through SVG line transformation. Use when asked to create morphing icons, build icon transitions, animate between icons, or transform icons.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Morphing Icons\n\nBuild icons that transform through actual shape transformation, not crossfades. Any icon can morph into any other because they share the same underlying 3-line structure.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nEvery icon is composed of exactly **three SVG lines**. Icons that need fewer lines collapse the extras to invisible center points. This constraint enables seamless morphing between any two icons.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### 1. Line Definition\n\nEach line has coordinates and optional opacity:\n\n```ts","body":"# Morphing Icons\n\nBuild icons that transform through actual shape transformation, not crossfades. Any icon can morph into any other because they share the same underlying 3-line structure.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nEvery icon is composed of exactly **three SVG lines**. Icons that need fewer lines collapse the extras to invisible center points. This constraint enables seamless morphing between any two icons.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### 1. Line Definition\n\nEach line has coordinates and optional opacity:\n\n```ts\ninterface IconLine {\n  x1: number;\n  y1: number;\n  x2: number;\n  y2: number;\n  opacity?: number;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Collapsed Lines\n\nIcons needing fewer than 3 lines use collapsed lines—zero-length lines at the center:\n\n```ts\nconst CENTER = 7; // Center of 14x14 viewbox\n\nconst collapsed: IconLine = {\n  x1: CENTER,\n  y1: CENTER,\n  x2: CENTER,\n  y2: CENTER,\n  opacity: 0,\n};\n```\n\n### 3. Icon Definition\n\nEach icon has exactly 3 lines, optional rotation, and optional group:\n\n```ts\ninterface IconDefinition {\n  lines: [IconLine, IconLine, IconLine];\n  rotation?: number;\n  group?: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Rotation Groups\n\nIcons sharing a `group` animate rotation when transitioning between them. Icons without matching groups jump to the new rotation instantly:\n\n```ts\n// These rotate smoothly between each other\n{ lines: plusLines, rotation: 0, group: \"plus-cross\" }   // plus\n{ lines: plusLines, rotation: 45, group: \"plus-cross\" }  // cross\n\n// These rotate smoothly between each other\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 0, group: \"arrow\" }       // arrow-right\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 90, group: \"arrow\" }      // arrow-down\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 180, group: \"arrow\" }     // arrow-left\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: -90, group: \"arrow\" }     // arrow-up\n```\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### `morphing-three-lines`\nEvery icon MUST use exactly 3 lines. No more, no fewer.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\nconst checkIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n  ], // Only 2 lines\n};\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst checkIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n    collapsed, // Third line collapsed\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-use-collapsed`\nUnused lines must use the collapsed constant, not omission or null.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\nconst minusIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    null,\n    null,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst minusIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    collapsed,\n    collapsed,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-consistent-viewbox`\nAll icons must use the same viewBox (14x14 recommended).\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\n// Mixing viewbox scales\nconst icon1 = { lines: [{ x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 }, ...] }; // 14x14\nconst icon2 = { lines: [{ x1: 4, y1: 14, x2: 24, y2: 14 }, ...] }; // 28x28\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst VIEWBOX_SIZE = 14;\nconst CENTER = 7;\n// All coordinates within 0-14 range\n```\n\n### `morphing-group-variants`\nIcons that are rotational variants MUST share the same group and base lines.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\n// Different line definitions for arrows\nconst arrowRight = { lines: [{ x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 }, ...] };\nconst arrowDown = { lines: [{ x1: 7, y1: 2, x2: 7, y2: 12 }, ...] }; // Different!\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst arrowLines: [IconLine, IconLine, IconLine] = [\n  { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n  { x1: 7.5, y1: 2.5, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n  { x1: 7.5, y1: 11.5, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n];\n\nconst icons = {\n  \"arrow-right\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 0, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-down\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 90, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-left\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 180, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-up\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: -90, group: \"arrow\" },\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-spring-rotation`\nRotation between grouped icons should use spring physics for natural motion.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<motion.g animate={{ rotate: rotation }} transition={{ duration: 0.3 }} />\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nconst rotation = useSpring(definition.rotation ?? 0, activeTransition);\n\n<motion.g style={{ rotate: rotation, transformOrigin: \"center\" }} />\n```\n\n### `morphing-reduced-motion`\nRespect `prefers-reduced-motion` by disabling animations.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\nfunction MorphingIcon({ icon }: Props) {\n  return <motion.line animate={...} transition={{ duration: 0.4 }} />;\n}\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nfunction MorphingIcon({ icon }: Props) {\n  const reducedMotion = useReducedMotion() ?? false;\n  const activeTransition = reducedMotion ? { duration: 0 } : transition;\n  \n  return <motion.line animate={...} transition={activeTransition} />;\n}\n```\n\n### `morphing-jump-non-grouped`\nWhen transitioning between icons NOT in the same group, rotation should jump instantly.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n// Always animating rotation regardless of group\nuseEffect(() => {\n  rotation.set(definition.rotation ?? 0);\n}, [definition]);\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (shouldRotate) {\n    rotation.set(definition.rotation ?? 0); // Animate\n  } else {\n    rotation.jump(definition.rotation ?? 0); // Instant\n  }\n}, [definition, shouldRotate]);\n```\n\n### `morphing-strokelinecap-round`\nLines should use `strokeLinecap=\"round\"` for polished endpoints.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<motion.line strokeLinecap=\"butt\" />\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\n<motion.line strokeLinecap=\"round\" />\n```\n\n### `morphing-aria-hidden`\nIcon SVGs should be `aria-hidden` since they''re decorative.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<svg width={size} height={size}>...</svg>\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\n<svg width={size} height={size} aria-hidden=\"true\">...</svg>\n```\n\n## Common Icon Patterns\n\n### Two-Line Icons (check, minus, equals, chevron)\nUse one or two collapsed lines:\n\n```ts\nconst check = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n    collapsed,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Three-Line Icons (menu, asterisk, play)\nUse all three lines:\n\n```ts\nconst menu = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 3.5, x2: 12, y2: 3.5 },\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 2, y1: 10.5, x2: 12, y2: 10.5 },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Point Icons (more, grip)\nUse zero-length lines as dots:\n\n```ts\nconst more = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 3, y1: 7, x2: 3, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 7, y1: 7, x2: 7, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 11, y1: 7, x2: 11, y2: 7 },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## Recommended Transition\n\nUse exponential ease-out for smooth morphing:\n\n```ts\nconst defaultTransition: Transition = {\n  ease: [0.19, 1, 0.22, 1],\n  duration: 0.4,\n};\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen auditing morphing icon implementations, output findings as:\n\n```\nfile:line - [rule-id] description of issue\n\nExample:\ncomponents/icon/index.tsx:45 - [morphing-three-lines] Icon \"check\" has only 2 lines, needs collapsed third\ncomponents/icon/index.tsx:78 - [morphing-group-variants] arrow-down uses different line definitions than arrow-right\n```\n\n## Summary Table\n\nAfter findings, output a summary:\n\n| Rule | Count | Severity |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| `morphing-three-lines` | 2 | HIGH |\n| `morphing-group-variants` | 1 | HIGH |\n| `morphing-reduced-motion` | 1 | MEDIUM |\n\n## References\n\n- [Benji''s experiments with Claude](https://benji.org/morphing-icons-with-claude)\n- [Motion useSpring](https://motion.dev/docs/react-use-spring)\n- [SVG Line Element](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/line)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:09.190Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced icon morphing capabilities for dynamic interfaces","zh":"非常适合需要高级图标变形能力的前端代理，用于动态接口","ja":"動的インターフェイスのための高度なアイコン変形機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"동적인 인터페이스에 대한 고급 아이콘 변형 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de morfismo de iconos avanzadas para interfaces dinámicas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de morphisme d''icônes avancées pour les interfaces dynamiques","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Icon-Morphing-Funktionen für dynamische Schnittstellen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de morfismo de ícones para interfaces dinâmicas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности морфинга иконок для динамических интерфейсов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى khảيات متقدمة لتحويل الأيقونات ديناميكيًا لواجهات المستخدم الديناميكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate seamless icon transformations using SVG lines, enabling morphing between any two icons through actual shape transformation, not crossfades, leveraging the underlying 3-line structure","zh":"赋予代理生成无缝图标转换的能力，使用SVG线，实现任何两个图标之间的变形，不使用交叉渐变，而是利用底层的3线结构","ja":"エージェントにSVGラインを使用してシームレスなアイコン変換を生成する能力を与え、交差渐層ではなく、下層の3本線構造を利用して、任意の2つのアイコン間の変形を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 SVG 라인을 사용하여 無縫な 아이콘 전환을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여,任意의 두 아이콘 사이의 변형을 실제 도형 변형을 통해, 교차渐层을 사용하지 않고,하위 3선 구조를 활용하여 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar transformaciones de iconos sin problemas utilizando líneas SVG, lo que permite la morfología entre dos iconos cualesquiera a través de la transformación real de la forma, no crossfades, aprovechando la estructura subyacente de 3 líneas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des transformations d''icônes sans problème en utilisant des lignes SVG, permettant la morphologie entre deux icônes quelconques par transformation réelle de forme, et non par crossfades, en exploitant la structure sous-jacente à 3 lignes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, nahtlose Ikonen-Transformationen unter Verwendung von SVG-Linien zu generieren, wodurch eine Morphing zwischen zwei beliebigen Icons durch tatsächliche Formtransformation, nicht Crossfades, unter Ausnutzung der zugrunde liegenden 3-Linien-Struktur ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar transformações de ícones sem interrupção usando linhas SVG, permitindo a morfagem entre qualquer dois ícones por meio de transformação de forma real, e não crossfades, aproveitando a estrutura de três linhas subjacente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать бесшовные трансформации иконок с помощью линий SVG, позволяя морфировать между любыми двумя иконками через реальную трансформацию формы, а не перекрестные затухания, используя базовую структуру из трех линий","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد تحويلات أيقونات متصلة باستخدام خطوط SVG، مما يسمح بالتحويل بين أيقونتين من خلال تحويل شكل فعلي وليس عبر إيقاف العرض، مستفيدًا من الهيكل الأساسي المكون من ثلاثة خطوط"},"useCases":{"en":["Morphing icons for dynamic user interfaces","Generating interactive icon sets with seamless transitions","Creating responsive icon designs using SVG lines"],"zh":["用于动态用户接口的图标变形","生成交互式图标集并实现无缝过渡","使用SVG线创建响应式图标设计"],"ja":["動的ユーザーインターフェイスのためのアイコン変形","シームレスな遷移を実現したインタラクティブアイコンセットの生成","SVGラインを使用したレスポンシブアイコン設計の作成"],"ko":["동적인 사용자 인터페이스에 대한 아이콘 변형","무缝한 전환을 구현한 상호작용 아이콘 세트 생성","SVG 라인을 사용한 반응형 아이콘 디자인 생성"],"es":["Morfismo de iconos para interfaces de usuario dinámicas","Generación de conjuntos de iconos interactivos con transiciones sin problemas","Creación de diseños de iconos responsivos utilizando líneas SVG"],"fr":["Morphisme d''icônes pour les interfaces utilisateur dynamiques","Génération d''ensembles d''icônes interactifs avec transitions sans problème","Création de conceptions d''icônes responsives en utilisant des lignes SVG"],"de":["Morphing von Icons für dynamische Benutzeroberflächen","Erzeugung interaktiver Icon-Sets mit nahtlosen Übergängen","Erstellung responsiver Icon-Designs unter Verwendung von SVG-Linien"],"pt":["Morfamento de ícones para interfaces de usuário dinâmicas","Geração de conjuntos de ícones interativos com transições sem interrupção","Criação de projetos de ícones responsivos usando linhas SVG"],"ru":["Морфинг иконок для динамических интерфейсов пользователя","Генерация интерактивных наборов иконок с бесшовными переходами","Создание адаптивных дизайнов иконок с помощью линий SVG"],"ar":["تحويل الأيقونات ديناميكيًا لواجهات المستخدم الديناميكية","توليد مجموعات أيقونات تفاعلية مع انتقالات متصلة","إنشاء تصميمات أيقونات مستجيبة باستخدام خطوط SVG"]},"limitations":{"en":["Icons must be composed of exactly three SVG lines","Requires SVG compatibility"],"zh":["图标必须由恰好三个SVG线组成","需要SVG兼容性"],"ja":["アイコンは正確に3本のSVGラインで構成されなければならない","SVGの互換性が必要"],"ko":["아이콘은 정확히 3개의 SVG 라인으로 구성되어야 함","SVG 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Los iconos deben estar compuestos por exactamente tres líneas SVG","Requiere compatibilidad con SVG"],"fr":["Les icônes doivent être composées d''exactement trois lignes SVG","Nécessite la compatibilité SVG"],"de":["Die Icons müssen aus genau drei SVG-Linien bestehen","Benötigt SVG-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Os ícones devem ser compostos por exatamente três linhas SVG","Requer compatibilidade com SVG"],"ru":["Иконки должны состоять ровно из трех линий SVG","Требуется совместимость с SVG"],"ar":["يجب أن تتكون الأيقونات من ثلاثة خطوط SVG بالضبط","يتطلب توافقًا مع SVG"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('houangrpg/polymarket-analysis/coding-agent', 'community', 'houangrpg', 'polymarket-analysis', 'houangrpg/polymarket-analysis', 'coding-agent', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z', '2026-02-18T02:33:58.653Z', NULL, '{"id":"houangrpg/polymarket-analysis/coding-agent","name":"coding-agent","description":{"zh":"Coding Agent 是一种交互式终端应用，需要 PTY 模式才能正常工作。这里介绍如何正确配置 PTY 模式","ja":"コーディング エージェントはインタラクティブなターミナル アプリケーションです。PTY モードを使用することで正常に動作します","ko":"코딩 에이전트는 대화형 터미널 애플리케이션으로 PTY 모드가 필요합니다. 여기서 PTY 모드를 올바르게 설정하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una aplicación de terminal interactiva que requiere PTY para funcionar correctamente","fr":"L''agent de codage est une application de terminal interactive qui nécessite PTY pour fonctionner correctement","de":"Der Codierungsagent ist eine interaktive Terminalanwendung, die PTY benötigt, um korrekt zu funktionieren","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma ferramenta interativa que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente. Aprenda a usá-lo com bash","ru":"Агент кодирования - это интерактивное приложение, требующее псевдотерминала для правильной работы. Узнайте, как им пользоваться с bash","ar":"وكلاء البرمجة هو تطبيق تفاعلي يحتاج إلى محطة افتراضية للعمل بشكل صحيح. تعلم كيفية استخدامه مع Bash","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Coding Agent 技术指南","ja":"コーディング エージェントの使い方","ko":"코딩 에이전트 사용법","es":"Agente de codificación: Guía para desarrolladores","fr":"Agent de codage: Guide pour les développeurs","de":"Codierungsagent: Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Agente de Codificação: Otimização com Bash","ru":"Агент Кодирования: Оптимизация с Bash","ar":"وكلاء البرمجة: تحسين الأداء باستخدام Bash","en":"coding-agent"},"description":{"zh":"Coding Agent 是一种交互式终端应用，需要 PTY 模式才能正常工作。这里介绍如何正确配置 PTY 模式","ja":"コーディング エージェントはインタラクティブなターミナル アプリケーションです。PTY モードを使用することで正常に動作します","ko":"코딩 에이전트는 대화형 터미널 애플리케이션으로 PTY 모드가 필요합니다. 여기서 PTY 모드를 올바르게 설정하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una aplicación de terminal interactiva que requiere PTY para funcionar correctamente","fr":"L''agent de codage est une application de terminal interactive qui nécessite PTY pour fonctionner correctement","de":"Der Codierungsagent ist eine interaktive Terminalanwendung, die PTY benötigt, um korrekt zu funktionieren","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma ferramenta interativa que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente. Aprenda a usá-lo com bash","ru":"Агент кодирования - это интерактивное приложение, требующее псевдотерминала для правильной работы. Узнайте, как им пользоваться с bash","ar":"وكلاء البرمجة هو تطبيق تفاعلي يحتاج إلى محطة افتراضية للعمل بشكل صحيح. تعلم كيفية استخدامه مع Bash","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 PTY 模式","交互式终端应用","bash 脚本支持","背景模式支持","简单有效的编码体验"],"ja":["PTY モード対応","インタラクティブなターミナル アプリケーション","bash スクリプト対応","バックグラウンド モード対応","シンプルかつ効果的なコーディング体験"],"ko":["PTY 모드 지원","대화형 터미널 애플리케이션","bash 스크립트 지원","백그라운드 모드 지원","단순하며 효과적인 코딩 경험"],"es":["Compatibilidad con bash","Modo de fondo opcional","Requiere PTY para funcionar correctamente","Soporte para codex, Claude Code y Pi","Salida de colores y formato"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec bash","Mode d''arrière-plan optionnel","Nécessite PTY pour fonctionner correctement","Prise en charge de codex, Claude Code et Pi","Sortie de couleurs et de format"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit bash","Optionaler Hintergrundmodus","Benötigt PTY, um korrekt zu funktionieren","Unterstützung für codex, Claude Code und Pi","Ausgabe von Farben und Format"],"pt":["Modo PTY para resultados precisos","Integração com bash","Ferramenta interativa para codificação","Suporte a comandos personalizados","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Режим PTY для точных результатов","Интеграция с bash","Интерактивная утилита для кодирования","Поддержка пользовательских команд","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["وضع PTY للحصول على نتائج دقيقة","التكامل مع Bash","أداة تفاعلية للبرمجة","دعم أوامر مخصصة","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Coding Agent","PTY 模式","交互式终端应用","bash 脚本","背景模式","编码体验","开发工具"],"ja":["コーディング エージェント","PTY モード","インタラクティブなターミナル アプリケーション","bash スクリプト","バックグラウンド モード","コーディング体験","開発ツール"],"ko":["코딩 에이전트","PTY 모드","대화형 터미널 애플리케이션","bash 스크립트","백그라운드 모드","코딩 경험","개발 도구"],"es":["agente de codificación","bash","PTY","desarrollo de software","herramientas de codificación","codex","Claude Code","Pi"],"fr":["agent de codage","bash","PTY","développement de logiciels","outils de codage","codex","Claude Code","Pi"],"de":["Codierungsagent","bash","PTY","Softwareentwicklung","Codierungstools","codex","Claude Code","Pi"],"pt":["agente de codificação","bash","pseudo-terminal","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","ferramentas de codificação"],"ru":["агент кодирования","bash","псевдотерминал","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","инструменты кодирования"],"ar":["وكيل البرمجة","Bash","محطة افتراضية","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","أدوات البرمجة"]}},"owner":"houangrpg","repo":"polymarket-analysis","repoPath":"houangrpg/polymarket-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent","description":"Run Codex CLI, Claude Code, OpenCode, or Pi Coding Agent via background process for programmatic control.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n#","body":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n# ❌ Wrong - no PTY, agent may break\nbash command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n```\n\n### Bash Tool Parameters\n\n| Parameter    | Type    | Description                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command`    | string  | The shell command to run                                                    |\n| `pty`        | boolean | **Use for coding agents!** Allocates a pseudo-terminal for interactive CLIs |\n| `workdir`    | string  | Working directory (agent sees only this folder''s context)                   |\n| `background` | boolean | Run in background, returns sessionId for monitoring                         |\n| `timeout`    | number  | Timeout in seconds (kills process on expiry)                                |\n| `elevated`   | boolean | Run on host instead of sandbox (if allowed)                                 |\n\n### Process Tool Actions (for background sessions)\n\n| Action      | Description                                          |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list`      | List all running/recent sessions                     |\n| `poll`      | Check if session is still running                    |\n| `log`       | Get session output (with optional offset/limit)      |\n| `write`     | Send raw data to stdin                               |\n| `submit`    | Send data + newline (like typing and pressing Enter) |\n| `send-keys` | Send key tokens or hex bytes                         |\n| `paste`     | Paste text (with optional bracketed mode)            |\n| `kill`      | Terminate the session                                |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: One-Shot Tasks\n\nFor quick prompts/chats, create a temp git repo and run:\n\n```bash\n# Quick chat (Codex needs a git repo!)\nSCRATCH=$(mktemp -d) && cd $SCRATCH && git init && codex exec \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Or in a real project - with PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/Projects/myproject command:\"codex exec ''Add error handling to the API calls''\"\n```\n\n**Why git init?** Codex refuses to run outside a trusted git directory. Creating a temp repo solves this for scratch work.\n\n---\n\n## The Pattern: workdir + background + pty\n\nFor longer tasks, use background mode with PTY:\n\n```bash\n# Start agent in target directory (with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a snake game''\"\n# Returns sessionId for tracking\n\n# Monitor progress\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# Check if done\nprocess action:poll sessionId:XXX\n\n# Send input (if agent asks a question)\nprocess action:write sessionId:XXX data:\"y\"\n\n# Submit with Enter (like typing \"yes\" and pressing Enter)\nprocess action:submit sessionId:XXX data:\"yes\"\n\n# Kill if needed\nprocess action:kill sessionId:XXX\n```\n\n**Why workdir matters:** Agent wakes up in a focused directory, doesn''t wander off reading unrelated files (like your soul.md 😅).\n\n---\n\n## Codex CLI\n\n**Model:** `gpt-5.2-codex` is the default (set in ~/.codex/config.toml)\n\n### Flags\n\n| Flag            | Effect                                             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exec \"prompt\"` | One-shot execution, exits when done                |\n| `--full-auto`   | Sandboxed but auto-approves in workspace           |\n| `--yolo`        | NO sandbox, NO approvals (fastest, most dangerous) |\n\n### Building/Creating\n\n```bash\n# Quick one-shot (auto-approves) - remember PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a dark mode toggle''\"\n\n# Background for longer work\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo ''Refactor the auth module''\"\n```\n\n### Reviewing PRs\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Never review PRs in OpenClaw''s own project folder!**\nClone to temp folder or use git worktree.\n\n```bash\n# Clone to temp for safe review\nREVIEW_DIR=$(mktemp -d)\ngit clone https://github.com/user/repo.git $REVIEW_DIR\ncd $REVIEW_DIR && gh pr checkout 130\nbash pty:true workdir:$REVIEW_DIR command:\"codex review --base origin/main\"\n# Clean up after: trash $REVIEW_DIR\n\n# Or use git worktree (keeps main intact)\ngit worktree add /tmp/pr-130-review pr-130-branch\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/pr-130-review command:\"codex review --base main\"\n```\n\n### Batch PR Reviews (parallel army!)\n\n```bash\n# Fetch all PR refs first\ngit fetch origin ''+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*''\n\n# Deploy the army - one Codex per PR (all with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #86. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/86''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #87. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/87''\"\n\n# Monitor all\nprocess action:list\n\n# Post results to GitHub\ngh pr comment <PR#> --body \"<review content>\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Claude Code\n\n```bash\n# With PTY for proper terminal output\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n\n# Background\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## OpenCode\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"opencode run ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pi Coding Agent\n\n```bash\n# Install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"pi ''Your task''\"\n\n# Non-interactive mode (PTY still recommended)\nbash pty:true command:\"pi -p ''Summarize src/''\"\n\n# Different provider/model\nbash pty:true command:\"pi --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini -p ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n**Note:** Pi now has Anthropic prompt caching enabled (PR #584, merged Jan 2026)!\n\n---\n\n## Parallel Issue Fixing with git worktrees\n\nFor fixing multiple issues in parallel, use git worktrees:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create worktrees for each issue\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-78 /tmp/issue-78 main\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-99 /tmp/issue-99 main\n\n# 2. Launch Codex in each (background + PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-78 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #78: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-99 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #99: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\n\n# 3. Monitor progress\nprocess action:list\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# 4. Create PRs after fixes\ncd /tmp/issue-78 && git push -u origin fix/issue-78\ngh pr create --repo user/repo --head fix/issue-78 --title \"fix: ...\" --body \"...\"\n\n# 5. Cleanup\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-78\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-99\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Rules\n\n1. **Always use pty:true** - coding agents need a terminal!\n2. **Respect tool choice** - if user asks for Codex, use Codex.\n   - Orchestrator mode: do NOT hand-code patches yourself.\n   - If an agent fails/hangs, respawn it or ask the user for direction, but don''t silently take over.\n3. **Be patient** - don''t kill sessions because they''re \"slow\"\n4. **Monitor with process:log** - check progress without interfering\n5. **--full-auto for building** - auto-approves changes\n6. **vanilla for reviewing** - no special flags needed\n7. **Parallel is OK** - run many Codex processes at once for batch work\n8. **NEVER start Codex in ~/clawd/** - it''ll read your soul docs and get weird ideas about the org chart!\n9. **NEVER checkout branches in ~/Projects/openclaw/** - that''s the LIVE OpenClaw instance!\n\n---\n\n## Progress Updates (Critical)\n\nWhen you spawn coding agents in the background, keep the user in the loop.\n\n- Send 1 short message when you start (what''s running + where).\n- Then only update again when something changes:\n  - a milestone completes (build finished, tests passed)\n  - the agent asks a question / needs input\n  - you hit an error or need user action\n  - the agent finishes (include what changed + where)\n- If you kill a session, immediately say you killed it and why.\n\nThis prevents the user from seeing only \"Agent failed before reply\" and having no idea what happened.\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Notify on Completion\n\nFor long-running background tasks, append a wake trigger to your prompt so OpenClaw gets notified immediately when the agent finishes (instead of waiting for the next heartbeat):\n\n```\n... your task here.\n\nWhen completely finished, run this command to notify me:\nopenclaw system event --text \"Done: [brief summary of what was built]\" --mode now\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo exec ''Build a REST API for todos.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \\\"Done: Built todos REST API with CRUD endpoints\\\" --mode now''\"\n```\n\nThis triggers an immediate wake event — Skippy gets pinged in seconds, not 10 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings (Jan 2026)\n\n- **PTY is essential:** Coding agents are interactive terminal apps. Without `pty:true`, output breaks or agent hangs.\n- **Git repo required:** Codex won''t run outside a git directory. Use `mktemp -d && git init` for scratch work.\n- **exec is your friend:** `codex exec \"prompt\"` runs and exits cleanly - perfect for one-shots.\n- **submit vs write:** Use `submit` to send input + Enter, `write` for raw data without newline.\n- **Sass works:** Codex responds well to playful prompts. Asked it to write a haiku about being second fiddle to a space lobster, got: _\"Second chair, I code / Space lobster sets the tempo / Keys glow, I follow\"_ 🦞\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:58.653Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents like Codex, Claude Code, and Pi needing interactive terminal applications with pseudo-terminal support","zh":"适合像 Codex、Claude Code 和 Pi 这样的编码代理，需要具有伪终端支持的交互式终端应用程序","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Pi などのコーディングエージェントに適しています。インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションを使用し、疑似端末のサポートが必要です","ko":"코덱스, 클로드 코드, 파이와 같은 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다. 상호 작용 터미널 애플리케이션을 사용하고 가상 터미널 지원이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación como Codex, Claude Code y Pi que necesitan aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con soporte de pseudo-terminal","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage tels que Codex, Claude Code et Pi nécessitant des applications de terminal interactives avec un support de pseudo-terminal","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten wie Codex, Claude Code und Pi, die interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit Pseudo-Terminal-Unterstützung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de codificação como Codex, Claude Code e Pi que necessitam de aplicativos de terminal interativos com suporte a pseudo-terminais","ru":"Идеально подходит для кодирующих агентов, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Pi, которым необходимы интерактивные терминальные приложения с поддержкой псевдотерминалов","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الترميز مثل Codex و Claude Code و Pi التي تحتاج إلى تطبيقات طرفية تفاعلية مع دعم المحاكاة الطرفية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute commands with bash, utilizing pseudo-terminals (PTY) for correct output rendering and color display, while supporting background mode for efficient task management with protocols like pty:true","zh":"赋予代理执行命令的能力，使用 bash，并利用伪终端（PTY）进行正确的输出渲染和颜色显示，同时支持后台模式，使用类似 pty:true 的协议进行高效的任务管理","ja":"エージェントにbashを使用してコマンドを実行する能力を与え、疑似端末（PTY）を使用して正しい出力レンダリングと色の表示を実現し、バックグラウンドモードをサポートして、pty:trueなどのプロトコルを使用した効率的なタスク管理を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 명령을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, bash를 사용하고 가상 터미널(PTY)을 사용하여 올바른 출력 렌더링과 색상 표시를 제공하며, 백그라운드 모드를 지원하여 pty:true와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 효율적인 작업 관리를 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos con bash, utilizando pseudo-terminales (PTY) para renderizar la salida correcta y mostrar colores, mientras que admite el modo de fondo para una gestión de tareas eficiente con protocolos como pty:true","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes avec bash, en utilisant des pseudo-terminaux (PTY) pour un rendu de sortie correct et une affichage des couleurs, tout en prenant en charge le mode arrière-plan pour une gestion de tâches efficace avec des protocoles tels que pty:true","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Befehle mit bash auszuführen, indem sie Pseudo-Terminals (PTY) für die korrekte Ausgabe-Wiedergabe und Farbanzeige verwenden, während sie den Hintergrundmodus für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung mit Protokollen wie pty:true unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos com bash, utilizando pseudo-terminais (PTY) para renderização correta de saída e exibição de cores, além de suportar modo de segundo plano para gerenciamento eficiente de tarefas com protocolos como pty:true","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью выполнять команды с помощью bash, используя псевдотерминалы (PTY) для правильного отображения вывода и цвета, а также поддерживает фоновый режим для эффективного управления задачами с протоколами, такими как pty:true","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل أوامر مع bash، باستخدام المحاكاة الطرفية (PTY) لعرض الإخراج بشكل صحيح وعرض الألوان، مع دعم وضع الخلفية لإدارة المهام بكفاءة مع بروتوكولات مثل pty:true"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing complex bash commands with PTY support","Debugging coding agent interactions with pseudo-terminals","Automating coding tasks with background mode"],"zh":["使用PTY支持执行复杂的bash命令","使用伪终端调试编码代理交互","使用后台模式自动化编码任务"],"ja":["PTYサポートを使用して複雑なbashコマンドを実行する","疑似端末を使用してコーディングエージェントの相互作用をデバッグする","バックグラウンドモードを使用してコーディングタスクを自動化する"],"ko":["가상 터미널 지원을 사용하여 복잡한 bash 명령어를 실행하는 것","가상 터미널을 사용하여 코딩 에이전트 상호 작용을 디버깅하는 것","백그라운드 모드를 사용하여 코딩 작업을 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar comandos bash complejos con soporte de PTY","Depurar interacciones de agentes de codificación con pseudo-terminales","Automatizar tareas de codificación con modo de fondo"],"fr":["Exécuter des commandes bash complexes avec un support de PTY","Déboguer les interactions des agents de codage avec des pseudo-terminaux","Automatiser des tâches de codage avec le mode arrière-plan"],"de":["Komplexe bash-Befehle mit PTY-Unterstützung ausführen","Interaktionen von Codierungsagenten mit Pseudo-Terminals debuggen","Codieraufgaben mit Hintergrundmodus automatisieren"],"pt":["Execução de comandos bash complexos com suporte a PTY","Depuração de interações de agentes de codificação com pseudo-terminais","Automatização de tarefas de codificação com modo de segundo plano"],"ru":["Выполнение сложных команд bash с поддержкой PTY","Отладка взаимодействия кодирующих агентов с псевдотерминалами","Автоматизация задач кодирования в фоновом режиме"],"ar":["تشغيل أوامر bash المعقدة مع دعم PTY","تصحيح أخطاء تفاعلات عمليات الترميز مع المحاكاة الطرفية","أتمتة مهام الترميز مع وضع الخلفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pseudo-terminal (PTY) support","PTY mode must be explicitly enabled with pty:true"],"zh":["需要伪终端（PTY）支持","PTY模式必须显式启用，使用pty:true"],"ja":["疑似端末（PTY）サポートが必要","PTYモードを有効にするには、pty:trueを使用して明示的に有効化する必要があります"],"ko":["가상 터미널(PTY) 지원이 필요합니다","가상 터미널 모드를 활성화하려면 pty:true를 사용하여 명시적으로 활성화해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere soporte de pseudo-terminal (PTY)","El modo PTY debe estar explícitamente habilitado con pty:true"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de pseudo-terminal (PTY)","Le mode PTY doit être explicitement activé avec pty:true"],"de":["Benötigt Pseudo-Terminal-Unterstützung (PTY)","Der PTY-Modus muss explizit mit pty:true aktiviert werden"],"pt":["Requer suporte a pseudo-terminal (PTY)","O modo PTY deve ser explicitamente habilitado com pty:true"],"ru":["Требует поддержки псевдотерминала (PTY)","Режим PTY должен быть явно включен с помощью pty:true"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم المحاكاة الطرفية (PTY)","يجب تمكين وضع PTY بشكل صريح مع pty:true"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
