一个本地首先的个人 AI 助手，支持多通道聊天和工具。它需要 PTY 模式来工作正确","ja":"コーディング エージェントは、ローカルファーストのパーソナル AI アシスタントで、マルチチャンネル チャットとツールをサポートします。PTY モードが必要です","ko":"코딩 에이전트는 로컬 우선의 개인 AI 어시스턴트로, 멀티 채널 채팅과 툴을 지원합니다. PTY 모드가 필요합니다","es":"El agente de codificación es un asistente AI local que ejecuta comandos de terminal de manera efectiva","fr":"L''agent de codage est un assistant AI local qui exécute des commandes de terminal de manière efficace","de":"Der Coding-Agent ist ein lokaler KI-Assistent, der Terminal-Befehle effektiv ausführt","pt":"O Agente de Codificação é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento local que utiliza o bash para executar comandos de codificação de forma simples e eficaz","ru":"Агент Кодирования - локальный инструмент для разработчиков, который использует bash для выполнения команд кодирования простым и эффективным способом","ar":"عامل الترميز هو أداة تطوير محلية تستخدم bash لتنفيذ أوامر الترميز ببساطة وفعالية","en":"Lazying Art Bot (LAB) — a local-first personal AI assistant you run on your own devices, with   multi-channel chat and tools."},"definition":{"en":"Lazying Art Bot (LAB) — a local-first personal AI assistant you run on your own devices, with   multi-channel chat and tools."},"features":{"zh":["支持多通道聊天","提供工具支持","需要 PTY 模式","支持 bash 脚本","可选的背景模式"],"ja":["マルチチャンネル チャットをサポート","ツールを提供","PTY モードが必要","bash スクリプトをサポート","バックグラウンド モードをオプション"],"ko":["멀티 채널 채팅 지원","툴 제공","PTY 모드 필요","bash 스크립트 지원","백그라운드 모드 선택"],"es":["Interfaz de terminal interactiva","Compatibilidad con PTY para una salida correcta","Ejecución de comandos de terminal de manera efectiva","Soporte para múltiples canales de chat","Opción de modo de fondo para una mayor flexibilidad"],"fr":["Interface de terminal interactive","Compatibilité avec PTY pour une sortie correcte","Exécution de commandes de terminal de manière efficace","Prise en charge de plusieurs canaux de chat","Option de mode d''arrière-plan pour une plus grande flexibilité"],"de":["Interaktive Terminal-Schnittstelle","Kompatibilität mit PTY für eine korrekte Ausgabe","Ausführung von Terminal-Befehlen auf effektive Weise","Unterstützung für mehrere Chat-Kanäle","Option für Hintergrundmodus für eine größere Flexibilität"],"pt":["Execução de comandos de codificação via bash","Modo de segundo plano opcional","Requerimento de PTY para funcionamento correto","Suporte a múltiplos canais de chat","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento integradas"],"ru":["Выполнение команд кодирования через bash","Опциональный фоновый режим","Требование PTY для правильной работы","Поддержка нескольких каналов чата","Встроенные инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تنفيذ أوامر الترميز عبر bash","الوضع الخلفي الاختياري","متطلب PTY للعمل الصحيح","دعم قنوات المحادثة المتعددة","أدوات التطوير المدمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Coding Agent","AI 助手","PTY 模式","bash 脚本","交互式终端","多通道聊天","工具支持"],"ja":["コーディング エージェント","AI アシスタント","PTY モード","bash スクリプト","インタラクティブ ターミナル","マルチチャンネル チャット","ツール サポート"],"ko":["코딩 에이전트","AI 어시스턴트","PTY 모드","bash 스크립트","인터랙티브 터미널","멀티 채널 채팅","툴 지원"],"es":["agente de codificación","asistente AI para desarrolladores","terminal interactiva","PTY","comandos de terminal","desarrollo de software","productividad para desarrolladores"],"fr":["agent de codage","assistant AI pour développeurs","terminal interactive","PTY","commandes de terminal","développement de logiciels","productivité pour développeurs"],"de":["Coding-Agent","KI-Assistent für Entwickler","interaktive Terminal-Schnittstelle","PTY","Terminal-Befehle","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität für Entwickler"],"pt":["agente de codificação","desenvolvimento local","bash","pty","canais de chat","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","codificação eficaz"],"ru":["агент кодирования","локальный разработчик","bash","pty","каналы чата","инструменты разработки","эффективное кодирование"],"ar":["عامل الترميز","تطوير محلي","bash","pty","قنوات المحادثة","أدوات التطوير","ترميز فعال"]}},"owner":"lachlanchen","repo":"LazyingArtBot","repoPath":"lachlanchen/LazyingArtBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent","description":"Run Codex CLI, Claude Code, OpenCode, or Pi Coding Agent via background process for programmatic control.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n#","body":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n# ❌ Wrong - no PTY, agent may break\nbash command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n```\n\n### Bash Tool Parameters\n\n| Parameter    | Type    | Description                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command`    | string  | The shell command to run                                                    |\n| `pty`        | boolean | **Use for coding agents!** Allocates a pseudo-terminal for interactive CLIs |\n| `workdir`    | string  | Working directory (agent sees only this folder''s context)                   |\n| `background` | boolean | Run in background, returns sessionId for monitoring                         |\n| `timeout`    | number  | Timeout in seconds (kills process on expiry)                                |\n| `elevated`   | boolean | Run on host instead of sandbox (if allowed)                                 |\n\n### Process Tool Actions (for background sessions)\n\n| Action      | Description                                          |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list`      | List all running/recent sessions                     |\n| `poll`      | Check if session is still running                    |\n| `log`       | Get session output (with optional offset/limit)      |\n| `write`     | Send raw data to stdin                               |\n| `submit`    | Send data + newline (like typing and pressing Enter) |\n| `send-keys` | Send key tokens or hex bytes                         |\n| `paste`     | Paste text (with optional bracketed mode)            |\n| `kill`      | Terminate the session                                |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: One-Shot Tasks\n\nFor quick prompts/chats, create a temp git repo and run:\n\n```bash\n# Quick chat (Codex needs a git repo!)\nSCRATCH=$(mktemp -d) && cd $SCRATCH && git init && codex exec \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Or in a real project - with PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/Projects/myproject command:\"codex exec ''Add error handling to the API calls''\"\n```\n\n**Why git init?** Codex refuses to run outside a trusted git directory. Creating a temp repo solves this for scratch work.\n\n---\n\n## The Pattern: workdir + background + pty\n\nFor longer tasks, use background mode with PTY:\n\n```bash\n# Start agent in target directory (with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a snake game''\"\n# Returns sessionId for tracking\n\n# Monitor progress\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# Check if done\nprocess action:poll sessionId:XXX\n\n# Send input (if agent asks a question)\nprocess action:write sessionId:XXX data:\"y\"\n\n# Submit with Enter (like typing \"yes\" and pressing Enter)\nprocess action:submit sessionId:XXX data:\"yes\"\n\n# Kill if needed\nprocess action:kill sessionId:XXX\n```\n\n**Why workdir matters:** Agent wakes up in a focused directory, doesn''t wander off reading unrelated files (like your soul.md 😅).\n\n---\n\n## Codex CLI\n\n**Model:** `gpt-5.2-codex` is the default (set in ~/.codex/config.toml)\n\n### Flags\n\n| Flag            | Effect                                             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exec \"prompt\"` | One-shot execution, exits when done                |\n| `--full-auto`   | Sandboxed but auto-approves in workspace           |\n| `--yolo`        | NO sandbox, NO approvals (fastest, most dangerous) |\n\n### Building/Creating\n\n```bash\n# Quick one-shot (auto-approves) - remember PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a dark mode toggle''\"\n\n# Background for longer work\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo ''Refactor the auth module''\"\n```\n\n### Reviewing PRs\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Never review PRs in OpenClaw''s own project folder!**\nClone to temp folder or use git worktree.\n\n```bash\n# Clone to temp for safe review\nREVIEW_DIR=$(mktemp -d)\ngit clone https://github.com/user/repo.git $REVIEW_DIR\ncd $REVIEW_DIR && gh pr checkout 130\nbash pty:true workdir:$REVIEW_DIR command:\"codex review --base origin/main\"\n# Clean up after: trash $REVIEW_DIR\n\n# Or use git worktree (keeps main intact)\ngit worktree add /tmp/pr-130-review pr-130-branch\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/pr-130-review command:\"codex review --base main\"\n```\n\n### Batch PR Reviews (parallel army!)\n\n```bash\n# Fetch all PR refs first\ngit fetch origin ''+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*''\n\n# Deploy the army - one Codex per PR (all with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #86. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/86''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #87. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/87''\"\n\n# Monitor all\nprocess action:list\n\n# Post results to GitHub\ngh pr comment <PR#> --body \"<review content>\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Claude Code\n\n```bash\n# With PTY for proper terminal output\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n\n# Background\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## OpenCode\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"opencode run ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pi Coding Agent\n\n```bash\n# Install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"pi ''Your task''\"\n\n# Non-interactive mode (PTY still recommended)\nbash pty:true command:\"pi -p ''Summarize src/''\"\n\n# Different provider/model\nbash pty:true command:\"pi --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini -p ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n**Note:** Pi now has Anthropic prompt caching enabled (PR #584, merged Jan 2026)!\n\n---\n\n## Parallel Issue Fixing with git worktrees\n\nFor fixing multiple issues in parallel, use git worktrees:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create worktrees for each issue\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-78 /tmp/issue-78 main\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-99 /tmp/issue-99 main\n\n# 2. Launch Codex in each (background + PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-78 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #78: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-99 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #99: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\n\n# 3. Monitor progress\nprocess action:list\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# 4. Create PRs after fixes\ncd /tmp/issue-78 && git push -u origin fix/issue-78\ngh pr create --repo user/repo --head fix/issue-78 --title \"fix: ...\" --body \"...\"\n\n# 5. Cleanup\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-78\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-99\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Rules\n\n1. **Always use pty:true** - coding agents need a terminal!\n2. **Respect tool choice** - if user asks for Codex, use Codex.\n   - Orchestrator mode: do NOT hand-code patches yourself.\n   - If an agent fails/hangs, respawn it or ask the user for direction, but don''t silently take over.\n3. **Be patient** - don''t kill sessions because they''re \"slow\"\n4. **Monitor with process:log** - check progress without interfering\n5. **--full-auto for building** - auto-approves changes\n6. **vanilla for reviewing** - no special flags needed\n7. **Parallel is OK** - run many Codex processes at once for batch work\n8. **NEVER start Codex in ~/clawd/** - it''ll read your soul docs and get weird ideas about the org chart!\n9. **NEVER checkout branches in ~/Projects/openclaw/** - that''s the LIVE OpenClaw instance!\n\n---\n\n## Progress Updates (Critical)\n\nWhen you spawn coding agents in the background, keep the user in the loop.\n\n- Send 1 short message when you start (what''s running + where).\n- Then only update again when something changes:\n  - a milestone completes (build finished, tests passed)\n  - the agent asks a question / needs input\n  - you hit an error or need user action\n  - the agent finishes (include what changed + where)\n- If you kill a session, immediately say you killed it and why.\n\nThis prevents the user from seeing only \"Agent failed before reply\" and having no idea what happened.\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Notify on Completion\n\nFor long-running background tasks, append a wake trigger to your prompt so OpenClaw gets notified immediately when the agent finishes (instead of waiting for the next heartbeat):\n\n```\n... your task here.\n\nWhen completely finished, run this command to notify me:\nopenclaw system event --text \"Done: [brief summary of what was built]\" --mode now\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo exec ''Build a REST API for todos.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \\\"Done: Built todos REST API with CRUD endpoints\\\" --mode now''\"\n```\n\nThis triggers an immediate wake event — Skippy gets pinged in seconds, not 10 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings (Jan 2026)\n\n- **PTY is essential:** Coding agents are interactive terminal apps. Without `pty:true`, output breaks or agent hangs.\n- **Git repo required:** Codex won''t run outside a git directory. Use `mktemp -d && git init` for scratch work.\n- **exec is your friend:** `codex exec \"prompt\"` runs and exits cleanly - perfect for one-shots.\n- **submit vs write:** Use `submit` to send input + Enter, `write` for raw data without newline.\n- **Sass works:** Codex responds well to playful prompts. Asked it to write a haiku about being second fiddle to a space lobster, got: _\"Second chair, I code / Space lobster sets the tempo / Keys glow, I follow\"_ 🦞\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:33:46.677Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for coding agents like Codex, Claude Code, and Pi requiring interactive terminal applications with pseudo-terminal support","zh":"适合于Codex、Claude Code和Pi等编码代理，需要交互式终端应用程序并支持伪终端","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Piなどのコーディングエージェントに適しており、インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションと擬似ターミナルをサポートする","ko":"코덱스, 클로드 코드, 파이와 같은 코딩 에이전트에 적합하며, 대화형 터미널 애플리케이션 및 유사 터미널을 지원한다","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación como Codex, Claude Code y Pi que requieren aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con soporte de pseudo-terminal","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage tels que Codex, Claude Code et Pi nécessitant des applications de terminal interactif avec un support de pseudo-terminal","de":"Ideal für Codierungsagenten wie Codex, Claude Code und Pi, die interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit Pseudo-Terminal-Unterstützung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de codificação como Codex, Claude Code e Pi que exigem aplicações de terminal interativas com suporte a pseudo-terminal","ru":"Идеально подходит для кодирующих агентов, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Pi, требующих интерактивных терминальных приложений с поддержкой псевдотерминала","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الترميز مثل Codex و Claude Code و Pi التي تتطلب تطبيقات طرفية تفاعلية مع دعم طرفية وهمية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute commands with bash using optional background mode, ensuring simple and effective coding agent work with features like PTY mode for correct output and color rendering, and support for protocols like pseudo-terminals","zh":"赋予代理使用bash执行命令的能力，具有可选的后台模式，确保简单有效的编码代理工作，并具有PTY模式以获得正确的输出和颜色渲染，以及对伪终端等协议的支持","ja":"エージェントにbashを使用してコマンドを実行する能力を与え、オプションのバックグラウンドモードを備え、シンプルで効果的なコーディングエージェントの作業を保証し、PTYモードによる正しい出力と色のレンダリング、および擬似ターミナルなどのプロトコルのサポート","ko":"에이전트가 배시를 사용하여 명령을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 선택적 배경 모드를 지원하여 간단하고 효과적인 코딩 에이전트 작업을 보장하고, PTY 모드를 통해 올바른 출력과 색상 렌더링을 제공하며, 유사 터미널 등을 포함한 프로토콜을 지원한다","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar comandos con bash utilizando el modo de fondo opcional, garantizando un trabajo de agente de codificación simple y eficaz con características como el modo PTY para una salida correcta y representación de colores, y soporte para protocolos como pseudo-terminales","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes avec bash en utilisant le mode d''arrière-plan facultatif, garantissant un travail d''agent de codage simple et efficace avec des fonctionnalités comme le mode PTY pour une sortie correcte et un rendu des couleurs, et un support pour les protocoles tels que les pseudo-terminaux","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Befehle mit bash unter Verwendung des optionalen Hintergrundmodus auszuführen, wodurch eine einfache und effektive Codierungsarbeitsagentur mit Funktionen wie PTY-Modus für korrekte Ausgabe und Farbdarstellung sowie Unterstützung für Protokolle wie Pseudo-Terminals gewährleistet ist","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos com bash usando modo de segundo plano opcional, garantindo um trabalho de agente de codificação simples e eficaz com recursos como modo PTY para saída correta e renderização de cores, e suporte a protocolos como pseudo-terminais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять команды с помощью bash, используя опциональный фоновый режим, обеспечивая простую и эффективную работу кодирующих агентов с функциями, такими как режим PTY для правильного вывода и цветового представления, и поддержку протоколов, таких как псевдотерминалы","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل أوامر باستخدام bash باستخدام وضع الخلفية الاختياري، مما يضمن عمل وكلاء الترميز البسيط والفعال مع ميزات مثل وضع PTY للخروج الصحيح وتصيير الألوان، والدعم لبروتوكولات مثل الطرفيات الوهمية"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing coding tasks with bash","Debugging interactive terminal applications","Running coding agents like Codex and Claude Code with PTY mode"],"zh":["使用bash执行编码任务","调试交互式终端应用程序","使用PTY模式运行Codex和Claude Code等编码代理"],"ja":["bashを使用してコーディングタスクを実行する","インタラクティブなターミナルアプリケーションのデバッグ","PTYモードでCodexやClaude Codeなどのコーディングエージェントを実行する"],"ko":["배시를 사용하여 코딩 작업을 실행한다","대화형 터미널 애플리케이션 디버깅","PTY 모드에서 코덱스 및 클라우드 코드와 같은 코딩 에이전트를 실행한다"],"es":["Ejecutar tareas de codificación con bash","Depurar aplicaciones de terminal interactivas","Ejecutar agentes de codificación como Codex y Claude Code con modo PTY"],"fr":["Exécuter des tâches de codage avec bash","Déboguer des applications de terminal interactif","Exécuter des agents de codage tels que Codex et Claude Code avec le mode PTY"],"de":["Ausführen von Codieraufgaben mit bash","Debuggen interaktiver Terminalanwendungen","Ausführen von Codierungsagenten wie Codex und Claude Code im PTY-Modus"],"pt":["Executar tarefas de codificação com bash","Depurar aplicações de terminal interativas","Executar agentes de codificação como Codex e Claude Code com modo PTY"],"ru":["Выполнение задач кодирования с помощью bash","Отладка интерактивных терминальных приложений","Выполнение кодирующих агентов, таких как Codex и Claude Code, в режиме PTY"],"ar":["تشغيل مهام الترميز باستخدام bash","تصحيح الأخطاء في تطبيقات الطرفية التفاعلية","تشغيل وكلاء الترميز مثل Codex و Claude Code مع وضع PTY"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PTY mode enabled with pty:true","Limited to bash-based coding tasks","May require specific device or environment configurations for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要启用PTY模式，设置pty:true","仅限于基于bash的编码任务","可能需要特定的设备或环境配置以获得最佳性能"],"ja":["PTYモードを有効にする必要があり、pty:trueを設定する","bashベースのコーディングタスクのみ","最適なパフォーマンスを得るために、特定のデバイスまたは環境の設定が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["PTY 모드를 활성화해야 하며, pty:true로 설정해야 한다","배시 기반 코딩 작업만 해당","최적의 성능을 얻으려면 특정 장치 또는 환경 구성이 필요할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere que el modo PTY esté habilitado con pty: true","Limitado a tareas de codificación basadas en bash","Puede requerir configuraciones de dispositivo o entorno específicas para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite que le mode PTY soit activé avec pty: true","Limité aux tâches de codage basées sur bash","Peut nécessiter des configurations d''appareil ou d''environnement spécifiques pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt PTY-Modus, der mit pty: true aktiviert ist","Begrenzt auf bash-basierte Codieraufgaben","Kann spezifische Geräte- oder UmgebungsKonfigurationen für optimale Leistung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige modo PTY ativado com pty:true","Limitado a tarefas de codificação baseadas em bash","Pode exigir configurações de dispositivo ou ambiente específicas para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует включенного режима PTY с pty:true","Ограничен задачами кодирования на основе bash","Может потребовать определенных конфигураций устройства или окружения для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع PTY مُفعّل مع pty:true","محدود بمهام الترميز المستندة إلى bash","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينات جهاز أو بيئة محددة لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
