"Prowler Commit: Улучшите Свой Поток Работы","ar":"برولر كوميت: تحسين تدفق العمل","en":"prowler-commit"},"description":{"zh":"prowler-commit 技术规范是一套代码提交的最佳实践，确保提交格式一致，提高代码可读性","ja":"prowler-commit 技術規格はコードの提交のベストプラクティスであり、提交フォーマットの一貫性を保ち、コードの可読性を向上させる","ko":"prowler-commit 기술 규격은 코드 제출의 최선의 관행을 제공하여 제출 형식의 일관성을 유지하고 코드의 가독성을 향상합니다","es":"prowler-commit es una habilidad de IA que permite crear, evaluar y conectar habilidades de IA. Sigue las reglas críticas para un desarrollo efectivo","fr":"prowler-commit est une compétence d''IA qui permet de créer, d''évaluer et de connecter des compétences d''IA. Suivez les règles critiques pour un développement...","de":"prowler-commit ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die das Erstellen, Bewerten und Verbinden von KI-Fähigkeiten ermöglicht. Befolgen Sie die kritischen Regeln für eine ef...","pt":"O Prowler Commit é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar, avaliar e conectar habilidades de IA. Ele fornece regras críticas para melhorar a produtividade","ru":"Prowler Commit - это инструмент, который помогает создавать, оценивать и подключать навыки ИИ. Он предоставляет критические правила для улучшения производите...","ar":"Prowler Commit هو أداة تساعد على إنشاء وتقييم وربط مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي. يوفر قواعد حاسمة لتحسين الإنتاجية","en":"Create, Evaluate, and Connect AI Skills"},"definition":{"en":"Create, Evaluate, and Connect AI Skills"},"features":{"zh":["使用 conventional-commits 格式","提交标题控制在 72 个字符以内","提交前确认用户意图","避免过度具体的提交信息","不包括实现细节在提交标题","不使用 `-n` 标志 unless 用户明确请求"],"ja":["conventional-commits フォーマットを使用","提交タイトルを 72 文字以内に制限","提交前にユーザーの意図を確認","過度に具体的な提交情報を避ける","実装詳細を提交タイトルに含めない","ユーザーが明示的に要求しない限り `-n` フラグを使用しない"],"ko":["conventional-commits 형식을 사용","제출 제목을 72자 이내로 제한","제출 전에 사용자의 의도를 확인","과도한 세부 사항을 포함한 제출 정보를 피함","제출 제목에 구현 세부 사항을 포함하지 않음","사용자가 명시적으로 요청하지 않는 한 `-n` 플래그를 사용하지 않음"],"es":["Creación de habilidades de IA","Evaluación de habilidades de IA","Conexión de habilidades de IA","Uso de conventional-commits","Confirmación de usuario antes de comprometer","Evitación de detalles de implementación en el título"],"fr":["Création de compétences d''IA","Évaluation de compétences d''IA","Connexion de compétences d''IA","Utilisation de conventional-commits","Confirmation de l''utilisateur avant de s''engager","Évitement des détails d''implémentation dans le titre"],"de":["Erstellung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Bewertung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Verbindung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Verwendung von conventional-commits","Benutzerbestätigung vor dem Commit","Vermeidung von Implementierungsdetails im Titel"],"pt":["Uso de formato de commit convencional","Manutenção da primeira linha abaixo de 72 caracteres","Solicitação de confirmação do usuário antes de commitar","Evitação de detalhes de implementação no título","Proibição do uso da flag -n a menos que solicitado pelo usuário","Proibição do uso de git push --force ou git push -f"],"ru":["Использование конвенционального формата коммита","Сохранение первой строки ниже 72 символов","Запрос подтверждения пользователя перед коммитом","Избежание деталей реализации в названии","Запрет использования флага -n, если пользователь не запросил","Запрет использования git push --force или git push -f"],"ar":["استخدام تنسيق التعهد المعتاد","الحفاظ على السطر الأول أقل من 72 حرفًا","طلب تأكيد المستخدم قبل التعهد","تجنب تفاصيل التنفيذ في العنوان","منع استخدام علم -n إلا إذا طالب المستخدم","منع استخدام git push --force أو git push -f"]},"keywords":{"zh":["prowler-commit","代码提交规范","conventional-commits","代码可读性","开发效率","代码提交最佳实践"],"ja":["prowler-commit","コードの提交規格","conventional-commits","コードの可読性","開発効率","コードの提交ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["prowler-commit","코드 제출 규격","conventional-commits","코드 가독성","개발 효율성","코드 제출 최선의 관행"],"es":["prowler-commit","habilidades de IA","desarrollo de IA","conventional-commits","confirmación de usuario","evaluación de habilidades","creación de habilidades","conexión de habilidades"],"fr":["prowler-commit","compétences d''IA","développement d''IA","conventional-commits","confirmation de l''utilisateur","évaluation de compétences","création de compétences","connexion de compétences"],"de":["prowler-commit","KI-Fähigkeiten","KI-Entwicklung","conventional-commits","Benutzerbestätigung","Bewertung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Erstellung von KI-Fähigkeiten","Verbindung von KI-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Prowler Commit","habilidades de IA","commits","formato de commit","produtividade","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de código","otimização de workflow"],"ru":["Prowler Commit","навыки ИИ","коммиты","формат коммита","производительность","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление кодом","оптимизация потока работы"],"ar":["Prowler Commit","مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعهدات","تنسيق التعهد","الإنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة الشفرة","تحسين تدفق العمل"]}},"owner":"zjunlp","repo":"SkillNet","repoPath":"zjunlp/SkillNet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prowler-commit","description":">","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"## Critical Rules\n\n- ALWAYS use conventional-commits format: `type(scope): description`\n- ALWAYS keep the first line under 72 characters\n- ALWAYS ask for user confirmation before committing\n- NEVER be overly specific (avoid counts like \"6 subsections\", \"3 files\")\n- NEVER include implementation details in the title\n- NEVER use `-n` flag unless user explicitly requests it\n- NEVER use `git push --force` or `git push -f` (destructive, rewrites history)\n- NEVER proactively offer to commit - wait for","body":"## Critical Rules\n\n- ALWAYS use conventional-commits format: `type(scope): description`\n- ALWAYS keep the first line under 72 characters\n- ALWAYS ask for user confirmation before committing\n- NEVER be overly specific (avoid counts like \"6 subsections\", \"3 files\")\n- NEVER include implementation details in the title\n- NEVER use `-n` flag unless user explicitly requests it\n- NEVER use `git push --force` or `git push -f` (destructive, rewrites history)\n- NEVER proactively offer to commit - wait for user to explicitly request it\n\n---\n\n## Commit Format\n\n```\ntype(scope): concise description\n\n- Key change 1\n- Key change 2\n- Key change 3\n```\n\n### Types\n\n| Type | Use When |\n|------|----------|\n| `feat` | New feature or functionality |\n| `fix` | Bug fix |\n| `docs` | Documentation only |\n| `chore` | Maintenance, dependencies, configs |\n| `refactor` | Code change without feature/fix |\n| `test` | Adding or updating tests |\n| `perf` | Performance improvement |\n| `style` | Formatting, no code change |\n\n### Scopes\n\n| Scope | When |\n|-------|------|\n| `api` | Changes in `api/` |\n| `ui` | Changes in `ui/` |\n| `sdk` | Changes in `prowler/` |\n| `mcp` | Changes in `mcp_server/` |\n| `skills` | Changes in `skills/` |\n| `ci` | Changes in `.github/` |\n| `docs` | Changes in `docs/` |\n| *omit* | Multiple scopes or root-level |\n\n---\n\n## Good vs Bad Examples\n\n### Title Line\n\n```\n# GOOD - Concise and clear\nfeat(api): add provider connection retry logic\nfix(ui): resolve dashboard loading state\nchore(skills): add Celery documentation\ndocs: update installation guide\n\n# BAD - Too specific or verbose\nfeat(api): add provider connection retry logic with exponential backoff and jitter (3 retries max)\nchore(skills): add comprehensive Celery documentation covering 8 topics\nfix(ui): fix the bug in dashboard component on line 45\n```\n\n### Body (Bullet Points)\n\n```\n# GOOD - High-level changes\n- Add retry mechanism for failed connections\n- Document task composition patterns\n- Expand configuration reference\n\n# BAD - Too detailed\n- Add retry with max_retries=3, backoff=True, jitter=True\n- Add 6 subsections covering chain, group, chord\n- Update lines 45-67 in dashboard.tsx\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze changes**\n   ```bash\n   git status\n   git diff --stat HEAD\n   git log -3 --oneline  # Check recent commit style\n   ```\n\n2. **Draft commit message**\n   - Choose appropriate type and scope\n   - Write concise title (< 72 chars)\n   - Add 2-5 bullet points for significant changes\n\n3. **Present to user for confirmation**\n   - Show files to be committed\n   - Show proposed message\n   - Wait for explicit confirmation\n\n4. **Execute commit**\n   ```bash\n   git add <files>\n   git commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n   type(scope): description\n\n   - Change 1\n   - Change 2\n   EOF\n   )\"\n   ```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nSingle file changed?\n├─ Yes → May omit body, title only\n└─ No → Include body with key changes\n\nMultiple scopes affected?\n├─ Yes → Omit scope: `feat: description`\n└─ No → Include scope: `feat(api): description`\n\nFixing a bug?\n├─ User-facing → fix(scope): description\n└─ Internal/dev → chore(scope): fix description\n\nAdding documentation?\n├─ Code docs (docstrings) → Part of feat/fix\n└─ Standalone docs → docs: or docs(scope):\n```\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check current state\ngit status\ngit diff --stat HEAD\n\n# Standard commit\ngit add <files>\ngit commit -m \"type(scope): description\"\n\n# Multi-line commit\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\ntype(scope): description\n\n- Change 1\n- Change 2\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# Amend last commit (same message)\ngit commit --amend --no-edit\n\n# Amend with new message\ngit commit --amend -m \"new message\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:34:47.432Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents requiring standardized commit formatting and validation.","zh":"适用于需要标准化提交格式和验证的 Git 基础 AI 代理。","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントが標準化されたコミット形式と検証を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 형식 및 유효성 검증이 필요한 Git 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Git que requieren un formato de confirmación estandarizado y validación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur Git nécessitant un format de confirmation standardisé et une validation.","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Format und eine Validierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Git que exigem formatação de commit padrão e validação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Git, требующих стандартизированного форматирования коммитов и проверки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يعتمدون على جيت ويحتاجون إلى تنسيق وتأكيد إرسال محدد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, evaluate, and connect AI skills using conventional-commits format, ensuring consistent and descriptive commit messages with `type(scope): description` syntax, while preventing destructive git push operations and respecting user confirmation for commits.","zh":"赋予代理创建、评估和连接 AI 技能的能力，使用 conventional-commits 格式，确保一致且描述性的提交消息，采用 `type(scope): description` 语法，同时防止破坏性的 Git 推送操作，并尊重用户对提交的确认。","ja":"エージェントが conventional-commits 形式を使用して AI スキルを作成、評価、接続できるようにし、一貫性と記述的なコミット メッセージを `type(scope): description` 構文で保証し、破壊的な Git プッシュ操作を防止し、ユーザーがコミットを確認することを尊重します。","ko":"에이전트가 표준 커밋 형식(conventional-commits)을 사용하여 AI 기술을 생성, 평가 및 연결할 수 있도록 하여 일관성 있고 설명 가능한 커밋 메시지를 `type(scope): description` 구문으로 보장하며, 파괴적인 Git 푸시 연산을 방지하고, 커밋에 대한 사용자 확인을尊重합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, evaluar y conectar habilidades de IA utilizando el formato conventional-commits, garantizando mensajes de confirmación coherentes y descriptivos con la sintaxis `type(scope): description`, al tiempo que evita operaciones de git push destructivas y respeta la confirmación del usuario para los commits.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''évaluer et de connecter les compétences IA en utilisant le format conventional-commits, garantissant des messages de confirmation cohérents et descriptifs avec la syntaxe `type(scope): description`, tout en empêchant les opérations de git push destructrices et en respectant la confirmation de l''utilisateur pour les commits.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, KI-Fähigkeiten zu erstellen, zu bewerten und zu verbinden, indem sie das conventional-commits-Format verwenden, wodurch konsistente und beschreibende Commit-Nachrichten mit der Syntax `type(scope): description` sichergestellt werden, während zerstörerische Git-Push-Vorgänge verhindert und die Benutzerbestätigung für Commits respektiert wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar, avaliar e conectar habilidades de IA usando o formato de conventional-commits, garantindo mensagens de commit consistentes e descritivas com a sintaxe `type(scope): description`, enquanto impede operações de git push destrutivas e respeita a confirmação do usuário para commits.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, оценивать и подключать навыки ИИ, используя формат conventional-commits, обеспечивая последовательные и описательные сообщения о коммитах с синтаксисом `type(scope): description`, а также предотвращая разрушительные операции git push и соблюдая подтверждение пользователя для коммитов.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من إنشاء وتقييم وربط مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام تنسيق conventional-commits، مما يضمن رسائل إرسال متسقة وشاملة بالتنسيق `type(scope): description`، مع منع عمليات الدفع التدميرية و احترام تأكيد المستخدم لإرسال"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message validation","Generating standardized commit history","Enforcing conventional-commits format across AI skill development"],"zh":["自动化提交消息验证","生成标准化的提交历史","强制执行 AI 技能开发中的 conventional-commits 格式"],"ja":["コミット メッセージの検証を自動化する","標準化されたコミット履歴を生成する","AI スキル開発全体で conventional-commits 形式を適用する"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 유효성 검증 자동화","표준화된 커밋 기록 생성","AI 스킬 개발 전반에 걸쳐 conventional-commits 형식을 적용"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de mensajes de confirmación","Generar un historial de confirmaciones estandarizado","Hacer cumplir el formato conventional-commits en todo el desarrollo de habilidades de IA"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation des messages de confirmation","Générer un historique de confirmation standardisé","Faire respecter le format conventional-commits dans tout le développement de compétences IA"],"de":["Automatisieren der Validierung von Commit-Nachrichten","Erzeugen einer standardisierten Commit-Historie","Durchsetzen des conventional-commits-Formats bei der gesamten KI-Fähigkeitsentwicklung"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de mensagens de commit","Gerar histórico de commit padronizado","Impor o formato conventional-commits em todo o desenvolvimento de habilidades de IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку сообщений о коммитах","Генерировать стандартизированную историю коммитов","Внедрять формат conventional-commits на всем этапе разработки навыков ИИ"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من رسائل الإرسال","генерировать سجل إرسال معياري","فرض تنسيق conventional-commits في جميع أنحاء تطوير مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Must adhere to conventional-commits format","Cannot use git push --force or git push -f"],"zh":["需要 Git 仓库访问权限","必须遵循 conventional-commits 格式","不能使用 git push --force 或 git push -f"],"ja":["Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","conventional-commits 形式に従う必要がある","git push --force または git push -f を使用できない"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스 권한이 필요","conventional-commits 형식을 따라야 함","git push --force 또는 git push -f를 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Debe adherirse al formato conventional-commits","No se puede usar git push --force o git push -f"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Doit respecter le format conventional-commits","Ne peut pas utiliser git push --force ou git push -f"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Muss dem conventional-commits-Format entsprechen","Kann nicht git push --force oder git push -f verwenden"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git","Deve seguir o formato conventional-commits","Não pode usar git push --force ou git push -f"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Должно придерживаться формата conventional-commits","Нельзя использовать git push --force или git push -f"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيت","يجب اتباع تنسيق conventional-commits","لا يمكن استخدام git push --force أو git push -f"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/heroui-react', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'heroui-react', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z', '2026-02-18T02:34:14.228Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/heroui-react","name":"heroui-react","description":{"zh":"HeroUI v3 React ","ja":"HeroUI v3 React","ko":"HeroUI v3 React ","es":"HeroUI v3 es una biblioteca de componentes para React que ofrece componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables","fr":"HeroUI v3 est une bibliothèque de composants pour React qui propose des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables","de":"HeroUI v3 ist eine Komponentenbibliothek für React, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten bietet","pt":"HeroUI v3 é uma biblioteca de componentes construída com Tailwind CSS v4 e React Aria Components, fornecendo componentes UI acessíveis e personalizáveis para aplicações React.","ru":"HeroUI v3 — это библиотека компонентов, построенная на базе Tailwind CSS v4 и React Aria Components, предоставляющая доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI для приложений React.","ar":"HeroUI v3 هي مكتبة مكونات مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4 و React Aria Components، توفر مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوفرة و قابلة للتخصيص لتطبيقات React.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"HeroUI v3 React ","ja":"HeroUI v3 React","ko":"HeroUI v3 React ","es":"Guía de Desarrollo HeroUI v3 para React","fr":"Guide de Développement HeroUI v3 pour React","de":"HeroUI v3 React-Entwicklerleitfaden","pt":"Guia de Desenvolvimento HeroUI v3 React","ru":"Руководство по разработке HeroUI v3 React","ar":"دليل تطوير HeroUI v3 React","en":"heroui-react"},"description":{"zh":"HeroUI v3 React ","ja":"HeroUI v3 React","ko":"HeroUI v3 React ","es":"HeroUI v3 es una biblioteca de componentes para React que ofrece componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables","fr":"HeroUI v3 est une bibliothèque de composants pour React qui propose des composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables","de":"HeroUI v3 ist eine Komponentenbibliothek für React, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten bietet","pt":"HeroUI v3 é uma biblioteca de componentes construída com Tailwind CSS v4 e React Aria Components, fornecendo componentes UI acessíveis e personalizáveis para...","ru":"HeroUI v3 — это библиотека компонентов, построенная на базе Tailwind CSS v4 и React Aria Components, предоставляющая доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI ...","ar":"HeroUI v3 هي مكتبة مكونات مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4 و React Aria Components، توفر مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوفرة و قابلة للتخصيص لتطبيقات React.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria ","React","UI","v3"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria ","React","UI","v3"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria ","React","UI","v3"],"es":["Componentes accesibles y personalizables","Basado en Tailwind CSS v4","Integración con React Aria Components","Guía de desarrollo para React","Compatibilidad con versiones anteriores de HeroUI v2"],"fr":["Composants accessibles et personnalisables","Basé sur Tailwind CSS v4","Intégration avec React Aria Components","Guide de développement pour React","Compatibilité avec les versions antérieures de HeroUI v2"],"de":["Zugängliche und anpassbare Komponenten","Basierend auf Tailwind CSS v4","Integration mit React Aria Components","Entwicklerleitfaden für React","Abwärtskompatibilität mit HeroUI v2"],"pt":["Componentes UI acessíveis e personalizáveis","Construída com Tailwind CSS v4","Integração com React Aria Components","Suporte a aplicações React","Documentação abrangente"],"ru":["Доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI","Построена на базе Tailwind CSS v4","Интеграция с React Aria Components","Поддержка приложений React","Полная документация"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوفرة و قابلة للتخصيص","مبنية على Tailwind CSS v4","التكامل مع React Aria Components","دعم تطبيقات React","توثيق شامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria","UI","v3","React "],"ja":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria","UI","v3","React "],"ko":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria","UI","v3","React "],"es":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Desarrollo de aplicaciones web","Componentes de interfaz de usuario","Accesibilidad web","Personalización de componentes"],"fr":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Développement d''applications web","Composants d''interface utilisateur","Accessibilité web","Personnalisation de composants"],"de":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS v4","React Aria Components","Webanwendungsentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Web-Zugänglichkeit","Anpassung von Komponenten"],"pt":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","componentes UI","acessibilidade","personalização","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","компоненты UI","доступность","настраиваемость","веб-разработка"],"ar":["HeroUI v3","React","Tailwind CSS","React Aria Components","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","التوفر","التخصيص","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"heroui-react","description":"HeroUI v3 React component library (Tailwind CSS v4 + React Aria). Use when working with HeroUI components, installing HeroUI, customizing HeroUI themes, or accessing HeroUI component documentation. Keywords: HeroUI, Hero UI, heroui, @heroui/react, @heroui/styles.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------","body":"# HeroUI v3 React Development Guide\n\nHeroUI v3 is a component library built on **Tailwind CSS v4** and **React Aria Components**, providing accessible, customizable UI components for React applications.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: v3 Only - Ignore v2 Knowledge\n\n**This guide is for HeroUI v3 ONLY.** Do NOT use any prior knowledge of HeroUI v2.\n\n### What Changed in v3\n\n| Feature       | v2 (DO NOT USE)                   | v3 (USE THIS)                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Provider      | `<HeroUIProvider>` required       | **No Provider needed**                      |\n| Animations    | `framer-motion` package           | CSS-based, no extra deps                    |\n| Component API | Flat props: `<Card title=\"x\">`    | Compound: `<Card><Card.Header>`             |\n| Styling       | Tailwind v3 + `@heroui/theme`     | Tailwind v4 + `@heroui/styles@beta`         |\n| Packages      | `@heroui/system`, `@heroui/theme` | `@heroui/react@beta`, `@heroui/styles@beta` |\n\n### WRONG (v2 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO NOT DO THIS - v2 pattern\nimport { HeroUIProvider } from \"@heroui/react\";\nimport { motion } from \"framer-motion\";\n\n<HeroUIProvider>\n\t<Card title=\"Product\" description=\"A great product\" />\n</HeroUIProvider>;\n```\n\n### CORRECT (v3 patterns)\n\n```tsx\n// DO THIS - v3 pattern (no provider, compound components)\nimport { Card } from \"@heroui/react@beta\";\n\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Product</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>A great product</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n</Card>;\n```\n\n**Always fetch v3 docs before implementing.** Do not assume v2 patterns work.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Semantic variants (`primary`, `secondary`, `tertiary`) over visual descriptions\n- Composition over configuration (compound components)\n- CSS variable-based theming with `oklch` color space\n- BEM naming convention for predictable styling\n\n---\n\n## Accessing Documentation & Component Information\n\n**For component details, examples, props, and implementation patterns, always fetch documentation:**\n\n### Using Scripts\n\n```bash\n# List all available components\nnode scripts/list_components.mjs\n\n# Get component documentation (MDX)\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button\nnode scripts/get_component_docs.mjs Button Card TextField\n\n# Get component source code\nnode scripts/get_source.mjs Button\n\n# Get component CSS styles (BEM classes)\nnode scripts/get_styles.mjs Button\n\n# Get theme variables\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n\n# Get non-component docs (guides, releases)\nnode scripts/get_docs.mjs /docs/react/getting-started/theming\n```\n\n### Direct MDX URLs\n\nComponent docs: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/{component-name}.mdx`\n\nExamples:\n\n- Button: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/button.mdx`\n- Modal: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/modal.mdx`\n- Form: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/components/form.mdx`\n\nGetting started guides: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/{topic}.mdx`\n\n**Important:** Always fetch component docs before implementing. The MDX docs include complete examples, props, anatomy, and API references.\n\n---\n\n## Installation Essentials\n\n**CRITICAL**: HeroUI v3 is currently in BETA. Always use `@beta` tag when installing packages.\n\n### Quick Install\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants\n```\n\n### Framework Setup (Next.js App Router - Recommended)\n\n1. **Install dependencies:**\n\n```bash\nnpm i @heroui/styles@beta @heroui/react@beta tailwind-variants tailwindcss @tailwindcss/postcss postcss\n```\n\n2. **Create/update `app/globals.css`:**\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind CSS v4 - Must be first */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n/* HeroUI v3 styles - Must be after Tailwind */\n@import \"@heroui/styles\";\n```\n\n3. **Import in `app/layout.tsx`:**\n\n```tsx\nimport \"./globals.css\";\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n\tchildren,\n}: {\n\tchildren: React.ReactNode;\n}) {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n\t\t\t<body>\n\t\t\t\t{/* No Provider needed in HeroUI v3! */}\n\t\t\t\t{children}\n\t\t\t</body>\n\t\t</html>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n4. **Configure PostCSS (`postcss.config.mjs`):**\n\n```js\nexport default {\n\tplugins: {\n\t\t\"@tailwindcss/postcss\": {},\n\t},\n};\n```\n\n### Critical Setup Requirements\n\n1. **Tailwind CSS v4 is MANDATORY** - HeroUI v3 will NOT work with Tailwind CSS v3\n2. **No Provider Required** - Unlike HeroUI v2, v3 components work directly without a Provider\n3. **Use Compound Components** - Components use compound structure (e.g., `Card.Header`, `Card.Content`)\n4. **Use onPress, not onClick** - For better accessibility, use `onPress` event handlers\n5. **Import Order Matters** - Always import Tailwind CSS before HeroUI styles\n\n---\n\n## Component Patterns\n\nHeroUI v3 uses **compound component patterns**. Each component has subcomponents accessed via dot notation.\n\n**Example - Card:**\n\n```tsx\n<Card>\n\t<Card.Header>\n\t\t<Card.Title>Title</Card.Title>\n\t\t<Card.Description>Description</Card.Description>\n\t</Card.Header>\n\t<Card.Content>{/* Content */}</Card.Content>\n\t<Card.Footer>{/* Actions */}</Card.Footer>\n</Card>\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Always use compound structure - don''t flatten to props\n- Subcomponents are accessed via dot notation (e.g., `Card.Header`)\n- Each subcomponent may have its own props\n- **Fetch component docs for complete anatomy and examples**\n\n---\n\n## Semantic Variants\n\nHeroUI uses semantic naming to communicate functional intent:\n\n| Variant     | Purpose                           | Usage          |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `primary`   | Main action to move forward       | 1 per context  |\n| `secondary` | Alternative actions               | Multiple       |\n| `tertiary`  | Dismissive actions (cancel, skip) | Sparingly      |\n| `danger`    | Destructive actions               | When needed    |\n| `ghost`     | Low-emphasis actions              | Minimal weight |\n| `outline`   | Secondary actions                 | Bordered style |\n\n**Don''t use raw colors** - semantic variants adapt to themes and accessibility.\n\n---\n\n## Theming\n\nHeroUI v3 uses CSS variables with `oklch` color space:\n\n```css\n:root {\n\t--accent: oklch(0.6204 0.195 253.83);\n\t--accent-foreground: var(--snow);\n\t--background: oklch(0.9702 0 0);\n\t--foreground: var(--eclipse);\n}\n```\n\n**Get current theme variables:**\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/get_theme.mjs\n```\n\n**Color naming:**\n\n- Without suffix = background (e.g., `--accent`)\n- With `-foreground` = text color (e.g., `--accent-foreground`)\n\n**Theme switching:**\n\n```html\n<html class=\"dark\" data-theme=\"dark\"></html>\n```\n\nFor detailed theming, fetch: `https://v3.heroui.com/docs/react/getting-started/theming.mdx`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:34:14.228Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components with React and Tailwind CSS v4","zh":"适用于需要可访问和可定制的UI组件的前端代理，使用React和Tailwind CSS v4","ja":"ReactとTailwind CSS v4を使用してアクセシビリティの高いカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています","ko":"리액트와 테일윈드 CSS v4를 사용하여 접근성이 높고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con React y Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec React et Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit React und Tailwind CSS v4 benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com React e Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI с React и Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة والقابلة للتخصيص مع React و Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive and accessible user interfaces using HeroUI v3''s component library, leveraging React Aria Components for enhanced accessibility and Tailwind CSS v4 for styling, while ensuring compatibility with the latest React applications","zh":"赋予代理构建响应式和可访问的用户界面使用HeroUI v3的组件库，利用React Aria组件增强可访问性和Tailwind CSS v4进行样式设置，同时确保与最新的React应用程序兼容","ja":"HeroUI v3のコンポーネントライブラリを使用して、React Ariaコンポーネントを使用してアクセシビリティを高め、Tailwind CSS v4を使用してスタイリングを行い、同時に最新のReactアプリケーションとの互換性を確保しながら、レスポンシブでアクセシビリティの高いユーザーインターフェイスを構築するエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"HeroUI v3의 컴포넌트 라이브러리를 사용하여 반응형 및 접근 가능한 사용자 인터페이스를 구축하고, React Aria 컴포넌트를 사용하여 접근성을 향상시키고, Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 스타일을 지정하며,同時に 최신 React 애플리케이션과 호환되는지 확인하는 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario responsivas y accesibles utilizando la biblioteca de componentes de HeroUI v3, aprovechando los componentes de React Aria para una mayor accesibilidad y Tailwind CSS v4 para el estilo, garantizando la compatibilidad con las aplicaciones de React más recientes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur responsives et accessibles en utilisant la bibliothèque de composants HeroUI v3, en exploitant les composants React Aria pour une meilleure accessibilité et Tailwind CSS v4 pour le style, tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec les dernières applications React","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, responsives und zugängliches Benutzerinterface mit der Komponentenbibliothek von HeroUI v3 zu erstellen, indem sie React-Aria-Komponenten für verbesserte Zugänglichkeit und Tailwind CSS v4 für die Stilgebung nutzen und dabei die Kompatibilität mit den neuesten React-Anwendungen gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces de usuário responsivas e acessíveis usando a biblioteca de componentes do HeroUI v3, aproveitando os componentes React Aria para acessibilidade aprimorada e Tailwind CSS v4 para estilização, garantindo a compatibilidade com os aplicativos React mais recentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые и доступные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя библиотеку компонентов HeroUI v3, используя компоненты React Aria для улучшенной доступности и Tailwind CSS v4 для стилизации, обеспечивая совместимость с последними приложениями React","ar":"تمكين العميل من بناء واجهات مستخدم مرنة وقابلة للوصول باستخدام مكتبة مكونات HeroUI v3، واستخدام مكونات React Aria لتحسين الوصول وتايلويند سي إس إس v4 للأسلوب، مع ضمان التوافق مع تطبيقات رياكت الأحدث"},"useCases":{"en":["Building accessible and customizable UI components for React applications","Integrating HeroUI v3 with existing React projects for enhanced user experience","Creating responsive and mobile-first designs using Tailwind CSS v4"],"zh":["为React应用程序构建可访问和可定制的UI组件","将HeroUI v3集成到现有的React项目中以增强用户体验","使用Tailwind CSS v4创建响应式和移动优先的设计"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーション用のアクセシビリティの高いカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを構築する","HeroUI v3を既存のReactプロジェクトに統合してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","Tailwind CSS v4を使用してレスポンシブでモバイルファーストのデザインを作成する"],"ko":["리액트 애플리케이션을 위한 접근성이 높고 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축합니다","HeroUI v3를 기존 리액트 프로젝트에 통합하여 사용자 경험을 향상시킵니다","Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 반응형 및 모바일 우선의 디자인을 생성합니다"],"es":["Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables para aplicaciones de React","Integración de HeroUI v3 con proyectos de React existentes para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Creación de diseños responsivos y de primer nivel móvil con Tailwind CSS v4"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables pour les applications React","Intégration de HeroUI v3 avec les projets React existants pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Création de conceptions responsives et mobile-first avec Tailwind CSS v4"],"de":["Erstellung von zugänglichen und anpassbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für React-Anwendungen","Integration von HeroUI v3 in bestehende React-Projekte für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Erstellung von responsiven und mobile-first-Designs mit Tailwind CSS v4"],"pt":["Construir componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis para aplicativos React","Integrar o HeroUI v3 com projetos React existentes para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada","Criar designs responsivos e mobile-first usando Tailwind CSS v4"],"ru":["Создание доступных и настраиваемых компонентов UI для приложений React","Интеграция HeroUI v3 с существующими проектами React для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Создание отзывчивых и мобильных дизайнов с помощью Tailwind CSS v4"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة والقابلة للتخصيص لتطبيقات رياكت","دمج HeroUI v3 مع مشاريع رياكت الحالية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","إنشاء تصاميم مرنة وأولوية المحمول باستخدام Tailwind CSS v4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Tailwind CSS v4","Only compatible with HeroUI v3, ignoring prior knowledge of HeroUI v2"],"zh":["需要了解React和Tailwind CSS v4","仅与HeroUI v3兼容，忽略HeroUI v2的先验知识"],"ja":["ReactとTailwind CSS v4の知識が必要","HeroUI v3のみと互換性があり、HeroUI v2の事前知識は無視する"],"ko":["리액트와 테일윈드 CSS v4에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","HeroUI v3만 호환되며 HeroUI v2에 대한 선행 지식은 무시합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Tailwind CSS v4","Solo es compatible con HeroUI v3, ignorando el conocimiento previo de HeroUI v2"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Tailwind CSS v4","N''est compatible qu''avec HeroUI v3, ignorant les connaissances précédentes de HeroUI v2"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Tailwind CSS v4","Ist nur mit HeroUI v3 kompatibel, wobei das vorherige Wissen von HeroUI v2 ignoriert wird"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Tailwind CSS v4","Somente compatível com HeroUI v3, ignorando conhecimento prévio de HeroUI v2"],"ru":["Требует знаний React и Tailwind CSS v4","Только совместимо с HeroUI v3, игнорируя предварительные знания HeroUI v2"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة رياكت وتايلويند سي إس إس v4","متوافق فقط مع HeroUI v3، مع تجاهل المعرفة السابقة لـ HeroUI v2"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
