o. Esta habilidad proporciona patrones y orientación para ...","fr":"La plateforme Fal propose des API de plateforme pour la gestion de modèles, de prix et de suivi d''utilisation. Cette compétence fournit des modèles et des co...","de":"Die Fal-Plattform bietet Plattform-APIs für das Modellmanagement, die Preisgestaltung und die Nutzungsverfolgung. Diese Fähigkeit bietet Muster und Anleitung...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["模型管理API","定价和成本跟踪","使用情况跟踪和分析","平台API集成","简化开发流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["モデル管理API","価格設定とコスト追跡","使用状況の追跡と分析","プラットフォームAPI統合","開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["모델 관리 API","가격 설정 및 비용 추적","사용 현황 추적 및 분석","플랫폼 API 통합","개발 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Gestión de modelos","Seguimiento de uso","Gestión de precios","APIs de plataforma","Patrones y orientación para el desarrollo","Integración con la comunidad de desarrolladores de Fal"],"fr":["Gestion de modèles","Suivi d''utilisation","Gestion de prix","API de plateforme","Modèles et conseils pour le développement","Intégration avec la communauté de développeurs de Fal"],"de":["Modellmanagement","Nutzungsverfolgung","Preisgestaltung","Plattform-APIs","Muster und Anleitungen für die Entwicklung","Integration mit der Entwicklergemeinschaft von Fal"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Fal Platform","模型管理","定价和成本跟踪","使用情况跟踪","平台API","开发效率","简化开发流程","技术开发"],"ja":["Fal Platform","モデル管理","価格設定とコスト追跡","使用状況の追跡","プラットフォームAPI","開発効率","開発プロセスの簡素化","技術開発"],"ko":["Fal 플랫폼","모델 관리","가격 설정 및 비용 추적","사용 현황 추적","플랫폼 API","개발 효율성","개발 프로세스 간소화","기술 개발"],"es":["plataforma Fal","gestión de modelos","seguimiento de uso","precios","APIs de plataforma","desarrollo de software","integración de APIs","comunidad de desarrolladores","Fal AI"],"fr":["plateforme Fal","gestion de modèles","suivi d''utilisation","prix","API de plateforme","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API","communauté de développeurs","Fal IA"],"de":["Fal-Plattform","Modellmanagement","Nutzungsverfolgung","Preisgestaltung","Plattform-APIs","Softwareentwicklung","API-Integration","Entwicklergemeinschaft","Fal KI"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fal-platform","description":"Platform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking","bodyPreview":"# Fal Platform\n\n## Overview\n\nPlatform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills/blob/main/skills/claude.ai/fal-platform/SKILL.md)","body":"# Fal Platform\n\n## Overview\n\nPlatform APIs for model management, pricing, and usage tracking\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to work with platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\n## Instructions\n\nThis skill provides guidance and patterns for platform apis for model management, pricing, and usage tracking.\n\nFor more information, see the [source repository](https://github.com/fal-ai-community/skills/blob/main/skills/claude.ai/fal-platform/SKILL.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:36:33.556Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Model Management Agents requiring seamless integration with platform APIs for pricing and usage tracking.","zh":"适用于需要与平台API无缝集成以进行定价和使用跟踪的模型管理代理。","ja":"プラットフォームAPIとのシームレスな統合が必要なモデル管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"가격 및 사용량 추적을 위한 플랫폼 API와의無縫な統合이 필요한 모델 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Modelos que requieren una integración sin problemas con las API de la plataforma para el seguimiento de precios y uso.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Modèles nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les API de la plateforme pour le suivi des prix et de l''utilisation.","de":"Ideal für Model Management Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Plattform-APIs für Preis- und Nutzungstracking erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Modelos que exigem integração perfeita com APIs de plataforma para acompanhamento de preços e utilização.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления моделями, требующих бесшовной интеграции с API платформы для отслеживания цен и использования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة النماذج الذي يتطلب التكامل السلس مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات المنصة لتعقب الأسعار واستخدامها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage models, track usage, and optimize pricing through platform APIs, utilizing guidance and patterns for efficient model management and usage tracking protocols.","zh":"赋予代理管理模型、跟踪使用情况并通过平台API优化定价的能力，利用指导和模式实现高效的模型管理和使用跟踪协议。","ja":"エージェントがモデルを管理し、利用状況を追跡し、プラットフォームAPIを使用して価格を最適化する能力を提供します。また、モデル管理と利用状況追跡のプロトコルを効率的に実施するためのガイダンスとパターンを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 모델을 관리하고 사용状況을 추적하며 플랫폼 API를 사용하여 가격을 최적화하는 기능을 제공합니다. 또한 모델 관리 및 사용량 추적 프로토콜을 효율적으로 구현하기 위한 지침 및 패턴을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar modelos, realizar un seguimiento del uso y optimizar los precios a través de las API de la plataforma, utilizando orientación y patrones para protocolos de gestión y seguimiento de uso de modelos eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les modèles, de suivre l''utilisation et d''optimiser les prix via les API de la plateforme, en utilisant des conseils et des modèles pour des protocoles de gestion et de suivi de l''utilisation des modèles efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Modelle zu verwalten, die Nutzung zu verfolgen und die Preise über Plattform-APIs zu optimieren, indem sie Anleitungen und Muster für effiziente Model-Management- und Nutzungstracking-Protokolle verwenden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem modelos, rastreiem o uso e otimizem os preços por meio de APIs de plataforma, utilizando orientação e padrões para protocolos de gerenciamento e rastreamento de uso eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять моделями, отслеживать использование и оптимизировать цены через API платформы, используя руководство и шаблоны для эффективных протоколов управления и отслеживания использования.","ar":"يمنح العميل إمكانية إدارة النماذج وتعقب الاستخدام وتحسين الأسعار من خلال واجهات برمجة تطبيقات المنصة، باستخدام الإرشادات والأنماط لبروتوكولات إدارة وتعقب الاستخدام الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating model deployment and monitoring","Generating usage reports and pricing analytics","Tracking model performance and optimizing resource allocation"],"zh":["自动化模型部署和监控","生成使用报告和价格分析","跟踪模型性能和优化资源分配"],"ja":["モデルのデプロイと監視の自動化","使用状況レポートと価格分析の生成","モデルのパフォーマンス追跡とリソース割り当ての最適化"],"ko":["모델 배포 및 모니터링 자동화","사용량 보고서 및 가격 분석 생성","모델 성능 추적 및 리소스 할당 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación y supervisión de modelos","Generación de informes de uso y análisis de precios","Seguimiento del rendimiento del modelo y optimización de la asignación de recursos"],"fr":["Automatisation du déploiement et de la surveillance des modèles","Génération de rapports d''utilisation et d''analyses de prix","Suivi des performances du modèle et optimisation de l''allocation des ressources"],"de":["Automatisierung der Modellbereitstellung und -überwachung","Generierung von Nutzungsberichten und Preisanalysen","Verfolgung der Modellleistung und Optimierung der Ressourcenzuweisung"],"pt":["Automatizar a implantação e monitoramento de modelos","Gerar relatórios de uso e análise de preços","Rastrear o desempenho do modelo e otimizar a alocação de recursos"],"ru":["Автоматизация развертывания и мониторинга моделей","Генерация отчетов об использовании и аналитика цен","Отслеживание производительности модели и оптимизация распределения ресурсов"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتثبيت النماذج ومراقبتها","توليد تقارير عن الاستخدام وتحليل الأسعار","تعقب أداء النموذج وتحسين تخصيص الموارد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to platform APIs","Limited to model management, pricing, and usage tracking functionality"],"zh":["需要访问平台API","仅限模型管理、定价和使用跟踪功能"],"ja":["プラットフォームAPIへのアクセスが必要","モデル管理、価格設定、使用状況追跡機能のみ"],"ko":["플랫폼 API에 액세스해야 함","모델 관리, 가격 설정, 사용량 추적 기능만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a las API de la plataforma","Limitado a la funcionalidad de gestión de modelos, precios y seguimiento de uso"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux API de la plateforme","Limité à la fonctionnalité de gestion de modèles, de prix et de suivi de l''utilisation"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Plattform-APIs","Begrenzt auf Model-Management-, Preis- und Nutzungstracking-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Exige acesso às APIs de plataforma","Limitado à funcionalidade de gerenciamento de modelos, preços e rastreamento de uso"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API платформы","Ограничен функциональностью управления моделями, цен и отслеживания использования"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهات برمجة تطبيقات المنصة","محدود بالوظائف إدارة النماذج والأسعار وتعقب الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rmyndharis/antigravity-skills/data-storytelling', 'community', 'rmyndharis', 'antigravity-skills', 'rmyndharis/antigravity-skills', 'data-storytelling', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z', '2026-02-18T02:37:05.085Z', NULL, '{"id":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills/data-storytelling","name":"data-storytelling","description":{"zh":"数据讲故事是一种将原始数据转化为有力的叙述的技术，驱动决策和行动","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、原始データを説得力のある物語に変える技術であり、意思決定と行動を促進する","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링은 원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로 변환하는 기술로서, 의사결정과 행동을 이끌어냅니다","es":"El cuentacuentos de datos es una habilidad que transforma datos en historias convincentes. Clarifica objetivos, aplica mejores prácticas y proporciona pasos para la verificación.","fr":"La narration de données est une compétence qui transforme les données en récits convaincants. Clarifiez les objectifs, appliquez les meilleures pratiques et fournissez des étapes pour la vérification.","de":"Das Data Storytelling ist eine Fähigkeit, die Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen verwandelt. Klären Sie Ziele, wenden Sie bewährte Methoden an und liefern Sie Schritte zur Überprüfung.","pt":"O skill de data-storytelling permite transformar dados em histórias convincentes, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ação","ru":"Навык data-storytelling позволяет превратить данные в убедительные истории, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя на действие","ar":"مهارة سرديات البيانات تمكنك من تحويل البيانات إلى قصص مقنعة تدفع القرارات وتحفز العمل","en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"数据讲故事 - 将原始数据转化为有力的叙述","ja":"データストーリーテリング - 原始データを説得力のある物語に","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링 - 원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로","es":"Cuentacuentos de datos: transforma datos en historias","fr":"Narration de données : transformer les données en récits","de":"Data Storytelling: Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen v...","pt":"Contando Histórias com Dados","ru":"Искусство рассказывания историй с данными","ar":"سرديات البيانات","en":"data-storytelling"},"description":{"zh":"数据讲故事是一种将原始数据转化为有力的叙述的技术，驱动决策和行动","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、原始データを説得力のある物語に変える技術であり、意思決定と行動を促進する","ko":"데이터 스토리텔링은 원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로 변환하는 기술로서, 의사결정과 행동을 이끌어냅니다","es":"El cuentacuentos de datos es una habilidad que transforma datos en historias convincentes. Clarifica objetivos, aplica mejores prácticas y proporciona pasos ...","fr":"La narration de données est une compétence qui transforme les données en récits convaincants. Clarifiez les objectifs, appliquez les meilleures pratiques et ...","de":"Das Data Storytelling ist eine Fähigkeit, die Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen verwandelt. Klären Sie Ziele, wenden Sie bewährte Methoden an und liefern ...","pt":"O skill de data-storytelling permite transformar dados em histórias convincentes, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ação","ru":"Навык data-storytelling позволяет превратить данные в убедительные истории, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя на действие","ar":"مهارة سرديات البيانات تمكنك من تحويل البيانات إلى قصص مقنعة تدفع القرارات وتحفز العمل","en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of Agent Skills for Google Antigravity"},"features":{"zh":["将原始数据转化为有力的叙述","驱动决策和行动","使用数据讲述有力的故事","提供可行的步骤和验证","支持资源和实现手册"],"ja":["原始データを説得力のある物語に変える","意思決定と行動を促進する","データを使用して説得力のある物語を語る","実行可能なステップと検証を提供する","リソースと実装ハンドブックをサポート"],"ko":["원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로 변환","의사결정과 행동을 이끌어내는","데이터를 사용하여 강력한 이야기를 전하는","실천 가능한 단계와 검증 제공","리소스와 구현 핸드북 지원"],"es":["Transformación de datos en historias convincentes","Clarificación de objetivos y restricciones","Aplicación de mejores prácticas","Proporcionar pasos para la verificación","Uso de ejemplos detallados para la implementación"],"fr":["Transformation des données en récits convaincants","Clarification des objectifs et des contraintes","Application des meilleures pratiques","Fournir des étapes pour la vérification","Utilisation d''exemples détaillés pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Verwandlung von Rohdaten in überzeugende Erzählungen","Klärung von Zielen und Einschränkungen","Anwendung bewährter Methoden","Liefern von Schritten zur Überprüfung","Verwendung detaillierter Beispiele für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Transformação de dados em narrativas","Criação de histórias convincentes","Impulsão de decisões e ação","Aplicação de melhores práticas","Validação de resultados"],"ru":["Преобразование данных в истории","Создание убедительных историй","Стимулирование принятия решений и действий","Применение лучших практик","Проверка результатов"],"ar":["تحويل البيانات إلى قصص","إنشاء قصص مقنعة","دفع القرارات والإجراءات","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات","تحقق النتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据讲故事","数据分析","数据可视化","决策驱动","行动驱动","数据故事"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データ分析","データ可視化","意思決定を促進","行動を促進","データ物語"],"ko":["데이터 스토리텔링","데이터 분석","데이터 시각화","의사결정驱动","행동驱动","데이터 이야기"],"es":["cuentacuentos de datos","transformación de datos","historias convincentes","tomar decisiones","acciones","mejores prácticas","verificación","ejemplos detallados"],"fr":["narration de données","transformation des données","récits convaincants","prise de décision","actions","meilleures pratiques","vérification","exemples détaillés"],"de":["Data Storytelling","Verwandlung von Rohdaten","überzeugende Erzählungen","Entscheidungsfindung","Aktionen","bewährte Methoden","Überprüfung","detaillierte Beispiele"],"pt":["data-storytelling","narrativas de dados","análise de dados","visualização de dados","tomada de decisões","inspiração para ação"],"ru":["data-storytelling","истории с данными","анализ данных","визуализация данных","принятие решений","вдохновение на действие"],"ar":["سرديات البيانات","تحليل البيانات","تصوير البيانات","اتخاذ القرارات","تحفيز العمل","قصص البيانات"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:37:05.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data visualization and narrative capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据可视化和叙述能力的分析代理。","ja":"高度なデータ視覚化および物語能力を必要とする分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터 시각화 및 내러티브 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas y narrativas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées et de narration.","de":"Perfekt für Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de visualização de dados avançada e capacidades narrativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Аналитики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и повествования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات التي تحتاج إلى ترسيم بيانات متقدم وقدرات سرد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using relevant best practices, validation, and actionable steps, leveraging libraries and protocols for optimized SEO andAgent Developers.","zh":"赋予代理将原始数据转化为令人信服的叙述的能力，使用相关的最佳实践、验证和可执行步骤，利用库和协议优化SEO和代理开发人员。","ja":"エージェントが生データを説得力のある物語に変換できるようにし、関連するベストプラクティス、検証、および実行可能なステップを使用し、SEOとエージェント開発者の最適化のためのライブラリとプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로 변환할 수 있도록 해주는 동시에 관련된 모범 사례, 검증 및 실행 가능한 단계를 사용하여 SEO 및 에이전트 개발자를 최적화하기 위한 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos brutos en narrativas convincentes utilizando las mejores prácticas relevantes, validación y pasos accionables, aprovechando bibliotecas y protocolos para una optimización de SEO y Desarrolladores de Agentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant les meilleures pratiques pertinentes, la validation et les étapes actionnables, en exploitant les bibliothèques et les protocoles pour une optimisation du SEO et des Développeurs d''Agents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie relevante Best Practices, Validierung und handhabbare Schritte verwenden, wobei Bibliotheken und Protokolle für eine optimierte SEO und Agent-Entwickler genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes, utilizando as melhores práticas, validação e etapas executáveis, aproveitando bibliotecas e protocolos para SEO otimizado e Desenvolvedores de Agentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сырые данные в убедительные нарративы, используя актуальные лучшие практики, проверку и выполнимые шаги, опираясь на библиотеки и протоколы для оптимизации SEO и Разработчиков Агентов.","ar":"تمكن العميل من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات والتحقق والخطوات القابلة للتنفيذ، واستخدام المكتبات والبروتوكولات لتحسين محركات البحث و مطورو الوكلاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data analysis and reporting","Generating interactive dashboards for stakeholder engagement","Crafting data-driven stories for business decision-making"],"zh":["自动化数据分析和报告","生成交互式仪表板以吸引利益相关者","为商业决策编织数据驱动的故事"],"ja":["データ分析およびレポートの自動化","ステークホルダーの関与のためのインタラクティブなダッシュボードの生成","ビジネス上の意思決定のためのデータ駆動型ストーリーの作成"],"ko":["데이터 분석 및 보고서 자동화","이해관계자參與를 위한 대화형 대시보드 생