Handbuch"],"pt":["Transformação de dados em narrativas","Aplicação de melhores práticas","Validação de resultados","Fornecimento de etapas concretas","Uso de recursos adicionais para implementação"],"ru":["Преобразование данных в повествования","Применение лучших практик","Валидация результатов","Предоставление конкретных шагов","Использование дополнительных ресурсов для реализации"],"ar":["تحويل البيانات إلى قصص","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات","التحقق من النتائج","توفير خطوات ملموسة","استخدام موارد إضافية للتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据故事讲述","数据分析","数据可视化","决策驱动","行动激励","数据科学","商业智能"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データ分析","データ可視化","意思決定の促進","行動の促進","データサイエンス","ビジネスインテリジェンス"],"ko":["데이터 스토리 텔링","데이터 분석","데이터 시각화","의사 결정 주도","행동 이끌어냄","데이터 과학","비즈니스 인텔리전스"],"es":["cuentacuentos de datos","transformación de datos","narrativas de datos","toma de decisiones","análisis de datos","visualización de datos","ciencia de datos","inteligencia de negocios"],"fr":["data storytelling","transformation de données","narrations de données","prise de décision","analyse de données","visualisation de données","science des données","intelligence d''affaires"],"de":["Data Storytelling","DatenTransformation","DatenNarrative","Entscheidungsfindung","Datenanalyse","Datenvisualisierung","Datenwissenschaft","Business Intelligence"],"pt":["conteúdo de dados","narrativas de dados","análise de dados","visualização de dados","tomada de decisões","inspiração para ação"],"ru":["истории данных","повествования с данными","анализ данных","визуализация данных","принятие решений","вдохновение на действие"],"ar":["سرد القصص بالبيانات","قصص البيانات","تحليل البيانات","تصوير البيانات","اتخاذ القرارات","التحفيز على العمل"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:37:34.847Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data narrative capabilities to drive business decisions.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据叙述能力来驱动商业决策的分析代理。","ja":"ビジネス上の意思決定を促進するための高度なデータナレッジ能力が必要な分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"비즈니스 의사 결정을驱動하기 위한 고급 데이터 내러티브 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de narrativa de datos para impulsar decisiones comerciales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse ayant besoin de capacités avancées de narration de données pour prendre des décisions commerciales.","de":"Perfekt für Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Daten-Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um Geschäftsentscheidungen zu treffen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de narração de dados para impulsionar decisões comerciais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для аналитических агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности повествования данных для принятия бизнес-решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في سرد البيانات لتشغيل القرارات التجارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using best practices, validation, and actionable steps, leveraging data visualization and storytelling protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人使用最佳实践、验证和可行步骤将原始数据转化为有说服力的叙述的能力，利用数据可视化和讲故事协议。","ja":"ベストプラクティス、検証、及び実行可能なステップを使用して、生のデータを説得力のある物語に変換するエージェントをエンパワーメントする、データ視覚化及び物語プロトコルを利用して。","ko":"최적의 방법, 검증 및 실행 가능한 단계를 사용하여 원시 데이터를 설득력 있는 내러티브로 변환하는 에이전트를 강화하여 데이터 시각화 및 스토리 텔링 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos sin procesar en narrativas convincentes utilizando las mejores prácticas, validación y pasos llevables a cabo, aprovechando protocolos de visualización y narración de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, la validation et les étapes réalisables, en exploitant les protocoles de visualisation et de narration de données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie bewährte Verfahren, Validierung und umsetzbare Schritte nutzen und Datenvisualisierungs- und Erzählprotokolle nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes usando as melhores práticas, validação e etapas realizáveis, aproveitando protocolos de visualização de dados e storytelling.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сырые данные в убедительные рассказы, используя лучшие практики, валидацию и реализуемые шаги, используя протоколы визуализации данных и рассказывания историй.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل البيانات الخام إلى روايات مقنعة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات والتحقق والخطوات القابلة للتنفيذ، واستخدام بروتوكولات تصور البيانات وسرد القصص."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data insights generation for stakeholder reports","Creating interactive dashboards to drive decision-making","Developing data-driven narratives for marketing campaigns"],"zh":["为利益相关者报告自动化数据洞察生成","创建交互式仪表板以驱动决策","为营销活动开发数据驱动的叙述"],"ja":["ステークホルダーの報告書のためのデータ洞察の自動生成","意思決定を促進するためのインタラクティブなダッシュボードの作成","マーケティングキャンペーンのためのデータドリブンの物語の開発"],"ko":["이익 관련자 보고서를 위한 데이터 인사이트 자동 생성","의사 결정 지원을 위한 대시보드 생성","마케팅 캠페인을 위한 데이터 주도 내러티브 개발"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de información de datos para informes de partes interesadas","Creación de paneles interactivos para la toma de decisiones","Desarrollo de narrativas impulsadas por datos para campañas de marketing"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération d''informations de données pour les rapports des parties prenantes","Création de tableaux de bord interactifs pour la prise de décision","Développement de récits pilotés par les données pour les campagnes de marketing"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Dateninformationen für Stakeholder-Berichte","Erstellung interaktiver Dashboards zur Entscheidungsfindung","Entwicklung von datengetriebenen Erzählungen für Marketingkampagnen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de informações de dados para relatórios de partes interessadas","Criar painéis interativos para impulsionar a tomada de decisões","Desenvolver narrativas impulsionadas por dados para campanhas de marketing"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию данных для отчетов заинтересованных сторон","Создавать интерактивные панели для принятия решений","Разрабатывать данные, управляемые повествованием, для маркетинговых кампаний"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد معلومات البيانات لتقرير أصحاب المصلحة","إنشاء لوحات تحكم تفاعلية لتسريع اتخاذ القرارات","تطوير روايات مدفوعة بالبيانات لحملات التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires relevant data inputs and context","Limited to data storytelling scope, excluding other domains or tools"],"zh":["需要相关的数据输入和上下文","仅限于数据讲故事范围，不包括其他领域或工具"],"ja":["関連するデータ入力とコンテキストが必要","データストーリーテリングの範囲に限定され、他のドメインまたはツールは除外される"],"ko":["관련 데이터 입력 및 컨텍스트가 필요","데이터 스토리 텔링 범위에만 국한되어 다른 도메인 또는 도구는 제외"],"es":["Requiere entradas de datos y contexto relevantes","Limitado al alcance de la narración de datos, excluyendo otros dominios o herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées de données et un contexte pertinents","Limité à la portée de la narration de données, à l''exclusion d''autres domaines ou outils"],"de":["Benötigt relevante Daten-Eingaben und Kontext","Beschränkt auf den Umfang der Daten-Erzählung, andere Bereiche oder Tools ausgeschlossen"],"pt":["Exige entradas de dados relevantes e contexto","Limitado ao escopo da narrativa de dados, excluindo outros domínios ou ferramentas"],"ru":["Требует соответствующих входных данных и контекста","Ограничен объемом повествования данных, исключая другие области или инструменты"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخالات بيانات ذات صلة والسياق","محدود نطاق سرد البيانات، باستثناء المجالات أو الأدوات الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
