","fr":"Data Storytelling : transformer les données en récits","de":"Daten-Erzaehlkunst: Rohdaten in ueberzeugende Geschichten...","pt":"Contando Histórias com Dados","ru":"Рассказывание историй с помощью данных","ar":"سرديات البيانات","en":"data-storytelling"},"description":{"zh":"数据故事讲述是将数据转化为驱动决策和激发行动的引人入胜的故事。它涉及数据分析、可视化和讲故事的技巧","ja":"データストーリーテリングは、データを意思決定と行動を促す魅力的ナラティブに変えることです。データ分析、可視化、ストーリーテリングのスキルが含まれます","ko":"데이터 스토리 텔링은 데이터를 결정과 행동을 이끌어내는 설득력 있는 이야기로 변환하는 것입니다. 데이터 분석, 시각화 및 스토리 텔링 기술을 포함","es":"El cuentacuentos de datos es una técnica para transformar datos en historias que impulsan decisiones y acciones. Clarifica metas, restricciones y entradas ne...","fr":"Le data storytelling est une technique pour transformer les données en récits qui stimulent les décisions et les actions. Clarifiez les objectifs, les contra...","de":"Die Daten-Erzaehlkunst ist eine Technik, um Rohdaten in Geschichten zu verwandeln, die Entscheidungen und Aktionen vorantreiben. Klären Sie Ziele, Einschränk...","pt":"A habilidade de data-storytelling permite transformar dados crus em narrativas convincentes que impulsionam decisões e inspiram ação","ru":"Навык рассказывания историй с данными позволяет преобразовать сырые данные в убедительные истории, которые стимулируют принятие решений и вдохновляют на дейс...","ar":"تمكن مهارة سرديات البيانات من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة تدفع القرارات وتلهم العمل","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["数据分析","数据可视化","故事讲述","决策驱动","行动激发"],"ja":["データ分析","データ可視化","ストーリーテリング","意思決定の促進","行動の促進"],"ko":["데이터 분석","데이터 시각화","스토리 텔링","결정 지원","행동 유도"],"es":["Transformación de datos en historias","Clarificación de metas y restricciones","Aplicación de mejores prácticas","Validación de resultados","Proporcionar pasos y verificación"],"fr":["Transformation des données en récits","Clarification des objectifs et des contraintes","Application des meilleures pratiques","Validation des résultats","Fournir des étapes et une vérification"],"de":["Verwandlung von Rohdaten in Geschichten","Klärung von Zielen und Einschränkungen","Anwendung von Best Practices","Validierung von Ergebnissen","Bereitstellung von Schritten und Überprüfung"],"pt":["Transformação de dados crus em narrativas convincentes","Desenvolvimento de habilidades de comunicação de dados","Criação de histórias de dados que impulsionam decisões","Uso de práticas recomendadas para validação de resultados","Fornecimento de etapas ação e verificação"],"ru":["Преобразование сырых данных в убедительные истории","Развитие навыков коммуникации данных","Создание историй данных, которые стимулируют принятие решений","Применение рекомендованных практик для проверки результатов","Предоставление шагов действий и верификации"],"ar":["تحويل البيانات الخام إلى قصص مقنعة","تنمية مهارات التواصل البيانات","إنشاء قصص بيانات تدفع القرارات","استخدام ممارسات موصى بها للتحقق من النتائج","توفير خطوات العمل والتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据故事讲述","数据分析","数据可视化","故事讲述","决策驱动","行动激发","数据科学"],"ja":["データストーリーテリング","データ分析","データ可視化","ストーリーテリング","意思決定の促進","行動の促進","データサイエンス"],"ko":["데이터 스토리 텔링","데이터 분석","데이터 시각화","스토리 텔링","결정 지원","행동 유도","데이터 과학"],"es":["cuentacuentos de datos","transformación de datos","historias de datos","análisis de datos","visualización de datos","comunicación de datos"],"fr":["data storytelling","transformation de données","récits de données","analyse de données","visualisation de données","communication de données"],"de":["Daten-Erzaehlkunst","Verwandlung von Rohdaten","Geschichten aus Daten","Datenanalyse","Datenvisualisierung","Datenkommunikation"],"pt":["data-storytelling","narrativas de dados","comunicação de dados","análise de dados","visualização de dados","tomada de decisões com dados"],"ru":["рассказывание историй с данными","истории данных","коммуникация данных","анализ данных","визуализация данных","принятие решений с данными"],"ar":["سرديات البيانات","قصص البيانات","تواصل البيانات","تحليل البيانات","تمثيل البيانات","اتخاذ القرارات بالبيانات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"data-storytelling","description":"Transform data into compelling narratives using visualization, context, and persuasive structure. Use when presenting analytics to stakeholders, creating data reports, or building executive presentations.","bodyPreview":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use","body":"# Data Storytelling\n\nTransform raw data into compelling narratives that drive decisions and inspire action.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to data storytelling\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Presenting analytics to executives\n- Creating quarterly business reviews\n- Building investor presentations\n- Writing data-driven reports\n- Communicating insights to non-technical audiences\n- Making recommendations based on data\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Story Structure\n\n```\nSetup → Conflict → Resolution\n\nSetup: Context and baseline\nConflict: The problem or opportunity\nResolution: Insights and recommendations\n```\n\n### 2. Narrative Arc\n\n```\n1. Hook: Grab attention with surprising insight\n2. Context: Establish the baseline\n3. Rising Action: Build through data points\n4. Climax: The key insight\n5. Resolution: Recommendations\n6. Call to Action: Next steps\n```\n\n### 3. Three Pillars\n\n| Pillar        | Purpose  | Components                       |\n| ------------- | -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Data**      | Evidence | Numbers, trends, comparisons     |\n| **Narrative** | Meaning  | Context, causation, implications |\n| **Visuals**   | Clarity  | Charts, diagrams, highlights     |\n\n## Story Frameworks\n\n### Framework 1: The Problem-Solution Story\n\n```markdown\n# Customer Churn Analysis\n\n## The Hook\n\n\"We''re losing $2.4M annually to preventable churn.\"\n\n## The Context\n\n- Current churn rate: 8.5% (industry average: 5%)\n- Average customer lifetime value: $4,800\n- 500 customers churned last quarter\n\n## The Problem\n\nAnalysis of churned customers reveals a pattern:\n\n- 73% churned within first 90 days\n- Common factor: < 3 support interactions\n- Low feature adoption in first month\n\n## The Insight\n\n[Show engagement curve visualization]\nCustomers who don''t engage in the first 14 days\nare 4x more likely to churn.\n\n## The Solution\n\n1. Implement 14-day onboarding sequence\n2. Proactive outreach at day 7\n3. Feature adoption tracking\n\n## Expected Impact\n\n- Reduce early churn by 40%\n- Save $960K annually\n- Payback period: 3 months\n\n## Call to Action\n\nApprove $50K budget for onboarding automation.\n```\n\n### Framework 2: The Trend Story\n\n```markdown\n# Q4 Performance Analysis\n\n## Where We Started\n\nQ3 ended with $1.2M MRR, 15% below target.\nTeam morale was low after missed goals.\n\n## What Changed\n\n[Timeline visualization]\n\n- Oct: Launched self-serve pricing\n- Nov: Reduced friction in signup\n- Dec: Added customer success calls\n\n## The Transformation\n\n[Before/after comparison chart]\n| Metric | Q3 | Q4 | Change |\n|----------------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Trial → Paid | 8% | 15% | +87% |\n| Time to Value | 14 days| 5 days | -64% |\n| Expansion Rate | 2% | 8% | +300% |\n\n## Key Insight\n\nSelf-serve + high-touch creates compound growth.\nCustomers who self-serve AND get a success call\nhave 3x higher expansion rate.\n\n## Going Forward\n\nDouble down on hybrid model.\nTarget: $1.8M MRR by Q2.\n```\n\n### Framework 3: The Comparison Story\n\n```markdown\n# Market Opportunity Analysis\n\n## The Question\n\nShould we expand into EMEA or APAC first?\n\n## The Comparison\n\n[Side-by-side market analysis]\n\n### EMEA\n\n- Market size: $4.2B\n- Growth rate: 8%\n- Competition: High\n- Regulatory: Complex (GDPR)\n- Language: Multiple\n\n### APAC\n\n- Market size: $3.8B\n- Growth rate: 15%\n- Competition: Moderate\n- Regulatory: Varied\n- Language: Multiple\n\n## The Analysis\n\n[Weighted scoring matrix visualization]\n\n| Factor      | Weight | EMEA Score | APAC Score |\n| ----------- | ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Market Size | 25%    | 5          | 4          |\n| Growth      | 30%    | 3          | 5          |\n| Competition | 20%    | 2          | 4          |\n| Ease        | 25%    | 2          | 3          |\n| **Total**   |        | **2.9**    | **4.1**    |\n\n## The Recommendation\n\nAPAC first. Higher growth, less competition.\nStart with Singapore hub (English, business-friendly).\nEnter EMEA in Year 2 with localization ready.\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\n- Timezone coverage: Hire 24/7 support\n- Cultural fit: Local partnerships\n- Payment: Multi-currency from day 1\n```\n\n## Visualization Techniques\n\n### Technique 1: Progressive Reveal\n\n```markdown\nStart simple, add layers:\n\nSlide 1: \"Revenue is growing\" [single line chart]\nSlide 2: \"But growth is slowing\" [add growth rate overlay]\nSlide 3: \"Driven by one segment\" [add segment breakdown]\nSlide 4: \"Which is saturating\" [add market share]\nSlide 5: \"We need new segments\" [add opportunity zones]\n```\n\n### Technique 2: Contrast and Compare\n\n```markdown\nBefore/After:\n┌─────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ BEFORE │ AFTER │\n│ │ │\n│ Process: 5 days│ Process: 1 day │\n│ Errors: 15% │ Errors: 2% │\n│ Cost: $50/unit │ Cost: $20/unit │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nThis/That (emphasize difference):\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CUSTOMER A vs B │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ │\n│ │ ████████ │ │ ██ │ │\n│ │ $45,000 │ │ $8,000 │ │\n│ │ LTV │ │ LTV │ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ │\n│ Onboarded No onboarding │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Technique 3: Annotation and Highlight\n\n```python\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 6))\n\n# Plot the main data\nax.plot(dates, revenue, linewidth=2, color=''#2E86AB'')\n\n# Add annotation for key events\nax.annotate(\n    ''Product Launch\\n+32% spike'',\n    xy=(launch_date, launch_revenue),\n    xytext=(launch_date, launch_revenue * 1.2),\n    fontsize=10,\n    arrowprops=dict(arrowstyle=''->'', color=''#E63946''),\n    color=''#E63946''\n)\n\n# Highlight a region\nax.axvspan(growth_start, growth_end, alpha=0.2, color=''green'',\n           label=''Growth Period'')\n\n# Add threshold line\nax.axhline(y=target, color=''gray'', linestyle=''--'',\n           label=f''Target: ${target:,.0f}'')\n\nax.set_title(''Revenue Growth Story'', fontsize=14, fontweight=''bold'')\nax.legend()\n```\n\n## Presentation Templates\n\n### Template 1: Executive Summary Slide\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY INSIGHT                                                │\n│  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════│\n│                                                             │\n│  \"Customers who complete onboarding in week 1              │\n│   have 3x higher lifetime value\"                           │\n│                                                             │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                      │                                      │\n│  THE DATA            │  THE IMPLICATION                     │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  Week 1 completers:  │  ✓ Prioritize onboarding UX         │\n│  • LTV: $4,500       │  ✓ Add day-1 success milestones     │\n│  • Retention: 85%    │  ✓ Proactive week-1 outreach        │\n│  • NPS: 72           │                                      │\n│                      │  Investment: $75K                    │\n│  Others:             │  Expected ROI: 8x                    │\n│  • LTV: $1,500       │                                      │\n│  • Retention: 45%    │                                      │\n│  • NPS: 34           │                                      │\n│                      │                                      │\n└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Template 2: Data Story Flow\n\n```\nSlide 1: THE HEADLINE\n\"We can grow 40% faster by fixing onboarding\"\n\nSlide 2: THE CONTEXT\nCurrent state metrics\nIndustry benchmarks\nGap analysis\n\nSlide 3: THE DISCOVERY\nWhat the data revealed\nSurprising finding\nPattern identification\n\nSlide 4: THE DEEP DIVE\nRoot cause analysis\nSegment breakdowns\nStatistical significance\n\nSlide 5: THE RECOMMENDATION\nProposed actions\nResource requirements\nTimeline\n\nSlide 6: THE IMPACT\nExpected outcomes\nROI calculation\nRisk assessment\n\nSlide 7: THE ASK\nSpecific request\nDecision needed\nNext steps\n```\n\n### Template 3: One-Page Dashboard Story\n\n```markdown\n# Monthly Business Review: January 2024\n\n## THE HEADLINE\n\nRevenue up 15% but CAC increasing faster than LTV\n\n## KEY METRICS AT A GLANCE\n\n┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐\n│ MRR │ NRR │ CAC │ LTV │\n│ $125K │ 108% │ $450 │ $2,200 │\n│ ▲15% │ ▲3% │ ▲22% │ ▲8% │\n└────────┴────────┴────────┴────────┘\n\n## WHAT''S WORKING\n\n✓ Enterprise segment growing 25% MoM\n✓ Referral program driving 30% of new logos\n✓ Support satisfaction at all-time high (94%)\n\n## WHAT NEEDS ATTENTION\n\n✗ SMB acquisition cost up 40%\n✗ Trial conversion down 5 points\n✗ Time-to-value increased by 3 days\n\n## ROOT CAUSE\n\n[Mini chart showing SMB vs Enterprise CAC trend]\nSMB paid ads becoming less efficient.\nCPC up 35% while conversion flat.\n\n## RECOMMENDATION\n\n1. Shift $20K/mo from paid to content\n2. Launch SMB self-serve trial\n3. A/B test shorter onboarding\n\n## NEXT MONTH''S FOCUS\n\n- Launch content marketing pilot\n- Complete self-serve MVP\n- Reduce time-to-value to < 7 days\n```\n\n## Writing Techniques\n\n### Headlines That Work\n\n```markdown\nBAD: \"Q4 Sales Analysis\"\nGOOD: \"Q4 Sales Beat Target by 23% - Here''s Why\"\n\nBAD: \"Customer Churn Report\"\nGOOD: \"We''re Losing $2.4M to Preventable Churn\"\n\nBAD: \"Marketing Performance\"\nGOOD: \"Content Marketing Delivers 4x ROI vs. Paid\"\n\nFormula:\n[Specific Number] + [Business Impact] + [Actionable Context]\n```\n\n### Transition Phrases\n\n```markdown\nBuilding the narrative:\n• \"This leads us to ask...\"\n• \"When we dig deeper...\"\n• \"The pattern becomes clear when...\"\n• \"Contrast this with...\"\n\nIntroducing insights:\n• \"The data reveals...\"\n• \"What surprised us was...\"\n• \"The inflection point came when...\"\n• \"The key finding is...\"\n\nMoving to action:\n• \"This insight suggests...\"\n• \"Based on this analysis...\"\n• \"The implication is clear...\"\n• \"Our recommendation is...\"\n```\n\n### Handling Uncertainty\n\n```markdown\nAcknowledge limitations:\n• \"With 95% confidence, we can say...\"\n• \"The sample size of 500 shows...\"\n• \"While correlation is strong, causation requires...\"\n• \"This trend holds for [segment], though [caveat]...\"\n\nPresent ranges:\n• \"Impact estimate: $400K-$600K\"\n• \"Confidence interval: 15-20% improvement\"\n• \"Best case: X, Conservative: Y\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with the \"so what\"** - Lead with insight\n- **Use the rule of three** - Three points, three comparisons\n- **Show, don''t tell** - Let data speak\n- **Make it personal** - Connect to audience goals\n- **End with action** - Clear next steps\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t data dump** - Curate ruthlessly\n- **Don''t bury the insight** - Front-load key findings\n- **Don''t use jargon** - Match audience vocabulary\n- **Don''t show methodology first** - Context, then method\n- **Don''t forget the narrative** - Numbers need meaning\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Storytelling with Data (Cole Nussbaumer)](https://www.storytellingwithdata.com/)\n- [The Pyramid Principle (Barbara Minto)](https://www.amazon.com/Pyramid-Principle-Logic-Writing-Thinking/dp/0273710516)\n- [Resonate (Nancy Duarte)](https://www.duarte.com/resonate/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:37:10.579Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data narrative capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据叙事能力的分析代理。","ja":"高度なデータナレーション機能を必要とする分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터 내러티브 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de narrativa de datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse ayant besoin de capacités narratives de données avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Daten-Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de narrativa de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для аналитических агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности повествования данных.","ar":" مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات روائية بيانات متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform raw data into compelling narratives using best practices, driving decisions and inspiring action with validated outcomes and actionable steps, potentially leveraging libraries like Matplotlib or Seaborn for data visualization and protocols like JSON for data exchange.","zh":"赋予代理将原始数据转化为有力的叙事的能力，使用最佳实践，驱动决策和激发行动，具有经过验证的结果和可执行的步骤，可能利用Matplotlib或Seaborn等库进行数据可视化，利用JSON等协议进行数据交换。","ja":"エージェントに生データを強力な物語に変換する能力を付与し、ベストプラクティスを使用して、検証済みの成果と実行可能なステップで、意思決定と行動を促進する。データ可視化には、MatplotlibやSeabornなどのライブラリを利用し、データ交換には、JSONなどのプロトコルを利用することができる。","ko":"에이전트가 원시 데이터를 강력한 내러티브로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 최고의 관행을 사용하여 검증된 결과와 실행 가능한 단계로 의사 결정을 구동하고 행동을 유도하며, 데이터 시각화를 위해 Matplotlib 또는 Seaborn과 같은 라이브러리를 활용하고, 데이터 교환을 위해 JSON과 같은 프로토콜을 활용할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar datos sin procesar en narrativas convincentes utilizando las mejores prácticas, impulsando decisiones e inspirando acciones con resultados validados y pasos realizables, potencialmente aprovechando bibliotecas como Matplotlib o Seaborn para la visualización de datos y protocolos como JSON para el intercambio de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données brutes en récits convaincants en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, en impulsant les décisions et en inspirant l''action avec des résultats validés et des étapes réalisables, en exploitant potentiellement des bibliothèques comme Matplotlib ou Seaborn pour la visualisation de données et des protocoles comme JSON pour l''échange de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rohe Daten in überzeugende Erzählungen umzuwandeln, indem sie bewährte Verfahren verwenden, Entscheidungen vorantreiben und Handlungen inspirieren, mit validierten Ergebnissen und umsetzbaren Schritten, möglicherweise durch die Nutzung von Bibliotheken wie Matplotlib oder Seaborn für die Datenvisualisierung und Protokollen wie JSON für den Datenaustausch.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados brutos em narrativas convincentes usando as melhores práticas, impulsionando decisões e inspirando ações com resultados validados e etapas executáveis, potencialmente utilizando bibliotecas como Matplotlib ou Seaborn para visualização de dados e protocolos como JSON para troca de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сырые данные в убедительные повествования, используя лучшие практики, стимулируя принятие решений и вдохновляя действия с проверенными результатами и выполнимыми шагами, потенциально используя библиотеки, такие как Matplotlib или Seaborn, для визуализации данных и протоколы, такие как JSON, для обмена данными.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل البيانات الخام إلى روايات مقنعة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات، ودفع القرارات وإلهام الإجراءات مع النتائج المُصادق عليها والخطوات القابلة للتنفيذ، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Matplotlib أو Seaborn لتصور البيانات وبروتوكولات مثل JSON لتبادل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating report generation with data-driven insights","Generating interactive dashboards for stakeholder presentations","Debugging data discrepancies through storytelling techniques"],"zh":["使用数据驱动的洞察力自动生成报告","为利益相关者演示生成交互式仪表板","通过故事讲述技术调试数据差异"],"ja":["データ駆動型の洞察力でレポートを自動生成する","利害関係者向けのプレゼンテーション用にインタラクティブなダッシュボードを生成する","物語の技術を使用してデータの不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["데이터 주도형 통찰력을 사용하여 보고서를 자동 생성하는 것","이익 관련자에게 프레젠테이션을 위한 인터랙티브 대시보드를 생성하는 것","스토리 텔링 기술을 사용하여 데이터 불일치를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de informes con conocimientos impulsados por datos","Generación de paneles interactivos para presentaciones a partes interesadas","Depuración de discrepancias de datos mediante técnicas de narración"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de rapports avec des connaissances impulsées par les données","Génération de tableaux de bord interactifs pour les présentations aux parties prenantes","Débogage des écarts de données grâce à des techniques de narration"],"de":["Automatisierung der Berichtsgenerierung mit datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen","Generierung interaktiver Dashboards für Präsentationen an Stakeholder","Fehlerbehebung von Datenunstimmigkeiten durch Erzähltechniken"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de relatórios com insights impulsionados por dados","Gerar dashboards interativos para apresentações de partes interessadas","Depurar discrepâncias de dados por meio de técnicas de narração"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию отчетов с данными, управляемыми данными","Генерировать интерактивные панели для презентаций заинтересованных сторон","Отлаживать несоответствия данных с помощью методов повествования"],"ar":["تأتمتة توليد التقارير مع رؤى مدفوعة بالبيانات","توليد لوحات تحكم تفاعلية للعروض التقديمية لأصحاب المصلحة","تصحيح أخطاء البيانات من خلال تقنيات السرد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires relevant data inputs and context","Scope limited to data storytelling domain"],"zh":["需要相关的数据输入和上下文","范围仅限于数据故事讲述领域"],"ja":["関連するデータ入力とコンテキストが必要","範囲はデータストーリーテリングのドメインに限定される"],"ko":["관련 데이터 입력 및 컨텍스트가 필요","범위는 데이터 스토리 텔링 도메인에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entradas de datos y contexto relevantes","Alcance limitado al dominio de la narrativa de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite des entrées de données et un contexte pertinents","Portée limitée au domaine de la narration de données"],"de":["Benötigt relevante Daten-Eingaben und -Kontext","Umfang beschränkt auf den Bereich der Daten-Erzählung"],"pt":["Exige entradas de dados relevantes e contexto","Escopo limitado ao domínio da narrativa de dados"],"ru":["Требует соответствующих входных данных и контекста","Область применения ограничена областью повествования данных"],"ar":["يتطلب مدخلات بيانات ذات صلة والسياق","نطاق محدود إلى مجال رواية البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
