нет-уведомление о платеже)","Периодическое выставление счетов","Работы по возврату","Валидация платежей","Интеграция с приложениями"],"ar":["دفع سريع","IPN (إشعار الدفع عبر الإنترنت)","فواتير دورية","عمليات الإرجاع","تحقق من الدفع","التكامل مع التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PayPal集成","支付集成","Express Checkout","IPN处理","重复计费","退款工作流","安全支付处理"],"ja":["PayPal統合","支払い統合","Express Checkout","IPN処理","繰り返し請求","返金ワークフロー","安全な支払い処理"],"ko":["페이팔 통합","결제 통합","익스프레스 체크아웃","IPN 처리","반복 청구","환불 워크플로","안전한 결제 처리"],"es":["integración de paypal","express checkout","ipn","facturación recurrente","reembolsos","seguridad de pago","desarrollo de pago","api de paypal"],"fr":["intégration de paypal","express checkout","ipn","facturation récurrente","remboursements","sécurité de paiement","développement de paiement","api paypal"],"de":["paypal-integration","express checkout","ipn","rechnungsstellung","rückzahlungen","zahlungssicherheit","zahlungsentwicklung","paypal-api"],"pt":["integração paypal","pagamento online","checkout express","ipn","faturamento recorrente","desenvolvimento de pagamentos","tecnologia de pagamento","soluções de pagamento","pagamento seguro"],"ru":["интеграция paypal","онлайн-оплата","экспресс-оплата","ipn","периодическое выставление счетов","разработка платежей","технология оплаты","решения по оплате","безопасная оплата"],"ar":["تكامل باي بال","دفع عبر الإنترنت","دفع سريع","ipn","فواتير دورية","تطوير الدفع","تكنولوجيا الدفع","حلول الدفع","دفع آمن"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paypal-integration","description":"Integrate PayPal payment processing with support for express checkout, subscriptions, and refund management. Use when implementing PayPal payments, processing online transactions, or building e-commerce checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Integrating PayPal as a payment option\n- Implementing express checkout flows\n- Setting up recurring billing with PayPal\n- Processing refunds and payment disputes\n- Handling PayPal webhooks (IPN)\n- Supporting international payments\n- Implementing PayPal subscriptions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Products\n**PayPal Checkout**\n- One-time payments\n- Express checkout experience\n- Guest and PayPal account payments\n\n**PayPal Subscriptions**\n- Recurring billing\n- Subscription plans\n- Automatic renewals\n\n**PayPal Payouts**\n- Send money to multiple recipients\n- Marketplace and platform payments\n\n### 2. Integration Methods\n**Client-Side (JavaScript SDK)**\n- Smart Payment Buttons\n- Hosted payment flow\n- Minimal backend code\n\n**Server-Side (REST API)**\n- Full control over payment flow\n- Custom checkout UI\n- Advanced features\n\n### 3. IPN (Instant Payment Notification)\n- Webhook-like payment notifications\n- Asynchronous payment updates\n- Verification required\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend - PayPal Smart Buttons\n<div id=\"paypal-button-container\"></div>\n\n<script src=\"https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&currency=USD\"></script>\n<script>\n  paypal.Buttons({\n    createOrder: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.create({\n        purchase_units: [{\n          amount: {\n            value: ''25.00''\n          }\n        }]\n      });\n    },\n    onApprove: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.capture().then(function(details) {\n        // Payment successful\n        console.log(''Transaction completed by '' + details.payer.name.given_name);\n\n        // Send to backend for verification\n        fetch(''/api/paypal/capture'', {\n          method: ''POST'',\n          headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n          body: JSON.stringify({orderID: data.orderID})\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  }).render(''#paypal-button-container'');\n</script>\n```\n\n```python\n# Backend - Verify and capture order\nfrom paypalrestsdk import Payment\nimport paypalrestsdk\n\npaypalrestsdk.configure({\n    \"mode\": \"sandbox\",  # or \"live\"\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n})\n\ndef capture_paypal_order(order_id):\n    \"\"\"Capture a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n    payment = Payment.find(order_id)\n\n    if payment.execute({\"payer_id\": payment.payer.payer_info.payer_id}):\n        # Payment successful\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''success'',\n            ''transaction_id'': payment.id,\n            ''amount'': payment.transactions[0].amount.total\n        }\n    else:\n        # Payment failed\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''failed'',\n            ''error'': payment.error\n        }\n```\n\n## Express Checkout Implementation\n\n### Server-Side Order Creation\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass PayPalClient:\n    def __init__(self, client_id, client_secret, mode=''sandbox''):\n        self.client_id = client_id\n        self.client_secret = client_secret\n        self.base_url = ''https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com'' if mode == ''sandbox'' else ''https://api-m.paypal.com''\n        self.access_token = self.get_access_token()\n\n    def get_access_token(self):\n        \"\"\"Get OAuth access token.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v1/oauth2/token\"\n        headers = {\"Accept\": \"application/json\", \"Accept-Language\": \"en_US\"}\n\n        response = requests.post(\n            url,\n            headers=headers,\n            data={\"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\"},\n            auth=(self.client_id, self.client_secret)\n        )\n\n        return response.json()[''access_token'']\n\n    def create_order(self, amount, currency=''USD''):\n        \"\"\"Create a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        payload = {\n            \"intent\": \"CAPTURE\",\n            \"purchase_units\": [{\n                \"amount\": {\n                    \"currency_code\": currency,\n                    \"value\": str(amount)\n                }\n            }]\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def capture_order(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Capture payment for an order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}/capture\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def get_order_details(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Get order details.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n```\n\n## IPN (Instant Payment Notification) Handling\n\n### IPN Verification and Processing\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport requests\nfrom urllib.parse import parse_qs\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route(''/ipn'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef handle_ipn():\n    \"\"\"Handle PayPal IPN notifications.\"\"\"\n    # Get IPN message\n    ipn_data = request.form.to_dict()\n\n    # Verify IPN with PayPal\n    if not verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n        return ''IPN verification failed'', 400\n\n    # Process IPN based on transaction type\n    payment_status = ipn_data.get(''payment_status'')\n    txn_type = ipn_data.get(''txn_type'')\n\n    if payment_status == ''Completed'':\n        handle_payment_completed(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Refunded'':\n        handle_refund(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Reversed'':\n        handle_chargeback(ipn_data)\n\n    return ''IPN processed'', 200\n\ndef verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Verify IPN message authenticity.\"\"\"\n    # Add ''cmd'' parameter\n    verify_data = ipn_data.copy()\n    verify_data[''cmd''] = ''_notify-validate''\n\n    # Send back to PayPal for verification\n    paypal_url = ''https://ipnpb.sandbox.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr''  # or production URL\n\n    response = requests.post(paypal_url, data=verify_data)\n\n    return response.text == ''VERIFIED''\n\ndef handle_payment_completed(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Process completed payment.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    payer_email = ipn_data.get(''payer_email'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n    item_name = ipn_data.get(''item_name'')\n\n    # Check if already processed (prevent duplicates)\n    if is_transaction_processed(txn_id):\n        return\n\n    # Update database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment completed: {txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_refund(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle refund.\"\"\"\n    parent_txn_id = ipn_data.get(''parent_txn_id'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n\n    # Process refund in your system\n    print(f\"Refund processed: {parent_txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_chargeback(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle payment reversal/chargeback.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    reason_code = ipn_data.get(''reason_code'')\n\n    # Handle chargeback\n    print(f\"Chargeback: {txn_id}, Reason: {reason_code}\")\n```\n\n## Subscription/Recurring Billing\n\n### Create Subscription Plan\n```python\ndef create_subscription_plan(name, amount, interval=''MONTH''):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription plan.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/plans\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"product_id\": \"PRODUCT_ID\",  # Create product first\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"billing_cycles\": [{\n            \"frequency\": {\n                \"interval_unit\": interval,\n                \"interval_count\": 1\n            },\n            \"tenure_type\": \"REGULAR\",\n            \"sequence\": 1,\n            \"total_cycles\": 0,  # Infinite\n            \"pricing_scheme\": {\n                \"fixed_price\": {\n                    \"value\": str(amount),\n                    \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n                }\n            }\n        }],\n        \"payment_preferences\": {\n            \"auto_bill_outstanding\": True,\n            \"setup_fee\": {\n                \"value\": \"0\",\n                \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n            },\n            \"setup_fee_failure_action\": \"CONTINUE\",\n            \"payment_failure_threshold\": 3\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef create_subscription(plan_id, subscriber_email):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/subscriptions\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"plan_id\": plan_id,\n        \"subscriber\": {\n            \"email_address\": subscriber_email\n        },\n        \"application_context\": {\n            \"return_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/success\",\n            \"cancel_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/cancel\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    subscription = response.json()\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    for link in subscription.get(''links'', []):\n        if link[''rel''] == ''approve'':\n            return {\n                ''subscription_id'': subscription[''id''],\n                ''approval_url'': link[''href'']\n            }\n```\n\n## Refund Workflows\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(capture_id, amount=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund for a captured payment.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/captures/{capture_id}/refund\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {}\n    if amount:\n        payload[\"amount\"] = {\n            \"value\": str(amount),\n            \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n        }\n\n    if note:\n        payload[\"note_to_payer\"] = note\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef get_refund_details(refund_id):\n    \"\"\"Get refund details.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/refunds/{refund_id}\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n    return response.json()\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```python\nclass PayPalError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Custom PayPal error.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\ndef handle_paypal_api_call(api_function):\n    \"\"\"Wrapper for PayPal API calls with error handling.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = api_function()\n        return result\n    except requests.exceptions.RequestException as e:\n        # Network error\n        raise PayPalError(f\"Network error: {str(e)}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        # Other errors\n        raise PayPalError(f\"PayPal API error: {str(e)}\")\n\n# Usage\ntry:\n    order = handle_paypal_api_call(lambda: client.create_order(25.00))\nexcept PayPalError as e:\n    # Handle error appropriately\n    log_error(e)\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use sandbox credentials\nSANDBOX_CLIENT_ID = \"...\"\nSANDBOX_SECRET = \"...\"\n\n# Test accounts\n# Create test buyer and seller accounts at developer.paypal.com\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID, SANDBOX_SECRET, mode=''sandbox'')\n\n    # Create order\n    order = client.create_order(10.00)\n    assert ''id'' in order\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    approval_url = next((link[''href''] for link in order[''links''] if link[''rel''] == ''approve''), None)\n    assert approval_url is not None\n\n    # After approval (manual step with test account)\n    # Capture order\n    # captured = client.capture_order(order[''id''])\n    # assert captured[''status''] == ''COMPLETED''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/express-checkout.md**: Express Checkout implementation guide\n- **references/ipn-handling.md**: IPN verification and processing\n- **references/refund-workflows.md**: Refund handling patterns\n- **references/billing-agreements.md**: Recurring billing setup\n- **assets/paypal-client.py**: Production PayPal client\n- **assets/ipn-processor.py**: IPN webhook processor\n- **assets/recurring-billing.py**: Subscription management\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Verify IPN**: Never trust IPN without verification\n2. **Idempotent Processing**: Handle duplicate IPN notifications\n3. **Error Handling**: Implement robust error handling\n4. **Logging**: Log all transactions and errors\n5. **Test Thoroughly**: Use sandbox extensively\n6. **Webhook Backup**: Don''t rely solely on client-side callbacks\n7. **Currency Handling**: Always specify currency explicitly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying IPN**: Accepting IPN without verification\n- **Duplicate Processing**: Not checking for duplicate transactions\n- **Wrong Environment**: Mixing sandbox and production URLs/credentials\n- **Missing Webhooks**: Not handling all payment states\n- **Hardcoded Values**: Not making configurable for different environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:38:19.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing seamless PayPal payment processing integration, including Express Checkout and recurring billing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝PayPal支付处理集成的电子商务代理，包括Express Checkout和重复计费功能。","ja":"PayPalの決済処理の統合、Express Checkoutおよびリクーリング請求機能を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Express Checkout 및 반복적인 청구 기능을 포함한 무제한 PayPal 결제 처리 통합이 필요한 전자 상거래 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una integración de procesamiento de pagos de PayPal sin problemas, incluyendo pago Express Checkout y capacidades de facturación recurrente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une intégration de traitement de paiement PayPal sans accroc, y compris le paiement Express Checkout et les capacités de facturation récurrente.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine nahtlose PayPal-Zahlungsabwicklungsintegration benötigen, einschließlich Express-Checkout und wiederkehrender Abrechnungsfunktionen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que necessitam de integração de processamento de pagamento do PayPal sem interrupções, incluindo Checkout Express e capacidades de faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция обработки платежей PayPal, включая Экспресс-оплату и возможности регулярного выставления счетов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التجاريين الإلكترونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج معالجة الدفع PayPal دون انقطاع، بما في ذلك الدفع السريع وتكرار الفواتير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle IPN handling, refund workflows, and secure payment transactions using PayPal''s API, enabling robust e-commerce functionality with support for Express Checkout and recurring billing.","zh":"赋予代理处理IPN处理、退款工作流和使用PayPal的API进行安全的支付交易的能力，使得电子商务功能强大，支持Express Checkout和重复计费。","ja":"エージェントがIPNの処理、返金ワークフロー、PayPalのAPIを使用した安全な決済トランザクションを処理できるようにし、Express Checkoutおよびリクーリング請求をサポートした強力な電子商取引機能を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 IPN 처리, 환불 워크플로 및 PayPal API를 사용하는 보안 결제 거래를 처리할 수 있도록 해주어 Express Checkout 및 반복적인 청구를 지원하는 강력한 전자 상거래 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar el manejo de IPN, flujos de trabajo de reembolsos y transacciones de pagos seguras utilizando la API de PayPal, lo que permite una funcionalidad de comercio electrónico robusta con soporte para Express Checkout y facturación recurrente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la gestion des IPN, les flux de travail de remboursement et les transactions de paiement sécurisées en utilisant l''API PayPal, permettant ainsi une fonctionnalité de commerce électronique robuste avec prise en charge du paiement Express Checkout et de la facturation récurrente.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, IPN-Handling, Rückzahlungs-Abläufe und sichere Zahlungstransaktionen mithilfe der PayPal-API zu verwalten, wodurch robuste E-Commerce-Funktionalität mit Unterstützung für Express-Checkout und wiederkehrende Abrechnung ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com o tratamento de IPN, fluxos de trabalho de reembolso e transações de pagamento seguras usando a API do PayPal, permitindo funcionalidades de comércio eletrônico robustas com suporte ao Checkout Express e faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать уведомления об мгновенных платежах, рабочие процессы возврата и безопасные транзакции платежей с помощью API PayPal, что обеспечивает надежную функциональность электронной коммерции с поддержкой Экспресс-оплаты и регулярного выставления счетов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع معالجة الإشعارات الفورية للدفع، وعمليات سير العمل للإعادة والتعاملات المالية الآمنة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات PayPal، مما يتيح وظائف تجارية إلكترونية قوية مع دعم الدفع السريع وفواتير متكررة."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating Express Checkout for streamlined payments","Handling Instant Payment Notifications (IPN) for real-time updates","Implementing recurring billing and subscription services","Processing refunds and handling payment disputes"],"zh":["集成Express Checkout进行流畅的支付","处理即时支付通知（IPN）以获取实时更新","实现重复计费和订阅服务","处理退款和处理支付争议"],"ja":["Express Checkoutを統合してスムーズな決済を行う","インスタント・ペイメント・ノーティフィケーション（IPN）を処理してリアルタイムの更新を取得する","リクーリング請求とサブスクリプションサービスを実装する","返金を処理して決済紛争に対応する"],"ko":["Express Checkout를 통합하여 원활한 결제를 thực hiện하는 것"," tức시 결제 알림（IPN）을 처리하여 실시간 업데이트를 获取하는 것"," 반복적인 청구 및 구독 서비스를 구현하는 것"," 환불을 처리하고 결제 분쟁을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Integración de Express Checkout para pagos simplificados","Manejo de Notificaciones de Pago Instantáneo (IPN) para actualizaciones en tiempo real","Implementación de facturación recurrente y servicios de suscripción","Procesamiento de reembolsos y manejo de disputas de pagos"],"fr":["Intégration du paiement Express Checkout pour des paiements simplifiés","Gestion des notifications de paiement instantanées (IPN) pour des mises à jour en temps réel","Mise en œuvre de la facturation récurrente et des services d''abonnement","Traitement des remboursements et gestion des litiges de paiement"],"de":["Integration von Express-Checkout für gestreamte Zahlungen","Handling von Instant Payment Notifications (IPN) für Echtzeit-Updates","Implementierung von wiederkehrender Abrechnung und Abonnementservices","Verarbeitung von Rückerstattungen und Abwicklung von Zahlungsstreitigkeiten"],"pt":["Integrar o Checkout Express para pagamentos simplificados","Lidar com notificações de pagamento instantâneas (IPN) para atualizações em tempo real","Implementar faturamento recorrente e serviços de assinatura","Processar reembolsos e lidar com disputas de pagamento"],"ru":["Интегрировать Экспресс-оплату для упрощенных платежей","Обрабатывать уведомления об мгновенных платежах (IPN) для обновлений в реальном времени","Реализовать регулярное выставление счетов и услуги подписки","Обрабатывать возвраты и разрешать споры о платежах"],"ar":["دمج الدفع السريع لعمليات دفع مبسطة","التعامل مع الإشعارات الفورية للدفع (IPN) لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","تنفيذ فواتير متكررة وخدمات الاشتراك","معالجة الإعادة والتعامل مع نزاعات الدفع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a PayPal business account","Limited to PayPal payment integration only","Task must be related to PayPal integration"],"zh":["需要PayPal商业账户","仅限PayPal支付集成","任务必须与PayPal集成相关"],"ja":["PayPalビジネスアカウントが必要","PayPal決済統合のみに限定される","タスクはPayPal統合に関連している必要がある"],"ko":["PayPal 비즈니스 계정이 필요합니다.","PayPal 결제 통합에만 제한됩니다.","작업은 PayPal 통합과 관련이 있어야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de negocio de PayPal","Limitado solo a la integración de pago de PayPal","La tarea debe estar relacionada con la integración de PayPal"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte entreprise PayPal","Limité à l''intégration de paiement PayPal uniquement","La tâche doit être liée à l''intégration de PayPal"],"de":["Benötigt ein PayPal-Geschäftskonto","Begrenzt auf die PayPal-Zahlungsintegration nur","Die Aufgabe muss mit der PayPal-Integration zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Exige uma conta comercial do PayPal","Limitado apenas à integração de pagamento do PayPal","A tarefa deve estar relacionada à integração do PayPal"],"ru":["Требуется бизнес-аккаунт PayPal","Ограничен только интеграцией платежей PayPal","Задача должна быть связана с интеграцией PayPal"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا تجاريًا من PayPal","محدود فقط بدمج الدفع PayPal","يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بدمج PayPal"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
