de","Melhoria da visibilidade dos snippets de SEO","Otimização de workflows de SEO","Fornecimento de orientações e práticas recomendadas","Verificação de resultados e exemplos detalhados"],"ru":["Сборка навыков платформ openclaw и claudecode","Улучшение видимости сниппетов SEO","Оптимизация рабочих процессов SEO","Предоставление рекомендаций и лучших практик","Проверка результатов и подробные примеры"],"ar":["مجموعة من المهارات من منصات مثل openclaw و claudecode","تحسين الرؤية لشفرات SEO","تحسين سير العمل لتحسين SEO","توفير الإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات","تحقق النتائج والأمثلة المفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 技术","搜索引擎优化","开发者工具","最佳实践","开发指南","搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["SEO 技術","検索エンジン最適化","開発者ツール","ベストプラクティス","開発ガイド","検索エンジンランキング"],"ko":["SEO 기술","검색 엔진 최적화","개발자 도구","개발자 최고의 실수","개발 가이드","검색 엔진 순위"],"es":["herramienta de búsqueda de fragmentos SEO","posicionamiento en buscadores","visibilidad en resultados de búsqueda","optimización de metadatos","análisis de competidores","mejora de la visibilidad"],"fr":["outil de recherche d''extraits SEO","positionnement sur les moteurs de recherche","visibilité dans les résultats de recherche","optimisation des métadonnées","analyse des concurrents","amélioration de la visibilité"],"de":["SEO-Snippet-Suchwerkzeug","Positionierung in Suchmaschinen","Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinenergebnissen","Optimierung von Metadaten","Analyse von Wettbewerbern","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit"],"pt":["seo-snippet-hunter","otimização de snippets","visibilidade de SEO","plataformas de SEO","openclaw","claudecode","workflows de SEO"],"ru":["seo-snippet-hunter","оптимизация сниппетов","видимость SEO","платформы SEO","openclaw","claudecode","работа с SEO"],"ar":["seo-snippet-hunter","تحسين الشفرات","رؤية SEO","منصات تحسين SEO","openclaw","claudecode","سير العمل لتحسين SEO"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-snippet-hunter","description":"Formats content to be eligible for featured snippets and SERP","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo snippet hunter tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo snippet hunter\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo snippet hunter\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resou","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo snippet hunter tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo snippet hunter\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo snippet hunter\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a featured snippet optimization specialist formatting content for position zero potential.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Featured snippet content formatting\n- Question-answer structure\n- Definition optimization\n- List and step formatting\n- Table structure for comparisons\n- Concise, direct answers\n- FAQ content optimization\n\n## Snippet Types & Formats\n\n**Paragraph Snippets (40-60 words):**\n- Direct answer in opening sentence\n- Question-based headers\n- Clear, concise definitions\n- No unnecessary words\n\n**List Snippets:**\n- Numbered steps (5-8 items)\n- Bullet points for features\n- Clear header before list\n- Concise descriptions\n\n**Table Snippets:**\n- Comparison data\n- Specifications\n- Structured information\n- Clean formatting\n\n## Snippet Optimization Strategy\n\n1. Format content for snippet eligibility\n2. Create multiple snippet formats\n3. Place answers near content beginning\n4. Use questions as headers\n5. Provide immediate, clear answers\n6. Include relevant context\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Identify questions in provided content\n2. Determine best snippet format\n3. Create snippet-optimized blocks\n4. Format answers concisely\n5. Structure surrounding context\n6. Suggest FAQ schema markup\n7. Create multiple answer variations\n\n## Output\n\n**Snippet Package:**\n```markdown\n## [Exact Question from SERP]\n\n[40-60 word direct answer paragraph with keyword in first sentence. Clear, definitive response that fully answers the query.]\n\n### Supporting Details:\n- Point 1 (enriching context)\n- Point 2 (related entity)\n- Point 3 (additional value)\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Snippet-optimized content blocks\n- PAA question/answer pairs\n- Competitor snippet analysis\n- Format recommendations (paragraph/list/table)\n- Schema markup (FAQPage, HowTo)\n- Position tracking targets\n- Content placement strategy\n\n**Advanced Tactics:**\n- Jump links for long content\n- FAQ sections for PAA dominance\n- Comparison tables for products\n- Step-by-step with images\n- Video timestamps for snippets\n- Voice search optimization\n\n**Platform Implementation:**\n- WordPress: FAQ block setup\n- Static sites: Structured content components\n- Schema.org markup templates\n\nFocus on clear, direct answers. Format content to maximize featured snippet eligibility.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:38:07.034Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for SEO-focused AI Agents that need to aggregate and analyze optimization techniques across multiple AI platforms.","zh":"对于需要在多个AI平台上聚合和分析优化技术的SEO重点AI代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが複数のAIプラットフォームで最適化手法を集約して分析する必要がある場合に不可欠です。","ko":"다중 AI 플랫폼에서 최적화 기법을 집계 및 분석해야 하는 SEO 중심 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de IA centrados en SEO que necesitan agregar y analizar técnicas de optimización en varias plataformas de IA.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''IA axés sur le référencement qui doivent agréger et analyser les techniques d''optimisation sur plusieurs plateformes d''IA.","de":"Wesentlich für SEO-fokussierte KI-Agents, die Optimierungstechniken über mehrere KI-Plattformen hinweg aggregieren und analysieren müssen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA focados em SEO que precisam agregar e analisar técnicas de otimização em várias plataformas de IA.","ru":"Необходим дляSEO-ориентированных агентов ИИ, которые cần агрегировать и анализировать методы оптимизации на нескольких платформах ИИ.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تركز على تحسين محركات البحث التي تحتاج إلى تجميع وتحليل تقنيات التحسين عبر منصات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides centralized access to SEO snippet hunting best practices and workflows from OpenClaw, Claude Code, and Open platforms. Enables agents to clarify goals, apply validated constraints, and deliver actionable verification steps for snippet optimization tasks.","zh":"提供来自OpenClaw、Claude Code和Open平台的SEO代码片段狩猎最佳实践和工作流的集中访问。使代理能够阐明目标、应用验证的约束并为代码片段优化任务提供可操作的验证步骤。","ja":"OpenClaw、Claude Code、およびOpenプラットフォームからのSEOスニペットハンティングのベストプラクティスとワークフローの集中アクセスを提供します。エージェントが目標を明確にし、検証済みの制約を適用し、スニペット最適化タスクのための可操作な検証ステップを提供できるようにします。","ko":"OpenClaw, Claude Code 및 Open 플랫폼의 SEO 스니펫 헌팅 모범 사례 및 워크플로에 대한集中된 액세스를 제공합니다. 에이전트가 목표를 명확히하고 검증된 제약을 적용하고 스니펫 최적화 작업에 대한 작업 가능한 검증 단계를 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Proporciona acceso centralizado a las mejores prácticas y flujos de trabajo de caza de fragmentos de SEO de OpenClaw, Claude Code y plataformas abiertas. Permite a los agentes aclarar objetivos, aplicar restricciones validadas y entregar pasos de verificación accionables para tareas de optimización de fragmentos.","fr":"Fournit un accès centralisé aux meilleures pratiques et flux de travail de chasse de snippets de référencement d''OpenClaw, Claude Code et plateformes ouvertes. Permet aux agents de clarifier les objectifs, d''appliquer des contraintes validées et de fournir des étapes de vérification actionnables pour les tâches d''optimisation de snippets.","de":"Bietet zentralen Zugriff auf die Best Practices und Workflows für SEO-Snippet-Jagd von OpenClaw, Claude Code und offenen Plattformen. Ermöglicht es Agents, Ziele zu klären, validierte Einschränkungen anzuwenden und handhabbare Verifizierungsschritte für Snippet-Optimierungsaufgaben zu liefern.","pt":"Fornece acesso centralizado às melhores práticas e fluxos de trabalho de caça a trechos de SEO de OpenClaw, Claude Code e plataformas abertas. Permite que os agentes esclareçam metas, apliquem restrições validadas e forneçam etapas de verificação de ação para tarefas de otimização de trechos.","ru":"Предоставляет централизованный доступ к лучшим практикам и рабочим процессам поиска SEO-вырезок от OpenClaw, Claude Code и открытых платформ. Позволяет агентам уточнить цели, применить проверенные ограничения и обеспечить выполнимые шаги проверки для задач оптимизации вырезок.","ar":"يوفر وصولاً مركزيًا إلى أفضل الممارسات وأساليب العمل لصيد شظايا تحسين محركات البحث من OpenClaw و Claude Code ومنصات مفتوحة. يتيح للموكلات توضيح الأهداف وتطبيق القيود المعتمدة وتقديم خطوات التحقق القابلة للتنفيذ لمهام تحسين الشظايا."},"useCases":{"en":["Aggregating SEO best practices from multiple AI platforms","Validating snippet optimization outcomes against constraints","Generating actionable verification checklists for SEO workflows"],"zh":["从多个AI平台聚合SEO最佳实践","验证代码片段优化结果与约束","为SEO工作流生成可操作的验证检查表"],"ja":["複数のAIプラットフォームからのSEOベストプラクティスの集約","スニペット最適化の結果を制約に対して検証する","SEOワークフロー用に可操作な検証チェックリストを生成する"],"ko":["다중 AI 플랫폼의 SEO 모범 사례 집계","스니펫 최적화 결과를 제약 조건과 비교","SEO 워크플로우를 위한 작업 가능한 검증 체크리스트 생성"],"es":["Agrupar las mejores prácticas de SEO de varias plataformas de IA","Validar los resultados de la optimización de fragmentos contra restricciones","Generar listas de verificación de acciones para flujos de trabajo de SEO"],"fr":["Regrouper les meilleures pratiques de référencement de plusieurs plateformes d''IA","Valider les résultats de l''optimisation de snippets par rapport à des contraintes","Générer des listes de vérification d''actions pour les flux de travail de référencement"],"de":["SEO-Best-Practices von mehreren KI-Plattformen zu aggregieren","Optimierungsergebnisse von Snippets gegen Einschränkungen zu validieren","Handhabbare Prüflisten für SEO-Workflows zu generieren"],"pt":["Agregação de melhores práticas de SEO de várias plataformas de IA","Validação de resultados de otimização de trechos contra restrições","Geração de listas de verificação de ação para fluxos de trabalho de SEO"],"ru":["Агрегация лучших методов SEO с нескольких платформ ИИ","Проверка результатов оптимизации вырезок против ограничений","Генерация списков действий для рабочих процессов SEO"],"ar":["تجميع أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث من منصات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتعددة","التحقق من نتائج تحسين الشظايا مقابل القيود","توليد قوائم التحقق القابلة للتنفيذ لأنظمة العمل لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to SEO snippet hunting domain exclusively","Requires specific input clarification before execution","Cannot operate outside predefined SEO scope"],"zh":["仅限于SEO代码片段狩猎领域","需要在执行前具体输入澄清","不能超出预定义的SEO范围"],"ja":["SEOスニペットハンティングのドメインに限定される","実行前に特定の入力の明確化が必要","予め定義されたSEOの範囲外では操作できない"],"ko":["SEO 스니펫 헌팅 도메인에만 국한됨","실행 전에 특정 입력澄清이 필요","사전 정의된 SEO 범위 외부에서 작동할 수 없음"],"es":["Limitado exclusivamente al dominio de caza de fragmentos de SEO","Requiere aclaración de entrada específica antes de la ejecución","No puede operar fuera del alcance predefinido de SEO"],"fr":["Limité exclusivement au domaine de la chasse de snippets de référencement","Nécessite une clarification d''entrée spécifique avant l''exécution","Ne peut pas fonctionner en dehors de la portée de référencement prédéfinie"],"de":["Auf das SEO-Snippet-Jagd-Domain beschränkt","Benötigt spezifische Eingabeklärung vor der Ausführung","Kann nicht außerhalb des vorgegebenen SEO-Umfangs operieren"],"pt":["Limitado exclusivamente ao domínio de caça a trechos de SEO","Requer esclarecimento de entrada específico antes da execução","Não pode operar fora do escopo de SEO pré-definido"],"ru":["Ограничен исключительно областью поиска SEO-вырезок","Требует конкретного уточнения ввода перед выполнением","Не может работать вне предварительно определенной области SEO"],"ar":["محدود حصرًا بنطاق صيد شظايا تحسين محركات البحث","يتطلب توضيحًا محددًا للمدخلات قبل التنفيذ","لا يمكنه العمل خارج نطاق تحسين محركات البحث المحدد مسبقًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
