"IPN (Instant Payment Notification)","Wiederkehrende Abrechnung","Rückzahlungsflüsse","Intelligente Technologie-Erkennung","Projektinstallation"],"pt":["Express Checkout","IPN (Internet Payment Notification)","Recorrência de pagamentos","Gestão de refundos","Integração fácil com projetos existentes"],"ru":["Express Checkout","IPN (Интернет-уведомление о платеже)","Регулярные платежи","Управление возвратами","Легкая интеграция с существующими проектами"],"ar":["Express Checkout","IPN (إشعار الدفع عبر الإنترنت)","الفواتير المتكررة","إدارة المستردات","التكامل السهل مع المشاريع الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PayPal","API","Express Checkout","IPN","Refund","PayPal","Payment Gateway","E-commerce"],"ja":["PayPal","API","Express Checkout","IPN","Refund","PayPal","Payment Gateway","E-commerce"],"ko":["PayPal","API","Express Checkout","IPN","Refund","PayPal","Payment Gateway","E-commerce"],"es":["integración de paypal","desarrollo de pagos","express checkout","ipn","facturación recurrente","reembolsos","tecnología de pagos"],"fr":["intégration paypal","développement de paiement","express checkout","ipn","facturation récurrente","remboursements","technologie de paiement"],"de":["paypal-integration","zahlungsentwicklung","express checkout","ipn","wiederkehrende abrechnung","rückzahlungen","zahlungstechnologie"],"pt":["integração paypal","pagamento online","express checkout","ipn","recorrência de pagamentos","desenvolvedores","soluções de pagamento"],"ru":["интеграция paypal","онлайн-оплата","express checkout","ipn","регулярные платежи","разработчики","решения для оплаты"],"ar":["تكامل باي بال","دفع عبر الإنترنت","express checkout","ipn","الفواتير المتكررة","مطورون","حلول الدفع"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paypal-integration","description":"Integrate PayPal payment processing with support for express checkout, subscriptions, and refund management. Use when implementing PayPal payments, processing online transactions, or building e-commerce checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to paypal integration\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Integrating PayPal as a payment option\n- Implementing express checkout flows\n- Setting up recurring billing with PayPal\n- Processing refunds and payment disputes\n- Handling PayPal webhooks (IPN)\n- Supporting international payments\n- Implementing PayPal subscriptions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Products\n**PayPal Checkout**\n- One-time payments\n- Express checkout experience\n- Guest and PayPal account payments\n\n**PayPal Subscriptions**\n- Recurring billing\n- Subscription plans\n- Automatic renewals\n\n**PayPal Payouts**\n- Send money to multiple recipients\n- Marketplace and platform payments\n\n### 2. Integration Methods\n**Client-Side (JavaScript SDK)**\n- Smart Payment Buttons\n- Hosted payment flow\n- Minimal backend code\n\n**Server-Side (REST API)**\n- Full control over payment flow\n- Custom checkout UI\n- Advanced features\n\n### 3. IPN (Instant Payment Notification)\n- Webhook-like payment notifications\n- Asynchronous payment updates\n- Verification required\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend - PayPal Smart Buttons\n<div id=\"paypal-button-container\"></div>\n\n<script src=\"https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&currency=USD\"></script>\n<script>\n  paypal.Buttons({\n    createOrder: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.create({\n        purchase_units: [{\n          amount: {\n            value: ''25.00''\n          }\n        }]\n      });\n    },\n    onApprove: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.capture().then(function(details) {\n        // Payment successful\n        console.log(''Transaction completed by '' + details.payer.name.given_name);\n\n        // Send to backend for verification\n        fetch(''/api/paypal/capture'', {\n          method: ''POST'',\n          headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n          body: JSON.stringify({orderID: data.orderID})\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  }).render(''#paypal-button-container'');\n</script>\n```\n\n```python\n# Backend - Verify and capture order\nfrom paypalrestsdk import Payment\nimport paypalrestsdk\n\npaypalrestsdk.configure({\n    \"mode\": \"sandbox\",  # or \"live\"\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n})\n\ndef capture_paypal_order(order_id):\n    \"\"\"Capture a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n    payment = Payment.find(order_id)\n\n    if payment.execute({\"payer_id\": payment.payer.payer_info.payer_id}):\n        # Payment successful\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''success'',\n            ''transaction_id'': payment.id,\n            ''amount'': payment.transactions[0].amount.total\n        }\n    else:\n        # Payment failed\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''failed'',\n            ''error'': payment.error\n        }\n```\n\n## Express Checkout Implementation\n\n### Server-Side Order Creation\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass PayPalClient:\n    def __init__(self, client_id, client_secret, mode=''sandbox''):\n        self.client_id = client_id\n        self.client_secret = client_secret\n        self.base_url = ''https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com'' if mode == ''sandbox'' else ''https://api-m.paypal.com''\n        self.access_token = self.get_access_token()\n\n    def get_access_token(self):\n        \"\"\"Get OAuth access token.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v1/oauth2/token\"\n        headers = {\"Accept\": \"application/json\", \"Accept-Language\": \"en_US\"}\n\n        response = requests.post(\n            url,\n            headers=headers,\n            data={\"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\"},\n            auth=(self.client_id, self.client_secret)\n        )\n\n        return response.json()[''access_token'']\n\n    def create_order(self, amount, currency=''USD''):\n        \"\"\"Create a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        payload = {\n            \"intent\": \"CAPTURE\",\n            \"purchase_units\": [{\n                \"amount\": {\n                    \"currency_code\": currency,\n                    \"value\": str(amount)\n                }\n            }]\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def capture_order(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Capture payment for an order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}/capture\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def get_order_details(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Get order details.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n```\n\n## IPN (Instant Payment Notification) Handling\n\n### IPN Verification and Processing\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport requests\nfrom urllib.parse import parse_qs\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route(''/ipn'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef handle_ipn():\n    \"\"\"Handle PayPal IPN notifications.\"\"\"\n    # Get IPN message\n    ipn_data = request.form.to_dict()\n\n    # Verify IPN with PayPal\n    if not verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n        return ''IPN verification failed'', 400\n\n    # Process IPN based on transaction type\n    payment_status = ipn_data.get(''payment_status'')\n    txn_type = ipn_data.get(''txn_type'')\n\n    if payment_status == ''Completed'':\n        handle_payment_completed(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Refunded'':\n        handle_refund(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Reversed'':\n        handle_chargeback(ipn_data)\n\n    return ''IPN processed'', 200\n\ndef verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Verify IPN message authenticity.\"\"\"\n    # Add ''cmd'' parameter\n    verify_data = ipn_data.copy()\n    verify_data[''cmd''] = ''_notify-validate''\n\n    # Send back to PayPal for verification\n    paypal_url = ''https://ipnpb.sandbox.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr''  # or production URL\n\n    response = requests.post(paypal_url, data=verify_data)\n\n    return response.text == ''VERIFIED''\n\ndef handle_payment_completed(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Process completed payment.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    payer_email = ipn_data.get(''payer_email'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n    item_name = ipn_data.get(''item_name'')\n\n    # Check if already processed (prevent duplicates)\n    if is_transaction_processed(txn_id):\n        return\n\n    # Update database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment completed: {txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_refund(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle refund.\"\"\"\n    parent_txn_id = ipn_data.get(''parent_txn_id'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n\n    # Process refund in your system\n    print(f\"Refund processed: {parent_txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_chargeback(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle payment reversal/chargeback.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    reason_code = ipn_data.get(''reason_code'')\n\n    # Handle chargeback\n    print(f\"Chargeback: {txn_id}, Reason: {reason_code}\")\n```\n\n## Subscription/Recurring Billing\n\n### Create Subscription Plan\n```python\ndef create_subscription_plan(name, amount, interval=''MONTH''):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription plan.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/plans\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"product_id\": \"PRODUCT_ID\",  # Create product first\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"billing_cycles\": [{\n            \"frequency\": {\n                \"interval_unit\": interval,\n                \"interval_count\": 1\n            },\n            \"tenure_type\": \"REGULAR\",\n            \"sequence\": 1,\n            \"total_cycles\": 0,  # Infinite\n            \"pricing_scheme\": {\n                \"fixed_price\": {\n                    \"value\": str(amount),\n                    \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n                }\n            }\n        }],\n        \"payment_preferences\": {\n            \"auto_bill_outstanding\": True,\n            \"setup_fee\": {\n                \"value\": \"0\",\n                \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n            },\n            \"setup_fee_failure_action\": \"CONTINUE\",\n            \"payment_failure_threshold\": 3\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef create_subscription(plan_id, subscriber_email):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/subscriptions\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"plan_id\": plan_id,\n        \"subscriber\": {\n            \"email_address\": subscriber_email\n        },\n        \"application_context\": {\n            \"return_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/success\",\n            \"cancel_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/cancel\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    subscription = response.json()\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    for link in subscription.get(''links'', []):\n        if link[''rel''] == ''approve'':\n            return {\n                ''subscription_id'': subscription[''id''],\n                ''approval_url'': link[''href'']\n            }\n```\n\n## Refund Workflows\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(capture_id, amount=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund for a captured payment.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/captures/{capture_id}/refund\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {}\n    if amount:\n        payload[\"amount\"] = {\n            \"value\": str(amount),\n            \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n        }\n\n    if note:\n        payload[\"note_to_payer\"] = note\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef get_refund_details(refund_id):\n    \"\"\"Get refund details.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/refunds/{refund_id}\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n    return response.json()\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```python\nclass PayPalError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Custom PayPal error.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\ndef handle_paypal_api_call(api_function):\n    \"\"\"Wrapper for PayPal API calls with error handling.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = api_function()\n        return result\n    except requests.exceptions.RequestException as e:\n        # Network error\n        raise PayPalError(f\"Network error: {str(e)}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        # Other errors\n        raise PayPalError(f\"PayPal API error: {str(e)}\")\n\n# Usage\ntry:\n    order = handle_paypal_api_call(lambda: client.create_order(25.00))\nexcept PayPalError as e:\n    # Handle error appropriately\n    log_error(e)\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use sandbox credentials\nSANDBOX_CLIENT_ID = \"...\"\nSANDBOX_SECRET = \"...\"\n\n# Test accounts\n# Create test buyer and seller accounts at developer.paypal.com\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID, SANDBOX_SECRET, mode=''sandbox'')\n\n    # Create order\n    order = client.create_order(10.00)\n    assert ''id'' in order\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    approval_url = next((link[''href''] for link in order[''links''] if link[''rel''] == ''approve''), None)\n    assert approval_url is not None\n\n    # After approval (manual step with test account)\n    # Capture order\n    # captured = client.capture_order(order[''id''])\n    # assert captured[''status''] == ''COMPLETED''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/express-checkout.md**: Express Checkout implementation guide\n- **references/ipn-handling.md**: IPN verification and processing\n- **references/refund-workflows.md**: Refund handling patterns\n- **references/billing-agreements.md**: Recurring billing setup\n- **assets/paypal-client.py**: Production PayPal client\n- **assets/ipn-processor.py**: IPN webhook processor\n- **assets/recurring-billing.py**: Subscription management\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Verify IPN**: Never trust IPN without verification\n2. **Idempotent Processing**: Handle duplicate IPN notifications\n3. **Error Handling**: Implement robust error handling\n4. **Logging**: Log all transactions and errors\n5. **Test Thoroughly**: Use sandbox extensively\n6. **Webhook Backup**: Don''t rely solely on client-side callbacks\n7. **Currency Handling**: Always specify currency explicitly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying IPN**: Accepting IPN without verification\n- **Duplicate Processing**: Not checking for duplicate transactions\n- **Wrong Environment**: Mixing sandbox and production URLs/credentials\n- **Missing Webhooks**: Not handling all payment states\n- **Hardcoded Values**: Not making configurable for different environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:38:26.584Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for E-commerce Agents requiring seamless PayPal payment processing, including Express Checkout and recurring billing capabilities.","zh":"适合需要无缝PayPal支付处理的电子商务代理，包括Express Checkout和循环计费功能。","ja":"PayPalの支払い処理を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適で、Express Checkoutや定期的な請求の機能を含む。","ko":"페이팔 결제 처리가 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에게 적합하며, Express Checkout 및 반복적인 청구 기능을 포함한다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de comercio electrónico que requieren un procesamiento de pagos de PayPal sin problemas, incluyendo la función de pago Express Checkout y capacidades de facturación recurrente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de commerce électronique nécessitant un traitement de paiement PayPal sans heurts, y compris la fonction de paiement Express Checkout et les capacités de facturation récurrente.","de":"Ideal für E-Commerce-Agents, die ein reibungsloses PayPal-Zahlverarbeitung benötigen, einschließlich Express-Checkout und wiederkehrender Abrechnungsfunktionen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de comércio eletrônico que exigem processamento de pagamento do PayPal sem interrupções, incluindo Checkout Express e capacidades de faturação recorrente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, требующих бесшовную обработку платежей PayPal, включая Express Checkout и возможности регулярного выставления счетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التجارة الإلكترونية الذي يتطلب معالجة دفع PayPal دون انقطاع، بما في ذلك الدفع السريع وتكرار الفواتير"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle complex payment workflows, including IPN handling and refund processes, utilizing PayPal''s API for secure transactions and auto-syncing from upstream sources for consistent data.","zh":"赋予代理人处理复杂支付工作流的能力，包括IPN处理和退款流程，利用PayPal的API进行安全交易，并从上游源自动同步以保持数据一致性。","ja":"エージェントが複雑な支払いワークフローを処理できるようにし、IPNの処理や返金プロセスなど、PayPalのAPIを使用して安全な取引を行い、上流ソースからの自動同期で一貫したデータを保持する。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 결제 워크플로를 처리할 수 있도록 하며, IPN 처리 및 환불 프로세스 등 페이팔의 API를 사용하여 안전한 거래를 수행하고, 업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화하여 일관된 데이터를 유지한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar flujos de trabajo de pago complejos, incluyendo el manejo de IPN y procesos de reembolso, utilizando la API de PayPal para transacciones seguras y la auto-sincronización desde fuentes de agua arriba para datos consistentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail de paiement complexes, y compris la gestion des IPN et des processus de remboursement, en utilisant l''API de PayPal pour des transactions sécurisées et une auto-synchronisation à partir de sources amont pour des données cohérentes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, komplexe Zahlungsworkflows zu verwalten, einschließlich IPN- und Rückerstattungsprozessen, unter Verwendung der PayPal-API für sichere Transaktionen und Auto-Synchronisierung von Quellen für konsistente Daten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com fluxos de trabalho de pagamento complexos, incluindo tratamento de IPN e processos de reembolso, utilizando a API do PayPal para transações seguras e auto-sincronização de fontes de montante para dados consistentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью xử lýть сложные потоки платежей, включая обработку IPN и процессы возврата, используя API PayPal для безопасных транзакций и авто-синхронизации из источников верхнего уровня для согласованных данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع عمليات الدفع المعقدة، بما في ذلك معالجة الإشعارات الفورية وتعويضات الإرجاع، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات PayPal لضمان معاملات آمنة وتزامن آلي من مصادر المنبع لضمان البيانات المتسقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Express Checkout for streamlined customer payments","Automating recurring billing and subscription management","Debugging IPN handling for reliable payment notifications"],"zh":["为客户支付实现Express Checkout的简化","自动化循环计费和订阅管理","调试IPN处理以实现可靠的支付通知"],"ja":["顧客の支払いを簡素化するためのExpress Checkoutの実装","定期的な請求やサブスクリプションの管理の自動化","信頼性の高い支払い通知のためのIPN処理のデバッグ"],"ko":["客户 결제를 간소화하기 위한 Express Checkout 구현","정기적인 청구 및 구독 관리 자동화","안정적인 결제 알림을 위한 IPN 처리 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar Express Checkout para pagos de clientes simplificados","Automatizar la facturación y gestión de suscripciones recurrentes","Depurar el manejo de IPN para notificaciones de pago confiables"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre Express Checkout pour des paiements de clients simplifiés","Automatiser la facturation et la gestion d''abonnements récurrents","Déboguer la gestion des IPN pour des notifications de paiement fiables"],"de":["Express-Checkout für vereinfachte Kundenzahlungen implementieren","Automatisierung der wiederkehrenden Abrechnung und des Abonnementmanagements","Fehlerbehebung bei der IPN-Verarbeitung für zuverlässige Zahlungsbenachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Implementar Checkout Express para pagamentos de clientes simplificados","Automatizar cobrança recorrente e gestão de assinaturas","Depurar tratamento de IPN para notificações de pagamento confiáveis"],"ru":["Реализация Express Checkout для упрощенных платежей клиентов","Автоматизация регулярных платежей и управления подписками","Отладка обработки IPN для надежных уведомлений о платежах"],"ar":["تنفيذ الدفع السريع لتعزيز بساطة دفع العملاء","تأتمة فواتير متكررة وإدارة الاشتراكات","تصحيح أخطاء معالجة الإشعارات الفورية من أجل إشعارات دفع موثوقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to PayPal integration","Limited to PayPal''s domain and tools, excluding other payment gateways"],"zh":["任务必须与PayPal集成相关","仅限于PayPal的域和工具，排除其他支付网关"],"ja":["タスクはPayPalの統合に関連している必要がある","PayPalのドメインとツールに限定され、他の決済ゲートウェイは除外される"],"ko":["작업은 페이팔 통합과 관련이 있어야 한다","페이팔의 도메인 및 도구에限定되어 다른 결제 게이트웨이는 제외된다"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con la integración de PayPal","Limitada al dominio y herramientas de PayPal, excluyendo otros pasarelas de pago"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à l''intégration de PayPal","Limitée au domaine et aux outils de PayPal, à l''exclusion d''autres passerelles de paiement"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit der PayPal-Integration zusammenhängen","Begrenzt auf PayPals Domain und Tools, andere Zahlungsgateways ausgeschlossen"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à integração do PayPal","Limitado ao domínio e às ferramentas do PayPal, excluindo outras portas de pagamento"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с интеграцией PayPal","Ограничен до домена и инструментов PayPal, исключая другие платежные шлюзы"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بتكامل دفع PayPal","محدود إلى نطاق أدوات PayPal، واستبعاد بوابات الدفع الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
