ubs Java SDK","ko":"Azure Event Hubs Java SDK ","es":"El SDK de Azure Event Hubs para Java permite construir aplicaciones de transmisión en tiempo real. La instalación es sencilla mediante la dependencia de Maven.","fr":"Le SDK Azure Event Hubs pour Java permet de construire des applications de diffusion en temps réel. L''installation est simple via la dépendance Maven.","de":"Das Azure Event Hubs SDK für Java ermöglicht die Erstellung von Echtzeit-Streaming-Anwendungen. Die Installation ist einfach über die Maven-Abhängigkeit.","pt":"O Azure Event Hubs SDK para Java permite construir aplicativos de streaming em tempo real. Aprenda a usar a SDK para criar soluções de streaming.","ru":"Azure Event Hubs SDK для Java позволяет создавать приложения реального времени. Узнайте, как использовать SDK для создания решений потоковой передачи.","ar":"يسمح Azure Event Hubs SDK للجافا ببناء تطبيقات بث في الوقت الفعلي. تعلم كيفية استخدام SDK لإنشاء حلول بث.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["Azure Event Hubs Java SDK","Real-time ","Azure ","Java","Maven","Checkpoint"],"ja":["Azure Event Hubs Java SDK","Real-time ","Azure ","Java","Maven","Checkpoint"],"ko":["Azure Event Hubs Java SDK","Real-time ","Azure ","Java","Maven","Checkpoint"],"es":["Instalación sencilla mediante Maven","Compatibilidad con almacenamiento de puntos de control","Soporte para aplicaciones de transmisión en tiempo real","Integración con Azure Blob Storage","Gestión de eventos en tiempo real","Escalabilidad y confiabilidad"],"fr":["Installation simple via Maven","Compatibilité avec le stockage des points de contrôle","Prise en charge des applications de diffusion en temps réel","Intégration avec Azure Blob Storage","Gestion des événements en temps réel","Évolutivité et fiabilité"],"de":["Einfache Installation über Maven","Kompatibilität mit Checkpoint-Speicher","Unterstützung für Echtzeit-Streaming-Anwendungen","Integration mit Azure Blob Storage","Verwaltung von Echtzeit-Ereignissen","Skalierbarkeit und Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos de streaming em tempo real","Integração com o Azure Event Hubs","Suporte a checkpoint store","Uso de dependências Maven","Desenvolvimento de soluções de streaming personalizadas","Integração com outros serviços do Azure"],"ru":["Создание приложений реального времени","Интеграция с Azure Event Hubs","Поддержка checkpoint store","Использование зависимостей Maven","Разработка индивидуальных решений потоковой передачи","Интеграция с другими сервисами Azure"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات بث في الوقت الفعلي","الدمج مع Azure Event Hubs","دعم مخزن التحقق","استخدام التبعيات Maven","تطوير حلول بث مخصصة","الدمج مع خدمات أخرى من Azure"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Event Hubs","Java SDK","Real-time ","Streaming","Azure","Java","Maven","Checkpoint","Event Hubs"],"ja":["Azure Event Hubs","Java SDK","Real-time ","Streaming","Azure","Java","Maven","Checkpoint","Event Hubs"],"ko":["Azure Event Hubs","Java SDK","Real-time ","Streaming","Azure","Java","Maven","Checkpoint","Event Hubs"],"es":["Azure Event Hubs","SDK de Java","transmisión en tiempo real","aplicaciones de streaming","Maven","Azure Blob Storage","eventos en tiempo real","escalabilidad","confiabilidad"],"fr":["Azure Event Hubs","SDK Java","diffusion en temps réel","applications de streaming","Maven","Azure Blob Storage","événements en temps réel","évolutivité","fiabilité"],"de":["Azure Event Hubs","Java SDK","Echtzeit-Streaming","Streaming-Anwendungen","Maven","Azure Blob Storage","Echtzeit-Ereignisse","Skalierbarkeit","Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Azure Event Hubs SDK para Java","aplicativos de streaming em tempo real","desenvolvimento de soluções de streaming","integração com o Azure","dependências Maven","checkpoint store","soluções de streaming personalizadas","serviços do Azure","Java"],"ru":["Azure Event Hubs SDK для Java","приложения реального времени","разработка решений потоковой передачи","интеграция с Azure","зависимости Maven","checkpoint store","индивидуальные решения потоковой передачи","сервисы Azure","Java"],"ar":["Azure Event Hubs SDK للجافا","تطبيقات بث في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير حلول بث","الدمج مع Azure","التبعيات Maven","مخزن التحقق","حلول بث مخصصة","خدمات Azure","الجافا"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-eventhub-java","description":"Build real-time streaming applications with Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java. Use when implementing event streaming, high-throughput data ingestion, or building event-driven architectures.","bodyPreview":"# Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java\n\nBuild real-time streaming applications using the Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java.\n\n## Installation\n\n```xml\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.azure</groupId>\n    <artifactId>azure-messaging-eventhubs</artifactId>\n    <version>5.19.0</version>\n</dependency>\n\n<!-- For checkpoint store (production) -->\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.azure</groupId>\n    <artifactId>azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob</artifactId>\n    <version>1.20.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```\n\n##","body":"# Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java\n\nBuild real-time streaming applications using the Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java.\n\n## Installation\n\n```xml\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.azure</groupId>\n    <artifactId>azure-messaging-eventhubs</artifactId>\n    <version>5.19.0</version>\n</dependency>\n\n<!-- For checkpoint store (production) -->\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.azure</groupId>\n    <artifactId>azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob</artifactId>\n    <version>1.20.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```\n\n## Client Creation\n\n### EventHubProducerClient\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventHubProducerClient;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventHubClientBuilder;\n\n// With connection string\nEventHubProducerClient producer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .buildProducerClient();\n\n// Full connection string with EntityPath\nEventHubProducerClient producer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string-with-entity-path>\")\n    .buildProducerClient();\n```\n\n### With DefaultAzureCredential\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.identity.DefaultAzureCredentialBuilder;\n\nEventHubProducerClient producer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .fullyQualifiedNamespace(\"<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net\")\n    .eventHubName(\"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .credential(new DefaultAzureCredentialBuilder().build())\n    .buildProducerClient();\n```\n\n### EventHubConsumerClient\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventHubConsumerClient;\n\nEventHubConsumerClient consumer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .consumerGroup(EventHubClientBuilder.DEFAULT_CONSUMER_GROUP_NAME)\n    .buildConsumerClient();\n```\n\n### Async Clients\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventHubProducerAsyncClient;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventHubConsumerAsyncClient;\n\nEventHubProducerAsyncClient asyncProducer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .buildAsyncProducerClient();\n\nEventHubConsumerAsyncClient asyncConsumer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .consumerGroup(\"$Default\")\n    .buildAsyncConsumerClient();\n```\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Send Single Event\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventData;\n\nEventData eventData = new EventData(\"Hello, Event Hubs!\");\nproducer.send(Collections.singletonList(eventData));\n```\n\n### Send Event Batch\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventDataBatch;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.models.CreateBatchOptions;\n\n// Create batch\nEventDataBatch batch = producer.createBatch();\n\n// Add events (returns false if batch is full)\nfor (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n    EventData event = new EventData(\"Event \" + i);\n    if (!batch.tryAdd(event)) {\n        // Batch is full, send and create new batch\n        producer.send(batch);\n        batch = producer.createBatch();\n        batch.tryAdd(event);\n    }\n}\n\n// Send remaining events\nif (batch.getCount() > 0) {\n    producer.send(batch);\n}\n```\n\n### Send to Specific Partition\n\n```java\nCreateBatchOptions options = new CreateBatchOptions()\n    .setPartitionId(\"0\");\n\nEventDataBatch batch = producer.createBatch(options);\nbatch.tryAdd(new EventData(\"Partition 0 event\"));\nproducer.send(batch);\n```\n\n### Send with Partition Key\n\n```java\nCreateBatchOptions options = new CreateBatchOptions()\n    .setPartitionKey(\"customer-123\");\n\nEventDataBatch batch = producer.createBatch(options);\nbatch.tryAdd(new EventData(\"Customer event\"));\nproducer.send(batch);\n```\n\n### Event with Properties\n\n```java\nEventData event = new EventData(\"Order created\");\nevent.getProperties().put(\"orderId\", \"ORD-123\");\nevent.getProperties().put(\"customerId\", \"CUST-456\");\nevent.getProperties().put(\"priority\", 1);\n\nproducer.send(Collections.singletonList(event));\n```\n\n### Receive Events (Simple)\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.models.EventPosition;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.models.PartitionEvent;\n\n// Receive from specific partition\nIterable<PartitionEvent> events = consumer.receiveFromPartition(\n    \"0\",                           // partitionId\n    10,                            // maxEvents\n    EventPosition.earliest(),      // startingPosition\n    Duration.ofSeconds(30)         // timeout\n);\n\nfor (PartitionEvent partitionEvent : events) {\n    EventData event = partitionEvent.getData();\n    System.out.println(\"Body: \" + event.getBodyAsString());\n    System.out.println(\"Sequence: \" + event.getSequenceNumber());\n    System.out.println(\"Offset: \" + event.getOffset());\n}\n```\n\n### EventProcessorClient (Production)\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventProcessorClient;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.EventProcessorClientBuilder;\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.checkpointstore.blob.BlobCheckpointStore;\nimport com.azure.storage.blob.BlobContainerAsyncClient;\nimport com.azure.storage.blob.BlobContainerClientBuilder;\n\n// Create checkpoint store\nBlobContainerAsyncClient blobClient = new BlobContainerClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<storage-connection-string>\")\n    .containerName(\"checkpoints\")\n    .buildAsyncClient();\n\n// Create processor\nEventProcessorClient processor = new EventProcessorClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<eventhub-connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .consumerGroup(\"$Default\")\n    .checkpointStore(new BlobCheckpointStore(blobClient))\n    .processEvent(eventContext -> {\n        EventData event = eventContext.getEventData();\n        System.out.println(\"Processing: \" + event.getBodyAsString());\n        \n        // Checkpoint after processing\n        eventContext.updateCheckpoint();\n    })\n    .processError(errorContext -> {\n        System.err.println(\"Error: \" + errorContext.getThrowable().getMessage());\n        System.err.println(\"Partition: \" + errorContext.getPartitionContext().getPartitionId());\n    })\n    .buildEventProcessorClient();\n\n// Start processing\nprocessor.start();\n\n// Keep running...\nThread.sleep(Duration.ofMinutes(5).toMillis());\n\n// Stop gracefully\nprocessor.stop();\n```\n\n### Batch Processing\n\n```java\nEventProcessorClient processor = new EventProcessorClientBuilder()\n    .connectionString(\"<connection-string>\", \"<event-hub-name>\")\n    .consumerGroup(\"$Default\")\n    .checkpointStore(new BlobCheckpointStore(blobClient))\n    .processEventBatch(eventBatchContext -> {\n        List<EventData> events = eventBatchContext.getEvents();\n        System.out.printf(\"Received %d events%n\", events.size());\n        \n        for (EventData event : events) {\n            // Process each event\n            System.out.println(event.getBodyAsString());\n        }\n        \n        // Checkpoint after batch\n        eventBatchContext.updateCheckpoint();\n    }, 50) // maxBatchSize\n    .processError(errorContext -> {\n        System.err.println(\"Error: \" + errorContext.getThrowable());\n    })\n    .buildEventProcessorClient();\n```\n\n### Async Receiving\n\n```java\nasyncConsumer.receiveFromPartition(\"0\", EventPosition.latest())\n    .subscribe(\n        partitionEvent -> {\n            EventData event = partitionEvent.getData();\n            System.out.println(\"Received: \" + event.getBodyAsString());\n        },\n        error -> System.err.println(\"Error: \" + error),\n        () -> System.out.println(\"Complete\")\n    );\n```\n\n### Get Event Hub Properties\n\n```java\n// Get hub info\nEventHubProperties hubProps = producer.getEventHubProperties();\nSystem.out.println(\"Hub: \" + hubProps.getName());\nSystem.out.println(\"Partitions: \" + hubProps.getPartitionIds());\n\n// Get partition info\nPartitionProperties partitionProps = producer.getPartitionProperties(\"0\");\nSystem.out.println(\"Begin sequence: \" + partitionProps.getBeginningSequenceNumber());\nSystem.out.println(\"Last sequence: \" + partitionProps.getLastEnqueuedSequenceNumber());\nSystem.out.println(\"Last offset: \" + partitionProps.getLastEnqueuedOffset());\n```\n\n## Event Positions\n\n```java\n// Start from beginning\nEventPosition.earliest()\n\n// Start from end (new events only)\nEventPosition.latest()\n\n// From specific offset\nEventPosition.fromOffset(12345L)\n\n// From specific sequence number\nEventPosition.fromSequenceNumber(100L)\n\n// From specific time\nEventPosition.fromEnqueuedTime(Instant.now().minus(Duration.ofHours(1)))\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```java\nimport com.azure.messaging.eventhubs.models.ErrorContext;\n\n.processError(errorContext -> {\n    Throwable error = errorContext.getThrowable();\n    String partitionId = errorContext.getPartitionContext().getPartitionId();\n    \n    if (error instanceof AmqpException) {\n        AmqpException amqpError = (AmqpException) error;\n        if (amqpError.isTransient()) {\n            System.out.println(\"Transient error, will retry\");\n        }\n    }\n    \n    System.err.printf(\"Error on partition %s: %s%n\", partitionId, error.getMessage());\n})\n```\n\n## Resource Cleanup\n\n```java\n// Always close clients\ntry {\n    producer.send(batch);\n} finally {\n    producer.close();\n}\n\n// Or use try-with-resources\ntry (EventHubProducerClient producer = new EventHubClientBuilder()\n        .connectionString(connectionString, eventHubName)\n        .buildProducerClient()) {\n    producer.send(events);\n}\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nEVENT_HUBS_CONNECTION_STRING=Endpoint=sb://<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net/;SharedAccessKeyName=...\nEVENT_HUBS_NAME=<event-hub-name>\nSTORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=<for-checkpointing>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use EventProcessorClient**: For production, provides load balancing and checkpointing\n2. **Batch Events**: Use `EventDataBatch` for efficient sending\n3. **Partition Keys**: Use for ordering guarantees within a partition\n4. **Checkpointing**: Checkpoint after processing to avoid reprocessing\n5. **Error Handling**: Handle transient errors with retries\n6. **Close Clients**: Always close producer/consumer when done\n\n## Trigger Phrases\n\n- \"Event Hubs Java\"\n- \"event streaming Azure\"\n- \"real-time data ingestion\"\n- \"EventProcessorClient\"\n- \"event hub producer consumer\"\n- \"partition processing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:39:11.539Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Integration Agents requiring real-time data streaming capabilities with Azure Event Hubs","zh":"适用于需要与 Azure 事件中心实现实时数据流传输的云集成代理","ja":"Azure Event Hubs を使用したリアルタイム データ ストリーミング機能を必要とするクラウド統合エージェントに最適","ko":"Azure Event Hubs를 사용한 실시간 데이터 스트리밍 기능을 필요로 하는 클라우드 통합 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Integración en la Nube que requieren capacidades de transmisión de datos en tiempo real con Azure Event Hubs","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant des capacités de diffusion de données en temps réel avec Azure Event Hubs","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Integration-Agenten, die Echtzeit-Datenstreaming-Funktionen mit Azure Event Hubs erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Integração de Nuvem que exigem capacidades de transmissão de dados em tempo real com os Hubs de Eventos do Azure","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции облака, требующих возможности потоковой передачи данных в режиме реального времени с помощью концентраторов событий Azure","ar":"مثالي لعميل تكامل السحابي الذي يتطلب возможности بث البيانات في الوقت الفعلي مع مراكز الأحداث في Azure"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable real-time streaming applications using the Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java, leveraging dependencies like azure-messaging-eventhubs and azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob for efficient event processing and checkpoint store management","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的实时流应用程序的能力，使用 Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java，并利用 azure-messaging-eventhubs 和 azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob 等依赖项实现高效的事件处理和检查点存储管理","ja":"Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java を使用して、スケーラブルなリアルタイム ストリーミング アプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を提供し、azure-messaging-eventhubs と azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob などの依存関係を活用して効率的なイベント処理とチェックポイント ストア管理を行う","ko":"Azure Event Hubs SDK for Java를 사용하여 확장 가능한 실시간 스트리밍 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, azure-messaging-eventhubs 및 azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob 등의 종속성으로 효율적인 이벤트 처리 및 체크포인트 저장소 관리를 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones de transmisión en tiempo real escalables utilizando el SDK de Azure Event Hubs para Java, aprovechando dependencias como azure-messaging-eventhubs y azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob para un procesamiento de eventos eficiente y una gestión de puntos de control","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de diffusion en temps réel escalables en utilisant le SDK Azure Event Hubs pour Java, en exploitant des dépendances comme azure-messaging-eventhubs et azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob pour un traitement d''événements efficace et une gestion du point de contrôle","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, skalierbare Echtzeit-Streaming-Anwendungen mit dem Azure Event Hubs SDK für Java zu erstellen, indem es Abhängigkeiten wie azure-messaging-eventhubs und azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob für effizientes Ereignisverarbeitung und Checkpoint-Speicher-Management nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de transmissão em tempo real escaláveis usando o SDK do Azure Event Hubs para Java, aproveitando dependências como azure-messaging-eventhubs e azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob para processamento eficiente de eventos e gerenciamento de armazenamento de pontos de verificação","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать масштабируемые приложения для потоковой передачи данных в режиме реального времени с помощью SDK концентраторов событий Azure для Java, используя зависимости, такие как azure-messaging-eventhubs и azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob, для эффективной обработки событий и управления хранилищем контрольных точек","ar":"تمكين العملاء من بناء تطبيقات بث الوقت الفعلي القابلة للتحجيم باستخدام SDK Azure Event Hubs للجافا، وافتنامًا من الاعتماديات مثل azure-messaging-eventhubs وazure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob لعمليات معالجة الفعالة للأحداث وإدارة مخزن نقاط التحكم"},"useCases":{"en":["Streaming event data from distributed systems","Building real-time analytics pipelines with Azure Event Hubs","Implementing event-driven architectures with Java applications"],"zh":["从分布式系统流式传输事件数据","使用 Azure 事件中心构建实时分析管道","使用 Java 应用程序实现事件驱动架构"],"ja":["分散システムからのイベント データのストリーミング","Azure Event Hubs を使用したリアルタイム アナリティクス パイプラインの構築","Java アプリケーションを使用したイベント ドリブン アーキテクチャの実装"],"ko":["분산 시스템에서 이벤트 데이터 스트리밍","Azure Event Hubs를 사용한 실시간 분석 파이프라인 구축","Java 애플리케이션을 사용한 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처 구현"],"es":["Transmisión de datos de eventos desde sistemas distribuidos","Creación de tuberías de análisis en tiempo real con Azure Event Hubs","Implementación de arquitecturas orientadas a eventos con aplicaciones Java"],"fr":["Diffusion de données d''événements à partir de systèmes distribués","Création de pipelines d''analyse en temps réel avec Azure Event Hubs","Mise en œuvre d''architectures orientées événement avec des applications Java"],"de":["Streaming von Ereignisdaten aus verteilten Systemen","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Analyse-Pipelines mit Azure Event Hubs","Implementierung von ereignisgesteuerten Architekturen mit Java-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Transmitir dados de eventos de sistemas distribuídos","Construir pipelines de análise em tempo real com os Hubs de Eventos do Azure","Implementar arquiteturas orientadas a eventos com aplicativos Java"],"ru":["Потоковая передача данных событий из распределенных систем","Создание конвейеров аналитики в режиме реального времени с помощью концентраторов событий Azure","Реализация событийно-ориентированных архитектур с помощью приложений Java"],"ar":["بث بيانات الأحداث من الأنظمة الموزعة","بناء خطوط أنابيب التحليل في الوقت الفعلي مع مراكز الأحداث في Azure","تنفيذ هندسة مدفوعة بالأحداث مع تطبيقات الجافا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Event Hubs namespace setup","Dependent on azure-messaging-eventhubs and azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob libraries","Java 8 or later required for compatibility"],"zh":["需要 Azure 事件中心命名空间设置","依赖于 azure-messaging-eventhubs 和 azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob 库","需要 Java 8 或更高版本以确保兼容性"],"ja":["Azure Event Hubs 名前空間の設定が必要","azure-messaging-eventhubs と azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob ライブラリに依存","Java 8 または以降のバージョンが必要なため、互換性が保証される"],"ko":["Azure Event Hubs 네임스페이스 설정이 필요","azure-messaging-eventhubs 및 azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob 라이브러리에 종속","Java 8 또는 이후 버전이 필요하여 호환성이 보장"],"es":["Requiere configuración del espacio de nombres de Azure Event Hubs","Dependiente de las bibliotecas azure-messaging-eventhubs y azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","Se requiere Java 8 o posterior para la compatibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de l''espace de noms Azure Event Hubs","Dépendant des bibliothèques azure-messaging-eventhubs et azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","Java 8 ou ultérieur est requis pour la compatibilité"],"de":["Benötigt Azure Event Hubs-Namespace-Setup","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken azure-messaging-eventhubs und azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","Java 8 oder höher wird für die Kompatibilität benötigt"],"pt":["Exige configuração do namespace do Azure Event Hubs","Dependente das bibliotecas azure-messaging-eventhubs e azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","Requer Java 8 ou posterior para compatibilidade"],"ru":["Требует настройки пространства имен концентраторов событий Azure","Зависит от библиотек azure-messaging-eventhubs и azure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","Требует Java 8 или более поздней версии для совместимости"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مساحة اسم مراكز الأحداث في Azure","يعتمد على المكتبات azure-messaging-eventhubs وazure-messaging-eventhubs-checkpointstore-blob","يتطلب الجافا 8 أو أحدث للإمتثال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pCruvinel/antig/distributed-tracing', 'community', 'pCruvinel', 'antig', 'pCruvinel/antig', 'distributed-tracing', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z', '2026-02-18T02:38:52.960Z', NULL, '{"id":"pCruvinel/antig/distributed-tracing","name":"distributed-tracing","description":{"zh":"分布式追踪是一种用于可视化微服务请求流的技术，使用Jaeger和Tempo实现分布式追踪","ja":"分散トレーシングは、微サービス間のリクエストフローを可視化する技術で、JaegerとTempoを使用して実現します","ko":"분산 추적은 미시 서비스의 요청 흐름을 시각화하는 기술로 Jaeger와 Tempo를 사용하여 구현합니다","es":"El rastreo distribuido permite visibilidad del flujo de solicitudes en microservicios. Implementa con Jaeger y Tempo","fr":"Le traçage distribué permet une visibilité du flux de requêtes dans les microservices. Mettez en œuvre avec Jaeger et Tempo","de":"Die verteilte Ablaufverfolgung ermöglicht Sichtbarkeit des Anfrageflusses in Microservices. Implementieren Sie mit Jaeger und Tempo","pt":"O rastreio distribuído é uma técnica para monitorar e depurar aplicações distribuídas. Implemente com Jaeger e Tempo para melhorar a visibilidade.","ru":"Распределённое трассирование - это техника для мониторинга и отладки распределённых приложений. Реализуйте с Jaeger и Tempo для улучшения видимости.","ar":"التحليل التISTRIBUTED هو تقنية لمراقبة وتحديد أخطاء التطبيقات الموزعة. نفذ مع Jaeger و Tempo لتحسين الرؤية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"分布式追踪技术","ja":"分散トレーシング","ko":"분산 추적","es":"Rastreo distribuido para microservicios","fr":"Traçage distribué pour microservices","de":"Verteilte Ablaufverfolgung für Microservices","pt":"Rastreio Distribuído com Jaeger e Tempo","ru":"Распределённое трассирование с Jaeger и Tempo","ar":"التحليل التISTRIBUTED مع Jaeger و Tempo","en":"distributed-tracing"},"description":{"zh":"分布式追踪是一种用于可视化微服务请求流的技术，使用Jaeger和Tempo实现分布式追踪","ja":"分散トレーシングは、微サービス間のリクエストフローを可視化する技術で、JaegerとTempoを使用して実現します","ko":"분산 추적은 미시 서비스의 요청 흐름을 시각화하는 기술로 Jaeger와 Tempo를 사용하여 구현합니다","es":"El rastreo distribuido permite visibilidad del flujo de solicitudes en microservicios. Implementa con Jaeger y Tempo","fr":"Le traçage distribué permet une visibilité du flux de requêtes dans les microservices. Mettez en œuvre avec Jaeger et Tempo","de":"Die verteilte Ablaufverfolgung ermöglicht Sichtbarkeit des Anfrageflusses in Microservices. Implementieren Sie mit Jaeger und Tempo","pt":"O rastreio distribuído é uma técnica para monitorar e depurar aplicações distribuídas. Implemente com Jaeger e Tempo para melhorar a visibilidade.","ru":"Распределённое трассирование - это техника для мониторинга и отладки распределённых приложений. Реализуйте с Jaeger и Tempo для улучшения видимости.","ar":"التحليل التISTRIBUTED هو تقنية لمراقبة وتحديد أخطاء التطبيقات الموزعة. نفذ مع Jaeger و Tempo لتحسين الرؤية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实现分布式追踪","使用Jaeger和Tempo","请求流可视化","微服务间的跟踪","提高系统性能"],"ja":["分散トレーシングの実装","JaegerとTempoの使用","リクエストフローの可視化","微サービス間の追跡","システム性能の向上"],"ko":["분산 추적 구현","Jaeger와 Tempo 사용","요청 흐름 시각화","미시 서비스 간의 추적","시스템 성능 향상"],"es":["Implementación de Jaeger y Tempo","Visibilidad del flujo de solicitudes","Monitoreo de microservicios","Análisis de rendimiento","Identificación de cuellos de botella","Optimización del flujo de solicitudes"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de Jaeger et Tempo","Visibilité du flux de requêtes","Surveillance des microservices","Analyse des performances","Identification des goulots d''étranglement","Optimisation du flux de requêtes"],"de":["Implementierung von Jaeger und Tempo","Sichtbarkeit des Anfrageflusses","Überwachung von Microservices","Leistungsanalyse","Identifizierung von Engpässen","Optimierung des Anfrageflusses"],"pt":["Visibilidade de fluxo de solicitação em microsserviços","Integração com Jaeger e Tempo","Melhoria da depuração e monitoramento","Suporte a aplicações distribuídas","Análise de desempenho e otimização"],"ru":["Видимость потока запросов в микросервисах","Интеграция с Jaeger и Tempo","Улучшение отладки и мониторинга","Поддержка распределённых приложений","Анализ производительности и оптимизация"],"ar":["رؤية سير تدفق الطلبات عبر الخدمات المايكروية","التكامل مع Jaeger و Tempo","تحسين التحليل و المراقبة","دعم التطبيقات الموزعة","تحليل الأداء و التحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["分布式追踪","微服务","Jaeger","Tempo","请求流可视化","系统性能优化"],"ja":["分散トレーシング","ミクロサービス","Jaeger","Tempo","リクエストフローの可視化","システム性能最適化"],"ko":["분산 추적","미시 서비스","Jaeger","Tempo","요청 흐름 시각화","시스템 성능 최적화"],"es":["rastreo distribuido","microservicios","Jaeger","Tempo","visibilidad del flujo de solicitudes","monitoreo de microservicios","análisis de rendimiento","optimización del flujo de solicitudes"],"fr":["traçage distribué","microservices","Jaeger","Tempo","visibilité du flux de requêtes","surveillance des microservices","analyse des performances","optimisation du flux de requêtes"],"de":["verteilte Ablaufverfolgung","Microservices","Jaeger","Tempo","Sichtbarkeit des Anfrageflusses","Überwachung von Microservices","Leistungsanalyse","Optimierung des Anfrageflusses"],"pt":["rastreio distribuído","jaeger","tempo","microsserviços","visibilidade de fluxo de solicitação","depuração","monitoramento","aplicações distribuídas"],"ru":["распределённое трассирование","jaeger","tempo","микросервисы","видимость потока запросов","отладка","мониторинг","распределённые приложения"],"ar":["التحليل التISTRIBUTED","jaeger","tempo","الخدمات المايكروية","رؤية سير تدفق الطلبات","تحليل","مراقبة","التطبيقات الموزعة"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"distributed-tracing","description":"Implement distributed tracing with Jaeger and Tempo to track requests across microservices and identify performance bottlenecks. Use when debugging microservices, analyzing request flows, or implementing observability for distributed systems.","bodyPreview":"# Distributed Tracing\n\nImplement distributed tracing with Jaeger and Tempo for request flow visibility across microservices.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to distributed tracing\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-pl","body":"# Distributed Tracing\n\nImplement distributed tracing with Jaeger and Tempo for request flow visibility across microservices.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to distributed tracing\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Purpose\n\nTrack requests across distributed systems to understand latency, dependencies, and failure points.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Debug latency issues\n- Understand service dependencies\n- Identify bottlenecks\n- Trace error propagation\n- Analyze request paths\n\n## Distributed Tracing Concepts\n\n### Trace Structure\n```\nTrace (Request ID: abc123)\n  ↓\nSpan (frontend) [100ms]\n  ↓\nSpan (api-gateway) [80ms]\n  ├→ Span (auth-service) [10ms]\n  └→ Span (user-service) [60ms]\n      └→ Span (database) [40ms]\n```\n\n### Key Components\n- **Trace** - End-to-end request journey\n- **Span** - Single operation within a trace\n- **Context** - Metadata propagated between services\n- **Tags** - Key-value pairs for filtering\n- **Logs** - Timestamped events within a span\n\n## Jaeger Setup\n\n### Kubernetes Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy Jaeger Operator\nkubectl create namespace observability\nkubectl create -f https://github.com/jaegertracing/jaeger-operator/releases/download/v1.51.0/jaeger-operator.yaml -n observability\n\n# Deploy Jaeger instance\nkubectl apply -f - <<EOF\napiVersion: jaegertracing.io/v1\nkind: Jaeger\nmetadata:\n  name: jaeger\n  namespace: observability\nspec:\n  strategy: production\n  storage:\n    type: elasticsearch\n    options:\n      es:\n        server-urls: http://elasticsearch:9200\n  ingress:\n    enabled: true\nEOF\n```\n\n### Docker Compose\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\nservices:\n  jaeger:\n    image: jaegertracing/all-in-one:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"5775:5775/udp\"\n      - \"6831:6831/udp\"\n      - \"6832:6832/udp\"\n      - \"5778:5778\"\n      - \"16686:16686\"  # UI\n      - \"14268:14268\"  # Collector\n      - \"14250:14250\"  # gRPC\n      - \"9411:9411\"    # Zipkin\n    environment:\n      - COLLECTOR_ZIPKIN_HOST_PORT=:9411\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/jaeger-setup.md`\n\n## Application Instrumentation\n\n### OpenTelemetry (Recommended)\n\n#### Python (Flask)\n```python\nfrom opentelemetry import trace\nfrom opentelemetry.exporter.jaeger.thrift import JaegerExporter\nfrom opentelemetry.sdk.resources import SERVICE_NAME, Resource\nfrom opentelemetry.sdk.trace import TracerProvider\nfrom opentelemetry.sdk.trace.export import BatchSpanProcessor\nfrom opentelemetry.instrumentation.flask import FlaskInstrumentor\nfrom flask import Flask\n\n# Initialize tracer\nresource = Resource(attributes={SERVICE_NAME: \"my-service\"})\nprovider = TracerProvider(resource=resource)\nprocessor = BatchSpanProcessor(JaegerExporter(\n    agent_host_name=\"jaeger\",\n    agent_port=6831,\n))\nprovider.add_span_processor(processor)\ntrace.set_tracer_provider(provider)\n\n# Instrument Flask\napp = Flask(__name__)\nFlaskInstrumentor().instrument_app(app)\n\n@app.route(''/api/users'')\ndef get_users():\n    tracer = trace.get_tracer(__name__)\n\n    with tracer.start_as_current_span(\"get_users\") as span:\n        span.set_attribute(\"user.count\", 100)\n        # Business logic\n        users = fetch_users_from_db()\n        return {\"users\": users}\n\ndef fetch_users_from_db():\n    tracer = trace.get_tracer(__name__)\n\n    with tracer.start_as_current_span(\"database_query\") as span:\n        span.set_attribute(\"db.system\", \"postgresql\")\n        span.set_attribute(\"db.statement\", \"SELECT * FROM users\")\n        # Database query\n        return query_database()\n```\n\n#### Node.js (Express)\n```javascript\nconst { NodeTracerProvider } = require(''@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-node'');\nconst { JaegerExporter } = require(''@opentelemetry/exporter-jaeger'');\nconst { BatchSpanProcessor } = require(''@opentelemetry/sdk-trace-base'');\nconst { registerInstrumentations } = require(''@opentelemetry/instrumentation'');\nconst { HttpInstrumentation } = require(''@opentelemetry/instrumentation-http'');\nconst { ExpressInstrumentation } = require(''@opentelemetry/instrumentation-express'');\n\n// Initialize tracer\nconst provider = new NodeTracerProvider({\n  resource: { attributes: { ''service.name'': ''my-service'' } }\n});\n\nconst exporter = new JaegerExporter({\n  endpoint: ''http://jaeger:14268/api/traces''\n});\n\nprovider.addSpanProcessor(new BatchSpanProcessor(exporter));\nprovider.register();\n\n// Instrument libraries\nregisterInstrumentations({\n  instrumentations: [\n    new HttpInstrumentation(),\n    new ExpressInstrumentation(),\n  ],\n});\n\nconst express = require(''express'');\nconst app = express();\n\napp.get(''/api/users'', async (req, res) => {\n  const tracer = trace.getTracer(''my-service'');\n  const span = tracer.startSpan(''get_users'');\n\n  try {\n    const users = await fetchUsers();\n    span.setAttributes({ ''user.count'': users.length });\n    res.json({ users });\n  } finally {\n    span.end();\n  }\n});\n```\n\n#### Go\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n    \"context\"\n    \"go.opentelemetry.io/otel\"\n    \"go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/jaeger\"\n    \"go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/resource\"\n    sdktrace \"go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace\"\n    semconv \"go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.4.0\"\n)\n\nfunc initTracer() (*sdktrace.TracerProvider, error) {\n    exporter, err := jaeger.New(jaeger.WithCollectorEndpoint(\n        jaeger.WithEndpoint(\"http://jaeger:14268/api/traces\"),\n    ))\n    if err != nil {\n        return nil, err\n    }\n\n    tp := sdktrace.NewTracerProvider(\n        sdktrace.WithBatcher(exporter),\n        sdktrace.WithResource(resource.NewWithAttributes(\n            semconv.SchemaURL,\n            semconv.ServiceNameKey.String(\"my-service\"),\n        )),\n    )\n\n    otel.SetTracerProvider(tp)\n    return tp, nil\n}\n\nfunc getUsers(ctx context.Context) ([]User, error) {\n    tracer := otel.Tracer(\"my-service\")\n    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, \"get_users\")\n    defer span.End()\n\n    span.SetAttributes(attribute.String(\"user.filter\", \"active\"))\n\n    users, err := fetchUsersFromDB(ctx)\n    if err != nil {\n        span.RecordError(err)\n        return nil, err\n    }\n\n    span.SetAttributes(attribute.Int(\"user.count\", len(users)))\n    return users, nil\n}\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/instrumentation.md`\n\n## Context Propagation\n\n### HTTP Headers\n```\ntraceparent: 00-0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-b7ad6b7169203331-01\ntracestate: congo=t61rcWkgMzE\n```\n\n### Propagation in HTTP Requests\n\n#### Python\n```python\nfrom opentelemetry.propagate import inject\n\nheaders = {}\ninject(headers)  # Injects trace context\n\nresponse = requests.get(''http://downstream-service/api'', headers=headers)\n```\n\n#### Node.js\n```javascript\nconst { propagation } = require(''@opentelemetry/api'');\n\nconst headers = {};\npropagation.inject(context.active(), headers);\n\naxios.get(''http://downstream-service/api'', { headers });\n```\n\n## Tempo Setup (Grafana)\n\n### Kubernetes Deployment\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: tempo-config\ndata:\n  tempo.yaml: |\n    server:\n      http_listen_port: 3200\n\n    distributor:\n      receivers:\n        jaeger:\n          protocols:\n            thrift_http:\n            grpc:\n        otlp:\n          protocols:\n            http:\n            grpc:\n\n    storage:\n      trace:\n        backend: s3\n        s3:\n          bucket: tempo-traces\n          endpoint: s3.amazonaws.com\n\n    querier:\n      frontend_worker:\n        frontend_address: tempo-query-frontend:9095\n---\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: tempo\nspec:\n  replicas: 1\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: tempo\n        image: grafana/tempo:latest\n        args:\n          - -config.file=/etc/tempo/tempo.yaml\n        volumeMounts:\n        - name: config\n          mountPath: /etc/tempo\n      volumes:\n      - name: config\n        configMap:\n          name: tempo-config\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/jaeger-config.yaml.template`\n\n## Sampling Strategies\n\n### Probabilistic Sampling\n```yaml\n# Sample 1% of traces\nsampler:\n  type: probabilistic\n  param: 0.01\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Sampling\n```yaml\n# Sample max 100 traces per second\nsampler:\n  type: ratelimiting\n  param: 100\n```\n\n### Adaptive Sampling\n```python\nfrom opentelemetry.sdk.trace.sampling import ParentBased, TraceIdRatioBased\n\n# Sample based on trace ID (deterministic)\nsampler = ParentBased(root=TraceIdRatioBased(0.01))\n```\n\n## Trace Analysis\n\n### Finding Slow Requests\n\n**Jaeger Query:**\n```\nservice=my-service\nduration > 1s\n```\n\n### Finding Errors\n\n**Jaeger Query:**\n```\nservice=my-service\nerror=true\ntags.http.status_code >= 500\n```\n\n### Service Dependency Graph\n\nJaeger automatically generates service dependency graphs showing:\n- Service relationships\n- Request rates\n- Error rates\n- Average latencies\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Sample appropriately** (1-10% in production)\n2. **Add meaningful tags** (user_id, request_id)\n3. **Propagate context** across all service boundaries\n4. **Log exceptions** in spans\n5. **Use consistent naming** for operations\n6. **Monitor tracing overhead** (<1% CPU impact)\n7. **Set up alerts** for trace errors\n8. **Implement distributed context** (baggage)\n9. **Use span events** for important milestones\n10. **Document instrumentation** standards\n\n## Integration with Logging\n\n### Correlated Logs\n```python\nimport logging\nfrom opentelemetry import trace\n\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\ndef process_request():\n    span = trace.get_current_span()\n    trace_id = span.get_span_context().trace_id\n\n    logger.info(\n        \"Processing request\",\n        extra={\"trace_id\": format(trace_id, ''032x'')}\n    )\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**No traces appearing:**\n- Check collector endpoint\n- Verify network connectivity\n- Check sampling configuration\n- Review application logs\n\n**High latency overhead:**\n- Reduce sampling rate\n- Use batch span processor\n- Check exporter configuration\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/jaeger-setup.md` - Jaeger installation\n- `references/instrumentation.md` - Instrumentation patterns\n- `assets/jaeger-config.yaml.template` - Jaeger configuration\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `prometheus-configuration` - For metrics\n- `grafana-dashboards` - For visualization\n- `slo-implementation` - For latency SLOs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:38:52.960Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Observability Agents requiring advanced request flow visibility across microservices with Jaeger and Tempo.","zh":"适用于需要在Jaeger和Tempo中跨微服务进行高级请求流可见性的可观察性代理。","ja":"JaegerおよびTempoを使用してマイクロサービス間のリクエストフローの可視性が必要な観測可能エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Jaeger와 Tempo를 사용하여 마이크로 서비스 간의 요청 흐름 가시성이 필요한 관찰 가능한 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Observabilidad que requieren visibilidad avanzada del flujo de solicitudes a través de microservicios con Jaeger y Tempo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''observabilité nécessitant une visibilité avancée du flux de requêtes à travers les microservices avec Jaeger et Tempo.","de":"Ideal für Observability-Agents, die eine erweiterte Sichtbarkeit des Anforderungsflusses über Mikrodienste mit Jaeger und Tempo erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Observabilidade que exigem visibilidade avançada do fluxo de solicitações em microsserviços com Jaeger e Tempo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов наблюдения, требующих расширенной видимости потока запросов в микросервисах с Jaeger и Tempo.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المراقبة الذي يتطلب رؤية متقدمة لتدفق الطلبات عبر الخدمات المصغرة مع Jaeger و Tempo."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement distributed tracing, providing end-to-end visibility into request flows using protocols like Jaeger and Tempo, and enabling actionable insights for microservice optimization.","zh":"使代理能够实现分布式跟踪，使用Jaeger和Tempo等协议提供对请求流的端到端可见性，并为微服务优化启用可行的见解。","ja":"エージェントがJaegerやTempoなどのプロトコルを使用して分散トレーシングを実装できるようにし、リクエストフローのエンドツーエンドの可視性を提供し、マイクロサービス最適化のための実行可能なインサイトを有効にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Jaeger 및 Tempo와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 분산 트레이싱을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 요청 흐름에 대한 종단 간 가시성을 제공하고 마이크로 서비스 최적화를 위한 실행 가능한 통찰력을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar un seguimiento distribuido, proporcionando visibilidad de extremo a extremo de los flujos de solicitudes utilizando protocolos como Jaeger y Tempo, y permitiendo información accionable para la optimización de microservicios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre un traçage distribué, fournissant une visibilité de bout en bout des flux de requêtes en utilisant des protocoles tels que Jaeger et Tempo, et permettant des informations exploitables pour l''optimisation des microservices.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein verteiltes Tracing umzusetzen, bietet eine durchgängige Sichtbarkeit der Anforderungsflüsse unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Jaeger und Tempo und ermöglicht handhabbare Erkenntnisse für die Optimierung von Mikrodiensten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar rastreamento distribuído, fornecendo visibilidade de ponta a ponta nos fluxos de solicitações usando protocolos como Jaeger e Tempo, e permitindo insights ações para otimização de microsserviços.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать распределенное трассирование, обеспечивая видимость от начала до конца потоков запросов с использованием протоколов, таких как Jaeger и Tempo, и позволяя получить действенные идеи для оптимизации микросервисов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ التتبع الموزع، وتوفير رؤية شاملة لتدفقات الطلبات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Jaeger و Tempo، وتمكين رؤى يمكن تنفيذها لتحسين الخدمات المصغرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracing request flows across multiple microservices","Debugging latency issues with Tempo","Visualizing service dependencies with Jaeger"],"zh":["跨多个微服务跟踪请求流","使用Tempo调试延迟问题","使用Jaeger可视化服务依赖关系"],"ja":["複数のマイクロサービス間のリクエストフローのトレース","Tempoを使用した遅延問題のデバッグ","Jaegerを使用したサービス依存関係の視覚化"],"ko":["여러 마이크로 서비스 간의 요청 흐름 추적","Tempo를 사용하여 대기 시간 문제를 디버깅","Jaeger를 사용하여 서비스 종속성 시각화"],"es":["Seguimiento de flujos de solicitudes a través de varios microservicios","Depuración de problemas de latencia con Tempo","Visualización de dependencias de servicios con Jaeger"],"fr":["Traçage des flux de requêtes à travers plusieurs microservices","Débogage des problèmes de latence avec Tempo","Visualisation des dépendances de service avec Jaeger"],"de":["Nachverfolgung von Anforderungsflüssen über mehrere Mikrodienste","Fehlerbehebung von Latenzproblemen mit Tempo","Visualisierung von Service-Abhängigkeiten mit Jaeger"],"pt":["Rastrear fluxos de solicitações em vários microsserviços","Depurar problemas de latência com Tempo","Visualizar dependências de serviço com Jaeger"],"ru":["Отслеживать потоки запросов в нескольких микросервисах","Отлаживать проблемы задержки с Tempo","Визуализировать зависимости служб с Jaeger"],"ar":["تتبع تدفقات الطلبات عبر خدمات مصغرة متعددة","تصحيح أخطاء في التأخير مع Tempo","تمثيل зависимости الخدمة باستخدام Jaeger"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to distributed tracing","Limited to Jaeger and Tempo tools"],"zh":["任务必须与分布式跟踪相关","仅限Jaeger和Tempo工具"],"ja":["タスクは分散トレーシングに関連している必要がある","JaegerおよびTempoツールのみに限定される"],"ko":["작업은 분산 트레이싱과 관련되어야 함","Jaeger 및 Tempo 도구만 제한됨"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con el seguimiento distribuido","Limitado a las herramientas Jaeger y Tempo"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée au traçage distribué","Limité aux outils Jaeger et Tempo"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit dem verteilten Tracing zusammenhängen","Begrenzt auf die Tools Jaeger und Tempo"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao rastreamento distribuído","Limitado às ferramentas Jaeger e Tempo"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с распределенным трассированием","Ограничен инструментами Jaeger и Tempo"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بالتتبع الموزع","محدود بأدوات Jaeger و Tempo"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
