e quantização","Otimização do uso de memória","Redução da latência de busca","Equilíbrio entre recall e velocidade","Escala para bilhões de vetores"],"ru":["Настройка параметров HNSW","Реализация квантования","Оптимизация использования памяти","Снижение задержки поиска","Балансировка recall и скорости","Масштабирование до миллиардов векторов"],"ar":["ضبط معاملات HNSW","تنفيذ الكمية","تحسين استخدام الذاكرة","تقليل تأخير البحث","توازن بين استدعاء السرعة","التوسع إلى مليارات المتجهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["向量索引","索引优化","搜索性能","HNSW","量化","内存优化","搜索延迟","召回率","速度优化"],"ja":["ベクトルインデックス","インデックス最適化","検索性能","HNSW","量化","メモリ最適化","検索遅延","リコール","速度最適化"],"ko":["벡터 인덱스","인덱스 최적화","검색 성능","HNSW","양자화","메모리 최적화","검색 지연","리콜","속도 최적화"],"es":["índices vectoriales","rendimiento en producción","ajuste de parámetros","cuantización","optimización de memoria","reducir latencia de búsqueda","equilibrio recall y velocidad","escalabilidad de vectores"],"fr":["index vectoriels","performances en production","ajustement de paramètres","quantification","optimisation de la mémoire","réduire la latence de recherche","équilibre rappel et vitesse","évolutivité des vecteurs"],"de":["Vektor-Indizes","Leistung in der Produktion","Anpassung von Parametern","Quantisierung","Optimierung des Speicherbedarfs","Reduzierung der Suchlatenz","Ausgleich zwischen Recall und Geschwindigkeit","Skalierbarkeit von Vektoren"],"pt":["otimização de índices vetoriais","desempenho em produção","parâmetros HNSW","quantização","uso de memória","latência de busca","recall","velocidade","bilhões de vetores"],"ru":["настройка векторных индексов","производительность","параметры HNSW","квантование","использование памяти","задержка поиска","recall","скорость","миллиарды векторов"],"ar":["تحسين فهرس المتجهات","أداء الإنتاج","معاملات HNSW","الكمية","استخدام الذاكرة","تأخير البحث","استدعاء","السرعة","مليارات المتجهات"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.398Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vector-index-tuning","description":"Optimize vector index performance for latency, recall, and memory. Use when tuning HNSW parameters, selecting quantization strategies, or scaling vector search infrastructure.","bodyPreview":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need exact search on small datasets (use a flat index)\n- You lack workload metrics or ground truth to validate recall\n- You need end-to-end retrieval system design beyond index tun","body":"# Vector Index Tuning\n\nGuide to optimizing vector indexes for production performance.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Tuning HNSW parameters\n- Implementing quantization\n- Optimizing memory usage\n- Reducing search latency\n- Balancing recall vs speed\n- Scaling to billions of vectors\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You only need exact search on small datasets (use a flat index)\n- You lack workload metrics or ground truth to validate recall\n- You need end-to-end retrieval system design beyond index tuning\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Gather workload targets (latency, recall, QPS), data size, and memory budget.\n2. Choose an index type and establish a baseline with default parameters.\n3. Benchmark parameter sweeps using real queries and track recall, latency, and memory.\n4. Validate changes on a staging dataset before rolling out to production.\n\nRefer to `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Avoid reindexing in production without a rollback plan.\n- Validate changes under realistic load before applying globally.\n- Track recall regressions and revert if quality drops.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns, checklists, and templates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:40:06.884Z","qualityScore":40}');
