Integração com outras ferramentas de SEO"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных стратегий контента","Анализ ключевых слов и тенденций поиска","Оптимизация контента для улучшения онлайн-видимости","Инструменты планирования и организации контента","Интеграция с другими инструментами SEO"],"ar":["إنشاء استراتيجيات المحتوى المخصصة","تحليل الكلمات الرئيسية وتوجهات البحث","تحسين المحتوى لتحسين الرؤية عبر الإنترنت","أدوات تخطيط وتنظيم المحتوى","التكامل مع أدوات تحسين محركات البحث الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO","内容规划","搜索引擎排名","网站优化","开发者工具","内容生成"],"ja":["SEO","コンテンツプランナー","検索エンジンのランキング","ウェブサイト最適化","開発者ツール","コンテンツ生成"],"ko":["SEO","콘텐츠 플래너","검색 엔진 순위","웹사이트 최적화","개발자 도구","콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["planificador de contenido SEO","optimización de contenido","palabras clave","visibilidad en motores de búsqueda","posicionamiento en Google","contenido de calidad"],"fr":["planificateur de contenu SEO","optimisation de contenu","mots-clés","visibilité sur les moteurs de recherche","positionnement sur Google","contenu de qualité"],"de":["SEO-Inhaltsplaner","Inhaltsoptimierung","Schlüsselwörter","Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen","Positionierung in Google","inhaltsqualität"],"pt":["planejador de conteúdo de SEO","otimização de conteúdo","visibilidade online","estratégias de conteúdo","palavras-chave","tendências de busca"],"ru":["планировщик контента SEO","оптимизация контента","онлайн-видимость","стратегии контента","ключевые слова","тенденции поиска"],"ar":["مخطط محتوى تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين المحتوى","الرؤية عبر الإنترنت","استراتيجيات المحتوى","الكلمات الرئيسية","توجهات البحث"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-content-planner","description":"Creates comprehensive content outlines and topic clusters for SEO.","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an SEO content strategist creating comprehensive content plans and outlines.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Topic cluster planning\n- Content gap identification\n- Comprehensive outline creation\n- Content calendar development\n- Search intent mapping\n- Topic depth analysis\n- Pillar content strategy\n- Supporting content ideas\n\n## Planning Framework\n\n**Content Outline Structure:**\n- Main topic and angle\n- Target audience definition\n- Search intent alignment\n- Primary/secondary keywords\n- Detailed section breakdown\n- Word count targets\n- Internal linking opportunities\n\n**Topic Cluster Components:**\n- Pillar page (comprehensive guide)\n- Supporting articles (subtopics)\n- FAQ and glossary content\n- Related how-to guides\n- Case studies and examples\n- Comparison/versus content\n- Tool and resource pages\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Analyze main topic comprehensively\n2. Identify subtopics and angles\n3. Map search intent variations\n4. Create detailed outline structure\n5. Plan internal linking strategy\n6. Suggest content formats\n7. Prioritize creation order\n\n## Output\n\n**Content Outline:**\n```\nTitle: [Main Topic]\nIntent: [Informational/Commercial/Transactional]\nWord Count: [Target]\n\nI. Introduction\n   - Hook\n   - Value proposition\n   - Overview\n\nII. Main Section 1\n    A. Subtopic\n    B. Subtopic\n    \nIII. Main Section 2\n    [etc.]\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Detailed content outline\n- Topic cluster map\n- Keyword targeting plan\n- Content calendar (30-60 days)\n- Internal linking blueprint\n- Content format recommendations\n- Priority scoring for topics\n\n**Content Calendar Format:**\n- Week 1-4 breakdown\n- Topic + target keyword\n- Content type/format\n- Word count target\n- Internal link targets\n- Publishing priority\n\nFocus on comprehensive coverage and logical content progression. Plan for topical authority.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:40:25.181Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for SEO-focused Content Agents planning data-driven content strategies.","zh":"Essential for SEO-focused Content Agents planning data-driven content strategies.","ja":"Essential for SEO-focused Content Agents planning data-driven content strategies.","ko":"Essential for SEO-focused Content Agents planning data-driven content strategies.","es":"Esencial para agentes de contenido centrados en SEO que planean estrategias de contenido basadas en datos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de contenu axés sur le SEO qui planifient des stratégies de contenu basées sur les données.","de":"Wesentlich für SEO-fokussierte Content-Agenten, die datengetriebene Content-Strategien planen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Conteúdo com foco em SEO que planejam estratégias de conteúdo baseadas em dados.","ru":"Необходим для контент-агентов, ориентированных на SEO, планирующих данные, управляемые содержанием стратегий.","ar":"ضروري لموظفي المحتوى المتخصصين في تحسين محركات البحث الذين يخططون لاستراتيجيات المحتوى القائمة على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides structured frameworks for goal clarification, best practice application, and outcome validation in content planning workflows. Enables actionable step generation and checklist verification for SEO-optimized content creation.","zh":"Provides structured frameworks for goal clarification, best practice application, and outcome validation in content planning workflows. Enables actionable step generation and checklist verification for SEO-optimized content creation.","ja":"Provides structured frameworks for goal clarification, best practice application, and outcome validation in content planning workflows. Enables actionable step generation and checklist verification for SEO-optimized content creation.","ko":"Provides structured frameworks for goal clarification, best practice application, and outcome validation in content planning workflows. Enables actionable step generation and checklist verification for SEO-optimized content creation.","es":"Proporciona marcos estructurados para la clarificación de objetivos, la aplicación de las mejores prácticas y la validación de resultados en los flujos de trabajo de planificación de contenido. Permite la generación de pasos accionables y la verificación de listas de comprobación para la creación de contenido optimizado para SEO.","fr":"Fournit des cadres structurés pour la clarification des objectifs, l''application des meilleures pratiques et la validation des résultats dans les flux de travail de planification de contenu. Permet la génération d''étapes actionnables et la vérification de listes de contrôle pour la création de contenu optimisé pour le SEO.","de":"Bietet strukturierte Rahmenbedingungen für die Klärung von Zielen, die Anwendung von Best Practices und die Überprüfung von Ergebnissen in Content-Planungsworkflows. Ermöglicht die Generierung von umsetzbaren Schritten und die Überprüfung von Checklisten für die Erstellung von SEO-optimiertem Content.","pt":"Fornece estruturas organizadas para esclarecimento de objetivos, aplicação de boas práticas e validação de resultados nos fluxos de trabalho de planejamento de conteúdo. Permite a geração de etapas realizáveis e verificação de listas de verificação para criação de conteúdo otimizado para SEO.","ru":"Предоставляет структурированные框架и для уточнения целей, применения лучших практик и проверки результатов в рабочих процессах планирования контента. Позволяет генерировать реализуемые шаги и проверку контрольных списков для создания контента, оптимизированного для SEO.","ar":"توفر إطارات منظمة لتوضيح الأهداف وتطبيق أفضل الممارسات و التحقق من النتائج في تدفقات عمل تخطيط المحتوى. تمكن من توليد خطوات يمكن تنفيذها و التحقق من قائمة التحقق لإنشاء محتوى محسّن لتحسين محركات البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Clarifying content goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to content planning","Validating content outcomes against SEO metrics","Generating actionable content planning steps"],"zh":["Clarifying content goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to content planning","Validating content outcomes against SEO metrics","Generating actionable content planning steps"],"ja":["Clarifying content goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to content planning","Validating content outcomes against SEO metrics","Generating actionable content planning steps"],"ko":["Clarifying content goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to content planning","Validating content outcomes against SEO metrics","Generating actionable content planning steps"],"es":["Clarificar metas y restricciones de contenido","Aplicar las mejores prácticas de SEO a la planificación de contenido","Validar resultados de contenido frente a métricas de SEO","Generar pasos de planificación de contenido accionables"],"fr":["Clarifier les objectifs et les contraintes de contenu","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques de SEO à la planification de contenu","Valider les résultats de contenu par rapport aux métriques de SEO","Générer des étapes de planification de contenu actionnables"],"de":[" Inhaltsziele und -beschränkungen klären","SEO-Best-Practices auf Content-Planung anwenden","Inhalts-Ergebnisse an SEO-Metriken überprüfen","Umsetzbare Content-Planungsschritte generieren"],"pt":["Esclarecer metas e restrições de conteúdo","Aplicar as melhores práticas de SEO ao planejamento de conteúdo","Validar resultados de conteúdo contra métricas de SEO","Gerar etapas de planejamento de conteúdo realizáveis"],"ru":["Уточнение целей и ограничений контента","Применение лучших практик SEO к планированию контента","Проверка результатов контента против метрик SEO","Генерирование реализуемых шагов планирования контента"],"ar":["توضيح أهداف وقيود المحتوى","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لتحسين محركات البحث في تخطيط المحتوى","التحقق من نتائج المحتوى مقابل معايير تحسين محركات البحث","توليد خطوات يمكن تنفيذها في تخطيط المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SEO content planning context","Limited to content planning scope only","Needs specific inputs for goal clarification"],"zh":["Requires SEO content planning context","Limited to content planning scope only","Needs specific inputs for goal clarification"],"ja":["Requires SEO content planning context","Limited to content planning scope only","Needs specific inputs for goal clarification"],"ko":["Requires SEO content planning context","Limited to content planning scope only","Needs specific inputs for goal clarification"],"es":["Requiere contexto de planificación de contenido de SEO","Limitado al ámbito de planificación de contenido solo","Necesita entradas específicas para la clarificación de objetivos"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de planification de contenu SEO","Limité à la portée de la planification de contenu uniquement","Nécessite des entrées spécifiques pour la clarification des objectifs"],"de":["Benötigt SEO-Content-Planungskontext","Begrenzt auf Content-Planungsbereich nur","Benötigt spezifische Eingaben für die Zielklärung"],"pt":["Requer contexto de planejamento de conteúdo de SEO","Limitado ao escopo de planejamento de conteúdo apenas","Necessita de entradas específicas para esclarecimento de objetivos"],"ru":["Требует контекста планирования контента SEO","Ограничен только объемом планирования контента","Требует конкретных входных данных для уточнения целей"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تخطيط محتوى تحسين محركات البحث","محدود بنطاق تخطيط المحتوى فقط","يحتاج إلى مدخلات محددة لتوضيح الأهداف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
