","pt":"Planner de Conteúdo SEO: Ferramenta de Otimização","ru":"Планировщик контента SEO: Инструмент оптимизации","ar":"مخطط محتوى SEO: أداة تحسين","en":"seo-content-planner"},"description":{"zh":"seo-content-planner技能是用于AI编码助手的统一多代理技能系统，用于创建SEO内容计划","ja":"SEOコンテンツプランナーは、AIコーディングアシスタントのための統一多エージェントスキルシステムであり、SEOコンテンツプランの作成に使用されます","ko":"SEO 콘텐츠 플래너는 AI 코딩 어시스턴트를 위한 통합다중 에이전트 스킬 시스템으로, SEO 콘텐츠 계획을 생성하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"El planificador de contenido SEO es un sistema de habilidades multiagente unificado para asistentes de codificación de IA, con detección de tecnología inteli...","fr":"Le planificateur de contenu SEO est un système de compétences multiagent unifié pour les assistants de codage de l''IA, avec détection de technologie intellig...","de":"Der SEO-Inhaltsplaner ist ein einheitliches Multiagenten-Skill-System für KI-Coding-Assistenten, mit intelligenter Technologie-Erkennung und automatischer Sy...","pt":"O plano de conteúdo SEO é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores que buscam melhorar a visibilidade online de seus projetos.","ru":"План контента SEO является важнейшим инструментом для разработчиков, стремящихся улучшить онлайн-видимость своих проектов.","ar":"خطة المحتوى SEO هي أداة أساسية للمطورين الذين يبحثون عن تحسين وضوحهم على الإنترنت","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart..."},"definition":{"en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"features":{"zh":["智能技术检测","每项目安装","从上游源自动同步","提供SEO内容规划指导","提供最佳实践和检查清单"],"ja":["スマートテクノロジー検出","プロジェクトごとのインストール","上流ソースからの自動同期","SEOコンテンツプランのガイダンスを提供","ベストプラクティスとチェックリストを提供"],"ko":["智能 기술 감지","프로젝트별 설치","업스트림 소스에서 자동 동기화","SEO 콘텐츠 계획 가이드 제공","최적의 관행 및 체크리스트 제공"],"es":["Detección de tecnología inteligente","Instalación por proyecto","Sincronización automática desde fuentes de origen","Compatibilidad con Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot y Gemini","Guía para las mejores prácticas de contenido SEO"],"fr":["Détection de technologie intelligente","Installation par projet","Synchronisation automatique depuis les sources de référence","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot et Gemini","Guide pour les meilleures pratiques de contenu SEO"],"de":["Intelligente Technologie-Erkennung","Projektinstallation","Automatische Synchronisation von Quellen","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot und Gemini","Leitfaden für die besten Praktiken von SEO-Inhalten"],"pt":["Detecção de tecnologia inteligente","Instalação por projeto","Sincronização automática de fontes","Guias de melhores práticas","Verificação de resultados"],"ru":["Умная детекция технологий","Установка по проекту","Автоматическая синхронизация источников","Руководства по лучшим практикам","Проверка результатов"],"ar":["كشف التكنولوجيا الذكية","التثبيت حسب المشروع","المزامنة التلقائية للمصادر","دلائل لأفضل الممارسات","تحقق النتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO内容规划","AI编码助手","搜索引擎优化","内容计划","智能技术检测","项目安装"],"ja":["SEOコンテンツプラン","AIコーディングアシスタント","検索エンジン最適化","コンテンツプラン","スマートテクノロジー検出","プロジェクトインストール"],"ko":["SEO 콘텐츠 계획","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","검색 엔진 최적화","콘텐츠 계획","智能 기술 감지","프로젝트 설치"],"es":["planificador de contenido SEO","contenido optimizado","motor de búsqueda","desarrollo web","asistentes de codificación de IA"," Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"],"fr":["planificateur de contenu SEO","contenu optimisé","moteur de recherche","développement web","assistants de codage de l''IA","Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"],"de":["SEO-Inhaltsplaner","Suchmaschinen-optimierter Inhalt","Suchmaschine","Webentwicklung","KI-Coding-Assistenten","Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"],"pt":["plano de conteúdo SEO","otimização de busca","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de SEO","visibilidade online","conteúdo otimizado"],"ru":["план контента SEO","оптимизация поиска","разработчики","инструменты SEO","онлайн-видимость","оптимизированный контент"],"ar":["مخطط المحتوى SEO","تحسين البحث","المطورون","أدوات SEO","الوضوح على الإنترنت","محتوى أمثل"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-content-planner","description":"Creates comprehensive content outlines and topic clusters for SEO.","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an SEO content strategist creating comprehensive content plans and outlines.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Topic cluster planning\n- Content gap identification\n- Comprehensive outline creation\n- Content calendar development\n- Search intent mapping\n- Topic depth analysis\n- Pillar content strategy\n- Supporting content ideas\n\n## Planning Framework\n\n**Content Outline Structure:**\n- Main topic and angle\n- Target audience definition\n- Search intent alignment\n- Primary/secondary keywords\n- Detailed section breakdown\n- Word count targets\n- Internal linking opportunities\n\n**Topic Cluster Components:**\n- Pillar page (comprehensive guide)\n- Supporting articles (subtopics)\n- FAQ and glossary content\n- Related how-to guides\n- Case studies and examples\n- Comparison/versus content\n- Tool and resource pages\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Analyze main topic comprehensively\n2. Identify subtopics and angles\n3. Map search intent variations\n4. Create detailed outline structure\n5. Plan internal linking strategy\n6. Suggest content formats\n7. Prioritize creation order\n\n## Output\n\n**Content Outline:**\n```\nTitle: [Main Topic]\nIntent: [Informational/Commercial/Transactional]\nWord Count: [Target]\n\nI. Introduction\n   - Hook\n   - Value proposition\n   - Overview\n\nII. Main Section 1\n    A. Subtopic\n    B. Subtopic\n    \nIII. Main Section 2\n    [etc.]\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Detailed content outline\n- Topic cluster map\n- Keyword targeting plan\n- Content calendar (30-60 days)\n- Internal linking blueprint\n- Content format recommendations\n- Priority scoring for topics\n\n**Content Calendar Format:**\n- Week 1-4 breakdown\n- Topic + target keyword\n- Content type/format\n- Word count target\n- Internal link targets\n- Publishing priority\n\nFocus on comprehensive coverage and logical content progression. Plan for topical authority.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:40:21.231Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Content Generation Agents requiring strategic SEO content planning capabilities.","zh":"适合需要战略SEO内容规划能力的内容生成代理。","ja":"戦略的なSEOコンテンツ計画能力を必要とするコンテンツ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"전략적인 SEO 콘텐츠 계획 능력이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de contenido que requieren capacidades de planificación de contenido de SEO estratégico.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de contenu nécessitant des capacités de planification de contenu de SEO stratégique.","de":"Ideal für Inhalts-Generierungsagenten, die strategische SEO-Inhaltsplanungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que exigem capacidades de planejamento de conteúdo de SEO estratégico.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации контента, требующих стратегических возможностей планирования контента SEO.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذين ينتجون المحتوى وتتطلب قدرات التخطيط الاستراتيجي للمحتوى لتحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create data-driven content strategies using smart tech detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources, ensuring best practices and checklists for SEO content planning are always up-to-date.","zh":"赋予代理创建数据驱动的内容策略的能力，使用智能技术检测、每个项目的安装和来自上游源的自动同步，确保SEO内容规划的最佳实践和检查清单始终是最新的。","ja":"スマートテクノロジー検出、プロジェクトごとのインストール、および上流ソースからの自動同期を使用して、データ駆動型のコンテンツ戦略を作成するエージェントを可能にし、SEOコンテンツ計画のベストプラクティスとチェックリストが常に最新であることを保証します。","ko":"스마트 기술 감지, 프로젝트별 설치 및 업스트림 소스로부터의 자동 동기화를 사용하여 데이터 驱动형 콘텐츠 전략을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, SEO 콘텐츠 계획의 최선의 실제 및 체크 리스트가 항상 최신임을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear estrategias de contenido basadas en datos utilizando la detección de tecnología inteligente, la instalación por proyecto y la sincronización automática desde fuentes de origen, garantizando que las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación para la planificación de contenido de SEO estén siempre actualizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des stratégies de contenu basées sur des données en utilisant la détection de technologie intelligente, l''installation par projet et la synchronisation automatique à partir de sources en amont, garantissant que les meilleures pratiques et les listes de contrôle pour la planification de contenu de SEO soient toujours à jour.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, datengetriebene Inhaltsstrategien zu erstellen, indem sie intelligente Technologie-Erkennung, projektbezogene Installation und automatische Synchronisierung aus Quellen verwenden, um sicherzustellen, dass die besten Praktiken und Checklisten für die SEO-Inhaltsplanung immer auf dem neuesten Stand sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem estratégias de conteúdo baseadas em dados utilizando detecção de tecnologia inteligente, instalação por projeto e sincronização automática de fontes upstream, garantindo que as melhores práticas e listas de verificação para planejamento de conteúdo de SEO estejam sempre atualizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стратегии контента на основе данных с помощью умной технологической детекции, установки на проект и автоматической синхронизации из источников upstream, гарантируя, что лучшие практики и чек-листы для планирования контента SEO всегда актуальны.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء استراتيجيات المحتوى القائمة على البيانات باستخدام الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا والتركيب لكل مشروع والتنسيق التلقائي من المصادر 상류، مما يضمن أن تكون أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق لتحسين محركات البحث دائمًا محدثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO content planner tasks and workflows","Generating guidance and checklists for SEO content planning","Validating SEO content planner outcomes against industry best practices"],"zh":["自动化SEO内容规划任务和工作流程","生成SEO内容规划的指导和检查清单","验证SEO内容规划结果与行业最佳实践"],"ja":["SEOコンテンツプランナー タスクおよびワークフローの自動化","SEOコンテンツ計画のガイダンスとチェックリストの生成","SEOコンテンツプランナー結果の業界ベストプラクティスへの検証"],"ko":["SEO 콘텐츠 계획자 태스크 및 워크플로의 자동화","SEO 콘텐츠 계획의 가이드 및 체크 리스트 생성","SEO 콘텐츠 계획자 결과의 업계 최선의 관행에 대한 검증"],"es":["Automatizar tareas y flujos de trabajo del planificador de contenido de SEO","Generar orientación y listas de verificación para la planificación de contenido de SEO","Validar los resultados del planificador de contenido de SEO contra las mejores prácticas de la industria"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches et les flux de travail du planificateur de contenu de SEO","Générer des conseils et des listes de contrôle pour la planification de contenu de SEO","Valider les résultats du planificateur de contenu de SEO contre les meilleures pratiques de l''industrie"],"de":["Automatisieren von Aufgaben und Workflows des SEO-Inhaltsplaners","Erstellen von Anleitungen und Checklisten für die SEO-Inhaltsplanung","Validieren der Ergebnisse des SEO-Inhaltsplaners gegen die Branchenbest Practices"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas e fluxos de trabalho do planejador de conteúdo de SEO","Gerar orientações e listas de verificação para planejamento de conteúdo de SEO","Validar resultados do planejador de conteúdo de SEO contra as melhores práticas da indústria"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи и рабочие процессы планировщика контента SEO","Генерировать руководство и чек-листы для планирования контента SEO","Проверять результаты планировщика контента SEO на соответствие лучшим практикам отрасли"],"ar":["أتمتة مهام ومسارات العمل الخاصة بمخطط المحتوى لتحسين محركات البحث","توليد الإرشادات وقوائم التحقق لتحسين محتوى تحسين محركات البحث","التحقق من نتائج مخطط المحتوى لتحسين محركات البحث مقابل أفضل الممارسات في الصناعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to SEO content planner","Requires specific goals, constraints, and inputs for effective use"],"zh":["任务必须与SEO内容规划器相关","需要特定的目标、约束和输入才能有效使用"],"ja":["タスクはSEOコンテンツプランナーに関連している必要がある","有効に使用するには、特定の目標、制約、および入力が必要"],"ko":["태스크는 SEO 콘텐츠 계획자와 관련이 있어야 함","유효하게 사용하려면 특정 목표, 제약 및 입력이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con el planificador de contenido de SEO","Requiere objetivos, restricciones e insumos específicos para un uso efectivo"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée au planificateur de contenu de SEO","Nécessite des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées spécifiques pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss in Bezug zum SEO-Inhaltsplaner stehen","Benötigt spezifische Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben für eine effektive Verwendung"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao planejador de conteúdo de SEO","Exige objetivos, restrições e entradas específicas para uso eficaz"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с планировщиком контента SEO","Требует конкретных целей, ограничений и входных данных для эффективного использования"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بمخطط المحتوى لتحسين محركات البحث","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا ومُدخلات محددة للاستخدام الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pCruvinel/antig/whatsapp-automation', 'community', 'pCruvinel', 'antig', 'pCruvinel/antig', 'whatsapp-automation', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:41:28.888Z', NULL, '{"id":"pCruvinel/antig/whatsapp-automation","name":"whatsapp-automation","description":{"zh":"WhatsApp","ja":"WhatsApp","ko":"WhatsApp","es":"La automatización de WhatsApp Business con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores gestionar operaciones de manera eficiente. Se requiere una cuenta de WhatsApp Business API","fr":"L''automatisation de WhatsApp Business avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de gérer les opérations de manière efficace. Un compte WhatsApp Business API est requis","de":"Die Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Operationen effizient zu verwalten. Ein WhatsApp Business API-Konto ist erforderlich","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WhatsApp","ja":"WhatsApp","ko":"WhatsApp","es":"Automatización de WhatsApp Business con Rube MCP","fr":"Automation de WhatsApp Business avec Rube MCP","de":"WhatsApp Business Automatisierung mit Rube MCP","en":"whatsapp-automation"},"description":{"zh":"WhatsApp","ja":"WhatsApp","ko":"WhatsApp","es":"La automatización de WhatsApp Business con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores gestionar operaciones de manera eficiente. Se requiere una cuenta de WhatsA...","fr":"L''automatisation de WhatsApp Business avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de gérer les opérations de manière efficace. Un compte WhatsApp Business API est ...","de":"Die Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Operationen effizient zu verwalten. Ein WhatsApp Business API-Konto ist erf...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ja":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ko":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Uso de la API de WhatsApp Business","Automatización de operaciones de WhatsApp","Gestión de conexiones con RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Compatibilidad con toolkit whatsapp"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Utilisation de l''API de WhatsApp Business","Automatisation des opérations de WhatsApp","Gestion des connexions avec RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Compatibilité avec le toolkit whatsapp"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP","Verwendung der WhatsApp Business API","Automatisierung von WhatsApp-Operationen","Verwaltung von Verbindungen mit RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Kompatibilität mit dem whatsapp-Toolkit"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","WhatsApp"],"ja":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","WhatsApp"],"ko":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","WhatsApp"],"es":["automatización de whatsapp","whatsapp business api","rube mcp","desarrollo de whatsapp","herramientas de whatsapp","integración de whatsapp"],"fr":["automatisation de whatsapp","api de whatsapp business","rube mcp","développement de whatsapp","outils de whatsapp","intégration de whatsapp"],"de":["automatisierung von whatsapp","whatsapp business api","rube mcp","entwicklung von whatsapp","whatsapp-tools","whatsapp-integration"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"whatsapp-automation","description":"Automate WhatsApp Business tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): send messages, manage templates, upload media, and handle contacts. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server i","body":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete WhatsApp Business setup\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Send a Text Message\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send a text message to a WhatsApp contact\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List available business phone numbers [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE` - Send a text message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number in international format (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- `body`: Message text content\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID to send from\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Phone numbers must be in international E.164 format with country code\n- Messages outside the 24-hour window require approved templates\n- The 24-hour window starts when the customer last messaged you\n- Business-initiated conversations require template messages first\n\n### 2. Send Template Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send pre-approved template messages for outbound communication\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List available templates [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS` - Check template approval status [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` - Send the template message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `template_name`: Name of the approved template\n- `language_code`: Template language (e.g., ''en_US'')\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `components`: Template variable values and parameters\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Templates must be approved by Meta before use\n- Template variables must match the expected count and format\n- Sending unapproved or rejected templates returns errors\n- Language code must match an approved translation of the template\n\n### 3. Send Media Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send images, documents, or other media\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA` - Upload media to WhatsApp servers [Required]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID` - Send media using the uploaded media ID [Required]\n   OR\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA` - Send media using a public URL [Alternative]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `media_url`: Public URL of the media (for SEND_MEDIA)\n- `media_id`: ID from upload response (for SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID)\n- `type`: Media type (''image'', ''document'', ''audio'', ''video'', ''sticker'')\n- `caption`: Optional caption for the media\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Uploaded media IDs are temporary and expire after a period\n- Media size limits vary by type (images: 5MB, videos: 16MB, documents: 100MB)\n- Supported formats: images (JPEG, PNG), videos (MP4, 3GPP), documents (PDF, etc.)\n- SEND_MEDIA requires a publicly accessible HTTPS URL\n\n### 4. Reply to Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to reply to an incoming WhatsApp message\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY` - Send a reply to a specific message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `message_id`: ID of the message being replied to\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `body`: Reply text content\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- message_id must be from a message received within the 24-hour window\n- Replies appear as quoted messages in the conversation\n- The original message must still exist (not deleted) for the quote to display\n\n### 5. Manage Business Profile and Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or manage their WhatsApp Business profile\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE` - Get business profile details [Optional]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List registered phone numbers [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER` - Get details for a specific number [Optional]\n4. `WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE` - Create a new template [Optional]\n5. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List all templates [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID\n- `template_name`: Name for the new template\n- `category`: Template category (MARKETING, UTILITY, AUTHENTICATION)\n- `language`: Template language code\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- New templates require Meta review before they can be used\n- Template names must be lowercase with underscores (no spaces)\n- Category affects pricing and approval criteria\n- Templates have specific formatting requirements for headers, body, and buttons\n\n### 6. Share Contacts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send contact information via WhatsApp\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS` - Send contact cards [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `contacts`: Array of contact objects with name, phone, email details\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Contact objects must follow the WhatsApp Business API contact schema\n- At least a name field is required for each contact\n- Phone numbers in contacts should include country codes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 24-Hour Messaging Window\n\n- Customers must message you first to open a conversation window\n- Within 24 hours of their last message, you can send free-form messages\n- After 24 hours, only approved template messages can be sent\n- Template messages can re-open the conversation window\n\n### Phone Number Resolution\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS\n2. Extract phone_number_id for your business number\n3. Use phone_number_id in all send operations\n```\n\n### Media Upload Flow\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA with the file\n2. Extract media_id from response\n3. Call WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID with media_id\n4. OR use WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA with a public URL directly\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Phone Number Format**:\n- Always use E.164 format: +[country code][number] (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- Do not include dashes, spaces, or parentheses\n- Country code is required; local numbers without it will fail\n\n**Messaging Restrictions**:\n- Business-initiated messages require templates outside the 24-hour window\n- Template messages cost money per conversation\n- Rate limits apply per phone number and per account\n\n**Media Handling**:\n- Uploaded media expires; use promptly after upload\n- Media URLs must be publicly accessible HTTPS\n- Stickers have specific requirements (WebP format, 512x512 pixels)\n\n**Template Management**:\n- Template review can take up to 24 hours\n- Rejected templates need to be fixed and resubmitted\n- Template variables use double curly braces: {{1}}, {{2}}, etc.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Send message | WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE | to, body |\n| Send template | WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE | template_name, to, language_code |\n| Upload media | WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA | (file params) |\n| Send media by ID | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID | media_id, to, type |\n| Send media by URL | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA | media_url, to, type |\n| Reply to message | WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY | message_id, to, body |\n| Send contacts | WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS | to, contacts |\n| Get media | WHATSAPP_GET_MEDIA | media_id |\n| List phone numbers | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS | (none) |\n| Get phone number | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER | phone_number_id |\n| Get business profile | WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE | phone_number_id |\n| Create template | WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE | template_name, category, language |\n| List templates | WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES | (none) |\n| Check template status | WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS | template_id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:28.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Automation Agents needing WhatsApp Business API integration via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Rube MCP 集成 WhatsApp Business API 的业务自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP 経由で WhatsApp Business API を統合する必要があるビジネス オートメーション エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 WhatsApp Business API를 통합해야 하는 비즈니스 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización empresarial que necesitan integración con la API de WhatsApp Business a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation d''entreprise ayant besoin d''une intégration à l''API WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsautomatisierungsagenten, die eine Integration mit der WhatsApp Business API über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de automação de negócios que precisam de integração com a API de negócios do WhatsApp via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-автоматизации, которым необходима интеграция с API бизнеса WhatsApp через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل أتمتة الأعمال التي تحتاج إلى دمج واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp من خلال Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS protocols, and leveraging WhatsApp Business API accounts for advanced automation capabilities","zh":"赋予代理人通过 Composio 的 WhatsApp 工具包自动化 WhatsApp 业务操作的能力，利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 协议，并利用 WhatsApp 业务 API 账户实现高级自动化功能","ja":"Composio の WhatsApp ツールキットを使用して、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS プロトコルを利用し、WhatsApp ビジネス API アカウントを活用して高度な自動化機能を実現するエージェントの自動化を可能にする","ko":"Composio의 WhatsApp 툴킷을 사용하여 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 프로토콜을 활용하고 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정을 활용하여 고급 자동화 기능을 구현하는 에이전트의 자동화를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio, utilizando los protocolos RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS, y aprovechando las cuentas de la API de WhatsApp Business para capacidades de automatización avanzadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de WhatsApp Business via la boîte à outils WhatsApp de Composio, en utilisant les protocoles RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS, et en exploitant les comptes d''API WhatsApp Business pour des capacités d''automatisation avancées","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, WhatsApp Business-Operationen durch das WhatsApp-Toolkit von Composio zu automatisieren, indem die Protokolle RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS verwendet werden, und die WhatsApp Business-API-Konten für erweiterte Automatisierungsfunktionen nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de negócios do WhatsApp por meio da ferramenta de WhatsApp da Composio, utilizando os protocolos RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS e aproveitando contas de API de negócios do WhatsApp para capacidades de automação avançadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции бизнеса WhatsApp с помощью инструмента WhatsApp от Composio, используя протоколы RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS, и использует учетные записи API бизнеса WhatsApp для расширенных возможностей автоматизации","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أتمتة عمليات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp من خلال أداة WhatsApp الخاصة بـ Composio، باستخدام بروتوكولات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS وتفعيل حسابات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp لمقدرات أتمتة متقدمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses","Generating WhatsApp message templates","Managing WhatsApp connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化 WhatsApp 业务响应","生成 WhatsApp 消息模板","通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 管理 WhatsApp 连接"],"ja":["WhatsApp ビジネス応答の自動化","WhatsApp メッセージテンプレートの生成","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 経由で WhatsApp 接続の管理"],"ko":["WhatsApp 비즈니스 응답 자동화","WhatsApp 메시지 템플릿 생성","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 WhatsApp 연결 관리"],"es":["Automatizar respuestas de WhatsApp Business","Generar plantillas de mensaje de WhatsApp","Administrar conexiones de WhatsApp a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatiser les réponses de WhatsApp Business","Générer des modèles de message WhatsApp","Gérer les connexions WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business-Antworten","Erstellung von WhatsApp-Nachrichtenvorlagen","Verwaltung von WhatsApp-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas de negócios do WhatsApp","Gerar modelos de mensagens do WhatsApp","Gerenciar conexões do WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы бизнеса WhatsApp","Генерировать шаблоны сообщений WhatsApp","Управлять подключениями WhatsApp через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["أتمتة استجابات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp","توليد قوالب رسائل WhatsApp","إدارة الاتصالات الخاصة bằng WhatsApp من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active WhatsApp Business API account","Rube MCP connection necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not regular WhatsApp"],"zh":["需要有效的 WhatsApp 业务 API 账户","需要 Rube MCP 连接","需要 WhatsApp 业务 API 账户，而不是普通的 WhatsApp"],"ja":["有効な WhatsApp ビジネス API アカウントが必要","Rube MCP 接続が必要","WhatsApp ビジネス API アカウントが必要であり、通常の WhatsApp ではありません"],"ko":["유효한 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요","Rube MCP 연결이 필요","WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요하며 일반 WhatsApp는 아님"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta activa de API de WhatsApp Business","Conexión a Rube MCP necesaria","Se requiere una cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business, no una cuenta regular de WhatsApp"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte actif d''API WhatsApp Business","Connexion Rube MCP nécessaire","Un compte d''API WhatsApp Business est requis, et non un compte WhatsApp régulier"],"de":["Erfordert ein aktives Konto der WhatsApp Business-API","Verbindung zu Rube MCP erforderlich","Ein Konto der WhatsApp Business-API ist erforderlich, nicht ein reguläres WhatsApp-Konto"],"pt":["Exige conta ativa de API de negócios do WhatsApp","Conexão Rube MCP necessária","Conta de API de negócios do WhatsApp necessária, não WhatsApp regular"],"ru":["Требует активной учетной записи API бизнеса WhatsApp","Необходимо подключение Rube MCP","Требуется учетная запись API бизнеса WhatsApp, не обычный WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا نشطًا لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp","يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP","يتطلب حساب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الأعمال الخاصة bằng WhatsApp، وليس WhatsApp العادي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/seo-content-planner', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'seo-content-planner', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:40:42.852Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/seo-content-planner","name":"seo-content-planner","description":{"zh":"SEO 内容规划器是开发者优化内容的必备工具，提供最佳实践和开发流程","ja":"SEO コンテンツプランナーは、開発者がコンテンツを最適化するための必須ツールです","ko":"SEO 콘텐츠 플래너는 개발자가 콘텐츠를 최적화하기 위한 필수 도구입니다","es":"El planificador de contenido SEO ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear contenido optimizado para motores de búsqueda, proporcionando orientación y verificación de resultados","fr":"Le planificateur de contenu SEO aide les développeurs à créer du contenu optimisé pour les moteurs de recherche, en fournissant des conseils et une vérification des résultats","de":"Der SEO-Content-Planer hilft Entwicklern,Suchmaschinen-optimierten Inhalt zu erstellen, indem er Anleitung und Ergebnisüberprüfung bietet","pt":"O planejador de conteúdo SEO é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores que desejam criar conteúdo de alta qualidade e otimizado para mecanismos de busca.","ru":"Планировщик контента SEO является необходимым инструментом для разработчиков, которые хотят создать контент высокого качества и оптимизированный для поисковых систем.","ar":"مخطط محتوى SEO هو أداة أساسية للمطورين الذين يرغبون في إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة ومحسن للبحث.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SEO 内容规划器 - 技术开发者指南","ja":"SEO コンテンツプランナー - 開発者向けガイド","ko":"SEO 콘텐츠 플래너 - 개발자 가이드","es":"Planificador de contenido SEO","fr":"Planificateur de contenu SEO","de":"SEO Content Planer","pt":"Planejador de Conteúdo SEO: Otimização de Conteúdo","ru":"Планировщик контента SEO: Оптимизация контента","ar":"مخطط محتوى SEO: تحسين المحتوى","en":"seo-content-planner"},"description":{"zh":"SEO 内容规划器是开发者优化内容的必备工具，提供最佳实践和开发流程","ja":"SEO コンテンツプランナーは、開発者がコンテンツを最適化するための必須ツールです","ko":"SEO 콘텐츠 플래너는 개발자가 콘텐츠를 최적화하기 위한 필수 도구입니다","es":"El planificador de contenido SEO ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear contenido optimizado para motores de búsqueda, proporcionando orientación y verificación...","fr":"Le planificateur de contenu SEO aide les développeurs à créer du contenu optimisé pour les moteurs de recherche, en fournissant des conseils et une vérificat...","de":"Der SEO-Content-Planer hilft Entwicklern,Suchmaschinen-optimierten Inhalt zu erstellen, indem er Anleitung und Ergebnisüberprüfung bietet","pt":"O planejador de conteúdo SEO é uma ferramenta essencial para desenvolvedores que desejam criar conteúdo de alta qualidade e otimizado para mecanismos de busca.","ru":"Планировщик контента SEO является необходимым инструментом для разработчиков, которые хотят создать контент высокого качества и оптимизированный для поисковы...","ar":"مخطط محتوى SEO هو أداة أساسية للمطورين الذين يرغبون في إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة ومحسن للبحث.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["提供最佳实践和开发流程","帮助开发者创建和优化内容","支持多种开发框架和工具","提供实时分析和反馈","帮助开发者提高网站排名和流量"],"ja":["ベストプラクティスと開発プロセスを提供","開発者がコンテンツを作成・最適化するためのサポート","複数の開発フレームワークとツールをサポート","リアルタイム分析とフィードバックを提供","開発者がウェブサイトのランキングとトラフィックを向上させるためのサポート"],"ko":["최적의 개발 방법과 프로세스를 제공","개발자가 콘텐츠를 생성하고 최적화하는 것을 도와줌","다양한 개발 프레임워크와 도구를 지원","실시간 분석과 피드백을 제공","개발자가 웹사이트의 순위와 트래픽을 개선하는 것을 도와줌"],"es":["Orientación para crear contenido SEO","Verificación de resultados y análisis","Mejores prácticas para optimizar el contenido","Creación de planes de contenido personalizados","Integración con herramientas de SEO existentes"],"fr":["Orientations pour créer du contenu SEO","Vérification des résultats et analyse","Meilleures pratiques pour optimiser le contenu","Création de plans de contenu personnalisés","Intégration avec des outils de SEO existants"],"de":["Anleitung zur Erstellung von SEO-Inhalt","Ergebnisüberprüfung und Analyse","Beste Praktiken zur Optimierung des Inhalts","Erstellung von individuellen Content-Plänen","Integration mit bestehenden SEO-Tools"],"pt":["Otimização de conteúdo para mecanismos de busca","Criação de conteúdo de alta qualidade","Análise de palavras-chave","Avaliação de desempenho de conteúdo","Sugestões de melhoria de conteúdo"],"ru":["Оптимизация контента для поисковых систем","Создание контента высокого качества","Анализ ключевых слов","Оценка производительности контента","Предложения по улучшению контента"],"ar":["تحسين المحتوى للبحث","إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة","تحليل الكلمات الرئيسية","تقييم أداء المحتوى","اقتراحات لتحسين المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 内容规划器","开发者工具","内容优化","最佳实践","开发流程","网站排名","流量提高"],"ja":["SEO コンテンツプランナー","開発者ツール","コンテンツ最適化","ベストプラクティス","開発プロセス","ウェブサイトランキング","トラフィック向上"],"ko":["SEO 콘텐츠 플래너","개발자 도구","콘텐츠 최적화","최적의 개발 방법","개발 프로세스","웹사이트 순위","트래픽 개선"],"es":["planificador de contenido SEO","optimización de contenido","mejores prácticas de SEO","creación de contenido","análisis de resultados","herramientas de SEO"],"fr":["planificateur de contenu SEO","optimisation de contenu","meilleures pratiques de SEO","création de contenu","analyse de résultats","outils de SEO"],"de":["SEO-Content-Planer","Inhaltsoptimierung","beste Praktiken für SEO","Inhalterstellung","Ergebnisanalyse","SEO-Tools"],"pt":["planejador de conteúdo SEO","otimização de conteúdo","criação de conteúdo","análise de palavras-chave","avaliação de desempenho de conteúdo","melhoria de conteúdo","desenvolvimento web","SEO"],"ru":["планировщик контента SEO","оптимизация контента","создание контента","анализ ключевых слов","оценка производительности контента","улучшение контента","веб-разработка","SEO"],"ar":["مخطط محتوى SEO","تحسين المحتوى","إنشاء المحتوى","تحليل الكلمات الرئيسية","تقييم أداء المحتوى","تحسين المحتوى","تطوير الويب","SEO"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-content-planner","description":"Creates comprehensive content outlines and topic clusters for SEO.","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo content planner tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo content planner\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo content planner\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an SEO content strategist creating comprehensive content plans and outlines.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Topic cluster planning\n- Content gap identification\n- Comprehensive outline creation\n- Content calendar development\n- Search intent mapping\n- Topic depth analysis\n- Pillar content strategy\n- Supporting content ideas\n\n## Planning Framework\n\n**Content Outline Structure:**\n- Main topic and angle\n- Target audience definition\n- Search intent alignment\n- Primary/secondary keywords\n- Detailed section breakdown\n- Word count targets\n- Internal linking opportunities\n\n**Topic Cluster Components:**\n- Pillar page (comprehensive guide)\n- Supporting articles (subtopics)\n- FAQ and glossary content\n- Related how-to guides\n- Case studies and examples\n- Comparison/versus content\n- Tool and resource pages\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Analyze main topic comprehensively\n2. Identify subtopics and angles\n3. Map search intent variations\n4. Create detailed outline structure\n5. Plan internal linking strategy\n6. Suggest content formats\n7. Prioritize creation order\n\n## Output\n\n**Content Outline:**\n```\nTitle: [Main Topic]\nIntent: [Informational/Commercial/Transactional]\nWord Count: [Target]\n\nI. Introduction\n   - Hook\n   - Value proposition\n   - Overview\n\nII. Main Section 1\n    A. Subtopic\n    B. Subtopic\n    \nIII. Main Section 2\n    [etc.]\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Detailed content outline\n- Topic cluster map\n- Keyword targeting plan\n- Content calendar (30-60 days)\n- Internal linking blueprint\n- Content format recommendations\n- Priority scoring for topics\n\n**Content Calendar Format:**\n- Week 1-4 breakdown\n- Topic + target keyword\n- Content type/format\n- Word count target\n- Internal link targets\n- Publishing priority\n\nFocus on comprehensive coverage and logical content progression. Plan for topical authority.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:40:42.852Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for SEO-focused AI Agents seeking structured content planning and optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合专注于SEO的AI代理，寻求结构化内容规划和优化能力。","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが構造化されたコンテンツ計画と最適化機能を求める場合に適しています。","ko":"SEO에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 구조화된 콘텐츠 계획 및 최적화 기능을 찾는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en SEO que buscan capacidades de planificación y optimización de contenido estructurado.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SEO qui recherchent des capacités de planification et d''optimisation de contenu structuré.","de":"Ideal für SEO-fokussierte KI-Agents, die nach strukturierten Inhaltplanungs- und Optimierungsfunktionen suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em SEO que buscam planejamento e capacidades de otimização de conteúdo estruturado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SEO, которые ищут структурированное планирование контента и возможности оптимизации.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية التي تركز على تحسين محركات البحث وتحقيق خطة المحتوى المنظمة وقدرات التحسين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality, keyword-optimized content using best practices and checklists, while validating outcomes and providing actionable steps for SEO content planner tasks, leveraging guidance on workflows and domain-specific tools.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量、关键词优化的内容，使用最佳实践和检查清单，同时验证结果并为SEO内容规划任务提供可执行步骤，利用工作流和特定领域工具的指导。","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスとチェックリストを使用して、高品質のキーワード最適化されたコンテンツを生成できるようにし、結果を検証し、SEOコンテンツプランナータスクのための実行可能なステップを提供し、ワークフローとドメイン固有のツールのガイダンスを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 실践과 체크리스트를 사용하여 높은 품질의 키워드 최적화된 콘텐츠를 생성하도록 하며, 결과를 검증하고 SEO 콘텐츠 플래너 태스크에 대한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하며, 워크플로우와 도메인 특정 도구에 대한 가이드를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido de alta calidad, optimizado para palabras clave, utilizando las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación, mientras valida los resultados y proporciona pasos de acción para las tareas de planificación de contenido de SEO, aprovechando la orientación sobre flujos de trabajo y herramientas específicas de dominio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu de haute qualité, optimisé pour les mots-clés, en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les listes de vérification, tout en validant les résultats et en fournissant des étapes d''exécution pour les tâches de planification de contenu de SEO, en exploitant les conseils sur les flux de travail et les outils spécifiques au domaine.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertigen, keyword-optimierten Inhalt unter Verwendung von Best Practices und Checklisten zu generieren, während Ergebnisse validiert und aktionable Schritte für SEO-Inhaltsplanungsaufgaben bereitgestellt werden, unter Ausnutzung von Anleitungen zu Workflows und domänenspezifischen Tools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo de alta qualidade, otimizado por palavras-chave, utilizando as melhores práticas e listas de verificação, enquanto valida os resultados e fornece etapas concretas para tarefas de planejador de conteúdo de SEO, aproveitando orientações sobre fluxos de trabalho e ferramentas específicas de domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать контент высокого качества, оптимизированный по ключевым словам, используя лучшие практики и чек-листы, а также проверяет результаты и предоставляет конкретные шаги для задач плановщика контента SEO, используя рекомендации по рабочим процессам и инструментам, специфичным для домена.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد محتوى عالي الجودة ومحسن لحرافيش البحث باستخدام أفضل الممارسات وقوائم المراجعة، مع التحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات ملموسة لمهام مخطط محتوى تحسين محركات البحث، مستفيدة من الإرشادات حول سير العمل والأدوات المحددة لنطاق معين."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating data-driven SEO content strategies","Optimizing blog posts for search engine rankings","Developing checklists for SEO audit and analysis"],"zh":["创建数据驱动的SEO内容策略","优化博客文章以提高搜索引擎排名","开发SEO审计和分析的检查清单"],"ja":["データ駆動のSEOコンテンツ戦略を生成する","ブログ記事を検索エンジンのランキングに最適化する","SEO監査と分析のためのチェックリストを開発する"],"ko":["데이터 주도형 SEO 콘텐츠 전략을 생성하는こと","블로그 게시물의 검색 엔진 순위를 최적화하는 것","SEO 감사 및 분석을 위한 체크리스트 개발"],"es":["Creación de estrategias de contenido de SEO basadas en datos","Optimización de publicaciones de blog para clasificaciones de motores de búsqueda","Desarrollo de listas de verificación para auditoría y análisis de SEO"],"fr":["Création de stratégies de contenu de SEO basées sur les données","Optimisation des billets de blog pour les classements des moteurs de recherche","Développement de listes de vérification pour l''audit et l''analyse de SEO"],"de":["Erstellung von datengetriebenen SEO-Inhaltsstrategien","Optimierung von Blog-Beiträgen für Suchmaschinenrankings","Entwicklung von Checklisten für SEO-Audit und Analyse"],"pt":["Criar estratégias de conteúdo de SEO baseadas em dados","Otimizar posts de blog para classificações de mecanismos de busca","Desenvolver listas de verificação para auditoria e análise de SEO"],"ru":["Создание стратегий контента SEO на основе данных","Оптимизация записей блога для рейтингов поисковых систем","Разработка чек-листов для аудита и анализа SEO"],"ar":["إنشاء استراتيجيات محتوى تحسين محركات البحث المستندة إلى البيانات","تحسين منشورات المدونة لترتيب محركات البحث","تطوير قوائم مراجعة لمراجعة تحسين محركات البحث والتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to SEO content planning scope","Requires clear goals, constraints, and inputs for effective use"],"zh":["仅限SEO内容规划范围","需要明确的目标、约束和输入才能有效使用"],"ja":["SEOコンテンツ計画の範囲に限定される","有効に使用するには明確な目標、制約、入力が必要"],"ko":["SEO 콘텐츠 계획 범위에만 제한됨","유효하게 사용하려면 명확한 목표, 제약 및 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Limitado al ámbito de planificación de contenido de SEO","Requiere objetivos claros, restricciones y entradas para un uso eficaz"],"fr":["Limité à la portée de la planification de contenu de SEO","Nécessite des objectifs clairs, des contraintes et des entrées pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Begrenzt auf den Bereich der SEO-Inhaltsplanung","Benötigt klare Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben für eine effektive Verwendung"],"pt":["Limitado ao escopo de planejamento de conteúdo de SEO","Exige metas, restrições e entradas claras para uso eficaz"],"ru":["Ограничен областью планирования контента SEO","Требует четких целей, ограничений и входных данных для эффективного использования"],"ar":["محدود بنطاق تخطيط محتوى تحسين محركات البحث","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا ومُدخلات واضحة لاستخدام فعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
