Rube MCP","ar":"آتمتة واتساب للأعمال عبر Rube MCP","en":"whatsapp-automation"},"description":{"zh":"WhatsApp Business ","ja":"WhatsApp ","ko":"WhatsApp ","es":"La automatización de WhatsApp Business con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores mejorar la eficiencia y reducir costos. Conecta con la API de WhatsApp Busi...","fr":"L''automatisation de WhatsApp Business avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs d''améliorer l''efficacité et de réduire les coûts. Connectez-vous à l''API WhatsApp...","de":"Die Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, die Effizienz zu steigern und Kosten zu reduzieren. Verbinden Sie sich mit ...","pt":"A automação do WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP permite integrar e otimizar operações de negócios. Saiba mais sobre como configurar e utilizar essa ferramenta.","ru":"Автоматизация WhatsApp Business через Rube MCP позволяет интегрировать и оптимизировать бизнес-операции. Узнайте больше о том, как настроить и использовать э...","ar":"تتيح آتمتة واتساب للأعمال عبر Rube MCP دمج وضبط عمليات الأعمال. تعلم المزيد حول كيفية تكوين واستخدام هذه الأداة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp Business ","API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ja":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ko":["Rube MCP","WhatsApp ","API","WhatsApp","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"es":["Conexión a la API de WhatsApp Business","Automatización de tareas y operaciones","Mejora de la eficiencia y reducción de costos","Integración con Rube MCP","Uso de la herramienta de Composio"],"fr":["Connexion à l''API WhatsApp Business","Automatisation de tâches et d''opérations","Amélioration de l''efficacité et réduction des coûts","Intégration avec Rube MCP","Utilisation de l''outil Composio"],"de":["Verbindung zur WhatsApp Business-API","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Operationen","Steigerung der Effizienz und Reduzierung von Kosten","Integration mit Rube MCP","Verwendung des Composio-Tools"],"pt":["Integração com Rube MCP","Automação de operações do WhatsApp Business","Utilização do toolkit do Composio","Requisito de conta da API do WhatsApp Business","Configuração via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Интеграция с Rube MCP","Автоматизация операций WhatsApp Business","Использование инструментария Composio","Требование учетной записи API WhatsApp Business","Настройка через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["التكامل مع Rube MCP","آتمتة عمليات واتساب للأعمال","استخدام أدوات Composio","متطلبات حساب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات واتساب للأعمال","الإعداد عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WhatsApp Business ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp ","API","WhatsApp Business API","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp "],"ja":["WhatsApp","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp Business API","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp "],"ko":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp","API","WhatsApp Business API","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp "],"es":["automatización de WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","API de WhatsApp Business","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","eficiencia y productividad"],"fr":["automatisation de WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","API WhatsApp Business","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","efficacité et productivité"],"de":["Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","WhatsApp Business-API","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["automação do whatsapp business","rube mcp","composio","whatsapp business api","integração de operações","otimização de processos"],"ru":["автоматизация whatsapp business","rube mcp","composio","whatsapp business api","интеграция операций","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["آتمتة واتساب للأعمال","rube mcp","composio","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات واتساب للأعمال","دمج العمليات","ضبط العمليات"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"whatsapp-automation","description":"Automate WhatsApp Business tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): send messages, manage templates, upload media, and handle contacts. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server i","body":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete WhatsApp Business setup\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Send a Text Message\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send a text message to a WhatsApp contact\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List available business phone numbers [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE` - Send a text message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number in international format (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- `body`: Message text content\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID to send from\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Phone numbers must be in international E.164 format with country code\n- Messages outside the 24-hour window require approved templates\n- The 24-hour window starts when the customer last messaged you\n- Business-initiated conversations require template messages first\n\n### 2. Send Template Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send pre-approved template messages for outbound communication\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List available templates [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS` - Check template approval status [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` - Send the template message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `template_name`: Name of the approved template\n- `language_code`: Template language (e.g., ''en_US'')\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `components`: Template variable values and parameters\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Templates must be approved by Meta before use\n- Template variables must match the expected count and format\n- Sending unapproved or rejected templates returns errors\n- Language code must match an approved translation of the template\n\n### 3. Send Media Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send images, documents, or other media\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA` - Upload media to WhatsApp servers [Required]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID` - Send media using the uploaded media ID [Required]\n   OR\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA` - Send media using a public URL [Alternative]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `media_url`: Public URL of the media (for SEND_MEDIA)\n- `media_id`: ID from upload response (for SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID)\n- `type`: Media type (''image'', ''document'', ''audio'', ''video'', ''sticker'')\n- `caption`: Optional caption for the media\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Uploaded media IDs are temporary and expire after a period\n- Media size limits vary by type (images: 5MB, videos: 16MB, documents: 100MB)\n- Supported formats: images (JPEG, PNG), videos (MP4, 3GPP), documents (PDF, etc.)\n- SEND_MEDIA requires a publicly accessible HTTPS URL\n\n### 4. Reply to Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to reply to an incoming WhatsApp message\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY` - Send a reply to a specific message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `message_id`: ID of the message being replied to\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `body`: Reply text content\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- message_id must be from a message received within the 24-hour window\n- Replies appear as quoted messages in the conversation\n- The original message must still exist (not deleted) for the quote to display\n\n### 5. Manage Business Profile and Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or manage their WhatsApp Business profile\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE` - Get business profile details [Optional]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List registered phone numbers [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER` - Get details for a specific number [Optional]\n4. `WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE` - Create a new template [Optional]\n5. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List all templates [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID\n- `template_name`: Name for the new template\n- `category`: Template category (MARKETING, UTILITY, AUTHENTICATION)\n- `language`: Template language code\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- New templates require Meta review before they can be used\n- Template names must be lowercase with underscores (no spaces)\n- Category affects pricing and approval criteria\n- Templates have specific formatting requirements for headers, body, and buttons\n\n### 6. Share Contacts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send contact information via WhatsApp\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS` - Send contact cards [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `contacts`: Array of contact objects with name, phone, email details\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Contact objects must follow the WhatsApp Business API contact schema\n- At least a name field is required for each contact\n- Phone numbers in contacts should include country codes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 24-Hour Messaging Window\n\n- Customers must message you first to open a conversation window\n- Within 24 hours of their last message, you can send free-form messages\n- After 24 hours, only approved template messages can be sent\n- Template messages can re-open the conversation window\n\n### Phone Number Resolution\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS\n2. Extract phone_number_id for your business number\n3. Use phone_number_id in all send operations\n```\n\n### Media Upload Flow\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA with the file\n2. Extract media_id from response\n3. Call WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID with media_id\n4. OR use WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA with a public URL directly\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Phone Number Format**:\n- Always use E.164 format: +[country code][number] (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- Do not include dashes, spaces, or parentheses\n- Country code is required; local numbers without it will fail\n\n**Messaging Restrictions**:\n- Business-initiated messages require templates outside the 24-hour window\n- Template messages cost money per conversation\n- Rate limits apply per phone number and per account\n\n**Media Handling**:\n- Uploaded media expires; use promptly after upload\n- Media URLs must be publicly accessible HTTPS\n- Stickers have specific requirements (WebP format, 512x512 pixels)\n\n**Template Management**:\n- Template review can take up to 24 hours\n- Rejected templates need to be fixed and resubmitted\n- Template variables use double curly braces: {{1}}, {{2}}, etc.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Send message | WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE | to, body |\n| Send template | WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE | template_name, to, language_code |\n| Upload media | WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA | (file params) |\n| Send media by ID | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID | media_id, to, type |\n| Send media by URL | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA | media_url, to, type |\n| Reply to message | WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY | message_id, to, body |\n| Send contacts | WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS | to, contacts |\n| Get media | WHATSAPP_GET_MEDIA | media_id |\n| List phone numbers | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS | (none) |\n| Get phone number | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER | phone_number_id |\n| Get business profile | WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE | phone_number_id |\n| Create template | WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE | template_name, category, language |\n| List templates | WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES | (none) |\n| Check template status | WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS | template_id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:13.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents seeking to streamline WhatsApp Business operations via the WhatsApp Business API and Rube MCP.","zh":"适用于寻求通过WhatsApp Business API和Rube MCP简化WhatsApp Business操作的高级自动化代理。","ja":"WhatsApp Business APIおよびRube MCPを使用してWhatsApp Business操作を簡素化しようとする高度な自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"WhatsApp Business API 및 Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 운영을 간소화하려는 고급 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización avanzados que buscan optimizar las operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la API de WhatsApp Business y Rube MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation avancés cherchant à rationaliser les opérations de WhatsApp Business via l''API de WhatsApp Business et Rube MCP.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Automatisierungsagenten, die WhatsApp Business-Operationen über die WhatsApp Business-API und Rube MCP optimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação Avançados que buscam otimizar as operações do WhatsApp Business por meio da API do WhatsApp Business e do Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов автоматизации, стремящихся оптимизировать операции WhatsApp Business через API WhatsApp Business и Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين المتقدمين الذين يسعون إلى简/streamline عمليات WhatsApp Business من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business و Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit, utilizing Rube MCP for seamless integration and management, including connection setup via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS and toolkit whatsapp.","zh":"通过Composio的WhatsApp工具包赋予代理人自动化WhatsApp Business操作的能力，利用Rube MCP实现无缝集成和管理，包括通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS和工具包whatsapp设置连接。","ja":"ComposioのWhatsAppツールキットを使用して、エージェントがWhatsApp Business操作を自動化できるようにし、Rube MCPを使用してシームレスな統合と管理を行うことができます。つまり、RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSおよびツールキットwhatsappを使用した接続の設定などです。","ko":"Composio의 WhatsApp 툴킷을 사용하여 에이전트가 WhatsApp 비즈니스 운영을 자동화할 수 있도록 하며, Rube MCP를 사용하여無중단 통합 및 관리를 수행하며, RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 및 툴킷 whatsapp를 사용한 연결 설정 등이 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio, utilizando Rube MCP para una integración y gestión sin problemas, incluyendo la configuración de la conexión a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS y la herramienta whatsapp.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de WhatsApp Business via la boîte à outils WhatsApp de Composio, en utilisant Rube MCP pour une intégration et une gestion sans problème, y compris la configuration de la connexion via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS et l''outil whatsapp.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, WhatsApp Business-Operationen über das WhatsApp-Toolkit von Composio zu automatisieren, indem Rube MCP für eine nahtlose Integration und Verwaltung verwendet wird, einschließlich der Verbindungskonfiguration über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS und das Toolkit whatsapp.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações do WhatsApp Business por meio do kit de ferramentas do WhatsApp da Composio, utilizando o Rube MCP para integração e gerenciamento sem interrupções, incluindo a configuração da conexão via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS e kit de ferramentas whatsapp.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать операции WhatsApp Business с помощью инструмента WhatsApp от Composio, используя Rube MCP для бесперебойной интеграции и управления, включая настройку подключения через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS и инструмент whatsapp.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير عمليات WhatsApp Business من خلال أداة WhatsApp من Composio، باستخدام Rube MCP من أجل دمج وتشغيل متواصل، بما في ذلك إعداد الاتصال عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS وأداة whatsapp."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses using Rube MCP","Managing WhatsApp connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Integrating WhatsApp Business API with other tools using Rube MCP"],"zh":["使用Rube MCP自动化WhatsApp Business响应","通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS管理WhatsApp连接","使用Rube MCP将WhatsApp Business API与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Rube MCPを使用してWhatsApp Businessの応答を自動化する","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用してWhatsApp接続を管理する","Rube MCPを使用してWhatsApp Business APIを他のツールと統合する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 응답을 자동화하는 것","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 WhatsApp 연결을 관리하는 것","Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API를 다른 툴과 통합하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar respuestas de WhatsApp Business utilizando Rube MCP","Gestionar conexiones de WhatsApp a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Integrar la API de WhatsApp Business con otras herramientas utilizando Rube MCP"],"fr":["Automatiser les réponses de WhatsApp Business en utilisant Rube MCP","Gérer les connexions WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Intégrer l''API de WhatsApp Business avec d''autres outils en utilisant Rube MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business-Antworten unter Verwendung von Rube MCP","Verwaltung von WhatsApp-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Integration der WhatsApp Business-API mit anderen Tools unter Verwendung von Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas do WhatsApp Business usando Rube MCP","Gerenciar conexões do WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Integrar API do WhatsApp Business com outras ferramentas usando Rube MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы WhatsApp Business с помощью Rube MCP","Управлять подключениями WhatsApp через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Интегрировать API WhatsApp Business с другими инструментами с помощью Rube MCP"],"ar":["توفير استجابات WhatsApp Business باستخدام Rube MCP","إدارة الاتصالات بالواتساب من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","دمج واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business مع أدوات أخرى باستخدام Rube MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection and WhatsApp Business API account","Needs active WhatsApp connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit whatsapp","Only compatible with WhatsApp Business API, not regular WhatsApp"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接和WhatsApp Business API账户","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS与工具包whatsapp的活跃WhatsApp连接","仅与WhatsApp Business API兼容，不支持普通WhatsApp"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続とWhatsApp Business APIアカウントが必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSとツールキットwhatsappを使用したアクティブなWhatsApp接続が必要","WhatsApp Business APIのみに対応しており、通常のWhatsAppはサポートされません"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 및 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 및 툴킷 whatsapp를 사용한 활성 WhatsApp 연결이 필요합니다.","WhatsApp 비즈니스 API만 호환되며, 일반 WhatsApp는 지원되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP y cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business","Necesita una conexión de WhatsApp activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta whatsapp","Solo es compatible con la API de WhatsApp Business, no con WhatsApp regular"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP et un compte d''API de WhatsApp Business","Nécessite une connexion WhatsApp active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec l''outil whatsapp","N''est compatible qu''avec l''API de WhatsApp Business, et non avec WhatsApp régulier"],"de":["Benötigt eine Rube MCP-Verbindung und ein WhatsApp Business-API-Konto","Benötigt eine aktive WhatsApp-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit whatsapp","Kompatibel nur mit der WhatsApp Business-API, nicht mit regulärem WhatsApp"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP e conta da API do WhatsApp Business","Necessita de conexão ativa do WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit whatsapp","Compatível apenas com a API do WhatsApp Business, não com o WhatsApp regular"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP и учетной записи API WhatsApp Business","Требует активного подключения WhatsApp через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с toolkit whatsapp","Поддерживает только API WhatsApp Business, а не обычный WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP و حساب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط بالواتساب عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة whatsapp","متوافق فقط مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business، وليس مع الواتساب العادي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
