upports","Erzeugen automatisierter Antworten über die WhatsApp Business-API","Optimieren der WhatsApp Business-Nachrichtenworkflows"],"pt":["Automatizar suporte ao cliente do WhatsApp Business","Gerar respostas automatizadas via API do WhatsApp Business","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de mensagens do WhatsApp Business"],"ru":["Автоматизировать поддержку клиентов WhatsApp Business","Генерировать автоматические ответы через API WhatsApp Business","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы обмена сообщениями WhatsApp Business"],"ar":["أتمتة دعم العملاء لعمليات WhatsApp Business","توليد استجابات أوتوماتيكية عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business","تحسين تدفقات عمل الرسائل لعمليات WhatsApp Business"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active WhatsApp Business API account necessary","WhatsApp Business API account required, not compatible with regular WhatsApp accounts"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接","需要活跃的WhatsApp Business API账户","需要WhatsApp Business API账户，不兼容普通WhatsApp账户"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続が必要","アクティブなWhatsApp Business APIアカウントが必要","WhatsApp Business APIアカウントが必要で、通常のWhatsAppアカウントとは互換性がありません"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요","활성화된 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요","WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요하며, 일반 WhatsApp 계정과 호환되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP","Cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business activa necesaria","Cuenta de API de WhatsApp Business requerida, no compatible con cuentas regulares de WhatsApp"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Compte API WhatsApp Business actif nécessaire","Compte API WhatsApp Business requis, non compatible avec les comptes WhatsApp réguliers"],"de":["Benötigt Rube MCP-Verbindung","Aktives WhatsApp Business-API-Konto erforderlich","WhatsApp Business-API-Konto erforderlich, nicht kompatibel mit regulären WhatsApp-Konten"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conta de API de negócios do WhatsApp ativa necessária","Conta de API de negócios do WhatsApp necessária, não é compatível com contas regulares do WhatsApp"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Необ