be MCP","Outil de Composio pour WhatsApp","Compte WhatsApp Business API","Automatisation des opérations de messagerie","Intégration avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Configuration de connexion sécurisée"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP","Composio-Tool für WhatsApp","WhatsApp Business API-Konto","Automatisierung von Messaging-Operationen","Integration mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Konfiguration einer sicheren Verbindung"],"pt":["Automação de operações de negócios do WhatsApp","Integração com Rube MCP","Requer conta de API do WhatsApp Business","Suporte a operações de negócios personalizadas","Fácil configuração e implantação"],"ru":["Автоматизация бизнес-операций WhatsApp","Интеграция с Rube MCP","Требуется учетная запись API бизнеса WhatsApp","Поддержка индивидуальных бизнес-операций","Легкая настройка и развертывание"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات أعمال واتساب","التكامل مع Rube MCP","يتطلب حساب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال واتساب","دعم عمليات الأعمال المخصصة","تكوين وتنفيذ سهل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WhatsApp自动化","Rube MCP","WhatsApp商业运营","自动化解决方案","客户服务","运营管理"],"ja":["WhatsApp自動化","Rube MCP","WhatsAppビジネスオペレーション","自動化ソリューション","顧客サービス","運用管理"],"ko":["WhatsApp 자동화","Rube MCP","WhatsApp 비즈니스 운영","자동화 솔루션","고객 서비스","운영 관리"],"es":["automatización de WhatsApp","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","mensajería instantánea","integración de herramientas","automatización de operaciones","desarrollo de software","soluciones de mensajería"],"fr":["automatisation de WhatsApp","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","messagerie instantanée","intégration d''outils","automatisation d''opérations","développement de logiciels","solutions de messagerie"],"de":["Automatisierung von WhatsApp","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","Instant-Messaging","Integration von Tools","Automatisierung von Operationen","Software-Entwicklung","Messaging-Lösungen"],"pt":["automação de negócios do WhatsApp","Rube MCP","API do WhatsApp Business","automação de operações de negócios","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de automação"],"ru":["автоматизация бизнеса WhatsApp","Rube MCP","API бизнеса WhatsApp","автоматизация бизнес-операций","разработка программного обеспечения","технология автоматизации"],"ar":["تأتمة أعمال واتساب","Rube MCP","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال واتساب","تأتمة عمليات الأعمال","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا التأتمة"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"whatsapp-automation","description":"Automate WhatsApp Business tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): send messages, manage templates, upload media, and handle contacts. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server i","body":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete WhatsApp Business setup\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Send a Text Message\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send a text message to a WhatsApp contact\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List available business phone numbers [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE` - Send a text message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number in international format (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- `body`: Message text content\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID to send from\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Phone numbers must be in international E.164 format with country code\n- Messages outside the 24-hour window require approved templates\n- The 24-hour window starts when the customer last messaged you\n- Business-initiated conversations require template messages first\n\n### 2. Send Template Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send pre-approved template messages for outbound communication\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List available templates [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS` - Check template approval status [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` - Send the template message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `template_name`: Name of the approved template\n- `language_code`: Template language (e.g., ''en_US'')\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `components`: Template variable values and parameters\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Templates must be approved by Meta before use\n- Template variables must match the expected count and format\n- Sending unapproved or rejected templates returns errors\n- Language code must match an approved translation of the template\n\n### 3. Send Media Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send images, documents, or other media\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA` - Upload media to WhatsApp servers [Required]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID` - Send media using the uploaded media ID [Required]\n   OR\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA` - Send media using a public URL [Alternative]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `media_url`: Public URL of the media (for SEND_MEDIA)\n- `media_id`: ID from upload response (for SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID)\n- `type`: Media type (''image'', ''document'', ''audio'', ''video'', ''sticker'')\n- `caption`: Optional caption for the media\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Uploaded media IDs are temporary and expire after a period\n- Media size limits vary by type (images: 5MB, videos: 16MB, documents: 100MB)\n- Supported formats: images (JPEG, PNG), videos (MP4, 3GPP), documents (PDF, etc.)\n- SEND_MEDIA requires a publicly accessible HTTPS URL\n\n### 4. Reply to Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to reply to an incoming WhatsApp message\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY` - Send a reply to a specific message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `message_id`: ID of the message being replied to\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `body`: Reply text content\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- message_id must be from a message received within the 24-hour window\n- Replies appear as quoted messages in the conversation\n- The original message must still exist (not deleted) for the quote to display\n\n### 5. Manage Business Profile and Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or manage their WhatsApp Business profile\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE` - Get business profile details [Optional]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List registered phone numbers [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER` - Get details for a specific number [Optional]\n4. `WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE` - Create a new template [Optional]\n5. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List all templates [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID\n- `template_name`: Name for the new template\n- `category`: Template category (MARKETING, UTILITY, AUTHENTICATION)\n- `language`: Template language code\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- New templates require Meta review before they can be used\n- Template names must be lowercase with underscores (no spaces)\n- Category affects pricing and approval criteria\n- Templates have specific formatting requirements for headers, body, and buttons\n\n### 6. Share Contacts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send contact information via WhatsApp\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS` - Send contact cards [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `contacts`: Array of contact objects with name, phone, email details\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Contact objects must follow the WhatsApp Business API contact schema\n- At least a name field is required for each contact\n- Phone numbers in contacts should include country codes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 24-Hour Messaging Window\n\n- Customers must message you first to open a conversation window\n- Within 24 hours of their last message, you can send free-form messages\n- After 24 hours, only approved template messages can be sent\n- Template messages can re-open the conversation window\n\n### Phone Number Resolution\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS\n2. Extract phone_number_id for your business number\n3. Use phone_number_id in all send operations\n```\n\n### Media Upload Flow\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA with the file\n2. Extract media_id from response\n3. Call WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID with media_id\n4. OR use WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA with a public URL directly\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Phone Number Format**:\n- Always use E.164 format: +[country code][number] (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- Do not include dashes, spaces, or parentheses\n- Country code is required; local numbers without it will fail\n\n**Messaging Restrictions**:\n- Business-initiated messages require templates outside the 24-hour window\n- Template messages cost money per conversation\n- Rate limits apply per phone number and per account\n\n**Media Handling**:\n- Uploaded media expires; use promptly after upload\n- Media URLs must be publicly accessible HTTPS\n- Stickers have specific requirements (WebP format, 512x512 pixels)\n\n**Template Management**:\n- Template review can take up to 24 hours\n- Rejected templates need to be fixed and resubmitted\n- Template variables use double curly braces: {{1}}, {{2}}, etc.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Send message | WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE | to, body |\n| Send template | WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE | template_name, to, language_code |\n| Upload media | WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA | (file params) |\n| Send media by ID | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID | media_id, to, type |\n| Send media by URL | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA | media_url, to, type |\n| Reply to message | WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY | message_id, to, body |\n| Send contacts | WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS | to, contacts |\n| Get media | WHATSAPP_GET_MEDIA | media_id |\n| List phone numbers | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS | (none) |\n| Get phone number | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER | phone_number_id |\n| Get business profile | WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE | phone_number_id |\n| Create template | WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE | template_name, category, language |\n| List templates | WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES | (none) |\n| Check template status | WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS | template_id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:13.426Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents seeking to automate WhatsApp Business operations via Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit and Rube MCP.","zh":"适用于寻求通过Composio的WhatsApp工具包和Rube MCP自动化WhatsApp商业运营的对话式代理。","ja":"ComposioのWhatsAppツールキットとRube MCPを使用してWhatsAppビジネス操作を自動化しようとする会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Composio의 WhatsApp 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 운영을 자동화하려는 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversación que buscan automatizar operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio y Rube MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation qui cherchent à automatiser les opérations de WhatsApp Business via l''outil WhatsApp de Composio et Rube MCP.","de":"Ideal für Conversational Agents, die WhatsApp Business Operationen über Composios WhatsApp Toolkit und Rube MCP automatisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação que buscam automatizar operações de negócios do WhatsApp por meio da ferramenta do WhatsApp da Composio e do Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, стремящихся автоматизировать операции WhatsApp Business с помощью инструмента WhatsApp Composio и Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الحواريين الذين يسعون إلى توفير عمليات أعمال WhatsApp من خلال أداة WhatsApp من Composio و Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing WhatsApp Business API and managing connections with RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS and RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, facilitating advanced automation capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理自动化WhatsApp商业运营的能力，通过Composio的WhatsApp工具包和Rube MCP，利用WhatsApp商业API，并使用RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS和RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS管理连接，实现高级自动化能力。","ja":"エージェントにWhatsAppビジネス操作の自動化能力を提供します。ComposioのWhatsAppツールキットとRube MCPを使用して、WhatsAppビジネスAPIを利用し、RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSとRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSで接続を管理し、高度な自動化機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 WhatsApp 비즈니스 운영을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. Composio의 WhatsApp 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API를 활용하고, RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS와 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS로 연결을 관리하여 고급 자동화 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio via Rube MCP, utilizando la API de WhatsApp Business y gestionando conexiones con RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS y RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, lo que facilita capacidades de automatización avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de automatiser les opérations de WhatsApp Business via l''outil WhatsApp de Composio via Rube MCP, en utilisant l''API WhatsApp Business et en gérant les connexions avec RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS et RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, ce qui facilite des capacités d''automatisation avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, WhatsApp Business Operationen über Composios WhatsApp Toolkit via Rube MCP zu automatisieren, indem die WhatsApp Business API verwendet und Verbindungen mit RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS und RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS verwaltet werden, was erweiterte Automatisierungsfähigkeiten ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de negócios do WhatsApp por meio da ferramenta do WhatsApp da Composio via Rube MCP, utilizando a API do WhatsApp Business e gerenciando conexões com RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS e RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, facilitando capacidades de automação avançadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции WhatsApp Business с помощью инструмента WhatsApp Composio через Rube MCP, используя API WhatsApp Business и управляя соединениями с RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS и RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, обеспечивая расширенные возможности автоматизации.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توفير عمليات أعمال WhatsApp من خلال أداة WhatsApp من Composio عبر Rube MCP، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال WhatsApp وإدارة الاتصالات مع RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS و RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS، وتسهيل القدرات التلقائية المتقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WhatsApp Business responses via Rube MCP","Managing WhatsApp connections with RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Validating tool schemas with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"zh":["通过Rube MCP自动化WhatsApp商业响应","使用RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS管理WhatsApp连接","使用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS验证工具模式"],"ja":["Rube MCPを使用してWhatsAppビジネスレスポンスを自動化する","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用してWhatsApp接続を管理する","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを使用してツールスキーマを検証する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 응답을 자동화하는 것","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 WhatsApp 연결을 관리하는 것","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하여 툴 스키마를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar respuestas de WhatsApp Business a través de Rube MCP","Gestionar conexiones de WhatsApp con RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Validar esquemas de herramientas con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"fr":["Automatiser les réponses de WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP","Gérer les connexions de WhatsApp avec RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Valider les schémas d''outils avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"de":["WhatsApp Business Antworten über Rube MCP automatisieren","WhatsApp Verbindungen mit RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS verwalten","Werkzeugschemas mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS validieren"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas de negócios do WhatsApp por meio do Rube MCP","Gerenciar conexões do WhatsApp com RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Validar esquemas de ferramentas com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы WhatsApp Business через Rube MCP","Управлять соединениями WhatsApp с помощью RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Проверять схемы инструментов с помощью RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ar":["توفير استجابات أعمال WhatsApp من خلال Rube MCP","إدارة اتصالات WhatsApp مع RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","إ�� تأكيد مخططات الأدوات مع RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active WhatsApp Business API account","Needs Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Only compatible with WhatsApp Business API, not regular WhatsApp"],"zh":["需要活跃的WhatsApp商业API账户","需要Rube MCP连接并且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","仅与WhatsApp商业API兼容，不支持普通WhatsApp"],"ja":["アクティブなWhatsAppビジネスAPIアカウントが必要","Rube MCP接続とRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSの利用が必要","WhatsAppビジネスAPIのみに互換性があり、通常のWhatsAppはサポートされません"],"ko":["활성화된 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요합니다","Rube MCP 연결과 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS의 사용이 필요합니다","WhatsApp 비즈니스 API만 호환되며, 일반 WhatsApp는 지원되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta activa de API de WhatsApp Business","Necesita una conexión de Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Solo es compatible con la API de WhatsApp Business, no con WhatsApp regular"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte actif d''API WhatsApp Business","A besoin d''une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","N''est compatible qu''avec l''API WhatsApp Business, et non avec WhatsApp régulier"],"de":["Benötigt ein aktives WhatsApp Business API Konto","Benötigt eine Rube MCP Verbindung mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Kompatibel nur mit WhatsApp Business API, nicht mit regulärem WhatsApp"],"pt":["Exige conta ativa da API do WhatsApp Business","Necessita conexão do Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponível","Somente compatível com API do WhatsApp Business, não com WhatsApp regular"],"ru":["Требует активного аккаунта API WhatsApp Business","Требует соединения Rube MCP с доступным RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Совместима только с API WhatsApp Business, а не с обычным WhatsApp"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا نشطًا لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال WhatsApp","يتطلب اتصالًا من Rube MCP مع RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS متاح","متوافقة فقط مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أعمال WhatsApp، وليس مع WhatsApp العادي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry/calendly-automation', 'community', 'mshraditya', 'SkillsForAgentRegistry', 'mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry', 'calendly-automation', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:41:20.619Z', NULL, '{"id":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry/calendly-automation","name":"calendly-automation","description":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化通过 Rube MCP 实现，提供事件列表、邀请者管理等功能","ja":"Calendly オートメーションは Rube MCP で実現され、イベントリスト、招待者管理などを提供","ko":"캘린들리 자동화는 루베 MCP에서 구현되며, 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리 등을 제공합니다","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite a los desarrolladores integrar y administrar eventos, invitados y más. Con Composio, puedes automatizar operaciones de Calendly de manera efectiva","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet aux développeurs d''intégrer et de gérer des événements, des invités et plus. Avec Composio, vous pouvez automatiser les opérations de Calendly de manière efficace","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Ereignisse, Gäste und mehr zu integrieren und zu verwalten. Mit Composio können Sie Calendly-Operationen effektiv automatisieren","pt":"A automação do Calendly permite que os desenvolvedores criem soluções personalizadas para gerenciar eventos e agendas. Com o kit de ferramentas Composio, é possível automatizar operações como criação de links de agendamento e gerenciamento de convidados.","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly позволяет разработчикам создавать индивидуальные решения для управления событиями и расписаниями. С помощью набора инструментов Composio можно автоматизировать операции, такие как создание ссылок для планирования и управление приглашениями.","ar":"أتمتة كاليندي تمكن المطورين من إنشاء حلول مخصصة لإدارة الأحداث والجداول. باستخدام أدوات كومبوسيو، يمكن أتمتة العمليات مثل إنشاء روابط الجدولة وإدارة الضيوف.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化集成","ja":"Calendly オートメーション","ko":"캘린들리 자동화","es":"Automatización de Calendly para Desarrolladores","fr":"Automatisation de Calendly pour Développeurs","de":"Calendly-Automatisierung für Entwickler","pt":"Automação Calendly para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly для разработчиков","ar":"أتمتة كاليندي للطورين","en":"calendly-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化通过 Rube MCP 实现，提供事件列表、邀请者管理等功能","ja":"Calendly オートメーションは Rube MCP で実現され、イベントリスト、招待者管理などを提供","ko":"캘린들리 자동화는 루베 MCP에서 구현되며, 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리 등을 제공합니다","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite a los desarrolladores integrar y administrar eventos, invitados y más. Con Composio, puedes automatizar operaciones de ...","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet aux développeurs d''intégrer et de gérer des événements, des invités et plus. Avec Composio, vous pouvez automatiser les o...","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Ereignisse, Gäste und mehr zu integrieren und zu verwalten. Mit Composio können Sie Calendly-Oper...","pt":"A automação do Calendly permite que os desenvolvedores criem soluções personalizadas para gerenciar eventos e agendas. Com o kit de ferramentas Composio, é p...","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly позволяет разработчикам создавать индивидуальные решения для управления событиями и расписаниями. С помощью набора инструментов Compos...","ar":"أتمتة كاليندي تمكن المطورين من إنشاء حلول مخصصة لإدارة الأحداث والجداول. باستخدام أدوات كومبوسيو، يمكن أتمتة العمليات مثل إنشاء روابط الجدولة وإدارة الضيوف.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["事件列表自动化","邀请者管理","日程安排链接创建","可用性查询","组织管理"],"ja":["イベントリストの自動化","招待者管理","スケジュール링リンクの作成","可用性の照会","組織管理"],"ko":["이벤트 목록 자동화","초대자 관리","일정 링크 생성","가용성 查询","조직 관리"],"es":["Integración de eventos de Calendly","Administración de invitados","Creación de enlaces de programación","Consultas de disponibilidad","Administración de organizaciones"],"fr":["Intégration d''événements de Calendly","Gestion des invités","Création de liens de planification","Requêtes de disponibilité","Gestion des organisations"],"de":["Integration von Calendly-Ereignissen","Verwaltung von Gästen","Erstellung von Terminvergabe-Links","Verfügbarkeitsanfragen","Verwaltung von Organisationen"],"pt":["Criação de links de agendamento","Gerenciamento de convidados","Consulta de disponibilidade","Administração de organizações","Integração com o Rube MCP","Personalização de soluções"],"ru":["Создание ссылок для планирования","Управление приглашениями","Запрос доступности","Администрирование организаций","Интеграция с Rube MCP","Настройка решений"],"ar":["إنشاء روابط الجدولة","إدارة الضيوف","استعلام عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمات","التكامل مع Rube MCP","تخصيص الحلول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","Rube MCP","事件列表","邀请者管理","日程安排","可用性查询","组织管理","开发者工具"],"ja":["Calendly オートメーション","Rube MCP","イベントリスト","招待者管理","スケジュールング","可用性の照会","組織管理","開発者ツール"],"ko":["캘린들리 자동화","루베 MCP","이벤트 목록","초대자 관리","일정 관리","가용성 查询","조직 관리","개발자 도구"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","integración de Calendly","desarrollo de Calendly","herramientas de Calendly","API de Calendly","Calendly para desarrolladores"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","intégration de Calendly","développement de Calendly","outils de Calendly","API de Calendly","Calendly pour développeurs"],"de":["Automatisierung von Calendly","Integration von Calendly","Entwicklung von Calendly","Tools von Calendly","Calendly-API","Calendly für Entwickler"],"pt":["automação do Calendly","desenvolvedores","kit de ferramentas Composio","gerenciamento de eventos","agendamento","convidados","disponibilidade","organizações","Rube MCP"],"ru":["автоматизация Calendly","разработчики","набор инструментов Composio","управление событиями","планирование","приглашения","доступность","организации","Rube MCP"],"ar":["أتمتة كاليندي","المطورين","أدوات كومبوسيو","إدارة الأحداث","الجدولة","الضيوف","التوفر","المنظمات","Rube MCP"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:20.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scheduling Agents needing seamless Calendly integration and automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝Calendly集成和自动化功能的调度代理。","ja":"Calendlyのシームレスな統合と自動化機能が必要なスケジューリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"무결점한 Calendly 통합 및 자동화 기능이 필요한 스케줄링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de programación que necesitan una integración y capacidades de automatización de Calendly sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de planification ayant besoin d''une intégration et de capacités d''automatisation de Calendly sans faille.","de":"Perfekt für Scheduling-Agents, die eine nahtlose Calendly-Integration und Automatisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Agendamento que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Calendly e capacidades de automação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов планирования, которым необходима беспрепятственная интеграция с Calendly и возможности автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات एजنت التخطيط التي تحتاج إلى دمج سلس مع Calendly و القدرات الأتمتيكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations, including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation, via Composio''s Calendly toolkit and Rube MCP, utilizing protocols like RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","zh":"赋予代理人通过Composio的Calendly工具包和Rube MCP自动化Calendly操作的能力，包括事件列表、受邀者管理和安排链接创建，利用协议如RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS。","ja":"ComposioのCalendlyツールキットとRube MCPを使用して、イベントリスト、招待者管理、スケジュール링リンクの作成などのCalendly操作を自動化するエージェントを可能にします。プロトコルとしてRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用します。","ko":"Composio의 Calendly 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 사용하여 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리, 스케줄링 링크 생성 등의 Calendly 작업을 자동화하는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. 프로토콜로 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Calendly, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación, a través de la herramienta de Calendly de Composio y Rube MCP, utilizando protocolos como RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de Calendly, y compris la liste des événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification, via l''outil de Calendly de Composio et Rube MCP, en utilisant des protocoles tels que RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Calendly-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Einladungsmanagement und Erstellung von Terminierungslinks, über Composios Calendly-Toolkit und Rube MCP, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly, incluindo lista de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento, por meio da ferramenta Calendly da Composio e Rube MCP, utilizando protocolos como RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly, включая перечень событий, управление приглашенными и создание ссылок на планирование, посредством инструмента Calendly Composio и Rube MCP, используя протоколы типа RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أتمتة عمليات كالندلي، بما في ذلك قائمة بالأحداث وإدارة المدعوين وإنشاء روابط الجدولة، من خلال أداة كالندلي كومبوسيو وروبي أم سي بي، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل روب_سيرش_تولز وروب_مينيج_كونيكشنز."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and organization administration","Generating scheduling links and managing invitee interactions","Querying availability and managing Calendly connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化事件调度和组织管理","生成调度链接和管理受邀者交互","通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS查询可用性和管理Calendly连接"],"ja":["イベントスケジューリングと組織管理の自動化","スケジューリングリンクの生成と招待者とのやり取りの管理","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用した可用性の照会とCalendly接続の管理"],"ko":["이벤트 스케줄링 및 조직 관리 자동화","스케줄링 링크 생성 및 초대자 상호작용 관리","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 가용성 조회 및 Calendly 연결 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de eventos y administración de organizaciones","Generación de enlaces de programación y gestión de interacciones de invitados","Consulta de disponibilidad y gestión de conexiones de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''événements et d''administration d''organisations","Génération de liens de planification et gestion des interactions des invités","Recherche de disponibilité et gestion des connexions de Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisplanung und Organisationsverwaltung","Erstellung von Terminierungslinks und Verwaltung von Einladungsinteraktionen","Abfrage von Verfügbarkeit und Verwaltung von Calendly-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar agendamento de eventos e administração de organização","Gerar links de agendamento e gerenciar interações de convidados","Consultar disponibilidade e gerenciar conexões Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование событий и администрирование организации","Генерировать ссылки на планирование и управлять взаимодействиями приглашенных","Запрашивать доступность и управлять подключениями Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["أتمتة جدولة الأحداث وإدارة المنظمة","توليد روابط الجدولة وإدارة互одействات المدعوين","استعلام عن التوفر وإدارة الاتصالات كالندلي من خلال روب_مينيج_كونيكشنز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with calendly toolkit necessary","Many operations require the user''s Calendly credentials"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Calendly连接以及Calendly工具包","许多操作需要用户的Calendly凭据"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能なRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用したCalendly接続とCalendlyツールキットが必要","多くの操作ではユーザーのCalendly資格情報が必要"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용할 수 있는 Rube MCP 연결이 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 Calendly 연결 및 Calendly 툴킷이 필요합니다.","많은 작업에서 사용자의 Calendly 자격 증명이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Conexión de Calendly activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con calendly toolkit necesaria","Muchas operaciones requieren las credenciales de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Connexion Calendly active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec calendly toolkit nécessaire","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent les informations d''identification de Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbarer RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit Calendly-Toolkit erforderlich","Viele Operationen erfordern die Calendly-Anmeldeinformationen des Benutzers"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponível","Conexão Calendly ativa via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit Calendly necessário","Muitas operações requerem as credenciais Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с необходимым инструментарием Calendly","Многие операции требуют учетных данных Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى اتصال روبي أم سي بي مع أدوات البحث روب_سيرش_تولز المتاحة","اتصال كالندلي نشط من خلال روب_مينيج_كونيكشنز مع حزمة أدوات كالندلي الضرورية","تتطلب العديد من العمليات بيانات اعتماد المستخدم كالندلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
