ación de la organización"],"fr":["Automatisation de la liste des événements","Gestion des invités et des participants","Création de liens de planification","Requêtes de disponibilité","Administration de l''organisation"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisliste","Verwaltung von Gästen und Teilnehmern","Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen","Verfügbarkeitsanfragen","Organisationsverwaltung"],"pt":["Criação de links de agendamento","Gerenciamento de convidados","Consulta de disponibilidade","Administração de organização"],"ru":["Создание ссылок на планирование","Управление приглашениями","Запрос наличия","Администрирование организации"],"ar":["إنشاء روابط جدولة","إدارة المُضيفين","استعلام عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","AI 编码代理","全能工程团队","事件列表","邀请者管理","调度链接创建"],"ja":["Calendly 自動化","AI コーディングエージェント","フルエンジニアリングチーム","イベントリスト","招待者管理","スケジュールリンク作成"],"ko":["Calendly 자동화","AI 코딩 에이전트","전체 엔지니어링 팀","이벤트 목록","초대자 관리","스케줄링 링크 생성"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","desarrollo de software","gestión de eventos","programación de reuniones","integración de Calendly","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","développement de logiciels","gestion des événements","planification de réunions","intégration de Calendly","outils de développement"],"de":["Calendly-Automatisierung","Software-Entwicklung","Veranstaltungsmanagement","Terminplanung","Calendly-Integration","Entwickler-Tools"],"pt":["calendly automatizado","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de eventos","convidados","agendamento","disponibilidade"],"ru":["автоматизация calendly","инструменты разработчика","управление мероприятиями","приглашения","планирование","наличие"],"ar":["تأتمة كالندلي","أدوات تطوير","إدارة الفعاليات","الضيوف","جدولة","توفر"]}},"owner":"SamarthaKV29","repo":"antigravity-god-mode","repoPath":"SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:26.049Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI coding agents seeking to automate event management and scheduling through Calendly integration.","zh":"适用于寻求通过Calendly集成自动化事件管理和调度的AI编码代理的理想选择。","ja":"Calendlyの統合を介してイベント管理とスケジューリングの自動化を目指すAIコーディングエージェントに最適。","ko":"Calendly 통합을 통해 이벤트 관리 및 예약 자동화를 추구하는 AI 코딩 에이전트에게 理想的な 선택입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA que buscan automatizar la gestión de eventos y programación a través de la integración con Calendly.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA cherchant à automatiser la gestion d''événements et la planification via l''intégration Calendly.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agenten, die die Ereignisverwaltung und -planung über die Calendly-Integration automatisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de codificação de IA que buscam automatizar a gestão e programação de eventos por meio da integração com o Calendly.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, стремящихся автоматизировать управление событиями и планирование через интеграцию с Calendly.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائمين على البرمجة الإلكترونية الذين يبتغون توفير آلي لإدارة الحوادث وتحديد المواعيد من خلال التكامل مع Calendly."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation via Composio''s Calendly toolkit and Rube MCP, leveraging RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless connectivity.","zh":"赋予代理自动化Calendly操作的能力，包括事件列表、被邀请者管理和调度链接创建，通过Composio的Calendly工具包和Rube MCP，利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS实现无缝连接。","ja":"ComposioのCalendlyツールキットとRube MCPを使用して、イベントリスト、招待者管理、スケジューリングリンクの作成などのCalendly操作を自動化するエージェントの能力を付与し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用してシームレスな接続を実現します。","ko":"Composio의 Calendly 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 사용하여 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리, 예약 링크 생성 등을 포함한 Calendly 작업을 자동화하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하여無縫接続을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Calendly, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación a través de la herramienta de Calendly de Composio y Rube MCP, aprovechando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una conectividad sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Calendly, y compris la liste d''événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification via l''outil Calendly de Composio et Rube MCP, en exploitant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une connectivité sans faille.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Calendly-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Teilnehmerverwaltung und Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen über Composios Calendly-Toolkit und Rube MCP, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Konnektivität genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly, incluindo listagem de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de programação por meio da ferramenta Calendly da Composio e Rube MCP, aproveitando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para conectividade sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly, включая перечисление событий, управление приглашениями и создание ссылок на планирование через набор инструментов Calendly Composio и Rube MCP, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для бесперебойного подключения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي لعمليات Calendly، بما في ذلك قائمة الأحداث وإدارة المُدعوين وإنشاء روابط جدولة من خلال مجموعة أدوات Calendly من Composio و Rube MCP، واستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS لضمان الاتصال السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and organization administration","Generating scheduling links and managing invitee interactions","Querying availability and managing event listings through Calendly"],"zh":["自动化事件调度和组织管理","生成调度链接和管理被邀请者交互","通过Calendly查询可用性和管理事件列表"],"ja":["イベントスケジューリングと組織管理の自動化","スケジューリングリンクの生成と招待者とのやり取りの管理","Calendlyを介した空き状況の照会とイベントリストの管理"],"ko":["이벤트 예약 및 조직 관리 자동화","예약 링크 생성 및 초대자 상호작용 관리","Calendly를 통한 가용성 조회 및 이벤트 목록 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación y administración de eventos y organizaciones","Generación de enlaces de programación y gestión de interacciones de invitados","Consulta de disponibilidad y gestión de listas de eventos a través de Calendly"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification et de l''administration d''événements et d''organisations","Génération de liens de planification et gestion des interactions des invités","Recherche de disponibilité et gestion des listes d''événements via Calendly"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisplanung und -verwaltung sowie Organisationsadministration","Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen und Verwaltung von Teilnehmerinteraktionen","Abfrage von Verfügbarkeit und Verwaltung von Ereignislisten über Calendly"],"pt":["Automatizar a programação e administração de eventos","Gerar links de programação e gerenciar interações de convidados","Consultar disponibilidade e gerenciar listagens de eventos por meio do Calendly"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование и администрирование событий","Генерировать ссылки на планирование и управлять взаимодействиями приглашенных","Запрашивать доступность и управлять списками событий через Calendly"],"ar":["توفير آلي لجدولة الأحداث وإدارة المنظمة","توليد روابط جدولة وإدارة تفاعلات المُدعوين","استعلام عن التوفر وإدارة قوائم الأحداث عبر Calendly"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","Dependent on user''s Calendly account for many operations"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Calendly连接","许多操作依赖于用户的Calendly账户"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能なRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したアクティブなCalendly接続が必要","多くの操作はユーザーのCalendlyアカウントに依存"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS가 사용 가능한 Rube MCP 연결이 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 활성 Calendly 연결이 필요합니다.","많은 작업은 사용자의 Calendly 계정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Conexión activa de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","Dependiente de la cuenta de Calendly del usuario para muchas operaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Connexion Calendly active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","Dépend de la compte Calendly de l''utilisateur pour de nombreuses opérations"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbarer RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","Von Benutzers Calendly-Konto für viele Operationen abhängig"],"pt":["Requer conexão com Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão ativa com Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","Dependente da conta Calendly do usuário para muitas operações"],"ru":["Требуется соединение с Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Необходимо активное подключение к Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Зависит от учетной записи Calendly пользователя для многих операций"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بِ Rube MCP مع أدوات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","يتطلب الاتصال النشط بِ Calendly عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","يعتمد على حساب Calendly للمستخدم للعديد من العمليات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pCruvinel/antig/calendly-automation', 'community', 'pCruvinel', 'antig', 'pCruvinel/antig', 'calendly-automation', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:41:19.962Z', NULL, '{"id":"pCruvinel/antig/calendly-automation","name":"calendly-automation","description":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化是通过 Rube MCP 实现的，支持事件列表、邀请管理、安排链接创建等功能。通过 Composio 的 Calendly 工具包，开发者可以高效地管理 Calendly 操作。","ja":"Calendly オートメーションは Rube MCP で実現され、イベントリスト、招待管理、スケジュールリンク作成などをサポートします。Composio の Calendly ツールキットを使用して、開発者は Calendly 操作を効率的に管理できます。","ko":"Calendly 자동화는 Rube MCP 에서 구현되며, 이벤트 목록, 초대 관리, 일정 링크 생성 등 기능을 지원합니다. Composio 의 Calendly 툴킷을 사용하면 개발자가 Calendly 작동을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다.","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite gestionar eventos y organizaciones de manera eficiente. Conecta con Rube MCP para automatizar operaciones.","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet de gérer les événements et les organisations de manière efficace. Connectez-vous à Rube MCP pour automatiser les opérations.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht eine effiziente Verwaltung von Ereignissen und Organisationen. Verbinden Sie sich mit Rube MCP, um Operationen zu automatisieren.","pt":"A automação do Calendly permite gerenciar eventos, convidados e links de agendamento de forma eficiente","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly позволяет эффективно управлять событиями, приглашениями и ссылками на планирование","ar":"تأتمة كالندلي تمكنك من إدارة الأحداث والمستخدمين والروابط التخطيطية بفعالية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化 - 通过 Rube MCP 实现高效管理","ja":"Calendly オートメーション - Rube MCP で効率化","ko":"Calendly 자동화 - Rube MCP 로 효율적인 관리","es":"Automatización de Calendly","fr":"Automatisation de Calendly","de":"Calendly Automatisierung","pt":"Automação Calendly para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly для разработчиков","ar":"تأتمة كالندلي لل مطورين","en":"calendly-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化是通过 Rube MCP 实现的，支持事件列表、邀请管理、安排链接创建等功能。通过 Composio 的 Calendly 工具包，开发者可以高效地管理 Calendly 操作。","ja":"Calendly オートメーションは Rube MCP で実現され、イベントリスト、招待管理、スケジュールリンク作成などをサポートします。Composio の Calendly ツールキットを使用して、開発者は Calendly 操作を効率的に管理できます。","ko":"Calendly 자동화는 Rube MCP 에서 구현되며, 이벤트 목록, 초대 관리, 일정 링크 생성 등 기능을 지원합니다. Composio 의 Calendly 툴킷을 사용하면 개발자가 Calendly 작동을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다.","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite gestionar eventos y organizaciones de manera eficiente. Conecta con Rube MCP para automatizar operaciones.","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet de gérer les événements et les organisations de manière efficace. Connectez-vous à Rube MCP pour automatiser les opérations.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht eine effiziente Verwaltung von Ereignissen und Organisationen. Verbinden Sie sich mit Rube MCP, um Operationen zu...","pt":"A automação do Calendly permite gerenciar eventos, convidados e links de agendamento de forma eficiente","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly позволяет эффективно управлять событиями, приглашениями и ссылками на планирование","ar":"تأتمة كالندلي تمكنك من إدارة الأحداث والمستخدمين والروابط التخطيطية بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["事件列表管理","邀请管理","安排链接创建","可用性查询","组织管理"],"ja":["イベントリスト管理","招待管理","スケジュールリンク作成","可用性クエリ","組織管理"],"ko":["이벤트 목록 관리","초대 관리","일정 링크 생성","사용 가능성 쿼리","조직 관리"],"es":["Automatización de eventos","Gestión de invitados","Creación de enlaces de programación","Consultas de disponibilidad","Administración de organizaciones"],"fr":["Automatisation d''événements","Gestion des invités","Création de liens de planification","Requêtes de disponibilité","Administration d''organisations"],"de":["Automatisierung von Ereignissen","Verwaltung von Teilnehmern","Erstellung von Terminierungslinks","Verfügbarkeitsanfragen","Organisationsverwaltung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de eventos","Gerenciamento de convidados","Criação de links de agendamento","Consultas de disponibilidade","Administração da organização"],"ru":["Управление событиями","Управление приглашениями","Создание ссылок на планирование","Запросы на доступность","Администрирование организации"],"ar":["إدارة الأحداث","إدارة المستخدمين","إنشاء روابط التخطيط","استفسارات عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","事件列表管理","邀请管理","安排链接创建","可用性查询","组织管理"],"ja":["Calendly オートメーション","Rube MCP","Composio","イベントリスト管理","招待管理","スケジュールリンク作成","可用性クエリ","組織管理"],"ko":["Calendly 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","이벤트 목록 관리","초대 관리","일정 링크 생성","사용 가능성 쿼리","조직 관리"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","gestión de eventos","administración de organizaciones","Rube MCP","Composio","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","gestion d''événements","administration d''organisations","Rube MCP","Composio","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Calendly-Automatisierung","Ereignisverwaltung","Organisationsverwaltung","Rube MCP","Composio","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["automação Calendly","Rube MCP","desenvolvedores","produtividade","gerenciamento de eventos","calendário de agendamento"],"ru":["автоматизация Calendly","Rube MCP","разработчики","производительность","управление событиями","календарь планирования"],"ar":["تأتمة كالندلي","Rube MCP","مطورين","إنتاجية","إدارة الأحداث","تقويم التخطيط"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:19.962Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Scheduling Agents requiring seamless Calendly integration and automation via Rube MCP","zh":"适合需要无缝Calendly集成和通过Rube MCP实现自动化的排班代理","ja":"Rube MCPを介したシームレスなCalendly統合と自動化を必要とするスケジューリングエージェントに適しています","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 무중단 Calendly 통합 및 자동화를 요구하는 스케줄링 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de programación que requieren una integración y automatización perfectas de Calendly a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de planification nécessitant une intégration et une automatisation parfaites de Calendly via Rube MCP","de":"Ideal für Scheduling-Agents, die eine nahtlose Calendly-Integration und -Automatisierung über Rube MCP erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Agendamento que exigem integração sem problemas do Calendly e automação via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов планирования, требующих бесшовной интеграции с Calendly и автоматизации через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لوكيلات الجدولة التي تتطلب دمجًا بدون مشاكل من Calendly وتأتمة عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations, including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation, using Composio''s Calendly toolkit and leveraging RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for streamlined connectivity and administration","zh":"赋予代理人使用Composio的Calendly工具包的能力，自动执行Calendly操作，包括事件列表、受邀者管理和安排链接创建，并利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS实现流线型连接和管理","ja":"ComposioのCalendlyツールキットを使用して、イベントリスト、招待者管理、スケジューリングリンクの作成などのCalendly操作を自動化し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用して接続と管理をストリームライン化するエージェントをエンパワーする","ko":"Composio의 Calendly 툴킷을 사용하여 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리, 스케줄링 링크 생성 등을 포함한 Calendly 작업을 자동화하고, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하여 연결 및 관리를 최적화하는 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de Calendly, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación, utilizando la herramienta de Calendly de Composio y aprovechando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una conectividad y administración fluidas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Calendly, y compris la liste des événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification, en utilisant le kit d''outils Calendly de Composio et en exploitant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une connectivité et une administration fluides","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Calendly-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Invitee-Verwaltung und Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen, unter Verwendung des Calendly-Toolkits von Composio und Nutzung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Konnektivität und Verwaltung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly, incluindo listagem de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento, usando a ferramenta Calendly da Composio e aproveitando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para conectividade e administração otimizadas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly, включая перечисление событий, управление приглашениями и создание ссылок на планирование, с использованием набора инструментов Calendly от Composio и использования RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для оптимизированного подключения и администрирования","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من تلقين عمليات كالندلي، بما في ذلك قائمة الأحداث وإدارة المدعوين وإنشاء رابط جدولة، باستخدام أداة كالندلي من كومبوسيو وتحسين الاتصال والإدارة عبر أدوات البحث RUBE و RUBE لإدارة الاتصالات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and organization administration","Generating scheduling links and managing invitee interactions","Querying availability and managing Calendly connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化事件安排和组织管理","生成安排链接和管理受邀者交互","查询可用性并通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS管理Calendly连接"],"ja":["イベントのスケジューリングと組織管理の自動化","スケジューリングリンクの生成と招待者とのやり取りの管理","利用可能な状況の照会とRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したCalendly接続の管理"],"ko":["이벤트 스케줄링 및 조직 관리 자동화","스케줄링 링크 생성 및 초대자 상호작용 관리","가용성 조회 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 Calendly 연결 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de eventos y administración de organizaciones","Generación de enlaces de programación y gestión de interacciones con invitados","Consulta de disponibilidad y gestión de conexiones de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''événements et d''administration d''organisations","Génération de liens de planification et gestion des interactions avec les invités","Recherche de disponibilité et gestion des connexions Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisplanung und Organisationsverwaltung","Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen und Verwaltung von Invitee-Interaktionen","Abfrage von Verfügbarkeit und Verwaltung von Calendly-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar agendamento de eventos e administração de organização","Gerar links de agendamento e gerenciar interações de convidados","Consultar disponibilidade e gerenciar conexões do Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование событий и администрирование организации","Генерировать ссылки на планирование и управлять взаимодействиями приглашенных","Запрашивать доступность и управлять соединениями Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["تلقين جدولة الأحداث وإدارة المنظمة","توليد روابط جدولة وإدارة تفاعلات المدعوين","استعلام عن التوفر وإدارة اتصالات كالندلي عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with calendly toolkit","Many operations require the user''s Calendly credentials"],"zh":["需要具有RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS的Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS具有活动的Calendly连接和Calendly工具包","许多操作需要用户的Calendly凭证"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを備えたRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したアクティブなCalendly接続とCalendlyツールキットが必要","多くの操作ではユーザーのCalendly資格情報が必要"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 갖춘 Rube MCP 연결이 필요합니다","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 활성 Calendly 연결 및 Calendly 툴킷이 필요합니다","많은 작업에서는 사용자의 Calendly 자격 증명이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Necesita una conexión activa de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta de Calendly","Muchas operaciones requieren las credenciales de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion avec Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Nécessite une connexion active Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec le kit d''outils Calendly","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent les informations d''identification Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung mit Rube MCP mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Benötigt eine aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Calendly-Toolkit","Viele Operationen erfordern die Calendly-Anmeldeinformationen des Benutzers"],"pt":["Exige conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Necessita conexão ativa do Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com kit de ferramentas do Calendly","Muitas operações exigem credenciais do Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требует соединения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Требует активного соединения Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с набором инструментов Calendly","Многие операции требуют учетных данных Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP مع أدوات البحث RUBE المتاحة","يتطلب اتصالًا نشطًا من كالندلي عبر RUBE لإدارة الاتصالات مع أداة كالندلي","تتطلب العديد من العمليات بيانات اعتماد كالندلي للمستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
