renciamento de eventos","Criação de links de agendamento","Consulta de disponibilidade","Administração de organização"],"ru":["Управление событиями","Создание ссылок на планирование","Запрос наличия","Администрирование организации"],"ar":["إدارة الفعاليات","إنشاء روابط جدولة","استعلام عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","Calendly 工具包","事件列表自动化","邀请者管理","日程链接创建","可用性查询","组织管理"],"ja":["Calendly オートメーション","Calendly ツールキット","イベントリストの自動化","招待者管理","スケジュールリンクの作成","可用性の照会","組織管理"],"ko":["Calendly 자동화","Calendly 툴킷","이벤트 목록 자동화","초대자 관리","일程 링크 생성","가용성 조회","조직 관리"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","programación de eventos","gestión de invitados","lista de eventos","consultas de disponibilidad","administración de organizaciones"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","planification d''événements","gestion des invités","liste d''événements","requêtes de disponibilité","administration d''organisations"],"de":["Calendly-Automatisierung","Terminplanung","Einladungsverwaltung","Ereignisliste","Verfügbarkeitsanfragen","Organisationsverwaltung"],"pt":["automação calendly","desenvolvimento de software","kit de ferramentas composio","gerenciamento de eventos","criação de links de agendamento","consulta de disponibilidade"],"ru":["автоматизация calendly","разработка программного обеспечения","инструмент composio","управление событиями","создание ссылок на планирование","запрос наличия"],"ar":["أتمتة كالندلي","تطوير البرمجيات","أداة كومبوسيو","إدارة الفعاليات","إنشاء روابط جدولة","استعلام عن التوفر"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:32.669Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Scheduling Agents seeking advanced Calendly automation and integration capabilities via Rube MCP and Composio''s Calendly toolkit.","zh":"适合寻求高级Calendly自动化和集成能力的调度代理，通过Rube MCP和Composio的Calendly工具包实现。","ja":"Rube MCPとComposioのCalendlyツールキットを介した高度なCalendlyの自動化と統合機能を求めるスケジューリングエージェントに最適。","ko":"Rube MCP와 Composio의 Calendly 툴킷을 통해 고급 Calendly 자동화 및 통합 기능을 찾는 스케줄링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Programación que buscan una automatización y capacidad de integración avanzada de Calendly a través de Rube MCP y la herramienta de Calendly de Composio.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de planification recherchant une automatisation et des capacités d''intégration avancées de Calendly via Rube MCP et la boîte à outils Calendly de Composio.","de":"Ideal für Scheduling-Agents, die erweiterte Calendly-Automatisierungs- und Integrationsfunktionen über Rube MCP und Composios Calendly-Toolkit suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Agendamento que buscam automação avançada do Calendly e capacidades de integração via Rube MCP e kit de ferramentas do Calendly da Composio.","ru":"Идеально для агентов планирования, ищущих расширенную автоматизацию Calendly и возможности интеграции через Rube MCP и набор инструментов Calendly от Composio.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الجدولة الذين يبحثون عن أتمتة متقدمة لبرنامج Calendly وخصائص التكامل من خلال Rube MCP وأداة Calendly من Composio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Calendly operations, including event listing, invitee management, and scheduling link creation, through seamless connections via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS and toolkit calendly, leveraging RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for current tool schemas.","zh":"赋予代理自动化Calendly操作的能力，包括事件列表、受邀者管理和调度链接创建，通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS和工具包calendly实现无缝连接，并利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS获取当前工具模式。","ja":"RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSとツールキットcalendlyを介したシームレスな接続を利用し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSで現在のツールスキーマを取得することで、イベントリスト、受け入れ管理、スケジューリングリンク作成などのCalendly操作の自動化をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS와 툴킷 calendly를 통해 시ーム리스한 연결을 제공하고, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 통해 현재 툴 스키마를 가져오는 등, 이벤트 목록, 초대자 관리, 스케줄링 링크 생성 등 Calendly 작업을 자동화하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las operaciones de Calendly, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados y la creación de enlaces de programación, a través de conexiones sin problemas a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS y la herramienta calendly, aprovechando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para los esquemas de herramientas actuales.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Calendly, y compris la liste des événements, la gestion des invités et la création de liens de planification, via des connexions sans interruption via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS et l''outil calendly, en exploitant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils actuels.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Calendly-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Invitee-Verwaltung und Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen, durch nahtlose Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS und das Toolkit calendly, unter Nutzung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für aktuelle Tool-Schemata.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Calendly, incluindo listagem de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados e criação de links de agendamento, por meio de conexões sem interrupção via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS e kit de ferramentas calendly, aproveitando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas atuais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Calendly, включая перечисление событий, управление приглашениями и создание ссылок на планирование, через беспрепятственные соединения через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS и набор инструментов calendly, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для текущих схем инструментов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة عمليات برنامج Calendly، بما في ذلك قائمة الأحداث وإدارة المدعوين وإنشاء روابط الجدولة، من خلال الاتصالات السلسة عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS وأداة calendly، واستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS لمخططات الأدوات الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event scheduling and organization administration","Streamlining invitee management and availability queries","Creating and managing scheduling links for efficient meeting setups"],"zh":["自动化事件调度和组织管理","简化受邀者管理和可用性查询","创建和管理调度链接以实现高效的会议设置"],"ja":["イベントスケジューリングと組織管理の自動化","受け入れ管理と可用性の問い合わせの合理化","効率的な會議設定のためのスケジューリングリンクの作成と管理"],"ko":["이벤트 스케줄링 및 조직 관리 자동화","초대자 관리 및 가용성 쿼리简化","효율적인 미팅 설정을 위한 스케줄링 링크 생성 및 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de eventos y administración de organizaciones","Optimización de la gestión de invitados y consultas de disponibilidad","Creación y gestión de enlaces de programación para una configuración eficiente de reuniones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification d''événements et d''administration d''organisations","Optimisation de la gestion des invités et des requêtes de disponibilité","Création et gestion de liens de planification pour une configuration de réunions efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ereignisplanung und Organisationsverwaltung","Optimierung der Invitee-Verwaltung und Verfügbarkeitsanfragen","Erstellung und Verwaltung von Terminverknüpfungen für eine effiziente Besprechungseinrichtung"],"pt":["Automatizar agendamento de eventos e administração de organização","Otizar gerenciamento de convidados e consultas de disponibilidade","Criar e gerenciar links de agendamento para configurações de reuniões eficientes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование событий и администрирование организации","Оптимизировать управление приглашениями и запросы о доступности","Создавать и управлять ссылками на планирование для эффективной настройки встреч"],"ar":["أتمتة جدولة الأحداث وإدارة المنظمة","تبسيط إدارة المدعوين واستفسارات التوافر","creating وادارة روابط الجدولة لترتيب الاجتماعات بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit calendly necessary","Many operations require the user''s Calendly credentials"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接且RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS和工具包calendly的活跃Calendly连接","许多操作需要用户的Calendly凭证"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSが利用可能なRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSとツールキットcalendlyを介したアクティブなCalendly接続が必要","多くの操作にはユーザーのCalendly資格情報が必要"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS가 사용 가능한 Rube MCP 연결이 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS와 툴킷 calendly를 통해 활성화된 Calendly 연결이 필요합니다.","많은 작업은 사용자의 Calendly 자격 증명이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Conexión activa de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta calendly necesaria","Muchas operaciones requieren las credenciales de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion à Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponible","Connexion active à Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec l''outil calendly nécessaire","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent les informations d''identification de Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbarer RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit calendly erforderlich","Viele Operationen erfordern die Anmeldeinformationen von Calendly des Benutzers"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponível","Conexão ativa do Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com kit de ferramentas calendly necessária","Muitas operações requerem credenciais do Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Необходимо активное подключение Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с набором инструментов calendly","Многие операции требуют учетных данных Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP مع RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS متوفر","يتطلب اتصال Calendly نشط عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة calendly","تتطلب العديد من العمليات بيانات اعتماد المستخدم الخاصة ببرنامج Calendly"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ngxtm/devkit/context-optimization', 'community', 'ngxtm', 'devkit', 'ngxtm/devkit', 'context-optimization', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:42:13.077Z', NULL, '{"id":"ngxtm/devkit/context-optimization","name":"context-optimization","description":{"zh":"上下文优化是一种通过压缩、遮蔽、缓存和分区等策略来提高AI代码助手的上下文窗口利用率的技术","ja":"コンテキスト最適化は、AIコードアシスタントのコンテキストウィンドウの有効容量を拡大するための技術です","ko":"컨텍스트 최적화는 AI 코드 어시스턴트의 컨텍스트 창 활용도를 높이는 기술입니다","es":"La optimización de contexto es una técnica para mejorar la capacidad de los ventanales de contexto limitados. Permite a los asistentes de codificación AI trabajar de manera más eficiente","fr":"L''optimisation de contexte est une technique pour améliorer la capacité des fenêtres de contexte limitées. Elle permet aux assistants de codage AI de travailler de manière plus efficace","de":"Die Kontextoptimierung ist eine Technik zur Verbesserung der Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster. Sie ermöglicht es den AI-Coding-Assistenten, effizienter zu arbeiten","pt":"A Otimização de Contexto é uma técnica que melhora a capacidade de contexto limitado em projetos de desenvolvimento","ru":"Оптимизация контекста - это техника, которая улучшает ограниченную емкость контекста в проектах разработки","ar":"تحسين السياق هو تقنية تحسن من سعة السياق المحدودة في مشاريع التطوير","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"上下文优化技术","ja":"コンテキスト最適化","ko":"컨텍스트 최적화","es":"Optimización de Contexto para Asistentes de Codificación AI","fr":"Optimisation de Contexte pour les Assistants de Codage AI","de":"Kontextoptimierung für AI-Coding-Assistenten","pt":"Otimização de Contexto para De