ligente des technologies","Installation par projet","Synchronisation automatique depuis les sources de upstream","Compression et masquage de contexte","Mise en cache et partitionnement de contexte"],"de":["Intelligente Technologie-Erkennung","Projektinstallation","Automatische Synchronisation von Upstream-Quellen","Komprimierung und Maskierung von Kontext","Cachierung und Partitionierung von Kontext"],"pt":["Compactação de código","Mascaramento de dados","Caching de resultados","Detecção de tecnologias","Instalação por projeto","Sincronização automática"],"ru":["Компактация кода","Маскирование данных","Кэширование результатов","Обнаружение технологий","Установка по проекту","Автоматическая синхронизация"],"ar":["ضغط الكود","التخفي للبيانات","الแคش للنتائج","كشف التكنولوجيا","التثبيت للمشروع","المزامنة التلقائية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","AI代码助手","压缩策略","遮蔽策略","缓存策略","智能技术检测","自动同步","代码优化"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","AIコードアシスタント","圧縮戦略","マスキング戦略","キャッシング戦略","スマートテクノロジー検出","自動同期","コード最適化"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","AI 코드 어시스턴트","압축 전략","마스킹 전략","캐싱 전략","スマート 기술 감지","자동 동기화","코드 최적화"],"es":["optimización de contexto","asistentes de codificación AI","técnicas de compresión","enmascaramiento de contexto","caché de contexto","particionamiento de contexto"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","assistants de codage AI","techniques de compression","masquage de contexte","mise en cache de contexte","partitionnement de contexte"],"de":["Kontextoptimierung","AI-Coding-Assistenten","Komprimierungstechniken","Maskierung von Kontext","Cachierung von Kontext","Partitionierung von Kontext"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","desenvolvimento de software","compactação de código","mascaramento de dados","caching de resultados","detecção de tecnologias","instalação por projeto","sincronização automática"],"ru":["оптимизация контекста","разработка программного обеспечения","компактация кода","маскирование данных","кэширование результатов","обнаружение технологий","установка по проекту","автоматическая синхронизация"],"ar":["تحسين السياق","تطوير البرمجيات","ضغط الكود","التخفي للبيانات","الแคش للنتائج","كشف التكنولوجيا","التثبيت للمشروع","المزامنة التلقائية"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:42:13.077Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot needing advanced context window optimization techniques.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、Cursor 和 Copilot 等人工智能编码助手，需要高级上下文窗口优化技术。","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot などの AI コーディング アシスタントに適しており、先進的なコンテキスト ウィンドウ最適化技術が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor 및 Copilot와 같은 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에 적합하며, 고급 컨텍스트 창 최적화 기술이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code, Cursor y Copilot que necesitan técnicas de optimización de ventanas de contexto avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage de l''IA comme Claude Code, Cursor et Copilot nécessitant des techniques d''optimisation de fenêtres de contexte avancées.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Copilot, die erweiterte Kontextfenster-Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação de IA, como Claude Code, Cursor e Copilot, que precisam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de janela de contexto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для помощников кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Copilot, которые требуют продвинутых техник оптимизации контекстного окна.","ar":"مثالي لمساعدي التشفير بالذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين نافذة السياق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to strategically apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies, effectively doubling or tripling the capacity of limited context windows through techniques like partitioning, thereby enhancing overall performance and efficiency in coding tasks.","zh":"赋予代理以战略性地应用压缩、屏蔽和缓存策略的能力，通过技术如分区，有效地将有限的上下文窗口的容量增加一倍或三倍，从而提高编码任务的整体性能和效率。","ja":"エージェントに戦略的に圧縮、マスキング、キャッシング戦略を適用する能力を与え、パーティショニングなどの技術を使用して、制限付きのコンテキスト ウィンドウの容量を効果的に 2 倍または 3 倍に増やし、コーディング タスクの全体的なパフォーマンスと効率を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 압축, 마스킹 및 캐싱 전략을 전략적으로 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 파티셔닝과 같은 기술을 통해 제한된 컨텍스트 창의 용량을 효과적으로 2 배 또는 3 배로 늘려 코딩 작업의 전체 성능과 효율성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar estrategias de compactación, enmascaramiento y almacenamiento en caché de manera estratégica, lo que efectivamente duplica o triplica la capacidad de ventanas de contexto limitadas a través de técnicas como la partición, mejorando así el rendimiento y la eficiencia generales en tareas de codificación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer stratégiquement des stratégies de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache, ce qui double ou triple efficacement la capacité de fenêtres de contexte limitées grâce à des techniques comme le partitionnement, améliorant ainsi les performances et l''efficacité globales dans les tâches de codage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Komprimierungs-, Maskierungs- und Caching-Strategien strategisch anzuwenden, wodurch die Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster effektiv durch Techniken wie Partitionierung verdoppelt oder verdreifacht wird, was die Gesamtleistung und Effizienz bei Codieraufgaben verbessert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar estratégias de compactação, mascaramento e cache de forma estratégica, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a capacidade de janelas de contexto limitadas por meio de técnicas como particionamento, melhorando assim o desempenho e a eficiência geral em tarefas de codificação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стратегически применять методы компактизации, маскирования и кэширования, эффективно удваивая или утраивая емкость ограниченных контекстных окон посредством методов, таких как разделение, тем самым повышая общую производительность и эффективность при выполнении задач кодирования.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق استراتيجيات التحسين والتخفيض والแคش بشكل استراتيجي، ورفع القدرة الفعلية لتحسين نوافذ السياق المحدودة من خلال تقنيات مثل التقسيم، وبالتالي تحسين الأداء والكفاءة العامة في المهام البرمجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to reduce context window size","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context data","Utilizing caching to optimize context window usage and reduce computational overhead"],"zh":["应用压缩策略以减少上下文窗口大小","实现屏蔽技术以关注相关上下文数据","利用缓存以优化上下文窗口使用并减少计算开销"],"ja":["コンテキスト ウィンドウのサイズを減らすための圧縮戦略の適用","関連するコンテキスト データに焦点を当てるためのマスキング技術の実装","コンテキスト ウィンドウの使用を最適化し、計算オーバーヘッドを削減するためのキャッシングの利用"],"ko":["컨텍스트 창 크기를 줄이기 위한 압축 전략의 적용","관련 컨텍스트 데이터에 집중하기 위한 마스킹 기술의 구현","컨텍스트 창 사용을 최적화하고 계산 오버헤드를 줄이기 위한 캐싱의 활용"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para reducir el tamaño de la ventana de contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en los datos de contexto relevantes","Utilizar el almacenamiento en caché para optimizar el uso de la ventana de contexto y reducir la sobrecarga computacional"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour réduire la taille de la fenêtre de contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur les données de contexte pertinentes","Utiliser la mise en cache pour optimiser l''utilisation de la fenêtre de contexte et réduire la charge de calcul"],"de":["Komprimierungsstrategien anwenden, um die Größe des Kontextfensters zu reduzieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf die relevanten Kontextdaten zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um die Nutzung des Kontextfensters zu optimieren und den Rechenaufwand zu reduzieren"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para reduzir o tamanho da janela de contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para se concentrar nos dados de contexto relevantes","Utilizar cache para otimizar o uso da janela de contexto e reduzir a sobrecarga computacional"],"ru":["Применять стратегии компактизации для уменьшения размера контекстного окна","Реализовывать методы маскирования для сосредоточения внимания на релевантных контекстных данных","Использовать кэш для оптимизации использования контекстного окна и снижения вычислительной нагрузки"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات التحسين لتحسين حجم نافذة السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفيض للتركيز على بيانات السياق ذات الصلة","استخدام الكاش لتحسين استخدام نافذة السياق وتقليل الحمل الحاسوبي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of context window limitations","Dependent on the capacity of the context window","Effective optimization may vary based on specific use cases and data complexity"],"zh":["需要了解上下文窗口的限制","依赖于上下文窗口的容量","有效的优化可能会根据具体的使用场景和数据复杂性而有所不同"],"ja":["コンテキスト ウィンドウの制限を理解する必要がある","コンテキスト ウィンドウの容量に依存する","特定の使用シナリオとデータの複雑さに応じて、有効な最適化は異なる場合がある"],"ko":["컨텍스트 창의 제한을 이해해야 함","컨텍스트 창의 용량에 의존함","유효한 최적화는 특정 사용 시나리오와 데이터 복잡도에 따라 다를 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las limitaciones de la ventana de contexto","Depende de la capacidad de la ventana de contexto","La optimización efectiva puede variar en función de los casos de uso específicos y la complejidad de los datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des limites de la fenêtre de contexte","Dépend de la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte","L''optimisation efficace peut varier en fonction des cas d''utilisation spécifiques et de la complexité des données"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis der Einschränkungen des Kontextfensters","Hängt von der Kapazität des Kontextfensters ab","Die effektive Optimierung kann je nach spezifischem Einsatzfall und Datenkomplexität variieren"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das limitações da janela de contexto","Depende da capacidade da janela de contexto","A otimização eficaz pode variar com base em casos de uso específicos e complexidade dos dados"],"ru":["Требует понимания ограничений контекстного окна","Зависит от емкости контекстного окна","Эффективная оптимизация может варьироваться в зависимости от конкретных случаев использования и сложности данных"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للقيود المحددة لنافذة السياق","يعتمد على سعة نافذة السياق","يمكن أن تختلف التحسين الفعال بناءً على حالات استخدام محددة و複雑ية البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
