zierung der Kontextgröße","Anwendung von Masking, um irrelevante Informationen zu verbergen","Implementierung von Cachetechniken zur Verbesserung des Informationszugriffs","Partitionierung der Informationen für eine bessere Organisation","Leistungsoptimierung durch Reduzierung der Datennutzlast"],"pt":["Compactação de contexto","Mascaramento de contexto","Caching de contexto","Particionamento de contexto","Otimização de capacidade"],"ru":["Компактация контекста","Маскирование контекста","Кэширование контекста","Разделение контекста","Оптимизация емкости"],"ar":["تكثيف السياق","إخفاء السياق","الแคش السياق","تقسيم السياق","تحسين السعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","有限上下文窗口","压缩","屏蔽","缓存","分区","优化性能"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","制限されたコンテキストウィンドウ","圧縮","隠蔽","キャッシュ","パーティショニング","パフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","제한된 컨텍스트 창","압축","마스킹","캐싱","파티ショ닝","성능 최적화"],"es":["optimización de contexto","técnicas de compresión","masking","caché","particionamiento","rendimiento","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","techniques de compression","masking","cache","partitionnement","performances","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Kontextoptimierung","Komprimierungstechniken","Masking","Cachetechniken","Partitionierung","Leistung","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","compactação de contexto","mascaramento de contexto","caching de contexto","particionamento de contexto","desempenho de contexto"],"ru":["оптимизация контекста","компактация контекста","маскирование контекста","кэширование контекста","разделение контекста","производительность контекста"],"ar":["تحسين السياق","تكثيف السياق","إخفاء السياق","الแคش السياق","تقسيم السياق","أداء السياق"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:41:56.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring strategic context window management through compaction, masking, and caching strategies.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要通过压缩、屏蔽和缓存策略来管理战略上下文窗口。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、圧縮、遮蔽、キャッシング戦略を通じて戦略的コンテキストウィンドウ管理を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이 에이전트는 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 전략을 통해 전략적 컨텍스트 창 관리를 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren un manejo estratégico de la ventana de contexto a través de estrategias de compactación, enmascaramiento y almacenamiento en caché.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une gestion stratégique de la fenêtre de contexte via des stratégies de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ein strategisches Kontextfenster-Management durch Komprimierungs-, Maskierungs- und Caching-Strategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que exigem gestão estratégica de janela de contexto por meio de estratégias de compactação, mascaramento e cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих стратегического управления контекстным окном посредством стратегий компактации, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذي يتطلب إدارة سياق استراتيجية من خلال استراتيجيات الضغط والتخفي والแคش."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning, leveraging techniques like compaction and caching to optimize context utilization.","zh":"赋予代理扩展有限上下文窗口的有效容量的能力，通过战略压缩、遮蔽、缓存和分区，利用压缩和缓存等技术优化上下文利用。","ja":"エージェントに、戦略的圧縮、遮蔽、キャッシング、パーティショニングを通じて、有限なコンテキストウィンドウの有効容量を拡張する能力を与え、圧縮やキャッシングなどの技術を利用してコンテキストの利用を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 전략적 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱, 파티셔닝을 통해 제한된 컨텍스트 창의有效 용량을 확장할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 압축 및 캐싱などの 기술을 활용하여 컨텍스트 활용을 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ampliar la capacidad efectiva de ventanas de contexto limitadas a través de una compresión, enmascaramiento, caché y particionamiento estratégicos, aprovechando técnicas como la compactación y el almacenamiento en caché para optimizar la utilización del contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la capacité effective des fenêtres de contexte limitées via une compression, un masquage, un cache et un partitionnement stratégiques, en exploitant des techniques comme la compactage et la mise en cache pour optimiser l''utilisation du contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die effektive Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster durch strategische Komprimierung, Maskierung, Caching und Partitionierung zu erweitern, indem Techniken wie Komprimierung und Caching zur Optimierung der Kontextnutzung eingesetzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a capacidade eficaz de janelas de contexto limitadas por meio da compressão estratégica, mascaramento, cache e particionamento, utilizando técnicas como compactação e cache para otimizar a utilização do contexto.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширить эффективную емкость ограниченных контекстных окон посредством стратегического сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения, используя такие техники, как компактация и кэширование для оптимизации использования контекста.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توسيع السعة الفعالة لنوافذ السياق المحدودة من خلال الضغط الاستراتيجي والتخفي والแคش والتقسيم، مستخدما تقنيات مثل الضغط والแคش لتحسين استخدام السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to reduce context size","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context","Utilizing caching to improve context window efficiency"],"zh":["应用压缩策略以减少上下文大小","实现遮蔽技术以关注相关上下文","利用缓存以提高上下文窗口效率"],"ja":["圧縮戦略を適用してコンテキストサイズを削減する","遮蔽技術を実装して関連するコンテキストに焦点を当てる","キャッシングを利用してコンテキストウィンドウの効率を向上させる"],"ko":["압축 전략을 적용하여 컨텍스트 크기를 줄이는 것","마스킹 기술을 구현하여 관련 컨텍스트에 집중하는 것","캐싱을 활용하여 컨텍스트 창 효율을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para reducir el tamaño del contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en el contexto relevante","Utilizar el almacenamiento en caché para mejorar la eficiencia de la ventana de contexto"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour réduire la taille du contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur le contexte pertinent","Utiliser la mise en cache pour améliorer l''efficacité de la fenêtre de contexte"],"de":["Komprimierungsstrategien anwenden, um die Kontextgröße zu reduzieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf den relevanten Kontext zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um die Effizienz des Kontextfensters zu verbessern"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para reduzir o tamanho do contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para focar no contexto relevante","Utilizar cache para melhorar a eficiência da janela de contexto"],"ru":["Применение стратегий компактации для уменьшения размера контекста","Реализация техник маскирования для фокусировки на релевантном контексте","Использование кэша для улучшения эффективности контекстного окна"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتقليل حجم السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفي لتركيز على السياق ذي الصلة","استخدام الكاش لتحسين كفاءة نافذة السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to optimizing existing context window capacity","Requires strategic application of optimization techniques"],"zh":["仅限于优化现有的上下文窗口容量","需要战略性的优化技术应用"],"ja":["既存のコンテキストウィンドウ容量の最適化のみ","戦略的な最適化技術の適用が必要"],"ko":["既存의 컨텍스트 창 용량을 최적화하는 것만으로 제한됨","전략적인 최적화 기술의 적용이 필요함"],"es":["Limitado a la optimización de la capacidad de la ventana de contexto existente","Requiere una aplicación estratégica de técnicas de optimización"],"fr":["Limité à l''optimisation de la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte existante","Nécessite une application stratégique de techniques d''optimisation"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der Kapazität des bestehenden Kontextfensters","Erfordert eine strategische Anwendung von Optimierungstechniken"],"pt":["Limitado à otimização da capacidade da janela de contexto existente","Exige aplicação estratégica de técnicas de otimização"],"ru":["Ограничен оптимизацией существующей емкости контекстного окна","Требует стратегического применения техник оптимизации"],"ar":["محدود بتحسين سعة نافذة السياق الحالية","يتطلب تطبيق استراتيجي لتقنيات التحسين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
