мизация: повысьте эффективность","ar":"تحسين سياق: تحسين الأداء","en":"context-optimization"},"description":{"zh":"上下文优化技能用于优化上下文窗口，通过压缩、遮罩、缓存和分区技术提高开发效率","ja":"コンテキスト最適化スキルはコンテキストウィンドウを最適化し、圧縮、隠蔽、キャッシュ、パーティション化技術を使用して開発効率を向上","ko":"컨텍스트 최적화 기술은 컨텍스트 창을 최적화하여 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 및 파티셔닝 기술을 사용하여 개발 효율성을 향상","es":"La optimización de contexto mejora la capacidad efectiva de las ventanas de contexto limitadas a través de la compresión, el masking, el caching y la partici...","fr":"L''optimisation de contexte améliore la capacité effective des fenêtres de contexte limitées grâce à la compression, au masking, au caching et à la partition ...","de":"Die Kontextoptimierung verbessert die effektive Kapazität der begrenzten Kontextfenster durch strategische Komprimierung, Masking, Caching und Partitionierung","pt":"A otimização de contexto estende a capacidade eficaz de janelas de contexto limitadas por meio de compressão, mascaramento, cache e partições estratégicas.","ru":"Контекстная оптимизация расширяет эффективную емкость ограниченных контекстных окон посредством стратегического сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения.","ar":"تحسين السياق يوسع القدرة الفعلية للنوافذ السياقية المحدودة من خلال الضغط والتخفيض والแคش والتقسيم الاستراتيجي","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["压缩技术","遮罩技术","缓存技术","分区技术","上下文窗口优化"],"ja":["圧縮技術","隠蔽技術","キャッシュ技術","パーティション化技術","コンテキストウィンドウ最適化"],"ko":["압축 기술","마스킹 기술","캐싱 기술","파티셔닝 기술","컨텍스트 창 최적화"],"es":["Técnicas de compacción para reducir el tamaño del contexto","Estrategias de masking para ocultar información irrelevante","Técnicas de caching para almacenar información frecuentemente utilizada","Particionamiento estratégico para mejorar la eficiencia","Mejora del rendimiento en aplicaciones con ventanas de contexto limitadas"],"fr":["Techniques de compaction pour réduire la taille du contexte","Stratégies de masking pour masquer les informations non pertinentes","Techniques de caching pour stocker les informations fréquemment utilisées","Partitionnement stratégique pour améliorer l''efficacité","Amélioration des performances dans les applications avec des fenêtres de contexte limitées"],"de":["Komprimierungstechniken zur Reduzierung der Kontextgröße","Masking-Strategien zur Verbergen irrelevanter Informationen","Caching-Techniken zur Speicherung häufig genutzter Informationen","Strategische Partitionierung zur Verbesserung der Effizienz","Leistungsverbesserung in Anwendungen mit begrenzten Kontextfenstern"],"pt":["Compactação de dados","Mascaramento de informações","Técnicas de cache","Partições estratégicas","Melhoria do desempenho do aplicativo","Extensão da capacidade eficaz de janelas de contexto"],"ru":["Компактирование данных","Маскирование информации","Методы кэширования","Стратегическое разделение","Повышение производительности приложения","Расширение эффективной емкости контекстных окон"],"ar":["ضغط البيانات","التخفيض للمعلومات","تقنيات الكैश","التقسيم الاستراتيجي","تحسين أداء التطبيق","توسيع القدرة الفعلية للنوافذ السياقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","压缩技术","遮罩技术","缓存技术","分区技术","开发效率","上下文窗口"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","圧縮技術","隠蔽技術","キャッシュ技術","パーティション化技術","開発効率","コンテキストウィンドウ"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","압축 기술","마스킹 기술","캐싱 기술","파티셔닝 기술","개발 효율성","컨텍스트 창"],"es":["optimización de contexto","técnicas de compacción","masking","caching","particionamiento estratégico","mejora del rendimiento","ventanas de contexto limitadas"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","techniques de compaction","masking","caching","partitionnement stratégique","amélioration des performances","fenêtres de contexte limitées"],"de":["Kontextoptimierung","Komprimierungstechniken","Masking","Caching","strategische Partitionierung","Leistungsverbesserung","begrenzte Kontextfenster"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","compactação de dados","mascaramento de informações","técnicas de cache","partições estratégicas","desempenho do aplicativo","janelas de contexto","compressão de dados","melhoria de desempenho"],"ru":["контекстная оптимизация","компактирование данных","маскирование информации","методы кэширования","стратегическое разделение","производительность приложения","контекстные окна","сжатие данных","повышение производительности"],"ar":["تحسين سياق","ضغط البيانات","التخفيض للمعلومات","تقنيات الكैश","التقسيم الاستراتيجي","أداء التطبيق","نوافذ سياق","ضغط البيانات","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:42:15.886Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing strategic context window optimization through compaction, masking, and caching strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要通过压缩、掩码和缓存策略优化策略上下文窗口的高级AI代理。","ja":"戦略的コンテキストウィンドウの最適化を必要とする高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전략적 컨텍스트 창 최적화를 필요로 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan optimizar la ventana de contexto estratégico a través de compactación, enmascaramiento y estrategias de almacenamiento en caché.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de l''IA avancés ayant besoin d''optimiser la fenêtre de contexte stratégique grâce à la compactation, au masquage et aux stratégies de mise en cache.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agents, die eine strategische Kontextfenster-Optimierung durch Kompaktion, Maskierung und Caching-Strategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de otimização da janela de contexto estratégico por meio de compactação, mascaramento e estratégias de cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуется стратегическая оптимизация окна контекста посредством компактизации, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين النافذة السياقية الاستراتيجية من خلال استراتيجيات الضغط والتخفي والแคش."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend effective capacity of limited context windows using techniques like compression, masking, caching, and partitioning, effectively doubling or tripling the context window''s utility without increasing its size, leveraging libraries and protocols for optimized data handling.","zh":"能够让代理扩大有限的上下文窗口的有效容量，使用压缩、掩码、缓存和分区等技术，能够在不增加上下文窗口大小的情况下，有效地将其容量加倍或使其增加三倍，利用库和协议进行优化的数据处理。","ja":"エージェントが、圧縮、マスキング、キャッシング、パーティショニングなどの技術を使用して、制限されたコンテキストウィンドウの有効容量を拡大できるようにし、コンテキストウィンドウのサイズを増やさずに、コンテキストウィンドウの有効性を2倍または3倍に増やすことができ、ライブラリやプロトコルを利用して最適化されたデータ処理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 및 파티셔닝などの 기술을 사용하여 제한된 컨텍스트 창의 유효 용량을 확장할 수 있도록 하며, 컨텍스트 창의 크기를 늘리지 않고도 컨텍스트 창의 유효성을 두 배 또는 세 배로 늘릴 수 있으며, 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 활용하여 최적화된 데이터 처리를 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ampliar la capacidad efectiva de ventanas de contexto limitadas utilizando técnicas como la compresión, el enmascaramiento, la caché y la partición, lo que efectivamente duplica o triplica la utilidad de la ventana de contexto sin aumentar su tamaño, aprovechando bibliotecas y protocolos para el manejo óptimo de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la capacité effective de fenêtres de contexte limitées en utilisant des techniques telles que la compression, le masquage, la mise en cache et le partitionnement, ce qui double ou triple effectivement l''utilité de la fenêtre de contexte sans augmenter sa taille, en exploitant les bibliothèques et les protocoles pour la gestion optimale des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die effektive Kapazität begrenzter Kontextfenster durch Techniken wie Komprimierung, Maskierung, Caching und Partitionierung zu erweitern, was die Nützlichkeit des Kontextfensters effektiv verdoppelt oder verdreifacht, ohne dessen Größe zu erhöhen, und dabei Bibliotheken und Protokolle für optimierte Datenverwaltung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a capacidade eficaz de janelas de contexto limitadas, utilizando técnicas como compressão, mascaramento, cache e particionamento, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a utilidade da janela de contexto sem aumentar seu tamanho, aproveitando bibliotecas e protocolos para manipulação de dados otimizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширить эффективную емкость ограниченных окон контекста, используя методы, такие как сжатие, маскирование, кэширование и разделение, эффективно удваивая или утраивая полезность окна контекста без увеличения его размера, используя библиотеки и протоколы для оптимизированной обработки данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توسيع السعة الفعلية للنوافذ السياقية المحدودة باستخدام تقنيات مثل الضغط والتخفي والแคش والتقسيم، بحيث يزيد بشكل فعال من فائدة النافذة السياقية مرتين أو ثلاث مرات بدون زيادة حجمها، مستفيداً من المكتبات والبروتوكولات لمعالجة البيانات المُحسّنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to reduce context window size","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context data","Utilizing caching to improve performance in context-dependent tasks"],"zh":["应用压缩策略以减少上下文窗口大小","实施掩码技术以关注相关的上下文数据","利用缓存以提高依赖上下文的任务性能"],"ja":["圧縮戦略を適用してコンテキストウィンドウのサイズを削減する","マスキング技術を実装して関連するコンテキストデータに焦点を当てる","キャッシングを利用してコンテキスト依存タスクのパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["압축 전략을 적용하여 컨텍스트 창 크기를 줄임","마스킹 기술을实施하여 관련 컨텍스트 데이터에 집중","캐싱을 활용하여 컨텍스트 종속 작업의 성능을 개선"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para reducir el tamaño de la ventana de contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en los datos de contexto relevantes","Utilizar la caché para mejorar el rendimiento en tareas dependientes del contexto"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactation pour réduire la taille de la fenêtre de contexte","Implémenter des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur les données de contexte pertinentes","Utiliser la mise en cache pour améliorer les performances dans les tâches dépendantes du contexte"],"de":["Kompaktionsstrategien anwenden, um die Größe des Kontextfensters zu reduzieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf die relevanten Kontextdaten zu konzentrieren","Caching verwenden, um die Leistung bei kontextabhängigen Aufgaben zu verbessern"],"pt":["Aplicação de estratégias de compactação para reduzir o tamanho da janela de contexto","Implementação de técnicas de mascaramento para se concentrar nos dados de contexto relevantes","Utilização de cache para melhorar o desempenho em tarefas dependentes de contexto"],"ru":["Применение стратегий компактизации для уменьшения размера окна контекста","Реализация методов маскирования для сосредоточения внимания на релевантных данных контекста","Использование кэша для улучшения производительности в задачах, зависящих от контекста"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتقليل حجم النافذة السياقية","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفي لتركيز الانتباه على بيانات السياق ذات الصلة","استخدام الكاش لتحسين الأداء في المهام التابعة للسياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strategic planning for effective context optimization","Limited by the capacity of the context window being optimized"],"zh":["需要战略规划以实现有效的上下文优化","受被优化的上下文窗口容量的限制"],"ja":["効果的なコンテキストの最適化を実現するための戦略的計画が必要","最適化されるコンテキストウィンドウの容量の制限を受ける"],"ko":["유효한 컨텍스트 최적화를 달성하기 위한 전략적 계획이 필요함","최적화되는 컨텍스트 창의 용량의 제한을 받음"],"es":["Requiere una planificación estratégica para una optimización de contexto efectiva","Está limitado por la capacidad de la ventana de contexto que se está optimizando"],"fr":["Nécessite une planification stratégique pour une optimisation de contexte effective","Est limité par la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte qui est optimisée"],"de":["Erfordert eine strategische Planung für eine effektive Kontextoptimierung","Wird durch die Kapazität des Kontextfensters begrenzt, das optimiert wird"],"pt":["Requer planejamento estratégico para otimização eficaz do contexto","Limitado pela capacidade da janela de contexto sendo otimizada"],"ru":["Требует стратегического планирования для эффективной оптимизации контекста","Ограничен емкостью окна контекста, которое оптимизируется"],"ar":["يتطلب التخطيط الاستراتيجي لتحسين السياق الفعال","محدود بسعة النافذة السياقية التي يتم تحسينها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
