isierung mit Rube MCP","pt":"Automatize ConvertKit com Rube MCP","ru":"Автоматизация ConvertKit с помощью Rube MCP","ar":"أوتوماتيك كونفرت كيت مع روب إم سي بي","en":"convertkit-automation"},"description":{"zh":"ConvertKit 自动化工具通过 Rube MCP 实现电子邮件营销操作的自动化，简化工作流程","ja":"ConvertKit オートメーションは Rube MCP を使用してメールマーケティング操作を自動化し、ワークフローを簡素化します","ko":"컨버트킷 자동화 도구는 Rube MCP를 사용하여 이메일 마케팅 작업을 자동화하여 워크플로우를 간소화합니다","es":"La automatización de ConvertKit permite a los desarrolladores automatizar operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico a través de Rube MCP. Conecta tu cu...","fr":"L''automatisation de ConvertKit permet aux développeurs d''automatiser les opérations de marketing par e-mail via Rube MCP. Connectez votre compte Kit et comme...","de":"Die Automatisierung von ConvertKit ermöglicht es Entwicklern, E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über Rube MCP zu automatisieren. Verbinden Sie Ihr Kit-Konto und b...","pt":"Automatize operações de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit com o kit de ferramentas Composio via Rube MCP. Pré-requisitos incluem conexão Rube MCP e conexão ...","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции электронного маркетинга ConvertKit с помощью набора инструментов Composio через Rube MCP. Предварительные требования включают подклю...","ar":"أتمتة عمليات التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني لكونفرت كيت باستخدام أدوات كومبوسيو عبر روب إم سي بي. المتطلبات المسبقة تشمل الاتصال بروب إم سي بي والاتصال النشط ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 实现 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销自动化","简化工作流程，提高工作效率","无需 API 密钥，轻松连接","支持多种工具和服务集成","提供实时工具模式和自动化支持"],"ja":["Rube MCP を使用して ConvertKit のメールマーケティングを自動化","ワークフローを簡素化し、作業効率を向上させる","API キーは不要、簡単に接続","多種のツールとサービスをサポート","リアルタイムのツールモードと自動化をサポート"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 자동화","워크플로우를 간소화하여 작업 효율성을 높여줌","API 키가 필요하지 않음, 쉽게 연결","다양한 도구와 서비스를 지원","실시간 도구 모드와 자동화 지원"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP sin necesidad de claves API","Automatización de operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico","Uso de la herramienta Kit de Composio","Configuración sencilla","Integración con Kit (anteriormente ConvertKit)"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP sans clés API nécessaires","Automatisation des opérations de marketing par e-mail","Utilisation de l''outil Kit de Composio","Configuration simple","Intégration avec Kit (anciennement ConvertKit)"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP ohne API-Schlüssel","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen","Verwendung des Kit-Tools von Composio","Einfache Konfiguration","Integration mit Kit (früher ConvertKit)"],"pt":["Automação de operações de marketing por e-mail","Conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa Kit","Uso do kit de ferramentas Composio","Sem necessidade de chaves de API","Configuração simples"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций электронного маркетинга","Подключение Rube MCP","Активное подключение Kit","Использование набора инструментов Composio","Не требуется ключ API","Простая настройка"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني","الارتباط بروب إم سي بي","الارتباط النشط كيت","استخدام أدوات كومبوسيو","لا حاجة لمفتاح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الإعداد البسيط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ConvertKit 自动化","Rube MCP","电子邮件营销自动化","工作流程简化","API 密钥","工具集成","自动化支持"],"ja":["ConvertKit オートメーション","Rube MCP","メールマーケティング自動化","ワークフロー簡素化","API キー","ツール統合","自動化サポート"],"ko":["컨버트킷 자동화","Rube MCP","이메일 마케팅 자동화","워크플로우 간소화","API 키","도구 통합","자동화 지원"],"es":["automatización de ConvertKit","Rube MCP","marketing por correo electrónico","herramienta Kit","Composio","integración con Kit"],"fr":["automatisation de ConvertKit","Rube MCP","marketing par e-mail","outil Kit","Composio","intégration avec Kit"],"de":["Automatisierung von ConvertKit","Rube MCP","E-Mail-Marketing","Kit-Tool","Composio","Integration mit Kit"],"pt":["automatização do ConvertKit","Rube MCP","kit de ferramentas Composio","marketing por e-mail","automação de operações","conexão Rube MCP","conexão ativa Kit"],"ru":["автоматизация ConvertKit","Rube MCP","набор инструментов Composio","электронный маркетинг","автоматизация операций","подключение Rube MCP","активное подключение Kit"],"ar":["أتمتة كونفرت كيت","روب إم سي بي","أدوات كومبوسيو","تسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني","أتمتة عمليات","الارتباط بروب إم سي بي","الارتباط النشط كيت"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convertkit-automation","description":"Automate ConvertKit (Kit) tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): manage subscribers, tags, broadcasts, and broadcast stats. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — ju","body":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Kit authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Subscribers\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse, search, or filter email subscribers\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers with filters and pagination [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `status`: Filter by status (''active'' or ''inactive'')\n- `email_address`: Exact email to search for\n- `created_after`/`created_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `updated_after`/`updated_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `sort_field`: Sort by ''id'', ''cancelled_at'', or ''updated_at''\n- `sort_order`: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n- `per_page`: Results per page (min 1)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' to get total subscriber count\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- If `sort_field` is ''cancelled_at'', the `status` must be set to ''cancelled''\n- Date filters use YYYY-MM-DD format (no time component)\n- `email_address` is an exact match; partial email search is not supported\n- Pagination uses cursor-based approach with `after`/`before` cursor strings\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean\n\n### 2. Manage Subscriber Tags\n\n**When to use**: User wants to tag subscribers for segmentation\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID by email [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER` - Associate a subscriber with a tag [Required]\n3. `KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers for a specific tag [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for tagging**:\n- `tag_id`: Numeric tag ID (required)\n- `subscriber_id`: Numeric subscriber ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Both `tag_id` and `subscriber_id` must be positive integers\n- Tag IDs must reference existing tags; tags are created via the Kit web UI\n- Tagging an already-tagged subscriber is idempotent (no error)\n- Subscriber IDs are returned from LIST_SUBSCRIBERS; use `email_address` filter to find specific subscribers\n\n### 3. Unsubscribe a Subscriber\n\n**When to use**: User wants to unsubscribe a subscriber from all communications\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER` - Unsubscribe the subscriber [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Subscriber ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This permanently unsubscribes the subscriber from ALL email communications\n- The subscriber''s historical data is retained but they will no longer receive emails\n- Operation is idempotent; unsubscribing an already-unsubscribed subscriber succeeds without error\n- Returns empty response (HTTP 204 No Content) on success\n- Subscriber ID must exist; non-existent IDs return 404\n\n### 4. List and View Broadcasts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse email broadcasts or get details of a specific one\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - List all broadcasts with pagination [Required]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Get detailed information for a specific broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS` - Get performance statistics for a broadcast [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-500)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' for total count\n\n**Key parameters for details**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `per_page` max is 500 for broadcasts\n- Broadcast stats are only available for sent broadcasts\n- Draft broadcasts will not have stats\n- Broadcast IDs are numeric integers\n\n### 5. Delete a Broadcast\n\n**When to use**: User wants to permanently remove a broadcast\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - Find the broadcast to delete [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Verify it is the correct broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST` - Permanently delete the broadcast [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone\n- Deleting a sent broadcast removes it but does not unsend the emails\n- Confirm the broadcast ID before deleting\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Subscriber Lookup by Email\n\n```\n1. Call KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS with email_address=''user@example.com''\n2. Extract subscriber ID from the response\n3. Use ID for tagging, unsubscribing, or other operations\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\nKit uses cursor-based pagination:\n- Check response for `after` cursor value\n- Pass cursor as `after` parameter in next request\n- Continue until no more cursor is returned\n- Use `include_total_count: ''true''` to track progress\n\n### Tag-Based Segmentation\n\n```\n1. Create tags in Kit web UI\n2. Use KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER to assign tags to subscribers\n3. Use KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS to view subscribers per tag\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Subscriber IDs: positive integers (e.g., 3887204736)\n- Tag IDs: positive integers\n- Broadcast IDs: positive integers\n- All IDs are numeric, not strings\n\n**Status Values**:\n- Subscriber statuses: ''active'', ''inactive'', ''cancelled''\n- Some operations are restricted by status (e.g., sorting by cancelled_at requires status=''cancelled'')\n\n**String vs Boolean Parameters**:\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean true\n- `sort_order` is a string enum: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Kit API has per-account rate limits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n- Bulk operations should be paced appropriately\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Cursor values are opaque strings; use exactly as returned\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List subscribers | KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS | status, email_address, per_page |\n| Tag subscriber | KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER | tag_id, subscriber_id |\n| List tag subscribers | KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS | tag_id |\n| Unsubscribe | KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER | id |\n| List broadcasts | KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS | per_page, after |\n| Get broadcast | KIT_GET_BROADCAST | id |\n| Get broadcast stats | KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS | id |\n| Delete broadcast | KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST | id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:42:16.769Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced email marketing workflow integration via Rube MCP and ConvertKit API","zh":"适合需要通过 Rube MCP 和 ConvertKit API 进行高级电子邮件营销工作流集成的营销自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP と ConvertKit API を使用した高度な電子メールマーケティングワークフローの統合が必要なマーケティング自動化エージェントに適しています","ko":"Rube MCP와 ConvertKit API를 사용하여 고급 이메일 마케팅 워크플로우 통합이 필요한 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Marketing que necesitan una integración avanzada de flujo de marketing por correo electrónico a través de Rube MCP y ConvertKit API","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation marketing ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de workflow de marketing par e-mail via Rube MCP et ConvertKit API","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte E-Mail-Marketing-Workflow-Integration über Rube MCP und ConvertKit API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que precisam de integração avançada de fluxo de trabalho de marketing por e-mail via Rube MCP e ConvertKit API","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов маркетинговой автоматизации, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция рабочего процесса электронного маркетинга через Rube MCP и ConvertKit API","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомاتية التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم في سير عمل التسويق الإلكتروني عبر Rube MCP و ConvertKit API"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit, leveraging RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and utilizing protocols like MCP for connection management","zh":"通过 Composio 的 Kit 工具包、利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 实现无缝集成，并使用 MCP 等协议进行连接管理，从而赋予代理自动化 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销操作的能力","ja":"Composio の Kit ツールキットを使用し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を利用してシームレスな統合を実現し、MCP などのプロトコルを使用して接続管理を行うことで、エージェントが ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティング操作を自動化することを可能にします","ko":"Composio의 Kit 툴킷을 사용하여 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하여 無шов한 통합을 구현하고 MCP 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 연결 관리를 수행함으로써 에이전트가 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico de ConvertKit a través de la herramienta Kit de Composio, aprovechando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración sin problemas, y utilizando protocolos como MCP para la gestión de conexiones","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de marketing par e-mail de ConvertKit via la boîte à outils Kit de Composio, en exploitant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration transparente, et en utilisant des protocoles comme MCP pour la gestion des connexions","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über das Composio-Kit-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem sie RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration nutzen und Protokolle wie MCP für die Verbindungsbewirtschaftung verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit por meio da ferramenta Kit da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração sem interrupções e utilizando protocolos como MCP para gerenciamento de conexões","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции электронного маркетинга ConvertKit с помощью инструментария Kit от Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для бесшовной интеграции и используя протоколы, такие как MCP, для управления подключениями","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير عمليات التسويق الإلكتروني من ConvertKit من خلال أداة Kit من Composio ،ользуя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل MCP لإدارة الاتصالات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating email sequences via ConvertKit","Managing subscriber lists through Rube MCP","Triggering Kit workflows based on user interactions"],"zh":["通过 ConvertKit 自动化电子邮件序列","通过 Rube MCP 管理订阅者列表","根据用户交互触发 Kit 工作流"],"ja":["ConvertKit を使用して電子メールシーケンスを自動化する","Rube MCP を使用してサブスクライバーの一覧を管理する","ユーザーの相互作用に基づいて Kit ワークフローをトリガーする"],"ko":["ConvertKit을 사용하여 이메일 시퀀스를 자동화하는 것","Rube MCP를 사용하여 구독자 목록을 관리하는 것","사용자 상호작용에 따라 Kit 워크플ロー 트리거"],"es":["Automatizar secuencias de correo electrónico a través de ConvertKit","Gestionar listas de suscriptores a través de Rube MCP","Activar flujos de trabajo de Kit en función de las interacciones del usuario"],"fr":["Automatiser les séquences d''e-mail via ConvertKit","Gérer les listes d''abonnés via Rube MCP","Déclencher des flux de travail Kit en fonction des interactions de l''utilisateur"],"de":["E-Mail-Sequenzen über ConvertKit automatisieren","Abonnentenlisten über Rube MCP verwalten","Kit-Workflows auf der Grundlage von Benutzerinteraktionen auslösen"],"pt":["Automatizar sequências de e-mails via ConvertKit","Gerenciar listas de assinantes por meio do Rube MCP","Acionar fluxos de trabalho do Kit com base em interações do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать последовательности электронной почты через ConvertKit","Управлять списками подписчиков через Rube MCP","Запускать рабочие процессы Kit на основе взаимодействия пользователя"],"ar":["توفير تسلسلات البريد الإلكتروني عبر ConvertKit","إدارة قوائم المشتركين من خلال Rube MCP","تشغيل سير عمل Kit dựa على تفاعلات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active Rube MCP connection","Needs active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for tool schemas"],"zh":["需要活动的 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的活动 Kit 连接","依赖于 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 的工具架构"],"ja":["アクティブな Rube MCP 接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用したアクティブな Kit 接続が必要","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS のツールスキーマに依存する"],"ko":["활성 Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용한 활성 Kit 연결이 필요","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS의 툴 스키마에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una conexión activa de Rube MCP","Necesita una conexión activa de Kit a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Depende de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion active Rube MCP","A besoin d''une connexion active Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Dépend de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils"],"de":["Benötigt eine aktive Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Benötigt eine aktive Kit-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Hängt von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für Werkzeugschemata ab"],"pt":["Exige conexão ativa do Rube MCP","Necessita conexão ativa do Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Dependente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas"],"ru":["Требует активного подключения Rube MCP","Требует активного подключения Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Зависит от RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال نشط من Rube MCP","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط من Kit عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","يعتمد على RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS من أجل مخططات الأدوات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
