it-Tool von Composio","Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Benötigt keine API-Schlüssel","Einfache Konfiguration","Automatisierung von Marketing-Aufgaben"],"pt":["Automatize operações de marketing por e-mail do Kit","Conecte-se ao Rube MCP sem necessidade de chaves de API","Active a conexão com o Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Chame RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para obter os esquemas de ferramentas atuais","Use o toolkit Composio para gerenciar operações de marketing por e-mail do Kit"],"ru":["Автоматизируйте операции электронного маркетинга Kit","Подключитесь к Rube MCP без необходимости в ключах API","Активируйте подключение к Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Вызовите RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, чтобы получить текущие схемы инструментов","Используйте инструментарий Composio для управления операциями электронного маркетинга Kit"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني لكيت","اتصل بروب إم سي بي بدون حاجة لمفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","activation الاتصال بكيت عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS لالحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية","استخدام أداة كومبوسيو لإدارة عمليات التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني لكيت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ConvertKit 自动化","Rube MCP","电子邮件营销自动化","Kit 工具包","自动化解决方案","工作流程简化"],"ja":["ConvertKit オートメーション","Rube MCP","メールマーケティングの自動化","Kit ツールキット","自動化ソリューション","ワークフローの簡素化"],"ko":["컨버트킷 자동화","루베 MCP","이메일 마케팅 자동화","Kit 툴킷","자동화 솔루션","작업 흐름 단순화"],"es":["automatización de ConvertKit","marketing por correo electrónico","herramienta Kit de Composio","Rube MCP","automatización de tareas de marketing","desarrollo de software","integración de API"],"fr":["automatisation de ConvertKit","marketing par e-mail","outil Kit de Composio","Rube MCP","automatisation des tâches de marketing","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API"],"de":["Automatisierung von ConvertKit","E-Mail-Marketing","Kit-Tool von Composio","Rube MCP","Automatisierung von Marketing-Aufgaben","Software-Entwicklung","API-Integration"],"pt":["automatização de marketing por e-mail","Rube MCP","Kit","Composio","marketing por e-mail","automatização de operações","ferramentas de marketing","integração de marketing"],"ru":["автоматизация электронного маркетинга","Rube MCP","Kit","Composio","электронный маркетинг","автоматизация операций","инструменты маркетинга","интеграция маркетинга"],"ar":["تأتمة التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني","روب إم سي بي","كيت","كومبوسيو","التسويق عبر البريد الإلكتروني","تأتمة العمليات","أدوات التسويق","دمج التسويق"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convertkit-automation","description":"Automate ConvertKit (Kit) tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): manage subscribers, tags, broadcasts, and broadcast stats. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — ju","body":"# ConvertKit (Kit) Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate ConvertKit (now known as Kit) email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Kit connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `kit`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Kit authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Subscribers\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse, search, or filter email subscribers\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers with filters and pagination [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `status`: Filter by status (''active'' or ''inactive'')\n- `email_address`: Exact email to search for\n- `created_after`/`created_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `updated_after`/`updated_before`: Date range filter (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `sort_field`: Sort by ''id'', ''cancelled_at'', or ''updated_at''\n- `sort_order`: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n- `per_page`: Results per page (min 1)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' to get total subscriber count\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- If `sort_field` is ''cancelled_at'', the `status` must be set to ''cancelled''\n- Date filters use YYYY-MM-DD format (no time component)\n- `email_address` is an exact match; partial email search is not supported\n- Pagination uses cursor-based approach with `after`/`before` cursor strings\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean\n\n### 2. Manage Subscriber Tags\n\n**When to use**: User wants to tag subscribers for segmentation\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID by email [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER` - Associate a subscriber with a tag [Required]\n3. `KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS` - List subscribers for a specific tag [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for tagging**:\n- `tag_id`: Numeric tag ID (required)\n- `subscriber_id`: Numeric subscriber ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Both `tag_id` and `subscriber_id` must be positive integers\n- Tag IDs must reference existing tags; tags are created via the Kit web UI\n- Tagging an already-tagged subscriber is idempotent (no error)\n- Subscriber IDs are returned from LIST_SUBSCRIBERS; use `email_address` filter to find specific subscribers\n\n### 3. Unsubscribe a Subscriber\n\n**When to use**: User wants to unsubscribe a subscriber from all communications\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS` - Find subscriber ID [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER` - Unsubscribe the subscriber [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Subscriber ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This permanently unsubscribes the subscriber from ALL email communications\n- The subscriber''s historical data is retained but they will no longer receive emails\n- Operation is idempotent; unsubscribing an already-unsubscribed subscriber succeeds without error\n- Returns empty response (HTTP 204 No Content) on success\n- Subscriber ID must exist; non-existent IDs return 404\n\n### 4. List and View Broadcasts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to browse email broadcasts or get details of a specific one\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - List all broadcasts with pagination [Required]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Get detailed information for a specific broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS` - Get performance statistics for a broadcast [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-500)\n- `after`/`before`: Cursor strings for pagination\n- `include_total_count`: Set to ''true'' for total count\n\n**Key parameters for details**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required, positive integer)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `per_page` max is 500 for broadcasts\n- Broadcast stats are only available for sent broadcasts\n- Draft broadcasts will not have stats\n- Broadcast IDs are numeric integers\n\n### 5. Delete a Broadcast\n\n**When to use**: User wants to permanently remove a broadcast\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS` - Find the broadcast to delete [Prerequisite]\n2. `KIT_GET_BROADCAST` - Verify it is the correct broadcast [Optional]\n3. `KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST` - Permanently delete the broadcast [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `id`: Broadcast ID (required)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Deletion is permanent and cannot be undone\n- Deleting a sent broadcast removes it but does not unsend the emails\n- Confirm the broadcast ID before deleting\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Subscriber Lookup by Email\n\n```\n1. Call KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS with email_address=''user@example.com''\n2. Extract subscriber ID from the response\n3. Use ID for tagging, unsubscribing, or other operations\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\nKit uses cursor-based pagination:\n- Check response for `after` cursor value\n- Pass cursor as `after` parameter in next request\n- Continue until no more cursor is returned\n- Use `include_total_count: ''true''` to track progress\n\n### Tag-Based Segmentation\n\n```\n1. Create tags in Kit web UI\n2. Use KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER to assign tags to subscribers\n3. Use KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS to view subscribers per tag\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Subscriber IDs: positive integers (e.g., 3887204736)\n- Tag IDs: positive integers\n- Broadcast IDs: positive integers\n- All IDs are numeric, not strings\n\n**Status Values**:\n- Subscriber statuses: ''active'', ''inactive'', ''cancelled''\n- Some operations are restricted by status (e.g., sorting by cancelled_at requires status=''cancelled'')\n\n**String vs Boolean Parameters**:\n- `include_total_count` is a string ''true'', not a boolean true\n- `sort_order` is a string enum: ''asc'' or ''desc''\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Kit API has per-account rate limits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n- Bulk operations should be paced appropriately\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Cursor values are opaque strings; use exactly as returned\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List subscribers | KIT_LIST_SUBSCRIBERS | status, email_address, per_page |\n| Tag subscriber | KIT_TAG_SUBSCRIBER | tag_id, subscriber_id |\n| List tag subscribers | KIT_LIST_TAG_SUBSCRIBERS | tag_id |\n| Unsubscribe | KIT_DELETE_SUBSCRIBER | id |\n| List broadcasts | KIT_LIST_BROADCASTS | per_page, after |\n| Get broadcast | KIT_GET_BROADCAST | id |\n| Get broadcast stats | KIT_GET_BROADCAST_STATS | id |\n| Delete broadcast | KIT_DELETE_BROADCAST | id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:42:26.326Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Automation Agents needing advanced ConvertKit email marketing operations via Rube MCP.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Rube MCP 进行高级 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销操作的营销自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP を介して高度な ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティング操作を必要とするマーケティングオートメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 고급 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 운영이 필요한 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de marketing que necesitan operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico avanzadas de ConvertKit a través de Rube MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation du marketing ayant besoin d''opérations de marketing par e-mail avancées ConvertKit via Rube MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über Rube MCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que precisam de operações avançadas de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit via Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов маркетинговой автоматизации, которым необходимы продвинутые операции по маркетингу электронной почты ConvertKit через Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تسويق الأتمتة التي تحتاج إلى عمليات تسويق بريد إلكتروني متقدمة من ConvertKit عبر Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate ConvertKit email marketing operations through Composio''s Kit toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration and management.","zh":"赋予代理人通过 Composio 的 Kit 工具包和 Rube MCP 实现 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销操作的自动化能力，利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 实现无缝集成和管理","ja":"Composio の Kit ツールキットと Rube MCP を通じて ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティング操作の自動化をエージェントに可能にし、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用してシームレスな統合と管理を実現","ko":"에이전트가 Composio의 Kit 툴킷 및 Rube MCP를 통해 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 운영을 자동화할 수 있도록하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 무결점 통합 및 관리를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de marketing por correo electrónico de ConvertKit a través de la herramienta Kit de Composio a través de Rube MCP, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración y gestión sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de marketing par e-mail ConvertKit via la boîte à outils Kit de Composio via Rube MCP, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration et une gestion sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Operationen über das Composio-Kit-Toolkit via Rube MCP zu automatisieren, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration und Verwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem operações de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit por meio da ferramenta Kit da Composio via Rube MCP, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração e gerenciamento sem problemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции по маркетингу электронной почты ConvertKit через набор инструментов Kit от Composio через Rube MCP, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для бесшовной интеграции и управления.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء قدرة على أتمتة عمليات تسويق البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit من خلال أداة Kit من Composio عبر Rube MCP، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس والإدارة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ConvertKit email marketing campaigns via Rube MCP","Managing Kit connections through RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for current tool schemas and automation"],"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 自动化 ConvertKit 电子邮件营销活动","通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 管理 Kit 连接","利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 获取当前工具架构和自动化"],"ja":["Rube MCP を介して ConvertKit 電子メールマーケティングキャンペーンを自動化","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用して Kit 接続を管理","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS を使用して現在のツールスキーマと自動化を取得"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 통해 ConvertKit 이메일 마케팅 캠페인을 자동화","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 Kit 연결을 관리","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하여 현재 툴 스키마 및 자동화를 구현"],"es":["Automatizar campañas de marketing por correo electrónico de ConvertKit a través de Rube MCP","Gestionar conexiones de Kit a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Utilizar RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de herramientas actuales y automatización"],"fr":["Automatiser les campagnes de marketing par e-mail ConvertKit via Rube MCP","Gérer les connexions Kit via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Utiliser RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils actuels et l''automatisation"],"de":["Automatisierung von ConvertKit-E-Mail-Marketing-Kampagnen über Rube MCP","Verwaltung von Kit-Verbindungen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für aktuelle Werkzeugschemata und Automatisierung"],"pt":["Automatizar campanhas de marketing por e-mail do ConvertKit via Rube MCP","Gerenciar conexões do Kit por meio de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Utilizar RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas atuais e automação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать кампании маркетинга электронной почты ConvertKit через Rube MCP","Управлять подключениями Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Использовать RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для текущих схем инструментов и автоматизации"],"ar":["أتمتة حملات تسويق البريد الإلكتروني من ConvertKit عبر Rube MCP","إدارة اتصالات Kit من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","استخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS للحصول على مخططات أدوات حالية وتأتمتة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Kit connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''kit'' necessary","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接并且 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 可用","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的 Kit 连接以及 ''kit'' 工具包","依赖于 Rube MCP 服务器配置"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続と RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS の利用が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を介した Kit 接続と ''kit'' ツールキットが必要","Rube MCP サーバー構成に依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 및 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 사용 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 Kit 연결 및 ''kit'' 툴킷 필요","Rube MCP 서버 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Conexión de Kit activa a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta ''kit'' necesaria","Dependiente de la configuración del servidor Rube MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Connexion Kit active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec l''outil ''kit'' nécessaire","Dépend de la configuration du serveur Rube MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Kit-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit ''kit'' erforderlich","Abhängig von der Rube-MCP-Server-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão Kit ativa via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com toolkit ''kit'' necessária","Dependente da configuração do servidor Rube MCP"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение Kit через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с набором инструментов ''kit'' необходимо","Зависит от конфигурации сервера Rube MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصال Rube MCP مع أدوات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","اتصال Kit نشط عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة ''kit'' ضروري","يعتمد على تكوين خادم Rube MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
