s, die das erwartete Verhalten definieren","Integriert sich mit dem test-automator-Agenten","Hilft, Entwicklungsworkflows zu verbessern"],"pt":["Criação de testes faling com TDD Red","Definição do comportamento esperado","Cobertura de casos de bordo","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Integração com test-automator agent","Suporte ao desenvolvimento orientado a testes"],"ru":["Создание фейлинг-тестов с TDD Red","Определение ожидаемого поведения","Покрытие граничных случаев","Улучшение качества кода","Интеграция с test-automator agent","Поддержка разработки, ориентированной на тесты"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة مع TDD Red","تحديد السلوك المتوقع","تغطية الحالات الحدودية","تحسين جودة الكود","التكامل مع test-automator agent","دعم التطوير الموجه بالاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD","测试驱动开发","红色阶段测试","失败测试","预期行为","测试覆盖"],"ja":["TDD","テスト駆動開発","レッドフェーズ テスト","失敗テスト","期待される動作","テストカバレッジ"],"ko":["TDD","테스트 주도 개발","레드 페즈 테스트","실패 테스트","예상 동작","테스트 커버리지"],"es":["TDD Red","pruebas fallidas","desarrollo de software","test-automator","flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","casos de borde","comportamiento esperado"],"fr":["TDD Red","tests échoués","développement de logiciels","test-automator","flux de travail de développement","cas de bordure","comportement attendu"],"de":["TDD Red","fehlende Tests","Softwareentwicklung","test-automator","Entwicklungsworkflows","Randfälle","erwartetes Verhalten"],"pt":["TDD","Test-Driven Development","TDD Red","Testes Failing","Desenvolvimento Orientado a Testes","Qualidade do Código","Test-automator agent","Casos de Bordo"],"ru":["TDD","Разработка, ориентированная на тесты","TDD Red","Фейлинг-тесты","Качество кода","Test-automator agent","Граничные случаи","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["TDD","التطوير الموجه بالاختبارات","TDD Red","اختبارات فاشلة","جودة الكود","test-automator agent","الحالات الحدودية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":"Generate failing tests for the TDD red phase to define expected behavior and edge cases.","bodyPreview":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against p","body":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against production systems\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify behaviors, constraints, and edge cases.\n2. Generate failing tests that define expected outcomes.\n3. Ensure failures are due to missing behavior, not setup errors.\n4. Document how to run tests and verify failures.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Keep test data isolated and avoid production environments.\n- Avoid flaky external dependencies in the red phase.\n\n## Role\n\nGenerate failing tests using Task tool with subagent_type=\"unit-testing::test-automator\".\n\n## Prompt Template\n\n\"Generate comprehensive FAILING tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n1. **Test Structure**\n   - Framework-appropriate setup (Jest/pytest/JUnit/Go/RSpec)\n   - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n   - should_X_when_Y naming convention\n   - Isolated fixtures with no interdependencies\n\n2. **Behavior Coverage**\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases (empty, null, boundary values)\n   - Error handling and exceptions\n   - Concurrent access (if applicable)\n\n3. **Failure Verification**\n   - Tests MUST fail when run\n   - Failures for RIGHT reasons (not syntax/import errors)\n   - Meaningful diagnostic error messages\n   - No cascading failures\n\n4. **Test Categories**\n   - Unit: Isolated component behavior\n   - Integration: Component interaction\n   - Contract: API/interface contracts\n   - Property: Mathematical invariants\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript (Jest/Vitest)**\n- Mock dependencies with `vi.fn()` or `jest.fn()`\n- Use `@testing-library` for React components\n- Property tests with `fast-check`\n\n**Python (pytest)**\n- Fixtures with appropriate scopes\n- Parametrize for multiple test cases\n- Hypothesis for property-based tests\n\n**Go**\n- Table-driven tests with subtests\n- `t.Parallel()` for parallel execution\n- Use `testify/assert` for cleaner assertions\n\n**Ruby (RSpec)**\n- `let` for lazy loading, `let!` for eager\n- Contexts for different scenarios\n- Shared examples for common behavior\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- Readable test names documenting intent\n- One behavior per test\n- No implementation leakage\n- Meaningful test data (not ''foo''/''bar'')\n- Tests serve as living documentation\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Tests passing immediately\n- Testing implementation vs behavior\n- Complex setup code\n- Multiple responsibilities per test\n- Brittle tests tied to specifics\n\n## Edge Case Categories\n\n- **Null/Empty**: undefined, null, empty string/array/object\n- **Boundaries**: min/max values, single element, capacity limits\n- **Special Cases**: Unicode, whitespace, special characters\n- **State**: Invalid transitions, concurrent modifications\n- **Errors**: Network failures, timeouts, permissions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Complete test files with imports\n- Documentation of test purpose\n- Commands to run and verify failures\n- Metrics: test count, coverage areas\n- Next steps for green phase\"\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generation:\n1. Run tests - confirm they fail\n2. Verify helpful failure messages\n3. Check test independence\n4. Ensure comprehensive coverage\n\n## Example (Minimal)\n\n```typescript\n// auth.service.test.ts\ndescribe(''AuthService'', () => {\n  let authService: AuthService;\n  let mockUserRepo: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    mockUserRepo = { findByEmail: jest.fn() } as any;\n    authService = new AuthService(mockUserRepo);\n  });\n\n  it(''should_return_token_when_valid_credentials'', async () => {\n    const user = { id: ''1'', email: ''test@example.com'', passwordHash: ''hashed'' };\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(user);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''test@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(true);\n    expect(result.token).toBeDefined();\n  });\n\n  it(''should_fail_when_user_not_found'', async () => {\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(null);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''none@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(false);\n    expect(result.error).toBe(''INVALID_CREDENTIALS'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\nTest requirements: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:43:17.206Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents requiring automated test generation for the red phase","zh":"适用于需要自动化测试生成的红色阶段的测试驱动开发代理","ja":"自動テスト生成が必要なテスト駆動開発エージェントの赤いフェーズに適している","ko":"자동화된 테스트 생성이 필요한 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트의 적색 단계에 적합함","es":"Ideal para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que requieren generación automática de pruebas para la fase roja","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests nécessitant une génération automatisée de tests pour la phase rouge","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven-Development-Agents, die eine automatisierte Testgenerierung für die rote Phase erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que requerem geração automática de testes para a fase vermelha","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Test-Driven Development, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация тестов для красной фазы","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الموجه بالاختبار الذين يتطلبون جيل التلقائي للاختبارات لمرحلة الحمرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles, utilizing test-automator agents for edge case coverage and defining expected behavior, all while ensuring compatibility with test-driven development workflows","zh":"赋予代理编写全面的失败测试的能力，遵循TDD红色阶段的原则，利用测试自动化代理进行边缘情况覆盖，并定义预期行为，同时确保与测试驱动开发工作流的兼容性","ja":"エージェントに、TDDの赤いフェーズの原則に従った包括的な失敗テストを記述する能力を付与し、テスト自動化エージェントを使用してエッジケースのカバレッジを行い、予想される動作を定義し、テスト駆動開発のワークフローとの互換性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 주도 개발의 적색 단계 원칙을 따르는 포괄적인 실패 테스트를 작성하도록 하는 기능을 부여하며, 테스트 자동화 에이전트를 사용하여 에지 케이스 커버리지와 예상 동작을 정의하고, 테스트 주도 개발 워크플로와의 호환성을 보장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas exhaustivas con fallos siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD, utilizando agentes automatizadores de pruebas para la cobertura de casos límite y definiendo el comportamiento esperado, todo ello garantizando la compatibilidad con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests complets avec des échecs en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD, en utilisant des agents automatisés de test pour la couverture des cas limites et en définissant le comportement attendu, le tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec les flux de travail de développement piloté par les tests","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende fehlerhafte Tests unter Einhaltung der TDD-Rot-Phase-Prinzipien zu schreiben, indem Testautomatisierungsagenten für die Abdeckung von Randfällen und die Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens eingesetzt werden, während die Kompatibilität mit Test-Driven-Development-Workflows gewährleistet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes abrangentes com falha, seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD, utilizando agentes automatizadores de testes para cobertura de casos de bordo e definindo comportamento esperado, garantindo compatibilidade com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento orientado a testes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать полные тесты с неудачами, следуя принципам красной фазы TDD, используя агентов-автоматизаторов тестов для покрытия граничных случаев и определения ожидаемого поведения, обеспечивая совместимость с рабочими процессами разработки, ориентированной на тестирование","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة اختبارات شاملة مع فشل، متبعين مبادئ مرحلة الحمرة من التطوير الموجه بالاختبار، واستخدام وكلاء آليين لاختبارات لتغطية حالات الحافة وتحديد السلوك المتوقع، مع ضمان التوافق مع سير عمل التطوير الموجه بالاختبار"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of failing tests for new behavior","Generating tests that capture expected behavior for edge cases","Initiating the TDD red phase for new feature development"],"zh":["为新行为自动创建失败测试","为边缘情况生成捕获预期行为的测试","启动新功能开发的TDD红色阶段"],"ja":["新しい動作のための失敗テストの自動作成","エッジケースのための予想される動作を捉えるテストの生成","新しい機能開発のためのTDDの赤いフェーズの開始"],"ko":["新的 동작을 위한 실패 테스트의 자동 생성","에지 케이스에 대한 예상 동작을 捕获하는 테스트의 생성","新的 기능 개발을 위한 테스트 주도 개발의 적색 단계의 시작"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de pruebas con fallos para nuevo comportamiento","Generar pruebas que capturen el comportamiento esperado para casos límite","Iniciar la fase roja de TDD para el desarrollo de nuevas características"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de tests avec des échecs pour un nouveau comportement","Générer des tests qui capturent le comportement attendu pour les cas limites","Lancer la phase rouge de TDD pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von fehlerhaften Tests für neues Verhalten","Generieren von Tests, die das erwartete Verhalten für Randfälle erfassen","Initiieren der TDD-Rot-Phase für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de testes com falha para novo comportamento","Gerar testes que capturem o comportamento esperado para casos de bordo","Iniciar a fase vermelha do TDD para desenvolvimento de recursos novos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание тестов с неудачей для нового поведения","Генерировать тесты, которые захватывают ожидаемое поведение для граничных случаев","Инициировать красную фазу TDD для разработки новых функций"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الاختبارات الفاشلة للتصرف الجديد","توليد اختبارات التي تلتقط السلوك المتوقع لحالات الحافة","بدء مرحلة الحمرة من التطوير الموجه بالاختبار لتطوير الميزات الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only applicable during the TDD red phase","Not suitable for performance benchmarks","Tests must be designed to fail initially to validate the red phase"],"zh":["仅适用于TDD红色阶段","不适用于性能基准测试","测试必须最初设计为失败，以验证红色阶段"],"ja":["TDDの赤いフェーズでのみ適用可能","パフォーマンスベンチマークには適さない","テストは最初に失敗するように設計する必要があるため、赤いフェーズを検証する"],"ko":["테스트 주도 개발의 적색 단계에서만 적용 가능","성능 벤치마크에는 적합하지 않음","테스트는最初에 실패하도록 설계되어야 하므로 적색 단계를 검증한다"],"es":["Sólo es aplicable durante la fase roja de TDD","No es adecuado para pruebas de rendimiento","Las pruebas deben estar diseñadas para fallar inicialmente para validar la fase roja"],"fr":["N''est applicable que pendant la phase rouge de TDD","N''est pas adapté pour les tests de performance","Les tests doivent être conçus pour échouer initialement pour valider la phase rouge"],"de":["Nur während der TDD-Rot-Phase anwendbar","Nicht geeignet für Leistungsbenchmarks","Tests müssen so konzipiert sein, dass sie zunächst fehlschlagen, um die Rot-Phase zu validieren"],"pt":["Apenas aplicável durante a fase vermelha do TDD","Não adequado para benchmarks de desempenho","Os testes devem ser projetados para falhar inicialmente para validar a fase vermelha"],"ru":["Применимо только во время красной фазы TDD","Не подходит для оценки производительности","Тесты должны быть разработаны так, чтобы изначально терпеть неудачу для проверки красной фазы"],"ar":["يتم تطبيقه فقط خلال مرحلة الحمرة من التطوير الموجه بالاختبار","لا يصلح لقياس الأداء","يجب تصميم الاختبارات بحيث تفشل في البداية للتحقق من مرحلة الحمرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
