zure Event Hubs","Event-Streaming",".NET","Hochgeschwindigkeits-Streaming","Ereignisse in Echtzeit","Datenverarbeitung","Azure Identity","Checkpointing"],"pt":["Azure Event Hubs","Streaming de eventos","High-throughput",".NET","Azure Messaging","EventHubs","Checkpointing","Autenticação"],"ru":["Azure Event Hubs","Потоковая передача событий","Высокая производительность",".NET","Azure Messaging","EventHubs","Checkpointing","Аутентификация"],"ar":["Azure Event Hubs","نقل الفعاليات بثا","أداء عالي",".NET","Azure Messaging","EventHubs","Checkpointing","التحقق"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-eventhub-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.Messaging.EventHubs (.NET)\n\nHigh-throughput event streaming SDK for sending and receiving events via Azure Event Hubs.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core package (sending and simple receiving)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs\n\n# Processor package (production receiving with checkpointing)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor\n\n# Authentication\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n\n# For checkpointing (required by EventProcessorClient)\ndotnet add package Azure.Stora","body":"# Azure.Messaging.EventHubs (.NET)\n\nHigh-throughput event streaming SDK for sending and receiving events via Azure Event Hubs.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core package (sending and simple receiving)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs\n\n# Processor package (production receiving with checkpointing)\ndotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor\n\n# Authentication\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n\n# For checkpointing (required by EventProcessorClient)\ndotnet add package Azure.Storage.Blobs\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Azure.Messaging.EventHubs v5.12.2, Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor v5.12.2\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nEVENTHUB_FULLY_QUALIFIED_NAMESPACE=<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net\nEVENTHUB_NAME=<event-hub-name>\n\n# For checkpointing (EventProcessorClient)\nBLOB_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=<storage-connection-string>\nBLOB_CONTAINER_NAME=<checkpoint-container>\n\n# Alternative: Connection string auth (not recommended for production)\nEVENTHUB_CONNECTION_STRING=Endpoint=sb://<namespace>.servicebus.windows.net/;SharedAccessKeyName=...\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\n// Always use DefaultAzureCredential for production\nvar credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();\n\nvar fullyQualifiedNamespace = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"EVENTHUB_FULLY_QUALIFIED_NAMESPACE\");\nvar eventHubName = Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"EVENTHUB_NAME\");\n\nvar producer = new EventHubProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    credential);\n```\n\n**Required RBAC Roles**:\n- **Sending**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Sender`\n- **Receiving**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Receiver`\n- **Both**: `Azure Event Hubs Data Owner`\n\n## Client Types\n\n| Client | Purpose | When to Use |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| `EventHubProducerClient` | Send events immediately in batches | Real-time sending, full control over batching |\n| `EventHubBufferedProducerClient` | Automatic batching with background sending | High-volume, fire-and-forget scenarios |\n| `EventHubConsumerClient` | Simple event reading | Prototyping only, NOT for production |\n| `EventProcessorClient` | Production event processing | **Always use this for receiving in production** |\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Send Events (Batch)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\nawait using var producer = new EventHubProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\n// Create a batch (respects size limits automatically)\nusing EventDataBatch batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n\n// Add events to batch\nvar events = new[]\n{\n    new EventData(BinaryData.FromString(\"{\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"message\\\": \\\"Hello\\\"}\")),\n    new EventData(BinaryData.FromString(\"{\\\"id\\\": 2, \\\"message\\\": \\\"World\\\"}\"))\n};\n\nforeach (var eventData in events)\n{\n    if (!batch.TryAdd(eventData))\n    {\n        // Batch is full - send it and create a new one\n        await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n        batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n        \n        if (!batch.TryAdd(eventData))\n        {\n            throw new Exception(\"Event too large for empty batch\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Send remaining events\nif (batch.Count > 0)\n{\n    await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Send Events (Buffered - High Volume)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\n\nvar options = new EventHubBufferedProducerClientOptions\n{\n    MaximumWaitTime = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1)\n};\n\nawait using var producer = new EventHubBufferedProducerClient(\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential(),\n    options);\n\n// Handle send success/failure\nproducer.SendEventBatchSucceededAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Batch sent: {args.EventBatch.Count} events\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\nproducer.SendEventBatchFailedAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Batch failed: {args.Exception.Message}\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\n// Enqueue events (sent automatically in background)\nfor (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++)\n{\n    await producer.EnqueueEventAsync(new EventData($\"Event {i}\"));\n}\n\n// Flush remaining events before disposing\nawait producer.FlushAsync();\n```\n\n### 3. Receive Events (Production - EventProcessorClient)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Consumer;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor;\nusing Azure.Storage.Blobs;\n\n// Blob container for checkpointing\nvar blobClient = new BlobContainerClient(\n    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"BLOB_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING\"),\n    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"BLOB_CONTAINER_NAME\"));\n\nawait blobClient.CreateIfNotExistsAsync();\n\n// Create processor\nvar processor = new EventProcessorClient(\n    blobClient,\n    EventHubConsumerClient.DefaultConsumerGroup,\n    fullyQualifiedNamespace,\n    eventHubName,\n    new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\n// Handle events\nprocessor.ProcessEventAsync += async args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Partition: {args.Partition.PartitionId}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Data: {args.Data.EventBody}\");\n    \n    // Checkpoint after processing (or batch checkpoints)\n    await args.UpdateCheckpointAsync();\n};\n\n// Handle errors\nprocessor.ProcessErrorAsync += args =>\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {args.Exception.Message}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Partition: {args.PartitionId}\");\n    return Task.CompletedTask;\n};\n\n// Start processing\nawait processor.StartProcessingAsync();\n\n// Run until cancelled\nawait Task.Delay(Timeout.Infinite, cancellationToken);\n\n// Stop gracefully\nawait processor.StopProcessingAsync();\n```\n\n### 4. Partition Operations\n\n```csharp\n// Get partition IDs\nstring[] partitionIds = await producer.GetPartitionIdsAsync();\n\n// Send to specific partition (use sparingly)\nvar options = new SendEventOptions\n{\n    PartitionId = \"0\"\n};\nawait producer.SendAsync(events, options);\n\n// Use partition key (recommended for ordering)\nvar batchOptions = new CreateBatchOptions\n{\n    PartitionKey = \"customer-123\"  // Events with same key go to same partition\n};\nusing var batch = await producer.CreateBatchAsync(batchOptions);\n```\n\n## EventPosition Options\n\nControl where to start reading:\n\n```csharp\n// Start from beginning\nEventPosition.Earliest\n\n// Start from end (new events only)\nEventPosition.Latest\n\n// Start from specific offset\nEventPosition.FromOffset(12345)\n\n// Start from specific sequence number\nEventPosition.FromSequenceNumber(100)\n\n// Start from specific time\nEventPosition.FromEnqueuedTime(DateTimeOffset.UtcNow.AddHours(-1))\n```\n\n## ASP.NET Core Integration\n\n```csharp\n// Program.cs\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Producer;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.Azure;\n\nbuilder.Services.AddAzureClients(clientBuilder =>\n{\n    clientBuilder.AddEventHubProducerClient(\n        builder.Configuration[\"EventHub:FullyQualifiedNamespace\"],\n        builder.Configuration[\"EventHub:Name\"]);\n    \n    clientBuilder.UseCredential(new DefaultAzureCredential());\n});\n\n// Inject in controller/service\npublic class EventService\n{\n    private readonly EventHubProducerClient _producer;\n    \n    public EventService(EventHubProducerClient producer)\n    {\n        _producer = producer;\n    }\n    \n    public async Task SendAsync(string message)\n    {\n        using var batch = await _producer.CreateBatchAsync();\n        batch.TryAdd(new EventData(message));\n        await _producer.SendAsync(batch);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use `EventProcessorClient` for receiving** — Never use `EventHubConsumerClient` in production\n2. **Checkpoint strategically** — After N events or time interval, not every event\n3. **Use partition keys** — For ordering guarantees within a partition\n4. **Reuse clients** — Create once, use as singleton (thread-safe)\n5. **Use `await using`** — Ensures proper disposal\n6. **Handle `ProcessErrorAsync`** — Always register error handler\n7. **Batch events** — Use `CreateBatchAsync()` to respect size limits\n8. **Use buffered producer** — For high-volume scenarios with automatic batching\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Messaging.EventHubs;\n\ntry\n{\n    await producer.SendAsync(batch);\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex) when (ex.Reason == EventHubsException.FailureReason.ServiceBusy)\n{\n    // Retry with backoff\n    await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex) when (ex.IsTransient)\n{\n    // Transient error - safe to retry\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Transient error: {ex.Message}\");\n}\ncatch (EventHubsException ex)\n{\n    // Non-transient error\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {ex.Reason} - {ex.Message}\");\n}\n```\n\n## Checkpointing Strategies\n\n| Strategy | When to Use |\n|----------|-------------|\n| Every event | Low volume, critical data |\n| Every N events | Balanced throughput/reliability |\n| Time-based | Consistent checkpoint intervals |\n| Batch completion | After processing a logical batch |\n\n```csharp\n// Checkpoint every 100 events\nprivate int _eventCount = 0;\n\nprocessor.ProcessEventAsync += async args =>\n{\n    // Process event...\n    \n    _eventCount++;\n    if (_eventCount >= 100)\n    {\n        await args.UpdateCheckpointAsync();\n        _eventCount = 0;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.Messaging.EventHubs` | Core sending/receiving | `dotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs` |\n| `Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor` | Production processing | `dotnet add package Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor` |\n| `Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs` | Management plane (create hubs) | `dotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.EventHubs` |\n| `Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.EventHubs` | Azure Functions binding | `dotnet add package Microsoft.Azure.WebJobs.Extensions.EventHubs` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:42:52.219Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing high-throughput event streaming capabilities with Azure Event Hubs via .NET","zh":"非常适合需要高吞吐量事件流传输能力的云代理，支持通过 .NET 与 Azure 事件中心进行集成","ja":"Azure Event Hubs を使用して、高スループットのイベント ストリーミング機能が必要なクラウド エージェントに最適。.NET 経由で Azure Event Hubs と連携することができます","ko":"Azure Event Hubs를 통해 높은 처리량의 이벤트 스트리밍 기능이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. .NET을 통해 Azure Event Hubs와 연동할 수 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de nube que necesitan capacidades de transmisión de eventos de alto rendimiento con Azure Event Hubs a través de .NET","fr":"Parfait pour les agents cloud qui ont besoin de capacités de diffusion d''événements à haut débit avec Azure Event Hubs via .NET","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die hochleistungsfähige Ereignis-Streaming-Funktionen mit Azure Event Hubs über .NET benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de transmissão de eventos de alta taxa com Azure Event Hubs via .NET","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуются возможности высокопроизводительного потокового вывода событий с помощью Azure Event Hubs через .NET","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل السحابي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات بث أحداث عالية الإنتاجية مع Azure Event Hubs عبر .NET"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to send and receive events via Azure Event Hubs using the Azure.Messaging.EventHubs library, enabling production-ready event processing with checkpointing and authentication via Azure.Identity","zh":"赋予代理通过 Azure.Messaging.EventHubs 库发送和接收事件的能力，实现具有检查点和 Azure.Identity 身份验证的生产就绪事件处理","ja":"Azure.Messaging.EventHubs ライブラリを使用して、エージェントがイベントの送信と受信を行うことを可能にし、Azure.Identity を使用したチェックポイントと認証を含む本番環境でのイベント処理を実現します","ko":"Azure.Messaging.EventHubs 라이브러리를 사용하여 에이전트가 이벤트를 송수신 할 수 있도록 하며, Azure.Identity를 사용한 체크포인트 및 인증을 포함한 프로덕션 준비 이벤트 처리를 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para enviar y recibir eventos a través de Azure Event Hubs mediante la biblioteca Azure.Messaging.EventHubs, lo que permite el procesamiento de eventos listo para producción con checkpointing y autenticación mediante Azure.Identity","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer et de recevoir des événements via Azure Event Hubs à l''aide de la bibliothèque Azure.Messaging.EventHubs, ce qui permet le traitement d''événements prêt pour la production avec checkpointing et authentification via Azure.Identity","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Ereignisse über Azure Event Hubs mithilfe der Bibliothek Azure.Messaging.EventHubs zu senden und zu empfangen, wodurch die Verarbeitung von Ereignissen bereit für die Produktion mit Checkpointing und Authentifizierung über Azure.Identity ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a enviar e receber eventos via Azure Event Hubs usando a biblioteca Azure.Messaging.EventHubs, permitindo o processamento de eventos pronto para produção com checkpointing e autenticação via Azure.Identity","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность отправлять и получать события через Azure Event Hubs, используя библиотеку Azure.Messaging.EventHubs, что позволяет обрабатывать события, готовые к производству, с checkpointing и аутентификацией через Azure.Identity","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إرسال واستقبال الأحداث عبر Azure Event Hubs باستخدام مكتبة Azure.Messaging.EventHubs، وتمكين معالجة الأحداث الجاهزة للانتاج مع التحقق من النقاط و المصادقة عبر Azure.Identity"},"useCases":{"en":["Streaming events from IoT devices to Azure Event Hubs","Building scalable event-driven architectures with Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Integrating Azure Event Hubs with other Azure services for real-time data processing"],"zh":["将 IoT 设备的事件流式传输到 Azure 事件中心","使用 Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor 构建可扩展的事件驱动架构","将 Azure 事件中心与其他 Azure 服务集成以进行实时数据处理"],"ja":["IoT デバイスからのイベントを Azure Event Hubs にストリーミングする","Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor を使用してスケーラブルなイベント ドリブン アーキテクチャを構築する","Azure Event Hubs を他の Azure サービスと統合してリアルタイム データ処理を行う"],"ko":["IoT 디바이스의 이벤트를 Azure Event Hubs로 스트리밍하는 것","Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor를 사용하여 확장 가능한 이벤트 드리븐 아키텍처를 구축하는 것","Azure Event Hubs를 다른 Azure 서비스와 통합하여 실시간 데이터 처리를 하는 것"],"es":["Transmisión de eventos desde dispositivos IoT a Azure Event Hubs","Creación de arquitecturas impulsadas por eventos escalables con Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Integración de Azure Event Hubs con otros servicios de Azure para el procesamiento de datos en tiempo real"],"fr":["Diffusion d''événements depuis des appareils IoT vers Azure Event Hubs","Création d''architectures à événements scalables avec Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Intégration d''Azure Event Hubs avec d''autres services Azure pour le traitement de données en temps réel"],"de":["Übertragung von Ereignissen von IoT-Geräten an Azure Event Hubs","Erstellung skalierbarer ereignisgesteuerter Architekturen mit Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Integration von Azure Event Hubs mit anderen Azure-Diensten für die Echtzeit-Datenaufbereitung"],"pt":["Transmissão de eventos de dispositivos IoT para Azure Event Hubs","Construção de arquiteturas orientadas a eventos escaláveis com Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Integração do Azure Event Hubs com outros serviços do Azure para processamento de dados em tempo real"],"ru":["Передача событий с устройств IoT в Azure Event Hubs","Построение масштабируемых событийно-ориентированных архитектур с помощью Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","Интеграция Azure Event Hubs с другими сервисами Azure для обработки данных в реальном времени"],"ar":["بث أحداث الأجهزة الإلكترونية من خلال أجهزة IoT إلى Azure Event Hubs","بناء هياكل معمارية قابلة للتحجيم تعتمد على الأحداث باستخدام Azure.Messaging.EventHubs.Processor","دمج Azure Event Hubs مع خدمات أخرى من Azure لمعالجة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET environment","Dependent on Azure Event Hubs service","Needs Azure.Identity for authentication and Azure.Storage for checkpointing"],"zh":[".NET 环境是必需的","依赖于 Azure 事件中心服务","需要 Azure.Identity 进行身份验证和 Azure.Storage 进行检查点"],"ja":[".NET 環境が必要","Azure Event Hubs サービスに依存する","認証とチェックポイントに Azure.Identity と Azure.Storage が必要"],"ko":[".NET 환경이 필요합니다","Azure Event Hubs 서비스에 의존합니다","인증 및 체크포인트에 Azure.Identity 및 Azure.Storage가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno .NET","Dependiente del servicio Azure Event Hubs","Necesita Azure.Identity para la autenticación y Azure.Storage para el checkpointing"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement .NET","Dépendant du service Azure Event Hubs","Nécessite Azure.Identity pour l''authentification et Azure.Storage pour le checkpointing"],"de":["Benötigt .NET-Umgebung","Abhängig vom Azure Event Hubs-Dienst","Benötigt Azure.Identity für die Authentifizierung und Azure.Storage für das Checkpointing"],"pt":["Requer ambiente .NET","Dependente do serviço Azure Event Hubs","Necessita Azure.Identity para autenticação e Azure.Storage para checkpointing"],"ru":["Требуется среда .NET","Зависит от сервиса Azure Event Hubs","Требуется Azure.Identity для аутентификации и Azure.Storage для checkpointing"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة .NET","يعتمد على خدمة Azure Event Hubs","يحتاج إلى Azure.Identity للمصادقة و Azure.Storage للتحقق من النقاط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
