er-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"features":{"zh":["智能技术检测","自动同步","多代理技能系统","统一架构","支持414+技能","支持38个代理"],"ja":["スマートテクノロジー検出","自動同期","多エージェントスキルシステム","統一アーキテクチャ","414以上のスキル対応","38のエージェント対応"],"ko":["스마트 기술 감지","자동 동기화","다중 에이전트 스킬 시스템","통합 아키텍처","414개 이상의 스킬 지원","38개의 에이전트 지원"],"es":["Sistema de agentes múltiples","Integración de herramientas","Detección de tecnologías","Instalación por proyecto","Sincronización automática"],"fr":["Système d''agents multiples","Intégration d''outils","Détection de technologies","Installation par projet","Synchronisation automatique"],"de":["Mehrere Agenten","Werkzeugintegration","Technologiedetektion","Projektinstallation","Automatische Synchronisation"],"pt":["Detecção de tecnologia inteligente","Instalação por projeto","Sincronização automática de fontes de montagem","Integração de ferramentas","Cadeias e memória","Suporte a vários agentes"],"ru":["Умное обнаружение технологий","Установка по проекту","Автоматическая синхронизация исходных кодов","Интеграция инструментов","Цепочки и память","Поддержка нескольких агентов"],"ar":["الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا","التثبيت حسب المشروع","التنظيم التلقائي للمصادر","تكامل الأدوات","السلاسل والذاكرة","دعم وكلاء متعددين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","LLM","AI","编码助手","智能技术检测","自动同步"],"ja":["LangChain","LLM","AI","コーディングアシスタント","スマートテクノロジー検出","自動同期"],"ko":["LangChain","LLM","AI","코딩 어시스턴트","스마트 기술 감지","자동 동기화"],"es":["LangChain","arquitectura LLM","desarrollo de aplicaciones","agentes múltiples","integración de herramientas","detección de tecnologías"],"fr":["LangChain","architecture LLM","développement d''applications","agents multiples","intégration d''outils","détection de technologies"],"de":["LangChain","LLM-Architektur","Anwendungsentwicklung","mehrere Agenten","Werkzeugintegration","Technologiedetektion"],"pt":["arquitetura LangChain","desenvolvimento de aplicações LLM","agentes de IA","ferramentas de codificação","integração de tecnologia","sistemas de habilidades de agente","aprendizado de máquina","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["архитектура LangChain","разработка приложений LLM","агенты ИИ","инструменты кодирования","интеграция технологий","системы агентских навыков","машиное обучение","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["هندسة لانجتشين","تطوير تطبيقات LLM","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الكتابة","تكامل التكنولوجيا","نظم مهارات الوكلاء","التعلم الالي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-architecture","description":"Design LLM applications using the LangChain framework with agents, memory, and tool integration patterns. Use when building LangChain applications, implementing AI agents, or creating complex LLM workflows.","bodyPreview":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, ope","body":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building autonomous AI agents with tool access\n- Implementing complex multi-step LLM workflows\n- Managing conversation memory and state\n- Integrating LLMs with external data sources and APIs\n- Creating modular, reusable LLM application components\n- Implementing document processing pipelines\n- Building production-grade LLM applications\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Agents\nAutonomous systems that use LLMs to decide which actions to take.\n\n**Agent Types:**\n- **ReAct**: Reasoning + Acting in interleaved manner\n- **OpenAI Functions**: Leverages function calling API\n- **Structured Chat**: Handles multi-input tools\n- **Conversational**: Optimized for chat interfaces\n- **Self-Ask with Search**: Decomposes complex queries\n\n### 2. Chains\nSequences of calls to LLMs or other utilities.\n\n**Chain Types:**\n- **LLMChain**: Basic prompt + LLM combination\n- **SequentialChain**: Multiple chains in sequence\n- **RouterChain**: Routes inputs to specialized chains\n- **TransformChain**: Data transformations between steps\n- **MapReduceChain**: Parallel processing with aggregation\n\n### 3. Memory\nSystems for maintaining context across interactions.\n\n**Memory Types:**\n- **ConversationBufferMemory**: Stores all messages\n- **ConversationSummaryMemory**: Summarizes older messages\n- **ConversationBufferWindowMemory**: Keeps last N messages\n- **EntityMemory**: Tracks information about entities\n- **VectorStoreMemory**: Semantic similarity retrieval\n\n### 4. Document Processing\nLoading, transforming, and storing documents for retrieval.\n\n**Components:**\n- **Document Loaders**: Load from various sources\n- **Text Splitters**: Chunk documents intelligently\n- **Vector Stores**: Store and retrieve embeddings\n- **Retrievers**: Fetch relevant documents\n- **Indexes**: Organize documents for efficient access\n\n### 5. Callbacks\nHooks for logging, monitoring, and debugging.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Request/response logging\n- Token usage tracking\n- Latency monitoring\n- Error handling\n- Custom metrics collection\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import AgentType, initialize_agent, load_tools\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\n\n# Initialize LLM\nllm = OpenAI(temperature=0)\n\n# Load tools\ntools = load_tools([\"serpapi\", \"llm-math\"], llm=llm)\n\n# Add memory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n\n# Create agent\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    memory=memory,\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Run agent\nresult = agent.run(\"What''s the weather in SF? Then calculate 25 * 4\")\n```\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: RAG with LangChain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import TextLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitter import CharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# Load and process documents\nloader = TextLoader(''documents.txt'')\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\ntext_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\ntexts = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# Create vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(texts, embeddings)\n\n# Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=llm,\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What is the main topic?\"})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Agent with Tools\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import Tool, AgentExecutor\nfrom langchain.agents.react.base import ReActDocstoreAgent\nfrom langchain.tools import tool\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\"\"\"\n    # Your database search logic\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef send_email(recipient: str, content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Send an email to specified recipient.\"\"\"\n    # Email sending logic\n    return f\"Email sent to {recipient}\"\n\ntools = [search_database, send_email]\n\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Step Chain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import LLMChain, SequentialChain\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\n\n# Step 1: Extract key information\nextract_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    template=\"Extract key entities from: {text}\\n\\nEntities:\"\n)\nextract_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=extract_prompt, output_key=\"entities\")\n\n# Step 2: Analyze entities\nanalyze_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\"],\n    template=\"Analyze these entities: {entities}\\n\\nAnalysis:\"\n)\nanalyze_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=analyze_prompt, output_key=\"analysis\")\n\n# Step 3: Generate summary\nsummary_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\"],\n    template=\"Summarize:\\nEntities: {entities}\\nAnalysis: {analysis}\\n\\nSummary:\"\n)\nsummary_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=summary_prompt, output_key=\"summary\")\n\n# Combine into sequential chain\noverall_chain = SequentialChain(\n    chains=[extract_chain, analyze_chain, summary_chain],\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    output_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\", \"summary\"],\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n## Memory Management Best Practices\n\n### Choosing the Right Memory Type\n```python\n# For short conversations (< 10 messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n# For long conversations (summarize old messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationSummaryMemory\nmemory = ConversationSummaryMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For sliding window (last N messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferWindowMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferWindowMemory(k=5)\n\n# For entity tracking\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationEntityMemory\nmemory = ConversationEntityMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For semantic retrieval of relevant history\nfrom langchain.memory import VectorStoreRetrieverMemory\nmemory = VectorStoreRetrieverMemory(retriever=retriever)\n```\n\n## Callback System\n\n### Custom Callback Handler\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.base import BaseCallbackHandler\n\nclass CustomCallbackHandler(BaseCallbackHandler):\n    def on_llm_start(self, serialized, prompts, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM started with prompts: {prompts}\")\n\n    def on_llm_end(self, response, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM ended with response: {response}\")\n\n    def on_llm_error(self, error, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM error: {error}\")\n\n    def on_chain_start(self, serialized, inputs, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Chain started with inputs: {inputs}\")\n\n    def on_agent_action(self, action, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Agent taking action: {action}\")\n\n# Use callback\nagent.run(\"query\", callbacks=[CustomCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Testing Strategies\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\ndef test_agent_tool_selection():\n    # Mock LLM to return specific tool selection\n    mock_llm = Mock()\n    mock_llm.predict.return_value = \"Action: search_database\\nAction Input: test query\"\n\n    agent = initialize_agent(tools, mock_llm, agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION)\n\n    result = agent.run(\"test query\")\n\n    # Verify correct tool was selected\n    assert \"search_database\" in str(mock_llm.predict.call_args)\n\ndef test_memory_persistence():\n    memory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n    memory.save_context({\"input\": \"Hi\"}, {\"output\": \"Hello!\"})\n\n    assert \"Hi\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n    assert \"Hello!\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Caching\n```python\nfrom langchain.cache import InMemoryCache\nimport langchain\n\nlangchain.llm_cache = InMemoryCache()\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Processing\n```python\n# Process multiple documents in parallel\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'')\ndocs = loader.load()\n\ndef process_doc(doc):\n    return text_splitter.split_documents([doc])\n\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:\n    split_docs = list(executor.map(process_doc, docs))\n```\n\n### 3. Streaming Responses\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.streaming_stdout import StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler\n\nllm = OpenAI(streaming=True, callbacks=[StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/agents.md**: Deep dive on agent architectures\n- **references/memory.md**: Memory system patterns\n- **references/chains.md**: Chain composition strategies\n- **references/document-processing.md**: Document loading and indexing\n- **references/callbacks.md**: Monitoring and observability\n- **assets/agent-template.py**: Production-ready agent template\n- **assets/memory-config.yaml**: Memory configuration examples\n- **assets/chain-example.py**: Complex chain examples\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Memory Overflow**: Not managing conversation history length\n2. **Tool Selection Errors**: Poor tool descriptions confuse agents\n3. **Context Window Exceeded**: Exceeding LLM token limits\n4. **No Error Handling**: Not catching and handling agent failures\n5. **Inefficient Retrieval**: Not optimizing vector store queries\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add request/response logging\n- [ ] Monitor token usage and costs\n- [ ] Set timeout limits for agent execution\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Add input validation\n- [ ] Test with edge cases\n- [ ] Set up observability (callbacks)\n- [ ] Implement fallback strategies\n- [ ] Version control prompts and configurations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:43:32.070Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot needing unified multi-agent skill systems with smart tech detection and auto-sync capabilities.","zh":"适用于Claude Code、Cursor和Copilot等需要统一的多代理技能系统、智能技术检测和自动同步功能的AI编码助手。","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、Copilotなどの統一されたマルチエージェントスキルシステム、スマートテクノロジー検出、自動同期機能を必要とするAIコーディングアシスタントに適しています。","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot 등의 AI 코딩 도우미에서 통일된 멀티 에이전트 스킬 시스템, 스마트 기술 감지 및 자동 동기화 기능이 필요한 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para asistentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code, Cursor y Copilot que necesitan sistemas de habilidades de multiagente unificados con detección de tecnología inteligente y capacidades de auto sincronización.","fr":"Idéal pour les assistants de codage IA comme Claude Code, Cursor et Copilot ayant besoin de systèmes de compétences multi-agents unifiés avec détection de technologie intelligente et des capacités d''auto-synchronisation.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Assistenten wie Claude Code, Cursor und Copilot, die einheitliche Multiagenten-Skill-Systeme mit intelligenter Technologie-Erkennung und Auto-Synchronisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Assistente de Codificação de IA como Claude Code, Cursor e Copilot que necessitam de sistemas de habilidades de multi-agente unificados com detecção de tecnologia inteligente e capacidades de auto-sincronização.","ru":"Идеально для помощников кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Copilot, которым требуются унифицированные системы навыков мультиагентов с умной детекцией технологий и возможностями авто-синхронизации.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المساعدون في 코딩 الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot الذين يحتاجون إلى أنظمة مهارات متعددة الوكلاء الموحدة مع الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا وقدرات التزامن التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master the LangChain framework, integrating chains, memory, and tooling for sophisticated LLM applications, leveraging 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands, with features like per-project installation and upstream source syncing via protocols.","zh":"赋予代理掌握LangChain框架的能力，集成链、内存和工具，用于复杂的LLM应用，利用414+个技能、38个代理和57个命令，具有每个项目安装和上游源同步等功能，通过协议实现。","ja":"LangChainフレームワークをマスターするエージェントを可能にし、チェーン、メモリ、ツールを統合して、複雑なLLMアプリケーションを実現します。414以上のスキル、38のエージェント、57のコマンドを利用し、プロジェクトごとのインストールやアップストリームソースの同期などの機能を提供し、プロトコル経由で実現します。","ko":"LangChain 프레임워크를 마스터하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 체인, 메모리, 툴을 통합하여 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구현합니다. 414개 이상의 스킬, 38개의 에이전트, 57개의 명령을 활용하며, 프로젝트별 설치 및 업스트림 소스 동기화 등의 기능을 제공하며, 프로토콜을 통해 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dominar el marco de LangChain, integrando cadenas, memoria y herramientas para aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas, aprovechando 414+ habilidades, 38 agentes y 57 comandos, con características como la instalación por proyecto y la sincronización de fuentes de origen mediante protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser le cadre de LangChain, en intégrant des chaînes, une mémoire et des outils pour des applications LLM sophistiquées, en exploitant 414+ compétences, 38 agents et 57 commandes, avec des fonctionnalités comme l''installation par projet et la synchronisation de sources de code en amont via des protocoles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das LangChain-Framework zu meistern, indem es Ketten, Speicher und Werkzeuge für anspruchsvolle LLM-Anwendungen integriert, wobei 414+ Fähigkeiten, 38 Agenten und 57 Befehle genutzt werden, mit Funktionen wie der projektspezifischen Installation und der Synchronisierung von Quellcode über Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar o framework LangChain, integrando cadeias, memória e ferramentas para aplicações LLM sofisticadas, aproveitando 414+ habilidades, 38 agentes e 57 comandos, com recursos como instalação por projeto e sincronização de fonte de upstream via protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить фреймворк LangChain, интегрируя цепочки, память и инструменты для сложных приложений LLM, используя 414+ навыков, 38 агентов и 57 команд, с функциями như установка по проекту и синхронизация источника upstream через протоколы.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التسلط على إطار العمل LangChain ، بإدماج السلاسل وذاكرة والأدوات من أجل تطبيقات LLM متقدمة ، باستخدام 414+ مهارات ، و 38 وكلاء و 57 أوامر ، مع ميزات مثل التركيب لكل مشروع وتزامن المصدر المتدفق عبر البروتوكولات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building sophisticated LLM applications with agent integration","Automating LangChain framework setup with smart tech detection","Debugging multi-agent interactions within the LangChain ecosystem"],"zh":["构建具有代理集成的复杂LLM应用","使用智能技术检测自动化LangChain框架设置","在LangChain生态系统中调试多代理交互"],"ja":["エージェント統合を備えた複雑なLLMアプリケーションを構築する","スマートテクノロジー検出を使用してLangChainフレームワークの設定を自動化する","LangChainエコシステム内でのマルチエージェントの相互作用をデバッグする"],"ko":["에이전트 통합을 갖춘 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","스마트 기술 감지를 사용하여 LangChain 프레임워크 설정을 자동화하는 것","LangChain 생태계 내에서 멀티 에이전트 상호 작용을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas con integración de agentes","Automatizar la configuración del marco de LangChain con detección de tecnología inteligente","Depurar interacciones de multiagentes dentro del ecosistema de LangChain"],"fr":["Construire des applications LLM sophistiquées avec l''intégration d''agents","Automatiser la configuration du cadre de LangChain avec la détection de technologie intelligente","Déboguer les interactions multi-agents au sein de l''écosystème de LangChain"],"de":["Aufbau von anspruchsvollen LLM-Anwendungen mit Agenten-Integration","Automatisierung der Einrichtung des LangChain-Frameworks mit intelligenter Technologie-Erkennung","Fehlerbehebung von Multiagenten-Interaktionen innerhalb des LangChain-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas com integração de agente","Automatizar a configuração do framework LangChain com detecção de tecnologia inteligente","Depurar interações de multi-agente dentro do ecossistema LangChain"],"ru":["Построение сложных приложений LLM с интеграцией агентов","Автоматизация настройки фреймворка LangChain с умной детекцией технологий","Отладка взаимодействий мультиагентов внутри экосистемы LangChain"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة مع دمج وكيل","تأتمتة إعداد إطار العمل LangChain مع الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا","تصحيح الأخطاء في تفاعلات متعددة الوكلاء داخل نظام LangChain"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LangChain framework compatibility","Task must be related to LangChain architecture","Limited to scope of LangChain and its integrated tools and agents"],"zh":["需要LangChain框架兼容性","任务必须与LangChain架构相关","仅限于LangChain及其集成工具和代理的范围"],"ja":["LangChainフレームワークの互換性が必要","タスクはLangChainアーキテクチャに関連している必要がある","LangChainおよびその統合ツールやエージェントの範囲に限定される"],"ko":["LangChain 프레임워크 호환성이 필요함","작업은 LangChain 아키텍처와 관련이 있어야 함","LangChain 및 그 통합 도구와 에이전트의 범위로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el marco de LangChain","La tarea debe estar relacionada con la arquitectura de LangChain","Limitado al alcance de LangChain y sus herramientas y agentes integrados"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec le cadre de LangChain","La tâche doit être liée à l''architecture de LangChain","Limité à la portée de LangChain et de ses outils et agents intégrés"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem LangChain-Framework","Die Aufgabe muss mit der LangChain-Architektur in Zusammenhang stehen","Begrenzt auf den Umfang von LangChain und seine integrierten Werkzeuge und Agenten"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o framework LangChain","Tarefa deve estar relacionada à arquitetura LangChain","Limitado ao escopo do LangChain e suas ferramentas e agentes integrados"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с фреймворком LangChain","Задача должна быть связана с архитектурой LangChain","Ограничен областью фреймворка LangChain и его интегрированных инструментов и агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع إطار العمل LangChain","يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بهندسة LangChain","محدود نطاق إطار العمل LangChain وأدواته ووكلائه المتكاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
