 Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações LLM avançadas","Integração de agentes e cadeias","Uso de memória para melhorar o desempenho","Integração de ferramentas para aumentar a funcionalidade","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas para validação de resultados"],"ru":["Создание сложных приложений LLM","Интеграция агентов и цепочек","Использование памяти для улучшения производительности","Интеграция инструментов для расширения функциональности","Применение рекомендованных практик для проверки результатов"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات LLM المتقدمة","تكامل الوكلاء والسلاسل","استخدام الذاكرة لتحسين الأداء","تكامل الأدوات لزيادة الوظائف","تطبيق الممارسات الموصى بها لتحقق النتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","LLM应用","链和内存","工具集成","复杂应用构建","最佳实践","LangChain框架"],"ja":["LangChain","LLMアプリケーション","チェーンとメモリ","ツール統合","複雑なアプリケーション構築","ベストプラクティス","LangChainフレームワーク"],"ko":["LangChain","LLM 애플리케이션","체인과 메모리","도구 통합","복잡한 애플리케이션 구축","최적의 관행","LangChain 프레임워크"],"es":["LangChain","aplicaciones LLM","desarrollo de software","agentes","cadenas","memoria","herramientas"],"fr":["LangChain","applications LLM","développement de logiciels","agents","chaînes","mémoire","outils"],"de":["LangChain","LLM-Anwendungen","Software-Entwicklung","Agenten","Ketten","Speicher","Werkzeuge"],"pt":["LangChain","aplicações LLM","agentes","cadeias","memória","integração de ferramentas","práticas recomendadas","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["LangChain","приложения LLM","агенты","цепочки","память","интеграция инструментов","рекомендованные практики","разработка программного обеспечения","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["LangChain","تطبيقات LLM","وكلاء","سلاسل","ذاكرة","تكامل أدوات","ممارسات موصى بها","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-architecture","description":"Design LLM applications using the LangChain framework with agents, memory, and tool integration patterns. Use when building LangChain applications, implementing AI agents, or creating complex LLM workflows.","bodyPreview":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, ope","body":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building autonomous AI agents with tool access\n- Implementing complex multi-step LLM workflows\n- Managing conversation memory and state\n- Integrating LLMs with external data sources and APIs\n- Creating modular, reusable LLM application components\n- Implementing document processing pipelines\n- Building production-grade LLM applications\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Agents\nAutonomous systems that use LLMs to decide which actions to take.\n\n**Agent Types:**\n- **ReAct**: Reasoning + Acting in interleaved manner\n- **OpenAI Functions**: Leverages function calling API\n- **Structured Chat**: Handles multi-input tools\n- **Conversational**: Optimized for chat interfaces\n- **Self-Ask with Search**: Decomposes complex queries\n\n### 2. Chains\nSequences of calls to LLMs or other utilities.\n\n**Chain Types:**\n- **LLMChain**: Basic prompt + LLM combination\n- **SequentialChain**: Multiple chains in sequence\n- **RouterChain**: Routes inputs to specialized chains\n- **TransformChain**: Data transformations between steps\n- **MapReduceChain**: Parallel processing with aggregation\n\n### 3. Memory\nSystems for maintaining context across interactions.\n\n**Memory Types:**\n- **ConversationBufferMemory**: Stores all messages\n- **ConversationSummaryMemory**: Summarizes older messages\n- **ConversationBufferWindowMemory**: Keeps last N messages\n- **EntityMemory**: Tracks information about entities\n- **VectorStoreMemory**: Semantic similarity retrieval\n\n### 4. Document Processing\nLoading, transforming, and storing documents for retrieval.\n\n**Components:**\n- **Document Loaders**: Load from various sources\n- **Text Splitters**: Chunk documents intelligently\n- **Vector Stores**: Store and retrieve embeddings\n- **Retrievers**: Fetch relevant documents\n- **Indexes**: Organize documents for efficient access\n\n### 5. Callbacks\nHooks for logging, monitoring, and debugging.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Request/response logging\n- Token usage tracking\n- Latency monitoring\n- Error handling\n- Custom metrics collection\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import AgentType, initialize_agent, load_tools\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\n\n# Initialize LLM\nllm = OpenAI(temperature=0)\n\n# Load tools\ntools = load_tools([\"serpapi\", \"llm-math\"], llm=llm)\n\n# Add memory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n\n# Create agent\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    memory=memory,\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Run agent\nresult = agent.run(\"What''s the weather in SF? Then calculate 25 * 4\")\n```\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: RAG with LangChain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import TextLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitter import CharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# Load and process documents\nloader = TextLoader(''documents.txt'')\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\ntext_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\ntexts = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# Create vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(texts, embeddings)\n\n# Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=llm,\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What is the main topic?\"})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Agent with Tools\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import Tool, AgentExecutor\nfrom langchain.agents.react.base import ReActDocstoreAgent\nfrom langchain.tools import tool\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\"\"\"\n    # Your database search logic\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef send_email(recipient: str, content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Send an email to specified recipient.\"\"\"\n    # Email sending logic\n    return f\"Email sent to {recipient}\"\n\ntools = [search_database, send_email]\n\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Step Chain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import LLMChain, SequentialChain\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\n\n# Step 1: Extract key information\nextract_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    template=\"Extract key entities from: {text}\\n\\nEntities:\"\n)\nextract_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=extract_prompt, output_key=\"entities\")\n\n# Step 2: Analyze entities\nanalyze_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\"],\n    template=\"Analyze these entities: {entities}\\n\\nAnalysis:\"\n)\nanalyze_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=analyze_prompt, output_key=\"analysis\")\n\n# Step 3: Generate summary\nsummary_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\"],\n    template=\"Summarize:\\nEntities: {entities}\\nAnalysis: {analysis}\\n\\nSummary:\"\n)\nsummary_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=summary_prompt, output_key=\"summary\")\n\n# Combine into sequential chain\noverall_chain = SequentialChain(\n    chains=[extract_chain, analyze_chain, summary_chain],\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    output_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\", \"summary\"],\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n## Memory Management Best Practices\n\n### Choosing the Right Memory Type\n```python\n# For short conversations (< 10 messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n# For long conversations (summarize old messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationSummaryMemory\nmemory = ConversationSummaryMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For sliding window (last N messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferWindowMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferWindowMemory(k=5)\n\n# For entity tracking\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationEntityMemory\nmemory = ConversationEntityMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For semantic retrieval of relevant history\nfrom langchain.memory import VectorStoreRetrieverMemory\nmemory = VectorStoreRetrieverMemory(retriever=retriever)\n```\n\n## Callback System\n\n### Custom Callback Handler\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.base import BaseCallbackHandler\n\nclass CustomCallbackHandler(BaseCallbackHandler):\n    def on_llm_start(self, serialized, prompts, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM started with prompts: {prompts}\")\n\n    def on_llm_end(self, response, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM ended with response: {response}\")\n\n    def on_llm_error(self, error, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM error: {error}\")\n\n    def on_chain_start(self, serialized, inputs, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Chain started with inputs: {inputs}\")\n\n    def on_agent_action(self, action, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Agent taking action: {action}\")\n\n# Use callback\nagent.run(\"query\", callbacks=[CustomCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Testing Strategies\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\ndef test_agent_tool_selection():\n    # Mock LLM to return specific tool selection\n    mock_llm = Mock()\n    mock_llm.predict.return_value = \"Action: search_database\\nAction Input: test query\"\n\n    agent = initialize_agent(tools, mock_llm, agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION)\n\n    result = agent.run(\"test query\")\n\n    # Verify correct tool was selected\n    assert \"search_database\" in str(mock_llm.predict.call_args)\n\ndef test_memory_persistence():\n    memory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n    memory.save_context({\"input\": \"Hi\"}, {\"output\": \"Hello!\"})\n\n    assert \"Hi\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n    assert \"Hello!\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Caching\n```python\nfrom langchain.cache import InMemoryCache\nimport langchain\n\nlangchain.llm_cache = InMemoryCache()\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Processing\n```python\n# Process multiple documents in parallel\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'')\ndocs = loader.load()\n\ndef process_doc(doc):\n    return text_splitter.split_documents([doc])\n\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:\n    split_docs = list(executor.map(process_doc, docs))\n```\n\n### 3. Streaming Responses\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.streaming_stdout import StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler\n\nllm = OpenAI(streaming=True, callbacks=[StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/agents.md**: Deep dive on agent architectures\n- **references/memory.md**: Memory system patterns\n- **references/chains.md**: Chain composition strategies\n- **references/document-processing.md**: Document loading and indexing\n- **references/callbacks.md**: Monitoring and observability\n- **assets/agent-template.py**: Production-ready agent template\n- **assets/memory-config.yaml**: Memory configuration examples\n- **assets/chain-example.py**: Complex chain examples\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Memory Overflow**: Not managing conversation history length\n2. **Tool Selection Errors**: Poor tool descriptions confuse agents\n3. **Context Window Exceeded**: Exceeding LLM token limits\n4. **No Error Handling**: Not catching and handling agent failures\n5. **Inefficient Retrieval**: Not optimizing vector store queries\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add request/response logging\n- [ ] Monitor token usage and costs\n- [ ] Set timeout limits for agent execution\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Add input validation\n- [ ] Test with edge cases\n- [ ] Set up observability (callbacks)\n- [ ] Implement fallback strategies\n- [ ] Version control prompts and configurations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:43:40.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to integrate LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.","zh":"非常适合需要将 LangChain 框架集成到构建复杂 LLM 应用中的 AI Agents，包括与代理、链、内存和工具集成。","ja":"LangChain フレームワークを使用して高度な LLM アプリケーションを構築するためにエージェント、チェーン、メモリ、およびツールの統合が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"에이전트, 체인, 메모리 및 도구 통합을 사용하여 고급 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 LangChain 프레임워크를 통합해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan integrar el marco de LangChain para construir aplicaciones LLM sofisticadas con agentes, cadenas, memoria y integración de herramientas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''intégrer le cadre LangChain pour construire des applications LLM sophistiquées avec des agents, des chaînes, une mémoire et une intégration d''outils.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die das LangChain-Framework für den Bau von komplexen LLM-Anwendungen mit Agents, Ketten, Speicher und Werkzeugintegration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam integrar o framework LangChain para construir aplicações LLM sofisticadas com agentes, cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо интегрировать фреймворк LangChain для создания сложных приложений LLM с агентами, цепочками, памятью и интеграцией инструментов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الإصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى دمج إطار العمل LangChain لإنشاء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة مع الوكلاء والسلاسل والذاكرة وإدماج الأدوات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master the LangChain framework, leveraging agents, chains, memory, and tool integration to build advanced LLM applications, utilizing best practices for validation and verification, and providing actionable steps for outcome optimization.","zh":"赋予代理掌握 LangChain 框架的能力，利用代理、链、内存和工具集成来构建先进的 LLM 应用，利用验证和验证的最佳实践，并为结果优化提供可行的步骤。","ja":"エージェント、チェーン、メモリ、およびツールの統合を使用して高度な LLM アプリケーションを構築するために LangChain フレームワークをマスターするエージェントを可能にし、検証と検証のベストプラクティスを利用し、結果の最適化のための実行可能なステップを提供します。","ko":"에이전트, 체인, 메모리 및 도구 통합을 사용하여 고급 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위해 LangChain 프레임워크를 마스터하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 검증 및 확인의 모범 사례를 사용하고, 결과 최적화에 대한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar el marco de LangChain, aprovechando los agentes, las cadenas, la memoria y la integración de herramientas para construir aplicaciones LLM avanzadas, utilizando las mejores prácticas para la validación y verificación, y proporcionando pasos acciónables para la optimización de resultados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser le cadre LangChain, en exploitant les agents, les chaînes, la mémoire et l''intégration d''outils pour construire des applications LLM avancées, en utilisant les meilleures pratiques pour la validation et la vérification, et en fournissant des étapes actionnables pour l''optimisation des résultats.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, das LangChain-Framework zu meistern, indem es Agents, Ketten, Speicher und Werkzeugintegration nutzt, um fortgeschrittene LLM-Anwendungen zu erstellen, bewährte Verfahren für Validierung und Verifizierung anwendet und handhabbare Schritte für die Ergebnisoptimierung bietet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar o framework LangChain, aproveitando os agentes, cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas para construir aplicações LLM avançadas, utilizando as melhores práticas para validação e verificação e fornecendo etapas concretas para otimização de resultados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить фреймворк LangChain, используя агентов, цепочки, память и интеграцию инструментов для создания передовых приложений LLM, применяя лучшие практики для проверки и верификации и предоставляя пошаговые рекомендации для оптимизации результатов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إتقان إطار العمل LangChain، مستفيدين من الوكلاء والسلاسل والذاكرة وإدماج الأدوات لإنشاء تطبيقات LLM متقدمة، مستخدمين أفضل الممارسات للتحقق والتحديق وتوفير خطوات ملموسة لتحسين النتائج."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing LangChain architecture for LLM applications","Integrating tools and memory for enhanced agent capabilities","Building sophisticated chains for advanced LLM workflows"],"zh":["为 LLM 应用设计 LangChain 架构","集成工具和内存以增强代理功能","构建复杂的链以支持高级 LLM 工作流"],"ja":["LLM アプリケーションの LangChain アーキテクチャを設計する","エージェントの機能を強化するためにツールとメモリを統合する","高度な LLM ワークフローをサポートするための複雑なチェーンを構築する"],"ko":["LLM 애플리케이션을 위한 LangChain 아키텍처 설계","에이전트 기능을 강화하기 위한 도구 및 메모리 통합","고급 LLM 워크플로우를 지원하는 복잡한 체인 구축"],"es":["Diseñar la arquitectura de LangChain para aplicaciones LLM","Integrar herramientas y memoria para mejorar las capacidades de los agentes","Crear cadenas sofisticadas para flujos de trabajo LLM avanzados"],"fr":["Concevoir l''architecture LangChain pour les applications LLM","Intégrer des outils et une mémoire pour améliorer les capacités des agents","Créer des chaînes sophistiquées pour les flux de travail LLM avancés"],"de":["Entwerfen der LangChain-Architektur für LLM-Anwendungen","Integrieren von Werkzeugen und Speicher für erweiterte Agentenfähigkeiten","Erstellen von komplexen Ketten für fortgeschrittene LLM-Workflows"],"pt":["Projetar arquitetura LangChain para aplicações LLM","Integrar ferramentas e memória para capacidades de agente aprimoradas","Construir cadeias sofisticadas para fluxos de trabalho LLM avançados"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры LangChain для приложений LLM","Интеграция инструментов и памяти для расширенных возможностей агентов","Создание сложных цепочек для передовых рабочих процессов LLM"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة LangChain لتطبيقات LLM","دمج الأدوات والذاكرة لتعزيز قدرات الوكيل","بناء سلاسل متقدمة لتدفقات العمل LLM المتقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to LangChain architecture","Requires understanding of LangChain framework and its components"],"zh":["任务必须与 LangChain 架构相关","需要了解 LangChain 框架及其组件"],"ja":["タスクは LangChain アーキテクチャに関連している必要がある","LangChain フレームワークとそのコンポーネントを理解する必要がある"],"ko":["작업은 LangChain 아키텍처와 관련이 있어야 함","LangChain 프레임워크 및その 구성 요소를 이해해야 함"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con la arquitectura de LangChain","Requiere comprensión del marco de LangChain y sus componentes"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à l''architecture LangChain","Nécessite une compréhension du cadre LangChain et de ses composants"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit der LangChain-Architektur zusammenhängen","Benötigt Verständnis des LangChain-Frameworks und seiner Komponenten"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à arquitetura LangChain","Exige compreensão do framework LangChain e seus componentes"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с архитектурой LangChain","Требует понимания фреймворка LangChain и его компонентов"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة ببنية LangChain","يتطلب فهم إطار العمل LangChain ومكوناته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
