"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 Freshservice 티켓 관리 자동화","Composio 툴킷을 사용하여 IT 서비스 데스크 작업 최적화","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하여 Freshservice를 다른 툴과 통합"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de tickets de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","Optimizar las operaciones de escritorio de servicios de TI con la herramienta de Composio","Integrar Freshservice con otras herramientas utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des tickets Freshservice via Rube MCP","Optimiser les opérations de bureau de services informatiques avec la trousse d''outils de Composio","Intégrer Freshservice avec d''autres outils en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Freshservice-Ticket-Verwaltung über Rube MCP","Optimierung der IT-Service-Desk-Operationen mit Composios Toolkit","Integration von Freshservice mit anderen Tools unter Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"pt":["Automating Freshservice ticket management via Rube MCP","Streamlining IT service desk operations with Composio''s toolkit","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ru":["Automating Freshservice ticket management via Rube MCP","Streamlining IT service desk operations with Composio''s toolkit","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ar":["Automating Freshservice ticket management via Rube MCP","Streamlining IT service desk operations with Composio''s toolkit","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''freshservice''","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接并且 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 可用","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 并具有 ''freshservice'' 工具包的活动 Freshservice 连接","依赖于 Rube MCP 服务器配置"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続が必要であり、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS が利用可能であること","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用して ''freshservice'' ツールキットを含むアクティブな Freshservice 接続が必要","Rube MCP サーバー構成に依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요하며 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS가 사용 가능해야 함","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 ''freshservice'' 툴킷을 포함하는 활성 Freshservice 연결이 필요","Rube MCP 서버 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Necesita conexión activa de Freshservice a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta ''freshservice''","Dependiente de la configuración del servidor Rube MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion avec Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Nécessite une connexion active Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec la trousse d''outils ''freshservice''","Dépend de la configuration du serveur Rube MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Benötigt aktive Freshservice-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit ''freshservice''","Abhängig von der Rube-MCP-Server-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''freshservice''","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"],"ru":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''freshservice''","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"],"ar":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''freshservice''","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
