ns de gestion de services IT","Configuration du serveur MCP","Nécessite pas de clés API"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP","Composio-Tool für Freshservice","Automatisierung von ITSM-Operationen","Konfiguration des MCP-Servers","Benötigt keine API-Schlüssel"],"pt":["Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração com o toolkit Composio via Rube MCP","Pré-requisitos claros para configuração","Configuração simples com o servidor MCP","Sem necessidade de chaves de API"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций по управлению сервисами ИТ","Интеграция с инструментом Composio через Rube MCP","Ясные предварительные условия для настройки","Простая настройка с сервером MCP","Нет необходимости в ключах API"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","التكامل مع أداة كومبوسيو عبر روب إم سي بي","متطلبات أساسية واضحة للتهيئة","تهيئة بسيطة مع خادم إم سي بي","لا حاجة لمفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Freshservice自动化","Rube MCP","IT服务管理","自动化工具","Composio","Freshservice工具包"],"ja":["Freshservice自動化","Rube MCP","ITサービス管理","自動化ツール","Composio","Freshserviceツールキット"],"ko":["Freshservice 자동화","Rube MCP","IT 서비스 관리","자동화 도구","Composio","Freshservice 툴킷"],"es":["automatización de Freshservice","Rube MCP","ITSM","Composio","desarrollo de software","automatización de procesos","integración de herramientas","gestión de servicios IT"],"fr":["automatisation de Freshservice","Rube MCP","ITSM","Composio","développement de logiciels","automatisation de processus","intégration d''outils","gestion de services IT"],"de":["Freshservice-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","ITSM","Composio","Softwareentwicklung","Prozessautomatisierung","Tool-Integration","IT-Service-Management"],"pt":["Freshservice Automation","Rube MCP","Composio","Automação de serviços de TI","Gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração de ferramentas"],"ru":["Автоматизация Freshservice","Rube MCP","Composio","Автоматизация сервисов ИТ","Управление сервисами ИТ","Интеграция инструментов"],"ar":["تأتمة فريش سيرفيس","روب إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","تأتمة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","تكامل الأدوات"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"freshservice-automation","description":"Automate Freshservice ITSM tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create/update tickets, bulk operations, service requests, and outbound emails. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys","body":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Freshservice authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find, list, or search for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with optional filtering and pagination [Required]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET` - Get detailed information for a specific ticket [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `filter`: Predefined filter (''all_tickets'', ''deleted'', ''spam'', ''watching'')\n- `updated_since`: ISO 8601 timestamp to get tickets updated after this time\n- `order_by`: Sort field (''created_at'', ''updated_at'', ''status'', ''priority'')\n- `order_type`: Sort direction (''asc'' or ''desc'')\n- `page`: Page number (1-indexed)\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-100, default 30)\n- `include`: Additional fields (''requester'', ''stats'', ''description'', ''conversations'', ''assets'')\n\n**Key parameters for get**:\n- `ticket_id`: Unique ticket ID or display_id\n- `include`: Additional fields to include\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- By default, only tickets created within the past 30 days are returned\n- Use `updated_since` to retrieve older tickets\n- Each `include` value consumes additional API credits\n- `page` is 1-indexed; minimum value is 1\n- `per_page` max is 100; default is 30\n- Ticket IDs can be the internal ID or the display_id shown in the UI\n\n### 2. Create a Ticket\n\n**When to use**: User wants to log a new incident or request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET` - Create a new ticket [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `subject`: Ticket subject line (required)\n- `description`: HTML description of the ticket (required)\n- `status`: Ticket status - 2 (Open), 3 (Pending), 4 (Resolved), 5 (Closed) (required)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Urgent) (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (provide either email or requester_id)\n- `requester_id`: User ID of the requester\n- `type`: Ticket type (''Incident'' or ''Service Request'')\n- `source`: Channel - 1 (Email), 2 (Portal), 3 (Phone), 4 (Chat), 5 (Twitter), 6 (Facebook)\n- `impact`: Impact level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High)\n- `urgency`: Urgency level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Critical)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `subject`, `description`, `status`, and `priority` are all required\n- Either `email` or `requester_id` must be provided to identify the requester\n- Status and priority use numeric codes, not string names\n- Description supports HTML formatting\n- If email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created\n\n### 3. Bulk Update Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to update multiple tickets at once\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - Find tickets to update [Prerequisite]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS` - Update multiple tickets [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `ids`: Array of ticket IDs to update (required)\n- `update_fields`: Dictionary of fields to update (required)\n  - Allowed keys: ''subject'', ''description'', ''status'', ''priority'', ''responder_id'', ''group_id'', ''type'', ''tags'', ''custom_fields''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Bulk update performs sequential updates internally; large batches may take time\n- All specified tickets receive the same field updates\n- If one ticket update fails, others may still succeed; check response for individual results\n- Cannot selectively update different fields per ticket in a single call\n- Custom fields must use their internal field names, not display names\n\n### 4. Create Ticket via Outbound Email\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a ticket by sending an outbound email notification\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL` - Create ticket with email notification [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (required)\n- `subject`: Email subject / ticket subject (required)\n- `description`: HTML email body content\n- `status`: Ticket status (2=Open, 3=Pending, 4=Resolved, 5=Closed)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority (1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High, 4=Urgent)\n- `cc_emails`: Array of CC email addresses\n- `email_config_id`: Email configuration ID for the sender address\n- `name`: Requester name\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This creates a standard ticket via the /api/v2/tickets endpoint while sending an email\n- If the email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created with the provided name\n- `email_config_id` determines which email address the notification appears to come from\n\n### 5. Create Service Requests\n\n**When to use**: User wants to submit a service catalog request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST` - Create a service request for a catalog item [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `item_display_id`: Display ID of the catalog item (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address\n- `quantity`: Number of items to request (default: 1)\n- `custom_fields`: Custom field values for the service item form\n- `parent_ticket_id`: Display ID of a parent ticket (for child requests)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `item_display_id` can be found in Admin > Service Catalog > item URL (e.g., /service_catalog/items/1)\n- Custom fields keys must match the service item form field names\n- Quantity defaults to 1 if not specified\n- Service requests follow the approval workflow defined for the catalog item\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Status Code Reference\n\n| Code | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| 2 | Open |\n| 3 | Pending |\n| 4 | Resolved |\n| 5 | Closed |\n\n### Priority Code Reference\n\n| Code | Priority |\n|------|----------|\n| 1 | Low |\n| 2 | Medium |\n| 3 | High |\n| 4 | Urgent |\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Use `page` (1-indexed) and `per_page` (max 100) parameters\n- Increment `page` by 1 each request\n- Continue until returned results count < `per_page`\n- Default page size is 30\n\n### Finding Tickets by Date Range\n\n```\n1. Call FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS with updated_since=''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z''\n2. Optionally add order_by=''updated_at'' and order_type=''desc''\n3. Paginate through results\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Numeric Codes**:\n- Status and priority use numeric values, not strings\n- Source channel uses numeric codes (1-6)\n- Impact and urgency use numeric codes (1-3 or 1-4)\n\n**Date Filtering**:\n- Default returns only tickets from the last 30 days\n- Use `updated_since` parameter for older tickets\n- Date format is ISO 8601 (e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z'')\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Freshservice API has per-account rate limits\n- Each `include` option consumes additional API credits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are numeric integers\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS | filter, updated_since, page, per_page |\n| Get ticket | FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET | ticket_id, include |\n| Create ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET | subject, description, status, priority, email |\n| Bulk update | FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS | ids, update_fields |\n| Outbound email ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL | email, subject, description |\n| Service request | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST | item_display_id, email, quantity |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:44:11.560Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for IT Service Management Agents needing advanced Freshservice automation capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过Rube MCP实现高级Freshservice自动化功能的IT服务管理代理","ja":"Rube MCPを介して高度なFreshserviceの自動化機能を必要とするITサービスマネージメントエージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 고급 Freshservice 자동화 기능을 필요로 하는 IT 서비스 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Servicios de TI que necesitan capacidades de automatización avanzadas de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de services informatiques qui ont besoin de capacités d''automatisation avancées de Freshservice via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für IT-Service-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Freshservice-Automatisierungsfunktionen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Serviços de TI que necessitam de capacidades de automação avançadas do Freshservice por meio do Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению ИТ-услугами, которым необходимы расширенные возможности автоматизации Freshservice через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعمال إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات أتمتة متقدمة من Freshservice عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the freshservice toolkit for efficient management","zh":"通过Composio的Freshservice工具包、利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS实现无缝集成，并利用freshservice工具包进行高效管理，从而赋予代理自动化Freshservice IT服务管理操作的能力","ja":"ComposioのFreshserviceツールキットを使用し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用してシームレスな統合を実現し、freshserviceツールキットを使用して効率的な管理を行うことで、エージェントがFreshservice ITサービス管理操作を自動化できるようになる","ko":"Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하고 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하여 무작위 통합을 구현하고 freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 효율적인 관리를 수행함으로써 에이전트가 Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 작업을 자동화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Gestión de Servicios de TI de Freshservice a través de la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración sin problemas, y aprovechando la herramienta de Freshservice para una gestión eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de gestion de services informatiques de Freshservice via la boîte à outils Freshservice de Composio, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration sans rupture, et en exploitant la boîte à outils Freshservice pour une gestion efficace","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Freshservice-IT-Service-Management-Operationen über das Composio-Freshservice-Toolkit zu automatisieren, das RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration nutzt und das Freshservice-Toolkit für eine effiziente Verwaltung einsetzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI do Freshservice por meio da ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração sem interrupções, e aproveitando a ferramenta do Freshservice para gerenciamento eficiente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по управлению ИТ-услугами Freshservice с помощью инструмента Freshservice от Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для бесшовной интеграции, и используя инструментарий Freshservice для эффективного управления","ar":"يمنح العمال القدرة على أتمتة عمليات إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات من Freshservice من خلال أداة Freshservice من Composio، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس، وتحقيق الإدارة الفعالة باستخدام أداة Freshservice"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Freshservice ticket management through Rube MCP","Streamlining IT service desk operations with Composio''s Freshservice toolkit","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["通过Rube MCP自动化Freshservice工单管理","使用Composio的Freshservice工具包简化IT服务台操作","使用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS将Freshservice与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Rube MCPを使用してFreshserviceのチケット管理を自動化する","ComposioのFreshserviceツールキットを使用してITサービスのデスク操作をストリームライン化する","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用してFreshserviceを他のツールと統合する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 Freshservice 티켓 관리를 자동화","Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 IT 서비스 데스크 작업을 간소화","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 Freshservice를 다른 도구와 통합"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de tickets de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","Optimizar las operaciones del escritorio de servicio de TI con la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio","Integrar Freshservice con otras herramientas utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des tickets de Freshservice via Rube MCP","Optimiser les opérations du bureau de service informatique avec la boîte à outils Freshservice de Composio","Intégrer Freshservice avec d''autres outils en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisieren der Freshservice-Ticketverwaltung über Rube MCP","Optimieren der IT-Service-Desk-Operationen mit dem Composio-Freshservice-Toolkit","Integrieren von Freshservice mit anderen Tools unter Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar o gerenciamento de tickets do Freshservice por meio do Rube MCP","Otizar operações da mesa de serviço de TI com a ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio","Integrar o Freshservice com outras ferramentas usando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление тикетами Freshservice через Rube MCP","Оптимизировать операции службы desks ИТ-услуг с помощью инструмента Freshservice от Composio","Интегрировать Freshservice с другими инструментами с помощью RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["أتمتة إدارة التذاكر في Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP","تحسين عمليات مكتب خدمة تكنولوجيا المعلومات باستخدام أداة Freshservice من Composio","دمج Freshservice مع أدوات أخرى باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with freshservice toolkit necessary","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要具有RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS的Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS具有活跃的Freshservice连接和freshservice工具包","依赖于RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS进行当前工具架构"],"ja":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを使用したRube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用したアクティブなFreshservice接続とfreshserviceツールキットが必要","現在のツールスキーマに対してRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSに依存"],"ko":["RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하는 Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하는 활성 Freshservice 연결 및 freshservice 툴킷이 필요","현재 툴 스키마에 대해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Conexión activa de Freshservice a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta de Freshservice necesaria","Dependiente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion à Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Connexion active Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec la boîte à outils Freshservice nécessaire","Dépendant de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung mit Rube MCP mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Aktive Freshservice-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Freshservice-Toolkit erforderlich","Abhängig von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für aktuelle Toolschemata"],"pt":["Exige conexão com Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponíveis","Conexão ativa do Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com ferramenta do Freshservice necessária","Dependente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требует подключения к Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Активное подключение к Freshservice через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с инструментарием Freshservice обязательно","Зависит от RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для текущих схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بـ Rube MCP مع أدوات RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","الارتباط الفعّال مع Freshservice من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة Freshservice ضروري","يعتمد على RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS لمخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
