ndung zu Rube MCP","Verwaltung von IT-Services mit Freshservice","Automatisierung von Operationen","Integration von Tools","Einfache Konfiguration"],"pt":["Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração com o Rube MCP","Utilização do toolkit Freshservice","Configuração simples com o RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Suporte à conexão ativa com o Freshservice"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций по управлению ИТ-услугами","Интеграция с Rube MCP","Использование инструментария Freshservice","Простая настройка с помощью RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Поддержка активного подключения к Freshservice"],"ar":["تطبيق автоматиّة لعمليات إدارة الخدمات التقنيّة","دمج مع روبي إم سي بي","استخدام حزمة أدوات فريشسيرفيس","التهيئة البسيطة مع روبي_سيرش_تولز","دعم الاتصال الفعّال بفريشسيرفيس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Freshservice 自动化","Rube MCP","IT 服务管理","自动化运维","Freshservice 工具包","Rube MCP 连接","Freshservice 连接"],"ja":["Freshservice オートメーション","Rube MCP","IT サービス管理","自動化運用","Freshservice ツールキット","Rube MCP 接続","Freshservice 接続"],"ko":["Freshservice 자동화","Rube MCP","IT 서비스 관리","자동화 운영","Freshservice 툴킷","Rube MCP 연결","Freshservice 연결"],"es":["automatización de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestión de servicios de TI","integración de herramientas","automatización de operaciones","Freshservice toolkit"],"fr":["automatisation de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestion des services de TI","intégration d''outils","automatisation des opérations","Freshservice toolkit"],"de":["Freshservice-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","IT-Service-Management","Tool-Integration","Automatisierung von Operationen","Freshservice-Toolkit"],"pt":["automação freshservice","rube mcp","gerenciamento de serviços de ti","integração freshservice","ferramentas de automação","configuração rube mcp"],"ru":["автоматизация freshservice","rube mcp","управление ит-услугами","интеграция freshservice","инструменты автоматизации","настройка rube mcp"],"ar":["تأثير فريشسيرفيس","روبي إم سي بي","إدارة الخدمات التقنيّة","دمج فريشسيرفيس","أدوات التأثير","تهيئة روبي إم سي بي"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"freshservice-automation","description":"Automate Freshservice ITSM tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create/update tickets, bulk operations, service requests, and outbound emails. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys","body":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Freshservice authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find, list, or search for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with optional filtering and pagination [Required]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET` - Get detailed information for a specific ticket [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `filter`: Predefined filter (''all_tickets'', ''deleted'', ''spam'', ''watching'')\n- `updated_since`: ISO 8601 timestamp to get tickets updated after this time\n- `order_by`: Sort field (''created_at'', ''updated_at'', ''status'', ''priority'')\n- `order_type`: Sort direction (''asc'' or ''desc'')\n- `page`: Page number (1-indexed)\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-100, default 30)\n- `include`: Additional fields (''requester'', ''stats'', ''description'', ''conversations'', ''assets'')\n\n**Key parameters for get**:\n- `ticket_id`: Unique ticket ID or display_id\n- `include`: Additional fields to include\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- By default, only tickets created within the past 30 days are returned\n- Use `updated_since` to retrieve older tickets\n- Each `include` value consumes additional API credits\n- `page` is 1-indexed; minimum value is 1\n- `per_page` max is 100; default is 30\n- Ticket IDs can be the internal ID or the display_id shown in the UI\n\n### 2. Create a Ticket\n\n**When to use**: User wants to log a new incident or request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET` - Create a new ticket [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `subject`: Ticket subject line (required)\n- `description`: HTML description of the ticket (required)\n- `status`: Ticket status - 2 (Open), 3 (Pending), 4 (Resolved), 5 (Closed) (required)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Urgent) (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (provide either email or requester_id)\n- `requester_id`: User ID of the requester\n- `type`: Ticket type (''Incident'' or ''Service Request'')\n- `source`: Channel - 1 (Email), 2 (Portal), 3 (Phone), 4 (Chat), 5 (Twitter), 6 (Facebook)\n- `impact`: Impact level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High)\n- `urgency`: Urgency level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Critical)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `subject`, `description`, `status`, and `priority` are all required\n- Either `email` or `requester_id` must be provided to identify the requester\n- Status and priority use numeric codes, not string names\n- Description supports HTML formatting\n- If email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created\n\n### 3. Bulk Update Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to update multiple tickets at once\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - Find tickets to update [Prerequisite]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS` - Update multiple tickets [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `ids`: Array of ticket IDs to update (required)\n- `update_fields`: Dictionary of fields to update (required)\n  - Allowed keys: ''subject'', ''description'', ''status'', ''priority'', ''responder_id'', ''group_id'', ''type'', ''tags'', ''custom_fields''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Bulk update performs sequential updates internally; large batches may take time\n- All specified tickets receive the same field updates\n- If one ticket update fails, others may still succeed; check response for individual results\n- Cannot selectively update different fields per ticket in a single call\n- Custom fields must use their internal field names, not display names\n\n### 4. Create Ticket via Outbound Email\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a ticket by sending an outbound email notification\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL` - Create ticket with email notification [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (required)\n- `subject`: Email subject / ticket subject (required)\n- `description`: HTML email body content\n- `status`: Ticket status (2=Open, 3=Pending, 4=Resolved, 5=Closed)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority (1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High, 4=Urgent)\n- `cc_emails`: Array of CC email addresses\n- `email_config_id`: Email configuration ID for the sender address\n- `name`: Requester name\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This creates a standard ticket via the /api/v2/tickets endpoint while sending an email\n- If the email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created with the provided name\n- `email_config_id` determines which email address the notification appears to come from\n\n### 5. Create Service Requests\n\n**When to use**: User wants to submit a service catalog request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST` - Create a service request for a catalog item [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `item_display_id`: Display ID of the catalog item (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address\n- `quantity`: Number of items to request (default: 1)\n- `custom_fields`: Custom field values for the service item form\n- `parent_ticket_id`: Display ID of a parent ticket (for child requests)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `item_display_id` can be found in Admin > Service Catalog > item URL (e.g., /service_catalog/items/1)\n- Custom fields keys must match the service item form field names\n- Quantity defaults to 1 if not specified\n- Service requests follow the approval workflow defined for the catalog item\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Status Code Reference\n\n| Code | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| 2 | Open |\n| 3 | Pending |\n| 4 | Resolved |\n| 5 | Closed |\n\n### Priority Code Reference\n\n| Code | Priority |\n|------|----------|\n| 1 | Low |\n| 2 | Medium |\n| 3 | High |\n| 4 | Urgent |\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Use `page` (1-indexed) and `per_page` (max 100) parameters\n- Increment `page` by 1 each request\n- Continue until returned results count < `per_page`\n- Default page size is 30\n\n### Finding Tickets by Date Range\n\n```\n1. Call FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS with updated_since=''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z''\n2. Optionally add order_by=''updated_at'' and order_type=''desc''\n3. Paginate through results\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Numeric Codes**:\n- Status and priority use numeric values, not strings\n- Source channel uses numeric codes (1-6)\n- Impact and urgency use numeric codes (1-3 or 1-4)\n\n**Date Filtering**:\n- Default returns only tickets from the last 30 days\n- Use `updated_since` parameter for older tickets\n- Date format is ISO 8601 (e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z'')\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Freshservice API has per-account rate limits\n- Each `include` option consumes additional API credits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are numeric integers\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS | filter, updated_since, page, per_page |\n| Get ticket | FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET | ticket_id, include |\n| Create ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET | subject, description, status, priority, email |\n| Bulk update | FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS | ids, update_fields |\n| Outbound email ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL | email, subject, description |\n| Service request | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST | item_display_id, email, quantity |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:44:18.522Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for IT Service Management Agents needing advanced Freshservice automation capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要高级Freshservice自动化功能的IT服务管理代理，通过Rube MCP实现","ja":"Rube MCPを介して高度なFreshserviceの自動化機能を必要とするITサービスマネージメントエージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 고급 Freshservice 자동화 기능을 필요로 하는 IT 서비스 관리 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Gestión de Servicios de TI que necesitan capacidades de automatización avanzadas de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de services informatiques ayant besoin de capacités d''automatisation avancées de Freshservice via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für IT-Service-Management-Agenten, die erweiterte Freshservice-Automatisierungsfunktionen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de gerenciamento de serviços de TI que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de automação do Freshservice via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению сервисами ИТ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности автоматизации Freshservice через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة خدمة تكنولوجيا المعلومات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تلقائية متقدمة من Freshservice عبر Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit, utilizing Rube MCP for streamlined connections and management, with features like RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","zh":"通过Composio的Freshservice工具包，利用Rube MCP实现流线化的连接和管理，具有RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS等功能，赋予代理自动化Freshservice IT服务管理操作的能力","ja":"ComposioのFreshserviceツールキットを使用して、Rube MCPを介して接続と管理をストリーミングし、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSやRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSなどの機能を提供し、エージェントがFreshservice ITサービス管理操作を自動化できるようにする","ko":"Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 Rube MCP를 통해 연결 및 관리를 스트리밍하고, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 등의 기능을 제공하여 에이전트가 Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Gestión de Servicios de TI de Freshservice a través de la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio, utilizando Rube MCP para conexiones y administración optimizadas, con características como RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de gestion de services informatiques de Freshservice via l''outil de Freshservice de Composio, en utilisant Rube MCP pour des connexions et une gestion optimisées, avec des fonctionnalités comme RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Freshservice-IT-Service-Management-Operationen durch Composios Freshservice-Toolkit zu automatisieren, wobei Rube MCP für optimierte Verbindungen und Verwaltung verwendet wird, mit Funktionen wie RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI do Freshservice por meio da ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio, utilizando o Rube MCP para conexões e gerenciamento otimizados, com recursos como RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по управлению сервисами ИТ Freshservice с помощью инструмента Freshservice от Composio, используя Rube MCP для оптимизированных подключений и управления, с функциями seperti RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير عمليات إدارة خدمة تكنولوجيا المعلومات من Freshservice من خلال أداة Freshservice الخاصة بشركة Composio، باستخدام Rube MCP للاتصالات والإدارة المُبسطة، مع ميزات مثل RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Freshservice ticket management via Rube MCP","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using Composio''s toolkit","Streamlining IT service desk operations through automated workflows"],"zh":["通过Rube MCP自动化Freshservice 티켓 관리","使用Composio的工具包将Freshservice与其他工具集成","通过自动化工作流优化IT服务台操作"],"ja":["Rube MCPを介してFreshserviceのチケット管理を自動化する","Composioのツールキットを使用してFreshserviceと他のツールを統合する","自動化されたワークフローを通じてITサービスデスクの操作を最適化する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 통해 Freshservice 티켓 관리 자동화","Composio의 툴킷을 사용하여 Freshservice와 다른 도구 통합","자동화된 워크플로를 통해 IT 서비스 데스크 작업 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de tickets de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","Integrar Freshservice con otras herramientas utilizando la herramienta de Composio","Optimizar las operaciones del escritorio de servicio de TI a través de flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des tickets de Freshservice via Rube MCP","Intégrer Freshservice avec d''autres outils en utilisant l''outil de Composio","Optimiser les opérations du bureau de service informatique via des flux de travail automatisés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Freshservice-Ticketverwaltung über Rube MCP","Integrieren von Freshservice mit anderen Tools mithilfe des Composio-Toolkits","Optimieren von IT-Service-Desk-Operationen durch automatisierte Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar gerenciamento de tickets do Freshservice via Rube MCP","Integrar Freshservice com outras ferramentas usando a ferramenta da Composio","Otimizar operações da mesa de serviço de TI por meio de fluxos de trabalho automatizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление тикетами Freshservice через Rube MCP","Интегрировать Freshservice с другими инструментами с помощью инструмента Composio","Оптимизировать операции службы поддержки ИТ с помощью автоматизированных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["توفير إدارة تذاكر Freshservice عبر Rube MCP","دمج Freshservice مع أدوات أخرى باستخدام أداة Composio","تحسين عمليات مكتب خدمة تكنولوجيا المعلومات من خلال سير عمل تلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available","Needs active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS with toolkit ''freshservice''","Dependent on Rube MCP server configuration"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接并具有RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS可用性","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS具有工具包''freshservice''的活跃Freshservice连接","依赖于Rube MCP服务器配置"],"ja":["Rube MCPの接続とRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSの利用が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介した''toolkit'' freshservice''のアクティブなFreshservice接続が必要","Rube MCPサーバーの構成に依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 및 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 사용 가능성 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 툴킷 ''freshservice''의 활성 Freshservice 연결 필요","Rube MCP 서버 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Necesita conexión activa de Freshservice a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS con la herramienta ''freshservice''","Dependiente de la configuración del servidor Rube MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion avec Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponibles","Nécessite une connexion active de Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS avec l''outil ''freshservice''","Dépend de la configuration du serveur Rube MCP"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung mit Rube MCP mit verfügbaren RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Benötigt eine aktive Freshservice-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS mit dem Toolkit ''freshservice''","Abhängig von der Konfiguration des Rube-MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Exige conexão com Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS disponível","Necessita conexão ativa com Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS com a ferramenta ''freshservice''","Dependente da configuração do servidor Rube MCP"],"ru":["Требует подключения к Rube MCP с доступными RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Требует активного подключения к Freshservice через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS с инструментом ''freshservice''","Зависит от конфигурации сервера Rube MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصالًا bằng Rube MCP مع أدوات البحث RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS المتاحة","يتطلب اتصالًا نشطًا بالفريشسيرفيس عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS مع أداة ''فريشسيرفيس''","يعتمد على تكوين خادم Rube MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/azure-storage-blob-java', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'azure-storage-blob-java', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z', '2026-02-18T02:44:25.951Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/azure-storage-blob-java","name":"azure-storage-blob-java","description":{"zh":"Azure Storage Blob SDK for Java是用于构建Blob存储应用程序的工具，提供了高效的数据存储和管理功能","ja":"Azure Storage Blob SDK for Javaは、Blobストレージアプリケーションを構築するためのツールであり、効率的なデータストレージと管理機能を提供","ko":"Azure Storage Blob SDK for Java는 Blob 스토리지 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 도구로, 효율적인 데이터 저장 및 관리 기능을 제공","es":"El SDK de Azure Storage Blob para Java permite a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones de almacenamiento de blobs escalables y seguras.","fr":"Le SDK Azure Storage Blob pour Java permet aux développeurs de créer des applications de stockage d''objets blob évolutives et sécurisées.","de":"Das Azure Storage Blob SDK für Java ermöglicht es Entwicklern, skalierbare und sichere Blob-Speicheranwendungen zu erstellen.","pt":"O SDK do Azure Storage Blob para Java permite criar aplicações de armazenamento de blobs escaláveis e seguras. Aprenda a instalar e criar clientes.","ru":"SDK Azure Storage Blob для Java позволяет создавать масштабируемые и безопасные приложения хранения BLOB. Узнайте, как установить и создать клиентов.","ar":"يسمح SDK Azure Storage Blob للجافا بإنشاء تطبيقات تخزين Blobs قابلة للتطوير وأمنة. تعلم كيفية التثبيت وإنشاء العملاء.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Azure Java Blob存储SDK","ja":"Azure Storage Blob SDK for Java","ko":"Azure 자바 Blob 스토리지 SDK","es":"SDK de Azure Storage Blob para Java","fr":"SDK Azure Storage Blob pour Java","de":"Azure Storage Blob SDK für Java","pt":"Azure Storage Blob Java: Desenvolvimento de Aplicações","ru":"Azure Stor