herramientas integradas","Configuración sencilla con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Soporte para la gestión de conexiones con RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Connexion de Rube MCP et Freshservice","Automatisation des opérations de gestion de services TI","Amélioration de l''efficacité avec des outils intégrés","Configuration simple avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Support pour la gestion des connexions avec RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Verbindung von Rube MCP und Freshservice","Automatisierung von IT-Service-Management-Operationen","Verbesserung der Effizienz mit integrierten Tools","Einfache Konfiguration mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Unterstützung für die Verwaltung von Verbindungen mit RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração com o Freshservice via Rube MCP","Utilização do toolkit da Composio","Configuração simples com o RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Suporte à conexão ativa com o Freshservice"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций управления сервисами ИТ","Интеграция с Freshservice через Rube MCP","Использование инструментария Composio","Простая настройка с помощью RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Поддержка активного соединения с Freshservice"],"ar":["تأتمتة عمليات إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","التكامل مع Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP","استخدام أدوات Composio","تهيئة بسيطة مع RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","دعم الاتصال النشط مع Freshservice"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Freshservice 自动化","Rube MCP","IT 服务管理","自动化解决方案","效率提升","生产力提高","IT 服务管理自动化","Freshservice 连接"],"ja":["Freshservice オートメーション","Rube MCP","IT サービス管理","自動化ソリューション","効率向上","生産性向上","IT サービス管理自動化","Freshservice 接続"],"ko":["Freshservice 자동화","Rube MCP","IT 서비스 관리","자동화 솔루션","효율 향상","생산성 향상","IT 서비스 관리 자동화","Freshservice 연결"],"es":["automatización de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestión de servicios de TI","integración de herramientas","eficiencia en la gestión de servicios","conexión de Rube MCP y Freshservice"],"fr":["automation de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestion de services TI","intégration d''outils","efficacité dans la gestion de services","connexion de Rube MCP et Freshservice"],"de":["Automatisierung von Freshservice","Rube MCP","IT-Service-Management","Integration von Tools","Effizienz in der Verwaltung von Dienstleistungen","Verbindung von Rube MCP und Freshservice"],"pt":["Freshservice","Rube MCP","Automação de serviços de TI","Gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Composio","Integração de sistemas","Automação de processos","Freshservice API"],"ru":["Freshservice","Rube MCP","Автоматизация сервисов ИТ","Управление сервисами ИТ","Composio","Интеграция систем","Автоматизация процессов","Freshservice API"],"ar":["Freshservice","Rube MCP","تأتمتة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","إدارة خدمات تكنولوجيا المعلومات","Composio","تكامل الأنظمة","تأتمتة العمليات","Freshservice API"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"freshservice-automation","description":"Automate Freshservice ITSM tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create/update tickets, bulk operations, service requests, and outbound emails. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys","body":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Freshservice authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find, list, or search for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with optional filtering and pagination [Required]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET` - Get detailed information for a specific ticket [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `filter`: Predefined filter (''all_tickets'', ''deleted'', ''spam'', ''watching'')\n- `updated_since`: ISO 8601 timestamp to get tickets updated after this time\n- `order_by`: Sort field (''created_at'', ''updated_at'', ''status'', ''priority'')\n- `order_type`: Sort direction (''asc'' or ''desc'')\n- `page`: Page number (1-indexed)\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-100, default 30)\n- `include`: Additional fields (''requester'', ''stats'', ''description'', ''conversations'', ''assets'')\n\n**Key parameters for get**:\n- `ticket_id`: Unique ticket ID or display_id\n- `include`: Additional fields to include\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- By default, only tickets created within the past 30 days are returned\n- Use `updated_since` to retrieve older tickets\n- Each `include` value consumes additional API credits\n- `page` is 1-indexed; minimum value is 1\n- `per_page` max is 100; default is 30\n- Ticket IDs can be the internal ID or the display_id shown in the UI\n\n### 2. Create a Ticket\n\n**When to use**: User wants to log a new incident or request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET` - Create a new ticket [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `subject`: Ticket subject line (required)\n- `description`: HTML description of the ticket (required)\n- `status`: Ticket status - 2 (Open), 3 (Pending), 4 (Resolved), 5 (Closed) (required)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Urgent) (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (provide either email or requester_id)\n- `requester_id`: User ID of the requester\n- `type`: Ticket type (''Incident'' or ''Service Request'')\n- `source`: Channel - 1 (Email), 2 (Portal), 3 (Phone), 4 (Chat), 5 (Twitter), 6 (Facebook)\n- `impact`: Impact level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High)\n- `urgency`: Urgency level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Critical)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `subject`, `description`, `status`, and `priority` are all required\n- Either `email` or `requester_id` must be provided to identify the requester\n- Status and priority use numeric codes, not string names\n- Description supports HTML formatting\n- If email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created\n\n### 3. Bulk Update Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to update multiple tickets at once\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - Find tickets to update [Prerequisite]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS` - Update multiple tickets [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `ids`: Array of ticket IDs to update (required)\n- `update_fields`: Dictionary of fields to update (required)\n  - Allowed keys: ''subject'', ''description'', ''status'', ''priority'', ''responder_id'', ''group_id'', ''type'', ''tags'', ''custom_fields''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Bulk update performs sequential updates internally; large batches may take time\n- All specified tickets receive the same field updates\n- If one ticket update fails, others may still succeed; check response for individual results\n- Cannot selectively update different fields per ticket in a single call\n- Custom fields must use their internal field names, not display names\n\n### 4. Create Ticket via Outbound Email\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a ticket by sending an outbound email notification\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL` - Create ticket with email notification [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (required)\n- `subject`: Email subject / ticket subject (required)\n- `description`: HTML email body content\n- `status`: Ticket status (2=Open, 3=Pending, 4=Resolved, 5=Closed)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority (1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High, 4=Urgent)\n- `cc_emails`: Array of CC email addresses\n- `email_config_id`: Email configuration ID for the sender address\n- `name`: Requester name\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This creates a standard ticket via the /api/v2/tickets endpoint while sending an email\n- If the email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created with the provided name\n- `email_config_id` determines which email address the notification appears to come from\n\n### 5. Create Service Requests\n\n**When to use**: User wants to submit a service catalog request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST` - Create a service request for a catalog item [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `item_display_id`: Display ID of the catalog item (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address\n- `quantity`: Number of items to request (default: 1)\n- `custom_fields`: Custom field values for the service item form\n- `parent_ticket_id`: Display ID of a parent ticket (for child requests)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `item_display_id` can be found in Admin > Service Catalog > item URL (e.g., /service_catalog/items/1)\n- Custom fields keys must match the service item form field names\n- Quantity defaults to 1 if not specified\n- Service requests follow the approval workflow defined for the catalog item\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Status Code Reference\n\n| Code | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| 2 | Open |\n| 3 | Pending |\n| 4 | Resolved |\n| 5 | Closed |\n\n### Priority Code Reference\n\n| Code | Priority |\n|------|----------|\n| 1 | Low |\n| 2 | Medium |\n| 3 | High |\n| 4 | Urgent |\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Use `page` (1-indexed) and `per_page` (max 100) parameters\n- Increment `page` by 1 each request\n- Continue until returned results count < `per_page`\n- Default page size is 30\n\n### Finding Tickets by Date Range\n\n```\n1. Call FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS with updated_since=''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z''\n2. Optionally add order_by=''updated_at'' and order_type=''desc''\n3. Paginate through results\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Numeric Codes**:\n- Status and priority use numeric values, not strings\n- Source channel uses numeric codes (1-6)\n- Impact and urgency use numeric codes (1-3 or 1-4)\n\n**Date Filtering**:\n- Default returns only tickets from the last 30 days\n- Use `updated_since` parameter for older tickets\n- Date format is ISO 8601 (e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z'')\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Freshservice API has per-account rate limits\n- Each `include` option consumes additional API credits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are numeric integers\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS | filter, updated_since, page, per_page |\n| Get ticket | FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET | ticket_id, include |\n| Create ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET | subject, description, status, priority, email |\n| Bulk update | FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS | ids, update_fields |\n| Outbound email ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL | email, subject, description |\n| Service request | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST | item_display_id, email, quantity |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:44:13.602Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IT Service Management Agents seeking to automate Freshservice operations via Rube MCP and Composio''s Freshservice toolkit","zh":"适合于寻求通过 Rube MCP 和 Composio 的 Freshservice 工具包自动化 Freshservice 操作的 IT 服务管理代理","ja":"Rube MCP と Composio の Freshservice ツールキットを使用して Freshservice 操作を自動化しようとする IT サービス管理エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP와 Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 Freshservice 작업을 자동화하려는 IT 서비스 관리 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de servicios de TI que buscan automatizar las operaciones de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP y la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de services informatiques souhaitant automatiser les opérations Freshservice via Rube MCP et l''outil de Freshservice de Composio","de":"Ideal für IT-Service-Management-Agents, die Freshservice-Operationen über Rube MCP und Composios Freshservice-Toolkit automatisieren möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Serviços de TI que buscam automatizar operações do Freshservice por meio do Rube MCP e da ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению службами ИТ, стремящихся автоматизировать операции Freshservice с помощью Rube MCP и набора инструментов Freshservice от Composio","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الخدمات الإلكترونية التي تسعى إلى توفير عمليات Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP وأداة Freshservice من Composio"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit, utilizing Rube MCP for streamlined connections and management, and leveraging `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` for current tool schemas","zh":"通过 Composio 的 Freshservice 工具包、利用 Rube MCP 实现流线化的连接和管理，并利用 `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` 实现当前工具模式，赋予代理自动化 Freshservice IT 服务管理操作的能力","ja":"Composio の Freshservice ツールキットを使用し、Rube MCP を使用して接続と管理を最適化し、`RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` を使用して現在のツールスキーマを利用することで、エージェントが Freshservice IT サービス管理操作を自動化できるようにする","ko":"Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하고, Rube MCP를 사용하여 연결과 관리를 최적화하며, `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`를 사용하여 현재 도구 스키마를 활용함으로써 에이전트가 Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de gestión de servicios de TI de Freshservice a través de la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio, utilizando Rube MCP para conexiones y gestión optimizadas, y aprovechando `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` para esquemas de herramientas actuales","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de gestion de services informatiques Freshservice via l''outil de Freshservice de Composio, en utilisant Rube MCP pour des connexions et une gestion optimisées, et en exploitant `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` pour les schémas d''outils actuels","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Freshservice-IT-Service-Management-Operationen über Composios Freshservice-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem Rube MCP für optimierte Verbindungen und Verwaltung verwendet wird und `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` für aktuelle Werkzeugschemata genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações de Gerenciamento de Serviços de TI do Freshservice por meio da ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio, utilizando o Rube MCP para conexões e gerenciamento otimizados, e utilizando `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` para esquemas de ferramentas atuais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по управлению службами ИТ Freshservice с помощью набора инструментов Freshservice от Composio, используя Rube MCP для оптимизированных подключений и управления, и используя `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` для текущих схем инструментов","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توفير عمليات إدارة الخدمات الإلكترونية من Freshservice من خلال أداة Freshservice من Composio، باستخدام Rube MCP لتحسين الاتصالات والإدارة، وتحقيق `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` لمخططات الأدوات الحالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Freshservice ticket management through Rube MCP","Streamlining IT service desk operations with Composio''s Freshservice toolkit","Integrating Freshservice with other tools via Rube MCP connections"],"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 自动化 Freshservice 票务管理","使用 Composio 的 Freshservice 工具包优化 IT 服务台操作","通过 Rube MCP 连接将 Freshservice 与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Rube MCP を使用して Freshservice のチケット管理を自動化する","Composio の Freshservice ツールキットを使用して IT サービスデスク操作を最適化する","Rube MCP 接続を使用して Freshservice を他のツールと統合する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 Freshservice 티켓 관리를 자동화하는 것","Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 IT 서비스 데스크 작업을 최적화하는 것","Rube MCP 연결을 사용하여 Freshservice를 다른 도구와 통합하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la gestión de tickets de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","Optimizar las operaciones del escritorio de servicios de TI con la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio","Integrar Freshservice con otras herramientas a través de conexiones de Rube MCP"],"fr":["Automatiser la gestion des tickets Freshservice via Rube MCP","Optimiser les opérations du bureau de services informatiques avec l''outil de Freshservice de Composio","Intégrer Freshservice avec d''autres outils via les connexions Rube MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung der Freshservice-Ticketverwaltung über Rube MCP","Optimierung der IT-Service-Desk-Operationen mit Composios Freshservice-Toolkit","Integration von Freshservice mit anderen Tools über Rube-MCP-Verbindungen"],"pt":["Automatizar o gerenciamento de tickets do Freshservice por meio do Rube MCP","Otimizar as operações da mesa de serviço de TI com a ferramenta do Freshservice da Composio","Integrar o Freshservice com outras ferramentas por meio de conexões do Rube MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление тикетами Freshservice с помощью Rube MCP","Оптимизировать операции службы поддержки ИТ с помощью набора инструментов Freshservice от Composio","Интегрировать Freshservice с другими инструментами через подключения Rube MCP"],"ar":["توفير إدارة التذاكر في Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP","تحسين عمليات مكتب الدعم الفني من خلال أداة Freshservice من Composio","إضافة Freshservice إلى أدوات أخرى من خلال اتصالات Rube MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` available","Needs active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`"],"zh":["需要具有 `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` 的 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` 并具有工具包 `freshservice` 的活跃 Freshservice 连接"],"ja":["`RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` が利用可能な Rube MCP 接続が必要","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` を使用して、ツールキット `freshservice` を持つアクティブな Freshservice 接続が必要"],"ko":["`RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`가 사용 가능한 Rube MCP 연결이 필요","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`를 사용하여 툴킷 `freshservice`를持つ 활성 Freshservice 연결이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP con `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponible","Necesita conexión activa de Freshservice a través de `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` con la herramienta `freshservice`"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponible","Nécessite une connexion Freshservice active via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` avec l''outil `freshservice`"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit verfügbarer `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`","Benötigt aktive Freshservice-Verbindung über `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` mit dem Toolkit `freshservice`"],"pt":["Exige conexão com Rube MCP com `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponíveis","Necessita de conexão ativa do Freshservice por meio de `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` com a ferramenta `freshservice`"],"ru":["Требует подключения к Rube MCP с доступными `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`","Требует активного подключения к Freshservice через `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` с инструментом `freshservice`"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بـ Rube MCP مع أدوات البحث `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` المتاحة","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط إلى Freshservice من خلال `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` مع أداة `freshservice`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
