e .NET: SDK de voz en tiempo real","fr":"Azure AI VoiceLive .NET : SDK de voix en temps réel","de":"Azure AI VoiceLive .NET: Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK","pt":"Azure AI Voice Live .NET - SDK de Voz em Tempo Real","ru":"Azure AI Voice Live .NET - SDK голосового интерфейса в ре...","ar":"Azure AI Voice Live .NET - SDK صوتي في الوقت الحقيقي","en":"azure-ai-voicelive-dotnet"},"description":{"zh":"Azure AI VoiceLive .NET SDK .NET, Azure AI.","ja":"Azure AI VoiceLive .NET SDK .NET, Azure AI.","ko":"Azure AI VoiceLive .NET SDK .NET, Azure AI.","es":"Azure AI VoiceLive es un SDK de voz en tiempo real para .NET que permite construir asistentes de voz bidireccionales con Azure AI. Ofrece instalación sencill...","fr":"Azure AI VoiceLive est un SDK de voix en temps réel pour .NET qui permet de construire des assistants vocaux bidirectionnels avec Azure AI. Il offre une inst...","de":"Azure AI VoiceLive ist ein Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK für .NET, mit dem Sie bidirektionale Sprachassistenten mit Azure AI erstellen können. Es bietet eine einfache ...","pt":"O Azure AI Voice Live .NET é um SDK de voz em tempo real para construir assistentes de voz bidirecionais com Azure AI.","ru":"Azure AI Voice Live .NET — это SDK голосового интерфейса в реальном времени для создания голосовых помощников с Azure AI.","ar":"Azure AI Voice Live .NET هو SDK صوتي في الوقت الحقيقي لإنشاء مساعدين صوتيين ثنائيي الاتجاه مع Azure AI.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":[".NET SDK","Azure AI",".NET","Real-time","Bidirectional"],"ja":[".NET SDK","Azure AI",".NET","Real-time","Bidirectional"],"ko":[".NET SDK","Azure AI",".NET","Real-time","Bidirectional"],"es":["SDK de voz en tiempo real para .NET","Compatibilidad con Azure AI","Instalación sencilla con NuGet","Compatibilidad con versiones estables y de vista previa","Captura y reproducción de audio con NAudio"],"fr":["SDK de voix en temps réel pour .NET","Compatibilité avec Azure AI","Installation simple avec NuGet","Compatibilité avec les versions stables et de préversion","Capture et lecture audio avec NAudio"],"de":["Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK für .NET","Kompatibilität mit Azure AI","Einfache Installation mit NuGet","Kompatibilität mit stabilen und Vorschauversionen","Audioaufnahme und -wiedergabe mit NAudio"],"pt":["SDK de voz em tempo real","Construção de assistentes de voz bidirecionais","Integração com Azure AI","Suporte a áudio em tempo real","Instalação fácil com pacotes NuGet"],"ru":["SDK голосового интерфейса в реальном времени","Создание голосовых помощников с двусторонней связью","Интеграция с Azure AI","Поддержка аудио в реальном времени","Легкая установка с помощью пакетов NuGet"],"ar":["SDK صوتي في الوقت الحقيقي","بناء مساعدين صوتيين ثنائيي الاتجاه","التكامل مع Azure AI","دعم الصوت في الوقت الحقيقي","تثبيت سهل مع حزم NuGet"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time voice AI","Bidirectional voice assistants","Azure AI","VoiceLive .NET","Azure AI SDK","Voice AI .NET"],"ja":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time voice AI","Bidirectional voice assistants","Azure AI","VoiceLive .NET","Azure AI SDK","Voice AI .NET"],"ko":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time voice AI","Bidirectional voice assistants","Azure AI","VoiceLive .NET","Azure AI SDK","Voice AI .NET"],"es":["Azure AI VoiceLive","SDK de voz en tiempo real",".NET","asistentes de voz bidireccionales","Azure AI","desarrollo de voz","NuGet","NAudio"],"fr":["Azure AI VoiceLive","SDK de voix en temps réel",".NET","assistants vocaux bidirectionnels","Azure AI","développement vocal","NuGet","NAudio"],"de":["Azure AI VoiceLive","Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK",".NET","bidirektionale Sprachassistenten","Azure AI","Sprachentwicklung","NuGet","NAudio"],"pt":["Azure AI Voice Live .NET","SDK de voz em tempo real","Assistentes de voz bidirecionais","Desenvolvimento de voz","Azure AI","NuGet"],"ru":["Azure AI Voice Live .NET","SDK голосового интерфейса в реальном времени","Голосовые помощники с двусторонней связью","Разработка голосовых приложений","Azure AI","NuGet"],"ar":["Azure AI Voice Live .NET","SDK صوتي في الوقت الحقيقي","مساعدين صوتيين ثنائيي الاتجاه","تطوير التطبيقات الصوتية","Azure AI","NuGet"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-ai-voicelive-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE","body":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_VOICE=en-US-AvaNeural\n# Optional: API key if not using Entra ID\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_API_KEY=<your-api-key>\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Microsoft Entra ID (Recommended)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nDefaultAzureCredential credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n**Required Role**: `Cognitive Services User` (assign in Azure Portal → Access control)\n\n### API Key\n\n```csharp\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nAzureKeyCredential credential = new AzureKeyCredential(\"your-api-key\");\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n## Client Hierarchy\n\n```\nVoiceLiveClient\n└── VoiceLiveSession (WebSocket connection)\n    ├── ConfigureSessionAsync()\n    ├── GetUpdatesAsync() → SessionUpdate events\n    ├── AddItemAsync() → UserMessageItem, FunctionCallOutputItem\n    ├── SendAudioAsync()\n    └── StartResponseAsync()\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Start Session and Configure\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nvar endpoint = new Uri(Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"AZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT\"));\nvar client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\nvar model = \"gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview\";\n\n// Start session\nusing VoiceLiveSession session = await client.StartSessionAsync(model);\n\n// Configure session\nVoiceLiveSessionOptions sessionOptions = new()\n{\n    Model = model,\n    Instructions = \"You are a helpful AI assistant. Respond naturally.\",\n    Voice = new AzureStandardVoice(\"en-US-AvaNeural\"),\n    TurnDetection = new AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection()\n    {\n        Threshold = 0.5f,\n        PrefixPadding = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(300),\n        SilenceDuration = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(500)\n    },\n    InputAudioFormat = InputAudioFormat.Pcm16,\n    OutputAudioFormat = OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16\n};\n\n// Set modalities (both text and audio for voice assistants)\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Clear();\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Text);\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Audio);\n\nawait session.ConfigureSessionAsync(sessionOptions);\n```\n\n### 2. Process Events\n\n```csharp\nawait foreach (SessionUpdate serverEvent in session.GetUpdatesAsync())\n{\n    switch (serverEvent)\n    {\n        case SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta audioDelta:\n            byte[] audioData = audioDelta.Delta.ToArray();\n            // Play audio via NAudio or other audio library\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta textDelta:\n            Console.Write(textDelta.Delta);\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall:\n            // Handle function call (see Function Calling section)\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateError error:\n            Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseDone:\n            Console.WriteLine(\"\\n--- Response complete ---\");\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Send User Message\n\n```csharp\nawait session.AddItemAsync(new UserMessageItem(\"Hello, can you help me?\"));\nawait session.StartResponseAsync();\n```\n\n### 4. Function Calling\n\n```csharp\n// Define function\nvar weatherFunction = new VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition(\"get_current_weather\")\n{\n    Description = \"Get the current weather for a given location\",\n    Parameters = BinaryData.FromString(\"\"\"\n        {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"location\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"The city and state or country\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\"location\"]\n        }\n        \"\"\")\n};\n\n// Add to session options\nsessionOptions.Tools.Add(weatherFunction);\n\n// Handle function call in event loop\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall)\n{\n    if (functionCall.Name == \"get_current_weather\")\n    {\n        var parameters = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, string>>(functionCall.Arguments);\n        string location = parameters?[\"location\"] ?? \"\";\n        \n        // Call external service\n        string weatherInfo = $\"The weather in {location} is sunny, 75°F.\";\n        \n        // Send response\n        await session.AddItemAsync(new FunctionCallOutputItem(functionCall.CallId, weatherInfo));\n        await session.StartResponseAsync();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Voice Options\n\n| Voice Type | Class | Example |\n|------------|-------|---------|\n| Azure Standard | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-AvaNeural\"` |\n| Azure HD | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-Ava:DragonHDLatestNeural\"` |\n| Azure Custom | `AzureCustomVoice` | Custom voice with endpoint ID |\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Model | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `gpt-4o-realtime-preview` | GPT-4o with real-time audio |\n| `gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview` | Lightweight, fast interactions |\n| `phi4-mm-realtime` | Cost-effective multimodal |\n\n## Key Types Reference\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `VoiceLiveClient` | Main client for creating sessions |\n| `VoiceLiveSession` | Active WebSocket session |\n| `VoiceLiveSessionOptions` | Session configuration |\n| `AzureStandardVoice` | Standard Azure voice provider |\n| `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection` | Voice activity detection |\n| `VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition` | Function tool definition |\n| `UserMessageItem` | User text message |\n| `FunctionCallOutputItem` | Function call response |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta` | Audio chunk event |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta` | Text chunk event |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always set both modalities** — Include `Text` and `Audio` for voice assistants\n2. **Use `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection`** — Provides natural conversation flow\n3. **Configure appropriate silence duration** — 500ms typical to avoid premature cutoffs\n4. **Use `using` statement** — Ensures proper session disposal\n5. **Handle all event types** — Check for errors, audio, text, and function calls\n6. **Use DefaultAzureCredential** — Never hardcode API keys\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateError error)\n{\n    if (error.Error.Message.Contains(\"Cancellation failed: no active response\"))\n    {\n        // Benign error, can ignore\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Audio Configuration\n\n- **Input Format**: `InputAudioFormat.Pcm16` (16-bit PCM)\n- **Output Format**: `OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16`\n- **Sample Rate**: 24kHz recommended\n- **Channels**: Mono\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.AI.VoiceLive` | Real-time voice (this SDK) | `dotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive` |\n| `Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` | Speech-to-text, text-to-speech | `dotnet add package Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` |\n| `NAudio` | Audio capture/playback | `dotnet add package NAudio` |\n\n## Reference Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| NuGet Package | https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| API Reference | https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.ai.voicelive |\n| GitHub Source | https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/tree/main/sdk/ai/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| Quickstart | https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/speech-service/voice-live-quickstart |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:44:34.581Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Voice Assistant Agents needing real-time voice AI capabilities with Azure AI and .NET integration.","zh":"非常适合需要实时语音 AI 能力的语音助手代理，具有 Azure AI 和 .NET 集成。","ja":"Azure AI および .NET 統合を備えたリアルタイムの音声 AI 機能が必要な音声アシスタント エージェントに最適。","ko":"Azure AI 및 .NET 통합을 갖춘 실시간 음성 AI 기능이 필요한 음성 어시스턴트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Asistentes de Voz que necesitan capacidades de voz de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real con integración de Azure AI y .NET.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''assistants vocaux nécessitant des capacités de voix d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel avec une intégration Azure AI et .NET.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachassistenten-Agenten, die Echtzeit-Sprach-KI-Funktionen mit Azure-KI- und .NET-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Assistente de Voz que necessitam de capacidades de IA de voz em tempo real com integração do Azure AI e .NET.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов помощников голоса, которым необходимы возможности голосовой ИИ в реальном времени с интеграцией Azure AI и .NET.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المساعدين الصوتيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي في الوقت الفعلي مع دمج Azure AI و .NET."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build bidirectional voice assistants using Azure.AI.VoiceLive, leveraging real-time voice AI SDK, and integrating with Azure Identity for secure authentication, while utilizing NAudio for seamless audio capture and playback.","zh":"赋予代理构建双向语音助手的能力，利用 Azure.AI.VoiceLive 和实时语音 AI SDK，并与 Azure Identity 进行安全认证，同时利用 NAudio 实现无缝音频捕获和播放。","ja":"Azure.AI.VoiceLive とリアルタイム音声 AI SDK を利用し、Azure Identity を使用したセキュアな認証を行い、NAudio を使用してシームレスなオーディオのキャプチャと再生を実現しながら、双方向の音声アシスタントを構築するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"Azure.AI.VoiceLive 및 실시간 음성 AI SDK를 활용하여 양방향 음성 어시스턴트를 구축할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Azure Identity를 사용한 보안 인증을 수행하고, NAudio를 사용하여 무шов한 오디오 캡처 및 재생을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear asistentes de voz bidireccionales utilizando Azure.AI.VoiceLive, aprovechando el kit de desarrollo de software de voz de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real y integrándose con Azure Identity para una autenticación segura, mientras utiliza NAudio para una captura y reproducción de audio sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des assistants vocaux bidirectionnels en utilisant Azure.AI.VoiceLive, en exploitant le SDK de voix d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel et en s''intégrant à Azure Identity pour une authentification sécurisée, tout en utilisant NAudio pour une capture et une lecture audio sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bidirektionale Sprachassistenten mit Azure.AI.VoiceLive zu erstellen, die Echtzeit-Sprach-KI-SDK nutzen und sich mit Azure Identity für eine sichere Authentifizierung integrieren, während NAudio für eine nahtlose Audioaufnahme und -wiedergabe verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir assistentes de voz bidirecionais usando Azure.AI.VoiceLive, aproveitando o SDK de IA de voz em tempo real e integrando com Azure Identity para autenticação segura, enquanto utiliza NAudio para captura e reprodução de áudio sem interrupções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать двусторонние голосовые помощники, используя Azure.AI.VoiceLive, используя SDK голосовой ИИ в реальном времени и интегрируя с Azure Identity для безопасной аутентификации, а также использует NAudio для бесперебойной захвата и воспроизведения аудио.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء مساعدين صوتيين ثنائي الاتجاه باستخدام Azure.AI.VoiceLive، واستخدام SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي في الوقت الفعلي، ودمجها مع Azure Identity لأغراض التحقق الآمن، مع استخدام NAudio لالتقاط الصوت وتشغيله دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time voice assistants with Azure AI","Integrating voice AI into .NET applications using Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Enhancing voice interaction with gpt-4o-realtime-preview model"],"zh":["使用 Azure AI 构建实时语音助手","使用 Azure.AI.VoiceLive 将语音 AI 集成到 .NET 应用程序中","使用 gpt-4o-realtime-preview 模型增强语音交互"],"ja":["Azure AI を使用したリアルタイム音声アシスタントの構築","Azure.AI.VoiceLive を使用した .NET アプリケーションへの音声 AI の統合","gpt-4o-realtime-preview モデルを使用した音声インタラクションの強化"],"ko":["Azure AI를 사용한 실시간 음성 어시스턴트 구축","Azure.AI.VoiceLive를 사용한 .NET 애플리케이션への 음성 AI 통합","gpt-4o-realtime-preview 모델을 사용한 음성 상호작용 강화"],"es":["Construir asistentes de voz en tiempo real con Azure AI","Integrar la inteligencia artificial de voz en aplicaciones .NET con Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Mejorar la interacción de voz con el modelo gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"fr":["Créer des assistants vocaux en temps réel avec Azure AI","Intégrer l''intelligence artificielle vocale dans des applications .NET à l''aide d''Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Améliorer l''interaction vocale avec le modèle gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Sprachassistenten mit Azure-KI","Integrieren von Sprach-KI in .NET-Anwendungen mit Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Verbesserung der Sprachinteraktion mit dem gpt-4o-realtime-preview-Modell"],"pt":["Construir assistentes de voz em tempo real com Azure AI","Integrar IA de voz em aplicativos .NET usando Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Melhorar interação de voz com modelo gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"ru":["Построение голосовых помощников в реальном времени с Azure AI","Интеграция голосовой ИИ в приложения .NET с помощью Azure.AI.VoiceLive","Улучшение взаимодействия голоса с моделью gpt-4o-realtime-preview"],"ar":["بناء مساعدين صوتيين في الوقت الفعلي مع Azure AI","دمج الذكاء الاصطناعي الصوتي في تطبيقات .NET باستخدام Azure.AI.VoiceLive","تحسين التفاعل الصوتي مع نموذج gpt-4o-realtime-preview"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT environment variable setup","Needs Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL specification, such as gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Dependent on Azure Identity and NAudio packages"],"zh":["需要设置 Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT 环境变量","需要指定 Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL，例如 gpt-4o-realtime-preview","依赖于 Azure Identity 和 NAudio 包"],"ja":["Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT 環境変数の設定が必要","Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL の指定が必要 (例: gpt-4o-realtime-preview)","Azure Identity および NAudio パッケージに依存"],"ko":["Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT 환경 변수 설정이 필요합니다","Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL 지정이 필요합니다(예: gpt-4o-realtime-preview)","Azure Identity 및 NAudio 패키지에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de la variable de entorno Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Necesita la especificación del modelo Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL, como gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Dependiente de los paquetes Azure Identity y NAudio"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de la variable d''environnement Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Nécessite la spécification du modèle Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL, comme gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Dépend des packages Azure Identity et NAudio"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung der Umgebungsvariable Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Benötigt die Spezifikation des Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL-Modells, wie z. B. gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Abhängig von den Paketen Azure Identity und NAudio"],"pt":["Requer configuração da variável de ambiente Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Necessita de especificação do modelo Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL, como gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Dependente dos pacotes Azure Identity e NAudio"],"ru":["Требуется настройка переменной среды Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","Требуется указание модели Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL, например gpt-4o-realtime-preview","Зависит от пакетов Azure Identity и NAudio"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد متغير البيئة Azure_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT","يحتاج إلى تحديد نموذج Azure_VOICELIVE_MODEL، مثل gpt-4o-realtime-preview","يعتمد على حزم Azure Identity و NAudio"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
