skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["SMB","Azure","Python","pip",""],"ja":["SMB","Azure","Python","pip",""],"ko":["SMB","Azure","Python","pip",""],"es":["Gestión de comparticiones de archivos SMB","Compatibilidad con escenarios cloud-native y lift-and-shift","Instalación mediante pip","Autenticación mediante cadena de conexión o URL de cuenta","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Gestion des partages de fichiers SMB","Compatibilité avec les scénarios cloud-native et lift-and-shift","Installation via pip","Authentification via chaîne de connexion ou URL de compte","Compatibilité avec Python"],"de":["Verwaltung von SMB-Dateifreigaben","Kompatibilität mit cloud-native- und lift-and-shift-Szenarien","Installation über pip","Authentifizierung über Verbindungscodes oder Kontourl","Kompatibilität mit Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Python","SMB","Azure","Python","pip","Azure Storage"],"ja":["Azure Python","SMB","Azure","Python","pip","Azure Storage"],"ko":["Azure Python","SMB","Azure","Python","pip","Azure Storage"],"es":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK de Azure para Python","Gestión de comparticiones de archivos SMB","Escenarios cloud-native","Escenarios lift-and-shift","Python","Desarrollo de aplicaciones en la nube"],"fr":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Azure pour Python","Gestion des partages de fichiers SMB","Scénarios cloud-native","Scénarios lift-and-shift","Python","Développement d''applications dans le cloud"],"de":["Azure Storage File Share","Azure-SDK für Python","Verwaltung von SMB-Dateifreigaben","Cloud-native-Szenarien","Lift-and-shift-Szenarien","Python","Cloud-Anwendungsentwicklung"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-storage-file-share-py","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice","body":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient.from_connection_string(\n    os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING\"]\n)\n```\n\n### Entra ID\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient(\n    account_url=os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL\"],\n    credential=DefaultAzureCredential()\n)\n```\n\n## Share Operations\n\n### Create Share\n\n```python\nshare = service.create_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### List Shares\n\n```python\nfor share in service.list_shares():\n    print(f\"{share.name}: {share.quota} GB\")\n```\n\n### Get Share Client\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### Delete Share\n\n```python\nservice.delete_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n## Directory Operations\n\n### Create Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory\")\n\n# Nested directory\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory/sub-directory\")\n```\n\n### List Directories and Files\n\n```python\ndirectory_client = share_client.get_directory_client(\"my-directory\")\n\nfor item in directory_client.list_directories_and_files():\n    if item[\"is_directory\"]:\n        print(f\"[DIR] {item[''name'']}\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"[FILE] {item[''name'']} ({item[''size'']} bytes)\")\n```\n\n### Delete Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client.delete_directory(\"my-directory\")\n```\n\n## File Operations\n\n### Upload File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# From string\nfile_client.upload_file(\"Hello, World!\")\n\n# From file\nwith open(\"local-file.txt\", \"rb\") as f:\n    file_client.upload_file(f)\n\n# From bytes\nfile_client.upload_file(b\"Binary content\")\n```\n\n### Download File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# To bytes\ndata = file_client.download_file().readall()\n\n# To file\nwith open(\"downloaded.txt\", \"wb\") as f:\n    data = file_client.download_file()\n    data.readinto(f)\n\n# Stream chunks\ndownload = file_client.download_file()\nfor chunk in download.chunks():\n    process(chunk)\n```\n\n### Get File Properties\n\n```python\nproperties = file_client.get_file_properties()\nprint(f\"Size: {properties.size}\")\nprint(f\"Content type: {properties.content_settings.content_type}\")\nprint(f\"Last modified: {properties.last_modified}\")\n```\n\n### Delete File\n\n```python\nfile_client.delete_file()\n```\n\n### Copy File\n\n```python\nsource_url = \"https://account.file.core.windows.net/share/source.txt\"\ndest_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"destination.txt\")\ndest_client.start_copy_from_url(source_url)\n```\n\n## Range Operations\n\n### Upload Range\n\n```python\n# Upload to specific range\nfile_client.upload_range(data=b\"content\", offset=0, length=7)\n```\n\n### Download Range\n\n```python\n# Download specific range\ndownload = file_client.download_file(offset=0, length=100)\ndata = download.readall()\n```\n\n## Snapshot Operations\n\n### Create Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot = share_client.create_snapshot()\nprint(f\"Snapshot: {snapshot[''snapshot'']}\")\n```\n\n### Access Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot_client = service.get_share_client(\n    \"my-share\",\n    snapshot=snapshot[\"snapshot\"]\n)\n```\n\n## Async Client\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare.aio import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity.aio import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nasync def upload_file():\n    credential = DefaultAzureCredential()\n    service = ShareServiceClient(account_url, credential=credential)\n    \n    share = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n    file_client = share.get_file_client(\"test.txt\")\n    \n    await file_client.upload_file(\"Hello!\")\n    \n    await service.close()\n    await credential.close()\n```\n\n## Client Types\n\n| Client | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `ShareServiceClient` | Account-level operations |\n| `ShareClient` | Share operations |\n| `ShareDirectoryClient` | Directory operations |\n| `ShareFileClient` | File operations |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use connection string** for simplest setup\n2. **Use Entra ID** for production with RBAC\n3. **Stream large files** using chunks() to avoid memory issues\n4. **Create snapshots** before major changes\n5. **Set quotas** to prevent unexpected storage costs\n6. **Use ranges** for partial file updates\n7. **Close async clients** explicitly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:33.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Storage Automation Agents needing enterprise-grade file management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要企业级文件管理功能的云存储自动化代理。","ja":"クラウドストレージの自動化エージェントに適した、企業レベルのファイル管理機能を必要とする。","ko":"기업급 파일 관리 기능이 필요한 클라우드 스토리지 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de almacenamiento en la nube que necesitan capacidades de administración de archivos de nivel empresarial.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de stockage dans le cloud nécessitant des capacités de gestion de fichiers de niveau entreprise.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud Storage-Automatisierungsagenten, die Unternehmens-Dateiverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Armazenamento em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de arquivos de nível empresarial.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации облачного хранилища, которым необходимы корпоративные возможности управления файлами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقائي تخزين السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة الملفات من الدرجة المؤسسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct SMB file share management in Azure cloud environments through the azure-storage-file-share SDK. Provides comprehensive file operations including upload, download, directory management, and metadata handling for both cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.","zh":"通过azure-storage-file-share SDK，在Azure云环境中启用直接SMB文件共享管理。为云原生和提升转移场景提供了包括上传、下载、目录管理和元数据处理在内的全面文件操作。","ja":"azure-storage-file-share SDKを使用して、Azureクラウド環境での直接SMBファイル共有管理を有効にします。クラウドネイティブおよびリフトアンドシフトのシナリオの両方で、アップロード、ダウンロード、ディレクトリ管理、およびメタデータ処理を含む包括的なファイル操作を提供します。","ko":"azure-storage-file-share SDK를 사용하여 Azure 클라우드 환경에서 직접 SMB 파일 공유 관리를 활성화합니다. 클라우드 네이티브 및 리프트 앤 시프트 시나리오 모두에서 업로드, 다운로드, 디렉토리 관리 및 메타데이터 처리를 포함한 포괄적인 파일 작업을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita la administración directa de recursos compartidos de archivos SMB en entornos de nube de Azure a través del SDK de azure-storage-file-share. Proporciona operaciones de archivo comprehensivas, incluidas carga, descarga, administración de directorios y control de metadatos tanto para escenarios cloud-native como lift-and-shift.","fr":"Permet la gestion directe des partages de fichiers SMB dans les environnements cloud Azure via le SDK azure-storage-file-share. Fournit des opérations de fichiers complètes, y compris le téléchargement, le téléchargement, la gestion des répertoires et la gestion des métadonnées pour les scénarios cloud-native et lift-and-shift.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Verwaltung von SMB-Dateifreigaben in Azure-Cloud-Umgebungen über das azure-storage-file-share-SDK. Bietet umfassende Dateivorgänge, einschließlich Upload, Download, Verzeichnisverwaltung und Metadatenverwaltung für Cloud-native- und Lift-and-Shift-Szenarien.","pt":"Permite o gerenciamento direto de compartilhamentos de arquivos SMB em ambientes de nuvem do Azure por meio do SDK azure-storage-file-share. Fornece operações de arquivo abrangentes, incluindo upload, download, gerenciamento de diretórios e manipulação de metadados para cenários nativos de nuvem e de elevação e transferência.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую управлять общими ресурсами файлов SMB в облачных средах Azure через SDK azure-storage-file-share. Предоставляет комплексные операции с файлами, включая загрузку, выгрузку, управление каталогами и обработку метаданных как для облачных, так и для сценариев подъема и переноса.","ar":"يمكّن إدارة مباشرة لمشاركة ملفات SMB في بيئات السحاب من أزور عبر SDK azure-storage-file-share. يوفر عمليات ملفات شاملة، بما في ذلك تحميل وتنزيل وإدارة دليل و xử lý بيانات التعريف لمواقف السحاب الأصليّة ورفع وانتقال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating file uploads/downloads to Azure File Shares","Managing directory structures in cloud storage","Synchronizing local files with Azure SMB shares","Implementing secure file transfer workflows"],"zh":["自动将文件上传/下载到Azure文件共享","管理云存储中的目录结构","将本地文件与Azure SMB共享同步","实施安全文件传输工作流"],"ja":["Azure File Sharesへのファイルの自動アップロード/ダウンロード","クラウドストレージ内のディレクトリ構造の管理","ローカルファイルとAzure SMB共有の同期","セキュアファイル転送ワークフローの実装"],"ko":["Azure 파일 공유에 대한 파일 자동 업로드/다운로드","클라우드 스토리지 내 디렉토리 구조 관리","로컬 파일과 Azure SMB 공유 동기화","보안 파일 전송 워크플로우 구현"],"es":["Automatizar cargas/descargas de archivos en recursos compartidos de Azure File","Administrar estructuras de directorios en almacenamiento en la nube","Sincronizar archivos locales con acciones compartidas de Azure SMB","Implementar flujos de trabajo de transferencia de archivos seguros"],"fr":["Automatiser les téléchargements/téléchargements de fichiers vers les partages de fichiers Azure","Gérer les structures de répertoire dans le stockage cloud","Synchroniser les fichiers locaux avec les partages SMB Azure","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail de transfert de fichiers sécurisés"],"de":["Automatisieren von Datei-Uploads/Downloads in Azure-Dateifreigaben","Verwalten von Verzeichnisstrukturen in Cloud-Speicher","Synchronisieren von lokalen Dateien mit Azure-SMB-Freigaben","Implementieren von sicheren Dateiübertragungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar uploads/downloads de arquivos para Compartilhamentos de Arquivos do Azure","Gerenciar estruturas de diretório em armazenamento em nuvem","Sincronizar arquivos locais com compartilhamentos SMB do Azure","Implementar fluxos de trabalho de transferência de arquivos seguros"],"ru":["Автоматизировать загрузку/выгрузку файлов в Общие ресурсы файлов Azure","Управлять структурами каталогов в облачном хранилище","Синхронизировать локальные файлы с общими ресурсами SMB Azure","Реализовать безопасные рабочие процессы передачи файлов"],"ar":["تحسين تحميل وتنزيل الملفات تلقائيًا إلى مشاركات ملفات أزور","إدارة هياكل الدليل في تخزين السحاب","تمكين-files المحلية مع مشاركات SMB من أزور","تنفيذ سلاسل عمل لنقل الملفات الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Storage connection string or account URL","Needs valid Azure Storage credentials","Python environment with azure-storage-file-share package installed"],"zh":["需要Azure存储连接字符串或帐户URL","需要有效的Azure存储凭据","安装了azure-storage-file-share包的Python环境"],"ja":["Azure Storage接続文字列またはアカウントURLが必要","有効なAzure Storage資格情報が必要","azure-storage-file-shareパッケージがインストールされたPython環境"],"ko":["Azure 스토리지 연결 문자열 또는 계정 URL 필요","유효한 Azure 스토리지 자격 증명 필요","azure-storage-file-share 패키지가 설치된 Python 환경"],"es":["Requiere cadena de conexión de almacenamiento de Azure o URL de cuenta","Necesita credenciales de almacenamiento de Azure válidas","Entorno de Python con paquete azure-storage-file-share instalado"],"fr":["Nécessite une chaîne de connexion de stockage Azure ou une URL de compte","Nécessite des informations d''identification de stockage Azure valides","Environnement Python avec package azure-storage-file-share installé"],"de":["Benötigt Azure-Speicher-Verbindungszeichenfolge oder Konto-URL","Benötigt gültige Azure-Speicher-Anmeldeinformationen","Python-Umgebung mit installiertem azure-storage-file-share-Paket"],"pt":["Exige uma cadeia de conexão de armazenamento do Azure ou URL da conta","Necessita de credenciais de armazenamento do Azure válidas","Ambiente Python com o pacote azure-storage-file-share instalado"],"ru":["Требует строки подключения к хранилищу Azure или URL-адреса учетной записи","Требует действительных учетных данных хранилища Azure","Среда Python с установленным пакетом azure-storage-file-share"],"ar":["يتطلب سلسلة اتصال تخزين أزور أو عنوان URL للحساب","يحتاج إلى أوراق اعتمادية تخزين أزور صالحة","بيئة بايثون مع حزمة azure-storage-file-share مثبتة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
