,"Prise en charge de l''audio en temps réel"],"de":["Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK für .NET","Erstellung bidirektionaler Sprachassistenten","Installation über NuGet","Anpassbare Umgebungsvariablen","Kompatibilität mit Azure AI","Unterstützung für Echtzeit-Audio"],"pt":["SDK de voz em tempo real para .NET","Criação de assistentes de voz bidirecionais","Integração com Azure AI","Suporte a áudio em tempo real","Versões estáveis e de visualização disponíveis"],"ru":["SDK реального времени для голоса для .NET","Создание двунаправленных голосовых помощников","Интеграция с Azure AI","Поддержка аудио в реальном времени","Доступны стабильные и предварительные версии"],"ar":["SDK صوت في الوقت الفعلي لـ .NET","إنشاء مساعدين صوتيين ثنائي الاتجاه","التكامل مع Azure AI","دعم الصوت في الوقت الفعلي","النسخ المستقرة والمعاينة متاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time Voice AI","Bidirectional Voice Assistants","Azure AI","Audio Capture/Playback","NAudio","Azure Identity"],"ja":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time Voice AI","Bidirectional Voice Assistants","Azure AI","Audio Capture/Playback","NAudio","Azure Identity"],"ko":["Azure AI VoiceLive",".NET SDK","Real-time Voice AI","Bidirectional Voice Assistants","Azure AI","Audio Capture/Playback","NAudio","Azure Identity"],"es":["Azure AI","SDK de voz en tiempo real",".NET","asistentes de voz bidireccionales","instalación NuGet","variables de entorno","audio en tiempo real","desarrollo de voz","Azure AI Voice Live"],"fr":["Azure AI","SDK de voix en temps réel",".NET","assistants vocaux bidirectionnels","installation NuGet","variables d''environnement","audio en temps réel","développement vocal","Azure AI Voice Live"],"de":["Azure AI","Echtzeit-Sprach-SDK",".NET","bidirektionale Sprachassistenten","Installation NuGet","Umgebungsvariablen","Echtzeit-Audio","Sprachentwicklung","Azure AI Voice Live"],"pt":["Azure AI VoiceLive","SDK de voz em tempo real","Assistentes de voz bidirecionais","Azure AI","Desenvolvimento de .NET","Voz em tempo real","Áudio em tempo real"],"ru":["Azure AI VoiceLive","SDK реального времени для голоса","Двунаправленные голосовые помощники","Azure AI","Разработка на .NET","Голос в реальном времени","Аудио в реальном времени"],"ar":["Azure AI VoiceLive","SDK صوت في الوقت الفعلي","مساعدين صوتيين ثنائي الاتجاه","Azure AI","تطوير .NET","صوت في الوقت الفعلي","صوت في الوقت الفعلي"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-ai-voicelive-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE","body":"# Azure.AI.VoiceLive (.NET)\n\nReal-time voice AI SDK for building bidirectional voice assistants with Azure AI.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\ndotnet add package NAudio                    # For audio capture/playback\n```\n\n**Current Versions**: Stable v1.0.0, Preview v1.1.0-beta.1\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT=https://<resource>.services.ai.azure.com/\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL=gpt-4o-realtime-preview\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_VOICE=en-US-AvaNeural\n# Optional: API key if not using Entra ID\nAZURE_VOICELIVE_API_KEY=<your-api-key>\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Microsoft Entra ID (Recommended)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nDefaultAzureCredential credential = new DefaultAzureCredential();\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n**Required Role**: `Cognitive Services User` (assign in Azure Portal → Access control)\n\n### API Key\n\n```csharp\nUri endpoint = new Uri(\"https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com\");\nAzureKeyCredential credential = new AzureKeyCredential(\"your-api-key\");\nVoiceLiveClient client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, credential);\n```\n\n## Client Hierarchy\n\n```\nVoiceLiveClient\n└── VoiceLiveSession (WebSocket connection)\n    ├── ConfigureSessionAsync()\n    ├── GetUpdatesAsync() → SessionUpdate events\n    ├── AddItemAsync() → UserMessageItem, FunctionCallOutputItem\n    ├── SendAudioAsync()\n    └── StartResponseAsync()\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Start Session and Configure\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.AI.VoiceLive;\n\nvar endpoint = new Uri(Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(\"AZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT\"));\nvar client = new VoiceLiveClient(endpoint, new DefaultAzureCredential());\n\nvar model = \"gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview\";\n\n// Start session\nusing VoiceLiveSession session = await client.StartSessionAsync(model);\n\n// Configure session\nVoiceLiveSessionOptions sessionOptions = new()\n{\n    Model = model,\n    Instructions = \"You are a helpful AI assistant. Respond naturally.\",\n    Voice = new AzureStandardVoice(\"en-US-AvaNeural\"),\n    TurnDetection = new AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection()\n    {\n        Threshold = 0.5f,\n        PrefixPadding = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(300),\n        SilenceDuration = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(500)\n    },\n    InputAudioFormat = InputAudioFormat.Pcm16,\n    OutputAudioFormat = OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16\n};\n\n// Set modalities (both text and audio for voice assistants)\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Clear();\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Text);\nsessionOptions.Modalities.Add(InteractionModality.Audio);\n\nawait session.ConfigureSessionAsync(sessionOptions);\n```\n\n### 2. Process Events\n\n```csharp\nawait foreach (SessionUpdate serverEvent in session.GetUpdatesAsync())\n{\n    switch (serverEvent)\n    {\n        case SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta audioDelta:\n            byte[] audioData = audioDelta.Delta.ToArray();\n            // Play audio via NAudio or other audio library\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta textDelta:\n            Console.Write(textDelta.Delta);\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall:\n            // Handle function call (see Function Calling section)\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateError error:\n            Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n            break;\n            \n        case SessionUpdateResponseDone:\n            Console.WriteLine(\"\\n--- Response complete ---\");\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Send User Message\n\n```csharp\nawait session.AddItemAsync(new UserMessageItem(\"Hello, can you help me?\"));\nawait session.StartResponseAsync();\n```\n\n### 4. Function Calling\n\n```csharp\n// Define function\nvar weatherFunction = new VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition(\"get_current_weather\")\n{\n    Description = \"Get the current weather for a given location\",\n    Parameters = BinaryData.FromString(\"\"\"\n        {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"location\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"The city and state or country\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\"location\"]\n        }\n        \"\"\")\n};\n\n// Add to session options\nsessionOptions.Tools.Add(weatherFunction);\n\n// Handle function call in event loop\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateResponseFunctionCallArgumentsDone functionCall)\n{\n    if (functionCall.Name == \"get_current_weather\")\n    {\n        var parameters = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, string>>(functionCall.Arguments);\n        string location = parameters?[\"location\"] ?? \"\";\n        \n        // Call external service\n        string weatherInfo = $\"The weather in {location} is sunny, 75°F.\";\n        \n        // Send response\n        await session.AddItemAsync(new FunctionCallOutputItem(functionCall.CallId, weatherInfo));\n        await session.StartResponseAsync();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Voice Options\n\n| Voice Type | Class | Example |\n|------------|-------|---------|\n| Azure Standard | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-AvaNeural\"` |\n| Azure HD | `AzureStandardVoice` | `\"en-US-Ava:DragonHDLatestNeural\"` |\n| Azure Custom | `AzureCustomVoice` | Custom voice with endpoint ID |\n\n## Supported Models\n\n| Model | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `gpt-4o-realtime-preview` | GPT-4o with real-time audio |\n| `gpt-4o-mini-realtime-preview` | Lightweight, fast interactions |\n| `phi4-mm-realtime` | Cost-effective multimodal |\n\n## Key Types Reference\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `VoiceLiveClient` | Main client for creating sessions |\n| `VoiceLiveSession` | Active WebSocket session |\n| `VoiceLiveSessionOptions` | Session configuration |\n| `AzureStandardVoice` | Standard Azure voice provider |\n| `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection` | Voice activity detection |\n| `VoiceLiveFunctionDefinition` | Function tool definition |\n| `UserMessageItem` | User text message |\n| `FunctionCallOutputItem` | Function call response |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseAudioDelta` | Audio chunk event |\n| `SessionUpdateResponseTextDelta` | Text chunk event |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always set both modalities** — Include `Text` and `Audio` for voice assistants\n2. **Use `AzureSemanticVadTurnDetection`** — Provides natural conversation flow\n3. **Configure appropriate silence duration** — 500ms typical to avoid premature cutoffs\n4. **Use `using` statement** — Ensures proper session disposal\n5. **Handle all event types** — Check for errors, audio, text, and function calls\n6. **Use DefaultAzureCredential** — Never hardcode API keys\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nif (serverEvent is SessionUpdateError error)\n{\n    if (error.Error.Message.Contains(\"Cancellation failed: no active response\"))\n    {\n        // Benign error, can ignore\n    }\n    else\n    {\n        Console.WriteLine($\"Error: {error.Error.Message}\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Audio Configuration\n\n- **Input Format**: `InputAudioFormat.Pcm16` (16-bit PCM)\n- **Output Format**: `OutputAudioFormat.Pcm16`\n- **Sample Rate**: 24kHz recommended\n- **Channels**: Mono\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.AI.VoiceLive` | Real-time voice (this SDK) | `dotnet add package Azure.AI.VoiceLive` |\n| `Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` | Speech-to-text, text-to-speech | `dotnet add package Microsoft.CognitiveServices.Speech` |\n| `NAudio` | Audio capture/playback | `dotnet add package NAudio` |\n\n## Reference Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| NuGet Package | https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| API Reference | https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.ai.voicelive |\n| GitHub Source | https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/tree/main/sdk/ai/Azure.AI.VoiceLive |\n| Quickstart | https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/speech-service/voice-live-quickstart |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:44:44.735Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Voice Interface Agents requiring real-time bidirectional communication with Azure AI services.","zh":"适用于需要与Azure AI服务进行实时双向通信的语音接口代理的必备条件。","ja":"Azure AIサービスとのリアルタイム双方向通信を必要とするVoice Interfaceエージェントに不可欠。","ko":"Azure AI 서비스와 실시간 양방향 통신이 필요한 음성 인터페이스 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de interfaz de voz que requieren comunicación bidireccional en tiempo real con los servicios de Azure AI.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''interface vocale nécessitant une communication bidirectionnelle en temps réel avec les services Azure AI.","de":"Wesentlich für Voice-Interface-Agents, die eine Echtzeit-Bidirektkommunikation mit Azure AI-Diensten erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Interface de Voz que exigem comunicação bidirecional em tempo real com serviços de IA do Azure.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов интерфейса голоса, требующих реального времени двусторонней связи с сервисами ИИ Azure.","ar":"ضروري لعميل واجهة الصوت الذي يتطلب الاتصال الاتجاهين في الوقت الفعلي مع خدمات Azure AI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to process and respond to audio streams in real-time using Azure''s GPT-4o-realtime-preview model, providing seamless voice interaction capabilities through NAudio integration for capture and playback.","zh":"使代理能够使用Azure的GPT-4o-realtime-preview模型实时处理和响应音频流，并通过NAudio集成提供无缝的语音交互功能。","ja":"AzureのGPT-4o-realtime-previewモデルを使用してエージェントが音声ストリームをリアルタイムで処理および応答できるようにし、NAudio統合を介してシームレスな音声インタラクション機能を提供します。","ko":"Azure의 GPT-4o-realtime-preview 모델을 사용하여 에이전트가 오디오 스트림을 실시간으로 처리하고 응답할 수 있도록 하며, NAudio 통합을 통해 無삭제의 음성 상호 작용 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes procesar y responder a flujos de audio en tiempo real utilizando el modelo GPT-4o-realtime-preview de Azure, proporcionando capacidades de interacción de voz sin problemas a través de la integración de NAudio para captura y reproducción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter et de répondre à des flux audio en temps réel en utilisant le modèle GPT-4o-realtime-preview d''Azure, fournissant des capacités d''interaction vocale sans interruption grâce à l''intégration de NAudio pour la capture et la lecture.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Audio-Streams in Echtzeit zu verarbeiten und zu beantworten, indem sie das GPT-4o-realtime-preview-Modell von Azure verwenden, und bietet so eine nahtlose Sprachinteraktionsfunktion durch die Integration von NAudio für Aufnahme und Wiedergabe.","pt":"Permite que os agentes processem e respondam a fluxos de áudio em tempo real usando o modelo GPT-4o-realtime-preview do Azure, fornecendo capacidades de interação de voz sem interrupção por meio da integração do NAudio para captura e reprodução.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обрабатывать и реагировать на аудиопотоки в реальном времени с использованием модели GPT-4o-realtime-preview от Azure, обеспечивая бесшовное взаимодействие голосом через интеграцию NAudio для захвата и воспроизведения.","ar":"يمكن للعميل处理 واستجابة لمسارات الصوت في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام نموذج GPT-4o-realtime-preview من Azure، وتوفير قدرات التفاعل الصوتي دون انقطاع من خلال دمج NAudio لالتقاط والتشغيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Building real-time voice assistants","Processing live audio conversations","Implementing bidirectional voice AI interfaces","Integrating Azure AI speech services into .NET applications"],"zh":["构建实时语音助手","处理实时音频对话","实现双向语音AI接口","将Azure AI语音服务集成到.NET应用程序中"],"ja":["リアルタイムボイスアシスタントの構築","ライブオーディオ会話の処理","双方向音声AIインターフェースの実装","Azure AI音声サービスを.NETアプリケーションに統合"],"ko":["실시간 음성 조수 구축","실시간 오디오 대화 처리","양방향 음성 AI 인터페이스 구현","Azure AI 음성 서비스를 .NET 애플리케이션에 통합"],"es":["Crear asistentes de voz en tiempo real","Procesar conversaciones de audio en vivo","Implementar interfaces de voz AI bidireccionales","Integrar servicios de voz de Azure en aplicaciones .NET"],"fr":["Créer des assistants vocaux en temps réel","Traiter des conversations audio en direct","Mettre en œuvre des interfaces de voix AI bidirectionnelles","Intégrer les services de voix Azure dans des applications .NET"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Sprachassistenten","Verarbeiten von Live-Audio-Konversationen","Implementieren von bidirektionalen Sprach-AI-Schnittstellen","Integrieren von Azure-Sprachdiensten in .NET-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Construir assistentes de voz em tempo real","Processar conversas de áudio ao vivo","Implementar interfaces de voz AI bidirecionais","Integrar serviços de fala de IA do Azure em aplicativos .NET"],"ru":["Построение реальных голосовых помощников","Обработка живых аудио-разговоров","Реализация двусторонних интерфейсов голосового ИИ","Интеграция сервисов речевого ИИ Azure в приложениях .NET"],"ar":["بناء مساعدين صوتيين في الوقت الفعلي","معالجة محادثات الصوت المباشر","تنفيذ واجهات صوتية ذات اتجاهين لآي أي","دمج خدمات كلام آي أي من Azure في تطبيقات .NET"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure VoiceLive endpoint configuration","Needs Azure.Identity for authentication","Dependent on NAudio for audio handling","Currently in preview (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"zh":["需要Azure VoiceLive端点配置","需要Azure.Identity进行身份验证","依赖于NAudio进行音频处理","目前处于预览阶段（v1.1.0-beta.1）"],"ja":["Azure VoiceLiveエンドポイントの構成が必要","Azure.Identityを使用した認証が必要","NAudioに依存して音声処理を行う","現在プレビュー段階（v1.1.0-beta.1）"],"ko":["Azure VoiceLive 엔드ポイント 구성이 필요합니다","Azure.Identity를 사용한 인증이 필요합니다","NAudio에 의존하여 오디오 처리를 수행합니다","현재 미리 보기 단계 (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"es":["Requiere configuración de punto de conexión de Azure VoiceLive","Necesita Azure.Identity para la autenticación","Dependiente de NAudio para el manejo de audio","Actualmente en versión de previsualización (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de point de terminaison Azure VoiceLive","A besoin d''Azure.Identity pour l''authentification","Dépend de NAudio pour la gestion de l''audio","Actuellement en version d''aperçu (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"de":["Erfordert Azure VoiceLive-Endpunkt-Konfiguration","Benötigt Azure.Identity für die Authentifizierung","Abhängig von NAudio für die Audiobearbeitung","Derzeit in der Vorschauversion (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"pt":["Exige configuração do endpoint Azure VoiceLive","Necessita Azure.Identity para autenticação","Dependente do NAudio para manipulação de áudio","Atualmente em pré-visualização (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"ru":["Требует настройки конечной точки Azure VoiceLive","Требуется Azure.Identity для аутентификации","Зависит от NAudio для обработки аудио","В настоящее время в предварительной версии (v1.1.0-beta.1)"],"ar":["يتطلب ضبط نهاية نقطة Azure VoiceLive","يحتاج إ