DK Azure Storage File Share pour Python permet aux développeurs de gérer les partages de fichiers SMB pour les scénarios cloud-natifs et lift-and-shift","de":"Das Azure Storage File Share SDK für Python ermöglicht es Entwicklern, SMB-Dateifreigaben für cloud-native- und lift-and-shift-Szenarien zu verwalten","pt":"O SDK do Azure Storage File Share para Python permite gerenciar compartilhamentos de arquivos SMB para cenários cloud-native e lift-and-shift","ru":"SDK Azure Storage File Share для Python позволяет управлять共享ами файлов SMB для сценариев cloud-native и lift-and-shift","ar":"SDK Azure Storage File Share ل Python يسمح بإدارة مشاركة الملفات SMB لسيناريوهات cloud-native و lift-and-shift","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"es":["Administración de acciones de archivo SMB","Compatibilidad con escenarios nativos de la nube y de elevación y cambio","Instalación sencilla con pip","Autenticación mediante cadena de conexión o URL de cuenta","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Gestion des partages de fichiers SMB","Prise en charge des scénarios cloud-natifs et lift-and-shift","Installation facile avec pip","Authentification via chaîne de connexion ou URL de compte","Prise en charge de Python"],"de":["Verwaltung von SMB-Dateifreigaben","Unterstützung für cloud-native- und lift-and-shift-Szenarien","Einfache Installation mit pip","Authentifizierung über Verbindungszeichenfolge oder Kontourl","Unterstützung für Python"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de compartilhamentos de arquivos SMB","Suporte a cenários cloud-native e lift-and-shift","Instalação via pip","Autenticação via connection string","Suporte a variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Управление共享ами файлов SMB","Поддержка сценариев cloud-native и lift-and-shift","Установка через pip","Аутентификация через connection string","Поддержка переменных среды"],"ar":["إدارة مشاركة الملفات SMB","دعم سيناريوهات cloud-native و lift-and-shift","التثبيت عبر pip","التحقق من الصحة عبر السلسلة الاتصال","دعم متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"es":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK de Python","almacenamiento de archivos","SMB","nubes nativas","elevación y cambio","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Python"],"fr":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Python","stockage de fichiers","SMB","cloud-natifs","lift-and-shift","développement d''applications","Python"],"de":["Azure Storage File Share","Python-SDK","Dateispeicher","SMB","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","Anwendungsentwicklung","Python"],"pt":["Azure Storage File Share","Python SDK","compartilhamento de arquivos","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","armazenamento de arquivos","nuvem","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Azure Storage File Share","Python SDK","共享 файлов","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","хранение файлов","облачные вычисления","разработка приложений"],"ar":["Azure Storage File Share","SDK Python","مشاركة الملفات","cloud-native","lift-and-shift","تخزين الملفات","السحابة","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-storage-file-share-py","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice","body":"# Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python\n\nManage SMB file shares for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install azure-storage-file-share\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=DefaultEndpointsProtocol=https;AccountName=...;AccountKey=...\n# Or\nAZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=https://<account>.file.core.windows.net\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Connection String\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient.from_connection_string(\n    os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING\"]\n)\n```\n\n### Entra ID\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nservice = ShareServiceClient(\n    account_url=os.environ[\"AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL\"],\n    credential=DefaultAzureCredential()\n)\n```\n\n## Share Operations\n\n### Create Share\n\n```python\nshare = service.create_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### List Shares\n\n```python\nfor share in service.list_shares():\n    print(f\"{share.name}: {share.quota} GB\")\n```\n\n### Get Share Client\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n### Delete Share\n\n```python\nservice.delete_share(\"my-share\")\n```\n\n## Directory Operations\n\n### Create Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory\")\n\n# Nested directory\nshare_client.create_directory(\"my-directory/sub-directory\")\n```\n\n### List Directories and Files\n\n```python\ndirectory_client = share_client.get_directory_client(\"my-directory\")\n\nfor item in directory_client.list_directories_and_files():\n    if item[\"is_directory\"]:\n        print(f\"[DIR] {item[''name'']}\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"[FILE] {item[''name'']} ({item[''size'']} bytes)\")\n```\n\n### Delete Directory\n\n```python\nshare_client.delete_directory(\"my-directory\")\n```\n\n## File Operations\n\n### Upload File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# From string\nfile_client.upload_file(\"Hello, World!\")\n\n# From file\nwith open(\"local-file.txt\", \"rb\") as f:\n    file_client.upload_file(f)\n\n# From bytes\nfile_client.upload_file(b\"Binary content\")\n```\n\n### Download File\n\n```python\nfile_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"my-directory/file.txt\")\n\n# To bytes\ndata = file_client.download_file().readall()\n\n# To file\nwith open(\"downloaded.txt\", \"wb\") as f:\n    data = file_client.download_file()\n    data.readinto(f)\n\n# Stream chunks\ndownload = file_client.download_file()\nfor chunk in download.chunks():\n    process(chunk)\n```\n\n### Get File Properties\n\n```python\nproperties = file_client.get_file_properties()\nprint(f\"Size: {properties.size}\")\nprint(f\"Content type: {properties.content_settings.content_type}\")\nprint(f\"Last modified: {properties.last_modified}\")\n```\n\n### Delete File\n\n```python\nfile_client.delete_file()\n```\n\n### Copy File\n\n```python\nsource_url = \"https://account.file.core.windows.net/share/source.txt\"\ndest_client = share_client.get_file_client(\"destination.txt\")\ndest_client.start_copy_from_url(source_url)\n```\n\n## Range Operations\n\n### Upload Range\n\n```python\n# Upload to specific range\nfile_client.upload_range(data=b\"content\", offset=0, length=7)\n```\n\n### Download Range\n\n```python\n# Download specific range\ndownload = file_client.download_file(offset=0, length=100)\ndata = download.readall()\n```\n\n## Snapshot Operations\n\n### Create Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot = share_client.create_snapshot()\nprint(f\"Snapshot: {snapshot[''snapshot'']}\")\n```\n\n### Access Snapshot\n\n```python\nsnapshot_client = service.get_share_client(\n    \"my-share\",\n    snapshot=snapshot[\"snapshot\"]\n)\n```\n\n## Async Client\n\n```python\nfrom azure.storage.fileshare.aio import ShareServiceClient\nfrom azure.identity.aio import DefaultAzureCredential\n\nasync def upload_file():\n    credential = DefaultAzureCredential()\n    service = ShareServiceClient(account_url, credential=credential)\n    \n    share = service.get_share_client(\"my-share\")\n    file_client = share.get_file_client(\"test.txt\")\n    \n    await file_client.upload_file(\"Hello!\")\n    \n    await service.close()\n    await credential.close()\n```\n\n## Client Types\n\n| Client | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `ShareServiceClient` | Account-level operations |\n| `ShareClient` | Share operations |\n| `ShareDirectoryClient` | Directory operations |\n| `ShareFileClient` | File operations |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use connection string** for simplest setup\n2. **Use Entra ID** for production with RBAC\n3. **Stream large files** using chunks() to avoid memory issues\n4. **Create snapshots** before major changes\n5. **Set quotas** to prevent unexpected storage costs\n6. **Use ranges** for partial file updates\n7. **Close async clients** explicitly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:44.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing seamless Azure Storage File Share integration in Python","zh":"非常适合需要在 Python 中实现无缝 Azure 存储文件共享集成的云原生代理","ja":"Python でシームレスな Azure Storage ファイル共有の統合が必要なクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"파이썬에서 무결점 Azure 스토리지 파일 공유 통합이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Cloud-Native que necesitan una integración perfecta de Azure Storage File Share en Python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente d''Azure Storage File Share en Python","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von Azure Storage File Share in Python benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que precisam de integração perfeita com o Azure Storage File Share em Python","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция с Azure Storage File Share на Python","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج مثالي مع مشاركة ملفات Azure Storage في بيثون"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage SMB file shares using the Azure Storage File Share SDK for Python, handling connection strings and authentication for cloud-native and lift-and-shift scenarios via the azure-storage-file-share library","zh":"赋予代理使用 Azure Storage 文件共享 SDK for Python 管理 SMB 文件共享的能力，处理连接字符串和身份验证，适用于云原生和提升转移场景，通过 azure-storage-file-share 库","ja":"Azure Storage ファイル共有 SDK for Python を使用して SMB ファイル共有を管理するためのエージェントをEmpowerする、接続文字列と認証を処理する、クラウドネイティブおよびリフトアンドシフトシナリオを介した azure-storage-file-share ライブラリ","ko":"에이전트가 Azure Storage 파일 공유 SDK for Python을 사용하여 SMB 파일 공유를 관리할 수 있도록 하는 것, 연결 문자열 및 인증을 처리하여 클라우드 네이티브 및 리프트 앤 시프트 시나리오를 위한 azure-storage-file-share 라이브러리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar acciones de archivo SMB utilizando el SDK de Azure Storage File Share para Python, manejando cadenas de conexión y autenticación para escenarios cloud-native y lift-and-shift a través de la biblioteca azure-storage-file-share","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les partages de fichiers SMB en utilisant le SDK Azure Storage File Share pour Python, en gérant les chaînes de connexion et l''authentification pour les scénarios cloud-native et lift-and-shift via la bibliothèque azure-storage-file-share","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SMB-Dateifreigaben mithilfe des Azure Storage File Share SDK für Python zu verwalten, wobei Verbindungscodes und Authentifizierung für cloud-native- und lift-and-shift-Szenarien über die Bibliothek azure-storage-file-share gehandhabt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar compartilhamentos de arquivos SMB usando o SDK do Azure Storage File Share para Python, manipulando cadeias de conexão e autenticação para cenários cloud-native e lift-and-shift via a biblioteca azure-storage-file-share","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять общими ресурсами файлов SMB с помощью SDK Azure Storage File Share для Python, обрабатывая строки подключения и аутентификацию для облачных и сценариев подъема и переноса через библиотеку azure-storage-file-share","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة مشتركات الملفات SMB باستخ