依存"],"ko":["Azure 스토리지 계정 자격 증명 필요","Python 3.x 호환성 필요","Azure 스토리지 파일 공유 SDK 종속"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de la cuenta de Azure Storage","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x","Dependencia del SDK de Azure Storage File Share"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification du compte de stockage Azure","Compatibilité Python 3.x requise","Dépendance du SDK Azure Storage File Share"],"de":["Erfordert Anmeldeinformationen für das Azure Storage-Konto","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Abhängigkeit vom Azure Storage File Share SDK"],"pt":["Requer credenciais de conta de armazenamento do Azure","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária","Dependência do SDK do Azure Storage File Share"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных учетной записи Azure Storage","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x","Зависимость от SDK Azure Storage File Share"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات اعتماد حساب مخزن Azure","متطلبات متوافقة مع بيثون 3.x","اعتماد على SDK مشاركة ملفات Azure Storage"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
