オーディットツールは、開発者がウェブサイトの SEO 問題を特定し、最適化の提案を提供するのに役立ちます","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 개발자가 웹사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 최적화 제안을 제공하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Análisis de SEO para identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda. Proporciona recomendaciones personalizadas para mejorar la visibilidad en línea","fr":"Audit SEO pour identifier les problèmes et améliorer les performances de recherche. Fournit des recommandations personnalisées pour améliorer la visibilité e...","de":"SEO-Audit zur Identifizierung von Problemen und Verbesserung der Suchleistung. Bietet maßgeschneiderte Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Online-Sichtbarkeit","pt":"A auditoria SEO identifica problemas de otimização e fornece recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica","ru":"Аудит SEO выявляет проблемы оптимизации и предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска","ar":"تدقيق تحسين محركات البحث يحدد مشاكل التحسين ويوفر توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي","en":"Personal Claude Code configuration: agents, commands, skills, and global settings."},"definition":{"en":"Personal Claude Code configuration: agents, commands, skills, and global settings."},"features":{"zh":["识别网站的 SEO 问题","提供优化建议","提高搜索引擎排名","分析网站结构","优化网站内容"],"ja":["ウェブサイトの SEO 問題を特定する","最適化の提案を提供する","検索エンジンランキングを向上させる","ウェブサイト構造を分析する","ウェブサイトコンテンツを最適化する"],"ko":["웹사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별한다","최적화 제안을 제공한다","검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킨다","웹사이트 구조를 분석한다","웹사이트 콘텐츠를 최적화한다"],"es":["Análisis de sitio web","Identificación de problemas de SEO","Recomendaciones personalizadas","Mejora del rendimiento de búsqueda","Análisis de contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Analyse de site web","Identification des problèmes de SEO","Recommandations personnalisées","Amélioration des performances de recherche","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Website-Analyse","Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Maßgeschneiderte Empfehlungen","Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts"],"pt":["Análise de contexto do site","Verificação de problemas de SEO","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de marketing de produto","Identificação de oportunidades de otimização","Relatório detalhado de resultados"],"ru":["Анализ контекста сайта","Проверка проблем SEO","Рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска","Анализ маркетинга продукта","Выявление возможностей оптимизации","Подробный отчет о результатах"],"ar":["تحليل سياق الموقع","فحص مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل تسويق المنتج","تحديد فرص التحسين","تقرير مفصل عن النتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站优化","开发者工具","SEO 问题","优化建议"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト最適化","開発者ツール","SEO 問題","最適化の提案"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 최적화","개발자 도구","SEO 문제","최적화 제안"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de búsqueda","mejora de rendimiento","recomendaciones de SEO","marketing de productos","visibilidad en línea"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de recherche","amélioration des performances","recommandations SEO","marketing de produits","visibilité en ligne"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Leistungsverbesserung","SEO-Empfehlungen","Produktmarketing","Online-Sichtbarkeit"],"pt":["auditoria SEO","otimização de site","desempenho de busca","recomendações de SEO","análise de marketing de produto","oportunidades de otimização","relatório de auditoria SEO","melhorar desempenho de busca","problemas de SEO"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация сайта","результаты поиска","рекомендации SEO","анализ маркетинга продукта","возможности оптимизации","отчет об аудите SEO","улучшить результаты поиска","проблемы SEO"],"ar":["تدقيق تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين موقع","أداء البحث","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل تسويق المنتج","فرص التحسين","تقرير تدقيق تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين أداء البحث","مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"Im5tu","repo":"claude","repoPath":"Im5tu/claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:24.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and audit capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和审计能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 감사 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de análisis y auditoría de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''audit de SEO avancés.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Auditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise e auditoria de SEO.","ru":"Идеально для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и аудита SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهاء التسويق الرقمي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل ومراجعة تحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context and product marketing context, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed assessments.","zh":"赋予代理商识别SEO问题的能力，并利用网站上下文和产品营销上下文提供可执行的建议，利用文件如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`进行明智的评估。","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を特定し、サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティングのコンテキストを利用して実行可能な推奨事項を提供することを可能にします。`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルを使用して情報に基づいた評価を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 정보에基づいた 평가를 진행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones con acciones concretas utilizando el contexto del sitio y el contexto de marketing de productos, aprovechando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para evaluaciones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations avec des actions concrètes en utilisant le contexte du site et le contexte de marketing de produits, en exploitant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour des évaluations éclairées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen unter Nutzung des Seitenkontexts und des Produktmarketing-Kontexts zu geben, indem Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für fundierte Bewertungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes identifiquem problemas de SEO e forneçam recomendações eficazes usando o contexto do site e o contexto de marketing de produtos, aproveitando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para avaliações informadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации, используя контекст сайта и контекст продуктивного маркетинга, опираясь на файлы типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для обоснованных оценок.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج، مستفيدة من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لتقييمات مستنيرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating recommendations for organic search improvement","Analyzing site context for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["网站SEO性能审计","生成有机搜索改进建议","分析网站上下文以查找优化机会"],"ja":["サイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","有機検索の改善に関する推奨事項を生成する","サイトのコンテキストを分析して最適化の機会を探す"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능 감사","유기적 검색 개선에 대한 추천 사항 생성","사이트 컨텍스트 분석을 통해 최적화 기회를찾기"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones para la mejora de la búsqueda orgánica","Análisis del contexto del sitio para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Audit des performances de SEO du site web","Génération de recommandations pour l''amélioration de la recherche organique","Analyse du contexte du site pour des opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Auditorium der SEO-Leistung der Website","Erzeugung von Empfehlungen für die Verbesserung der organischen Suche","Analyse des Seitenkontexts für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações para melhoria de busca orgânica","Análise do contexto do site para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация рекомендаций для улучшения органического поиска","Анализ контекста сайта для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["مراجعة أداء تحسين محركات البحث للموقع","توليد توصيات لتحسين البحث العضوي","تحليل سياق الموقع لفرص تحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Dependent on existence of `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for product marketing context"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文信息","依赖`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件以获取产品营销上下文"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルの存在に依存して製品マーケティングのコンテキストを取得する"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함",".claude/product-marketing-context.md 파일의 존재에 의존하여 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 얻음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información del contexto del sitio","Dependiente de la existencia de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''information du contexte du site","Dépendante de l''existence de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Informationen des Seitenkontexts","Abhängig von der Existenz von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Requer acesso às informações de contexto do site","Depende da existência de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта","Зависит от существования `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста продуктивного маркетинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","يعتمد على وجود `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لسياق تسويق المنتج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('seflless/dot-agents/seo-audit', 'community', 'seflless', 'dot-agents', 'seflless/dot-agents', 'seo-audit', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:45:27.594Z', NULL, '{"id":"seflless/dot-agents/seo-audit","name":"seo-audit","description":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具帮助您提高网站的搜索引擎排名，通过识别和解决 SEO 问题","ja":"SEO オーディット ツールは、ウェブサイトの検索エンジンランキングを高めるために、SEO の問題を特定して解決します","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 웹사이트의 검색 엔진 랭킹을 높이기 위해 SEO 문제를 식별하고 해결합니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica. Proporciona recomendaciones para desarrolladores.","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche organique. Il fournit des recommandations pour les développeurs.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und der Verbesserung der Leistung der organischen Suche. Es bietet Empfehlungen für Entwickler.","pt":"A análise SEO ajuda a identificar problemas e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Obtenha recomendações para otimizar seu site","ru":"Аудит SEO помогает выявить проблемы и улучшить показатели органического поиска. Получите рекомендации для оптимизации вашего сайта","ar":"تحليل SEO يساعد على تحديد المشاكل و تحسين أداء البحث العضوي. احصل على توصيات لتحسين موقعك","en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具","ja":"SEO オーディット ツール","ko":"SEO 감사 도구","es":"Análisis de SEO para desarrolladores","fr":"Audit SEO pour les développeurs","de":"SEO-Audit für Entwickler","pt":"Análise SEO: Otimização para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Аудит SEO: Оптимизация для Разработчиков","ar":"تحليل SEO: تحسين للمنشئين","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具帮助您提高网站的搜索引擎排名，通过识别和解决 SEO 问题","ja":"SEO オーディット ツールは、ウェブサイトの検索エンジンランキングを高めるために、SEO の問題を特定して解決します","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 웹사이트의 검색 엔진 랭킹을 높이기 위해 SEO 문제를 식별하고 해결합니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica. Proporciona recomendaciones para desarrolladores.","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche organique. Il fournit des recommandations pour les développeurs.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und der Verbesserung der Leistung der organischen Suche. Es bietet Empfehlungen für Entwickler.","pt":"A análise SEO ajuda a identificar problemas e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Obtenha recomendações para otimizar seu site","ru":"Аудит SEO помогает выявить проблемы и улучшить показатели органического поиска. Получите рекомендации для оптимизации вашего сайта","ar":"تحليل SEO يساعد على تحديد المشاكل و تحسين أداء البحث العضوي. احصل على توصيات لتحسين موقعك","en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"definition":{"en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"features":{"zh":["网站分析","SEO 问题识别","性能优化","关键词研究","技术支持"],"ja":["ウェブサイト分析","SEO 問題の特定","パフォーマンス最適化","キーワード研究","テクニカルサポート"],"ko":["웹사이트 분석","SEO 문제 식별","성능 최적화","키워드 연구","기술 지원"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de contexto de sitio","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda","Análisis de marketing de producto","Optimización de contenido","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse du contexte de site","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche","Analyse de marketing de produit","Optimisation de contenu","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse des Seitenkontexts","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Analyse des Produktmarketings","Optimierung von Inhalten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de SEO","Análise de contexto de marketing de produto","Otimização de desempenho de busca orgânica","Recomendações para melhorar o ranking","Análise de site e conteúdo"],"ru":["Определение проблем SEO","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","Оптимизация показателей органического поиска","Рекомендации для улучшения рейтинга","Анализ сайта и контента"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل SEO","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج","تحسين أداء البحث العضوي","توصيات لتحسين التصنيف","تحليل الموقع و المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站分析","性能优化","关键词研究","技术支持"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト分析","パフォーマンス最適化","キーワード研究","テクニカルサポート"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 분석","성능 최적화","키워드 연구","기술 지원"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de motores de búsqueda","desarrollo web","marketing digital","mejora de la búsqueda","rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica","recomendaciones de SEO","auditoría de SEO","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation des moteurs de recherche","développement web","marketing digital","amélioration de la recherche","performances de recherche organique","recommandations SEO","auditorat SEO","SEO pour les développeurs"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Webentwicklung","digitales Marketing","Verbesserung der Suche","Leistung der organischen Suche","SEO-Empfehlungen","SEO-Prüfung","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["análise SEO","otimização de busca","desempenho de busca orgânica","recomendações de SEO","melhoria de ranking","análise de site","SEO para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация поиска","показатели органического поиска","рекомендации по SEO","улучшение рейтинга","анализ сайта","SEO для разработчиков"],"ar":["تحليل SEO","تحسين البحث","أداء البحث العضوي","توصيات SEO","تحسين التصنيف","تحليل الموقع","SEO للمنشئين"]}},"owner":"seflless","repo":"dot-agents","repoPath":"seflless/dot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:27.594Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing in-depth SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要进行深入SEO分析和优化的数字营销代理","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが詳細なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"디지털 마케팅 에이전트가 심층적인 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan un análisis y capacidades de optimización de SEO en profundidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et de capacités d''optimisation de SEO en profondeur.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die eine umfassende SEO-Analyse und Optimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO aprofundadas.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, которым необходим глубокий анализ и возможности оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الرقمي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل وخصائص تحسين محركات البحث المتعمقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using product marketing context, improving organic search performance through site context analysis and understanding of specific site types, such as e-commerce or blog sites.","zh":"赋予代理识别SEO问题并提供可行建议的能力，利用产品营销背景提高有机搜索性能，通过网站背景分析和特定网站类型的理解，如电子商务或博客网站","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を特定し、製品マーケティングコンテキストを使用して行動可能な推奨事項を提供する機能を提供し、サイトコンテキスト分析と特定のサイトタイプ（電子商取引またはブログサイトなど）の理解を通じて有機検索パフォーマンスを向上させる","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하여 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 사이트 컨텍스트 분석 및 특정 사이트 유형(전자 상거래 또는 블로그 사이트 등)의 이해를 통해 유기적 검색 성능을 향상","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones concretas utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, mejorando el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica a través del análisis del contexto del sitio y la comprensión de tipos de sitios específicos, como sitios de comercio electrónico o blogs.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations concrètes en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, améliorant les performances de recherche organique à travers l''analyse du contexte du site et la compréhension de types de sites spécifiques, tels que les sites de commerce électronique ou les blogs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen unter Verwendung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts zu liefern, wodurch die Leistung der organischen Suche durch die Analyse des Kontexts der Website und das Verständnis spezifischer Website-Typen, wie z.B. E-Commerce- oder Blog-Seiten, verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações práticas usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, melhorando o desempenho de busca orgânica por meio da análise do contexto do site e compreensão de tipos de sites específicos, como sites de comércio eletrônico ou blogs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации, используя контекст маркетинга продукции, улучшая органический поисковый результат за счет анализа контекста сайта и понимания конкретных типов сайтов, таких как сайты электронной коммерции или блоги.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل محركات البحث و تقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، و تحسين أداء البحث العضوي من خلال تحليل سياق الموقع و فهم أنواع مواقع محددة، مثل مواقع التجارة الإلكترونية أو المدونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structures for SEO optimization","Analyzing product marketing context for tailored recommendations","Identifying site-specific SEO issues, such as those related to site type or content"],"zh":["审计网站结构以优化SEO","分析产品营销背景以提供个性化建议","识别特定于网站类型或内容的SEO问题"],"ja":["SEO最適化のためにサイト構造を監査する","製品マーケティングコンテキストを分析してカスタマイズされた推奨事項を提供する","サイトタイプまたはコンテンツに特有のSEOの問題を特定する"],"ko":["SEO 최적화를 위해 웹사이트 구조를 감사","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 분석하여 맞춤형 추천을 제공","사이트 유형 또는 컨텐츠에 특정한 SEO 문제를 식별"],"es":["Auditoría de estructuras de sitios web para la optimización de SEO","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para recomendaciones personalizadas","Identificación de problemas de SEO específicos del sitio, como aquellos relacionados con el tipo de sitio o contenido"],"fr":["Auditing des structures de sites web pour l''optimisation de SEO","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits pour des recommandations personnalisées","Identification de problèmes de SEO spécifiques au site, tels que ceux liés au type de site ou au contenu"],"de":["Prüfung von Website-Strukturen für die SEO-Optimierung","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für maßgeschneiderte Empfehlungen","Identifizierung von seiten-spezifischen SEO-Problemen, wie z.B. solchen, die mit dem Seitentyp oder Inhalt zusammenhängen"],"pt":["Auditoria de estruturas de sites para otimização de SEO","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para recomendações personalizadas","Identificação de problemas de SEO específicos do site, como aqueles relacionados ao tipo de site ou conteúdo"],"ru":["Аудит структуры сайта для оптимизации SEO","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукции для индивидуальных рекомендаций","Выявление проблем SEO, специфичных для сайта, таких как проблемы, связанные с типом сайта или контентом"],"ar":["تدقيق هيكل الموقع للتحسين لتحسين محركات البحث","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لتوصيات مخصصة","تحديد مشاكل محركات البحث المحددة للموقع، مثل تلك المرتبطة بنوع الموقع أو المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .claude/product-marketing-context.md for context","Limited to sites with available context information","May require additional information for comprehensive analysis"],"zh":["需要访问.claude/product-marketing-context.md以获取背景信息","仅限具有可用背景信息的网站","可能需要额外信息以进行全面分析"],"ja":[".claude/product-marketing-context.mdへのアクセスが必要なコンテキスト情報を取得する","利用可能なコンテキスト情報を持つサイトに限定される","包括的な分析を行うには追加の情報が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":[".claude/product-marketing-context.md에 접근하여 컨텍스트 정보를 얻을 필요","사용 가능한 컨텍스트 정보를 가진 사이트로 제한","전체적인 분석을 위해 추가 정보가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a .claude/product-marketing-context.md para contexto","Limitado a sitios con información de contexto disponible","Puede requerir información adicional para un análisis exhaustivo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à .claude/product-marketing-context.md pour le contexte","Limité aux sites avec des informations de contexte disponibles","Peut nécessiter des informations supplémentaires pour une analyse exhaustive"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf .claude/product-marketing-context.md für Kontext","Begrenzt auf Sites mit verfügbarer Kontextinformation","Kann zusätzliche Informationen für eine umfassende Analyse erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso a .claude/product-marketing-context.md para contexto","Limitado a sites com informações de contexto disponíveis","Pode requerer informações adicionais para análise abrangente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к .claude/product-marketing-context.md для контекста","Ограничен для сайтов с доступной информацией о контексте","Может потребовать дополнительную информацию для всестороннего анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى .claude/product-marketing-context.md للسياق","محدود للمواقع التي تحتوي على معلومات سياق متاحة","يمكن أن يتطلب معلومات إضافية لتحليل شامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
