 للمطورين","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具帮助您识别和解决网站的 SEO 问题，提高搜索引擎排名","ja":"SEO オーディットツールは、ウェブサイトの SEO の問題を特定して解決し、検索エンジンランキングを上げるのに役立ちます","ko":"SEO 감사 도구는 웹사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 해결하여 검색 엔진 순위를 높이는데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El análisis de SEO te ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar tu rendimiento de búsqueda. Optimiza tu sitio para mejorar la visibilidad y el tráfico.","fr":"L''audit SEO vous aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer vos performances de recherche. Optimisez votre site pour améliorer la visibilité et le trafic.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft Ihnen, Probleme zu identifizieren und Ihre Suchmaschinenleistung zu verbessern. Optimieren Sie Ihre Website, um die Sichtbarkeit und den ...","pt":"A análise de SEO é um processo que ajuda a identificar problemas de otimização e fornecer recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс, который помогает выявить проблемы оптимизации и предоставить рекомендации для улучшения органического поиска.","ar":"تقييم تحسين محركات البحث هو عملية تساعد على تحديد مشاكل التحسين وتقديم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي.","en":"Agents gathered from forked repos (mainly \"agents\" repo)"},"definition":{"en":"Agents gathered from forked repos (mainly \"agents\" repo)"},"features":{"zh":["网站结构分析","关键词研究","内容优化建议","技术SEO问题检测","性能优化建议","可扩展的审计报告"],"ja":["ウェブサイト構造分析","キーワード研究","コンテンツ最適化提案","テクニカルSEOの問題検出","パフォーマンス最適化提案","拡張可能な監査レポート"],"ko":["웹사이트 구조 분석","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화 제안","기술 SEO 문제 감지","성능 최적화 제안","확장 가능한 감사 보고서"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de la estructura del sitio","Optimización de metadatos","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Análisis de enlaces y redes sociales"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse de la structure du site","Optimisation des métadonnées","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Analyse des liens et des réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse der Website-Struktur","Optimierung von Metadaten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Analyse von Links und sozialen Netzwerken"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de otimização","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de contexto de site","Verificação de marketing de produto","Avaliação de desempenho de busca orgânica","Fornecimento de ações para melhoria"],"ru":["Выявление проблем оптимизации","Рекомендации для улучшения поиска","Анализ контекста сайта","Проверка маркетинга продукта","Оценка органического поиска","Предоставление действий для улучшения"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل التحسين","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث","تحليل سياق الموقع","تحقق من تسويق المنتج","تقييم أداء البحث العضوي","تقديم إجراءات لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站优化","关键词研究","技术 SEO","性能优化"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト最適化","キーワード研究","テクニカル SEO","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 최적화","키워드 연구","기술 SEO","성능 최적화"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de motores de búsqueda","mejora de la visibilidad","tráfico orgánico","posicionamiento en buscadores","SEO técnico"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation des moteurs de recherche","amélioration de la visibilité","trafic organique","positionnement dans les moteurs de recherche","SEO technique"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit","organischer Traffik","Positionierung in Suchmaschinen","technisches SEO"],"pt":["análise de SEO","otimização de site","desempenho de busca orgânica","recomendações de SEO","problemas de otimização","melhoria de desempenho de busca","contexto de site","marketing de produto"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация сайта","органический поиск","рекомендации SEO","проблемы оптимизации","улучшение поиска","контекст сайта","маркетинг продукта"],"ar":["تقييم تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين موقع","البحث العضوي","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","مشاكل التحسين","تحسين أداء البحث","سياق الموقع","تسويق المنتج"]}},"owner":"pelan05","repo":"vscode_agents_folder","repoPath":"pelan05/vscode_agents_folder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:36.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de análisis y optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise e otimização de SEO.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل وتحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context analysis, product marketing context, and organic search performance metrics, leveraging file formats like .md for context understanding.","zh":"使代理能够使用网站上下文分析、产品营销上下文和有机搜索性能指标来识别SEO问题并提供可行的建议，利用.md等文件格式以了解上下文。","ja":"サイトのコンテキスト分析、製品マーケティングコンテキスト、有機検索パフォーマンスメトリクスを使用して、SEOの問題を特定し、実行可能な推奨事項を提供することができるようにエージェントに権限を与え、.mdなどのファイル形式を使用してコンテキストを理解します。","ko":"에이전트가 사이트 컨텍스트 분석, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 및 유기적 검색 성능 메트릭을 사용하여 SEO 문제를 식별하고 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 하며, .md와 같은 파일 형식을 사용하여 컨텍스트를 이해합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables utilizando el análisis de contexto del sitio, el contexto de marketing de productos y las métricas de rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica, aprovechando formatos de archivo como .md para la comprensión del contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant l''analyse de contexte du site, le contexte de marketing de produits et les métriques de performance de recherche organique, en exploitant des formats de fichiers tels que .md pour la compréhension du contexte.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen bereitzustellen, indem sie die Kontextanalyse der Website, den Produktmarketing-Kontext und die Metriken der organischen Suchleistung nutzen und Dateiformate wie .md für das Kontextverständnis ausnutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando análise de contexto do site, contexto de marketing de produtos e métricas de desempenho de busca orgânica, aproveitando formatos de arquivo como .md para compreensão do contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с помощью анализа контекста сайта, контекста продуктивного маркетинга и метрик органического поискового трафика, используя форматы файлов seperti .md для понимания контекста.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل SEO وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تحليل سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج وأداء البحث العضوي باستخدام صيغ الملفات مثل .md لفهم السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating actionable recommendations for improvement","Analyzing site context for optimization opportunities"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成改进的可行建议","分析网站上下文以优化机会"],"ja":["ウェブサイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","改善のための実行可能な推奨事項を生成する","最適化の機会のためにサイトのコンテキストを分析する"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능을 감사합니다","개선 사항에 대한 실행 가능한 추천을 생성합니다","최적화 기회를 위해 사이트 컨텍스트를 분석합니다"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento de SEO de un sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones accionables para la mejora","Análisis del contexto del sitio para oportunidades de optimización"],"fr":["Audit des performances de SEO d''un site web","Génération de recommandations actionnables pour l''amélioration","Analyse du contexte du site pour les opportunités d''optimisation"],"de":["Prüfung der SEO-Leistung einer Website","Erstellung von handhabbaren Empfehlungen für die Verbesserung","Analyse des Kontexts der Website für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações eficazes para melhoria","Análise do contexto do site para oportunidades de otimização"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация действенных рекомендаций для улучшения","Анализ контекста сайта для возможностей оптимизации"],"ar":["تدقيق أداء SEO للموقع","Generating توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين","تحليل سياق الموقع لفرص تحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context information","Dependent on existence of .claude/product-marketing-context.md for product marketing context"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文信息","依赖于.claude/产品营销上下文.md的存在以获取产品营销上下文"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキスト情報にアクセスする必要がある",".claude/製品マーケティングコンテキスト.mdの存在に依存して製品マーケティングコンテキストを取得する"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 정보에 액세스해야 합니다",".claude/제품 마케팅 컨텍스트.md의 존재에 의존하여 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 얻습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información de contexto del sitio","Dependiente de la existencia de .claude/product-marketing-context.md para el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''information de contexte du site","Dépend de l''existence de .claude/product-marketing-context.md pour le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kontextinformationen der Website","Hängt von der Existenz von .claude/product-marketing-context.md für den Produktmarketing-Kontext ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso às informações de contexto do site","Depende da existência de .claude/product-marketing-context.md para contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информациям контекста сайта","Зависит от существования .claude/product-marketing-context.md для контекста продуктивного маркетинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع","يعتمد على وجود .claude/product-marketing-context.md لسياق تسويق المنتج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
