,"fr":"L''audit SEO vous aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft Ihnen, Probleme zu identifizieren und die Suchleistung zu verbessern","pt":"A análise de SEO é um processo de identificação de problemas de otimização de busca e fornecimento de recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca.","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс выявления проблем оптимизации поиска и предоставления рекомендаций для улучшения поисковой производительности.","ar":"تحليل محركات البحث هو عملية لتحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي.","en":".files, including ~/.osx — sensible hacker defaults for OS X "},"definition":{"en":".files, including ~/.osx — sensible hacker defaults for OS X "},"features":{"zh":["网站结构分析","内容优化建议","关键词研究","页面速度优化","移动设备兼容性检查"],"ja":["ウェブサイト構造分析","コンテンツ最適化提案","キーワード研究","ページ速度最適化","モバイルデバイス互換性チェック"],"ko":["웹사이트 구조 분석","콘텐츠 최적화 제안","키워드 연구","페이지 속도 최적화","모바일 기기 호환성 확인"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de contexto de sitio","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda","Análisis de marketing de productos","Optimización de contenido","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse du contexte du site","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche","Analyse de marketing de produits","Optimisation du contenu","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse des Kontexts der Website","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Analyse des Produktmarketings","Optimierung des Inhalts","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de SEO","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca","Análise de site context","Verificação de marketing de produto","Otimização de conteúdo","Melhoria do tráfego orgânico"],"ru":["Выявление проблем SEO","Рекомендации для улучшения поисковой производительности","Анализ контекста сайта","Проверка маркетинга продукта","Оптимизация контента","Улучшение органического трафика"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","توصيات لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي","تحليل سياق الموقع","التحقق من تسويق المنتج","تحسين المحتوى","تحسين حركة المرور العضوية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审核","搜索引擎优化","网站优化","关键词研究","页面速度优化","移动设备兼容性"],"ja":["SEOオーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイト最適化","キーワード研究","ページ速度最適化","モバイルデバイス互換性"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 최적화","키워드 연구","페이지 속도 최적화","모바일 기기 호환성"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de motores de búsqueda","mejora del rendimiento de búsqueda","contexto de sitio","marketing de productos","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web","SEO para desarrolladores"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation des moteurs de recherche","amélioration des performances de recherche","contexte du site","marketing de produits","expérience utilisateur","développement web","SEO pour développeurs"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Kontext der Website","Produktmarketing","Benutzererfahrung","Webentwicklung","SEO für Entwickler"],"pt":["análise de SEO","otimização de busca","desempenho de busca","tráfego orgânico","recomendações de SEO","melhoria de desempenho","marketing de produto","conteúdo otimizado"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация поиска","поисковая производительность","органический трафик","рекомендации SEO","улучшение производительности","маркетинг продукта","оптимизированный контент"],"ar":["تحليل محركات البحث","تحسين محركات البحث","أداء البحث العضوي","حركة المرور العضوية","توصيات محركات البحث","تحسين الأداء","تسويق المنتج","محتوى محسّن"]}},"owner":"Kikobeats","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"Kikobeats/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.399Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:26.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis y optimización SEO.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Marketing Digital nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse et d''optimisation SEO.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم وقدرات تحسين SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using product marketing context, site context, and technical SEO audits, including analysis of .md files and OS X defaults.","zh":"使代理能够使用产品营销背景、网站背景和技术SEO审计（包括.md文件和OS X默认值的分析）来识别SEO问题并提供可执行的建议。","ja":"エージェントが製品マーケティングコンテキスト、サイトコンテキスト、テクニカルSEO監査（.mdファイルとOS Xデフォルト値の分析を含む）を使用してSEOの問題を特定し、実行可能な推奨事項を提供できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트, 사이트 컨텍스트 및 기술 SEO 감사를 사용하여 SEO 문제를 식별하고 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다(이其中에는 .md 파일 및 OS X 기본값의 분석이 포함됨).","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones accionables utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, el contexto del sitio y auditorías técnicas de SEO, incluyendo análisis de archivos .md y configuraciones predeterminadas de OS X.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables en utilisant le contexte de marketing produit, le contexte du site et des audits techniques SEO, incluant l''analyse de fichiers .md et des paramètres par défaut d''OS X.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und umsetzbare Empfehlungen zu geben, unter Verwendung von Produktmarketing-Kontext, Website-Kontext und technischen SEO-Audits, einschließlich der Analyse von .md-Dateien und OS X-Standardeinstellungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, contexto do site e auditorias técnicas de SEO, incluindo análise de arquivos .md e padrões do OS X.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с использованием контекста маркетинга продукта, контекста сайта и технических аудитов SEO, включая анализ файлов .md и настройки OS X по умолчанию.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وسياق الموقع وتحليلات تقنية لتحسين محركات البحث، بما في ذلك تحليل ملفات .md وإعدادات OS X الافتراضية."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website SEO performance","Generating recommendations for organic search improvement","Analyzing product marketing context for SEO optimization"],"zh":["审计网站SEO性能","生成有机搜索改进的建议","分析产品营销背景以优化SEO"],"ja":["ウェブサイトのSEOパフォーマンスを監査する","有機検索の改善に関する推奨事項を生成する","SEO最適化のための製品マーケティングコンテキストを分析する"],"ko":["웹사이트 SEO 성능 감사","유기적 검색 개선에 대한 제안 생성","SEO 최적화를 위한 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 분석"],"es":["Auditoría del rendimiento SEO del sitio web","Generación de recomendaciones para la mejora de búsqueda orgánica","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para la optimización SEO"],"fr":["Audit des performances SEO du site web","Génération de recommandations pour l''amélioration du référencement naturel","Analyse du contexte de marketing produit pour l''optimisation SEO"],"de":["Überprüfung der SEO-Leistung von Websites","Erstellung von Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suche","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für die SEO-Optimierung"],"pt":["Auditoria do desempenho de SEO do site","Geração de recomendações para melhoria de busca orgânica","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para otimização de SEO"],"ru":["Аудит производительности SEO сайта","Генерация рекомендаций для улучшения органической поисковой системы","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимизации SEO"],"ar":["مراجعة أداء تحسين محركات البحث للموقع","توليد توصيات لتحسين البحث العضوي","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to .claude/product-marketing-context.md file","Limited to OS X environment"],"zh":["需要访问.claude/产品营销背景.md文件","仅限OS X环境"],"ja":[".claude/製品マーケティングコンテキスト.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","OS X環境のみ"],"ko":[".claude/제품 마케팅 컨텍스트.md 파일에 접근해야 함","OS X 환경에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Limitado al entorno OS X"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Limité à l''environnement OS X"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die .claude/product-marketing-context.md-Datei","Beschränkt auf die OS X-Umgebung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Limitado ao ambiente OS X"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Ограничен средой OS X"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف .claude/product-marketing-context.md","محدود بالبيئة OS X"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/popup-cro', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:45:56.984Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"弹出式转化率优化（Popup CRO）专注于创建不打扰用户的弹出式窗口，以提高转化率和提升品牌知名度","ja":"ポップアップのコンバージョン率最適化（Popup CRO）では、ユーザーを困惑させずにコンバージョン率を向上させるポップアップを作成します","ko":"팝업 전환률 최적화 전문가(Popup CRO)는 사용자를 방해하지 않고 전환률을 높이는 팝업 창을 만드는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para crear ventanas emergentes que convierten sin dañar la percepción de la marca. Aprende a optimizar popups para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour créer des fenêtres émergentes qui convertissent sans nuire à la perception de la marque. Apprenez à optimiser les popups pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Der Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu erstellen, die umwandeln, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Popups optimieren, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"O popup CRO é uma técnica de otimização que visa criar popups que convertem sem prejudicar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Попап-CRO - это метод оптимизации, направленный на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без ущерба для пользовательского опыта.","ar":"النافذة المنبثقة CRO هي تقنية لتحسين الأداء تهدف إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون الإضرار بتجربة المستخدم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"弹出式转化率优化（Popup CRO）专家","ja":"ポップアップのコンバージョン率最適化（Popup CRO）","ko":"팝업 전환률 최적화 전문가(Popup CRO)","es":"Optimización de Popups para CRO","fr":"Optimisation des Popups pour CRO","de":"Popup-Optimierung für CRO","pt":"Otimização de Popups para CRO","ru":"Попап-оптимизация для CRO","ar":"تحسين 팝업 لتحويل","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"弹出式转化率优化（Popup CRO）专注于创建不打扰用户的弹出式窗口，以提高转化率和提升品牌知名度","ja":"ポップアップのコンバージョン率最適化（Popup CRO）では、ユーザーを困惑させずにコンバージョン率を向上させるポップアップを作成します","ko":"팝업 전환률 최적화 전문가(Popup CRO)는 사용자를 방해하지 않고 전환률을 높이는 팝업 창을 만드는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para crear ventanas emergentes que convierten sin dañar la percepción de la marca. Aprende a optimizar popups para mejorar la exp...","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour créer des fenêtres émergentes qui convertissent sans nuire à la perception de la marque. Apprenez à optimiser les popups ...","de":"Der Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu erstellen, die umwandeln, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Popups optimieren, um d...","pt":"O popup CRO é uma técnica de otimização que visa criar popups que convertem sem prejudicar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Попап-CRO - это метод оптимизации, направленный на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без ущерба для пользовательского опыта.","ar":"النافذة المنبثقة CRO هي تقنية لتحسين الأداء تهدف إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون الإضرار بتجربة المستخدم.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["弹出式窗口设计","转化率优化","用户体验提升","品牌知名度提高","个性化推荐"],"ja":["ポップアップのデザイン","コンバージョン率の最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上","ブランド認知度の向上","パーソナライズされたレコメンド"],"ko":["팝업 창 디자인","전환률 최적화","사용자 경험 향상","브랜드 인지도 향상","개인화된 추천"],"es":["Optimización de popups para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Técnicas para aumentar las conversiones sin molestar a los usuarios","Creación de popups personalizados para cada tipo de usuario","Análisis de rendimiento de los popups para optimizar su eficacia","Integración con herramientas de marketing para mejorar la eficacia de los popups"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Techniques pour augmenter les conversions sans agacer les utilisateurs","Création de popups personnalisés pour chaque type d''utilisateur","Analyse de performance des popups pour optimiser leur efficacité","Intégration avec des outils de marketing pour améliorer l''efficacité des popups"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","Techniken, um Umwandlungen zu steigern, ohne Benutzer zu stören","Erstellung von Popups, die auf jeden Benutzertyp zugeschnitten sind","Analyse der Leistung von Popups, um ihre Effektivität zu optimieren","Integration mit Marketing-Tools, um die Effektivität von Popups zu verbessern"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para melhorar a taxa de conversão","Criação de popups personalizados para diferentes segmentos de usuários","Análise de desempenho de popups para identificar áreas de melhoria","Integração com ferramentas de marketing para automatizar campanhas","Desenvolvimento de estratégias de popups para diferentes dispositivos e plataformas"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для улучшения коэффициента конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов для разных сегментов пользователей","Анализ производительности попапов для выявления областей для улучшения","Интеграция с инструментами маркетинга для автоматизации кампаний","Разработка стратегий попапов для разных устройств и платформ"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لنوافذ منبثقة لتحسين معدل التحويل","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة لمختلف فئات المستخدمين","تحليل أداء نوافذ منبثقة لتحديد المجالات التي يمكن تحسينها","تكامل مع أدوات التسويق لتحسين الحملات","تنمية استراتيجيات لنوافذ منبثقة لمختلف الأجهزة والمنصات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹出式转化率优化","Popup CRO","转化率优化","用户体验","品牌知名度","个性化推荐"],"ja":["ポップアップのコンバージョン率最適化","Popup CRO","コンバージョン率の最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ブランド認知度","パーソナライズされたレコメンド"],"ko":["팝업 전환률 최적화","Popup CRO","전환률 최적화","사용자 경험","브랜드 인지도","개인화된 추천"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","marketing de popups","conversiones de popups","experiencia del usuario","popups personalizados","análisis de popups"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","marketing des popups","conversions des popups","expérience utilisateur","popups personnalisés","analyse des popups"],"de":["Popup CRO","Popup-Optimierung","Marketing mit Popups","Umwandlungen von Popups","Benutzererfahrung","personalisierte Popups","Analyse von Popups"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popups","taxa de conversão","experiência do usuário","marketing digital","ferramentas de marketing"],"ru":["попап-CRO","оптимизация попапов","коэффициент конверсии","пользовательский опыт","цифровой маркетинг","инструменты маркетинга"],"ar":["نافذة منبثقة CRO","تحسين الأداء لنوافذ منبثقة","معدل التحويل","تجربة المستخدم","تسويق رقمي","أدوات التسويق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:56.984Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced popup and modal optimization for enhanced user conversion.","zh":"适合需要高级弹出窗口和模态优化以提高用户转化率的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なポップアップとモーダル最適化を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 팝업 및 모달 최적화를 통해 사용자 전환률을 향상시키는 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan una optimización avanzada de ventanas emergentes y modales para una conversión de usuario mejorada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée des fenêtres contextuelles et des modales pour améliorer la conversion des utilisateurs.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von Popups und Modals für eine verbesserte Benutzerkonversion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de otimização avançada de popups e modais para conversão de usuário aprimorada.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация всплывающих окон и модальных окон для улучшения конверсии пользователей.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تسويق العميل التي تحتاج إلى تحسين متقدم لتنبؤات وتنسيق أفضل لتحويل المستخدمين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create targeted popups for email or newsletter capture, leveraging product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` to avoid damaging brand perception, utilizing modal optimization techniques to improve conversion rates without annoying users.","zh":"赋予代理创建针对电子邮件或新闻稿捕获的有针对性的弹出窗口的能力，利用来自文件（如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）的产品营销背景，以避免损害品牌知名度，利用模态优化技术提高转化率而不打扰用户。","ja":"エージェントが、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルから得られる製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用して、電子メールまたはニュースレターのキャプチャに特化したターゲットポップアップを作成できるようにし、ブランド認知度を損なわないようにすることで、モーダル最適化技術を使用して、ユーザーを邪魔せずに転換率を向上させる。","ko":"에이전트가 이메일 또는 뉴스레터 캡처를 위한 타겟팅된 팝업을 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일에서 얻은 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 브랜드 인지도를 손상하지 않도록 하며, 모달 최적화 기술을 사용하여 사용자를 방해하지 않고 전환률을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear ventanas emergentes dirigidas para la captura de correos electrónicos o boletines, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para evitar dañar la percepción de la marca, utilizando técnicas de optimización de modales para mejorar las tasas de conversión sin molestar a los usuarios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles ciblées pour la capture d''adresses e-mail ou de newsletters, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour éviter de nuire à la perception de la marque, en utilisant des techniques d''optimisation de modales pour améliorer les taux de conversion sans ennuyer les utilisateurs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gezielte Popups für die Erfassung von E-Mails oder Newslettern zu erstellen, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen, um die Markenwahrnehmung nicht zu beeinträchtigen, und Techniken zur Optimierung von Modals verwenden, um die Konversionsraten zu verbessern, ohne Benutzer zu belästigen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem popups direcionados para captura de e-mail ou boletim informativo, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produto de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para evitar danificar a percepção da marca, utilizando técnicas de otimização de modais para melhorar as taxas de conversão sem irritar os usuários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целевые всплывающие окна для сбора электронной почты или новостей, используя контекст продукта маркетинга из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, чтобы избежать повреждения восприятия бренда, используя методы оптимизации модальных окон для улучшения показателей конверсии без раздражения пользователей.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء نافذة منبثقة موجهة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني أو نشرة الإخبار، مستفيداً من سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لتجنب الإضرار باستهلاك العلامة التجارية، مستخدما تقنيات تحسين النموذج لتحسين معدلات التحويل دون إزعاج المستخدمين."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversion","Creating targeted modals based on product marketing context","Analyzing user interaction with popups to improve design"],"zh":["为最大转化率优化弹出窗口放置","根据产品营销背景创建有针对性的模态","分析用户与弹出窗口的交互以改进设计"],"ja":["最大転換率のためにポップアップの配置を最適化する","製品マーケティングコンテキストに基づいてターゲットモーダルを作成する","ポップアップとのユーザーインタラクションを分析してデザインを改善する"],"ko":["최대 전환율을 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 기반한 타겟팅된 모달 생성","사용자와 팝업의 상호작용을 분석하여 디자인을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar la colocación de ventanas emergentes para una conversión máxima","Crear modales dirigidos en función del contexto de marketing de productos","Analizar la interacción del usuario con las ventanas emergentes para mejorar el diseño"],"fr":["Optimiser le positionnement des fenêtres contextuelles pour une conversion maximale","Créer des modales ciblées en fonction du contexte de marketing de produits","Analyser l''interaction de l''utilisateur avec les fenêtres contextuelles pour améliorer la conception"],"de":["Optimieren der Platzierung von Popups für eine maximale Konversion","Erstellen gezielter Modals basierend auf dem Produktmarketing-Kontext","Analysieren der Benutzerinteraktion mit Popups, um das Design zu verbessern"],"pt":["Otimizar a colocação de popups para conversão máxima","Criar modais direcionados com base no contexto de marketing do produto","Analizar a interação do usuário com popups para melhorar o design"],"ru":["Оптимизировать размещение всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Создавать целевые модальные окна на основе контекста продукта маркетинга","Анализировать взаимодействие пользователя со всплывающими окнами для улучшения дизайна"],"ar":["تحسين وضع التنبؤات لتحويل أقصى","إنشاء نماذج موجهة استناداً إلى سياق تسويق المنتج","تحليل تفاعل المستخدم مع التنبؤات لتحسين التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of product marketing context","May need to balance conversion goals with user experience considerations"],"zh":["需要了解产品营销背景","可能需要平衡转化目标与用户体验考虑"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストを理解する必要がある","転換目標とユーザーエクスペリエンスの考慮事項のバランスを取る必要があるかもしれない"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 이해해야 함","전환 목표와 사용자 경험 고려 사항의 균형을 맞추어야 할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del contexto de marketing de productos","Puede ser necesario equilibrar los objetivos de conversión con las consideraciones de experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du contexte de marketing de produits","Peut nécessiter un équilibre entre les objectifs de conversion et les considérations d''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Es kann erforderlich sein, die Konversionsziele mit den Benutzererfahrungsbetrachtungen in Einklang zu bringen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do contexto de marketing do produto","Pode ser necessário equilibrar metas de conversão com considerações de experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Требует понимания контекста продукта маркетинга","Может потребоваться балансировать цели конверсии с учетом опыта пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سياق تسويق المنتج","قد يلزم موازنة أهداف التحويل مع مراعاة تجربة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('seflless/dot-agents/popup-cro', 'community', 'seflless', 'dot-agents', 'seflless/dot-agents', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:46:13.686Z', NULL, '{"id":"seflless/dot-agents/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"Popup CRO是关于创建高转换率的弹窗，而不损害用户体验","ja":"ポップアップCROは、高いコンバージョン率を実現しながらユーザーエクスペリエンスを損なわないポップアップを作成することです","ko":"팝업 CRO는 높은 전환률을 달성하면서 사용자 경험을 손상하지 않는 팝업을 만드는 것입니다","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para crear ventanas emergentes que convierten sin dañar la percepción de la marca.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour créer des fenêtres émergentes qui convertissent sans nuire à la perception de la marque.","de":"Das Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu erstellen, die konvertieren, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen.","pt":"O popup CRO é uma técnica de otimização que visa criar popups que convertem sem prejudicar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это техника оптимизации, направленная на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без ущерба для восприятия бренда.","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هي تقنية تحسين ترمي إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون إتلاف تصور العلامة التجارية","en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Popup CRO 优化专家","ja":"ポップアップCRO最適化","ko":"팝업 CRO 최적화 전문가","es":"Optimización de Popups CRO","fr":"Optimisation des Popups CRO","de":"Optimierung von Popups CRO","pt":"Otimização de Popups CRO","ru":"Попап CRO Оптимизация","ar":"تحسين 팝업 CRO","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"Popup CRO是关于创建高转换率的弹窗，而不损害用户体验","ja":"ポップアップCROは、高いコンバージョン率を実現しながらユーザーエクスペリエンスを損なわないポップアップを作成することです","ko":"팝업 CRO는 높은 전환률을 달성하면서 사용자 경험을 손상하지 않는 팝업을 만드는 것입니다","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para crear ventanas emergentes que convierten sin dañar la percepción de la marca.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour créer des fenêtres émergentes qui convertissent sans nuire à la perception de la marque.","de":"Das Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu erstellen, die konvertieren, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen.","pt":"O popup CRO é uma técnica de otimização que visa criar popups que convertem sem prejudicar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это техника оптимизации, направленная на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без ущерба для восприятия бренда.","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هي تقنية تحسين ترمي إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون إتلاف تصور العلامة التجارية","en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"definition":{"en":"Back up of my .agents folder (MIT)"},"features":{"zh":["弹窗目的分析","产品营销背景理解","高转换率弹窗设计","用户体验优化","品牌声誉保护"],"ja":["ポップアップ目的分析","製品マーケティング背景理解","高コンバージョン率ポップアップ設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化","ブランド評判保護"],"ko":["팝업 목적 분석","제품 마케팅 배경 이해","높은 전환률 팝업 디자인","사용자 경험 최적화","브랜드 평판 보호"],"es":["Optimización de popups para mejorar la conversión","Creación de popups personalizados","Análisis de comportamiento del usuario","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Integración con herramientas de marketing","Seguimiento y medición de resultados"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups pour améliorer la conversion","Création de popups personnalisés","Analyse du comportement de l''utilisateur","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec des outils de marketing","Suivi et mesure des résultats"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups, um die Konvertierung zu verbessern","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Popups","Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit Marketing-Tools","Verfolgung und Messung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Análise de contexto de marketing de produto","Criação de popups personalizados","Otimização para dispositivos móveis","Integração com estratégias de marketing"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств","Интеграция со стратегиями маркетинга"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة منبثقة للتحويل","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة","تحسين للجهاز المحمول","التكامل مع استراتيجيات التسويق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["弹窗优化","CRO","转换率优化","用户体验","品牌声誉","产品营销","弹窗设计"],"ja":["ポップアップ最適化","CRO","コンバージョン率最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ブランド評判","製品マーケティング","ポップアップ設計"],"ko":["팝업 최적화","CRO","전환률 최적화","사용자 경험","브랜드 평판","제품 마케팅","팝업 디자인"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","conversión","experiencia del usuario","marketing digital","análisis de comportamiento","personalización","integración con herramientas de marketing"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","conversion","expérience utilisateur","marketing digital","analyse du comportement","personnalisation","intégration avec des outils de marketing"],"de":["popup CRO","Optimierung von Popups","Konvertierung","Benutzererfahrung","digitales Marketing","Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens","Personalisierung","Integration mit Marketing-Tools"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popups","conversão de popups","marketing de produto","análise de contexto","criação de popups personalizados"],"ru":["попап CRO","оптимизация попапов","конверсия попапов","маркетинг продукта","анализ контекста","создание индивидуальных попапов"],"ar":["نافذة منبثقة CRO","تحسين نافذة منبثقة","تحويل نافذة منبثقة","تسويق المنتج","تحليل السياق","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة"]}},"owner":"seflless","repo":"dot-agents","repoPath":"seflless/dot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:46:13.686Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced popup and modal optimization capabilities to boost conversion rates without damaging brand perception.","zh":"非常适合需要高级弹出窗口和模态优化功能的营销代理，以提高转化率而不损害品牌形象。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがコンバージョン率を上げるために、高度なポップアップとモーダル最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"마케팅 에이전트가 전환률을 높이기 위해 고급 팝업 및 모달 최적화 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales para aumentar las tasas de conversión sin dañar la percepción de la marca.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et modales pour améliorer les taux de conversion sans nuire à la perception de la marque.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Popup- und Modal-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen, um die Konvertierungsrate zu steigern, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu beeinträchtigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de popups e modais para aumentar as taxas de conversão sem danificar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон для повышения коэффициентов конверсии без вреда для восприятия бренда.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والتعديلات لتعزيز معدلات التحويل دون الإضرار باستهلاك العلامة التجارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-converting popups with optimal user experience, leveraging product marketing context and understanding of popup purpose, such as email/newsletter capture, to drive engagement and sales, utilizing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","zh":"赋予代理创建高转化率弹出窗口的能力，利用产品营销背景和对弹出窗口目的的理解，例如电子邮件/新闻简报捕获，来驱动参与度和销售，利用文件如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 中的背景。","ja":"エージェントが、高コンバージョンのポップアップを作成できるようにし、製品マーケティングコンテキストとポップアップの目的（例：メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャ）を理解し、參照ファイル `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` に基づいてエンゲージメントと売上を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 전환률의 팝업을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트와 팝업 목적(예: 이메일/뉴스레터 캡처)을 이해하여 참여도와 판매를 驅動하며, 파일 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 컨텍스트를 利用합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ventanas emergentes con alta conversión y una experiencia de usuario óptima, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos y la comprensión del propósito de la ventana emergente, como la captura de correos electrónicos o boletines, para impulsar el compromiso y las ventas, utilizando el contexto de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fenêtres contextuelles à forte conversion avec une expérience utilisateur optimale, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits et la compréhension de l''objectif de la fenêtre contextuelle, comme la capture d''adresses e-mail ou de newsletters, pour stimuler l''engagement et les ventes, en utilisant le contexte de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Popups mit hoher Konvertierungsrate und optimaler Benutzererfahrung zu erstellen, indem sie den Kontext des Produktmarketings und das Verständnis des Zwecks des Popups, wie z. B. die Erfassung von E-Mails oder Newslettern, nutzen, um Engagement und Verkäufe zu fördern, unter Verwendung des Kontexts von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar popups de alta conversão com experiência do usuário ótima, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos e compreensão do propósito do popup, como captura de e-mail / boletim informativo, para impulsionar o envolvimento e as vendas, utilizando contexto de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокоэффективные всплывающие окна с оптимальным пользовательским опытом, используя контекст маркетинга продукта и понимание цели всплывающего окна, chẳng hạn как захват электронной почты / новостной рассылки, для стимулирования вовлеченности и продаж, используя контекст из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة ذات تحويل عالي مع تجربة مستخدم ممتازة، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج وفهم غرض النافذة المنبثقة، مثل التقاط البريد الإلكتروني / نشرة الإخبار، لتعزيز المشاركة والمبيعات، باستخدام السياق من ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing popup placement for maximum conversion","Generating targeted modal content for specific user segments","Analyzing popup performance to inform marketing strategy"],"zh":["优化弹出窗口位置以实现最大转化率","为特定用户段生成有针对性的模态内容","分析弹出窗口性能以指导营销策略"],"ja":["コンバージョン率の最大化を目的としたポップアップの配置の最適化","特定のユーザーセグメント向けのターゲット化されたモーダルコンテンツの生成","ポップアップのパフォーマンス分析によるマーケティング戦略の策定"],"ko":["최대 전환률을 위한 팝업 배치 최적화","특정 사용자 세그먼트를 위한 타겟팅된 모달 컨텐츠 생성","팝업 성능 분석을 통한 마케팅 전략 수립"],"es":["Optimización de la colocación de ventanas emergentes para una máxima conversión","Generación de contenido de modal dirigido a segmentos de usuarios específicos","Análisis del rendimiento de las ventanas emergentes para informar la estrategia de marketing"],"fr":["Optimisation de la position des fenêtres contextuelles pour une conversion maximale","Génération de contenu de modal ciblé pour des segments d''utilisateurs spécifiques","Analyse des performances des fenêtres contextuelles pour éclairer la stratégie marketing"],"de":["Optimierung der Platzierung von Popups für eine maximale Konvertierungsrate","Erzeugung von zielgerichtetem Modal-Inhalt für bestimmte Benutzerssegmente","Analyse der Leistung von Popups, um die Marketingstrategie zu informieren"],"pt":["Otimização do posicionamento de popups para conversão máxima","Geração de conteúdo de modal direcionado para segmentos de usuário específicos","Análise do desempenho de popups para informar a estratégia de marketing"],"ru":["Оптимизация размещения всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Генерация целевого контента модального окна для конкретных сегментов пользователей","Анализ производительности всплывающих окон для информирования маркетинговой стратегии"],"ar":["تحسين وضع النوافذ المنبثقة لتحقيق أقصى تحويل","توليد محتوى تعديلي مستهدف لفئات مستخدمين محددة","تحليل أداء النوافذ المنبثقة لإبلاغ استراتيجية التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files, such as `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limited to popup and modal optimization use cases"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件，例如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","仅限弹出窗口和模态优化用例"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイル（例：`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）へのアクセスが必要","ポップアップとモーダル最適化の用途に限定される"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","팝업 및 모달 최적화 용례에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos, como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado a casos de uso de optimización de ventanas emergentes y modales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits, tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limité aux cas d''utilisation d''optimisation des fenêtres contextuelles et modales"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontextdateien, wie z. B. `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Begrenzt auf Anwendungsfälle für die Optimierung von Popups und Modals"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos, como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Limitado a casos de uso de otimização de popups e modais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта, таким как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Ограничен случаи использования оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج، مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","محدود لاستخدامات تحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والتعديلات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Im5tu/claude/popup-cro', 'community', 'Im5tu', 'claude', 'Im5tu/claude', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:45:46.478Z', NULL, '{"id":"Im5tu/claude/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para optimizar los popups y mejorar la conversión. Aprende a crear popups efectivos.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour optimiser les popups et améliorer la conversion. Apprenez à créer des popups efficaces.","de":"Der Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu optimieren und die Konversion zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Popups erstellen.","pt":"O popup-cro é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem afetar negativamente a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это навык, целью которого является создание попапов, которые конвертируют без негативного влияния на восприятие бренда.","ar":"التحكم في نافذة المنبثقة هو مهارة تهدف إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون المساس بالسمعة التجارية","en":"Personal Claude Code configuration: agents, commands, skills, and global settings."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","es":"Optimización de Popups CRO","fr":"Optimisation des Popups CRO","de":"Optimierung von Popups CRO","pt":"Otimização de Popups para Conversão","ru":"Попап CRO: Оптимизация для Конверсии","ar":"تحسين ظهور النافذة المنبثقة لتحويل المبيعات","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"popup-cro ","ja":"popup-cro","ko":"popup-cro ","es":"El popup CRO es una técnica para optimizar los popups y mejorar la conversión. Aprende a crear popups efectivos.","fr":"Le popup CRO est une technique pour optimiser les popups et améliorer la conversion. Apprenez à créer des popups efficaces.","de":"Der Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups zu optimieren und die Konversion zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Popups erstellen.","pt":"O popup-cro é uma habilidade que visa criar popups que convertem sem afetar negativamente a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это навык, целью которого является создание попапов, которые конвертируют без негативного влияния на восприятие бренда.","ar":"التحكم في نافذة المنبثقة هو مهارة تهدف إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون المساس بالسمعة التجارية","en":"Personal Claude Code configuration: agents, commands, skills, and global settings."},"definition":{"en":"Personal Claude Code configuration: agents, commands, skills, and global settings."},"features":{"zh":["popup","CRO","",""],"ja":["popup","CRO","",""],"ko":["popup","CRO","",""],"es":["Optimización de popups para mejorar la conversión","Creación de popups personalizados","Análisis de la efectividad de los popups","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Aumento de las conversiones"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups pour améliorer la conversion","Création de popups personnalisés","Analyse de l''efficacité des popups","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Augmentation des conversions"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups zur Verbesserung der Konversion","Erstellung von personalisierten Popups","Analyse der Effektivität von Popups","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Steigerung der Konversionen"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Análise de contexto de marketing de produto","Definição de propósito de popup","Otimização de layout e design","Testes A/B para melhorar a conversão"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","Определение цели попапа","Оптимизация макета и дизайна","Тесты A/B для улучшения конверсии"],"ar":["تحسين نافذة المنبثقة لتحويل","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج","تحديد غرض النافذة المنبثقة","تحسين تخطيط وتصميم","اختبارات أ/ب لتحسين التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["popup-cro","CRO","","seo","popup",""],"ja":["popup-cro","CRO","","seo","popup",""],"ko":["popup-cro","CRO","","seo","popup",""],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","marketing de popups","conversión de popups","experiencia del usuario","popups personalizados"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","marketing des popups","conversion des popups","expérience utilisateur","popups personnalisés"],"de":["Popup CRO","Optimierung von Popups","Marketing von Popups","Konversion von Popups","Benutzererfahrung","personalisierte Popups"],"pt":["popup cro","otimização de popups","conversão de popups","marketing de produto","análise de contexto","testes a/b"],"ru":["попап cro","оптимизация попапов","конверсия попапов","маркетинг продукта","анализ контекста","тесты a/b"],"ar":["نافذة المنبثقة","تحسين نافذة المنبثقة","تحويل نافذة المنبثقة","تسويق المنتج","تحليل السياق","اختبارات أ/ب"]}},"owner":"Im5tu","repo":"claude","repoPath":"Im5tu/claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:45:46.478Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents seeking to refine popup and modal strategies for enhanced user engagement.","zh":"适用于转化率优化代理，旨在完善弹出窗口和模态策略以提高用户参与度。","ja":"コンバージョンレート最適化エージェントがポップアップとモーダル戦略を洗練するのに最適です。","ko":"전환률 최적화 에이전트가 팝업 및 모달 전략을 tinh chỉnh하여 사용자 참여도를 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Optimización de Tasa de Conversión que buscan perfeccionar estrategias de popup y modal para un mejor compromiso del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion qui cherchent à affiner les stratégies de popup et de modal pour un engagement utilisateur amélioré.","de":"Ideal für Agenten zur Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate, die Popup- und Modalstrategien verfeinern möchten, um die Benutzerbeteiligung zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão que buscam aprimorar estratégias de popup e modal para um engajamento do usuário aprimorado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, стремящихся усовершенствовать стратегии попапов и модальных окон для улучшения вовлеченности пользователей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين معدل التحويل الذين يسعون لتحسين استراتيجيات النافذة المنبثقة ونمطية الحوار لتحسين المشاركة المستخدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft targeted popups that convert without annoying users, leveraging product marketing context and optimizing for email/newsletter capture, all while preserving brand integrity through careful modal optimization and understanding of popup purpose.","zh":"赋予代理创造有针对性的弹出窗口的能力，使其能够在不打扰用户的情况下转化，利用产品营销背景，并针对电子邮件/新闻邮件捕获进行优化，同时通过仔细的模态优化和对弹出窗口目的的理解来保持品牌完整性。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーを迷惑させずにコンバージョンできるターゲットを絞ったポップアップを作成できるようにし、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを利用し、電子メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャに最適化し、慎重なモーダル最適化とポップアップの目的の理解を通じてブランドの完全性を保ちます。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자를 방해하지 않고 전환할 수 있는 타겟팅된 팝업을 만들 수 있도록 하며, 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 이메일/뉴스레터 캡처를 최적화하고, 신중한 모달 최적화와 팝업 목적의 이해를 통해 브랜드 완전성을 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear popups dirigidos que convierten sin molestar a los usuarios, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos y optimizando la captura de correos electrónicos y boletines, todo mientras se preserva la integridad de la marca a través de una cuidadosa optimización de modales y comprensión del propósito del popup.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des popups ciblés qui convertissent sans ennuyer les utilisateurs, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits et en optimisant la capture d''adresses e-mail et de newsletters, le tout en préservant l''intégrité de la marque grâce à une optimisation soignée des modales et à une compréhension du but du popup.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gezielte Popups zu erstellen, die konvertieren, ohne Benutzer zu belästigen, indem sie den Kontext des Produktmarketings nutzen und die Erfassung von E-Mails und Newslettern optimieren, alles bei gleichzeitiger Wahrung der Markenintegrität durch sorgfältige Modaloptimierung und Verständnis des Popup-Zwecks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar popups direcionados que convertem sem irritar os usuários, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos e otimizando para captura de e-mail/boletim, tudo isso preservando a integridade da marca por meio da otimização cuidadosa do modal e compreensão do propósito do popup.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целевые попапы, которые конвертируют без раздражения пользователей, используя контекст маркетинга продукта и оптимизируя для захвата электронной почты/новостей, при этом сохраняя целостность бренда за счет тщательной оптимизации модального окна и понимания цели попапа.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من إنشاء نافذة منبثقة مستهدفة تتحول دون إزعاج المستخدمين، مستفيدة من سياق تسويق المنتجات وتحسين захط إلكتروني/النشرة الإخبارية، مع الحفاظ على سلامة العلامة التجارية من خلال تحسين نمطية الحوار بعناية وفهم الغرض من النافذة المنبثقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing popup effectiveness for newsletter signup rates","Optimizing modal display timing to minimize user disruption","Crafting personalized popup content based on user behavior"],"zh":["分析弹出窗口对新闻邮件注册率的有效性","优化模态显示时机以最小化用户干扰","根据用户行为创建个性化弹出窗口内容"],"ja":["ニュースレター登録率に対するポップアップの有効性を分析する","ユーザーの混乱を最小限に抑えるためにモーダル表示のタイミングを最適化する","ユーザーの行動に基づいてパーソナライズされたポップアップコンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["뉴스레터 가입률에 대한 팝업의 효과를 분석하는 것","사용자 혼란을 최소화하기 위해 모달 표시 시점을 최적화하는 것","사용자 행동을 기반으로 개인화된 팝업 콘텐츠를制作하는 것"],"es":["Analizar la eficacia de los popups para las tasas de registro de boletines","Optimizar el momento de visualización de los modales para minimizar la interrupción del usuario","Crear contenido personalizado de popups en función del comportamiento del usuario"],"fr":["Analyser l''efficacité des popups pour les taux d''inscription à la newsletter","Optimiser le moment d''affichage des modales pour minimiser la perturbation de l''utilisateur","Créer du contenu de popups personnalisé en fonction du comportement de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Die Wirksamkeit von Popups für Newsletter-Anmelderaten analysieren","Die Anzeigedauer von Modals optimieren, um die Unterbrechung des Benutzers zu minimieren","Benutzerdefinierten Popup-Inhalt basierend auf Benutzerverhalten erstellen"],"pt":["Analisar a eficácia do popup para taxas de inscrição na newsletter","Otimizar o tempo de exibição do modal para minimizar a interrupção do usuário","Criar conteúdo personalizado de popup com base no comportamento do usuário"],"ru":["Анализ эффективности попапа для показателей регистрации на новости","Оптимизация времени отображения модального окна для минимизации прерывания пользователя","Создание персонализированного контента попапа на основе поведения пользователя"],"ar":["تحليل فعالية النافذة المنبثقة لمعدلات التسجيل في النشرة الإخبارية","تحسين وقت عرض نمطية الحوار لتقليل مقاطعة المستخدم","إنشاء محتوى مخصص لنافذة منبثقة على أساس سلوك المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existence of .claude/product-marketing-context.md for contextual understanding","Specific to popup and modal optimization, not applicable to other CRO strategies"],"zh":["需要存在.claude/product-marketing-context.md以获得上下文理解","仅适用于弹出窗口和模态优化，不适用于其他CRO策略"],"ja":[".claude/product-marketing-context.mdの存在がコンテキストの理解に必要","ポップアップとモーダル最適化に特化しており、他のCRO戦略には適用できない"],"ko":[".claude/product-marketing-context.md의 존재가 컨텍스트 이해에 필요함","팝업 및 모달 최적화에 특화되어 있으며, 다른 CRO 전략에는 적용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la existencia de .claude/product-marketing-context.md para una comprensión contextual","Específico para la optimización de popups y modales, no aplicable a otras estrategias de CRO"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence de .claude/product-marketing-context.md pour une compréhension contextuelle","Spécifique à l''optimisation des popups et des modales, non applicable à d''autres stratégies de CRO"],"de":["Erfordert die Existenz von .claude/product-marketing-context.md für ein kontextuelles Verständnis","Spezifisch für die Optimierung von Popups und Modals, nicht anwendbar auf andere CRO-Strategien"],"pt":["Requer a existência de .claude/product-marketing-context.md para compreensão contextual","Específico para otimização de popup e modal, não aplicável a outras estratégias de CRO"],"ru":["Требует существования .claude/product-marketing-context.md для контекстного понимания","Конкретно для оптимизации попапов и модальных окон, не применимо к другим стратегиям CRO"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود .claude/product-marketing-context.md لفهم سياقي","محدد لتحسين النافذة المنبثقة ونمطية الحوار، لا ينطبق على استراتيجيات CRO الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ashleytower/claude-code-workflow/popup-cro', 'community', 'ashleytower', 'claude-code-workflow', 'ashleytower/claude-code-workflow', 'popup-cro', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:46:18.282Z', NULL, '{"id":"ashleytower/claude-code-workflow/popup-cro","name":"popup-cro","description":{"zh":"Popup CRO 是一种综合的工作流自动化系统，用于优化弹窗和模态窗口，提高转化率和用户体验","ja":"Popup CRO は転換率とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるためのポップアップとモーダルウィンドウの最適化を目的とした総合的なワークフロー自動化システムです","ko":"팝업 CRO는 전환률과 사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위한 팝업 및 모달 창의 최적화를 위한 종합적인 워크플로 자동화 시스템입니다","es":"popup-cro es un sistema de automatización de flujo de trabajo para optimizar popups y modales, mejorando la conversión sin molestar a los usuarios.","fr":"popup-cro est un système d''automatisation de workflow pour optimiser les popups et les modales, améliorant la conversion sans déranger les utilisateurs.","de":"popup-cro ist ein Workflow-Automatisierungssystem, um Popups und Modale zu optimieren, die Konvertierung zu verbessern, ohne die Benutzer zu stören.","pt":"O Popup CRO é um sistema de automação de workflows para Claude Code, projetado para otimizar popups e modais","ru":"Попап CRO - это комплексная система автоматизации рабочих процессов для Claude Code, предназначенная для оптимизации попапов и модальных окон","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هو نظام تلقائي لتحسين نوافذ المنبثق والتحسينات المخصصة لموقع Claude Code","en":"A comprehensive workflow automation system for Claude Code featuring multi-agent coordination, learning system, and anti-hallucination enforcement"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Popup CRO 优化专家：提高转化率而不打扰用户","ja":"Popup CRO 最適化専門家：転換率を上げるためにユーザーを妨げない","ko":"팝업 CRO 최적화 전문가: 전환률을 높이는 동안 사용자를 방해하지 않음","es":"Optimización de Popups con popup-cro","fr":"Optimisation des Popups avec popup-cro","de":"Popup-Optimierung mit popup-cro","pt":"Otimização de Popups com Popup CRO","ru":"Попап CRO: автоматизация рабочих процессов","ar":"تحسين نافذة 팝업 مع Popup CRO","en":"popup-cro"},"description":{"zh":"Popup CRO 是一种综合的工作流自动化系统，用于优化弹窗和模态窗口，提高转化率和用户体验","ja":"Popup CRO は転換率とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるためのポップアップとモーダルウィンドウの最適化を目的とした総合的なワークフロー自動化システムです","ko":"팝업 CRO는 전환률과 사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위한 팝업 및 모달 창의 최적화를 위한 종합적인 워크플로 자동화 시스템입니다","es":"popup-cro es un sistema de automatización de flujo de trabajo para optimizar popups y modales, mejorando la conversión sin molestar a los usuarios.","fr":"popup-cro est un système d''automatisation de workflow pour optimiser les popups et les modales, améliorant la conversion sans déranger les utilisateurs.","de":"popup-cro ist ein Workflow-Automatisierungssystem, um Popups und Modale zu optimieren, die Konvertierung zu verbessern, ohne die Benutzer zu stören.","pt":"O Popup CRO é um sistema de automação de workflows para Claude Code, projetado para otimizar popups e modais","ru":"Попап CRO - это комплексная система автоматизации рабочих процессов для Claude Code, предназначенная для оптимизации попапов и модальных окон","ar":"نافذة منبثقة CRO هو نظام تلقائي لتحسين نوافذ المنبثق والتحسينات المخصصة لموقع Claude Code","en":"A comprehensive workflow automation system for Claude Code featuring multi-agent coordination, learning system, and anti-hallucination enforcement"},"definition":{"en":"A comprehensive workflow automation system for Claude Code featuring multi-agent coordination, learning system, and anti-hallucination enforcement"},"features":{"zh":["多代理协调","学习系统","反幻觉执行","弹窗优化","模态窗口优化","转化率提高"],"ja":["マルチエージェントコーディネーション","学習システム","アンチホールュシネーション実施","ポップアップ最適化","モーダルウィンドウ最適化","転換率向上"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 조정","학습 시스템","반환상 상각","팝업 최적화","모달 창 최적화","전환률 향상"],"es":["Optimización de popups y modales","Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Mejora de la conversión sin molestar a los usuarios","Coordinación multi-agente","Sistema de aprendizaje","Aplicación de anti-hallucinación"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups et des modales","Automatisation des flux de travail","Amélioration de la conversion sans déranger les utilisateurs","Coordination multi-agents","Système d''apprentissage","Application d''anti-hallucination"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups und Modalen","Automatisierung von Workflows","Verbesserung der Konvertierung ohne die Benutzer zu stören","Mehragentenkoordination","Lernsystem","Anwendung von Anti-Halluzination"],"pt":["Otimização de popups e modais","Automação de workflows","Coordenação multi-agente","Sistema de aprendizado","Enforcement anti-hallucinação"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов и модальных окон","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Мультиагентная координация","Система обучения","Принудительное соблюдение антигаллюцинации"],"ar":["تحسين نوافذ المنبثق","التلقائي لتحسين نوافذ المنبثق","تنسيق متعدد الوكلاء","نظام التعلم","تنفيذ منع الهلوسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["_popup CRO","弹窗优化","模态窗口优化","转化率提高","用户体验","工作流自动化"],"ja":["Popup CRO","ポップアップ最適化","モーダルウィンドウ最適化","転換率向上","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ワークフロー自動化"],"ko":["팝업 CRO","팝업 최적화","모달 창 최적화","전환률 향상","사용자 경험","워크플로 자동화"],"es":["optimización de popups","automatización de workflow","mejora de conversión","popup-cro","claude code","marketing de productos"],"fr":["optimisation des popups","automatisation de workflow","amélioration de conversion","popup-cro","claude code","marketing de produits"],"de":["Popup-Optimierung","Workflow-Automatisierung","Konvertierungsverbesserung","popup-cro","claude code","Produktmarketing"],"pt":["otimização de popups","popup cro","automatização de workflows","coordenação multi-agente","sistema de aprendizado","enforcement anti-hallucinação","claud code","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["оптимизация попапов","попап cro","автоматизация рабочих процессов","мультиагентная координация","система обучения","принудительное соблюдение антигаллюцинации","клод код","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تحسين نوافذ المنبثق","نافذة منبثقة cro","التلقائي لتحسين نوافذ المنبثق","تنسيق متعدد الوكلاء","نظام التعلم","تنفيذ منع الهلوسة","كلود كود","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"ashleytower","repo":"claude-code-workflow","repoPath":"ashleytower/claude-code-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:46:18.282Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in workflow automation and multi-agent coordination, such as Claude Code, needing advanced popup optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合专门从事工作流自动化和多代理协调的AI代理，例如Claude Code，需要高级弹出窗口优化功能。","ja":"ワークフロー自動化やマルチエージェントの調整を専門とするAIエージェント、たとえばClaude Codeに適しています。これらのエージェントは高度なポップアップ最適化機能が必要です。","ko":"워크플로 자동화 및 멀티 에이전트 조정을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트(Claude Code 등)에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 고급 팝업 최적화 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in workflow automation and multi-agent coordination, such as Claude Code, needing advanced popup optimization capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in workflow automation and multi-agent coordination, such as Claude Code, needing advanced popup optimization capabilities.","de":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in workflow automation and multi-agent coordination, such as Claude Code, needing advanced popup optimization capabilities.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA especializados em automação de fluxo de trabalho e coordenação multiagente, como o Claude Code, que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de popups.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, специализирующихся на автоматизации рабочих процессов и координации множественных агентов, таких как Claude Code, которым требуются расширенные возможности оптимизации всплывающих окон.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في أتمتة سير العمل وتنسيق الوكلاء المتعددين، مثل Claude Code، والذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create optimized popups that convert without annoying users, leveraging multi-agent coordination and anti-hallucination enforcement, while utilizing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and understanding popup purposes like email/newsletter capture.","zh":"赋予代理创建优化的弹出窗口的能力，这些弹出窗口可以在不打扰用户的情况下转化，利用多代理协调和反幻觉执行，同时利用`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件的上下文，并理解弹出窗口的用途，如电子邮件/新闻稿捕获。","ja":"エージェントは、マルチエージェントの調整や幻覚防止を活用して、ユーザーを妨げることなくコンバージョンを実現する最適化されたポップアップを作成できるようになります。また、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルのコンテキストや、メール/ニュースレターのキャプチャなどのポップアップの目的を理解します。","ko":"에이전트는 멀티 에이전트 조정 및 반환상(hallucination) 방지 집행을 활용하여 사용자를 방해하지 않고도 전환을 달성할 수 있는 최적화된 팝업을 생성할 수 있습니다. 또한 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 컨텍스트와 이메일/소식지 캡처와 같은 팝업의 목적을 이해합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to create optimized popups that convert without annoying users, leveraging multi-agent coordination and anti-hallucination enforcement, while utilizing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and understanding popup purposes like email/newsletter capture.","fr":"Empowers agents to create optimized popups that convert without annoying users, leveraging multi-agent coordination and anti-hallucination enforcement, while utilizing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and understanding popup purposes like email/newsletter capture.","de":"Empowers agents to create optimized popups that convert without annoying users, leveraging multi-agent coordination and anti-hallucination enforcement, while utilizing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files and understanding popup purposes like email/newsletter capture.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar popups otimizados que convertem sem incomodar os usuários, aproveitando a coordenação multiagente e a aplicação anti-alucinação, utilizando o contexto dos arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e compreendendo os propósitos dos popups, como captura de e-mail/newsletter.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать оптимизированные всплывающие окна, которые конвертируют, не раздражая пользователей, используя координацию множественных агентов и обеспечение защиты от галлюцинаций, при этом используя контекст из файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимая цели всплывающих окон, такие как сбор email-адресов или подписка на рассылку.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة محسنة تحقق التحويل دون إزعاج المستخدمين، مع الاستفادة من تنسيق الوكلاء المتعددين وإنفاذ مكافحة الهلوسة، مع استخدام السياق من ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وفهم أغراض النوافذ المنبثقة مثل capture البريد الإلكتروني/النشرات الإخبارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating popup campaigns for maximum conversion","Generating popup content optimized for user engagement","Debugging popup issues to prevent brand perception damage"],"zh":["自动化弹出窗口活动以实现最大转化","生成针对用户参与度优化的弹出窗口内容","调试弹出窗口问题以防止品牌认知度受损"],"ja":["最大コンバージョンを実現するためのポップアップキャンペーンの自動化","ユーザー参与度の最適化に合わせたポップアップコンテンツの生成","ブランド認知度の損傷を防ぐためのポップアップの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["최대 전환을 달성하기 위한 팝업 캠페인의 자동화","사용자 참여도 최적화를 위한 팝업 콘텐츠 생성","브랜드 인지도 손상 방지를 위한 팝업 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automating popup campaigns for maximum conversion","Generating popup content optimized for user engagement","Debugging popup issues to prevent brand perception damage"],"fr":["Automating popup campaigns for maximum conversion","Generating popup content optimized for user engagement","Debugging popup issues to prevent brand perception damage"],"de":["Automating popup campaigns for maximum conversion","Generating popup content optimized for user engagement","Debugging popup issues to prevent brand perception damage"],"pt":["Automatizando campanhas de popup para máxima conversão","Gerando conteúdo de popup otimizado para engajamento do usuário","Depurando problemas de popup para evitar danos à percepção da marca"],"ru":["Автоматизация кампаний всплывающих окон для максимальной конверсии","Генерация контента всплывающих окон, оптимизированного для вовлечения пользователей","Отладка проблем всплывающих окон для предотвращения ущерба восприятию бренда"],"ar":["أتمتة حملات النوافذ المنبثقة لتحقيق أقصى قدر من التحويل","إنشاء محتوى نوافذ منبثقة محسّن لجذب المستخدمين","تصحيح مشاكل النوافذ المنبثقة لمنع الضرر بصورة العلامة التجارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Needs access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files for context","Specifically designed for popup and modal optimization"],"zh":["需要Claude Code集成","需要访问`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件以获取上下文","专门针对弹出窗口和模态优化设计"],"ja":["Claude Codeの統合が必要","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルへのアクセスが必要","ポップアップおよびモーダル最適化のために特に設計されています"],"ko":["Claude Code 통합이 필요합니다","`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일에 접근하여 컨텍스트를 얻을 필요가 있습니다","팝업 및 모달 최적화를 위한 특수 설계입니다"],"es":["Requires Claude Code integration","Needs access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files for context","Specifically designed for popup and modal optimization"],"fr":["Requires Claude Code integration","Needs access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files for context","Specifically designed for popup and modal optimization"],"de":["Requires Claude Code integration","Needs access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files for context","Specifically designed for popup and modal optimization"],"pt":["Requer integração com Claude Code","Necessita de acesso aos arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto","Projetado especificamente para otimização de popups e modais"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Требует доступа к файлам `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для получения контекста","Специально разработан для оптимизации всплывающих окон и модальных окон"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع Claude Code","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للحصول على السياق","مصمم خصيصًا لتحسين النوافذ المنبثقة والنوافذ المشروطة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
