Intégration avec Google Antigravity","Outils d''analyse et de débogage","Support pour plusieurs contextes"],"de":["Effiziente Kontextverwaltung","Verbesserung der Arbeitsabläufe","Integration mit Google Antigravity","Analyse- und Debugging-Tools","Unterstützung für mehrere Kontexte"],"pt":["Coleção curada de habilidades de agente","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho","Melhoria da produtividade","Suporte a tarefas de gerenciamento de contexto","Ferramenta de salvar contexto inteligente"],"ru":["Отобранная коллекция навыков агента","Оптимизация рабочих процессов","Повышение производительности","Поддержка задач по управлению контекстом","Инструмент сохранения контекста интеллектуально"],"ar":["مجموعة محددة من مهارات الوكيل","تحسين تدفقات العمل","تحسين الإنتاجية","دعم مهام إدارة السياق","أداة حفظ السياق الذكية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文保存工具","智能上下文管理","开发过程优化","工作流管理","实时指导","开发者工具"],"ja":["コンテキスト保存ツール","インテリジェントコンテキスト管理","開発プロセスの最適化","ワークフローマネジメント","リアルタイムガイダンス","開発者ツール"],"ko":["컨텍스트 저장 도구","지능형 컨텍스트 관리","개발 과정 최적화","워크플로우 관리","실시간 가이드","개발자 도구"],"es":["gestión de contexto","herramienta de gestión de contexto","Google Antigravity","desarrollo de software","eficiencia en el desarrollo","mejora de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["gestion de contexte","outil de gestion de contexte","Google Antigravity","développement de logiciels","efficacité dans le développement","amélioration des flux de travail"],"de":["Kontextverwaltung","Kontext-Verwaltungstool","Google Antigravity","Software-Entwicklung","Effizienz im Entwicklungsprozess","Verbesserung der Arbeitsabläufe"],"pt":["gerenciamento de contexto","ferramenta de salvar contexto","especialista em gerenciamento de contexto","fluxos de trabalho","produtividade","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["управление контекстом","инструмент сохранения контекста","специалист по управлению контекстом","рабочие процессы","производительность","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["إدارة السياق","أداة حفظ السياق","متخصص إدارة السياق","تدفقات العمل","الإنتاجية","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-management-context-save","description":"Use when working with context management context save","bodyPreview":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify","body":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Role and Purpose\nAn elite context engineering specialist focused on comprehensive, semantic, and dynamically adaptable context preservation across AI workflows. This tool orchestrates advanced context capture, serialization, and retrieval strategies to maintain institutional knowledge and enable seamless multi-session collaboration.\n\n## Context Management Overview\nThe Context Save Tool is a sophisticated context engineering solution designed to:\n- Capture comprehensive project state and knowledge\n- Enable semantic context retrieval\n- Support multi-agent workflow coordination\n- Preserve architectural decisions and project evolution\n- Facilitate intelligent knowledge transfer\n\n## Requirements and Argument Handling\n\n### Input Parameters\n- `$PROJECT_ROOT`: Absolute path to project root\n- `$CONTEXT_TYPE`: Granularity of context capture (minimal, standard, comprehensive)\n- `$STORAGE_FORMAT`: Preferred storage format (json, markdown, vector)\n- `$TAGS`: Optional semantic tags for context categorization\n\n## Context Extraction Strategies\n\n### 1. Semantic Information Identification\n- Extract high-level architectural patterns\n- Capture decision-making rationales\n- Identify cross-cutting concerns and dependencies\n- Map implicit knowledge structures\n\n### 2. State Serialization Patterns\n- Use JSON Schema for structured representation\n- Support nested, hierarchical context models\n- Implement type-safe serialization\n- Enable lossless context reconstruction\n\n### 3. Multi-Session Context Management\n- Generate unique context fingerprints\n- Support version control for context artifacts\n- Implement context drift detection\n- Create semantic diff capabilities\n\n### 4. Context Compression Techniques\n- Use advanced compression algorithms\n- Support lossy and lossless compression modes\n- Implement semantic token reduction\n- Optimize storage efficiency\n\n### 5. Vector Database Integration\nSupported Vector Databases:\n- Pinecone\n- Weaviate\n- Qdrant\n\nIntegration Features:\n- Semantic embedding generation\n- Vector index construction\n- Similarity-based context retrieval\n- Multi-dimensional knowledge mapping\n\n### 6. Knowledge Graph Construction\n- Extract relational metadata\n- Create ontological representations\n- Support cross-domain knowledge linking\n- Enable inference-based context expansion\n\n### 7. Storage Format Selection\nSupported Formats:\n- Structured JSON\n- Markdown with frontmatter\n- Protocol Buffers\n- MessagePack\n- YAML with semantic annotations\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### 1. Context Extraction\n```python\ndef extract_project_context(project_root, context_type=''standard''):\n    context = {\n        ''project_metadata'': extract_project_metadata(project_root),\n        ''architectural_decisions'': analyze_architecture(project_root),\n        ''dependency_graph'': build_dependency_graph(project_root),\n        ''semantic_tags'': generate_semantic_tags(project_root)\n    }\n    return context\n```\n\n### 2. State Serialization Schema\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"project_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"context_fingerprint\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"captured_at\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"},\n    \"architectural_decisions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"decision_type\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"impact_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Context Compression Algorithm\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, compression_level=''standard''):\n    strategies = {\n        ''minimal'': remove_redundant_tokens,\n        ''standard'': semantic_compression,\n        ''comprehensive'': advanced_vector_compression\n    }\n    compressor = strategies.get(compression_level, semantic_compression)\n    return compressor(context)\n```\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Project Onboarding Context Capture\n1. Analyze project structure\n2. Extract architectural decisions\n3. Generate semantic embeddings\n4. Store in vector database\n5. Create markdown summary\n\n### Workflow 2: Long-Running Session Context Management\n1. Periodically capture context snapshots\n2. Detect significant architectural changes\n3. Version and archive context\n4. Enable selective context restoration\n\n## Advanced Integration Capabilities\n- Real-time context synchronization\n- Cross-platform context portability\n- Compliance with enterprise knowledge management standards\n- Support for multi-modal context representation\n\n## Limitations and Considerations\n- Sensitive information must be explicitly excluded\n- Context capture has computational overhead\n- Requires careful configuration for optimal performance\n\n## Future Roadmap\n- Improved ML-driven context compression\n- Enhanced cross-domain knowledge transfer\n- Real-time collaborative context editing\n- Predictive context recommendation systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:46:57.734Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring advanced context management capabilities for efficient workflow execution.","zh":"适用于像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要高级上下文管理功能以实现高效的工作流执行。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらは効率的なワークフロー実行のために高度なコンテキスト管理機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 효율적인 워크플ロー 실행을 위해 고급 컨텍스트 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren capacidades avanzadas de gestión de contexto para una ejecución de flujo de trabajo eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de contexte pour une exécution de flux de travail efficace.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Kontextverwaltungsfunktionen für eine effiziente Workflow-Ausführung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que exigem capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de contexto para execução eficiente do fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих передовых возможностей управления контекстом для эффективного выполнения рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة السياق من أجل تنفيذ سير عمل فعال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently manage context through specialized tools and best practices, utilizing protocols like Google Antigravity for seamless task integration and checklist guidance, thereby enhancing overall productivity and reducing errors.","zh":"赋予代理智能地管理上下文，通过专门的工具和最佳实践，利用 Google Antigravity 等协议实现无缝的任务集成和检查清单指南，从而提高整体生产力并减少错误。","ja":"エージェントがコンテキストをインテリジェントに管理できるようにします。専用のツールとベストプラクティスを使用して、Google Antigravity などのプロトコルを利用し、シームレスなタスク統合とチェックリストのガイダンスを提供します。これにより、全体的な生産性が向上し、エラーが減ります。","ko":"에이전트가 컨텍스트를 지능적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 전문 도구와 모범 사례를 사용하여 Google Antigravity와 같은 프로토콜을 활용하여 무결점의 작업 통합 및 체크리스트 가이드를 제공함으로써 전체적인 생산성 향상 및 오류 감소에 기여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar inteligentemente el contexto a través de herramientas especializadas y mejores prácticas, utilizando protocolos como Google Antigravity para una integración de tareas sin problemas y orientación de lista de verificación, lo que mejora la productividad general y reduce los errores.","fr":"Habilite les agents à gérer intelligemment le contexte via des outils spécialisés et des meilleures pratiques, en utilisant des protocoles comme Google Antigravity pour une intégration de tâches sans problème et un guidage de liste de vérification, améliorant ainsi la productivité globale et réduisant les erreurs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Kontext intelligenterweise durch spezialisierte Tools und Best Practices zu verwalten, indem Protokolle wie Google Antigravity für eine nahtlose Aufgabenintegration und Checklistenanleitung verwendet werden, wodurch die Gesamtproduktivität verbessert und Fehler reduziert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar inteligentemente o contexto por meio de ferramentas especializadas e melhores práticas, utilizando protocolos como o Google Antigravity para integração de tarefas sem interrupção e orientação de checklist, melhorando assim a produtividade geral e reduzindo erros.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально управлять контекстом посредством специализированных инструментов и передовых практик, используя протоколы, такие как Google Antigravity, для бесшовной интеграции задач и руководства по проверке, тем самым повышая общую производительность и снижая количество ошибок.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة السياق بذكاء من خلال أدوات متخصصة وأفضل الممارسات، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Google Antigravity من أجل دمج المهام بشكل متواصل وتوجيه قائمة التحقق، وبالتالي تعزيز الإنتاجية العامة وتقليل الأخطاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating context save tasks for intelligent context management specialist workflows","Generating guidance and checklists for context management tasks","Optimizing context save tool workflows for improved efficiency"],"zh":["为智能上下文管理专家工作流自动化上下文保存任务","为上下文管理任务生成指南和检查清单","优化上下文保存工具工作流以提高效率"],"ja":["インテリジェント コンテキスト管理専門家のワークフローにコンテキスト保存タスクを自動化する","コンテキスト管理タスクのガイダンスとチェックリストを生成する","コンテキスト保存ツールのワークフローを最適化して効率を向上させる"],"ko":["지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가 워크플로우에 컨텍스트 저장 작업 자동화","컨텍스트 관리 작업에 대한 가이드 및 체크리스트 생성","컨텍스트 저장 도구 워크플로우 최적화하여 효율성 향상"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de guardado de contexto para flujos de trabajo de especialistas en gestión de contexto inteligente","Generar orientación y listas de verificación para tareas de gestión de contexto","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de herramientas de guardado de contexto para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches d''enregistrement de contexte pour les flux de travail de spécialistes en gestion de contexte intelligente","Générer des conseils et des listes de vérification pour les tâches de gestion de contexte","Optimiser les flux de travail d''outils d''enregistrement de contexte pour une meilleure efficacité"],"de":["Automatisieren von Konte