nte de codificação AI","detecção de tecnologia inteligente","sincronização automática","gerenciamento de contexto","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Context Save Tool","помощник кодирования AI","интеллектуальное обнаружение технологий","автоматическая синхронизация","управление контекстом","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أداة حفظ السياق","مساعد الترميز الإصطناعي","اكتشاف تكنولوجي ذكي","التزامن التلقائي","إدارة السياق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-management-context-save","description":"Use when working with context management context save","bodyPreview":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify","body":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Role and Purpose\nAn elite context engineering specialist focused on comprehensive, semantic, and dynamically adaptable context preservation across AI workflows. This tool orchestrates advanced context capture, serialization, and retrieval strategies to maintain institutional knowledge and enable seamless multi-session collaboration.\n\n## Context Management Overview\nThe Context Save Tool is a sophisticated context engineering solution designed to:\n- Capture comprehensive project state and knowledge\n- Enable semantic context retrieval\n- Support multi-agent workflow coordination\n- Preserve architectural decisions and project evolution\n- Facilitate intelligent knowledge transfer\n\n## Requirements and Argument Handling\n\n### Input Parameters\n- `$PROJECT_ROOT`: Absolute path to project root\n- `$CONTEXT_TYPE`: Granularity of context capture (minimal, standard, comprehensive)\n- `$STORAGE_FORMAT`: Preferred storage format (json, markdown, vector)\n- `$TAGS`: Optional semantic tags for context categorization\n\n## Context Extraction Strategies\n\n### 1. Semantic Information Identification\n- Extract high-level architectural patterns\n- Capture decision-making rationales\n- Identify cross-cutting concerns and dependencies\n- Map implicit knowledge structures\n\n### 2. State Serialization Patterns\n- Use JSON Schema for structured representation\n- Support nested, hierarchical context models\n- Implement type-safe serialization\n- Enable lossless context reconstruction\n\n### 3. Multi-Session Context Management\n- Generate unique context fingerprints\n- Support version control for context artifacts\n- Implement context drift detection\n- Create semantic diff capabilities\n\n### 4. Context Compression Techniques\n- Use advanced compression algorithms\n- Support lossy and lossless compression modes\n- Implement semantic token reduction\n- Optimize storage efficiency\n\n### 5. Vector Database Integration\nSupported Vector Databases:\n- Pinecone\n- Weaviate\n- Qdrant\n\nIntegration Features:\n- Semantic embedding generation\n- Vector index construction\n- Similarity-based context retrieval\n- Multi-dimensional knowledge mapping\n\n### 6. Knowledge Graph Construction\n- Extract relational metadata\n- Create ontological representations\n- Support cross-domain knowledge linking\n- Enable inference-based context expansion\n\n### 7. Storage Format Selection\nSupported Formats:\n- Structured JSON\n- Markdown with frontmatter\n- Protocol Buffers\n- MessagePack\n- YAML with semantic annotations\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### 1. Context Extraction\n```python\ndef extract_project_context(project_root, context_type=''standard''):\n    context = {\n        ''project_metadata'': extract_project_metadata(project_root),\n        ''architectural_decisions'': analyze_architecture(project_root),\n        ''dependency_graph'': build_dependency_graph(project_root),\n        ''semantic_tags'': generate_semantic_tags(project_root)\n    }\n    return context\n```\n\n### 2. State Serialization Schema\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"project_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"context_fingerprint\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"captured_at\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"},\n    \"architectural_decisions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"decision_type\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"impact_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Context Compression Algorithm\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, compression_level=''standard''):\n    strategies = {\n        ''minimal'': remove_redundant_tokens,\n        ''standard'': semantic_compression,\n        ''comprehensive'': advanced_vector_compression\n    }\n    compressor = strategies.get(compression_level, semantic_compression)\n    return compressor(context)\n```\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Project Onboarding Context Capture\n1. Analyze project structure\n2. Extract architectural decisions\n3. Generate semantic embeddings\n4. Store in vector database\n5. Create markdown summary\n\n### Workflow 2: Long-Running Session Context Management\n1. Periodically capture context snapshots\n2. Detect significant architectural changes\n3. Version and archive context\n4. Enable selective context restoration\n\n## Advanced Integration Capabilities\n- Real-time context synchronization\n- Cross-platform context portability\n- Compliance with enterprise knowledge management standards\n- Support for multi-modal context representation\n\n## Limitations and Considerations\n- Sensitive information must be explicitly excluded\n- Context capture has computational overhead\n- Requires careful configuration for optimal performance\n\n## Future Roadmap\n- Improved ML-driven context compression\n- Enhanced cross-domain knowledge transfer\n- Real-time collaborative context editing\n- Predictive context recommendation systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:47:12.094Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Coding Assistants requiring persistent context management across complex development sessions.","zh":"适用于需要在复杂开发会话中进行持久上下文管理的AI编码助手。","ja":"複雑な開発セッション全体で永続的なコンテキスト管理を必要とするAIコーディングアシスタントに不可欠。","ko":"복잡한 개발 세션 전반에서 지속적인 컨텍스트 관리가 필요한 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para asistentes de codificación de IA que requieren una gestión de contexto persistente en sesiones de desarrollo complejas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les assistants de codage IA nécessitant une gestion de contexte persistante lors de sessions de développement complexes.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Coding-Assistenten, die eine persistente Kontextverwaltung über komplexe Entwicklungssitzungen hinweg erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Assistente de Codificação de IA que exige gerenciamento de contexto persistente em sessões de desenvolvimento complexas.","ru":"Необходимо для Помощников Кодирования ИИ, требующих постоянного управления контекстом в сложных сессиях разработки.","ar":"ضروري لمساعدي الترميز الإصطناعي الذين يتطلبون إدارة سياق مستمرة عبر جلسات التطوير المعقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables unified multi-agent context preservation across Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, and Gemini with smart tech detection and per-project installation capabilities. Automatically syncs context states from upstream sources to maintain continuity in long-running development workflows.","zh":"能够在Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot和Gemini之间实现统一的多智能体上下文保留，具有智能技术检测和每个项目安装能力。自动从上游源同步上下文状态，以在长时间运行的开发工作流中保持连续性。","ja":"Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot、Gemini間で統一されたマルチエージェントコンテキスト保存を可能にし、スマートテクノロジー検出とプロジェクトごとのインストール機能を備えている。長時間実行される開発ワークフローで連続性を維持するために、上流ソースからコンテキスト状態を自動的に同期する。","ko":"Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot 및 Gemini 간에 단일한 멀티 에이전트 컨텍스트 보존을 가능하게 하며, 스마트 기술 감지 및 프로젝트별 설치 기능을 제공합니다. 장기간 실행되는 개발 워크플로에서 연속성을 유지하기 위해 업스트림 소스에서 컨텍스트 상태를 자동으로 동기화합니다.","es":"Permite la preservación unificada de contexto multiagente a través de Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot y Gemini con detección inteligente de tecnología y capacidades de instalación por proyecto. Sincroniza automáticamente los estados de contexto desde fuentes de origen para mantener la continuidad en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de larga duración.","fr":"Permet la préservation unifiée du contexte multiagent à travers Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot et Gemini avec une détection intelligente de la technologie et des capacités d''installation par projet. Synchronise automatiquement les états de contexte à partir de sources amont pour maintenir la continuité dans les flux de travail de développement de longue durée.","de":"Ermöglicht die einheitliche Beibehaltung des Multiagenten-Kontexts über Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot und Gemini mit intelligenter Technologieerkennung und Projektinstallationsoptionen. Synchronisiert automatisch Kontextzustände aus Quellen mit höherer Priorität, um die Kontinuität in langfristigen Entwicklungsworkflows aufrechtzuerhalten.","pt":"Permite a preservação unificada do contexto de vários agentes em Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot e Gemini, com detecção de tecnologia inteligente e capacidades de instalação por projeto. Sincroniza automaticamente os estados de contexto de fontes de upstream para manter a continuidade em fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de longa duração.","ru":"Позволяет обеспечить унифицированное сохранение контекста нескольких агентов в Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot и Gemini с помощью умной технологической детекции и возможностей установки на уровне проекта. Автоматически синхронизирует состояния контекста из источников upstream, чтобы поддерживать непрерывность в долгосрочных рабочих процессах разработки.","ar":"يسمح بالحفاظ الموحد على سياق وكلاء متعددين عبر Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot و Gemini باستخدام الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا و Đặcية التثبيت لكل مشروع. يتزامن تلقائيًا مع حالات السياق من المصادر الأساسية للحفاظ على الاستمرارية في تدفقات عمل التطوير الطويلة الأمد."},"useCases":{"en":["Saving coding session context across agent restarts","Synchronizing project-specific context between multiple AI assistants","Managing per-project context configurations for different tech stacks"],"zh":["在智能体重启时保存编码会话上下文","在多个AI助手之间同步项目特定上下文","管理不同技术栈的项目特定上下文配置"],"ja":["エージェントの再起動時にコーディングセッションコンテキストを保存する","複数のAIアシスタント間でプロジェクト特有のコンテキストを同期する","異なるテクノロジースタックのプロジェクト特有のコンテキスト構成を管理する"],"ko":["에이전트 재시작 시 코딩 세션 컨텍스트를 저장하는 것","여러 AI 어시스턴트 간에 프로젝트별 컨텍스트를 동기화하는 것","다른 기술 스택에 대한 프로젝트별 컨텍스트 구성 관리"],"es":["Guardar el contexto de la sesión de codificación a través de reinicios de agente","Sincronizar el contexto específico del proyecto entre varios asistentes de IA","Administrar configuraciones de contexto por proyecto para diferentes pilas tecnológicas"],"fr":["Enregistrer le contexte de la session de codage à travers les redémarrages de l''agent","Synchroniser le contexte spécifique au projet entre plusieurs assistants IA","Gérer les configurations de contexte par projet pour différentes piles technologiques"],"de":["Speichern des Codiersitzungskontexts über Agent-Neustarts hinweg","Synchronisieren des projektspezifischen Kontexts zwischen mehreren AI-Assistenten","Verwalten von Kontextkonfigurationen pro Projekt für verschiedene Technologiestacks"],"pt":["Salvar o contexto da sessão de codificação em reinicializações de agente","Sincronizar o contexto específico do projeto entre vários assistentes de IA","Gerenciar configurações de contexto por projeto para diferentes pilhas de tecnologia"],"ru":["Сохранять контекст сессии кодирования при перезапуске агента","Синхронизировать контекст, специфичный для проекта, между несколькими помощниками ИИ","Управлять конфигурациями контекста на уровне проекта для разных технологических стеков"],"ar":["حفظ سياق جلسة الترميز عبر إعادة تشغيل الوكيل","متزامنة سياق محدد للمشروع بين مساعدي الإصطناعي المتعددين","إدارة تكوين سياق لكل مشروع لتقنيات مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to supported AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Requires project-specific installation and configuration","Dependent on upstream source synchronization availability"],"zh":["仅限支持的AI编码助手（Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot、Gemini）","需要项目特定的安装和配置","依赖于上游源同步可用性"],"ja":["サポートされているAIコーディングアシスタント（Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot、Gemini）のみ","プロジェクトごとのインストールと構成が必要","上流ソースの同期可用性に依存"],"ko":["지원되는 AI 코딩 어시스턴트(Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)만 해당","프로젝트별 설치 및 구성 필요","업스트림 소스의 동기화 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Limitado a asistentes de codificación de IA compatibles (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Requiere instalación y configuración específicas del proyecto","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de sincronización de fuentes de origen"],"fr":["Limité aux assistants de codage IA pris en charge (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Nécessite une installation et une configuration spécifiques au projet","Dépend de la disponibilité de la synchronisation des sources amont"],"de":["Begrenzt auf unterstützte AI-Coding-Assistenten (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Benötigt projektspezifische Installation und Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit der Quellen-Synchronisation"],"pt":["Limitado a assistentes de codificação de IA com suporte (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Exige instalação e configuração específicas do projeto","Dependente da disponibilidade da sincronização de fontes de upstream"],"ru":["Ограничен поддерживаемыми помощниками кодирования ИИ (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini)","Требует установки и конфигурации на уровне проекта","Зависит от доступности синхронизации источников upstream"],"ar":["محدود لمساعدي الترميز الإصطناعي المدعومين (Claude Code و Cursor و Copilot و Gemini)","يتطلب تثبيتًا وتكوينًا محددًا للمشروع","يعتمد على توافر التزامن من المصادر الأساسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
