м","Инструмент сохранения контекста","Обучение у лучших","Оптимизация задач","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["إدارة سياق ذكية","أداة حفظ السياق","التعلم من الأفضل","تحسين المهام","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文管理","Context Save","智能管理","工作流优化","任务自动化","最佳实践","技术集成"],"ja":["コンテキスト管理","Context Save","インテリジェント管理","ワークフローの最適化","タスクの自動化","ベストプラクティス","技術の統合"],"ko":["컨텍스트 관리","컨텍스트 저장","지능형 관리","워크플로우 최적화","작업 자동화","모범 사례","기술 통합"],"es":["gestión de contexto","herramienta de gestión de contexto","especialista en contexto","desarrollo de software","gestión de tareas","flujos de trabajo","guidance para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["gestion de contexte","outil de gestion de contexte","spécialiste de contexte","développement de logiciels","gestion de tâches","flux de travail","guidance pour les développeurs","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Kontextverwaltung","Kontextverwaltungstool","Kontext-Spezialist","Softwareentwicklung","Aufgabenverwaltung","Arbeitsabläufe","Guidance für Entwickler","Best Practices"],"pt":["gerenciamento de contexto","ferramenta de salvamento de contexto","aprendizado com os melhores","otimização de tarefas","melhoria da produtividade","tecnologia de contexto","gerenciamento de contexto inteligente"],"ru":["управление контекстом","инструмент сохранения контекста","обучение у лучших","оптимизация задач","повышение производительности","технология контекста","умное управление контекстом"],"ar":["إدارة السياق","أداة حفظ السياق","التعلم من الأفضل","تحسين المهام","تحسين الإنتاجية","تكنولوجيا السياق","إدارة سياق ذكية"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-management-context-save","description":"Use when working with context management context save","bodyPreview":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify","body":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Role and Purpose\nAn elite context engineering specialist focused on comprehensive, semantic, and dynamically adaptable context preservation across AI workflows. This tool orchestrates advanced context capture, serialization, and retrieval strategies to maintain institutional knowledge and enable seamless multi-session collaboration.\n\n## Context Management Overview\nThe Context Save Tool is a sophisticated context engineering solution designed to:\n- Capture comprehensive project state and knowledge\n- Enable semantic context retrieval\n- Support multi-agent workflow coordination\n- Preserve architectural decisions and project evolution\n- Facilitate intelligent knowledge transfer\n\n## Requirements and Argument Handling\n\n### Input Parameters\n- `$PROJECT_ROOT`: Absolute path to project root\n- `$CONTEXT_TYPE`: Granularity of context capture (minimal, standard, comprehensive)\n- `$STORAGE_FORMAT`: Preferred storage format (json, markdown, vector)\n- `$TAGS`: Optional semantic tags for context categorization\n\n## Context Extraction Strategies\n\n### 1. Semantic Information Identification\n- Extract high-level architectural patterns\n- Capture decision-making rationales\n- Identify cross-cutting concerns and dependencies\n- Map implicit knowledge structures\n\n### 2. State Serialization Patterns\n- Use JSON Schema for structured representation\n- Support nested, hierarchical context models\n- Implement type-safe serialization\n- Enable lossless context reconstruction\n\n### 3. Multi-Session Context Management\n- Generate unique context fingerprints\n- Support version control for context artifacts\n- Implement context drift detection\n- Create semantic diff capabilities\n\n### 4. Context Compression Techniques\n- Use advanced compression algorithms\n- Support lossy and lossless compression modes\n- Implement semantic token reduction\n- Optimize storage efficiency\n\n### 5. Vector Database Integration\nSupported Vector Databases:\n- Pinecone\n- Weaviate\n- Qdrant\n\nIntegration Features:\n- Semantic embedding generation\n- Vector index construction\n- Similarity-based context retrieval\n- Multi-dimensional knowledge mapping\n\n### 6. Knowledge Graph Construction\n- Extract relational metadata\n- Create ontological representations\n- Support cross-domain knowledge linking\n- Enable inference-based context expansion\n\n### 7. Storage Format Selection\nSupported Formats:\n- Structured JSON\n- Markdown with frontmatter\n- Protocol Buffers\n- MessagePack\n- YAML with semantic annotations\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### 1. Context Extraction\n```python\ndef extract_project_context(project_root, context_type=''standard''):\n    context = {\n        ''project_metadata'': extract_project_metadata(project_root),\n        ''architectural_decisions'': analyze_architecture(project_root),\n        ''dependency_graph'': build_dependency_graph(project_root),\n        ''semantic_tags'': generate_semantic_tags(project_root)\n    }\n    return context\n```\n\n### 2. State Serialization Schema\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"project_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"context_fingerprint\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"captured_at\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"},\n    \"architectural_decisions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"decision_type\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"impact_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Context Compression Algorithm\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, compression_level=''standard''):\n    strategies = {\n        ''minimal'': remove_redundant_tokens,\n        ''standard'': semantic_compression,\n        ''comprehensive'': advanced_vector_compression\n    }\n    compressor = strategies.get(compression_level, semantic_compression)\n    return compressor(context)\n```\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Project Onboarding Context Capture\n1. Analyze project structure\n2. Extract architectural decisions\n3. Generate semantic embeddings\n4. Store in vector database\n5. Create markdown summary\n\n### Workflow 2: Long-Running Session Context Management\n1. Periodically capture context snapshots\n2. Detect significant architectural changes\n3. Version and archive context\n4. Enable selective context restoration\n\n## Advanced Integration Capabilities\n- Real-time context synchronization\n- Cross-platform context portability\n- Compliance with enterprise knowledge management standards\n- Support for multi-modal context representation\n\n## Limitations and Considerations\n- Sensitive information must be explicitly excluded\n- Context capture has computational overhead\n- Requires careful configuration for optimal performance\n\n## Future Roadmap\n- Improved ML-driven context compression\n- Enhanced cross-domain knowledge transfer\n- Real-time collaborative context editing\n- Predictive context recommendation systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:47:37.345Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Intelligent Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced context management capabilities for efficient workflow handling","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的智能代理，需要高级上下文管理功能以实现高效的工作流处理","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度なコンテキスト管理機能を必要とするインテリジェントエージェントに最適","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 지능형 에이전트에 적합하며, 효율적인 워크플로 처리를 위해 고급 컨텍스트 관리 기능이 필요함","es":"Ideal para Agentes Inteligentes como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de contexto para un manejo eficiente del flujo de trabajo","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Intelligents comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion de contexte pour une gestion efficace du flux de travail","de":"Ideal für intelligente Agenten wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Kontextverwaltungsfunktionen für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Inteligentes como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de contexto para manipulação de fluxo de trabalho eficiente","ru":"Идеально подходит для Интеллектуальных Агентов, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих продвинутых возможностей управления контекстом для эффективного управления рабочим процессом","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة السياق من أجل التعامل الفعال مع تدفق العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently manage and save context using best practices and checklists, facilitating seamless task execution and workflow optimization through specialized context save tools","zh":"赋予代理智能地管理和保存上下文，使用最佳实践和检查列表，通过专门的上下文保存工具实现无缝的任务执行和工作流优化","ja":"エージェントがコンテキストをインテリジェントに管理および保存できるようにし、ベストプラクティスとチェックリストを使用してタスクの実行とワークフローの最適化を促進する","ko":"에이전트가 지능적으로 컨텍스트를 관리하고 저장할 수 있도록 하며,最佳實踐과 체크리스트를 사용하여 태스크의 실행과 워크플로우의 최적화를 원활하게 수행하는 데 도움을 줌","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar y guardar el contexto de manera inteligente utilizando las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación, facilitando la ejecución fluida de tareas y la optimización del flujo de trabajo a través de herramientas especializadas de guarda de contexto","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et de sauvegarder le contexte de manière intelligente en utilisant les meilleures pratiques et les listes de vérification, facilitant l''exécution fluide des tâches et l''optimisation du flux de travail via des outils spécialisés de sauvegarde de contexte","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den Kontext intelligent zu verwalten und zu speichern, indem sie die besten Praktiken und Checklisten verwenden, wodurch eine nahtlose Aufgabenausführung und eine Optimierung des Workflows durch spezielle Kontext-Speichertools ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar e salvar contexto de forma inteligente, utilizando as melhores práticas e listas de verificação, facilitando a execução de tarefas sem interrupção e a otimização do fluxo de trabalho por meio de ferramentas especializadas de salvamento de contexto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально управлять и сохранять контекст, используя лучшие практики и чек-листы, облегчая бесперебойное выполнение задач и оптимизацию рабочего процесса посредством специализированных инструментов для сохранения контекста","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة السياق وحفظه بذكاء، باستخدام أفضل الممارسات والقوائم المرجعية، وتسهيل تنفيذ المهام دون انقطاع وتحسين تدفق العمل من خلال أدوات مخصصة لحفظ السياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating context save for complex workflows","Generating checklists for context management specialist tasks","Debugging context-related issues in intelligent workflows"],"zh":["自动化复杂工作流的上下文保存","为上下文管理专家任务生成检查列表","调试智能工作流中的上下文相关问题"],"ja":["複雑なワークフローのコンテキスト保存の自動化","コンテキスト管理専門家タスクのチェックリストの生成","インテリジェントワークフロー中的コンテキスト関連の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["복잡한 워크플로우의 컨텍스트 저장 자동화","컨텍스트 관리 전문가 태스크를 위한 체크리스트 생성","지능형 워크플로우의 컨텍스트 관련 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la guarda de contexto para flujos de trabajo complejos","Generar listas de verificación para tareas especializadas de gestión de contexto","Depurar problemas relacionados con el contexto en flujos de trabajo inteligentes"],"fr":["Automatiser la sauvegarde de contexte pour les flux de travail complexes","Générer des listes de vérification pour les tâches spécialisées de gestion de contexte","Déboguer les problèmes liés au contexte dans les flux de travail intelligents"],"de":["Automatisieren der Kontextspeicherung für komplexe Workflows","Erstellen von Checklisten für spezialisierte Kontextverwaltungsaufgaben","Fehlerbehebung bei kontextbezogenen Problemen in intelligenten Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a economia de contexto para fluxos de trabalho complexos","Gerar listas de verificação para tarefas de especialista em gerenciamento de contexto","Depurar problemas relacionados ao contexto em fluxos de trabalho inteligentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сохранение контекста для сложных рабочих процессов","Генерировать чек-листы для задач специалиста по управлению контекстом","Отладить проблемы, связанные с контекстом, в интеллектуальных рабочих процессах"],"ar":["تأتمتة حفظ السياق لتدفقات العمل المعقدة","توليد قوائم مرجعية لمهام أخصائي إدارة السياق","تصحيح الأخطاء ذات الصلة بالسياق في تدفقات العمل الذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific domain knowledge of context save tool: intelligent context management specialist","Limited to tasks related to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist"],"zh":["需要特定领域的上下文保存工具知识：智能上下文管理专家","仅限于与上下文保存工具相关的任务：智能上下文管理专家"],"ja":["コンテキスト保存ツール：インテリジェントコンテキスト管理スペシャリストの特定ドメインの知識が必要","コンテキスト保存ツール：インテリジェントコンテキスト管理スペシャリストに関連するタスクのみ"],"ko":["컨텍스트 저장 도구: 지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가의 특정 도메인 지식 필요","컨텍스트 저장 도구: 지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가와 관련된 태스크에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento específico del dominio de la herramienta de guarda de contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente","Limitado a tareas relacionadas con la herramienta de guarda de contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances spécifiques du domaine de l''outil de sauvegarde de contexte: spécialiste de la gestion de contexte intelligente","Limité aux tâches liées à l''outil de sauvegarde de contexte: spécialiste de la gestion de contexte intelligente"],"de":["Benötigt spezifische Domänenkenntnisse des Kontext-Speichertools: Spezialist für intelligente Kontextverwaltung","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben im Zusammenhang mit dem Kontext-Speichertool: Spezialist für intelligente Kontextverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento específico de domínio da ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente","Limitado a tarefas relacionadas à ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente"],"ru":["Требует конкретных знаний домена инструмента сохранения контекста: специалиста по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом","Ограничен задачами, связанными с инструментом сохранения контекста: специалиста по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة محددة بنطاق أداة حفظ السياق: أخصائي إدارة السياق الذكي","محدود بالمهام المرتبطة بأداة حفظ السياق: أخصائي إدارة السياق الذكي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
