de","Ferramenta de ajuda para desenvolvedores","Gerenciamento eficaz de contextos"],"ru":["Умное управление контекстом","Интеграция с несколькими платформами","Повышение производительности","Инструмент помощи для разработчиков","Эффективное управление контекстами"],"ar":["إدارة سياق ذكية","دمج مع منصات متعددة","تحسين الإنتاجية","أداة مساعدة للمطورين","إدارة سياقات فعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文管理","Context Save Tool","智能上下文管理","上下文保存","工作流管理","任务管理","跨平台兼容"],"ja":["コンテキスト管理","Context Save Tool","スマートなコンテキスト管理","コンテキスト保存","ワークフロー管理","タスク管理","クロスプラットフォーム互換"],"ko":["컨텍스트 관리","컨텍스트 저장 도구","智能한 컨텍스트 관리","컨텍스트 저장","워크플로우 관리","태스크 관리","크로스 플랫폼 호환"],"es":["herramienta de contexto","gestión de contexto","especialista en gestión de contexto","flujos de trabajo","optimización de procesos","análisis de contexto"],"fr":["outil de contexte","gestion de contexte","spécialiste de la gestion de contexte","flux de travail","optimisation de processus","analyse de contexte"],"de":["Kontext-Tool","Kontextverwaltung","Spezialist für Kontextverwaltung","Arbeitsabläufe","Prozessoptimierung","Kontextanalyse"],"pt":["gerenciamento de contexto","ferramenta de gerenciamento de contexto","desenvolvedores","produtividade","plataformas de desenvolvimento","contexto inteligente"],"ru":["менеджер контекста","инструмент менеджера контекста","разработчики","производительность","платформы разработки","интеллектуальный контекст"],"ar":["إدارة السياق","أداة إدارة السياق","مطورو البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","منصات التطوير","سياق ذكي"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-management-context-save","description":"Use when working with context management context save","bodyPreview":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify","body":"# Context Save Tool: Intelligent Context Management Specialist\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Role and Purpose\nAn elite context engineering specialist focused on comprehensive, semantic, and dynamically adaptable context preservation across AI workflows. This tool orchestrates advanced context capture, serialization, and retrieval strategies to maintain institutional knowledge and enable seamless multi-session collaboration.\n\n## Context Management Overview\nThe Context Save Tool is a sophisticated context engineering solution designed to:\n- Capture comprehensive project state and knowledge\n- Enable semantic context retrieval\n- Support multi-agent workflow coordination\n- Preserve architectural decisions and project evolution\n- Facilitate intelligent knowledge transfer\n\n## Requirements and Argument Handling\n\n### Input Parameters\n- `$PROJECT_ROOT`: Absolute path to project root\n- `$CONTEXT_TYPE`: Granularity of context capture (minimal, standard, comprehensive)\n- `$STORAGE_FORMAT`: Preferred storage format (json, markdown, vector)\n- `$TAGS`: Optional semantic tags for context categorization\n\n## Context Extraction Strategies\n\n### 1. Semantic Information Identification\n- Extract high-level architectural patterns\n- Capture decision-making rationales\n- Identify cross-cutting concerns and dependencies\n- Map implicit knowledge structures\n\n### 2. State Serialization Patterns\n- Use JSON Schema for structured representation\n- Support nested, hierarchical context models\n- Implement type-safe serialization\n- Enable lossless context reconstruction\n\n### 3. Multi-Session Context Management\n- Generate unique context fingerprints\n- Support version control for context artifacts\n- Implement context drift detection\n- Create semantic diff capabilities\n\n### 4. Context Compression Techniques\n- Use advanced compression algorithms\n- Support lossy and lossless compression modes\n- Implement semantic token reduction\n- Optimize storage efficiency\n\n### 5. Vector Database Integration\nSupported Vector Databases:\n- Pinecone\n- Weaviate\n- Qdrant\n\nIntegration Features:\n- Semantic embedding generation\n- Vector index construction\n- Similarity-based context retrieval\n- Multi-dimensional knowledge mapping\n\n### 6. Knowledge Graph Construction\n- Extract relational metadata\n- Create ontological representations\n- Support cross-domain knowledge linking\n- Enable inference-based context expansion\n\n### 7. Storage Format Selection\nSupported Formats:\n- Structured JSON\n- Markdown with frontmatter\n- Protocol Buffers\n- MessagePack\n- YAML with semantic annotations\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### 1. Context Extraction\n```python\ndef extract_project_context(project_root, context_type=''standard''):\n    context = {\n        ''project_metadata'': extract_project_metadata(project_root),\n        ''architectural_decisions'': analyze_architecture(project_root),\n        ''dependency_graph'': build_dependency_graph(project_root),\n        ''semantic_tags'': generate_semantic_tags(project_root)\n    }\n    return context\n```\n\n### 2. State Serialization Schema\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"project_name\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"version\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"context_fingerprint\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"captured_at\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\"},\n    \"architectural_decisions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"decision_type\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"impact_score\": {\"type\": \"number\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Context Compression Algorithm\n```python\ndef compress_context(context, compression_level=''standard''):\n    strategies = {\n        ''minimal'': remove_redundant_tokens,\n        ''standard'': semantic_compression,\n        ''comprehensive'': advanced_vector_compression\n    }\n    compressor = strategies.get(compression_level, semantic_compression)\n    return compressor(context)\n```\n\n## Reference Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Project Onboarding Context Capture\n1. Analyze project structure\n2. Extract architectural decisions\n3. Generate semantic embeddings\n4. Store in vector database\n5. Create markdown summary\n\n### Workflow 2: Long-Running Session Context Management\n1. Periodically capture context snapshots\n2. Detect significant architectural changes\n3. Version and archive context\n4. Enable selective context restoration\n\n## Advanced Integration Capabilities\n- Real-time context synchronization\n- Cross-platform context portability\n- Compliance with enterprise knowledge management standards\n- Support for multi-modal context representation\n\n## Limitations and Considerations\n- Sensitive information must be explicitly excluded\n- Context capture has computational overhead\n- Requires careful configuration for optimal performance\n\n## Future Roadmap\n- Improved ML-driven context compression\n- Enhanced cross-domain knowledge transfer\n- Real-time collaborative context editing\n- Predictive context recommendation systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:47:45.355Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced context management and saving capabilities.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高级上下文管理和保存功能。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しており、先進的なコンテキスト管理と保存機能が必要です。","ko":"커서, 윈드서핑, 클로드 코드와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고급 컨텍스트 관리 및 저장 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de gestión y guardar contexto avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui ont besoin de capacités de gestion et d''enregistrement de contexte avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Kontextverwaltungs- und Speicherfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e salvamento de contexto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления и сохранения контекста.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى إدارة سياق متقدمة وقدرات الحفظ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently manage and save context using OpenCLAW, Claude Code, and other platforms, providing best practices and checklists for efficient workflows through protocols like OpenCLAW and file formats specific to context save tools.","zh":"使代理能够使用OpenCLAW、Claude Code和其他平台智能地管理和保存上下文，通过OpenCLAW和特定于上下文保存工具的文件格式等协议提供高效工作流的最佳实践和检查清单。","ja":"OpenCLAW、Claude Code、およびその他のプラットフォームを使用して、エージェントがコンテキストを智能的に管理および保存できるようにし、OpenCLAWやコンテキスト保存ツールに特有のファイル形式などのプロトコルを通じて、効率的なワークフローに対するベストプラクティスとチェックリストを提供します。","ko":"OpenCLAW, Claude Code 및 기타 플랫폼을 사용하여 에이전트가 컨텍스트를 지능적으로 관리하고 저장할 수 있도록 하며, OpenCLAW 및 컨텍스트 저장 도구에 특정 파일 형식과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 효율적인 워크플로우에 대한 모범 사례 및 체크리스트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar y guardar contextos de manera inteligente mediante OpenCLAW, Claude Code y otras plataformas, proporcionando las mejores prácticas y listas de verificación para flujos de trabajo eficientes a través de protocolos como OpenCLAW y formatos de archivo específicos para herramientas de guardar contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et d''enregistrer des contextes de manière intelligente à l''aide d''OpenCLAW, de Claude Code et d''autres plateformes, en fournissant les meilleures pratiques et les listes de vérification pour des flux de travail efficaces via des protocoles tels qu''OpenCLAW et des formats de fichier spécifiques aux outils d''enregistrement de contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Kontexte intelligent zu verwalten und zu speichern, indem es OpenCLAW, Claude Code und andere Plattformen nutzt und bewährte Verfahren und Prüflisten für effiziente Workflows über Protokolle wie OpenCLAW und Dateiformate, die speziell für Kontext-Speicher-Tools entwickelt wurden, bereitstellt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar e salvar contexto de forma inteligente usando OpenCLAW, Claude Code e outras plataformas, fornecendo as melhores práticas e listas de verificação para fluxos de trabalho eficientes por meio de protocolos como OpenCLAW e formatos de arquivo específicos para ferramentas de salvamento de contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально управлять и сохранять контекст, используя OpenCLAW, Claude Code и другие платформы, предоставляя лучшие практики и чек-листы для эффективных рабочих процессов через протоколы, такие как OpenCLAW, и форматы файлов, специфичные для инструментов сохранения контекста.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة السياق وحفظه بذكاء باستخدام OpenCLAW و Claude Code ومنصات أخرى، وتوفير أفضل الممارسات وقوائم التحقق لتدفقات العمل الفعالة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل OpenCLAW وتنسيقات الملفات المحددة لأدوات حفظ السياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating context save tasks","Generating checklists for context management","Debugging context save tool workflows"],"zh":["自动化上下文保存任务","为上下文管理生成检查清单","调试上下文保存工具工作流"],"ja":["コンテキスト保存タスクの自動化","コンテキスト管理のチェックリストの生成","コンテキスト保存ツールのワークフローのデバッグ"],"ko":["컨텍스트 저장 작업 자동화","컨텍스트 관리를 위한 체크리스트 생성","컨텍스트 저장 도구 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de guardar contexto","Generar listas de verificación para la gestión de contexto","Depurar flujos de trabajo de herramientas de guardar contexto"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches d''enregistrement de contexte","Générer des listes de vérification pour la gestion de contexte","Déboguer les flux de travail des outils d''enregistrement de contexte"],"de":["Automatisieren von Kontext-Speichertasks","Erstellen von Prüflisten für die Kontextverwaltung","Fehlerbehebung in Workflows von Kontext-Speicher-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de salvamento de contexto","Gerar listas de verificação para gerenciamento de contexto","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de ferramentas de salvamento de contexto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи сохранения контекста","Генерировать чек-листы для управления контекстом","Отладить рабочие процессы инструментов сохранения контекста"],"ar":["تحسين مهام حفظ السياق تلقائيًا","إنتاج قوائم التحقق لإدارة السياق","تصحيح أخطاء سير عمل أدوات حفظ السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires context save tool: intelligent context management specialist tasks or workflows","Limited to context save tool: intelligent context management specialist domain"],"zh":["需要上下文保存工具：智能上下文管理专家任务或工作流","仅限上下文保存工具：智能上下文管理专家领域"],"ja":["コンテキスト保存ツールが必要：智能コンテキスト管理スペシャリストのタスクまたはワークフロー","コンテキスト保存ツールに限定：智能コンテキスト管理スペシャリストのドメイン"],"ko":["컨텍스트 저장 도구 필요: 지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가 작업 또는 워크플로우","컨텍스트 저장 도구로 제한: 지능형 컨텍스트 관리 전문가 도메인"],"es":["Requiere herramienta de guardar contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente, tareas o flujos de trabajo","Limitado a herramienta de guardar contexto: especialista en gestión de contexto inteligente, dominio"],"fr":["Nécessite un outil d''enregistrement de contexte : tâches ou flux de travail de spécialiste de gestion de contexte intelligente","Limité à l''outil d''enregistrement de contexte : domaine de spécialiste de gestion de contexte intelligente"],"de":["Benötigt Kontext-Speicher-Tool: intelligente Kontextverwaltungsspezialist, Aufgaben oder Workflows","Eingeschränkt auf Kontext-Speicher-Tool: intelligente Kontextverwaltungsspezialist, Domäne"],"pt":["Exige ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: tarefas ou fluxos de trabalho de especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente","Limitado a ferramenta de salvamento de contexto: domínio de especialista em gerenciamento de contexto inteligente"],"ru":["Требует инструментов сохранения контекста: задачи или рабочие процессы специалиста по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом","Ограничен инструментами сохранения контекста: домен специалиста по интеллектуальному управлению контекстом"],"ar":["يتطلب أداة حفظ السياق: مهام أو سير عمل خبير في إدارة السياق الذكية","محدود بأداة حفظ السياق: نطاق خبير في إدارة السياق الذكية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
