os para Desenvolvedores","ru":"IDAPython: Современные модули для разработчиков","ar":"إيدابيثون: موديلات حديثة للمطورين","en":"idapython"},"description":{"zh":"IDAPython是一种用于IDA Pro的Python脚本，使用现代ida_*模块进行开发","ja":"IDAPythonは、IDA Pro用のPythonスクリプトで、モダンなida_*モジュールを使用する","ko":"IDAPython은 IDA Pro용 Python 스크립트로, 최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용합니다","es":"IDAPython es una poderosa herramienta para desarrollar scripts para IDA utilizando módulos modernos. Ofrece una amplia gama de funcionalidades para el anális...","fr":"IDAPython est un outil puissant pour développer des scripts pour IDA en utilisant des modules modernes. Il offre une large gamme de fonctionnalités pour l''an...","de":"IDAPython ist ein leistungsstarkes Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Skripten für IDA unter Verwendung moderner Module. Es bietet eine breite Palette von Funktionen...","pt":"IDAPython é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores que desejam criar aplicações personalizadas. Use módulos modernos para melhorar sua produtividade.","ru":"IDAPython - это мощный инструмент для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать индивидуальные приложения. Используйте современные модули, чтобы повысить произв...","ar":"إيدابيثون هي أداة قوية للمطورين الذين يرغبون في إنشاء تطبيقات مخصصة. استخدم الموديلات الحديثة لتحسين إنتاجيتك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用现代ida_*模块","避免使用过时的idc模块","支持Bytes/memory操作","支持Functions操作","支持Names操作","支持Types操作"],"ja":["モダンなida_*モジュールを使用","過時したidcモジュールを避ける","Bytes/memory操作をサポート","Functions操作をサポート","Names操作をサポート","Types操作をサポート"],"ko":["최신 ida_* 모듈을 사용","구식 idc 모듈을 피함","Bytes/memory 연산 지원","Functions 연산 지원","Names 연산 지원","Types 연산 지원"],"es":["Módulos modernos para el análisis de código","Funcionalidades para la manipulación de bytes y memoria","Soporte para la descompilación de funciones","Gestión de nombres y tipos de datos","Integración con el descompilador IDA Hexrays"],"fr":["Modules modernes pour l''analyse de code","Fonctionnalités pour la manipulation de bytes et de mémoire","Prise en charge de la désassemblage de fonctions","Gestion des noms et des types de données","Intégration avec le désassembleur IDA Hexrays"],"de":["Moderne Module für die Code-Analyse","Funktionen für die Manipulation von Bytes und Speicher","Unterstützung für die Dekompilierung von Funktionen","Verwaltung von Namen und Datentypen","Integration mit dem Dekompilierer IDA Hexrays"],"pt":["Módulos modernos para análise de binários","Suporte a bytes e memória","Gerenciamento de funções e nomes","Tipos e informações de tipo","Descompilador integrado"],"ru":["Современные модули для анализа бинарных файлов","Поддержка байтов и памяти","Управление функциями и именами","Типы и информация о типах","Встроенный декомпилятор"],"ar":["موديلات حديثة لتحليل الملفات الثنائية","دعم البايتات والذاكرة","إدارة الدوال والأسماء","الأنواع ومعلومات النوع","مفكك مدمج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["IDAPython","IDA Pro","Python脚本","自动化","开发","ida_*模块","idc模块"],"ja":["IDAPython","IDA Pro","Pythonスクリプト","自動化","開発","ida_*モジュール","idcモジュール"],"ko":["IDAPython","IDA Pro","Python 스크립트","자동화","개발","ida_* 모듈","idc 모듈"],"es":["IDAPython","desarrollo de scripts","análisis de código","manipulación de bytes","descompilación de funciones","IDA Hexrays","módulos modernos"],"fr":["IDAPython","développement de scripts","analyse de code","manipulation de bytes","désassemblage de fonctions","IDA Hexrays","modules modernes"],"de":["IDAPython","Skriptentwicklung","Code-Analyse","Manipulation von Bytes","Dekompilierung von Funktionen","IDA Hexrays","moderne Module"],"pt":["IDAPython","análise de binários","desenvolvimento de aplicações","módulos modernos","produtividade","desenvolvedores","programação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["IDAPython","анализ бинарных файлов","разработка приложений","современные модули","производительность","разработчики","программирование","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إيدابيثون","تحليل الملفات الثنائية","تطوير التطبيقات","موديلات حديثة","إنتاجية","مطورون","برمجة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"QYmag1c","repo":"ida-pro-mcp-multi","repoPath":"QYmag1c/ida-pro-mcp-multi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"idapython","description":"IDA Pro Python scripting for reverse engineering. Use when writing IDAPython scripts, analyzing binaries, working with IDAs API for disassembly, decompilation (Hex-Rays), type systems, cross-references, functions, segments, or any IDA database manipulation. Covers ida_* modules (50+), idautils iterators, and common patterns.","bodyPreview":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `","body":"# IDAPython\n\nUse modern `ida_*` modules. Avoid legacy `idc` module.\n\n## Module Router\n\n| Task | Module | Key Items |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| Bytes/memory | `ida_bytes` | `get_bytes`, `patch_bytes`, `get_flags`, `create_*` |\n| Functions | `ida_funcs` | `func_t`, `get_func`, `add_func`, `get_func_name` |\n| Names | `ida_name` | `set_name`, `get_name`, `demangle_name` |\n| Types | `ida_typeinf` | `tinfo_t`, `apply_tinfo`, `parse_decl` |\n| Decompiler | `ida_hexrays` | `decompile`, `cfunc_t`, `lvar_t`, ctree visitor |\n| Segments | `ida_segment` | `segment_t`, `getseg`, `add_segm` |\n| Xrefs | `ida_xref` | `xrefblk_t`, `add_cref`, `add_dref` |\n| Instructions | `ida_ua` | `insn_t`, `op_t`, `decode_insn` |\n| Stack frames | `ida_frame` | `get_frame`, `define_stkvar` |\n| Iteration | `idautils` | `Functions()`, `Heads()`, `XrefsTo()`, `Strings()` |\n| UI/dialogs | `ida_kernwin` | `msg`, `ask_*`, `jumpto`, `Choose` |\n| Database info | `ida_ida` | `inf_get_*`, `inf_is_64bit()` |\n| Analysis | `ida_auto` | `auto_wait`, `plan_and_wait` |\n| Flow graphs | `ida_gdl` | `FlowChart`, `BasicBlock` |\n| Register tracking | `ida_regfinder` | `find_reg_value`, `reg_value_info_t` |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Iterate functions\n```python\nfor ea in idautils.Functions():\n    name = ida_funcs.get_func_name(ea)\n    func = ida_funcs.get_func(ea)\n```\n\n### Iterate instructions in function\n```python\nfor head in idautils.FuncItems(func_ea):\n    insn = ida_ua.insn_t()\n    if ida_ua.decode_insn(insn, head):\n        print(f\"{head:#x}: {insn.itype}\")\n```\n\n### Cross-references\n```python\nfor xref in idautils.XrefsTo(ea):\n    print(f\"{xref.frm:#x} -> {xref.to:#x} type={xref.type}\")\n```\n\n### Read/write bytes\n```python\ndata = ida_bytes.get_bytes(ea, size)\nida_bytes.patch_bytes(ea, b\"\\x90\\x90\")\n```\n\n### Names\n```python\nname = ida_name.get_name(ea)\nida_name.set_name(ea, \"new_name\", ida_name.SN_NOCHECK)\n```\n\n### Decompile function\n```python\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nif cfunc:\n    print(cfunc)  # pseudocode\n    for lvar in cfunc.lvars:\n        print(f\"{lvar.name}: {lvar.type()}\")\n```\n\n### Walk ctree (decompiled AST)\n```python\nclass MyVisitor(ida_hexrays.ctree_visitor_t):\n    def visit_expr(self, e):\n        if e.op == ida_hexrays.cot_call:\n            print(f\"Call at {e.ea:#x}\")\n        return 0\n\ncfunc = ida_hexrays.decompile(ea)\nMyVisitor().apply_to(cfunc.body, None)\n```\n\n### Apply type\n```python\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\nif ida_typeinf.parse_decl(tif, None, \"int (*)(char *, int)\", 0):\n    ida_typeinf.apply_tinfo(ea, tif, ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE)\n```\n\n### Create structure\n```python\nudt = ida_typeinf.udt_type_data_t()\nm = ida_typeinf.udm_t()\nm.name = \"field1\"\nm.type = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t(ida_typeinf.BTF_INT32)\nm.offset = 0\nm.size = 4\nudt.push_back(m)\ntif = ida_typeinf.tinfo_t()\ntif.create_udt(udt, ida_typeinf.BTF_STRUCT)\ntif.set_named_type(ida_typeinf.get_idati(), \"MyStruct\")\n```\n\n### Strings list\n```python\nfor s in idautils.Strings():\n    print(f\"{s.ea:#x}: {str(s)}\")\n```\n\n### Wait for analysis\n```python\nida_auto.auto_wait()  # Block until autoanalysis completes\n```\n\n## Key Constants\n\n| Constant | Value/Use |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `BADADDR` | Invalid address sentinel |\n| `ida_name.SN_NOCHECK` | Skip name validation |\n| `ida_typeinf.TINFO_DEFINITE` | Force type application |\n| `o_reg`, `o_mem`, `o_imm`, `o_displ`, `o_near` | Operand types |\n| `dt_byte`, `dt_word`, `dt_dword`, `dt_qword` | Data types |\n| `fl_CF`, `fl_CN`, `fl_JF`, `fl_JN`, `fl_F` | Code xref types |\n| `dr_R`, `dr_W`, `dr_O` | Data xref types |\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **NEVER convert hex/decimal manually** — use `int_convert` MCP tool\n2. **Wait for analysis**: Call `ida_auto.auto_wait()` before reading results\n3. **Thread safety**: IDA SDK calls must run on main thread (use `@idasync`)\n4. **64-bit addresses**: Always assume `ea_t` can be 64-bit\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Do Instead |\n|-------|------------|\n| `idc.*` functions | Use `ida_*` modules |\n| Hardcoded addresses | Use names, patterns, or xrefs |\n| Manual hex conversion | Use `int_convert` tool |\n| Blocking main thread | Use `execute_sync()` for long ops |\n| Guessing at types | Derive from disassembly/decompilation |\n\n## Detailed API Reference\n\nFor comprehensive documentation on any module, read `docs/<module>.md`:\n- **High-use**: `ida_bytes`, `ida_funcs`, `ida_hexrays`, `ida_typeinf`, `ida_name`, `idautils`\n- **Medium-use**: `ida_segment`, `ida_xref`, `ida_ua`, `ida_frame`, `ida_kernwin`\n- **Specialized**: `ida_dbg` (debugger), `ida_nalt` (netnode storage), `ida_regfinder` (register tracking)\n\nFull RST sources from hex-rays.com available at `docs/<module>.rst`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:03.489Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced binary analysis and manipulation capabilities using idapython","zh":"非常适合需要使用idapython进行高级二进制分析和操作的逆向工程代理","ja":"Idapythonを使用した高度なバイナリ分析および操作機能を必要とする逆向きエンジニアリングエージェントに最適","ko":"idapython을 사용하여 고급 바이너리 분석 및 조작 기능이 필요한 역공학 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Ingeniería Inversa que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis y manipulación de binarios utilizando idapython","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénierie inverse ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse et de manipulation de binaires avancées utilisant idapython","de":"Perfekt für Reverse-Engineering-Agents, die erweiterte Binär-Analyse- und Manipulationsfunktionen mit idapython benötigen","pt":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced binary analysis and manipulation capabilities using idapython","ru":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced binary analysis and manipulation capabilities using idapython","ar":"Perfect for Reverse Engineering Agents needing advanced binary analysis and manipulation capabilities using idapython"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with IDA Pro databases using modern `ida_*` modules, providing capabilities such as byte patching with `ida_bytes`, function analysis with `ida_funcs`, and decompilation with `ida_hexrays`","zh":"赋予代理交互式IDA Pro数据库的能力，使用现代`ida_*`模块，提供诸如使用`ida_bytes`进行字节补丁、使用`ida_funcs`进行函数分析以及使用`ida_hexrays`进行反编译等功能","ja":"エージェントに、モダンな`ida_*`モジュールを使用してIDA Proデータベースとやり取りする能力を与え、`ida_bytes`を使用したバイトパッチング、`ida_funcs`を使用した関数分析、`ida_hexrays`を使用したデコンパイルなどの機能を提供する","ko":"에이전트에게 현대적인 `ida_*` 모듈을 사용하여 IDA Pro 데이터베이스와 상호 작용할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여, `ida_bytes`를 사용한 바이트 패치, `ida_funcs`를 사용한 함수 분석, `ida_hexrays`를 사용한 디컴파일 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con bases de datos de IDA Pro utilizando módulos modernos `ida_*`, proporcionando capacidades como el parcheado de bytes con `ida_bytes`, el análisis de funciones con `ida_funcs` y la descompilación con `ida_hexrays`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec les bases de données IDA Pro en utilisant des modules modernes `ida_*`, fournissant des fonctionnalités telles que le patchage de bytes avec `ida_bytes`, l''analyse de fonctions avec `ida_funcs` et la désassemblage avec `ida_hexrays`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, mit IDA Pro-Datenbanken zu interagieren, indem sie moderne `ida_*`-Module verwenden, und bietet Funktionen wie Byte-Patching mit `ida_bytes`, Funktionsanalyse mit `ida_funcs` und Dekompilierung mit `ida_hexrays`","pt":"Empowers agents to interact with IDA Pro databases using modern `ida_*` modules, providing capabilities such as byte patching with `ida_bytes`, function analysis with `ida_funcs`, and decompilation with `ida_hexrays`","ru":"Empowers agents to interact with IDA Pro databases using modern `ida_*` modules, providing capabilities such as byte patching with `ida_bytes`, function analysis with `ida_funcs`, and decompilation with `ida_hexrays`","ar":"Empowers agents to interact with IDA Pro databases using modern `ida_*` modules, providing capabilities such as byte patching with `ida_bytes`, function analysis with `ida_funcs`, and decompilation with `ida_hexrays`"},"useCases":{"en":["Decompiling binaries for vulnerability analysis","Patching bytes in memory for dynamic analysis","Analyzing functions for reverse engineering purposes"],"zh":["为了漏洞分析而反编译二进制文件","为了动态分析而在内存中修补字节","为了逆向工程目的而分析函数"],"ja":["脆弱性分析のためにバイナリをデコンパイルする","動的分析のためにメモリ内のバイトをパッチする","逆向きエンジニアリングのために関数を分析する"],"ko":["취약점 분석을 위해 바이너리를 디컴파일하는 것","동적 분석을 위해 메모리 내 바이트를 패치하는 것","역공학 목적으로 함수를 분석하는 것"],"es":["Descompilar binarios para análisis de vulnerabilidades","Parchear bytes en memoria para análisis dinámico","Analizar funciones para fines de ingeniería inversa"],"fr":["Désassembler des binaires pour l''analyse des vulnérabilités","Patcher des bytes en mémoire pour l''analyse dynamique","Analyser des fonctions pour des fins d''ingénierie inverse"],"de":["Binärdateien für Schwachstellenanalyse dekompilieren","Bytes im Speicher für dynamische Analyse patchen","Funktionen für Reverse-Engineering-Zwecke analysieren"],"pt":["Decompiling binaries for vulnerability analysis","Patching bytes in memory for dynamic analysis","Analyzing functions for reverse engineering purposes"],"ru":["Decompiling binaries for vulnerability analysis","Patching bytes in memory for dynamic analysis","Analyzing functions for reverse engineering purposes"],"ar":["Decompiling binaries for vulnerability analysis","Patching bytes in memory for dynamic analysis","Analyzing functions for reverse engineering purposes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IDA Pro installation","Python scripting required","Avoids legacy `idc` module, uses modern `ida_*` modules only"],"zh":["需要IDA Pro安装","需要Python脚本","避免使用遗留的`idc`模块，只使用现代的`ida_*`模块"],"ja":["IDA Proのインストールが必要","Pythonスクリプトが必要","レガシーの`idc`モジュールは使用せず、モダンな`ida_*`モジュールのみを使用"],"ko":["IDA Pro 설치가 필요","파이썬 스크립트가 필요","레거시 `idc` 모듈을 사용하지 않음, 현대적인 `ida_*` 모듈만을 사용"],"es":["Requiere instalación de IDA Pro","Se requiere scripting de Python","Evita el módulo de herencia `idc`, solo utiliza módulos modernos `ida_*`"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation d''IDA Pro","Le scripting Python est requis","Évite le module hérité `idc`, n''utilise que des modules modernes `ida_*`"],"de":["Benötigt IDA Pro-Installation","Python-Skripting erforderlich","Vermeidet Legacy-`idc`-Modul, verwendet nur moderne `ida_*`-Module"],"pt":["Requires IDA Pro installation","Python scripting required","Avoids legacy `idc` module, uses modern `ida_*` modules only"],"ru":["Requires IDA Pro installation","Python scripting required","Avoids legacy `idc` module, uses modern `ida_*` modules only"],"ar":["Requires IDA Pro installation","Python scripting required","Avoids legacy `idc` module, uses modern `ida_*` modules only"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
