Manager SDK를 사용","애플리케이션 성능 모니터링 기능을 제공","환경 변수 설정을 지원"],"es":["Administración de recursos de Application Insights","Monitoreo del rendimiento de las aplicaciones","Instalación sencilla con NuGet","Compatibilidad con la versión 2022-06-15 de la API","Soporte para autenticación con Azure.Identity"],"fr":["Gestion des ressources Application Insights","Surveillance des performances des applications","Installation facile avec NuGet","Compatibilité avec la version 2022-06-15 de l''API","Prise en charge de l''authentification avec Azure.Identity"],"de":["Verwaltung von Application Insights-Ressourcen","Überwachung der Leistung von Anwendungen","Einfache Installation mit NuGet","Kompatibilität mit der Version 2022-06-15 der API","Unterstützung für Authentifizierung mit Azure.Identity"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de recursos do Application Insights","Monitoramento de desempenho do aplicativo","Instalação via NuGet","Compatibilidade com .NET","Suporte à autenticação do Azure","Gerenciamento de grupos de recursos do Azure"],"ru":["Управление ресурсами Application Insights","Мониторинг производительности приложения","Установка через NuGet","Совместимость с .NET","Поддержка аутентификации Azure","Управление группами ресурсов Azure"],"ar":["إدارة موارد Application Insights","مراقبة أداء التطبيق","التثبيت عبر NuGet","التوافق مع .NET","دعم مصادقة Azure","إدارة مجموعات موارد Azure"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure 应用程序洞察","Azure 资源管理器",".NET SDK","应用程序性能监控","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","环境变量配置"],"ja":["Azure Application Insights","Azure Resource Manager",".NET SDK","アプリケーションのパフォーマンス モニタリング","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","環境変数の設定"],"ko":["Azure 애플리케이션 인사이트","Azure Resource Manager",".NET SDK","애플리케이션 성능 모니터링","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","환경 변수 설정"],"es":["Azure","Application Insights",".NET","SDK","monitoreo de rendimiento","administración de recursos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights"],"fr":["Azure","Application Insights",".NET","SDK","surveillance des performances","gestion des ressources","développement d''applications","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights"],"de":["Azure","Application Insights",".NET","SDK","Leistungsüberwachung","Ressourcenverwaltung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights"],"pt":["Azure Application Insights .NET","SDK do Azure Resource Manager","Gerenciamento de recursos","Monitoramento de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Azure .NET","Application Insights","Azure Resource Manager"],"ru":["Azure Application Insights для .NET","SDK Azure Resource Manager","Управление ресурсами","Мониторинг производительности","Разработка приложений","Azure .NET","Application Insights","Azure Resource Manager"],"ar":["Azure Application Insights .NET","SDK Azure Resource Manager","إدارة موارد","مراقبة الأداء","تطوير التطبيقات","Azure .NET","Application Insights","Azure Resource Manager"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-mgmt-applicationinsights-dotnet","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights (.NET)\n\nAzure Resource Manager SDK for managing Application Insights resources for application performance monitoring.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n```\n\n**Current Version**: v1.0.0 (GA)  \n**API Version**: 2022-06-15\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=<your-subscription-id>\nAZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP=<your-resource-group>\nAZURE_APPINSIGHTS_NAME=<y","body":"# Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights (.NET)\n\nAzure Resource Manager SDK for managing Application Insights resources for application performance monitoring.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights\ndotnet add package Azure.Identity\n```\n\n**Current Version**: v1.0.0 (GA)  \n**API Version**: 2022-06-15\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nAZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=<your-subscription-id>\nAZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP=<your-resource-group>\nAZURE_APPINSIGHTS_NAME=<your-appinsights-component>\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.Identity;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights;\n\nArmClient client = new ArmClient(new DefaultAzureCredential());\n```\n\n## Resource Hierarchy\n\n```\nSubscription\n└── ResourceGroup\n    └── ApplicationInsightsComponent          # App Insights resource\n        ├── ApplicationInsightsComponentApiKey  # API keys for programmatic access\n        ├── ComponentLinkedStorageAccount      # Linked storage for data export\n        └── (via component ID)\n            ├── WebTest                        # Availability tests\n            ├── Workbook                       # Workbooks for analysis\n            ├── WorkbookTemplate               # Workbook templates\n            └── MyWorkbook                     # Private workbooks\n```\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create Application Insights Component (Workspace-based)\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights;\nusing Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights.Models;\n\nResourceGroupResource resourceGroup = await client\n    .GetDefaultSubscriptionAsync()\n    .Result\n    .GetResourceGroupAsync(\"my-resource-group\");\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentCollection components = resourceGroup.GetApplicationInsightsComponents();\n\n// Workspace-based Application Insights (recommended)\nApplicationInsightsComponentData data = new ApplicationInsightsComponentData(\n    AzureLocation.EastUS,\n    ApplicationInsightsApplicationType.Web)\n{\n    Kind = \"web\",\n    WorkspaceResourceId = new ResourceIdentifier(\n        \"/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/<workspace-name>\"),\n    IngestionMode = IngestionMode.LogAnalytics,\n    PublicNetworkAccessForIngestion = PublicNetworkAccessType.Enabled,\n    PublicNetworkAccessForQuery = PublicNetworkAccessType.Enabled,\n    RetentionInDays = 90,\n    SamplingPercentage = 100,\n    DisableIPMasking = false,\n    ImmediatePurgeDataOn30Days = false,\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { \"environment\", \"production\" },\n        { \"application\", \"mywebapp\" }\n    }\n};\n\nArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await components\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", data);\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = operation.Value;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Component created: {component.Data.Name}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Instrumentation Key: {component.Data.InstrumentationKey}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Connection String: {component.Data.ConnectionString}\");\n```\n\n### 2. Get Connection String and Keys\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\n// Get connection string for SDK configuration\nstring connectionString = component.Data.ConnectionString;\nstring instrumentationKey = component.Data.InstrumentationKey;\nstring appId = component.Data.AppId;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Connection String: {connectionString}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Instrumentation Key: {instrumentationKey}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"App ID: {appId}\");\n```\n\n### 3. Create API Key\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyCollection apiKeys = component.GetApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeys();\n\n// API key for reading telemetry\nApplicationInsightsApiKeyContent keyContent = new ApplicationInsightsApiKeyContent\n{\n    Name = \"ReadTelemetryKey\",\n    LinkedReadProperties =\n    {\n        $\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/{component.Data.Name}/api\",\n        $\"/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/{component.Data.Name}/agentconfig\"\n    }\n};\n\nApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyResource apiKey = await apiKeys\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, keyContent);\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"API Key Name: {apiKey.Data.Name}\");\nConsole.WriteLine($\"API Key: {apiKey.Data.ApiKey}\"); // Only shown once!\n```\n\n### 4. Create Web Test (Availability Test)\n\n```csharp\nWebTestCollection webTests = resourceGroup.GetWebTests();\n\n// URL Ping Test\nWebTestData urlPingTest = new WebTestData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    Kind = WebTestKind.Ping,\n    SyntheticMonitorId = \"webtest-ping-myapp\",\n    WebTestName = \"Homepage Availability\",\n    Description = \"Checks if homepage is available\",\n    IsEnabled = true,\n    Frequency = 300, // 5 minutes\n    Timeout = 120,   // 2 minutes\n    WebTestKind = WebTestKind.Ping,\n    IsRetryEnabled = true,\n    Locations =\n    {\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-ca-sjc-azr\" },  // West US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-tx-sn1-azr\" },  // South Central US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-il-ch1-azr\" },  // North Central US\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"emea-gb-db3-azr\" }, // UK South\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"apac-sg-sin-azr\" }  // Southeast Asia\n    },\n    Configuration = new WebTestConfiguration\n    {\n        WebTest = \"\"\"\n            <WebTest Name=\"Homepage\" Enabled=\"True\" Timeout=\"120\" \n                     xmlns=\"http://microsoft.com/schemas/VisualStudio/TeamTest/2010\">\n                <Items>\n                    <Request Method=\"GET\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"120\" ParseDependentRequests=\"False\" \n                             FollowRedirects=\"True\" RecordResult=\"True\" Cache=\"False\" \n                             ResponseTimeGoal=\"0\" Encoding=\"utf-8\" ExpectedHttpStatusCode=\"200\" />\n                </Items>\n            </WebTest>\n        \"\"\"\n    },\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { $\"hidden-link:/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/my-appinsights\", \"Resource\" }\n    }\n};\n\nArmOperation<WebTestResource> operation = await webTests\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"webtest-homepage\", urlPingTest);\n\nWebTestResource webTest = operation.Value;\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Web test created: {webTest.Data.Name}\");\n```\n\n### 5. Create Multi-Step Web Test\n\n```csharp\nWebTestData multiStepTest = new WebTestData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    Kind = WebTestKind.MultiStep,\n    SyntheticMonitorId = \"webtest-multistep-login\",\n    WebTestName = \"Login Flow Test\",\n    Description = \"Tests login functionality\",\n    IsEnabled = true,\n    Frequency = 900, // 15 minutes\n    Timeout = 300,   // 5 minutes\n    WebTestKind = WebTestKind.MultiStep,\n    IsRetryEnabled = true,\n    Locations =\n    {\n        new WebTestGeolocation { WebTestLocationId = \"us-ca-sjc-azr\" }\n    },\n    Configuration = new WebTestConfiguration\n    {\n        WebTest = \"\"\"\n            <WebTest Name=\"LoginFlow\" Enabled=\"True\" Timeout=\"300\"\n                     xmlns=\"http://microsoft.com/schemas/VisualStudio/TeamTest/2010\">\n                <Items>\n                    <Request Method=\"GET\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com/login\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"60\" />\n                    <Request Method=\"POST\" Version=\"1.1\" Url=\"https://myapp.example.com/api/auth\" \n                             ThinkTime=\"0\" Timeout=\"60\">\n                        <Headers>\n                            <Header Name=\"Content-Type\" Value=\"application/json\" />\n                        </Headers>\n                        <Body>{\"username\":\"testuser\",\"password\":\"{{TestPassword}}\"}</Body>\n                    </Request>\n                </Items>\n            </WebTest>\n        \"\"\"\n    },\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { $\"hidden-link:/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/microsoft.insights/components/my-appinsights\", \"Resource\" }\n    }\n};\n\nawait webTests.CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"webtest-login-flow\", multiStepTest);\n```\n\n### 6. Create Workbook\n\n```csharp\nWorkbookCollection workbooks = resourceGroup.GetWorkbooks();\n\nWorkbookData workbookData = new WorkbookData(AzureLocation.EastUS)\n{\n    DisplayName = \"Application Performance Dashboard\",\n    Category = \"workbook\",\n    Kind = WorkbookSharedTypeKind.Shared,\n    SerializedData = \"\"\"\n    {\n        \"version\": \"Notebook/1.0\",\n        \"items\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": 1,\n                \"content\": {\n                    \"json\": \"# Application Performance\\n\\nThis workbook shows application performance metrics.\"\n                },\n                \"name\": \"header\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": 3,\n                \"content\": {\n                    \"version\": \"KqlItem/1.0\",\n                    \"query\": \"requests\\n| summarize count() by bin(timestamp, 1h)\\n| render timechart\",\n                    \"size\": 0,\n                    \"title\": \"Requests per Hour\",\n                    \"timeContext\": {\n                        \"durationMs\": 86400000\n                    },\n                    \"queryType\": 0,\n                    \"resourceType\": \"microsoft.insights/components\"\n                },\n                \"name\": \"requestsChart\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"isLocked\": false\n    }\n    \"\"\",\n    SourceId = component.Id,\n    Tags =\n    {\n        { \"environment\", \"production\" }\n    }\n};\n\n// Note: Workbook ID should be a new GUID\nstring workbookId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n\nArmOperation<WorkbookResource> operation = await workbooks\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, workbookId, workbookData);\n\nWorkbookResource workbook = operation.Value;\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Workbook created: {workbook.Data.DisplayName}\");\n```\n\n### 7. Link Storage Account\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\nComponentLinkedStorageAccountCollection linkedStorage = component.GetComponentLinkedStorageAccounts();\n\nComponentLinkedStorageAccountData storageData = new ComponentLinkedStorageAccountData\n{\n    LinkedStorageAccount = new ResourceIdentifier(\n        \"/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/<storage-account>\")\n};\n\nArmOperation<ComponentLinkedStorageAccountResource> operation = await linkedStorage\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, StorageType.ServiceProfiler, storageData);\n```\n\n### 8. List and Manage Components\n\n```csharp\n// List all Application Insights components in resource group\nawait foreach (ApplicationInsightsComponentResource component in \n    resourceGroup.GetApplicationInsightsComponents())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Component: {component.Data.Name}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  App ID: {component.Data.AppId}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Type: {component.Data.ApplicationType}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Ingestion Mode: {component.Data.IngestionMode}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Retention: {component.Data.RetentionInDays} days\");\n}\n\n// List web tests\nawait foreach (WebTestResource webTest in resourceGroup.GetWebTests())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Web Test: {webTest.Data.WebTestName}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Enabled: {webTest.Data.IsEnabled}\");\n    Console.WriteLine($\"  Frequency: {webTest.Data.Frequency}s\");\n}\n\n// List workbooks\nawait foreach (WorkbookResource workbook in resourceGroup.GetWorkbooks())\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Workbook: {workbook.Data.DisplayName}\");\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Update Component\n\n```csharp\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\n\n// Update using full data (PUT operation)\nApplicationInsightsComponentData updateData = component.Data;\nupdateData.RetentionInDays = 180;\nupdateData.SamplingPercentage = 50;\nupdateData.Tags[\"updated\"] = \"true\";\n\nArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponents()\n    .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", updateData);\n```\n\n### 10. Delete Resources\n\n```csharp\n// Delete Application Insights component\nApplicationInsightsComponentResource component = await resourceGroup\n    .GetApplicationInsightsComponentAsync(\"my-appinsights\");\nawait component.DeleteAsync(WaitUntil.Completed);\n\n// Delete web test\nWebTestResource webTest = await resourceGroup.GetWebTestAsync(\"webtest-homepage\");\nawait webTest.DeleteAsync(WaitUntil.Completed);\n```\n\n## Key Types Reference\n\n| Type | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentResource` | App Insights component |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentData` | Component configuration |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentCollection` | Collection of components |\n| `ApplicationInsightsComponentApiKeyResource` | API key for programmatic access |\n| `WebTestResource` | Availability/web test |\n| `WebTestData` | Web test configuration |\n| `WorkbookResource` | Analysis workbook |\n| `WorkbookData` | Workbook configuration |\n| `ComponentLinkedStorageAccountResource` | Linked storage for exports |\n\n## Application Types\n\n| Type | Enum Value |\n|------|------------|\n| Web Application | `Web` |\n| iOS Application | `iOS` |\n| Java Application | `Java` |\n| Node.js Application | `NodeJS` |\n| .NET Application | `MRT` |\n| Other | `Other` |\n\n## Web Test Locations\n\n| Location ID | Region |\n|-------------|--------|\n| `us-ca-sjc-azr` | West US |\n| `us-tx-sn1-azr` | South Central US |\n| `us-il-ch1-azr` | North Central US |\n| `us-va-ash-azr` | East US |\n| `emea-gb-db3-azr` | UK South |\n| `emea-nl-ams-azr` | West Europe |\n| `emea-fr-pra-edge` | France Central |\n| `apac-sg-sin-azr` | Southeast Asia |\n| `apac-hk-hkn-azr` | East Asia |\n| `apac-jp-kaw-edge` | Japan East |\n| `latam-br-gru-edge` | Brazil South |\n| `emea-au-syd-edge` | Australia East |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use workspace-based** — Workspace-based App Insights is the current standard\n2. **Link to Log Analytics** — Store data in Log Analytics for better querying\n3. **Set appropriate retention** — Balance cost vs. data availability\n4. **Use sampling** — Reduce costs for high-volume applications\n5. **Store connection string securely** — Use Key Vault or managed identity\n6. **Enable multiple test locations** — For accurate availability monitoring\n7. **Use workbooks** — For custom dashboards and analysis\n8. **Set up alerts** — Based on availability tests and metrics\n9. **Tag resources** — For cost allocation and organization\n10. **Use private endpoints** — For secure data ingestion\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```csharp\nusing Azure;\n\ntry\n{\n    ArmOperation<ApplicationInsightsComponentResource> operation = await components\n        .CreateOrUpdateAsync(WaitUntil.Completed, \"my-appinsights\", data);\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex) when (ex.Status == 409)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(\"Component already exists\");\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex) when (ex.Status == 400)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Invalid configuration: {ex.Message}\");\n}\ncatch (RequestFailedException ex)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Azure error: {ex.Status} - {ex.Message}\");\n}\n```\n\n## SDK Integration\n\nUse the connection string with Application Insights SDK:\n\n```csharp\n// Program.cs in ASP.NET Core\nbuilder.Services.AddApplicationInsightsTelemetry(options =>\n{\n    options.ConnectionString = configuration[\"ApplicationInsights:ConnectionString\"];\n});\n\n// Or set via environment variable\n// APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING=InstrumentationKey=...;IngestionEndpoint=...\n```\n\n## Related SDKs\n\n| SDK | Purpose | Install |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights` | Resource management (this SDK) | `dotnet add package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights` |\n| `Microsoft.ApplicationInsights` | Telemetry SDK | `dotnet add package Microsoft.ApplicationInsights` |\n| `Microsoft.ApplicationInsights.AspNetCore` | ASP.NET Core integration | `dotnet add package Microsoft.ApplicationInsights.AspNetCore` |\n| `Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter` | OpenTelemetry export | `dotnet add package Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter` |\n\n## Reference Links\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| NuGet Package | https://www.nuget.org/packages/Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights |\n| API Reference | https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/azure.resourcemanager.applicationinsights |\n| Product Documentation | https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/app/app-insights-overview |\n| GitHub Source | https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/tree/main/sdk/applicationinsights/Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:31.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for .NET-based AI Agents requiring advanced application performance monitoring and Azure Resource Manager integration.","zh":"适用于需要高级应用程序性能监视和Azure资源管理器集成的基于.NET的AI代理。","ja":".NETベースのAIエージェントに高级なアプリケーションのパフォーマンス監視とAzure Resource Manager統合が必要な場合に最適。","ko":"고급 애플리케이션 성능 모니터링 및 Azure Resource Manager 통합이 필요한 .NET 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en .NET que requieren un monitoreo avanzado de rendimiento de aplicaciones y una integración con Azure Resource Manager.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur .NET nécessitant un suivi avancé des performances des applications et une intégration à Azure Resource Manager.","de":"Ideal für .NET-basierte KI-Agents, die ein erweitertes Anwendungsleistungsmonitoring und eine Azure Resource Manager-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em .NET que exigem monitoramento avançado de desempenho de aplicativos e integração com o Azure Resource Manager.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе .NET, требующих расширенного мониторинга производительности приложений и интеграции с Azure Resource Manager.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على .NET الذي يتطلب مراقبة متقدمة لأداء التطبيقات وتكامل مع Azure Resource Manager."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Application Insights resources using the Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights SDK, enabling seamless application performance monitoring and leveraging Azure.Identity for secure authentication, all while utilizing the 2022-06-15 API version.","zh":"赋予代理使用Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights SDK管理Application Insights资源的能力，实现无缝的应用程序性能监视，并利用Azure.Identity进行安全身份验证，同时使用2022-06-15 API版本。","ja":"Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights SDKを使用してApplication Insightsリソースを管理するエージェントの能力を付与し、シームレスなアプリケーションのパフォーマンス監視を可能にし、Azure.Identityを使用してセキュアな認証を行い、2022-06-15 APIバージョンを使用。","ko":"Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights SDK를 사용하여 Application Insights 리소스를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, 무중단 애플리케이션 성능 모니터링을 가능하게 하며, Azure.Identity를 사용하여 보안 인증을 수행하며, 2022-06-15 API 버전을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar recursos de Application Insights mediante el SDK Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, lo que permite un monitoreo de rendimiento de aplicaciones sin problemas y aprovecha Azure.Identity para autenticación segura, todo mientras utiliza la versión de API del 2022-06-15.","fr":"Équipe les agents pour gérer les ressources Application Insights à l''aide du SDK Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, permettant un suivi des performances des applications sans accroc et exploitant Azure.Identity pour une authentification sécurisée, le tout en utilisant la version d''API 2022-06-15.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Application Insights-Ressourcen mit dem Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights-SDK zu verwalten, ermöglicht so ein nahtloses Anwendungsleistungsmonitoring und nutzt Azure.Identity für sichere Authentifizierung, und zwar unter Verwendung der API-Version 2022-06-15.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar recursos do Application Insights usando o SDK do Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, permitindo o monitoramento de desempenho de aplicativos sem interrupções e aproveitando o Azure.Identity para autenticação segura, tudo isso utilizando a versão da API 2022-06-15.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять ресурсами Application Insights с помощью SDK Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights, обеспечивая бесшовный мониторинг производительности приложений и использует Azure.Identity для безопасной аутентификации, все это при использовании версии API 2022-06-15.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إدارة مورد Application Insights باستخدام SDK Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights ، وتمكين مراقبة أداء التطبيقات بشكل سلس واستخدام Azure.Identity للتحقق من الصحة بشكل آمن ، وكل ذلك باستخدام إصدار API 2022-06-15."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Application Insights resource deployment","Monitoring application performance metrics using Azure Resource Manager","Integrating Azure.Identity for secure authentication in .NET applications"],"zh":["自动化Application Insights资源部署","使用Azure Resource Manager监视应用程序性能指标","在.NET应用程序中集成Azure.Identity进行安全身份验证"],"ja":["Application Insightsリソースのデプロイの自動化","Azure Resource Managerを使用したアプリケーションのパフォーマンスメトリックの監視",".NETアプリケーションでAzure.Identityを使用したセキュアな認証の統合"],"ko":["Application Insights 리소스 배포 자동화","Azure Resource Manager를 사용한 애플리케이션 성능 메트릭 모니터링",".NET 애플리케이션에서 Azure.Identity를 사용한 보안 인증 통합"],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de recursos de Application Insights","Supervisar las métricas de rendimiento de aplicaciones mediante Azure Resource Manager","Integrar Azure.Identity para autenticación segura en aplicaciones .NET"],"fr":["Automatiser le déploiement de ressources Application Insights","Surveiller les métriques de performances des applications à l''aide d''Azure Resource Manager","Intégrer Azure.Identity pour une authentification sécurisée dans les applications .NET"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereitstellung von Application Insights-Ressourcen","Überwachen von Anwendungsleistungsmetriken mit Azure Resource Manager","Integrieren von Azure.Identity für sichere Authentifizierung in .NET-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a implantação de recursos do Application Insights","Monitorar métricas de desempenho de aplicativos usando o Azure Resource Manager","Integrar o Azure.Identity para autenticação segura em aplicativos .NET"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание ресурсов Application Insights","Отслеживать метрики производительности приложений с помощью Azure Resource Manager","Интегрировать Azure.Identity для безопасной аутентификации в приложениях .NET"],"ar":["أتمتة نشر مورد Application Insights","مراقبة معايير أداء التطبيقات باستخدام Azure Resource Manager","دمج Azure.Identity للتحقق من الصحة بشكل آمن في تطبيقات .NET"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure subscription and resource group setup","Limited to .NET environment with Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights package","Dependent on Azure.Identity package for authentication"],"zh":["需要Azure订阅和资源组设置","仅限于具有Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights包的.NET环境","依赖于Azure.Identity包进行身份验证"],"ja":["Azureサブスクリプションとリソースグループの設定が必要","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsightsパッケージを含む.NET環境に限定","Azure.Identityパッケージへの依存による認証"],"ko":["Azure 구독 및 리소스 그룹 설정이 필요합니다.","Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights 패키지를 포함하는 .NET 환경에限定됩니다.","Azure.Identity 패키지에 의존하여 인증합니다."],"es":["Requiere una suscripción y configuración de grupo de recursos de Azure","Limitado al entorno .NET con paquete Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","Dependiente del paquete Azure.Identity para la autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite un abonnement et une configuration de groupe de ressources Azure","Limité à l''environnement .NET avec le package Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","Dépendant du package Azure.Identity pour l''authentification"],"de":["Erfordert ein Azure-Abonnement und eine Ressourcengruppen-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf .NET-Umgebung mit Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights-Paket","Abhängig vom Azure.Identity-Paket für Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Exige assinatura do Azure e configuração de grupo de recursos","Limitado ao ambiente .NET com pacote Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","Dependente do pacote Azure.Identity para autenticação"],"ru":["Требует подписки Azure и настройки группы ресурсов","Ограничен средой .NET с пакетом Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","Зависит от пакета Azure.Identity для аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب اشتراك في Azure وضبط مجموعة مورد","محدود بالبيئة .NET مع حزمة Azure.ResourceManager.ApplicationInsights","يعتمد على حزمة Azure.Identity للتحقق من الصحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cgaeking/ClawRouter/clawrouter', 'community', 'cgaeking', 'ClawRouter', 'cgaeking/ClawRouter', 'clawrouter', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:48:28.380Z', NULL, '{"id":"cgaeking/ClawRouter/clawrouter","name":"clawrouter","description":{"zh":"ClawRouter是一种智能LLM路由器，能够节省78%的推理成本，支持30+个模型和5个提供商","ja":"ClawRouterはスマートLLMルーターで、78%の推論コストを節約し、30以上のモデルと5つのプロバイダーをサポートします","ko":"클로우 라우터는 스마트 LLM 라우터로, 78%의 추론 비용을 절감하고 30개 이상의 모델 및 5개 제공업체를 지원합니다","es":"ClawRouter es un enrutador LLM inteligente que ahorra un 78% en costos de inferencia al enrutar cada solicitud al modelo más barato que pueda manejarla.","fr":"ClawRouter est un routeur LLM intelligent qui économise 78% sur les coûts d''inférence en routant chaque requête vers le modèle le moins cher qui peut la gérer.","de":"ClawRouter ist ein intelligenter LLM-Router, der 78% der Inferenzkosten spart, indem er jede Anfrage an das günstigste Modell weiterleitet, das sie verarbeiten kann.","pt":"O ClawRouter é um roteador de LLM inteligente que reduz custos de inferência escolhendo o modelo mais barato para cada solicitação","ru":"ClawRouter - это умный маршрутизатор LLM, который снижает затраты на вывод, выбирая самый дешевый модель для каждой запроса","ar":"ClawRouter هو مُوجّه ذكاء LLM يقلل من تكاليف الاستدلال عن طريق اختيار الطراز الأرخص لكل طلب","en":"Smart LLM router with direct API keys + OpenRouter support. Fork of BlockRunAI/ClawRouter without crypto payments."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ClawRouter智能LLM路由器","ja":"ClawRouterスマートLLMルーター","ko":"클로우 라우터 스마트 LLM 라우터","es":"ClawRouter: Enrutador LLM Inteligente","fr":"ClawRouter: Routeur LLM Intelligent","de":"ClawRouter: Intelligentes LLM-Router","pt":"ClawRouter: Roteador Inteligente de LLM","ru":"ClawRouter: Умный маршрутизатор LLM","ar":"ClawRouter: مُوجّه ذكاء LLM","en":"clawrouter"},"description":{"zh":"ClawRouter是一种智能LLM路由器，能够节省78%的推理成本，支持30+个模型和5个提供商","ja":"ClawRouterはスマートLLMルーターで、78%の推論コストを節約し、30以上のモデルと5つのプロバイダーをサポートします","ko":"클로우 라우터는 스마트 LLM 라우터로, 78%의 추론 비용을 절감하고 30개 이상의 모델 및 5개 제공업체를 지원합니다","es":"ClawRouter es un enrutador LLM inteligente que ahorra un 78% en costos de inferencia al enrutar cada solicitud al modelo más barato que pueda manejarla.","fr":"ClawRouter est un routeur LLM intelligent qui économise 78% sur les coûts d''inférence en routant chaque requête vers le modèle le moins cher qui peut la gérer.","de":"ClawRouter ist ein intelligenter LLM-Router, der 78% der Inferenzkosten spart, indem er jede Anfrage an das günstigste Modell weiterleitet, das sie verarbeit...","pt":"O ClawRouter é um roteador de LLM inteligente que reduz custos de inferência escolhendo o modelo mais barato para cada solicitação","ru":"ClawRouter - это умный маршрутизатор LLM, который снижает затраты на вывод, выбирая самый дешевый модель для каждой запроса","ar":"ClawRouter هو مُوجّه ذكاء LLM يقلل من تكاليف الاستدلال عن طريق اختيار الطراز الأرخص لكل طلب","en":"Smart LLM router with direct API keys + OpenRouter support. Fork of BlockRunAI/ClawRouter without crypto payments."},"definition":{"en":"Smart LLM router with direct API keys + OpenRouter support. Fork of BlockRunAI/ClawRouter without crypto payments."},"features":{"zh":["智能路由","支持30+个模型","支持5个提供商","节省78%的推理成本","简单的安装和设置","支持OpenRouter"],"ja":["スマートルーティング","30以上のモデルをサポート","5つのプロバイダーをサポート","78%の推論コストを節約","簡単なインストールと設定","OpenRouterをサポート"],"ko":["스마트 라우팅","30개 이상의 모델 지원","5개 제공업체 지원","78%의 추론 비용 절감","간단한 설치 및 설정","OpenRouter 지원"],"es":["Enrutamiento inteligente para reducir costos de inferencia","Compatibilidad con 30+ modelos de 5 proveedores","Soporte para OpenRouter","Instalación sencilla con openclaw","Selección automática del modelo más barato","Posibilidad de anclar un modelo específico"],"fr":["Enrutamiento intelligent pour réduire les coûts d''inférence","Compatibilité avec 30+ modèles de 5 fournisseurs","Support pour OpenRouter","Installation simple avec openclaw","Sélection automatique du modèle le moins cher","Possibilité d''ancrire un modèle spécifique"],"de":["Intelligentes Routing zur Reduzierung der Inferenzkosten","Kompatibilität mit 30+ Modellen von 5 Anbietern","Unterstützung für OpenRouter","Einfache Installation mit openclaw","Automatische Auswahl des günstigsten Modells","Möglichkeit, ein bestimmtes Modell zu verwenden"],"pt":["Redução de 78% nos custos de inferência","Roteamento inteligente para o modelo mais barato","Suporte a 30+ modelos em 5 provedores","Uso de uma única carteira para todos os modelos","Instalação fácil com o comando openclaw","Configuração flexível com opções de roteamento personalizadas"],"ru":["Снижение на 78% затрат на вывод","Умный маршрутизатор для самого дешевого модели","Поддержка 30+ моделей от 5 провайдеров","Использование одной кошелька для всех моделей","Легкая установка с помощью команды openclaw","Гибкая настройка с возможностью настройки маршрутизации"],"ar":["تخفيض 78% من تكاليف الاستدلال","مُوجّه ذكاء للطراز الأرخص","دعم 30+ طرازًا من 5 مزودين","استخدام محفظة واحدة لجميع الطرازات","تثبيت سهل باستخدام الأمر openclaw","إعداد مرن مع خيارات مُوجّه مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ClawRouter","智能LLM路由器","推理成本节省","模型路由","OpenRouter","LLM","机器学习","人工智能"],"ja":["ClawRouter","スマートLLMルーター","推論コスト節約","モデルルーティング","OpenRouter","LLM","機械学習","人工知能"],"ko":["클로우 라우터","스마트 LLM 라우터","추론 비용 절감","모델 라우팅","OpenRouter","LLM","기계 학습","인공 지능"],"es":["ClawRouter","enrutador LLM","reducción de costos de inferencia","modelos de lenguaje grande","OpenRouter","openclaw","desarrollo de inteligencia artificial","optimización de costos","tecnología de lenguaje natural"],"fr":["ClawRouter","routeur LLM","réduction des coûts d''inférence","modèles de langage","OpenRouter","openclaw","développement d''intelligence artificielle","optimisation des coûts","technologie de traitement du langage naturel"],"de":["ClawRouter","LLM-Router","Reduzierung der Inferenzkosten","große Sprachmodelle","OpenRouter","openclaw","Entwicklung künstlicher Intelligenz","Kostenoptimierung","Technologie für natürliche Sprachverarbeitung"],"pt":["ClawRouter","roteador de LLM","redução de custos","inferência","modelos de LLM","OpenRouter","API","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["ClawRouter","маршрутизатор LLM","снижение затрат","вывод","модели LLM","OpenRouter","API","разработка программного обеспечения","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["ClawRouter","مُوجّه LLM","تخفيض التكاليف","استدلال","طرازات LLM","OpenRouter","API","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"cgaeking","repo":"ClawRouter","repoPath":"cgaeking/ClawRouter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clawrouter","description":"Smart LLM router — save 78% on inference costs. Routes every request to the cheapest capable model across 30+ models from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, and xAI.","bodyPreview":"# ClawRouter\n\nSmart LLM router that saves 78% on inference costs by routing each request to the cheapest model that can handle it. 30+ models across 5 providers, all through one wallet.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install @blockrun/clawrouter\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\n# Enable smart routing (auto-picks cheapest model per request)\nopenclaw models set blockrun/auto\n\n# Or pin a specific model\nopenclaw models set openai/gpt-4o\n```\n\n## How Routing Works\n\nClawRouter classifies each request into","body":"# ClawRouter\n\nSmart LLM router that saves 78% on inference costs by routing each request to the cheapest model that can handle it. 30+ models across 5 providers, all through one wallet.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nopenclaw plugins install @blockrun/clawrouter\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\n# Enable smart routing (auto-picks cheapest model per request)\nopenclaw models set blockrun/auto\n\n# Or pin a specific model\nopenclaw models set openai/gpt-4o\n```\n\n## How Routing Works\n\nClawRouter classifies each request into one of four tiers:\n\n- **SIMPLE** (40% of traffic) — factual lookups, greetings, translations → Gemini Flash ($0.60/M, 99% savings)\n- **MEDIUM** (30%) — summaries, explanations, data extraction → DeepSeek Chat ($0.42/M, 99% savings)\n- **COMPLEX** (20%) — code generation, multi-step analysis → Claude Opus ($75/M, best quality)\n- **REASONING** (10%) — proofs, formal logic, multi-step math → o3 ($8/M, 89% savings)\n\nRules handle ~80% of requests in <1ms. Only ambiguous queries hit the LLM classifier (~$0.00003 per classification).\n\n## Available Models\n\n30+ models including: gpt-5.2, gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, o3, o4-mini, claude-opus-4.5, claude-sonnet-4, claude-haiku-4.5, gemini-2.5-pro, gemini-2.5-flash, deepseek-chat, deepseek-reasoner, grok-3, grok-3-mini.\n\n## Example Output\n\n```\n[ClawRouter] google/gemini-2.5-flash (SIMPLE, rules, confidence=0.92)\n             Cost: $0.0025 | Baseline: $0.308 | Saved: 99.2%\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:28.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cost-Optimization Agents needing smart LLM routing capabilities with direct API keys and OpenRouter support.","zh":"非常适合需要智能LLM路由功能的成本优化代理，具有直接的API密钥和OpenRouter支持。","ja":"コスト最適化エージェントに最適で、スマートなLLMルーティング機能と直接のAPIキー、およびOpenRouterのサポートを備えています。","ko":"비용 최적화 에이전트에게 적합하며, 스마트한 LLM 라우팅 기능과 직접 API 키, OpenRouter 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de costos que necesitan capacidades de enrutamiento LLM inteligentes con claves de API directas y soporte de OpenRouter.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de coûts qui ont besoin de capacités de routage LLM intelligentes avec des clés d''API directes et de la prise en charge d''OpenRouter.","de":"Perfekt für Cost-Optimization-Agents, die intelligente LLM-Routing-Funktionen mit direkten API-Schlüsseln und OpenRouter-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Custo que precisam de capacidades de roteamento LLM inteligentes com chaves de API diretas e suporte ao OpenRouter.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации затрат, которым необходимы умные возможности маршрутизации LLM с прямыми ключами API и поддержкой OpenRouter.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحسين التكلفة الذين يحتاجون إلىقدرات التوجيه الذكية لنموذج LLM مع مفاتيح API مباشرة ودعم OpenRouter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to route each request to the cheapest model that can handle it, supporting 30+ models across 5 providers through one wallet, utilizing OpenClaw plugins and smart routing with auto-picked cheapest models per request.","zh":"赋予代理将每个请求路由到可以处理它的最便宜的模型的能力，支持30多个模型跨5个提供商，通过一个钱包，利用OpenClaw插件和智能路由，自动选择每个请求的最便宜模型。","ja":"エージェントが各リクエストをそれを処理できる最も安いモデルにルーティングできるようにし、5つのプロバイダーにわたる30以上のモデルを1つのウォレットでサポートし、OpenClawプラグインとスマートルーティングを利用し、自動で各リクエストの最も安いモデルを選択します。","ko":"에이전트가 각 요청을 처리할 수 있는 가장 저렴한 모델로 라우팅할 수 있게 해주며, 5개 이상의 공급자에 걸쳐 30개 이상의 모델을 1개의 지갑을 통해 지원하며, OpenClaw 플러그인 및 스마트 라우팅을 사용하여 각 요청에 대한 가장 저렴한 모델을 자동으로 선택합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para enrutar cada solicitud al modelo más barato que pueda manejarla, admitiendo más de 30 modelos a través de 5 proveedores mediante una sola billetera, utilizando plugins de OpenClaw y enrutamiento inteligente con modelos más baratos seleccionados automáticamente por solicitud.","fr":"Permet aux agents de router chaque demande au modèle le moins cher qui peut la gérer, en prenant en charge 30 modèles ou plus à travers 5 fournisseurs via un seul portefeuille, en utilisant des plugins OpenClaw et un routage intelligent avec des modèles les moins chers sélectionnés automatiquement par demande.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, jede Anfrage an das günstigste Modell zu routen, das sie verarbeiten kann, und unterstützt dabei über 30 Modelle bei 5 Anbietern über eine einzige Brieftasche, wobei OpenClaw-Plugins und intelligente Routing-Funktionen mit automatisch ausgewählten günstigsten Modellen pro Anfrage verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a encaminhar cada solicitação para o modelo mais barato que possa lidar com ela, suportando 30+ modelos em 5 provedores por meio de uma carteira, utilizando plug-ins OpenClaw e roteamento inteligente com modelos mais baratos autopreenchidos por solicitação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью направлять каждый запрос к самой дешевой модели, которая может его обработать, поддерживая 30+ моделей от 5 поставщиков через один кошелек, используя плагины OpenClaw и умное маршрутизация с автоматически выбранными самыми дешевыми моделями для каждого запроса.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توجيه كل طلب إلى أقل نموذج تكلفة يمكنه التعامل معه، يدعم 30+ نموذجًا عبر 5 مزودين من خلال محفظة واحدة، باستخدام إضافات OpenClaw والتوجيه الذكي مع النماذج الأقل تكلفة المحددة تلقائيًا لكل طلب."},"useCases":{"en":["Routing requests to the cheapest compatible LLM model","Automating model selection for cost optimization","Integrating with OpenRouter for seamless model switching"],"zh":["将请求路由到最便宜的兼容LLM模型","自动选择模型以进行成本优化","与OpenRouter集成以实现无缝模型切换"],"ja":["最も安い互換性のあるLLMモデルへのリクエストのルーティング","コスト最適化のための自動モデル選択","OpenRouterとの統合によるシームレスなモデル切り替え"],"ko":["요청을 가장 저렴한 호환되는 LLM 모델로 라우팅","비용 최적화를 위한 모델 자동 선택","OpenRouter와의 통합을 통해 무중단 모델 전환"],"es":["Enrutar solicitudes al modelo LLM compatible más barato","Automatizar la selección de modelos para la optimización de costos","Integrar con OpenRouter para un cambio de modelo sin problemas"],"fr":["Router les demandes vers le modèle LLM compatible le moins cher","Automatiser la sélection de modèles pour l''optimisation des coûts","Intégrer avec OpenRouter pour un commutation de modèle sans problème"],"de":["Anfragen an das günstigste kompatible LLM-Modell routen","Modellauswahl für die Kosteneffizienz automatisieren","Mit OpenRouter integrieren, um ein reibungsloses Modellwechseln zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Encaminhamento de solicitações para o modelo LLM compatível mais barato","Automatização da seleção de modelos para otimização de custos","Integração com OpenRouter para alternância de modelos sem interrupção"],"ru":["Направление запросов к самой дешевой совместимой модели LLM","Автоматизация выбора моделей для оптимизации затрат","Интеграция с OpenRouter для бесшовного переключения моделей"],"ar":["توجيه الطلبات إلى أقل نموذج LLM متوافق تكلفة","تأتمتية اختيار النماذج لتحسين التكلفة","التكامل مع OpenRouter للتبديل السلس بين النماذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenClaw installation and setup","Dependent on availability of supported LLM models and providers"],"zh":["需要OpenClaw的安装和设置","依赖于支持的LLM模型和提供商的可用性"],"ja":["OpenClawのインストールとセットアップが必要","サポートされているLLMモデルとプロバイダーの可用性に依存"],"ko":["OpenClaw 설치 및 설정이 필요","지원되는 LLM 모델 및 공급자의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de OpenClaw","Depende de la disponibilidad de modelos LLM y proveedores compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''OpenClaw","Dépend de la disponibilité des modèles LLM et des fournisseurs pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Einrichtung von OpenClaw","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von unterstützten LLM-Modellen und Anbietern ab"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do OpenClaw","Dependente da disponibilidade de modelos LLM suportados e provedores"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки OpenClaw","Зависит от наличия поддерживаемых моделей LLM и поставщиков"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت إعدادات OpenClaw","يعتمد على توافر نماذج LLM المدعومة والمزودين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/baoyu-url-to-markdown', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'baoyu-url-to-markdown', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:48:40.137Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/baoyu-url-to-markdown","name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":{"zh":"该工具使用Chrome CDP获取任何URL并将HTML转换为干净的Markdown，主要用于开发人员提高效率","ja":"このツールはChrome CDPを使用して任意のURLを取得し、HTMLをきれいなMarkdownに変換します","ko":"이 도구는 Chrome CDP를 사용하여任意 URL을 가져와 HTML을 깨끗한 Markdown로 변환하여 개발자들의 효율성을 높입니다","es":"El skill baoyu-url-to-markdown permite convertir HTML a markdown limpio desde cualquier URL utilizando Chrome CDP.","fr":"Le skill baoyu-url-to-markdown permet de convertir HTML en markdown propre à partir de n''importe quelle URL en utilisant Chrome CDP.","de":"Das Skill baoyu-url-to-markdown ermöglicht die Umwandlung von HTML in sauberes Markdown aus jeder URL mit Chrome CDP.","pt":"O skill baoyu-url-to-markdown é uma ferramenta poderosa que converte URLs em markdown limpo via Chrome CDP.","ru":"Навык baoyu-url-to-markdown - это мощный инструмент, который преобразует URL в чистый markdown через Chrome CDP.","ar":"مهارة baoyu-url-to-markdown هي أداة قوية تحول وصلات إلى markdown نظيف عبر Chrome CDP.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"URL转Markdown工具","ja":"URLをMarkdownに変換","ko":"URL을 Markdown로 변환","es":"Conversor URL a Markdown","fr":"Convertisseur URL en Markdown","de":"URL zu Markdown Konverter","pt":"Conversor de URL para Markdown - baoyu-url-to-markdown","ru":"Преобразователь URL в Markdown - baoyu-url-to-markdown","ar":"مُحَوِّل URL إلى Markdown - baoyu-url-to-markdown","en":"baoyu-url-to-markdown"},"description":{"zh":"该工具使用Chrome CDP获取任何URL并将HTML转