pts/","Suporte à execução de scripts personalizados","Conversão de HTML para markdown limpo","Facilidade de uso e configuração"],"ru":["Преобразование URL в markdown","Использование Chrome CDP для фетча URL","Скрипты расположены в поддиректории scripts/","Поддержка выполнения пользовательских скриптов","Преобразование HTML в чистый markdown","Легкость использования и настройки"],"ar":["تحويل وصلات إلى markdown","استخدام Chrome CDP لاسترجاع وصلات","السكريبتات تقع في المجلد الفرعي scripts/","دعم تشغيل السكريبتات المخصصة","تحويل HTML إلى markdown نظيف","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["URL转Markdown","Chrome CDP","HTML转换","Markdown工具","开发效率","脚本支持"],"ja":["URLをMarkdownに変換","Chrome CDP","HTML変換","Markdownツール","開発効率","スクリプトサポート"],"ko":["URL을 Markdown로 변환","Chrome CDP","HTML 변환","Markdown 도구","개발 효율","스크립트 지원"],"es":["conversor url a markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","html a markdown","desarrollo web","seo"],"fr":["convertisseur url en markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","html en markdown","développement web","référencement"],"de":["url zu markdown konverter","baoyu-url-to-markdown","chrome cdp","html in markdown","webentwicklung","suchmaschinenoptimierung"],"pt":["baoyu-url-to-markdown","conversor de url para markdown","chrome cdp","markdown limpo","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","conversão de url","skillets de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["baoyu-url-to-markdown","преобразователь url в markdown","chrome cdp","чистый markdown","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","преобразование url","навыки разработки"],"ar":["baoyu-url-to-markdown","مُحَوِّل url إلى markdown","chrome cdp","markdown نظيف","تطوير ويب","أدوات التطوير","تحويل url","مهارات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":"Fetch any URL and convert to markdown using Chrome CDP. Supports two modes - auto-capture on page load, or wait for user signal (for pages requiring login). Use when user wants to save a webpage as markdown.","bodyPreview":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.t","body":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for URL fetching |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default output directory | Default capture mode | Timeout settings\n\n## Features\n\n- Chrome CDP for full JavaScript rendering\n- Two capture modes: auto or wait-for-user\n- Clean markdown output with metadata\n- Handles login-required pages via wait mode\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto mode (default) - capture when page loads\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url>\n\n# Wait mode - wait for user signal before capture\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> --wait\n\n# Save to specific file\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> -o output.md\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<url>` | URL to fetch |\n| `-o <path>` | Output file path (default: auto-generated) |\n| `--wait` | Wait for user signal before capturing |\n| `--timeout <ms>` | Page load timeout (default: 30000) |\n\n## Capture Modes\n\n| Mode | Behavior | Use When |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Auto (default) | Capture on network idle | Public pages, static content |\n| Wait (`--wait`) | User signals when ready | Login-required, lazy loading, paywalls |\n\n**Wait mode workflow**:\n1. Run with `--wait` → script outputs \"Press Enter when ready\"\n2. Ask user to confirm page is ready\n3. Send newline to stdin to trigger capture\n\n## Output Format\n\nYAML front matter with `url`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `published`, `captured_at` fields, followed by converted markdown content.\n\n## Output Directory\n\n```\nurl-to-markdown/<domain>/<slug>.md\n```\n\n- `<slug>`: From page title or URL path (kebab-case, 2-6 words)\n- Conflict resolution: Append timestamp `<slug>-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `URL_CHROME_PATH` | Custom Chrome executable path |\n| `URL_DATA_DIR` | Custom data directory |\n| `URL_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Custom Chrome profile directory |\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Chrome not found → set `URL_CHROME_PATH`. Timeout → increase `--timeout`. Complex pages → try `--wait` mode.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:40.137Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Scraping Agents needing to convert HTML content from any URL to clean markdown.","zh":"非常适合需要将任何 URL 的 HTML 内容转换为干净 markdown 的 Web Scraping Agents","ja":"Web Scraping エージェントが任意の URL の HTML コンテンツをクリーンな markdown に変換する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"任意 URL의 HTML 콘텐츠를 깨끗한 마크다운으로 변환해야 하는 웹 스크래핑 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Scraping Web que necesitan convertir contenido HTML de cualquier URL a markdown limpio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de scraping Web ayant besoin de convertir le contenu HTML de n''importe quelle URL en markdown propre.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Scraping-Agents, die HTML-Inhalt von jeder URL in sauberen Markdown umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Scraping da Web que precisam converter conteúdo HTML de qualquer URL para markdown limpo.","ru":"Идеально для веб-скрапинговых агентов, которым необходимо преобразовывать содержимое HTML с любого URL в чистый markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائمين على حصر البيانات من الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل المحتوى HTML من أي URL إلى markdown نظيف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch URLs via Chrome CDP and convert HTML to markdown, utilizing TypeScript scripts for seamless execution, and providing a clean output for further text processing or analysis.","zh":"赋予代理通过 Chrome CDP 获取 URL 并将 HTML 转换为 markdown 的能力，利用 TypeScript 脚本实现无缝执行，并为进一步的文本处理或分析提供干净的输出","ja":"Chrome CDP を使用して URL を取得し、HTML を markdown に変換するエージェントを可能にし、TypeScript スクリプトを使用してシームレスに実行し、さらにテキスト処理または分析のためのクリーンな出力を提供","ko":"에이전트가 Chrome CDP를 통해 URL를 가져와 HTML을 마크다운으로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, TypeScript 스크립트를 사용하여 무缝으로 실행하고, 추가적인 텍스트 처리 또는 분석을 위한 깨끗한 출력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar URLs a través de Chrome CDP y convertir HTML a markdown, utilizando scripts de TypeScript para una ejecución fluida y proporcionando una salida limpia para un procesamiento o análisis de texto adicional.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des URL via Chrome CDP et de convertir le HTML en markdown, en utilisant des scripts TypeScript pour une exécution fluide, et en fournissant une sortie propre pour un traitement ou une analyse de texte ultérieure.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, URLs über Chrome CDP abzurufen und HTML in Markdown umzuwandeln, indem es TypeScript-Skripte für eine nahtlose Ausführung verwendet und eine saubere Ausgabe für weitere Textverarbeitung oder Analyse bereitstellt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar URLs via Chrome CDP e converter HTML para markdown, utilizando scripts TypeScript para execução sem problemas, e fornecendo uma saída limpa para processamento ou análise de texto adicional.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать URL-адреса через Chrome CDP и преобразовывать HTML в markdown, используя скрипты TypeScript для бесшовного выполнения, и обеспечивая чистый вывод для дальнейшей обработки или анализа текста.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع URLs عبر Chrome CDP وتحويل HTML إلى markdown ، باستخدام سكريبتات TypeScript لتنفيذ ملس ، وتوفير إخراج نظيف للمعالجة أو التحليل النصي الإضافي."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting web page content to markdown for text analysis","Fetching and processing HTML tables from websites","Generating markdown documents from online resources"],"zh":["将网页内容转换为 markdown 进行文本分析","从网站获取和处理 HTML 表格","从在线资源生成 markdown 文档"],"ja":["テキスト分析のための Web ページのコンテンツを markdown に変換","Web サイトから HTML テーブルを取得して処理","オンライン リソースから markdown ドキュメントを生成"],"ko":["텍스트 분석을 위한 웹 페이지 콘텐츠를 마크다운으로 변환","웹사이트에서 HTML 테이블을 가져와 처리","온라인 리소스에서 마크다운 문서를 생성"],"es":["Convertir el contenido de la página web a markdown para análisis de texto","Recuperar y procesar tablas HTML de sitios web","Generar documentos markdown a partir de recursos en línea"],"fr":["Convertir le contenu de la page Web en markdown pour l''analyse de texte","Récupérer et traiter des tableaux HTML à partir de sites Web","Générer des documents markdown à partir de ressources en ligne"],"de":["Inhalte von Webseiten in Markdown für die Textanalyse umwandeln","HTML-Tabellen von Webseiten abrufen und verarbeiten","Markdown-Dokumente aus Online-Ressourcen generieren"],"pt":["Conversão de conteúdo de página da web para markdown para análise de texto","Buscar e processar tabelas HTML de sites","Geração de documentos markdown a partir de recursos online"],"ru":["Преобразование содержимого веб-страницы в markdown для анализа текста","Извлечение и обработка таблиц HTML с сайтов","Генерация документов markdown из онлайн-ресурсов"],"ar":["تحويل محتوى صفحة الويب إلى markdown للتحليل النصي","استرجاع ومعالجة جداول HTML من المواقع","توليد مستندات markdown من المصادر المنزلقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome CDP for URL fetching","TypeScript scripts must be executed in the scripts/ subdirectory","Output is limited to markdown format"],"zh":["需要 Chrome CDP 来获取 URL","TypeScript 脚本必须在 scripts/ 子目录中执行","输出仅限于 markdown 格式"],"ja":["URL の取得には Chrome CDP が必要","TypeScript スクリプトは scripts/ サブディレクトリで実行する必要がある","出力は markdown フォーマットのみ"],"ko":["URL 가져오기에는 Chrome CDP가 필요","TypeScript 스크립트는 scripts/ 하위 디렉토리에서 실행되어야 함","출력은 마크다운 형식으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Chrome CDP para la recuperación de URLs","Los scripts de TypeScript deben ejecutarse en el subdirectorio scripts/","La salida está limitada al formato markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite Chrome CDP pour la récupération d''URL","Les scripts TypeScript doivent être exécutés dans le sous-répertoire scripts/","La sortie est limitée au format markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Chrome CDP für das Abrufen von URLs","TypeScript-Skripte müssen im Unterverzeichnis scripts/ ausgeführt werden","Die Ausgabe ist auf das Markdown-Format beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer Chrome CDP para busca de URLs","Os scripts TypeScript devem ser executados no subdiretório scripts/","A saída é limitada ao formato markdown"],"ru":["Требует Chrome CDP для извлечения URL-адресов","Скрипты TypeScript должны выполняться в подкаталоге scripts/","Выход ограничен форматом markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب Chrome CDP لاسترجاع URLs","يتعين تشغيل سكريبتات TypeScript في المجلد الفرعي scripts /","الإخراج مقيد بتنسيق markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/preline-theme-generator', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'preline-theme-generator', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:48:38.103Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/preline-theme-generator","name":"preline-theme-generator","description":{"zh":"Preline 主题生成器用于生成一致的 UI 样式，提供详细的文档和示例。","ja":"Preline テーマ生成器は、一貫した UI スタイルを生成し、詳細なドキュメントと例を提供します。","ko":"Preline 테마 생성기는 일관된 UI 스타일을 생성하며, 자세한 문서와 예제를 제공합니다.","es":"El generador de temas Preline crea archivos CSS para una UI consistente y hermosa. Aprende a utilizarlo con nuestra documentación detallada.","fr":"Le générateur de thèmes Preline crée des fichiers CSS pour une UI cohérente et élégante. Apprenez à l''utiliser avec notre documentation détaillée.","de":"Der Preline Theme Generator erstellt CSS-Dateien für eine konsistente und schöne Benutzeroberfläche. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn mit unserer detaillierten Dokumentation verwenden können.","pt":"O gerador de tema Preline é uma ferramenta que cria arquivos CSS para produzir interfaces de usuário consistentes e bonitas em todos os componentes Preline.","ru":"Генератор темы Preline - это инструмент, который создает файлы CSS для производства единого и красивого UI во всех компонентах Preline.","ar":"مُنشئ موضوع بريلين هو أداة تُنشئ ملفات CSS لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم جميلة ومتناسقة في جميع مكونات بريلين.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Preline 主题生成器 - 自动生成一致的 UI 样式","ja":"Preline テーマ生成器 - 一貫した UI スタイルを自動生成","ko":"Preline 테마 생성기 - 자동으로 일관된 UI 스타일 생성","es":"Generador de Temas Preline: Crea UI Consistentes","fr":"Générateur de Thèmes Preline: Créez des UI Cohérentes","de":"Preline Theme Generator: Erstelle Konsistente UI","pt":"Gerador de Tema Preline: Crie Interfaces Uniformes","ru":"Генератор темы Preline: Создайте единый UI","ar":"مُنشئ موضوع بريلين: أنشئ واجهات مستخدم متسقة","en":"preline-theme-generator"},"description":{"zh":"Preline 主题生成器用于生成一致的 UI 样式，提供详细的文档和示例。","ja":"Preline テーマ生成器は、一貫した UI スタイルを生成し、詳細なドキュメントと例を提供します。","ko":"Preline 테마 생성기는 일관된 UI 스타일을 생성하며, 자세한 문서와 예제를 제공합니다.","es":"El generador de temas Preline crea archivos CSS para una UI consistente y hermosa. Aprende a utilizarlo con nuestra documentación detallada.","fr":"Le générateur de thèmes Preline crée des fichiers CSS pour une UI cohérente et élégante. Apprenez à l''utiliser avec notre documentation détaillée.","de":"Der Preline Theme Generator erstellt CSS-Dateien für eine konsistente und schöne Benutzeroberfläche. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn mit unserer detaillierten Doku...","pt":"O gerador de tema Preline é uma ferramenta que cria arquivos CSS para produzir interfaces de usuário consistentes e bonitas em todos os componentes Preline.","ru":"Генератор темы Preline - это инструмент, который создает файлы CSS для производства единого и красивого UI во всех компонентах Preline.","ar":"مُنشئ موضوع بريلين هو أداة تُنشئ ملفات CSS لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم جميلة ومتناسقة في جميع مكونات بريلين.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["生成一致的 UI 样式","提供详细的文档","包含示例和用例","支持自定义主题","提高用户体验"],"ja":["一貫した UI スタイルを生成","詳細なドキュメントを提供","例とユースケースを含む","カスタムテーマをサポート","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上"],"ko":["일관된 UI 스타일 생성","자세한 문서 제공","예제와 사용 사례 포함","사용자 정의 테마 지원","사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Crea archivos CSS para una UI consistente","Permite personalizar la paleta de colores","Incluye guías detalladas para el proceso de creación","Validación de temas para asegurar la calidad","Ejemplos de uso para inspirar tu desarrollo"],"fr":["Crée des fichiers CSS pour une UI cohérente","Permet de personnaliser la palette de couleurs","Inclut des guides détaillés pour le processus de création","Validation des thèmes pour assurer la qualité","Exemples d''utilisation pour inspirer votre développement"],"de":["Erstellt CSS-Dateien für eine konsistente Benutzeroberfläche","Ermöglicht die Anpassung der Farbpalette","Enthält detaillierte Anleitungen für den Erstellungsprozess","Validierung von Themen für die Qualitätssicherung","Beispiele für die Verwendung, um Ihre Entwicklung zu inspirieren"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos CSS personalizados","Criação de interfaces de usuário consistentes","Compatibilidade com todos os componentes Preline","Guia de estilo e paleta de cores personalizável","Validação e checklist de tokens"],"ru":["Генерация пользовательских файлов CSS","Создание единого UI","Совместимость со всеми компонентами Preline","Настройка стиля и палитры цветов","Валидация и чеклист токенов"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات CSS مخصصة","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم متسقة","التوافق مع جميع مكونات بريلين","تخصيص نمط ولوحة الألوان","التحقق والقائمة المرجعية للأ符ول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Preline 主题生成器","UI 样式","一致性","用户体验","前端开发","CSS 生成"],"ja":["Preline テーマ生成器","UI スタイル","一貫性","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","フロントエンド開発","CSS 生成"],"ko":["Preline 테마 생성기","UI 스타일","일관성","사용자 경험","프론트엔드 개발","CSS 생성"],"es":["generador de temas Preline","UI consistente","CSS para UI","personalización de temas","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["générateur de thèmes Preline","UI cohérente","CSS pour UI","personnalisation de thèmes","développement web","outils de développement"],"de":["Preline Theme Generator","konsistente Benutzeroberfläche","CSS für Benutzeroberflächen","Anpassung von Themen","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["gerador de tema preline","interfaces de usuário consistentes","arquivos css personalizados","componentes preline","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["генератор темы preline","единый ui","пользовательские файлы css","компоненты preline","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مُنشئ موضوع بريلين","واجهات مستخدم متسقة","ملفات css مخصصة","مكونات بريلين","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"preline-theme-generator","description":"Generates beautiful, consistent Preline Theme CSS files. Agent interprets user request, runs build script, delivers complete CSS.","bodyPreview":"# Preline Theme Generator\n\n> **This file is for the AGENT (LLM) only — not end users.**\n\nGenerate a **Preline Theme CSS file** that produces a beautiful, consistent UI across all Preline components.\n\n---\n\n## Docs\n\n- `docs/step-1.md` to `docs/step-7.md` (detailed workflow guidance)\n- `docs/palette-guidance.md` (mood, hue, neutral mapping, OKLCH rules)\n- `docs/validation-checklist.md`\n- `docs/token-reference.md`\n- `docs/examples.md`\n\n---\n\n## Agent workflow (FOLLOW THIS)\n\nWhen user requests a theme","body":"# Preline Theme Generator\n\n> **This file is for the AGENT (LLM) only — not end users.**\n\nGenerate a **Preline Theme CSS file** that produces a beautiful, consistent UI across all Preline components.\n\n---\n\n## Docs\n\n- `docs/step-1.md` to `docs/step-7.md` (detailed workflow guidance)\n- `docs/palette-guidance.md` (mood, hue, neutral mapping, OKLCH rules)\n- `docs/validation-checklist.md`\n- `docs/token-reference.md`\n- `docs/examples.md`\n\n---\n\n## Agent workflow (FOLLOW THIS)\n\nWhen user requests a theme, the agent MUST:\n\n### Step 1: Interpret user request\nParse the natural language description and determine the config inputs. See `docs/step-1.md` and `docs/palette-guidance.md`.\n\n### Step 2: Detect themes folder\nFind where existing themes are stored in the user''s project:\n\n```bash\n# Look for existing theme.css to find the themes folder\nfind . -name \"theme.css\" -path \"*/themes/*\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" 2>/dev/null | head -1\n```\n\nIf no themes folder found: ask user where they want the theme file saved. See `docs/step-2.md`.\n\n### Step 3: Create temp config file (AUTO-RUN, NO PROMPT)\nWrite a JSON config. This must run silently without user approval.\n\n```bash\necho ''{\"name\":\"<theme-name>\",\"hue\":<hue>,\"style\":\"<style>\",\"useCustomDarkGray\":<true|false>,\"tailwindGray\":\"<gray>\"}'' > /tmp/preline-theme-config.json\n```\n\n### Step 4: Run the generator + cleanup (AUTO-RUN, NO PROMPT)\nRun generator and immediately delete temp file in a single command chain. This must run silently without user approval.\n\nOption A (preferred) - use npx if preline is installed:\n\n```bash\nnpx preline-theme-generator /tmp/preline-theme-config.json <themes-folder>/<theme-name>.css && rm /tmp/preline-theme-config.json\n```\n\nOption B - find and run the script directly:\n\n```bash\nnode $(find . -path \"*/preline/skills/theme-generator/scripts/generate-theme.js\" 2>/dev/null | head -1) /tmp/preline-theme-config.json <themes-folder>/<theme-name>.css && rm /tmp/preline-theme-config.json\n```\n\nOption C - if script location is known (e.g., in node_modules):\n\n```bash\nnode node_modules/preline/skills/theme-generator/scripts/generate-theme.js /tmp/preline-theme-config.json <themes-folder>/<theme-name>.css && rm /tmp/preline-theme-config.json\n```\n\n### Step 5: Confirm to user\nTell user the theme was created and show enable snippet:\n\n```css\n/* In your main CSS file */\n@import \"./themes/<theme-name>.css\";\n```\n\n```html\n<!-- On HTML element -->\n<html data-theme=\"theme-<theme-name>\">\n```\n\nSee `docs/step-5.md` and `docs/examples.md` for response examples.\n\n---\n\n## Generated themes include\n- Coherent light + dark modes\n- Safe to ship (valid CSS, correct selectors)\n- No HTML class changes required (only `data-theme` + optional `.dark`)\n- Custom color palettes in `@theme theme-<name> inline { }` block\n\n---\n\n## Example prompts\n\nSimple:\n> \"Create a sunset theme\"\n\nDescriptive:\n> \"Create a theme that feels like a cozy coffee shop — warm browns, cream backgrounds, inviting and calm\"\n\nSpecific:\n> \"Generate a cyberpunk theme with neon cyan accents on dark surfaces\"\n\nBrand-focused:\n> \"Create a theme matching this brand color #2F6BFF — professional, high-clarity SaaS feel\"\n\n---\n\n## RULES (ALL MUST BE FOLLOWED)\n\n### Rule 1 — Do not modify the shipped base theme\n- Never change `theme.css`. Always generate a separate theme file.\n\n### Rule 2 — Theme file MUST include imports in this exact order\nEvery generated theme file MUST begin with:\n\n```css\n@import \"./theme.css\";\n```\n\n### Rule 3 — Theme scoping block placement\nEvery theme file MUST include a scoping block after imports:\n\n```css\n@theme theme-<name> inline {\n  /* Theme scoping - custom palettes only */\n}\n```\n\n**What goes INSIDE this block:**\n- Custom color palettes (soft grays, brand colors) — these create Tailwind utilities\n- Example: `--color-<name>-50: oklch(98% 0.003 <hue>);` through `--color-<name>-950`\n\n**What goes OUTSIDE (in selector blocks):**\n- All semantic token overrides (`--background`, `--primary`, `--navbar-*`, etc.)\n- Tailwind core mappings are owned by the shipped base theme only\n\nSee `docs/palette-guidance.md` for palette construction details and examples.\n\n### Rule 4 — No HTML utility class edits required\n- Theme must NOT require users to change Tailwind utility classes in HTML.\n- Theme activation must work using ONLY:\n  - CSS imports\n  - `data-theme=\"theme-<name>\"`\n- Dark mode may use `.dark` if the project uses it; do not introduce new conventions.\n\n### Rule 5 — Use exact, required theme selectors\nLight mode token overrides MUST be under:\n\n```css\n:root[data-theme=\"theme-<name>\"],\n[data-theme=\"theme-<name>\"] { ... }\n```\n\nDark mode overrides MUST be theme-scoped and use:\n\n```css\n[data-theme=\"theme-<name>\"].dark { ... }\n```\n\n### Rule 6 — Full-theme mode: comprehensive token coverage is REQUIRED\nBecause this generator is full-theme mode, output MUST define a comprehensive set of token values so the theme looks complete and intentional.\n\nAt minimum, the theme MUST define:\n\n#### 6.1 Global surfaces + text\n- `--background`\n- `--background-1`\n- `--background-2`\n- `--background-plain`\n- `--foreground`\n- `--foreground-inverse`\n- `--inverse`\n\n#### 6.2 Borders (full scale)\n- `--border`\n- `--border-line-inverse`\n- `--border-line-1` through `--border-line-8` (coherent scale)\n\n#### 6.3 Primary ramp (full) + primary states\n- `--primary-50` through `--primary-950`\n- `--primary`\n- `--primary-hover`\n- `--primary-focus`\n- `--primary-active`\n- `--primary-checked`\n- `--primary-foreground` (must be readable)\n\n#### 6.4 Secondary / muted / destructive (at least)\n- `--secondary`\n- `--muted`\n- `--destructive`\n- Include related state/variant tokens if they exist in the base naming system.\n\n#### 6.5 Core component groups for a complete theme feel (prefer explicit values)\nProvide explicit values for major component groups so the theme feels cohesive:\n- `--navbar-*`\n- `--sidebar-*`\n- `--card-*`\n- `--dropdown-*`\n- `--select-*`\n- `--overlay-*`\n- `--popover-*`\n- `--tooltip-*`\n- Optionally: `--scrollbar-*`\n- Charts/maps tokens ONLY if included safely (see Rule 10)\n\n**Full-theme output MUST NOT:**\n- put token definitions inside the `@theme` block\n- invent new mappings that force HTML class edits\n\n### Rule 7 — Token naming must match Preline''s token system\n- Do not invent random token names for Preline components.\n- Only introduce new custom tokens if explicitly requested, and keep them isolated and documented in comments.\n\n### Rule 8 — Theme-scoped behavior overrides ONLY\nIf the theme changes behavior (e.g. retro-sharp radii), it MUST be scoped to the theme only.\n\n**Allowed:**\n- Override radius tokens under the theme selector\n- Add `@layer utilities` rules scoped to the theme selector\n\n**Not allowed:**\n- Global `.rounded { ... }` overrides without theme scoping\n- Any behavior overrides that affect non-theme pages\n\n### Rule 9 — Typography tokens are allowed, but font loading is separate by default\nIf fonts are requested, you MAY set:\n- `--font-sans` and/or `--font-serif` and/or `--font-mono`\n\ninside the theme selector.\n\nDo NOT add Google Fonts `@import url(...)` into the theme file unless the user explicitly requests it.\n(Font loading typically belongs in the main CSS entry file.)\n\n### Rule 10 — Charts/maps compatibility rules\nIf adjusting chart/map tokens:\n- Prefer safe formats where required by libraries.\n- Keep any `*-hex` tokens as valid hex values if the ecosystem expects hex.\n- Do not force `oklch(...)` where it may break gradients or third-party rendering.\n\n### Rule 11 — Valid CSS is mandatory\n- No missing braces\n- No invalid selectors\n- No broken comments\n- No duplicate conflicting selectors\n\n### Rule 12 — Output discipline\n- First code block must contain ONLY the generated theme CSS.\n- Optional second code block may contain ONLY the enable snippet.\n- No additional commentary unless explicitly requested.\n\n---\n\n## Required file structure (MUST follow order)\n\n1. **Imports** (`@import \"./theme.css\"`)\n2. **Theme scoping block** (`@theme theme-<name> inline { }`) — contains custom color palettes only\n3. **Light mode theme selector block** (full semantic token set using `var()` references)\n4. **Dark mode theme selector block** (override only what differs, use `var()` for consistency)\n5. **Optional theme-scoped `@layer utilities` overrides** (only if requested)\n\n---\n\n## Additional guidance\n\n- Theme construction details: `docs/step-6.md` and `docs/step-7.md`\n- Palette guidance: `docs/palette-guidance.md`\n- Validation checklist: `docs/validation-checklist.md`\n- Token reference: `docs/token-reference.md`"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:38.103Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced CSS theme generation capabilities for Preline components.","zh":"非常适合需要高级CSS主题生成功能的前端代理，特别是用于Preline组件。","ja":"Prelineコンポーネント用の高度なCSSテーマ生成機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Preline 컴포넌트를 위한 고급 CSS 테마 생성 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de temas CSS para componentes Preline.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de thèmes CSS pour les composants Preline.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte CSS-Themen-Generierungsfunktionen für Preline-Komponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de temas CSS para componentes Preline.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности генерации тем CSS для компонентов Preline.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء مواضيع CSS لمكونات Preline."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate beautiful, consistent UI themes across all Preline components using Preline Theme CSS files, OKLCH color rules, and palette guidance.","zh":"赋予代理生成Preline Theme CSS文件、使用OKLCH颜色规则和调色板指南，跨所有Preline组件创建美丽、统一的UI主题。","ja":"Preline Theme CSSファイル、OKLCHカラールール、およびパレットガイダンスを使用して、すべてのPrelineコンポーネントにわたる美しい、一貫性のあるUIテーマを生成するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"Preline Theme CSS 파일, OKLCH 색상 규칙 및 팔레트 가이드를 사용하여 모든 Preline 컴포넌트에 걸쳐 아름답고 일관된 UI 테마를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar temas de interfaz de usuario hermosos y coherentes en todos los componentes Preline utilizando archivos CSS de tema Preline, reglas de color OKLCH y orientación de paleta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des thèmes d''interface utilisateur beaux et cohérents sur tous les composants Preline en utilisant des fichiers CSS de thème Preline, des règles de couleur OKLCH et des conseils de palette.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, schöne und konsistente Benutzeroberflächen-Themen über alle Preline-Komponenten hinweg zu generieren, indem sie Preline-Themencss-Dateien, OKLCH-Farbenregeln und Palettenrichtlinien verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar temas de UI bonitos e consistentes em todos os componentes Preline usando arquivos CSS do tema Preline, regras de cor OKLCH e orientação de paleta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать красивые и последовательные темы интерфейса пользователя во всех компонентах Preline, используя файлы CSS темы Preline, правила цвета OKLCH и руководство по палитре.","ar":"يمنح العميل قدرة إنشاء مواضيع واجهة المستخدم الجميلة والمتناسقة عبر جميع مكونات Preline باستخدام ملفات CSS لموضوع Preline وقواعد الألوان OKLCH وتوجيه اللوحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Preline Theme CSS files for consistent UI","Creating custom color palettes with mood, hue, and neutral mapping","Validating theme consistency using the validation checklist"],"zh":["为一致的UI生成Preline Theme CSS文件","使用情绪、色调和中性映射创建自定义颜色调色板","使用验证检查表验证主题一致性"],"ja":["一貫性のあるUIのためにPreline Theme CSSファイルを生成する","ムード、色相、ニュートラルマッピングを使用してカスタムカラーパレットを作成する","バリデーションチェックリストを使用してテーマの一貫性を検証する"],"ko":["일관된 UI를 위한 Preline 테마 CSS 파일 생성","무드, 색조, 중립 매핑을 사용하여 사용자 정의 색상 팔레트 생성","검증 체크리스트를 사용하여 테마 일관성 검증"],"es":["Generar archivos CSS de tema Preline para una interfaz de usuario coherente","Crear paletas de colores personalizadas con asignación de estado de ánimo, matiz y neutral","Validar la coherencia del tema utilizando la lista de verificación de validación"],"fr":["Générer des fichiers CSS de thème Preline pour une interface utilisateur cohérente","Créer des palettes de couleurs personnalisées avec une carte d''humeur, de teinte et de neutre","Valider la cohérence du thème à l''aide de la liste de vérification de validation"],"de":["Generieren von Preline-Themencss-Dateien für eine konsistente Benutzeroberfläche","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Farbpaletten mit Stimmungs-, Farbton- und Neutralzuordnung","Überprüfen der Themenkonsistenz mithilfe der Überprüfungs-Checkliste"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos CSS do tema Preline para UI consistente","Criação de paletas de cores personalizadas com mapeamento de humor, tom e neutro","Validação da consistência do tema usando a lista de verificação de validação"],"ru":["Генерация файлов CSS темы Preline для последовательного интерфейса пользователя","Создание пользовательских палитр цветов с отображением настроения, тона и нейтрального цвета","Проверка согласованности темы с помощью контрольного списка проверки"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات CSS لموضوع Preline لواجهة المستخدم المتناسقة","إنشاء لوحات الألوان المخصصة مع تخطيط المزاج واللون والألوان المحايدة","التحقق من الاتساقية للموضوع باستخدام قائمة التحقق من الصحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires documentation guidance from docs/step-1.md to docs/step-7.md","Limited to Preline components only"],"zh":["需要docs/step-1.md到docs/step-7.md的文档指导","仅限Preline组件"],"ja":["docs/step-1.mdからdocs/step-7.mdまでのドキュメントガイダンスが必要","Prelineコンポーネントのみに限定"],"ko":["docs/step-1.md에서 docs/step-7.md까지의 문서 안내가 필요","Preline 컴포넌트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere orientación de la documentación desde docs/step-1.md hasta docs/step-7.md","Limitado solo a componentes Preline"],"fr":["Nécessite une orientation de la documentation de docs/step-1.md à docs/step-7.md","Limité uniquement aux composants Preline"],"de":["Benötigt Dokumentationsanleitung von docs/step-1.md bis docs/step-7.md","Begrenzt auf Preline-Komponenten"],"pt":["Requer orientação da documentação de docs/step-1.md a docs/step-7.md","Limitado a componentes Preline apenas"],"ru":["Требует руководства по документации из docs/step-1.md до docs/step-7.md","Ограничен только компонентами Preline"],"ar":["يتطلب إرشادات الوثائق من docs/step-1.md إلى docs/step-7.md","محدود بمكونات Preline فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
