","en":"baoyu-url-to-markdown"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-url-to-markdown技能可以通过Chrome CDP抓取任何URL并将HTML转换为干净的Markdown","ja":"baoyu-url-to-markdownスキルは、Chrome CDPを使用して任意のURLを取得し、HTMLをクリーンなMarkdownに変換","ko":"baoyu-url-to-markdown 스킬은 Chrome CDP를 사용하여任意의 URL을 가져와 HTML을 깨끗한 Markdown으로 변환","es":"La habilidad baoyu-url-to-markdown es una herramienta de seguridad auditada que convierte HTML a markdown limpio","fr":"Le skill baoyu-url-to-markdown est un outil sécurisé qui convertit l''HTML en markdown propre","de":"Die Fähigkeit baoyu-url-to-markdown ist ein sicherheitsgeprüftes Tool, das HTML in sauberes Markdown konvertiert","pt":"O skill baoyu-url-to-markdown converte URLs em markdown limpo via Chrome CDP. É uma solução de instalação de um clique e verificação de qualidade.","ru":"Навык baoyu-url-to-markdown преобразует URL в чистый markdown через Chrome CDP. Это решение с однократной установкой и проверкой качества.","ar":"المهارة baoyu-url-to-markdown تحول عناوين URL إلى markdown نظيف عبر Chrome CDP. وهي حل تثبيت في خطوة واحدة وتحقق من الجودة.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["一键安装","安全审计","高质量转换","支持Chrome CDP","将HTML转换为干净的Markdown"],"ja":["一クリックインストール","セキュリティ監査","高品質変換","Chrome CDPをサポート","HTMLをクリーンなMarkdownに変換"],"ko":["한 번의 클릭으로 설치","보안 감사","높은 품질의 변환","Chrome CDP 지원","HTML을 깨끗한 Markdown으로 변환"],"es":["Conversión de HTML a markdown limpio","Seguridad auditada","Instalación de un solo clic","Verificación de calidad","Uso de Chrome CDP"],"fr":["Conversion d''HTML en markdown propre","Sécurité auditée","Installation en un seul clic","Vérification de la qualité","Utilisation de Chrome CDP"],"de":["Konvertierung von HTML in sauberes Markdown","Sicherheitsprüfung","Ein-Klick-Installation","Qualitätsprüfung","Verwendung von Chrome CDP"],"pt":["Conversão de URL em markdown limpo","Uso do Chrome CDP para fetch de URLs","Instalação de um clique","Verificação de qualidade","Suporte a scripts personalizados"],"ru":["Преобразование URL в чистый markdown","Использование Chrome CDP для-fetch URL","Однократная установка","Проверка качества","Поддержка пользовательских скриптов"],"ar":["تحويل عنوان URL إلى markdown نظيف","استخدام Chrome CDP لاسترجاع عناوين URL","تثبيت في خطوة واحدة","تحقق من الجودة","دعم السكريبتات المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["URL转Markdown","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","安全审计","一键安装","高质量转换"],"ja":["URLをMarkdownに変換","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","セキュリティ監査","一クリックインストール","高品質変換"],"ko":["URL을 Markdown로 변환","baoyu-url-to-markdown","Chrome CDP","보안 감사","한 번의 클릭으로 설치","높은 품질의 변환"],"es":["conversión de URL a markdown","seguridad de markdown","herramientas de desarrollo","Chrome CDP","markdown limpio","instalación de un solo clic"],"fr":["conversion d''URL en markdown","sécurité de markdown","outils de développement","Chrome CDP","markdown propre","installation en un seul clic"],"de":["Konvertierung von URL in Markdown","Sicherheit von Markdown","Entwicklungstools","Chrome CDP","sauberes Markdown","Ein-Klick-Installation"],"pt":["conversão de url para markdown","chrome cdp","markdown limpo","instalação de um clique","verificação de qualidade","desenvolvimento web","skil baoyu-url-to-markdown"],"ru":["преобразование url в markdown","chrome cdp","чистый markdown","однократная установка","проверка качества","веб-разработка","навык baoyu-url-to-markdown"],"ar":["تحويل عنوان url إلى markdown","chrome cdp","markdown نظيف","تثبيت في خطوة واحدة","تحقق من الجودة","تطوير الويب","مهارة baoyu-url-to-markdown"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-url-to-markdown","description":"Fetch any URL and convert to markdown using Chrome CDP. Supports two modes - auto-capture on page load, or wait for user signal (for pages requiring login). Use when user wants to save a webpage as markdown.","bodyPreview":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.t","body":"# URL to Markdown\n\nFetches any URL via Chrome CDP and converts HTML to clean markdown.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for URL fetching |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-url-to-markdown/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default output directory | Default capture mode | Timeout settings\n\n## Features\n\n- Chrome CDP for full JavaScript rendering\n- Two capture modes: auto or wait-for-user\n- Clean markdown output with metadata\n- Handles login-required pages via wait mode\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto mode (default) - capture when page loads\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url>\n\n# Wait mode - wait for user signal before capture\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> --wait\n\n# Save to specific file\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <url> -o output.md\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<url>` | URL to fetch |\n| `-o <path>` | Output file path (default: auto-generated) |\n| `--wait` | Wait for user signal before capturing |\n| `--timeout <ms>` | Page load timeout (default: 30000) |\n\n## Capture Modes\n\n| Mode | Behavior | Use When |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| Auto (default) | Capture on network idle | Public pages, static content |\n| Wait (`--wait`) | User signals when ready | Login-required, lazy loading, paywalls |\n\n**Wait mode workflow**:\n1. Run with `--wait` → script outputs \"Press Enter when ready\"\n2. Ask user to confirm page is ready\n3. Send newline to stdin to trigger capture\n\n## Output Format\n\nYAML front matter with `url`, `title`, `description`, `author`, `published`, `captured_at` fields, followed by converted markdown content.\n\n## Output Directory\n\n```\nurl-to-markdown/<domain>/<slug>.md\n```\n\n- `<slug>`: From page title or URL path (kebab-case, 2-6 words)\n- Conflict resolution: Append timestamp `<slug>-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `URL_CHROME_PATH` | Custom Chrome executable path |\n| `URL_DATA_DIR` | Custom data directory |\n| `URL_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Custom Chrome profile directory |\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Chrome not found → set `URL_CHROME_PATH`. Timeout → increase `--timeout`. Complex pages → try `--wait` mode.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:48:48.172Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Scraping Agents needing to convert HTML content from URLs to clean markdown format via Chrome CDP.","zh":"适合需要将 URL 的 HTML 内容转换为干净的 markdown 格式的 Web Scraping Agents，通过 Chrome CDP 实现。","ja":"Web Scraping エージェントが URL の HTML コンテンツをクリーンな Markdown フォーマットに変換する必要がある場合に適しています。Chrome CDP を使用します。","ko":"URL의 HTML 콘텐츠를 깨끗한 마크다운 형식으로 변환해야 하는 웹 스크래핑 에이전트에 적합합니다. Chrome CDP를 통해 구현됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de scraping web que necesitan convertir contenido HTML de URLs a formato markdown limpio a través de Chrome CDP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de scraping Web qui ont besoin de convertir le contenu HTML à partir d''URL en format markdown propre via Chrome CDP.","de":"Ideal für Web-Scraping-Agents, die HTML-Inhalte von URLs in ein sauberes Markdown-Format über Chrome CDP umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Web Scraping que precisam converter conteúdo HTML de URLs para formato markdown limpo via Chrome CDP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-скрапинга, которым необходимо преобразовывать содержимое HTML из URL в чистый формат markdown через Chrome CDP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل حفرة الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحويل المحتوى HTML من عناوين URL إلى تنسيق markdown نظيف عبر Chrome CDP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch URLs and convert HTML to markdown using Chrome CDP, providing a clean and readable output format, leveraging quality-verified scripts for seamless execution.","zh":"赋予代理程序通过 Chrome CDP 提取 URL 并将 HTML 转换为 markdown 的能力，提供干净且可读的输出格式，并利用经过验证的脚本实现无缝执行。","ja":"Chrome CDP を使用して URL を取得し、HTML を Markdown に変換するエージェントの能力を提供し、クリーンで読みやすい出力形式を提供し、品質保証済みのスクリプトを使用してシームレスに実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 Chrome CDP를 통해 URL을 가져오고 HTML을 마크다운으로 변환하는 기능을 제공하여 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 출력 형식을 제공하고, 검증된 스크립트를 사용하여 무정지 실행을实现합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar URLs y convertir HTML a markdown utilizando Chrome CDP, proporcionando un formato de salida limpio y legible, aprovechando scripts verificados para una ejecución sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des URL et de convertir le HTML en markdown en utilisant Chrome CDP, fournissant un format de sortie propre et lisible, en exploitant des scripts vérifiés pour une exécution sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, URLs abzurufen und HTML in Markdown umzuwandeln, indem Chrome CDP verwendet wird, und bietet so ein sauberes und lesbares Ausgabeformat, indem qualitätsgeprüfte Skripte für eine reibungslose Ausführung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar URLs e converter HTML para markdown usando Chrome CDP, fornecendo um formato de saída limpo e legível, aproveitando scripts verificados por qualidade para execução sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать URL и преобразовывать HTML в markdown с помощью Chrome CDP, обеспечивая чистый и удобочитаемый формат вывода, используя скрипты, проверенные на качество, для бесперебойного выполнения.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استخراج عناوين URL وتحويل HTML إلى markdown باستخدام Chrome CDP، مع تقديم تنسيق مخرج نظيف وقابل للقراءة، مستفيداً من البرامج النصية المعتمدة على الجودة لتنفيذ بدون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting web pages to markdown for archiving","Fetching and formatting HTML content for text analysis","Generating markdown documents from URLs for further processing"],"zh":["将网页转换为 markdown 格式以进行存档","获取和格式化 HTML 内容以进行文本分析","从 URL 生成 markdown 文档以进行进一步处理"],"ja":["アーカイブのために Web ページを Markdown 形式に変換する","テキスト分析のために HTML コンテンツを取得してフォーマットする","URL から Markdown ドキュメントを生成してさらに処理する"],"ko":["보관을 위해 웹 페이지를 마크다운 형식으로 변환","텍스트 분석을 위해 HTML 콘텐츠를 가져와서 형식화","URL에서 마크다운 문서를 생성하여 추가 처리"],"es":["Convertir páginas web a markdown para archivado","Recuperar y dar formato a contenido HTML para análisis de texto","Generar documentos markdown a partir de URLs para un procesamiento posterior"],"fr":["Convertir des pages Web en markdown pour archivage","Récupérer et formater le contenu HTML pour l''analyse de texte","Générer des documents markdown à partir d''URL pour un traitement ultérieur"],"de":["Webseiten in Markdown für Archivzwecke umwandeln","HTML-Inhalte abrufen und für Textanalyse formatieren","Markdown-Dokumente aus URLs für weitere Verarbeitung generieren"],"pt":["Conversão de páginas da web para markdown para arquivamento","Busca e formatação de conteúdo HTML para análise de texto","Geração de documentos markdown a partir de URLs para processamento adicional"],"ru":["Преобразование веб-страниц в markdown для архивирования","Извлечение и форматирование содержимого HTML для анализа текста","Генерация документов markdown из URL для дальнейшей обработки"],"ar":["تحويل صفحات الويب إلى markdown لأغراض الأرشفة","استخراج وتحويل المحتوى HTML لتحليل النص","توليد مستندات markdown من عناوين URL للمعالجة اللاحقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome CDP for URL fetching","Limited to converting HTML to markdown format"],"zh":["需要 Chrome CDP 来获取 URL","仅限于将 HTML 转换为 markdown 格式"],"ja":["URL を取得するには Chrome CDP が必要","HTML を Markdown 形式に変換することのみに限定される"],"ko":["URL을 가져올 때 Chrome CDP가 필요합니다","HTML을 마크다운 형식으로 변환하는 것만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Chrome CDP para la recuperación de URLs","Limitado a la conversión de HTML a formato markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite Chrome CDP pour la récupération d''URL","Limité à la conversion de HTML en format markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Chrome CDP für das Abrufen von URLs","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von HTML in Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Requer Chrome CDP para busca de URLs","Limitado à conversão de HTML para formato markdown"],"ru":["Требует Chrome CDP для извлечения URL","Ограничен преобразованием HTML в формат markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب Chrome CDP لاستخراج عناوين URL","محدود بتحويل HTML إلى تنسيق markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
