SCAD 技术允许开发者创建、验证和导出 3D 模型，具有参数自定义、视觉预览和 STL 导出等功能","ja":"OpenSCAD スキルは、開発者が 3D モデルを作成、検証、エクスポートできるようにします。パラメータのカスタマイズ、視覚的なプレビュー、STL のエクスポートなどが可能","ko":"OpenSCAD 기술은 개발자가 3D 모델을 생성, 검증 및 내보내기할 수 있도록 합니다. 매개변수 사용자 지정, 시각적 미리 보기 및 STL 내보내기 등","es":"OpenSCAD es una herramienta para crear y exportar modelos 3D. Ofrece personalización de parámetros y vista previa visual.","fr":"OpenSCAD est un outil pour créer et exporter des modèles 3D. Il offre une personnalisation de paramètres et une vue préalable visuelle.","de":"OpenSCAD ist ein Tool zum Erstellen und Exportieren von 3D-Modellen. Es bietet Parameteranpassung und visuelle Vorschau.","pt":"OpenSCAD é uma ferramenta de criação de modelos 3D que permite personalizar parâmetros e visualizar em diferentes ângulos.","ru":"OpenSCAD — это инструмент для создания 3D-моделей, который позволяет настраивать параметры и просматривать с разных углов.","ar":"OpenSCAD هو أداة لإنشاء نماذج 3D التي تسمح بتخصيص المعلمات والمراجعة من زوايا متعددة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["参数自定义","视觉预览","STL 导出","支持 MakerWorld 等 3D 打印平台","多角度预览","命令行工具"],"ja":["パラメータのカスタマイズ","視覚的なプレビュー","STL のエクスポート","MakerWorld などの 3D プリントプラットフォームのサポート","多角度のプレビュー","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["매개변수 사용자 지정","시각적 미리 보기","STL 내보내기","MakerWorld와 같은 3D 프린팅 플랫폼 지원","다중 각도 미리 보기","명령줄 도구"],"es":["Creación de modelos 3D personalizados","Vista previa visual desde múltiples ángulos","Exportación a STL para plataformas de impresión 3D","Personalización de parámetros de modelo","Compatibilidad con MakerWorld"],"fr":["Création de modèles 3D personnalisés","Aperçu visuel sous plusieurs angles","Exportation au format STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D","Personnalisation des paramètres de modèle","Compatibilité avec MakerWorld"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen","Visuelle Vorschau aus mehreren Winkeln","Export in STL-Format für 3D-Druckplattformen","Anpassung von Modellparametern","Kompatibilität mit MakerWorld"],"pt":["Criação de modelos 3D personalizados","Visualização em diferentes ângulos","Exportação para STL para impressão 3D","Suporte a parâmetros personalizados","Pré-visualização de modelos antes da exportação"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских 3D-моделей","Просмотр с разных углов","Экспорт в STL для 3D-печати","Поддержка настраиваемых параметров","Предварительный просмотр моделей перед экспортом"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة","المراجعة من زوايا متعددة","التصدير إلى STL لطباعة 3D","دعم المعلمات المخصصة","المراجعة المسبقة للنماذج قبل التصدير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSCAD","3D 模型","参数自定义","视觉预览","STL 导出","3D 打印","MakerWorld","命令行工具"],"ja":["OpenSCAD","3D モデル","パラメータのカスタマイズ","視覚的なプレビュー","STL のエクスポート","3D プリント","MakerWorld","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["OpenSCAD","3D 모델","매개변수 사용자 지정","시각적 미리 보기","STL 내보내기","3D 프린팅","MakerWorld","명령줄 도구"],"es":["OpenSCAD","modelado 3D","impresión 3D","MakerWorld","STL","personalización de modelos","vista previa 3D","skript de modelado"],"fr":["OpenSCAD","modélisation 3D","impression 3D","MakerWorld","STL","personnalisation de modèles","aperçu 3D","script de modélisation"],"de":["OpenSCAD","3D-Modellierung","3D-Druck","MakerWorld","STL","Modellparameteranpassung","3D-Vorschau","Skript-Modellierung"],"pt":["OpenSCAD","modelos 3D","criação de modelos","impressão 3D","STL","parâmetros personalizados","visualização 3D"],"ru":["OpenSCAD","3D-модели","создание моделей","3D-печать","STL","настраиваемые параметры","3D-визуализация"],"ar":["OpenSCAD","نماذج 3D","إنشاء نماذج","طباعة 3D","STL","معلمات مخصصة","تجسيد 3D"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openscad","description":"Create and render OpenSCAD 3D models. Generate preview images from multiple angles, extract customizable parameters, validate syntax, and export STL files for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.","bodyPreview":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,","body":"# OpenSCAD Skill\n\nCreate, validate, and export OpenSCAD 3D models. Supports parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nOpenSCAD must be installed. Install via Homebrew:\n```bash\nbrew install openscad\n```\n\n## Tools\n\nThis skill provides several tools in the `tools/` directory:\n\n### Preview Generation\n```bash\n# Generate a single preview image\n./tools/preview.sh model.scad output.png [--camera=x,y,z,tx,ty,tz,dist] [--size=800x600]\n\n# Generate multi-angle preview (front, back, left, right, top, iso)\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad output_dir/\n```\n\n### STL Export\n```bash\n# Export to STL for 3D printing\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl [-D ''param=value'']\n```\n\n### Parameter Extraction\n```bash\n# Extract customizable parameters from an OpenSCAD file\n./tools/extract-params.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### Validation\n```bash\n# Check for syntax errors and warnings\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n## Visual Validation (Required)\n\n**Always validate your OpenSCAD models visually after creating or modifying them.**\n\nAfter writing or editing any OpenSCAD file:\n\n1. **Generate multi-angle previews** using `multi-preview.sh`\n2. **View each generated image** using the `read` tool\n3. **Check for issues** from multiple perspectives:\n   - Front/back: Verify symmetry, features, and proportions\n   - Left/right: Check depth and side profiles\n   - Top: Ensure top features are correct\n   - Isometric: Overall shape validation\n4. **Iterate if needed**: If something looks wrong, fix the code and re-validate\n\nThis catches issues that syntax validation alone cannot detect:\n- Inverted normals or inside-out geometry\n- Misaligned features or incorrect boolean operations\n- Proportions that don''t match the intended design\n- Missing or floating geometry\n- Z-fighting or overlapping surfaces\n\n**Never deliver an OpenSCAD model without visually confirming it looks correct from multiple angles.**\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Creating an OpenSCAD Model\n\nWrite OpenSCAD code with customizable parameters at the top:\n\n```openscad\n// Customizable parameters\nwall_thickness = 2;        // [1:0.5:5] Wall thickness in mm\nwidth = 50;                // [20:100] Width in mm\nheight = 30;               // [10:80] Height in mm\nrounded = true;            // Add rounded corners\n\n// Model code below\nmodule main_shape() {\n    if (rounded) {\n        minkowski() {\n            cube([width - 4, width - 4, height - 2]);\n            sphere(r = 2);\n        }\n    } else {\n        cube([width, width, height]);\n    }\n}\n\ndifference() {\n    main_shape();\n    translate([wall_thickness, wall_thickness, wall_thickness])\n        scale([1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1 - 2*wall_thickness/width, 1])\n        main_shape();\n}\n```\n\nParameter comment format:\n- `// [min:max]` - numeric range\n- `// [min:step:max]` - numeric range with step\n- `// [opt1, opt2, opt3]` - dropdown options\n- `// Description text` - plain description\n\n### 2. Validate the Model\n```bash\n./tools/validate.sh model.scad\n```\n\n### 3. Generate Previews\n\nGenerate preview images to visually validate the model:\n```bash\n./tools/multi-preview.sh model.scad ./previews/\n```\n\nThis creates PNG images from multiple angles. Use the `read` tool to view them.\n\n### 4. Export to STL\n```bash\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl\n# With custom parameters:\n./tools/export-stl.sh model.scad output.stl -D ''width=60'' -D ''height=40''\n```\n\n## Camera Positions\n\nCommon camera angles for previews:\n- **Isometric**: `--camera=0,0,0,45,0,45,200`\n- **Front**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,0,200`\n- **Top**: `--camera=0,0,0,0,0,0,200`\n- **Right**: `--camera=0,0,0,90,0,90,200`\n\nFormat: `x,y,z,rotx,roty,rotz,distance`\n\n## MakerWorld Publishing\n\nFor MakerWorld, you typically need:\n1. STL file(s) exported via `export-stl.sh`\n2. Preview images (at least one good isometric view)\n3. A description of customizable parameters\n\nConsider creating a `model.json` with metadata:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Model Name\",\n  \"description\": \"Description for MakerWorld\",\n  \"parameters\": [...],\n  \"tags\": [\"functional\", \"container\", \"organizer\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Example: Full Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create the model (write .scad file)\n\n# 2. Validate syntax\n./tools/validate.sh box.scad\n\n# 3. Generate multi-angle previews\n./tools/multi-preview.sh box.scad ./previews/\n\n# 4. IMPORTANT: View and validate ALL preview images\n#    Use the read tool on each PNG file to visually inspect:\n#    - previews/box_front.png\n#    - previews/box_back.png\n#    - previews/box_left.png\n#    - previews/box_right.png\n#    - previews/box_top.png\n#    - previews/box_iso.png\n#    Look for geometry issues, misalignments, or unexpected results.\n#    If anything looks wrong, go back to step 1 and fix it!\n\n# 5. Extract and review parameters\n./tools/extract-params.sh box.scad\n\n# 6. Export STL with default parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box.stl\n\n# 7. Export STL with custom parameters\n./tools/export-stl.sh box.scad box_large.stl -D ''width=80'' -D ''height=60''\n```\n\n**Remember**: Never skip the visual validation step. Many issues (wrong dimensions, boolean operation errors, inverted geometry) are only visible when you actually look at the rendered model.\n\n## OpenSCAD Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Shapes\n```openscad\ncube([x, y, z]);\nsphere(r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r = radius);\ncylinder(h = height, r1 = bottom_r, r2 = top_r);  // cone\n```\n\n### Transformations\n```openscad\ntranslate([x, y, z]) object();\nrotate([rx, ry, rz]) object();\nscale([sx, sy, sz]) object();\nmirror([x, y, z]) object();\n```\n\n### Boolean Operations\n```openscad\nunion() { a(); b(); }        // combine\ndifference() { a(); b(); }   // subtract b from a\nintersection() { a(); b(); } // overlap only\n```\n\n### Advanced\n```openscad\nlinear_extrude(height) 2d_shape();\nrotate_extrude() 2d_shape();\nhull() { objects(); }        // convex hull\nminkowski() { a(); b(); }    // minkowski sum (rounding)\n```\n\n### 2D Shapes\n```openscad\ncircle(r = radius);\nsquare([x, y]);\npolygon(points = [[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]);\ntext(\"string\", size = 10);\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:49:07.600Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Modeling Agents needing advanced OpenSCAD capabilities for custom 3D model creation and STL export.","zh":"适合需要高级 OpenSCAD 功能的 3D 建模代理，用于自定义 3D 模型创建和 STL 导出。","ja":"高度な OpenSCAD 機能を必要とする 3D モデリング エージェントに最適で、カスタム 3D モデル作成と STL 出力に対応しています。","ko":"고급 OpenSCAD 기능이 필요한 3D 모델링 에이전트에게 적합하며, 사용자 정의 3D 모델 создания와 STL 내보내기용으로 설계되었습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modelado 3D que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de OpenSCAD para la creación de modelos 3D personalizados y exportación de STL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modélisation 3D nécessitant des fonctionnalités OpenSCAD avancées pour la création de modèles 3D personnalisés et l''exportation de STL.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Modeling-Agents, die erweiterte OpenSCAD-Funktionen für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten 3D-Modellen und den Export von STL benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelagem 3D que necessitam de capacidades avançadas do OpenSCAD para criação personalizada de modelos 3D e exportação STL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-моделирования, которым требуются расширенные возможности OpenSCAD для создания пользовательских 3D-моделей и экспорта STL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من OpenSCAD لإنشاء نماذج 3D مخصصة وتصدير STL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and export customizable OpenSCAD 3D models with parameter customization, visual preview from multiple angles, and STL export for 3D printing platforms like MakerWorld, utilizing OpenSCAD''s scripting capabilities and Homebrew installation.","zh":"赋予代理创建、验证和导出可定制的 OpenSCAD 3D 模型的能力，具有参数定制、多角度视觉预览和 STL 导出功能，用于 3D 打印平台，如 MakerWorld，利用 OpenSCAD 的脚本功能和 Homebrew 安装。","ja":"エージェントがカスタマイズ可能な OpenSCAD 3D モデルを作成、検証、エクスポートできるようにし、パラメータのカスタマイズ、複数の視点からの視覚的なプレビュー、STL のエクスポート機能を提供し、3D プリントプラットフォームの MakerWorld に対応し、OpenSCAD のスクリプト機能と Homebrew インストールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 정의 가능한 OpenSCAD 3D 모델을 생성, 확인 및 내보내기 할 수 있도록하며, 매개 변수 사용자 정의, 다중 角度의 시각적 미리 보기 및 3D 인쇄 플랫폼인 MakerWorld 용 STL 내보내기 기능을 제공하며, OpenSCAD의 스크립트 기능 및 홈브류 설치를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, validar y exportar modelos 3D personalizables de OpenSCAD con personalización de parámetros, vista previa visual desde múltiples ángulos y exportación de STL para plataformas de impresión 3D como MakerWorld, utilizando las capacidades de scripting de OpenSCAD y la instalación de Homebrew.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de valider et d''exporter des modèles 3D OpenSCAD personnalisables avec une personnalisation de paramètres, une prévisualisation visuelle sous plusieurs angles et une exportation de STL pour les plateformes d''impression 3D comme MakerWorld, en utilisant les capacités de scripting d''OpenSCAD et l''installation de Homebrew.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, anpassbare OpenSCAD-3D-Modelle mit Parameteranpassung, visueller Vorschau aus mehreren Winkeln und STL-Export für 3D-Druckplattformen wie MakerWorld zu erstellen, zu validieren und zu exportieren, indem sie die Skriptfunktionen von OpenSCAD und die Homebrew-Installation nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, validar e exportar modelos 3D personalizáveis do OpenSCAD com personalização de parâmetros, visualização prévia de múltiplos ângulos e exportação STL para plataformas de impressão 3D como o MakerWorld, utilizando as capacidades de script do OpenSCAD e instalação Homebrew.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, проверять и экспортировать настраиваемые 3D-модели OpenSCAD с настройкой параметров, предварительным просмотром с нескольких углов и экспортом STL для платформ 3D-печати, таких как MakerWorld, используя возможности скриптов OpenSCAD и установку Homebrew.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء واختبار وتصدير نماذج 3D مخصصة من OpenSCAD مع تخصيص المعلمات وتنبؤات بصرية متعددة الزوايا وتصدير STL منصات الطباعة 3D مثل MakerWorld، باستخدام إمكانات البرمجة من OpenSCAD وتثبيت Homebrew."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D model previews from multiple angles","Creating customizable 3D models with parameter modification","Exporting STL files for 3D printing"],"zh":["从多个角度生成 3D 模型预览","创建具有参数修改的可定制 3D 模型","导出 3D 打印用 STL 文件"],"ja":["複数の視点からの 3D モデル プレビューの生成","パラメータの変更を含むカスタマイズ可能な 3D モデルの作成","3D プリント用の STL ファイルのエクスポート"],"ko":["다중 角度의 3D 모델 프리뷰 생성","매개 변수 수정을含은 사용자 정의 가능한 3D 모델 생성","3D 인쇄용 STL 파일 내보내기"],"es":["Generación de vistas previas de modelos 3D desde múltiples ángulos","Creación de modelos 3D personalizables con modificación de parámetros","Exportación de archivos STL para la impresión 3D"],"fr":["Génération d''aperçus de modèles 3D sous plusieurs angles","Création de modèles 3D personnalisables avec modification de paramètres","Exportation de fichiers STL pour l''impression 3D"],"de":["Erstellung von Vorschauen von 3D-Modellen aus mehreren Winkeln","Erstellung von anpassbaren 3D-Modellen mit Parametermodifikation","Export von STL-Dateien für den 3D-Druck"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações prévias de modelos 3D de múltiplos ângulos","Criação de modelos 3D personalizáveis com modificação de parâmetros","Exportação de arquivos STL para plataformas de impressão 3D"],"ru":["Генерация предварительных просмотров 3D-моделей с нескольких углов","Создание настраиваемых 3D-моделей с изменением параметров","Экспорт файлов STL для платформ 3D-печати"],"ar":["生成 معاينة مسبقة لنماذج 3D من زوايا متعددة","إنشاء نماذج 3D قابلة للتخصيص مع تعديل المعلمات","تصدير ملفات STL لمنصات الطباعة 3D"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenSCAD installation via Homebrew","Limited to OpenSCAD 3D model format"],"zh":["需要通过 Homebrew 安装 OpenSCAD","仅限 OpenSCAD 3D 模型格式"],"ja":["Homebrew 経由で OpenSCAD をインストールする必要がある","OpenSCAD 3D モデル形式のみに対応"],"ko":["홈브류를 통해 OpenSCAD를 설치해야함","OpenSCAD 3D 모델 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere instalación de OpenSCAD a través de Homebrew","Limitado al formato de modelo 3D de OpenSCAD"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limité au format de modèle 3D OpenSCAD"],"de":["Benötigt OpenSCAD-Installation über Homebrew","Begrenzt auf OpenSCAD-3D-Modellformat"],"pt":["Requer instalação do OpenSCAD via Homebrew","Limitado ao formato de modelo 3D do OpenSCAD"],"ru":["Требуется установка OpenSCAD через Homebrew","Ограничен форматом 3D-модели OpenSCAD"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت OpenSCAD من خلال Homebrew","محدود بنموذج 3D من OpenSCAD"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
