m .NET Core com experiência em .NET 8, C# 12 e desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas da nuvem.","ru":"Эксперт по .NET Core с опытом работы с .NET 8, C# 12 и разработкой облачных приложений.","ar":"خبير في .NET Core مع خبرة في .NET 8 و C# 12 وتنمية التطبيقات الأصلية للسحابة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":[".NET 8","C# 12","API","Entity Framework Core","Cloud Native","High-Performance"],"ja":[".NET 8","C# 12","API","Entity Framework Core","Cloud Native","High-Performance"],"ko":[".NET 8","C# 12","API","Entity Framework Core","Cloud Native","High-Performance"],"es":["Desarrollo de APIs mínimas con .NET 8","Experiencia en C# 12 y Entity Framework Core","Arquitectura de aplicaciones escalables y de alto rendimiento","Patrones de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Integración con servicios de la nube"],"fr":["Développement d''API minimales avec .NET 8","Expérience dans C# 12 et Entity Framework Core","Architecture d''applications évolutives et hautes performances","Modèles d''applications natives de cloud","Intégration avec les services de cloud"],"de":["Entwicklung von Minimal-APIs mit .NET 8","Erfahrung in C# 12 und Entity Framework Core","Architektur von skalierbaren und hochleistungsfähigen Anwendungen","Cloud-nativen AnwendungsMuster","Integration mit Cloud-Diensten"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações com .NET 8","Uso de C# 12 para melhor desempenho","Criação de APIs mínimas","Utilização de Entity Framework Core","Desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas da nuvem"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с помощью .NET 8","Использование C# 12 для повышения производительности","Создание минималистичных API","Использование Entity Framework Core","Разработка облачных приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات باستخدام .NET 8","استخدام C# 12 لتحسين الأداء","إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات thiểu","استخدام Entity Framework Core","تنمية التطبيقات السحابية"]},"keywords":{"zh":[".NET Core",".NET 8","C# 12","Cloud Native","Entity Framework Core","High-Performance","API","Minimal API","Clean Architecture"],"ja":[".NET Core",".NET 8","C# 12","Cloud Native","Entity Framework Core","High-Performance","API","Minimal API","Clean Architecture"],"ko":[".NET Core",".NET 8","C# 12","Cloud Native","Entity Framework Core","High-Performance","API","Minimal API","Clean Architecture"],"es":["NET Core","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","APIs mínimas","Aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Arquitectura de aplicaciones","Escalabilidad","Rendimiento"],"fr":["NET Core","Développement d''applications","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","API minimales","Applications natives de cloud","Architecture d''applications","Évolutivité","Performances"],"de":["NET Core","AnwendungsEntwicklung","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","Minimal-APIs","Cloud-nativen Anwendungen","AnwendungsArchitektur","Skalierbarkeit","Leistung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicações .NET","C# 12","APIs mínimas","Entity Framework Core","aplicações nativas da nuvem","especialista em .NET Core"],"ru":["разработка приложений .NET","C# 12","минималистичные API","Entity Framework Core","облачные приложения","эксперт по .NET Core"],"ar":["تنمية التطبيقات .NET","C# 12","واجهات برمجة تطبيقات thiểu","Entity Framework Core","التطبيقات السحابية","خبير .NET Core"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:49:28.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing expertise in .NET 8 and modern C# for building high-performance applications","zh":"非常适合需要在 .NET 8 和现代 C# 中具备专业知识的云原生代理，用于构建高性能应用程序","ja":".NET 8 とモダン C# に関する専門知識が必要なクラウドネイティブ エージェントに最適","ko":".NET 8 및 현대적인 C#에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 고성능 애플리케이션 구축을 위해","es":"Perfecto para agentes nativos de la nube que necesitan experiencia en .NET 8 y C# moderno para construir aplicaciones de alto rendimiento","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native ayant besoin d''expertise en .NET 8 et C# moderne pour construire des applications à haute performance","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Expertenwissen in .NET 8 und modernem C# für den Bau von Hochleistungsanwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que necessitam de expertise em .NET 8 e C# moderno para construir aplicações de alto desempenho","ru":"Идеально подходит для Cloud-Native агентов, которым необходимы знания в области .NET 8 и современного C# для создания высокопроизводительных приложений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في .NET 8 و C# الحديثة لإنشاء تطبيقات عالية الأداء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable applications with clean architecture using minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns, leveraging .NET 8 and C# 12 for optimal performance","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展应用程序的能力，使用最小 API、实体框架核心和云原生模式，利用 .NET 8 和 C# 12 实现最佳性能","ja":".NET 8 と C# 12 を使用して最適なパフォーマンスを実現し、ミニマル API、Entity Framework Core、クラウドネイティブ パターンを使用してスケーラブルなアプリケーションを構築するエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":".NET 8 및 C# 12를 사용하여 최적의 성능을实现하고 최소 API, 엔티티 프레임워크 핵심 및 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 사용하여 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를赋能합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones escalables con arquitectura limpia utilizando APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core y patrones nativos de la nube, aprovechando .NET 8 y C# 12 para un rendimiento óptimo","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications scalables avec une architecture propre en utilisant des API minimales, Entity Framework Core et des modèles Cloud-Native, en exploitant .NET 8 et C# 12 pour des performances optimales","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare Anwendungen mit sauberer Architektur zu bauen, indem minimalen APIs, Entity Framework Core und Cloud-Native-Mustern verwendet werden, um .NET 8 und C# 12 für optimale Leistung zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações escaláveis com arquitetura limpa usando APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core e padrões nativos da nuvem, aproveitando .NET 8 e C# 12 para desempenho ótimo","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые приложения с чистой архитектурой, используя минимальные API, Entity Framework Core и облачные паттерны, используя .NET 8 и C# 12 для оптимальной производительности","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات قابلة للتحجيم مع هندسة نظيفة باستخدام واجهات برمجة تطبيقات минимальة و Entity Framework Core و أنماط الأصليين السحابيين ، واستخدام .NET 8 و C# 12 للحصول على أداء مثالي"},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for enterprise applications","Developing cloud-native applications with Entity Framework Core","Optimizing application performance using .NET 8 and C# 12 features"],"zh":["使用 .NET 8 为企业应用程序构建最小 API","使用实体框架核心开发云原生应用程序","使用 .NET 8 和 C# 12 功能优化应用程序性能"],"ja":[".NET 8 を使用してエンタープライズ アプリケーション用のミニマル API を構築する","Entity Framework Core を使用してクラウドネイティブ アプリケーションを開発する",".NET 8 と C# 12 の機能を使用してアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":[".NET 8을 사용하여 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션용 최소 API를 구축하는 것","엔티티 프레임워크 핵심을 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것",".NET 8 및 C# 12의 기능을 사용하여 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construir APIs mínimas con .NET 8 para aplicaciones empresariales","Desarrollar aplicaciones nativas de la nube con Entity Framework Core","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación utilizando características de .NET 8 y C# 12"],"fr":["Construire des API minimales avec .NET 8 pour des applications d''entreprise","Développer des applications Cloud-Native avec Entity Framework Core","Optimiser les performances de l''application en utilisant les fonctionnalités de .NET 8 et C# 12"],"de":["Minimale APIs mit .NET 8 für Unternehmensanwendungen erstellen","Cloud-Native-Anwendungen mit Entity Framework Core entwickeln","Anwendungsleistung mit Funktionen von .NET 8 und C# 12 optimieren"],"pt":["Construção de APIs mínimas com .NET 8 para aplicações empresariais","Desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas da nuvem com Entity Framework Core","Otimização do desempenho da aplicação usando recursos de .NET 8 e C# 12"],"ru":["Создание минимальных API с помощью .NET 8 для корпоративных приложений","Разработка облачных приложений с помощью Entity Framework Core","Оптимизация производительности приложения с помощью функций .NET 8 и C# 12"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات минимальة مع .NET 8 لتطبيقات الشركات","تطوير تطبيقات الأصليين السحابيين مع Entity Framework Core","تحسين أداء التطبيق باستخدام ميزات .NET 8 و C# 12"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 8 and C# 12 expertise","Limited to cloud-native application development","Entity Framework Core required for database operations"],"zh":[".NET 8 和 C# 12 的专业知识是必需的","仅限云原生应用程序开发","需要实体框架核心进行数据库操作"],"ja":[".NET 8 と C# 12 の専門知識が必要","クラウドネイティブ アプリケーションの開発のみ","データベース操作には Entity Framework Core が必要"],"ko":[".NET 8 및 C# 12에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에만 국한됩니다.","데이터베이스 작업을 위해 엔티티 프레임워크 핵심이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en .NET 8 y C# 12","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","Entity Framework Core es necesario para operaciones de base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en .NET 8 et C# 12","Limité au développement d''applications Cloud-Native","Entity Framework Core est nécessaire pour les opérations de base de données"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in .NET 8 und C# 12","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Cloud-Native-Anwendungen","Entity Framework Core ist erforderlich für Datenbankoperationen"],"pt":["Requer expertise em .NET 8 e C# 12","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas da nuvem","Entity Framework Core necessário para operações de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требуется знания в области .NET 8 и C# 12","Ограничен разработкой облачных приложений","Требуется Entity Framework Core для операций с базой данных"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في .NET 8 و C# 12","مقيد بتطوير تطبيقات الأصليين السحابيين","يحتاج إلى Entity Framework Core للعمليات الأساسية للقاعدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
