"معالجة ملفات PDF: دليل لاستخراج وإنشاء","en":"pdf"},"description":{"zh":"PDF处理指南，使用Python库和命令行工具进行文本和表格提取、PDF创建、文件合并和分割、表单填写","ja":"PDF処理ガイド。Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用してテキストと表を抽出し、PDFを作成し、ファイルを結合または分割し、フォームを埋める","ko":"PDF 처리 가이드. Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 텍스트와 테이블을 추출하고, PDF를 생성하고, 파일을 결합하거나 분할하고, 양식을 작성","es":"Guía para procesar PDFs con Python, incluyendo extracción de texto y tablas, creación y fusión de archivos","fr":"Guide pour traiter les PDF avec Python, y compris l''extraction de texte et de tableaux, la création et la fusion de fichiers","de":"Anleitung zum Verarbeiten von PDFs mit Python, einschließlich Text- und Tabellenextraktion, Erstellung und Zusammenführung von Dateien","pt":"O processamento de PDF permite extrair texto e tabelas, criar e mesclar arquivos PDF. Aprenda a usar bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Обработка PDF позволяет извлекать текст и таблицы, создавать и объединять файлы PDF. Узнайте, как использовать библиотеки Python и командную строку.","ar":"معالجة ملفات PDF تتيح لك استخراج النص والجداول وإنشاء ودمج ملفات PDF. تعلم كيفية استخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["文本和表格提取","PDF创建","文件合并和分割","表单填写","使用Python库和命令行工具"],"ja":["テキストと表の抽出","PDFの作成","ファイルの結合と分割","フォームの埋め込み","Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールの使用"],"ko":["텍스트와 테이블 추출","PDF 생성","파일 결합과 분할","양식 작성","Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구 사용"],"es":["Extracción de texto y tablas de archivos PDF","Creación de nuevos archivos PDF","Fusión y división de archivos PDF","Rellenado de formularios PDF","Análisis de documentos PDF"],"fr":["Extraction de texte et de tableaux de fichiers PDF","Création de nouveaux fichiers PDF","Fusion et division de fichiers PDF","Remplissage de formulaires PDF","Analyse de documents PDF"],"de":["Extraktion von Text und Tabellen aus PDF-Dateien","Erstellung neuer PDF-Dateien","Zusammenführung und Aufteilung von PDF-Dateien","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen","Analyse von PDF-Dokumenten"],"pt":["Extração de texto e tabelas de arquivos PDF","Criação de arquivos PDF","Mesclagem e divisão de arquivos PDF","Preenchimento de formulários em arquivos PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando"],"ru":["Извлечение текста и таблиц из файлов PDF","Создание файлов PDF","Объединение и разделение файлов PDF","Заполнение форм в файлах PDF","Использование библиотек Python и командной строки"],"ar":["استخراج النص والجداول من ملفات PDF","إنشاء ملفات PDF","دمج وتقسيم ملفات PDF","ملء استمارات في ملفات PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","文本提取","表格提取","PDF创建","文件合并","文件分割","表单填写"],"ja":["PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","テキスト抽出","表抽出","PDF作成","ファイル結合","ファイル分割","フォーム埋め込み"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","텍스트 추출","테이블 추출","PDF 생성","파일 결합","파일 분할","양식 작성"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","extracción de texto pdf","creación de pdf","fusión de pdf","rellenado de formularios pdf","análisis de documentos pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","extraction de texte pdf","création de pdf","fusion de pdf","remplissage de formulaires pdf","analyse de documents pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","textextraktion pdf","erstellung von pdf","zusammenführung von pdf","ausfüllen von pdf-formularen","analyse von pdf-dokumenten"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","extração de texto","criação de pdf","mesclagem de pdf","preenchimento de formulários","bibliotecas python","ferramentas de linha de comando"],"ru":["обработка pdf","извлечение текста","создание pdf","объединение pdf","заполнение форм","библиотеки python","командная строка"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","استخراج النص","إنشاء ملفات pdf","دمج ملفات pdf","ملء استمارات","مكتبات python","أدوات سطر الأوامر"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"PDF manipulation toolkit. Extract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split, fill forms, for programmatic document processing and analysis.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does not already contain schematics or diagrams:\n- Use the **scientific-schematics** skill to generate AI-powered publication-quality diagrams\n- Simply describe your desired diagram in natural language\n- Nano Banana Pro will automatically generate, review, and refine the schematic\n\n**For new documents:** Scientific schematics should be generated by default to visually represent key concepts, workflows, architectures, or relationships described in the text.\n\n**How to generate schematics:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_schematic.py \"your diagram description\" -o figures/output.png\n```\n\nThe AI will automatically:\n- Create publication-quality images with proper formatting\n- Review and refine through multiple iterations\n- Ensure accessibility (colorblind-friendly, high contrast)\n- Save outputs in the figures/ directory\n\n**When to add schematics:**\n- PDF processing workflow diagrams\n- Document manipulation flowcharts\n- Form processing visualizations\n- Data extraction pipeline diagrams\n- Any complex concept that benefits from visualization\n\nFor detailed guidance on creating schematics, refer to the scientific-schematics skill documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:49:30.392Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF处理功能的文档分析智能体。","ja":"高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents nécessitant des capacités de traitement de PDF avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Документов, требующих расширенных возможностей обработки PDF.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المستندات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات معالجة PDF متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, create and merge PDFs, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with features like command-line tools and reference guides.","zh":"赋能智能体使用Python库提取文本和表格、创建和合并PDF以及填写表单，通过命令行工具和参考指南等特性增强程序化文档处理和分析能力。","ja":"Pythonライブラリを使用したテキストや表の抽出、PDFの作成・結合、フォーム入力機能をエージェントに提供し、コマンドラインツールやリファレンスガイドなどの機能によりプログラム的なドキュメント処理と分析を強化します。","ko":"Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 및 표를 추출하고, PDF를 생성 및 병합하며, 양식을 채우는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여 명령줄 도구 및 참조 가이드와 같은 기능으로 프로그램적 문서 처리 및 분석을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto y tablas, crear y combinar PDF, y rellenar formularios utilizando bibliotecas de Python, mejorando el procesamiento y análisis de documentos programáticos con características como herramientas de línea de comandos y guías de referencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte et des tableaux, de créer et de fusionner des PDF, et de remplir des formulaires en utilisant des bibliothèques Python, améliorant le traitement et l''analyse de documents programmés avec des fonctionnalités telles que des outils de ligne de commande et des guides de référence.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Text und Tabellen zu extrahieren, PDF-Dateien zu erstellen und zu kombinieren sowie Formulare mithilfe von Python-Bibliotheken auszufüllen, wodurch das programmatische Dokumentenverarbeitung und -analyse mit Funktionen wie Befehlszeilentools und Referenzhandbüchern verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto e tabelas, criar e mesclar PDFs e preencher formulários usando bibliotecas Python, melhorando o processamento e análise de documentos programáticos com recursos como ferramentas de linha de comando e guias de referência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст и таблицы, создавать и объединять PDF, заполнять формы с помощью библиотек Python, улучшая программную обработку и анализ документов с функциями, такими как инструменты командной строки и справочные руководства.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من استخراج النص والجداول، وإنشاء وتجميع ملفات PDF، وتعبئة الاستمارات باستخدام مكتبات بايثون، مما يعزز معالجة المستندات والتحليل البرمجي مع ميزات مثل أدوات سطر الأوامر ومراجع الدليل."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting data from PDF tables","Merging and splitting PDF files programmatically","Automating form filling in PDF documents"],"zh":["从PDF表格中提取数据","以编程方式合并和拆分PDF文件","自动化填写PDF文档中的表单"],"ja":["PDF表からのデータ抽出","プログラムによるPDFファイルの結合と分割","PDF文書でのフォーム入力を自動化"],"ko":["PDF 테이블에서 데이터 추출","프로그램 방식으로 PDF 파일 병합 및 분할","PDF 문서에서 양식 작성 자동화"],"es":["Extraer datos de tablas PDF","Combinar y dividir archivos PDF de forma programática","Automatizar el relleno de formularios en documentos PDF"],"fr":["Extraire des données de tableaux PDF","Fusionner et diviser des fichiers PDF de manière programmatique","Automatiser le remplissage de formulaires dans des documents PDF"],"de":["Daten aus PDF-Tabellen extrahieren","PDF-Dateien programmatisch kombinieren und aufteilen","Formulare in PDF-Dokumenten automatisch ausfüllen"],"pt":["Extração de dados de tabelas PDF","Mesclagem e divisão de arquivos PDF de forma programática","Automação de preenchimento de formulários em documentos PDF"],"ru":["Извлечение данных из таблиц PDF","Объединение и разделение файлов PDF программным образом","Автоматизация заполнения форм в документах PDF"],"ar":["استخراج البيانات من جداول PDF","دمج وتنقيح ملفات PDF بالشكل البرمجي","تحويل تعبئة الاستمارات في مستندات PDF تلقائيًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python libraries","Limited to PDF file format","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"zh":["需要Python库支持","仅限PDF文件格式","高级功能需要查阅reference.md和forms.md文档"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリが必要","PDFファイル形式に限定","高度な機能にはreference.mdおよびforms.mdの参照が必要"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리 필요","PDF 파일 형식으로 제한됨","고급 기능은 reference.md 및 forms.md 참조 가이드 확인 필요"],"es":["Requiere bibliotecas de Python","Limitado al formato de archivo PDF","Las características avanzadas requieren la consulta de reference.md y forms.md"],"fr":["Nécessite des bibliothèques Python","Limité au format de fichier PDF","Les fonctionnalités avancées nécessitent la consultation de reference.md et forms.md"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Bibliotheken","Begrenzt auf das PDF-Dateiformat","Erweiterte Funktionen erfordern die Konsultation von reference.md und forms.md"],"pt":["Requer bibliotecas Python","Limitado ao formato de arquivo PDF","Recursos avançados requerem consulta do reference.md e forms.md"],"ru":["Требует библиотек Python","Ограничен форматом файла PDF","Расширенные функции требуют консультации reference.md и forms.md"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبات بايثون","محدود بتنسيق ملف PDF","تتطلب الميزات المتقدمة استشارة reference.md وforms.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
