arbeiten mit Python","pt":"O processamento de PDF permite extrair texto, criar e editar documentos com facilidade. Aprenda a usar Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Обработка PDF позволяет извлекать текст, создавать и редактировать документы легко. Узнайте, как использовать Python и командную строку.","ar":"معالجة پی دی إف تسمح باستخراج النص وإنشاء المستندات بسهولة. تعلم كيفية استخدام بايثون وأدوات سطر الأوامر.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"ja":["Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"ko":["Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"es":["Extracción de texto de archivos PDF","Creación de nuevos archivos PDF","Fusión y división de archivos PDF","Rellenado de formularios PDF","Análisis de documentos PDF"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de fichiers PDF","Création de nouveaux fichiers PDF","Fusion et division de fichiers PDF","Remplissage de formulaires PDF","Analyse de documents PDF"],"de":["Textextraktion aus PDF-Dateien","Erstellung neuer PDF-Dateien","Zusammenführung und Aufteilung von PDF-Dateien","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen","Analyse von PDF-Dokumenten"],"pt":["Extraia texto de documentos PDF","Crie e edite documentos PDF com Python","Mescle e divida arquivos PDF","Preencha formulários PDF","Adicione diagramas científicos e esquemas"],"ru":["Извлекайте текст из документов PDF","Создавайте и редактируйте документы PDF с помощью Python","Объединяйте и разделяйте файлы PDF","Заполняйте формы PDF","Добавляйте научные диаграммы и схемы"],"ar":["استخراج النص من المستندات پی دی إف","إنشاء وتحرير المستندات پی دی إف باستخدام بايثون","دمج و تقسيم الملفات پی دی إف","ملء استمارات پی دی إف","إضافة الرسومات العلمية و المخططات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF","Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"ja":["PDF","Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"ko":["PDF","Python","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF","PDF"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","herramientas pdf","extracción de texto","creación de pdf","fusionar pdf","rellenar formularios pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","bibliothèques pdf","outils pdf","extraction de texte","création de pdf","fusionner pdf","remplir des formulaires pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-bibliotheken","pdf-tools","textextraktion","pdf-erstellung","pdf-zusammenführung","pdf-formulare ausfüllen"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","extração de texto","criação de documentos","edição de pdf","mescle de arquivos","preenchimento de formulários"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","извлечение текста","создание документов","редактирование pdf","объединение файлов","заполнение форм"],"ar":["معالجة پی دی إف","بايثون پی دی إف","استخراج النص","إنشاء المستندات","تحرير پی دی إف","دمج الملفات","ملء الاستمارات"]}},"owner":"drshailesh88","repo":"integrated_content_OS","repoPath":"drshailesh88/integrated_content_OS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"PDF manipulation toolkit. Extract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split, fill forms, for programmatic document processing and analysis.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract text/tables, create PDFs, merge/split files, fill forms using Python libraries and command-line tools. Apply this skill for programmatic document processing and analysis. For advanced features or form filling, consult reference.md and forms.md.\n\n## Visual Enhancement with Scientific Schematics\n\n**When creating documents with this skill, always consider adding scientific diagrams and schematics to enhance visual communication.**\n\nIf your document does not already contain schematics or diagrams:\n- Use the **scientific-schematics** skill to generate AI-powered publication-quality diagrams\n- Simply describe your desired diagram in natural language\n- Nano Banana Pro will automatically generate, review, and refine the schematic\n\n**For new documents:** Scientific schematics should be generated by default to visually represent key concepts, workflows, architectures, or relationships described in the text.\n\n**How to generate schematics:**\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_schematic.py \"your diagram description\" -o figures/output.png\n```\n\nThe AI will automatically:\n- Create publication-quality images with proper formatting\n- Review and refine through multiple iterations\n- Ensure accessibility (colorblind-friendly, high contrast)\n- Save outputs in the figures/ directory\n\n**When to add schematics:**\n- PDF processing workflow diagrams\n- Document manipulation flowcharts\n- Form processing visualizations\n- Data extraction pipeline diagrams\n- Any complex concept that benefits from visualization\n\nFor detailed guidance on creating schematics, refer to the scientific-schematics skill documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:49:40.970Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF处理能力的文档分析代理。","ja":"高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа документов, требующих расширенных возможностей обработки PDF.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الوثائق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة PDF."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables, create and merge PDFs, and fill forms using Python libraries, enhancing programmatic document processing and analysis with command-line tools and advanced features like form filling.","zh":"赋予代理提取文本和表格、创建和合并PDF、使用Python库填写表单的能力，通过命令行工具和高级功能如表单填写增强程序化文档处理和分析。","ja":"Pythonライブラリを使用してテキストと表を抽出する、PDFを作成して結合する、フォームを埋める機能をエージェントに与え、コマンドラインツールとフォーム埋め込みなどの高度な機能でプログラムによる文書処理と分析を強化します。","ko":"Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 텍스트 및 표를 추출하고, PDF를 생성 및 병합하고, 양식을填写하는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하여, 명령줄 도구 및 양식填写와 같은 고급 기능으로 프로그래밍 방식의 문서 처리 및 분석을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto y tablas, crear y fusionar PDF, y rellenar formularios utilizando bibliotecas de Python, mejorando el procesamiento y análisis de documentos programáticos con herramientas de línea de comandos y características avanzadas como el relleno de formularios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte et des tableaux, de créer et de fusionner des PDF, et de remplir des formulaires en utilisant des bibliothèques Python, améliorant ainsi le traitement et l''analyse de documents programmiques avec des outils de ligne de commande et des fonctionnalités avancées comme le remplissage de formulaires.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Text und Tabellen zu extrahieren, PDF-Dateien zu erstellen und zu kombinieren sowie Formulare mithilfe von Python-Bibliotheken auszufüllen, wodurch das programmatische Dokumentenverarbeitung und -analyse mit Befehlszeilenwerkzeugen und erweiterten Funktionen wie Formulareingabe verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto e tabelas, criar e mesclar PDFs e preencher formulários usando bibliotecas Python, melhorando o processamento e análise de documentos programáticos com ferramentas de linha de comando e recursos avançados como preenchimento de formulários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст и таблицы, создавать и объединять PDF, заполнять формы с помощью библиотек Python, улучшая программную обработку и анализ документов с помощью инструментов командной строки и расширенных функций, таких как заполнение форм.","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من استخراج النص والجداول، وإنشاء ودمج ملفات PDF، وملء الاستمارات باستخدام مكتبات Python، مما يعزز معالجة وتحليل المستندات البرمجي مع أدوات سطر الأوامر والميزات المتقدمة مثل ملء الاستمارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting data from PDF tables","Merging and splitting PDF files for document management","Automating form filling for efficient document processing"],"zh":["从PDF表格中提取数据","合并和拆分PDF文件以进行文档管理","自动填写表格以实现高效的文档处理"],"ja":["PDF表からデータを抽出する","ドキュメント管理のためにPDFファイルを結合して分割する","効率的な文書処理のためにフォームを自動で埋める"],"ko":["PDF 표에서 데이터를 추출하는 것","문서 관리를 위해 PDF 파일을 병합 및 분할하는 것","효율적인 문서 처리를 위해 양식을 자동으로填写하는 것"],"es":["Extraer datos de tablas de PDF","Combinar y dividir archivos de PDF para la gestión de documentos","Automatizar el relleno de formularios para un procesamiento de documentos eficiente"],"fr":["Extraire des données de tableaux PDF","Fusionner et diviser des fichiers PDF pour la gestion des documents","Automatiser le remplissage de formulaires pour un traitement de documents efficace"],"de":["Daten aus PDF-Tabellen extrahieren","PDF-Dateien für die Dokumentenverwaltung kombinieren und aufteilen","Formulareingabe automatisieren, um eine effiziente Dokumentenverarbeitung zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Extração de dados de tabelas PDF","Mesclagem e divisão de arquivos PDF para gerenciamento de documentos","Automação de preenchimento de formulários para processamento eficiente de documentos"],"ru":["Извлечение данных из таблиц PDF","Объединение и разделение файлов PDF для управления документами","Автоматизация заполнения форм для эффективной обработки документов"],"ar":["استخراج البيانات من جداول PDF","دمج و تقسيم ملفات PDF لإدارة المستندات","أتمتة ملء الاستمارات لمعالجة المستندات الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python libraries and command-line tools","Advanced features require consultation of reference.md and forms.md"],"zh":["需要Python库和命令行工具","高级功能需要参考reference.md和forms.md"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールが必要","高度な機能を使用するにはreference.mdとforms.mdを参照する必要がある"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리 및 명령줄 도구가 필요","고급 기능을 사용하려면 reference.md 및 forms.md를 참조해야 함"],"es":["Requiere bibliotecas de Python y herramientas de línea de comandos","Las características avanzadas requieren la consulta de reference.md y forms.md"],"fr":["Nécessite des bibliothèques Python et des outils de ligne de commande","Les fonctionnalités avancées nécessitent la consultation de reference.md et forms.md"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Bibliotheken und Befehlszeilenwerkzeuge","Erweiterte Funktionen erfordern die Konsultation von reference.md und forms.md"],"pt":["Requer bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando","Recursos avançados requerem consulta de reference.md e forms.md"],"ru":["Требует библиотек Python и инструментов командной строки","Расширенные функции требуют консультации reference.md и forms.md"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر","الميزات المتقدمة تتطلب استشارة reference.md و forms.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
