的技能，用于创建、更新和修复WP块，包括动态渲染和迁移等功能","ja":"WP ブロック開発は、セキュリティ監査されたスキルで、WP ブロックを作成、更新、修復し、高度な機能を提供します","ko":"WP 블록 개발은 보안 감사를 통한 스킬로 WP 블록을 생성, 업데이트 및 수정하고 고급 기능을 제공합니다","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP permite crear y personalizar bloques en WordPress para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP permet de créer et de personnaliser des blocs dans WordPress pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ermöglicht die Erstellung und Anpassung von Blöcken in WordPress, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP permite criar blocos personalizados para o WordPress. Use para criar, atualizar ou depurar blocos.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP позволяет создавать персонализированные блоки для WordPress. Используйте для создания, обновления или отладки блоков.","ar":"تطوير الكتل ووردبريس يسمح بإنشاء كتل مخصصة لوردبريس. استخدم لإنشاء أو تحديث أو تصحيح الأخطاء في الكتل.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新WP块","动态渲染和迁移","修复块无效或不保存的问题","添加动态渲染和回调函数","块弃用和迁移","构建工具支持"],"ja":["WPブロックの作成と更新","動的レンダリングとマイグレーション","ブロックの無効や保存されない問題の修復","動的レンダリングとコールバック関数の追加","ブロックの廃止とマイグレーション","ビルドツールのサポート"],"ko":["WP 블록 생성 및 업데이트","동적 렌더링 및 마이그레이션","블록 무효 또는 저장되지 않는 문제 수정","동적 렌더링 및 콜백 함수 추가","블록 폐기 및 마이그레이션","빌드 툴 지원"],"es":["Creación de nuevos bloques","Actualización de bloques existentes","Personalización de bloques","Solución de problemas de bloques","Implementación de renderizado dinámico","Uso de herramientas de creación de bloques"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux blocs","Mise à jour de blocs existants","Personnalisation de blocs","Résolution de problèmes de blocs","Implémentation de rendu dynamique","Utilisation d''outils de création de blocs"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Aktualisierung vorhandener Blöcke","Anpassung von Blöcken","Behebung von Blockproblemen","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendern","Verwendung von Blockerstellungstools"],"pt":["Criação de blocos personalizados","Atualização de blocos existentes","Depuração de blocos","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Gerenciamento de depreciações e migrações de blocos","Uso de ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание персонализированных блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Отладка блоков","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Управление устаревшими версиями и миграциями блоков","Использование инструментов сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل مخصصة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تصحيح أخطاء الكتل","إضافة عرض ديناميكي","إدارة الإصدارات القديمة والهجرة من الكتل","استخدام أدوات البناء للكتل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WP 块开发","安全审计","一键安装","动态渲染","迁移","块无效","不保存","构建工具"],"ja":["WP ブロック開発","セキュリティ監査","ワンクリックインストール","動的レンダリング","マイグレーション","ブロックの無効","保存されない","ビルドツール"],"ko":["WP 블록 개발","보안 감사","일키 설치","동적 렌더링","마이그레이션","블록 무효","저장되지 않는","빌드 툴"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","creación de bloques","personalización de bloques","WordPress","bloques","desarrollo web","programación","WP Block Development"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","création de blocs","personnalisation de blocs","WordPress","blocs","développement web","programmation","WP Block Development"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Blöcken","Anpassung von Blöcken","WordPress","Blöcke","Webentwicklung","Programmierung","WP Block Development"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","criação de blocos personalizados","wordpress","blocos","desenvolvimento web","personalização de blocos","wordpress blocks","blocos personalizados","desenvolvimento de sites"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","создание персонализированных блоков","wordpress","блоки","веб-разработка","персонализация блоков","wordpress блоки","персонализированные блоки","разработка сайтов"],"ar":["تطوير كتل ووردبريس","إنشاء كتل مخصصة","ووردبريس","كتل","تطوير الويب","تخصيص الكتل","كتل ووردبريس","كتل مخصص","تطوير المواقع"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:10.646Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Agents needing advanced block development and customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级块开发和自定义功能的 WordPress 代理。","ja":"WordPress エージェントが高度なブロック開発とカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 개발 및 사용자 정의 기능이 필요한 WordPress 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de WordPress que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y personalización de bloques avanzados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents WordPress ayant besoin de capacités de développement et de personnalisation de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Agenten, die erweiterte Blockentwicklungs- und Anpassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes do WordPress que precisam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento e personalização de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов WordPress, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки и настройки блоков.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير البلوك وتعديلها في ووردبريس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and update WordPress blocks with ease, leveraging tools like @wordpress/scripts and @wordpress/create-block, while ensuring security and quality through one-click installation and verification, supporting dynamic rendering with render.php and render_callback.","zh":"赋予代理创建和更新 WordPress 块的能力，利用 @wordpress/scripts 和 @wordpress/create-block 等工具，同时通过一键安装和验证确保安全性和质量，支持使用 render.php 和 render_callback 实现动态渲染。","ja":"エージェントが @wordpress/scripts や @wordpress/create-block などのツールを利用して WordPress ブロックを作成および更新できるようにし、一クリックインストールと検証を通じてセキュリティと品質を確保し、render.php と render_callback を使用した動的レンダリングをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 @wordpress/scripts 및 @wordpress/create-block와 같은 도구를 사용하여 WordPress 블록을 생성하고 업데이트할 수 있도록 하며, 한 번의 클릭으로 설치 및 검증을 통해 보안 및 품질을 보장하고 render.php 및 render_callback를 사용한 동적 렌더링을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y actualizar bloques de WordPress con facilidad, aprovechando herramientas como @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block, garantizando la seguridad y la calidad a través de la instalación y verificación de un solo clic, y admitiendo la representación dinámica con render.php y render_callback.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de mettre à jour des blocs WordPress avec facilité, en exploitant des outils tels que @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block, tout en assurant la sécurité et la qualité grâce à une installation et une vérification en un seul clic, et en prenant en charge le rendu dynamique avec render.php et render_callback.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, WordPress-Blöcke mit Leichtigkeit zu erstellen und zu aktualisieren, indem es Tools wie @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block nutzt, während es Sicherheit und Qualität durch eine Ein-Klick-Installation und -Verifizierung gewährleistet und dynamisches Rendering mit render.php und render_callback unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e atualizar blocos do WordPress com facilidade, utilizando ferramentas como @wordpress/scripts e @wordpress/create-block, garantindo segurança e qualidade por meio da instalação e verificação em um clique, suportando renderização dinâmica com render.php e render_callback.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и обновлять блоки WordPress с легкостью, используя инструменты như @wordpress/scripts и @wordpress/create-block, обеспечивая безопасность и качество посредством однократной установки и верификации, поддерживая динамическую отрисовку с помощью render.php и render_callback.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحديث البلوك في ووردبريس بسهولة، باستخدام أدوات مثل @wordpress/scripts و @wordpress/create-block، وضمان الأمان والجودة من خلال التثبيت والتحقق بلمسة واحدة، ودعم العرض الديناميكي باستخدام render.php و render_callback."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new custom blocks","Updating existing block attributes and scripts","Debugging block invalidation and persistence issues","Implementing block deprecations and migrations"],"zh":["创建新的自定义块","更新现有块属性和脚本","调试块失效和持久性问题","实施块弃用和迁移"],"ja":["新しいカスタム ブロックを作成する","既存のブロック属性とスクリプトを更新する","ブロックの無効化と永続化の問題をデバッグする","ブロックの廃止と移行を実装する"],"ko":["새로운 사용자 정의 블록을 생성한다","기존 블록 속성 및 스크립트를 업데이트한다","블록의 무효화 및 영속성 문제를 디버깅한다","블록의 중단 및 마이그레이션을 구현한다"],"es":["Crear nuevos bloques personalizados","Actualizar atributos y scripts de bloques existentes","Depurar problemas de invalidación y persistencia de bloques","Implementar deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux blocs personnalisés","Mettre à jour les attributs et les scripts de blocs existants","Déboguer les problèmes d''invalidation et de persistance de blocs","Mettre en œuvre des dépréciations et des migrations de blocs"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Blöcken","Aktualisieren von Attributen und Skripten von bestehenden Blöcken","Beheben von Problemen mit der Blockinvalidierung und -persistenz","Implementieren von Block-Veraltungen und -Migrationen"],"pt":["Criar novos blocos personalizados","Atualizar atributos e scripts de blocos existentes","Depurar problemas de invalidação e persistência de blocos","Implementar depreciações e migrações de blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых пользовательских блоков","Обновление атрибутов и скриптов существующих блоков","Отладка проблем с недействительностью и сохранением блоков","Реализация устаревания и миграции блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء بلوكات مخصصة جديدة","تحديث سمات وبرامج بلوكات موجودة","تصحيح أخطاء إبطال واستمرارية البلوك","تنفيذ إهمال وتحويل البلوك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment","Specific to WordPress block development"],"zh":["需要 WordPress 环境","特定于 WordPress 块开发"],"ja":["WordPress 環境が必要","WordPress ブロック開発に特有"],"ko":["WordPress 환경이 필요합니다","WordPress 블록 개발에 특정"],"es":["Requiere entorno de WordPress","Específico para el desarrollo de bloques de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress","Spécifique au développement de blocs WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt WordPress-Umgebung","Spezifisch für die WordPress-Blockentwicklung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente do WordPress","Específico para desenvolvimento de blocos do WordPress"],"ru":["Требует среды WordPress","Является специфичным для разработки блоков WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس","خاص بتطوير البلوك في ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
