clé d''API, en fournissant une guidance étape par étape sur REST, GraphQL, OpenAPI, l''authentification et les modèles de conception d''API, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques pour le développement d''API sécurisé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Aufgaben für die Einrichtung der API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierung zu automatisieren, indem sie eine schrittweise Anleitung zu REST, GraphQL, OpenAPI, Authentifizierung und API-Designmustern bereitstellen und bewährte Verfahren für die sichere API-Entwicklung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas de configuração de autenticação de chave de API, fornecendo orientação passo a passo sobre REST, GraphQL, OpenAPI, autenticação e padrões de design de API, aproveitando as melhores práticas para o desenvolvimento de API seguro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи настройки аутентификации ключа API, предоставляя пошаговое руководство по REST, GraphQL, OpenAPI, аутентификации и шаблонам проектирования API, используя лучшие практики для безопасного развития API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل مهام إعداد مفاتيح وثائق.api آلياً, مع توفير إرشادات خطوة بخطوة حول REST وGraphQL وOpenAPI والتحقق, ونماذج تصميم وثائق.api, والاستفادة من أفضل الممارسات لتطوير وثائق.api آمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API key authentication setup for new projects","Generating secure API key auth patterns for RESTful APIs","Debugging API key authentication issues in GraphQL applications"],"zh":["为新项目自动执行API密钥认证设置","为RESTful API生成安全的API密钥认证模式","调试GraphQL应用程序中的API密钥认证问题"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトのAPIキー認証の設定を自動化","RESTful API用のセキュアなAPIキー認証パターンを生成","GraphQLアプリケーションのAPIキー認証の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트의 API 키 인증 설정을 자동화","RESTful API를 위한 안전한 API 키 인증 패턴 생성","GraphQL 애플리케이션의 API 키 인증 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración de autenticación de clave de API para nuevos proyectos","Generar patrones de autenticación de clave de API seguros para API RESTful","Depurar problemas de autenticación de clave de API en aplicaciones GraphQL"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration de l''authentification par clé d''API pour les nouveaux projets","Générer des modèles d''authentification par clé d''API sécurisés pour les API RESTful","Déboguer les problèmes d''authentification par clé d''API dans les applications GraphQL"],"de":["Automatisieren der Einrichtung der API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierung für neue Projekte","Generieren sicherer API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierungsmuster für RESTful-APIs","Debuggen von API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierungsproblemen in GraphQL-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração de autenticação de chave de API para novos projetos","Gerar padrões de autenticação de chave de API seguros para APIs RESTful","Depurar problemas de autenticação de chave de API em aplicações GraphQL"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку аутентификации ключа API для новых проектов","Генерировать безопасные шаблоны аутентификации ключа API для RESTful API","Отлаживать проблемы аутентификации ключа API в приложениях GraphQL"],"ar":["تشغيل إعداد مفاتيح وثائق.api آلياً لمشاريع جديدة","إنشاء أنماط آمنة لمفاتيح وثائق.api لبروتوكولات RESTful","تصحيح أخطاء مفاتيح وثائق.api في تطبيقات GraphQL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of API development frameworks","Limited to API key auth setup, does not cover other authentication methods"],"zh":["需要API开发框架的知识","仅限API密钥认证设置，不涵盖其他认证方法"],"ja":["API開発フレームワークの知識が必要","APIキー認証の設定のみに限定され、他の認証方法はカバーしない"],"ko":["API 개발 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","API 키 인증 설정만 해당되며, 다른 인증 방법은 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los marcos de desarrollo de API","Limitado a la configuración de autenticación de clave de API, no cubre otros métodos de autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des frameworks de développement d''API","Limité à la configuration de l''authentification par clé d''API, ne couvre pas d''autres méthodes d''authentification"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der API-Entwicklungsfameworks","Begrenzt auf die Einrichtung der API-Schlüssel-Authentifizierung, deckt keine anderen Authentifizierungsmethoden ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de frameworks de desenvolvimento de API","Limitado à configuração de autenticação de chave de API, não cobre outros métodos de autenticação"],"ru":["Требует знаний фреймворков разработки API","Ограничен настройкой аутентификации ключа API, не покрывает другие методы аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطارات عمل وثائق.api","محدود لإعداد مفاتيح وثائق.api, ولا يغطي أساليب التحقق الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MrGKanev/agent-skills/wp-block-development', 'community', 'MrGKanev', 'agent-skills', 'MrGKanev/agent-skills', 'wp-block-development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:50:23.090Z', NULL, '{"id":"MrGKanev/agent-skills/wp-block-development","name":"wp-block-development","description":{"zh":"WP 块开发技能是用于优化工作流程的综合技能，包括创建、更新和管理 WP 块。","ja":"WP ブロック開発スキルは、ワークフローを最適化するための総合的なスキルです。WP ブロックの作成、更新、管理が含まれます。","ko":"WP 블록 개발 스킬은 워크플로우를 최적화하기 위한 종합적인 스킬로, WP 블록의 생성, 업데이트, 관리를 포함합니다.","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP es una combinación de habilidades para crear y personalizar bloques en WordPress. Aprende a crear bloques nuevos, actualizar bloques existentes y solucionar problemas comunes.","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP est une combinaison de compétences pour créer et personnaliser des blocs WordPress. Découvrez comment créer de nouveaux blocs, mettre à jour des blocs existants et résoudre des problèmes courants.","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ist eine Kombination von Fähigkeiten, um Blöcke in WordPress zu erstellen und anzupassen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie neue Blöcke erstellen, bestehende Blöcke aktualisieren und häufige Probleme lösen können.","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade que combina várias técnicas para melhorar os fluxos de trabalho no WordPress.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP - это навык, который объединяет несколько техник для улучшения рабочих процессов в WordPress.","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP هو مهارة تجمع بين عدة تقنيات لتحسين سير العمل في ووردبريس.","en":"Combination of Agent Skills for better workflows."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WP 块开发：优化工作流程","ja":"WP ブロック開発：ワークフローを最適化","ko":"WP 블록 개발: 워크플로우 최적화","es":"Desarrollo de bloques WP","fr":"Développement de blocs WP","de":"WP-Block-Entwicklung","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Blocos WP","ru":"Разработка блоков WP","ar":"تطوير كتل WP","en":"wp-block-development"},"description":{"zh":"WP 块开发技能是用于优化工作流程的综合技能，包括创建、更新和管理 WP 块。","ja":"WP ブロック開発スキルは、ワークフローを最適化するための総合的なスキルです。WP ブロックの作成、更新、管理が含まれます。","ko":"WP 블록 개발 스킬은 워크플로우를 최적화하기 위한 종합적인 스킬로, WP 블록의 생성, 업데이트, 관리를 포함합니다.","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP es una combinación de habilidades para crear y personalizar bloques en WordPress. Aprende a crear bloques nuevos, actualizar bloq...","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP est une combinaison de compétences pour créer et personnaliser des blocs WordPress. Découvrez comment créer de nouveaux blocs, m...","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ist eine Kombination von Fähigkeiten, um Blöcke in WordPress zu erstellen und anzupassen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie neue Blöcke erstelle...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade que combina várias técnicas para melhorar os fluxos de trabalho no WordPress.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP - это навык, который объединяет несколько техник для улучшения рабочих процессов в WordPress.","ar":"تطوير الكتل WP هو مهارة تجمع بين عدة تقنيات لتحسين سير العمل في ووردبريس.","en":"Combination of Agent Skills for better workflows."},"definition":{"en":"Combination of Agent Skills for better workflows."},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新 WP 块","管理 block.json 文件","解决块无效或属性不持久的问题","添加动态渲染功能","处理块弃用和迁移"],"ja":["WP ブロックの作成と更新","block.json ファイルの管理","ブロックの無効化や属性の不一致問題の解決","動的レンダリング機能の追加","ブロックの廃止と移行の処理"],"ko":["WP 블록의 생성과 업데이트","block.json 파일의 관리","블록의 무효화 또는 속성의 비일치 문제의 해결","동적 렌더링 기능의 추가","블록의 폐기와 이동의 처리"],"es":["Crear bloques nuevos","Actualizar bloques existentes","Solucionar problemas de bloques inválidos","Agregar renderizado dinámico","Realizar migraciones de bloques"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux blocs","Mettre à jour des blocs existants","Résoudre des problèmes de blocs invalides","Ajouter un rendu dynamique","Effectuer des migrations de blocs"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Blöcken","Aktualisieren von bestehenden Blöcken","Lösen von Problemen mit ungültigen Blöcken","Hinzufügen von dynamischem Rendern","Durchführen von Block-Migrationen"],"pt":["Criação de novos blocos","Atualização de blocos existentes","Edição de arquivos block.json","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Редактирование файлов block.json","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تحرير ملفات block.json","إضافة تسريع ديناميكي","إلغاء وتحويل الكتل","أدوات بناء للكتل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WP 块开发","WordPress 块","block.json","动态渲染","块弃用","WP 块创建","WP 块更新","WP 块管理"],"ja":["WP ブロック開発","WordPress ブロック","block.json","動的レンダリング","ブロック廃止","WP ブロック作成","WP ブロック更新","WP ブロック管理"],"ko":["WP 블록 개발","WordPress 블록","block.json","동적 렌더링","블록 폐기","WP 블록 생성","WP 블록 업데이트","WP 블록 관리"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","WordPress","bloques","personalización","creación de bloques","actualización de bloques","solución de problemas"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","WordPress","blocs","personnalisation","création de blocs","mise à jour de blocs","résolution de problèmes"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","WordPress","Blöcke","Anpassung","Erstellung von Blöcken","Aktualisierung von Blöcken","Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress","blocos","personalização","criação de blocos","atualização de blocos","block.json","renderização dinâmica","depreciação de blocos","ferramentas de build"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","wordpress","блоки","настройка","создание блоков","обновление блоков","block.json","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание блоков","инструменты сборки"],"ar":["تطوير كتل wp","ووردبريس","كتل","تخصيص","إنشاء كتل","تحديث الكتل","block.json","تسريع ديناميكي","إلغاء الكتل","أدوات بناء"]}},"owner":"MrGKanev","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"MrGKanev/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:23.090Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Agents needing advanced block development and customization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级块开发和自定义功能的 WordPress 代理。","ja":"WordPress エージェントが高度なブロック開発とカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 개발 및 사용자 정의 기능이 필요한 WordPress 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de WordPress que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y personalización de bloques avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents WordPress ayant besoin de capacités de développement et de personnalisation de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Agenten, die erweiterte Blockentwicklungs- und Anpassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes do WordPress que precisam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento e personalização de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов WordPress, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки и настройки блоков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ووردبريس الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности متقدمة لتحديث الكتلة وتخصيصها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage WordPress blocks using @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block, and wp-env, while handling block deprecations and migrations, and adding dynamic rendering with render.php and render_callback.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理 WordPress 块的能力，使用 @wordpress/scripts、@wordpress/create-block 和 wp-env，同时处理块弃用和迁移，并使用 render.php 和 render_callback 添加动态渲染。","ja":"@wordpress/scripts、@wordpress/create-block、および wp-env を使用して WordPress ブロックを作成および管理するエージェントを可能にし、ブロックの非推奨と移行を処理し、render.php と render_callback を使用して動的レンダリングを追加します。","ko":"@wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block 및 wp-env를 사용하여 WordPress 블록을 생성하고 관리하는 에이전트를 활성화하고 블록 폐기 및 마이그레이션을 처리하며 render.php 및 render_callback를 사용하여 동적 렌더링을 추가합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar bloques de WordPress utilizando @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block y wp-env, mientras se manejan las deprecaciones y migraciones de bloques, y se agrega renderizado dinámico con render.php y render_callback.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des blocs WordPress en utilisant @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block et wp-env, tout en gérant les dépréciations et les migrations de blocs, et en ajoutant un rendu dynamique avec render.php et render_callback.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, WordPress-Blöcke mit @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block und wp-env zu erstellen und zu verwalten, während Block-Abbrüche und -Migrationen gehandhabt werden und dynamisches Rendering mit render.php und render_callback hinzugefügt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar blocos do WordPress usando @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block e wp-env, além de lidar com depreciações e migrações de blocos e adicionar renderização dinâmica com render.php e render_callback.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять блоками WordPress с помощью @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block и wp-env, а также обрабатывать устаревание и миграцию блоков, и добавлять динамическую отрисовку с render.php и render_callback.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء وإدارة كتلة ووردبريس باستخدام @wordpress/scripts، @wordpress/create-block و wp-env، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع إزالة الكتلة والهجرة وإضافة عرض ديناميكي مع render.php و render_callback."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and updating custom WordPress blocks","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic rendering for blocks using render.php and render_callback"],"zh":["创建和更新自定义 WordPress 块","调试块失效和属性持久性问题","使用 render.php 和 render_callback 实现块的动态渲染"],"ja":["カスタム WordPress ブロックを作成および更新する","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性の問題をデバッグする","render.php と render_callback を使用してブロックの動的レンダリングを実装する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 WordPress 블록을 생성하고 업데이트합니다.","블록 무효화 및 속성 영속성 문제를 디버깅합니다.","render.php 및 render_callback를 사용하여 블록의 동적 렌더링을 구현합니다."],"es":["Creación y actualización de bloques personalizados de WordPress","Depuración de problemas de invalidación y persistencia de atributos de bloques","Implementación de renderizado dinámico para bloques con render.php y render_callback"],"fr":["Création et mise à jour de blocs WordPress personnalisés","Débogage des problèmes d''invalidation et de persistance d''attributs de blocs","Mise en œuvre d''un rendu dynamique pour les blocs avec render.php et render_callback"],"de":["Erstellung und Aktualisierung von benutzerdefinierten WordPress-Blöcken","Fehlerbehebung bei Block-Invalidierungs- und Attributpersistence-Problemen","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendering für Blöcke mit render.php und render_callback"],"pt":["Criar e atualizar blocos personalizados do WordPress","Depurar problemas de invalidação de blocos e persistência de atributos","Implementar renderização dinâmica para blocos usando render.php e render_callback"],"ru":["Создание и обновление пользовательских блоков WordPress","Отладка проблем с недействительностью блоков и сохранением атрибутов","Реализация динамической отрисовки для блоков с помощью render.php и render_callback"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحديث كتل ووردبريس المخصصة","تصحيح أخطاء إلغاء صلاحية الكتلة واستمرارية السمة","تنفيذ عرض ديناميكي للكتلة باستخدام render.php و render_callback"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment","Familiarity with block.json and WordPress block development principles"],"zh":["需要 WordPress 环境","需要熟悉 block.json 和 WordPress 块开发原则"],"ja":["WordPress 環境が必要","block.json と WordPress ブロック開発の原則に関する知識が必要"],"ko":["WordPress 환경이 필요합니다.","block.json 및 WordPress 블록 개발 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de WordPress","Conocimiento de block.json y principios de desarrollo de bloques de WordPress"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress","Connaissance de block.json et des principes de développement de blocs WordPress"],"de":["Benötigt WordPress-Umgebung","Vertrautheit mit block.json und WordPress-Blockentwicklungsprinzipien"],"pt":["Exige ambiente do WordPress","Familiaridade com block.json e princípios de desenvolvimento de blocos do WordPress"],"ru":["Требуется среда WordPress","Знакомство с block.json и принципами разработки блоков WordPress"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس","إلمام ب block.json ومبادئ تطوير الكتلة في ووردبريس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
