"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Blöcke","Aktualisierung von bestehenden Blöcken","Anpassung von Blöcken mit Attributen und Skripten","Behebung von Problemen mit ungültigen oder nicht gespeicherten Blöcken","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendern"],"pt":["Criação de novos blocos","Atualização de blocos existentes","Edição de arquivos block.json","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Редактирование файлов block.json","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تعديل ملفات block.json","إضافة تحديث ديناميكي","الإهمال والهجرة الكتل","أدوات البناء للكتلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WP 块开发","WordPress 块","块创建","块更新","动态渲染","构建工具","WordPress 开发"],"ja":["WP ブロック開発","WordPress ブロック","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","動的レンダリング","ビルドツール","WordPress 開発"],"ko":["WP 블록 개발","WordPress 블록","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","동적 렌더링","빌드 툴","WordPress 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","WordPress","bloques","personalización","creación de bloques","actualización de bloques","atributos de bloques","scripts de bloques"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","WordPress","blocs","personnalisation","création de blocs","mise à jour de blocs","attributs de blocs","scripts de blocs"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","WordPress","Blöcke","Anpassung","Erstellung von Blöcken","Aktualisierung von Blöcken","Blockattribute","Blockskripte"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress","blocos","personalização","criação de blocos","atualização de blocos","block.json","renderização dinâmica","depreciação de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","wordpress","блоки","настройка","создание блоков","обновление блоков","block.json","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание блоков"],"ar":["تطوير الكتلة wp","ووردبريس","الكتلة","تخصيص","إنشاء الكتلة","تحديث الكتلة","block.json","التحديث الديناميكي","الإهمال الكتلة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:18.982Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress Developer Agents specializing in Gutenberg block creation, troubleshooting, and optimization.","zh":"Ideal for WordPress Developer Agents specializing in Gutenberg block creation, troubleshooting, and optimization.","ja":"Ideal for WordPress Developer Agents specializing in Gutenberg block creation, troubleshooting, and optimization.","ko":"Ideal for WordPress Developer Agents specializing in Gutenberg block creation, troubleshooting, and optimization.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrolladores de WordPress especializados en la creación de bloques de Gutenberg, solución de problemas y optimización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développeurs WordPress spécialisés dans la création de blocs Gutenberg, la dépannage et l''optimisation.","de":"Ideal für WordPress-Entwickler-Agenten, die auf die Erstellung von Gutenberg-Blöcken, Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedores do WordPress especializados na criação de blocos do Gutenberg, solução de problemas e otimização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков WordPress, специализирующихся на создании блоков Gutenberg, устранении неполадок и оптимизации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مطور ووردبريس متخصص في إنشاء كتلة جوتينبرغ وتصحيح الأعطال والتحسين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct manipulation of the WordPress block development lifecycle, from configuring `block.json` attributes and supports to implementing dynamic rendering with `render.php` and handling complex block deprecations with migration strategies. Provides expert-level tooling integration for `@wordpress/scripts` and `wp-env` workflows.","zh":"Enables direct manipulation of the WordPress block development lifecycle, from configuring `block.json` attributes and supports to implementing dynamic rendering with `render.php` and handling complex block deprecations with migration strategies. Provides expert-level tooling integration for `@wordpress/scripts` and `wp-env` workflows.","ja":"Enables direct manipulation of the WordPress block development lifecycle, from configuring `block.json` attributes and supports to implementing dynamic rendering with `render.php` and handling complex block deprecations with migration strategies. Provides expert-level tooling integration for `@wordpress/scripts` and `wp-env` workflows.","ko":"Enables direct manipulation of the WordPress block development lifecycle, from configuring `block.json` attributes and supports to implementing dynamic rendering with `render.php` and handling complex block deprecations with migration strategies. Provides expert-level tooling integration for `@wordpress/scripts` and `wp-env` workflows.","es":"Permite la manipulación directa del ciclo de vida del desarrollo de bloques de WordPress, desde la configuración de atributos y soportes de `block.json` hasta la implementación de renderizado dinámico con `render.php` y el manejo de deprecaciones de bloques complejos con estrategias de migración. Proporciona una integración de herramientas de nivel experto para flujos de trabajo de `@wordpress/scripts` y `wp-env`.","fr":"Permet la manipulation directe du cycle de vie du développement de blocs WordPress, depuis la configuration des attributs et des supports de `block.json` jusqu''à la mise en œuvre du rendu dynamique avec `render.php` et la gestion des dépréciations de blocs complexes avec des stratégies de migration. Fournit une intégration d''outils de niveau expert pour les flux de travail de `@wordpress/scripts` et `wp-env`.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Manipulation des WordPress-Block-Entwicklungslebenszyklus, von der Konfiguration von `block.json`-Attributen und -Unterstützungen bis zur Implementierung der dynamischen Rendering mit `render.php` und der Handhabung komplexer Block-Veraltungen mit Migrationsstrategien. Bietet eine Experten-Tool-Integration für `@wordpress/scripts`- und `wp-env`-Workflows.","pt":"Permite a manipulação direta do ciclo de vida do desenvolvimento de blocos do WordPress, desde a configuração de atributos e suportes do `block.json` até a implementação de renderização dinâmica com `render.php` e tratamento de depreciações de blocos complexas com estratégias de migração. Fornece integração de ferramentas de nível expert para fluxos de trabalho `@wordpress/scripts` e `wp-env`.","ru":"Позволяет trực tiếp манипулировать циклом жизни разработки блоков WordPress, начиная от конфигурирования атрибутов и поддержек `block.json` и заканчивая реализацией динамической отрисовки с помощью `render.php` и обработкой сложных устаревших блоков с помощью стратегий миграции. Предоставляет интеграцию инструментов экспертного уровня для рабочих процессов `@wordpress/scripts` и `wp-env`.","ar":"يسمح بالتعامل المباشر مع دورة حياة تطوير كتلة ووردبريس، بدءًا من تكوين سمات ودعم `block.json` حتى تنفيذ تقديم ديناميكي مع `render.php` ومعالجة كتلة قديمة معقدة باستخدام استراتيجيات النقل. يوفر تكامل أدوات مستوى خبير لتدفقات العمل `@wordpress/scripts` و `wp-env`."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ''block invalid'' errors and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic block rendering via `render_callback` or `render.php`","Configuring block build tooling with `@wordpress/create-block` and `@wordpress/scripts`","Managing block deprecation and migration through `deprecated` versions"],"zh":["Debugging ''block invalid'' errors and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic block rendering via `render_callback` or `render.php`","Configuring block build tooling with `@wordpress/create-block` and `@wordpress/scripts`","Managing block deprecation and migration through `deprecated` versions"],"ja":["Debugging ''block invalid'' errors and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic block rendering via `render_callback` or `render.php`","Configuring block build tooling with `@wordpress/create-block` and `@wordpress/scripts`","Managing block deprecation and migration through `deprecated` versions"],"ko":["Debugging ''block invalid'' errors and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic block rendering via `render_callback` or `render.php`","Configuring block build tooling with `@wordpress/create-block` and `@wordpress/scripts`","Managing block deprecation and migration through `deprecated` versions"],"es":["Depuración de errores de ''bloque no válido'' y problemas de persistencia de atributos","Implementación de renderizado de bloques dinámicos a través de `render_callback` o `render.php`","Configuración de herramientas de compilación de bloques con `@wordpress/create-block` y `@wordpress/scripts`","Gestión de la deprecación y migración de bloques a través de versiones `deprecated`"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de ''bloc non valide'' et des problèmes de persistance d''attributs","Mise en œuvre du rendu de blocs dynamiques via `render_callback` ou `render.php`","Configuration des outils de construction de blocs avec `@wordpress/create-block` et `@wordpress/scripts`","Gestion de la dépréciation et de la migration de blocs via des versions `deprecated`"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von ''Block ungültig''-Fehlern und Attribut-Persistenzproblemen","Implementierung der dynamischen Blockrendering über `render_callback` oder `render.php`","Konfiguration der Block-Build-Tools mit `@wordpress/create-block` und `@wordpress/scripts`","Verwaltung der Block-Veraltung und Migration über `deprecated`-Versionen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros de ''bloco inválido'' e problemas de persistência de atributos","Implementação de renderização de bloco dinâmica via `render_callback` ou `render.php`","Configuração de ferramentas de construção de blocos com `@wordpress/create-block` e `@wordpress/scripts`","Gerenciamento de depreciação e migração de blocos por meio de versões `deprecated`"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок ''неправильный блок'' и проблем с сохранением атрибутов","Реализация динамической отрисовки блоков через `render_callback` или `render.php`","Конфигурирование инструментов построения блоков с помощью `@wordpress/create-block` и `@wordpress/scripts`","Управление устареванием и миграцией блоков посредством версий `deprecated`"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء ''كتلة غير صالحة'' ومشاكل استمرار السمات","تنفيذ تقديم كتلة ديناميكي عبر `render_callback` أو `render.php`","تكوين أدوات بناء الكتلة باستخدام `@wordpress/create-block` و `@wordpress/scripts`","إدارة الإلغاء والتجديد للكتلة من خلال إصدارات `deprecated`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Exclusively for WordPress Gutenberg block development","Requires familiarity with PHP and modern JavaScript build processes","Dependent on WordPress-specific tooling and environments"],"zh":["Exclusively for WordPress Gutenberg block development","Requires familiarity with PHP and modern JavaScript build processes","Dependent on WordPress-specific tooling and environments"],"ja":["Exclusively for WordPress Gutenberg block development","Requires familiarity with PHP and modern JavaScript build processes","Dependent on WordPress-specific tooling and environments"],"ko":["Exclusively for WordPress Gutenberg block development","Requires familiarity with PHP and modern JavaScript build processes","Dependent on WordPress-specific tooling and environments"],"es":["Exclusivamente para el desarrollo de bloques de WordPress Gutenberg","Requiere familiaridad con PHP y procesos de compilación de JavaScript modernos","Dependiente de herramientas y entornos específicos de WordPress"],"fr":["Exclusivement pour le développement de blocs WordPress Gutenberg","Nécessite une connaissance de PHP et des processus de construction de JavaScript modernes","Dépendant d''outils et d''environnements spécifiques à WordPress"],"de":["Ausschließlich für die Entwicklung von WordPress-Gutenberg-Blöcken","Benötigt Kenntnisse von PHP und modernen JavaScript-Build-Prozessen","Abhängig von WordPress-spezifischen Tooling und Umgebungen"],"pt":["Exclusivamente para desenvolvimento de blocos do Gutenberg do WordPress","Requer familiaridade com PHP e processos de compilação de JavaScript modernos","Dependente de ferramentas e ambientes específicos do WordPress"],"ru":["Исключительно для разработки блоков Gutenberg в WordPress","Требует знания PHP и современных процессов сборки JavaScript","Зависит от конкретных инструментов и сред WordPress"],"ar":["حصرًا لتطوير كتلة جوتينبرغ في ووردبريس","يتطلب معرفة بى إتش بي والعمليات الحديثة لإنشاء جافاسكريبت","يعتمد على أدوات وبيئات ووردبريس المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
