cke","Anpassung von bestehenden Blöcken","Bearbeitung von block.json-Dateien","Implementierung von dynamischem Rendern","Verwendung von Build-Tools für Blöcke","Veraltetheit und Migration von Blöcken"],"pt":["Criação de blocos personalizados","Atualização de blocos existentes","Depuração de blocos","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Отладка блоков","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل مخصصة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تصحيح أخطاء الكتل","إضافة العرض الديناميكي","هجرة الكتل","أدوات البناء للكتल"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress块开发","块创建","块更新","动态渲染","构建工具","WordPress开发"],"ja":["WordPressブロック開発","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","動的レンダリング","ビルドツール","WordPress開発"],"ko":["워드프레스 블록 개발","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","동적 렌더링","빌드 툴","워드프레스 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques wp","wordpress block development","creación de bloques personalizados","personalización de bloques","block.json","renderizado dinámico","herramientas de construcción de bloques","deprecación de bloques","migración de bloques"],"fr":["développement de blocs wp","wordpress block development","création de blocs personnalisés","personnalisation de blocs","block.json","rendu dynamique","outils de construction de blocs","obsolescence de blocs","migration de blocs"],"de":["wp-block-entwicklung","wordpress block development","erstellung benutzerdefinierter blöcke","anpassung von blöcken","block.json","dynamisches rendern","build-tools für blöcke","veraltetheit von blöcken","migration von blöcken"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de bloco wordpress","criação de blocos","atualização de blocos","depuração de blocos","renderização dinâmica","migração de blocos","ferramentas de build","wordpress","blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wordpress","создание блоков","обновление блоков","отладка блоков","динамическая отрисовка","миграция блоков","инструменты сборки","wordpress","блоки"],"ar":["تطوير كتلة ووردبريس","إنشاء كتل","تحديث الكتل","تصحيح أخطاء الكتل","العرض الديناميكي","هجرة الكتل","أدوات البناء","ووردبريس","الكتل"]}},"owner":"Xilonz","repo":"gemini-wordpress-agent-skills","repoPath":"Xilonz/gemini-wordpress-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:18.817Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress-focused Agents needing advanced block development and customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级块开发和自定义功能的WordPress专注代理。","ja":"WordPressに特化したエージェントが高度なブロック開発とカスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 블록 개발 및 사용자 지정 기능이 필요한 워드프레스 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en WordPress que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y personalización de bloques avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur WordPress nécessitant des capacités de développement et de personnalisation de blocs avancées.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte Blockentwicklungs- und Anpassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes focados no WordPress que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento e personalização de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на WordPress, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки и настройки блоков.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على ووردبريس والذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتطوير البلوك وتخصيصها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage WordPress blocks with ease, utilizing tools like @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block, and wp-env, while handling block deprecations and migrations, and implementing dynamic rendering with render.php and render_callback.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理WordPress块的能力，利用@wordpress/scripts、@wordpress/create-block和wp-env等工具，同时处理块弃用和迁移，并使用render.php和render_callback实现动态渲染。","ja":"エージェントが@wordpress/scripts、@wordpress/create-block、wp-envなどのツールを利用してWordPressブロックを作成して管理できるようにし、ブロックの廃止と移行の処理や、render.phpとrender_callbackを使用した動的なレンダリングの実装を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block 및 wp-env와 같은 도구를 사용하여 워드프레스 블록을 만들고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 블록 폐기 및 마이그레이션 처리 및 render.php 및 render_callback를 사용한 동적 렌더링 구현을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar bloques de WordPress con facilidad, utilizando herramientas como @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block y wp-env, mientras maneja la obsolescencia y las migraciones de bloques, y implementa la renderización dinámica con render.php y render_callback.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des blocs WordPress avec facilité, en utilisant des outils tels que @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block et wp-env, tout en gérant les dépréciations et les migrations de blocs, et en mettant en œuvre un rendu dynamique avec render.php et render_callback.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, WordPress-Blöcke einfach zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem es Tools wie @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block und wp-env verwendet, während es Block-Veraltungen und -Migrationen handhabt und dynamisches Rendering mit render.php und render_callback implementiert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem blocos do WordPress com facilidade, utilizando ferramentas como @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block e wp-env, além de lidar com a descontinuação e migração de blocos e implementar renderização dinâmica com render.php e render_callback.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять блоками WordPress с легкостью, используя инструменты как @wordpress/scripts, @wordpress/create-block и wp-env, а также обрабатывать устаревание и миграцию блоков и реализовывать динамическую отрисовку с помощью render.php и render_callback.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة البلوك في ووردبريس بسهولة، باستخدام أدوات مثل @wordpress/scripts و @wordpress/create-block و wp-env، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع إيقاف تشغيل البلوك والهجرة وتطبيق العرض الديناميكي باستخدام render.php و render_callback."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and updating custom WordPress blocks","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic block rendering with render.php"],"zh":["创建和更新自定义WordPress块","调试块失效和属性持久性问题","使用render.php实现动态块渲染"],"ja":["カスタムWordPressブロックの作成と更新","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性に関する問題のデバッグ","render.phpを使用したブロックの動的なレンダリングの実装"],"ko":["사용자 지정 워드프레스 블록 만들기 및 업데이트","블록 무효화 및 속성 영속성 문제 디버깅","render.php를 사용한 블록 동적 렌더링 구현"],"es":["Creación y actualización de bloques personalizados de WordPress","Depuración de problemas de invalidación y persistencia de atributos de bloques","Implementación de renderizado de bloques dinámicos con render.php"],"fr":["Création et mise à jour de blocs WordPress personnalisés","Débogage des problèmes d''invalidation et de persistance d''attributs de blocs","Mise en œuvre du rendu de blocs dynamiques avec render.php"],"de":["Erstellung und Aktualisierung von benutzerdefinierten WordPress-Blöcken","Fehlerbeheb