:{"zh":"Tiptap 是一个生产就绪的富文本编辑器，支持 React 19+ 和 Tailwind v4","ja":"Tiptap はプロダクションレディのリッチテキストエディターで、React 19+ と Tailwind v4 をサポートしています","ko":"Tiptap은 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 리치텍스트 에디터로 React 19+와 Tailwind v4를 지원합니다","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para React que ofrece una amplia gama de funcionalidades y extensiones. Aprende a utilizarlo en tu proyecto.","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte enrichi pour React qui offre une large gamme de fonctionnalités et d''extensions. Apprenez à l''utiliser dans votre projet.","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für React, der eine breite Palette von Funktionen und Erweiterungen bietet. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ihn in Ihrem Projekt verwen...","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto enriquecido para React, pronto para produção e com dependências como React 19+ e Tailwind v4","ru":"Tiptap - редактор богатого текста для React, готовый к производству и имеющий зависимости seperti React 19+ и Tailwind v4","ar":"تيبتاب هو محرر نص غني لرياكت، جاهز للانتاج ومعتمدين مثل رياكت 19+ وتايلويند v4","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持 React 19+","支持 Tailwind v4","提供快速开始指南","包含多种扩展插件","支持图片、颜色和文本样式"],"ja":["React 19+ をサポート","Tailwind v4 をサポート","クイックスタートガイドを提供","多種の拡張プラグインを含む","画像、色、テキストスタイルをサポート"],"ko":["React 19+ 지원","Tailwind v4 지원","快速 시작 가이드 제공","다양한 확장 플러그인 포함","이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일 지원"],"es":["Soporte para React 19+","Compatibilidad con Tailwind v4","Extensiones para imágenes, colores y estilos de texto","Kit de inicio para un rápido comienzo","Actualizaciones verificadas hasta 2026-01-21"],"fr":["Prise en charge de React 19+","Compatibilité avec Tailwind v4","Extensions pour les images, les couleurs et les styles de texte","Kit de démarrage pour un démarrage rapide","Mises à jour vérifiées jusqu''au 2026-01-21"],"de":["Unterstützung für React 19+","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind v4","Erweiterungen für Bilder, Farben und Textstile","Startkit für einen schnellen Einstieg","Aktualisierungen überprüft bis 2026-01-21"],"pt":["Editor de texto enriquecido para React","Recursos avançados de formatação","Personalização com Tailwind v4","Suporte a imagens e estilos de texto","Kit de inicialização para projetos rápidos"],"ru":["Редактор богатого текста для React","Расширенные функции форматирования","Настройка с помощью Tailwind v4","Поддержка изображений и стилей текста","Набор для быстрого запуска проектов"],"ar":["محرر نص غني لرياكت","ميزات متقدمة للتنسيق","التحسين باستخدام تايلويند v4","دعم الصور وأساليب النص","حزمة لبدء المشاريع بسرعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tiptap","富文本编辑器","React","Tailwind","JavaScript 库","快速开始","扩展插件"],"ja":["Tiptap","リッチテキストエディター","React","Tailwind","JavaScript ライブラリ","クイックスタート","拡張プラグイン"],"ko":["Tiptap","리치텍스트 에디터","React","Tailwind","JavaScript 라이브러리","快速 시작","확장 플러그인"],"es":["Tiptap","editor de texto enriquecido","React","Tailwind","extensiones","kit de inicio","desarrollo web","JavaScript"],"fr":["Tiptap","éditeur de texte enrichi","React","Tailwind","extensions","kit de démarrage","développement web","JavaScript"],"de":["Tiptap","Rich-Text-Editor","React","Tailwind","Erweiterungen","Startkit","Webentwicklung","JavaScript"],"pt":["Tiptap","Editor de texto enriquecido","React","Tailwind","Formatação de texto","Personalização de UI","Desenvolvimento web","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Tiptap","Редактор богатого текста","React","Tailwind","Форматирование текста","Настройка интерфейса","Веб-разработка","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تيبتاب","محرر نص غني","رياكت","تايلويند","تنسيق النص","تحسين الواجهة","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```","body":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- `@tiptap/pm` is required peer dependency (ProseMirror engine)\n- StarterKit bundles 20+ essential extensions (headings, lists, bold, italic, etc.)\n- Image/color/typography are common additions not in StarterKit\n\n**Important**: If using Tiptap v3.14.0+, drag handle functionality requires minimum v3.14.0 (regression fixed in that release). For Pro extensions with drag handles, React 18 is recommended due to tippyjs-react dependency.\n\n### 2. Create SSR-Safe Editor\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor, EditorContent } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\n\nexport function Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    content: ''<p>Hello World!</p>'',\n    immediatelyRender: false, // ⚠️ CRITICAL for SSR/Next.js\n    editorProps: {\n      attributes: {\n        class: ''prose prose-sm focus:outline-none min-h-[200px] p-4'',\n      },\n    },\n  })\n\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- **Always set `immediatelyRender: false`** for Next.js/SSR apps (prevents hydration mismatch)\n- Without this, you''ll see: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n- This is the #1 error reported by Tiptap users\n\n### 3. Add Tailwind Typography (Optional but Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\n```\n\nUpdate your `tailwind.config.ts`:\n```typescript\nimport typography from ''@tailwindcss/typography''\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [typography],\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Provides default prose styling for headings, lists, links, etc.\n- Without it, formatted content looks unstyled\n- Alternative: Use custom Tailwind classes with `.tiptap` selector\n\n---\n\n## The 3-Step Setup Process\n\n### Step 1: Choose Your Integration Method\n\n**Option A: shadcn Minimal Tiptap Component (Recommended)**\n\nInstall the pre-built shadcn component:\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap/main/registry/block-registry.json\n```\n\nThis installs:\n- Fully-featured editor component with toolbar\n- Image upload support\n- Code block with syntax highlighting\n- Typography extension configured\n- Dark mode support\n\n**Option B: Build Custom Editor (Full Control)**\n\nUse templates from this skill:\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal editor setup\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Option A: Faster setup, opinionated UI\n- Option B: Complete customization, headless approach\n- Both work with React + Tailwind v4\n\n### Step 2: Configure Extensions\n\nExtensions add functionality to your editor:\n\n```typescript\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport Image from ''@tiptap/extension-image''\nimport Link from ''@tiptap/extension-link''\nimport Typography from ''@tiptap/extension-typography''\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      // Customize built-in extensions\n      heading: {\n        levels: [1, 2, 3],\n      },\n      bulletList: {\n        keepMarks: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Image.configure({\n      inline: true,\n      allowBase64: false, // ⚠️ Prevent base64 bloat\n      resize: {\n        enabled: true,\n        directions: [''top-right'', ''bottom-right'', ''bottom-left'', ''top-left''],\n        minWidth: 100,\n        minHeight: 100,\n        alwaysPreserveAspectRatio: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Link.configure({\n      openOnClick: false,\n      HTMLAttributes: {\n        class: ''text-primary underline'',\n      },\n    }),\n    Typography, // Smart quotes, dashes, etc.\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Set `allowBase64: false` to prevent huge JSON payloads\n- Use upload handler pattern (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n- Extension order matters - dependencies must load first\n\n### Step 3: Handle Image Uploads (If Needed)\n\n**Pattern**: Base64 preview → background upload → replace with URL\n\nSee `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` for full implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Editor } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nasync function uploadImageToR2(file: File, env: Env): Promise<string> {\n  // 1. Create base64 preview for immediate display\n  const reader = new FileReader()\n  const base64 = await new Promise<string>((resolve) => {\n    reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string)\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file)\n  })\n\n  // 2. Insert preview into editor\n  editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src: base64 }).run()\n\n  // 3. Upload to R2 in background\n  const formData = new FormData()\n  formData.append(''file'', file)\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/upload'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: formData,\n  })\n\n  const { url } = await response.json()\n\n  // 4. Replace base64 with permanent URL\n  editor.chain()\n    .focus()\n    .updateAttributes(''image'', { src: url })\n    .run()\n\n  return url\n}\n```\n\n**Why this pattern:**\n- Immediate user feedback (preview)\n- No database bloat from base64\n- Works with Cloudflare R2\n- Graceful error handling\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` for SSR apps\n✅ Install `@tailwindcss/typography` for prose styling\n✅ Use upload handler for images (not base64)\n✅ Memoize editor configuration to prevent re-renders\n✅ Include `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `immediatelyRender: true` (default) with Next.js/SSR\n❌ Store images as base64 in database (use URL after upload)\n❌ Forget to add `prose` classes to editor container\n❌ Load more than 100 widgets in collaborative mode\n❌ Use Create React App (v3 incompatible - use Vite)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **7** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: SSR Hydration Mismatch\n**Error**: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856), [#5602](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5602)\n**Why It Happens**: Default `immediatelyRender: true` breaks Next.js hydration\n**Prevention**: Template includes `immediatelyRender: false` by default\n\n### Issue #2: Editor Re-renders on Every Keystroke\n**Error**: Laggy typing, poor performance in large documents\n**Source**: [Tiptap Performance Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor#immediatelyrender)\n**Why It Happens**: `useEditor()` hook re-renders component on every change\n**Prevention**: Use `useEditorState()` hook or memoization patterns (see templates)\n\n### Issue #3: Tailwind Typography Not Working\n**Error**: Headings/lists render unstyled, no formatting visible\n**Source**: [shadcn Tiptap Discussion](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/discussions/1729)\n**Why It Happens**: Missing `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n**Prevention**: Skill includes typography plugin installation in checklist\n\n### Issue #4: Image Upload Base64 Bloat\n**Error**: JSON payloads become megabytes, slow saves, database bloat\n**Source**: [Tiptap Image Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions/nodes/image#usage)\n**Why It Happens**: Default allows base64, no upload handler configured\n**Prevention**: R2 upload template with URL replacement pattern\n\n### Issue #5: Build Errors in Create React App\n**Error**: \"jsx-runtime\" module resolution errors after upgrading to v3\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6812](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6812)\n**Why It Happens**: CRA incompatibility with v3 module structure\n**Prevention**: Skill documents Vite as preferred bundler + provides working config\n\n### Issue #6: ProseMirror Multiple Versions Conflict\n**Error**: `Error: Looks like multiple versions of prosemirror-model were loaded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #577](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/577) (131 comments), [Issue #6171](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6171)\n**Why It Happens**: Installing additional Tiptap extensions can pull different versions of prosemirror-model or prosemirror-view, creating duplicate dependencies in node_modules. The unique-id extension is particularly problematic in testing environments.\n**Prevention**: Use package resolutions to force a single ProseMirror version\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"prosemirror-model\": \"~1.21.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-view\": \"~1.33.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-state\": \"~1.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr reinstall dependencies:\n```bash\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm install\n```\n\n**Note**: The @tiptap/pm package is designed to prevent this issue, but extensions may still introduce conflicts.\n\n### Issue #7: EditorProvider vs useEditor Confusion (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: `SSR has been detected, please set ''immediatelyRender'' explicitly to ''false''` (when both used together)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856 Comment](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856#issuecomment-2493124171)\n**Why It Happens**: Users commonly use EditorProvider and useEditor together, but EditorProvider is a wrapper around useEditor for React Context setup - they should not be used simultaneously.\n**Prevention**: Choose one pattern only\n\n**Incorrect Pattern**:\n```typescript\n// Don''t use both together\n<EditorProvider>\n  <MyComponent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const editor = useEditor({ ... }) // ❌ Wrong - EditorProvider already created editor\n}\n```\n\n**Correct Patterns**:\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Use EditorProvider only\n<EditorProvider immediatelyRender={false} extensions={[StarterKit]}>\n  <EditorContent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\n// Option 2: Use useEditor only\nfunction Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    immediatelyRender: false,\n  })\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Reference\n\n### Tailwind Prose Styling (tiptap-prose.css)\n\n```css\n/* Apply to editor container */\n.tiptap {\n  /* Tailwind Typography */\n  @apply prose prose-sm sm:prose-base lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none;\n\n  /* Custom overrides */\n  h1 {\n    @apply text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    @apply text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    @apply my-4 text-base leading-7;\n  }\n\n  ul, ol {\n    @apply my-4 ml-6;\n  }\n\n  code {\n    @apply bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono;\n  }\n\n  pre {\n    @apply bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto;\n  }\n\n  blockquote {\n    @apply border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Why these settings:**\n- `prose` classes provide consistent formatting\n- `dark:prose-invert` handles dark mode automatically\n- Custom overrides use semantic Tailwind v4 colors\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Collaborative Editing with Y.js\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport Collaboration from ''@tiptap/extension-collaboration''\nimport * as Y from ''yjs''\n\nconst ydoc = new Y.Doc()\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      history: false, // Disable history for collaboration\n    }),\n    Collaboration.configure({\n      document: ydoc,\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: Real-time multi-user editing (Notion-like)\n**See**: `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` for full example\n\n### Pattern 2: Markdown Support\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport { Markdown } from ''@tiptap/markdown''\n\n// Load editor with markdown content\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [StarterKit, Markdown],\n  content: ''# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown**!'',\n  contentType: ''markdown'',  // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must specify or content parsed as HTML\n  immediatelyRender: false,\n})\n\n// Get markdown from editor\nconst markdownOutput = editor.getMarkdown()\n\n// Insert markdown content\neditor.commands.setContent(''## New heading'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\neditor.commands.insertContent(''**Bold** text'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\n```\n\n**When to use**: Storing content as markdown, displaying/editing rich text\n**Install**: `npm install @tiptap/markdown@3.16.0`\n**Status**: Beta (released Oct 2025, API stable but may change)\n**CRITICAL**: Always specify `contentType: ''markdown''` when setting markdown content\n\n**Recent Fixes** (v3.15.0-v3.16.0):\n- Fixed incorrect Markdown output when underline is mixed with bold/italic and ranges don''t fully overlap\n- Improved serialization for overlapping formatting marks\n- Source: [v3.16.0 Release](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/releases/tag/v3.16.0)\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Integration with react-hook-form\n\n```typescript\nimport { useForm, Controller } from ''react-hook-form''\n\nfunction BlogForm() {\n  const { control, handleSubmit } = useForm()\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n      <Controller\n        name=\"content\"\n        control={control}\n        render={({ field }) => (\n          <Editor\n            content={field.value}\n            onUpdate={({ editor }) => {\n              field.onChange(editor.getHTML())\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n      />\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Blog posts, comments, any form-based content\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\nNo executable scripts for this skill.\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**Required for all projects:**\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal React editor component\n- `templates/package.json` - Required dependencies\n\n**Optional based on needs:**\n- `templates/minimal-tiptap-setup.sh` - shadcn component installation\n- `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` - R2 upload handler\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n- `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` - Y.js collaboration\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n\n**When to load these**: Claude should reference templates when user asks to:\n- Set up tiptap editor\n- Add image uploads\n- Configure collaborative editing\n- Style with Tailwind prose\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `references/tiptap-docs.md` - Key documentation links\n- `references/common-errors.md` - Error troubleshooting guide\n- `references/extension-catalog.md` - Popular extensions list\n\n**When Claude should load these**: Troubleshooting errors, exploring extensions, understanding API\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### Custom Extensions\n\nCreate your own Tiptap extensions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Node } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nconst CustomNode = Node.create({\n  name: ''customNode'',\n\n  group: ''block'',\n\n  content: ''inline*'',\n\n  parseHTML() {\n    return [{ tag: ''div[data-custom]'' }]\n  },\n\n  renderHTML({ HTMLAttributes }) {\n    return [''div'', { ''data-custom'': '''', ...HTMLAttributes }, 0]\n  },\n\n  addCommands() {\n    return {\n      insertCustomNode: () => ({ commands }) => {\n        return commands.insertContent({ type: this.name })\n      },\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Custom widgets, embeds, interactive elements\n\n### Slash Commands\n\nAdd Notion-like `/` commands:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Extension } from ''@tiptap/core''\nimport Suggestion from ''@tiptap/suggestion''\n\nconst SlashCommands = Extension.create({\n  name: ''slashCommands'',\n\n  addOptions() {\n    return {\n      suggestion: {\n        char: ''/'',\n        items: ({ query }) => {\n          return [\n            { title: ''Heading 1'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).setHeading({ level: 1 }).run()\n            }},\n            { title: ''Bullet List'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).toggleBulletList().run()\n            }},\n          ]\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  },\n\n  addProseMirrorPlugins() {\n    return [Suggestion({ editor: this.editor, ...this.options.suggestion })]\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Productivity shortcuts, quick formatting\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- `@tiptap/react@^3.16.0` - React integration (React 19 supported)\n- `@tiptap/starter-kit@^3.16.0` - Essential extensions bundle\n- `@tiptap/pm@^3.16.0` - ProseMirror peer dependency\n- `react@^19.0.0` - React framework\n\n**React Version Compatibility**:\n- **Core Tiptap**: Supports React 19 as of v2.10.0\n- **UI Components**: Work best with React 18 (Next.js 15 recommended per [official docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/install/nextjs))\n- **Pro Extensions**: May require React 18 - drag-handle extension depends on archived tippyjs-react without React 19 support ([Issue #5876](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5876))\n\n**Optional**:\n- `@tiptap/extension-audio@^3.16.0` - Audio support (NEW in v3.16.0)\n- `@tiptap/extension-image@^3.16.0` - Image support\n- `@tiptap/extension-link@^3.16.0` - Link support (NEW in v3, included in StarterKit)\n- `@tiptap/extension-color@^3.16.0` - Text color\n- `@tiptap/extension-typography@^3.16.0` - Smart typography\n- `@tiptap/extension-collaboration@^3.16.0` - Real-time collaboration\n- `@tiptap/extension-markdown@^3.16.0` - Markdown support (Beta)\n- `@tailwindcss/typography@^0.5.19` - Prose styling\n- `yjs@^13.6.0` - Collaborative editing backend\n- `react-medium-image-zoom@^5.2.0` - Image zoom functionality\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tiptap**: https://tiptap.dev\n- **Installation Guide**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/installation/react\n- **Extensions**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions\n- **API Reference**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: https://github.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap\n- **Context7 Library ID**: tiptap/tiptap\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-21)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tiptap/react\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/starter-kit\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/pm\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-audio\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-image\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-color\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-text-style\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-typography\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-link\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-markdown\": \"^3.16.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/typography\": \"^0.5.19\",\n    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Example\n\nThis skill is based on real-world implementations:\n- **GitLab**: Uses Tiptap for issue/MR descriptions\n- **Statamic CMS**: Tiptap as default rich text editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: 3.14M downloads/week\n\n**Token Savings**: ~71% (14k → 4k tokens)\n**Errors Prevented**: 7/7 documented errors (5 critical setup + 2 community patterns)\n**Validation**: ✅ SSR compatibility, ✅ Image uploads, ✅ Tailwind v4, ✅ Performance, ✅ React 19 compatibility\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Solution**: Add `immediatelyRender: false` to your `useEditor()` config\n\n### Problem: Headings/lists look unstyled\n**Solution**: Install `@tailwindcss/typography` and add `prose` classes to editor container\n\n### Problem: Editor lags when typing\n**Solution**: Use `useEditorState()` hook instead of `useEditor()` for read-only rendering, or memoize editor configuration\n\n### Problem: Images make JSON huge\n**Solution**: Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension config and use upload handler (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n\n### Problem: Build fails in Create React App\n**Solution**: Switch to Vite - CRA incompatible with Tiptap v3. See cloudflare-worker-base skill for Vite setup.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to verify your setup:\n\n- [ ] Installed `@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`, `@tiptap/pm`\n- [ ] Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` config\n- [ ] Installed `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n- [ ] Added `prose` classes to editor container\n- [ ] Configured image upload handler (if using images)\n- [ ] Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension\n- [ ] Editor renders without hydration errors\n- [ ] Formatted text displays correctly (headings, lists, etc.)\n- [ ] Dev server runs without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Production build succeeds\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check `references/common-errors.md` for troubleshooting\n2. Verify `immediatelyRender: false` is set\n3. Check official docs: https://tiptap.dev\n4. Ensure `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency is installed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:40.152Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced rich text editing capabilities with React and Tailwind integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级富文本编辑功能的前端代理，特别是与 React 和 Tailwind 集成的场景。","ja":"React および Tailwind 統合を必要とするフロントエンド エージェント向けの高度なリッチ テキスト編集機能に最適です。","ko":"React와 Tailwind 통합을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트가 사용하기에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de edición de texto rico avanzadas con integración de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de modification de texte enrichi avancées avec une intégration de React et Tailwind.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Rich-Text-Editing-Funktionen mit React- und Tailwind-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de edição de texto rico com integração do React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которые нуждаются в расширенных возможностях редактирования богатого текста с интеграцией React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحرير نص غني متقدمة مع تكنولوجيا React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive rich text editors with support for images, colors, text styles, and typography using @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm libraries, and seamlessly integrates with shadcn/ui for a robust user interface.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式富文本编辑器的能力，支持图像、颜色、文本样式和排版，使用 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm 库，并与 shadcn/ui 无缝集成以提供强大的用户界面。","ja":"@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm ライブラリを使用して、画像、色、テキストスタイル、タイポグラフィをサポートするインタラクティブなリッチテキストエディターを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、shadcn/ui とシームレスに統合して堅牢なユーザーインターフェイスを提供します。","ko":"@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 라이브러리를 사용하여 이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일, 타이포그래피를 지원하는 상호작용형 리치 텍스트 편집기를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, shadcn/ui와의 무缝 통합을 통해 강력한 사용자 인터페이스를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear editores de texto rico interactivos con soporte para imágenes, colores, estilos de texto y tipografía utilizando las bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm, y se integra de forma transparente con shadcn/ui para una interfaz de usuario robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éditeurs de texte enrichi interactifs avec une prise en charge des images, des couleurs, des styles de texte et de la typographie en utilisant les bibliothèques @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm, et s''intègre sans problème avec shadcn/ui pour une interface utilisateur robuste.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, interaktive Rich-Text-Editor mit Unterstützung für Bilder, Farben, Textstile und Typografie zu erstellen, indem sie die Bibliotheken @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm verwenden, und integriert sich nahtlos mit shadcn/ui für eine robuste Benutzeroberfläche.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem editores de texto rico interativos com suporte a imagens, cores, estilos de texto e tipografia usando as bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm, e se integra perfeitamente com shadcn/ui para uma interface de usuário robusta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивные редакторы богатого текста с поддержкой изображений, цветов, стилей текста и типографики с использованием библиотек @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm, и обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с shadcn/ui для надежного пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محررات نص غني تفاعلية مع دعم الصور والألوان وأساليب النص والطباعة باستخدام مكتبات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm، وتتكامل بشكل متكامل مع shadcn/ui من أجل واجهة مستخدم قوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building customizable rich text editors for web applications","Generating formatted text content with images and styling","Creating interactive text-based user interfaces with React and Tailwind"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序构建可自定义的富文本编辑器","生成带有图像和样式的格式化文本内容","使用 React 和 Tailwind 创建交互式基于文本的用户界面"],"ja":["Web アプリケーション用のカスタマイズ可能なリッチテキストエディターの構築","画像やスタイルを含む整形済みテキストコンテンツの生成","React および Tailwind を使用したインタラクティブなテキストベースのユーザーインターフェイスの作成"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 가능한 리치 텍스트 편집기 구축","이미지와 스타일을 포함한 형식화된 텍스트 콘텐츠 생성","React 및 Tailwind를 사용한 상호작용형 텍스트 기반 사용자 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Construir editores de texto rico personalizables para aplicaciones web","Generar contenido de texto con formato con imágenes y estilos","Crear interfaces de usuario interactivas basadas en texto con React y Tailwind"],"fr":["Créer des éditeurs de texte enrichi personnalisables pour les applications Web","Générer du contenu de texte formaté avec des images et des styles","Créer des interfaces utilisateur interactives basées sur le texte avec React et Tailwind"],"de":["Erstellen von anpassbaren Rich-Text-Editoren für Webanwendungen","Generieren von formatiertem Textinhalt mit Bildern und Stilen","Erstellen von interaktiven textbasierten Benutzeroberflächen mit React und Tailwind"],"pt":["Construir editores de texto rico personalizáveis para aplicações web","Gerar conteúdo de texto formatado com imagens e estilos","Criar interfaces de usuário baseadas em texto interativas com React e Tailwind"],"ru":["Построение настраиваемых редакторов богатого текста для веб-приложений","Генерация форматированного текстового контента с изображениями и стилями","Создание интерактивных текстовых интерфейсов пользователя с использованием React и Tailwind"],"ar":["بناء محررات نص غني قابلة للتخصيص لتطبيقات الويب","генерация محتوى نصي منسق مع الصور والأسلوب","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم تفاعلية قائمة على النص باستخدام React و Tailwind"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19+ and Tailwind v4","Dependent on @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm libraries","Recommended to use with shadcn/ui for optimal user interface"],"zh":["需要 React 19+ 和 Tailwind v4","依赖 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm 库","建议与 shadcn/ui 一起使用以获得最佳的用户界面"],"ja":["React 19+ および Tailwind v4 が必要","@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm ライブラリに依存","最適なユーザーインターフェイスを得るために shadcn/ui と共に使用することをお勧め"],"ko":["React 19+ 및 Tailwind v4가 필요함","@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 라이브러리에 의존","최적의 사용자 인터페이스를 얻으려면 shadcn/ui와 함께 사용하는 것을 권장"],"es":["Requiere React 19+ y Tailwind v4","Depende de las bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm","Se recomienda usar con shadcn/ui para una interfaz de usuario óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite React 19+ et Tailwind v4","Dépend des bibliothèques @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm","Recommandé d''utiliser avec shadcn/ui pour une interface utilisateur optimale"],"de":["Benötigt React 19+ und Tailwind v4","Hängt von den Bibliotheken @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm ab","Empfohlen, mit shadcn/ui für eine optimale Benutzeroberfläche zu verwenden"],"pt":["Requer React 19+ e Tailwind v4","Dependente das bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm","Recomendado usar com shadcn/ui para interface de usuário ótima"],"ru":["Требуется React 19+ и Tailwind v4","Зависит от библиотек @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm","Рекомендуется использовать с shadcn/ui для оптимального пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب React 19+ و Tailwind v4","يعتمد على مكتبات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm","يوصى باستخدامه مع shadcn/ui لتحقيق واجهة مستخدم ممتازة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/tiptap', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'tiptap', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:50:57.801Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/tiptap","name":"tiptap","description":{"zh":"Tiptap 是一个生产就绪的富文本编辑器，支持 React 和 Tailwind CSS","ja":"Tiptap は Production Ready のリッチテキストエディターで、React と Tailwind CSS をサポート","ko":"Tiptap은 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 리치 텍스트 에디터로 React와 Tailwind CSS를 지원","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para aplicaciones web, compatible con React y Tailwind. Ofrece una instalación rápida y fácil.","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte enrichi pour les applications web, compatible avec React et Tailwind. Il offre une installation rapide et facile.","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für Webanwendungen, der mit React und Tailwind kompatibel ist. Er bietet eine schnelle und einfache Installation.","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para React, pronto para produção e com dependências atualizadas","ru":"Tiptap - редактор богатого текста для React, готовый к производству и с обновленными зависимостями","ar":"تبتاب هو محرر نص غني لري액ت، جاهز للانتاج مع تبعيات محدثة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tiptap 富文本编辑器","ja":"Tiptap リッチテキストエディター","ko":"Tiptap 리치 텍스트 에디터","es":"Tiptap: Editor de Texto Enrichido para Desarrolladores","fr":"Tiptap : Éditeur de Texte Riche pour Développeurs","de":"Tiptap: Rich-Text-Editor für Entwickler","pt":"Tiptap Editor de Texto Rico","ru":"Tiptap Редактор Богатого Текста","ar":"تبتاب محرر نص غني","en":"tiptap"},"description":{"zh":"Tiptap 是一个生产就绪的富文本编辑器，支持 React 和 Tailwind CSS","ja":"Tiptap は Production Ready のリッチテキストエディターで、React と Tailwind CSS をサポート","ko":"Tiptap은 프로덕션 준비가 완료된 리치 텍스트 에디터로 React와 Tailwind CSS를 지원","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para aplicaciones web, compatible con React y Tailwind. Ofrece una instalación rápida y fácil.","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte enrichi pour les applications web, compatible avec React et Tailwind. Il offre une installation rapide et facile.","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für Webanwendungen, der mit React und Tailwind kompatibel ist. Er bietet eine schnelle und einfache Installation.","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para React, pronto para produção e com dependências atualizadas","ru":"Tiptap - редактор богатого текста для React, готовый к производству и с обновленными зависимостями","ar":"تبتاب هو محرر نص غني لري액ت، جاهز للانتاج مع تبعيات محدثة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 React 19+","支持 Tailwind v4","支持 shadcn/ui","提供快速开始指南","支持多种扩展插件"],"ja":["React 19+ をサポート","Tailwind v4 をサポート","shadcn/ui をサポート","クイックスタートガイドを提供","多種の拡張プラグインをサポート"],"ko":["React 19+ 지원","Tailwind v4 지원","shadcn/ui 지원","快速 시작 가이드 제공","다수의 확장 플러그인 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con React 19+","Integración con Tailwind v4","Soporte para imágenes y colores","Estilos de texto personalizables","Tipografía adaptable"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec React 19+","Intégration avec Tailwind v4","Prise en charge des images et des couleurs","Styles de texte personnalisables","Typographie adaptable"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit React 19+","Integration mit Tailwind v4","Unterstützung für Bilder und Farben","Anpassbare Textstile","Anpassbare Typografie"],"pt":["Editor de texto rico para React","Pronto para produção","Dependências atualizadas","Instalação rápida em 5 minutos","Suporte a imagens, cores e estilos de texto"],"ru":["Редактор богатого текста для React","Готовый к производству","Обновленные зависимости","Быстрая установка за 5 минут","Поддержка изображений, цветов и стилей текста"],"ar":["محرر نص غني لري액ت","جاهز للانتاج","التبعيات محدثة","التثبيت السريع في 5 دقائق","دعم الصور، الألوان وأساليب النص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tiptap","富文本编辑器","React","Tailwind CSS","JavaScript 库","编辑器","前端开发"],"ja":["Tiptap","リッチテキストエディター","React","Tailwind CSS","JavaScript ライブラリ","エディター","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Tiptap","리치 텍스트 에디터","React","Tailwind CSS","JavaScript 라이브러리","에디터","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["editor de texto enriquecido","tiptap","react","tailwind","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario personalizadas"],"fr":["éditeur de texte enrichi","tiptap","react","tailwind","développement web","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées"],"de":["rich-text-editor","tiptap","react","tailwind","webentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Tiptap","Editor de texto rico","React","Produção","Dependências","Instalação rápida","Imagens","Cores","Estilos de texto"],"ru":["Tiptap","Редактор богатого текста","React","Производство","Зависимости","Быстрая установка","Изображения","Цвета","Стили текста"],"ar":["تبتاب","محرر نص غني","ري액ت","الانتاج","التبعيات","التثبيت السريع","الصور","الألوان","أساليب النص"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```","body":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- `@tiptap/pm` is required peer dependency (ProseMirror engine)\n- StarterKit bundles 20+ essential extensions (headings, lists, bold, italic, etc.)\n- Image/color/typography are common additions not in StarterKit\n\n**Important**: If using Tiptap v3.14.0+, drag handle functionality requires minimum v3.14.0 (regression fixed in that release). For Pro extensions with drag handles, React 18 is recommended due to tippyjs-react dependency.\n\n### 2. Create SSR-Safe Editor\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor, EditorContent } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\n\nexport function Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    content: ''<p>Hello World!</p>'',\n    immediatelyRender: false, // ⚠️ CRITICAL for SSR/Next.js\n    editorProps: {\n      attributes: {\n        class: ''prose prose-sm focus:outline-none min-h-[200px] p-4'',\n      },\n    },\n  })\n\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- **Always set `immediatelyRender: false`** for Next.js/SSR apps (prevents hydration mismatch)\n- Without this, you''ll see: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n- This is the #1 error reported by Tiptap users\n\n### 3. Add Tailwind Typography (Optional but Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\n```\n\nUpdate your `tailwind.config.ts`:\n```typescript\nimport typography from ''@tailwindcss/typography''\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [typography],\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Provides default prose styling for headings, lists, links, etc.\n- Without it, formatted content looks unstyled\n- Alternative: Use custom Tailwind classes with `.tiptap` selector\n\n---\n\n## The 3-Step Setup Process\n\n### Step 1: Choose Your Integration Method\n\n**Option A: shadcn Minimal Tiptap Component (Recommended)**\n\nInstall the pre-built shadcn component:\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap/main/registry/block-registry.json\n```\n\nThis installs:\n- Fully-featured editor component with toolbar\n- Image upload support\n- Code block with syntax highlighting\n- Typography extension configured\n- Dark mode support\n\n**Option B: Build Custom Editor (Full Control)**\n\nUse templates from this skill:\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal editor setup\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Option A: Faster setup, opinionated UI\n- Option B: Complete customization, headless approach\n- Both work with React + Tailwind v4\n\n### Step 2: Configure Extensions\n\nExtensions add functionality to your editor:\n\n```typescript\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport Image from ''@tiptap/extension-image''\nimport Link from ''@tiptap/extension-link''\nimport Typography from ''@tiptap/extension-typography''\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      // Customize built-in extensions\n      heading: {\n        levels: [1, 2, 3],\n      },\n      bulletList: {\n        keepMarks: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Image.configure({\n      inline: true,\n      allowBase64: false, // ⚠️ Prevent base64 bloat\n      resize: {\n        enabled: true,\n        directions: [''top-right'', ''bottom-right'', ''bottom-left'', ''top-left''],\n        minWidth: 100,\n        minHeight: 100,\n        alwaysPreserveAspectRatio: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Link.configure({\n      openOnClick: false,\n      HTMLAttributes: {\n        class: ''text-primary underline'',\n      },\n    }),\n    Typography, // Smart quotes, dashes, etc.\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Set `allowBase64: false` to prevent huge JSON payloads\n- Use upload handler pattern (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n- Extension order matters - dependencies must load first\n\n### Step 3: Handle Image Uploads (If Needed)\n\n**Pattern**: Base64 preview → background upload → replace with URL\n\nSee `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` for full implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Editor } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nasync function uploadImageToR2(file: File, env: Env): Promise<string> {\n  // 1. Create base64 preview for immediate display\n  const reader = new FileReader()\n  const base64 = await new Promise<string>((resolve) => {\n    reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string)\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file)\n  })\n\n  // 2. Insert preview into editor\n  editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src: base64 }).run()\n\n  // 3. Upload to R2 in background\n  const formData = new FormData()\n  formData.append(''file'', file)\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/upload'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: formData,\n  })\n\n  const { url } = await response.json()\n\n  // 4. Replace base64 with permanent URL\n  editor.chain()\n    .focus()\n    .updateAttributes(''image'', { src: url })\n    .run()\n\n  return url\n}\n```\n\n**Why this pattern:**\n- Immediate user feedback (preview)\n- No database bloat from base64\n- Works with Cloudflare R2\n- Graceful error handling\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` for SSR apps\n✅ Install `@tailwindcss/typography` for prose styling\n✅ Use upload handler for images (not base64)\n✅ Memoize editor configuration to prevent re-renders\n✅ Include `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `immediatelyRender: true` (default) with Next.js/SSR\n❌ Store images as base64 in database (use URL after upload)\n❌ Forget to add `prose` classes to editor container\n❌ Load more than 100 widgets in collaborative mode\n❌ Use Create React App (v3 incompatible - use Vite)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **7** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: SSR Hydration Mismatch\n**Error**: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856), [#5602](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5602)\n**Why It Happens**: Default `immediatelyRender: true` breaks Next.js hydration\n**Prevention**: Template includes `immediatelyRender: false` by default\n\n### Issue #2: Editor Re-renders on Every Keystroke\n**Error**: Laggy typing, poor performance in large documents\n**Source**: [Tiptap Performance Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor#immediatelyrender)\n**Why It Happens**: `useEditor()` hook re-renders component on every change\n**Prevention**: Use `useEditorState()` hook or memoization patterns (see templates)\n\n### Issue #3: Tailwind Typography Not Working\n**Error**: Headings/lists render unstyled, no formatting visible\n**Source**: [shadcn Tiptap Discussion](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/discussions/1729)\n**Why It Happens**: Missing `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n**Prevention**: Skill includes typography plugin installation in checklist\n\n### Issue #4: Image Upload Base64 Bloat\n**Error**: JSON payloads become megabytes, slow saves, database bloat\n**Source**: [Tiptap Image Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions/nodes/image#usage)\n**Why It Happens**: Default allows base64, no upload handler configured\n**Prevention**: R2 upload template with URL replacement pattern\n\n### Issue #5: Build Errors in Create React App\n**Error**: \"jsx-runtime\" module resolution errors after upgrading to v3\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6812](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6812)\n**Why It Happens**: CRA incompatibility with v3 module structure\n**Prevention**: Skill documents Vite as preferred bundler + provides working config\n\n### Issue #6: ProseMirror Multiple Versions Conflict\n**Error**: `Error: Looks like multiple versions of prosemirror-model were loaded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #577](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/577) (131 comments), [Issue #6171](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6171)\n**Why It Happens**: Installing additional Tiptap extensions can pull different versions of prosemirror-model or prosemirror-view, creating duplicate dependencies in node_modules. The unique-id extension is particularly problematic in testing environments.\n**Prevention**: Use package resolutions to force a single ProseMirror version\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"prosemirror-model\": \"~1.21.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-view\": \"~1.33.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-state\": \"~1.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr reinstall dependencies:\n```bash\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm install\n```\n\n**Note**: The @tiptap/pm package is designed to prevent this issue, but extensions may still introduce conflicts.\n\n### Issue #7: EditorProvider vs useEditor Confusion (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: `SSR has been detected, please set ''immediatelyRender'' explicitly to ''false''` (when both used together)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856 Comment](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856#issuecomment-2493124171)\n**Why It Happens**: Users commonly use EditorProvider and useEditor together, but EditorProvider is a wrapper around useEditor for React Context setup - they should not be used simultaneously.\n**Prevention**: Choose one pattern only\n\n**Incorrect Pattern**:\n```typescript\n// Don''t use both together\n<EditorProvider>\n  <MyComponent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const editor = useEditor({ ... }) // ❌ Wrong - EditorProvider already created editor\n}\n```\n\n**Correct Patterns**:\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Use EditorProvider only\n<EditorProvider immediatelyRender={false} extensions={[StarterKit]}>\n  <EditorContent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\n// Option 2: Use useEditor only\nfunction Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    immediatelyRender: false,\n  })\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Reference\n\n### Tailwind Prose Styling (tiptap-prose.css)\n\n```css\n/* Apply to editor container */\n.tiptap {\n  /* Tailwind Typography */\n  @apply prose prose-sm sm:prose-base lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none;\n\n  /* Custom overrides */\n  h1 {\n    @apply text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    @apply text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    @apply my-4 text-base leading-7;\n  }\n\n  ul, ol {\n    @apply my-4 ml-6;\n  }\n\n  code {\n    @apply bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono;\n  }\n\n  pre {\n    @apply bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto;\n  }\n\n  blockquote {\n    @apply border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Why these settings:**\n- `prose` classes provide consistent formatting\n- `dark:prose-invert` handles dark mode automatically\n- Custom overrides use semantic Tailwind v4 colors\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Collaborative Editing with Y.js\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport Collaboration from ''@tiptap/extension-collaboration''\nimport * as Y from ''yjs''\n\nconst ydoc = new Y.Doc()\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      history: false, // Disable history for collaboration\n    }),\n    Collaboration.configure({\n      document: ydoc,\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: Real-time multi-user editing (Notion-like)\n**See**: `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` for full example\n\n### Pattern 2: Markdown Support\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport { Markdown } from ''@tiptap/markdown''\n\n// Load editor with markdown content\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [StarterKit, Markdown],\n  content: ''# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown**!'',\n  contentType: ''markdown'',  // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must specify or content parsed as HTML\n  immediatelyRender: false,\n})\n\n// Get markdown from editor\nconst markdownOutput = editor.getMarkdown()\n\n// Insert markdown content\neditor.commands.setContent(''## New heading'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\neditor.commands.insertContent(''**Bold** text'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\n```\n\n**When to use**: Storing content as markdown, displaying/editing rich text\n**Install**: `npm install @tiptap/markdown@3.16.0`\n**Status**: Beta (released Oct 2025, API stable but may change)\n**CRITICAL**: Always specify `contentType: ''markdown''` when setting markdown content\n\n**Recent Fixes** (v3.15.0-v3.16.0):\n- Fixed incorrect Markdown output when underline is mixed with bold/italic and ranges don''t fully overlap\n- Improved serialization for overlapping formatting marks\n- Source: [v3.16.0 Release](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/releases/tag/v3.16.0)\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Integration with react-hook-form\n\n```typescript\nimport { useForm, Controller } from ''react-hook-form''\n\nfunction BlogForm() {\n  const { control, handleSubmit } = useForm()\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n      <Controller\n        name=\"content\"\n        control={control}\n        render={({ field }) => (\n          <Editor\n            content={field.value}\n            onUpdate={({ editor }) => {\n              field.onChange(editor.getHTML())\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n      />\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Blog posts, comments, any form-based content\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\nNo executable scripts for this skill.\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**Required for all projects:**\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal React editor component\n- `templates/package.json` - Required dependencies\n\n**Optional based on needs:**\n- `templates/minimal-tiptap-setup.sh` - shadcn component installation\n- `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` - R2 upload handler\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n- `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` - Y.js collaboration\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n\n**When to load these**: Claude should reference templates when user asks to:\n- Set up tiptap editor\n- Add image uploads\n- Configure collaborative editing\n- Style with Tailwind prose\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `references/tiptap-docs.md` - Key documentation links\n- `references/common-errors.md` - Error troubleshooting guide\n- `references/extension-catalog.md` - Popular extensions list\n\n**When Claude should load these**: Troubleshooting errors, exploring extensions, understanding API\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### Custom Extensions\n\nCreate your own Tiptap extensions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Node } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nconst CustomNode = Node.create({\n  name: ''customNode'',\n\n  group: ''block'',\n\n  content: ''inline*'',\n\n  parseHTML() {\n    return [{ tag: ''div[data-custom]'' }]\n  },\n\n  renderHTML({ HTMLAttributes }) {\n    return [''div'', { ''data-custom'': '''', ...HTMLAttributes }, 0]\n  },\n\n  addCommands() {\n    return {\n      insertCustomNode: () => ({ commands }) => {\n        return commands.insertContent({ type: this.name })\n      },\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Custom widgets, embeds, interactive elements\n\n### Slash Commands\n\nAdd Notion-like `/` commands:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Extension } from ''@tiptap/core''\nimport Suggestion from ''@tiptap/suggestion''\n\nconst SlashCommands = Extension.create({\n  name: ''slashCommands'',\n\n  addOptions() {\n    return {\n      suggestion: {\n        char: ''/'',\n        items: ({ query }) => {\n          return [\n            { title: ''Heading 1'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).setHeading({ level: 1 }).run()\n            }},\n            { title: ''Bullet List'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).toggleBulletList().run()\n            }},\n          ]\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  },\n\n  addProseMirrorPlugins() {\n    return [Suggestion({ editor: this.editor, ...this.options.suggestion })]\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Productivity shortcuts, quick formatting\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- `@tiptap/react@^3.16.0` - React integration (React 19 supported)\n- `@tiptap/starter-kit@^3.16.0` - Essential extensions bundle\n- `@tiptap/pm@^3.16.0` - ProseMirror peer dependency\n- `react@^19.0.0` - React framework\n\n**React Version Compatibility**:\n- **Core Tiptap**: Supports React 19 as of v2.10.0\n- **UI Components**: Work best with React 18 (Next.js 15 recommended per [official docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/install/nextjs))\n- **Pro Extensions**: May require React 18 - drag-handle extension depends on archived tippyjs-react without React 19 support ([Issue #5876](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5876))\n\n**Optional**:\n- `@tiptap/extension-audio@^3.16.0` - Audio support (NEW in v3.16.0)\n- `@tiptap/extension-image@^3.16.0` - Image support\n- `@tiptap/extension-link@^3.16.0` - Link support (NEW in v3, included in StarterKit)\n- `@tiptap/extension-color@^3.16.0` - Text color\n- `@tiptap/extension-typography@^3.16.0` - Smart typography\n- `@tiptap/extension-collaboration@^3.16.0` - Real-time collaboration\n- `@tiptap/extension-markdown@^3.16.0` - Markdown support (Beta)\n- `@tailwindcss/typography@^0.5.19` - Prose styling\n- `yjs@^13.6.0` - Collaborative editing backend\n- `react-medium-image-zoom@^5.2.0` - Image zoom functionality\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tiptap**: https://tiptap.dev\n- **Installation Guide**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/installation/react\n- **Extensions**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions\n- **API Reference**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: https://github.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap\n- **Context7 Library ID**: tiptap/tiptap\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-21)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tiptap/react\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/starter-kit\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/pm\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-audio\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-image\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-color\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-text-style\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-typography\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-link\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-markdown\": \"^3.16.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/typography\": \"^0.5.19\",\n    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Example\n\nThis skill is based on real-world implementations:\n- **GitLab**: Uses Tiptap for issue/MR descriptions\n- **Statamic CMS**: Tiptap as default rich text editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: 3.14M downloads/week\n\n**Token Savings**: ~71% (14k → 4k tokens)\n**Errors Prevented**: 7/7 documented errors (5 critical setup + 2 community patterns)\n**Validation**: ✅ SSR compatibility, ✅ Image uploads, ✅ Tailwind v4, ✅ Performance, ✅ React 19 compatibility\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Solution**: Add `immediatelyRender: false` to your `useEditor()` config\n\n### Problem: Headings/lists look unstyled\n**Solution**: Install `@tailwindcss/typography` and add `prose` classes to editor container\n\n### Problem: Editor lags when typing\n**Solution**: Use `useEditorState()` hook instead of `useEditor()` for read-only rendering, or memoize editor configuration\n\n### Problem: Images make JSON huge\n**Solution**: Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension config and use upload handler (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n\n### Problem: Build fails in Create React App\n**Solution**: Switch to Vite - CRA incompatible with Tiptap v3. See cloudflare-worker-base skill for Vite setup.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to verify your setup:\n\n- [ ] Installed `@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`, `@tiptap/pm`\n- [ ] Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` config\n- [ ] Installed `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n- [ ] Added `prose` classes to editor container\n- [ ] Configured image upload handler (if using images)\n- [ ] Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension\n- [ ] Editor renders without hydration errors\n- [ ] Formatted text displays correctly (headings, lists, etc.)\n- [ ] Dev server runs without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Production build succeeds\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check `references/common-errors.md` for troubleshooting\n2. Verify `immediatelyRender: false` is set\n3. Check official docs: https://tiptap.dev\n4. Ensure `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency is installed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:50:57.801Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced rich text editing capabilities with React and Tailwind integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级富文本编辑功能的前端代理，支持React和Tailwind集成。","ja":"ReactおよびTailwindの統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェント向けの高度なリッチテキスト編集機能に最適です。","ko":"리액트와 테일윈드 통합을 지원하는 고급 리치 텍스트 편집 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de edición de texto rico avanzadas con integración de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de fonctionnalités de modification de texte enrichi avancées avec une intégration de React et Tailwind.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte reiche Textbearbeitungsfunktionen mit React- und Tailwind-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de edição de texto rico com integração do React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности редактирования текста с интеграцией React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحرير النص الغني مع تكامل React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customizable rich text editors with support for images, colors, and typography using @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm libraries, while leveraging shadcn/ui for enhanced UI components.","zh":"赋予代理创建可自定义的富文本编辑器的能力，支持图像、颜色和排版，使用@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit和@tiptap/pm库，同时利用shadcn/ui增强UI组件。","ja":"@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pmライブラリを使用して、画像、色、タイポグラフィをサポートするカスタマイズ可能なリッチテキストエディターを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、shadcn/uiを使用してUIコンポーネントを強化します。","ko":"@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 라이브러리를 사용하여 이미지, 색상, 타이포그래피를 지원하는 사용자 정의 가능한 리치 텍스트 편집기를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, shadcn/ui를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear editores de texto rico personalizables con soporte para imágenes, colores y tipografía utilizando las bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm, mientras aprovecha shadcn/ui para componentes de interfaz de usuario mejorados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éditeurs de texte enrichi personnalisables avec un support pour les images, les couleurs et la typographie en utilisant les bibliothèques @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm, tout en exploitant shadcn/ui pour des composants d''interface utilisateur améliorés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte reiche Texteditoren mit Unterstützung für Bilder, Farben und Typografie zu erstellen, indem sie die Bibliotheken @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm verwenden und shadcn/ui für verbesserte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem editores de texto rico personalizáveis com suporte a imagens, cores e tipografia usando as bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm, aproveitando o shadcn/ui para componentes de UI aprimorados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать настраиваемые редакторы текста с поддержкой изображений, цветов и типографии, используя библиотеки @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm, при этом использует shadcn/ui для улучшенных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محررين لنص غني قابلة للتخصيص مع دعم الصور والألوان والطباعة باستخدام المكتبات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm، مع الاستفادة من shadcn/ui لتحسين مكونات الواجهة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and feature-rich text editors for web applications","Integrating image and media support into existing rich text editors","Customizing text styles and typography for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["为Web应用程序构建响应式和功能丰富的文本编辑器","将图像和媒体支持集成到现有的富文本编辑器中","自定义文本样式和排版以增强用户体验"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション向けのレスポンシブで機能豊富なテキストエディターを構築する","画像やメディアのサポートを既存のリッチテキストエディターに統合する","テキストスタイルやタイポグラフィをカスタマイズしてユーザー体験を向上させる"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 반응형 및 기능豊富한 텍스트 편집기를 구축하는 것","기존의 리치 텍스트 편집기에 이미지 및 미디어 지원을 통합하는 것","텍스트 스타일 및 타이포그래피를 사용자 지정하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Crear editores de texto responsivos y con características avanzadas para aplicaciones web","Integrar soporte para imágenes y medios en editores de texto rico existentes","Personalizar estilos de texto y tipografía para una experiencia del usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Créer des éditeurs de texte responsives et riches en fonctionnalités pour les applications web","Intégrer un support pour les images et les médias dans les éditeurs de texte enrichi existants","Personnaliser les styles de texte et la typographie pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven und funktionsreichen Texteditoren für Webanwendungen","Integrieren von Bild- und Medienunterstützung in bestehende reiche Texteditoren","Anpassen von Textstilen und Typografie für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Construção de editores de texto responsivos e ricos em recursos para aplicações web","Integração do suporte de imagem e mídia em editores de texto rico existentes","Personalização de estilos de texto e tipografia para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Создание отзывчивых и функционально богатых редакторов текста для веб-приложений","Интеграция поддержки изображений и мультимедиа в существующие редакторы текста","Настройка стилей текста и типографики для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["بناء محررين لنص غني وتفاعليين لمواقع الويب","دمج دعم الصور والوسائط في محررين نص غني موجودين","تخصيص أساليب النص والطباعة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19+ and Tailwind v4","Dependent on @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm libraries"],"zh":["需要React 19+和Tailwind v4","依赖@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit和@tiptap/pm库"],"ja":["React 19+とTailwind v4が必要","@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pmライブラリに依存している"],"ko":["리액트 19+ 및 테일윈드 v4가 필요","@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere React 19+ y Tailwind v4","Dependiente de las bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm"],"fr":["Nécessite React 19+ et Tailwind v4","Dépend des bibliothèques @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm"],"de":["Benötigt React 19+ und Tailwind v4","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm"],"pt":["Exige React 19+ e Tailwind v4","Dependente das bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm"],"ru":["Требует React 19+ и Tailwind v4","Зависит от библиотек @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm"],"ar":["يتطلب React 19+ و Tailwind v4","يعتمد على المكتبات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/tiptap', 'community', 'brendadeeznuts1111', 'tier-1380-omega', 'brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega', 'tiptap', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z', '2026-02-18T02:51:05.455Z', NULL, '{"id":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/tiptap","name":"tiptap","description":{"zh":"Tiptap是一个生产就绪的富文本编辑器，支持React 19+和Tailwind v4","ja":"Tiptapはプロダクションレディのリッチテキストエディターで、React 19+とTailwind v4をサポートしています","ko":"티프탭은 프로덕션 레디 리치 텍스트 에디터로, 리액트 19+와 테일윈드 v4를 지원합니다","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para React con dependencias como Tailwind y shadcn/ui","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte riche pour React avec des dépendances comme Tailwind et shadcn/ui","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für React mit Abhängigkeiten wie Tailwind und shadcn/ui","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para React, com suporte a imagens, cores e estilos de texto. É fácil de usar e personalizar","ru":"Tiptap - это богатый текстовый редактор для React, с поддержкой изображений, цветов и стилей текста. Он легко используется и настраивается","ar":"تيبتاب هو محرر نص متقدم لرياكت، يدعم الصور والألوان وأساليب النص. إنه سهل الاستخدام والتخصيص","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tiptap富文本编辑器","ja":"Tiptapリッチテキストエディター","ko":"티프탭 리치 텍스트 에디터","es":"Tiptap Editor de Texto Enriquecido","fr":"Éditeur de Texte Riche Tiptap","de":"Tiptap Rich Text Editor","pt":"Tiptap: Editor de Texto Rico para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Tiptap: Богатый Текстовый Редактор для Разработчиков","ar":"تيبتاب: محرر نص متقدم للمطورين","en":"tiptap"},"description":{"zh":"Tiptap是一个生产就绪的富文本编辑器，支持React 19+和Tailwind v4","ja":"Tiptapはプロダクションレディのリッチテキストエディターで、React 19+とTailwind v4をサポートしています","ko":"티프탭은 프로덕션 레디 리치 텍스트 에디터로, 리액트 19+와 테일윈드 v4를 지원합니다","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para React con dependencias como Tailwind y shadcn/ui","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte riche pour React avec des dépendances comme Tailwind et shadcn/ui","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für React mit Abhängigkeiten wie Tailwind und shadcn/ui","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para React, com suporte a imagens, cores e estilos de texto. É fácil de usar e personalizar","ru":"Tiptap - это богатый текстовый редактор для React, с поддержкой изображений, цветов и стилей текста. Он легко используется и настраивается","ar":"تيبتاب هو محرر نص متقدم لرياكت، يدعم الصور والألوان وأساليب النص. إنه سهل الاستخدام والتخصيص","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持React 19+","支持Tailwind v4","支持图片、颜色、文本样式和排版等功能","快速开始，仅5分钟","生产就绪"],"ja":["React 19+をサポート","Tailwind v4をサポート","画像、色、テキストスタイル、組版などの機能をサポート","迅速に開始、5分で開始できます","プロダクションレディ"],"ko":["리액트 19+ 지원","테일윈드 v4 지원","이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일, 조판 등의 기능 지원","빠르게 시작, 5분만에 시작할 수 있습니다","프로덕션 레디"],"es":["Compatibilidad con React 19+","Integración con Tailwind v4","Soporte para imágenes y colores","Estilos de texto y tipografía personalizables"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec React 19+","Intégration avec Tailwind v4","Prise en charge des images et des couleurs","Styles de texte et typographie personnalisables"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit React 19+","Integration mit Tailwind v4","Unterstützung für Bilder und Farben","Anpassbare Text- und Typografie-Stile"],"pt":["Suporte a imagens","Suporte a cores","Suporte a estilos de texto","Fácil de usar e personalizar","Compatível com React 19+","Suporte a Tailwind v4"],"ru":["Поддержка изображений","Поддержка цветов","Поддержка стилей текста","Легко используется и настраивается","Совместим с React 19+","Поддержка Tailwind v4"],"ar":["دعم الصور","دعم الألوان","دعم أساليب النص","سهل الاستخدام والتخصيص","متوافق مع رياكت 19+","دعم تيلوين德 v4"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tiptap","富文本编辑器","React","Tailwind","快速开始","生产就绪","前端开发","JavaScript库"],"ja":["Tiptap","リッチテキストエディター","React","Tailwind","迅速に開始","プロダクションレディ","フロントエンド開発","JavaScriptライブラリ"],"ko":["티프탭","리치 텍스트 에디터","리액트","테일윈드","빠르게 시작","프로덕션 레디","프론트엔드 개발","자바스크립트 라이브러리"],"es":["editor de texto enriquecido","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","texto enriquecido","aplicaciones web"],"fr":["éditeur de texte riche","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","texte riche","applications web"],"de":["Rich-Text-Editor","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","Rich-Text","Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Tiptap","Editor de texto rico","React","Imagens","Cores","Estilos de texto","Desenvolvimento web","Interface de usuário","Personalização"],"ru":["Tiptap","Богатый текстовый редактор","React","Изображения","Цвета","Стили текста","Веб-разработка","Интерфейс пользователя","Настройка"],"ar":["تيبتاب","محرر نص متقدم","رياكت","الصور","الألوان","أساليب النص","تطوير الويب","واجهة المستخدم","تخصيص"]}},"owner":"brendadeeznuts1111","repo":"tier-1380-omega","repoPath":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.400Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```","body":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- `@tiptap/pm` is required peer dependency (ProseMirror engine)\n- StarterKit bundles 20+ essential extensions (headings, lists, bold, italic, etc.)\n- Image/color/typography are common additions not in StarterKit\n\n**Important**: If using Tiptap v3.14.0+, drag handle functionality requires minimum v3.14.0 (regression fixed in that release). For Pro extensions with drag handles, React 18 is recommended due to tippyjs-react dependency.\n\n### 2. Create SSR-Safe Editor\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor, EditorContent } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\n\nexport function Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    content: ''<p>Hello World!</p>'',\n    immediatelyRender: false, // ⚠️ CRITICAL for SSR/Next.js\n    editorProps: {\n      attributes: {\n        class: ''prose prose-sm focus:outline-none min-h-[200px] p-4'',\n      },\n    },\n  })\n\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- **Always set `immediatelyRender: false`** for Next.js/SSR apps (prevents hydration mismatch)\n- Without this, you''ll see: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n- This is the #1 error reported by Tiptap users\n\n### 3. Add Tailwind Typography (Optional but Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\n```\n\nUpdate your `tailwind.config.ts`:\n```typescript\nimport typography from ''@tailwindcss/typography''\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [typography],\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Provides default prose styling for headings, lists, links, etc.\n- Without it, formatted content looks unstyled\n- Alternative: Use custom Tailwind classes with `.tiptap` selector\n\n---\n\n## The 3-Step Setup Process\n\n### Step 1: Choose Your Integration Method\n\n**Option A: shadcn Minimal Tiptap Component (Recommended)**\n\nInstall the pre-built shadcn component:\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap/main/registry/block-registry.json\n```\n\nThis installs:\n- Fully-featured editor component with toolbar\n- Image upload support\n- Code block with syntax highlighting\n- Typography extension configured\n- Dark mode support\n\n**Option B: Build Custom Editor (Full Control)**\n\nUse templates from this skill:\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal editor setup\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Option A: Faster setup, opinionated UI\n- Option B: Complete customization, headless approach\n- Both work with React + Tailwind v4\n\n### Step 2: Configure Extensions\n\nExtensions add functionality to your editor:\n\n```typescript\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport Image from ''@tiptap/extension-image''\nimport Link from ''@tiptap/extension-link''\nimport Typography from ''@tiptap/extension-typography''\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      // Customize built-in extensions\n      heading: {\n        levels: [1, 2, 3],\n      },\n      bulletList: {\n        keepMarks: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Image.configure({\n      inline: true,\n      allowBase64: false, // ⚠️ Prevent base64 bloat\n      resize: {\n        enabled: true,\n        directions: [''top-right'', ''bottom-right'', ''bottom-left'', ''top-left''],\n        minWidth: 100,\n        minHeight: 100,\n        alwaysPreserveAspectRatio: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Link.configure({\n      openOnClick: false,\n      HTMLAttributes: {\n        class: ''text-primary underline'',\n      },\n    }),\n    Typography, // Smart quotes, dashes, etc.\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Set `allowBase64: false` to prevent huge JSON payloads\n- Use upload handler pattern (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n- Extension order matters - dependencies must load first\n\n### Step 3: Handle Image Uploads (If Needed)\n\n**Pattern**: Base64 preview → background upload → replace with URL\n\nSee `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` for full implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Editor } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nasync function uploadImageToR2(file: File, env: Env): Promise<string> {\n  // 1. Create base64 preview for immediate display\n  const reader = new FileReader()\n  const base64 = await new Promise<string>((resolve) => {\n    reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string)\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file)\n  })\n\n  // 2. Insert preview into editor\n  editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src: base64 }).run()\n\n  // 3. Upload to R2 in background\n  const formData = new FormData()\n  formData.append(''file'', file)\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/upload'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: formData,\n  })\n\n  const { url } = await response.json()\n\n  // 4. Replace base64 with permanent URL\n  editor.chain()\n    .focus()\n    .updateAttributes(''image'', { src: url })\n    .run()\n\n  return url\n}\n```\n\n**Why this pattern:**\n- Immediate user feedback (preview)\n- No database bloat from base64\n- Works with Cloudflare R2\n- Graceful error handling\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` for SSR apps\n✅ Install `@tailwindcss/typography` for prose styling\n✅ Use upload handler for images (not base64)\n✅ Memoize editor configuration to prevent re-renders\n✅ Include `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `immediatelyRender: true` (default) with Next.js/SSR\n❌ Store images as base64 in database (use URL after upload)\n❌ Forget to add `prose` classes to editor container\n❌ Load more than 100 widgets in collaborative mode\n❌ Use Create React App (v3 incompatible - use Vite)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **7** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: SSR Hydration Mismatch\n**Error**: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856), [#5602](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5602)\n**Why It Happens**: Default `immediatelyRender: true` breaks Next.js hydration\n**Prevention**: Template includes `immediatelyRender: false` by default\n\n### Issue #2: Editor Re-renders on Every Keystroke\n**Error**: Laggy typing, poor performance in large documents\n**Source**: [Tiptap Performance Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor#immediatelyrender)\n**Why It Happens**: `useEditor()` hook re-renders component on every change\n**Prevention**: Use `useEditorState()` hook or memoization patterns (see templates)\n\n### Issue #3: Tailwind Typography Not Working\n**Error**: Headings/lists render unstyled, no formatting visible\n**Source**: [shadcn Tiptap Discussion](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/discussions/1729)\n**Why It Happens**: Missing `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n**Prevention**: Skill includes typography plugin installation in checklist\n\n### Issue #4: Image Upload Base64 Bloat\n**Error**: JSON payloads become megabytes, slow saves, database bloat\n**Source**: [Tiptap Image Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions/nodes/image#usage)\n**Why It Happens**: Default allows base64, no upload handler configured\n**Prevention**: R2 upload template with URL replacement pattern\n\n### Issue #5: Build Errors in Create React App\n**Error**: \"jsx-runtime\" module resolution errors after upgrading to v3\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6812](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6812)\n**Why It Happens**: CRA incompatibility with v3 module structure\n**Prevention**: Skill documents Vite as preferred bundler + provides working config\n\n### Issue #6: ProseMirror Multiple Versions Conflict\n**Error**: `Error: Looks like multiple versions of prosemirror-model were loaded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #577](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/577) (131 comments), [Issue #6171](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6171)\n**Why It Happens**: Installing additional Tiptap extensions can pull different versions of prosemirror-model or prosemirror-view, creating duplicate dependencies in node_modules. The unique-id extension is particularly problematic in testing environments.\n**Prevention**: Use package resolutions to force a single ProseMirror version\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"prosemirror-model\": \"~1.21.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-view\": \"~1.33.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-state\": \"~1.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr reinstall dependencies:\n```bash\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm install\n```\n\n**Note**: The @tiptap/pm package is designed to prevent this issue, but extensions may still introduce conflicts.\n\n### Issue #7: EditorProvider vs useEditor Confusion (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: `SSR has been detected, please set ''immediatelyRender'' explicitly to ''false''` (when both used together)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856 Comment](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856#issuecomment-2493124171)\n**Why It Happens**: Users commonly use EditorProvider and useEditor together, but EditorProvider is a wrapper around useEditor for React Context setup - they should not be used simultaneously.\n**Prevention**: Choose one pattern only\n\n**Incorrect Pattern**:\n```typescript\n// Don''t use both together\n<EditorProvider>\n  <MyComponent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const editor = useEditor({ ... }) // ❌ Wrong - EditorProvider already created editor\n}\n```\n\n**Correct Patterns**:\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Use EditorProvider only\n<EditorProvider immediatelyRender={false} extensions={[StarterKit]}>\n  <EditorContent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\n// Option 2: Use useEditor only\nfunction Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    immediatelyRender: false,\n  })\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Reference\n\n### Tailwind Prose Styling (tiptap-prose.css)\n\n```css\n/* Apply to editor container */\n.tiptap {\n  /* Tailwind Typography */\n  @apply prose prose-sm sm:prose-base lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none;\n\n  /* Custom overrides */\n  h1 {\n    @apply text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    @apply text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    @apply my-4 text-base leading-7;\n  }\n\n  ul, ol {\n    @apply my-4 ml-6;\n  }\n\n  code {\n    @apply bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono;\n  }\n\n  pre {\n    @apply bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto;\n  }\n\n  blockquote {\n    @apply border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Why these settings:**\n- `prose` classes provide consistent formatting\n- `dark:prose-invert` handles dark mode automatically\n- Custom overrides use semantic Tailwind v4 colors\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Collaborative Editing with Y.js\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport Collaboration from ''@tiptap/extension-collaboration''\nimport * as Y from ''yjs''\n\nconst ydoc = new Y.Doc()\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      history: false, // Disable history for collaboration\n    }),\n    Collaboration.configure({\n      document: ydoc,\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: Real-time multi-user editing (Notion-like)\n**See**: `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` for full example\n\n### Pattern 2: Markdown Support\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport { Markdown } from ''@tiptap/markdown''\n\n// Load editor with markdown content\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [StarterKit, Markdown],\n  content: ''# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown**!'',\n  contentType: ''markdown'',  // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must specify or content parsed as HTML\n  immediatelyRender: false,\n})\n\n// Get markdown from editor\nconst markdownOutput = editor.getMarkdown()\n\n// Insert markdown content\neditor.commands.setContent(''## New heading'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\neditor.commands.insertContent(''**Bold** text'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\n```\n\n**When to use**: Storing content as markdown, displaying/editing rich text\n**Install**: `npm install @tiptap/markdown@3.16.0`\n**Status**: Beta (released Oct 2025, API stable but may change)\n**CRITICAL**: Always specify `contentType: ''markdown''` when setting markdown content\n\n**Recent Fixes** (v3.15.0-v3.16.0):\n- Fixed incorrect Markdown output when underline is mixed with bold/italic and ranges don''t fully overlap\n- Improved serialization for overlapping formatting marks\n- Source: [v3.16.0 Release](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/releases/tag/v3.16.0)\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Integration with react-hook-form\n\n```typescript\nimport { useForm, Controller } from ''react-hook-form''\n\nfunction BlogForm() {\n  const { control, handleSubmit } = useForm()\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n      <Controller\n        name=\"content\"\n        control={control}\n        render={({ field }) => (\n          <Editor\n            content={field.value}\n            onUpdate={({ editor }) => {\n              field.onChange(editor.getHTML())\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n      />\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Blog posts, comments, any form-based content\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\nNo executable scripts for this skill.\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**Required for all projects:**\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal React editor component\n- `templates/package.json` - Required dependencies\n\n**Optional based on needs:**\n- `templates/minimal-tiptap-setup.sh` - shadcn component installation\n- `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` - R2 upload handler\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n- `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` - Y.js collaboration\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n\n**When to load these**: Claude should reference templates when user asks to:\n- Set up tiptap editor\n- Add image uploads\n- Configure collaborative editing\n- Style with Tailwind prose\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `references/tiptap-docs.md` - Key documentation links\n- `references/common-errors.md` - Error troubleshooting guide\n- `references/extension-catalog.md` - Popular extensions list\n\n**When Claude should load these**: Troubleshooting errors, exploring extensions, understanding API\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### Custom Extensions\n\nCreate your own Tiptap extensions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Node } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nconst CustomNode = Node.create({\n  name: ''customNode'',\n\n  group: ''block'',\n\n  content: ''inline*'',\n\n  parseHTML() {\n    return [{ tag: ''div[data-custom]'' }]\n  },\n\n  renderHTML({ HTMLAttributes }) {\n    return [''div'', { ''data-custom'': '''', ...HTMLAttributes }, 0]\n  },\n\n  addCommands() {\n    return {\n      insertCustomNode: () => ({ commands }) => {\n        return commands.insertContent({ type: this.name })\n      },\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Custom widgets, embeds, interactive elements\n\n### Slash Commands\n\nAdd Notion-like `/` commands:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Extension } from ''@tiptap/core''\nimport Suggestion from ''@tiptap/suggestion''\n\nconst SlashCommands = Extension.create({\n  name: ''slashCommands'',\n\n  addOptions() {\n    return {\n      suggestion: {\n        char: ''/'',\n        items: ({ query }) => {\n          return [\n            { title: ''Heading 1'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).setHeading({ level: 1 }).run()\n            }},\n            { title: ''Bullet List'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).toggleBulletList().run()\n            }},\n          ]\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  },\n\n  addProseMirrorPlugins() {\n    return [Suggestion({ editor: this.editor, ...this.options.suggestion })]\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Productivity shortcuts, quick formatting\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- `@tiptap/react@^3.16.0` - React integration (React 19 supported)\n- `@tiptap/starter-kit@^3.16.0` - Essential extensions bundle\n- `@tiptap/pm@^3.16.0` - ProseMirror peer dependency\n- `react@^19.0.0` - React framework\n\n**React Version Compatibility**:\n- **Core Tiptap**: Supports React 19 as of v2.10.0\n- **UI Components**: Work best with React 18 (Next.js 15 recommended per [official docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/install/nextjs))\n- **Pro Extensions**: May require React 18 - drag-handle extension depends on archived tippyjs-react without React 19 support ([Issue #5876](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5876))\n\n**Optional**:\n- `@tiptap/extension-audio@^3.16.0` - Audio support (NEW in v3.16.0)\n- `@tiptap/extension-image@^3.16.0` - Image support\n- `@tiptap/extension-link@^3.16.0` - Link support (NEW in v3, included in StarterKit)\n- `@tiptap/extension-color@^3.16.0` - Text color\n- `@tiptap/extension-typography@^3.16.0` - Smart typography\n- `@tiptap/extension-collaboration@^3.16.0` - Real-time collaboration\n- `@tiptap/extension-markdown@^3.16.0` - Markdown support (Beta)\n- `@tailwindcss/typography@^0.5.19` - Prose styling\n- `yjs@^13.6.0` - Collaborative editing backend\n- `react-medium-image-zoom@^5.2.0` - Image zoom functionality\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tiptap**: https://tiptap.dev\n- **Installation Guide**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/installation/react\n- **Extensions**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions\n- **API Reference**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: https://github.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap\n- **Context7 Library ID**: tiptap/tiptap\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-21)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tiptap/react\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/starter-kit\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/pm\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-audio\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-image\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-color\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-text-style\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-typography\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-link\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-markdown\": \"^3.16.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/typography\": \"^0.5.19\",\n    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Example\n\nThis skill is based on real-world implementations:\n- **GitLab**: Uses Tiptap for issue/MR descriptions\n- **Statamic CMS**: Tiptap as default rich text editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: 3.14M downloads/week\n\n**Token Savings**: ~71% (14k → 4k tokens)\n**Errors Prevented**: 7/7 documented errors (5 critical setup + 2 community patterns)\n**Validation**: ✅ SSR compatibility, ✅ Image uploads, ✅ Tailwind v4, ✅ Performance, ✅ React 19 compatibility\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Solution**: Add `immediatelyRender: false` to your `useEditor()` config\n\n### Problem: Headings/lists look unstyled\n**Solution**: Install `@tailwindcss/typography` and add `prose` classes to editor container\n\n### Problem: Editor lags when typing\n**Solution**: Use `useEditorState()` hook instead of `useEditor()` for read-only rendering, or memoize editor configuration\n\n### Problem: Images make JSON huge\n**Solution**: Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension config and use upload handler (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n\n### Problem: Build fails in Create React App\n**Solution**: Switch to Vite - CRA incompatible with Tiptap v3. See cloudflare-worker-base skill for Vite setup.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to verify your setup:\n\n- [ ] Installed `@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`, `@tiptap/pm`\n- [ ] Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` config\n- [ ] Installed `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n- [ ] Added `prose` classes to editor container\n- [ ] Configured image upload handler (if using images)\n- [ ] Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension\n- [ ] Editor renders without hydration errors\n- [ ] Formatted text displays correctly (headings, lists, etc.)\n- [ ] Dev server runs without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Production build succeeds\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check `references/common-errors.md` for troubleshooting\n2. Verify `immediatelyRender: false` is set\n3. Check official docs: https://tiptap.dev\n4. Ensure `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency is installed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:51:05.455Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced rich text editing capabilities with React and Tailwind integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级富文本编辑功能的前端代理，尤其是与 React 和 Tailwind 集成的场景。","ja":"React および Tailwind 統合を必要とするフロントエンド エージェント向けの高度なリッチ テキスト編集機能に最適です。","ko":"React 및 Tailwind 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합한 고급 리치 텍스트 편집 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de edición de texto enriquecido con integración de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''édition de texte enrichi avec intégration React et Tailwind.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Rich-Text-Bearbeitungsfunktionen mit React- und Tailwind-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de edição de texto rico com integração do React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей редактирования форматированного текста с интеграцией React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تحرير نص غني متقدمة مع تكامل React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customizable rich text editors with support for images, colors, text styles, and typography using @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm libraries, and integrates seamlessly with shadcn/ui for enhanced UI components.","zh":"赋予代理创建可自定义的富文本编辑器的能力，支持图像、颜色、文本样式和排版，使用 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm 库，并与 shadcn/ui 无缝集成以增强 UI 组件。","ja":"@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm ライブラリを使用して、画像、色、テキストスタイル、タイポグラフィをサポートするカスタマイズ可能なリッチテキストエディターを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、shadcn/ui とシームレスに統合して UI コンポーネントを強化します。","ko":"@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 라이브러리를 사용하여 이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일, 타이포그래피를 지원하는 사용자 정의 가능한 리치 텍스트 편집기를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, shadcn/ui와 원활하게 통합하여 UI 구성 요소를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear editores de texto enriquecido personalizables con soporte para imágenes, colores, estilos de texto y tipografía utilizando las bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm, y se integra perfectamente con shadcn/ui para componentes de interfaz de usuario mejorados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éditeurs de texte enrichi personnalisables avec prise en charge des images, des couleurs, des styles de texte et de la typographie en utilisant les bibliothèques @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm, et s''intègre parfaitement avec shadcn/ui pour des composants d''interface utilisateur améliorés.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Erstellung anpassbarer Rich-Text-Editoren mit Unterstützung für Bilder, Farben, Textstile und Typografie unter Verwendung der Bibliotheken @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm und integriert sich nahtlos mit shadcn/ui für verbesserte UI-Komponenten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar editores de texto rico personalizáveis com suporte a imagens, cores, estilos de texto e tipografia usando as bibliotecas @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm, e se integra perfeitamente com o shadcn/ui para componentes de UI aprimorados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать настраиваемые редакторы форматированного текста с поддержкой изображений, цветов, стилей текста и типографики, используя библиотеки @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm, и бесшовно интегрируется с shadcn/ui для улучшенных компонентов интерфейса пользователя.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محررات نص غني قابلة للتعديل بدعم للصور والألوان وأساليب النص والطباعة باستخدام المكتبات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm، وتكاملها بشكل متكامل مع shadcn/ui لتحسين مكونات واجهة المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Building customizable blog post editors","Generating rich text content with images and colors","Creating collaborative document editing tools with real-time updates"],"zh":["构建可自定义的博客帖子编辑器","生成带有图像和颜色的富文本内容","创建具有实时更新的协作文档编辑工具"],"ja":["カスタマイズ可能なブログ投稿エディターの構築","画像や色を含むリッチテキストコンテンツの生成","リアルタイム更新を備えたコラボレーションドキュメント編集ツールの作成"],"ko":["사용자 정의 가능한 블로그 게시물 편집기의 구축","이미지 및 색상을 포함하는 리치 텍스트 콘텐츠의 생성","실시간 업데이트를 갖춘 협업 문서 편집 도구의 생성"],"es":["Construcción de editores de entradas de blog personalizables","Generación de contenido de texto enriquecido con imágenes y colores","Creación de herramientas de edición de documentos colaborativos con actualizaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["Construction d''éditeurs d''articles de blog personnalisables","Génération de contenu texte enrichi avec images et couleurs","Création d''outils d''édition de documents collaboratifs avec mises à jour en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellung anpassbarer Blogpost-Editoren","Erstellung von Rich-Text-Inhalten mit Bildern und Farben","Entwicklung kollaborativer Dokumentenbearbeitungswerkzeuge mit Echtzeit-Updates"],"pt":["Construir editores de posts de blog personalizáveis","Gerar conteúdo de texto rico com imagens e cores","Criar ferramentas de edição de documentos colaborativos com atualizações em tempo real"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых редакторов постов в блоге","Генерация форматированного текстового контента с изображениями и цветами"