t development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of performance testing concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **Performance Testing** skill category.\nTags: performance, load-testing, k6, jmeter, benchmarking\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:51:49.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Testing Agents needing automated heap dump analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化堆转储分析功能的性能测试代理。","ja":"パフォーマンステストエージェントが自動化されたヒープダンプ分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 힙 덤프 분석 기능이 필요한 성능 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de pruebas de rendimiento que necesitan capacidades de análisis de volcados de memoria automatizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test de performance ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse de dump de tas automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungs-Test-Agents, die automatisierte Speicherabbild-Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste de Desempenho que necessitam de capacidades de análise de dump de heap automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования производительности, которым необходимы автоматические возможности анализа дампа кучи.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار الأداء الذي يحتاج إلى возможности تحليل 덤프 الكومة المُ자동ة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze heap dump patterns, provide step-by-step guidance for load testing, stress testi