nctionnalités à jour","Met à jour la section d''utilisation avec les dernières instructions","Détecte les mentions d''utilisateurs sur le README ou la documentation","Met à jour les fichiers de configuration"],"de":["Aktualisiert den Installationsabschnitt mit neuen Abhängigkeiten","Spiegelt Änderungen in der Projektstruktur wider","Hält den Funktionsabschnitt aktuell","Aktualisiert den Anwendungsabschnitt mit den neuesten Anweisungen","Erkennnt Benutzererwähnungen des README oder der Dokumentation","Aktualisiert Konfigurationsdateien"],"pt":["Atualização de dependências","Atualização de instruções de instalação","Atualização de seções de recursos","Atualização de configurações de ambiente","Atualização de pré-requisitos"],"ru":["Обновление зависимостей","Обновление инструкций по установке","Обновление разделов функций","Обновление настроек окружения","Обновление предварительных требований"],"ar":["تحديث الإعتماديات","تحديث إرشادات التثبيت","تحديث أقسام الميزات","تحديث إعدادات البيئة","تحديث المتطلبات السابقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["README 更新器","自动更新 README","项目变更自动更新","新功能更新","依赖项更新","设置说明更新"],"ja":["README アップデーター","README 自動更新","プロジェクト変更自動更新","新しい機能更新","依存関係更新","設定手順更新"],"ko":["README 업데이터","README 자동 업데이트","프로젝트 변경 자동 업데이트","新的 기능 업데이트","의존성 업데이트","설정 지침 업데이트"],"es":["actualizador de README","automatización de documentación","herramientas de desarrollo","gestión de proyecto","actualización de archivos","dependencias de proyecto","estructura de proyecto"],"fr":["mise à jour de README","automatisation de la documentation","outils de développement","gestion de projet","mise à jour de fichiers","dépendances de projet","structure de projet"],"de":["README-Updater","Automatisierung von Dokumentation","Entwicklungstools","Projektmanagement","Aktualisierung von Dateien","Projektabhängigkeiten","Projektstruktur"],"pt":["atualizador de README","gerenciamento de projetos","documentação de projetos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","produtividade de desenvolvedores","manutenção de código"],"ru":["обновлятор README","управление проектами","документация проектов","инструменты разработки","производительность разработчиков","обслуживание кода"],"ar":["محدّث ملف README","إدارة المشاريع","توثيق المشاريع","أدوات التطوير","إنتاجية المطورين","صيانة الكود"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-updater","description":"Keep README files current with project changes. Use when project structure changes, features added, or setup instructions modified. Suggests README updates based on code changes. Triggers on significant project changes, new features, dependency changes.","bodyPreview":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage","body":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage:**\n- API changes\n- New examples\n- Updated screenshots\n\n**Configuration:**\n- New options\n- Environment variables\n- Config file changes\n\n## Examples\n\n### New Feature Addition\n\n```bash\n# You add authentication:\ngit diff\n# + auth.service.ts\n# + login.component.tsx\n# + JWT middleware\n\n# I suggest README update:\n## Features\n- ✨ User authentication with JWT  # NEW\n- 🔐 Role-based access control    # NEW\n- User management\n- Dashboard\n```\n\n### New Dependency\n\n```bash\n# You add: npm install stripe\n\n# I suggest:\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm install stripe  # Added for payment processing\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_key  # Required for payments\n```\n```\n\n### Setup Instructions\n\n```bash\n# You modify docker-compose.yml\n\n# I update README:\n## Development Setup\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone [url]\n\n# 2. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 3. Start services (UPDATED)\ndocker-compose up -d  # Now includes Redis cache\n\n# 4. Run migrations\nnpm run migrate\n```\n```\n\n## Detection Logic\n\n### Change Analysis\n\nI detect these changes automatically:\n- **package.json** → Update dependencies section\n- **New routes** → Update API documentation\n- **.env.example** → Update environment variables\n- **docker-compose.yml** → Update setup instructions\n- **New features** → Update features list\n\n### Section Mapping\n\n```yaml\nCode Change → README Section:\n  - New API endpoint → Usage / API Reference\n  - New dependency → Installation\n  - New env var → Configuration\n  - New feature → Features list\n  - Architecture change → Architecture section\n```\n\n## Intelligent Updates\n\n### Keep Structure\n\nI maintain your README structure:\n- Preserve emoji style\n- Keep formatting consistent\n- Maintain tone and voice\n- Respect existing organization\n\n### Add Missing Sections\n\n```markdown\n# Suggested additions:\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Node.js 18+\n- Docker (for development)\n- PostgreSQL 14+\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost/mydb\nAPI_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## Testing\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n```\n\n### Update Examples\n\n```markdown\n# Before:\n```javascript\nconst result = api.getUsers();\n```\n\n# After (API changed):\n```javascript\nconst result = await api.getUsers({ page: 1, limit: 10 });\n```\n```\n\n## Version Compatibility\n\nI track version-specific documentation:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ (updated from 16+)\n- TypeScript 5.0+ (new requirement)\n- React 18+ (unchanged)\n```\n\n## Changelog Integration\n\nI can sync with CHANGELOG.md:\n\n```markdown\n## Recent Changes\n\nSee [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for detailed version history.\n\n### Latest (v2.1.0)\n- ✨ Added user authentication\n- 🔧 Fixed memory leak in data processing\n- 📝 Updated API documentation\n```\n\n## Screenshot Management\n\n```markdown\n# I suggest when UI changes:\n## Screenshots\n\n![Dashboard](screenshots/dashboard.png)\n*Updated: 2025-10-24 - New authentication panel*\n\n![User Profile](screenshots/profile.png)\n*New feature - user profile management*\n```\n\n## Relationship with @docs-writer\n\n**Me (Skill):** Keep README current with code changes\n**@docs-writer (Sub-Agent):** Comprehensive documentation strategy\n\n### Workflow\n1. I detect changes\n2. I suggest README updates\n3. For full docs → Invoke **@docs-writer** sub-agent\n4. Sub-agent creates complete documentation\n\n## Sandboxing Compatibility\n\n**Works without sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n**Works with sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n\n- **Filesystem**: Writes to README.md\n- **Network**: None required\n- **Configuration**: None required\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep it current** - Update README with every feature\n2. **Be specific** - Include version numbers, prerequisites\n3. **Add examples** - Show actual usage, not just API\n4. **Include troubleshooting** - Common issues and solutions\n5. **Badge status** - Keep build/coverage badges current\n\n## README Templates\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description\n\n## Features\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Installation\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Usage\n```javascript\n// Example\n```\n\n## Configuration\nEnvironment variables needed\n\n## Contributing\nHow to contribute\n\n## License\nMIT\n```\n\n### Comprehensive Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n> Tagline\n\n[Badges]\n\n## Table of Contents\n- Features\n- Installation\n- Usage\n- API Reference\n- Configuration\n- Development\n- Testing\n- Deployment\n- Contributing\n- License\n\n[Sections with detailed content]\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n### With /docs-gen Command\n\n```bash\n/docs-gen --format markdown\n\n# Generates:\n# 1. README.md (via me)\n# 2. Full documentation site (via @docs-writer)\n# 3. API reference (via api-documenter)\n```\n\n### With CI/CD\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/docs.yml\n- name: Update README\n  run: |\n    # Skill suggests updates based on changes\n    # Review and commit\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nAdd company-specific README standards:\n\n```bash\ncp -r ~/.claude/skills/documentation/readme-updater \\\n      ~/.claude/skills/documentation/company-readme-updater\n\n# Edit to add:\n# - Company README template\n# - Required sections\n# - Badge standards\n```\n\n## Related Tools\n\n- **api-documenter skill**: API documentation\n- **@docs-writer sub-agent**: Comprehensive docs\n- **git-commit-helper skill**: Commit messages for updates\n- **/docs-gen command**: Full documentation generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:52:32.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Code Analysis Agents that need to maintain project documentation integrity across file changes.","zh":"对于需要在文件更改时保持项目文档完整性的代码分析代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"ファイルの変更時にもプロジェクトのドキュメントの完全性を維持する必要があるコード分析エージェントにとって不可欠です。","ko":"파일 변경 시에도 프로젝트 문서의 完整性을 유지해야 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de análisis de código que necesitan mantener la integridad de la documentación del proyecto a través de los cambios de archivos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''analyse de code qui ont besoin de maintenir l''intégrité de la documentation du projet à travers les modifications de fichiers.","de":"Wesentlich für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die die Integrität der Projektdokumentation über Dateiänderungen hinweg aufrechterhalten müssen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam manter a integridade da documentação do projeto durante alterações de arquivos.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов анализа кода, которые нуждаются в поддержании целостности документации проекта при изменении файлов.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى الحفاظ على سلامة توثيق المشروع عبر تغييرات الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Automatically synchronizes README content with project changes by monitoring dependencies, configuration files, setup instructions, and feature updates. Ensures documentation accuracy through real-time analysis of installation steps, environment variables, and structural modifications.","zh":"通过监控依赖项、配置文件、设置说明和功能更新，自动同步README内容与项目更改。通过对安装步骤、环境变量和结构修改的实时分析，确保文档准确性。","ja":"依存関係、設定ファイル、セットアップ手順、機能更新を監視して、READMEのコンテンツをプロジェクトの変更と自動的に同期します。インストール手順、環境変数、構造の変更のリアルタイム分析により、ドキュメントの正確性を確保します。","ko":"의존성, 설정 파일, 설치 설명 및 기능 업데이트를 모니터링하여 README 내용을 프로젝트 변경과 자동으로 동기화합니다. 설치 단계, 환경 변수 및 구조 변경에 대한 실시간 분석을 통해 문서의 정확성을 보장합니다.","es":"Sincroniza automáticamente el contenido de README con los cambios del proyecto mediante la supervisión de dependencias, archivos de configuración, instrucciones de instalación y actualizaciones de características. Garantiza la precisión de la documentación a través del análisis en tiempo real de los pasos de instalación, variables de entorno y modificaciones estructurales.","fr":"Synchronise automatiquement le contenu de README avec les modifications du projet en surveillant les dépendances, les fichiers de configuration, les instructions d''installation et les mises à jour de fonctionnalités. Assure l''exactitude de la documentation grâce à l''analyse en temps réel des étapes d''installation, des variables d''environnement et des modifications structurelles.","de":"Synchronisiert den README-Inhalt automatisch mit den Projektnänderungen, indem es Abhängigkeiten, Konfigurationsdateien, Installationsanweisungen und Funktionsupdates überwacht. Stellt die Genauigkeit der Dokumentation durch Echtzeitanalyse der Installationschritte, Umgebungsvariablen und Strukturänderungen sicher.","pt":"Sincroniza automaticamente o conteúdo do README com as alterações do projeto, monitorando dependências, arquivos de configuração, instruções de configuração e atualizações de recursos. Garante a precisão da documentação por meio da análise em tempo real das etapas de instalação, variáveis de ambiente e modificações estruturais.","ru":"Автоматически синхронизирует содержимое README с изменениями проекта, отслеживая зависимости, файлы конфигурации, инструкции по настройке и обновления функций. Обеспечивает точность документации посредством анализа в реальном времени шагов установки, переменных среды и структурных изменений.","ar":"يتماشى تلقائياً مع محتوى ملف README مع التغييرات في المشروع عن طريق مراقبة التبعيات وملفات التكوين وإرشادات الإعداد وتحديثات الميزات. يضمن دقة الوثائق من خلال التحليل في الوقت الفعلي لخطوات التثبيت ومتغيرات البيئة والتعديلات الهيكلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating installation instructions when dependencies change","Documenting new features added to the codebase","Synchronizing setup steps after configuration file modifications"],"zh":["当依赖项更改时更新安装说明","将新功能添加到代码库时记录","配置文件修改后同步设置步骤"],"ja":["依存関係が変更されたときにインストール手順を更新する","コードベースに新しい機能を追加したときにドキュメント化する","設定ファイルを変更した後、セットアップ手順を同期する"],"ko":["의존성 변경 시 설치 지침 업데이트","코드베이스에 새 기능 추가 시 문서화","설정 파일 수정 후 설정 단계 동기화"],"es":["Actualización de las instrucciones de instalación cuando cambian las dependencias","Documentación de las nuevas características agregadas a la base de código","Sincronización de los pasos de configuración después de las modificaciones del archivo de configuración"],"fr":["Mise à jour des instructions d''installation lorsque les dépendances changent","Documentation des nouvelles fonctionnalités ajoutées à la base de code","Synchronisation des étapes de configuration après les modifications du fichier de configuration"],"de":["Aktualisierung der Installationsanweisungen, wenn Abhängigkeiten geändert werden","Dokumentation neuer Funktionen, die zur Codebasis hinzugefügt werden","Synchronisierung der Konfigurationsschritte nach Änderungen an der Konfigurationsdatei"],"pt":["Atualizar instruções de instalação quando as dependências mudam","Documentar novos recursos adicionados à base de código","Sincronizar etapas de configuração após modificações em arquivos de configuração"],"ru":["Обновление инструкций по установке при изменении зависимостей","Документирование новых функций, добавленных в кодовую базу","Синхронизация шагов настройки после изменений в файлах конфигурации"],"ar":["تحديث إرشادات التثبيت عند تغيير التبعيات","توثيق الميزات الجديدة المضافة إلى قاعدة الشفرة","تماشى خطوات الإعداد بعد تعديلات في ملفات التكوين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project files and documentation","Limited to README.md format conventions","Depends on clear code structure for accurate analysis"],"zh":["需要访问项目文件和文档","仅限于README.md格式约定","依赖于清晰的代码结构以进行准确分析"],"ja":["プロジェクトファイルとドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","README.md形式の規約のみに限定される","正確な分析のために明確なコード構造に依存する"],"ko":["프로젝트 파일 및 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요함","README.md 형식 규약에만 제한됨","정확한 분석을 위해明確한 코드 구조에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos y documentación del proyecto","Limitado a las convenciones de formato de README.md","Depende de una estructura de código clara para un análisis preciso"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers et à la documentation du projet","Limité aux conventions de format de README.md","Dépend d''une structure de code claire pour une analyse précise"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdateien und -dokumentation","Begrenzt auf die Formatkonventionen von README.md","Hängt von einer klaren Codestruktur für eine genaue Analyse ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos e documentação do projeto","Limitado às convenções de formato README.md","Depende de estrutura de código clara para análise precisa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам и документации проекта","Ограничен конвенциями формата README.md","Зависит от ясной структуры кода для точного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات ووثائق المشروع","محدود بالاتفاقيات لتنسيق ملف README.md","يعتمد على هيكل الشفرة الواضح لتحليل دقيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
