AI Droid","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de processos","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["обновление файла README","FactoryAI Droid","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","автоматизация процессов","управление проектами"],"ar":["تحديث ملف README","FactoryAI Droid","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أتمتة العمليات","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"ovachiever","repo":"droid-tings","repoPath":"ovachiever/droid-tings","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-updater","description":"Keep README files current with project changes. Use when project structure changes, features added, or setup instructions modified. Suggests README updates based on code changes. Triggers on significant project changes, new features, dependency changes.","bodyPreview":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage","body":"# README Updater Skill\n\nKeep your README current with project changes.\n\n## When I Activate\n\n- ✅ New features added\n- ✅ Project structure changes\n- ✅ Dependencies added/removed\n- ✅ Setup instructions change\n- ✅ User mentions README or documentation\n- ✅ Configuration files modified\n\n## What I Update\n\n### README Sections\n\n**Installation:**\n- New dependencies\n- Setup steps\n- Prerequisites\n- Environment variables\n\n**Features:**\n- New capabilities\n- Functionality changes\n- Feature deprecation\n\n**Usage:**\n- API changes\n- New examples\n- Updated screenshots\n\n**Configuration:**\n- New options\n- Environment variables\n- Config file changes\n\n## Examples\n\n### New Feature Addition\n\n```bash\n# You add authentication:\ngit diff\n# + auth.service.ts\n# + login.component.tsx\n# + JWT middleware\n\n# I suggest README update:\n## Features\n- ✨ User authentication with JWT  # NEW\n- 🔐 Role-based access control    # NEW\n- User management\n- Dashboard\n```\n\n### New Dependency\n\n```bash\n# You add: npm install stripe\n\n# I suggest:\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm install stripe  # Added for payment processing\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_key  # Required for payments\n```\n```\n\n### Setup Instructions\n\n```bash\n# You modify docker-compose.yml\n\n# I update README:\n## Development Setup\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone [url]\n\n# 2. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 3. Start services (UPDATED)\ndocker-compose up -d  # Now includes Redis cache\n\n# 4. Run migrations\nnpm run migrate\n```\n```\n\n## Detection Logic\n\n### Change Analysis\n\nI detect these changes automatically:\n- **package.json** → Update dependencies section\n- **New routes** → Update API documentation\n- **.env.example** → Update environment variables\n- **docker-compose.yml** → Update setup instructions\n- **New features** → Update features list\n\n### Section Mapping\n\n```yaml\nCode Change → README Section:\n  - New API endpoint → Usage / API Reference\n  - New dependency → Installation\n  - New env var → Configuration\n  - New feature → Features list\n  - Architecture change → Architecture section\n```\n\n## Intelligent Updates\n\n### Keep Structure\n\nI maintain your README structure:\n- Preserve emoji style\n- Keep formatting consistent\n- Maintain tone and voice\n- Respect existing organization\n\n### Add Missing Sections\n\n```markdown\n# Suggested additions:\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Node.js 18+\n- Docker (for development)\n- PostgreSQL 14+\n\n## Environment Variables\n```bash\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost/mydb\nAPI_KEY=your_api_key\n```\n\n## Testing\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n```\n\n### Update Examples\n\n```markdown\n# Before:\n```javascript\nconst result = api.getUsers();\n```\n\n# After (API changed):\n```javascript\nconst result = await api.getUsers({ page: 1, limit: 10 });\n```\n```\n\n## Version Compatibility\n\nI track version-specific documentation:\n\n```markdown\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ (updated from 16+)\n- TypeScript 5.0+ (new requirement)\n- React 18+ (unchanged)\n```\n\n## Changelog Integration\n\nI can sync with CHANGELOG.md:\n\n```markdown\n## Recent Changes\n\nSee [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) for detailed version history.\n\n### Latest (v2.1.0)\n- ✨ Added user authentication\n- 🔧 Fixed memory leak in data processing\n- 📝 Updated API documentation\n```\n\n## Screenshot Management\n\n```markdown\n# I suggest when UI changes:\n## Screenshots\n\n![Dashboard](screenshots/dashboard.png)\n*Updated: 2025-10-24 - New authentication panel*\n\n![User Profile](screenshots/profile.png)\n*New feature - user profile management*\n```\n\n## Relationship with @docs-writer\n\n**Me (Skill):** Keep README current with code changes\n**@docs-writer (Sub-Agent):** Comprehensive documentation strategy\n\n### Workflow\n1. I detect changes\n2. I suggest README updates\n3. For full docs → Invoke **@docs-writer** sub-agent\n4. Sub-agent creates complete documentation\n\n## Sandboxing Compatibility\n\n**Works without sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n**Works with sandboxing:** ✅ Yes\n\n- **Filesystem**: Writes to README.md\n- **Network**: None required\n- **Configuration**: None required\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep it current** - Update README with every feature\n2. **Be specific** - Include version numbers, prerequisites\n3. **Add examples** - Show actual usage, not just API\n4. **Include troubleshooting** - Common issues and solutions\n5. **Badge status** - Keep build/coverage badges current\n\n## README Templates\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description\n\n## Features\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n\n## Installation\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Usage\n```javascript\n// Example\n```\n\n## Configuration\nEnvironment variables needed\n\n## Contributing\nHow to contribute\n\n## License\nMIT\n```\n\n### Comprehensive Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n> Tagline\n\n[Badges]\n\n## Table of Contents\n- Features\n- Installation\n- Usage\n- API Reference\n- Configuration\n- Development\n- Testing\n- Deployment\n- Contributing\n- License\n\n[Sections with detailed content]\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n### With /docs-gen Command\n\n```bash\n/docs-gen --format markdown\n\n# Generates:\n# 1. README.md (via me)\n# 2. Full documentation site (via @docs-writer)\n# 3. API reference (via api-documenter)\n```\n\n### With CI/CD\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/docs.yml\n- name: Update README\n  run: |\n    # Skill suggests updates based on changes\n    # Review and commit\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nAdd company-specific README standards:\n\n```bash\ncp -r ~/.claude/skills/documentation/readme-updater \\\n      ~/.claude/skills/documentation/company-readme-updater\n\n# Edit to add:\n# - Company README template\n# - Required sections\n# - Badge standards\n```\n\n## Related Tools\n\n- **api-documenter skill**: API documentation\n- **@docs-writer sub-agent**: Comprehensive docs\n- **git-commit-helper skill**: Commit messages for updates\n- **/docs-gen command**: Full documentation generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:52:39.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated documentation updates for project changes, dependencies, and setup instructions.","zh":"非常适合需要自动更新项目变更、依赖关系和设置说明的开发代理。","ja":"プロジェクトの変更、依存関係、設定手順の自動ドキュメント更新が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 변경, 종속성 및 설정 지침에 대한 자동화된 문서 업데이트가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas para cambios de proyecto, dependencias e instrucciones de configuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de mises à jour de documentation automatiques pour les modifications de projet, les dépendances et les instructions de configuration.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die automatisierte Dokumentationsaktualisierungen für Projektänderungen, Abhängigkeiten und Einrichtungsanweisungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de atualizações automatizadas de documentação para alterações de projeto, dependências e instruções de configuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации для изменений проекта, зависимостей и инструкций по настройке.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات وثائق محوسبة لأي تغييرات في المشروع والاعتماديات وإرشادات الإعداد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to keep project READMEs current with changes in dependencies, setup steps, and feature updates, ensuring accurate documentation using markdown format and configuration files.","zh":"赋予代理保持项目README文件与依存关系、设置步骤和功能更新的变化同步，确保使用markdown格式和配置文件的准确文档。","ja":"エージェントが依存関係、設定手順、機能更新の変更とともにプロジェクトのREADMEを最新の状態に保つことを可能にし、Markdown形式と設定ファイルを使用した正確なドキュメントを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 종속성, 설정 단계 및 기능 업데이트의 변경과 함께 프로젝트 README를 현재 상태로 유지할 수 있도록 하여, 마크다운 형식 및 구성 파일을 사용하여 정확한 문서를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener los archivos README del proyecto actualizados con los cambios en las dependencias, los pasos de configuración y las actualizaciones de características, garantizando una documentación precisa mediante el formato markdown y los archivos de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir les fichiers README du projet à jour avec les modifications des dépendances, les étapes de configuration et les mises à jour de fonctionnalités, en garantissant une documentation précise à l''aide du format markdown et des fichiers de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Projekt-README-Dateien mit Änderungen in den Abhängigkeiten, Konfigurationsschritten und Funktionsupdates auf dem neuesten Stand zu halten, und stellt so eine genaue Dokumentation unter Verwendung des Markdown-Formats und der Konfigurationsdateien sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter os arquivos README do projeto atualizados com as alterações nas dependências, etapas de configuração e atualizações de recursos, garantindo a documentação precisa usando formato markdown e arquivos de configuração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать актуальность файлов README проекта с изменениями в зависимостях, шагах настройки и обновлениях функций, обеспечивая точность документации с использованием формата markdown и файлов конфигурации.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على الاحتفاظ بملفات README الخاصة بالمشروع محدثة مع التغييرات في الاعتماديات وخطوات الإعداد وتحديثات الميزات، مما يضمن دقة الوثائق باستخدام تنسيق markdown وملفات التهيئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating README updates after adding new dependencies or modifying project structure","Generating documentation for new features and functionality changes","Updating setup instructions and prerequisites in the README"],"zh":["在添加新依赖项或修改项目结构后自动更新README","为新功能和功能更改生成文档","在README中更新设置说明和先决条件"],"ja":["新しい依存関係を追加したり、プロジェクト構造を変更した後にREADMEを自動更新する","新しい機能や機能の変更に対するドキュメントを生成する","README内で設定手順や前提条件を更新する"],"ko":["새로운 종속성을 추가하거나 프로젝트 구조를 수정한 후 README를 자동으로 업데이트함","새로운 기능 및 기능 변경에 대한 문서를 생성함","README에서 설정 지침 및 사전 조건을 업데이트함"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de README después de agregar nuevas dependencias o modificar la estructura del proyecto","Generar documentación para nuevas características y cambios de funcionalidad","Actualizar las instrucciones de configuración y los prerequisitos en el archivo README"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de README après avoir ajouté de nouvelles dépendances ou modifié la structure du projet","Générer la documentation pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités et les modifications de fonctionnalité","Mettre à jour les instructions de configuration et les prérequis dans le fichier README"],"de":["Automatisieren von README-Aktualisierungen nach dem Hinzufügen neuer Abhängigkeiten oder der Änderung der Projektstruktur","Erzeugen von Dokumentationen für neue Funktionen und Funktionsänderungen","Aktualisieren der Einrichtungsanweisungen und Voraussetzungen in der README-Datei"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de README após adicionar novas dependências ou modificar a estrutura do projeto","Gerar documentação para novos recursos e alterações de funcionalidade","Atualizar instruções de configuração e requisitos prévios no README"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления README после добавления новых зависимостей или изменения структуры проекта","Генерировать документацию для новых функций и изменений функциональности","Обновлять инструкции по настройке и предварительные требования в README"],"ar":["تحديث ملفات README تلقائيًا بعد إضافة الاعتماديات الجديدة أو تعديل هيكل المشروع","توليد وثائق لميزات جديدة وتغييرات في الوظيفة","تحديث إرشادات الإعداد والمتطلبات السابقة في ملف README"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project configuration files and README","Limited to updating specific sections of the README, such as Installation, Features, and Usage"],"zh":["需要访问项目配置文件和README","仅限更新README的特定部分，例如安装、功能和使用"],"ja":["プロジェクトの設定ファイルとREADMEへのアクセスが必要","READMEの特定のセクション（例：インストール、機能、使用法）のみを更新可能"],"ko":["프로젝트 구성 파일 및 README에 대한 액세스가 필요함","README의 특정 섹션(예: 설치, 기능, 사용법)만 업데이트할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de configuración del proyecto y al archivo README","Limitado a la actualización de secciones específicas del archivo README, como Instalación, Características y Uso"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de configuration du projet et au fichier README","Limité à la mise à jour de sections spécifiques du fichier README, telles que l''Installation, les Fonctionnalités et l''Utilisation"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Projekt-Konfigurationsdateien und die README-Datei","Begrenzt auf die Aktualisierung bestimmter Abschnitte der README-Datei, wie z. B. Installation, Funktionen und Verwendung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de configuração do projeto e README","Limitado à atualização de seções específicas do README, como Instalação, Recursos e Uso"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам конфигурации проекта и README","Ограничен обновлением конкретных разделов README, таких как Установка, Функции и Использование"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات التهيئة الخاصة بالمشروع وملف README","محدود بالتحديثات في أقسام محددة من ملف README، مثل التثبيت والميزات والاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cloudflare-kv', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'cloudflare-kv', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z', '2026-02-18T02:52:47.443Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cloudflare-kv","name":"cloudflare-kv","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Workers KV","ja":"Cloudflare Workers KV","ko":"Cloudflare Workers KV","es":"Cloudflare KV es un almacenamiento de clave-valor para Cloudflare Workers, que ofrece una forma eficiente de almacenar y recuperar datos. Actualizado recientemente con mejoras en el rendimiento y la latencia.","fr":"Cloudflare KV est un stockage clé-valeur pour Cloudflare Workers, qui offre un moyen efficace de stocker et de récupérer des données. Mis à jour récemment avec des améliorations des performances et de la latence.","de":"Cloudflare KV ist ein Schlüssel-Wert-Speicher für Cloudflare Workers, der eine effiziente Methode zum Speichern und Abrufen von Daten bietet. Aktuell aktualisiert mit Verbesserungen bei der Leistung und Latenz.","pt":"O Cloudflare KV é uma solução de armazenamento de chave-valor na nuvem que oferece desempenho e escalabilidade para desenvolvedores, com atualizações recentes que melhoram a arquitetura e a latência","ru":"Cloudflare KV - это облачное хранилище ключ-значение, которое обеспечивает производительность и масштабируемость для разработчиков, с недавними обновлениями, которые улучшают архитектуру и задержку","ar":"Cloudflare KV هو حل لتخزين القيم المفتاحية السحابي الذي يوفر الأداء والتمكين للمطورين، مع تحديثات حديثة تحسن الهندسة المعمارية والكفاءة","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Cloudflare Workers KV","ja":"Cloudflare Workers KV","ko":"Cloudflare Workers KV","es":"C