","Choisir les primitifs de concurrence appropriés","Comprendre le modèle d''échange de données","Assurer la sécurité du thread","Gérer les erreurs courantes de concurrence"],"de":["Den Arbeitsarttyp identifizieren (CPU-bound oder I/O-bound)","Die richtigen Konkurrenzsprimitiven auswählen","Das Datenfreigabemodell verstehen","Die Thread-Sicherheit gewährleisten","Häufige Konkurrenzfehler handhaben"],"pt":["Primitivas de concorrência","Modelos de compartilhamento de dados","Thread safety","Tipos de workload","CPU-bound e I/O-bound"],"ru":["Примитивы параллелизма","Модели обмена данными","Безопасность потоков","Типы рабочей нагрузки","CPU-BOUND и I/O-BOUND"],"ar":["البدائيات التزامنية","نماذج مشاركة البيانات","سلامة الخيط","أنواع الحمل العمل","CPU-BOUND و I/O-BOUND"]},"keywords":{"zh":["并发性","m07-concurrency","语言机制","线程安全","错误设计","并行性编程"],"ja":["並行性","m07-concurrency","言語メカニズム","スレッドセーフティ","エラーデザイン","並行性プログラミング"],"ko":["동시성","m07-concurrency","언어 메커니즘","스레드 안전성","오류 설계","동시성 프로그래밍"],"es":["concurrencia en programación","mecánica de lenguaje","tipos de trabajo","primitivos de concurrencia","seguridad del hilo","errores de concurrencia"],"fr":["concurrence en programmation","mécanique de langage","types de travail","primitifs de concurrence","sécurité du thread","erreurs de concurrence"],"de":["Konkurrenz in der Programmierung","Sprachmechanik","Arbeitsarten","Konkurrenzsprimitiven","Thread-Sicherheit","Konkurrenzfehler"],"pt":["concorrência","paralelismo","primitivas de concorrência","modelos de compartilhamento","thread safety","desenvolvimento de software","programação concorrente"],"ru":["параллелизм","параллельное программирование","примитивы параллелизма","модели обмена","безопасность потоков","разработка программного обеспечения","параллельное программирование"],"ar":["التزامن","برمجة متوازي","البدائيات التزامنية","نماذج مشاركة","سلامة الخيط","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة متوازي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m07-concurrency","description":"CRITICAL: Use for concurrency/async. Triggers: E0277 Send Sync, cannot be sent between threads, thread, spawn, channel, mpsc, Mutex, RwLock, Atomic, async, await, Future, tokio, deadlock, race condition, 并发, 线程, 异步, 死锁","bodyPreview":"# Concurrency\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Is this CPU-bound or I/O-bound, and what''s the sharing model?**\n\nBefore choosing concurrency primitives:\n- What''s the workload type?\n- What data needs to be shared?\n- What''s the thread safety requirement?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 Send | \"Add Send bound\" | Should this type cross threads? |\n| E0277 Sync | \"Wrap in Mutex\" | Is share","body":"# Concurrency\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Is this CPU-bound or I/O-bound, and what''s the sharing model?**\n\nBefore choosing concurrency primitives:\n- What''s the workload type?\n- What data needs to be shared?\n- What''s the thread safety requirement?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 Send | \"Add Send bound\" | Should this type cross threads? |\n| E0277 Sync | \"Wrap in Mutex\" | Is shared access really needed? |\n| Future not Send | \"Use spawn_local\" | Is async the right choice? |\n| Deadlock | \"Reorder locks\" | Is the locking design correct? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore adding concurrency:\n\n1. **What''s the workload?**\n   - CPU-bound → threads (std::thread, rayon)\n   - I/O-bound → async (tokio, async-std)\n   - Mixed → hybrid approach\n\n2. **What''s the sharing model?**\n   - No sharing → message passing (channels)\n   - Immutable sharing → Arc<T>\n   - Mutable sharing → Arc<Mutex<T>> or Arc<RwLock<T>>\n\n3. **What are the Send/Sync requirements?**\n   - Cross-thread ownership → Send\n   - Cross-thread references → Sync\n   - Single-thread async → spawn_local\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑ (MANDATORY)\n\n**CRITICAL**: Don''t just fix the error. Trace UP to find domain constraints.\n\n### Domain Detection Table\n\n| Context Keywords | Load Domain Skill | Key Constraint |\n|-----------------|-------------------|----------------|\n| Web API, HTTP, axum, actix, handler | **domain-web** | Handlers run on any thread |\n| 交易, 支付, trading, payment | **domain-fintech** | Audit + thread safety |\n| gRPC, kubernetes, microservice | **domain-cloud-native** | Distributed tracing |\n| CLI, terminal, clap | **domain-cli** | Usually single-thread OK |\n\n### Example: Web API + Rc Error\n\n```\n\"Rc cannot be sent between threads\" in Web API context\n    ↑ DETECT: \"Web API\" → Load domain-web\n    ↑ FIND: domain-web says \"Shared state must be thread-safe\"\n    ↑ FIND: domain-web says \"Rc in state\" is Common Mistake\n    ↓ DESIGN: Use Arc<T> with State extractor\n    ↓ IMPL: axum::extract::State<Arc<AppConfig>>\n```\n\n### Generic Trace\n\n```\n\"Send not satisfied for my type\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain is this? Load domain-* skill\n    ↑ Ask: Does this type need to cross thread boundaries?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (is the data model correct?)\n```\n\n| Situation | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------|----------|----------|\n| Send/Sync in Web | **domain-web** | What''s the state management pattern? |\n| Send/Sync in CLI | **domain-cli** | Is multi-thread really needed? |\n| Mutex vs channels | m09-domain | Shared state or message passing? |\n| Async vs threads | m10-performance | What''s the workload profile? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Need parallelism for CPU work\"\n    ↓ Use: std::thread or rayon\n\n\"Need concurrency for I/O\"\n    ↓ Use: async/await with tokio\n\n\"Need to share immutable data across threads\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<T>\n\n\"Need to share mutable data across threads\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<Mutex<T>> or Arc<RwLock<T>>\n    ↓ Or: channels for message passing\n\n\"Need simple atomic operations\"\n    ↓ Use: AtomicBool, AtomicUsize, etc.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Send/Sync Markers\n\n| Marker | Meaning | Example |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `Send` | Can transfer ownership between threads | Most types |\n| `Sync` | Can share references between threads | `Arc<T>` |\n| `!Send` | Must stay on one thread | `Rc<T>` |\n| `!Sync` | No shared refs across threads | `RefCell<T>` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Thread-Safe | Blocking | Use When |\n|---------|-------------|----------|----------|\n| `std::thread` | Yes | Yes | CPU-bound parallelism |\n| `async/await` | Yes | No | I/O-bound concurrency |\n| `Mutex<T>` | Yes | Yes | Shared mutable state |\n| `RwLock<T>` | Yes | Yes | Read-heavy shared state |\n| `mpsc::channel` | Yes | Optional | Message passing |\n| `Arc<Mutex<T>>` | Yes | Yes | Shared mutable across threads |\n\n## Decision Flowchart\n\n```\nWhat type of work?\n├─ CPU-bound → std::thread or rayon\n├─ I/O-bound → async/await\n└─ Mixed → hybrid (spawn_blocking)\n\nNeed to share data?\n├─ No → message passing (channels)\n├─ Immutable → Arc<T>\n└─ Mutable →\n   ├─ Read-heavy → Arc<RwLock<T>>\n   └─ Write-heavy → Arc<Mutex<T>>\n   └─ Simple counter → AtomicUsize\n\nAsync context?\n├─ Type is Send → tokio::spawn\n├─ Type is !Send → spawn_local\n└─ Blocking code → spawn_blocking\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| E0277 `Send` not satisfied | Non-Send in async | Use Arc or spawn_local |\n| E0277 `Sync` not satisfied | Non-Sync shared | Wrap with Mutex |\n| Deadlock | Lock ordering | Consistent lock order |\n| `future is not Send` | Non-Send across await | Drop before await |\n| `MutexGuard` across await | Guard held during suspend | Scope guard properly |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| Arc<Mutex<T>> everywhere | Contention, complexity | Message passing |\n| thread::sleep in async | Blocks executor | tokio::time::sleep |\n| Holding locks across await | Blocks other tasks | Scope locks tightly |\n| Ignoring deadlock risk | Hard to debug | Lock ordering, try_lock |\n\n---\n\n## Async-Specific Patterns\n\n### Avoid MutexGuard Across Await\n\n```rust\n// Bad: guard held across await\nlet guard = mutex.lock().await;\ndo_async().await;  // guard still held!\n\n// Good: scope the lock\n{\n    let guard = mutex.lock().await;\n    // use guard\n}  // guard dropped\ndo_async().await;\n```\n\n### Non-Send Types in Async\n\n```rust\n// Rc is !Send, can''t cross await in spawned task\n// Option 1: use Arc instead\n// Option 2: use spawn_local (single-thread runtime)\n// Option 3: ensure Rc is dropped before .await\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Smart pointer choice | m02-resource |\n| Interior mutability | m03-mutability |\n| Performance tuning | m10-performance |\n| Domain concurrency needs | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:53:08.903Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multithreaded Agents needing advanced concurrency control and thread safety mechanisms.","zh":"非常适合需要高级并发控制和线程安全机制的多线程代理。","ja":"マルチスレッドエージェントが高度なコンカレンシー制御とスレッドセーフティメカニズムを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 병렬 처리 제어 및 스레드 안전성 메커니즘이 필요한 멀티 스레드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes multihilo que necesitan mecanismos de control de concurrencia avanzados y seguridad de subprocesos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents multithreads nécessitant des mécanismes de contrôle de concurrence avancés et des mécanismes de sécurité de thread.","de":"Perfekt für multithreaded Agents, die erweiterte Konkurrenzsteuerungs- und Thread-Sicherheitsmechanismen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes multithreaded que necessitam de mecanismos avançados de controle de concorrência e segurança de thread.","ru":"Идеально подходит для многопоточных агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые механизмы контроля согласованности и безопасности потоков.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط المتعددة التي تحتاج إلى آليات متقدمة لمراقبة التزامن وأمان الخيط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage CPU-bound and I/O-bound workloads, leveraging concurrency primitives and sharing models, while ensuring thread safety with Send and Sync bounds, and utilizing Mutex for shared data access.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理CPU绑定和I/O绑定工作负载的能力，利用并发原语和共享模型，同时确保线程安全性，并使用Mutex实现共享数据访问。","ja":"エージェントがCPUバウンドとI/Oバウンドのワークロードを効率的に管理できるようにし、コンカレンシープリミティブと共有モデルを利用し、SendとSyncの境界でスレッドセーフティを確保し、Mutexを使用して共有データにアクセスします。","ko":"에이전트가 CPU 바운드와 I/O 바운드 작업을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 병렬 처리 원시값과 공유 모델을 활용하며, Send 및 Sync 경계에서 스레드 안전성을 보장하고, Mutex를 사용하여 공유 데이터에 액세스합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de forma eficiente las cargas de trabajo limitadas por CPU y E/S, aprovechando primitivas de concurrencia y modelos de intercambio, al mismo tiempo que garantiza la seguridad del subproceso con límites Send y Sync, y utilizando Mutex para el acceso a datos compartidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les charges de travail liées au processeur et à l''E/S, en exploitant les primitives de concurrence et les modèles de partage, tout en assurant la sécurité des threads avec les limites Send et Sync, et en utilisant Mutex pour l''accès aux données partagées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, CPU- und E/S-begrenzte Arbeitslasten effizient zu verwalten, indem Konkurrenzprimitiven und Austauschmodelle genutzt werden, während gleichzeitig die Thread-Sicherheit mit Send- und Sync-Grenzen gewährleistet und Mutex für den Zugriff auf gemeinsam genutzte Daten verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma eficiente as cargas de trabalho limitadas por CPU e E/S, utilizando primitivas de concorrência e modelos de compartilhamento, garantindo a segurança do thread com limites Send e Sync, e utilizando Mutex para acesso a dados compartilhados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять задачами, ограниченными CPU и вводом/выводом, используя примитивы согласованности и модели обмена, обеспечивая безопасность потоков с помощью ограничений Send и Sync, и используя Mutex для доступа к общим данным.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة الحمل بشكل فعال، سواء كان مقيدًا بمركز 처리 البيانات أو الإدخال/الإخراج، مستخدمًا примитивات التزامن ونماذج المشاركة، مع ضمان سلامة الخيط باستخدام حدود الإرسال والتنظيم، واستخدام Mutex للوصول إلى البيانات المشتركة."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging concurrency-related errors like E0277 Send and E0277 Sync","Optimizing workload performance by identifying CPU-bound or I/O-bound tasks","Implementing thread-safe data sharing models for concurrent programming"],"zh":["调试与并发性相关的错误，如E0277 Send和E0277 Sync","通过识别CPU绑定或I/O绑定任务来优化工作负载性能","实现线程安全的数据共享模型以进行并发编程"],"ja":["コンカレンシー関連のエラー（E0277 SendおよびE0277 Sync）をデバッグする","CPUバウンドまたはI/Oバウンドのタスクを識別してワークロードのパフォーマンスを最適化する","コンカレンシープログラミングのためにスレッドセーフなデータ共有モデルを実装する"],"ko":["병렬 처리 관련 오류(E0277 Send 및 E0277 Sync) 디버깅","CPU 바운드 또는 I/O 바운드 작업을 식별하여 작업負荷 성능 최적화","병렬 처리 프로그래밍을 위한 스레드 안전한 데이터 공유 모델 구현"],"es":["Depuración de errores relacionados con la concurrencia como E0277 Send y E0277 Sync","Optimización del rendimiento de la carga de trabajo identificando tareas limitadas por CPU o E/S","Implementación de modelos de intercambio de datos seguros para la programación concurrente"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs liées à la concurrence comme E0277 Send et E0277 Sync","Optimisation des performances de la charge de travail en identifiant les tâches liées au processeur ou à l''E/S","Mise en œuvre de modèles de partage de données sécurisés pour la programmation concurrente"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Konkurrenzfehlern wie E0277 Send und E0277 Sync","Optimierung der Arbeitslastenleistung durch Identifizierung von CPU- oder E/S-begrenzten Aufgaben","Implementierung von threadsicheren Datenfreigabemodellen für die konkurrierende Programmierung"],"pt":["Depurar erros relacionados à concorrência, como E0277 Send e E0277 Sync","Otimizar o desempenho da carga de trabalho, identificando tarefas limitadas por CPU ou E/S","Implementar modelos de compartilhamento de dados seguros para programação concorrente"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок, связанных с согласованностью, таких как E0277 Send и E0277 Sync","Оптимизация производительности рабочей нагрузки путем выявления задач, ограниченных CPU или вводом/выводом","Реализация моделей безопасного обмена данными для параллельного программирования"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالتزامن، مثل E0277 Send و E0277 Sync","تحسين أداء الحمل من خلال تحديد المهام المقيدة بمركز 처리 البيانات أو الإدخال/الإخراج","تنفيذ نماذج مشاركة بيانات آمنة للبرمجة المتزامنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of concurrency primitives and thread safety requirements","Limited to agents capable of handling multithreaded workloads","May require additional dependencies for Mutex and concurrency libraries"],"zh":["需要了解并发原语和线程安全性要求","仅限于能够处理多线程工作负载的代理","可能需要为Mutex和并发库添加额外的依赖项"],"ja":["コンカレンシープリミティブとスレッドセーフティの要件を理解する必要がある","マルチスレッドのワークロードを処理できるエージェントに限定される","Mutexとコンカレンシーライブラリの依存関係を追加する必要がある場合がある"],"ko":["병렬 처리 원시값 및 스레드 안전성 요구 사항을 이해해야 함","멀티 스레드 작업을 처리할 수 있는 에이전트로 제한됨","Mutex 및 병렬 처리 라이브러리에 대한 추가 종속성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de primitivas de concurrencia y requisitos de seguridad de subprocesos","Limitado a agentes capaces de manejar cargas de trabajo multihilo","Puede requerir dependencias adicionales para Mutex y bibliotecas de concurrencia"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des primitives de concurrence et des exigences de sécurité des threads","Limité aux agents capables de gérer des charges de travail multithreads","Peut nécessiter des dépendances supplémentaires pour Mutex et les bibliothèques de concurrence"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis von Konkurrenzprimitiven und Thread-Sicherheitsanforderungen","Begrenzt auf Agents, die multithreaded Arbeitslasten verarbeiten können","Kann zusätzliche Abhängigkeiten für Mutex und Konkurrenzbibliotheken erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão das primitivas de concorrência e requisitos de segurança de thread","Limitado a agentes capazes de lidar com cargas de trabalho multithreaded","Pode exigir dependências adicionais para Mutex e bibliotecas de concorrência"],"ru":["Требует понимания примитивов согласованности и требований безопасности потоков","Ограничен агентами, способными обрабатывать многопоточные рабочие нагрузки","Может требовать дополнительных зависимостей для Mutex и библиотек согласованности"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لبريمتيفات التزامن ومتطلبات أمان الخيط","محدود بالوكلاء القادرة على التعامل مع أحمال عمل متعددة الخيط","يمكن أن يتطلب تبعيات إضافية لMutex ومكتبات التزامن"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
