ualizaciones de reuniones","Integración con GitHub y Jira","Resumen de sesiones de ayer","Selección de elementos relevantes a través de multiSelect","Compatibilidad con Claude Code"],"fr":["Entrevues interactives pour générer des mises à jour de réunion","Intégration avec GitHub et Jira","Résumé des sessions d''hier","Sélection d''éléments pertinents via multiSelect","Compatibilité avec Claude Code"],"de":["Interaktive Interviews zum Erstellen von Meetings-Updates","Integration mit GitHub und Jira","Zusammenfassung der Sitzungen von gestern","Auswahl von relevanten Elementen über multiSelect","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Geração de atualizações de reunião interativas","Integração com GitHub e Jira","Resumo personalizado de atividades","Detecção de integrações configuradas","Seleção de itens relevantes via multiSelect"],"ru":["Генерация интерактивных обновлений встреч","Интеграция с GitHub и Jira","Индивидуальное резюме активностей","Обнаружение настроенных интеграций","Выбор актуальных элементов через multiSelect"],"ar":["إنشاء تحديثات اجتماع تفاعلية","دمج مع GitHub و Jira","ملخص مخصص للأنشطة","اكتشاف التكاملات الم 구성","اختيار العناصر ذات الصلة عبر multiSelect"]},"keywords":{"zh":["日常会议更新","Claude Code","互动面板","团队协作","GitHub","Jira","协作工具"],"ja":["デイリーミーティング更新","Claude Code","インタラクティブパネル","チームコラボレーション","GitHub","Jira","コラボレーションツール"],"ko":["일일 미팅 업데이트","Claude Code","인터랙티브 패널","팀 협업","GitHub","Jira","협업 도구"],"es":["actualización diaria de reuniones","desarrollo de software","entrevistas interactivas","integración con GitHub","integración con Jira","Claude Code"],"fr":["mise à jour quotidienne de réunion","développement de logiciels","entrevues interactives","intégration avec GitHub","intégration avec Jira","Claude Code"],"de":["täglicher Meetings-Update","Software-Entwicklung","interaktive Interviews","Integration mit GitHub","Integration mit Jira","Claude Code"],"pt":["atualização de reunião diária","ferramenta de integração","github","jira","reunião interativa","resumo personalizado","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ежедневное обновление встречи","инструмент интеграции","github","jira","интерактивная встреча","индивидуальное резюме","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تحديث اجتماع يومي","أداة دمج","github","jira","اجتماع تفاعلي","ملخص مخصص","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily-meeting-update","description":"Interactive daily standup/meeting update generator. Use when user says daily, standup, scrum update, status update, what did I do yesterday, prepare for meeting, morning update, or team sync. Pulls activity from GitHub, Jira, and Claude Code session history. Conducts 4-question interview (yesterday, today, blockers, discussion topics) and generates formatted Markdown update.","bodyPreview":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if","body":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if approved          │\n│ • Pull data NOW (before interview)                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 2: INTERVIEW (with insights)                  │\n│ • Show pulled data as context                       │\n│ • Yesterday: \"I see you merged PR #123, what else?\" │\n│ • Today: What will you work on?                     │\n│ • Blockers: Anything blocking you?                  │\n│ • Topics: Anything to discuss at end of meeting?    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 3: GENERATE UPDATE                            │\n│ • Combine interview answers + tool data             │\n│ • Format as clean Markdown                          │\n│ • Present to user                                   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Detect & Offer Integrations\n\n### Step 1: Silent Detection\n\nCheck for available integrations **silently** (suppress errors, don''t show to user):\n\n| Integration | Detection |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| **Claude Code History** | `~/.claude/projects` directory exists with `.jsonl` files |\n| GitHub CLI | `gh auth status` succeeds |\n| Jira CLI | `jira` command exists |\n| Atlassian MCP | `mcp__atlassian__*` tools available |\n| Git | Inside a git repository |\n\n### Step 2: Offer GitHub/Jira Integrations (if available)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for all questions in this phase.\n\n**GitHub/Git:**\n\nIf `HAS_GH` or `HAS_GIT`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have GitHub/Git configured. Want me to pull your recent activity (commits, PRs, reviews)?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull the info\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\nIf yes:\n\n```\n\"Which repositories/projects should I check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Just the current directory\" (if in a git repo)\n- \"I''ll list the repos\" → user provides list\n```\n\n**Jira:**\n\nIf `HAS_JIRA_CLI` or `HAS_ATLASSIAN_MCP`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have Jira configured. Want me to pull your tickets?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my tickets\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pull GitHub/Jira Data (if approved)\n\n**GitHub/Git** — For each approved repo:\n- Commits by user since yesterday\n- PRs opened/merged by user\n- Reviews done by user\n\n**Jira** — Tickets assigned to user, updated in last 24h\n\n**Key insight**: Store results to use as context in Phase 2 interview.\n\n### Step 4: Offer Claude Code History\n\nThis integration captures everything you worked on with Claude Code — useful for recalling work that isn''t in git or Jira.\n\n**Detection:**\n```bash\nls ~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1\n```\n\n**If Claude Code history exists, ask:**\n\n```\n\"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. This can help recall work that isn''t in git/Jira (research, debugging, planning). Want me to check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my Claude Code sessions\"\n- \"No, I have everything I need\"\n```\n\n**If yes, run the digest script:**\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n```\n\n**Then present sessions with multiSelect:**\n\nUse `AskUserQuestionTool` with `multiSelect: true` to let user pick relevant items:\n\n```\n\"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n\nOptions (multiSelect):\n- \"Fix authentication bug (backend-api)\"\n- \"Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\"\n- \"Update homepage styles (frontend-app)\"\n- \"Research payment providers (docs)\"\n```\n\n**Key insight:** User selects which sessions are work-related. Personal projects or experiments can be excluded.\n\n**Do NOT run digest script when:**\n- User explicitly says \"No\" to Claude Code history\n- User says they''ll provide everything manually\n- `~/.claude/projects` directory doesn''t exist\n\n**If digest script fails:**\n- Fallback: Skip Claude Code integration silently, proceed with interview\n- Common issues: Python not installed, no sessions from yesterday, permission errors\n- Do NOT block the standup flow — the script is supplemental, not required\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Interview (with insights)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool to conduct the interview. This provides a better UX with structured options.\n\n**Use pulled data as context** to make questions smarter.\n\n### Question 1: Yesterday\n\n**If data was pulled**, show it first:\n\n```\n\"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #123: fix login timeout\n- 3 commits in backend-api\n- Reviewed PR #456 (approved)\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\n```\n\n**If no data pulled:**\n\n```\n\"What did you work on yesterday/since the last standup?\"\n```\n\nIf user response is vague, ask follow-up:\n- \"Can you give more details about X?\"\n- \"Did you complete anything specific?\"\n\n### Question 2: Today\n\n```\n\"What will you work on today?\"\n\nOptions:\n- [Text input - user types freely]\n```\n\n**If Jira data was pulled**, you can suggest:\n\n```\n\"I see you have these tickets assigned:\n- PROJ-123: Implement OAuth flow (In Progress)\n- PROJ-456: Fix payment bug (To Do)\n\nWill you work on any of these today?\"\n```\n\n### Question 3: Blockers\n\n```\n\"Do you have any blockers or impediments?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No blockers\"\n- \"Yes, I have blockers\" → follow-up for details\n```\n\n### Question 4: Topics for Discussion\n\n```\n\"Any topic you want to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No, nothing to discuss\"\n- \"Yes\" → follow-up for details\n\nExamples of topics:\n- Technical decision that needs input\n- Alignment with another team\n- Question about prioritization\n- Announcement or info for the team\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Generate Update\n\nCombine all information into clean Markdown:\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - [DATE]\n\n## Yesterday\n- [Items from interview]\n- [Items from GitHub/Jira if pulled]\n\n## Today\n- [Items from interview]\n\n## Blockers\n- [Blockers or \"No blockers\"]\n\n## PRs & Reviews (if pulled from GitHub)\n- [PRs opened]\n- [PRs merged]\n- [Reviews done]\n\n## Jira (if pulled from Jira)\n- [Tickets updated]\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- [Topics or \"None\"]\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- [PR links]\n- [Ticket links]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Interview is primary** — Tools supplement, they don''t replace human context\n2. **Consent before access** — Always ask before pulling from any integration\n3. **Context-aware questions** — Show pulled data during interview to trigger memory (\"I see you merged PR #123...\")\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Action | Tool |\n|-------|--------|------|\n| 1. Detect & Offer | Check gh/jira/claude history, ask user, pull data | Bash (silent), AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 2. Interview | Ask 4 questions with insights | AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 3. Generate | Format Markdown | Output text |\n\n*Claude Code only: Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for structured questions.\n\n### Claude Code Digest Script\n\n```bash\n# Get yesterday''s sessions as JSON\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n\n# Get today''s sessions\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --date today --format json\n\n# Filter to specific project\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --project ~/my-app --format json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nClaude: \"Let''s prepare your daily! I detected GitHub configured. Want me to pull your recent activity?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\nClaude: \"Which repos should I check?\"\nUser: \"backend-api and frontend-app\"\n\n[Claude pulls GitHub data silently]\n\nClaude: \"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. Want me to check?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\n[Claude runs digest script, gets 5 sessions]\n\nClaude: \"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n  ☑ Fix authentication timeout bug (backend-api)\n  ☑ Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\n  ☐ Update personal blog (blog) - [user unchecks personal project]\n  ☑ Research payment providers (docs)\n  ☐ Debugging test failures (experiments)\n\nUser: [selects 3 relevant items]\n\nClaude: \"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #120: fix login timeout\n- Opened PR #125: feat: add OAuth flow\n- Reviewed PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n- 5 commits in backend-api\n- [From Claude Code] Fix authentication timeout bug\n- [From Claude Code] Implement OAuth flow\n- [From Claude Code] Research payment providers\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\nUser: \"No, that covers it\"\n\nClaude: \"What will you work on today?\"\nUser: \"Continue the OAuth feature and deploy to staging\"\n\nClaude: \"Any blockers?\"\nUser: \"No\"\n\nClaude: \"Any topic to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\nUser: \"Yes, I want to discuss the architecture of the new payments module\"\n\n[Claude generates update]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Example\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - 2026-01-22\n\n## Yesterday\n- Worked on authentication feature\n- Research on payment providers\n- Merged PR #120 (fix: login timeout)\n- Opened PR #125 (feat: add OAuth flow)\n\n## Today\n- Continue OAuth feature\n- Deploy to staging\n\n## Blockers\n- No blockers\n\n## PRs & Reviews\n- **Opened:** PR #125 - feat: add OAuth flow\n- **Merged:** PR #120 - fix: login timeout\n- **Reviews:** PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- Architecture of the new payments module\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/125\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/120\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why (Expert Knowledge) | Instead |\n|-------|------------------------|---------|\n| Run gh/jira without asking | Users may have personal repos visible, or be in a sensitive project context they don''t want exposed | Always ask first, let user choose repos |\n| Assume current directory is the only project | Developers often work on 2-5 repos simultaneously (frontend, backend, infra) | Ask \"Which projects are you working on?\" |\n| Skip interview even with tool data | Tools capture WHAT happened but miss WHY and context (research, meetings, planning) | Interview is primary, tools supplement |\n| Generate update before all 4 questions | User might have critical blocker or discussion topic that changes the narrative | Complete interview, then generate |\n| Include raw commit messages | Commit messages are often cryptic (\"fix\", \"wip\") and don''t tell the story | Summarize into human-readable outcomes |\n| Ask for data after interview | Showing insights during interview makes questions smarter (\"I see you merged PR #123, anything else?\") | Pull data first, then interview with context |\n\n---\n\n## NEVER\n\n- **NEVER assume tools are configured** — Many devs have gh installed but not authenticated, or jira CLI pointing to wrong instance\n- **NEVER skip the \"Topics for Discussion\" question** — This is often the most valuable part of standup that tools can''t capture\n- **NEVER generate more than 15 bullets** — Standup should be <2 minutes to read; long updates lose the audience\n- **NEVER include ticket/PR numbers without context** — \"PROJ-123\" means nothing; always include title or summary\n- **NEVER pull data from repos user didn''t explicitly approve** — Even if you can see other repos, respect boundaries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:53:20.118Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Productivity Agents requiring interactive meeting updates and integration with tools like GitHub and Jira.","zh":"适合需要交互式会议更新和与GitHub和Jira等工具集成的生产力代理。","ja":"GitHubやJiraなどのツールとの統合と、インタラクティブなミーティング更新が必要な生産性エージェントに最適。","ko":"GitHub 및 Jira와 같은 도구와의 통합 및 상호 작용형 미팅 업데이트가 필요한 생산성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Productividad que requieren actualizaciones de reuniones interactivas y integración con herramientas como GitHub y Jira.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de productivité nécessitant des mises à jour de réunions interactives et une intégration avec des outils comme GitHub et Jira.","de":"Ideal für Produktivitätsagenten, die interaktive Besprechungsaktualisierungen und Integration mit Tools wie GitHub und Jira erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Produtividade que requerem atualizações de reuniões interativas e integração com ferramentas como GitHub e Jira.","ru":"Идеально для агентов производительности, требующих интерактивных обновлений встреч и интеграции с инструментами как GitHub и Jira.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يتطلبون تحديثات اجتماعات تفاعلية وتكامل مع أدوات مثل GitHub و Jira."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate daily standup updates through interactive interviews, leveraging multiSelect for user input and integrating with gh CLI and jira CLI for seamless data pulling, all while ensuring compatibility with Claude Code history.","zh":"赋予代理生成每日站立更新的能力，通过交互式访谈，利用multiSelect进行用户输入，并与gh CLI和jira CLI集成以实现无缝数据拉取，同时确保与Claude Code历史的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが毎日のスタンドアップ更新を生成できるようにすることで、インタラクティブなインタビューを通じてユーザー入力を取得し、gh CLIとjira CLIを統合してデータをシームレスに取得し、同時にClaude Codeの履歴との互換性を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 매일 스탠드업 업데이트를 생성할 수 있도록하여 상호 작용형 인터뷰를 통해 사용자 입력을 얻고 gh CLI 및 jira CLI를 통합하여 데이터를 무결점으로 가져오며 Claude Code 기록과 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar actualizaciones de standup diarias a través de entrevistas interactivas, aprovechando multiSelect para la entrada de usuario e integrándose con gh CLI y jira CLI para una extracción de datos sin problemas, todo mientras se garantiza la compatibilidad con el historial de código de Claude.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des mises à jour de standup quotidiennes via des entretiens interactifs, en exploitant multiSelect pour la saisie utilisateur et en s''intégrant à gh CLI et jira CLI pour un accès aux données sans heurts, le tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec l''historique de code de Claude.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, tägliche Standup-Updates durch interaktive Interviews zu generieren, indem multiSelect für die Benutzereingabe genutzt und eine Integration mit gh CLI und jira CLI für eine nahtlose Datenübertragung erfolgt, während die Kompatibilität mit der Code-Historie von Claude gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem atualizações diárias de standup por meio de entrevistas interativas, aproveitando o multiSelect para entrada de usuário e integrando com o gh CLI e o jira CLI para extração de dados sem problemas, garantindo compatibilidade com o histórico do Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать ежедневные обновления стендапа через интерактивные интервью, используя multiSelect для ввода пользователя и интегрируя с gh CLI и jira CLI для беспрепятственного извлечения данных, обеспечивая совместимость с историей Claude Code.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد تحديثات يومية للاجتماعات من خلال مقابلات تفاعلية، مستفيدة من متعدد التحديد لمدخلات المستخدم وتكاملها مع واجهة سطر الأوامر gh وواجهة سطر الأوامر jira لنقل البيانات بسلاسة، مع ضمان التوافق مع سجل كلاود كلود."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily meeting updates with relevant session digests","Generating interactive interviews for user input on meeting updates","Integrating with GitHub and Jira for streamlined data access"],"zh":["使用相关会话摘要自动执行每日会议更新","生成交互式访谈以获取会议更新的用户输入","与GitHub和Jira集成以实现流畅的数据访问"],"ja":["関連セッションの要約を使用して毎日のミーティング更新を自動化する","ミーティング更新のユーザー入力を取得するためのインタラクティブなインタビューを生成する","GitHubとJiraを統合してデータアクセスをスムーズにする"],"ko":["관련 세션 요약을 사용하여 매일 미팅 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","미팅 업데이트에 대한 사용자 입력을 얻기 위한 상호 작용형 인터뷰를 생성하는 것","GitHub 및 Jira와 통합하여 데이터 액세스를 원활하게 하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de reuniones diarias con resúmenes de sesión relevantes","Generar entrevistas interactivas para la entrada de usuario sobre actualizaciones de reuniones","Integrar con GitHub y Jira para un acceso a datos optimizado"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes avec des résumés de session pertinents","Générer des entretiens interactifs pour la saisie utilisateur sur les mises à jour de réunions","Intégrer avec GitHub et Jira pour un accès aux données rationalisé"],"de":["Automatisieren von täglichen Besprechungsaktualisierungen mit relevanten Sitzungsverläufen","Generieren von interaktiven Interviews für die Benutzereingabe zu Besprechungsaktualisierungen","Integrieren mit GitHub und Jira für einen optimierten Datenzugriff"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de reuniões diárias com resumos de sessões relevantes","Gerar entrevistas interativas para entrada de usuário sobre atualizações de reuniões","Integrar com GitHub e Jira para acesso de dados simplificado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневные обновления встреч с соответствующими сводками сессий","Генерировать интерактивные интервью для ввода пользователя об обновлениях встреч","Интегрироваться с GitHub и Jira для упрощенного доступа к данным"],"ar":["توسيع تحديثات الاجتماعات اليومية مع موجزات الجلسات ذات الصلة","توليد مقابلات تفاعلية لمدخلات المستخدم بشأن تحديثات الاجتماعات","التكامل مع GitHub و Jira لنقل البيانات المبسّط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code history or gh CLI and jira CLI configuration","Needs user input via multiSelect for relevant item selection"],"zh":["需要Claude Code历史或gh CLI和jira CLI配置","需要通过multiSelect进行用户输入以选择相关项"],"ja":["Claude Codeの履歴またはgh CLIとjira CLIの設定が必要","関連アイテムの選択のためにmultiSelectを介したユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 기록 또는 gh CLI 및 jira CLI 구성이 필요함","관련 항목을 선택하기 위해 multiSelect를 통해 사용자 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración del historial de código de Claude o gh CLI y jira CLI","Necesita entrada de usuario a través de multiSelect para la selección de elementos relevantes"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''historique de code de Claude ou de gh CLI et jira CLI","A besoin d''une saisie utilisateur via multiSelect pour la sélection d''éléments pertinents"],"de":["Benötigt Konfiguration der Code-Historie von Claude oder gh CLI und jira CLI","Benötigt Benutzereingabe über multiSelect für die Auswahl von relevanten Elementen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do histórico do Claude Code ou do gh CLI e do jira CLI","Necessita de entrada de usuário via multiSelect para seleção de itens relevantes"],"ru":["Требует настройки истории Claude Code или gh CLI и jira CLI","Требует ввода пользователя через multiSelect для выбора соответствующих пунктов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين سجل كلود كلود أو واجهة سطر الأوامر gh وواجهة سطر الأوامر jira","يحتاج إلى مدخلات المستخدم عبر متعدد التحديد لتحديد العناصر ذات الصلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/daily-meeting-update', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'daily-meeting-update', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z', '2026-02-18T02:53:23.431Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/daily-meeting-update","name":"daily-meeting-update","description":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能通过交互式访谈生成每日站立会议更新，支持GitHub和Jira集成","ja":"デイリーミーティングアップデートスキルはインタラクティブなインタビューを通じてデイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデートを生成し、GitHubとJiraの統合をサポート","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 스킬은 대화형 인터뷰를 통해 일일 스탠드업/미팅 업데이트를 생성하며 깃허브 및 지라 통합을 지원","es":"La actualización de reunión diaria es una herramienta que genera un resumen de reunión diaria a través de una entrevista interactiva. Ayuda a optimizar las reuniones diarias","fr":"La mise à jour de réunion quotidienne est un outil qui génère un résumé de réunion quotidienne via un entretien interactif. Il aide à optimiser les réunions quotidiennes","de":"Das tägliche Meeting-Update ist ein Tool, das ein tägliches Meeting-Update durch ein interaktives Interview generiert. Es hilft bei der Optimierung der täglichen Meetings","pt":"O ''daily-meeting-update'' gera atualizações de reunião diária através de entrevistas interativas, verificando integrações e histórico de código.","ru":"Ежедневное обновление встречи ''daily-meeting-update'' генерирует обновления встречи через интерактивные интервью, проверяя интеграции и историю кода.","ar":"تحديث الاجتماعات اليومي ''daily-meeting-update'' يولد تحديثات الاجتماعات اليومية من خلال مقابلات تفاعلية، يتحقق من التكاملات وسجل الشفرة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能","ja":"デイリーミーティングアップデートスキル","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 스킬","es":"Actualización de reunión diaria","fr":"Mise à jour de réunion quotidienne","de":"Täglicher Meeting-Update","pt":"Atualização de Reunião Diária","ru":"Ежедневное обновление встречи","ar":"تحديث الاجتماعات اليومي","en":"daily-meeting-update"},"description":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能通过交互式访谈生成每日站立会议更新，支持GitHub和Jira集成","ja":"デイリーミーティングアップデートスキルはインタラクティブなインタビューを通じてデイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデートを生成し、GitHubとJiraの統合をサポート","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 스킬은 대화형 인터뷰를 통해 일일 스탠드업/미팅 업데이트를 생성하며 깃허브 및 지라 통합을 지원","es":"La actualización de reunión diaria es una herramienta que genera un resumen de reunión diaria a través de una entrevista interactiva. Ayuda a optimizar las r...","fr":"La mise à jour de réunion quotidienne est un outil qui génère un résumé de réunion quotidienne via un entretien interactif. Il aide à optimiser les réunions ...","de":"Das tägliche Meeting-Update ist ein Tool, das ein tägliches Meeting-Update durch ein interaktives Interview generiert. Es hilft bei der Optimierung der tägli...","pt":"O ''daily-meeting-update'' gera atualizações de reunião diária através de entrevistas interativas, verificando integrações e histórico de código.","ru":"Ежедневное обновление встречи ''daily-meeting-update'' генерирует обновления встречи через интерактивные интервью, проверяя интеграции и историю кода.","ar":"تحديث الاجتماعات اليومي ''daily-meeting-update'' يولد تحديثات الاجتماعات اليومية من خلال مقابلات تفاعلية، يتحقق من التكاملات وسجل الشفرة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["交互式访谈","GitHub集成","Jira集成","每日站立会议更新生成","多选项选择"],"ja":["インタラクティブなインタビュー","GitHub統合","Jira統合","デイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデート生成","多選択"],"ko":["대화형 인터뷰","깃허브 통합","지라 통합","일일 스탠드업/미팅 업데이트 생성","다중 선택"],"es":["Entrevista interactiva","Resumen de reunión diaria","Integración con GitHub y Jira","Selección de elementos relevantes","Optimización de reuniones diarias"],"fr":["Entretien interactif","Résumé de réunion quotidienne","Intégration avec GitHub et Jira","Sélection d''éléments pertinents","Optimisation des réunions quotidiennes"],"de":["Interaktives Interview","Tägliches Meeting-Update","Integration mit GitHub und Jira","Auswahl relevanter Elemente","Optimierung der täglichen Meetings"],"pt":["Entrevista interativa para coletar informações","Verificação de integrações com GitHub e Jira","Geração automática de atualizações de reunião","Suporte a histórico de código","Multi-seleção de itens relevantes"],"ru":["Интерактивное интервью для сбора информации","Проверка интеграций с GitHub и Jira","Автоматическая генерация обновлений встречи","Поддержка истории кода","Мульти-выбор элементов"],"ar":["مقابلة تفاعلية لجمع المعلومات","التحقق من التكامل مع GitHub و Jira","توليد آلي لتحديثات الاجتماعات","دعم سجل الشفرة","التحديد المتعدد للعناصر ذات الصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["每日会议更新","交互式访谈","GitHub集成","Jira集成","站立会议更新","开发者工具"],"ja":["デイリーミーティングアップデート","インタラクティブなインタビュー","GitHub統合","Jira統合","デイリースタンドアップ/ミーティングアップデート","開発者ツール"],"ko":["일일 미팅 업데이트","대화형 인터뷰","깃허브 통합","지라 통합","일일 스탠드업/미팅 업데이트","개발자 툴"],"es":["actualización de reunión diaria","reunión diaria","entrevista interactiva","resumen de reunión","integración con GitHub","integración con Jira","optimización de reuniones"],"fr":["mise à jour de réunion quotidienne","réunion quotidienne","entretien interactif","résumé de réunion","intégration avec GitHub","intégration avec Jira","optimisation des réunions"],"de":["täglicher Meeting-Update","tägliches Meeting","interaktives Interview","Meeting-Update","Integration mit GitHub","Integration mit Jira","Optimierung der Meetings"],"pt":["atualização de reunião diária","entrevista interativa","integrações GitHub","integrações Jira","histórico de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de reunião"],"ru":["ежедневное обновление встречи","интерактивное интервью","интеграции GitHub","интеграции Jira","история кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты для встреч"],"ar":["تحديث الاجتماعات اليومي","مقابلة تفاعلية","التكامل مع GitHub","التكامل مع Jira","سجل الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاجتماعات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily-meeting-update","description":"Interactive daily standup/meeting update generator. Use when user says daily, standup, scrum update, status update, what did I do yesterday, prepare for meeting, morning update, or team sync. Pulls activity from GitHub, Jira, and Claude Code session history. Conducts 4-question interview (yesterday, today, blockers, discussion topics) and generates formatted Markdown update.","bodyPreview":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if","body":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if approved          │\n│ • Pull data NOW (before interview)                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 2: INTERVIEW (with insights)                  │\n│ • Show pulled data as context                       │\n│ • Yesterday: \"I see you merged PR #123, what else?\" │\n│ • Today: What will you work on?                     │\n│ • Blockers: Anything blocking you?                  │\n│ • Topics: Anything to discuss at end of meeting?    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 3: GENERATE UPDATE                            │\n│ • Combine interview answers + tool data             │\n│ • Format as clean Markdown                          │\n│ • Present to user                                   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Detect & Offer Integrations\n\n### Step 1: Silent Detection\n\nCheck for available integrations **silently** (suppress errors, don''t show to user):\n\n| Integration | Detection |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| **Claude Code History** | `~/.claude/projects` directory exists with `.jsonl` files |\n| GitHub CLI | `gh auth status` succeeds |\n| Jira CLI | `jira` command exists |\n| Atlassian MCP | `mcp__atlassian__*` tools available |\n| Git | Inside a git repository |\n\n### Step 2: Offer GitHub/Jira Integrations (if available)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for all questions in this phase.\n\n**GitHub/Git:**\n\nIf `HAS_GH` or `HAS_GIT`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have GitHub/Git configured. Want me to pull your recent activity (commits, PRs, reviews)?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull the info\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\nIf yes:\n\n```\n\"Which repositories/projects should I check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Just the current directory\" (if in a git repo)\n- \"I''ll list the repos\" → user provides list\n```\n\n**Jira:**\n\nIf `HAS_JIRA_CLI` or `HAS_ATLASSIAN_MCP`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have Jira configured. Want me to pull your tickets?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my tickets\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pull GitHub/Jira Data (if approved)\n\n**GitHub/Git** — For each approved repo:\n- Commits by user since yesterday\n- PRs opened/merged by user\n- Reviews done by user\n\n**Jira** — Tickets assigned to user, updated in last 24h\n\n**Key insight**: Store results to use as context in Phase 2 interview.\n\n### Step 4: Offer Claude Code History\n\nThis integration captures everything you worked on with Claude Code — useful for recalling work that isn''t in git or Jira.\n\n**Detection:**\n```bash\nls ~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1\n```\n\n**If Claude Code history exists, ask:**\n\n```\n\"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. This can help recall work that isn''t in git/Jira (research, debugging, planning). Want me to check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my Claude Code sessions\"\n- \"No, I have everything I need\"\n```\n\n**If yes, run the digest script:**\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n```\n\n**Then present sessions with multiSelect:**\n\nUse `AskUserQuestionTool` with `multiSelect: true` to let user pick relevant items:\n\n```\n\"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n\nOptions (multiSelect):\n- \"Fix authentication bug (backend-api)\"\n- \"Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\"\n- \"Update homepage styles (frontend-app)\"\n- \"Research payment providers (docs)\"\n```\n\n**Key insight:** User selects which sessions are work-related. Personal projects or experiments can be excluded.\n\n**Do NOT run digest script when:**\n- User explicitly says \"No\" to Claude Code history\n- User says they''ll provide everything manually\n- `~/.claude/projects` directory doesn''t exist\n\n**If digest script fails:**\n- Fallback: Skip Claude Code integration silently, proceed with interview\n- Common issues: Python not installed, no sessions from yesterday, permission errors\n- Do NOT block the standup flow — the script is supplemental, not required\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Interview (with insights)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool to conduct the interview. This provides a better UX with structured options.\n\n**Use pulled data as context** to make questions smarter.\n\n### Question 1: Yesterday\n\n**If data was pulled**, show it first:\n\n```\n\"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #123: fix login timeout\n- 3 commits in backend-api\n- Reviewed PR #456 (approved)\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\n```\n\n**If no data pulled:**\n\n```\n\"What did you work on yesterday/since the last standup?\"\n```\n\nIf user response is vague, ask follow-up:\n- \"Can you give more details about X?\"\n- \"Did you complete anything specific?\"\n\n### Question 2: Today\n\n```\n\"What will you work on today?\"\n\nOptions:\n- [Text input - user types freely]\n```\n\n**If Jira data was pulled**, you can suggest:\n\n```\n\"I see you have these tickets assigned:\n- PROJ-123: Implement OAuth flow (In Progress)\n- PROJ-456: Fix payment bug (To Do)\n\nWill you work on any of these today?\"\n```\n\n### Question 3: Blockers\n\n```\n\"Do you have any blockers or impediments?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No blockers\"\n- \"Yes, I have blockers\" → follow-up for details\n```\n\n### Question 4: Topics for Discussion\n\n```\n\"Any topic you want to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No, nothing to discuss\"\n- \"Yes\" → follow-up for details\n\nExamples of topics:\n- Technical decision that needs input\n- Alignment with another team\n- Question about prioritization\n- Announcement or info for the team\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Generate Update\n\nCombine all information into clean Markdown:\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - [DATE]\n\n## Yesterday\n- [Items from interview]\n- [Items from GitHub/Jira if pulled]\n\n## Today\n- [Items from interview]\n\n## Blockers\n- [Blockers or \"No blockers\"]\n\n## PRs & Reviews (if pulled from GitHub)\n- [PRs opened]\n- [PRs merged]\n- [Reviews done]\n\n## Jira (if pulled from Jira)\n- [Tickets updated]\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- [Topics or \"None\"]\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- [PR links]\n- [Ticket links]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Interview is primary** — Tools supplement, they don''t replace human context\n2. **Consent before access** — Always ask before pulling from any integration\n3. **Context-aware questions** — Show pulled data during interview to trigger memory (\"I see you merged PR #123...\")\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Action | Tool |\n|-------|--------|------|\n| 1. Detect & Offer | Check gh/jira/claude history, ask user, pull data | Bash (silent), AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 2. Interview | Ask 4 questions with insights | AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 3. Generate | Format Markdown | Output text |\n\n*Claude Code only: Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for structured questions.\n\n### Claude Code Digest Script\n\n```bash\n# Get yesterday''s sessions as JSON\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n\n# Get today''s sessions\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --date today --format json\n\n# Filter to specific project\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --project ~/my-app --format json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nClaude: \"Let''s prepare your daily! I detected GitHub configured. Want me to pull your recent activity?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\nClaude: \"Which repos should I check?\"\nUser: \"backend-api and frontend-app\"\n\n[Claude pulls GitHub data silently]\n\nClaude: \"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. Want me to check?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\n[Claude runs digest script, gets 5 sessions]\n\nClaude: \"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n  ☑ Fix authentication timeout bug (backend-api)\n  ☑ Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\n  ☐ Update personal blog (blog) - [user unchecks personal project]\n  ☑ Research payment providers (docs)\n  ☐ Debugging test failures (experiments)\n\nUser: [selects 3 relevant items]\n\nClaude: \"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #120: fix login timeout\n- Opened PR #125: feat: add OAuth flow\n- Reviewed PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n- 5 commits in backend-api\n- [From Claude Code] Fix authentication timeout bug\n- [From Claude Code] Implement OAuth flow\n- [From Claude Code] Research payment providers\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\nUser: \"No, that covers it\"\n\nClaude: \"What will you work on today?\"\nUser: \"Continue the OAuth feature and deploy to staging\"\n\nClaude: \"Any blockers?\"\nUser: \"No\"\n\nClaude: \"Any topic to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\nUser: \"Yes, I want to discuss the architecture of the new payments module\"\n\n[Claude generates update]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Example\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - 2026-01-22\n\n## Yesterday\n- Worked on authentication feature\n- Research on payment providers\n- Merged PR #120 (fix: login timeout)\n- Opened PR #125 (feat: add OAuth flow)\n\n## Today\n- Continue OAuth feature\n- Deploy to staging\n\n## Blockers\n- No blockers\n\n## PRs & Reviews\n- **Opened:** PR #125 - feat: add OAuth flow\n- **Merged:** PR #120 - fix: login timeout\n- **Reviews:** PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- Architecture of the new payments module\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/125\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/120\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why (Expert Knowledge) | Instead |\n|-------|------------------------|---------|\n| Run gh/jira without asking | Users may have personal repos visible, or be in a sensitive project context they don''t want exposed | Always ask first, let user choose repos |\n| Assume current directory is the only project | Developers often work on 2-5 repos simultaneously (frontend, backend, infra) | Ask \"Which projects are you working on?\" |\n| Skip interview even with tool data | Tools capture WHAT happened but miss WHY and context (research, meetings, planning) | Interview is primary, tools supplement |\n| Generate update before all 4 questions | User might have critical blocker or discussion topic that changes the narrative | Complete interview, then generate |\n| Include raw commit messages | Commit messages are often cryptic (\"fix\", \"wip\") and don''t tell the story | Summarize into human-readable outcomes |\n| Ask for data after interview | Showing insights during interview makes questions smarter (\"I see you merged PR #123, anything else?\") | Pull data first, then interview with context |\n\n---\n\n## NEVER\n\n- **NEVER assume tools are configured** — Many devs have gh installed but not authenticated, or jira CLI pointing to wrong instance\n- **NEVER skip the \"Topics for Discussion\" question** — This is often the most valuable part of standup that tools can''t capture\n- **NEVER generate more than 15 bullets** — Standup should be <2 minutes to read; long updates lose the audience\n- **NEVER include ticket/PR numbers without context** — \"PROJ-123\" means nothing; always include title or summary\n- **NEVER pull data from repos user didn''t explicitly approve** — Even if you can see other repos, respect boundaries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:53:23.431Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Productivity Agents that need to automate daily standup reporting through intelligent integration harvesting.","zh":"非常适合需要通过智能集成收集来自动化每日站会报告的开发人员生产力代理。","ja":"インテリジェントな統合収集を通じてデイリースタンドアップ報告を自動化する必要がある開発者生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"지능형 통합 수집을 통해 데일리 스탠드업 보고를 자동화해야 하는 개발자 생산성 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad de Desarrolladores que necesitan automatizar la creación de informes de reuniones diarias a través de la integración inteligente de la recolección.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité des Développeurs qui ont besoin d''automatiser la création de rapports de réunions quotidiennes via l''intégration intelligente de la récolte.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Produktivitätsagenten, die tägliche Standup-Berichte durch intelligente Integration und Ernte automatisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade de Desenvolvedores que precisam automatizar a geração de relatórios de reunião diária por meio de integração inteligente de colheita.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности разработчиков, которым необходимо автоматизировать ежедневную отчетность о встречах посредством интеллектуальной интеграции сбора.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إنتاجية المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى توفير التقرير اليومي للوقوف من خلال التكامل الذكي للحصاد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated daily standup generation through interactive interviews and multi-source integration detection. Harvests context from Claude Code history, GitHub CLI, and Jira CLI to populate updates with relevant work items via multiSelect interfaces.","zh":"通过交互式访谈和多源集成检测实现自动化每日站会生成。从Claude Code历史记录、GitHub CLI和Jira CLI中收集上下文，通过多选界面使用相关工作项填充更新。","ja":"インタラクティブなインタビューとマルチソース統合検出を通じて自動化されたデイリースタンドアップ生成を可能にします。Claude Codeの履歴、GitHub CLI、およびJira CLIからコンテキストを収集し、マルチセレクトインターフェースを介して関連する作業項目で更新を入力します。","ko":"대화형 인터뷰 및 다중 소스 통합 감지를 통해 자동화된 데일리 스탠드업 생성을 가능하게 합니다. Claude Code 기록, GitHub CLI 및 Jira CLI에서 컨텍스트를 수집하여 다중 선택 인터페이스를 통해 관련 작업 항목으로 업데이트를 채웁니다.","es":"Permite la generación automática de informes de reuniones diarias a través de entrevistas interactivas y la detección de integración multi-fuente. Recopila el contexto de la historia de Claude Code, GitHub CLI y Jira CLI para poblar actualizaciones con elementos de trabajo relevantes a través de interfaces multiSelect.","fr":"Permet la génération automatisée de rapports de réunions quotidiennes via des entretiens interactifs et la détection d''intégration multi-source. Récolte le contexte de l''historique de Claude Code, GitHub CLI et Jira CLI pour peupler les mises à jour avec des éléments de travail pertinents via des interfaces multiSelect.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erstellung von täglichen Standup-Berichten durch interaktive Interviews und die Erkennung von Multi-Quellen-Integrationen. Sammelt den Kontext aus der Geschichte von Claude Code, GitHub CLI und Jira CLI, um Updates mit relevanten Arbeitsartikeln über Multi-Select-Schnittstellen zu füllen.","pt":"Permite a geração automática de reuniões diárias por meio de entrevistas interativas e detecção de integração de multi-fonte. Coleta contexto do histórico do Claude Code, do GitHub CLI e do Jira CLI para popular atualizações com itens de trabalho relevantes por meio de interfaces multiSelect.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически генерировать ежедневные встречи посредством интерактивных интервью и обнаружения интеграции из нескольких источников. Сбор контекста из истории Claude Code, GitHub CLI и Jira CLI для заполнения обновлений релевантными рабочими элементами через интерфейсы multiSelect.","ar":"يسمح بالتوليد التلقائي للاجتماعات اليومية من خلال المقابلات التفاعلية والكشف عن التكامل من عدة مصادر. يحصد السياق من تاريخ Claude Code وواجهة سطر أوامر GitHub وواجهة سطر أوامر Jira لتعبئة التحديثات bằng عناصر عمل ذات صلة عبر واجهات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily status report generation","Extracting yesterday''s session digests from Claude Code","Synchronizing work items across GitHub and Jira integrations","Conducting interactive standup interviews without manual input"],"zh":["自动化每日状态报告生成","从Claude Code提取前一日会话摘要","跨GitHub和Jira集成同步工作项","无需手动输入进行交互式站会访谈"],"ja":["デイリーステータスレポートの自動生成","Claude Codeから前日のセッション要約を抽出","GitHubとJiraの統合間での作業項目の同期","手動入力を必要としないインタラクティブなスタンドアップインタビューの実施"],"ko":["일일 상태 보고서 생성 자동화","Claude Code에서 어제의 세션 요약 추출","GitHub 및 Jira 통합 간 작업 항목 동기화","수동 입력 없이 대화형 스탠드업 인터뷰 수행"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de informes de estado diarios","Extraer los resúmenes de la sesión de ayer de Claude Code","Sincronizar elementos de trabajo en las integraciones de GitHub y Jira","Realizar entrevistas de reuniones interactivas sin entrada manual"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de rapports d''état quotidiens","Extraire les résumés de la session d''hier de Claude Code","Synchroniser les éléments de travail dans les intégrations GitHub et Jira","Réalisé des entretiens de réunions interactifs sans saisie manuelle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von täglichen Statusberichten","Extrahieren der Sitzungsprotokolle von gestern aus Claude Code","Synchronisierung von Arbeitsartikeln in GitHub- und Jira-Integrationen","Durchführung interaktiver Standup-Interviews ohne manuelle Eingabe"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de relatórios de status diários","Extrair resumos de sessões de ontem do Claude Code","Sincronizar itens de trabalho em integrações do GitHub e Jira","Realizar entrevistas de reunião interativas sem entrada manual"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию ежедневных отчетов о статусе","Извлекать сводки вчерашней сессии из Claude Code","Синхронизировать рабочие элементы по интеграциям GitHub и Jira","Проводить интерактивные встречи без ручного ввода"],"ar":["توفير توليد تقارير الحالة اليومية","استخراج ملخصات جلسات الأمس من Claude Code","تنسيق عناصر العمل عبر التكاملات GitHub و Jira","إجراء مقابلات وقوف تفاعلية بدون إدخال يدوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user confirmation for tool configuration","Depends on available integration access (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","Needs manual selection of relevant items via multiSelect"],"zh":["需要用户确认工具配置","依赖于可用的集成访问权限（Claude Code/GitHub/Jira）","需要通过多选手动选择相关项目"],"ja":["ツール構成にはユーザー確認が必要","利用可能な統合アクセス（Claude Code/GitHub/Jira）に依存","マルチセレクトによる関連項目の手動選択が必要"],"ko":["도구 구성에 대한 사용자 확인 필요","사용 가능한 통합 액세스(Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)에 의존","다중 선택을 통한 관련 항목 수동 선택 필요"],"es":["Requiere confirmación del usuario para la configuración de herramientas","Depende del acceso a integraciones disponibles (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","Necesita selección manual de elementos relevantes a través de multiSelect"],"fr":["Nécessite une confirmation de l''utilisateur pour la configuration de l''outil","Dépend de l''accès aux intégrations disponibles (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","Nécessite une sélection manuelle d''éléments pertinents via multiSelect"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzerbestätigung für die Werkzeugkonfiguration","Hängt vom Zugriff auf verfügbare Integrationen (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira) ab","Benötigt manuelle Auswahl von relevanten Artikeln über Multi-Select"],"pt":["Requer confirmação do usuário para configuração da ferramenta","Depende do acesso à integração disponível (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","Necessita de seleção manual de itens relevantes via multiSelect"],"ru":["Требует подтверждения пользователя для конфигурации инструмента","Зависит от доступного доступа к интеграции (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","Требует ручного выбора релевантных элементов через multiSelect"],"ar":["يتطلب تأكيد المستخدم لتهيئة الأداة","يعتمد على الوصول المتاح إلى التكامل (Claude Code/GitHub/Jira)","يحتاج إلى تحديد عناصر ذات صلة يدوياً عبر متعدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
