ocumentos claros y precisos"],"fr":["Reçoit des descriptions de fonctionnalités","Pose des questions de clarification","Génère un PRD structuré","Enregistre le PRD dans un fichier Markdown","Crée des documents clairs et précis"],"de":["Erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen","Stellt Klarstellungsfragen","Generiert ein strukturiertes PRD","Speichert das PRD in einer Markdown-Datei","Erstellt klare und präzise Dokumente"],"pt":["Criação de PRD personalizados","Perguntas esclarecedoras para garantir clareza","Geração de PRD estruturados","Salvar PRD em formato Markdown"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных PRD","Разъясняющие вопросы для обеспечения ясности","Генерация структурированных PRD","Сохранение PRD в формате Markdown"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات المنتج المخصصة","الأسئلة التوضيحية لضمان الوضوح","إنشاء مواصفات المنتج المنظمة","حفظ مواصفات المنتج في تنسيق Markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PRD 生成器","产品需求文档","结构化文档","开发团队","产品特性","软件开发","产品管理"],"ja":["PRD ジェネレーター","製品要件文書","構造化文書","開発チーム","製品の特性","ソフトウェア開発","製品管理"],"ko":["PRD 생성기","제품 요구 사항 문서","구조화 문서","개발 팀","제품의 특성","소프트웨어 개발","제품 관리"],"es":["generador de PRD","documento de requisitos de producto","desarrollo de software","automatización de documentos","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","document de spécifications de produit","développement de logiciels","automatisation de documents","outils de développement"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Produktanforderungsdokument","Softwareentwicklung","Dokumentenautomatisierung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["gerador de PRD","documentos de requisitos de produto","desenvolvimento de software","requisitos de produto","PRD personalizados","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["генератор PRD","документы требований продукта","разработка программного обеспечения","требования продукта","индивидуальные PRD","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مولد مواصفات المنتج","وثائق متطلبات المنتج","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات المنتج","مواصفات المنتج المخصصة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt i","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:55:18.955Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured product requirement documentation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化产品需求文档功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化された製品要件文書の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan capacidades estructuradas de documentación de requisitos de producto.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin de capacités structurées de documentation des exigences produit.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungs-Agents, die strukturierte Fähigkeiten zur Dokumentation von Produktanforderungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de documentação de requisitos de produtos estruturados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности структурированной документации требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات توثيق متطلبات المنتج المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate detailed Product Requirements Documents (PRD) in Markdown format, utilizing essential clarifying questions and structured templates, saving outputs to specific file paths like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","zh":"使代理能够生成详细的产品需求文档（PRD），以Markdown格式输出，利用基本的澄清问题和结构化模板，保存输出到特定的文件路径，如`tasks/prd-[功能名称].md`。","ja":"エージェントが詳細な製品要件文書（PRD）を生成できるようにし、Markdown形式で出力します。基本的な明確化質問と構造化テンプレートを使用し、出力を特定のファイルパス（例： `tasks/prd-[機能名].md`）に保存します。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 요구 사항 문서(PRD)를 자세히 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Markdown 형식으로 출력하고, 필수적인 명확화 질문과 구조화된 템플릿을 사용하며, 출력을 특정 파일 경로(예: `tasks/prd-[기능 이름].md`)에 저장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar Documentos de Requisitos de Producto (PRD) detallados en formato Markdown, utilizando preguntas aclaratorias esenciales y plantillas estructuradas, guardando los resultados en rutas de archivo específicas como `tasks/prd-[nombre-de-la-funcionalidad].md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des Documents d''Exigences Produit (PRD) détaillés au format Markdown, en utilisant des questions clarificatrices essentielles et des modèles structurés, en enregistrant les sorties dans des chemins de fichiers spécifiques comme `tasks/prd-[nom-de-la-fonctionnalité].md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) im Markdown-Format zu erstellen, indem sie essentielle Klärungsfragen und strukturierte Vorlagen nutzen und die Ausgaben in spezifischen Dateipfaden wie `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md` speichern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos de requisitos de produtos detalhados (PRD) no formato Markdown, utilizando questões essenciais de esclarecimento e modelos estruturados, salvando as saídas em caminhos de arquivo específicos como `tasks/prd-[nome-da-funcionalidade].md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать подробные документы требований к продукту (PRD) в формате Markdown, используя основные вопросы разъяснения и структурированные шаблоны, сохраняя выводы в определенные пути файлов, такие как `tasks/prd-[имя-функции].md`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة (PRD) بصيغة Markdown، مستخدمين أسئلة توضيح أساسية وقوالب منظمّة، وحفظ الإخراج في مسارات ملفات محددة مثل `tasks/prd-[اسم-الميزة].md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for product development","Assisting in clarifying feature descriptions through targeted questioning"],"zh":["为新功能实现生成PRD","为产品开发创建结构化文档","通过有针对性的提问帮助澄清功能描述"],"ja":["新しい機能の実装のためのPRDを生成する","製品開発のための構造化ドキュメントを作成する","機能の説明を明確にするためのターゲットを絞った質問に支援する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 PRD 생성","제품 개발을 위한 구조화된 문서 생성","타겟팅된 질문을 통해 기능 설명을 명확히 하는 것을 지원"],"es":["Generación de PRD para implementaciones de nuevas funcionalidades","Creación de documentación estructurada para el desarrollo de productos","Asistencia en la clarificación de descripciones de funcionalidades mediante preguntas específicas"],"fr":["Génération de PRD pour les implémentations de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Création d''une documentation structurée pour le développement produit","Aide à clarifier les descriptions de fonctionnalités via un questionnement ciblé"],"de":["Generierung von PRDs für neue Funktionsimplementierungen","Erstellung strukturierter Dokumentation für die Produktentwicklung","Unterstützung bei der Klärung von Funktionsbeschreibungen durch gezieltes Befragen"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para implementações de novas funcionalidades","Criação de documentação estruturada para desenvolvimento de produtos","Auxílio na clarificação das descrições de funcionalidades por meio de questionamento direcionado"],"ru":["Генерация PRD для реализации новых функций","Создание структурированной документации для разработки продукта","Помощь в разъяснении описаний функций посредством целевого вопросowania"],"ar":["إنتاج وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) لتنفيذ المزايا الجديدة","إنشاء توثيق منظم لتطوير المنتجات","مساعدة في توضيح описات الميزات عبر أسئلة استكشافية مستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not implement features, only generates PRD","Requires user input for feature description and answering clarifying questions"],"zh":["不实现功能，只生成PRD","需要用户输入功能描述和回答明确化问题"],"ja":["機能を実装せず、PRDのみを生成する","機能の説明と明確化質問への回答のためのユーザー入力を必要とする"],"ko":["기능을 구현하지 않고, PRD만 생성한다","기능 설명 및 명확화 질문에 대한 답변을 위한 사용자 입력이 필요하다"],"es":["No implementa funcionalidades, solo genera PRD","Requiere la intervención del usuario para la descripción de la funcionalidad y responder a las preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["N''implémente pas les fonctionnalités, génère uniquement le PRD","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la description de la fonctionnalité et pour répondre aux questions clarificatrices"],"de":["Implementiert keine Funktionen, sondern generiert nur das PRD","Erfordert Benutzereingaben für die Funktionsbeschreibung und das Beantworten von Klärungsfragen"],"pt":["Não implementa funcionalidades, gera apenas PRD","Requer entrada do usuário para descrição da funcionalidade e resposta a questões de esclarecimento"],"ru":["Не реализует функции, а только генерирует PRD","Требует ввода пользователя для описания функции и ответов на вопросы разъяснения"],"ar":["لا يُطبّق الميزات، بل يُنتج فقط وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD)","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصف الميزة والإجابة على أسئلة التفسير"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bmartinez287/dart-app-laravel/prd', 'community', 'bmartinez287', 'dart-app-laravel', 'bmartinez287/dart-app-laravel', 'prd', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z', '2026-02-18T02:55:44.643Z', NULL, '{"id":"bmartinez287/dart-app-laravel/prd","name":"prd","description":{"zh":"prd, ","ja":"PRD","ko":"prd, ","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados y acciónables para desarrolladores de aplicaciones.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés et actionnables pour les développeurs d''applications.","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und umsetzbare Produktanforderungsdokumente für Entwickler von Anwendungen.","pt":"O gerador de PRD cria documentos de requisitos de produto claros e açãoaveis para desenvolvedores. Ele recebe uma descrição de recurso, faz perguntas clarificadoras e gera um PRD estruturado.","ru":"Генератор PRD создает четкие и действенные документы требований к продукту для разработчиков. Он получает описание функции, задает уточняющие вопросы и генерирует структурированный PRD.","ar":"مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج يُنشئ وثائق متطلبات المنتج الواضحة والقابلة للتنفيذ للمطورين. يتلقى وصف الميزة، ويسأل أسئلة توضيحية، وينشئ وثيقة متطلبات المنتج المنظمة.","en":"dart-app-laravel"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"prd ","ja":"PRD","ko":"prd ","es":"Generador de PRD para Desarrolladores","fr":"Générateur de PRD pour Développeurs","de":"PRD-Generator für Entwickler","pt":"Gerador de PRD para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Генератор PRD для Разработчиков","ar":"مُولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج","en":"prd"},"description":{"zh":"prd, ","ja":"PRD","ko":"prd, ","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados y acciónables para desarrolladores de aplicaciones.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés et actionnables pour les développeurs d''applications.","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und umsetzbare Produktanforderungsdokumente für Entwickler von Anwendungen.","pt":"O gerador de PRD cria documentos de requisitos de produto claros e açãoaveis para desenvolvedores. Ele recebe uma descrição de recurso, faz perguntas clarifi...","ru":"Генератор PRD создает четкие и действенные документы требований к продукту для разработчиков. Он получает описание функции, задает уточняющие вопросы и генер...","ar":"مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج يُنشئ وثائق متطلبات المنتج الواضحة والقابلة للتنفيذ للمطورين. يتلقى وصف الميزة، ويسأل أسئلة توضيحية، وينشئ وثيقة متطلبات المنتج الم...","en":"dart-app-laravel"},"definition":{"en":"dart-app-laravel"},"features":{"zh":["","","","",""],"ja":["","","","",""],"ko":["","","","",""],"es":["Recibe descripciones de características del usuario","Hace preguntas clarificadoras esenciales","Genera un PRD estructurado","Guarda el PRD en un archivo Markdown","Soporte para aplicaciones Dart y Laravel"],"fr":["Reçoit les descriptions de fonctionnalités de l''utilisateur","Pose des questions clarificatrices essentielles","Génère un PRD structuré","Enregistre le PRD dans un fichier Markdown","Prise en charge des applications Dart et Laravel"],"de":["Erhält Benutzerfunktionsbeschreibungen","Stellt wesentliche Klarstellungsfragen","Erstellt ein strukturiertes PRD","Speichert das PRD in einer Markdown-Datei","Unterstützung für Dart- und Laravel-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Receba descrição de recurso do usuário","Faça perguntas clarificadoras","Gere PRD estruturado","Salve em arquivo Markdown","Integração com Laravel e Dart"],"ru":["Получить описание функции от пользователя","Задать уточняющие вопросы","Сгенерировать структурированный PRD","Сохранить в файл Markdown","Интеграция с Laravel и Dart"],"ar":["استلام وصف الميزة من المستخدم","الأسئلة التوضيحية","إنشاء وثيقة متطلبات المنتج المنظمة","حفظ في ملف Markdown","التكامل مع Laravel و Dart"]},"keywords":{"zh":["prd","","","","",""],"ja":["PRD","","","","",""],"ko":["prd","","","","",""],"es":["generador de PRD","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Dart","Laravel","documento de requisitos de producto","PRD para desarrolladores","creación de PRD","herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","développement d''applications","Dart","Laravel","document de spécifications de produit","PRD pour les développeurs","création de PRD","outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Anwendungsentwicklung","Dart","Laravel","Produktanforderungsdokument","PRD für Entwickler","Erstellung von PRD","Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["PRD","Gerador de PRD","Desenvolvimento de software","Laravel","Dart","Documentos de requisitos","Desenvolvedores","Aplicativos","Programação"],"ru":["PRD","Генератор PRD","Разработка программного обеспечения","Laravel","Dart","Документы требований","Разработчики","Приложения","Программирование"],"ar":["وثائق متطلبات المنتج","مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج","تطوير البرمجيات","Laravel","Dart","وثائق المتطلبات","المطورون","التطبيقات","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"bmartinez287","repo":"dart-app-laravel","repoPath":"bmartinez287/dart-app-laravel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt i","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:55:44.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","zh":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","ja":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","ko":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan generar documentos de requisitos de producto estructurados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de générer des documents de spécifications de produit structurés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto estruturados.","ru":"Идеален для агентов разработки, которым необходима генерация структурированных документов требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستند متطلبات المنتج المنظم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on feature descriptions, utilizing markdown file formats and essential clarifying questions to ensure actionable implementation plans, saving outputs to specific directories like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","zh":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on feature descriptions, utilizing markdown file formats and essential clarifying questions to ensure actionable implementation plans, saving outputs to specific directories like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","ja":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on feature descriptions, utilizing markdown file formats and essential clarifying questions to ensure actionable implementation plans, saving outputs to specific directories like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","ko":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on feature descriptions, utilizing markdown file formats and essential clarifying questions to ensure actionable implementation plans, saving outputs to specific directories like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear PRD detallados basados en descripciones de funciones, utilizando formatos de archivo de markdown y preguntas esenciales de aclaración para garantizar planes de implementación que se pueden llevar a cabo, guardando los resultados en directorios específicos como tasks/prd-[nombre-de-la-función].md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des PRD détaillés basés sur des descriptions de fonctionnalités, en utilisant des formats de fichiers markdown et des questions essentielles de clarification pour assurer des plans d''implémentation actionnables, en sauvegardant les sorties dans des répertoires spécifiques comme tasks/prd-[nom-de-la-fonctionnalité].md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, detaillierte PRD auf Basis von Funktionsbeschreibungen zu erstellen, indem es Markdown-Dateiformate und wesentliche Klarstellungsfragen verwendet, um handhabbare Implementierungspläne sicherzustellen, und speichert die Ausgaben in bestimmten Verzeichnissen wie tasks/prd-[funktionsname].md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar PRDs detalhados com base em descrições de recursos, utilizando formatos de arquivo markdown e questões essenciais de esclarecimento para garantir planos de implementação eficazes, salvando as saídas em diretórios específicos como tasks/prd-[nome-do-recurso].md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные документы требований к продукту на основе описаний функций, используя форматы файлов markdown и необходимые вопросы разъяснения для обеспечения реализуемых планов реализации, сохраняя выводы в определенные каталоги, такие как tasks/prd-[имя-функции].md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج مفصلة بناءً على وصفات الميزات، باستخدام تنسيقات الملفات markdown والأسئلة التوضيحية الأساسية لضمان خطط التنفيذ القابلة للتنفيذ، وحفظ الإخراج في دلائل محددة مثل tasks/prd-[اسم-الميزة].md."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for development teams","Clarifying project requirements through targeted questioning"],"zh":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for development teams","Clarifying project requirements through targeted questioning"],"ja":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for development teams","Clarifying project requirements through targeted questioning"],"ko":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for development teams","Clarifying project requirements through targeted questioning"],"es":["Generación de PRD para nuevas implementaciones de funciones","Creación de documentación estructurada para equipos de desarrollo","Aclaración de los requisitos del proyecto a través de preguntas dirigidas"],"fr":["Génération de PRD pour de nouvelles mises en œuvre de fonctionnalités","Création de documentation structurée pour les équipes de développement","Clarification des exigences du projet à travers des questions ciblées"],"de":["Generierung von PRD für neue Funktionsimplementierungen","Erstellung von strukturierter Dokumentation für Entwicklungsteams","Klärung der Projektanforderungen durch gezielte Fragen"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para implementações de novos recursos","Criação de documentação estruturada para equipes de desenvolvimento","Esclarecimento dos requisitos do projeto por meio de questionamento direcionado"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для реализации новых функций","Создание структурированной документации для команд разработки","Разъяснение требований проекта посредством целенаправленного вопроса"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج للتنفيذات الجديدة للميزات","إنشاء توثيق منظم للفرق التطويرية","توضيح متطلبات المشروع من خلال أسئلة موجهة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions"],"zh":["Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions"],"ja":["Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions"],"ko":["Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions"],"es":["No admite la implementación, solo la generación de PRD","Requiere entrada de usuario para descripciones de funciones y respuestas a preguntas de aclaración"],"fr":["N''a pas la possibilité d''implémentation, uniquement la génération de PRD","Nécessite une saisie utilisateur pour les descriptions de fonctionnalités et les réponses aux questions de clarification"],"de":["Unterstützt keine Implementierung, nur die Generierung von PRD","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Funktionsbeschreibungen und Antworten auf Klarstellungsfragen"],"pt":["Não suporta implementação, apenas geração de PRD","Exige entrada do usuário para descrições de recursos e respostas a questões de esclarecimento"],"ru":["Не поддерживает реализацию, только генерацию документа требований к продукту","Требует ввода пользователя для описаний функций и ответов на вопросы разъяснения"],"ar":["لا يدعم التنفيذ، بل إنشاء مستند متطلبات المنتج فقط","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصفات الميزات والإجابات على الأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('glowfinger/tagging-rugby-cli/prd', 'community', 'glowfinger', 'tagging-rugby-cli', 'glowfinger/tagging-rugby-cli', 'prd', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z', '2026-02-18T02:55:20.750Z', NULL, '{"id":"glowfinger/tagging-rugby-cli/prd","name":"prd","description":{"zh":"PRD 生成器可以根据用户输入创建详细的产品需求文档，帮助开发团队更好地理解项目需求","ja":"PRD ジェネレーターはユーザーの入力に基づいて詳細な製品要件文書を作成し、開発チームがプロジェクトの要件をよりよく理解できるようにします","ko":"PRD 생성기는 사용자의 입력에 따라詳細한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성하여 개발 팀이 프로젝트 요구 사항을 더 잘 이해할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos. Recibe descripciones de funciones y genera PRD estructurados.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis. Il reçoit des descriptions de fonctionnalités et génère des PRD structurés.","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente. Er erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen und generiert strukturierte PRD.","pt":"O Gerador de PRD é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar documentos de requisitos de produto claros e açãoaveis. Ele recebe uma descrição de recurso do usuário e gera um PRD estruturado.","ru":"Генератор PRD - это инструмент, который помогает создать технические требования продукта, ясные и действенные. Он получает описание функции от пользователя и генерирует структурированный PRD.","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج الواضحة والقابلة للتنفيذ. يتلقى وصف الميزة من المستخدم وينشئ مواصفات المنتج المهيكلة.","en":"Tagging Rugby CLI vibe-coded proof of concept that also coaches or analysts to tag a rugby match and generate match information. I wanted to test Ralph loops and thought this would be an interesting test case."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PRD 生成器 - 自动创建产品需求文档","ja":"PRD ジェネレーター - 明確な製品要件文書を作成","ko":"PRD 생성기 - 자동으로 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","es":"Generador de PRD: Crea documentos de requisitos de producto","fr":"Générateur de PRD: Créez des documents de spécifications ...","de":"PRD-Generator: Erstellen Sie detaillierte Produktanforder...","pt":"Gerador de PRD: Crie Documentos de Requisitos de Produto","ru":"Генератор PRD: Создайте Технические Требования Продукта","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج: قم بإنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج","en":"prd"},"description":{"zh":"PRD 生成器可以根据用户输入创建详细的产品需求文档，帮助开发团队更好地理解项目需求","ja":"PRD ジェネレーターはユーザーの入力に基づいて詳細な製品要件文書を作成し、開発チームがプロジェクトの要件をよりよく理解できるようにします","ko":"PRD 생성기는 사용자의 입력에 따라詳細한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성하여 개발 팀이 프로젝트 요구 사항을 더 잘 이해할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos. Recibe descripciones de funciones y genera PRD estructurados.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis. Il reçoit des descriptions de fonctionnalités et génère des PRD struct...","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente. Er erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen und generiert strukturierte PRD.","pt":"O Gerador de PRD é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar documentos de requisitos de produto claros e açãoaveis. Ele recebe uma descrição de recurso do usuário e ...","ru":"Генератор PRD - это инструмент, который помогает создать технические требования продукта, ясные и действенные. Он получает описание функции от пользователя и...","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج هو أداة تساعد في إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج الواضحة والقابلة للتنفيذ. يتلقى وصف الميزة من المستخدم وينشئ مواصفات المنتج المهيكلة.","en":"Tagging Rugby CLI vibe-coded proof of concept that also coaches or analysts to tag a rugby match and generate match information. I wanted to test Ralph loops..."},"definition":{"en":"Tagging Rugby CLI vibe-coded proof of concept that also coaches or analysts to tag a rugby match and generate match information. I wanted to test Ralph loops and thought this would be an interesting test case."},"features":{"zh":["自动创建产品需求文档","支持用户输入和澄清问题","生成清晰、可行的文档","保存为 Markdown 文件"],"ja":["製品要件文書の自動生成","ユーザーの入力とクエリのサポート","明確な製品要件文書の生成","Markdown ファイルとして保存"],"ko":["제품 요구 사항 문서의 자동 생성","사용자 입력 및 질문 지원","명확하고 실행 가능한 문서 생성","Markdown 파일로 저장"],"es":["Recibe descripciones de funciones del usuario","Hace preguntas de aclaración","Genera PRD estructurados","Guarda PRD en formato Markdown","No requiere implementación"],"fr":["Reçoit des descriptions de fonctionnalités de l''utilisateur","Pose des questions de clarification","Génère des PRD structurés","Enregistre les PRD au format Markdown","N''exige pas de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen vom Benutzer","Stellt Klarstellungsfragen","Generiert strukturierte PRD","Speichert PRD im Markdown-Format","Erfordert keine Implementierung"],"pt":["Recebe descrição de recurso do usuário","Gera PRD estruturado","Salva em formato Markdown","Perguntas clarificadoras essenciais","Criação de PRD personalizado"],"ru":["Получает описание функции от пользователя","Генерирует структурированный PRD","Сохраняет в формате Markdown","Существенные вопросы-разъяснения","Создание индивидуального PRD"],"ar":["يتلقى وصف الميزة من المستخدم","ينشئ مواصفات المنتج المهيكلة","يحفظ في صيغة Markdown","اسئلة توضيحية أساسية","إنشاء مواصفات المنتج المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PRD 生成器","产品需求文档","开发工具","自动化文档","项目管理"],"ja":["PRD ジェネレーター","製品要件文書","開発ツール","自動化ドキュメント","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["PRD 생성기","제품 요구 사항 문서","개발 도구","자동화 문서","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["generador de PRD","documento de requisitos de producto","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","análisis de requisitos","especificaciones de producto"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","document de spécifications de produit","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","analyse de besoins","spécifications de produit"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Produktanforderungsdokument","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen","Anforderungsanalyse","Produktspezifikation"],"pt":["Gerador de PRD","Documentos de requisitos de produto","Desenvolvimento de software","Requisitos de produto","PRD personalizado","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Генератор PRD","Технические требования продукта","Разработка программного обеспечения","Требования продукта","Индивидуальный PRD","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مولد مواصفات المنتج","مستندات متطلبات المنتج","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات المنتج","مواصفات المنتج المخصصة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"glowfinger","repo":"tagging-rugby-cli","repoPath":"glowfinger/tagging-rugby-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt i","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:55:20.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing structured product requirements document generation.","zh":"非常适合需要生成结构化产品需求文档的技术写作代理","ja":"テクニカルライティングエージェントが構造化された製品要件文書を生成する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성이 필요한 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan generación de documentos de requisitos de producto estructurados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de génération de documents de spécifications de produit structurés.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die eine strukturierte Generierung von Produktanforderungsdokumenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de geração de documentos de requisitos de produtos estruturados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического письма, которым необходима генерация структурированных документов требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate detailed Product Requirements Documents in Markdown format, utilizing clarifying questions and feature descriptions to create clear, actionable, and implementable PRDs, saving them to specific files like `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`.","zh":"使代理能够生成详细的产品需求文档（PRD），以Markdown格式书写，利用澄清问题和功能描述创建清晰、可行和可实施的PRD，并将其保存到特定的文件中，如 tasks/prd-[功能名称].md","ja":"エージェントが詳細な製品要件文書（PRD）をMarkdown形式で生成できるようにし、明確化する質問と機能説明を使用して明確で実行可能なPRDを作成し、tasks/prd-[機能名].mdのような特定のファイルに保存する","ko":"에이전트가 자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서（PRD)를 Markdown 형식으로 생성하도록 하며,澄清 질문과 기능 설명을 사용하여 명확하고 실행 가능하며 구현 가능한 PRD를 생성하고 tasks/prd-[기능 이름].md와 같은 특정 파일에 저장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de requisitos de producto detallados en formato Markdown, utilizando preguntas aclaratorias y descripciones de características para crear PRD claros, accionables e implementables, guardándolos en archivos específicos como tasks/prd-[nombre-de-característica].md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés au format Markdown, en utilisant des questions clarificatrices et des descriptions de fonctionnalités pour créer des PRD clairs, actionnables et implementables, les sauvegardant dans des fichiers spécifiques comme tasks/prd-[nom-de-fonctionnalité].md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente im Markdown-Format zu generieren, indem sie klarifizierende Fragen und Funktionsbeschreibungen verwenden, um klare, umsetzbare und implementierbare PRD zu erstellen und sie in bestimmten Dateien wie tasks/prd-[funktionname].md zu speichern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar Documentos de Requisitos de Produto detalhados no formato Markdown, utilizando perguntas esclarecedoras e descrições de recursos para criar PRDs claros, acionáveis e implementáveis, salvando-os em arquivos específicos como tasks/prd-[nome-do-recurso].md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать подробные документы требований к продукту в формате Markdown, используя уточняющие вопросы и описания функций для создания ясных, действенных и реализуемых документов требований к продукту, сохраняя их в конкретные файлы, такие как tasks/prd-[название-функции].md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة بتنسيق Markdown، باستخدام أسئلة توضيحية ووصفات الميزات لإنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ، وحفظها في ملفات محددة مثل tasks/prd-[اسم-الميزة].md."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature development","Creating structured documentation for product launches","Assisting coaches or analysts in tagging and generating match information for rugby matches"],"zh":["为新功能开发生成PRD","为产品发布创建结构化文档","协助教练或分析师标记和生成橄榄球比赛的匹配信息"],"ja":["新機能開発のためのPRDを生成する","製品リリースのための構造化ドキュメントを作成する","コーチまたはアナリストがラグビーの試合のマッチ情報をタグ付けして生成するのを支援する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 개발을 위한 PRD 생성","제품 출시를 위한 구조화된 문서 생성","코치 또는 분석가가 럭비 경기의 일치 정보를 태그하고 생성하는 것을 지원"],"es":["Generación de PRD para el desarrollo de nuevas características","Creación de documentación estructurada para lanzamientos de productos","Asistencia a entrenadores o analistas en la etiquetado y generación de información de partido para partidos de rugby"],"fr":["Génération de PRD pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Création de documentation structurée pour les lancements de produits","Aide aux entraîneurs ou analystes dans l''étiquetage et la génération d''informations de match pour les matchs de rugby"],"de":["Generierung von PRD für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen","Erstellung von strukturierter Dokumentation für Produktstarts","Unterstützung von Trainern oder Analysten bei der Kennzeichnung und Generierung von Spielinformationen für Rugby-Spiele"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para desenvolvimento de novos recursos","Criação de documentação estruturada para lançamentos de produtos","Auxílio a treinadores ou analistas na marcação e geração de informações de jogos de rugby"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для разработки новых функций","Создание структурированной документации для запуска продуктов","Помощь тренерам или аналитикам в标ании и генерации информации о матчах по регби"],"ar":["توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج لتنمية الميزات الجديدة","إنشاء توثيق منظم لل产品 عند إطلاقه","مساعدة المدربين أو المحللين في تعليم وتوليد معلومات المباريات رجبي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not implement features, only generates PRDs","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions"],"zh":["不实施功能，只生成PRD","需要用户输入功能描述和澄清问题的答案"],"ja":["機能を実装せず、PRDのみを生成する","機能説明と明確化する質問の回答についてのユーザー入力を必要とする"],"ko":["기능을 구현하지 않고 PRD만 생성","기능 설명과 澄明 질문의 답변에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요"],"es":["No implementa características, solo genera PRD","Requiere entrada de usuario para descripciones de características y respuestas a preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["N''implémente pas les fonctionnalités, ne génère que des PRD","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les descriptions de fonctionnalités et les réponses aux questions clarificatrices"],"de":["Implementiert keine Funktionen, generiert nur PRD","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Funktionsbeschreibungen und Antworten auf klarifizierende Fragen"],"pt":["Não implementa recursos, apenas gera PRDs","Requer entrada do usuário para descrições de recursos e respostas a perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Не реализует функции, только генерирует документы требований к продукту","Требует ввода пользователя для описаний функций и ответов на уточняющие вопросы"],"ar":["لا يطبق الميزات، فقط يولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصفات الميزات والإجابات على الأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
