lementación y mejores prácticas para JPA, Hibernate y consultas","fr":"Apprenez à optimiser l''accès aux données dans Spring Boot avec des lignes directrices d''implémentation et les meilleures pratiques pour JPA, Hibernate et les...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Datenzugriff in Spring Boot optimieren können, mit Implementierungsrichtlinien und Best Practices für JPA, Hibernate und Abfragen","pt":"O acesso a dados é fundamental em aplicações Spring Boot. Aqui estão as melhores práticas para otimizar o desempenho e evitar problemas comuns","ru":"Доступ к данным является фундаментальным в приложениях Spring Boot. Здесь представлены лучшие практики для оптимизации производительности и избежания распрос...","ar":"الوصول إلى البيانات هو أمر أساسي في تطبيقات Spring Boot. هنا هي أفضل الممارسات لتحسين الأداء وتجنب المشاكل الشائعة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["JPA Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"ja":["JPA Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"ko":["JPA Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 "],"es":["Implementación de JPA y Hibernate","Optimización de consultas con JOIN y Proyecciones","Uso de Pageable para paginación","Detección de problemas de carga diferida con Open-In-View","Mejores prácticas para servicios de solo lectura"],"fr":["Implémentation de JPA et Hibernate","Optimisation des requêtes avec JOIN et Projections","Utilisation de Pageable pour la pagination","Détection des problèmes de chargement différé avec Open-In-View","Meilleures pratiques pour les services en lecture seule"],"de":["Implementierung von JPA und Hibernate","Optimierung von Abfragen mit JOIN und Projections","Verwendung von Pageable für Paginierung","Erkennung von Problemen mit verzögerter Ladung mit Open-In-View","Best Practices für schreibgeschützte Dienste"],"pt":["Uso de JPA e Hibernate","Otimização de consultas com JOIN","Uso de Pageable para paginção","Desativação do Open-In-View","Uso de Java Records para consultas somente leitura"],"ru":["Использование JPA и Hibernate","Оптимизация запросов с JOIN","Использование Pageable для постраничной навигации","Отключение Open-In-View","Использование Java Records для запросов только для чтения"],"ar":["استخدام JPA و Hibernate","تحسين الاستعلامات مع JOIN","استخدام Pageable للتنقل الصفحي","إلغاء تنشيط Open-In-View","استخدام Java Records للاستعلامات القراءة فقط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Spring Boot ","Java "],"ja":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Spring Boot ","Java "],"ko":["Spring Boot","JPA","Hibernate","Java","Pageable","Open-In-View","N+1 ","Spring Boot ","Java "],"es":["Spring Boot","Acceso a datos","JPA","Hibernate","Optimización de consultas","Pageable","Open-In-View","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Bases de datos"],"fr":["Spring Boot","Accès aux données","JPA","Hibernate","Optimisation des requêtes","Pageable","Open-In-View","Développement d''applications","Bases de données"],"de":["Spring Boot","Datenzugriff","JPA","Hibernate","Abfrageoptimierung","Pageable","Open-In-View","Anwendungsentwicklung","Datenbanken"],"pt":["Spring Boot","Acesso a dados","JPA","Hibernate","Otimização de consultas","Pageable","Open-In-View","Java Records"],"ru":["Spring Boot","Доступ к данным","JPA","Hibernate","Оптимизация запросов","Pageable","Open-In-View","Java Records"],"ar":["Spring Boot","الوصول إلى البيانات","JPA","Hibernate","تحسين الاستعلامات","Pageable","Open-In-View","Java Records"]}},"owner":"fierzone","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Spring Boot Data Access","description":"Best practices for JPA, Hibernate, and Database interactions in Spring Boot","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Data Access\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### JPA & Hibernate\n\n- **Read-Only**: Default to `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` on Services. Override only on write methods.\n- **Projections**: Use Java Records for read-only queries. Avoid fetching full Entities.\n- **Pagination**: ALWAYS use `Pageable` for collections.\n- **Open-In-View**: Set `spring.jpa.open-in-view=false` to detect lazy loading issues early.\n\n### Query Optimization\n\n- **N+1 Problem**: Use `JOIN F","body":"# Spring Boot Data Access\n\n## **Priority: P0**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### JPA & Hibernate\n\n- **Read-Only**: Default to `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` on Services. Override only on write methods.\n- **Projections**: Use Java Records for read-only queries. Avoid fetching full Entities.\n- **Pagination**: ALWAYS use `Pageable` for collections.\n- **Open-In-View**: Set `spring.jpa.open-in-view=false` to detect lazy loading issues early.\n\n### Query Optimization\n\n- **N+1 Problem**: Use `JOIN FETCH` (JPQL) or `@EntityGraph` for relationships.\n- **Bulk Operations**: Use `@Modifying` for batch updates/deletes to bypass Entity overhead.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **N+1 Selects**: `**No loops in loops**: Fetch eagerly or use graphs.`\n- **Logic in Queries**: `**No complex JPQL**: Use Service logic.`\n- **Returning Streams**: `**No raw Streams**: Use Lists or Page.`\n\n## References\n\n- [Implementation Examples](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:56:13.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based AI Agents requiring efficient data access and management with Spring Boot","zh":"适用于需要高效数据访问和管理的基于Java的AI代理，搭配Spring Boot","ja":"JavaベースのAIエージェントが効率的なデータアクセスと管理を必要とする場合に適しています。Spring Bootを使用します","ko":"효율적인 데이터 접근 및 관리가 필요한 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 스프링 부트 사용","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Java que requieren un acceso y gestión de datos eficientes con Spring Boot","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java nécessitant un accès et une gestion de données efficaces avec Spring Boot","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die einen effizienten Datenzugriff und eine Datenverwaltung mit Spring Boot erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que exigem acesso e gerenciamento de dados eficientes com Spring Boot","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих эффективного доступа и управления данными с Spring Boot","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الذكي المعتمد على جافا الذي يتطلب الوصول والادارة الفعاله للبيانات مع Spring Boot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage JPA and Hibernate for optimized data retrieval, utilizing Java Records for projections and enforcing pagination with Pageable, while detecting lazy loading issues by setting spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","zh":"赋予代理使用JPA和Hibernate进行优化的数据检索，利用Java Records进行投影，并通过Pageable强制分页，同时通过设置spring.jpa.open-in-view=false检测懒加载问题","ja":"エージェントがJPAとHibernateを使用して最適化されたデータの取得を実行できるようにし、Java Recordsを使用して投影を行い、Pageableを使用してページングを強制し、spring.jpa.open-in-view=falseを設定して遅延ロードの問題を検出します","ko":"에이전트가 JPA와 하이버네이트를 사용하여 최적화된 데이터检索를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 자바 레코드를 사용하여 투영을 수행하고, 페이지가능을 사용하여 페이징을 강제하며, 스프링.jpa.open-in-view=false를 설정하여 지연 로딩 문제를 감지합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar JPA y Hibernate para una recuperación de datos optimizada, utilizando Java Records para proyecciones y aplicando paginación con Pageable, mientras detecta problemas de carga diferida estableciendo spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser JPA et Hibernate pour une récupération de données optimisée, en utilisant Java Records pour les projections et en appliquant la pagination avec Pageable, tout en détectant les problèmes de chargement différé en définissant spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, JPA und Hibernate für eine optimierte Datenerfassung zu nutzen, indem Java Records für Projektionen verwendet und eine Paginierung mit Pageable durchgesetzt wird, während Probleme mit der verzögerten Laden durch Setzen von spring.jpa.open-in-view=false erkannt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o JPA e o Hibernate para recuperação de dados otimizada, utilizando Registros Java para projeções e aplicando paginação com Pageable, enquanto detecta problemas de carregamento lento definindo spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать JPA и Hibernate для оптимизированного извлечения данных, используя записи Java для проекций и применение постраничной навигации с помощью Pageable, а также обнаруживая проблемы с ленивой загрузкой, устанавливая spring.jpa.open-in-view=false","ar":"يسمح للعميل بالاستفادة من JPA و Hibernate لاسترجاع البيانات المتحسنة ، باستخدام سجلات جافا للمشاريع وتطبيق التنقل الصفحي مع Pageable ، وفي الوقت نفسه اكتشاف مشاكل التحميل البطيء عن طريق تعيين spring.jpa.open-in-view=false"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing read-only transactions with @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Optimizing queries using JOIN FETCH to avoid the N+1 problem","Enforcing pagination for large datasets with Pageable"],"zh":["使用@Transactional(readOnly = true)实现只读事务","使用JOIN FETCH优化查询以避免1+N问题","使用Pageable强制对大型数据集进行分页"],"ja":["トランザクションを使用して只読トランザクションを実現する (@Transactional(readOnly = true))","JOIN FETCHを使用してクエリを最適化し、1+N問題を回避する","Pageableを使用して大規模なデータセットに対するページングを強制する"],"ko":["트랜잭션을 사용하여 읽기 전용 트랜잭션을 구현합니다 (@Transactional(readOnly = true))","조인 페치를 사용하여 쿼리를 최적화하고 1+N 문제를 피합니다","페이지 가능을 사용하여 대규모 데이터 세트에 대한 페이지를 강제 적용합니다"],"es":["Implementar transacciones de solo lectura con @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Optimizar consultas utilizando JOIN FETCH para evitar el problema N+1","Aplicar paginación para grandes conjuntos de datos con Pageable"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des transactions en lecture seule avec @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Optimiser les requêtes en utilisant JOIN FETCH pour éviter le problème N+1","Appliquer la pagination pour les grands ensembles de données avec Pageable"],"de":["Implementierung von schreibgeschützten Transaktionen mit @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Optimierung von Abfragen unter Verwendung von JOIN FETCH, um das N+1-Problem zu vermeiden","Durchsetzung der Paginierung für große Datenmengen mit Pageable"],"pt":["Implementação de transações somente leitura com @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Otimização de consultas usando JOIN FETCH para evitar o problema N+1","Aplicação de paginação para grandes conjuntos de dados com Pageable"],"ru":["Реализация транзакций только для чтения с помощью @Transactional(readOnly = true)","Оптимизация запросов с помощью JOIN FETCH для избежания проблемы N+1","Применение постраничной навигации для больших наборов данных с помощью Pageable"],"ar":["تنفيذ معاملات القراءة فقط مع @Transactional(readOnly = true)","تحسين الاستفسارات باستخدام JOIN FETCH لتجنب مشكلة N+1","تطبيق التنقل الصفحي للollections البيانات الكبيرة مع Pageable"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Spring Boot setup","Limited to JPA and Hibernate for data access","Needs careful configuration to avoid lazy loading issues"],"zh":["需要Spring Boot设置","仅限于JPA和Hibernate进行数据访问","需要仔细配置以避免懒加载问题"],"ja":["Spring Bootの設定が必要","データアクセスはJPAとHibernateのみ","遅延ロードの問題を回避するために注意深い設定が必要"],"ko":["스프링 부트 설정이 필요합니다","데이터 접근은 JPA와 하이버네이트만 가능합니다","지연 로딩 문제를 피하기 위해 주의 깊은 설정이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Spring Boot","Limitado a JPA y Hibernate para el acceso a datos","Requiere una configuración cuidadosa para evitar problemas de carga diferida"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Spring Boot","Limité à JPA et Hibernate pour l''accès aux données","Nécessite une configuration soigneuse pour éviter les problèmes de chargement différé"],"de":["Erfordert eine Spring-Boot-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf JPA und Hibernate für den Datenzugriff","Erfordert eine sorgfältige Konfiguration, um Probleme mit der verzögerten Laden zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Spring Boot","Limitado ao JPA e Hibernate para acesso a dados","Necessita de configuração cuidadosa para evitar problemas de carregamento lento"],"ru":["Требует настройки Spring Boot","Ограничен JPA и Hibernate для доступа к данным","Требует тщательной настройки для избежания проблем с ленивой загрузкой"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Spring Boot","محدود بال JPA و Hibernate للوصول إلى البيانات","يحتاج إلى إعداد دقيق لتجنب مشاكل التحميل البطيء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
