ados","Recursos para aprendizado contínuo","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["Рекомендации для бизнес-задач","Лучшие практики для бизнес-процессов","Чек-лист для проверки результатов","Ресурсы для непрерывного обучения","Применение рекомендованных практик"],"ar":["إرشادات لمهام الأعمال","أفضل الممارسات لتدفقات العمل","قوائم المراجعة للتحقق من النتائج","مصادر للتعلم المستمر","تطبيق الممارسات الموصى بها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["业务分析师技能","业务分析","软件能力","任务管理","工作流程","最佳实践","检查清单","操作步骤","验证"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストスキル","ビジネス分析","ソフトウェア能力","タスク管理","ワークフロー","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト","操作手順","検証"],"ko":["사업 분석가 스킬","사업 분석","소프트웨어 능력","태스크 관리","워크플로우","최佳实践","체크리스트","작업 단계","검증"],"es":["analista de negocios","procesos comerciales","mejora de procesos","toma de decisiones","gestión de proyectos","optimización de procesos"],"fr":["analyste commercial","processus commerciaux","amélioration des processus","prise de décisions","gestion de projets","optimisation des processus"],"de":["Geschäftsanalyst","Geschäftsprozesse","Prozessverbesserung","Entscheidungsfindung","Projektmanagement","Prozessoptimierung"],"pt":["analista de negócios","desenvolvimento de workflows","tarefas de negócios","melhores práticas","checklist","validação de resultados","recursos para aprendizado"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","разработка бизнес-процессов","бизнес-задачи","лучшие практики","чек-лист","проверка результатов","ресурсы для обучения"],"ar":["محلل الأعمال","تطوير تدفقات العمل","مهام الأعمال","أفضل الممارسات","قوائم المراجعة","التحقق من النتائج","مصادر للتعلم"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:56:46.671Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agent Developers needing advanced business analysis capabilities, particularly those working on tasks involving business analyst workflows and best practices.","zh":"适合需要高级商业分析能力的Agent开发人员，尤其是那些从事涉及商业分析师工作流和最佳实践的任务的人员。","ja":"ビジネス分析能力の高度な開発者向けに最適化されており、特にビジネスアナリストのワークフローとベストプラクティスを扱うタスクに従事する人々に適しています。","ko":"고급 비즈니스 분석 기능이 필요한 에이전트 개발자에게 적합하며, 특히 비즈니스 분석가 워크플ロー 및 모범 사례와 관련된 작업을 수행하는 사람들에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de agentes que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de negocios, particularmente aquellos que trabajan en tareas que involucran flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios y mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''agents ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse commerciale avancées, en particulier ceux qui travaillent sur des tâches impliquant des flux de travail d''analyste commercial et des meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Agent-Entwickler, die erweiterte Geschäftsanalysefunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die an Aufgaben arbeiten, die Workflows und Best Practices von Business Analysten beinhalten.","pt":"Ideal para Desenvolvedores de Agentes que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de negócios, particularmente aqueles que trabalham em tarefas que envolvem fluxos de trabalho de analista de negócios e melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности бизнес-анализа, особенно для тех, кто работает над задачами, связанными с рабочими процессами бизнес-аналитика и лучшими практиками.","ar":"مثالي لمنطقيي وكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحليل أعمال متقدمة، خاصة أولئك الذين يعملون على مهام تتضمن سير عمل محلل أعمال وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps for business analyst tasks, utilizing guidance and checklists for informed decision-making and workflow optimization, including clarification of goals and constraints.","zh":"赋予代理人应用相关的最佳实践、验证结果并为商业分析师任务提供可行步骤的能力，利用指导和清单进行明智的决策和工作流优化，包括目标和约束的澄清。","ja":"エージェントに、関連するベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、ビジネスアナリストのタスクのための実行可能なステップを提供する力を与え、ガイダンスとチェックリストを使用して、情報に基づいた意思決定とワークフローの最適化を実現し、目標と制約の明確化を含む。","ko":"에이전트에게 관련 모범 사례를 적용하고 결과를 검증하고 비즈니스 분석가 태스크에 대한 실행 가능한 단계를 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 지침과 체크리스트를 사용하여 정보에 의한 의사 결정과 워크플로 최적화를 실현하며, 목표와 제약의 명확화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas relevantes, validar los resultados y proporcionar pasos de acción para las tareas de analista de negocios, utilizando orientación y listas de verificación para la toma de decisiones informadas y la optimización del flujo de trabajo, incluyendo la aclaración de objetivos y restricciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques pertinentes, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes de réalisation pour les tâches d''analyste commercial, en utilisant des conseils et des listes de vérification pour la prise de décision éclairée et l''optimisation du flux de travail, y compris la clarification des objectifs et des contraintes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, relevante Best Practices anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und Handlungen für Aufgaben von Business Analysten bereitzustellen, unter Verwendung von Anleitungen und Prüflisten für eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung und eine optimierte Arbeitsablauf, einschließlich der Klärung von Zielen und Einschränkungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas relevantes, validar resultados e fornecer etapas ação para tarefas de analista de negócios, utilizando orientação e listas de verificação para tomada de decisões informadas e otimização de fluxo de trabalho, incluindo esclarecimento de metas e restrições.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять соответствующие лучшие практики, проверять результаты и предоставлять действия по задачам бизнес-аналитика, используя руководство и чек-листы для информированного принятия решений и оптимизации рабочего процесса, включая разъяснение целей и ограничений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تطبيق الممارسات المثالية ذات الصلة، وValidation النتائج وتقديم خطوات ملموسة لمهام محلل الأعمال، باستخدام الإرشاد وقوائم التحقق من الصحة لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة وتنظيم سير العمل، بما في ذلك توضيح الأهداف والقيود."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating business analyst workflows","Generating checklists for business analysis","Validating business outcomes and providing actionable steps"],"zh":["自动化商业分析工作流","为商业分析生成清单","验证商业结果并提供可行步骤"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのワークフローを自動化する","ビジネス分析のためのチェックリストを生成する","ビジネスの結果を検証し、実行可能なステップを提供する"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석 워크플ロー 자동화","비즈니스 분석을 위한 체크리스트 생성","비즈니스 결과 검증 및 실행 가능한 단계 제공"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios","Generación de listas de verificación para el análisis de negocios","Validación de resultados de negocios y proporcionar pasos de acción"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail d''analyste commercial","Génération de listes de vérification pour l''analyse commerciale","Validation des résultats commerciaux et fourniture d''étapes de réalisation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflows von Business Analysten","Erstellung von Prüflisten für die Geschäftsanalyse","Validierung von Geschäftsergebnissen und Bereitstellung von Handlungsschritten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de analista de negócios","Gerar listas de verificação para análise de negócios","Validar resultados de negócios e fornecer etapas ação"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов бизнес-аналитика","Генерация чек-листов для бизнес-анализа","Проверка бизнес-результатов и предоставление действий"],"ar":["تأتمتة سير عمل محلل الأعمال","توليد قوائم التحقق من الصحة لتحليل الأعمال","التحقق من نتائج الأعمال وتقديم خطوات ملموسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to business analyst domain","Requires clear goals, constraints, and inputs for effective application"],"zh":["任务必须与商业分析师领域相关","需要明确的目标、约束和输入以有效应用"],"ja":["タスクはビジネスアナリストのドメインに関連している必要がある","有効な適用のために明確な目標、制約、入力が必要"],"ko":["태스크는 비즈니스 분석가 도메인과 관련되어야 함","유효한 적용을 위해 명확한 목표, 제약, 입력이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con el dominio del analista de negocios","Requiere objetivos, restricciones y entradas claras para una aplicación efectiva"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée au domaine de l''analyste commercial","Nécessite des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées claires pour une application efficace"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit dem Bereich des Business Analysten zusammenhängen","Benötigt klare Ziele, Einschränkungen und Eingaben für eine wirksame Anwendung"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao domínio do analista de negócios","Requer metas, restrições e entradas claras para aplicação eficaz"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с доменом бизнес-аналитика","Требует rõких целей, ограничений и входных данных для эффективного применения"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة ذات صلة بمجال محلل الأعمال","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا ومدخلات واضحة للتطبيق الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
