asy as single-platform."},"features":{"zh":["跨平台支持","单一的 Vite 插件","共享代码","轻松部署","项目管理"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム対応","単一の Vite プラグイン","共有コード","簡単なデプロイ","プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 지원","단일의 Vite 플러그인","공유 코드","쉬운 배포","프로젝트 관리"],"es":["Desarrollo cross-plataforma con un solo plugin de Vite","Código compartido para aplicaciones web y nativas","Instalación fácil mediante npm o brew","Autenticación segura con Railway CLI","Variables de entorno para CI/CD","Soporte para entornos headless y SSH"],"fr":["Développement cross-plateforme avec un seul plugin Vite","Code partagé pour les applications web et natives","Installation facile via npm ou brew","Authentification sécurisée avec Railway CLI","Variables d''environnement pour CI/CD","Prise en charge des environnements headless et SSH"],"de":["Cross-plattformübergreifende Entwicklung mit einem einzigen Vite-Plugin","Gemeinsamer Code für Web- und Native-Anwendungen","Einfache Installation über npm oder brew","Sichere Authentifizierung mit Railway CLI","Umgebungsvariablen für CI/CD","Unterstützung für headless- und SSH-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento cross-plataforma com um único plugin Vite","Código compartilhado para aplicações web e nativas","Instalação fácil com brew, npm ou curl","Autenticação segura com login baseado em navegador ou em ambiente headless","Variáveis de ambiente para CI/CD","Suporte a projetos Railway cloud"],"ru":["Кроссплатформенная разработка с одним плагином Vite","Общий код для веб- и родных приложений","Легкая установка с помощью brew, npm или curl","Безопасная аутентификация с браузерным или безбраузерным входом","Переменные среды для CI/CD","Поддержка проектов Railway cloud"],"ar":["التطوير على منصات متعددة باستخدام موفري Vite واحد","رمز مشترك للتطبيقات الويب والأصلية","تثبيت سهل باستخدام brew أو npm أو curl","التحقق من الهوية الآمنة باستخدام تسجيل الدخول القائم على المتصفح أو في بيئة بدون متصفح","متغيرات البيئة للCI/CD","دعم مشاريع Railway السحابية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 框架","跨平台开发","Vite 插件","共享代码","云平台项目","部署管理"],"ja":["React フレームワーク","クロスプラットフォーム開発","Vite プラグイン","共有コード","クラウド プラットフォーム プロジェクト","デプロイ管理"],"ko":["React 프레임워크","크로스 플랫폼 개발","Vite 플러그인","공유 코드","클라우드 플랫폼 프로젝트","배포 관리"],"es":["Railway","React","framework","desarrollo cross-plataforma","Vite","código compartido","autenticación segura","CI/CD","entornos headless","SSH"],"fr":["Railway","React","framework","développement cross-plateforme","Vite","code partagé","authentification sécurisée","CI/CD","environnements headless","SSH"],"de":["Railway","React","Framework","cross-plattformübergreifende Entwicklung","Vite","gemeinsamer Code","sichere Authentifizierung","CI/CD","headless-Umgebungen","SSH"],"pt":["Railway","React","framework","desenvolvimento cross-plataforma","Vite","plugin","código compartilhado","autenticação","CI/CD"],"ru":["Railway","React","фреймворк","кроссплатформенная разработка","Vite","плагин","общий код","аутентификация","CI/CD"],"ar":["Railway","React","إطار العمل","تطوير التطبيقات متعددة المنصات","Vite","موفري","رمز مشترك","التحقق من الهوية","CI/CD"]}},"owner":"onejs","repo":"one","repoPath":"onejs/one","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"railway","description":">-","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Railway CLI\n\nDeploy and manage Railway cloud platform projects.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nbrew install railway\n# or: npm i -g @railway/cli\n# or: bash <(curl -fsSL cli.new)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\nrailway login              # Browser-based login\nrailway login --browserless  # For headless/SSH environments (prints pairing code)\nrailway logout             # Disconnect from account\n```\n\n**Environment Variables for CI/CD:**\n- `RAILWAY_TOKEN` - Project token (deploy, redeploy, logs only)\n- `","body":"# Railway CLI\n\nDeploy and manage Railway cloud platform projects.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nbrew install railway\n# or: npm i -g @railway/cli\n# or: bash <(curl -fsSL cli.new)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\nrailway login              # Browser-based login\nrailway login --browserless  # For headless/SSH environments (prints pairing code)\nrailway logout             # Disconnect from account\n```\n\n**Environment Variables for CI/CD:**\n- `RAILWAY_TOKEN` - Project token (deploy, redeploy, logs only)\n- `RAILWAY_API_TOKEN` - Account token (full access including init, link)\n\n## Project Management\n\n```bash\nrailway init               # Create new project\nrailway link               # Link current directory to existing project/environment\nrailway service            # Link to specific service in project\nrailway environment        # Switch linked environment (default: production)\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\nrailway up                 # Deploy with build logs\nrailway up --detach        # Deploy and return immediately (no logs)\nrailway redeploy           # Redeploy current service\n```\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\nrailway run <cmd>          # Run command locally with Railway env vars\nrailway run npm start      # Example: start dev server with Railway vars\nrailway shell              # Open shell with Railway environment loaded\n```\n\n## Logs & Debugging\n\n```bash\nrailway logs               # View service logs\nrailway ssh                # SSH into running service\nrailway ssh -- ls          # Execute single command via SSH\n```\n\n**SSH with specific target:**\n```bash\nrailway ssh --project=<ID> --environment=<ID> --service=<ID>\n```\n\n## Database & Services\n\n```bash\nrailway add                # Provision database (Postgres, MySQL, Redis, MongoDB)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Deploy a new project\n```bash\nrailway login\nrailway init\nrailway up\n```\n\n### Link existing project and deploy\n```bash\nrailway login\nrailway link\nrailway up\n```\n\n### Run local dev with production database\n```bash\nrailway link\nrailway run npm run dev\n```\n\n### View logs for debugging\n```bash\nrailway logs\n# or SSH in for interactive debugging\nrailway ssh\n```\n\n## User Invocation\n\n- `/railway` - Show status and common commands\n- `/railway deploy` - Deploy current directory\n- `/railway logs` - View service logs\n- `/railway ssh` - Connect to service\n\n## Agent Response Protocol\n\n**For `/railway` or `/railway status`:**\n1. Check if logged in: `railway whoami`\n2. Check linked project: `railway status`\n3. Report current state and suggest next actions\n\n**For `/railway deploy`:**\n1. Verify logged in and linked\n2. Run `railway up` and report results\n3. On failure, suggest fixes\n\n**For `/railway logs`:**\n1. Run `railway logs` (add `--help` to see filtering options)\n2. Summarize recent activity\n\n**For `/railway ssh`:**\n1. Run `railway ssh` for interactive session\n2. Or `railway ssh -- <command>` for one-off commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:57:07.393Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing streamlined project management on the Railway cloud platform.","zh":"非常适合需要在铁路云平台上简化项目管理的云部署代理。","ja":"鉄道クラウドプラットフォームでのプロジェクト管理を簡素化する必要があるクラウドデプロイエージェントに最適です。","ko":"철도 클라우드 플랫폼에서 프로젝트 관리를 간소화해야 하는 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan una gestión de proyectos simplificada en la plataforma de nube Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant une gestion de projet simplifiée sur la plateforme cloud Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Projektverwaltung auf der Railway-Cloud-Plattform benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação em Nuvem que precisam de gerenciamento de projetos simplificado na plataforma de nuvem Railway.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной развертки, которым требуется упрощенное управление проектами на облачной платформе Railway.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات एजنت النشر السحابي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة مشروع مبسطة على منصة سكة حديد السحابي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and manage Railway projects using the Railway CLI, with features like browser-based login, headless authentication, and environment variables for CI/CD pipelines, including project tokens and logs access.","zh":"赋予代理部署和管理铁路项目的能力，使用铁路CLI，具有浏览器登录、无头认证和CI/CD管道的环境变量等功能，包括项目令牌和日志访问。","ja":"鉄道CLIを使用して鉄道プロジェクトのデプロイと管理を可能にし、ブラウザベースのログイン、ヘッドレス認証、CI/CDパイプライン用の環境変数など、プロジェクトトークンとログへのアクセスなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"철도 CLI를 사용하여 철도 프로젝트의 배포 및 관리를 가능하게 하며, 브라우저 기반 로그인, 헤드리스 인증, CI/CD 파이프라인을 위한 환경 변수 등 프로젝트 토큰 및 로그 액세스와 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar y gestionar proyectos Railway utilizando la CLI de Railway, con características como inicio de sesión basado en navegador, autenticación sin cabeza y variables de entorno para tuberías de CI/CD, incluyendo tokens de proyecto y acceso a registros.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et de gérer des projets Railway en utilisant la CLI Railway, avec des fonctionnalités comme la connexion basée sur le navigateur, l''authentification sans tête et des variables d''environnement pour les pipelines CI/CD, y compris les jetons de projet et l''accès aux journaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Railway-Projekte mithilfe der Railway-CLI zu bereitstellen und zu verwalten, mit Funktionen wie browserbasierter Login, headloser Authentifizierung und Umgebungsvariablen für CI/CD-Pipelines, einschließlich Projekt-Token und Zugriff auf Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e gerenciar projetos Railway usando o Railway CLI, com recursos como login baseado em navegador, autenticação sem cabeça e variáveis de ambiente para pipelines de CI/CD, incluindo tokens de projeto e acesso a logs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать и управлять проектами Railway с помощью Railway CLI, с функциями như браузерный вход, бесхедная аутентификация и переменные среды для конвейеров CI/CD, включая токены проекта и доступ к журналам.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khả Praze لإدارة مشاريع سكة حديد باستخدام واجهة سكة حديد CLI، مع ميزات مثل تسجيل الدخول المبني على المتصفح والتحقق بدون رأس ومتغيرات البيئة لخطوط أنابيب CI/CD، بما في ذلك رموز المشروع ووصول إلى السجلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Railway project deployments using the Railway CLI","Managing project tokens and environment variables for secure CI/CD pipelines","Debugging Railway project issues using logs access"],"zh":["使用铁路CLI自动化铁路项目的部署","管理项目令牌和环境变量以实现安全的CI/CD管道","使用日志访问调试铁路项目问题"],"ja":["鉄道CLIを使用して鉄道プロジェクトのデプロイを自動化する","プロジェクトトークンと環境変数を管理してセキュアなCI/CDパイプラインを実現する","ログへのアクセスを使用して鉄道プロジェクトの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["철도 CLI를 사용하여 철도 프로젝트의 배포를 자동화하는 것","프로젝트 토큰 및 환경 변수를 관리하여 보안 CI/CD 파이프라인을 구현하는 것","로그 액세스를 사용하여 철도 프로젝트 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de proyectos Railway mediante la CLI de Railway","Gestión de tokens de proyecto y variables de entorno para tuberías de CI/CD seguras","Depuración de problemas de proyectos Railway mediante acceso a registros"],"fr":["Automation des déploiements de projets Railway à l''aide de la CLI Railway","Gestion des jetons de projet et des variables d''environnement pour des pipelines CI/CD sécurisés","Débogage des problèmes de projets Railway à l''aide de l''accès aux journaux"],"de":["Automatisierung von Railway-Projekt-Implementierungen mithilfe der Railway-CLI","Verwaltung von Projekt-Token und Umgebungsvariablen für sichere CI/CD-Pipelines","Fehlerbehebung von Railway-Projektproblemen mithilfe des Zugriffs auf Protokolle"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de projetos Railway usando o Railway CLI","Gerenciar tokens de projeto e variáveis de ambiente para pipelines de CI/CD seguras","Depurar problemas de projetos Railway usando acesso a logs"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку проектов Railway с помощью Railway CLI","Управлять токенами проекта и переменными среды для безопасных конвейеров CI/CD","Отлаживать проблемы проектов Railway с помощью доступа к журналам"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات نشر مشاريع سكة حديد باستخدام واجهة سكة حديد CLI","إدارة رموز المشروع ومتغيرات البيئة لأغراض خطوط أنابيب CI/CD الآمنة","تصحيح أخطاء مشاريع سكة حديد باستخدام وصول إلى السجلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and project setup","Limited to Railway cloud platform","Needs `RAILWAY_TOKEN` environment variable for project token authentication"],"zh":["需要铁路账户和项目设置","仅限铁路云平台","需要`RAILWAY_TOKEN`环境变量进行项目令牌认证"],"ja":["鉄道アカウントとプロジェクト設定が必要","鉄道クラウドプラットフォームに限定される","プロジェクトトークン認証に`RAILWAY_TOKEN`環境変数が必要"],"ko":["철도 계정 및 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다","철도 클라우드 플랫폼에만 적용됩니다","프로젝트 토큰 인증에는 `RAILWAY_TOKEN` 환경 변수가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de proyecto Railway","Limitado a la plataforma de nube Railway","Necesita la variable de entorno `RAILWAY_TOKEN` para la autenticación de tokens de proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration de projet Railway","Limité à la plateforme cloud Railway","Nécessite la variable d''environnement `RAILWAY_TOKEN` pour l''authentification des jetons de projet"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Projektkonfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Railway-Cloud-Plattform","Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable `RAILWAY_TOKEN` für die Projekt-Token-Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Requer conta e configuração de projeto Railway","Limitado à plataforma de nuvem Railway","Necessita da variável de ambiente `RAILWAY_TOKEN` para autenticação de token de projeto"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись и настройка проекта Railway","Ограничен только облачной платформой Railway","Требуется переменная среды `RAILWAY_TOKEN` для аутентификации токена проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب وتهيئة مشروع سكة حديد","محدود بمنصة سكة حديد السحابي","يحتاج إلى متغير بيئة `RAILWAY_TOKEN` لتأكيد رموز المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('flowglad/flowglad/pm', 'community', 'flowglad', 'flowglad', 'flowglad/flowglad', 'pm', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z', '2026-02-18T02:57:37.490Z', NULL, '{"id":"flowglad/flowglad/pm","name":"pm","description":{"zh":"pm 是一种开源的零 webhook 支付提供商，帮助开发者简化支付流程","ja":"pm はオープンソースのウェブフックなし決済プロバイダーで、開発者が決済プロセスを簡素化できるように設計されています","ko":"pm은 오픈소스 웹훅 없음 결제 제공자로 개발자가 결제 프로세스를 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"pm es un proveedor de pagos de código abierto y sin webhooks. Ofrece una forma sencilla de procesar pagos en línea.","fr":"pm est un fournisseur de paiement open source et sans webhooks. Il offre une façon simple de traiter les paiements en ligne.","de":"pm ist ein Open-Source-Zahlungsanbieter ohne Webhooks. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Online-Zahlungen zu verarbeiten.","pt":"O pm é um provedor de pagamento open source e sem webhooks, ideal para desenvolvedores que buscam uma solução flexível e personalizável","ru":"Платежный провайдер pm - это открытый исходный код и без вебхуков, идеальный для разработчиков, ищущих гибкое и настраиваемое решение","ar":"موفر الدفع pm هو حل مفتوح المصدر وبدون هوك الويب، مناسب لمطوري البرامج الذين يبحثون عن حل مرن ويمكن تخصيصه","en":"Open source, zero webhooks payment provider"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"开源零 webhook 支付提供商 pm","ja":"オープンソースのウェブフックなし決済プロバイダー pm","ko":"오픈소스 웹훅 없음 결제 제공자 pm","es":"Proveedor de pagos pm de código abierto","fr":"Fournisseur de paiement pm open source","de":"Open-Source-Zahlungsanbieter pm","pt":"Provedor de Pagamento pm: Open Source e sem Webhooks","ru":"Платежный провайдер pm: Открытый исходный код и без вебхуков","ar":"موفر الدفع pm: مفتوح المصدر وبدون هوك الويب","en":"pm"},"description":{"zh":"pm 是一种开源的零 webhook 支付提供商，帮助开发者简化支付流程","ja":"pm はオープンソースのウェブフックなし決済プロバイダーで、開発者が決済プロセスを簡素化できるように設計されています","ko":"pm은 오픈소스 웹훅 없음 결제 제공자로 개발자가 결제 프로세스를 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"pm es un proveedor de pagos de código abierto y sin webhooks. Ofrece una forma sencilla de procesar pagos en línea.","fr":"pm est un fournisseur de paiement open source et sans webhooks. Il offre une façon simple de traiter les paiements en ligne.","de":"pm ist ein Open-Source-Zahlungsanbieter ohne Webhooks. Es bietet eine einfache Möglichkeit, Online-Zahlungen zu verarbeiten.","pt":"O pm é um provedor de pagamento open source e sem webhooks, ideal para desenvolvedores que buscam uma solução flexível e personalizável","ru":"Платежный провайдер pm - это открытый исходный код и без вебхуков, идеальный для разработчиков, ищущих гибкое и настраиваемое решение","ar":"موفر الدفع pm هو حل مفتوح المصدر وبدون هوك الويب، مناسب لمطوري البرامج الذين يبحثون عن حل مرن ويمكن تخصيصه","en":"Open source, zero webhooks payment provider"},"definition":{"en":"Open source, zero webhooks payment provider"},"features":{"zh":["开源","零 webhook","简化支付流程","提高开发效率","支持多种支付方式"],"ja":["オープンソース","ウェブフックなし","決済プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","複数の決済方法のサポート"],"ko":["오픈소스","웹훅 없음","결제 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 결제 방법 지원"],"es":["Proveedor de pagos de código abierto","Sin webhooks","Procesamiento de pagos en línea","Integración sencilla","Seguridad y confiabilidad"],"fr":["Fournisseur de paiement open source","Sans webhooks","Traitement des paiements en ligne","Intégration simple","Sécurité et fiabilité"],"de":["Open-Source-Zahlungsanbieter","Ohne Webhooks","Online-Zahlungsverarbeitung","Einfache Integration","Sicherheit und Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Open source","Sem webhooks","Flexível e personalizável","Ideal para desenvolvedores","Solução de pagamento online"],"ru":["Открытый исходный код","Без вебхуков","Гибкое и настраиваемое решение","Идеальный для разработчиков","Онлайн-платежное решение"],"ar":["مفتوح المصدر","بدون هوك الويب","مرن ويمكن تخصيصه","مناسب لمطوري البرامج","حل الدفع عبر الإنترنت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开源支付","零 webhook","支付提供商","开发者工具","简化支付流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["オープンソース決済","ウェブフックなし","決済プロバイダー","開発者向けツール","決済プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["오픈소스 결제","웹훅 없음","결제 제공자","개발자 도구","결제 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["proveedor de pagos","código abierto","sin webhooks","pagos en línea","desarrollo web","integración de pagos"],"fr":["fournisseur de paiement","open source","sans webhooks","paiements en ligne","développement web","intégration de paiement"],"de":["Zahlungsanbieter","Open Source","ohne Webhooks","Online-Zahlungen","Webentwicklung","Zahlungsintegration"],"pt":["provedor de pagamento","open source","sem webhooks","pagamento online","desenvolvedores","solução de pagamento","flexível","personalizável"],"ru":["платежный провайдер","открытый исходный код","без вебхуков","онлайн-платежи","разработчики","платежное решение","гибкое","настраиваемое"],"ar":["موفر الدفع","مفتوح المصدر","بدون هوك الويب","الدفع عبر الإنترنت","مطوري البرامج","حل الدفع","مرن","يمكن تخصيصه"]}},"owner":"flowglad","repo":"flowglad","repoPath":"flowglad/flowglad","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pm","description":"Create incident postmortems by reading Slack incident channels and creating structured postmortem documents in Notion. Use when conducting postmortem reviews or documenting incident responses.","bodyPreview":"# Incident Postmortem Generator\n\nCreate comprehensive incident postmortem documents by reading Slack incident channels and storing structured postmortems in Notion.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After resolving a production incident\n- When conducting postmortem reviews\n- When documenting incident responses for team learning\n- To generate action items from incident discussions\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThis skill requires the following MCP servers to be configured:\n- **Slack MCP** - For reading incident channel hi","body":"# Incident Postmortem Generator\n\nCreate comprehensive incident postmortem documents by reading Slack incident channels and storing structured postmortems in Notion.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After resolving a production incident\n- When conducting postmortem reviews\n- When documenting incident responses for team learning\n- To generate action items from incident discussions\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThis skill requires the following MCP servers to be configured:\n- **Slack MCP** - For reading incident channel history\n- **Notion MCP** - For creating postmortem documents in the Notes database\n\nOptional:\n- **Betterstack MCP** - For including telemetry and uptime links\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Identify the Incident Channel\n\nAsk the user for the Slack channel name or ID. The channel should be the dedicated incident channel (typically named like `#incident-<name>` or `#inc-<date>-<description>`).\n\n### 2. Read Slack Channel History\n\nUse the Slack MCP to fetch the channel''s message history:\n\n```\nmcp__slack__slack_list_channels\n```\n\nFind the channel ID, then fetch history:\n\n```\nmcp__slack__slack_get_channel_history with channel_id\n```\n\nFor threaded discussions, also fetch thread replies:\n\n```\nmcp__slack__slack_get_thread_replies with channel_id and thread_ts\n```\n\nGet user information to resolve mentions:\n\n```\nmcp__slack__slack_get_users\n```\n\n### 3. Analyze the Incident\n\nFrom the Slack messages, extract:\n\n1. **Timeline**: Key events in chronological order\n   - When was the incident first detected?\n   - When was it acknowledged?\n   - What investigation steps were taken?\n   - When was it mitigated/resolved?\n\n2. **Root Cause**: The underlying technical issue\n   - What broke?\n   - Why did it break?\n   - What dependencies were involved?\n\n3. **Impact**: The effect on users/systems\n   - What services were affected?\n   - How many users impacted?\n   - What was the duration?\n\n4. **Open Questions**: Unresolved items from discussion\n   - Unclear technical details\n   - Areas needing further investigation\n   - Decisions that need to be made\n\n5. **Action Items**: Follow-up tasks with assignees\n   - Preventive measures\n   - Monitoring improvements\n   - Documentation updates\n   - Process changes\n\n### 4. Generate Postmortem Document\n\nCreate a markdown document following this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Incident Postmortem: [Brief Title]\n\n**Date:** [Incident Date]\n**Severity:** [P0/P1/P2/P3]\n**Duration:** [Total incident duration]\n**Author:** [Person creating postmortem]\n\n## Summary\n\n[2-3 sentence summary of what happened and the impact]\n\n## Timeline\n\n| Time (UTC) | Event |\n|------------|-------|\n| HH:MM | Incident detected via [source] |\n| HH:MM | Team alerted |\n| HH:MM | Investigation began |\n| HH:MM | Root cause identified |\n| HH:MM | Mitigation deployed |\n| HH:MM | Incident resolved |\n\n## Impact\n\n- **Services Affected:** [List of affected services]\n- **Users Impacted:** [Number or percentage]\n- **Duration:** [How long users were affected]\n- **Data Loss:** [Yes/No, details if applicable]\n\n## Root Cause Analysis\n\n### What Happened\n\n[Detailed technical explanation of the failure]\n\n### Why It Happened\n\n[Contributing factors, systemic issues]\n\n### Detection\n\n[How was the incident discovered? Could we have detected it sooner?]\n\n## Telemetry & Monitoring\n\n[If Betterstack MCP is available, include relevant links]\n\n- **Uptime Dashboard:** [Link]\n- **Error Metrics:** [Link]\n- **Relevant Alerts:** [Link]\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- [ ] [Unresolved question 1]\n- [ ] [Unresolved question 2]\n\n## Action Items\n\n| Action | Assignee | Priority | Status |\n|--------|----------|----------|--------|\n| [Action description] | @[username] | High/Medium/Low | Open |\n| [Action description] | @[username] | High/Medium/Low | Open |\n\n## Lessons Learned\n\n### What Went Well\n\n- [Positive aspects of incident response]\n\n### What Could Be Improved\n\n- [Areas for improvement]\n\n## References\n\n- **Incident Channel:** #[channel-name]\n- **Related PRs:** [Links to fix PRs]\n- **Related Docs:** [Links to relevant documentation]\n```\n\n### 5. Create Notion Page\n\nUse the Notion MCP to create the postmortem in the Notes database:\n\nFirst, search for the Notes database:\n\n```\nmcp__claude_ai_Notion__notion-search with query: \"Notes\"\n```\n\nOr use the Notion skill:\n\n```\nSkill: notion-search with \"Notes database\"\n```\n\nThen create the page with the postmortem content:\n\n```\nmcp__claude_ai_Notion__notion-create-pages with:\n- parent: Notes database ID\n- title: \"Incident Postmortem: [Brief Title]\"\n- content: [Generated markdown content]\n```\n\n**Important:** Add the required tags to the page:\n- `eng`\n- `postmortem`\n\nIf the Notion MCP supports tags/properties, set them during creation. Otherwise, use the update page tool:\n\n```\nmcp__claude_ai_Notion__notion-update-page with:\n- page_id: [created page ID]\n- properties: { tags: [\"eng\", \"postmortem\"] }\n```\n\n### 6. Share Results\n\nAfter creating the postmortem:\n\n1. Provide the Notion page link to the user\n2. Optionally post a summary back to the Slack channel:\n\n```\nmcp__slack__slack_post_message with:\n- channel: [incident channel ID]\n- text: \"Postmortem document created: [Notion link]\"\n```\n\n## Tips for Quality Postmortems\n\n### Blameless Culture\n\n- Focus on systems and processes, not individuals\n- Use \"the system failed to...\" rather than \"person X failed to...\"\n- Treat failures as learning opportunities\n\n### Be Specific\n\n- Include exact timestamps when available\n- Reference specific commits, PRs, or deployments\n- Quantify impact with numbers when possible\n\n### Actionable Items\n\n- Each action item should be specific and achievable\n- Assign clear owners\n- Set priorities to help with planning\n\n### Capture Context\n\n- Include relevant Slack threads and discussions\n- Link to monitoring dashboards and alerts\n- Reference any related incidents\n\n## Output\n\nProvide to the user:\n\n1. **Summary** of what was extracted from Slack\n2. **Notion link** to the created postmortem\n3. **List of action items** for easy reference\n4. **Any gaps** that need manual filling (if information was missing from Slack)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:57:37.490Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing streamlined incident postmortem documentation in Notion","zh":"适用于需要在Notion中简化事件事后总结文档的自动化代理","ja":"Notionでのインシデント事後総括文書の簡素化を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Notion에서 인시던트 사후 총结 문서를 간소화해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan documentación de autopsia de incidentes simplificada en Notion","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin d''une documentation d''autopsie d''incident simplifiée dans Notion","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine gestreamte Dokumentation von Incident-Post-Mortem-Analysen in Notion benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de documentação pós-mortem de incidentes simplificada no Notion","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым необходима упрощенная документация по инцидентам после их завершения в Notion","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiون الذي يحتاج إلى توثيق بعد الحادث المُبسّط في Notion"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive incident postmortem documents by reading Slack incident channels and storing structured postmortems in Notion, utilizing Slack MCP for seamless integration and facilitating team learning through action item generation","zh":"通过读取Slack事件频道并将结构化事后总结存储在Notion中，利用Slack MCP实现无缝集成，并通过生成操作项促进团队学习，从而赋予代理生成全面事件事后总结文档的能力","ja":"Slackのインシデントチャンネルを読み込み、構造化された事後総括をNotionに保存し、Slack MCPを使用してシームレスな統合を実現し、行動アイテムの生成を通じてチームの学習を促進することで、エージェントが包括的なインシデント事後総括文書を生成できるようにする","ko":"Slack 인시던트 채널을 읽고 구조화된 사후 총결을 Notion에 저장하며 Slack MCP를 활용하여 무결점 통합을 구현하고 행동 항목 생성을 통해 팀 학습을 촉진하여 에이전트가 포괄적인 인시던트 사후 총결 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de autopsia de incidentes completos leyendo canales de incidentes de Slack y almacenando autopsias estructuradas en Notion, utilizando Slack MCP para una integración sin problemas y facilitando el aprendizaje del equipo a través de la generación de elementos de acción","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents d''autopsie d''incident complets en lisant les canaux d''incident Slack et en stockant des autopsies structurées dans Notion, en utilisant Slack MCP pour une intégration transparente et en facilitant l''apprentissage de l''équipe grâce à la génération d''éléments d''action","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Incident-Post-Mortem-Dokumente zu erstellen, indem sie Slack-Incident-Kanäle lesen und strukturierte Post-Mortem-Analysen in Notion speichern, unter Nutzung von Slack MCP für eine nahtlose Integration und erleichtert das Teamlernen durch die Generierung von Aktionspunkten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos de incidentes pós-mortem abrangentes lendo canais de incidentes do Slack e armazenando postmortems estruturados no Notion, utilizando o Slack MCP para integração sem problemas e facilitando o aprendizado da equipe por meio da geração de itens de ação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать комплексные документы по инцидентам после их завершения, читая каналы инцидентов Slack и храня структурированные постмортомы в Notion, используя Slack MCP для бесшовной интеграции и облегчая обучение команды посредством генерации пунктов действий","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من توليد وثائق شاملة لما بعد الحوادث عن طريق قراءة قنوات حوادث Slack وتخزين ما بعد الحوادث المنظمة في Notion، واستخدام Slack MCP من أجل التكامل السلس وتمكين فريق التعلم من خلال توليد عناصر الإجراء"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating incident postmortem documentation","Generating action items from incident discussions","Streamlining postmortem reviews"],"zh":["自动化事件事后总结文档","从事件讨论中生成操作项","简化事后总结审查"],"ja":["インシデント事後総括文書の自動化","インシデント討論から行動アイテムを生成","事後総括レビューの簡素化"],"ko":["인시던트 사후 총결 문서의 자동화","인시던트 논의에서 행동 항목 생성","사후 총결 검토의 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la documentación de autopsia de incidentes","Generación de elementos de acción a partir de discusiones de incidentes","Optimización de las revisiones de autopsia"],"fr":["Automatisation de la documentation d''autopsie d''incident","Génération d''éléments d''action à partir de discussions d''incident","Optimisation des révisions d''autopsie"],"de":["Automatisierung der Dokumentation von Incident-Post-Mortem-Analysen","Generierung von Aktionspunkten aus Incident-Diskussionen","Optimierung von Post-Mortem-Überprüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a documentação pós-mortem de incidentes","Gerar itens de ação a partir de discussões de incidentes","Simplificar as revisões pós-mortem"],"ru":["Автоматизировать документацию по инцидентам после их завершения","Генерировать пункты действий из обсуждений инцидентов","Упростить обзоры после инцидентов"],"ar":["توسيع تلقائي لتوثيق ما بعد الحوادث","توليد عناصر الإجراء من مناقشات الحوادث","تبسيط استعراض ما بعد الحوادث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Slack MCP server configuration","Notion storage required"],"zh":["需要Slack MCP服务器配置","需要Notion存储"],"ja":["Slack MCPサーバーの構成が必要","Notionのストレージが必要"],"ko":["Slack MCP 서버 구성이 필요","Notion 저장소가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Slack MCP","Se requiere almacenamiento en Notion"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur Slack MCP","Un stockage Notion est requis"],"de":["Benötigt Slack-MCP-Server-Konfiguration","Notion-Speicherung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do servidor Slack MCP","Armazenamento no Notion é necessário"],"ru":["Требуется конфигурация сервера Slack MCP","Требуется хранилище Notion"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين خادم Slack MCP","المخزن Notion مطلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
