 extensibilidade","Composição sobre configuração","Modelo de cebola","APIs óbvias e rápidas","Configurações padrão e escape hatches","Desenvolvimento de bibliotecas TypeScript"],"ru":["Эмерджентная расширяемость","Композиция над конфигурацией","Луковый модель","Очевидные и быстрые API","Настройки по умолчанию и возможности выхода","Разработка библиотек TypeScript"],"ar":["الامتداد المتأصل","التكوين على التكوين","نموذج البصل","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الواضحة والسريعة","إعدادات افتراضية وفرص الخروج","تطوير مكتبات TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 设计","开发者体验","TypeScript 库","Video.js v10","开源媒体播放器","技术预览","Emergent extensibility","Composition over configuration"],"ja":["API デザイン","開発者エクスペリエンス","TypeScript ライブラリ","Video.js v10","オープンソースメディアプレーヤー","技術プレビュー","エメラントな拡張性","コンポジションオーバーコンフィギュレーション"],"ko":["API 디자인","개발자 경험","TypeScript 라이브러리","Video.js v10","오픈소스 미디어플레이어","기술预览","Emergent extensibility","Composition over configuration"],"es":["diseño de API","experiencia del desarrollador","TypeScript","bibliotecas de TypeScript","API seguras","API componibles","principios de diseño","evaluación de la experiencia del desarrollador","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["conception d''API","expérience du développeur","TypeScript","bibliothèques TypeScript","API sécurisées","API componibles","principes de conception","évaluation de l''expérience du développeur","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["API-Design","Entwicklererfahrung","TypeScript","TypeScript-Bibliotheken","sichere APIs","komponierbare APIs","Designprinzipien","Bewertung der Entwicklererfahrung","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["design de API","experiência do desenvolvedor","bibliotecas TypeScript","desenvolvimento de software","programação de aplicativos","interfaces de programação","desenvolvimento web","React","Video.js"],"ru":["дизайн API","опыт разработчика","библиотеки TypeScript","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование приложений","интерфейсы программирования","веб-разработка","React","Video.js"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تجربة المطور","مكتبات TypeScript","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة التطبيقات","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير الويب","React","Video.js"]}},"owner":"videojs","repo":"v10","repoPath":"videojs/v10","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# API Design & Developer Experience\n\nPrinciples for designing TypeScript library APIs and evaluating developer experience.\n\n**Goal**: APIs should feel **obvious**, **fast**, **safe**, and **composable** — with great defaults and great escape hatches.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Foundational\n\n- **Emergent extensibility** — Best extension points look like well-designed APIs, not plugin systems\n- **Composition over configuration** — `devtools(persist(fn))` beats `{ middlewares: [] }`\n- **Onion model**","body":"# API Design & Developer Experience\n\nPrinciples for designing TypeScript library APIs and evaluating developer experience.\n\n**Goal**: APIs should feel **obvious**, **fast**, **safe**, and **composable** — with great defaults and great escape hatches.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Foundational\n\n- **Emergent extensibility** — Best extension points look like well-designed APIs, not plugin systems\n- **Composition over configuration** — `devtools(persist(fn))` beats `{ middlewares: [] }`\n- **Onion model** — Transformative middleware innermost, observational outermost\n\n### API Surface\n\n- **Config objects** for 3+ parameters (no overloads)\n- **Flat returns** for independent values, namespaced for cohesive units\n- **Rule of two** — Tuples for 2 values, objects for 3+\n- **Inference over annotation** — If users annotate, types aren''t flowing\n\n### Progressive Disclosure\n\n- **Complexity grows with use case** — Zero-config → Options → Composition → Headless → Core\n- **Escape hatches compose** — Don''t require reimplementing defaults\n- **Explicit contracts** — Render props over implicit requirements\n\n### Developer Experience\n\n- **Time-to-first-success** — Minimize time from install to working code\n- **Cognitive load** — Fewer concepts > fewer keystrokes\n- **Predictable outcomes** — Match user mental models\n- **Editor ergonomics** — TypeScript inference should just work\n\n### Conflict Resolution\n\nWhen principles conflict, prioritize:\n\n1. **Correctness** — wrong behavior > verbose API\n2. **Type Safety** — inference failures > extra generics\n3. **Simplicity** — fewer concepts > fewer keystrokes\n4. **Consistency** — match existing codebase patterns\n5. **Bundle Size** — tree-shaking matters, but not at DX cost\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern                | Why It Fails                            |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Function overloads          | Poor errors, autocomplete confusion     |\n| Runtime plugin registration | Loses type safety, implicit ordering    |\n| Positional parameters (3+)  | Order confusion, breaking changes       |\n| Implicit contracts          | Silent breakage when requirements unmet |\n| Per-module middleware       | Unexpected interactions                 |\n| Shotgun parsing             | Validation scattered, not at boundaries |\n| Boolean traps               | `fn(true, false)` — what do these mean? |\n| Multiple competing APIs     | Confusing — which method to use?        |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File                                                       | Contents                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| [references/principles.md](references/principles.md)       | Core design and DX principles               |\n| [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)       | Type inference patterns (author + consumer) |\n| [references/state.md](references/state.md)                 | State management patterns and architecture  |\n| [references/extensibility.md](references/extensibility.md) | Pipelines, builders, adapters, lifecycles   |\n| [references/anti-patterns.md](references/anti-patterns.md) | Common mistakes to avoid                    |\n| [references/libraries.md](references/libraries.md)         | Reference libraries and their patterns      |\n| [references/voices.md](references/voices.md)               | Practitioner heuristics and reference URLs  |\n\n## Loading by Domain\n\n| Domain              | Load                        |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| General API work    | `principles.md`             |\n| TypeScript/types    | `typescript.md`             |\n| State management    | `state.md`                  |\n| Middleware/plugins  | `extensibility.md`          |\n| Avoiding mistakes   | `anti-patterns.md`          |\n| Library comparisons | `libraries.md`, `voices.md` |\n\n## Review\n\nFor reviewing APIs and architecture, load `review/workflow.md`.\n\n| File                                       | Contents                      |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| [review/workflow.md](review/workflow.md)   | Review process and checklists |\n| [review/agents.md](review/agents.md)       | Sub-agent prompts             |\n| [review/templates.md](review/templates.md) | Issue format, report template |\n| [review/checklist.md](review/checklist.md) | Quick single-agent checklist  |\n| [review/example.md](review/example.md)     | Complete example review       |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Need                   | Use               |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------- |\n| Building UI components | `component` skill |\n| Accessibility patterns | `aria` skill      |\n| Documentation          | `docs` skill |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:58:12.346Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced media player framework integration via APIs.","zh":"非常适合需要通过API集成高级媒体播放器框架的前端代理。","ja":"APIを介して高度なメディアプレーヤーフレームワークを統合する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"API를 통해 고급 미디어 플레이어 프레임워크를 통합해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada del marco de reproducción de medios a través de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui nécessitent une intégration avancée du framework de lecteur multimédia via des API.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration des Media-Player-Frameworks über APIs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração avançada de estrutura de framework de mídia por meio de APIs.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция фреймворка проигрывателя мультимедиа через API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى إدماج متقدم لإطار لاعب الوسائط عبر واجهات البرمجة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and interact with open-source media players using TypeScript libraries, enabling emergent extensibility, composition over configuration, and great defaults with escape hatches, leveraging principles like the Onion model.","zh":"赋予代理设计和交互的开源媒体播放器使用TypeScript库的能力，实现突发性的可扩展性、组合优于配置以及具有逃生舱的默认值，利用洋葱模型等原则。","ja":"TypeScriptライブラリを使用してオープンソースメディアプレーヤーを設計および操作できるエージェントをエンパワーメントし、突発的な拡張性、コンポジションオーバーコンフィギュレーション、グレートデフォルトとエスケープハッチを実現し、オニオンモデルなどの原則を利用する。","ko":"타입스크립트 라이브러리를 사용하여 오픈소스 미디어 플레이어를 설계하고 상호작용 할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, 발생하는 확장성, 구성보다 구성, 그리고 Defaults와 탈출구를 갖춘 Defaults를 구현하고, 양파 모델 등의 원칙을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e interactuar con reproductores de medios de código abierto utilizando bibliotecas de TypeScript, lo que permite una extensibilidad emergente, composición sobre configuración y grandes valores predeterminados con escapes, aprovechando principios como el modelo Onion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et d''interagir avec des lecteurs multimédias open source en utilisant des bibliothèques TypeScript, permettant une extensibilité émergente, une composition sur configuration et de grandes valeurs par défaut avec des échappatoires, en exploitant des principes comme le modèle Onion.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mit Open-Source-Mediaplayern unter Verwendung von TypeScript-Bibliotheken zu entwerfen und zu interagieren, wodurch eine emergente Erweiterbarkeit, eine Zusammensetzung über Konfiguration und großartige Standardwerte mit Ausnahmen ermöglicht werden, wobei Prinzipien wie das Onion-Modell genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e interagir com jogadores de mídia de código aberto usando bibliotecas TypeScript, permitindo extensibilidade emergente, composição sobre configuração e ótimos padrões com escape hatches, aproveitando princípios como o modelo Onion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и взаимодействовать с открытыми проигрывателями мультимедиа, используя библиотеки TypeScript, что обеспечивает возникающую расширяемость, композицию над конфигурацией и хорошие настройки по умолчанию с возможностью выхода, используя принципы, такие как модель Onion.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم وتفاعل مع مشغلات الوسائط مفتوحة المصدر باستخدام مكتبات TypeScript، وتمكين التمديد الناشئ والتركيب على التكوين وأفضل الإعدادات افتراضيًا مع فتح ملاجئ، مستفيدة من مبادئ مثل نموذج البصل"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing intuitive media player APIs","Evaluating developer experience for Video.js v10 integration","Building composable and safe media player frameworks"],"zh":["设计直观的媒体播放器API","评估Video.js v10集成的开发者体验","构建可组合且安全的媒体播放器框架"],"ja":["直感的なメディアプレーヤーAPIを設計する","Video.js v10統合の開発者エクスペリエンスを評価する","構成可能で安全なメディアプレーヤーフレームワークを構築する"],"ko":["직관적인 미디어 플레이어 API 설계","Video.js v10 통합의 개발자 경험 평가","구성 가능하고 안전한 미디어 플레이어 프레임워크 구축"],"es":["Diseñar APIs de reproductor de medios intuitivas","Evaluar la experiencia del desarrollador para la integración de Video.js v10","Crear marcos de reproductor de medios componibles y seguros"],"fr":["Concevoir des API de lecteur multimédia intuitives","Évaluer l''expérience du développeur pour l''intégration de Video.js v10","Créer des frameworks de lecteur multimédia componibles et sûrs"],"de":["Intuitive Mediaplayer-APIs entwerfen","Entwicklererfahrung für die Integration von Video.js v10 bewerten","Komponierbare und sichere Mediaplayer-Frameworks erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar APIs de jogador de mídia intuitivas","Avaliar a experiência do desenvolvedor para integração do Video.js v10","Construir estruturas de jogador de mídia compostas e seguras"],"ru":["Проектировать интуитивно понятные API проигрывателей мультимедиа","Оценивать опыт разработчика для интеграции Video.js v10","Создавать составные и безопасные фреймворки проигрывателей мультимедиа"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات مشغلات الوسائط بديهية","تقييم تجربة المطور لدمج Video.js v10","بناء إطارات مشغلات الوسائط القابلة للتركيب والأمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript compatibility","Specific to Web and React applications","Technical preview limitations apply"],"zh":["需要TypeScript兼容性","特定于Web和React应用程序","技术预览限制适用"],"ja":["TypeScriptの互換性が必要","WebおよびReactアプリケーションに特有","テクニカルプレビューの制限が適用される"],"ko":["타입스크립트 호환성이 필요","웹 및 리액트 애플리케이션에 특정","기술 프리뷰 제한 사항이 적용"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript","Específico para aplicaciones web y React","Se aplican limitaciones de vista previa técnica"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec TypeScript","Spécifique aux applications Web et React","Des limites de l''aperçu technique s''appliquent"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Kompatibilität","Spezifisch für Web- und React-Anwendungen","Technische Vorschau-Beschränkungen gelten"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com TypeScript","Específico para aplicações Web e React","Limitações de visualização técnica se aplicam"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с TypeScript","Конкретно для веб- и реактивных приложений","Применяются ограничения технического просмотра"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع TypeScript","محدد للتطبيقات الويب و React","تطبق قيود المعاينة الفنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('barefootford/buttercut/roughcut', 'community', 'barefootford', 'buttercut', 'barefootford/buttercut', 'roughcut', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z', '2026-02-18T02:58:29.983Z', NULL, '{"id":"barefootford/buttercut/roughcut","name":"roughcut","description":{"zh":"粗剪技能使用 Claude 代码创建粗剪时间线脚本，支持多分钟和 30-60 秒的短序列","ja":"ラフカットスキルは Claude コードを使用してラフカットタイムラインスクリプトを作成し、複数分と 30-60 秒の短いシーケンスをサポート","ko":"러프 컷 스킬은 클라우드 코드를 사용하여 러프 컷 타임라인 스크립트를 생성하며, 여러 분과 30-60 초의 짧은 시퀀스를 지원","es":"El skill roughcut edita video con Claude Code, creando guiones de rough cut desde transcripciones de video.","fr":"Le skill roughcut édite la vidéo avec Claude Code, créant des scripts de rough cut à partir de transcriptions vidéo.","de":"Der roughcut-Skill bearbeitet Video mit Claude Code, indem er Rough-Cut-Timeline-Skripte aus Videotranskriptionen erstellt.","pt":"O agente roughcut lida com o processo editorial de criação de scripts de linha do tempo de rough cut a partir de transcrições de footage de vídeo.","ru":"Агент roughcut занимается редакторским процессом создания сценариев чернового монтажа из транскрипций видеозаписей.","ar":"يعمل وكيل roughcut على عملية تحرير إنشاء سيناريوهات خط زمني لقطة مقتبة من نسخ مكتوبة من مقاطع الفيديو.","en":"Edit Video with Claude Code"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"使用 Claude 代码编辑视频的粗剪技能","ja":"Claude コードで動画を編集するラフカットスキル","ko":"클라우드 코드로 비디오 편집하는 러프 컷 스킬","es":"Edición de video con Claude Code: Roughcut","fr":"Édition vidéo avec Claude Code: Roughcut","de":"Videobearbeitung mit Claude Code: Roughcut","pt":"Crie um Rough Cut com Claude Code","ru":"Создайте черновой монтаж с Claude Code","ar":"أنشئ لقطة مقتبة مع Claude Code","en":"roughcut"},"description":{"zh":"粗剪技能使用 Claude 代码创建粗剪时间线脚本，支持多分钟和 30-60 秒的短序列","ja":"ラフカットスキルは Claude コードを使用してラフカットタイムラインスクリプトを作成し、複数分と 30-60 秒の短いシーケンスをサポート","ko":"러프 컷 스킬은 클라우드 코드를 사용하여 러프 컷 타임라인 스크립트를 생성하며, 여러 분과 30-60 초의 짧은 시퀀스를 지원","es":"El skill roughcut edita video con Claude Code, creando guiones de rough cut desde transcripciones de video.","fr":"Le skill roughcut édite la vidéo avec Claude Code, créant des scripts de rough cut à partir de transcriptions vidéo.","de":"Der roughcut-Skill bearbeitet Video mit Claude Code, indem er Rough-Cut-Timeline-Skripte aus Videotranskriptionen erstellt.","pt":"O agente roughcut lida com o processo editorial de criação de scripts de linha do tempo de rough cut a partir de transcrições de footage de vídeo.","ru":"Агент roughcut занимается редакторским процессом создания сценариев чернового монтажа из транскрипций видеозаписей.","ar":"يعمل وكيل roughcut على عملية تحرير إنشاء سيناريوهات خط زمني لقطة مقتبة من نسخ مكتوبة من مقاطع الفيديو.","en":"Edit Video with Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"Edit Video with Claude Code"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Claude 代码创建粗剪时间线脚本","支持多分钟和 30-60 秒的短序列","输出结构化 YAML 粗剪","导出 Final Cut Pro XML 格式","分析转录和做出编辑决策"],"ja":["Claude コードを使用してラフカットタイムラインスクリプトを作成","複数分と 30-60 秒の短いシーケンスをサポート","構造化 YAML ラフカットを出力","Final Cut Pro XML フォーマットにエクスポート","転写を分析して編集の決定を下す"],"ko":["클라우드 코드를 사용하여 러프 컷 타임라인 스크립트를 생성","여러 분과 30-60 초의 짧은 시퀀스를 지원","구조화된 YAML 러프 컷을 출력","Final Cut Pro XML 형식으로 내보내기","전사된 내용을 분석하여 편집 결정"],"es":["Análisis de transcripciones de video","Toma de decisiones editoriales","Salida de guiones de rough cut en formato YAML","Exportación a Final Cut Pro XML","Compatibilidad con secuencias cortas y largas","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Analyse de transcriptions vidéo","Prise de décisions éditoriales","Sortie de scripts de rough cut au format YAML","Exportation vers Final Cut Pro XML","Compatibilité avec des séquences courtes et longues","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Analyse von Videotranskriptionen","Editorische Entscheidungen","Ausgabe von Rough-Cut-Timeline-Skripten im YAML-Format","Export in Final Cut Pro XML","Kompatibilität mit kurzen und langen Sequenzen","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Criação de timelines de rough cut","Análise de transcrições de vídeo","Tomada de decisões editoriais","Saída em formato YAML","Exportação para Final Cut Pro XML"],"ru":["Создание черновых монтажей","Анализ транскрипций видео","Принятие редакторских решений","Выходные данные в формате YAML","Экспорт в формат Final Cut Pro XML"],"ar":["إنشاء خطوط زمنية لقطة مقتبة","تحليل النسخ المكتوبة من مقاطع الفيديو","اتخاذ قرارات تحريرية","إخراج في تنسيق YAML","تصدير إلى تنسيق Final Cut Pro XML"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视频编辑","粗剪技能","Claude 代码","转录脚本","时间线脚本","YAML 格式","Final Cut Pro"],"ja":["動画編集","ラフカットスキル","Claude コード","転写スクリプト","タイムラインスクリプト","YAML フォーマット","Final Cut Pro"],"ko":["비디오 편집","러프 컷 스킬","클라우드 코드","전사된 脚本","타임라인 스크립트","YAML 형식","Final Cut Pro"],"es":["edición de video","rough cut","Claude Code","transcripción de video","guiones de rough cut","Final Cut Pro XML","desarrollo de video","herramientas de edición de video","tecnología de video"],"fr":["édition de vidéo","rough cut","Claude Code","transcription de vidéo","scripts de rough cut","Final Cut Pro XML","développement de vidéo","outils d''édition de vidéo","technologie de vidéo"],"de":["Videobearbeitung","Rough Cut","Claude Code","Videotranskription","Rough-Cut-Timeline-Skripte","Final Cut Pro XML","Videotechnologie","Videobearbeitungstools","Entwicklung von Videoinhalten"],"pt":["roughcut","Claude Code","edição de vídeo","timeline de rough cut","transcrição de vídeo","YAML","Final Cut Pro XML"],"ru":["roughcut","Claude Code","видеомонтаж","черновой монтаж","транскрипция видео","YAML","Final Cut Pro XML"],"ar":["roughcut","Claude Code","تحرير الفيديو","خط زمني لقطة مقتبة","نسخة مكتوبة من مقطع فيديو","YAML","Final Cut Pro XML"]}},"owner":"barefootford","repo":"buttercut","repoPath":"barefootford/buttercut","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roughcut","description":"Creates video rough cut yaml file for use with Buttercut gem. Concatenates visual transcripts with file markers, creates a roughcut yaml with clip selections, then exports to XML format. Use this skill when users want a roughcut, sequence or scene generated. These are all the same thing, just with different lengths.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: Create Rough Cut\n\nThis skill handles the editorial process of creating rough cut timeline scripts from transcribed video footage. It launches a specialized agent that analyzes transcripts, makes editorial decisions, outputs a structured YAML rough cut, and exports it to Final Cut Pro XML format.\n\n**Note:** This skill is used for both full-length rough cuts (multiple minutes) and short sequences (30-60 seconds).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\nBefore launching the roughcut agent, verify all tra","body":"# Skill: Create Rough Cut\n\nThis skill handles the editorial process of creating rough cut timeline scripts from transcribed video footage. It launches a specialized agent that analyzes transcripts, makes editorial decisions, outputs a structured YAML rough cut, and exports it to Final Cut Pro XML format.\n\n**Note:** This skill is used for both full-length rough cuts (multiple minutes) and short sequences (30-60 seconds).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\nBefore launching the roughcut agent, verify all transcripts are complete:\n\n1. **Check library exists:**\n   ```bash\n   ls libraries/[library-name]/library.yaml\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify visual transcripts:**\n   Read `libraries/[library-name]/library.yaml` and check that every video entry has both:\n   - `transcript` populated (audio transcript filename)\n   - `visual_transcript` populated (visual descriptions filename)\n\n   If any visual transcripts are missing:\n   - Inform user that transcript processing must be completed first\n   - Ask if they want Claude to finish transcript processing using the `transcribe-audio` and `analyze-video` skills\n   - Do not proceed with roughcut creation until all transcripts are complete\n\n## Launch Roughcut Agent\n\nOnce prerequisites are verified, launch the roughcut creation agent using the Task tool:\n\n```\nTask tool with:\n- subagent_type: \"general-purpose\"\n- description: \"Create rough cut from visual transcripts\"\n- prompt: [See agent prompt template below]\n```\n\n### Agent Prompt Template\n\nWhen launching the agent, provide a detailed prompt with all necessary context:\n\n```\nYou are a video editor AI agent creating a rough cut or sequence for the \"{library_name}\" library.\n\nUSER REQUEST: {what_user_asked_for}\n\nLIBRARY CONTEXT:\n{paste relevant content from library.yaml - footage_summary, user_context, etc.}\n\nYOUR TASK:\n1. Read the roughcut creation instructions from .claude/skills/roughcut/agent_instructions.md\n2. Follow those instructions to create the rough cut\n3. Return the paths to the created YAML and XML files when complete\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n- Rough cut YAML file at: libraries/{library_name}/roughcuts/{roughcut_name}_{datetime}.yaml\n- Exported XML file for user''s chosen video editor\n- Backup created via backup-library skill\n\nBegin by reading the agent instructions file.\n```\n\n## After Agent Completes\n\nWhen the agent returns:\n1. Inform the user of the created roughcut file (the xml file, not the yaml file) and its location\n2. Confirm the rough cut is ready to import into their video editor\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:58:29.983Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Video Editing Agents requiring automated rough cut timeline scripting from transcribed footage.","zh":"适用于需要从转录的视频脚本中自动创建粗略剪辑时间轴的视频编辑代理。","ja":"映像編集エージェントがトランスクリプトされた映像から自動でラフカットのタイムラインスクリプトを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"전사된 영상에서 자동으로粗略한 편집 타임라인 스크립트를 생성해야 하는 비디오 편집 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Edición de Video que requieren una programación de línea de tiempo de corte brusco automatizada a partir de metraje transcrito.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de montage vidéo nécessitant un script de timeline de montage brut automatisé à partir de footage transcrit.","de":"Ideal für Video-Bearbeitungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Rohschnitt-Zeitachsen-Skriptierung aus transkribiertem Footage erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Edição de Vídeo que exigem script de linha do tempo de corte bruto automatizado a partir de footagens transcritas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов видеомонтажа, требующих автоматизированного сценария грубой временной шкалы редактирования из транскрибированных кадров.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء لتحرير الفيديو الذين يتطلبون سيناريو تلقائي للخط الزمني للقص الأولي من مقاطع الفيديو المنسوخة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze transcripts, make editorial decisions, and output structured YAML rough cuts, exportable to Final Cut Pro XML format, leveraging advanced video editing capabilities.","zh":"使代理能够分析转录文本、做出编辑决策，并输出结构化的YAML粗略剪辑，且可导出为Final Cut Pro XML格式，从而利用高级视频编辑功能。","ja":"エージェントがトランスクリプトを分析し、編集上の決定を下し、構造化されたYAMLのラフカットを出力し、Final Cut Pro XML形式でエクスポートできるようにし、高度なビデオ編集機能を利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 전사본을 분석하고 편집 결정 및 구조화된 YAML粗略한 편집을 출력하고 Final Cut Pro XML 형식으로 내보낼 수 있게 하여 고급 비디오 편집 기능을 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar transcripciones, tomar decisiones editoriales y producir cortes brutos estructurados en formato YAML, exportables al formato XML de Final Cut Pro, aprovechando capacidades de edición de video avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les transcriptions, de prendre des décisions éditoriales et de produire des montages bruts structurés au format YAML, exportables au format XML de Final Cut Pro, en exploitant des capacités de montage vidéo avancées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Transkriptionen zu analysieren, redaktionelle Entscheidungen zu treffen und strukturierte Rohschnitte im YAML-Format auszugeben, die in das Final Cut Pro XML-Format exportiert werden können und erweiterte Video-Bearbeitungsfunktionen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisarem transcrições, tomarem decisões editoriais e produzirem cortes brutos estruturados em YAML, exportáveis para o formato Final Cut Pro XML, aproveitando capacidades avançadas de edição de vídeo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать транскрипты, принимать редакторские решения и выдавать структурированные грубые версии в формате YAML, экспортируемые в формат Final Cut Pro XML, использующие продвинутые возможности видеомонтажа.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحليل النسخ، اتخاذ قرارات تحريرية وإنتاج قصات أولية منسقة في YAML ، قابلة للتصدير إلى تنسيق Final Cut Pro XML ، واستخدام إمكانيات تحرير فيديو متقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating rough cut creation for full-length videos","Generating short sequence timelines for social media","Exporting rough cuts to Final Cut Pro for further editing"],"zh":["用于全长视频的自动粗略剪辑创建","用于社交媒体的短序列时间轴生成","将粗略剪辑导出到Final Cut Pro进行进一步编辑"],"ja":["フルレングス映像の自動ラフカット作成","ソーシャルメディア用の短いシーケンスのタイムライン生成","ラフカットをFinal Cut Proにエクスポートしてさらに編集"],"ko":["전체 길이 비디오의 자동 粗略한 편집 생성","소셜 미디어용 짧은 시퀀스 타임 라인 생성","粗略한 편집을 Final Cut Pro로 내보내서 추가 편집"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de cortes brutos para videos de larga duración","Generación de líneas de tiempo de secuencias cortas para redes sociales","Exportación de cortes brutos a Final Cut Pro para una edición adicional"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de montages bruts pour des vidéos longues","Génération de lignes de temps de séquences courtes pour les réseaux sociaux","Exportation de montages bruts vers Final Cut Pro pour une édition supplémentaire"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Rohschnitten für Vollvideos","Generierung von Zeitachsen für kurze Sequenzen für soziale Medien","Export von Rohschnitten zu Final Cut Pro für weitere Bearbeitung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de cortes brutos para vídeos de comprimento total","Gerar timelines de sequências curtas para mídias sociais","Exportar cortes brutos para Final Cut Pro para edição adicional"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания грубых версий для полнометражных видеороликов","Генерация временных шкал коротких последовательностей для социальных сетей","Экспорт грубых версий в Final Cut Pro для дальнейшего редактирования"],"ar":["تتمة إنشاء قصات أولية للفيديوهات الكاملة الطول","إنشاء جداول زمنية لتسلسلات قصيرة لوسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","تصدير القصات الأولية إلى Final Cut Pro للمونتاج الإضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires transcript data from video footage","Output limited to Final Cut Pro XML format"],"zh":["需要来自视频脚本的转录数据","输出仅限于Final Cut Pro XML格式"],"ja":["ビデオ脚本からのトランスクリプトデータが必要","出力はFinal Cut Pro XML形式のみ"],"ko":["영상 스크립트에서 전사 데이터가 필요","출력은 Final Cut Pro XML 형식으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere datos de transcripción de footage de video","Salida limitada al formato XML de Final Cut Pro"],"fr":["Nécessite des données de transcription de footage vidéo","Sortie limitée au format XML de Final Cut Pro"],"de":["Benötigt Transkriptionsdaten von Videofootage","Ausgabe beschränkt auf das Final Cut Pro XML-Format"],"pt":["Exige dados de transcrição de footagens de vídeo","Saída limitada ao formato Final Cut Pro XML"],"ru":["Требует данных транскрипции видеокадров","Выход ограничен форматом Final Cut Pro XML"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات نسخ من مقاطع الفيديو","الخرج محدود بتنسيق Final Cut Pro XML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
