entación de ARK proporciona una guía para estructurar contenido de proyectos de desarrollo de manera efectiva.","fr":"La documentation ARK fournit un guide pour structurer le contenu des projets de développement de manière efficace.","de":"Die ARK-Dokumentation bietet eine Anleitung zur Strukturierung von Entwicklungsprojektinhalten auf effektive Weise.","pt":"A documentação ARK fornece orientação para estruturar recursos de agente de forma eficaz","ru":"Документация ARK предоставляет руководство по структурированию агентских ресурсов эффективно","ar":"يوفر توثيق ARK إرشادات لتحديد هيكل موارد الوكيل بفعالية","en":"Provider-agnostic operations for agentic resources. ARK codifies patterns and practices developed across dozens of agentic application projects."},"definition":{"en":"Provider-agnostic operations for agentic resources. ARK codifies patterns and practices developed across dozens of agentic application projects."},"features":{"zh":["结构化的文档指南","适用于创建新文档","用于决定内容归属","用于审查文档 PR","用于重构现有文档"],"ja":["構造化されたドキュメントガイド","新しいドキュメントの作成に適しています","コンテンツの所属を決定するために使用","ドキュメント PR のレビューに使用","既存のドキュメントのリファクタリングに使用"],"ko":["구조화된 문서 가이드","새 문서 작성에 적합","내용 소속을 결정하는 데 사용","문서 PR審查에 사용","기존 문서의 리팩토링에 사용"],"es":["Estructura de documentación basada en Diataxis","Guía para la creación de nuevos documentos","Orientación para la revisión de solicitudes de cambios de documentación","Estructura de carpetas y organización de contenido","Patrones y prácticas para operaciones de recursos de agencia"],"fr":["Structure de documentation basée sur Diataxis","Guide pour la création de nouveaux documents","Orientations pour l''examen des demandes de modification de documentation","Structure de dossiers et organisation de contenu","Modèles et pratiques pour les opérations de ressources d''agence"],"de":["Dokumentationsstruktur basierend auf Diataxis","Anleitung zur Erstellung neuer Dokumente","Richtlinien für die Überprüfung von Dokumentenänderungsanfragen","Verzeichnisstruktur und Inhaltsorganisation","Muster und Praktiken für Agenten-Ressourcen-Operationen"],"pt":["Estrutura de documentação personalizada","Guia de início rápido para desenvolvedores","Tutoriais passo a passo para aprendizado linear","Guias de tarefas para diferentes perfis de usuário","Conceitos centrais para compreender o porquê e o como"],"ru":["Пользовательская структура документации","Руководство для быстрого начала работы для разработчиков","Пошаговые учебники для линейного обучения","Руководства по задачам для разных пользовательских ролей","Основные понятия для понимания почему и как"],"ar":["هيكل توثيق مخصص","دليل سريع للبدء للمطورين","دروس تعليمية خطوة بخطوة لتعلم tuyếnي","دلائل مهمة لمختلف أدوار المستخدم","مفاهيم أساسية لفهم السبب والكيف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ARK 文档","文档结构","开发者文档","文档最佳实践","结构化文档","文档创建"],"ja":["ARK ドキュメント","ドキュメント構造","開発者ドキュメント","ドキュメントベストプラクティス","構造化ドキュメント","ドキュメント作成"],"ko":["ARK 문서","문서 구조","개발자 문서","문서 최적화","구조화된 문서","문서 작성"],"es":["documentación de ARK","Diataxis","desarrollo de software","estructura de documentación","patrones de desarrollo","prácticas de desarrollo","operaciones de recursos de agencia"],"fr":["documentation ARK","Diataxis","développement de logiciels","structure de documentation","modèles de développement","pratiques de développement","opérations de ressources d''agence"],"de":["ARK-Dokumentation","Diataxis","Software-Entwicklung","Dokumentationsstruktur","Entwicklungs-Muster","Entwicklungs-Praktiken","Agenten-Ressourcen-Operationen"],"pt":["documentação ARK","desenvolvimento de agente","estrutura de documentação","guia de início rápido","tutoriais de aprendizado","guias de tarefas"],"ru":["документация ARK","разработка агента","структура документации","руководство для быстрого начала работы","учебники по обучению","руководства по задачам"],"ar":["توثيق ARK","تطوير الوكيل","هيكل التوثيق","دليل البدء السريع","دروس التعلم الخطوة بخطوة","دلائل المهام"]}},"owner":"mckinsey","repo":"agents-at-scale-ark","repoPath":"mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ark-documentation","description":"Guidance for structuring Ark documentation using the Diataxis framework. Use this skill when creating new docs, deciding where content belongs, reviewing documentation PRs, or restructuring existing documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├──","body":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├── Reference          → Factual lookup material\n├── Marketplace        → External link\n└── Disclaimer\n```\n\n### Terminology\n\n| Diataxis | Ark Term | Why |\n|----------|----------|-----|\n| Explanation | **Core Concepts** | More accessible |\n\n## The four quadrants\n\n### 1. Tutorials (learning-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Hands-on lessons for newcomers.\n\n**Characteristics**:\n- Linear, numbered paths (1, 2, 3...)\n- Single prescribed path - no choices\n- Frequent visible results\n- Ends with \"Next step\" → How-to Guides\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Use \"we\" language\n- Don''t explain - link to Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It teaches a skill through doing\n- Reader is studying, not working\n- Success requires following steps in order\n\n**Examples**: Quickstart, Running the Dashboard, Starting a New Project, Complete Worked Example\n\n---\n\n### 2. How-to guides (task-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Help competent users complete specific tasks.\n\n**Organized by persona**:\n\n#### Build with ARK (application developers)\n- Configure models, create agents, coordinate teams, run queries, add tools.\n\n#### Extend ARK (contributors)\n- Build services locally, implement APIs, build A2A servers, add tests.\n\n#### Operate ARK (operators / SRE / security)\n- **Platform operations**: Provisioning, deploying\n- **CI/CD and supply chain**: Build pipelines\n- **Security & assurance**: Pen testing, code analysis\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Goal-oriented: \"If you want X, do Y\"\n- Assumes competence\n- Don''t teach - link to Tutorials or Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- Reader has a specific task to complete\n- Reader is working, not studying\n\n---\n\n### 3. Core concepts (understanding-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Explain what ARK is, how it''s designed, and why.\n\n**Topics**:\n- What ARK is and how it works.\n- Design effective agentic systems.\n- Platform architecture concepts.\n- Extensibility concepts.\n- Security and identity concepts.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Discursive: \"The reason for X is...\"\n- Make connections between concepts\n- Provide design decision context\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It answers \"why\" or \"how does this work\"\n- Reader is deciding how to design/extend/operate\n- Content provides context, not procedures\n\n---\n\n### 4. Reference (information-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Factual lookup material.\n\n**Organized by type**:\n- **Interfaces**: ARK APIs.\n- **Kubernetes API**: CRDs, resources.\n- **Evaluations**: Guides, event-based evaluations.\n- **System behavior**: Query execution, relationships.\n- **Operations**: Upgrading, troubleshooting.\n- **Project**: Contributors.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Austere, factual, neutral\n- Structure mirrors product\n- No instruction, explanation, or opinion\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It describes what something IS\n- Reader needs to look up specific details\n- Content is consulted, not read cover-to-cover\n\n---\n\n## Decision guide\n\n```\nIs the reader LEARNING or WORKING?\n│\n├─ LEARNING (studying)\n│   ├─ Hands-on, step-by-step? → TUTORIALS\n│   └─ Understanding concepts? → CORE CONCEPTS\n│\n└─ WORKING (applying)\n    ├─ Completing a task? → HOW-TO GUIDES\n    └─ Looking up facts? → REFERENCE\n```\n\n## Hub pages\n\nHub pages link to content without moving files:\n\n- `tutorials.mdx` - Lists tutorials in order.\n- `how-to-guides.mdx` - Groups by persona.\n- `core-concepts.mdx` - Groups by topic.\n- `reference/index.mdx` - Groups by type.\n\nHub pages should:\n- Explain purpose in one sentence.\n- Group links logically.\n- Not duplicate content.\n\n## Personas\n\n| Persona | Sections |\n|---------|----------|\n| End users | Quickstart, Tutorials |\n| Agent builders | Tutorials, How-to (Build) |\n| Platform engineers | How-to (Operate), Reference |\n| Contributors | How-to (Extend), Core Concepts |\n\n## Writing guidelines\n\n### Lexicon\n- The product is known as ARK rather than Ark.\n\n\n### General style\n- Be concise and direct.\n- Use simple language.\n- Keep descriptions to 1-2 sentences.\n- Use active voice: \"Creates agent\" not \"Agent is created\".\n- Write \"ARK\" not \"Ark\".\n- Use US English.\n- Use Oxford commas in lists.\n\n### Bullets\n- Capitalize the first word and end with a period.\n- Use numbered lists only for sequences of instructions or when referencing items later.\n\n### Capitalization\n- Capitalize only proper nouns (product names, tools, services).\n- Use sentence case for titles: \"An introduction to data visualization\" not \"An Introduction to Data Visualization\".\n- Don''t capitalize: cloud, internet, machine learning, advanced analytics.\n\n### Headings\n- Avoid gerunds: \"Get started\" not \"Getting started,\" \"Customize a layout\" not \"Customizing a layout\".\n- Keep titles short and descriptive for search discoverability.\n\n### Instructions\n- Use imperatives: \"Complete the configuration steps\".\n- Don''t use \"please\".\n- Don''t use passive tense: \"Complete the steps\" not \"The steps should be completed\".\n\n### Links\n- Make hyperlinks descriptive: `Learn how to [contribute to ARK](url)`.\n- Don''t write: `To contribute, see [here](url)`.\n\n### Avoid\n- Gerunds in headings.\n- Colloquialisms (may not translate across regions/languages).\n- Business speak: \"leverage\", \"utilize\", \"facilitate\".\n\n### What not to mix\n\n| Don''t put in... | This content... |\n|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Tutorials | Explanations, choices. |\n| How-to guides | Teaching, complete reference. |\n| Core concepts | Instructions, reference. |\n| Reference | Instructions, explanations. |\n\n## References\n\n- [Diataxis Framework](https://diataxis.fr/)\n- [Issue #338](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/issues/338)\n- [PR #620](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/pull/620)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:58:26.773Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing standardized documentation practices for agentic resources","zh":"适用于像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要标准化的文档实践用于代理资源","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しており、エージェント リソースの標準化された文書化の慣行が必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 에이전트 리소스에 대한 표준화된 문서화 관행이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan prácticas de documentación estandarizadas para recursos agentivos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin de pratiques de documentation standardisées pour les ressources agentives","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die standardisierte Dokumentationspraktiken für agentische Ressourcen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de práticas de documentação padronizadas para recursos ágicos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуются стандартизированные практики документации для агентных ресурсов","ar":"مثالي لموكلات الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى ممارسات وثائقية معيارية لموارد الوكيل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to structure and maintain high-quality documentation using Diataxis framework, facilitating provider-agnostic operations and streamlined content management through clear patterns and practices for tutorials, how-to guides, and core concepts","zh":"赋予代理能力以使用 Diataxis 框架结构和维护高质量的文档，从而促进提供商无关的操作和通过清晰的模式和实践对教程、操作指南和核心概念进行流畅的内容管理","ja":"Diataxis フレームワークを使用して、高品質のドキュメントを構造化および維持するエージェントの能力を付与し、プロバイダー非依存の操作と、チュートリアル、ハウツー ガイド、コアコンセプトに対する明確なパターンと実践を通じてスムーズなコンテンツ管理を促進する","ko":"Diataxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 높은 품질의 문서를 구조화하고 유지 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여, 제공자에 종속되지 않는 작업과, 튜토리얼, 사용자 가이드, 핵심 개념에 대한 명확한 패턴 및 관행을 통해 원활한 콘텐츠 관리를促進합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes estructurar y mantener documentación de alta calidad utilizando el marco Diataxis, lo que facilita operaciones agnósticas de proveedor y una gestión de contenido optimizada a través de patrones y prácticas claras para tutoriales, guías prácticas y conceptos básicos","fr":"Permet aux agents de structurer et de maintenir une documentation de haute qualité en utilisant le cadre Diataxis, ce qui facilite les opérations agnostiques de fournisseur et une gestion de contenu optimisée grâce à des modèles et des pratiques clairs pour des didacticiels, des guides pratiques et des concepts de base","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine hochwertige Dokumentation mithilfe des Diataxis-Frameworks zu strukturieren und zu pflegen, was provideragnostische Operationen und eine optimierte Inhaltsverwaltung durch klare Muster und Praktiken für Tutorien, Anleitungen und Kernkonzepte erleichtert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estruturarem e manterem documentação de alta qualidade usando o framework Diataxis, facilitando operações independentes de provedor e gerenciamento de conteúdo otimizado por meio de padrões e práticas claras para tutoriais, guias de como fazer e conceitos principais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью структурировать и поддерживать документацию высокого качества с использованием фреймворка Diataxis, облегчая операции, независимые от поставщика, и оптимизированное управление контентом посредством четких шаблонов и практик для учебников, руководств и основных концепций","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من هيكلة وثائقهم وضمان جودتها باستخدام إطار Diataxis، ويسهم في عمليات غير معتمدة على المزود وإدارة المحتوى المُبسّطة من خلال أنماط وممارسات واضحة للتعليمات ودوائر عمل كيفية القيام وال概念ات الأساسية"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating standardized documentation for new agentic applications","Restructuring existing documentation for better clarity and usability","Reviewing and validating documentation pull requests for consistency"],"zh":["为新的代理应用程序创建标准化的文档","重新组织现有的文档以提高清晰度和可用性","查看和验证文档拉取请求以确保一致性"],"ja":["新しいエージェント アプリケーションの標準化されたドキュメントを作成する","既存のドキュメントを再構成して明確性と使いやすさを高める","ドキュメントのプル リクエストを確認して検証して一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["新的 에이전트 애플리케이션을 위한 표준화된 문서를 생성하는 것","既存의 문서를 재구성하여 명확성과 사용 편의성을 향상시키는 것","문서 풀 요청을 검토하고 검증하여 일관성을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Crear documentación estandarizada para nuevas aplicaciones agentivas","Reestructurar la documentación existente para una mejor claridad y usabilidad","Revisar y validar solicitudes de extracción de documentación para la coherencia"],"fr":["Créer une documentation standardisée pour de nouvelles applications agentives","Réorganiser la documentation existante pour une meilleure clarté et une meilleure utilisabilité","Réviser et valider les demandes d''extraction de documentation pour la cohérence"],"de":["Erstellen von standardisierter Dokumentation für neue agentische Anwendungen","Umstrukturieren der bestehenden Dokumentation für bessere Klarheit und Benutzerfreundlichkeit","Überprüfen und Validieren von Dokumentations-Pull-Requests für Konsistenz"],"pt":["Criar documentação padronizada para novas aplicações ágicas","Reestruturar documentação existente para melhor clareza e usabilidade","Revisar e validar solicitações de pull de documentação para consistência"],"ru":["Создание стандартизированной документации для новых агентных приложений","Переструктуризация существующей документации для лучшей ясности и удобства использования","Проверка и подтверждение запросов на документацию для согласованности"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق معيارية لبرامج الوكيل الجديدة","إعادة هيكلة الوثائق الحالية لتحسين الوضوح والاستخدام","مراجعة وتأكيد طلبات السحب للوثائق للتأكد من الاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Diataxis framework","Specifically designed for agentic resources and applications"],"zh":["需要理解 Diataxis 框架","专门为代理资源和应用程序设计"],"ja":["Diataxis フレームワークの理解が必要","エージェント リソースおよびアプリケーションのみを対象とした設計"],"ko":["Diataxis 프레임워크에 대한 이해가 필요합니다","에이전트 리소스 및 애플리케이션 전용으로設計되었습니다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del marco Diataxis","Diseñado específicamente para recursos y aplicaciones agentivos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du cadre Diataxis","Conçu spécifiquement pour les ressources et les applications agentives"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis des Diataxis-Frameworks","Speziell für agentische Ressourcen und Anwendungen konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do framework Diataxis","Especificamente projetado para recursos e aplicações ágicos"],"ru":["Требует понимания фреймворка Diataxis","Специально разработан для агентных ресурсов и приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم إطار Diataxis","مصمم خصيصًا لموارد وبرامج الوكيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
