발 효율성을 높임"],"es":["Generación de archivos de configuración JSON para MCM Helper","Compatibilidad con Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Creación y edición de menús de ajustes de mods de Skyrim","Soporte para mods de Skyrim con menús de configuración en el juego","Uso de comandos bash para ejecutar herramientas"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers de configuration JSON pour MCM Helper","Compatibilité avec Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Création et édition de menus de paramètres de mods Skyrim","Prise en charge des mods Skyrim avec des menus de configuration dans le jeu","Utilisation de commandes bash pour exécuter des outils"],"de":["Generierung von JSON-Konfigurationsdateien für MCM Helper","Kompatibilität mit Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Skyrim-Mod-Einstellungsmenüs","Unterstützung für Skyrim-Mods mit Spiel-Einstellungsmenüs","Verwendung von Bash-Befehlen zur Ausführung von Tools"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos de configuração JSON para menus de configuração de mods","Compatibilidade com o MCM Helper","Utilização do Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Edição de mods do Skyrim","Geração de menus de configuração de mods personalizados"],"ru":["Создание файлов конфигурации JSON для меню настроек модов","Совместимость с MCM Helper","Использование Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Редактирование модов Skyrim","Генерация пользовательских меню настроек модов"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات التكوين JSON لمنوس إعدادات المودات","التوافق مع MCM Helper","استخدام Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","تحرير المودات الخاصة بskyrim","إنشاء منوس إعدادات المودات المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim模组","游戏内设置菜单","模组开发","MCM配置文件","Skyrim模组工具"],"ja":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrimモッド","ゲーム内設定メニュー","モッド開発","MCM設定ファイル","Skyrimモッドツール"],"ko":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim 모드","게임 내 설정 메뉴","모드 개발","MCM 구성 파일","Skyrim 모드 도구"],"es":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","mods de Skyrim","menús de configuración","JSON","bash","desarrollo de mods"],"fr":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","mods Skyrim","menus de configuration","JSON","bash","développement de mods"],"de":["Skyrim MCM","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim-Mods","Spiel-Einstellungsmenüs","JSON","Bash","Mod-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Skyrim MCM","mods do Skyrim","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","criação de mods","edição de mods","menus de configuração de mods"],"ru":["Skyrim MCM","моды Skyrim","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","создание модов","редактирование модов","меню настроек модов"],"ar":["Skyrim MCM","المودات الخاصة بskyrim","MCM Helper","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","إنشاء المودات","تحرير المودات","منوس إعدادات المودات"]}},"owner":"SpookyPirate","repo":"spookys-automod-toolkit","repoPath":"SpookyPirate/spookys-automod-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skyrim-mcm","description":"Create and edit MCM Helper configuration files for mod settings menus. Use when the user wants to add in-game settings, configuration options, toggles, sliders, or dropdowns to their mod.","bodyPreview":"# Skyrim MCM Module\n\nCreate and edit MCM Helper configuration files for in-game mod settings menus using Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRun all commands from the toolkit directory:\n```bash\ncd \"<TOOLKIT_PATH>\"\n# Example: cd \"C:\\Tools\\spookys-automod-toolkit\"\n```\n\n## Overview\n\nMCM (Mod Configuration Menu) allows mods to have in-game settings menus. This module generates JSON configuration files compatible with [MCM Helper](https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/53000).","body":"# Skyrim MCM Module\n\nCreate and edit MCM Helper configuration files for in-game mod settings menus using Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRun all commands from the toolkit directory:\n```bash\ncd \"<TOOLKIT_PATH>\"\n# Example: cd \"C:\\Tools\\spookys-automod-toolkit\"\n```\n\n## Overview\n\nMCM (Mod Configuration Menu) allows mods to have in-game settings menus. This module generates JSON configuration files compatible with [MCM Helper](https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/53000).\n\n## Command Reference\n\n### Create MCM Configuration\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm create \"<modName>\" \"<displayName>\" --output \"<file>\"\n```\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<modName>` | Internal mod name (no spaces, used for file paths) |\n| `<displayName>` | Display name shown in MCM menu |\n| `--output`, `-o` | Output file path |\n\n### Get MCM Info\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm info \"<config>\"\n```\n\n### Validate MCM Configuration\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm validate \"<config>\"\n```\n\n### Add Toggle (Checkbox)\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"<config>\" \"<id>\" \"<text>\" [options]\n```\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `<config>` | Path to config.json |\n| `<id>` | Control identifier (e.g., `bEnabled`) |\n| `<text>` | Display text |\n| `--help-text` | Help text shown on hover |\n| `--page` | Target page name |\n\n### Add Slider\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"<config>\" \"<id>\" \"<text>\" --min <n> --max <n> [options]\n```\n| Option | Default | Description |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| `<config>` | Required | Path to config.json |\n| `<id>` | Required | Control identifier (e.g., `fDamage`) |\n| `<text>` | Required | Display text |\n| `--min` | 0 | Minimum value |\n| `--max` | 100 | Maximum value |\n| `--step` | 1 | Step increment |\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Create Basic Mod Settings\n```bash\n# 1. Create the MCM config\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm create \"MyMod\" \"My Awesome Mod\" --output \"./MCM/config/MyMod/config.json\"\n\n# 2. Add an enable toggle\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config/MyMod/config.json\" \"bEnabled\" \"Enable Mod\" --help-text \"Turn the mod on or off\"\n\n# 3. Add a debug toggle\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config/MyMod/config.json\" \"bDebugMode\" \"Debug Mode\" --help-text \"Show debug messages\"\n\n# 4. Add a damage multiplier slider\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"./MCM/config/MyMod/config.json\" \"fDamageMultiplier\" \"Damage Multiplier\" --min 0.5 --max 3.0 --step 0.1\n\n# 5. Validate the configuration\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm validate \"./MCM/config/MyMod/config.json\"\n```\n\n### Create Multi-Page Settings\n```bash\n# Create config\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm create \"MyMod\" \"My Mod\" --output \"./MCM/config.json\"\n\n# Add controls to \"General\" page (default)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config.json\" \"bEnabled\" \"Enable Mod\"\n\n# Add controls to \"Combat\" page\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"./MCM/config.json\" \"fDamage\" \"Damage Bonus\" --min 0 --max 100 --page \"Combat\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config.json\" \"bCritical\" \"Enable Criticals\" --page \"Combat\"\n\n# Add controls to \"Magic\" page\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"./MCM/config.json\" \"fSpellCost\" \"Spell Cost Reduction\" --min 0 --max 50 --page \"Magic\"\n```\n\n### Validate and Check Existing MCM\n```bash\n# Check MCM structure\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm info \"./MCM/config/SomeMod/config.json\"\n\n# Validate for errors\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm validate \"./MCM/config/SomeMod/config.json\"\n```\n\n## MCM Helper Integration\n\n### Required File Structure\nMCM Helper expects files in specific locations:\n```\nData/\n  MCM/\n    config/\n      MyMod/\n        config.json     # Main config (required)\n        settings.ini    # Default values (optional)\n    translations/\n      MyMod_english.txt # Translations (optional)\n```\n\n### Config JSON Format\nGenerated config.json structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"modName\": \"MyMod\",\n  \"displayName\": \"My Awesome Mod\",\n  \"minMcmVersion\": 7,\n  \"pages\": [\n    {\n      \"pageDisplayName\": \"Main\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toggle\",\n          \"id\": \"bEnabled\",\n          \"text\": \"Enable Mod\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"slider\",\n          \"id\": \"fDamage\",\n          \"text\": \"Damage Multiplier\",\n          \"min\": 0.5,\n          \"max\": 2.0,\n          \"step\": 0.1\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Control Types\n\n| Type | Description | Properties |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| toggle | Checkbox | id, text, help |\n| slider | Value slider | id, text, min, max, step |\n| dropdown | Dropdown list | id, text, options |\n| keymap | Key binding | id, text |\n| text | Text input | id, text |\n\n### Linking MCM to Scripts\n\nMCM values are stored as GlobalVariables in your plugin:\n```papyrus\nScriptName MyMod_ConfigScript extends Quest\n\n; These must match the MCM control IDs\nGlobalVariable Property bEnabled Auto\nGlobalVariable Property fDamageMultiplier Auto\n\nFunction ApplySettings()\n    If bEnabled.GetValue() == 1\n        float damage = fDamageMultiplier.GetValue()\n        ; Apply settings...\n    EndIf\nEndFunction\n```\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n### Control IDs\nFollow Hungarian notation for clarity:\n- `bSomething` - Boolean toggles\n- `fSomething` - Float sliders\n- `iSomething` - Integer values\n- `sSomething` - String values\n\n### Examples\n- `bEnabled` - Main enable toggle\n- `bDebugMode` - Debug mode toggle\n- `fDamageMultiplier` - Damage multiplier (float)\n- `iItemCount` - Item count (integer)\n- `fSpellCostReduction` - Spell cost reduction percentage\n\n## Important Notes\n\n1. **MCM Helper required** - Users must have MCM Helper installed\n2. **GlobalVariables must exist** - Create matching globals in your plugin\n3. **File location matters** - Place config in `Data/MCM/config/ModName/`\n4. **Validate before release** - Always run validate command\n5. **Use `--json` flag** for machine-readable output when scripting\n\n## Complete MCM + Plugin Workflow (Basic)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create the plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"MyConfigMod.esp\" --light\n\n# 2. Add globals that match MCM controls\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"bEnabled\" --type long --value 1\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"fDamageMultiplier\" --type float --value 1.0\n\n# 3. Create MCM config\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm create \"MyConfigMod\" \"My Config Mod\" --output \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\"\n\n# 4. Add matching controls\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\" \"bEnabled\" \"Enable Mod\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\" \"fDamageMultiplier\" \"Damage Multiplier\" --min 0.5 --max 2.0 --step 0.1\n\n# 5. Validate\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm validate \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\"\n```\n\n## Complete MCM + Script Workflow with Auto-Fill\n```bash\n# 1. Create the plugin and quest\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"MyConfigMod.esp\" --light\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-quest \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"MyConfigQuest\" --start-enabled\n\n# 2. Add globals that match MCM controls\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"bEnabled\" --type long --value 1\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"fDamageMultiplier\" --type float --value 1.0\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"MyConfigMod.esp\" \"bDebugMode\" --type long --value 0\n\n# 3. Create script that references these globals\ncat > \"./Scripts/Source/MyConfigScript.psc\" << ''EOF''\nScriptName MyConfigScript extends Quest\n\nGlobalVariable Property bEnabled Auto\nGlobalVariable Property fDamageMultiplier Auto\nGlobalVariable Property bDebugMode Auto\n\nEvent OnInit()\n    RegisterForSingleUpdate(1.0)\nEndEvent\n\nEvent OnUpdate()\n    If bEnabled.GetValue() == 1\n        float mult = fDamageMultiplier.GetValue()\n        If bDebugMode.GetValue() == 1\n            Debug.Notification(\"Damage multiplier: \" + mult)\n        EndIf\n    EndIf\n    RegisterForSingleUpdate(5.0)\nEndEvent\nEOF\n\n# 4. Compile script\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- papyrus compile \"./Scripts/Source/MyConfigScript.psc\" --output \"./Scripts\" --headers \"./skyrim-script-headers\"\n\n# 5. Attach script to quest\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp attach-script \"MyConfigMod.esp\" --quest \"MyConfigQuest\" --script \"MyConfigScript\"\n\n# 6. Auto-fill script properties from PSC (links globals automatically!)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp auto-fill \"MyConfigMod.esp\" --quest \"MyConfigQuest\" --script \"MyConfigScript\" --psc-file \"./Scripts/Source/MyConfigScript.psc\" --data-folder \"C:/Skyrim/Data\"\n\n# Output:\n# Filled property ''bEnabled'' with MyConfigMod.esp:0x000800\n# Filled property ''fDamageMultiplier'' with MyConfigMod.esp:0x000801\n# Filled property ''bDebugMode'' with MyConfigMod.esp:0x000802\n\n# 7. Create MCM config\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm create \"MyConfigMod\" \"My Config Mod\" --output \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\"\n\n# 8. Add matching MCM controls\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\" \"bEnabled\" \"Enable Mod\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-slider \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\" \"fDamageMultiplier\" \"Damage Multiplier\" --min 0.5 --max 2.0 --step 0.1\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm add-toggle \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\" \"bDebugMode\" \"Debug Mode\"\n\n# 9. Validate MCM\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm validate \"./MCM/config/MyConfigMod/config.json\"\n\n# 10. Generate SEQ file (required for start-enabled quest)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp generate-seq \"MyConfigMod.esp\" --output \"./SEQ\"\n```\n\n**Why This Workflow Matters:**\n- Auto-fill automatically links the GlobalVariable properties in your script to the actual globals in your plugin\n- No manual property filling in Creation Kit required\n- Type-safe matching ensures correct globals are linked\n- Works with your own plugin''s globals, not just vanilla Skyrim records\n\n## JSON Output\n\nAll commands support `--json` for structured output:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- mcm info \"./config.json\" --json\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:59:24.992Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents specializing in Skyrim mod creation and requiring advanced MCM configuration management.","zh":"非常适合专门从事上古卷轴5模组创建并需要高级MCM配置管理的游戏开发代理。","ja":"スカイリムモッド作成を専門とするゲーム開発エージェントに最適で、高度なMCM設定管理が必要です。","ko":"스카이림 모드 생성 및 고급 MCM 구성 관리가 필요한 게임 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos especializados en la creación de mods de Skyrim y que requieren una gestión avanzada de configuración de MCM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux spécialisés dans la création de mods Skyrim et nécessitant une gestion avancée de la configuration MCM.","de":"Perfekt für Game-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf die Erstellung von Skyrim-Mods spezialisiert sind und eine erweiterte MCM-Konfigurationsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de jogos especializados na criação de mods para Skyrim e que requerem gerenciamento avançado de configuração do MCM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, специализирующихся на создании модов для Skyrim и требующих продвинутого управления конфигурацией MCM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الألعاب المتخصص في إنشاء تحديثات لسكاي ريم و يتطلب إدارة متقدمة لتكوين MCM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and edit MCM Helper configuration files in JSON format, utilizing Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit for seamless integration with in-game mod settings menus, and compatible with MCM Helper from NexusMods.","zh":"赋予代理生成和编辑MCM Helper配置文件的能力，文件格式为JSON，并利用Spooky的AutoMod Toolkit实现与游戏内模组设置菜单的无缝集成，兼容来自NexusMods的MCM Helper。","ja":"エージェントがMCM Helper設定ファイルを生成および編集できるようにし、JSON形式を使用し、SpookyのAutoMod Toolkitを使用してゲーム内モッド設定メニューとのシームレスな統合を実現し、NexusModsからのMCM Helperと互換性がある。","ko":"에이전트가 MCM Helper 구성 파일을 생성 및 편집할 수 있도록 하며, JSON 형식을 사용하며, Spooky의 AutoMod Toolkit을 사용하여 게임 내 모드 설정 메뉴와의無縫한 통합을 실현하며, NexusMods의 MCM Helper와 호환됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y editar archivos de configuración de MCM Helper en formato JSON, utilizando Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit para una integración sin problemas con los menús de configuración de mods en el juego, y compatible con MCM Helper de NexusMods.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de modifier des fichiers de configuration MCM Helper au format JSON, en utilisant Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit pour une intégration transparente avec les menus de paramètres de mod en jeu, et compatible avec MCM Helper de NexusMods.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, MCM-Helper-Konfigurationsdateien im JSON-Format zu generieren und zu bearbeiten, indem es Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit für eine nahtlose Integration mit den Spiel-Mod-Einstellungs-Menüs verwendet und mit MCM Helper von NexusMods kompatibel ist.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e editar arquivos de configuração do MCM Helper no formato JSON, utilizando o Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit para integração perfeita com os menus de configuração de mods dentro do jogo, e compatível com o MCM Helper da NexusMods.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и редактировать файлы конфигурации MCM Helper в формате JSON, используя Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit для бесшовной интеграции с меню настройки модов в игре, и совместим с MCM Helper от NexusMods.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإنشاء وتحرير ملفات تكوين MCM Helper بتنسيق JSON، باستخدام أداة Spooky''s AutoMod لدمجها بشكل متكامل مع قوائم إعدادات التحديثات داخل اللعبة، ومتوافق مع MCM Helper من NexusMods."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating MCM configuration files for custom Skyrim mods","Editing existing MCM Helper configurations for mod updates","Creating in-game settings menus with advanced JSON configuration options"],"zh":["为自定义斯카伊림模组生成MCM配置文件","编辑现有的MCM Helper配置以更新模组","使用高级JSON配置选项创建游戏内设置菜单"],"ja":["カスタムスカイリムモッド用のMCM設定ファイルを生成する","既存のMCM Helper設定を編集してモッドを更新する","高度なJSON設定オプションを使用してゲーム内設定メニューを作成する"],"ko":["커스텀 스카이림 모드에 대한 MCM 구성 파일 생성","모드 업데이트 위해 기존 MCM Helper 구성 편집","고급 JSON 구성 옵션을 사용한 게임 내 설정 메뉴 생성"],"es":["Generar archivos de configuración de MCM para mods personalizados de Skyrim","Editar configuraciones de MCM Helper existentes para actualizaciones de mods","Crear menús de configuración en el juego con opciones de configuración JSON avanzadas"],"fr":["Générer des fichiers de configuration MCM pour des mods Skyrim personnalisés","Modifier les configurations MCM Helper existantes pour les mises à jour des mods","Créer des menus de paramètres en jeu avec des options de configuration JSON avancées"],"de":["Generieren von MCM-Konfigurationsdateien für benutzerdefinierte Skyrim-Mods","Bearbeiten von bestehenden MCM-Helper-Konfigurationen für Mod-Updates","Erstellen von Spiel-Einstellungs-Menüs mit erweiterten JSON-Konfigurationsoptionen"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos de configuração do MCM para mods personalizados do Skyrim","Edição de configurações existentes do MCM Helper para atualizações de mods","Criação de menus de configuração dentro do jogo com opções de configuração avançadas em JSON"],"ru":["Генерация файлов конфигурации MCM для пользовательских модов Skyrim","Редактирование существующих конфигураций MCM Helper для обновлений модов","Создание меню настроек в игре с продвинутыми опциями конфигурации в формате JSON"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات تكوين MCM لتحديثات سكاي ريم المخصصة","تحرير تكوينات MCM Helper الحالية لتحديثات التحديثات","إنشاء قوائم إعدادات داخل اللعبة مع خيارات تكوين متقدمة بتنسيق JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit installation","Must run commands from the toolkit directory","Specific to Skyrim MCM and MCM Helper compatibility"],"zh":["需要安装Spooky的AutoMod Toolkit","必须从工具包目录运行命令","仅限于斯卡伊림MCM和MCM Helper兼容性"],"ja":["SpookyのAutoMod Toolkitをインストールする必要がある","ツールキットのディレクトリからコマンドを実行する必要がある","スカイリムMCMおよびMCM Helperの互換性に限定される"],"ko":["Spooky의 AutoMod Toolkit을 설치해야 함","도구 키트 디렉토리에서 명령을 실행해야 함","스카이림 MCM 및 MCM Helper 호환성에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Debe ejecutar comandos desde el directorio de la herramienta","Específico para la compatibilidad de MCM y MCM Helper de Skyrim"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Doit exécuter des commandes depuis le répertoire de l''outil","Spécifique à la compatibilité de MCM et MCM Helper de Skyrim"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Muss Befehle aus dem Toolkit-Verzeichnis ausführen","Spezifisch für die Kompatibilität von Skyrim-MCM und MCM-Helper"],"pt":["Requer a instalação do Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Deve executar comandos a partir do diretório da ferramenta","Específico para compatibilidade do MCM e do MCM Helper do Skyrim"],"ru":["Требует установки Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Должен запускать команды из директории инструмента","Специфичен для совместимости MCM и MCM Helper от Skyrim"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة Spooky''s AutoMod","يجب تشغيل الأوامر من 目录 الأداة","محدد لتوافق MCM و MCM Helper من سكاي ريم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Yorick-Ryu/deep-share/md2docx', 'community', 'Yorick-Ryu', 'deep-share', 'Yorick-Ryu/deep-share', 'md2docx', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z', '2026-02-18T02:59:25.424Z', NULL, '{"id":"Yorick-Ryu/deep-share/md2docx","name":"md2docx","description":{"zh":"md2docx ","ja":"md2docx ","ko":"md2docx ","es":"md2docx es una extensión ligera que convierte texto Markdown en documentos Word profesionales. Soporta varias fuentes de IA.","fr":"md2docx est une extension légère qui convertit du texte Markdown en documents Word professionnels. Elle prend en charge plusieurs sources d''IA.","de":"md2docx ist eine leichte Erweiterung, die Markdown-Text in professionelle Word-Dokumente umwandelt. Sie unterstützt mehrere IA-Quellen.","pt":"O md2docx é uma extensão de navegador leve que converte texto Markdown em documentos Word formatados.","ru":"md2docx - это легкое расширение браузера, которое преобразует текст Markdown в форматированные документы Word.","ar":"md2docx هو مُ拓ِع متصفح خفيف يُحول نص Markdown إلى مستندات Word معدة.","en":"A lightweight browser extension designed for AI users to easily copy formulas from ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Grok and 10+ other AI conversations, export beautifully formatted Word documents, and support long conversation screenshot sharing for DeepSeek."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"md2docx - ","ja":"md2docx - ","ko":"md2docx - ","es":"md2docx: Conversor de Markdown a Word","fr":"md2docx : Convertisseur Markdown en Word","de":"md2docx: Markdown in Word umwandeln","pt":"Conversor Markdown para Word - md2docx","ru":"Конвертер Markdown в Word - md2docx","ar":"مُحول Markdown إلى Word - md2docx","en":"md2docx"},"description":{"zh":"md2docx ","ja":"md2docx ","ko":"md2docx ","es":"md2docx es una extensión ligera que convierte texto Markdown en documentos Word profesionales. Soporta varias fuentes de IA.","fr":"md2docx est une extension légère qui convertit du texte Markdown en documents Word professionnels. Elle prend en charge plusieurs sources d''IA.","de":"md2docx ist eine leichte Erweiterung, die Markdown-Text in professionelle Word-Dokumente umwandelt. Sie unterstützt mehrere IA-Quellen.","pt":"O md2docx é uma extensão de navegador leve que converte texto Markdown em documentos Word formatados.","ru":"md2docx - это легкое расширение браузера, которое преобразует текст Markdown в форматированные документы Word.","ar":"md2docx هو مُ拓ِع متصفح خفيف يُحول نص Markdown إلى مستندات Word معدة.","en":"A lightweight browser extension designed for AI users to easily copy formulas from ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Grok and 10+ other AI conversations, export beautifully..."},"definition":{"en":"A lightweight browser extension designed for AI users to easily copy formulas from ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Grok and 10+ other AI conversations, export beautifully formatted Word documents, and support long conversation screenshot sharing for DeepSeek."},"features":{"zh":["Markdown","Word ()","AI","URL","","DeepSeek"],"ja":["Markdown","Word ()","AI","URL","","DeepSeek"],"ko":["Markdown","Word ()","AI","URL","","DeepSeek"],"es":["Conversión de Markdown a Word","Compatibilidad con varias fuentes de IA","Modos de conversión URL y archivo","Soporte para compartir capturas de pantalla de conversaciones largas","Documentos Word profesionales y bien formateados","Extensión ligera y fácil de usar"],"fr":["Conversion de Markdown en Word","Compatibilité avec plusieurs sources d''IA","Modes de conversion URL et fichier","Prise en charge du partage d''écran de conversations longues","Documents Word professionnels et bien formatés","Extension légère et facile à utiliser"],"de":["Konvertierung von Markdown in Word","Unterstützung für mehrere IA-Quellen","Konvertierungsmodi URL und Datei","Unterstützung für das Teilen von Bildschirmfotos von langen Konversationen","Professionelle und gut formatierte Word-Dokumente","Leichte und benutzerfreundliche Erweiterung"],"pt":["Converte texto Markdown em documentos Word","Suporta modos de URL e arquivo","Permite compartilhamento de capturas de tela de conversas longas","Funciona com vários modelos de AI","Fácil de usar e configurar","Suporta exportação de fórmulas de ChatGPT e outros"],"ru":["Преобразует текст Markdown в документы Word","Поддерживает режимы URL и файла","Позволяет делиться скриншотами длинных разговоров","Работает с несколькими моделями ИИ","Легко использовать и настраивать","Поддерживает экспорт формул из ChatGPT и других"],"ar":["يحول نص Markdown إلى مستندات Word","يدعم أوضاع URL وملف","يسمح بمشاركة لقطات شاشة للنقاشات الطويلة","يعمل مع نماذج متعددة من الذكاء الاصطناعي","سهل الاستخدام والتهيئة","يدعم تصدير الصيغ من ChatGPT وغيرها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["md2docx","Markdown","Word","AI","DeepSeek","ChatGPT","Grok","browser extension","document conversion"],"ja":["md2docx","Markdown","Word","AI","DeepSeek","ChatGPT","Grok","browser extension","document conversion"],"ko":["md2docx","Markdown","Word","AI","DeepSeek","ChatGPT","Grok","browser extension","document conversion"],"es":["conversor markdown","markdown a word","extensión ia","conversión de texto","documentos word profesionales","compatibilidad con ia","modos de conversión","compartir capturas de pantalla","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["convertisseur markdown","markdown en word","extension ia","conversion de texte","documents word professionnels","compatibilité avec ia","modes de conversion","partage d''écran","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["markdown-konverter","markdown in word","ia-erweiterung","textkonvertierung","professionelle word-dokumente","unterstützung für ia","konvertierungsmodi","bildschirmfoto teilen","software-entwicklung","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["conversor markdown para word","md2docx","extensão de navegador","documento word","texto markdown","exportar documentos","ai","chatgpt","deepseek","grok"],"ru":["конвертер markdown в word","md2docx","расширение браузера","документ word","текст markdown","экспорт документов","искусственный интеллект","chatgpt","deepseek","grok"],"ar":["مُحول markdown إلى word","md2docx","مُ拓ِع متصفح","مستند وورد","نص markdown","تصدير المستندات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","chatgpt","deepseek","grok"]}},"owner":"Yorick-Ryu","repo":"deep-share","repoPath":"Yorick-Ryu/deep-share","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"md2docx","description":"Convert Markdown to Word (DOCX) documents. Use when user wants to export, convert, or create Word documents from Markdown content.","bodyPreview":"# md2docx - Markdown to Word Converter\n\nConvert Markdown text to professionally formatted Word (DOCX) documents.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Choose the right mode based on your environment**:\n\n```bash\n# URL mode: Returns download URL (for cloud/remote environments)\npython scripts/convert.py input.md --url\n\n# File mode: Saves file directly (for local environments)\npython scripts/convert.py input.md --file\n```\n\n## Choosing the Right Mode\n\n| Scenario | Mode | Command |\n|----------|------|---------|\n| Skill","body":"# md2docx - Markdown to Word Converter\n\nConvert Markdown text to professionally formatted Word (DOCX) documents.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Choose the right mode based on your environment**:\n\n```bash\n# URL mode: Returns download URL (for cloud/remote environments)\npython scripts/convert.py input.md --url\n\n# File mode: Saves file directly (for local environments)\npython scripts/convert.py input.md --file\n```\n\n## Choosing the Right Mode\n\n| Scenario | Mode | Command |\n|----------|------|---------|\n| Skill runs in cloud, user needs to download | `--url` | `python scripts/convert.py input.md --url` |\n| Skill runs locally, user wants file saved | `--file` | `python scripts/convert.py input.md --file` |\n| Remote execution (MCP, API, cloud agent) | `--url` | Returns URL for user to download |\n| Local execution (user''s machine) | `--file` | Saves .docx directly to disk |\n\n**Decision Rule**:\n- **Use `--url`** when the skill runs in a different environment than the user (cloud, remote server, MCP server)\n- **Use `--file`** when the skill runs on the same machine where the user wants the output file\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Prepare Markdown**: Ensure content is in standard Markdown format\n2. **Run Script**: Execute `scripts/convert.py` with appropriate mode\n3. **Get Result**: \n   - URL mode: Receive download URL\n   - File mode: File saved to specified location\n\n## API Details\n\n**Endpoints**:\n- URL mode: `https://api.deepshare.app/convert-text-to-url` → Returns `{\"url\": \"...\"}`\n- File mode: `https://api.deepshare.app/convert-text` → Returns DOCX file directly\n\n**Authentication**: Include header `X-API-Key: {api_key}`\n\n### API Key Configuration\n\nYou can configure the API key in three ways:\n\n1. **Environment Variable** (Highest Priority)\n   ```bash\n   export DEEP_SHARE_API_KEY=\"your_api_key_here\"\n   ```\n\n2. **Skill Variable** (Medium Priority)\n   Edit the `api_key` field in the YAML frontmatter of this Skill file:\n   ```yaml\n   ---\n   name: md2docx\n   api_key: \"your_api_key_here\"\n   ---\n   ```\n\n3. **Trial Key** (Fallback): `f4e8fe6f-e39e-486f-b7e7-e037d2ec216f`\n\n**Priority Order**:\n1. Environment variable `DEEP_SHARE_API_KEY` (if set)\n2. Skill''s `api_key` variable (if not empty)\n3. Trial key (limited quota)\n\n⚠️ **Trial Mode**: Limited quota. For stable production use, purchase at: https://ds.rick216.cn/purchase\n\n## Request Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"content\": \"markdown text here\",\n  \"filename\": \"output\",\n  \"template_name\": \"templates\",\n  \"language\": \"zh\",\n  \"hard_line_breaks\": false,\n  \"remove_hr\": false\n}\n```\n\n## Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Default | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `content` | required | Markdown text to convert |\n| `filename` | `\"output\"` | Output filename (without .docx) |\n| `template_name` | `\"templates\"` | Template: `templates`, `论文`, `article`, `thesis`, etc. |\n| `language` | `\"zh\"` | Template language: `zh` or `en` |\n| `hard_line_breaks` | `false` | Preserve single line breaks |\n| `remove_hr` | `false` | Remove horizontal rules |\n\n## Common Templates\n\n**Chinese** (`language: \"zh\"`):\n- `templates` - General purpose\n- `论文` - Academic paper\n- `论文-首行不缩进` - Paper without indent\n- `论文-标题加粗` - Paper with bold headings\n\n**English** (`language: \"en\"`):\n- `templates` - General purpose\n- `article` - Article/report style\n- `thesis` - Academic thesis\n\n## Conversion Script Usage\n\n### Command Line Options\n\n```bash\npython scripts/convert.py <input.md> [options]\n\nOptions:\n  --url              Return download URL (default if no mode specified)\n  --file             Save file directly to disk\n  --template, -t     Template name (default: templates)\n  --language, -l     Language: zh or en (default: zh)\n  --output, -o       Output directory for file mode\n  --api-key, -k      API key (optional)\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n```bash\n# URL mode (cloud/remote environments)\npython scripts/convert.py document.md --url\npython scripts/convert.py paper.md --url --template 论文 --language zh\n\n# File mode (local environments)\npython scripts/convert.py document.md --file\npython scripts/convert.py paper.md --file --output ./docs --template thesis --language en\n\n# With custom API key\npython scripts/convert.py doc.md --url --api-key your_key\n```\n\n## Validation Before Conversion\n\nEnsure Markdown content:\n- Headers use `#` syntax\n- Lists use `-` or `1.` syntax\n- Code blocks use triple backticks\n- Math formulas use `$...$` (inline) or `$$...$$` (block)\n- Images use publicly accessible URLs\n\n## Response Handling\n\n### URL Mode Response\n\n**Success** (200 OK):\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"https://flies.deepshare.app/mcp/hash/document_xxx.docx\"\n}\n```\n\n### File Mode Response\n\n**Success**: File saved to disk, path printed to stdout\n\n### Error Responses (Both Modes)\n\n- `401 Unauthorized` - Invalid API key\n- `403 Forbidden` - Quota exceeded → Purchase at https://ds.rick216.cn/purchase\n- `413 Payload Too Large` - Content exceeds 10MB\n- `500 Internal Server Error` - Service unavailable, retry\n\n## User Communication\n\n### On Success\n\nTell user:\n1. Conversion completed successfully\n2. **URL mode**: Provide the download URL\n3. **File mode**: Provide the file path where document was saved\n4. Check which API key was used:\n   - **If using environment variable or Skill variable**: No reminder needed\n   - **If using trial key**: Remind: \"⚠️ You''re using trial mode (limited quota). For stable production use, get your API key at: https://ds.rick216.cn/purchase\"\n\n### On Quota Exceeded\n\nTell user:\n1. Conversion failed: quota exceeded\n2. Purchase more credits at: https://ds.rick216.cn/purchase\n3. Or use another API key\n\n### On Other Errors\n\nTell user:\n1. What went wrong (based on error message)\n2. How to fix it\n3. Offer to retry\n\n## Tips\n\n- **API Key Configuration**:\n  - **Option 1 (Recommended)**: Set environment variable `DEEP_SHARE_API_KEY`\n    ```bash\n    export DEEP_SHARE_API_KEY=\"your_api_key_here\"\n    ```\n  - **Option 2**: Edit `api_key` in this Skill''s YAML frontmatter\n  - **Option 3**: Use trial key (limited quota)\n- **File Size**: Keep Markdown under 10MB\n- **Images**: Use `https://` URLs, not local paths\n- **Math**: Use LaTeX syntax: `$E=mc^2$` or `$$\\int_0^\\infty$$`\n- **Line Breaks**: Use `hard_line_breaks: true` for addresses, poetry\n- **Templates**: Choose based on document type (paper, article, etc.)\n\n## Example Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Cloud Environment (URL Mode)\n\n**User asks**: \"Convert this to Word\" (skill running in cloud)\n\n1. Save the Markdown content to a temporary file (e.g., `temp.md`)\n\n2. Run the conversion script with URL mode:\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/convert.py temp.md --url\n   ```\n\n3. The script will:\n   - Select API key by priority (env → skill → trial)\n   - Call the conversion API\n   - Return download URL\n\n4. Provide the download URL to user\n\n5. Clean up temporary file\n\n### Workflow 2: Local Environment (File Mode)\n\n**User asks**: \"Convert my notes.md to Word\" (skill running locally)\n\n1. Run the conversion script with file mode:\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/convert.py notes.md --file --output ./output\n   ```\n\n2. The script will:\n   - Select API key by priority (env → skill → trial)\n   - Call the conversion API\n   - Save the DOCX file directly\n\n3. Tell user where the file was saved\n\n4. No cleanup needed - file is the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:59:25.424Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Processing Agents needing Markdown to DOCX conversion capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要 Markdown 到 DOCX 转换能力的文档处理代理。","ja":"Markdown を DOCX に変換する機能が必要なドキュメント処理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Markdown을 DOCX로 변환하는 기능이 필요한 문서 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de procesamiento de documentos que necesitan capacidades de conversión de Markdown a DOCX.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de traitement de documents ayant besoin de capacités de conversion de Markdown en DOCX.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenverarbeitungsagenten, die Markdown- in DOCX-Konvertierungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades de conversão de Markdown para DOCX.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки документов, которым требуются возможности преобразования Markdown в DOCX.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء معالجة المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحويل Markdown إلى DOCX."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert Markdown text to professionally formatted Word (DOCX) documents using Python, supporting both URL and file modes for flexible deployment, and enabling long conversation screenshot sharing for DeepSeek.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Python 将 Markdown 文本转换为专业格式的 Word（DOCX）文档的能力，支持 URL 和文件模式的灵活部署，并为 DeepSeek 启用长对话截图共享。","ja":"Python を使用して Markdown テキストをプロフェッショナルなフォーマットの Word（DOCX）ドキュメントに変換するエージェントの能力を提供し、URL モードとファイル モードの両方をサポートして柔軟なデプロイを可能にし、DeepSeek の長い会話のスクリーンショットの共有を有効にします。","ko":"Python을 사용하여 Markdown 텍스트를 전문가적으로 형식화된 Word(DOCX) 문서로 변환하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, URL 모드와 파일 모드를 모두 지원하여 유연한 배포를 가능하게 하며, DeepSeek의 긴 대화 스크린샷 공유를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir texto Markdown en documentos Word (DOCX) profesionalmente formateados utilizando Python, admitiendo tanto modo URL como modo de archivo para una implementación flexible, y permitiendo la compartición de capturas de pantalla de conversaciones largas para DeepSeek.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir du texte Markdown en des documents Word (DOCX) professionnellement mis en forme à l''aide de Python, prenant en charge les modes URL et fichier pour un déploiement flexible, et permettant le partage d''captures d''écran de conversations longues pour DeepSeek.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Markdown-Text in professionell formatierte Word-(DOCX)-Dokumente mithilfe von Python zu konvertieren, unterstützt sowohl URL- als auch Dateimodus für eine flexible Bereitstellung und ermöglicht das Teilen von Screenshot-Langkonversations für DeepSeek.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a converter texto Markdown em documentos Word (DOCX) formatados profissionalmente usando Python, suportando modos de URL e arquivo para implantação flexível e permitindo o compartilhamento de capturas de tela de longas conversas para o DeepSeek.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать текст Markdown в профессионально отформатированные документы Word (DOCX) с использованием Python, поддерживая как URL, так и файловые режимы для гибкого развертывания, а также обеспечивая обмен скриншотами длинных бесед для DeepSeek.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل نص Markdown إلى مستندات Word (DOCX) منسقة بشكل احترافي باستخدام Python، مع دعم كل من وضعي URL والملف للنشر المرن، وتمكين مشاركة لقطات المحادثات الطويلة لـ DeepSeek."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting AI-generated Markdown text to DOCX","Generating beautifully formatted Word documents from chat conversations","Exporting formulas from ChatGPT and other AI platforms to editable DOCX files"],"zh":["将 AI 生成的 Markdown 文本转换为 DOCX","从聊天对话生成美丽的 Word 文档","从 ChatGPT 和其他 AI 平台导出公式到可编辑的 DOCX 文件"],"ja":["AI によって生成された Markdown テキストを DOCX に変換する","チャット会話から美しくフォーマットされた Word ドキュメントを生成する","ChatGPT やその他の AI プラットフォームから式を編集可能な DOCX ファイルにエクスポートする"],"ko":["AI가 생성한 Markdown 텍스트를 DOCX로 변환하는 것","대화에서 아름답게 형식화된 Word 문서를 생성하는 것","ChatGPT 및 기타 AI 플랫폼에서 수식을 편집 가능한 DOCX 파일로 내보내기"],"es":["Conversión de texto Markdown generado por IA en DOCX","Generación de documentos Word bellamente formateados a partir de conversaciones de chat","Exportación de fórmulas desde ChatGPT y otras plataformas de IA a archivos DOCX editables"],"fr":["Conversion de texte Markdown généré par IA en DOCX","Génération de documents Word magnifiquement mis en forme à partir de conversations de chat","Exportation de formules depuis ChatGPT et d''autres plateformes d''IA vers des fichiers DOCX modifiables"],"de":["Konvertierung von AI-generiertem Markdown-Text in DOCX","Erzeugung von schön formatierten Word-Dokumenten aus Chat-Konversationen","Export von Formeln aus ChatGPT und anderen KI-Plattformen in bearbeitbare DOCX-Dateien"],"pt":["Conversão de texto Markdown gerado por IA para DOCX","Geração de documentos Word belamente formatados a partir de conversas de chat","Exportação de fórmulas do ChatGPT e outras plataformas de IA para arquivos DOCX editáveis"],"ru":["Преобразование сгенерированного ИИ текста Markdown в DOCX","Создание красиво отформатированных документов Word из чат-бесед","Экспорт формул из ChatGPT и других ИИ-платформ в редактируемые файлы DOCX"],"ar":["تحويل نص Markdown المُنشأ بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي إلى DOCX","إنشاء مستندات Word منسقة بشكل جميل من محادثات الدردشة","تصدير الصيغ من ChatGPT ومنصات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى إلى ملفات DOCX قابلة للتحرير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Markdown input format","Specifically designed for Word (DOCX) output"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","仅限 Markdown 输入格式","专门为 Word（DOCX）输出设计"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","Markdown 入力形式のみ","Word（DOCX）出力用に特別に設計されています"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다","Markdown 입력 형식만 해당","Word(DOCX) 출력을 위한 특별한 설계"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al formato de entrada Markdown","Diseñado específicamente para la salida de Word (DOCX)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au format de saisie Markdown","Conçu spécifiquement pour la sortie Word (DOCX)"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Eingabeformat","Speziell für Word-(DOCX)-Ausgabe konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao formato de entrada Markdown","Projetado especificamente para saída Word (DOCX)"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничено входным форматом Markdown","Специально разработано для вывода в Word (DOCX)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","مقتصر على تنسيق إدخال Markdown","مصمم خصيصًا لإخراج Word (DOCX)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SpookyPirate/spookys-automod-toolkit/skyrim-esp', 'community', 'SpookyPirate', 'spookys-automod-toolkit', 'SpookyPirate/spookys-automod-toolkit', 'skyrim-esp', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z', '2026-02-18T02:59:23.906Z', NULL, '{"id":"SpookyPirate/spookys-automod-toolkit/skyrim-esp","name":"skyrim-esp","description":{"zh":"Skyrim ESP模块是Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit的一部分，用于创建、检查和修改Skyrim插件文件","ja":"Skyrim ESPモジュールは、Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkitの一部であり、Skyrimプラグインファイルを作成、検査、変更するために使用されます","ko":"Skyrim ESP 모듈은 Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit의 일부로서 Skyrim 플러그인 파일을 생성, 검사 및 수정하기 위해 사용됩니다","es":"El módulo ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit te permite crear, inspectar y modificar archivos de plugin de Skyrim. Utiliza comandos como ''dotnet run'' para crear plugins personalizados.","fr":"Le module ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit vous permet de créer, d''inspecter et de modifier les fichiers de plugin de Skyrim. Utilisez des commandes comme ''dotnet run'' pour créer des plugins personnalisés.","de":"Das ESP-Modul von Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit ermöglicht es Ihnen, Skyrim-Plugin-Dateien zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu modifizieren. Verwenden Sie Befehle wie ''dotnet run'', um benutzerdefinierte Plugins zu erstellen.","pt":"O módulo ESP do Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit permite criar, inspecionar e modificar arquivos de plugin para Skyrim. Desenvolva mods com facilidade e eficiência.","ru":"Модуль ESP инструмента Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit позволяет создавать, проверять и изменять файлы плагинов для Skyrim. Разработайте моды с легкостью и эффективностью.","ar":"وحدة إسب من أداة Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit تسمح بإنشاء وتصفح وتعديل ملفات الإضافة لسكايريم. طور مودات بسهولة وفعالية.","en":"Tools to assist LLMs with creating and editing Skyrim mods."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Skyrim ESP模块：创建和编辑Skyrim模组","ja":"Skyrim ESPモジュール：Skyrimモッドの作成と編集","ko":"Skyrim ESP 모듈: Skyrim 모드 생성 및 편집","es":"Herramientas de modificación de Skyrim ESP","fr":"Outils de modification de Skyrim ESP","de":"Skyrim ESP-Modifizierungstools","pt":"Ferramentas Skyrim ESP para Criar e Editar Mods","ru":"Инструменты Skyrim ESP для создания и редактирования модов","ar":"أدوات سكايريم إسب لإنشاء وتعديل المودات","en":"skyrim-esp"},"description":{"zh":"Skyrim ESP模块是Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit的一部分，用于创建、检查和修改Skyrim插件文件","ja":"Skyrim ESPモジュールは、Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkitの一部であり、Skyrimプラグインファイルを作成、検査、変更するために使用されます","ko":"Skyrim ESP 모듈은 Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit의 일부로서 Skyrim 플러그인 파일을 생성, 검사 및 수정하기 위해 사용됩니다","es":"El módulo ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit te permite crear, inspectar y modificar archivos de plugin de Skyrim. Utiliza comandos como ''dotnet run'' para crear...","fr":"Le module ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit vous permet de créer, d''inspecter et de modifier les fichiers de plugin de Skyrim. Utilisez des commandes comme ''do...","de":"Das ESP-Modul von Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit ermöglicht es Ihnen, Skyrim-Plugin-Dateien zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu modifizieren. Verwenden Sie Befehle ...","pt":"O módulo ESP do Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit permite criar, inspecionar e modificar arquivos de plugin para Skyrim. Desenvolva mods com facilidade e eficiência.","ru":"Модуль ESP инструмента Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit позволяет создавать, проверять и изменять файлы плагинов для Skyrim. Разработайте моды с легкостью и эффектив...","ar":"وحدة إسب من أداة Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit تسمح بإنشاء وتصفح وتعديل ملفات الإضافة لسكايريم. طور مودات بسهولة وفعالية.","en":"Tools to assist LLMs with creating and editing Skyrim mods."},"definition":{"en":"Tools to assist LLMs with creating and editing Skyrim mods."},"features":{"zh":["创建Skyrim插件文件","检查和修改Skyrim插件文件","支持ESL标志的轻量级插件","使用命令行工具进行模组开发","集成到Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit中"],"ja":["Skyrimプラグインファイルの作成","Skyrimプラグインファイルの検査と変更","ESLフラグのライトプラグインをサポート","コマンドラインツールを使用したモッド開発","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkitへの統合"],"ko":["Skyrim 플러그인 파일 생성","Skyrim 플러그인 파일 검사 및 수정","ESL 标志의 경량 플러그인을 지원","명령줄 도구를 사용한 모드 개발","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit에 통합"],"es":["Crea plugins de Skyrim personalizados","Inspecta y modifica archivos de plugin existentes","Utiliza el comando ''dotnet run'' para crear plugins","Soporte para plugins ESL-flagged light","Integración con Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"fr":["Créez des plugins de Skyrim personnalisés","Inspectez et modifiez les fichiers de plugin existants","Utilisez la commande ''dotnet run'' pour créer des plugins","Prise en charge des plugins ESL-flagged light","Intégration à Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"de":["Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Skyrim-Plugins","Überprüfen und modifizieren Sie bestehende Plugin-Dateien","Verwenden Sie den Befehl ''dotnet run'', um Plugins zu erstellen","Unterstützung für ESL-flagged Light-Plugins","Integration in Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"pt":["Criação de plugins para Skyrim","Edição de arquivos de plugin","Inspecção de arquivos de plugin","Suporte a plugins leves com ESL","Interface de linha de comando para facilidade de uso","Integração com o Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"ru":["Создание плагинов для Skyrim","Редактирование файлов плагинов","Проверка файлов плагинов","Поддержка легких плагинов с ESL","Интерфейс командной строки для простоты использования","Интеграция с инструментом Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"ar":["إنشاء إضافات لسكايريم","تعديل ملفات الإضافة","تصفح ملفات الإضافة","دعم الإضافات الخفيفة مع إسل","واجهة سطر الأوامر لسهولة الاستخدام","التكامل مع أداة Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Skyrim模组","Skyrim ESP","模组开发","自动化工具","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim插件文件"],"ja":["Skyrimモッド","Skyrim ESP","モッド開発","自動化ツール","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrimプラグインファイル"],"ko":["Skyrim 모드","Skyrim ESP","모드 개발","자동화 도구","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim 플러그인 파일"],"es":["Skyrim mods","ESP módulo","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","plugins de Skyrim","creación de mods","edición de mods","dotnet run","ESL-flagged light"],"fr":["mods de Skyrim","module ESP","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","plugins de Skyrim","création de mods","édition de mods","dotnet run","ESL-flagged light"],"de":["Skyrim-Mods","ESP-Modul","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","Skyrim-Plugins","Mod-Erstellung","Mod-Bearbeitung","dotnet run","ESL-flagged Light"],"pt":["skyrim esp","skyrim mods","spooky''s automod toolkit","criar mods","editar mods","plugins skyrim","esl skyrim","desenvolvimento de mods","ferramentas de modding"],"ru":["skyrim esp","skyrim моды","spooky''s automod toolkit","создание модов","редактирование модов","плагины skyrim","esl skyrim","разработка модов","инструменты моддинга"],"ar":["سكايريم إسب","مودات سكايريم","أداة Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit","إنشاء مودات","تعديل مودات","إضافات سكايريم","إسل سكايريم","تطوير المودات","أدوات المودينج"]}},"owner":"SpookyPirate","repo":"spookys-automod-toolkit","repoPath":"SpookyPirate/spookys-automod-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skyrim-esp","description":"Create and modify Skyrim plugin files (.esp/.esl). Use when the user wants to create a mod, add weapons, armor, spells, perks, books, quests, NPCs, NPC AI packages (36 types for complete behavior control), factions, globals, leveled lists, encounter zones, locations, outfits, or form lists to a plugin. Includes quest aliases, script property management, type inspection, and detailed analysis. Also use when the user wants to view existing records, create override patches, search for records across plugins, manage perk conditions, compare record versions, or detect load order conflicts. Eliminates need for xEdit and Creation Kit for NPC behavior setup.","bodyPreview":"# Skyrim ESP Module\n\nCreate, inspect, and modify Skyrim plugin files using the ESP module of Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRun all commands from the toolkit directory:\n```bash\ncd \"<TOOLKIT_PATH>\"\n# Example: cd \"C:\\Tools\\spookys-automod-toolkit\"\n```\n\n## Command Reference\n\n### Create a Plugin\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"<name>.esp\" [options]\n```\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--light` | Create as ESL-flagged light plugin |","body":"# Skyrim ESP Module\n\nCreate, inspect, and modify Skyrim plugin files using the ESP module of Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRun all commands from the toolkit directory:\n```bash\ncd \"<TOOLKIT_PATH>\"\n# Example: cd \"C:\\Tools\\spookys-automod-toolkit\"\n```\n\n## Command Reference\n\n### Create a Plugin\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"<name>.esp\" [options]\n```\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--light` | Create as ESL-flagged light plugin |\n| `--author \"Name\"` | Set author in header |\n| `--output \"./path\"` | Output directory |\n\n### Inspect a Plugin\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"<plugin>\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp list-masters \"<plugin>\"\n```\n\n### Add Records\n\n**Books** (work immediately, no model needed):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-book \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --text \"Content...\" --value 50\n```\n\n**Weapons** (require `--model` to be visible):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-weapon \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --type sword --damage 25 --model iron-sword\n```\nModel presets: `iron-sword`, `steel-sword`, `iron-dagger`, `hunting-bow`\n\n**Armor** (require `--model` to be visible):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-armor \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --type heavy --slot body --rating 40 --model iron-cuirass\n```\nModel presets: `iron-cuirass`, `iron-helmet`, `iron-gauntlets`, `iron-boots`, `iron-shield`\n\n**Spells** (require `--effect` to function):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-spell \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --effect damage-health --magnitude 50 --cost 45\n```\nEffect presets: `damage-health`, `restore-health`, `damage-magicka`, `restore-magicka`, `damage-stamina`, `restore-stamina`, `fortify-health`, `fortify-magicka`, `fortify-stamina`, `fortify-armor`, `fortify-attack`\n\n**Perks** (require `--effect` to function):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-perk \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --description \"Effect\" --effect weapon-damage --bonus 25 --playable\n```\nEffect presets: `weapon-damage`, `damage-reduction`, `armor`, `spell-cost`, `spell-power`, `spell-duration`, `sneak-attack`, `pickpocket`, `prices`\n\n**Quests**:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-quest \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --start-enabled\n```\n\n**Globals** (configuration variables):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-global \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type float --value 1.5\n```\n\n**NPCs** (record only - need race/face data for visibility):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-npc \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --level 20 --essential\n```\n\n**NPC AI Packages** (complete behavior system - 36 types supported):\n```bash\n# Basic behaviors\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type sandbox --radius 500\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type travel --marker \"DestRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type sleep --bed \"BedRef\" --start-hour 22 --duration 8\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type eat --furniture \"ChairRef\" --start-hour 12 --duration 2\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type follow --target \"PlayerRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type guard --marker \"GuardRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type patrol --marker \"PatrolRef\"\n\n# Activities & actions\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type useitemat --item-ref \"ForgeRef\"  # Crafting\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type sit --furniture \"ChairRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type useidlemarker --marker \"IdleRef\"  # Sweeping, hammering\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type wander --marker \"CenterRef\" --radius 1000\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type wait --marker \"WaitRef\"\n\n# Combat & magic\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type flee --distance 1500\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type useweapon --weapon-ref \"WeaponRef\" --target \"TargetRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type usemagic --spell-ref \"SpellRef\" --target \"TargetRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type shout --shout-ref \"ShoutRef\"\n\n# Dialogue & social\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type forcegreet --target \"PlayerRef\"  # Quest interactions\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type greet --target \"ActorRef\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-package \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --type say --topic-ref \"TopicRef\"\n\n# Attach packages to NPCs (evaluated in order)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp attach-package \"<plugin>\" --npc \"NpcEditorId\" --package \"PackageEditorId\"\n```\n**All 36 Types**: sandbox, travel, sleep, eat, follow, guard, patrol, useitemat, activate, sit, useidlemarker, wander, wait, relax, flee, ambush, useweapon, usemagic, castmagic, shout, dialogue, forcegreet, greet, say, accompany, escortto, followto, acquire, find, holdposition, keepaneyeon, lockdoors, unlockdoors, dismount, hover, orbit\n\n**FormKey Format**: Must be \"FORMID:MODNAME\" with exactly 6 hex digits (e.g., \"000007:Skyrim.esm\")\n\n**Factions** (for tracking and organization):\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-faction \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Name\" --flags \"HiddenFromPC,TrackCrime\"\n```\n\n**LeveledItems** (for random loot distribution):\n```bash\n# With preset\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-leveled-item \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --preset low-treasure\n\n# Custom with entries (format: item,level,count)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-leveled-item \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --chance-none 15 --add-entry \"GoldBase,1,100\" --add-entry \"LockPick,5,3\"\n\n# Guaranteed multi-item drop\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-leveled-item \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --use-all --add-entry \"Sword,10,1\" --add-entry \"Shield,10,1\"\n```\nPresets: `low-treasure` (25% none), `medium-treasure` (15% none), `high-treasure` (5% none), `guaranteed-loot` (0% none)\n\n**FormLists** (for script property collections):\n```bash\n# Add vanilla forms by FormKey\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-form-list \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --add-form \"Skyrim.esm:0x000896\"\n\n# Add mod forms by EditorID\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-form-list \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --add-form \"MyWeapon01\" --add-form \"MyWeapon02\"\n\n# Use in scripts: FormList Property MyList Auto\n# Set property: --property MyList --value \"ModName.esp|0x800\"\n```\n\n**EncounterZones** (for level scaling control):\n```bash\n# With preset\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-encounter-zone \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --preset mid-level\n\n# Custom with flags\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-encounter-zone \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --min-level 30 --max-level 50 --never-resets\n\n# Fully scaling (1-unlimited)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-encounter-zone \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --preset scaling\n```\nPresets: `low-level` (1-10), `mid-level` (10-30), `high-level` (30-50), `scaling` (1-unlimited)\nFlags: `--never-resets` (enemies stay dead), `--disable-combat-boundary` (NPCs pursue anywhere)\n\n**Locations** (for quest markers and fast travel):\n```bash\n# With preset\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-location \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"The Rusty Tankard\" --preset inn\n\n# With parent location\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-location \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"My Shop\" --preset dwelling --parent-location \"WhiterunHoldLocation\"\n\n# Custom keywords\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-location \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --name \"Special Place\" --add-keyword \"LocTypeCity\"\n```\nPresets: `inn` (LocTypeInn), `city` (LocTypeCity), `dungeon` (LocTypeDungeon), `dwelling` (LocTypeDwelling)\n\n**Outfits** (for NPC equipment sets):\n```bash\n# With preset\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-outfit \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --preset guard\n\n# Custom items\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-outfit \"<plugin>\" \"<editorId>\" --add-item \"ArmorIronCuirass\" --add-item \"WeaponIronSword\"\n```\nPresets: `guard` (iron armor + sword + shield), `farmer` (clothes), `mage` (robes + hood), `thief` (leather armor)\n\n### Quest Aliases\nQuest aliases enable dynamic tracking of NPCs, objects, or locations. Essential for follower frameworks.\n\n**Add Alias with Script:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-alias \"<plugin>\" --quest \"<questId>\" --name \"<aliasName>\" --script \"<scriptName>\" --flags \"Optional,AllowReuseInQuest\"\n```\n\n**Attach Script to Existing Alias:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp attach-alias-script \"<plugin>\" --quest \"<questId>\" --alias \"<aliasName>\" --script \"<scriptName>\"\n```\n\nCommon flags: `Optional`, `AllowReuseInQuest`, `AllowReserved`, `Essential`, `Protected`\n\n### Script Management\n\n**Attach Script to Quest:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp attach-script \"<plugin>\" --quest \"<questId>\" --script \"<scriptName>\"\n```\n\n**Set Script Property Manually:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp set-property \"<plugin>\" --quest \"<questId>\" --script \"<scriptName>\" --property \"<propName>\" --value \"<formId>\" --type object\n```\n\n**Auto-Fill Properties (RECOMMENDED):**\n```bash\n# Single script - parses PSC file and fills vanilla properties\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp auto-fill \"<plugin>\" --quest \"<questId>\" --script \"<scriptName>\" --psc-file \"<path>\" --data-folder \"<skyrim-data-path>\"\n\n# Bulk auto-fill ALL scripts (5x faster for multiple scripts)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp auto-fill-all \"<plugin>\" --script-dir \"<source-dir>\" --data-folder \"<skyrim-data-path>\"\n```\n\n**What Auto-Fill Does:**\n- Parses PSC files to extract property names and types\n- Searches Skyrim.esm with type-aware filtering\n- Automatically fills matching vanilla properties\n- Prevents wrong matches (e.g., Location vs Keyword with similar names)\n- Supports array properties (creates ScriptObjectListProperty)\n\n### Analysis & Inspection\n\n**Basic Info:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"<plugin>\"\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp list-masters \"<plugin>\"\n```\n\n**Type Inspection (Debug Mutagen Types):**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp debug-types \"<pattern>\" --json\n```\nExamples: `QuestAlias`, `Quest*`, `--all`\n\n### Dry-Run Mode\nPreview changes without saving:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-weapon \"<plugin>\" \"<id>\" --name \"Test\" --damage 30 --model iron-sword --dry-run --json\n```\n\nAvailable on all `add-*` commands.\n\n### SEQ File Generation\n\nRequired for start-enabled quests:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp generate-seq \"<plugin>\" --output \"./SEQ\"\n```\n\n### Merge Plugins\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp merge \"<source>.esp\" \"<target>.esp\" --output \"Merged.esp\"\n```\n\n## Record Viewing and Override System\n\nView, analyze, and create override patches for existing records without xEdit.\n\n### View Record Details\n```bash\n# View by EditorID (requires --type)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp view-record \"<plugin>\" --editor-id \"<id>\" --type <type>\n\n# View by FormID (type inferred)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp view-record \"<plugin>\" --form-id \"<formid>\"\n```\n**Supported Types:** spell, weapon, armor, quest, npc, perk, faction, book, miscitem, global, leveleditem, formlist, outfit, location, encounterzone\n\n### Create Override Patches\n```bash\n# Create override patch (copies record to new plugin)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create-override \"<source>.esp\" -o \"<patch>.esp\" --editor-id \"<id>\" --type <type>\n```\nThe patch automatically:\n- Adds source as master reference\n- Preserves FormKey from original\n- Loads after source in load order (wins conflicts)\n\n### Search for Records\n```bash\n# Search by pattern\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp find-record --search \"<pattern>\" --type <type> --plugin \"<plugin>\"\n\n# Search across all plugins in Data folder\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp find-record --search \"<pattern>\" --type <type> --data-folder \"C:/Skyrim/Data\" --all-plugins\n```\n\n### Batch Override Multiple Records\n```bash\n# Create overrides for all matching records\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp batch-override \"<source>.esp\" -o \"<patch>.esp\" --search \"<pattern>*\" --type <type>\n\n# Override specific records by EditorID list\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp batch-override \"<source>.esp\" -o \"<patch>.esp\" --type <type> --editor-ids \"ID1,ID2,ID3\"\n```\n\n### Compare Records\n```bash\n# Compare same record in two plugins\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp compare-record \"<plugin1>.esp\" \"<plugin2>.esp\" --editor-id \"<id>\" --type <type>\n```\n\n### Detect Conflicts\n```bash\n# Find which plugins modify a specific record\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp conflicts \"<data-folder>\" --editor-id \"<id>\" --type <type>\n\n# Check all conflicts for a plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp conflicts \"<data-folder>\" --plugin \"<plugin>.esp\"\n```\n\n### Condition Management (Perks Only)\n\n**Note:** Conditions only work on Perk, Package, IdleAnimation, and MagicEffect records.\n\n**List Conditions:**\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp list-conditions \"<plugin>\" --editor-id \"<perkId>\" --type perk\n```\n\n**Add Condition:**\n```bash\n# Add level requirement\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-condition \"<source>.esp\" -o \"<patch>.esp\" --editor-id \"<perkId>\" --type perk --function GetLevel\n\n# Common functions: GetLevel, IsSneaking, IsRunning, IsSwimming, IsInCombat\n```\n\n**Remove Conditions:**\n```bash\n# Remove conditions by index (get indices from list-conditions)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp remove-condition \"<source>.esp\" -o \"<patch>.esp\" --editor-id \"<perkId>\" --type perk --indices \"0,2\"\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Create a Complete Weapon Mod\n```bash\n# 1. Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"MyWeaponMod.esp\" --light --author \"YourName\"\n\n# 2. Add weapon with model\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-weapon \"MyWeaponMod.esp\" \"MyWeapon_Sword\" --name \"Blade of Power\" --type sword --damage 35 --value 500 --model iron-sword\n\n# 3. Verify\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"MyWeaponMod.esp\"\n```\n\n### Create a Spell Pack\n```bash\n# Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"SpellPack.esp\" --light\n\n# Add damage spell\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-spell \"SpellPack.esp\" \"SP_Fireball\" --name \"Greater Fireball\" --effect damage-health --magnitude 75 --cost 60\n\n# Add healing spell\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-spell \"SpellPack.esp\" \"SP_Heal\" --name \"Major Healing\" --effect restore-health --magnitude 100 --cost 50\n\n# Add buff spell\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-spell \"SpellPack.esp\" \"SP_Fortify\" --name \"Warrior''s Blessing\" --effect fortify-health --magnitude 50 --duration 120 --cost 80\n```\n\n### Create a Perk Overhaul\n```bash\n# Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"PerkMod.esp\" --light\n\n# Combat perks\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-perk \"PerkMod.esp\" \"PM_WeaponMaster\" --name \"Weapon Master\" --description \"+20% weapon damage\" --effect weapon-damage --bonus 20 --playable\n\n# Magic perks\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-perk \"PerkMod.esp\" \"PM_Efficiency\" --name \"Magical Efficiency\" --description \"Spells cost 25% less\" --effect spell-cost --bonus 25 --playable\n\n# Stealth perks\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-perk \"PerkMod.esp\" \"PM_Assassin\" --name \"Assassin''s Strike\" --description \"3x sneak attack damage\" --effect sneak-attack --bonus 200 --playable\n```\n\n### Add Content to Existing Mod\n```bash\n# Check what''s in the mod\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"ExistingMod.esp\"\n\n# Add new content\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-weapon \"ExistingMod.esp\" \"NewWeapon\" --name \"Added Sword\" --damage 30 --model steel-sword\n\n# Verify addition\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"ExistingMod.esp\"\n```\n\n### Create a Dungeon with Level Scaling\n```bash\n# Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"DungeonMod.esp\" --light\n\n# Create location\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-location \"DungeonMod.esp\" \"DM_Crypt\" --name \"Forgotten Crypt\" --preset dungeon\n\n# Create encounter zone\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-encounter-zone \"DungeonMod.esp\" \"DM_CryptZone\" --preset mid-level --never-resets\n\n# Create boss loot\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-leveled-item \"DungeonMod.esp\" \"DM_BossChest\" --preset high-treasure\n\n# Verify\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"DungeonMod.esp\"\n```\n\n### Create NPCs with Custom Outfits\n```bash\n# Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"NPCMod.esp\" --light\n\n# Create custom outfit\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-outfit \"NPCMod.esp\" \"NM_GuardOutfit\" --preset guard\n\n# Create faction\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-faction \"NPCMod.esp\" \"NM_TownGuards\" --name \"Town Guards\"\n\n# Create NPC (outfit assigned in Creation Kit)\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-npc \"NPCMod.esp\" \"NM_GuardCaptain\" --name \"Captain Smith\" --level 20 --essential\n```\n\n### Create Form List for Script Property\n```bash\n# Create plugin\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp create \"ScriptHelpers.esp\" --light\n\n# Create form list with weapons\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp add-form-list \"ScriptHelpers.esp\" \"SH_AllWeapons\" --add-form \"MyWeapon01\" --add-form \"MyWeapon02\"\n\n# In your script, declare: FormList Property AllWeapons Auto\n# Then auto-fill or manually set: --property AllWeapons --value \"ScriptHelpers.esp|0x800\"\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n1. **Always use `--model`** for weapons and armor - without it they''ll be invisible\n2. **Always use `--effect`** for spells and perks - without it they won''t function\n3. **EditorIDs must be unique** - use a prefix like `MyMod_` to avoid conflicts\n4. **Light plugins (.esl)** have a 2048 record limit but don''t use a load order slot\n5. **Start-enabled quests require SEQ files** - generate with `generate-seq` command\n6. **Use `--json` flag** for machine-readable output when scripting\n\n## JSON Output\n\nAll commands support `--json` for structured output:\n```bash\ndotnet run --project src/SpookysAutomod.Cli -- esp info \"MyMod.esp\" --json\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T02:59:23.906Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Agents needing advanced Skyrim mod creation and editing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Skyrim模组创建和编辑功能的游戏代理。","ja":"Skyrimモッドの作成および編集の高度な機能を必要とするゲームエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Skyrim 모드 생성 및 편집의 고급 기능이 필요한 게임 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de juego que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación y edición de mods de Skyrim.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de jeu ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création et de modification de mods Skyrim.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Agents, die erweiterte Skyrim-Mod-Erstellung- und -Bearbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Jogos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de criação e edição de mods do Skyrim.","ru":"Идеально подходит для игровых агентов, которым требуются передовые возможности создания и редактирования модов Skyrim.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الألعاب الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء وتحرير تعديلات Skyrim."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, inspect, and modify Skyrim plugin files using the ESP module of Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit, supporting ESL-flagged light plugins and utilizing dotnet run commands.","zh":"赋予代理创建、检查和修改Skyrim插件文件的能力，使用Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit的ESP模块，支持ESL标记的轻量插件，并利用dotnet运行命令。","ja":"Spooky''s AutoMod ToolkitのESPモジュールを使用して、Skyrimプラグインファイルを作成、検査、変更する機能をエージェントに与え、ESLフラグ付きの軽量プラグインをサポートし、dotnet実行コマンドを利用します。","ko":"Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit의 ESP 모듈을 사용하여 Skyrim 플러그인 파일을 생성, 검사 및 수정할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, ESL 플래그가 있는 경량 플러그인을 지원하고 dotnet 실행 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, inspeccionar y modificar archivos de plugin de Skyrim utilizando el módulo ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit, que admite plugins ligeros con marcador ESL y utiliza comandos dotnet run.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''inspecter et de modifier des fichiers de plugin Skyrim en utilisant le module ESP de Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit, qui prend en charge les plugins légers avec drapeau ESL et utilise des commandes dotnet run.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Skyrim-Plugin-Dateien mit dem ESP-Modul von Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu bearbeiten, das ESL-markierte Leicht-Plugins unterstützt und dotnet-Befehle verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, inspecionar e modificar arquivos de plugin do Skyrim usando o módulo ESP do Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit, suportando plugins leves com sinalização ESL e utilizando comandos dotnet run.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, инспектировать и изменять файлы плагинов Skyrim с помощью модуля ESP Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit, поддерживающего легкие плагины с флагом ESL и использующего команды dotnet run.","ar":"يُقوي العميل لإنشاء وتفتيش وتعديل ملفات الإضافة Skyrim باستخدام وحدة ESP من أداة Spooky''s AutoMod ، ودعم الإضافات الخفيفة المُدرجة ESL و باستخدام أوامر dotnet run."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom Skyrim plugins with specific options","Inspecting and modifying existing ESP files","Automating Skyrim mod development workflows using Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"zh":["使用特定选项创建自定义Skyrim插件","检查和修改现有的ESP文件","使用Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit自动化Skyrim模组开发工作流"],"ja":["特定のオプションを使用してカスタムSkyrimプラグインを作成する","既存のESPファイルを検査および変更する","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkitを使用してSkyrimモッド開発ワークフローを自動化する"],"ko":["특정 옵션을 사용하여 사용자 정의 Skyrim 플러그인을 생성하는 것","기존 ESP 파일을 검사 및 수정하는 것","Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit을 사용하여 Skyrim 모드 개발 워크플로를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Crear plugins personalizados de Skyrim con opciones específicas","Inspeccionar y modificar archivos ESP existentes","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de mods de Skyrim con Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"fr":["Créer des plugins Skyrim personnalisés avec des options spécifiques","Inspecter et modifier des fichiers ESP existants","Automatiser les flux de travail de développement de mods Skyrim avec Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Skyrim-Plugins mit bestimmten Optionen erstellen","Vorhandene ESP-Dateien überprüfen und bearbeiten","Skyrim-Mod-Entwicklungsworkflows mit Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit automatisieren"],"pt":["Criar plugins personalizados do Skyrim com opções específicas","Inspecionar e modificar arquivos ESP existentes","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de mods do Skyrim usando o Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских плагинов Skyrim с определенными опциями","Просмотр и изменение существующих файлов ESP","Автоматизация рабочих процессов разработки модов Skyrim с помощью Spooky''s AutoMod Toolkit"],"ar":["إنشاء إضافات Skyrim المخصصة مع خيارات محددة","تفتيش وتعديل ملفات ESP الحالية","توفير سير عمل تطوير التعديلات Skyrim باستخدام أداة Spooky''s AutoMod"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dotnet runtime environment","Toolkit directory setup necessary","Limited to Skyrim plugin files (.esp)"],"zh":["需要dotnet运行环境","工具目录设置必要","仅限Skyrim插件文件(.esp)"],"ja":["dotnetランタイム環境が必要","ツールディレクトリの設定が必要","Skyrimプラグインファイル(.esp)のみ"],"ko":["dotnet 실행 환경이 필요","도구 디렉토리 설정이 필요","Skyrim 플러그인 파일(.esp)만"],"es":["Requiere entorno de tiempo de ejecución dotnet","Configuración del directorio de herramientas necesaria","Limitado a archivos de plugin de Skyrim (.esp)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution dotnet","Configuration du répertoire d''outils nécessaire","Limité aux fichiers de plugin Skyrim (.esp)"],"de":["Benötigt dotnet-Laufzeitumgebung","Toolkit-Verzeichnisseinrichtung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Skyrim-Plugin-Dateien (.esp)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de tempo de execução dotnet","Configuração do diretório de ferramentas necessária","Limitado a arquivos de plugin do Skyrim (.esp)"],"ru":["Требуется среда выполнения dotnet","Необходимо настроить директорию инструментов","Ограничен файлами плагинов Skyrim (.esp)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة وقت تشغيل dotnet","إعداد دليل الأداة ضروري","محدود بملفات الإضافة Skyrim (.esp)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lylo/pagecord/ci', 'community', 'lylo', 'pagecord', 'lylo/pagecord', 'ci', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z', '2026-02-18T03:00:04.978Z', NULL, '{"id":"lylo/pagecord/ci","name":"ci","description":{"zh":"CI管道可以帮助开发者确保代码的安全和质量，通过运行一系列的检查和测试","ja":"CIパイプラインは、開発者がコードのセキュリティと品質を確保するために、さまざまなチェックとテストを実行するのに役立ちます","ko":"CI 파이프라인은 개발자가 코드의 보안과 품질을 확보하기 위해 일련의 체크와 테스트를 실행하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El pipeline de integración continua se ejecuta localmente antes de pushing, garantizando la calidad del código.","fr":"Le pipeline d''intégration continue s''exécute localement avant de pushing, garantissant la qualité du code.","de":"Der Pipeline der kontinuierlichen Integration wird lokal vor dem Pushen ausgeführt, um die Code-Qualität zu gewährleisten.","en":"Blogging as easy as sending an email."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CI管道本地运行","ja":"CIパイプラインのローカル実行","ko":"CI 파이프라인 로컬 실행","es":"CI: Ejecuta el pipeline localmente","fr":"CI : Exécutez le pipeline localement","de":"CI: Führen Sie den lokalen Pipeline aus","en":"ci"},"description":{"zh":"CI管道可以帮助开发者确保代码的安全和质量，通过运行一系列的检查和测试","ja":"CIパイプラインは、開発者がコードのセキュリティと品質を確保するために、さまざまなチェックとテストを実行するのに役立ちます","ko":"CI 파이프라인은 개발자가 코드의 보안과 품질을 확보하기 위해 일련의 체크와 테스트를 실행하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El pipeline de integración continua se ejecuta localmente antes de pushing, garantizando la calidad del código.","fr":"Le pipeline d''intégration continue s''exécute localement avant de pushing, garantissant la qualité du code.","de":"Der Pipeline der kontinuierlichen Integration wird lokal vor dem Pushen ausgeführt, um die Code-Qualität zu gewährleisten.","en":"Blogging as easy as sending an email."},"definition":{"en":"Blogging as easy as sending an email."},"features":{"zh":["安全扫描","风格检查","JS依赖检查","单元测试","系统测试"],"ja":["セキュリティスキャン","スタイルチェック","JS依存関係チェック","ユニットテスト","システムテスト"],"ko":["보안 스캔","스타일 체크","JS 의존성 체크","유닛 테스트","시스템 테스트"],"es":["Ejecución de Brakeman para escaneos de seguridad","Verificación de estilo con Rubocop","Análisis de dependencias de JavaScript con Importmap Audit","Ejecución de pruebas unitarias con Rails","Ejecución de pruebas de sistema con Rails"],"fr":["Exécution de Brakeman pour les analyses de sécurité","Vérification du style avec Rubocop","Analyse des dépendances JavaScript avec Importmap Audit","Exécution des tests unitaires avec Rails","Exécution des tests de système avec Rails"],"de":["Ausführung von Brakeman für Sicherheitsscans","Stilprüfung mit Rubocop","Analyse von JavaScript-Abhängigkeiten mit Importmap Audit","Ausführung von Einheitstests mit Rails","Ausführung von Systemtests mit Rails"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CI管道","持续集成","代码安全","代码质量","自动化测试","开发流程"],"ja":["CIパイプライン","継続的インテグレーション","コードセキュリティ","コード品質","自動テスト","開発プロセス"],"ko":["CI 파이프라인","지속적인 통합","코드 보안","코드 품질","자동 테스트","개발 프로세스"],"es":["integración continua","pipeline de integración continua","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de sistema","Brakeman","Rubocop","Importmap Audit","Rails"],"fr":["intégration continue","pipeline d''intégration continue","tests unitaires","tests de système","Brakeman","Rubocop","Importmap Audit","Rails"],"de":["kontinuierliche Integration","Pipeline der kontinuierlichen Integration","Einheitstests","Systemtests","Brakeman","Rubocop","Importmap Audit","Rails"]}},"owner":"lylo","repo":"pagecord","repoPath":"lylo/pagecord","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci","description":"Run the CI pipeline locally (brakeman, rubocop, importmap audit, tests). Use when asked to run CI, check code quality, or verify code before pushing.","bodyPreview":"# CI\n\nRun the CI pipeline locally before pushing.\n\n## Steps\n\nRun these commands in sequence, stopping on first failure:\n\n1. **Brakeman** (security scan)\n   ```bash\n   bundle exec brakeman --quiet --no-pager --ensure-latest\n   ```\n\n2. **Rubocop** (style check)\n   ```bash\n   bundle exec rubocop\n   ```\n\n3. **Importmap Audit** (JS dependency check)\n   ```bash\n   bin/importmap audit\n   ```\n\n4. **Unit Tests**\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test\n   ```\n\n5. **System Tests**\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test:system","body":"# CI\n\nRun the CI pipeline locally before pushing.\n\n## Steps\n\nRun these commands in sequence, stopping on first failure:\n\n1. **Brakeman** (security scan)\n   ```bash\n   bundle exec brakeman --quiet --no-pager --ensure-latest\n   ```\n\n2. **Rubocop** (style check)\n   ```bash\n   bundle exec rubocop\n   ```\n\n3. **Importmap Audit** (JS dependency check)\n   ```bash\n   bin/importmap audit\n   ```\n\n4. **Unit Tests**\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test\n   ```\n\n5. **System Tests**\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test:system\n   ```\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Run all checks in sequence\n- Stop and report on first failure\n- Summarize results at the end as a table:\n\n| Step | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| Brakeman (security) | ✅ Passed |\n| Rubocop (style) | ✅ Passed |\n| Importmap Audit (JS deps) | ✅ Passed |\n| Unit Tests | ✅ X tests passed |\n| System Tests | ✅ X tests passed |\n\n- If all pass, confirm the code is ready to push\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:00:04.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated testing and security scanning with Brakeman and Rubocop","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Brakeman 和 Rubocop 进行自动化测试和安全扫描的 DevOps Agents","ja":"Brakeman と Rubocop を使用した自動テストとセキュリティスキャンが必要な DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"Brakeman과 Rubocop을 사용한 자동화된 테스트 및 보안 스캔이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan pruebas automatizadas y análisis de seguridad con Brakeman y Rubocop","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin de tests automatisés et d''analyse de sécurité avec Brakeman et Rubocop","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Tests und Sicherheitsscans mit Brakeman und Rubocop benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de testes automatizados e digitalização de segurança com Brakeman e Rubocop","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходимы автоматизированное тестирование и сканирование безопасности с помощью Brakeman и Rubocop","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات آلية وفحص أمان مع Brakeman و Rubocop"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive CI pipelines locally, including security scans with Brakeman, style checks with Rubocop, and JS dependency audits with Importmap, ensuring code quality and security before deployment via protocols like SSH and Git","zh":"赋予代理运行综合的 CI 流水线，包括使用 Brakeman 进行安全扫描、使用 Rubocop 进行样式检查、使用 Importmap 进行 JS 依赖项审计，确保在通过 SSH 和 Git 等协议部署之前的代码质量和安全","ja":"Brakeman を使用したセキュリティスキャン、Rubocop を使用したスタイルチェック、Importmap を使用した JS 依存関係の監査を含む、包括的な CI パイプラインをローカルで実行するエージェントを可能にし、SSH や Git などのプロトコルを使用してデプロイする前のコード品質とセキュリティを確保する","ko":"브라크만을 사용한 보안 스캔, 루비コ프를 사용한 스타일 체크, 임포트맵을 사용한 JS 의존성 감사 등 포함된 포괄적인 CI 파이프라인을 로컬에서 실행할 수 있는 에이전트를 위한 권장 사항으로, SSH 및 Git과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 배포하기 전에 코드 품질 및 보안을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pipelines de CI integrales de forma local, incluyendo análisis de seguridad con Brakeman, comprobaciones de estilo con Rubocop y auditorías de dependencias de JS con Importmap, garantizando la calidad y la seguridad del código antes de la implementación a través de protocolos como SSH y Git","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des pipelines de CI complets en local, y compris des analyses de sécurité avec Brakeman, des vérifications de style avec Rubocop et des audits de dépendances JS avec Importmap, garantissant la qualité et la sécurité du code avant le déploiement via des protocoles comme SSH et Git","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende CI-Pipelines lokal auszuführen, einschließlich Sicherheitsscans mit Brakeman, Stilprüfungen mit Rubocop und JS-Abhängigkeitsaudits mit Importmap, um die Codequalität und -sicherheit vor der Bereitstellung über Protokolle wie SSH und Git sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar pipelines de CI abrangentes localmente, incluindo digitalizações de segurança com Brakeman, verificações de estilo com Rubocop e auditorias de dependência JS com Importmap, garantindo a qualidade e segurança do código antes da implantação via protocolos como SSH e Git","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать комплексные конвейеры CI локально, включая сканирование безопасности с помощью Brakeman, проверку стилей с помощью Rubocop и аудит зависимостей JS с помощью Importmap, обеспечивая качество и безопасность кода до развертывания через протоколы như SSH и Git","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تشغيل خطوط أنابيب CI شاملة محليًا، بما في ذلك فحوصات الأمان مع Brakeman وعمليات فحص الأسلوب مع Rubocop وتدقيق الإعتماديات JS مع Importmap، مع ضمان جودة و أمان الكود قبل النشر عبر بروتوكولات مثل SSH و Git"},"useCases":{"en":["Running security audits with Brakeman","Enforcing coding standards with Rubocop","Auditing JS dependencies with Importmap","Executing unit and system tests with Rails"],"zh":["使用 Brakeman 运行安全审计","使用 Rubocop 强制执行编码标准","使用 Importmap 审计 JS 依赖项","使用 Rails 执行单元和系统测试"],"ja":["Brakeman を使用したセキュリティ監査の実行","Rubocop を使用したコード規約の強制","Importmap を使用した JS 依存関係の監査","Rails を使用したユニットテストとシステムテストの実行"],"ko":["브라크만을 사용한 보안 감사 실행","루비코프를 사용한 코딩 표준 강제","임포트맵을 사용한 JS 의존성 감사","레일스를 사용한 유닛 및 시스템 테스트 실행"],"es":["Ejecutar auditorías de seguridad con Brakeman","Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación con Rubocop","Auditar dependencias de JS con Importmap","Ejecutar pruebas unitarias y de sistema con Rails"],"fr":["Exécuter des audits de sécurité avec Brakeman","Faire respecter les normes de codage avec Rubocop","Auditer les dépendances JS avec Importmap","Exécuter des tests unitaires et système avec Rails"],"de":["Sicherheitsaudits mit Brakeman durchführen","Codierungsstandards mit Rubocop durchsetzen","JS-Abhängigkeiten mit Importmap auditen","Einheiten- und Systemtests mit Rails ausführen"],"pt":["Execução de auditorias de segurança com Brakeman","Aplicação de padrões de codificação com Rubocop","Auditoria de dependências JS com Importmap","Execução de testes unitários e de sistema com Rails"],"ru":["Проведение аудита безопасности с помощью Brakeman","Внедрение стандартов кодирования с помощью Rubocop","Аудит зависимостей JS с помощью Importmap","Выполнение модульных и системных тестов с помощью Rails"],"ar":["تشغيل فحوصات أمان مع Brakeman","تطبيق معايير التشفير مع Rubocop","تدقيق الإعتماديات JS مع Importmap","تشغيل الاختبارات الوحدوية و النظمية مع Rails"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby environment","Bundle exec required for Brakeman and Rubocop","Rails test suite needed for unit and system tests"],"zh":["需要 Ruby 环境","需要 bundle exec 来运行 Brakeman 和 Rubocop","需要 Rails 测试套件来运行单元和系统测试"],"ja":["Ruby 環境が必要","Brakeman と Rubocop を実行するには bundle exec が必要","ユニットテストとシステムテストを実行するには Rails テストスイートが必要"],"ko":["루비 환경이 필요","브라크만 및 루비코프를 실행하려면 번들 실행이 필요","유닛 및 시스템 테스트를 실행하려면 레일스 테스트套件이 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Ruby","Se requiere bundle exec para Brakeman y Rubocop","Se necesita conjunto de pruebas de Rails para pruebas unitarias y de sistema"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Ruby","Exécution de bundle requis pour Brakeman et Rubocop","Un jeu de tests Rails est nécessaire pour les tests unitaires et système"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby-Umgebung","Bundle-Ausführung erforderlich für Brakeman und Rubocop","Rails-Testsuite erforderlich für Einheiten- und Systemtests"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Ruby","Execução do bundle necessário para Brakeman e Rubocop","Conjunto de testes do Rails necessário para testes unitários e de sistema"],"ru":["Требуется среда Ruby","Требуется выполнение bundle для Brakeman и Rubocop","Необходим набор тестов Rails для модульных и системных тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Ruby","يتطلب تنفيذ حزمة ل Brakeman و Rubocop","مطلوب مجموعة اختبارات Rails للاختبارات الوحدوية و النظمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
