owner":"Gerstep","repo":"cybos","repoPath":"Gerstep/cybos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"telegram","description":"Process Telegram messages via GramJS MTProto client. Read messages, generate AI drafts, save drafts, and create intro groups. Use when handling Telegram conversations or facilitating introductions.","bodyPreview":"# Telegram Skill\n\nProcess Telegram messages via GramJS MTProto client. Supports unread messages, specific users, message requests, and group creation for introductions.\n\n**CRITICAL: NEVER SEND MESSAGES. Only save drafts.**\n\n## Capabilities\n\n| Capability | Description |\n|------------|-------------|\n| **Unread Mode** | Process N unread conversations |\n| **User Mode** | Find specific person by username/name (any read state) |\n| **Requests Mode** | Process message requests folder (non-contacts) |\n|","body":"# Telegram Skill\n\nProcess Telegram messages via GramJS MTProto client. Supports unread messages, specific users, message requests, and group creation for introductions.\n\n**CRITICAL: NEVER SEND MESSAGES. Only save drafts.**\n\n## Capabilities\n\n| Capability | Description |\n|------------|-------------|\n| **Unread Mode** | Process N unread conversations |\n| **User Mode** | Find specific person by username/name (any read state) |\n| **Requests Mode** | Process message requests folder (non-contacts) |\n| **Entity Context** | Load context from database for known contacts |\n| **Draft Replies** | AI generates contextual reply drafts |\n| **Save Drafts** | Save drafts to Telegram (no sending) |\n| **Create Groups** | Create new groups and add members for introductions |\n| **Dialog Cache** | Fast lookups via cached dialog IDs (~1s vs ~90s) |\n| **Mark Unread** | Re-mark conversations as unread after processing |\n| **History** | Save per-person history to vault `context/telegram/` |\n\n## Workflows\n\n- **`workflows/process-messages.md`** - Full workflow for reading/replying\n- **`workflows/create-intro-group.md`** - Workflow for facilitating introductions\n\n## Tools\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/telegram-gramjs.ts` | GramJS MTProto client - fetch messages, populate cache |\n| `scripts/telegram-save-drafts.ts` | Save AI drafts to Telegram from work file |\n| `scripts/save-telegram-draft.ts` | Quick helper to save one draft by username |\n| `scripts/telegram-create-group.ts` | Create groups and add members for intros |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Unread mode (default)\n/cyber-telegram                    # 1 unread dialog\n/cyber-telegram --count 3          # 3 unread dialogs\n\n# User mode\n/cyber-telegram --user \"@username\" # By username\n/cyber-telegram --user \"Name\"      # By name\n\n# Requests mode\n/cyber-telegram --requests         # Message requests folder\n\n# Modifiers\n/cyber-telegram --dry-run          # Read only\n/cyber-telegram --no-mark-unread   # Don''t preserve unread state\n\n# Create intro group\nbun scripts/telegram-create-group.ts --dry-run --title \"A <> B\" --users \"@user1,@user2\"\nbun scripts/telegram-create-group.ts --title \"A <> B\" --users \"@user1,@user2\" --draft \"Intro message\"\n```\n\nSee workflow files for full documentation.\n\n## Dialog Cache\n\nDialog cache (`~/.cybos/telegram/dialog-cache.json`) stores all dialog IDs with access hashes for fast lookups:\n- Populated automatically during searches\n- Used by `telegram-save-drafts.ts` to avoid fetching all dialogs\n- ~1 second draft save vs ~90 seconds without cache\n\n## Safety\n\nDrafts only - never sends messages automatically. User reviews and sends manually in Telegram.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:00:19.103Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring advanced Telegram message processing via GramJS MTProto client.","zh":"适合需要通过 GramJS MTProto 客户端进行高级 Telegram 消息处理的社交媒体代理。","ja":"GramJS MTProto クライアントを使用して高度な Telegram メッセージ処理を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GramJS MTProto 클라이언트를 사용하여 고급 Telegram 메시지 처리가 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios sociales que requieren un procesamiento avanzado de mensajes de Telegram a través del cliente GramJS MTProto.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux nécessitant un traitement avancé des messages Telegram via le client GramJS MTProto.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die ein erweitertes Telegram-Nachrichtenverarbeitung über den GramJS MTProto-Client benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que exigem processamento avançado de mensagens do Telegram via cliente GramJS MTProto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для социальных медиа-агентов, требующих продвинутой обработки сообщений Telegram через клиент GramJS MTProto.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وسائط التواصل الاجتماعي التي تتطلب معالجة متقدمة لرسائل تليجرام عبر عميل GramJS MTProto."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process unread messages, find specific users, and handle message requests using MTProto protocol, all while ensuring safety by only saving drafts and never sending messages.","zh":"赋予代理处理未读消息、查找特定用户和使用 MTProto 协议处理消息请求的能力，同时通过仅保存草稿并且永远不发送消息来确保安全。","ja":"MTProto プロトコルを使用して未読メッセージの処理、特定のユーザーの検索、メッセージリクエストの自動化をエージェントに可能にし、安全性を確保するために草稿のみを保存し、メッセージを送信することはありません。","ko":"MTProto 프로토콜을 사용하여 未读 메시지 처리, 특정 사용자 검색, 메시지 요청 자동화를 에이전트에 가능하게 하며, 안전성을 보장하기 위해草稿만 저장하고 메시지를 전송하지 않는다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar mensajes no leídos, encontrar usuarios específicos y manejar solicitudes de mensaje utilizando el protocolo MTProto, todo mientras se garantiza la seguridad al solo guardar borradores y nunca enviar mensajes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les messages non lus, de trouver des utilisateurs spécifiques et de gérer les demandes de message en utilisant le protocole MTProto, le tout en garantissant la sécurité en ne sauvegardant que des brouillons et en n''envoyant jamais de messages.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ungelesene Nachrichten zu verarbeiten, bestimmte Benutzer zu finden und Nachrichtenanfragen mithilfe des MTProto-Protokolls zu bearbeiten, während die Sicherheit gewährleistet ist, indem nur Entwürfe gespeichert und niemals Nachrichten gesendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar conversas não lidas, encontrar usuários específicos e lidar com solicitações de mensagem usando o protocolo MTProto, garantindo a segurança ao salvar apenas rascunhos e nunca enviar mensagens.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать непрочитанные сообщения, находить конкретных пользователей и обрабатывать запросы на сообщения с помощью протокола MTProto, обеспечивая при этом безопасность, сохраняя только черновики и не отправляя сообщения.","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من معالجة المحادثات غير المقروءة، العثور على مستخدمين محددين، وتحويل طلبات الرسائل باستخدام بروتوكول MTProto، مع ضمان السلامة من خلال حفظ المسودات فقط وأبدا إرسال الرسائل."},"useCases":{"en":["Processing unread conversations in bulk","Finding specific users by username or name","Automating message request handling for non-contacts"],"zh":["批量处理未读会话","通过用户名或名称查找特定用户","自动处理非联系人消息请求"],"ja":["未読会話を一括処理する","ユーザー名または名前で特定のユーザーを検索する","非連絡先のメッセージリクエストを自動化する"],"ko":["일괄 처리로 읽지 않은 대화를 처리한다","사용자 이름 또는 이름으로 특정 사용자를 찾는다","비연락처의 메시지 요청을 자동화한다"],"es":["Procesamiento de conversaciones no leídas en bloque","Búsqueda de usuarios específicos por nombre de usuario o nombre","Automatización del manejo de solicitudes de mensaje para no contactos"],"fr":["Traitement de conversations non lues en bloc","Recherche d''utilisateurs spécifiques par nom d''utilisateur ou nom","Automatisation de la gestion des demandes de message pour les non-contacts"],"de":["Verarbeitung ungelesener Konversationen in grossem Umfang","Suche nach bestimmten Benutzern über Benutzernamen oder Namen","Automatisierung der Bearbeitung von Nachrichtenanfragen für Nicht-Kontakte"],"pt":["Processamento em massa de conversas não lidas","Encontrar usuários específicos por nome de usuário ou nome","Automatizar o tratamento de solicitações de mensagem para não contatos"],"ru":["Массовая обработка непрочитанных разговоров","Поиск конкретных пользователей по имени пользователя или имени","Автоматизация обработки запросов на сообщения для не контактов"],"ar":["معالجة المحادثات غير المقروءة بالجملة","العثور على مستخدمين محددين من خلال اسم المستخدم أو الاسم","توفير demande معالجة طلبات الرسائل للأشخاص غير معارفين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Never sends messages, only saves drafts","Requires GramJS MTProto client setup"],"zh":["永远不发送消息，只保存草稿","需要 GramJS MTProto 客户端设置"],"ja":["メッセージを送信しない、草稿のみを保存する","GramJS MTProto クライアントの設定が必要"],"ko":["메시지를 전송하지 않고,草稿만 저장한다","GramJS MTProto 클라이언트 설정이 필요하다"],"es":["Nunca envía mensajes, solo guarda borradores","Requiere configuración del cliente GramJS MTProto"],"fr":["N''envoie jamais de messages, ne sauvegarde que des brouillons","Nécessite la configuration du client GramJS MTProto"],"de":["Sendet niemals Nachrichten, speichert nur Entwürfe","Benötigt die Einrichtung des GramJS MTProto-Clients"],"pt":["Nunca envia mensagens, salva apenas rascunhos","Exige configuração do cliente GramJS MTProto"],"ru":["Никогда не отправляет сообщения, только сохраняет черновики","Требует настройки клиента GramJS MTProto"],"ar":["أبدا إرسال الرسائل، يحفظ المسودات فقط","يتطلب إعداد عميل GramJS MTProto"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
