lementación de middleware de JWT y S3","Creación de rutas y manejo de solicitudes"],"fr":["Développement d''API avec Next.js et Elysia","Gestion des erreurs et composition d''applications","Utilisation de Drizzle pour la gestion de la base de données","Mise en œuvre de middleware de JWT et S3","Création de routes et gestion de requêtes"],"de":["API-Entwicklung mit Next.js und Elysia","Fehlerbehandlung und Anwendungszusammensetzung","Verwendung von Drizzle für die Datenbankverwaltung","Implementierung von JWT- und S3-Middleware","Erstellung von Routen und Anfragebehandlung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de API com Next.js e Elysia","Criação de soluções escaláveis e seguras","Integração com banco de dados Drizzle","Implementação de middleware JWT","Uso de rotas catch-all com Next.js","Integração com armazenamento S3"],"ru":["Разработка API с помощью Next.js и Elysia","Создание масштабируемых и безопасных решений","Интеграция с базой данных Drizzle","Реализация middleware JWT","Использование catch-all маршрутов с Next.js","Интеграция с хранилищем S3"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام Next.js و Elysia","إنشاء حلول متوسعة وآمنة","التكامل مع قاعدة بيانات Drizzle","تنفيذ middleware JWT","استخدام مسارات catch-all مع Next.js","التكامل مع مخزن S3"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API开发","Next.js","Elysia","React Native","移动应用开发","后端开发","混合后端"],"ja":["API開発","Next.js","Elysia","React Native","モバイルアプリ開発","バックエンド開発","ハイブリッドバックエンド"],"ko":["API 개발","Next.js","Elysia","React Native","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","백엔드 개발","하이브리드 백엔드"],"es":["desarrollo de api","next.js","elysia","drizzle","jwt","s3","aplicaciones móviles","escalabilidad","robustez"],"fr":["développement d''api","next.js","elysia","drizzle","jwt","s3","applications mobiles","évolution","robustesse"],"de":["api-entwicklung","next.js","elysia","drizzle","jwt","s3","mobile anwendungen","skalierbarkeit","robustheit"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de api","next.js","elysia","aplicativos móveis","banco de dados drizzle","middleware jwt","rotas catch-all","armazenamento s3","segurança api"],"ru":["разработка api","next.js","elysia","мобильные приложения","база данных drizzle","middleware jwt","catch-all маршруты","хранилище s3","безопасность api"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","next.js","elysia","تطبيقات محمولة","قاعدة بيانات drizzle","middleware jwt","مسارات catch-all","مخزن s3","أمن واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"jvidalv","repo":"100cims","repoPath":"jvidalv/100cims","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api","description":"Use when working on the backend API (packages/api). Covers Elysia routes, Drizzle ORM, TypeBox schemas, JWT authentication, S3 uploads, Google Sheets logging, and the Next.js hybrid setup.","bodyPreview":"# API Development Guide\n\nYou are working on the **100cims API** (`packages/api`), a Next.js + Elysia hybrid backend.\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/routes/index.ts` | Elysia app composition, error handling |\n| `src/app/api/[[...slugs]]/route.ts` | Next.js catch-all for Elysia |\n| `src/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle schema (source of truth) |\n| `src/db/index.ts` | Database client |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/jwt.ts` | JWT middleware |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/s3.ts` | S3","body":"# API Development Guide\n\nYou are working on the **100cims API** (`packages/api`), a Next.js + Elysia hybrid backend.\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/routes/index.ts` | Elysia app composition, error handling |\n| `src/app/api/[[...slugs]]/route.ts` | Next.js catch-all for Elysia |\n| `src/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle schema (source of truth) |\n| `src/db/index.ts` | Database client |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/jwt.ts` | JWT middleware |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/s3.ts` | S3 upload utilities |\n| `src/api/lib/sheets.ts` | Google Sheets logging |\n| `drizzle.config.ts` | Database connection config |\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Hybrid Stack\n\n- **Next.js 15** (App Router) for web pages and runtime\n- **Elysia 1.4** for API routes (mounted at `/api/*`)\n- **Drizzle ORM** with PostgreSQL\n- **TypeBox** for schema validation\n\n### Why This Hybrid?\n\nElysia provides excellent TypeScript inference, OpenAPI generation, and performance while Next.js handles the server runtime and potential web pages.\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n- `/src/api/`: All Elysia API code\n  - `/routes/`: Route handlers (public, protected, @shared)\n  - `/schemas/`: TypeBox validation schemas\n  - `/lib/`: Utilities (sheets, dates, images, slug)\n- `/src/db/`: Database schema and client\n- `/src/app/`: Next.js pages and API catch-all route\n\n### Shared Utilities\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/lib/slug.ts` | `generateSlug()` - URL-friendly slug generation |\n| `src/api/lib/images.ts` | `isBase64SizeValid()` - Image size validation |\n| `src/api/lib/sheets.ts` | Google Sheets logging utilities |\n| `src/api/lib/dates.ts` | Date formatting utilities |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Route Organization\n\n```\n/api/routes/\n├── @shared/          # Middleware, JWT, S3, types\n├── public/           # No auth required\n│   ├── mountains.route.ts\n│   ├── challenge.route.ts\n│   └── hiscores.route.ts\n├── protected/        # JWT required\n│   ├── summit.route.ts\n│   ├── user.route.ts\n│   ├── plan.route.ts\n│   ├── mountains/    # Folder-based organization\n│   │   ├── index.ts\n│   │   ├── my-list.route.ts\n│   │   └── update.route.ts\n│   └── community-challenge/\n│       ├── index.ts\n│       ├── create.route.ts\n│       ├── update.route.ts\n│       └── delete.route.ts\n└── index.ts          # Compose all routes\n```\n\n**Folder-based routes**: Group related endpoints in folders with an `index.ts` that composes them with a prefix. Each endpoint gets its own file.\n\n### Creating Routes\n\n```typescript\nimport { Elysia } from ''elysia'';\nimport { db } from ''@/db'';\nimport { userSchema } from ''@/api/schemas'';\n\nexport const userRoute = new Elysia({ prefix: ''/user'', tags: [''users''] })\n  .get(''/:id'', async ({ params }) => {\n    const user = await db.query.user.findFirst({\n      where: (u, { eq }) => eq(u.id, params.id)\n    });\n    return user;\n  }, {\n    detail: { summary: ''Get user by ID'' },\n    params: userSchema.params,\n    response: userSchema.response\n  });\n```\n\n### Protected Routes\n\n```typescript\nimport { jwt } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/jwt'';\nimport { store } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/store'';\n\nexport const summitRoute = new Elysia({ prefix: ''/summit'', tags: [''summits''] })\n  .use(jwt)\n  .use(store)\n  .derive(async ({ bearer, store }) => {\n    const payload = await bearer(bearer);\n    store.userId = payload.userId;\n  })\n  .post(''/'', async ({ body, store }) => {\n    // store.userId available from JWT\n    const summit = await db.insert(summitTable).values({\n      userId: store.userId,\n      mountainId: body.mountainId\n    });\n    return summit;\n  });\n```\n\n### Database Queries\n\n```typescript\nimport { db } from ''@/db'';\nimport { user, summit, mountain } from ''@/db/schema'';\nimport { eq, desc } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Simple query\nconst users = await db.select().from(user).where(eq(user.id, userId));\n\n// Join query\nconst summits = await db\n  .select({\n    id: summit.id,\n    mountainName: mountain.name,\n    date: summit.createdAt\n  })\n  .from(summit)\n  .leftJoin(mountain, eq(summit.mountainId, mountain.id))\n  .where(eq(summit.userId, userId))\n  .orderBy(desc(summit.createdAt));\n```\n\n### Schema Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport { t } from ''elysia'';\n\nexport const summitSchema = {\n  body: t.Object({\n    mountainId: t.String(),\n    date: t.Optional(t.String()),\n    image: t.Optional(t.String())\n  }),\n  response: {\n    200: t.Object({\n      id: t.String(),\n      mountainId: t.String(),\n      userId: t.String()\n    })\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Pagination Pattern\n\nFor paginated endpoints, use this pattern for backwards compatibility:\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nexport const PaginatedItemsSchema = t.Object({\n  items: t.Array(ItemSchema),\n  pagination: t.Object({\n    page: t.Number(),\n    pageSize: t.Number(),\n    totalItems: t.Number(),\n    totalPages: t.Number(),\n    hasMore: t.Boolean(),\n  }),\n});\n\n// Route handler - backwards compatible\nconst isPaginated = query.page !== undefined || query.limit !== undefined;\n\nif (isPaginated) {\n  // Return paginated results with count query\n  return { items: results, pagination: { page, pageSize, totalItems, totalPages, hasMore } };\n}\n\n// No pagination params = return ALL results (backwards compatible)\nreturn { items: results, pagination: { page: 1, pageSize: results.length, totalItems: results.length, totalPages: 1, hasMore: false } };\n```\n\n**Key**: Old clients without pagination params get all results. New clients can paginate.\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Add New Endpoint\n\n1. Create schema in `/api/schemas/`\n2. Create route file in `/routes/public/` or `/protected/`\n3. Import and use in `/routes/index.ts`\n4. Mobile app: Run `yarn generate-api-types`\n\n### Database Migration\n\n1. Update `/src/db/schema.ts`\n2. Run `yarn drizzle-kit push` (pushes to DB)\n3. Verify schema changes in database\n\n### Image Upload to S3\n\n```typescript\nimport { putImageOnS3 } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/s3'';\n\nconst key = `${process.env.APP_NAME}/user/avatar/${userId}.jpeg`;\nawait putImageOnS3(key, buffer);\n```\n\n### Log to Google Sheets\n\n```typescript\nimport { addRowToSheets, ERRORS_SPREADSHEET } from ''@/api/lib/sheets'';\n\nawait addRowToSheets(ERRORS_SPREADSHEET, [\n  ''error_type'',\n  ''status_code'',\n  ''url'',\n  ''message''\n]);\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `DATABASE_URL`: PostgreSQL connection string\n- `AUTH_SECRET`: JWT signing secret\n- `AWS_*`: S3 credentials (region, bucket, access keys)\n- `SHEETS_*`: Google service account credentials\n- `APP_NAME`: Application name (used in S3 paths)\n\nSee `.env.example` for complete list.\n\n## Swagger Documentation\n\nAvailable at `/api/swagger` during development. Auto-generated from:\n- Route tags\n- TypeBox schemas\n- OpenAPI metadata in route definitions\n\n## Database Schema\n\nSee `/src/db/schema.ts` for full schema. Key tables:\n- `user`: OAuth accounts\n- `mountain`: Peak data (name, lat/lng, elevation, difficulty)\n- `summit`: User summit logs\n- `plan`: Group hiking plans\n- `plan_attendee`: Plan participants\n- `plan_chat`: Chat messages\n- `challenge`: Curated challenges\n- `hiscores`: Leaderboard\n\n## Error Handling\n\nGlobal error handler in `/routes/index.ts`:\n- Logs all errors to Google Sheets\n- Returns appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Distinguishes ValidationError, ParseError, generic errors\n\n## Deployment\n\nVercel (configured in root `vercel.json`):\n- Builds from `packages/api`\n- Environment variables set in Vercel dashboard\n- Automatic deployments on main branch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:00:26.329Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Next.js and Elysia-focused agents seeking to develop and integrate RESTful APIs with JWT authentication and S3 storage.","zh":"适合于Next.js和Elysia专注的代理商，旨在开发和集成使用JWT身份验证和S3存储的RESTful API。","ja":"Next.jsとElysiaに焦点を当てたエージェントがRESTful APIを開発および統合するためにJWT認証とS3ストレージを使用することが理想的です。","ko":"Next.js와 Elysia에 초점을 둔 에이전트가 RESTful API를 개발 및 통합하기에 적합합니다. JWT 인증 및 S3 저장소를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes enfocados en Next.js y Elysia que buscan desarrollar e integrar APIs RESTful con autenticación JWT y almacenamiento S3.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur Next.js et Elysia qui cherchent à développer et à intégrer des API RESTful avec une authentification JWT et un stockage S3.","de":"Ideal für Next.js- und Elysia-fokussierte Agenten, die RESTful-APIs mit JWT-Authentifizierung und S3-Speicher entwickeln und integrieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes focados em Next.js e Elysia que buscam desenvolver e integrar APIs RESTful com autenticação JWT e armazenamento em S3.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Next.js и Elysia, которые стремятся разработать и интегрировать RESTful API с аутентификацией JWT и хранилищем S3.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهات Next.js و Elysia التي تهدف إلى تطوير وتكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful مع مصادقة JWT وتخزين S3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create hybrid backends using Next.js and Elysia, leveraging Drizzle schema for database management and integrating JWT middleware for secure authentication, alongside S3 for scalable storage solutions.","zh":"赋予代理商使用Next.js和Elysia创建混合后端的能力，利用Drizzle模式管理数据库，并集成JWT中间件进行安全认证，以及使用S3进行可扩展的存储解决方案。","ja":"Next.jsとElysiaを使用してハイブリッドバックエンドを作成するエージェントをEmpowerします。Drizzleスキーマを使用してデータベースを管理し、JWTミドルウェアを使用して安全な認証を実現し、S3を使用してスケーラブルなストレージソリューションを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js와 Elysia를 사용하여 하이브리드 백엔드를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. Drizzle 스키마를 사용하여 데이터베이스를 관리하고, JWT 미들웨어를 사용하여 보안 인증을 제공하며, S3를 사용하여 확장 가능한 저장소 솔루션을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear backends híbridos utilizando Next.js y Elysia, aprovechando el esquema Drizzle para la gestión de bases de datos e integrando el middleware JWT para una autentificación segura, junto con S3 para soluciones de almacenamiento escalables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des backends hybrides en utilisant Next.js et Elysia, en exploitant le schéma Drizzle pour la gestion de bases de données et en intégrant le middleware JWT pour une authentification sécurisée, aux côtés de S3 pour des solutions de stockage escalables.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hybride Backends mit Next.js und Elysia zu erstellen, indem sie das Drizzle-Schema für die Datenbankverwaltung nutzen und JWT-Middleware für sichere Authentifizierung integrieren, zusammen mit S3 für skalierbare Speicherlösungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem backends híbridos usando Next.js e Elysia, aproveitando o esquema Drizzle para gerenciamento de banco de dados e integrando middleware JWT para autenticação segura, juntamente com o S3 para soluções de armazenamento escaláveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать гибридные бэкенды, используя Next.js и Elysia, используя схему Drizzle для управления базой данных и интегрируя middleware JWT для безопасной аутентификации, а также S3 для масштабируемых решений хранения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من إنشاء خلفيات هجينة باستخدام Next.js و Elysia، واستغلال مخطط Drizzle لإدارة قاعدة البيانات وتكامل middleware JWT للتحقق الآمن، جنبًا إلى جنب مع S3 لحلول تخزين قابلة للتوسعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing RESTful APIs with Elysia","Implementing JWT authentication for secure data exchange","Integrating S3 storage for scalable file management"],"zh":["使用Elysia开发RESTful API","实施JWT身份验证以实现安全的数据交换","集成S3存储以实现可扩展的文件管理"],"ja":["Elysiaを使用してRESTful APIを開発する","JWT認証を実装して安全なデータ交換を実現する","S3ストレージを統合してスケーラブルなファイル管理を実現する"],"ko":["Elysia를 사용하여 RESTful API를 개발하는 것","JWT 인증을 구현하여 안전한 데이터 교환을 실현하는 것","S3 저장소를 통합하여 확장 가능한 파일 관리를 실현하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar APIs RESTful con Elysia","Implementar la autenticación JWT para un intercambio de datos seguro","Integrar el almacenamiento S3 para una gestión de archivos escalable"],"fr":["Développer des API RESTful avec Elysia","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification JWT pour un échange de données sécurisé","Intégrer le stockage S3 pour une gestion de fichiers escalable"],"de":["RESTful-APIs mit Elysia entwickeln","JWT-Authentifizierung für sicheren Datenaustausch implementieren","S3-Speicher integrieren für eine skalierbare Dateiverwaltung"],"pt":["Desenvolver APIs RESTful com Elysia","Implementar autenticação JWT para troca de dados segura","Integrar armazenamento em S3 para gerenciamento de arquivos escalável"],"ru":["Разработка RESTful API с помощью Elysia","Реализация аутентификации JWT для безопасного обмена данными","Интеграция хранилища S3 для масштабируемого управления файлами"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful مع Elysia","تنفيذ مصادقة JWT لتبادل البيانات الآمن","دمج تخزين S3 لإدارة الملفات القابلة للتوسعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js and Elysia setup","Dependent on Drizzle schema for database client","Needs AWS S3 access for storage integration"],"zh":["需要Next.js和Elysia设置","依赖于Drizzle模式的数据库客户端","需要AWS S3访问权限以实现存储集成"],"ja":["Next.jsとElysiaの設定が必要","Drizzleスキーマのデータベースクライアントに依存する","ストレージ統合のためにAWS S3へのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Next.js와 Elysia 설정이 필요합니다","Drizzle 스키마의 데이터베이스 클라이언트에 의존합니다","저장소 통합을 위해 AWS S3에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Next.js y Elysia","Depende del esquema Drizzle para el cliente de base de datos","Necesita acceso a AWS S3 para la integración de almacenamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Next.js et Elysia","Dépend du schéma Drizzle pour le client de base de données","Nécessite un accès à AWS S3 pour l''intégration de stockage"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js- und Elysia-Setup","Hängt vom Drizzle-Schema für den Datenbank-Client ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf AWS S3 für die Speicherintegration"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Next.js e Elysia","Depende do esquema Drizzle para cliente de banco de dados","Necessita de acesso ao AWS S3 para integração de armazenamento"],"ru":["Требует настройки Next.js и Elysia","Зависит от схемы Drizzle для клиента базы данных","Требует доступа к AWS S3 для интеграции хранилища"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Next.js و Elysia","يعتمد على مخطط Drizzle للعميل قاعدة البيانات","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى AWS S3 لدمج التخزين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
