ocumentación automatizada","Versionamiento de metadatos a nivel de muestra","Soporte para pipelines multimodales"],"fr":["Validation du code et des métadonnées","Intégration avec Pytest","Documentation automatisée","Versionnage de métadonnées au niveau de l''échantillon","Prise en charge des pipelines multimodaux"],"de":["Validierung von Code und Metadaten","Integration mit Pytest","Automatisierte Dokumentation","Versionierung von Metadaten auf Beispielbasis","Unterstützung für multimodale Pipelines"],"pt":["Validação de exemplos de código em documentação","Integração com Pytest","Metadados de nível de amostra para pipelines multimodais","Instalação simples com pip","Documentação oficial completa"],"ru":["Проверка примеров кода в документации","Интеграция с Pytest","Метаданные уровня выборки для мультимодальных конвейеров","Простая установка с помощью pip","Полная официальная документация"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة الأمثلة البرمجية في الوثائق","التكامل مع Pytest","بيانات وصفية على مستوى العينة للأنابيب المتعددة الأوضاع","التثبيت البسيط مع pip","وثائق رسمية كاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码文档测试","元数据版本控制","增量多模态管道","Pytest","代码质量","自动测试","代码验证"],"ja":["コードドキュメントのテスト","メタデータバージョニング","インクリメンタルマルチモーダルパイプライン","Pytest","コード品質","自動テスト","コード検証"],"ko":["코드 문서 테스트","메타데이터 버저닝","증분 다중 모드 파이프라인","Pytest","코드 품질","자동 테스트","코드 검증"],"es":["sybil","versionamiento de metadatos","pipelines multimodales","validación de código","integración con pytest","documentación automatizada","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["sybil","versionnage de métadonnées","pipelines multimodaux","validation du code","intégration avec pytest","documentation automatisée","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["sybil","metadaten-versionierung","multimodale pipelines","code-validierung","integration mit pytest","automatisierte dokumentation","software-entwicklung","entwicklertools"],"pt":["sybil","metadados","pipelines multimodais","validação de código","documentação","pytest","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["sybil","метаданные","мультимодальные конвейеры","проверка кода","документация","pytest","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["sybil","بيانات وصفية","أنابيب متعددة الأوضاع","التحقق من الأمثلة البرمجية","توثيق","pytest","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"anam-org","repo":"metaxy","repoPath":"anam-org/metaxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sybil","description":"Use Sybil for testing code examples in documentation and docstrings. Covers pytest integration, parsers, skip directives, and namespace management.","bodyPreview":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.m","body":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        PythonCodeBlockParser(),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\", \"**/*.py\"],\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Sybil Parameters\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#sybil.Sybil).\n\n| Parameter        | Description                                                     |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `parsers`        | Sequence of parser callables                                    |\n| `patterns`       | File glob patterns to include (e.g., `[\"*.md\", \"src/**/*.py\"]`) |\n| `excludes`       | File glob patterns to exclude                                   |\n| `setup`          | Callable receiving namespace dict, called before each document  |\n| `teardown`       | Callable receiving namespace dict, called after each document   |\n| `fixtures`       | List of pytest fixture names to inject into namespace           |\n| `document_types` | Map file extensions to Document classes                         |\n\n### Document Types\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#documents).\n\n- **Default**: Parse entire file\n- `PythonDocument`: Import `.py` file as module, names available in namespace\n- `PythonDocStringDocument`: Parse only docstrings from `.py` files\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"src/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Fixtures\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom sybil import Sybil\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef my_fixture():\n    return {\"key\": \"value\"}\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\"],\n    fixtures=[\"my_fixture\"],  # Available in document namespace\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Setup/Teardown\n\n```python\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    namespace[\"helper\"] = lambda x: x * 2\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    pass  # Cleanup if needed\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n).pytest()\n```\n\n## Disable pytest''s Built-in Doctest\n\nAdd to `pyproject.toml` to prevent conflicts:\n\n```toml\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\naddopts = \"-p no:doctest\"\n```\n\n## Markdown Parsers\n\nSee [Markdown parsers docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser, CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.clear import ClearNamespaceParser\n```\n\n## Skip Directives\n\nSee [skip directive docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#skipping-examples).\n\n**SkipParser must come before other parsers** to handle skip directives.\n\n````markdown\n<!-- skip: next -->\n\n```python\n# This example is skipped\n```\n````\n\n<!-- skip: next \"reason for skipping\" -->\n\n```python\n# Skipped and reported as skipped test with reason\n```\n\n<!-- skip: start -->\n\n```python\n# Multiple examples\n```\n\n```python\n# All skipped\n```\n\n<!-- skip: end -->\n\n<!-- skip: next if(condition_var) -->\n\n```python\n# Conditionally skipped based on namespace variable\n```\n\n````\n## Invisible Code Blocks\n\nSetup code that doesn''t render in documentation. See [invisible code blocks docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#invisible-code-blocks).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- invisible-code-block: python\nsetup_var = \"hidden setup\"\n-->\n````\n\n## Clear Namespace\n\nReset the document namespace for isolation. See [clear namespace docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#clearing-the-namespace).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- clear-namespace -->\n```\n\n## Custom Evaluators\n\nSee [evaluators API](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#evaluators).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\n\n# Custom evaluator with future imports\nevaluator = PythonEvaluator(future_imports=[\"annotations\"])\n\nparser = CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=evaluator)\n```\n\n## Running Sybil Tests\n\nSybil tests are collected like regular pytest tests. To run only Sybil tests:\n\n```bash\n# Run tests from specific directory containing documented code\npytest src/mypackage/ -v\n\n# Exclude regular tests, only run documentation examples\npytest docs/ -v\n```\n\nTo exclude Sybil tests from regular test runs, use pytest''s `--ignore` flag or configure `addopts` in `pyproject.toml`.\n\n## Example: Complete conftest.py\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Sybil configuration for docstring testing.\"\"\"\n\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\nimport mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Pre-populate namespace for all examples.\"\"\"\n    namespace[\"pkg\"] = mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Cleanup after document.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"py\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"src/mypackage/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n    excludes=[\n        \"**/tests/**\",\n        \"**/_internal/**\",\n    ],\n).pytest()\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:01:04.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Testing Agents needing advanced incremental multimodal pipeline validation and pluggable sample-level metadata versioning.","zh":"非常适合需要高级增量多模态管道验证和可插拔样本级元数据版本的测试代理。","ja":"テストエージェントが高度なインクリメンタルなマルチモーダル パイプラインの検証とプラグ可能なサンプル レベルのメタデータ バージョニングを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 증분 다중 모드 파이프라인 검증 및 플러그 가능한 샘플 수준 메타데이터 버전 관리가 필요한 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba que necesitan una validación de tubería multimodal incremental avanzada y una versión de metadatos a nivel de muestra conectable.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test nécessitant une validation de pipeline multimodal incrémental avancée et une version de métadonnées au niveau de l''échantillon connectable.","de":"Perfekt für Testagenten, die eine erweiterte inkrementelle Multimodal-Pipeline-Validierung und eine pluggable Metadaten-Versionierung auf Sample-Ebene benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste que necessitam de validação de pipeline multimodal incremental avançada e versionamento de metadados de nível de amostra plugável.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования, которым требуется продвинутая инкрементная валидация многомодального конвейера и плагинная версия метаданных уровня образца.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبار متقدم للpipeline المتعدد الوسائط بشكل متزايد ونسخة بيانات وصفية قابلة للتشغيل على مستوى العينة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs using Pytest integration and libraries like sybil.parsers.","zh":"赋予代理通过解析和执行文档和文档字符串中嵌入的代码示例来验证代码示例的能力，使用 Pytest 集成和类似 sybil.parsers 的库作为正常测试运行的一部分。","ja":"Pytest 統合や sybil.parsers ライブラリなどの使用により、ドキュメントやドキュメント文字列に埋め込まれたコード例を解析して実行することで、コード例を検証するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"Pytest 통합 및 sybil.parsers와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 문서 및 문서 문자열에 포함된 코드 예제를 파싱 및 실행하여 코드 예제를 검증할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar ejemplos de código incrustados en la documentación y cadenas de documentación analizando y ejecutándolos como parte de las ejecuciones de prueba normales utilizando la integración de Pytest y bibliotecas como sybil.parsers.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les exemples de code intégrés dans la documentation et les docstrings en les analysant et en les exécutant dans le cadre des exécutions de test normales en utilisant l''intégration Pytest et des bibliothèques comme sybil.parsers.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Codebeispiele in Dokumentationen und Docstrings zu validieren, indem sie diese analysieren und als Teil normaler Testläufe mithilfe der Pytest-Integration und Bibliotheken wie sybil.parsers ausführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar exemplos de código incorporados na documentação e docstrings, analisando e executando-os como parte de execuções de teste normais usando integração Pytest e bibliotecas como sybil.parsers.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить примеры кода, встроенные в документацию и строковые документации, парся и выполняя их как часть обычных запусков тестов с использованием интеграции Pytest и библиотек типа sybil.parsers.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من أمثلة الشفرة المضمنة في الوثائق والتوثيقات النصية من خلال تحليلها وتنفيذها كجزء من تشغيل الاختبارات العادي باستخدام تكامل Pytest ومكتبات مثل sybil.parsers."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating documentation code examples","Executing embedded code snippets as tests","Parsing multimodal pipeline metadata"],"zh":["验证文档代码示例","执行嵌入式代码片段作为测试","解析多模态管道元数据"],"ja":["ドキュメントのコード例を検証する","埋め込まれたコードスニペットをテストとして実行する","マルチモーダル パイプラインのメタデータを解析する"],"ko":["문서 코드 예제를 검증","내장 코드 스니펫을 테스트로 실행","다중 모드 파이프라인 메타데이터를 파싱"],"es":["Validar ejemplos de código de documentación","Ejecutar fragmentos de código incrustados como pruebas","Analizar metadatos de tubería multimodal"],"fr":["Valider les exemples de code de documentation","Exécuter les extraits de code intégrés en tant que tests","Analyser les métadonnées de pipeline multimodal"],"de":["Dokumentationscodebeispiele validieren","Eingebettete Codefragmente als Tests ausführen","Multimodal-Pipeline-Metadaten analysieren"],"pt":["Validar exemplos de código de documentação","Executar trechos de código incorporados como testes","Analise de metadados de pipeline multimodal"],"ru":["Проверка примеров кода документации","Выполнение встроенных фрагментов кода как тестов","Разбор метаданных многомодального конвейера"],"ar":["التحقق من أمثلة الشفرة في الوثائق","تنفيذ شفرة مضمنة كاختبارات","تحليل بيانات وصفية متعددة الوسائط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Pytest installation","Python environment needed","Limited to incremental multimodal pipelines"],"zh":["需要 Pytest 安装","需要 Python 环境","仅限增量多模态管道"],"ja":["Pytest のインストールが必要","Python 環境が必要","インクリメンタル マルチモーダル パイプラインに限定"],"ko":["Pytest 설치 필요","Python 환경 필요","증분 다중 모드 파이프라인으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Pytest","Se necesita entorno de Python","Limitado a tuberías multimodales incrementales"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Pytest","Environnement Python nécessaire","Limité aux pipelines multimodaux incrémentaux"],"de":["Benötigt Pytest-Installation","Python-Umgebung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf inkrementelle Multimodal-Pipelines"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Pytest","Ambiente Python necessário","Limitado a pipelines multimodais incrementais"],"ru":["Требуется установка Pytest","Необходимо окружение Python","Ограничен многомодальными инкрементными конвейерами"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Pytest","بيئة بايثون ضرورية","محدود بالأنابيب متعددة الوسائط المتزايدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
