Debug-Überprüfung","pt":"Revisão de Depuração Automatizada de PR","ru":"Автоматический обзор отладки PR","ar":"مراجعة تصحيح الأخطاء التلقائية ل PR","en":"debug-review"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查调试助手是一种自动化 PR 代码审查服务，使用 Claude Code CLI 跟踪整个 PR 生命周期","ja":"コードレビューのデバッグアシスタントは、Claude Code CLI を使用して全 PR ライフサイクルを追跡する自動化 PR コードレビューサービス","ko":"코드 리뷰 디버깅 어시스턴트는 Claude Code CLI를 사용하여 전체 PR 生命周期를 추적하는 자동화된 PR 코드 리뷰 서비스","es":"Nuestra herramienta de revisión de depuración automática de PR utiliza Claude Code CLI para diagnosticar y solucionar problemas en el ciclo de vida de las so...","fr":"Notre outil de révision automatique de débogage de PR utilise Claude Code CLI pour diagnostiquer et résoudre les problèmes dans le cycle de vie des demandes ...","de":"Unser Tool für die automatisierte PR-Debug-Überprüfung verwendet Claude Code CLI, um Probleme im Lebenszyklus von Pull-Requests zu diagnostizieren und zu lösen.","pt":"A revisão de depuração automática de PR é um serviço que utiliza a CLI do Claude Code para realizar uma revisão completa do ciclo de vida do PR","ru":"Автоматический обзор отладки PR - это сервис, использующий CLI от Claude Code для полного обзора жизненного цикла PR","ar":"مراجعة تصحيح الأخطاء التلقائية ل PR هي خدمة تستخدم واجهة سطر الأوامر من كلود كود لتنفيذ مراجعة شاملة ل دورة حياة PR","en":"Automated PR code review service using Claude Code CLI — polls or listens via webhooks, posts review comments with full PR lifecycle state tracking"},"definition":{"en":"Automated PR code review service using Claude Code CLI — polls or listens via webhooks, posts review comments with full PR lifecycle state tracking"},"features":{"zh":["自动化 PR 代码审查","跟踪整个 PR 生命周期","提供操作诊断","支持 Claude Code CLI","可配置的审查流程"],"ja":["PR コードレビューの自動化","全 PR ライフサイクルの追跡","操作可能な診断の提供","Claude Code CLI のサポート","カスタマイズ可能なレビュー プロセス"],"ko":["PR 코드 리뷰 자동화","전체 PR 生命周期 추적","작업 가능한 진단 제공","Claude Code CLI 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 리뷰 프로세스"],"es":["Revisión automática de código","Diagnóstico de problemas en el ciclo de vida de las solicitudes de extracción","Uso de Claude Code CLI","Seguimiento del estado de las solicitudes de extracción","Comentarios de revisión personalizados"],"fr":["Révision automatique de code","Diagnostic des problèmes dans le cycle de vie des demandes d''extraction","Utilisation de Claude Code CLI","Suivi de l''état des demandes d''extraction","Commentaires de révision personnalisés"],"de":["Automatisierte Code-Überprüfung","Diagnose von Problemen im Lebenszyklus von Pull-Requests","Verwendung von Claude Code CLI","Verfolgung des Status von Pull-Requests","Personalisierte Überprüfungskommentare"],"pt":["Revisão automática do ciclo de vida do PR","Utilização da CLI do Claude Code","Rastreamento completo do estado do PR","Diagnóstico ação de problemas no fluxo de trabalho","Integração com webhooks para atualizações em tempo real"],"ru":["Автоматический обзор жизненного цикла PR","Использование CLI от Claude Code","Полное отслеживание состояния PR","Диагностика и исправление проблем в рабочем процессе","Интеграция с вебхуками для обновлений в реальном времени"],"ar":["مراجعة تلقائية ل دورة حياة PR","استخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر من كلود كود","مراقبة كاملة ل حالة PR","تشخيص و تصحيح مشاكل في proceso التطوير","دمج مع الويب هوك لتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","调试助手","自动化","PR 生命周期","Claude Code CLI","代码审查工具"],"ja":["コードレビュー","デバッグアシスタント","自動化","PR ライフサイクル","Claude Code CLI","コードレビューツール"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","디버깅 어시스턴트","자동화","PR 生命周期","Claude Code CLI","코드 리뷰 도구"],"es":["revisión de depuración automática de PR","Claude Code CLI","ciclo de vida de las solicitudes de extracción","diagnóstico de problemas","seguridad del código","eficiencia del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["révision automatique de débogage de PR","Claude Code CLI","cycle de vie des demandes d''extraction","diagnostic des problèmes","sécurité du code","efficacité du flux de travail"],"de":["automatisierte PR-Debug-Überprüfung","Claude Code CLI","Lebenszyklus von Pull-Requests","Problemdiagnose","Codesicherheit","Arbeitsablauffeffizienz"],"pt":["revisão de depuração automática de PR","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","CLI do Claude Code","revisão de código","depuração de código","desenvolvedores de software"],"ru":["автоматический обзор отладки PR","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс разработки","CLI от Claude Code","обзор кода","отладка кода","разработчики программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مراجعة تصحيح الأخطاء التلقائية ل PR","تطوير البرمجيات","processo التطوير","واجهة سطر الأوامر من كلود كود","مراجعة الكود","تصحيح الأخطاء في الكود","مطورو البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"martin-janci","repo":"claude-code-reviewer","repoPath":"martin-janci/claude-code-reviewer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug-review","description":"Trace a specific PR through the review pipeline to diagnose failures.","bodyPreview":"You are a debugging assistant for diagnosing PR review issues in the claude-code-reviewer service. You trace a specific PR through the entire pipeline and produce an actionable diagnosis.\n\n## Input\n\n**Required:** A PR identifier — `owner/repo#N` or just `N` (PR number).\n\nIf no argument is provided, ask the user for a PR number.\n\n## Step 1: Load PR State\n\nRead `data/state.json` and find the PR entry. If only a number is given, search all entries for a matching `number` field. If not found, report","body":"You are a debugging assistant for diagnosing PR review issues in the claude-code-reviewer service. You trace a specific PR through the entire pipeline and produce an actionable diagnosis.\n\n## Input\n\n**Required:** A PR identifier — `owner/repo#N` or just `N` (PR number).\n\nIf no argument is provided, ask the user for a PR number.\n\n## Step 1: Load PR State\n\nRead `data/state.json` and find the PR entry. If only a number is given, search all entries for a matching `number` field. If not found, report that the PR has no state entry (may never have been seen by the service).\n\nDisplay a brief status summary: key, status, headSha (7 chars), lastReviewedSha (7 chars), title.\n\n## Step 2: Error Analysis\n\nIf `lastError` is set:\n\n1. Show the error details: `phase`, `message`, `occurredAt`\n2. Explain what the phase means:\n   - `diff_fetch` — failed to fetch the PR diff via `gh pr diff`\n   - `clone_prepare` — failed to clone/fetch the repo or create a worktree\n   - `claude_review` — Claude CLI returned an error or timed out\n   - `comment_post` — failed to post the review comment/PR review to GitHub\n3. Show `consecutiveErrors` vs `maxRetries` (default: 3)\n4. Calculate current backoff: `60s * 2^(consecutiveErrors - 1)`\n5. Show when the backoff expires: `lastError.occurredAt + backoff`\n\nIf no errors, note that the error tracking is clean.\n\n## Step 3: Review History\n\nList all `ReviewRecord` entries:\n- sha (7 chars) | reviewedAt | verdict | posted | findings breakdown | commentId/reviewId\n\nHighlight:\n- Reviews with `posted: false` (review ran but comment failed to post)\n- Reviews with blocking findings (severity: \"issue\" or blocking: true)\n- The most recent review''s verdict and whether it matches the current state\n\n## Step 4: Skip Analysis\n\nIf status is `skipped`:\n- Show `skipReason` and explain:\n  - `draft` — PR is marked as draft; clears when marked ready_for_review\n  - `wip_title` — title starts with \"WIP\"; clears when title is edited\n  - `diff_too_large` — diff exceeds `maxDiffLines`; show `skipDiffLines` vs limit\n- Whether the skip condition could clear automatically: `draft` clears on `ready_for_review` event; `wip_title` clears when title is edited to remove WIP prefix; `diff_too_large` clears when new commits are pushed (SHA changes), then the diff is re-checked on next review attempt\n\n## Step 5: shouldReview Simulation\n\nWalk through the gating logic in `src/state/decisions.ts` with the current PR state:\n\n1. Terminal state check (merged/closed)\n2. In-progress lock (reviewing)\n3. Config-based skips (skipDrafts + isDraft, skipWip + title starts with \"wip\")\n4. Skipped state (still skipped after evaluateTransitions clears conditions)\n5. Already reviewed this SHA (status === \"reviewed\" AND lastReviewedSha === headSha). **Bypass:** `forceReview` skips this gate.\n6. Debounce check (lastPushAt age vs debouncePeriodSeconds). **Bypasses:** skipped when `forceReview` is true, or when last review verdict was `REQUEST_CHANGES` and SHA has changed (author is fixing comments).\n7. Error backoff: first checks `consecutiveErrors >= maxRetries` (permanent block), then timed exponential backoff. **Bypass:** `forceReview` skips both checks.\n8. Ready states (pending_review, changes_pushed, error, reviewed with new SHA)\n\nFor each gate, report **pass** or **blocked** with the specific values. Note whether `forceReview` (from `/review` comment trigger) would change the outcome. Stop at the first blocking gate.\n\nRead `config.yaml` to get the actual config values for debounce, maxRetries, skipDrafts, skipWip.\n\n## Step 6: Clone/Worktree Check\n\nIf codebase access is enabled (`review.codebaseAccess: true` in config):\n\n- Check if a bare clone exists: `ls data/clones/<owner>/<repo>` (or configured `cloneDir`). Note: the directory has no `.git` suffix despite being a bare clone.\n- Check for worktree: `ls data/clones/<owner>/<repo>--pr-<N>` (double dash `--pr-`)\n- Report existence and age (last modified time)\n- If missing, note that it will be created on next review\n\n## Step 7: Diff Size Check\n\nRun: `gh pr diff <N> --repo <owner>/<repo> | wc -l`\n\nCompare against `maxDiffLines` from config. Report whether the diff would be skipped for size.\n\nIf `gh` fails, report the error (may indicate auth issues or PR not found).\n\n## Step 8: Diagnosis Summary\n\nProduce a summary with:\n\n1. **Root cause** — the primary issue (e.g., \"stuck in error state due to repeated claude_review failures\")\n2. **Current blocking gate** — which shouldReview gate is preventing the next review\n3. **Recommendations** — actionable steps:\n   - For errors: check Claude CLI auth, check GH_TOKEN, retry manually\n   - For skipped: un-draft the PR, rename title, reduce diff size\n   - For stale review: push new commits or force re-review with `/review` comment\n   - For stuck: manually edit state.json to reset consecutiveErrors, or delete the entry\n   - For missing state: the poller should pick it up on next cycle, or send a test webhook\n\n## Notes\n\n- If `gh` CLI is not available or not authenticated, skip Step 7 and note it\n- All timestamps should be shown in human-readable format with relative age (e.g., \"2h ago\")\n- Keep the output focused and actionable — this is for debugging, not exploration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:01:36.182Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents leveraging Claude Code CLI for automated PR analysis and debugging","zh":"非常适合利用 Claude Code CLI 进行自动化 PR 分析和调试的代码审查智能体","ja":"Claude Code CLIを活用した自動PR分析とデバッグを行うコードレビューエージェントに最適です","ko":"Claude Code CLI를 활용하여 자동화된 PR 분석 및 디버깅을 수행하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que utilizan Claude Code CLI para el análisis automatizado de PR y depuración","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code utilisant Claude Code CLI pour l''analyse automatisée des PR et le débogage","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die Claude Code CLI für die automatisierte PR-Analyse und Fehlersuche nutzen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que utilizam a CLI do Claude Code para análise e depuração automatizada de PR","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, использующих Claude Code CLI для автоматизированного анализа и отладки PR","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكودية الذين يستفيدون من واجهة سطر الأوامر Claude Code للتحليل التلقائي وتحليل الأعطال لمراجعة PR"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track the full PR lifecycle, poll or listen via webhooks, and post review comments using data from ''data/state.json'' files, enabling seamless integration with GitHub PR workflows via CLI","zh":"使智能体能够跟踪完整的 PR 生命周期，通过 Webhook 轮询或监听，并使用来自 ''data/state.json'' 文件的数据发布审查评论，从而通过 CLI 实现与 GitHub PR 工作流的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントがPRの完全なライフサイクルを追跡し、Webhook経由でポーリングまたはリスニングを行い、''data/state.json''ファイルからのデータを使用してレビューコメントを投稿できるようにし、CLIを介したGitHub PRワークフローとのシームレスな統合を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 전체 PR 라이프사이클을 추적하고, 웹훅을 통해 폴링 또는 수신하며, ''data/state.json'' 파일의 데이터를 사용하여 리뷰 코멘트를 게시할 수 있도록 하여 CLI를 통한 GitHub PR 워크플로우와의 원활한 통합을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes rastrear el ciclo de vida completo de la PR, sondear o escuchar a través de webhooks, y publicar comentarios de revisión utilizando datos de archivos ''data/state.json'', lo que permite una integración perfecta con los flujos de trabajo de PR de GitHub mediante CLI","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre le cycle de vie complet des PR, d''interroger ou d''écouter via des webhooks, et de publier des commentaires de revue en utilisant les données des fichiers ''data/state.json'', permettant une intégration transparente avec les workflows de PR GitHub via CLI","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den gesamten PR-Lebenszyklus zu verfolgen, über Webhooks abzufragen oder zu lauschen und Überprüfungskommentare unter Verwendung von Daten aus ''data/state.json''-Dateien zu posten, was eine nahtlose Integration in GitHub-PR-Workflows über die CLI ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear o ciclo de vida completo do PR, pesquisar ou ouvir via webhooks e postar comentários de revisão usando dados de arquivos ''data/state.json'', permitindo integração sem problemas com fluxos de trabalho de PR do GitHub via CLI","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать полный жизненный цикл PR, опрашивать или слушать через вебхуки и публиковать комментарии к обзору, используя данные из файлов ''data/state.json'', обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с рабочими процессами PR GitHub через CLI","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تتبع دورة حياة مراجعة PR الكاملة، والاستطلاع أو الاستماع عبر الويب هوك، ومنشور تعليقات المراجعة باستخدام البيانات من ملفات ''data/state.json''، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع سير عمل GitHub PR عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging PR review issues","Tracking PR lifecycle states","Automating code review comments"],"zh":["调试 PR 审查问题","跟踪 PR 生命周期状态","自动化代码审查评论"],"ja":["PRレビュー問題のデバッグ","PRライフサイクル状態の追跡","コードレビューコメントの自動化"],"ko":["PR 리뷰 문제 디버깅","PR 라이프사이클 상태 추적","코드 리뷰 코멘트 자동화"],"es":["Depuración de problemas en la revisión de PR","Seguimiento de los estados del ciclo de vida de la PR","Automatización de comentarios en la revisión de código"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de revue de PR","Suivi des états du cycle de vie des PR","Automatisation des commentaires de revue de code"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei PR-Review-Problemen","Verfolgung von PR-Lebenszyklusstatus","Automatisierung von Code-Review-Kommentaren"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de revisão de PR","Rastreamento de estados de ciclo de vida de PR","Automatização de comentários de revisão de código"],"ru":["Отладка проблем обзора PR","Отслеживание состояний жизненного цикла PR","Автоматизация комментариев кодового обзора"],"ar":["تحليل أعطال مراجعة PR","تتبع حالات دورة حياة مراجعة PR","تأليف تعليقات مراجعة الكود تلقائيًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code CLI","Needs access to ''data/state.json'' files","PR identifier required (owner/repo#N or N)"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code CLI","需要访问 ''data/state.json'' 文件","需要 PR 标识符（owner/repo#N 或 N）"],"ja":["Claude Code CLIが必要","''data/state.json''ファイルへのアクセスが必要","PR識別子が必要（owner/repo#N または N）"],"ko":["Claude Code CLI 필요","''data/state.json'' 파일에 대한 액세스 필요","PR 식별자 필요(owner/repo#N 또는 N)"],"es":["Requiere Claude Code CLI","Necesita acceso a los archivos ''data/state.json''","Se requiere un identificador de PR (propietario/repo#N o N)"],"fr":["Nécessite Claude Code CLI","Nécessite un accès aux fichiers ''data/state.json''","Identifiant de PR requis (propriétaire/repo#N ou N)"],"de":["Erfordert Claude Code CLI","Benötigt Zugriff auf ''data/state.json''-Dateien","PR-Kennung erforderlich (Eigentümer/Repo#N oder N)"],"pt":["Requer a CLI do Claude Code","Necessita acesso a arquivos ''data/state.json''","Identificador de PR necessário (owner/repo#N ou N)"],"ru":["Требуется Claude Code CLI","Требуется доступ к файлам ''data/state.json''","Требуется идентификатор PR (owner/repo#N или N)"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة سطر الأوامر Claude Code","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى ملفات ''data/state.json''","مُعرّف مراجعة PR مطلوب (owner/repo#N أو N)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
