n"],"pt":["Análise de resultados de simulações","Fornecimento de parâmetros e observáveis","Cálculo de média e erro padrão","Suporte a diretórios com arquivos bin_*.h5","Integração com bibliotecas Python"],"ru":["Анализ результатов симуляций","Предоставление параметров и наблюдаемых","Расчет среднего значения и стандартной ошибки","Поддержка директорий с файлами bin_*.h5","Интеграция с библиотеками Python"],"ar":["تحليل نتائج المحاكاة","توفير معاملات و متغيرات قابلة لل观察","حساب متوسط و خطأ معياري","دعم دليل مع ملفات bin_*.h5","التكامل مع مكتبات Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DQMC","模拟结果分析","可观测量","平均值","标准误差","Python","dqmc-analyze"],"ja":["DQMC","シミュレーション結果分析","可観測量","平均値","標準誤差","Python","dqmc-analyze"],"ko":["DQMC","시뮬레이션 결과 분석","관측 가능한 값","평균","표준 오차","Python","dqmc-analyze"],"es":["dqmc-analyze","análisis de resultados","simulaciones dqmc","código Python","parámetros","valores de error estándar","bin_*.h5","nombres de observables"],"fr":["dqmc-analyze","analyse de résultats","simulations dqmc","code Python","paramètres","erreurs standard","bin_*.h5","noms d''observables"],"de":["dqmc-analyze","Ergebnisanalyse","dqmc-Simulationen","Python-Code","Parameter","Standardfehler","bin_*.h5","Beobachternamen"],"pt":["dqmc-analyze","análise de simulações","parâmetros e observáveis","média e erro padrão","Python","simulações numéricas"],"ru":["dqmc-analyze","анализ симуляций","параметры и наблюдаемые","среднее значение и стандартная ошибка","Python","численные симуляции"],"ar":["dqmc-analyze","تحليل المحاكاة","معاملات و متغيرات قابلة لل观察","متوسط و خطأ معياري","Python","محاكاة عددية"]}},"owner":"edwnh","repo":"dqmc","repoPath":"edwnh/dqmc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dqmc-analyze","description":"Extract physical observables with error estimates from completed DQMC simulations. Use when computing density, double occupancy, spin correlations, structure factors, or any measured quantity from simulation data.","bodyPreview":"# Analyze Results\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Directory containing `bin_*.h5` files (completed simulations)\n- Observable names (see table below)\n\n## Outputs\n\n- Dictionary with parameters and `(mean, stderr)` tuples for each observable\n\n## Procedure\n\n**Basic analysis:**\n```python\nfrom dqmc_util import analyze_hub\n\ndata = analyze_hub.get(\"data/run/\", \"sign\", \"den\", \"zzr\")\n\nprint(f\"sign = {data[''sign''][0]:.4f} +/- {data[''sign''][1]:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"density = {data[''den''][0]:.4f} +/- {data[''den''][1]:.4f}\")\n```\n\n**Av","body":"# Analyze Results\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Directory containing `bin_*.h5` files (completed simulations)\n- Observable names (see table below)\n\n## Outputs\n\n- Dictionary with parameters and `(mean, stderr)` tuples for each observable\n\n## Procedure\n\n**Basic analysis:**\n```python\nfrom dqmc_util import analyze_hub\n\ndata = analyze_hub.get(\"data/run/\", \"sign\", \"den\", \"zzr\")\n\nprint(f\"sign = {data[''sign''][0]:.4f} +/- {data[''sign''][1]:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"density = {data[''den''][0]:.4f} +/- {data[''den''][1]:.4f}\")\n```\n\n**Available observables:**\n\n| Name | Description | Requires |\n|------|-------------|----------|\n| `sign` | Fermion sign | - |\n| `den` | Density <n> | - |\n| `docc` | Double occupancy <n_up n_down> | - |\n| `gr`, `gk` | Green''s function (real/k-space) | - |\n| `nnr`, `nnq` | Density correlator / structure factor | - |\n| `zzr`, `zzq` | Spin-z correlator / structure factor | - |\n| `xxr` | Spin-x correlator | - |\n| `swq0` | S-wave pair structure factor | - |\n| `nnrw0`, `zzrw0` | Zero-freq susceptibilities | `period_uneqlt > 0` |\n| `dwq0t` | D-wave pair susceptibility | `period_uneqlt > 0` |\n\n**Collect from multiple directories:**\n```python\nimport os\n\ndef collect_results(base_dir, observables):\n    results = []\n    for subdir in sorted(os.listdir(base_dir)):\n        path = os.path.join(base_dir, subdir)\n        if os.path.isdir(path):\n            try:\n                results.append(analyze_hub.get(path + \"/\", *observables))\n            except Exception as e:\n                print(f\"Skipping {path}: {e}\")\n    return results\n```\n\n**Compute derived quantities:**\n```python\n# Magnetic moment squared from spin correlator\npath = \"data/run/\"\ndata = analyze_hub.get(path, \"zzr\")\nmz2 = 4 * data[\"zzr\"][0][0, 0]       # [0] = mean, shape (Ny, Nx)\nmz2_err = 4 * data[\"zzr\"][1][0, 0]   # [1] = stderr\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n- [ ] Errorbar on sign is significantly less than mean. Otherwise, sign problem is too severe.\n- [ ] Errorbars on observable are reasonable (not >> mean)\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n| Symptom | Cause | Recovery |\n|---------|-------|----------|\n| KeyError for observable | Observable not computed | Check `period_uneqlt` setting |\n| \"No files found\" | Wrong path or no `bin_*.h5` | Verify directory structure |\n| Large error bars | Insufficient statistics | Run more sweeps or bins |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:02:14.559Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Quantum Physics Simulation Agents analyzing Determinant Quantum Monte Carlo (DQMC) data outputs.","zh":"适用于量子物理模拟代理分析决定性量子 蒙特卡罗（DQMC）数据输出。","ja":"量子物理シミュレーションエージェントが決定論的量子モンテカルロ（DQMC）データ出力を分析するのに適しています。","ko":"결정적 양자 몬테카로(DQMC) 데이터 출력을 분석하는 양자 물리 시뮬레이션 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de simulación de física cuántica que analizan datos de salida de Monte Carlo cuántico determinante (DQMC).","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de simulation de physique quantique analysant les données de sortie de Monte Carlo quantique déterminant (DQMC).","de":"Ideal für Quantenphysik-Simulationsagenten, die Determinant-Quanten-Monte-Carlo-(DQMC)-Datenoutputs analysieren.","pt":"Ideal for Quantum Physics Simulation Agents analyzing Determinant Quantum Monte Carlo (DQMC) data outputs.","ru":"Ideal for Quantum Physics Simulation Agents analyzing Determinant Quantum Monte Carlo (DQMC) data outputs.","ar":"Ideal for Quantum Physics Simulation Agents analyzing Determinant Quantum Monte Carlo (DQMC) data outputs."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct parsing and statistical analysis of HDF5-formatted DQMC simulation results, extracting (mean, stderr) tuples for specific observables like sign, density, and zzr correlations. Integrates with dqmc_util library for specialized quantum many-body physics calculations.","zh":"实现直接解析和统计分析HDF5格式的DQMC模拟结果，提取特定观测量（如符号、密度和zzr相关性）的（均值、stderr）元组。集成了dqmc_util库，用于专门的量子多体物理计算。","ja":"HDF5形式のDQMCシミュレーションの結果を直接解析して統計分析を行い、符号、密度、zzr相関関数などの特定の観測量の（平均、stderr）タプルを抽出する。dqmc_utilライブラリと統合して、専門の量子多体物理計算を行う。","ko":"HDF5 형식의 DQMC 시뮬레이션 결과를 직접 파싱하고 통계 분석을 수행하여 특정 관측값(예: 부호, 밀도, zzr 상관관계)의 (평균, stderr) 튜플을 추출합니다. dqmc_util 라이브러리와 통합하여 전문적인 양자 다체 fizik 계산을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite el análisis directo y estadístico de resultados de simulación DQMC en formato HDF5, extrayendo tuplas (media, stderr) para observables específicos como signo, densidad y correlaciones zzr. Se integra con la biblioteca dqmc_util para cálculos de física cuántica de muchos cuerpos especializados.","fr":"Permet l''analyse directe et statistique des résultats de simulation DQMC au format HDF5, en extrayant des tuples (moyenne, stderr) pour des observables spécifiques comme le signe, la densité et les corrélations zzr. S''intègre à la bibliothèque dqmc_util pour des calculs de physique quantique à plusieurs corps spécialisés.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte und statistische Analyse von DQMC-Simulationsergebnissen im HDF5-Format, wobei (Mittelwert, stderr)-Tupel für bestimmte Observablen wie Vorzeichen, Dichte und zzr-Korrelationen extrahiert werden. Integriert sich mit der dqmc_util-Bibliothek für spezialisierte Quanten-Vielkörper-Physik-Berechnungen.","pt":"Enables direct parsing and statistical analysis of HDF5-formatted DQMC simulation results, extracting (mean, stderr) tuples for specific observables like sign, density, and zzr correlations. Integrates with dqmc_util library for specialized quantum many-body physics calculations.","ru":"Enables direct parsing and statistical analysis of HDF5-formatted DQMC simulation results, extracting (mean, stderr) tuples for specific observables like sign, density, and zzr correlations. Integrates with dqmc_util library for specialized quantum many-body physics calculations.","ar":"Enables direct parsing and statistical analysis of HDF5-formatted DQMC simulation results, extracting (mean, stderr) tuples for specific observables like sign, density, and zzr correlations. Integrates with dqmc_util library for specialized quantum many-body physics calculations."},"useCases":{"en":["Processing bin_*.h5 simulation output files","Calculating statistical error bars for quantum observables","Automating analysis pipelines for Hubbard model simulations"],"zh":["处理bin_*.h5模拟输出文件","计算量子观测量的统计误差条","自动化Hubbard模型模拟的分析流水线"],"ja":["bin_*.h5シミュレーション出力ファイルを処理する","量子観測量の統計誤差バーを計算する","ハバード模型シミュレーションの分析パイプラインを自動化する"],"ko":["bin_*.h5 시뮬레이션 출력 파일 처리","양자 관측값의 통계 오차 막대를 계산","허바드 모델 시뮬레이션의 분석 파이프라인 자동화"],"es":["Procesamiento de archivos de salida de simulación bin_*.h5","Cálculo de barras de error estadístico para observables cuánticos","Automatización de tuberías de análisis para simulaciones del modelo de Hubbard"],"fr":["Traitement des fichiers de sortie de simulation bin_*.h5","Calcul des barres d''erreur statistique pour les observables quantiques","Automatisation des pipelines d''analyse pour les simulations du modèle de Hubbard"],"de":["Verarbeitung von Simulationsausgabedateien bin_*.h5","Berechnung von statistischen Fehlerbalken für Quantenobservablen","Automatisierung von Analysepipelines für Hubbard-Modell-Simulationen"],"pt":["Processing bin_*.h5 simulation output files","Calculating statistical error bars for quantum observables","Automating analysis pipelines for Hubbard model simulations"],"ru":["Processing bin_*.h5 simulation output files","Calculating statistical error bars for quantum observables","Automating analysis pipelines for Hubbard model simulations"],"ar":["Processing bin_*.h5 simulation output files","Calculating statistical error bars for quantum observables","Automating analysis pipelines for Hubbard model simulations"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires directory containing bin_*.h5 files","Depends on dqmc_util Python library","Specific to quantum Monte Carlo observables (sign, den, zzr)"],"zh":["需要包含bin_*.h5文件的目录","依赖于dqmc_util Python库","仅适用于量子蒙特卡罗观测量（符号、密度、zzr）"],"ja":["bin_*.h5ファイルを含むディレクトリが必要","dqmc_util Pythonライブラリに依存する","量子モンテカルロ観測量（符号、密度、zzr）に限定される"],"ko":["bin_*.h5 파일을 포함하는 디렉토리가 필요","dqmc_util Python 라이브러리에 의존","양자 몬테카로 관측값(부호, 밀도, zzr)에 한정"],"es":["Requiere un directorio que contenga archivos bin_*.h5","Depende de la biblioteca Python dqmc_util","Específico para observables de Monte Carlo cuántico (signo, den, zzr)"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire contenant des fichiers bin_*.h5","Dépend de la bibliothèque Python dqmc_util","Spécifique aux observables de Monte Carlo quantique (signe, den, zzr)"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verzeichnis, das Dateien bin_*.h5 enthält","Hängt von der Python-Bibliothek dqmc_util ab","Spezifisch für Quanten-Monte-Carlo-Observablen (Vorzeichen, Dichte, zzr)"],"pt":["Requires directory containing bin_*.h5 files","Depends on dqmc_util Python library","Specific to quantum Monte Carlo observables (sign, den, zzr)"],"ru":["Requires directory containing bin_*.h5 files","Depends on dqmc_util Python library","Specific to quantum Monte Carlo observables (sign, den, zzr)"],"ar":["Requires directory containing bin_*.h5 files","Depends on dqmc_util Python library","Specific to quantum Monte Carlo observables (sign, den, zzr)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
