dian","Accès aux documents et transcriptions","Mises à jour en temps réel","N''a pas besoin d''appels d''API"],"de":["Lokales Speichern von Besprechungsnotizen","Synchronisation mit Obsidian","Zugriff auf Dokumente und Transkriptionen","Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen","Benötigt keine API-Aufrufe"],"pt":["Integração com Claude Code e Obsidian","Gerenciamento de projetos e tarefas","Registro de reuniões com notas e transcrições","Atualizações em tempo real","Armazenamento local de dados"],"ru":["Интеграция с Claude Code и Obsidian","Управление проектами и задачами","Запись встреч с заметками и транскрипциями","Обновления в режиме реального времени","Местное хранение данных"],"ar":["التكامل مع كلود كود وأوبسيديان","إدارة المشاريع والمهام","تسجيل الاجتماعات مع الملاحظات والنسخ","التحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","تخزين البيانات المحلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Granola 技术","AI 会议笔记","Obsidian 协同","开发效率","开发工具","实时会议记录","本地数据存储","多语言开发"],"ja":["Granola 技術","AI ミーティングノート","Obsidian 連携","開発効率","開発ツール","リアルタイムミーティング記録","ローカルデータストレージ","多言語開発"],"ko":["Granola 기술","AI 회의 기록","Obsidian 연동","개발 효율성","개발 도구","실시간 회의 기록","로컬 데이터 저장소","다중 언어 개발"],"es":["Granola","Claude Code","Obsidian","notas de reuniones","sincronización local","desarrollo de software","productividad","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["Granola","Claude Code","Obsidian","notes de réunions","synchronisation locale","développement de logiciels","productivité","gestion de projets"],"de":["Granola","Claude Code","Obsidian","Besprechungsnotizen","lokale Synchronisation","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projetos","reuniões de negócios","integração de ferramentas","armazenamento de dados"," Claude Code","Obsidian"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами","бизнес-встречи","интеграция инструментов","хранение данных","Claude Code","Obsidian"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع","الاجتماعات التجارية","تكامل الأدوات","تخزين البيانات","كلود كود","أوبسيديان"]}},"owner":"ArtemXTech","repo":"claude-code-obsidian-starter","repoPath":"ArtemXTech/claude-code-obsidian-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"granola","description":"Query and sync Granola meetings to Obsidian vault. Use when user mentions Granola, meeting transcripts, or wants to sync meeting notes. Reads from local cache - no API needed.","bodyPreview":"# Granola Skill\n\nQuery and sync Granola AI meeting notes to Obsidian vault.\n\n## How It Works\n\nGranola stores everything locally at `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/cache-v3.json`:\n- Documents (meetings with title, notes, people)\n- Transcripts (real-time, with timestamps and source)\n- Updates in real-time as you record\n\nNo API calls needed - reads directly from local cache.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# List all meetings\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py list\n\n# Get specific me","body":"# Granola Skill\n\nQuery and sync Granola AI meeting notes to Obsidian vault.\n\n## How It Works\n\nGranola stores everything locally at `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/cache-v3.json`:\n- Documents (meetings with title, notes, people)\n- Transcripts (real-time, with timestamps and source)\n- Updates in real-time as you record\n\nNo API calls needed - reads directly from local cache.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# List all meetings\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py list\n\n# Get specific meeting with transcript\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py get <id>\n\n# Sync new meetings to vault\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync\n\n# Sync specific meeting\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync --id <id>\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### list\n\nList all Granola meetings with sync status.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py list\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py list --limit 5\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\n[✓] 2026-01-09  Team Sync - Weekly\n    ID: abc123...\n    Transcript: 450 segments, ~86 min\n\n[ ] 2026-01-10  Team Standup\n    ID: def456...\n    Transcript: 120 segments, ~15 min\n```\n\n- `[✓]` = already synced to vault\n- `[ ]` = not synced yet\n\n### get\n\nView full meeting details and transcript.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py get <id>\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py get <id> --no-transcript\n```\n\n### sync\n\nSync meetings to `Meetings/` as structured Markdown.\n\n```bash\n# Sync new meetings only\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync\n\n# Sync specific meeting\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync --id <id>\n\n# Re-sync all (overwrites existing)\npython3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync --all\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nSynced meetings are saved to `Meetings/` with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntype: granola-meeting\ndate: 2026-01-09\ntime: \"19:30\"\nduration_min: 86\ngranola_id: abc123...\npeople:\n  - \"[[Sarah Chen]]\"\ntopics: []\nstatus: raw\n---\n\n# Meeting Title\n\n## Notes\n\n(Your notes from Granola)\n\n## Transcript\n\n[19:30:45] 🎤 Hey, how''s it going?\n[19:30:48] 🎤 Great to meet you...\n```\n\n**Transcript icons:**\n- 🎤 = microphone (you)\n- 🔊 = system audio (others on call)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Record meeting** in Granola (real-time transcription)\n2. **Sync to vault**: `python3 .claude/skills/granola/scripts/granola.py sync`\n3. **Process meeting**: Extract action items, update people notes\n4. **Mark as processed**: Change `status: raw` to `status: processed`\n\n## Querying with Bases\n\nUse `Granola.base` to query synced meetings:\n\n| View | Filter |\n|------|--------|\n| Recent | Last 7 days |\n| Needs Processing | status = raw |\n| By Person | Grouped by people field |\n\n## Data Structure\n\n**Local cache:** `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/cache-v3.json`\n\n```\ncache (JSON string) → state →\n  ├── documents: {id: {title, notes_plain, notes_markdown, people, created_at}}\n  └── transcripts: {id: [{text, source, start_timestamp, end_timestamp}]}\n```\n\n**Transcript segment:**\n```json\n{\n  \"text\": \"Hey, how''s it going?\",\n  \"source\": \"microphone\",\n  \"start_timestamp\": \"2026-01-09T19:30:45.123Z\",\n  \"end_timestamp\": \"2026-01-09T19:30:48.456Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n- **Real-time access**: Cache updates as you record - can query mid-meeting\n- **Free tier hack**: Sync hourly to bypass 7-day history limit\n- **No auth needed**: Uses local files, not API\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:03:54.890Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Agents needing local meeting note synchronization and real-time transcript analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要本地会议笔记同步和实时转录分析的代理","ja":"エージェントがローカルミーティングノートの同期とリアルタイムのトランスクリプト分析を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"로컬 미팅 노트 동기화 및 실시간 전사 분석이 필요한 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes que necesitan sincronización de notas de reuniones locales y análisis de transcripciones en tiempo real.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents ayant besoin d''une synchronisation de notes de réunion locales et d''une analyse de transcripts en temps réel.","de":"Perfekt für Agenten, die eine lokale Synchronisierung von Besprechungsnotizen und eine Echtzeit-Transkriptanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes que precisam de sincronização de notas de reunião locais e análise de transcrição em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, которым необходима синхронизация местных заметок о встречах и анализ транскриптов в реальном времени.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى مزامنة ملاحظات الاجتماعات المحلية وتحليل النصوص الحقيقية في الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query and sync Granola AI meeting notes to Obsidian vaults, leveraging local cache files like `cache-v3.json` for real-time updates and transcripts with timestamps and source information, all without requiring API calls.","zh":"赋予代理查询和同步Granola AI会议笔记到Obsidian库的能力，利用本地缓存文件如`cache-v3.json`进行实时更新和带时间戳和源信息的转录，而无需进行API调用","ja":"エージェントがGranola AIのミーティングノートをObsidianのバウルトに同期し、`cache-v3.json`のようなローカルキャッシュファイルを使用してリアルタイムで更新やタイムスタンプとソース情報を付けたトランスクリプトを取得する機能を提供し、APIコールを必要としない","ko":"에이전트가 Granola AI 미팅 노트를 Obsidian 볼트에 동기화하고 `cache-v3.json` 같은 로컬 캐시 파일을 사용하여 실시간 업데이트와 타임스탬프 및 소스 정보가 포함된 전사를 얻을 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, API 호출을 필요로 하지 않음","es":"Permite a los agentes consultar y sincronizar las notas de reuniones de Granola AI con los vaults de Obsidian, aprovechando archivos de caché locales como `cache-v3.json` para actualizaciones y transcripciones en tiempo real con marcas de tiempo y información de origen, todo sin requerir llamadas a la API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger et de synchroniser les notes de réunion Granola AI avec les coffres Obsidian, en exploitant les fichiers de cache locaux comme `cache-v3.json` pour des mises à jour et des transcripts en temps réel avec des horodatages et des informations de source, le tout sans nécessiter d''appels d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Granola-KI-Besprechungsnotizen mit Obsidian-Vaults abzufragen und zu synchronisieren, indem lokale Cache-Dateien wie `cache-v3.json` für Echtzeit-Updates und Transkripte mit Zeitstempeln und Quelleninformationen genutzt werden, alles ohne API-Aufrufe zu benötigen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes consultem e sincronizem as notas de reunião da Granola AI com cofres do Obsidian, utilizando arquivos de cache local como `cache-v3.json` para atualizações em tempo real e transcrições com carimbos de data/hora e informações de origem, tudo sem exigir chamadas de API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запрашивать и синхронизировать заметки о встречах Granola AI с хранилищами Obsidian, используя локальные кэш-файлы, такие как `cache-v3.json`, для обновлений в реальном времени и транскриптов с метками времени и информацией об источнике, все без необходимости вызовов API.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بالاستعلام عن مزامنة ملاحظات الاجتماعات من جرانولا أيه آي مع الخزائن أوبسيديان، باستخدام ملفات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت المحلية مثل `cache-v3.json` للتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي والنصوص مع توقيعات الوقت ومعلومات المصدر، كل ذلك دون الحاجة إلى استدعاءات واجهة البرنامج."},"useCases":{"en":["Syncing meeting notes to Obsidian for project management","Automating transcript analysis for daily routines","Generating client reports from local meeting data"],"zh":["将会议笔记同步到Obsidian用于项目管理","自动化转录分析用于日常例行程序","从本地会议数据生成客户报告"],"ja":["Obsidianにミーティングノートを同期してプロジェクト管理を行う","日常のルーティーンにトランスクリプト分析を自動化する","ローカルのミーティングデータからクライアントレポートを生成する"],"ko":["Obsidian에 미팅 노트를 동기화하여 프로젝트 관리를 수행","일상 루틴에 전사 분석을 자동화","로컬 미팅 데이터에서 클라이언트 리포트를 생성"],"es":["Sincronización de notas de reuniones con Obsidian para la gestión de proyectos","Automatización del análisis de transcripciones para rutinas diarias","Generación de informes de clientes a partir de datos de reuniones locales"],"fr":["Synchronisation des notes de réunion avec Obsidian pour la gestion de projets","Automatisation de l''analyse de transcripts pour les routines quotidiennes","Génération de rapports clients à partir de données de réunions locales"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Besprechungsnotizen mit Obsidian für das Projektmanagement","Automatisierung der Transkriptanalyse für tägliche Routinen","Erstellung von Kundenberichten aus lokalen Besprechungsdaten"],"pt":["Sincronização de notas de reunião com o Obsidian para gerenciamento de projetos","Automatização da análise de transcrições para rotinas diárias","Geração de relatórios de clientes a partir de dados de reunião local"],"ru":["Синхронизация заметок о встречах с Obsidian для управления проектами","Автоматизация анализа транскриптов для ежедневных рутин","Генерация отчетов клиентов из местных данных о встречах"],"ar":["مزامنة ملاحظات الاجتماعات مع أوبسيديان لإدارة المشاريع","آليّة تحليل النصوص للحصول على روتين يومي","توليد تقارير العملاء من بيانات الاجتماعات المحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local access to `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/` directory","Limited to Granola AI meeting notes and Obsidian vaults","Python 3.x required for script execution"],"zh":["需要访问`~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`目录","仅限Granola AI会议笔记和Obsidian库","需要Python 3.x来执行脚本"],"ja":["`~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","Granola AIのミーティングノートとObsidianのバウルトのみに限定","スクリプトの実行にはPython 3.xが必要"],"ko":["`~/Library/Application Support/Granola/` 디렉토리에 접근해야 함","Granola AI 미팅 노트와 Obsidian 볼트만 지원","스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 3.x가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso local al directorio `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","Limitado a notas de reuniones de Granola AI y vaults de Obsidian","Se requiere Python 3.x para la ejecución de scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès local au répertoire `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","Limité aux notes de réunion Granola AI et aux coffres Obsidian","Python 3.x est requis pour l''exécution de scripts"],"de":["Erfordert lokalen Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","Begrenzt auf Granola-KI-Besprechungsnotizen und Obsidian-Vaults","Python 3.x ist erforderlich für die Skriptausführung"],"pt":["Exige acesso local ao diretório `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","Limitado às notas de reunião da Granola AI e aos cofres do Obsidian","Requer Python 3.x para execução de scripts"],"ru":["Требует местного доступа к каталогу `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","Ограничен заметками о встречах Granola AI и хранилищами Obsidian","Требует Python 3.x для выполнения скриптов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول المحلي إلى الدليل `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/`","محدود بملاحظات الاجتماعات جرانولا أيه آي والخزائن أوبسيديان","يتطلب بايثون 3.x لتنفيذ البرامج النصية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
