 процесс","интеграция с uv","разработчики","структурированный рабочий процесс"],"ar":["Textum","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة العملية","متطلبات المشروع","تدفق العمل","التكامل مع uv","المطورون","عملية عمل منظمة"]}},"owner":"snakeying","repo":"Textum","repoPath":"snakeying/Textum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"textum","description":"Textum PRD→Scaffold→Story workflow for Codex with low-noise outputs and gate checks.","bodyPreview":"# Textum\n\nHard constraints:\n- Low-noise is non-negotiable (avoid attention/context pollution).\n- Multi-window: each stage is self-contained; do not narrate upstream/downstream flow.\n- Output “next step” as a stage name only.\n\nPrereq (runtime):\n- `uv` installed.\n- Run `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts` once (creates `.claude/skills/textum/scripts/.venv`).\n\nSupported stages:\n- PRD Plan → `references/prd-plan.md`\n- PRD Check → `references/prd-check.md`\n- PRD Render → `references/prd-","body":"# Textum\n\nHard constraints:\n- Low-noise is non-negotiable (avoid attention/context pollution).\n- Multi-window: each stage is self-contained; do not narrate upstream/downstream flow.\n- Output “next step” as a stage name only.\n\nPrereq (runtime):\n- `uv` installed.\n- Run `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts` once (creates `.claude/skills/textum/scripts/.venv`).\n\nSupported stages:\n- PRD Plan → `references/prd-plan.md`\n- PRD Check → `references/prd-check.md`\n- PRD Render → `references/prd-render.md`\n- PRD Slice → `references/prd-slice.md`\n- Scaffold Plan → `references/scaffold-plan.md`\n- Scaffold Render → `references/scaffold.md`\n- Scaffold Check → `references/scaffold-check.md`\n- Split Plan → `references/split-plan.md`\n- Split Generate → `references/split.md`\n- Split Check1 → `references/split-check1.md`\n- Split Check2 → `references/split-check2.md`\n- Split Checkout → `references/split-checkout.md`\n- Story Check → `references/story-check.md`\n- Story Pack → `references/story-pack.md`\n- Story Exec → `references/story.md`\n- Story Full Exec (experimental) → `references/story-full-exec.md`\n\nRouting:\n- CN intent examples:\n  - `PRD Plan`: 需求澄清 / 澄清需求 / PRD 计划\n  - `PRD Render`: 生成PRD / 渲染PRD / 输出PRD\n  - `PRD Check`: 校验PRD / 检查PRD / 门禁\n  - `PRD Slice`: PRD 切片 / 切片 / 低噪切片 / slice\n  - `Scaffold Plan`: 上下文提取 / 全局上下文 / Scaffold 计划\n  - `Scaffold Render`: 生成GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 渲染GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 输出GLOBAL-CONTEXT\n  - `Scaffold Check`: 校验GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 检查GLOBAL-CONTEXT / GC 门禁\n  - `Split Plan`: Story 拆分规划 / Split Plan / 拆分计划\n  - `Split Generate`: 生成Story / Split Generate / 拆分生成\n  - `Split Check1`: Split 校验1 / 拆分校验1 / 结构阈值校验\n  - `Split Check2`: Split 校验2 / 拆分校验2 / 引用一致性校验\n  - `Split Checkout`: Split Checkout / 依赖图 / 导出依赖图\n  - `Story Check`: Story 校验 / Story Check / 单 Story 门禁\n  - `Story Pack`: Story 执行包生成 / Story Pack / 生成执行包\n  - `Story Exec`: Story 执行 / Story Exec / 单 Story 执行\n  - `Story Full Exec`: Story 批量执行 / Story Full Exec / 试验性全执行\n- If intent is unclear, ask the user to pick one: `PRD Plan` / `PRD Check` / `PRD Render` / `PRD Slice` / `Scaffold Plan` / `Scaffold Render` / `Scaffold Check` / `Split Plan` / `Split Generate` / `Split Check1` / `Split Check2` / `Split Checkout` / `Story Check` / `Story Pack` / `Story Exec` / `Story Full Exec`.\n\nAlways:\n- For every `FAIL` item (in diagnostics/replan packs): include `loc/problem/expected/impact/fix`, and `fix` must be a single action.\n- Keep chat output low-noise: prefer paths (`wrote: docs/*`) over pasting long `FAIL` lists.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:03:17.625Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents requiring structured project requirement management with low-noise and multi-window capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要低噪声和多窗口能力的结构化项目管理的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"ノイズが少なくマルチウィンドウ機能を備えた構造化プロジェクト要件管理を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"저노이즈 및 멀티윈도우 기능을 갖춘 구조화된 프로젝트 요구사항 관리가 필요한 워크플로우 자동화 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo que requieren una gestión de requisitos de proyecto estructurada con capacidades de baja ruido y multi-ventana.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Flux de Travail nécessitant une gestion de exigences de projet structurée avec des capacités de faible bruit et multi-fenêtres.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungs-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Projektanforderungsverwaltung mit Low-Noise- und Multi-Fenster-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que exigem gerenciamento de requisitos de projeto estruturado com capacidades de baixo ruído e multi-janela.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих структурированного управления требованиями проекта с низким уровнем шума и возможностью многовиндовой обработки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي لتحسين تدفق العمل الذي يتطلب إدارة متطلبات المشروع المنظمة مع القدرات قليلة الضوضاء ومتعددة النوافذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain controllable processes through a 4-phase workflow with validation gates, utilizing uv for runtime synchronization and generating next steps as stage names, ensuring seamless project progression with minimal attention pollution.","zh":"通过带有验证门的四阶段工作流程，利用uv进行运行时同步并生成阶段名称作为后续步骤，确保项目无缝推进且注意力污染最小化，使代理能够维护可控流程。","ja":"検証ゲートを備えた4段階のワークフローにより、uvを使用したランタイム同期とステージ名としての次のステップの生成を通じて、注意力の汚染を最小限に抑えつつシームレスなプロジェクト進行を確保し、エージェントが制御可能なプロセスを維持できるようにします。","ko":"검증 게이트가 있는 4단계 워크플로우를 통해 uv를 사용한 런타임 동기화 및 단계 이름으로 다음 단계를 생성하여 주의력 오염을 최소화하면서 원활한 프로젝트 진행을 보장함으로써 에이전트가 제어 가능한 프로세스를 유지할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener procesos controlables a través de un flujo de trabajo de 4 fases con puertas de validación, utilizando uv para la sincronización en tiempo de ejecución y generando los siguientes pasos como nombres de etapa, garantizando una progresión de proyecto sin problemas con una mínima contaminación de atención.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des processus contrôlables à travers un flux de travail de 4 phases avec des portes de validation, en utilisant uv pour la synchronisation à l''exécution et en générant les prochaines étapes sous forme de noms d''étape, garantissant une progression de projet sans heurts avec une pollution d''attention minimale.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kontrollierbare Prozesse durch einen 4-Phasen-Workflow mit Validierungstoren zu maintainen, indem uv für die Laufzeitsynchronisation verwendet wird und die nächsten Schritte als Stagennamen generiert werden, um eine nahtlose Projektfortschritt mit minimaler Ablenkung zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a manter processos controláveis por meio de um fluxo de trabalho de 4 fases com portas de validação, utilizando uv para sincronização em tempo de execução e gerando próximas etapas como nomes de estágios, garantindo uma progressão de projeto sem problemas com poluição de atenção mínima.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать контролируемые процессы посредством 4-фазового рабочего процесса с валидационными ворота, используя uv для синхронизации во время выполнения и генерируя следующие шаги в качестве имен стадий, обеспечивающих бесперебойное развитие проекта с минимальным вниманием к загрязнению.","ar":"يضفي على العميل القدرة على الحفاظ على عمليات قابلة للسيطرة من خلال تدفق عمل يتكون من 4 مراحل مع بوابات التحقق، واستخدام uv لتزامن وقت التشغيل وتوليد الخطوات التالية باسم مراحل، مما يضمن تقدم المشروع بسلاسة مع تلوث انتباه أدنى حد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PRD Plan creation with references to `references/prd-plan.md`","Validating project requirements through PRD Check with `references/prd-check.md`","Rendering project details with PRD Render using `references/prd-render.md`"],"zh":["使用`references/prd-plan.md`自动创建PRD计划","通过`references/prd-check.md`进行PRD检查来验证项目需求","使用`references/prd-render.md`通过PRD渲染呈现项目详细信息"],"ja":["`references/prd-plan.md`を参照したPRD計画の自動作成","`references/prd-check.md`を使用したPRDチェックによるプロジェクト要件の検証","`references/prd-render.md`を使用したPRDレンダリングによるプロジェクト詳細の表示"],"ko":["`references/prd-plan.md` 참조를 통한 PRD 계획 자동 생성","`references/prd-check.md`를 사용한 PRD 체크를 통한 프로젝트 요구사항 검증","`references/prd-render.md`를 사용한 PRD 렌더링으로 프로젝트 세부 정보 표시"],"es":["Automatizar la creación del Plan PRD con referencias a `references/prd-plan.md`","Validar los requisitos del proyecto a través de la Verificación PRD con `references/prd-check.md`","Representar los detalles del proyecto con PRD Render utilizando `references/prd-render.md`"],"fr":["Automatiser la création du Plan PRD avec des références à `references/prd-plan.md`","Valider les exigences du projet à travers la Vérification PRD avec `references/prd-check.md`","Rendre les détails du projet avec PRD Render en utilisant `references/prd-render.md`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung des PRD-Plans mit Verweisen auf `references/prd-plan.md`","Validieren der Projektanforderungen durch die Überprüfung PRD mit `references/prd-check.md`","Darstellen der Projektdetails mit PRD Render unter Verwendung von `references/prd-render.md`"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação do Plano PRD com referências a `references/prd-plan.md`","Validar os requisitos do projeto por meio da Verificação PRD com `references/prd-check.md`","Renderizar detalhes do projeto com PRD Render usando `references/prd-render.md`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание плана PRD с ссылками на `references/prd-plan.md`","Проверять требования проекта с помощью Проверки PRD с `references/prd-check.md`","Отображать детали проекта с помощью PRD Render с использованием `references/prd-render.md`"],"ar":["تحسين إنشاء خطة PRD مع الإشارات إلى `references/prd-plan.md`","التحقق من متطلبات المشروع من خلال فحص PRD مع `references/prd-check.md`","إظهار تفاصيل المشروع مع إعادة عرض PRD باستخدام `references/prd-render.md`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `uv` installed","Needs initial runtime synchronization with `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Limited to specific supported stages: PRD Plan, PRD Check, PRD Render"],"zh":["需要安装`uv`","需要与`uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`进行初始运行时同步","仅限于特定支持的阶段：PRD计划、PRD检查、PRD渲染"],"ja":["`uv`のインストールが必要","`uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`による初期ランタイム同期が必要","特定のサポート段階に限定: PRD計画、PRDチェック、PRDレンダリング"],"ko":["`uv` 설치 필요","`uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`를 통한 초기 런타임 동기화 필요","특정 지원 단계로 제한됨: PRD 계획, PRD 체크, PRD 렌더링"],"es":["Requiere `uv` instalado","Necesita una sincronización inicial de tiempo de ejecución con `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Limitado a etapas específicas compatibles: Plan PRD, Verificación PRD, Renderizado PRD"],"fr":["Nécessite `uv` installé","A besoin d''une synchronisation initiale à l''exécution avec `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Limité à des étapes spécifiques prises en charge : Plan PRD, Vérification PRD, Render PRD"],"de":["Benötigt `uv` installiert","Benötigt eine anfängliche Laufzeitsynchronisation mit `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Begrenzt auf bestimmte unterstützte Stufen: PRD-Plan, PRD-Überprüfung, PRD-Render"],"pt":["Exige `uv` instalado","Necessita de sincronização inicial em tempo de execução com `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Limitado a estágios específicos com suporte: PRD Plan, PRD Check, PRD Render"],"ru":["Требует安装 `uv`","Требует начальной синхронизации во время выполнения с `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","Ограничен конкретными поддерживаемыми стадиями: PRD Plan, PRD Check, PRD Render"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `uv`","يحتاج إلى مزامنة وقت التشغيل الأولي مع `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts`","محدود بمستويات دعم محددة: خطة PRD، وفحص PRD، وترnder PRD"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('avivsinai/jenkins-cli/jk', 'community', 'avivsinai', 'jenkins-cli', 'avivsinai/jenkins-cli', 'jk', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:04:35.868Z', NULL, '{"id":"avivsinai/jenkins-cli/jk","name":"jk","description":{"zh":"jk是Jenkins控制器的GitHub CLI风格接口，提供现代化的可脚本化工作流","ja":"jkはJenkinsコントローラーのGitHub CLIスタイルインターフェースです","ko":"jk는 Jenkins 컨트롤러의 GitHub CLI 스타일 인터페이스입니다","es":"jk es una interfaz de línea de comandos de estilo GitHub para Jenkins, que ofrece flujos de trabajo modernos y scriptables para desarrolladores y operadores.","fr":"jk est une interface CLI de style GitHub pour Jenkins, qui propose des flux de travail modernes et scriptables pour les développeurs et les opérateurs.","de":"jk ist eine GitHub-ähnliche Kommandozeilenoberfläche für Jenkins, die moderne, skriptbare Workflows für Entwickler und Betreiber bietet.","pt":"JK é uma interface de linha de comando do Jenkins que fornece fluxos de trabalho modernos e scriptáveis para desenvolvedores e operadores.","ru":"JK — это интерфейс командной строки Jenkins, который предоставляет современные и скриптовые рабочие процессы для разработчиков и операторов.","ar":"JK هو واجهة سطر الأوامر لجينكينز الذي يوفر عمليات عمل حديثة وقابلة للبرمجة للمطورين والمنفذين.","en":"GitHub-style CLI for Jenkins — manage contexts, runs, logs, and admin tasks from your terminal."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Jenkins CLI（jk）- GitHub 风格的命令行接口","ja":"Jenkins CLI（jk）- GitHubスタイルのコマンドラインインターフェース","ko":"Jenkins CLI(jk) - GitHub 스타일의 명령줄 인터페이스","es":"jk: CLI de Jenkins para desarrolladores","fr":"jk : Interface CLI de Jenkins pour les développeurs","de":"jk: Jenkins-CLI für Entwickler","pt":"JK: Interface de Linha de Comando do Jenkins","ru":"JK: Интерфейс командной строки Jenkins","ar":"JK: واجهة سطر الأوامر لجينكينز","en":"jk"},"description":{"zh":"jk是Jenkins控制器的GitHub CLI风格接口，提供现代化的可脚本化工作流","ja":"jkはJenkinsコントローラーのGitHub CLIスタイルインターフェースです","ko":"jk는 Jenkins 컨트롤러의 GitHub CLI 스타일 인터페이스입니다","es":"jk es una interfaz de línea de comandos de estilo GitHub para Jenkins, que ofrece flujos de trabajo modernos y scriptables para desarrolladores y operadores.","fr":"jk est une interface CLI de style GitHub pour Jenkins, qui propose des flux de travail modernes et scriptables pour les développeurs et les opérateurs.","de":"jk ist eine GitHub-ähnliche Kommandozeilenoberfläche für Jenkins, die moderne, skriptbare Workflows für Entwickler und Betreiber bietet.","pt":"JK é uma interface de linha de comando do Jenkins que fornece fluxos de trabalho modernos e scriptáveis para desenvolvedores e operadores.","ru":"JK — это интерфейс командной строки Jenkins, который предоставляет современные и скриптовые рабочие процессы для разработчиков и операторов.","ar":"JK هو واجهة سطر الأوامر لجينكينز الذي يوفر عمليات عمل حديثة وقابلة للبرمجة للمطورين والمنفذين.","en":"GitHub-style CLI for Jenkins — manage contexts, runs, logs, and admin tasks from your terminal."},"definition":{"en":"GitHub-style CLI for Jenkins — manage contexts, runs, logs, and admin tasks from your terminal."},"features":{"zh":["现代化的可脚本化工作流","GitHub CLI风格的接口","支持终端管理Jenkins控制器","可用于管理上下文、运行、日志和管理任务","支持多平台安装"],"ja":["モダンなスクリプト可能なワークフロー","GitHub CLIスタイルのインターフェース","ターミナルからJenkinsコントローラーを管理","コンテキスト、実行、ログ、管理タスクの管理","複数プラットフォームのインストールをサポート"],"ko":["현대적인 스크립트 가능한 워크플ロー","GitHub CLI 스타일의 인터페이스","터미널에서 Jenkins 컨트롤러 관리","컨텍스트, 실행, 로그, 관리 작업 관리","여러 플랫폼 설치 지원"],"es":["Interfaz de línea de comandos de estilo GitHub","Flujos de trabajo modernos y scriptables","Gestión de contextos y ejecuciones de Jenkins","Acceso a registros y tareas de administración","Instalación sencilla mediante Homebrew o Scoop"],"fr":["Interface CLI de style GitHub","Flux de travail modernes et scriptables","Gestion des contextes et des exécutions de Jenkins","Accès aux journaux et aux tâches d''administration","Installation facile via Homebrew ou Scoop"],"de":["GitHub-ähnliche Kommandozeilenoberfläche","Moderne, skriptbare Workflows","Verwaltung von Kontexten und Ausführungen von Jenkins","Zugriff auf Protokolle und Administrativaufgaben","Einfache Installation über Homebrew oder Scoop"],"pt":["Interface de linha de comando moderna e scriptável","Gerenciamento de contextos e execuções","Acesso a logs e tarefas de administração","Instalação fácil via Homebrew ou Scoop","Compatível com macOS, Linux e Windows"],"ru":["Современный и скриптовый интерфейс командной строки","Управление контекстами и выполнениями","Доступ к журналам и административным задачам","Легкая установка через Homebrew или Scoop","Совместим с macOS, Linux и Windows"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر الحديثة والقابلة للبرمجة","إدارة السياقات وعمليات التشغيل","الوصول إلى السجلات ومهام الإدارة","التثبيت السهل عبر Homebrew أو Scoop","متوافق مع macOS و Linux و Windows"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jenkins CLI","jk","GitHub CLI","Jenkins控制器","可脚本化工作流","终端管理","开发人员工具"],"ja":["Jenkins CLI","jk","GitHub CLI","Jenkinsコントローラー","スクリプト可能なワークフロー","ターミナル管理","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Jenkins CLI","jk","GitHub CLI","Jenkins 컨트롤러","스크립트 가능한 워크플ロー","터미널 관리","개발자 도구"],"es":["jk","Jenkins CLI","GitHub CLI","desarrollo de software","automatización de flujos de trabajo","herramientas de desarrollo","Jenkins","CLI","terminal"],"fr":["jk","Jenkins CLI","GitHub CLI","développement de logiciels","automatisation de flux de travail","outils de développement","Jenkins","CLI","terminal"],"de":["jk","Jenkins-CLI","GitHub-CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Workflows","Entwicklungstools","Jenkins","CLI","Konsole"],"pt":["JK","Jenkins","Interface de linha de comando","Gerenciamento de contextos","Execuções","Logs","Tarefas de administração","Desenvolvedores","Operadores"],"ru":["JK","Jenkins","Интерфейс командной строки","Управление контекстами","Выполнения","Журналы","Административные задачи","Разработчики","Операторы"],"ar":["JK","جينكينز","واجهة سطر الأوامر","إدارة السياقات","عمليات التشغيل","السجلات","مهام الإدارة","المطورون","المنفذون"]}},"owner":"avivsinai","repo":"jenkins-cli","repoPath":"avivsinai/jenkins-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jk","description":"Jenkins CLI for controllers. Use when users need to manage jobs, pipelines, runs, logs, artifacts, credentials, nodes, or queues in Jenkins. Triggers include jenkins, jk, pipeline, build, run logs, job list, jenkins credentials, jenkins node.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Jenkins CLI (jk)\n\n`jk` is a GitHub CLI–style interface for **Jenkins controllers**. It provides modern, scriptable workflows for developers and operators.\n\n## Dependency Check\n\n**Before executing any `jk` command**, verify the CLI is installed:\n\n```bash\njk --version\n```\n\nIf the command fails or `jk` is not found, install it using one of these methods:\n\n| Platform | Command |\n|----------|---------|\n| macOS/Linux | `brew install avivsinai/tap/jk` |\n| Windows | `scoop bucket add avivsinai https:/","body":"# Jenkins CLI (jk)\n\n`jk` is a GitHub CLI–style interface for **Jenkins controllers**. It provides modern, scriptable workflows for developers and operators.\n\n## Dependency Check\n\n**Before executing any `jk` command**, verify the CLI is installed:\n\n```bash\njk --version\n```\n\nIf the command fails or `jk` is not found, install it using one of these methods:\n\n| Platform | Command |\n|----------|---------|\n| macOS/Linux | `brew install avivsinai/tap/jk` |\n| Windows | `scoop bucket add avivsinai https://github.com/avivsinai/scoop-bucket && scoop install jk` |\n| Go | `go install github.com/avivsinai/jenkins-cli/cmd/jk@latest` |\n| Binary | Download from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/avivsinai/jenkins-cli/releases) |\n\n**Only proceed with `jk` commands after confirming installation succeeds.**\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Login with credentials\njk auth login https://jenkins.example.com --username alice --token <API_TOKEN>\n\n# Login with custom context name\njk auth login https://jenkins.example.com --name prod --username alice --token <TOKEN>\n\n# Login with TLS options\njk auth login https://jenkins.example.com --username alice --token <TOKEN> --insecure\njk auth login https://jenkins.example.com --username alice --token <TOKEN> --ca-file /path/to/ca.pem\n\n# Check auth status (active context)\njk auth status\n\n# Logout from a context\njk auth logout              # Logout from active context\njk auth logout prod         # Logout from specific context\n```\n\nOptions for `auth login`:\n- `--name` — Context name (defaults to hostname)\n- `--username` — Jenkins username\n- `--token` — API token\n- `--insecure` — Skip TLS verification\n- `--proxy` — Proxy URL\n- `--ca-file` — Custom CA bundle\n- `--set-active` — Set as active context (default: true)\n- `--allow-insecure-store` — Allow encrypted file fallback\n\n## Contexts\n\nContexts store controller URLs and credentials for easy switching:\n\n```bash\n# List contexts (* = active)\njk context ls\n\n# Switch active context\njk context use prod-jenkins\n\n# Remove a context\njk context rm staging\n```\n\nEnvironment: `JK_CONTEXT` overrides active context.\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search jobs | `jk search --job-glob ''*deploy*''` |\n| List jobs | `jk job ls` |\n| View job | `jk job view team/app` |\n| List runs | `jk run ls team/app` |\n| Start run | `jk run start team/app -p KEY=value` |\n| View run | `jk run view team/app 128` |\n| Follow logs | `jk run start team/app --follow` |\n| Stream logs | `jk log team/app 128 --follow` |\n| Download artifacts | `jk artifact download team/app 128` |\n| Test report | `jk test report team/app 128` |\n| List credentials | `jk cred ls` |\n| List nodes | `jk node ls` |\n| View queue | `jk queue ls` |\n| List plugins | `jk plugin ls` |\n\n## Job Discovery\n\n```bash\n# Search across folders\njk search --job-glob ''*deploy*'' --limit 10\n\n# Search in specific folder\njk search --folder team/services --job-glob ''*api*''\n\n# Filter by run results\njk search --job-glob ''*'' --filter result=FAILURE --since 7d\n\n# With parameter filters\njk search --job-glob ''*/deploy-*'' --filter param.ENV=production\n```\n\n## Job Operations\n\n```bash\n# List jobs in root\njk job ls\n\n# List jobs in folder (positional or flag)\njk job ls team/app\njk job ls --folder team/app\n\n# View job details\njk job view team/app/pipeline\n```\n\n## Run Management\n\n### Listing Runs\n\n```bash\n# List recent runs\njk run ls team/app/pipeline\n\n# Limit results\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --limit 50\n\n# Filter runs\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --filter result=SUCCESS\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --filter result=FAILURE --since 7d\n\n# Filter by parameters\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --filter param.ENV=staging\n\n# Include queued builds\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --include-queued\n\n# Group by parameter\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --group-by param.ENV --agg last\n\n# With metadata for agents\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --json --with-meta\n\n# Pagination\njk run ls team/app/pipeline --cursor <cursor-from-previous>\n```\n\n### Starting Runs\n\n```bash\n# Start a run\njk run start team/app/pipeline\n\n# Start with parameters\njk run start team/app/pipeline -p BRANCH=main -p ENV=staging\n\n# Start and follow logs\njk run start team/app/pipeline --follow\n\n# Start, wait for completion (no log streaming)\njk run start team/app/pipeline --wait --timeout 10m\n\n# Get only the result\njk run start team/app/pipeline --follow --result\n\n# Fuzzy job matching\njk run start deploy --fuzzy\n```\n\n### Viewing Runs\n\n```bash\n# View run details\njk run view team/app/pipeline 128\n\n# Get only result status\njk run view team/app/pipeline 128 --result\n\n# Exit with build result code\njk run view team/app/pipeline 128 --exit-status\n\n# Wait for completion\njk run view team/app/pipeline 128 --wait --timeout 5m\n\n# Show summary\njk run view team/app/pipeline 128 --summary\n```\n\n### Other Run Commands\n\n```bash\n# View run parameters\njk run params team/app/pipeline\n\n# Cancel a run\njk run cancel team/app/pipeline 128\njk run cancel team/app/pipeline 128 --mode term\njk run cancel team/app/pipeline 128 --mode kill\n\n# Rerun a build (with same parameters)\njk run rerun team/app/pipeline 128\njk run rerun team/app/pipeline 128 --follow\n```\n\n## Logs\n\n```bash\n# View console log (snapshot)\njk log team/app/pipeline 128\n\n# Stream live logs\njk log team/app/pipeline 128 --follow\n\n# Custom poll interval\njk log team/app/pipeline 128 --follow --interval 2s\n\n# Plain output (no decorations)\njk log team/app/pipeline 128 --plain\n```\n\n## Artifacts\n\n```bash\n# List artifacts\njk artifact ls team/app/pipeline 128\n\n# Download all artifacts\njk artifact download team/app/pipeline 128\n\n# Download with pattern filter\njk artifact download team/app/pipeline 128 --pattern \"**/*.jar\"\njk artifact download team/app/pipeline 128 -p \"reports/**/*.xml\"\n\n# Output directory\njk artifact download team/app/pipeline 128 -o ./artifacts/\n\n# Allow empty result (no error if no matches)\njk artifact download team/app/pipeline 128 -p \"*.log\" --allow-empty\n```\n\n## Test Results\n\n```bash\n# View test report\njk test report team/app/pipeline 128\n\n# JSON output\njk test report team/app/pipeline 128 --json\n```\n\n## Credentials\n\n```bash\n# List credentials (system scope)\njk cred ls\n\n# List folder-scoped credentials\njk cred ls --scope folder --folder team/app\n\n# Create secret text\njk cred create-secret --id my-secret --secret \"value\"\njk cred create-secret --id my-secret --secret \"value\" --description \"API key\"\n\n# Create from stdin\necho \"secret-value\" | jk cred create-secret --id my-secret --from-stdin\n\n# Folder-scoped credential\njk cred create-secret --id my-secret --secret \"value\" --scope folder --folder team/app\n\n# Delete credential (system scope only)\njk cred rm my-secret\n```\n\n## Node Management\n\n```bash\n# List nodes\njk node ls\n\n# Cordon node (mark temporarily offline)\njk node cordon agent-01\njk node cordon agent-01 --message \"Maintenance\"\n\n# Uncordon node (bring back online)\njk node uncordon agent-01\n\n# Remove node\njk node rm agent-01\n```\n\n## Queue Management\n\n```bash\n# List queued items\njk queue ls\n\n# Cancel queued item\njk queue cancel <item-id>\n```\n\n## Plugin Management\n\n```bash\n# List installed plugins\njk plugin ls\n\n# Install plugin (prompts for confirmation)\njk plugin install docker-workflow\n\n# Install without confirmation\njk plugin install docker-workflow --yes\n\n# Install specific version\njk plugin install docker-workflow@1.26\n\n# Enable/disable plugin\njk plugin enable docker-workflow\njk plugin disable docker-workflow\n```\n\n## Output Modes\n\nAll commands support structured output:\n\n```bash\n# JSON output\njk run ls team/app --json\n\n# YAML output\njk run ls team/app --yaml\n\n# Filter with jq expression\njk run ls team/app --json --jq ''.items[0].number''\n\n# Go template\njk run ls team/app --json --template ''{{range .items}}{{.number}}{{end}}''\n\n# Quiet mode (minimal output)\njk run start team/app --quiet\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n- `-c, --context <name>` — Use specific context\n- `--json` — JSON output\n- `--yaml` — YAML output\n- `--format json|yaml` — Output format\n- `--jq <expr>` — Filter JSON with jq expression\n- `-t, --template <tmpl>` — Format with Go template\n- `-q, --quiet` — Suppress non-essential output\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `JK_CONTEXT` — Override active context\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| 0 | Success |\n| 1 | General error |\n| 2 | Validation error |\n| 3 | Not found |\n| 4 | Authentication failure |\n| 5 | Permission denied |\n| 6 | Connectivity failure |\n| 7 | Timeout |\n| 8 | Feature unsupported |\n\nWith `--follow` or `--wait`, build results use additional codes:\n\n| Code | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| 0 | SUCCESS |\n| 10 | UNSTABLE |\n| 11 | FAILURE |\n| 12 | ABORTED |\n| 13 | NOT_BUILT |\n| 14 | RUNNING |\n\n## References\n\n- **Full command reference**: See [references/commands.md](references/commands.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:04:35.868Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing streamlined Jenkins management from the terminal.","zh":"非常适合需要从终端对 Jenkins 进行流线化管理的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"ターミナルからの Jenkins 管理をストリームライン化する必要がある DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"터미널에서 젠킨스를 스트림라인화하여 관리해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de Jenkins optimizada desde la terminal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps qui ont besoin d''une gestion de Jenkins rationalisée à partir du terminal.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine optimierte Jenkins-Verwaltung aus der Terminal benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que precisam de uma gestão de Jenkins simplificada a partir do terminal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходима упрощенная управление Jenkins из терминала.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة Jenkins مبسطة من الطرفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Jenkins contexts, runs, logs, and admin tasks efficiently using a GitHub-style CLI, enabling scriptable workflows for developers and operators with commands like `jk --version`.","zh":"使得代理能够使用类似 GitHub 的 CLI 高效地管理 Jenkins 上下文、运行、日志和管理员任务，从而为开发人员和操作员启用可脚本化的工作流，例如使用 `jk --version` 命令。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub スタイルの CLI を使用して Jenkins コンテキスト、実行、ログ、および管理タスクを効率的に管理できるようにし、開発者とオペレーターが `jk --version` のようなコマンドを使用してスクリプト化されたワークフローを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 스타일의 CLI를 사용하여 젠킨스 컨텍스트, 실행, 로그 및 관리 작업을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하여 개발자와 운영자가 `jk --version`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 스크립트화된 워크플ロー를 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar contextos de Jenkins, ejecuciones, registros y tareas de administración de forma eficiente utilizando una CLI de estilo GitHub, lo que permite flujos de trabajo scriptables para desarrolladores y operadores con comandos como `jk --version`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les contextes Jenkins, les exécutions, les journaux et les tâches administratives de manière efficace en utilisant une CLI de style GitHub, ce qui permet des flux de travail scriptables pour les développeurs et les opérateurs avec des commandes comme `jk --version`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Jenkins-Kontexte, Ausführungen, Protokolle und Administrativaufgaben effizient mithilfe einer GitHub-ähnlichen CLI zu verwalten, wodurch Skript-Workflows für Entwickler und Betreiber mit Befehlen wie `jk --version` ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar contextos do Jenkins, execuções, logs e tarefas de administração de forma eficiente usando uma CLI no estilo GitHub, permitindo fluxos de trabalho scriptáveis para desenvolvedores e operadores com comandos como `jk --version`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять контекстами Jenkins, запусками, журналами и административными задачами эффективно с помощью CLI в стиле GitHub, что обеспечивает возможность создания сценариев для разработчиков и операторов с командами типа `jk --version`.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإدارة سياقات Jenkins و تشغيلها و سجلاتها و مهام الإدارة بفعالية باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر بنمط GitHub ، و ما يتيح سير عمل قابلة للبرمجة للمطورين و المشغلين بأوامر مثل `jk --version`."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing Jenkins controllers from the command line","Scripting automated workflows for CI/CD pipelines","Troubleshooting Jenkins issues using log analysis"],"zh":["从命令行管理 Jenkins 控制器","为 CI/CD 流水线编写自动化工作流脚本","使用日志分析进行 Jenkins 故障排除"],"ja":["コマンドラインから Jenkins コントローラーを管理する","CI/CD パイプライン用の自動化されたワークフロー スクリプトを記述する","ログ分析を使用した Jenkins のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["명령줄에서 젠킨스 컨트롤러를 관리하는 것","CI/CD 파이프라인을 위한 자동화된 워크플로 스크립트 작성","로그 분석을 사용한 젠킨스 문제 해결"],"es":["Gestión de controladores de Jenkins desde la línea de comandos","Creación de flujos de trabajo automatizados para tuberías de CI/CD","Solución de problemas de Jenkins mediante análisis de registros"],"fr":["Gestion des contrôleurs Jenkins à partir de la ligne de commande","Création de flux de travail automatisés pour les pipelines CI/CD","Dépannage des problèmes Jenkins à l''aide de l''analyse des journaux"],"de":["Verwaltung von Jenkins-Controllern über die Kommandozeile","Erstellung automatisierter Workflows für CI/CD-Pipelines","Fehlerbehebung bei Jenkins mit Protokollanalyse"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de controladores Jenkins a partir da linha de comando","Criação de fluxos de trabalho automatizados para pipelines de CI/CD","Solução de problemas do Jenkins usando análise de logs"],"ru":["Управление контроллерами Jenkins из командной строки","Создание автоматизированных рабочих процессов для конвейеров CI/CD","Поиск и решение проблем Jenkins с помощью анализа журналов"],"ar":["إدارة متحكمات Jenkins من سطر الأوامر","إنشاء سير عمل آلي للأنابيب CI/CD","معالجة مشاكل Jenkins باستخدام تحليل السجلات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation via brew or scoop","Dependent on Jenkins controller setup"],"zh":["需要通过 brew 或 scoop 进行安装","依赖于 Jenkins 控制器设置"],"ja":["brew または scoop を使用してインストールする必要がある","Jenkins コントローラー設定に依存する"],"ko":["brew 또는 scoop을 사용하여 설치해야 함","젠킨스 컨트롤러 설정에 종속됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación a través de brew o scoop","Dependiente de la configuración del controlador de Jenkins"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation via brew ou scoop","Dépend de la configuration du contrôleur Jenkins"],"de":["Erfordert Installation über brew oder scoop","Abhängig von der Konfiguration des Jenkins-Controllers"],"pt":["Requer instalação via brew ou scoop","Dependente da configuração do controlador Jenkins"],"ru":["Требует установки через brew или scoop","Зависит от настройки контроллера Jenkins"],"ar":["يتطلب التثبيت عبر brew أو scoop","يعتمد على إعداد متحكم Jenkins"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kriegcloud/beep-effect/react-vm', 'community', 'kriegcloud', 'beep-effect', 'kriegcloud/beep-effect', 'react-vm', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:04:07.163Z', NULL, '{"id":"kriegcloud/beep-effect/react-vm","name":"react-vm","description":{"zh":"React VM是一种效果视图模型架构，实现零UI逻辑的开发。它将域输入转换为UI准备好的输出，组件成为纯渲染器","ja":"React VMは効果的なビュー モデル アーキテクチャであり、ゼロUIロジックの開発を実現します。ドメイン入力をUI準備済みの出力に変換し、コンポーネントを純粋なレンダラーにします","ko":"React VM은 효과적인 뷰 모델 아키텍처로, UI 로직 없이 개발을 구현합니다. 도메인 입력을 UI 준비된 출력으로 변환하고, 컴포넌트를 순수한 렌더러로 만듭니다","es":"React-VM es una arquitectura de modelo de vista que separa la lógica de la interfaz de usuario, mejorando la eficiencia y la escalabilidad de las aplicaciones.","fr":"React-VM est une architecture de modèle de vue qui sépare la logique de l''interface utilisateur, améliorant l''efficacité et la scalabilité des applications.","de":"React-VM ist eine View-Model-Architektur, die die Benutzeroberflächenlogik trennt, um die Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit von Anwendungen zu verbessern.","pt":"O React-VM é uma arquitetura de modelo de visão que separa a lógica de negócios da lógica de interface do usuário, melhorando a manutenção e a escalabilidade da aplicação.","ru":"React-VM - это архитектура модели представления, которая разделяет бизнес-логику и логику интерфейса пользователя, улучшая поддержку и масштабируемость приложения.","ar":"React-VM هو هندسة نموذج عرض يفصل بين منطق العمل و منطق واجهة المستخدم، مما يحسن صيانة وتوسيع تطبيقك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"React VM：零UI逻辑的效果视图模型架构","ja":"React VM：ゼロUIロジックの効果的なビュー モデル アーキテクチャ","ko":"React VM: UI 로직 없이 효과적인 뷰 모델 아키텍처","es":"Arquitectura de Modelo de Vista Efectiva con React-VM","fr":"Architecture de Modèle de Vue Efficace avec React-VM","de":"Effektive View-Model-Architektur mit React-VM","pt":"Arquitetura de Modelo de Visão Eficaz com Re