ité et de la scalabilité","Transformation de données de domaine en sortie d''interface utilisateur","Composants d''interface utilisateur purs","Gestion des erreurs et des exceptions"],"de":["Trennung der Benutzeroberflächenlogik","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit","Transformation von Domänen-Daten in Benutzeroberflächen-Ausgabe","Reine Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","Fehler- und Ausnahmehandling"],"pt":["Separação de lógica de negócios e lógica de interface do usuário","Transformação de dados de domínio em saída pronta para interface do usuário","Melhoria da manutenção e escalabilidade da aplicação","Componentes puros e reutilizáveis","Suporte a formatação de strings e datas"],"ru":["Разделение бизнес-логики и логики интерфейса пользователя","Преобразование доменных данных в готовый для интерфейса пользователя вывод","Улучшение поддержки и масштабируемости приложения","Чистые и повторно используемые компоненты","Поддержка форматирования строк и дат"],"ar":["فصل منطق العمل و منطق واجهة المستخدم","تحويل بيانات المجال إلى مخرجات جاهزة لواجهة المستخدم","تحسين صيانة وتوسيع تطبيقك","مكونات نقية ويمكن إعادة استخدامها","دعم تنسيق السلاسل و التواريخ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React VM","效果视图模型架构","零UI逻辑","域输入转换","UI准备好的输出","组件纯渲染器","代码可维护性","代码可扩展性"],"ja":["React VM","効果的なビュー モデル アーキテクチャ","ゼロUIロジック","ドメイン入力変換","UI準備済み出力","コンポーネント純粋なレンダラー","コード保守性","コード拡張性"],"ko":["React VM","효과적인 뷰 모델 아키텍처","UI 로직 없이","도메인 입력 변환","UI 준비된 출력","컴포넌트 순수한 렌더러","코드 유지 보수성","코드 확장성"],"es":["React-VM","arquitectura de modelo de vista","separación de la lógica de la interfaz de usuario","eficiencia y escalabilidad","transformación de datos de dominio","componentes de interfaz de usuario puros","gestión de errores y excepciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["React-VM","architecture de modèle de vue","séparation de la logique de l''interface utilisateur","efficacité et scalabilité","transformation de données de domaine","composants d''interface utilisateur purs","gestion des erreurs et des exceptions","développement d''applications web"],"de":["React-VM","View-Model-Architektur","Trennung der Benutzeroberflächenlogik","Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit","Transformation von Domänen-Daten","reine Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","Fehler- und Ausnahmehandling","Webanwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["react-vm","arquitetura de modelo de visão","lógica de negócios","lógica de interface do usuário","transformação de dados","manutenção de aplicação","escalabilidade de aplicação"],"ru":["react-vm","архитектура модели представления","бизнес-логика","логика интерфейса пользователя","преобразование данных","поддержка приложения","масштабируемость приложения"],"ar":["react-vm","هندسة نموذج عرض","منطق العمل","منطق واجهة المستخدم","تحويل بيانات","صيانة تطبيق","توسيع تطبيق"]}},"owner":"kriegcloud","repo":"beep-effect","repoPath":"kriegcloud/beep-effect","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-vm","description":"Implement the VM pattern using Effect and Effect-Atom for reactive, testable frontend state management. Use this skill when building React applications with View Models that bridge domain services and UI.","bodyPreview":"# Effectful View Model Architecture Guide\n\n## The Golden Rule: Zero UI Logic\n\n**VMs take domain input → VMs produce UI-ready output → Components are pure renderers**\n\nVM transforms domain to UI-ready:\n- `User` entity → `displayName: \"John D.\"`\n- `timestamp: 1702425600` → `formattedDate: \"Dec 13, 2024\"`\n- `balance: 1000000n` → `displayBalance: \"$1,000,000\"`\n- `isActive && hasAccess` → `canEdit: true`\n- `error.code` → `errorMessage: \"Network failed\"`\n\n**Components must NEVER:** format strings/date","body":"# Effectful View Model Architecture Guide\n\n## The Golden Rule: Zero UI Logic\n\n**VMs take domain input → VMs produce UI-ready output → Components are pure renderers**\n\nVM transforms domain to UI-ready:\n- `User` entity → `displayName: \"John D.\"`\n- `timestamp: 1702425600` → `formattedDate: \"Dec 13, 2024\"`\n- `balance: 1000000n` → `displayBalance: \"$1,000,000\"`\n- `isActive && hasAccess` → `canEdit: true`\n- `error.code` → `errorMessage: \"Network failed\"`\n\n**Components must NEVER:** format strings/dates/numbers, compute derived values, contain business logic, transform entities\n\n**Components ONLY:** subscribe via `useAtomValue`, invoke via `useAtomSet`, pattern match with `$match`, render UI-ready values\n\n**Error handling:** Components CAN pattern match on error states (to render different UI per error type), but MUST render `error.message` as-is—VM is responsible for producing user-friendly messages\n\n---\n\n## File Structure\n\nEvery **parent component** needs a VM:\n\n```\ncomponents/\n  Wallet/\n    Wallet.tsx       # Component - pure renderer\n    Wallet.vm.ts     # VM - interface, tag, default layer export\n    index.ts         # Re-exports\n```\n\nChild components used for UI composition receive VM as props—only parent components define their own VM.\n\n---\n\n## VMs vs Regular Layers\n\n**VMs are strictly UI constructs.** A VM only exists if a component for that exact VM exists.\n\n| Pattern | When to Use | Location |\n|---------|-------------|----------|\n| **VM** | Layer serves a React component | `components/X/X.vm.ts` paired with `X.tsx` |\n| **Service Layer** | Non-UI logic, shared business rules | `services/`, `lib/`, etc. |\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG - No component uses this, not a VM\n// components/Analytics/Analytics.vm.ts  (but no Analytics.tsx!)\n\n// ✅ CORRECT - Just a service layer\n// services/Analytics.ts\nexport class AnalyticsService extends Context.Tag(\"AnalyticsService\")<\n  AnalyticsService,\n  { track: (event: string) => Effect.Effect<void> }\n>() {}\n```\n\n**When VMs share logic**: Use standard Effect layer composition. Shared logic lives in service layers, VMs compose over them:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Context, Effect, Layer } from \"effect\"\nimport { AtomRegistry } from \"@effect-atom/atom/Registry\"\ninterface Consent { id: string }\ndeclare var ConsentListVM: Context.Tag<ConsentListVM, ConsentListVM>\ninterface ConsentListVM {}\n\n// services/ConsentService.ts - shared business logic\nexport class ConsentService extends Context.Tag(\"ConsentService\")<\n  ConsentService,\n  { getConsents: Effect.Effect<Consent[]> }\n>() {}\n\n// components/ConsentList/ConsentList.vm.ts - UI-specific, uses service\nconst layer = Layer.effect(\n  ConsentListVM,\n  Effect.gen(function* () {\n    const consentService = yield* ConsentService  // Compose over service\n    const registry = yield* AtomRegistry\n    // ... VM-specific UI state\n  })\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Flow\n\n- Component calls `useVM(tag, layer)` → VMRuntime lazily builds VM via `Layer.buildWithMemoMap` → VM yields services from infrastructure layers\n- VMRuntime provides render-stable scope for all VMs\n- User action → VM action (updates atom via registry) → atom notifies → `useAtomValue` re-renders\n\n---\n\n## VM File Pattern\n\nEach VM file contains: interface, tag, and default `{ tag, layer }` export.\n\n```typescript\n// components/Wallet/Wallet.vm.ts\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom/Atom\"\nimport { AtomRegistry } from \"@effect-atom/atom/Registry\"\nimport { Context, Layer, Effect, pipe, Data } from \"effect\"\n\n// State machine\nexport type WalletState = Data.TaggedEnum<{\n  Disconnected: {}\n  Connecting: {}\n  Connected: { displayAddress: string; fullAddress: string }\n}>\nexport const WalletState = Data.taggedEnum<WalletState>()\n\n// 1. Interface - atoms use camelCase with $ suffix\nexport interface WalletVM {\n  readonly state$: Atom.Atom<WalletState>\n  readonly isConnected$: Atom.Atom<boolean>  // Derived, UI-ready\n  readonly connect: () => void               // Actions return void\n  readonly disconnect: () => void\n}\n\n// 2. Tag\nexport const WalletVM = Context.GenericTag<WalletVM>(\"WalletVM\")\n\n// 3. Layer - atoms ONLY defined inside the layer\n// VMRuntime provides scope, so Layer.effect is the default\nconst layer = Layer.effect(\n  WalletVM,\n  Effect.gen(function* () {\n    const registry = yield* AtomRegistry\n    const walletService = yield* WalletService\n\n    // Atoms defined here, inside the layer\n    const state$ = Atom.make<WalletState>(WalletState.Disconnected())\n    const isConnected$ = pipe(state$, Atom.map(WalletState.$is(\"Connected\")))\n\n    const connect = () => {\n      registry.set(state$, WalletState.Connecting())\n      Effect.runPromise(\n        walletService.connect.pipe(\n          Effect.match({\n            onFailure: () => registry.set(state$, WalletState.Disconnected()),\n            onSuccess: (addr) => registry.set(state$, WalletState.Connected({\n              displayAddress: `${addr.slice(0,6)}...${addr.slice(-4)}`,\n              fullAddress: addr\n            }))\n          })\n        )\n      )\n    }\n\n    const disconnect = () => {\n      registry.set(state$, WalletState.Disconnected())\n    }\n\n    return { state$, isConnected$, connect, disconnect }\n  })\n)\n\n// 4. Default export\nexport default { tag: WalletVM, layer }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Pattern\n\n```tsx\n// components/Wallet/Wallet.tsx\n\"use client\"\nimport { useVM } from \"@/lib/VMRuntime\"\nimport { useAtomValue } from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\nimport * as Result from \"@effect-atom/atom/Result\"\nimport WalletVM, { WalletState, type WalletVM as WalletVMType } from \"./Wallet.vm\"\n\n// Child components receive VM as prop - no own VM needed\nfunction WalletStatus({ vm }: { vm: WalletVMType }) {\n  const state = useAtomValue(vm.state$)\n\n  return WalletState.$match(state, {\n    Disconnected: () => <span>Not connected</span>,\n    Connecting: () => <Spinner />,\n    Connected: ({ displayAddress }) => <span>{displayAddress}</span>\n  })\n}\n\nfunction WalletActions({ vm }: { vm: WalletVMType }) {\n  const isConnected = useAtomValue(vm.isConnected$)\n\n  return isConnected\n    ? <button onClick={vm.disconnect}>Disconnect</button>\n    : <button onClick={vm.connect}>Connect</button>\n}\n\n// Parent component owns VM\nexport default function Wallet() {\n  const vmResult = useVM(WalletVM.tag, WalletVM.layer)\n\n  return Result.match(vmResult, {\n    onInitial: () => <Spinner />,\n    onSuccess: ({ value: vm }) => (\n      <div className=\"wallet\">\n        <WalletStatus vm={vm} />\n        <WalletActions vm={vm} />\n      </div>\n    ),\n    onFailure: ({ cause }) => <Alert>{String(cause)}</Alert>\n  })\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Pattern: Atom.fn for Async Actions\n\n**Key insight**: Use `Atom.fn` with `Effect.fnUntraced` for effect-based actions. This gives you:\n1. Automatic `waiting` flag for loading state\n2. `Result<Success, Error>` with Initial/Success/Failure states\n3. No manual state management or void wrappers\n\n```tsx\nimport { Atom, useAtomValue, useAtomSet } from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\nimport * as Result from \"@effect-atom/atom/Result\"\nimport { Effect, Exit } from \"effect\"\n\n// Define action with Atom.fn + Effect.fnUntraced\nconst refreshAtom = Atom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* () {\n    const consents = yield* consentService.getOwnConsents\n    return consents\n  })\n)\n\n// In component - useAtom for result and trigger\nfunction ConsentList() {\n  const [result, refresh] = useAtom(refreshAtom)\n\n  // result.waiting is true while the effect runs\n  const isLoading = result.waiting\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={() => refresh()} disabled={isLoading}>\n        {isLoading ? \"Loading...\" : \"Refresh\"}\n      </button>\n      {Result.matchWithWaiting(result, {\n        onWaiting: () => <Loading />,\n        onSuccess: ({ value }) => <List items={value} />,\n        onError: (error) => <Error message={String(error)} />,\n        onDefect: (defect) => <Error message={String(defect)} />\n      })}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**With services using Atom.runtime:**\n\n```tsx\nclass ConsentService extends Effect.Service<ConsentService>()(\"ConsentService\", {\n  effect: Effect.gen(function* () {\n    const getAll = Effect.succeed([{ id: \"1\", name: \"Terms\" }])\n    return { getAll } as const\n  }),\n}) {}\n\nconst runtimeAtom = Atom.runtime(ConsentService.Default)\n\nconst refreshAtom = runtimeAtom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* () {\n    const service = yield* ConsentService\n    return yield* service.getAll\n  })\n)\n```\n\n**With promiseExit for async handlers:**\n\n```tsx\nfunction CreateUser() {\n  // mode: \"promiseExit\" returns Promise<Exit<...>> for await\n  const createUser = useAtomSet(createUserAtom, { mode: \"promiseExit\" })\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={async () => {\n      const exit = await createUser(\"John\")\n      if (Exit.isSuccess(exit)) {\n        console.log(exit.value)\n      }\n    }}>\n      Create\n    </button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Anti-pattern: Manual void wrappers**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ DON''T - manual state management loses waiting control\nconst loading$ = Atom.make(false)\nconst data$ = Atom.make<Data | null>(null)\n\nconst refresh = (): void => {\n  registry.set(loading$, true)\n  Effect.runPromise(fetchData).then(data => {\n    registry.set(data$, data)\n    registry.set(loading$, false)\n  })\n}\n\n// ✅ DO - Atom.fn handles everything\nconst refreshAtom = Atom.fn(Effect.fnUntraced(function* () {\n  return yield* fetchData\n}))\n// result.waiting, Result.matchWithWaiting - all built-in\n```\n\n---\n\n## Building Blocks\n\n### Atoms & Registry\n\nAtoms are ONLY defined inside VM layers:\n\n```typescript\n// Inside Layer.effect or Layer.scoped\nconst registry = yield* AtomRegistry\n\n// Writable atom - camelCase with $ suffix\nconst count$ = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Derived atom (read-only)\nconst doubled$ = pipe(count$, Atom.map((n) => n * 2))\n\n// Read/write via registry\nregistry.get(count$)      // read\nregistry.set(count$, 42)  // write\n```\n\n### Data.TaggedEnum - State Machines\n\n```tsx\nexport type WalletState = Data.TaggedEnum<{\n  Disconnected: {}\n  Connecting: {}\n  Connected: { displayAddress: string; fullAddress: string }\n}>\nexport const WalletState = Data.taggedEnum<WalletState>()\n\n// Pattern match in UI\nWalletState.$match(state, {\n  Disconnected: () => <ConnectButton />,\n  Connecting: () => <Spinner />,\n  Connected: ({ displayAddress }) => <span>{displayAddress}</span>\n})\n```\n\n### VMs with Lists (Atom.family)\n\n```typescript\nconst makeConsentItemVM = Atom.family((consent: Consent): ConsentItemVM => {\n  const status$ = pipe(consentsState$, Atom.map((either) =>\n    Either.match(either, {\n      onLeft: () => ConsentStatus.Active(),\n      onRight: (consents) => {\n        const c = consents.find(x => x.consentId === consent.consentId)\n        return c?.isRevoked ? ConsentStatus.Revoked() : ConsentStatus.Active()\n      }\n    })\n  ))\n\n  // Close over consent.consentId - UI never sees it\n  const revoke = () => {\n    Effect.gen(function* () {\n      yield* consentService.revokeById(consent.consentId)\n      yield* refresh()\n    }).pipe(Effect.runFork)\n  }\n\n  return { key: consent.consentId, status$, revoke }\n})\n```\n\n### Event Listeners → Atom with Finalizer\n\nInstead of `useEffect` for event listeners, use `Atom.make` with `get.addFinalizer`:\n\n```typescript\n// Window scroll position - auto-cleanup when atom is no longer used\nconst scrollY$ = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const onScroll = () => get.setSelf(window.scrollY)\n  window.addEventListener(\"scroll\", onScroll)\n  get.addFinalizer(() => window.removeEventListener(\"scroll\", onScroll))\n  return window.scrollY\n})\n\n// Resize observer\nconst windowSize$ = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const update = () => get.setSelf({ width: window.innerWidth, height: window.innerHeight })\n  window.addEventListener(\"resize\", update)\n  get.addFinalizer(() => window.removeEventListener(\"resize\", update))\n  return { width: window.innerWidth, height: window.innerHeight }\n})\n```\n\n### URL Search Params → Atom.searchParam\n\nInstead of `useEffect` + `useSearchParams`, use `Atom.searchParam`:\n\n```typescript\n// Simple string param\nconst filter$ = Atom.searchParam(\"filter\")  // Atom.Writable<string>\n\n// With schema parsing\nconst page$ = Atom.searchParam(\"page\", {\n  schema: Schema.NumberFromString\n})  // Atom.Writable<Option<number>>\n\n// Multiple params for a search form\nconst search$ = Atom.searchParam(\"q\")\nconst sort$ = Atom.searchParam(\"sort\")\nconst limit$ = Atom.searchParam(\"limit\", { schema: Schema.NumberFromString })\n```\n\n---\n\n## VMRuntime Hook\n\n```typescript\n// lib/VMRuntime.ts\nconst memoMap = Layer.makeMemoMap.pipe(Effect.runSync)\n\nconst vmAtom = Atom.family(<Id, Value, E>(key: VmKey<Id, Value, E>) =>\n  Atom.make(\n    Effect.gen(function* () {\n      const scope = yield* Scope.Scope\n      const ctx = yield* Layer.buildWithMemoMap(key.layer, memoMap, scope)\n      return Context.get(ctx, key.tag)\n    })\n  )\n)\n\nexport const useVM = <Id, Value, E>(\n  tag: Context.Tag<Id, Value>,\n  layer: Layer.Layer<Id, E, Scope.Scope | AtomRegistry>\n): Result.Result<Value, E> => useAtomValue(vmAtom(makeVmKey(tag, layer)))\n```\n\n---\n\n## React Integration\n\n### Provider Setup\n\n```tsx\n// app/providers.tsx\nimport { RegistryProvider } from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\nexport function Providers({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <RegistryProvider>{children}</RegistryProvider>\n}\n```\n\n### Hooks Reference\n\n| Hook | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `useAtomValue(atom$)` | Subscribe to value |\n| `useAtomSet(atom$)` | Get setter function |\n| `useAtom(atom$)` | Get `[value, setter]` |\n\n---\n\n## Testing VMs\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(\"WalletVM\", () => {\n  const WalletServiceMock = Layer.succeed(WalletService, WalletService.of({\n    connect: Effect.succeed(\"0x1234...\"),\n    disconnect: Effect.succeed(undefined)\n  }))\n\n  const makeVM = () => {\n    const r = Registry.make()\n    const vm = Layer.build(WalletVM.layer).pipe(\n      Effect.map((ctx) => Context.get(ctx, WalletVM.tag)),\n      Effect.scoped,\n      Effect.provideService(Registry.AtomRegistry, r),\n      Effect.provide(WalletServiceMock),\n      Effect.runSync\n    )\n    return { r, vm }\n  }\n\n  it(\"should start disconnected\", () => {\n    const { r, vm } = makeVM()\n    expect(WalletState.$is(\"Disconnected\")(r.get(vm.state$))).toBe(true)\n  })\n\n  it(\"should connect wallet\", async () => {\n    const { r, vm } = makeVM()\n    vm.connect()\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 10))\n    expect(WalletState.$is(\"Connected\")(r.get(vm.state$))).toBe(true)\n  })\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Core Pattern**\n- Use `Atom.fn()` for async actions—gives you `AtomResultFn` with automatic `waiting` flag\n- Use `useAtom(action$)` to get `[result, trigger]` tuple\n- `Result.matchWithWaiting` for rendering async states (onWaiting/onSuccess/onError/onDefect)\n- `Result.match` for one-time builds like VM initialization (onInitial/onSuccess/onFailure)\n- Never manually wrap Effects in void functions—you lose `waiting` control\n\n**Naming & Structure**\n- Atoms use `camelCase$` suffix\n- Every parent component: `Component.tsx` + `Component.vm.ts`\n- Child components receive VM as prop (no own VM)\n- VM file exports: interface, tag, default `{ tag, layer }`\n\n**Interface Design**\n- ALL formatting happens in VM—components receive ready-to-render strings\n- Use `key` for React, close over IDs in callbacks\n\n### UI-Ready Output Examples\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG - Logic in component\nfunction UserCard({ vm }: { vm: UserVM }) {\n  const user = useAtomValue(vm.user$)\n  const balance = useAtomValue(vm.balance$)\n\n  // NO! Formatting in component\n  const displayName = `${user.firstName} ${user.lastName.charAt(0)}.`\n  const formattedBalance = new Intl.NumberFormat(''en-US'', {\n    style: ''currency'', currency: ''USD''\n  }).format(balance / 100)\n  const isVip = balance > 10000 && user.memberSince < Date.now() - 31536000000\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h2>{displayName}</h2>\n      <span>{formattedBalance}</span>\n      {isVip && <VipBadge />}  {/* NO! Conditional logic */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// CORRECT - VM produces UI-ready values\ninterface UserVM {\n  readonly displayName$: Atom.Atom<string>       // \"John D.\"\n  readonly formattedBalance$: Atom.Atom<string>  // \"$1,234.56\"\n  readonly showVipBadge$: Atom.Atom<boolean>     // true/false\n}\n\nfunction UserCard({ vm }: { vm: UserVM }) {\n  const displayName = useAtomValue(vm.displayName$)\n  const formattedBalance = useAtomValue(vm.formattedBalance$)\n  const showVipBadge = useAtomValue(vm.showVipBadge$)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h2>{displayName}</h2>\n      <span>{formattedBalance}</span>\n      {showVipBadge && <VipBadge />}  {/* OK - just reading a boolean */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Implementation**\n- Atoms ONLY defined inside VM layers\n- `Layer.effect` is the default (VMRuntime provides scope)\n- Use `Atom.family` for list item sub-VMs\n- Use `Effect.forkScoped` for background tasks\n- Handle all errors in actions (update atom on failure)\n\n**Testing**\n- Test VMs without UI using registry directly\n- Create fresh VM per test\n- Mock services with `Layer.succeed`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:04:07.163Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to separate UI logic using Effectful View Model Architecture.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Effectful View Model Architecture 分离 UI 逻辑的前端代理。","ja":"Effectful View Model Architecture を使用して UI ロジックを分離する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Effectful View Model Architecture를 사용하여 UI 논리를 분리해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que necesitan separar la lógica de la interfaz de usuario utilizando la Arquitectura de Modelo de Vista con Efectos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Frontend ayant besoin de séparer la logique d''interface utilisateur en utilisant l''Architecture de Modèle de Vue avec Effets.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die die Benutzeroberflächenlogik mithilfe der Architektur des effektvollen View-Modells trennen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam separar a lógica da UI usando a Arquitetura de Modelo de Visão com Efeitos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо разделить логику UI с помощью архитектуры Effectful View Model.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى فصل منطق الواجهة باستخدام هندسة نموذج العرض الفعّال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform domain data into UI-ready output using View Models, ensuring components are pure renderers and never format strings or dates, thus promoting a Golden Rule of Zero UI Logic with features like domain to UI-ready data transformation and error message handling.","zh":"赋予代理将域数据转换为 UI 准备好的输出的能力，使用视图模型，确保组件是纯渲染器，永远不会格式化字符串或日期，从而促进零 UI 逻辑的黄金法则，并具有域到 UI 准备好的数据转换和错误消息处理等功能。","ja":"ドメインデータを UI への出力に変換するエージェントの能力を提供し、ビューモデルを使用してコンポーネントが純粋なレンダラーであり、文字列や日付をフォーマットしないことを保証し、ゼロ UI ロジックの黄金規則を推進し、ドメインから UI へのデータ変換やエラーメッセージの処理などの機能を提供します。","ko":"도메인 데이터를 UI 출력으로 변환하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하고, 뷰 모델을 사용하여 컴포넌트가 순수한 렌더러이고, 문자열이나 날짜를 포맷하지 않는 것을 보장하고, 0 UI 논리의 황금 규칙을 촉진하며, 도메인에서 UI로의 데이터 변환 및 오류 메시지 처리와 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar los datos de dominio en salidas listas para la interfaz de usuario utilizando Modelos de Vista, asegurando que los componentes sean renderizadores puros y nunca formateen cadenas o fechas, promoviendo así la Regla de Oro de Cero Lógica de Interfaz de Usuario con características como la transformación de datos de dominio a datos listos para la interfaz de usuario y el manejo de mensajes de error.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les données de domaine en sorties prêtes pour l''interface utilisateur en utilisant des Modèles de Vue, en veillant à ce que les composants soient des renderers purs et ne formattent jamais des chaînes ou des dates, promouvant ainsi la Règle d''Or de Zéro Logique d''Interface Utilisateur avec des fonctionnalités telles que la transformation de données de domaine en données prêtes pour l''interface utilisateur et la gestion des messages d''erreur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Domänen-Daten in benutzeroberflächenbereite Ausgaben umzuwandeln, indem View-Modelle verwendet werden, wodurch sichergestellt wird, dass Komponenten reine Renderer sind und nie Zeichenfolgen oder Daten formatieren, wodurch die Goldene Regel der Null-Benutzeroberflächenlogik mit Funktionen wie der Umwandlung von Domänen-Daten in benutzeroberflächenbereite Daten und der Fehlermeldungsbehandlung gefördert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar dados de domínio em saída pronta para a UI usando Modelos de Visão, garantindo que os componentes sejam renderizadores puros e nunca formatem strings ou datas, promovendo assim uma Regra de Ouro de Zero Lógica de UI com recursos como transformação de dados de domínio em dados prontos para a UI e tratamento de mensagens de erro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать доменные данные в выходные данные, готовые для UI, с помощью представлений, гарантируя, что компоненты являются чистыми рендерерами и никогда не форматируют строки или даты, тем самым продвигая Золотое правило нулевой логики UI с функциями, такими как преобразование доменных данных в данные, готовые для UI, и обработка сообщений об ошибках.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحويل بيانات المجال إلى خرج جاهز لواجهة المستخدم باستخدام نماذج العرض، وضمان أن تكون المكونات محوّلات نقية ولا تنسيق السلاسل أو التواريخ، ممّا يُشجّع قاعدة الذهب للقواعد الخالية من منطق واجهة المستخدم مع ميزات مثل تحويل بيانات المجال إلى بيانات جاهزة لواجهة المستخدم وتحديد رسائل الخطأ."},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming domain entities into UI-ready data","Formatting dates and numbers for display","Generating error messages from error codes","Separating UI logic from component rendering"],"zh":["将域实体转换为 UI 准备好的数据","格式化日期和数字以进行显示","从错误代码生成错误消息","将 UI 逻辑与组件渲染分离"],"ja":["ドメインエンティティを UI への出力に変換する","日付や数字を表示するためにフォーマットする","エラーコードからエラーメッセージを生成する","UI ロジックをコンポーネントレンダリングから分離する"],"ko":["도메인 엔티티를 UI 출력으로 변환하는 것","날짜 및 숫자를 표시하기 위해 포맷하는 것","오류 코드에서 오류 메시지를 생성하는 것","UI 논리를 컴포넌트 렌더링에서 분리하는 것"],"es":["Transformar entidades de dominio en datos listos para la interfaz de usuario","Formato de fechas y números para su visualización","Generación de mensajes de error a partir de códigos de error","Separación de la lógica de la interfaz de usuario del renderizado de componentes"],"fr":["Transformer les entités de domaine en données prêtes pour l''interface utilisateur","Mise en forme de dates et de nombres pour l''affichage","Génération de messages d''erreur à partir de codes d''erreur","Séparation de la logique d''interface utilisateur du rendu de composants"],"de":["Umwandlung von Domänenentitäten in benutzeroberflächenbereite Daten","Formatierung von Daten und Zahlen zur Anzeige","Generierung von Fehlermeldungen aus Fehlernummern","Trennung der Benutzeroberflächenlogik von der Komponentenrenderung"],"pt":["Transformar entidades de domínio em dados prontos para a UI","Formatar datas e números para exibição","Gerar mensagens de erro a partir de códigos de erro","Separar a lógica da UI do renderizado de componentes"],"ru":["Преобразование сущностей домена в данные, готовые для UI","Форматирование дат и чисел для отображения","Генерация сообщений об ошибках из кодов ошибок","Разделение логики UI от рендеринга компонентов"],"ar":["تحويل كيانات المجال إلى بيانات جاهزة لواجهة المستخدم","تنسيق التواريخ والأرقام للعرض","generating رسائل الخطأ من رموز الخطأ","فصل منطق واجهة المستخدم عن تقديم المكونات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Golden Rule of Zero UI Logic","Components must not perform UI logic or formatting"],"zh":["需要遵守零 UI 逻辑的黄金法则","组件不得执行 UI 逻辑或格式化"],"ja":["ゼロ UI ロジックの黄金規則に従う必要がある","コンポーネントは UI ロジックやフォーマットを実行してはならない"],"ko":["0 UI 논리의 황금 규칙을 따르야 함","컴포넌트는 UI 논리 또는 포맷을 수행해서는 안 됨"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la Regla de Oro de Cero Lógica de Interfaz de Usuario","Los componentes no deben realizar lógica de interfaz de usuario ni formato"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la Règle d''Or de Zéro Logique d''Interface Utilisateur","Les composants ne doivent pas effectuer de logique d''interface utilisateur ou de mise en forme"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Goldenen Regel der Null-Benutzeroberflächenlogik","Komponenten dürfen keine Benutzeroberflächenlogik oder Formatierung durchführen"],"pt":["Exige aderência à Regra de Ouro de Zero Lógica de UI","Os componentes não devem realizar lógica da UI ou formatação"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Золотого правила нулевой логики UI","Компоненты не должны выполнять логику UI или форматирование"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بقاعدة الذهب للقواعد الخالية من منطق واجهة المستخدم","يجب ألا يقوم المكونات بتنفيذ منطق واجهة المستخدم أو تنسيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kriegcloud/beep-effect/wide-events', 'community', 'kriegcloud', 'beep-effect', 'kriegcloud/beep-effect', 'wide-events', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:04:34.123Z', NULL, '{"id":"kriegcloud/beep-effect/wide-events","name":"wide-events","description":{"zh":"Wide Events 技术是一种优化查询和事件注释的方法，通过使用 OTel spans 和注释来提高开发效率","ja":"Wide Events 技術は、OTel spans と注釈を使用してクエリとイベント注釈を最適化する方法です","ko":"Wide Events 기술은 OTel spans 및 주석을 사용하여 쿼리 및 이벤트 주석을 최적화하는 방법입니다","es":"Los eventos amplios permiten la optimización de consultas estructuradas para desarrolladores","fr":"Les événements étendus permettent l''optimisation des requêtes structurées pour les développeurs","de":"Breite Ereignisse ermöglichen die Optimierung von strukturierten Abfragen für Entwickler","pt":"Wide Events é uma abordagem para otimizar consultas de eventos, utilizando OpenTelemetry para melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Широкие события - это подход к оптимизации запросов событий, использующий OpenTelemetry для повышения эффективности","ar":"الأحداث الواسعة هي نهج لتحسين استفسارات الأحداث، يستخدم OpenTelemetry لتحسين الكفاءة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Wide Events 技术：优化查询和事件注释","ja":"Wide Events 技術：クエリとイベント注釈の最適化","ko":"Wide Events 기술: 쿼리 및 이벤트 주석 최적화","es":"Eventos Amplios: Optimización de Consultas","fr":"Événements Étendus: Optimisation des Requêtes","de":"Breite Ereignisse: Abfrageoptimierung","pt":"Wide Events: Otimização de Consultas de Eventos","ru":"Широкие события: оптимизация запросов событий","ar":"الأحداث الواسعة: تحسين استفسارات الأحداث","en":"wide-events"},"description":{"zh":"Wide Events 技术是一种优化查询和事件注释的方法，通过使用 OTel spans 和注释来提高开发效率","ja":"Wide Events 技術は、OTel spans と注釈を使用してクエリとイベント注釈を最適化する方法です","ko":"Wide Events 기술은 OTel spans 및 주석을 사용하여 쿼리 및 이벤트 주석을 최적화하는 방법입니다","es":"Los eventos amplios permiten la optimización de consultas estructuradas para desarrolladores","fr":"Les événements étendus permettent l''optimisation des requêtes structurées pour les développeurs","de":"Breite Ereignisse ermöglichen die Optimierung von strukturierten Abfragen für Entwickler","pt":"Wide Events é uma abordagem para otimizar consultas de eventos, utilizando OpenTelemetry para melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Широкие события - это подход к оптимизации запросов событий, использующий OpenTelemetry для повышения эффективности","ar":"الأحداث الواسعة هي نهج لتحسين استفسارات الأحداث، يستخدم OpenTelemetry لتحسين الكفاءة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化查询和事件注释","使用 OTel spans 和注释","提高开发效率","支持多维事件字段","提供结构化查询和答案"],"ja":["クエリとイベント注釈の最適化","OTel spans と注釈の使用","開発効率の向上","多次元イベントフィールドのサポート","構造化クエリと回答の提供"],"ko":["쿼리 및 이벤트 주석 최적화","OTel spans 및 주석 사용","개발 효율성 향상","다차원 이벤트 필드 지원","구조화된 쿼리 및 답변 제공"],"es":["Optimización de consultas","Anotación de spans y contexto","Modelo mental para estrategia de anotación","Campos de eventos amplios","Integración con OTel"],"fr":["Optimisation des requêtes","Annotation des spans et du contexte","Modèle mental pour stratégie d''annotation","Champs d''événements étendus","Intégration avec OTel"],"de":["Abfrageoptimierung","Annotierung von Spans und Kontext","Mentales Modell für Annotierungsstrategie","Felder für breite Ereignisse","Integration mit OTel"],"pt":["Otimização de consultas de eventos","Utilização de OpenTelemetry","Anotação de spans e contextos","Melhoria da eficiência","Suporte a múltiplos campos de eventos"],"ru":["Оптимизация запросов событий","Использование OpenTelemetry","Аннотация спанов и контекстов","Повышение эффективности","Поддержка нескольких полей событий"],"ar":["تحسين استفسارات الأحداث","استخدام OpenTelemetry","التعليق على النطاقات والسياقات","تحسين الكفاءة","دعم حقول الأحداث المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wide Events","事件注释","查询优化","OTel spans","注释","开发效率","多维事件字段"],"ja":["Wide Events","イベント注釈","クエリ最適化","OTel spans","注釈","開発効率","多次元イベントフィールド"],"ko":["Wide Events","이벤트 주석","쿼리 최적화","OTel spans","주석","개발 효율성","다차원 이벤트 필드"],"es":["eventos amplios","optimización de consultas","anotación de spans","modelo mental","OTel","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["événements étendus","optimisation des requêtes","annotation des spans","modèle mental","OTel","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["breite Ereignisse","Abfrageoptimierung","Annotierung von Spans","mentales Modell","OTel","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Wide Events","OpenTelemetry","Otimização de consultas","Anotação de eventos","Desempenho de aplicativos","Monitoramento de eventos"],"ru":["Широкие события","OpenTelemetry","Оптимизация запросов","Аннотация событий","Производительность приложений","Мониторинг событий"],"ar":["الأحداث الواسعة","OpenTelemetry","تحسين الاستفسارات","التعليق على الأحداث","أداء التطبيقات","مراقبة الأحداث"]}},"owner":"kriegcloud","repo":"beep-effect","repoPath":"kriegcloud/beep-effect","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wide-events","description":"Conceptual guide to wide events (canonical log lines) for observability. Use when thinking about instrumentation strategy, span annotations, or designing what context to capture.","bodyPreview":"<wide-events>\n\n<philosophy>\ntraditional := many(log-lines) → grep(services) → hope\nwide        := one(event) → query(structured) → answer\n\noptimize(querying) ∧ ¬optimize(writing)\n</philosophy>\n\n<current-practice>\nimplementation := OTel spans + annotations\nwide-events    := mental-model for annotation strategy\n\nannotate(span, context) where context = {\n  business ∪ user ∪ technical ∪ outcome\n}\n</current-practice>\n\n<dimensionality>\nwide-event.fields := {\n  identity:    {traceId, spanId, service, o","body":"<wide-events>\n\n<philosophy>\ntraditional := many(log-lines) → grep(services) → hope\nwide        := one(event) → query(structured) → answer\n\noptimize(querying) ∧ ¬optimize(writing)\n</philosophy>\n\n<current-practice>\nimplementation := OTel spans + annotations\nwide-events    := mental-model for annotation strategy\n\nannotate(span, context) where context = {\n  business ∪ user ∪ technical ∪ outcome\n}\n</current-practice>\n\n<dimensionality>\nwide-event.fields := {\n  identity:    {traceId, spanId, service, operation}\n  user:        {userId, accountTier, accountAge, lifetimeValue}\n  business:    {featureFlags, experimentGroup, cartValue}\n  performance: {durationMs, dbQueryCount, cacheHitRate, retryCount}\n  outcome:     {success, errorCode, httpStatus}\n}\n\nhigh-dimensionality → better-queryability\nhigh-cardinality(userId) → acceptable\n</dimensionality>\n\n<anti-patterns>\nscattered-logs     := console.log(\"step1\") >> console.log(\"step2\") >> ...\nlow-dimensionality := span.set(\"success\", true) ∧ |fields| < 5\ntechnical-only     := {http.status, db.queries} ∧ ¬{user, business}\n</anti-patterns>\n\n<correct-pattern>\nspan.setAttributes({\n  \"request.operation\", \"user.id\", \"user.tier\",\n  \"cart.items\", \"cart.value\", \"feature.*\",\n  \"db.query_count\", \"cache.hit_rate\",\n  \"request.success\"\n})\n\n∀ span → attach(identity ∪ user ∪ business ∪ performance ∪ outcome)\n</correct-pattern>\n\n<tail-sampling>\nretain(100%) := errors ∨ slow(>p99) ∨ vip\nretain(1-5%) := success ∧ fast\n</tail-sampling>\n\n<queryability-test>\nbefore(instrument) → verify(answerable({\n  \"failures where tier=premium ∧ feature.new_flow=true\"\n  \"p99(latency) group by tier\"\n  \"errors group by featureFlags\"\n  \"full context for user X incident\"\n}))\n\n¬queryable → ¬enough-context\n</queryability-test>\n\n<terminology>\ncardinality    := |unique values| (userId=high, httpMethod=low)\ndimensionality := |fields per event| (more → better)\nwide-event     := canonical-log-line := one comprehensive record\n</terminology>\n\n<when-to-apply>\ndeciding(span-annotations)\nreviewing(instrumentation-coverage)\ndebugging(incidents) → \"what context was missing?\"\nplanning(new-service-observability)\nchoosing(fields-to-index)\n</when-to-apply>\n\n</wide-events>\n\nReference: See `Article.md` for full article by Boris Tane (loggingsucks.com)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:04:34.123Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Observability Agents leveraging OpenTelemetry (OTel) for advanced event annotation and querying capabilities.","zh":"适用于利用 OpenTelemetry (OTel) 进行高级事件注释和查询能力的可观察性代理的理想选择。","ja":"OpenTelemetry (OTel) を使用して高度なイベント注釈とクエリ機能を利用する Observability エージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenTelemetry (OTel)를 사용하여 고급 이벤트 주석 및 쿼리 기능을 활용하는 관찰 가능성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de observabilidad que utilizan OpenTelemetry (OTel) para capacidades avanzadas de anotación y consulta de eventos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''observabilité qui utilisent OpenTelemetry (OTel) pour des capacités avancées d''annotation et d''interrogation d''événements.","de":"Ideal für Observability-Agents, die OpenTelemetry (OTel) für erweiterte Ereignisannotierung und Abfragefunktionen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Observabilidade que utilizam OpenTelemetry (OTel) para anotações de eventos avançadas e capacidades de consulta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов наблюдаемости, использующих OpenTelemetry (OTel) для расширенной аннотации событий и возможностей запроса.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات مراقبة الوكلاء التي تستخدم OpenTelemetry (OTel) لتعليقات الأحداث المتقدمة وقدرات الاستعلام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize querying capabilities using structured annotations, leveraging OTel spans and annotations to provide a mental model for annotation strategy, and enabling the annotation of spans with business, user, technical, and outcome context.","zh":"赋予代理优化查询能力使用结构化注释，利用 OTel跨度和注释提供注释策略的思维模型，并能够用业务、用户、技术和结果背景注释跨度。","ja":"エージェントに構造化された注釈を使用してクエリ機能を最適化する力を与え、OTel スパンと注釈を使用して注釈戦略のメンタルモデルを提供し、ビジネス、ユーザー、技術、および結果のコンテキストでスパンを注釈できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트에 구조화된 주석을 사용하여 쿼리 기능을 최적화하는 힘을 부여하고, OTel 범위와 주석을 사용하여 주석 전략의 정신 모델을 제공하며, 비즈니스, 사용자, 기술 및 결과 컨텍스트로 범위를 주석으로 표시할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar las capacidades de consulta utilizando anotaciones estructuradas, aprovechando los spans y anotaciones de OTel para proporcionar un modelo mental para la estrategia de anotación y permitiendo la anotación de spans con contexto empresarial, de usuario, técnico y de resultado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les capacités d''interrogation en utilisant des annotations structurées, en exploitant les spans et les annotations d''OTel pour fournir un modèle mental pour la stratégie d''annotation et en permettant l''annotation des spans avec un contexte commercial, utilisateur, technique et de résultat.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Abfragefunktionen mithilfe strukturierter Annotationen zu optimieren, indem sie die Spans und Annotationen von OTel nutzen, um ein mentales Modell für die Annotierungsstrategie bereitzustellen und die Annotierung von Spans mit Geschäfts-, Benutzer-, technischem und Ergebniskontext zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem as capacidades de consulta usando anotações estruturadas, aproveitando os spans e anotações do OTel para fornecer um modelo mental para estratégia de anotação e permitindo a anotação de spans com contexto de negócios, usuário, técnico e resultado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать возможности запроса с помощью структурированных аннотаций, используя спаны и аннотации OTel для предоставления умственной модели для стратегии аннотации, и позволяя аннотировать спаны с контекстом бизнеса, пользователя, техническим и результатом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين قدرات الاستعلام باستخدام التعليقات المهيكلة، واستخدام مدى و تعليقات OTel لتوفير نموذج عقلي لاستراتيجية التعليق، وتمكين تعليق المدى السياق التجاري و المستخدم و الفني و النتيجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Annotating OTel spans with business and technical context for enhanced observability","Implementing a wide-events strategy for optimized event querying and analysis","Developing a mental model for annotation strategy to improve event annotation consistency"],"zh":["使用业务和技术背景注释 OTel跨度以提高可观察性","实施宽事件策略以优化事件查询和分析","开发注释策略的思维模型以提高事件注释的一致性"],"ja":["ビジネスと技術のコンテキストで OTel スパンを注釈して観測可能性を高める","広いイベント戦略を実装してイベントのクエリと分析を最適化する","注釈戦略のメンタルモデルを開発してイベント注釈の一貫性を高める"],"ko":["비즈니스 및 기술 컨텍스트로 OTel 범위를 주석으로 표시하여 관찰 가능성을 향상하는 것","최적의 이벤트 쿼리 및 분석을 위한 광범위한 이벤트 전략을 구현하는 것","이벤트 주석 일관성을 개선하기 위한 주석 전략의 정신 모델을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Anotar spans de OTel con contexto empresarial y técnico para una mejor observabilidad","Implementar una estrategia de eventos amplios para una consulta y análisis de eventos optimizados","Desarrollar un modelo mental para la estrategia de anotación para mejorar la coherencia de la anotación de eventos"],"fr":["Annoter les spans d''OTel avec un contexte commercial et technique pour une meilleure observabilité","Mettre en œuvre une stratégie d''événements étendus pour une interrogation et une analyse d''événements optimisées","Développer un modèle mental pour la stratégie d''annotation pour améliorer la cohérence de l''annotation des événements"],"de":["OTel-Spans mit Geschäfts- und technischem Kontext annotieren, um die Observierbarkeit zu verbessern","Eine Strategie für umfassende Ereignisse implementieren, um die Ereignisabfrage und -analyse zu optimieren","Ein mentales Modell für die Annotierungsstrategie entwickeln, um die Konsistenz der Ereignisannotierung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Anotar spans do OTel com contexto de negócios e técnico para observabilidade aprimorada","Implementar uma estratégia de eventos amplos para consulta e análise de eventos otimizados","Desenvolver um modelo mental para estratégia de anotação para melhorar a consistência da anotação de eventos"],"ru":["Аннотировать спаны OTel контекстом бизнеса и техники для улучшенной наблюдаемости","Реализовать стратегию широких событий для оптимизированной запроса и анализа событий","Разработать умственную модель для стратегии аннотации для улучшения последовательности аннотации событий"],"ar":["تعليق مدى OTel بالسياق التجاري و التقني لمراقبة محسنة","تنفيذ استراتيجية للأحداث الواسعة لاستعلام الأحداث المحسنة و التحليل","تطوير نموذج عقلي لاستراتيجية التعليق لتحسين التماسك في تعليق الأحداث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of OpenTelemetry (OTel) spans and annotations","Optimization focused on querying, not writing"],"zh":["需要实现 OpenTelemetry (OTel)跨度和注释","优化重点在于查询，而不是写入"],"ja":["OpenTelemetry (OTel) スパンと注釈の実装が必要","最適化の焦点はクエリであり、書き込みではありません"],"ko":["OpenTelemetry (OTel) 범위 및 주석의 구현이 필요","최적화 초점은 쿼리이며, 쓰기에는 해당하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere la implementación de spans y anotaciones de OpenTelemetry (OTel)","Optimización centrada en la consulta, no en la escritura"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de spans et d''annotations d''OpenTelemetry (OTel)","Optimisation axée sur l''interrogation, et non sur l''écriture"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung von OpenTelemetry-Spans und -Annotationen (OTel)","Optimierung konzentriert sich auf die Abfrage, nicht auf das Schreiben"],"pt":["Exige a implementação de spans e anotações do OpenTelemetry (OTel)","Otimização focada na consulta, não na escrita"],"ru":["Требует реализации спанов и аннотаций OpenTelemetry (OTel)","Оптимизация сконцентрирована на запросе, а не на написании"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ مدى وتعليقات OpenTelemetry (OTel)","التحسين يركز على الاستعلام، وليس على الكتابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
