gs de software de manera eficiente","fr":"Triage est un outil de ligne de commande pour analyser et prioriser les backlogs de logiciel de manière efficace","de":"Triage ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zur Analyse und Priorisierung von Software-Backlogs","pt":"Triage é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para análise e priorização de backlogs de software","ru":"Triage — это инструмент командной строки для анализа и приоритизации бэклога программного обеспечения","ar":"ترياج هو أداة سطر أوامر لتحليل وتحديد الأولويات لقائمة العمل البرمجية","en":"A token-efficient CLI for Linear"},"definition":{"en":"A token-efficient CLI for Linear"},"features":{"zh":["令牌高效的 CLI","分析和优先处理软件后台","支持 Linear 初始化","可以获取所有后台问题","优先处理决策","查找陈旧或阻塞的问题"],"ja":["トークン効率の良い CLI","ソフトウェア バックログの分析と優先化","Linear 初期化のサポート","すべてのバックログ問題の取得","優先順位の決定","古いまたはブロックされた問題の検索"],"ko":["토큰 효율적인 CLI","소프트웨어 백로그 분석 및 우선 순위 지정","Linear 초기화 지원","모든 백로그 문제 가져오기","우선 순위 결정","陈旧 또는 차단된 문제 찾기"],"es":["Análisis de backlog eficiente","Priorización de tareas","Detección de problemas estancados o bloqueados","Integración con Linear","Uso de línea de comandos","Configuración sencilla"],"fr":["Analyse de backlog efficace","Priorisation des tâches","Détection des problèmes figés ou bloqués","Intégration avec Linear","Utilisation en ligne de commande","Configuration simple"],"de":["Effiziente Backlog-Analyse","Priorisierung von Aufgaben","Erkennung von festgefahrenen oder blockierten Problemen","Integration mit Linear","Verwendung der Kommandozeile","Einfache Konfiguration"],"pt":["Análise de backlog eficiente","Priorização de issues","Detecção de issues bloqueadas ou obsoletas","Integração com Linear","Uso de linha de comando"],"ru":["Эффективный анализ бэклога","Приоритизация задач","Обнаружение заблокированных или устаревших задач","Интеграция с Linear","Использование командной строки"],"ar":["تحليل قائمة العمل ذو الكفاءة العالية","تحديد الأولويات لقائمة العمل","اكتشاف قائمة العمل المحظورة أو المتقادمة","التكامل مع Linear","استخدام سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Triage 技能","Linear 命令行工具","软件后台分析","优先处理","令牌高效","CLI 工具","软件项目管理"],"ja":["Triage スキル","Linear 用 CLI","ソフトウェア バックログ分析","優先化","トークン効率","CLI ツール","ソフトウェア プロジェクト管理"],"ko":["Triage 스킬","Linear 명령줄 도구","소프트웨어 백로그 분석","우선 순위 지정","토큰 효율","CLI 도구","소프트웨어 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["análisis de backlog","priorización de tareas","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","CLI","Linear","productividad","eficiencia"],"fr":["analyse de backlog","priorisation des tâches","développement de logiciel","outils de développement","CLI","Linear","productivité","efficacité"],"de":["Backlog-Analyse","Priorisierung von Aufgaben","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","CLI","Linear","Produktivität","Effizienz"],"pt":["análise de backlog","priorização de issues","ferramenta de linha de comando","desenvolvimento de software","gestão de projeto","Linear"],"ru":["анализ бэклога","приоритизация задач","инструмент командной строки","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектом","Linear"],"ar":["تحليل القائمة الباكية","تحديد الأولويات لقائمة العمل","أداة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشروع","Linear"]}},"owner":"joa23","repo":"linear-cli","repoPath":"joa23/linear-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage","description":"Triage and prioritize Linear backlog. Analyzes issues for staleness, blockers, and suggests priorities based on dependencies and capacity.","bodyPreview":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues l","body":"# Triage Skill - Backlog Analysis\n\nYou are an expert at analyzing and prioritizing software backlogs.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- The backlog needs cleanup\n- Prioritization decisions need to be made\n- Looking for stale or blocked issues\n\n## Process\n\n### CRITICAL: Setup First\n**Ensure team context is set:**\n```bash\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n```\n\n1. **Fetch the Backlog**\n   ```bash\n   # Get all backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n   ```\n\n2. **Analyze Dependencies**\n   ```bash\n   linear deps --team ENG\n   ```\n\n3. **Filter by Priority**\n   ```bash\n   # High priority backlog items\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Urgent only (P1)\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full\n\n   # Customer issues\n   linear issues list --labels customer --format full\n\n   # Bugs in backlog\n   linear issues list --state Backlog --labels bug --format full\n   ```\n\n4. **Identify Issues**\n   Look for:\n   - **Stale issues**: No updates in 30+ days\n   - **Blocked issues**: Dependencies not resolved\n   - **Priority mismatches**: High priority but blocked\n   - **Orphaned issues**: No assignee, no activity\n\n5. **Generate Recommendations**\n\n## Analysis Framework\n\n### Staleness Check\n- Last updated > 30 days ago = Stale\n- Last updated > 60 days ago = Very stale (consider closing)\n- No activity + no assignee = Orphaned\n\n### Dependency Health\n- Blocked by completed issues = Unblock\n- Circular dependencies = Flag for resolution\n- Long blocking chains = Risk\n\n### Priority Assessment\n- P1/P2 but blocked = Escalate blocker\n- P3/P4 with no activity = Consider closing\n- No priority set = Needs triage\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\nBACKLOG TRIAGE: Team ENG\n════════════════════════════════════════\n\nURGENT ATTENTION (3)\n────────────────────────────────────────\nENG-101 [Stale 45d] Login bug - P1 but no activity\nENG-102 [Blocked] Payment flow - blocked by ENG-99\nENG-103 [Orphaned] API refactor - no owner\n\nRECOMMENDED ACTIONS\n────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Unblock ENG-102: Complete ENG-99 or remove dependency\n2. Assign ENG-103: Needs owner or close if abandoned\n3. Update ENG-101: Stale P1 needs attention\n\nHEALTH SUMMARY\n────────────────────────────────────────\nTotal issues: 45\nBlocked: 8 (17%)\nStale: 12 (26%)\nHealthy: 25 (55%)\n```\n\n## Commands Used\n\n```bash\n# FIRST: Ensure team context is set\nlinear init  # If .linear.yaml doesn''t exist\n\n# Get backlog issues (returns ALL issues, not just assigned)\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --format full --limit 100\n\n# Filter by priority\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --format full  # Urgent\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 2 --format full  # High\n\n# Filter by labels\nlinear issues list --labels customer --format full\nlinear issues list --labels bug --format full\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --labels \"customer,bug\" --format full\n\n# Combine filters\nlinear issues list --state Backlog --priority 1 --labels customer --format full\n\n# Check dependencies\nlinear deps --team ENG\n\n# Update priority\nlinear issues update ENG-123 --priority 2\n\n# Add a comment about triage\nlinear issues comment ENG-123 --body \"Triaged: Needs unblocking before sprint\"\n```\n\n## Key Learnings\n\n- **`linear issues list` returns ALL issues** (not just assigned to you)\n- Use `--format full` for structured output\n- Combine filters: `--state Backlog --labels customer`\n- Priority values: 0=none, 1=urgent, 2=high, 3=normal, 4=low\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Regular cadence** - Triage weekly or bi-weekly\n2. **Be decisive** - Close issues that won''t be done\n3. **Document reasoning** - Add comments explaining priority changes\n4. **Involve stakeholders** - Flag issues needing product input\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:03:55.127Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing efficient backlog analysis and prioritization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高效的后台分析和优先级排序能力的CLI代理。","ja":"CLIエージェントが効率的なバックログ分析と優先順位付けの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"CLI 에이전트가 효율적인 백로그 분석 및 우선 순위 지정 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI que necesitan capacidades de análisis y priorización de backlog eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse et de priorisation de backlog efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-Agents, die effiziente Backlog-Analyse- und Priorisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes CLI que precisam de análise e priorização eficientes de backlogs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов CLI, которым необходимы эффективные возможности анализа и приоритезации задач.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكلاء CLI التي تحتاج إلى تحليل وتحديد أهمية الفواصل الزمنية بكفاءة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and prioritize software backlogs using Linear, providing features like stale issue detection and prioritization decisions through command-line interfaces, utilizing tools like `linear init` and `linear issues` commands.","zh":"赋予代理分析和优先级排序软件项目后台的能力，利用Linear提供的功能，如过期问题检测和通过命令行界面进行的优先级排序决策，使用诸如`linear init`和`linear issues`命令的工具。","ja":"Linearを使用して、エージェントがソフトウェアバックログを分析および優先順位付けできるようにし、古い問題の検出やコマンドラインインターフェイスを介した優先順位付けの決定などの機能を提供する。また、`linear init`や`linear issues`コマンドなどのツールを利用する。","ko":"Linear를 사용하여 에이전트가 소프트웨어 백로그를 분석 및 우선순위 지정할 수 있도록 하며, `linear init` 및 `linear issues` 명령과 같은 도구를 사용하여 구식 이슈 감지 및 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 우선순위 지정 결정을 포함한 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y priorizar los backlogs de software utilizando Linear, proporcionando características como la detección de problemas obsoletos y decisiones de priorización a través de interfaces de línea de comandos, utilizando herramientas como los comandos `linear init` y `linear issues`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de prioriser les backlogs de logiciels à l''aide de Linear, offrant des fonctionnalités telles que la détection de problèmes obsolètes et les décisions de priorisation via des interfaces de ligne de commande, en utilisant des outils comme les commandes `linear init` et `linear issues`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Software-Backlogs mithilfe von Linear zu analysieren und zu priorisieren, indem es Funktionen wie die Erkennung veralteter Probleme und Priorisierungsentscheidungen über die Befehlszeilenoberfläche bereitstellt, unter Verwendung von Tools wie den Befehlen `linear init` und `linear issues`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisarem e priorizarem backlogs de software usando Linear, fornecendo recursos como detecção de problemas obsoletos e decisões de priorização por meio de interfaces de linha de comando, utilizando ferramentas como os comandos `linear init` e `linear issues`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и приоритезировать программные задачи с помощью Linear, предоставляя функции, такие как обнаружение устаревших задач и принятие решений о приоритете через командную строку, используя инструменты, такие как команды `linear init` и `linear issues`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وتحديد أهمية فواصل زمنية البرامج باستخدام Linear، وتقديم ميزات مثل الكشف عن قضايا قديمة وعمليات تحديد الأولوية من خلال واجهات سطر الأوامر، باستخدام أدوات مثل أوامر `linear init` و `linear issues`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating backlog cleanup","Prioritizing issues with `linear issues`","Identifying stale or blocked issues for resolution"],"zh":["自动化后台清理","使用`linear issues`优先级排序问题","识别过期或被阻塞的问题以进行解决"],"ja":["バックログの自動クリーンアップ","`linear issues`を使用した問題の優先順位付け","解決のために古くなったまたはブロックされた問題を特定する"],"ko":["백로그 자동 정리","`linear issues`를 사용한 이슈 우선순위 지정","해결을 위해 구식 또는 차단된 문제 식별"],"es":["Automatizar la limpieza de backlog","Priorizar problemas con `linear issues`","Identificar problemas obsoletos o bloqueados para su resolución"],"fr":["Automatiser le nettoyage du backlog","Prioriser les problèmes avec `linear issues`","Identifier les problèmes obsolètes ou bloqués pour résolution"],"de":["Automatisierung der Backlog-Reinigung","Priorisierung von Problemen mit `linear issues`","Identifizierung veralteter oder blockierter Probleme zur Lösung"],"pt":["Automatizar a limpeza do backlog","Priorizar problemas com `linear issues`","Identificar problemas obsoletos ou bloqueados para resolução"],"ru":["Автоматизировать очистку задач","Приоритезировать проблемы с помощью `linear issues`","Определить устаревшие или заблокированные проблемы для решения"],"ar":["تحسين وتيرة تنظيف الفواصل الزمنية","تحديد الأولوية للمشاكل مع `linear issues`","تحديد المشاكل القديمة أو المحظورة لحلها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linear context setup with `linear init`","Dependent on `.linear.yaml` configuration file","Limited to Linear platform"],"zh":["需要使用`linear init`设置Linear上下文","依赖于`.linear.yaml`配置文件","仅限于Linear平台"],"ja":["`linear init`を使用してLinearコンテキストを設定する必要がある","`.linear.yaml`構成ファイルに依存する","Linearプラットフォームに限定される"],"ko":["`linear init`를 사용하여 Linear 컨텍스트 설정이 필요합니다.","`.linear.yaml` 구성 파일에 의존합니다.","Linear 플랫폼에만限합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de contexto de Linear con `linear init`","Dependiente del archivo de configuración `.linear.yaml`","Limitado a la plataforma Linear"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de contexte Linear avec `linear init`","Dépendant du fichier de configuration `.linear.yaml`","Limité à la plate-forme Linear"],"de":["Benötigt Linear-Kontexteinrichtung mit `linear init`","Abhängig von der Konfigurationsdatei `.linear.yaml`","Begrenzt auf die Linear-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer configuração de contexto Linear com `linear init`","Dependente do arquivo de configuração `.linear.yaml`","Limitado à plataforma Linear"],"ru":["Требует настройки контекста Linear с помощью `linear init`","Зависит от файла конфигурации `.linear.yaml`","Ограничен платформой Linear"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد سياق Linear باستخدام `linear init`","يعتمد على ملف التكوين `.linear.yaml`","محدود بمنصة Linear"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
