更改","ja":"SDD Commit ガイドラインは、変更を効果的に文書化するために、明確で一貫性のあるコミットメッセージとプルリクエストを作成する方法を提供します","ko":"SDD 커밋 가이드는 변경 사항을 효과적으로 문서화하기 위해 명확하고 일관된 커밋 메시지 및 풀 리퀘스트를 생성하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"SDD Commit es una guía para crear mensajes de commit claros y consistentes. Sigue el estándar Conventional Commits para documentar tus cambios de manera efec...","fr":"SDD Commit est un guide pour créer des messages de commit clairs et cohérents. Suivez la norme Conventional Commits pour documenter vos modifications de mani...","de":"SDD Commit ist eine Anleitung zum Erstellen klarer und konsistenter Commit-Mitteilungen. Befolgen Sie den Conventional Commits-Standard, um Ihre Änderungen e...","pt":"O SDD Commit é um conjunto de diretrizes para criar mensagens de commit e pull requests claras e consistentes","ru":"SDD Commit - это набор руководств для создания четких и последовательных сообщений коммитов и запросов pull","ar":"SDD Commit هو مجموعة من الإرشادات لإنشاء رسائل إلتزام وطلبات سحابية واضحة ومستمرة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["遵循 Conventional Commits 规范","支持 feat、fix、docs 等类型前缀","可选正文和脚注","清晰、连贯的提交消息","有效的拉取请求文档"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 規格に従う","feat、fix、docs などのタイププレフィックスをサポート","オプションの本文とフッター","明確で一貫性のあるコミットメッセージ","効果的なプルリクエスト文書"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 규격 준수","feat, fix, docs 등의 유형 접두사 지원","선택적 본문 및 푸터","명확하고 일관된 커밋 메시지","효과적인 풀 리퀘스트 문서"],"es":["Mensajes de commit claros y consistentes","Seguimiento del estándar Conventional Commits","Documentación efectiva de cambios","Tipos de commit predefinidos (feat, fix, docs)","Soporte para cuerpo y pie de página opcionales"],"fr":["Messages de commit clairs et cohérents","Suivi de la norme Conventional Commits","Documentation efficace des modifications","Types de commit prédéfinis (feat, fix, docs)","Prise en charge de corps et de pied de page facultatifs"],"de":["Klare und konsistente Commit-Mitteilungen","Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Standards","Effektive Dokumentation von Änderungen","Vordefinierte Commit-Typen (feat, fix, docs)","Unterstützung für optionalen Textkörper und Fußzeile"],"pt":["Padrão de mensagens de commit","Tipos de commit (feat, fix, docs)","Estrutura de corpo e rodapé","Convenções de nomenclatura","Compatibilidade com Conventional Commits"],"ru":["Стандарт сообщений коммитов","Типы коммитов (feat, fix, docs)","Структура тела и футера","Конвенции именования","Совместимость с Conventional Commits"],"ar":["معيار رسائل الإلتزام","أنواع الإلتزام (feat, fix, docs)","هيكل الجسم والتذييل","اتفاقيات التسمية","التوافق مع Conventional Commits"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","提交消息","拉取请求","代码更改","文档","feat","fix","docs"],"ja":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","コミットメッセージ","プルリクエスト","コード変更","文書","feat","fix","docs"],"ko":["SDD 커밋","Conventional Commits","커밋 메시지","풀 리퀘스트","코드 변경","문서","feat","fix","docs"],"es":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","messaging de commit","documentación de cambios","desarrollo de software","mejores prácticas de commit"],"fr":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","messagerie de commit","documentation des modifications","développement de logiciels","meilleures pratiques de commit"],"de":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","Commit-Mitteilungen","Dokumentation von Änderungen","Software-Entwicklung","Best Practices für Commits"],"pt":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","mensagens de commit","pull requests","padrões de commit","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","сообщения коммитов","запросы pull","стандарты коммитов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["SDD Commit","Conventional Commits","رسائل الإلتزام","طلبات سحابية","معايير الإلتزام","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"yi-john-huang","repo":"sdd-mcp","repoPath":"yi-john-huang/sdd-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-commit","description":"Guide commit message and PR creation for SDD workflow. Use when committing changes, creating pull requests, or documenting changes. Invoked via /sdd-commit.","bodyPreview":"# SDD Commit & PR Guidelines\n\nCreate clear, consistent commit messages and pull requests that document changes effectively.\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nFollow the Conventional Commits specification:\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Type Prefixes\n\n| Type | When to Use | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | `feat(auth): add JWT refresh token` |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | `fix(api): handle null user response` |\n| `docs` | Documen","body":"# SDD Commit & PR Guidelines\n\nCreate clear, consistent commit messages and pull requests that document changes effectively.\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\nFollow the Conventional Commits specification:\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Type Prefixes\n\n| Type | When to Use | Example |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | `feat(auth): add JWT refresh token` |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | `fix(api): handle null user response` |\n| `docs` | Documentation only | `docs(readme): update installation steps` |\n| `style` | Formatting, no code change | `style(lint): fix linter warnings` |\n| `refactor` | Code change, no new feature or fix | `refactor(user): extract validation logic` |\n| `perf` | Performance improvement | `perf(query): add index for user lookup` |\n| `test` | Adding/updating tests | `test(auth): add login failure tests` |\n| `build` | Build system changes | `build(deps): update dependencies` |\n| `ci` | CI/CD changes | `ci(github): add test workflow` |\n| `chore` | Other changes | `chore(deps): bump lodash version` |\n| `revert` | Revert previous commit | `revert: feat(auth): add JWT refresh` |\n\n### Scope\n\nThe scope should indicate the area affected:\n\n```\nfeat(auth):       # Authentication module\nfix(api/users):   # Users API endpoint\ndocs(readme):     # README file\ntest(e2e):        # End-to-end tests\nrefactor(db):     # Database layer\n```\n\n### Subject Line\n\n- Use imperative mood: \"add\" not \"added\" or \"adds\"\n- Don''t capitalize first letter\n- No period at the end\n- Max 50 characters\n\n```\n# GOOD\nfeat(auth): add password reset flow\nfix(cart): prevent duplicate items\n\n# BAD\nfeat(auth): Added password reset flow.\nfix(cart): Fixes the duplicate items bug\n```\n\n### Body (Optional)\n\nUse for explaining:\n- **What** changed and **why**\n- Breaking changes\n- Related issues\n\n```\nfeat(auth): add multi-factor authentication\n\nImplement TOTP-based 2FA for enhanced security.\nUsers can now enable 2FA from their profile settings.\n\n- Add TOTP secret generation\n- Add QR code for authenticator apps\n- Add backup codes for recovery\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n### Footer (Optional)\n\n```\nBREAKING CHANGE: API endpoint changed from /users to /api/v1/users\n\nRefs: #123, #456\nCo-authored-by: Name <email@example.com>\n```\n\n## Pull Request Template\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n<!-- 1-3 bullet points describing the changes -->\n- Add user authentication with JWT\n- Implement password reset flow\n- Add comprehensive test coverage\n\n## Motivation\n<!-- Why is this change needed? -->\nUsers need secure authentication to access protected resources.\n\n## Changes\n<!-- Detailed list of changes -->\n### Added\n- `AuthService` for handling authentication logic\n- `JWTProvider` for token generation/validation\n- Unit and integration tests for auth flow\n\n### Changed\n- Updated `UserController` to use AuthService\n- Modified API routes to require authentication\n\n### Removed\n- Deprecated session-based authentication\n\n## Testing\n<!-- How was this tested? -->\n- [x] Unit tests pass\n- [x] Integration tests pass\n- [x] Manual testing completed\n- [ ] E2E tests (pending)\n\n## Screenshots\n<!-- If applicable -->\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project style guidelines\n- [x] Tests added/updated\n- [x] Documentation updated\n- [x] No breaking changes (or documented)\n- [x] Security considerations reviewed\n\n## Related Issues\nCloses #123\nRefs #456\n```\n\n## Commit Best Practices\n\n### Atomic Commits\nEach commit should be one logical change:\n\n```bash\n# GOOD: Separate commits for separate changes\ngit commit -m \"feat(user): add email validation\"\ngit commit -m \"test(user): add email validation tests\"\n\n# BAD: Multiple unrelated changes\ngit commit -m \"add email validation, fix bug, update docs\"\n```\n\n### Commit Frequency\n- Commit when a logical unit is complete\n- Don''t commit broken code\n- Small, frequent commits are better than large, infrequent ones\n\n### Commit Message Examples\n\n#### Feature\n```\nfeat(cart): add quantity update functionality\n\nAllow users to update item quantities directly from the cart.\nIncludes optimistic UI updates and error handling.\n\n- Add updateQuantity method to CartService\n- Add quantity input component\n- Add debounced API calls\n\nCloses #234\n```\n\n#### Bug Fix\n```\nfix(auth): prevent session fixation attack\n\nRegenerate session ID after successful login to prevent\nsession fixation attacks.\n\nSecurity: OWASP A7 - Identification and Authentication Failures\n```\n\n#### Refactor\n```\nrefactor(api): extract common error handling\n\nMove error handling logic to middleware for consistency\nacross all API endpoints.\n\n- Create ErrorHandlerMiddleware\n- Add custom error classes\n- Update all controllers to throw custom errors\n\nNo functional changes.\n```\n\n#### Breaking Change\n```\nfeat(api)!: change user endpoint response format\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The /api/users endpoint now returns\na paginated response instead of an array.\n\nBefore:\n[{ id: 1, name: \"John\" }, ...]\n\nAfter:\n{\n  data: [{ id: 1, name: \"John\" }, ...],\n  pagination: { page: 1, total: 100 }\n}\n\nMigration: Update all clients to handle the new response format.\n```\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n```\n<type>/<ticket>-<description>\n\nExamples:\nfeature/AUTH-123-jwt-authentication\nbugfix/CART-456-duplicate-items\nhotfix/PROD-789-security-patch\nchore/update-dependencies\n```\n\n## Git Workflow\n\n### Before Committing\n```bash\n# Check status\ngit status\n\n# Review changes\ngit diff\n\n# Stage specific files\ngit add src/auth/\n\n# Or stage all\ngit add -A\n```\n\n### Creating Commit\n```bash\n# With message\ngit commit -m \"feat(auth): add login endpoint\"\n\n# Open editor for longer message\ngit commit\n```\n\n### Before PR\n```bash\n# Update from main\ngit fetch origin main\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Run tests\n{your test command}  # e.g., npm test, pytest, cargo test, go test\n\n# Push\ngit push origin feature/AUTH-123-jwt-auth\n```\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- [ ] Commit message follows format\n- [ ] Type prefix is appropriate\n- [ ] Scope is specific\n- [ ] Subject is imperative and concise\n- [ ] Body explains why (if needed)\n- [ ] Breaking changes documented\n- [ ] Related issues linked\n- [ ] Branch name follows convention\n- [ ] Tests pass before commit\n- [ ] PR description complete\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:04:46.303Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit message formatting.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息格式的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージのフォーマットを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 필요로 하는 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Administración de Código que necesitan un formato de mensaje de confirmación estandarizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Code nécessitant un format de message de validation standardisé.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Nachrichten-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de formatação de mensagens de commit padronizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированного форматирования сообщений о коммитах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق رسائل الالتزام الموحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create clear and consistent commit messages following the Conventional Commits specification, utilizing type prefixes like ''feat'', ''fix'', and ''docs'' to effectively document changes in Git repositories using protocols like HTTP or SSH.","zh":"赋予代理创建清晰、一致的提交消息的能力，遵循 Conventional Commits 规范，利用类型前缀如 ''feat''、''fix'' 和 ''docs''，有效地记录 Git 仓库中的更改，使用 HTTP 或 SSH 等协议。","ja":"エージェントが Conventional Commits の仕様に従って明確で一貫したコミットメッセージを作成する能力を提供します。''feat''、''fix''、''docs'' などのタイプのプレフィックスを使用して、HTTP や SSH などのプロトコルを使用する Git リポジトリ内の変更を有効に文書化します。","ko":"Conventional Commits 사양을 준수하여明確하고 일관된 커밋 메시지를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. ''feat'', ''fix'', ''docs''와 같은 유형의 접두사를 사용하여 HTTP 또는 SSH와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하는 Git 리포지토리 내의 변경 사항을 효과적으로 문서화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear mensajes de confirmación claros y coherentes siguiendo la especificación Conventional Commits, utilizando prefijos de tipo como ''feat'', ''fix'' y ''docs'' para documentar efectivamente los cambios en los repositorios Git utilizando protocolos como HTTP o SSH.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des messages de validation clairs et cohérents en suivant la spécification Conventional Commits, en utilisant des préfixes de type tels que ''feat'', ''fix'' et ''docs'' pour documenter efficacement les modifications dans les référentiels Git en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP ou SSH.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klare und konsistente Commit-Nachrichten zu erstellen, die der Conventional Commits-Spezifikation entsprechen, unter Verwendung von Typ-Präfixen wie ''feat'', ''fix'' und ''docs'', um Änderungen in Git-Repositorys effektiv zu dokumentieren, die Protokolle wie HTTP oder SSH verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar mensagens de commit claras e consistentes, seguindo a especificação Conventional Commits, utilizando prefixos de tipo como ''feat'', ''fix'' e ''docs'' para documentar efetivamente as alterações em repositórios Git que usam protocolos como HTTP ou SSH.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать ясные и последовательные сообщения о коммитах, следуя спецификации Conventional Commits, используя префиксы типа ''feat'', ''fix'' и ''docs'' для эффективной документации изменений в репозиториях Git, использующих протоколы như HTTP или SSH.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إنشاء رسائل الالتزام الواضحة والمستمرة، اتباعًا لمواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية، باستخدام بادئات النوع مثل ''feat'' و ''fix'' و ''docs'' لتوثيق التغييرات بشكل فعال في مستودعات جيت باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP أو SSH."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating commit messages for new features","Automating pull request descriptions","Standardizing commit history for collaborative projects"],"zh":["为新功能生成提交消息","自动化拉取请求描述","为协作项目标准化提交历史"],"ja":["新機能のコミットメッセージを生成する","プルリクエストの説明を自動化する","コラボレーションプロジェクトのコミット履歴を標準化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능에 대한 커밋 메시지 생성","풀 요청 설명 자동화","협업 프로젝트를 위한 커밋 기록 표준화"],"es":["Generación de mensajes de confirmación para nuevas características","Automatización de descripciones de solicitudes de extracción","Estandarización del historial de confirmaciones para proyectos colaborativos"],"fr":["Génération de messages de validation pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Automatisation des descriptions de demandes d''extraction","Standardisation de l''historique des validations pour les projets collaboratifs"],"de":["Generierung von Commit-Nachrichten für neue Funktionen","Automatisierung von Pull-Request-Beschreibungen","Standardisierung der Commit-Historie für kollaborative Projekte"],"pt":["Geração de mensagens de commit para recursos novos","Automatização de descrições de solicitações de pull","Padronização do histórico de commit para projetos colaborativos"],"ru":["Генерация сообщений о коммитах для новых функций","Автоматизация описаний запросов на принятие изменений","Стандартизация истории коммитов для совместных проектов"],"ar":["توليد رسائل الالتزام ل功能 جديدة","آليّة وصف طلبات السحب","توحيد تاريخ الالتزام لمشاريع تعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits syntax","Limited to Git version control systems"],"zh":["需要遵守 Conventional Commits 语法","仅限 Git 版本控制系统"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 構文に従う必要がある","Git バージョン管理システムに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 구문을 따라야 함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la sintaxis Conventional Commits","Limitado a los sistemas de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la syntaxe Conventional Commits","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Conventional Commits-Syntax","Begrenzt auf Git-Versionierungssysteme"],"pt":["Exige aderência à sintaxe Conventional Commits","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения синтаксиса Conventional Commits","Ограничен системами контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال لتنسيق الالتزامات التقليدية","محدود بنظم التحكم في الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
