e se centra en la corrección, simplicidad y mantenibilidad del código","fr":"La révision de code SDD est une analyse exhaustive qui se concentre sur la correction, la simplicité et la maintenabilité du code","de":"Die SDD-Code-Review ist eine umfassende Analyse, die sich auf die Korrektheit, Einfachheit und Wartbarkeit des Codes konzentriert","pt":"A revisão de código SDD é uma análise técnica completa que visa garantir a correção, simplicidade e manutenção do código","ru":"Обзор кода SDD - это тщательный технический анализ, направленный на обеспечение правильности, простоты и поддержки кода","ar":"استعراض رمز SDD هو تحليل تقني شامل يهدف إلى ضمان صحة و بساطة و صيانة الشفرة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码正确性检查","代码简单性分析","代码可维护性评估","遵循 Linus Torvalds 的代码审查哲学"],"ja":["コードの正確性の確認","コードのシンプルさの分析","コードの保守性の評価","Linus Torvalds のコードレビューフィロソフィーに従ったレビュー"],"ko":["코드 정확성 체크","코드 단순성 분석","코드 유지 보수성 평가","Linus Torvalds 의 코드 리뷰 철학을 따르는 리뷰"],"es":["Análisis de corrección","Evaluación de simplicidad","Verificación de mantenibilidad","Revisión de convenciones","Mejora de la calidad del código","Análisis de casos límite"],"fr":["Analyse de correction","Évaluation de simplicité","Vérification de maintenabilité","Révision de conventions","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Analyse de cas limites"],"de":["Korrektheitsanalyse","Einfachheitsbewertung","Wartbarkeitsprüfung","Überprüfung von Konventionen","Qualitätsverbesserung des Codes","Analyse von Randfällen"],"pt":["Análise de correção","Verificação de simplicidade","Avaliação de manutenção","Conformidade com convenções"],"ru":["Анализ правильности","Проверка простоты","Оценка поддержки","Соответствие конвенциям"],"ar":["تحليل الصحة","فحص البساطة","تقييم الصيانة","امتثال للاتفاقيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SDD 代码审查","代码质量","代码正确性","代码简单性","代码可维护性","Linus Torvalds"],"ja":["SDD コードレビュー","コード品質","コードの正確性","コードのシンプルさ","コードの保守性","Linus Torvalds"],"ko":["SDD 코드 리뷰","코드 품질","코드 정확성","코드 단순성","코드 유지 보수성","Linus Torvalds"],"es":["revisión de código","análisis de código","calidad del código","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","mejora de código","optimización de código","codificación eficiente"],"fr":["révision de code","analyse de code","qualité du code","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","amélioration de code","optimisation de code","codage efficace"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Analyse","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Code-Optimierung","Code-Verbesserung","effizientes Coden"],"pt":["revisão de código","análise técnica","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","manutenção de código","convenções de código"],"ru":["обзор кода","технический анализ","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","поддержка кода","конвенции кода"],"ar":["استعراض الشفرة","تحليل تقني","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","صيانة الشفرة","اتفاقيات الشفرة"]}},"owner":"yi-john-huang","repo":"sdd-mcp","repoPath":"yi-john-huang/sdd-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-review","description":"Perform thorough Linus-style code review focusing on correctness, maintainability, and adherence to project conventions. Use after completing implementation to ensure code quality. Invoked via /sdd-review [file-path or PR-number].","bodyPreview":"# SDD Code Review\n\nPerform comprehensive code reviews in the style of Linus Torvalds - direct, thorough, and focused on what matters: correctness, simplicity, and long-term maintainability.\n\n## Review Philosophy\n\n> \"Talk is cheap. Show me the code.\"\n> — Linus Torvalds\n\nThis review focuses on:\n1. **Correctness** - Does it actually work? Does it handle edge cases?\n2. **Simplicity** - Is it more complex than necessary?\n3. **Maintainability** - Will future developers understand this?\n4. **Convention","body":"# SDD Code Review\n\nPerform comprehensive code reviews in the style of Linus Torvalds - direct, thorough, and focused on what matters: correctness, simplicity, and long-term maintainability.\n\n## Review Philosophy\n\n> \"Talk is cheap. Show me the code.\"\n> — Linus Torvalds\n\nThis review focuses on:\n1. **Correctness** - Does it actually work? Does it handle edge cases?\n2. **Simplicity** - Is it more complex than necessary?\n3. **Maintainability** - Will future developers understand this?\n4. **Convention Adherence** - Does it follow project patterns?\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify Review Scope\n\nDetermine what to review:\n- **Single file**: `/sdd-review src/services/UserService.ts`\n- **Directory**: `/sdd-review src/services/`\n- **Git diff**: `/sdd-review HEAD~3..HEAD`\n- **PR/MR**: `/sdd-review PR-123` or `/sdd-review MR-45`\n\n### Step 2: Load Project Context\n\nBefore reviewing:\n1. Read project steering documents from `.spec/steering/`\n2. Understand existing patterns in the codebase\n3. Check if there''s a related spec in `.spec/specs/`\n\n### Step 3: Perform Review\n\n#### Code Correctness Checks\n\n```markdown\n## Correctness Issues\n\n### Critical\n- [ ] Logic errors that will cause bugs\n- [ ] Race conditions or threading issues\n- [ ] Resource leaks (files, connections, memory)\n- [ ] Unhandled error conditions\n\n### Important\n- [ ] Edge cases not handled\n- [ ] Assumptions that may not hold\n- [ ] Off-by-one errors\n- [ ] Type mismatches or unsafe casts\n```\n\n#### Simplicity Assessment\n\nAsk these questions:\n- Could this be done with less code?\n- Is there a standard library function for this?\n- Is this abstraction earning its keep?\n- Would a junior developer understand this in 6 months?\n\n#### Pattern Violations\n\nCheck against project conventions:\n```markdown\n## Pattern Violations\n\n### Naming\n- [ ] Variables don''t follow naming convention\n- [ ] Functions named for implementation, not purpose\n\n### Structure\n- [ ] Logic in wrong layer (controller doing business logic)\n- [ ] Missing separation of concerns\n- [ ] Circular dependencies introduced\n\n### Error Handling\n- [ ] Swallowed exceptions\n- [ ] Generic error messages\n- [ ] Missing error propagation\n```\n\n### Step 4: Provide Feedback\n\nStructure feedback with clear categories:\n\n```markdown\n# Code Review: {file/PR description}\n\n## Summary\nBrief overall assessment (1-2 sentences)\n\n## 🚨 Must Fix (Blocking)\nIssues that must be resolved before merge:\n1. **Line 42**: Memory leak - connection never closed\n   ```diff\n   - const conn = await getConnection();\n   + const conn = await getConnection();\n   + try { ... } finally { conn.close(); }\n   ```\n\n## ⚠️ Should Fix (Non-blocking)\nIssues that should be addressed but won''t block:\n1. **Line 78**: Magic number should be a named constant\n2. **Line 103**: Consider extracting this to a helper function\n\n## 💡 Suggestions (Optional)\nImprovements that would be nice but are truly optional:\n1. **Line 156**: This could be simplified with `Array.flatMap()`\n\n## ✅ What''s Good\nAcknowledge good patterns to reinforce them:\n1. Good use of dependency injection\n2. Clear separation of concerns\n3. Comprehensive error handling in auth module\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify Tests\n\nFor any code changes:\n1. Check if tests exist for modified code\n2. Verify edge cases are tested\n3. Run existing tests to ensure no regressions\n\n```bash\n# Run tests for affected files\nnpm test -- --findRelatedTests {changed-files}\n```\n\n## Review Severity Levels\n\n| Level | Meaning | Action Required |\n|-------|---------|-----------------|\n| 🚨 **Critical** | Bug, security issue, data loss risk | Must fix before merge |\n| ⚠️ **Warning** | Code smell, potential issue | Should fix, discuss if disagree |\n| 💡 **Info** | Suggestion, style preference | Optional, author''s choice |\n\n## Common Issues to Watch For\n\n### TypeScript/JavaScript Specific\n- `any` type usage without justification\n- Missing null/undefined checks\n- Promises not awaited\n- Event listener memory leaks\n- Mutable shared state\n\n### General\n- Functions doing too much\n- Deep nesting (> 3 levels)\n- Boolean parameters (use options object)\n- Comments explaining *what* instead of *why*\n- Dead code or unused imports\n\n## Integration with SDD Workflow\n\nWhen reviewing implementation:\n1. Compare against requirements in `.spec/specs/{feature}/requirements.md`\n2. Verify design patterns from `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n3. Check task completion against `.spec/specs/{feature}/tasks.md`\n\n## Example Review\n\n```markdown\n# Code Review: UserAuthService.ts\n\n## Summary\nGood overall structure but has a critical security issue and some error handling gaps.\n\n## 🚨 Must Fix\n1. **Line 67**: Password stored in plain text in error log\n   ```typescript\n   // BAD: Leaks credentials\n   logger.error(`Login failed for ${email} with password ${password}`);\n\n   // GOOD: Never log credentials\n   logger.error(`Login failed for ${email}`);\n   ```\n\n## ⚠️ Should Fix\n1. **Line 89**: Catch block swallows all errors\n2. **Line 112-130**: This block should be extracted to a private method\n\n## ✅ What''s Good\n- Clean separation between auth logic and data access\n- Good use of TypeScript discriminated unions for auth result\n- Comprehensive input validation\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:04:55.979Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing comprehensive analysis of correctness, simplicity, and maintainability in codebases.","zh":"非常适合需要对代码库进行全面分析的代码审查代理，包括正确性、简单性和可维护性。","ja":"コードレビュー代理がコードベースの正しさ、シンプルさ、メンテナブル性の包括的な分析を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 코드베이스의 정확성, 단순성, 유지 보수성을 종합적으로 분석해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan un análisis integral de la corrección, la simplicidad y la mantenibilidad en bases de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code ayant besoin d''une analyse complète de la correction, de la simplicité et de la maintenabilité des bases de code.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine umfassende Analyse der Richtigkeit, Einfachheit und Wartbarkeit in Codebasen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise abrangente de correção, simplicidade e manutenibilidade em repositórios de código.","ru":"Идеально для агентов код-ревью, которым необходим всесторонний анализ правильности, простоты и поддерживаемости кодовых баз.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعراض الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل شامل للصحة والدقة والصيانة في قواعد الشفرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough code reviews focusing on correctness, simplicity, and long-term maintainability, utilizing principles akin to Linus Torvalds'' philosophy, emphasizing edge case handling, and adherence to convention.","zh":"使代理能够执行彻底的代码审查，重点关注正确性、简单性和长期可维护性，利用类似Linus Torvalds哲学的原则，强调边缘情况处理和对规范的遵守。","ja":"エージェントがコードの正しさ、シンプルさ、長期的なメンテナブル性に焦点を当てた徹底的なコードレビューを実行できるようにし、Linus Torvaldsの哲学に似た原則を使用し、エッジケースの処理と規約への従順性を強調します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드의 정확성, 단순성, 장기적인 유지 보수성을 중점으로 하는 철저한 코드 리뷰를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, Linus Torvalds의 철학과 유사한 원칙을 사용하여 에지 케이스 처리와 규약 준수를 강조합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas centradas en la corrección, la simplicidad y la mantenibilidad a largo plazo, utilizando principios similares a la filosofía de Linus Torvalds, enfatizando el manejo de casos límite y el cumplimiento de convenciones.","fr":"Habilite les agents à effectuer des révisions de code approfondies en se concentrant sur la correction, la simplicité et la maintenabilité à long terme, en utilisant des principes similaires à la philosophie de Linus Torvalds, en mettant l''accent sur la gestion des cas limites et le respect des conventions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Code-Reviews durchzuführen, die sich auf Richtigkeit, Einfachheit und langfristige Wartbarkeit konzentrieren, unter Verwendung von Prinzipien, die der Philosophie von Linus Torvalds ähneln, wobei der Umgang mit Randfällen und die Einhaltung von Konventionen betont werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de código aprofundadas, focando na correção, simplicidade e manutenibilidade a longo prazo, utilizando princípios semelhantes à filosofia de Linus Torvalds, destacando o tratamento de casos de bordo e a aderência às convenções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные код-ревью, сосредотачиваясь на правильности, простоте и долгосрочной поддерживаемости, используя принципы, аналогичные философии Линуса Торвальдса, подчеркивая обработку граничных случаев и соблюдение конвенций.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء استعراض شفرة متعمق يركز على الصحة والدقة والصيانة على المدي الطويل، مستخدمًا مبادئ شبيهة بفلسفة لينوس تورفالدس، وشدد على معالجة حالات الحواف والامتثال للمواصفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing code correctness for production readiness","Simplifying complex codebases for better maintainability","Reviewing adherence to coding conventions"],"zh":["分析代码的正确性以确定生产就绪性","简化复杂的代码库以提高可维护性","审查对编码约定的遵守情况"],"ja":["本番環境への準備度を判断するためのコードの正しさの分析","メンテナブル性の向上のための複雑なコードベースの簡素化","コード規約への準拠状況のレビュー"],"ko":["생산 준비성을 결정하기 위한 코드의 정확성 분석","유지 보수성을 향상하기 위한 복잡한 코드베이스의 단순화","코딩 규약 준수状況의 검토"],"es":["Análisis de la corrección del código para la preparación de producción","Simplificación de bases de código complejas para una mejor mantenibilidad","Revisión del cumplimiento de las convenciones de codificación"],"fr":["Analyse de la correction du code pour la préparation de la production","Simplification de bases de code complexes pour une meilleure maintenabilité","Révision du respect des conventions de codage"],"de":["Analyse der Richtigkeit des Codes für die Produktionsbereitschaft","Vereinfachung komplexer Codebasen für eine bessere Wartbarkeit","Überprüfung der Einhaltung von Kodierkonventionen"],"pt":["Analisar a correção do código para preparação para produção","Simplificar repositórios de código complexos para melhor manutenibilidade","Revisar a aderência às convenções de codificação"],"ru":["Анализ правильности кода для подготовки к производству","Упрощение сложных кодовых баз для лучшей поддерживаемости","Проверка соблюдения кодекса конвенций"],"ar":["تحليل صحة الشفرة للاستعداد للإنتاج","تبسيط قواعد الشفرة المعقدة من أجل صيانة أفضل","استعراض الامتثال لمواصفات التشفير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Focuses on code quality aspects only"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅关注代码质量方面"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","コード品質の側面のみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요","코드 품질 측면만 중점적으로 다룸"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de código","Se centra solo en aspectos de calidad del código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels de code","Se concentre uniquement sur les aspects de qualité du code"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Code-Repositorys","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf Aspekte der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Requer acesso a repositórios de código","Foca apenas em aspectos de qualidade de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовым репозиториям","Фокусируется только на аспектах качества кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الشفرة","يركز فقط على جوانب جودة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
