トとして扱います。","ko":"jj 버전 관리는 고유한 워크플로를 채택하여 전통적인 커밋 방법을改变했습니다. 暫存 영역의 개념을 없애고 작업 디렉토리를 직접 커밋 객체로 취급합니다.","es":"jj es un sistema de control de versiones que trabaja directamente dentro de un commit, eliminando la necesidad de un área de preparación","fr":"jj est un système de contrôle de version qui fonctionne directement à l''intérieur d''un commit, éliminant la nécessité d''une zone de préparation","de":"jj ist ein Versionskontrollsystem, das direkt innerhalb eines Commits arbeitet und die Notwendigkeit einer Vorbereitungszone eliminiert","pt":"O JJ é um sistema de controle de versão que permite commits imediatos e elimina a necessidade de área de estágio.","ru":"JJ - это система контроля версий, которая позволяет мгновенно коммитить изменения и исключает необходимость в области подготовки.","ar":"JJ هو نظام التحكم في الإصدار الذي يسمح بالالتمات الفورية ويقضي على الحاجة إلى منطقة الإعداد","en":"My dotfile Repo"},"definition":{"en":"My dotfile Repo"},"features":{"zh":["无暂存区直接提交","工作目录即为提交对象","简化的开发流程","提高开发效率","支持新工作的快速开始"],"ja":["ステージングエリアなしで直接コミット","ワーキングディレクトリが直接コミットオブジェクト","開発プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","新しい作業の迅速な開始をサポート"],"ko":["暫存 영역 없이 직접 커밋","작업 디렉토리가 직접 커밋 객체","개발 프로세스의 단순화","개발 효율성의 향상","새로운 작업의 신속한 시작을 지원"],"es":["Commit integrado","Sin área de preparación","Cambios inmediatos en el commit","Nuevo trabajo en un commit fresco","Simplificación del flujo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Commit intégré","Pas de zone de préparation","Changements immédiats dans le commit","Nouveau travail dans un commit frais","Simplification du flux de développement"],"de":["Integrierter Commit","Keine Vorbereitungszone","Sofortige Änderungen im Commit","Neue Arbeit in einem frischen Commit","Vereinfachung des Entwicklungsflusses"],"pt":["Commits imediatos","Sem área de estágio","Trabalho dentro de um commit","Squash de commits","Fluxo de trabalho simplificado"],"ru":["Мгновенные коммиты","Без области подготовки","Работа внутри коммита","Сквош коммитов","Упрощенный рабочий процесс"],"ar":["الالتزامات الفورية","بدون منطقة إعداد","العمل داخل الالتزام","الضغط على الالتزامات","تрощة عمل مبسطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["jj 版本控制","版本管理","开发流程","提交工作流","开发效率","代码管理"],"ja":["jj バージョン管理","バージョン管理","開発プロセス","コミットワークフロー","開発効率","コード管理"],"ko":["jj 버전 관리","버전 관리","개발 프로세스","커밋 워크플로","개발 효율성","코드 관리"],"es":["control de versiones","commit integrado","desarrollo de software","sistema de control de versiones","flujo de trabajo","gestión de código"],"fr":["contrôle de version","commit intégré","développement de logiciels","système de contrôle de version","flux de travail","gestion de code"],"de":["Versionskontrolle","integrierter Commit","Softwareentwicklung","Versionskontrollsystem","Arbeitsfluss","Codeverwaltung"],"pt":["controle de versão","sistema de controle de versão","commits imediatos","sem área de estágio","trabalho dentro de um commit","squash de commits","fluxo de trabalho simplificado"],"ru":["контроль версий","система контроля версий","мгновенные коммиты","без области подготовки","работа внутри коммита","сквош коммитов","упрощенный рабочий процесс"],"ar":["التحكم في الإصدار","نظام التحكم في الإصدار","الالتزامات الفورية","بدون منطقة إعداد","العمل داخل الالتزام","الضغط على الالتزامات","تрощة عمل مبسطة"]}},"owner":"coreyja","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"coreyja/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jj","description":"Use Jujutsu (jj) for version control. Covers workflow, commits, bookmarks, pushing to GitHub, absorb, squash, and stacked PRs. Use when working with jj, creating commits, pushing changes, or managing version control.","bodyPreview":"# Jujutsu (jj) Version Control\n\n## The Key Mental Model\n\n**In jj, the working copy IS a commit.** This is fundamentally different from Git where you stage changes then commit. In jj, you''re always working inside a commit.\n\nThis means:\n- Changes you make are immediately part of the current commit\n- You should start new work in a fresh commit (so you can squash it later)\n- There''s no staging area - your working directory is the commit\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Always Start with `jj status`\n\nBefore an","body":"# Jujutsu (jj) Version Control\n\n## The Key Mental Model\n\n**In jj, the working copy IS a commit.** This is fundamentally different from Git where you stage changes then commit. In jj, you''re always working inside a commit.\n\nThis means:\n- Changes you make are immediately part of the current commit\n- You should start new work in a fresh commit (so you can squash it later)\n- There''s no staging area - your working directory is the commit\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Always Start with `jj status`\n\nBefore any operation, check your state:\n\n```bash\njj status\n```\n\n- \"Working copy is clean\" = you''re in an empty commit, ready to work\n- Shows file changes = current commit has work in it\n- Shows description = current commit is already described\n\n### The Basic Pattern\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create a new commit BEFORE starting work\njj new\n\n# 2. Make your changes (edit files)\n\n# 3. Describe what you did\njj describe -m \"Add user authentication\"\n\n# 4. Create a new commit for the next task\njj new\n\n# Repeat\n```\n\n**Why `jj new` before work?** If you work directly in a described commit, those changes get mixed in. Then you have to split them later. Starting fresh means you can always squash back if needed.\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\njj status          # Check current state - ALWAYS run first\njj log             # View commit history\njj diff            # See changes in current commit\njj describe -m \"\"  # Set/update commit message\njj new             # Create new empty commit\njj squash          # Move current changes into parent commit\njj absorb          # Auto-distribute changes to ancestor commits\n```\n\n## Bookmarks (Not Branches)\n\njj uses \"bookmarks\" instead of Git branches. Key differences:\n- Bookmarks are just labels pointing to commits\n- They don''t automatically advance when you commit\n- You can have commits without any bookmark\n\n```bash\njj bookmark list              # List all bookmarks\njj bookmark set foo -r @      # Create/move bookmark to current commit\njj bookmark delete foo        # Delete a bookmark\n```\n\n## Pushing to GitHub\n\n### First Push (New PR)\n\nUse `--change` (`-c`) to auto-create a bookmark and push:\n\n```bash\n# Push current commit, auto-generates bookmark name\njj git push -c @\n\n# Push parent of working copy (common when @ is empty)\njj git push -c @-\n```\n\nThis creates a bookmark with an auto-generated name like `push-abcdefgh` and pushes it.\n\n### Subsequent Pushes (Same PR)\n\nOnce a bookmark exists and tracks the remote, just push:\n\n```bash\njj git push\n```\n\njj knows which bookmarks have changed and pushes them. Force push is automatic when history rewrites.\n\n### Creating the PR\n\n```bash\n# Get the bookmark name from jj log or the push output\njj log -r @ --no-graph\n\n# Create PR with gh CLI (must specify --head since gh uses git)\ngh pr create --head push-abcdefgh\n```\n\n## Making More Changes to a PR\n\nWhen you need to update an existing PR:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create new commit on top of the PR commit\njj new\n\n# 2. Make your changes\n\n# 3. Fold changes back into the PR commit\njj squash          # Moves all changes to parent\n\n# 4. Push the update\njj git push\n```\n\n**Never work directly in the PR commit.** Always `jj new` first, then squash back.\n\n## Squash vs Absorb\n\n### `jj squash` - When You Know Where It Goes\n\nMoves changes from current commit into parent:\n\n```bash\njj squash                    # All changes to parent\njj squash file.rs            # Only specific files\njj squash --into <commit>    # Into a specific commit (not just parent)\n```\n\n### `jj absorb` - Auto-Distribute to Ancestors\n\nAnalyzes each changed line and moves it to the ancestor commit that last modified that line:\n\n```bash\njj absorb\n```\n\n**Best for stacked PRs**: When you have commits A → B → C and fix things that belong in different commits, `jj absorb` figures out where each change should go.\n\nTry `jj absorb` first. If it can''t figure out where something goes (new lines, ambiguous context), use `jj squash` manually.\n\n## Stacked PRs Workflow\n\nWhen working on multiple dependent PRs:\n\n```bash\n# Create stack: each commit = one PR\njj new main\n# work on feature A\njj describe -m \"Feature A\"\njj git push -c @\n\njj new\n# work on feature B (depends on A)\njj describe -m \"Feature B\"\njj git push -c @\n\n# Continue stacking...\n```\n\n### After a PR Merges\n\nWhen a PR in the middle of the stack merges:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Update the next PR''s base branch on GitHub\ngh pr edit <PR_NUMBER> --base main\n\n# 2. Fetch the new main\njj git fetch\n\n# 3. Rebase the remaining stack onto main\njj rebase -r <first-remaining-commit> -d main\n\n# 4. Push all updated branches\njj git push --all\n```\n\nThe `*` mark in `jj log` indicates bookmarks that need pushing.\n\n## Editing Earlier Commits\n\nNeed to modify a commit that has descendants?\n\n```bash\n# Switch working copy to that commit\njj edit <commit-id>\n\n# Make changes (they go directly into that commit)\n\n# Return to where you were\njj edit @\n\n# Descendants are automatically rebased\njj git push --all\n```\n\n## Splitting Commits\n\nWhen a commit has changes that should be separate:\n\n```bash\n# Interactive split\njj split\n\n# Non-interactive: specify files for first commit\nJJ_EDITOR=true jj split -m \"First commit message\" file1.rs file2.rs\n# Remaining files stay in second commit\njj describe -m \"Second commit message\"\n```\n\n## Undo\n\nMade a mistake? jj tracks all operations:\n\n```bash\njj undo              # Undo last operation\njj op log            # View operation history\njj op restore <id>   # Restore to specific operation\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### Working in a Described Commit\n\n**Wrong:**\n```bash\njj describe -m \"Feature A\"\n# ... keep making changes in same commit ...\n# Now Feature A commit has unrelated stuff mixed in\n```\n\n**Right:**\n```bash\njj describe -m \"Feature A\"\njj new                      # Start fresh for next work\n# ... make changes ...\njj squash                   # If changes belong in Feature A\n```\n\n### Forgetting `--allow-new` on First Push\n\n```bash\n# First time pushing a bookmark to a new remote\njj git push --bookmark main --allow-new\n```\n\nAfter the bookmark exists on the remote, you don''t need this flag.\n\n### Pushing a New Commit as a New PR\n\n**Wrong:**\n```bash\njj new\n# ... changes for existing PR ...\njj git push -c @            # Creates NEW bookmark/PR!\n```\n\n**Right:**\n```bash\njj new\n# ... changes for existing PR ...\njj squash                   # Fold into existing PR commit\njj git push                 # Updates existing bookmark\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:05:45.464Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing streamlined commit management and direct working copy integration.","zh":"非常适合需要简化提交管理和直接工作副本集成的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントがストリームライン化されたコミット管理と直接のワーキングコピー統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"버전 관리 에이전트가 스트림 라인화 된 커밋 관리 및 직접 작업 복사본 통합을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan una gestión de confirmación optimizada y una integración directa de copia de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant une gestion de commit rationalisée et une intégration directe de copie de travail.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine optimierte Commit-Verwaltung und eine direkte Integration der Arbeitskopie benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de controle de versão que necessitam de gerenciamento de commit otimizado e integração direta de cópia de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системы контроля версий, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент коммитов и прямая интеграция рабочей копии.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة Commit المُبسطة والتكامل المباشر للنسخة العامل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to work directly within commits, eliminating the need for staging areas and leveraging immediate change integration through the jj version control system, utilizing core workflow commands like `jj status`.","zh":"赋予代理直接在提交中工作的能力，消除了对暂存区域的需求，并通过jj版本控制系统利用立即的更改集成，利用诸如`jj status`的核心工作流命令。","ja":"エージェントがコミット内で直接作業できるようにし、ステージングエリアの必要性を排除し、jjバージョン管理システムを介した即時の変更の統合を活用し、`jj status`などのコアワークフローコマンドを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 커밋 내에서 직접 작업할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 스테이징 영역의 필요성을 제거하고 커밋을 통해 즉시 변경을 통합하며 `jj status`와 같은 핵심 워크플로우 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a trabajar directamente dentro de los commits, eliminando la necesidad de áreas de preparación y aprovechando la integración inmediata de cambios a través del sistema de control de versiones jj, utilizando comandos de flujo de trabajo básicos como `jj status`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de travailler directement à l''intérieur des commits, éliminant ainsi le besoin de zones de préparation et exploitant l''intégration immédiate des modifications via le système de contrôle de version jj, en utilisant des commandes de workflow de base comme `jj status`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, direkt innerhalb von Commits zu arbeiten, wodurch der Bedarf an Bereichen für die Vorbereitung eliminiert wird und die sofortige Integration von Änderungen durch das JJ-versionskontrollsystem genutzt wird, indem grundlegende Workflow-Befehle wie `jj status` verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a trabalharem diretamente dentro dos commits, eliminando a necessidade de áreas de preparação e aproveitando a integração imediata de alterações por meio do sistema de controle de versão jj, utilizando comandos de fluxo de trabalho principais como `jj status`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам работать напрямую внутри коммитов, исключая необходимость в области подготовки и используя мгновенную интеграцию изменений через систему контроля версий jj, используя основные команды рабочего процесса, такие как `jj status`.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بالعمل مباشرة داخل Commits، وإلغاء الحاجة إلى مناطق الإعداد واستغلال تكامل التغيير الفوري من خلال نظام التحكم في الإصدار jj، واستخدام أوامر تدفق العمل الرئيسية مثل `jj status`"},"useCases":{"en":["Streamlining commit workflows by starting new work in fresh commits","Squashing commits for cleaner version histories","Managing working directories as direct commit representations"],"zh":["通过在新提交中启动新工作来简化提交工作流","为了更干净的版本历史而压缩提交","将工作目录管理为直接提交的表示"],"ja":["新しいコミットで新しい作業を開始することでコミットワークフローをストリームライン化する","クリーンなバージョンの履歴のためにコミットを圧縮する","ワーキングディレクトリを直接コミットの表現として管理する"],"ko":["새로운 커밋에서 새로운 작업을 시작하여 커밋 워크플ロー 스트림 라인화","깨끗한 버전 기록을 위해 커밋을 스쿼시","작업 디렉토리를 직접 커밋의 표현으로 관리"],"es":["Optimización de flujos de trabajo de confirmación al iniciar nuevos trabajos en confirmaciones frescas","Aplanar confirmaciones para historias de versiones más limpias","Administración de directorios de trabajo como representaciones directas de confirmación"],"fr":["Optimisation des flux de travail de commit en lançant de nouveaux travaux dans des commits frais","Aplatir les commits pour des historiques de version plus propres","Gestion des répertoires de travail comme représentations directes de commit"],"de":["Optimierung von Commit-Arbeitsflüssen durch Starten neuer Arbeiten in frischen Commits","Zusammenfassen von Commits für saubere Versionsverläufe","Verwaltung von Arbeitsverzeichnissen als direkte Commit-Darstellungen"],"pt":["Otimização de fluxos de trabalho de commit, iniciando novos trabalhos em commits frescos","Squash de commits para históricos de versão mais limpos","Gerenciamento de diretórios de trabalho como representações diretas de commit"],"ru":["Оптимизация рабочих процессов коммитов, начиная новую работу в свежих коммитах","Сквош коммитов для более чистой истории версий","Управление рабочими каталогами как прямыми представлениями коммита"],"ar":["تسهيل تدفقات العمل من Commits، بدء عمل جديد في Commits جديدة","ضغط Commits من أجل تواريخ إصدارات أنظف","إدارة دلائل العمل كتجسيد مباشر للـ Commit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of commit-based version control","No staging area available","Working copy is always a commit"],"zh":["需要了解基于提交的版本控制","没有暂存区域可用","工作副本始终是一个提交"],"ja":["コミットベースのバージョン管理の理解が必要","ステージングエリアは利用できない","ワーキングコピーは常にコミットである"],"ko":["커밋 기반 버전 관리에 대한 이해가 필요함","스테이징 영역을 사용할 수 없음","작업 복사본은 항상 커밋"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del control de versiones basado en confirmaciones","No hay área de preparación disponible","La copia de trabajo siempre es un commit"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du contrôle de version basé sur les commits","Aucune zone de préparation disponible","La copie de travail est toujours un commit"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für commit-basiertes Versionskontrollsystem","Kein Bereitstellungsbereich verfügbar","Die Arbeitskopie ist immer ein Commit"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de controle de versão baseado em commit","Nenhuma área de preparação disponível","Cópia de trabalho é sempre um commit"],"ru":["Требует понимания контроля версий на основе коммитов","Нет доступной области подготовки","Рабочая копия всегда является коммитом"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم التحكم في الإصدار القائم على Commit","لا توجد منطقة إعداد متاحة","النسخة العامل دائمًا ما تكون Commit"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
