ry-sync"},"description":{"zh":"Memory Sync 技术用于维护会话之间的连续性，通过保存和加载上下文、跟踪关系和更新学习内容","ja":"メモリ同期スキルは、セッション間の連続性を維持するために使用され、コンテキストの保存とロード、関係の追跡、学習内容の更新を行います","ko":"메모리 동기화 기술은 세션 사이의 연속성을 유지하기 위해 사용되며, 컨텍스트의 저장 및 로드, 관계의 추적, 학습 내용의 업데이트를 수행합니다","es":"La habilidad de sincronización de memoria permite mantener la continuidad en tus sesiones de desarrollo, guardando y cargando el contexto actual","fr":"La compétence de synchronisation de mémoire permet de maintenir la continuité dans vos sessions de développement, en sauvegardant et en chargeant le contexte...","de":"Die Fähigkeit der Speicher-Synchronisation ermöglicht die Kontinuität über Sitzungen hinweg, indem sie den aktuellen Kontext speichert und lädt","pt":"A habilidade de sincronização de memória permite manter a continuidade entre sessões, salvando o contexto atual e carregando o estado anterior","ru":"Навык синхронизации памяти позволяет сохранить последовательность между сессиями, сохраняя текущий контекст и загружая предыдущее состояние","ar":"تسمح مهارة مزامنة الذاكرة بالحفاظ على الاتساق بين الجلسات، وحفظ السياق الحالي وتحميل الحالة السابقة","en":"AI"},"definition":{"en":"AI"},"features":{"zh":["保存当前上下文","加载之前的状态","更新学习内容","跟踪关系","支持多种操作"],"ja":["現在のコンテキストを保存","前の状態をロード","学習内容を更新","関係を追跡","複数の操作をサポート"],"ko":["현재 컨텍스트 저장","이전 상태 로드","학습 내용 업데이트","관계 추적","다중 작동 지원"],"es":["Guarda el contexto actual","Carga el contexto anterior","Actualiza los aprendizajes","Seguimiento de relaciones"],"fr":["Sauvegarde le contexte actuel","Charge le contexte précédent","Met à jour les apprentissages","Suivi des relations"],"de":["Speichert den aktuellen Kontext","Lädt den vorherigen Kontext","Aktualisiert die Lerninhalte","Verfolgt Beziehungen"],"pt":["Salva o contexto atual","Carrega o estado anterior","Atualiza os aprendizados","Acompanha as relações","Permite a sincronização de memória entre sessões"],"ru":["Сохраняет текущий контекст","Загружает предыдущее состояние","Обновляет знания","Отслеживает отношения","Позволяет синхронизацию памяти между сессиями"],"ar":["حفظ السياق الحالي","تحميل الحالة السابقة","تحديث التعلم","تتبع العلاقات","تمكين مزامنة الذاكرة بين الجلسات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Memory Sync","会话连续性","上下文保存","关系跟踪","学习内容更新","AI 技术"],"ja":["メモリ同期","セッションの連続性","コンテキストの保存","関係の追跡","学習内容の更新","AI 技術"],"ko":["메모리 동기화","세션 연속성","컨텍스트 저장","관계 추적","학습 내용 업데이트","AI 기술"],"es":["sincronización de memoria","desarrollo de sesiones","guardar contexto","cargar contexto","aprendizaje automático","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["synchronisation de mémoire","développement de sessions","sauvegarder le contexte","charger le contexte","apprentissage automatique","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Speicher-Synchronisation","Entwicklung von Sitzungen","Kontext speichern","Kontext laden","Automatisches Lernen","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["sincronização de memória","continuidade entre sessões","salvar contexto","carregar estado","atualizar aprendizados","acompanhar relações","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de memória"],"ru":["синхронизация памяти","последовательность между сессиями","сохранить контекст","загрузить состояние","обновить знания","отслеживать отношения","разработка программного обеспечения","технология памяти"],"ar":["مزامنة الذاكرة","الاتساق بين الجلسات","حفظ السياق","تحميل الحالة","تحديث التعلم","تتبع العلاقات","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذاكرة"]}},"owner":"frogr","repo":"austnomaton","repoPath":"frogr/austnomaton","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memory-sync","description":"Persist and recall context between sessions","bodyPreview":"# Memory Sync Skill\n\n## Purpose\nMaintain continuity across sessions:\n- Save current context\n- Load previous state\n- Update learnings\n- Track relationships\n\n## Invocation\n```\n/memory-sync [action] [options]\n```\n\n### Arguments\n- `action`: save, load, update, or status\n- `--file [file]`: Specific memory file\n- `--full`: Include all memory files\n\n### Examples\n```\n/memory-sync save                  # Save current context\n/memory-sync load                  # Load context at session start\n/memory-sync","body":"# Memory Sync Skill\n\n## Purpose\nMaintain continuity across sessions:\n- Save current context\n- Load previous state\n- Update learnings\n- Track relationships\n\n## Invocation\n```\n/memory-sync [action] [options]\n```\n\n### Arguments\n- `action`: save, load, update, or status\n- `--file [file]`: Specific memory file\n- `--full`: Include all memory files\n\n### Examples\n```\n/memory-sync save                  # Save current context\n/memory-sync load                  # Load context at session start\n/memory-sync update learnings      # Add to learnings\n/memory-sync status                # Show memory state\n```\n\n## Memory Files\n\n### context.md\nCurrent operational state:\n- What''s being worked on\n- Recent activity\n- Pending decisions\n- Notes for next session\n\n### learnings.md\nAccumulated knowledge:\n- What works\n- What doesn''t\n- Patterns discovered\n- Technical notes\n\n### relationships.md\nPeople and connections:\n- Key accounts\n- Interaction history\n- Potential collaborations\n\n### content-log.md\nEverything posted:\n- Full post history\n- Performance data\n- Prevents repetition\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Session Start\n```\n/memory-sync load\n```\n1. Read context.md for current state\n2. Check what was last worked on\n3. Note any pending items\n4. Ready to continue\n\n### During Session\n- Context updates happen naturally\n- Log content when posted\n- Note learnings as discovered\n- Track relationship interactions\n\n### Session End\n```\n/memory-sync save\n```\n1. Update context.md with current state\n2. Log any new learnings\n3. Update relationship notes\n4. Prepare for next session\n\n## Context Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Current Context\n\n## Last Updated\n[DATE]\n\n## Current Session Focus\n[What we''re working on]\n\n## Recent Activity\n[What was just done]\n\n## What Needs Attention\n[Priority items]\n\n## Pending Decisions\n[Open questions]\n\n## Context for Next Session\n[What to start with]\n\n## Notes\n[Anything else]\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Always Save\n- Before ending sessions\n- After major activities\n- When switching focus\n\n### Keep Context Fresh\n- Remove stale items\n- Update priorities\n- Clear completed items\n\n### Learn Continuously\n- Note what works\n- Note what doesn''t\n- Build knowledge base\n\n## Integration\n\nMemory system integrates with:\n- All other skills (they read/write context)\n- Dashboard (displays memory state)\n- Notifications (can alert on stale context)\n\n## Data Retention\n\n- context.md: Rolling (recent only)\n- learnings.md: Permanent (grows over time)\n- relationships.md: Permanent\n- content-log.md: Permanent archive\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:05:38.961Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational AI Agents requiring context continuity and session-based learning capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要上下文连续性和基于会话的学习能力的对话式 AI 代理。","ja":"会話の連続性とセッションベースの学習機能を必要とする会話型 AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"대화형 AI 에이전트가 문맥 연속성과 세션 기반 학습 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que requieren continuidad de contexto y capacidades de aprendizaje basadas en sesiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA conversationnelle nécessitant une continuité de contexte et des capacités d''apprentissage basées sur les sessions.","de":"Ideal für Conversational-AI-Agents, die Kontextkontinuität und Sitzungs-basierte Lernfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Conversacional que exigem continuidade de contexto e capacidades de aprendizado baseadas em sessão.","ru":"Идеально для конверсационных агентов ИИ, требующих непрерывности контекста и возможностей обучения на основе сессий.","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي للحوار الذي يتطلب استمرار السياق و القدرات التعليمية المعتمدة على الجلسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain continuity across sessions by saving and loading context, updating learnings, and tracking relationships using file-based memory storage with options like --file and --full.","zh":"通过保存和加载上下文、更新学习成果、使用基于文件的内存存储（如 --file 和 --full 选项）跟踪关系，赋予代理在会话间保持连续性的能力。","ja":"コンテキストを保存して読み込み、学習を更新し、ファイルベースのメモリストレージ（--file および --full オプションなど）を使用して関係を追跡することで、セッション間で連続性を維持するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"파일 기반 메모리 저장소（예: --파일 및 --전체 옵션）를 사용하여 문맥을 저장하고 로드하며, 학습을 업데이트하고 관계를 추적하여 에이전트가 세션 간에 연속성을 유지하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener la continuidad entre sesiones mediante el guardado y la carga de contexto, la actualización de aprendizajes y el seguimiento de relaciones utilizando un almacenamiento de memoria basado en archivos con opciones como --file y --full.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la continuité entre les sessions en sauvegardant et en chargeant le contexte, en mettant à jour les apprentissages et en suivant les relations à l''aide d''un stockage de mémoire basé sur des fichiers avec des options comme --file et --full.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Kontinuität zwischen Sitzungen durch Speichern und Laden von Kontext, Aktualisieren von Lernfunktionen und Nachverfolgen von Beziehungen mithilfe von dateibasiertem Speicher mit Optionen wie --file und --full aufrechtzuerhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a continuidade entre as sessões, salvando e carregando o contexto, atualizando os aprendizados e rastreando as relações usando o armazenamento de memória baseado em arquivos com opções como --file e --full.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать непрерывность между сессиями, сохраняя и загружая контекст, обновляя знания и отслеживая отношения с помощью файлового хранилища памяти с опциями --file и --full.","ar":"تمكن العميل من الحفاظ على الاستمرارية بين الجلسات من خلال حفظ و تحميل السياق و تحديث التعلم و تتبع العلاقات باستخدام تخزين ذاكرة الملفات مع خيارات مثل --file و --full."},"useCases":{"en":["Saving current context for future sessions","Loading previous state to resume conversations","Updating learnings based on user interactions"],"zh":["为将来的会话保存当前上下文","加载以前的状态以恢复对话","根据用户交互更新学习成果"],"ja":["将来的セッションのために現在のコンテキストを保存する","以前の状態をロードして会話を再開する","ユーザーとのやり取りに基づいて学習を更新する"],"ko":["미래의 세션을 위해 현재 문맥을 저장하는 것","以前의 상태를 로드하여 대화를 재개하는 것","사용자 상호 작용에 따라 학습을 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Guardar el contexto actual para futuras sesiones","Cargar el estado anterior para reanudar conversaciones","Actualizar los aprendizajes en función de las interacciones del usuario"],"fr":["Enregistrer le contexte actuel pour les sessions futures","Charger l''état précédent pour reprendre les conversations","Mettre à jour les apprentissages en fonction des interactions de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Aktuelles Kontext für zukünftige Sitzungen speichern","Vorherigen Zustand laden, um Konversationen fortzusetzen","Lernfunktionen basierend auf Benutzerinteraktionen aktualisieren"],"pt":["Salvar o contexto atual para sessões futuras","Carregar o estado anterior para retomar conversas","Atualizar os aprendizados com base em interações do usuário"],"ru":["Сохранить текущий контекст для будущих сессий","Загрузить предыдущее состояние для возобновления разговоров","Обновить знания на основе взаимодействия пользователя"],"ar":["حفظ السياق الحالي لجلسات مستقبلية","تحميل الحالة السابقة لاستئناف المحادثات","تحديث التعلم على أساس تفاعلات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for memory file storage","Limited to file-based memory storage"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限以实现内存文件存储","仅限于文件 기반内存存储"],"ja":["メモリファイルストレージのためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","ファイルベースのメモリストレージのみ"],"ko":["메모리 파일 저장소를 위해 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요함","파일 기반 메모리 저장소만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para el almacenamiento de memoria de archivos","Limitado al almacenamiento de memoria basado en archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour le stockage de mémoire de fichiers","Limité au stockage de mémoire basé sur des fichiers"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem für die dateibasierte Speicherung","Begrenzt auf dateibasierte Speicherung"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao sistema de arquivos para armazenamento de memória de arquivos","Limitado ao armazenamento de memória baseado em arquivos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для хранения файлов памяти","Ограничен файловым хранилищем памяти"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لتخزين ذاكرة الملفات","محدود بتخزين ذاكرة الملفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('PovertyAction/ipa-research-data-science-hub/uv', 'community', 'PovertyAction', 'ipa-research-data-science-hub', 'PovertyAction/ipa-research-data-science-hub', 'uv', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:06:08.097Z', NULL, '{"id":"PovertyAction/ipa-research-data-science-hub/uv","name":"uv","description":{"zh":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","ja":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","ko":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","es":"uv es un gestor de paquetes y proyectos Python extremadamente rápido, que reemplaza a pip, pip-tools y más","fr":"uv est un gestionnaire de paquets et de projets Python extrêmement rapide, qui remplace pip, pip-tools et plus","de":"uv ist ein extrem schneller Python-Paket- und Projektmanager, der pip, pip-tools und mehr ersetzt","pt":"uv é um gerenciador de pacotes Python extremamente rápido, escrito em Rust, que fornece isolamento de projeto e execução de código.","ru":"uv — это非常 быстрый менеджер пакетов Python, написанный на Rust, который обеспечивает изоляцию проекта и выполнение кода.","ar":"uv هو مدير حزم بايثون سريع للغاية، مكتوب بلغة روست، يوفر عزلة المشروع وتنفيذ الكود.","en":"IPA Research and Data Science Hub"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"uv Python ","ja":"uv Python","ko":"uv Python ","es":"uv: Gestor de Paquetes y Proyectos Python","fr":"uv: Gestionnaire de Paquets et de Projets Python","de":"uv: Python-Paket- und Projektmanager","pt":"uv: Gerenciador de Pacotes Python Rápido","ru":"uv: Быстрый Менеджер Пакетов Python","ar":"uv: مدير حزم بايثون سريع","en":"uv"},"description":{"zh":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","ja":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","ko":"uv , Rust , 10-100, pip","es":"uv es un gestor de paquetes y proyectos Python extremadamente rápido, que reemplaza a pip, pip-tools y más","fr":"uv est un gestionnaire de paquets et de projets Python extrêmement rapide, qui remplace pip, pip-tools et plus","de":"uv ist ein extrem schneller Python-Paket- und Projektmanager, der pip, pip-tools und mehr ersetzt","pt":"uv é um gerenciador de pacotes Python extremamente rápido, escrito em Rust, que fornece isolamento de projeto e execução de código.","ru":"uv — это非常 быстрый менеджер пакетов Python, написанный на Rust, который обеспечивает изоляцию проекта и выполнение кода.","ar":"uv هو مدير حزم بايثون سريع للغاية، مكتوب بلغة روست، يوفر عزلة المشروع وتنفيذ الكود.","en":"IPA Research and Data Science Hub"},"definition":{"en":"IPA Research and Data Science Hub"},"features":{"zh":["10-100","Rust ","pyproject.toml","uv run","pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv"],"ja":["10-100","Rust ","pyproject.toml","uv run","pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv"],"ko":["10-100","Rust ","pyproject.toml","uv run","pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv"],"es":["Reemplaza a pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv y más","Ejecución de código en entornos de proyecto aislados con uv run","Compatible con archivos pyproject.toml","10-100 veces más rápido que otros gestores de paquetes","Escrito en Rust para mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Remplace pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv et plus","Exécution de code dans des environnements de projet isolés avec uv run","Compatible avec les fichiers pyproject.toml","10-100 fois plus rapide que les autres gestionnaires de paquets","Écrit en Rust pour une meilleure efficacité"],"de":["Ersetzt pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv und mehr","Ausführung von Code in isolierten Projektumgebungen mit uv run","Kompatibel mit pyproject.toml-Dateien","10-100 Mal schneller als andere Paketmanager","In Rust geschrieben für höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Velocidade 10-100x maior que pip e poetry","Isolamento de projeto","Execução de código em ambientes isolados","Substitui pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv e virtualenv"],"ru":["Скорость на 10-100 раз выше, чем у pip и poetry","Изоляция проекта","Выполнение кода в изолированных средах","Заменяет pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv и virtualenv"],"ar":["سرعة 10-100 مرة أسرع من pip وpoetry","عزلة المشروع","تنفيذ الكود في بيئات معزولة","يحل محل pip وpip-tools وpipx وpoetry وpyenv وvirtualenv"]},"keywords":{"zh":["uv","Python ","Rust","pip","pyproject.toml","uv run"],"ja":["uv","Python ","Rust","pip","pyproject.toml","uv run"],"ko":["uv","Python ","Rust","pip","pyproject.toml","uv run"],"es":["uv","gestor de paquetes python","proyecto python","pyproject.toml","rust","desarrollo de software","eficiencia","velocidad"],"fr":["uv","gestionnaire de paquets python","projet python","pyproject.toml","rust","développement de logiciels","efficacité","vitesse"],"de":["uv","python-paketmanager","python-projekt","pyproject.toml","rust","softwareentwicklung","effizienz","geschwindigkeit"],"pt":["uv","gerenciador de pacotes python","pip","poetry","pyenv","virtualenv","desenvolvimento python","velocidade"],"ru":["uv","менеджер пакетов python","pip","poetry","pyenv","virtualenv","разработка python","скорость"],"ar":["uv","مدير حزم بايثون","pip","poetry","pyenv","virtualenv","تطوير بايثون","سرعة"]}},"owner":"PovertyAction","repo":"ipa-research-data-science-hub","repoPath":"PovertyAction/ipa-research-data-science-hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv","description":"This skill should be used when working with Python projects that use uv for package and project management. Use this skill for running Python scripts and CLI tools with `uv run`, managing dependencies, creating projects, handling virtual environments, and executing commands within isolated project environments. Essential for projects with pyproject.toml files.","bodyPreview":"# uv - Fast Python Package and Project Manager\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using **uv**, an extremely fast Python package and project manager written in Rust. uv replaces pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv, and more while being 10-100x faster. The skill focuses particularly on `uv run` for executing code within isolated project environments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Working in a Python project with a `pyproject.toml` file\n- Running Pytho","body":"# uv - Fast Python Package and Project Manager\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides guidance for using **uv**, an extremely fast Python package and project manager written in Rust. uv replaces pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, virtualenv, and more while being 10-100x faster. The skill focuses particularly on `uv run` for executing code within isolated project environments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Working in a Python project with a `pyproject.toml` file\n- Running Python scripts or CLI tools that require dependencies\n- Managing project dependencies and virtual environments\n- Executing commands within an isolated project environment\n- Creating new Python projects or initializing scripts\n- Converting from pip, poetry, or other Python tooling to uv\n\n## Core Concept: `uv run`\n\nThe most important command in uv is `uv run`, which executes commands within an isolated project environment.\n\n### Why Use `uv run`\n\n**ALWAYS use `uv run` instead of bare `python` or direct script execution when:**\n\n1. Running Python scripts that depend on project dependencies\n2. Executing Python CLI tools installed in the project\n3. Working within a uv-managed project (has `pyproject.toml`)\n4. Running commands that need access to the project''s virtual environment\n\n**Key behavior:** `uv run` automatically ensures the project environment is current before executing the command. It installs the project into `.venv` and keeps it isolated from the system Python.\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Run a Python script\nuv run example.py\n\n# Run a Python module\nuv run python -m mymodule\n\n# Run a CLI tool from project dependencies\nuv run pytest\nuv run ruff check\nuv run black .\n\n# Run external commands that need project access\nuv run bash scripts/deploy.sh\n```\n\n### Adding Dependencies Per-Invocation\n\nUse `--with` to include or override dependencies for a single execution without modifying `pyproject.toml`:\n\n```bash\n# Add a dependency temporarily\nuv run --with httpx python -c \"import httpx; print(httpx.__version__)\"\n\n# Specify version constraints\nuv run --with ''httpx==0.26.0'' python script.py\n\n# Multiple dependencies\nuv run --with httpx --with rich python script.py\n```\n\nThis is useful for:\n\n- Testing code with different dependency versions\n- One-off operations requiring special packages\n- Running scripts without permanently adding dependencies\n\n### Running Scripts with Inline Dependencies\n\nPython scripts can declare their own dependencies using inline metadata. This creates isolated environments separate from the project:\n\n```python\n# /// script\n# dependencies = [\n#   \"requests<3\",\n#   \"rich\",\n# ]\n# requires-python = \">=3.12\"\n# ///\n\nimport requests\nimport rich\n\n# Script code here...\n```\n\n**Important:** When a script has inline metadata, `uv run` uses ONLY those dependencies and ignores the project''s dependencies, even when run inside a project directory.\n\nInitialize a script with metadata:\n\n```bash\n# Create script with inline metadata\nuv init --script example.py --python 3.12\n\n# Add dependencies to script\nuv add --script example.py ''requests<3'' ''rich''\n\n# Run the script (uses its own dependencies)\nuv run example.py\n```\n\n## Common Tasks and Workflows\n\n### Creating a New Project\n\n```bash\n# Create a new application project\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Create a library project\nuv init --lib my-library\n\n# Create project in current directory\nuv init\n\n# Specify Python version\nuv init --python 3.12\n```\n\nThis creates:\n\n- `pyproject.toml` - Project configuration and dependencies\n- `.python-version` - Python version specification\n- `README.md` - Basic documentation\n- `src/my_project/` - Source code directory (for apps)\n\n### Managing Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Add a dependency\nuv add requests\n\n# Add with version constraint\nuv add ''httpx>=0.25,<0.27''\n\n# Add development dependency\nuv add --dev pytest\n\n# Add optional dependency group\nuv add --optional docs sphinx\n\n# Remove a dependency\nuv remove requests\n\n# Update all dependencies\nuv lock --upgrade\n\n# Sync environment to match lockfile\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Virtual Environment Management\n\n```bash\n# uv automatically creates and manages .venv/\n# Most operations don''t require manual venv activation\n\n# To manually create a venv (rarely needed)\nuv venv\n\n# To activate manually (usually unnecessary)\nsource .venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate     # Windows\n```\n\n**Best practice:** Use `uv run` instead of manually activating virtual environments. This ensures environment consistency and automatic updates.\n\n### Python Version Management\n\n```bash\n# Install a specific Python version\nuv python install 3.12\n\n# List available Python versions\nuv python list\n\n# Find Python installations\nuv python find\n\n# Pin project to specific Python version\nuv python pin 3.12\n```\n\n### Running Tools Without Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run a tool ephemerally (like pipx)\nuvx ruff check .\nuvx black --check .\n\n# Equivalent to:\nuv tool run ruff check .\n\n# Install tool globally\nuv tool install ruff\n```\n\n### pip-Compatible Commands\n\nuv provides drop-in pip replacements:\n\n```bash\n# Install packages (like pip install)\nuv pip install requests\n\n# Generate requirements.txt (like pip freeze)\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Compile dependencies (like pip-compile)\nuv pip compile pyproject.toml -o requirements.txt\n\n# Show dependency tree\nuv pip tree\n```\n\n## Decision Tree: Which Command to Use\n\n**Need to run code in this project?**\n→ Use `uv run <command>`\n\n**Need to add a package to this project?**\n→ Use `uv add <package>`\n\n**Need to run a tool once without installing?**\n→ Use `uvx <tool>` or `uv tool run <tool>`\n\n**Need to create a new project?**\n→ Use `uv init [project-name]`\n\n**Need to update dependencies to latest versions?**\n→ Use `uv lock --upgrade`\n\n**Need to sync environment after pulling changes?**\n→ Use `uv sync`\n\n**Need to install a specific Python version?**\n→ Use `uv python install <version>`\n\n**Working with legacy pip workflows?**\n→ Use `uv pip` commands as drop-in replacements\n\n## Key Differences from Other Tools\n\n### vs pip\n\n- **10-100x faster** due to Rust implementation\n- Automatic virtual environment management\n- Built-in lockfile support\n- No need for pip-tools or virtualenv\n\n### vs poetry\n\n- Faster dependency resolution\n- Compatible with standard `pyproject.toml`\n- Simpler command structure\n- No separate `poetry.lock` format (uses `uv.lock`)\n\n### vs pipx\n\n- `uvx` provides same functionality\n- Faster execution\n- Better caching and deduplication\n\n### vs pyenv\n\n- `uv python` manages Python versions\n- Integrated with project management\n- Faster installation and switching\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use `uv run` in projects** - Don''t manually activate virtual environments; let uv handle environment management automatically.\n\n2. **Commit lockfiles** - Include `uv.lock` in version control for reproducible builds.\n\n3. **Pin Python versions** - Use `uv python pin` to specify project Python requirements.\n\n4. **Use `--with` for experiments** - Test dependencies temporarily without modifying `pyproject.toml`.\n\n5. **Leverage inline metadata for scripts** - Single-file scripts should declare dependencies inline for portability.\n\n6. **Use `uvx` for one-off tools** - Don''t pollute project dependencies with tools you run occasionally.\n\n7. **Let uv manage environments** - Trust `uv sync` to keep environments in sync; avoid manual pip installs in uv projects.\n\n8. **Check `.python-version` files** - Respect project Python version specifications.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Add pytest as dev dependency\nuv add --dev pytest pytest-cov\n\n# Run tests\nuv run pytest\n\n# Run with coverage\nuv run pytest --cov\n```\n\n### Linting and Formatting\n\n```bash\n# Add dev tools\nuv add --dev ruff black mypy\n\n# Run tools\nuv run ruff check .\nuv run black .\nuv run mypy src/\n```\n\n### Building and Publishing\n\n```bash\n# Build distributions\nuv build\n\n# Publish to PyPI\nuv publish\n\n# Publish to test PyPI\nuv publish --index-url https://test.pypi.org/legacy/\n```\n\n### Working with Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Create standalone script with dependencies\nuv init --script analyze.py\nuv add --script analyze.py pandas numpy\n\n# Run script (uses its inline dependencies)\nuv run analyze.py\n\n# Lock script dependencies for reproducibility\nuv lock --script analyze.py\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Command not found after `uv add`\n\n**Problem:** Added a package with a CLI tool, but command doesn''t work.\n\n**Solution:** Use `uv run <command>` to execute within project environment:\n\n```bash\nuv add ruff\nuv run ruff check .  # Not just \"ruff check .\"\n```\n\n### Environment out of sync\n\n**Problem:** Dependencies changed but environment hasn''t updated.\n\n**Solution:** Run `uv sync` to synchronize:\n\n```bash\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Wrong Python version\n\n**Problem:** Project requires different Python version.\n\n**Solution:** Install and pin correct version:\n\n```bash\nuv python install 3.12\nuv python pin 3.12\n```\n\n### Script ignores project dependencies\n\n**Problem:** Script with inline metadata doesn''t use project packages.\n\n**Solution:** This is intentional. Scripts with inline metadata are isolated. Either:\n\n- Remove inline metadata to use project dependencies\n- Add needed dependencies to script''s inline metadata\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed command options and advanced usage, see [references/cli_reference.md](references/cli_reference.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:08.097Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing ultra-fast package and project management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要超快包和项目管理能力的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが超高速のパッケージとプロジェクト管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"초고속 패키지 및 프로젝트 관리 기능이 필요한 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan capacidades de gestión de paquetes y proyectos ultra rápidas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de paquets et de projets ultra rapides.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die ultraschnelle Paket- und Projektmanagementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de pacotes e projetos ultra-rápidas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимы сверхбыстрые возможности управления пакетами и проектами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة الحزم والمشاريع فائقة السرعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Python projects up to 100x faster using uv, replacing pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, and virtualenv, while utilizing `uv run` for isolated project environments and working seamlessly with `pyproject.toml` files.","zh":"赋予代理管理Python项目的能力，使用uv可以比pip、pip-tools、pipx、poetry、pyenv和virtualenv快100倍，同时利用`uv run`用于隔离的项目环境，并与`pyproject.toml`文件无缝协作。","ja":"エージェントがuvを使用して、pip、pip-tools、pipx、poetry、pyenv、virtualenvよりも100倍高速でPythonプロジェクトを管理できるようにします。さらに、`uv run`を使用して分離されたプロジェクト環境を作成し、`pyproject.toml`ファイルとシームレスに連携します。","ko":"에이전트가 uv를 사용하여 pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv 및 virtualenv보다 100배 빠르게 Python 프로젝트를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 `uv run`를 사용하여 분리된 프로젝트 환경을 만들고 `pyproject.toml` 파일과 무결점으로 협업합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar proyectos de Python hasta 100 veces más rápido utilizando uv, reemplazando a pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv y virtualenv, mientras utiliza `uv run` para entornos de proyecto aislados y funciona sin problemas con archivos `pyproject.toml`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des projets Python jusqu''à 100 fois plus rapidement en utilisant uv, en remplaçant pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv et virtualenv, tout en utilisant `uv run` pour des environnements de projet isolés et en fonctionnant sans problème avec des fichiers `pyproject.toml`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Python-Projekte bis zu 100-mal schneller zu verwalten, indem uv verwendet wird, um pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv und virtualenv zu ersetzen, während `uv run` für isolierte Projektumgebungen verwendet wird und nahtlos mit `pyproject.toml`-Dateien zusammenarbeitet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem projetos Python até 100x mais rápido usando uv, substituindo pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv e virtualenv, enquanto utiliza `uv run` para ambientes de projeto isolados e trabalha em perfeita harmonia com arquivos `pyproject.toml`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять проектами Python до 100 раз быстрее с использованием uv, заменяя pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv и virtualenv, а также использует `uv run` для изолированных сред проекта и работает без проблем с файлами `pyproject.toml`.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة مشاريع بايثون حتى 100 ضعف أسرع باستخدام uv، واستبدال pip وpip-tools وpipx وpoetry وpyenv وvirtualenv، بينما يستخدم `uv run` لبيئات المشروع المعزولة ويعمل بسلاسة مع ملفات `pyproject.toml`."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing code within isolated project environments using `uv run`","Managing Python packages with unprecedented speed","Streamlining project workflows by consolidating package management tools"],"zh":["使用`uv run`在隔离的项目环境中执行代码","以前所未有的速度管理Python包","通过整合包管理工具来简化项目工作流"],"ja":["`uv run`を使用して分離されたプロジェクト環境内でコードを実行する","前例のない高速でPythonパッケージを管理する","パッケージ管理ツールを統合してプロジェクトのワークフローを簡素化する"],"ko":["`uv run`를 사용하여 분리된 프로젝트 환경에서 코드를 실행하는 것","전례 없는 속도로 Python 패키지를 관리하는 것","패키지 관리 도구를 통합하여 프로젝트 워크플ロー簡素화"],"es":["Ejecutar código dentro de entornos de proyecto aislados utilizando `uv run`","Gestionar paquetes de Python con una velocidad sin precedentes","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de proyectos consolidando herramientas de gestión de paquetes"],"fr":["Exécuter du code à l''intérieur d''environnements de projet isolés en utilisant `uv run`","Gérer des paquets Python avec une vitesse sans précédent","Optimiser les flux de travail de projets en consolidant les outils de gestion de paquets"],"de":["Code innerhalb isolierter Projektumgebungen mit `uv run` ausführen","Python-Pakete mit unvergleichlicher Geschwindigkeit verwalten","Projektworkflows optimieren, indem Paketverwaltungstools konsolidiert werden"],"pt":["Executando código dentro de ambientes de projeto isolados usando `uv run`","Gerenciando pacotes Python com uma velocidade sem precedentes","Otimizando fluxos de trabalho de projeto consolidando ferramentas de gerenciamento de pacotes"],"ru":["Выполнение кода в изолированных средах проекта с помощью `uv run`","Управление пакетами Python с беспрецедентной скоростью","Оптимизация потоков работы проекта за счет консолидации инструментов управления пакетами"],"ar":["تشغيل التعليمات البرمجية داخل بيئات المشروع المعزولة باستخدام `uv run`","إدارة حزم بايثون بسرعة غير مسبوقة","تبسيط سير عمل المشروع من خلال توحيد أدوات إدارة الحزم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust for compilation","Python project must have a `pyproject.toml` file","uv must be installed and configured"],"zh":["需要Rust进行编译","Python项目必须有一个`pyproject.toml`文件","uv必须被安装和配置"],"ja":["コンパイルにはRustが必要","Pythonプロジェクトには`pyproject.toml`ファイルが必要","uvをインストールして設定する必要がある"],"ko":["컴파일을 위해 Rust가 필요","Python 프로젝트에는 `pyproject.toml` 파일이 필요","uv를 설치하고 구성해야 함"],"es":["Requiere Rust para la compilación","El proyecto de Python debe tener un archivo `pyproject.toml`","uv debe estar instalado y configurado"],"fr":["Nécessite Rust pour la compilation","Le projet Python doit avoir un fichier `pyproject.toml`","uv doit être installé et configuré"],"de":["Benötigt Rust für die Kompilierung","Das Python-Projekt muss eine `pyproject.toml`-Datei haben","uv muss installiert und konfiguriert werden"],"pt":["Exige Rust para compilação","O projeto Python deve ter um arquivo `pyproject.toml`","uv deve ser instalado e configurado"],"ru":["Требуется Rust для компиляции","Проект Python должен иметь файл `pyproject.toml`","uv должен быть установлен и настроен"],"ar":["يتطلب روست للترجمة","يجب أن يكون للمشروع بايثون ملف `pyproject.toml`","يجب تثبيت uv وتفصيله"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
