en":"word"},"description":{"zh":"Word 文档工具允许开发人员使用 Node.js 工具创建、读取和修改 Microsoft Word 文档","ja":"Word ドキュメントツールは、開発者が Node.js ツールを使用して Microsoft Word ドキュメントを作成、読み取り、変更できるようにします","ko":"Word 문서 도구는 개발자가 Node.js 툴을 사용하여 Microsoft Word 문서를 생성, 읽기 및 수정할 수 있도록 해줍니다","es":"La herramienta de documento Word es una GUI wrapper para Claude Agent SDK que permite a los desarrolladores trabajar con documentos Word en Node.js.","fr":"L''outil de document Word est un wrapper GUI pour Claude Agent SDK qui permet aux développeurs de travailler avec des documents Word en Node.js.","de":"Das Word-Dokumenten-Tool ist ein GUI-Wrapper für Claude Agent SDK, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, mit Word-Dokumenten in Node.js zu arbeiten.","pt":"A ferramenta Word é uma solução para trabalhar com documentos do Word em Node.js, permitindo ler, criar e modificar documentos.","ru":"Инструмент Word — это решение для работы с документами Word в Node.js, позволяющее читать, создавать и изменять документы.","ar":"أداة الوورد هي حل لتعامل مع مستندات الوورد في Node.js، مما يسمح بقراءة وإنشاء وتعديل المستندات.","en":"GUI wrapper built on top of Claude Agent SDK"},"definition":{"en":"GUI wrapper built on top of Claude Agent SDK"},"features":{"zh":["读取现有 Word 文档","创建新 Word 文档","修改现有文档","提取文档结构和格式"],"ja":["既存の Word ドキュメントを読み取り","新しい Word ドキュメントを作成","既存のドキュメントを変更","ドキュメント構造と形式を抽出"],"ko":["기존 Word 문서 읽기","새로운 Word 문서 생성","기존 문서 수정","문서 구조 및 형식 추출"],"es":["Lectura de documentos Word existentes","Creación de nuevos documentos Word","Modificación de documentos existentes","Extracción de estructura y formato de documentos"],"fr":["Lecture de documents Word existants","Création de nouveaux documents Word","Modification de documents existants","Extraction de la structure et du format des documents"],"de":["Lesen von bestehenden Word-Dokumenten","Erstellen neuer Word-Dokumente","Modifizieren von bestehenden Dokumenten","Extrahieren von Dokumentenstruktur und -format"],"pt":["Leitura de documentos existentes","Criação de novos documentos","Modificação de documentos existentes","Extração de estrutura e formatação de documentos"],"ru":["Чтение существующих документов","Создание новых документов","Изменение существующих документов","Извлечение структуры и форматирования документов"],"ar":["قراءة المستندات الحالية","إنشاء مستندات جديدة","تعديل المستندات الحالية","استخراج هيكل وتشكيل المستندات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Word 文档工具","Node.js","Microsoft Word","文档创建","文档读取","文档修改"],"ja":["Word ドキュメントツール","Node.js","Microsoft Word","ドキュメント作成","ドキュメント読み取り","ドキュメント変更"],"ko":["Word 문서 도구","Node.js","Microsoft Word","문서 생성","문서 읽기","문서 수정"],"es":["documento Word","Node.js","desarrollo de software","herramienta de documento","Claude Agent SDK","GUI wrapper"],"fr":["document Word","Node.js","développement de logiciels","outil de document","Claude Agent SDK","wrapper GUI"],"de":["Word-Dokument","Node.js","Softwareentwicklung","Dokumenten-Tool","Claude Agent SDK","GUI-Wrapper"],"pt":["Node.js","Documentos do Word","GUI wrapper","Claude Agent SDK","Leitura de documentos","Criação de documentos","Modificação de documentos"],"ru":["Node.js","Документы Word","GUI-оболочка","Claude Agent SDK","Чтение документов","Создание документов","Изменение документов"],"ar":["Node.js","مستندات الوورد","غلاف واجهة المستخدم الرسومية","Claude Agent SDK","قراءة المستندات","إنشاء المستندات","تعديل المستندات"]}},"owner":"Fergana-Labs","repo":"claude_agent_desktop","repoPath":"Fergana-Labs/claude_agent_desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"word","description":"Create, read, edit, and manipulate Microsoft Word documents (.docx files). Use when users ask to work with Word files, create documents, read .docx files, or format text documents.","bodyPreview":"# Word Document Tool\n\nThis skill allows you to work with Microsoft Word documents using Node.js tools.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- **Read** existing Word documents and extract text content\n- **Create** new Word documents with formatted text, headings, paragraphs, and tables\n- **Modify** existing documents by appending content\n- **Extract** document structure and formatting\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Mentions Word documents, .docx files, or document creation\n- Asks to read, creat","body":"# Word Document Tool\n\nThis skill allows you to work with Microsoft Word documents using Node.js tools.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- **Read** existing Word documents and extract text content\n- **Create** new Word documents with formatted text, headings, paragraphs, and tables\n- **Modify** existing documents by appending content\n- **Extract** document structure and formatting\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Mentions Word documents, .docx files, or document creation\n- Asks to read, create, modify, or format text documents\n- Needs to generate reports, letters, or formatted documents\n- Wants to extract text from existing Word files\n\n## How to Use\n\nThe Word tool is implemented as a TypeScript script at `src/tools/word-tool.ts`. You can invoke it using the Bash tool:\n\n### Reading a Document\n```bash\nts-node src/tools/word-tool.ts read \"/path/to/document.docx\"\n```\n\n### Creating a Document\n```bash\nts-node src/tools/word-tool.ts create \"/path/to/new-document.docx\" ''{\"title\":\"My Document\",\"paragraphs\":[\"First paragraph\",\"Second paragraph\"]}''\n```\n\n## JSON Structure for Creating Documents\n\nWhen creating documents, use this JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Document Title\",\n  \"paragraphs\": [\"Paragraph 1\", \"Paragraph 2\"],\n  \"headings\": [{\"text\": \"Section 1\", \"level\": 1}],\n  \"tables\": [{\"headers\": [\"Col1\", \"Col2\"], \"rows\": [[\"A\", \"B\"]]}]\n}\n```\n\n## Implementation\n\nUses the `docx` and `mammoth` npm libraries for reading and writing Word documents.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:28.287Z","qualityScore":55}');
