r pares con Gemini CLI","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Création de plans personnalisés pour les tâches et les projets","Détection automatique du type de problème","Création de plans d''exploration pour les spikes","Révision par les pairs avec Gemini CLI","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Plänen für Aufgaben und Projekte","Automatische Erkennung von Problemtypen","Erstellung von Explorationsplänen für Spikes","Peer-Review mit Gemini CLI","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Criação de planos personalizados para tarefas e projetos","Detecção automática de tipo de problema","Criação de planos de exploração para spikes","Revisão por pares com o Gemini CLI","Integração com o Claude Code"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных планов для задач и проектов","Автоматическое обнаружение типа проблемы","Создание планов исследования для спайков","Проверка с помощью Gemini CLI","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط مخصصة للمهام والمشاريع","اكتشاف تلقائي لنوع المشكلة","إنشاء خطط استكشافية للانقضاض","استعراض الأقران مع Gemini CLI","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude Code","生活管理框架","个人生产力","技能","代理","工作流程","项目管理","任务管理"],"ja":["Claude Code","生活管理フレームワーク","個人の生産性","スキル","エージェント","ワークフロー","プロジェクト管理","タスク管理"],"ko":["Claude Code","생활 관리 프레임워크","개인 생산성","기술","에이전트","워크플로우","프로젝트 관리","태스크 관리"],"es":["planificación de tareas","gestión de proyectos","Claude Code","desarrollo de software","productividad personal","gestión de vida","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["planification de tâches","gestion de projets","Claude Code","développement de logiciels","productivité personnelle","gestion de vie","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Aufgabenplanung","Projektmanagement","Claude Code","Softwareentwicklung","persönliche Produktivität","Lebensmanagement","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["gerenciamento de vida","produtividade","plano personalizado","Claude Code","desenvolvimento de software","gestão de projetos","tarefas","spikes","bugs"],"ru":["управление жизнью","продуктивность","индивидуальный план","Claude Code","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами","задачи","спайки","баги"],"ar":["إدارة الحياة","الإنتاجية","خطة مخصصة","Claude Code","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع","المهام","الانقضاض","الحوادث"]}},"owner":"TaylorHuston","repo":"local-life-manager","repoPath":"TaylorHuston/local-life-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan","description":"Create PLAN.md file with phase-based breakdown for issues. Use after creating an issue with /issue to break down work into phases.","bodyPreview":"# /plan\n\nCreate PLAN.md with phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/plan 001                    # Create plan for issue 001 (auto-detect project)\n/plan 001 --project coordinatr  # Explicit project\n/plan SPIKE-003              # Plan for a spike (creates exploration plans)\n/plan 003 --second-opinion   # Get peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing\n```\n\n## Issue Type Detection\n\n| Issue Type | Plan Structure | File Created |\n|------------|---------------|-------","body":"# /plan\n\nCreate PLAN.md with phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/plan 001                    # Create plan for issue 001 (auto-detect project)\n/plan 001 --project coordinatr  # Explicit project\n/plan SPIKE-003              # Plan for a spike (creates exploration plans)\n/plan 003 --second-opinion   # Get peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing\n```\n\n## Issue Type Detection\n\n| Issue Type | Plan Structure | File Created |\n|------------|---------------|--------------|\n| Task (TASK.md) | Sequential phases with checkpoints | PLAN.md |\n| Bug (BUG.md) | Investigation → Fix phases | PLAN.md |\n| Spike (SPIKE.md) | Exploration phases per approach | PLAN-1.md, PLAN-2.md, ... |\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### For Task/Bug\n\n1. **Load Context**:\n   ```bash\n   Read: ideas/[project]/issues/###-*/TASK.md (or BUG.md)\n   Read: spaces/[project]/docs/specs/*.md (if implements: field exists)\n   Glob: spaces/[project]/docs/adrs/ADR-*.md\n   Glob: resources/research/*.md\n   ```\n\n   If the issue has an `implements:` field, load that specific spec section:\n   ```bash\n   Read: spaces/[project]/docs/specs/required-features.md  # Extract relevant section\n   ```\n\n2. **Cross-Project Pattern Search**:\n   ```bash\n   # Search other projects for similar implementations\n   Grep: spaces/*/src/ for relevant patterns\n   ```\n\n   Include relevant references in plan:\n   ```markdown\n   ## Related Implementations\n\n   Found similar patterns in other projects:\n   - `spaces/yourbench/src/auth/clerk.ts` - Clerk auth setup\n   - `spaces/coordinatr/src/lib/session.ts` - Session handling\n   ```\n\n3. **Library Documentation** (automatic for integrations):\n\n   **MANDATORY when task involves:**\n   - Installing/configuring external libraries or SDKs\n   - Framework integrations (auth providers, databases, APIs)\n   - Third-party services (Clerk, Stripe, AWS services, etc.)\n\n   **Process:**\n   ```bash\n   # 1. Resolve library ID\n   mcp__context7__resolve-library-id: {libraryName}\n\n   # 2. Fetch current documentation\n   mcp__context7__query-docs: {context7CompatibleLibraryID}\n\n   # 3. Search for recent patterns/best practices\n   WebSearch: \"{library} {framework} integration 2026\"\n   ```\n\n   **Document findings:**\n   ```markdown\n   ## Library Documentation Validation\n\n   **{Library Name}** (validated YYYY-MM-DD):\n   - Current version: X.Y.Z\n   - Key integration patterns: [summary]\n   - Recommended approach: [based on current docs]\n   ```\n\n4. **Generate Plan**:\n   - Break work into logical phases\n   - Each phase has clear deliverables\n   - Include checkpoints between phases\n   - Add \"Done When\" criteria\n\n5. **Write PLAN.md**:\n   - Present phases, estimated effort, dependencies\n   - Include \"Library Documentation Validation\" section (if applicable)\n   - Include \"Second Opinion Analysis\" section (if requested)\n\n6. **Commit Suggestion**:\n   - Ask: \"Commit PLAN.md to ideas repo? (yes/no)\"\n\n### For Spike (Exploration)\n\n1. **Load Context**: Read SPIKE.md (questions, success criteria, time box)\n\n2. **Gather Approaches**:\n   - Ask: \"How many approaches to explore?\" → N\n   - For each: \"Describe approach N?\"\n\n3. **Generate**: Create PLAN-N.md for each approach\n\n4. **Commit Suggestion**: Ask to commit all plan files\n\n## Task Plan Example\n\n```markdown\n# Implementation Plan: 001 Research Auth Patterns\n\n## Overview\nResearch authentication patterns for Coordinatr''s multi-tenant architecture.\n\n## Phase 1: Survey Existing Solutions\n\n### 1.1 - Research Auth Libraries\n- [ ] Review Better Auth documentation\n- [ ] Compare with Auth.js and Lucia\n- [ ] Document trade-offs\n\n### 1.2 - Multi-Tenant Patterns\n- [ ] Research team-based auth patterns\n- [ ] Review how Slack, Linear handle it\n- [ ] [CHECKPOINT] Summary document complete\n\n## Phase 2: Architecture Proposal\n\n### 2.1 - Draft Architecture\n- [ ] Create architecture diagram\n- [ ] Document token strategy\n- [ ] Define permission model\n\n### 2.2 - Review\n- [ ] Self-critique against requirements\n- [ ] [CHECKPOINT] Architecture doc complete\n\n## Done When\n- [ ] Auth library recommendation documented\n- [ ] Architecture proposal in ideas/coordinatr/docs/\n- [ ] Trade-offs and risks identified\n```\n\n## Second Opinion Feature\n\n**What**: Optional peer review from Gemini CLI before finalizing plans.\n\n**Usage**: Pass `--second-opinion` flag to trigger Gemini review with Context7 validation.\n\n**Process**:\n1. Send plan to Gemini CLI for review\n2. Validate each recommendation against Context7 docs\n3. Claude makes final decision on each:\n   - ✅ **ACCEPT**: Recommendation validated AND improves plan\n   - ⚠️ **MODIFY**: Good idea but needs adjustment\n   - ❌ **REJECT**: Invalid or not applicable\n4. Document all decisions in \"Second Opinion Analysis\" section\n\n**Requirements**:\n- Gemini CLI installed and functional\n- `--second-opinion` flag explicitly passed\n\n**Graceful degradation**: If Gemini unavailable, proceeds with Claude-only plan.\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\n/spec → /issue → /plan {ID} → (work phases) → /complete {ID}\n                    ↓\n          Load spec section from implements: field\n```\n\n**Creates:**\n- Task/Bug: `ideas/{project}/issues/###-*/PLAN.md`\n- Spike: `ideas/{project}/issues/###-*/PLAN-1.md`, `PLAN-2.md`, etc.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:31.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing customizable life management frameworks and phase-based task breakdowns.","zh":"非常适合需要可定制的生活管理框架和基于阶段的任务分解的生产力代理。","ja":"生産性エージェントがカスタマイズ可能なライフマネジメントフレームワークとフェーズベースのタスク分解を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"생산성 에이전트가 사용자 정의 가능한 라이프 관리 프레임워크와 단계 기반 작업 분해를 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad que necesitan marcos de gestión de vida personalizables y desglose de tareas por fases.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité ayant besoin de cadres de gestion de vie personnalisables et de décomposition de tâches par phases.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die benutzerdefinierte Lebensmanagement-Frameworks und phasenbasierte Aufgabenzerlegung benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing customizable life management frameworks and phase-based task breakdowns.","ru":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing customizable life management frameworks and phase-based task breakdowns.","ar":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing customizable life management frameworks and phase-based task breakdowns."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create PLAN.md files with issue type detection, phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs, utilizing command-line interfaces like Gemini CLI for peer review and project management.","zh":"赋予代理创建 PLAN.md 文件的能力，具有问题类型检测、基于阶段的任务、峰值和错误分解，利用 Gemini CLI 等命令行接口进行同行评审和项目管理。","ja":"エージェントが PLAN.md ファイルを作成できるようにし、問題タイプの検出、タスク、スパイク、バグのフェーズベースの分解を実施し、Gemini CLI などのコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用してピアレビューとプロジェクト管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 PLAN.md 파일을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 문제 유형 감지, 작업, 스파이크, 버그의 단계 기반 분해를 실시하고 Gemini CLI와 같은 명령줄 인터페이스를 사용하여 동료 리뷰 및 프로젝트 관리를 수행한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear archivos PLAN.md con detección de tipo de problema, desglose por fases para tareas, picos y errores, utilizando interfaces de línea de comandos como Gemini CLI para revisión por pares y gestión de proyectos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fichiers PLAN.md avec détection de type de problème, décomposition par phases pour les tâches, les pics et les bogues, en utilisant des interfaces de ligne de commande comme Gemini CLI pour la révision par les pairs et la gestion de projet.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PLAN.md-Dateien mit Problemtyp-Erkennung, phasenbasierter Aufgabenzerlegung für Aufgaben, Spikes und Fehler zu erstellen, unter Nutzung von Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen wie Gemini CLI für Peer-Review und Projektmanagement.","pt":"Empowers agents to create PLAN.md files with issue type detection, phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs, utilizing command-line interfaces like Gemini CLI for peer review and project management.","ru":"Empowers agents to create PLAN.md files with issue type detection, phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs, utilizing command-line interfaces like Gemini CLI for peer review and project management.","ar":"Empowers agents to create PLAN.md files with issue type detection, phase-based breakdown for tasks, spikes, and bugs, utilizing command-line interfaces like Gemini CLI for peer review and project management."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task planning with phase-based breakdowns","Generating exploration plans for spikes","Creating project plans with auto-detecting project features"],"zh":["使用基于阶段的分解自动执行任务规划","为峰值生成探索计划","创建具有自动检测项目功能的项目计划"],"ja":["フェーズベースの分解を使用してタスク計画を自動化する","スパイクのための探索計画を生成する","プロジェクト機能を自動検出するプロジェクト計画を作成する"],"ko":["단계 기반 분해를 사용하여 작업 계획을 자동화한다","스파이크를 위한 탐색 계획을 생성한다","프로젝트 기능을 자동으로 감지하는 프로젝트 계획을 생성한다"],"es":["Automatizar la planificación de tareas con desglose por fases","Generar planes de exploración para picos","Crear planes de proyecto con autodetección de características de proyecto"],"fr":["Automatiser la planification de tâches avec décomposition par phases","Générer des plans d''exploration pour les pics","Créer des plans de projet avec détection automatique des fonctionnalités de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenplanung mit phasenbasierter Zerlegung","Erstellung von Explorationsplänen für Spikes","Erstellung von Projektplänen mit automatischer Erkennung von Projektfunktionen"],"pt":["Automating task planning with phase-based breakdowns","Generating exploration plans for spikes","Creating project plans with auto-detecting project features"],"ru":["Automating task planning with phase-based breakdowns","Generating exploration plans for spikes","Creating project plans with auto-detecting project features"],"ar":["Automating task planning with phase-based breakdowns","Generating exploration plans for spikes","Creating project plans with auto-detecting project features"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Specific issue type detection needed","Command-line interface required"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 集成","需要特定的问题类型检测","需要命令行接口"],"ja":["Claude Code の統合が必要","特定の問題タイプの検出が必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスが必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 통합이 필요합니다","특정 문제 유형 감지가 필요합니다","명령줄 인터페이스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Se necesita detección de tipo de problema específico","Se requiere interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Une détection de type de problème spécifique est nécessaire","Une interface de ligne de commande est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code-Integration","Spezifische Problemtyp-Erkennung erforderlich","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires Claude Code integration","Specific issue type detection needed","Command-line interface required"],"ru":["Requires Claude Code integration","Specific issue type detection needed","Command-line interface required"],"ar":["Requires Claude Code integration","Specific issue type detection needed","Command-line interface required"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('remiverdiesen/agents-at-scale/ark-documentation', 'community', 'remiverdiesen', 'agents-at-scale', 'remiverdiesen/agents-at-scale', 'ark-documentation', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:06:30.178Z', NULL, '{"id":"remiverdiesen/agents-at-scale/ark-documentation","name":"ark-documentation","description":{"zh":"ARK 文档提供了结构化的指导，使用 Diataxis 适配 ARK 的需求","ja":"ARK ドキュメントは、Diataxis を使用して構造化されたガイダンスを提供します","ko":"ARK 문서는 Diataxis를 사용하여 구조화된 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"La documentación de ARK proporciona patrones y prácticas para operaciones de recursos agenticos. Aprenda a estructurarla con Diataxis","fr":"La documentation ARK fournit des modèles et des pratiques pour les opérations de ressources agenticos. Découvrez comment la structurer avec Diataxis","de":"Die ARK-Dokumentation bietet Muster und Praktiken für agentic-Ressourcen-Operationen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit Diataxis strukturieren","pt":"A documentação ARK fornece orientação para estruturar conteúdo de forma clara e eficaz, utilizando o framework Diataxis.","ru":"Документация ARK предоставляет руководство по структуре контента в ясной и эффективной форме, используя фреймворк Diataxis.","ar":"توفر وثائق ARK إرشادات للهيكلة المحتوى بطريقة واضحة وفعالة، باستخدام إطار Diataxis.","en":"Provider-agnostic operations for agentic resources. ARK codifies patterns and practices developed across dozens of agentic application projects."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ARK 文档指南 - 技术文档结构","ja":"ARK ドキュメントガイド - テクニカルドキュメント構造","ko":"ARK 문서 가이드 - 기술 문서 구조","es":"Documentación ARK: Guía para desarrolladores","fr":"Documentation ARK : Guide pour les développeurs","de":"ARK-Dokumentation: Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Documentação ARK: Guia de Estruturação","ru":"Документация ARK: Руководство по Структуре","ar":"وثائق ARK: إرشاد هيكلي","en":"ark-documentation"},"description":{"zh":"ARK 文档提供了结构化的指导，使用 Diataxis 适配 ARK 的需求","ja":"ARK ドキュメントは、Diataxis を使用して構造化されたガイダンスを提供します","ko":"ARK 문서는 Diataxis를 사용하여 구조화된 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"La documentación de ARK proporciona patrones y prácticas para operaciones de recursos agenticos. Aprenda a estructurarla con Diataxis","fr":"La documentation ARK fournit des modèles et des pratiques pour les opérations de ressources agenticos. Découvrez comment la structurer avec Diataxis","de":"Die ARK-Dokumentation bietet Muster und Praktiken für agentic-Ressourcen-Operationen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit Diataxis strukturieren","pt":"A documentação ARK fornece orientação para estruturar conteúdo de forma clara e eficaz, utilizando o framework Diataxis.","ru":"Документация ARK предоставляет руководство по структуре контента в ясной и эффективной форме, используя фреймворк Diataxis.","ar":"توفر وثائق ARK إرشادات للهيكلة المحتوى بطريقة واضحة وفعالة، باستخدام إطار Diataxis.","en":"Provider-agnostic operations for agentic resources. ARK codifies patterns and practices developed across dozens of agentic application projects."},"definition":{"en":"Provider-agnostic operations for agentic resources. ARK codifies patterns and practices developed across dozens of agentic application projects."},"features":{"zh":["介绍","快速入门","教程","操作指南","核心概念"],"ja":["イントロダクション","クイックスタート","チュートリアル","ハウツーガイド","コアコンセプト"],"ko":["소개","빠른 시작","튜토리얼","사용자 가이드","핵심 개념"],"es":["Estructura de documentación adaptable","Guía para crear nueva documentación","Decide dónde pertenece el contenido","Revisa solicitudes de cambios de documentación","Reestructura la documentación existente"],"fr":["Structure de documentation adaptable","Guide pour créer une nouvelle documentation","Déterminez où le contenu appartient","Examinez les demandes de modification de documentation","Réorganisez la documentation existante"],"de":["Anpassbare Dokumentenstruktur","Leitfaden zur Erstellung neuer Dokumentation","Bestimmen Sie, wo der Inhalt hingehört","Überprüfen Sie Dokumentenänderungsanfragen","Strukturieren Sie die bestehende Dokumentation um"],"pt":["Estrutura de documentação personalizada","Guia de criação de conteúdo","Revisão e reestruturação de documentação","Integração com Diataxis","Orientação para decisões de conteúdo"],"ru":["Пользовательская структура документации","Руководство по созданию контента","Проверка и перестройка документации","Интеграция с Diataxis","Руководство для решений о контенте"],"ar":["هيكلة وثائق مخصصة","دليل إنشاء المحتوى","مراجعة وإعادة هيكلة الوثائق","التكامل مع Diataxis","إرشاد لاتخاذ قرارات المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ARK 文档","Diataxis","技术文档","结构化指导","提供商无关操作","ARK 资源"],"ja":["ARK ドキュメント","Diataxis","テクニカルドキュメント","構造化ガイダンス","提供商に依存しない操作","ARK リソース"],"ko":["ARK 문서","Diataxis","기술 문서","구조화된 가이드","제공商에 종속되지 않는 연산","ARK 리소스"],"es":["documentación ARK","Diataxis","desarrollo de software","operaciones de recursos agenticos","patrones y prácticas","estructura de documentación"],"fr":["documentation ARK","Diataxis","développement de logiciels","opérations de ressources agenticos","modèles et pratiques","structure de documentation"],"de":["ARK-Dokumentation","Diataxis","Softwareentwicklung","agentic-Ressourcen-Operationen","Muster und Praktiken","Dokumentenstruktur"],"pt":["documentação ARK","Diataxis","estrutura de documentação","criação de conteúdo","revisão de documentação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["документация ARK","Diataxis","структура документации","создание контента","проверка документации","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["وثائق ARK","Diataxis","هيكلة الوثائق","إنشاء المحتوى","مراجعة الوثائق","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"remiverdiesen","repo":"agents-at-scale","repoPath":"remiverdiesen/agents-at-scale","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ark-documentation","description":"Guidance for structuring Ark documentation using the Diataxis framework. Use this skill when creating new docs, deciding where content belongs, reviewing documentation PRs, or restructuring existing documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├──","body":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├── Reference          → Factual lookup material\n├── Marketplace        → External link\n└── Disclaimer\n```\n\n### Terminology\n\n| Diataxis | Ark Term | Why |\n|----------|----------|-----|\n| Explanation | **Core Concepts** | More accessible |\n\n## The four quadrants\n\n### 1. Tutorials (learning-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Hands-on lessons for newcomers.\n\n**Characteristics**:\n- Linear, numbered paths (1, 2, 3...)\n- Single prescribed path - no choices\n- Frequent visible results\n- Ends with \"Next step\" → How-to Guides\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Use \"we\" language\n- Don''t explain - link to Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It teaches a skill through doing\n- Reader is studying, not working\n- Success requires following steps in order\n\n**Examples**: Quickstart, Running the Dashboard, Starting a New Project, Complete Worked Example\n\n---\n\n### 2. How-to guides (task-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Help competent users complete specific tasks.\n\n**Organized by persona**:\n\n#### Build with ARK (application developers)\n- Configure models, create agents, coordinate teams, run queries, add tools.\n\n#### Extend ARK (contributors)\n- Build services locally, implement APIs, build A2A servers, add tests.\n\n#### Operate ARK (operators / SRE / security)\n- **Platform operations**: Provisioning, deploying\n- **CI/CD and supply chain**: Build pipelines\n- **Security & assurance**: Pen testing, code analysis\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Goal-oriented: \"If you want X, do Y\"\n- Assumes competence\n- Don''t teach - link to Tutorials or Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- Reader has a specific task to complete\n- Reader is working, not studying\n\n---\n\n### 3. Core concepts (understanding-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Explain what ARK is, how it''s designed, and why.\n\n**Topics**:\n- What ARK is and how it works.\n- Design effective agentic systems.\n- Platform architecture concepts.\n- Extensibility concepts.\n- Security and identity concepts.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Discursive: \"The reason for X is...\"\n- Make connections between concepts\n- Provide design decision context\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It answers \"why\" or \"how does this work\"\n- Reader is deciding how to design/extend/operate\n- Content provides context, not procedures\n\n---\n\n### 4. Reference (information-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Factual lookup material.\n\n**Organized by type**:\n- **Interfaces**: ARK APIs.\n- **Kubernetes API**: CRDs, resources.\n- **Evaluations**: Guides, event-based evaluations.\n- **System behavior**: Query execution, relationships.\n- **Operations**: Upgrading, troubleshooting.\n- **Project**: Contributors.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Austere, factual, neutral\n- Structure mirrors product\n- No instruction, explanation, or opinion\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It describes what something IS\n- Reader needs to look up specific details\n- Content is consulted, not read cover-to-cover\n\n---\n\n## Decision guide\n\n```\nIs the reader LEARNING or WORKING?\n│\n├─ LEARNING (studying)\n│   ├─ Hands-on, step-by-step? → TUTORIALS\n│   └─ Understanding concepts? → CORE CONCEPTS\n│\n└─ WORKING (applying)\n    ├─ Completing a task? → HOW-TO GUIDES\n    └─ Looking up facts? → REFERENCE\n```\n\n## Hub pages\n\nHub pages link to content without moving files:\n\n- `tutorials.mdx` - Lists tutorials in order.\n- `how-to-guides.mdx` - Groups by persona.\n- `core-concepts.mdx` - Groups by topic.\n- `reference/index.mdx` - Groups by type.\n\nHub pages should:\n- Explain purpose in one sentence.\n- Group links logically.\n- Not duplicate content.\n\n## Personas\n\n| Persona | Sections |\n|---------|----------|\n| End users | Quickstart, Tutorials |\n| Agent builders | Tutorials, How-to (Build) |\n| Platform engineers | How-to (Operate), Reference |\n| Contributors | How-to (Extend), Core Concepts |\n\n## Writing guidelines\n\n### Lexicon\n- The product is known as ARK rather than Ark.\n\n\n### General style\n- Be concise and direct.\n- Use simple language.\n- Keep descriptions to 1-2 sentences.\n- Use active voice: \"Creates agent\" not \"Agent is created\".\n- Write \"ARK\" not \"Ark\".\n- Use US English.\n- Use Oxford commas in lists.\n\n### Bullets\n- Capitalize the first word and end with a period.\n- Use numbered lists only for sequences of instructions or when referencing items later.\n\n### Capitalization\n- Capitalize only proper nouns (product names, tools, services).\n- Use sentence case for titles: \"An introduction to data visualization\" not \"An Introduction to Data Visualization\".\n- Don''t capitalize: cloud, internet, machine learning, advanced analytics.\n\n### Headings\n- Avoid gerunds: \"Get started\" not \"Getting started,\" \"Customize a layout\" not \"Customizing a layout\".\n- Keep titles short and descriptive for search discoverability.\n\n### Instructions\n- Use imperatives: \"Complete the configuration steps\".\n- Don''t use \"please\".\n- Don''t use passive tense: \"Complete the steps\" not \"The steps should be completed\".\n\n### Links\n- Make hyperlinks descriptive: `Learn how to [contribute to ARK](url)`.\n- Don''t write: `To contribute, see [here](url)`.\n\n### Avoid\n- Gerunds in headings.\n- Colloquialisms (may not translate across regions/languages).\n- Business speak: \"leverage\", \"utilize\", \"facilitate\".\n\n### What not to mix\n\n| Don''t put in... | This content... |\n|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Tutorials | Explanations, choices. |\n| How-to guides | Teaching, complete reference. |\n| Core concepts | Instructions, reference. |\n| Reference | Instructions, explanations. |\n\n## References\n\n- [Diataxis Framework](https://diataxis.fr/)\n- [Issue #338](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/issues/338)\n- [PR #620](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/pull/620)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:30.178Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured documentation and knowledge management using Diataxis framework.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Diataxis 框架进行结构化文档和知识管理的 AI 代理。","ja":"Diataxis フレームワークを使用した構造化されたドキュメントと知識管理が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Diataxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화된 문서와 지식 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan documentación estructurada y gestión del conocimiento utilizando el marco Diataxis.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une documentation structurée et d''une gestion des connaissances utilisant le framework Diataxis.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die strukturierte Dokumentation und Wissensmanagement unter Verwendung des Diataxis-Frameworks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de documentação estruturada e gerenciamento de conhecimento usando o framework Diataxis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходима структурированная документация и управление знаниями с использованием фреймворка Diataxis.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق منظم وإدارة المعرفة باستخدام إطار Diataxis."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, manage, and maintain high-quality documentation using a standardized structure, including Introduction, Quickstart, Tutorials, and How-to Guides, leveraging Diataxis for organized content.","zh":"赋予代理创建、管理和维护高质量文档的能力，使用标准化结构，包括介绍、快速入门、教程和操作指南，利用 Diataxis 进行内容组织。","ja":"標準化された構造を使用して、高品質のドキュメントを作成、管理、維持するエージェントの能力を強化します。Diataxis を使用したコンテンツの整理を含み、紹介、クイックスタート、チュートリアル、ハウツーガイドなどが含まれます。","ko":"标准화된 구조를 사용하여 고품질의 문서를 생성, 관리, 유지하는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다. Diataxis를 사용한 콘텐츠의 조직을 포함하며, 소개, 퀵스타트, 튜토리얼, 하우투 가이드 등이 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, gestionar y mantener documentación de alta calidad utilizando una estructura estandarizada, incluyendo Introducción, Inicio rápido, Tutoriales y Guías prácticas, aprovechando Diataxis para contenido organizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, gérer et maintenir une documentation de haute qualité en utilisant une structure standardisée, notamment Introduction, Démarrage rapide, Tutoriels et Guides pratiques, en exploitant Diataxis pour un contenu organisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Dokumentationen zu erstellen, zu verwalten und zu warten, indem sie eine standardisierte Struktur verwenden, einschließlich Einführung, Schnellstart, Tutorials und Anleitungen, und Diataxis für organisierten Inhalt nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, gerenciar e manter documentação de alta qualidade usando uma estrutura padronizada, incluindo Introdução, Início Rápido, Tutoriais e Guias de Como Fazer, aproveitando o Diataxis para conteúdo organizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, управлять и поддерживать документацию высокого качества, используя стандартизированную структуру, включая Введение, Быстрый старт, Уроки и Руководства по выполнению, используя Diataxis для организованного контента.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة وصيانة توثيق عالي الجودة باستخدام هيكل معياري، بما في ذلك المقدمة والبدء السريع والدروس وإرشادات كيفية، واستخدام Diataxis للcontents المنظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new documentation sets","Restructuring existing documentation for clarity","Reviewing documentation pull requests for consistency"],"zh":["创建新的文档集","重新组织现有的文档以提高清晰度","审查文档拉取请求以确保一致性"],"ja":["新しいドキュメントセットを作成する","既存のドキュメントを再構成して明確性を高める","ドキュメントのプルリクエストをレビューして一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["새로운 문서 세트 생성","既存의 문서를 재구성하여 명확성을 높임","문서 풀 리퀘스트를 검토하여 일관성을 보장"],"es":["Crear nuevos conjuntos de documentación","Reestructurar la documentación existente para mayor claridad","Revisar solicitudes de extracción de documentación para coherencia"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux ensembles de documentation","Réorganiser la documentation existante pour plus de clarté","Examiner les demandes d''extraction de documentation pour cohérence"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Dokumentationssätze","Umstrukturieren bestehender Dokumentation für bessere Klarheit","Überprüfen von Dokumentationspull-Anfragen auf Konsistenz"],"pt":["Criar novos conjuntos de documentação","Reestruturar documentação existente para clareza","Revisar solicitações de pull de documentação para consistência"],"ru":["Создание новых наборов документации","Переструктуризация существующей документации для ясности","Проверка запросов на включение документации для согласованности"],"ar":["إنشاء مجموعات توثيق جديدة","إعادة هيكلة التوثيق الحالي من أجل الوضوح","مراجعة طلبات السحب للتوثيق من أجل الاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Diataxis framework","Limited to documentation management"],"zh":["需要了解 Diataxis 框架","仅限于文档管理"],"ja":["Diataxis フレームワークの理解が必要","ドキュメント管理のみに限定される"],"ko":["Diataxis 프레임워크에 대한 이해가 필요","문서 관리에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del marco Diataxis","Limitado a la gestión de documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du framework Diataxis","Limité à la gestion de documentation"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis des Diataxis-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf Dokumentenmanagement"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do framework Diataxis","Limitado ao gerenciamento de documentação"],"ru":["Требует понимания фреймворка Diataxis","Ограничен управлением документацией"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم إطار Diataxis","محدود بإدارة التوثيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
