iza Diataxis para guiar a los desarrolladores en la creación y estructuración de contenido.","fr":"La documentation Ark utilise Diataxis pour guider les développeurs dans la création et la structuration de contenu.","de":"Die Ark-Dokumentation verwendet Diataxis, um Entwickler bei der Erstellung und Strukturierung von Inhalten zu unterstützen.","pt":"O Ark Documentation é um guia para estruturar documentação usando Diataxis, adaptado para as necessidades do Ark","ru":"Документация Арк - это руководство по структуре содержания с использованием Diataxis, адаптированное для нужд Арк","ar":"وثائق آرك هي إرشادات للهيكلة باستخدام دياتاكس، مصممة خصيصاً لاحتياجات آرك","en":"Claude Code Slide Builder"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code Slide Builder"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Diataxis 框架","创建高质量的文档","结构清晰的文档组织","支持多种文档类型","易于使用和维护"],"ja":["Diataxis フレームワークを使用","高品質のドキュメントを作成","構造が明確なドキュメントの組織","多種多様なドキュメントのサポート","使用とメンテナンスが容易"],"ko":["Diataxis 프레임워크 사용","고품질의 문서 생성","구조가 명확한 문서 구성","다양한 문서 유형 지원","사용과 유지 보수가 쉬움"],"es":["Estructuración de contenido con Diataxis","Guía para crear y revisar documentación","Linear learning paths para desarrolladores","Task-oriented guides para personas específicas","Core Concepts para entender el porqué y el cómo"],"fr":["Structuration de contenu avec Diataxis","Guide pour créer et examiner la documentation","Linear learning paths pour les développeurs","Guides orientés vers les tâches pour les personnes spécifiques","Core Concepts pour comprendre le pourquoi et le comment"],"de":["Inhaltsstrukturierung mit Diataxis","Anleitung zur Erstellung und Überprüfung von Dokumentation","Linearer Lernpfad für Entwickler","Aufgabenorientierte Anleitungen für bestimmte Personen","Core-Konzepte zum Verständnis von Warum und Wie"],"pt":["Estrutura de documentação personalizada","Guias de início rápido e tutoriais","Conceitos centrais e guias de como fazer","Revisão e reestruturação de documentação existente","Integração com o framework Diataxis"],"ru":["Пользовательская структура документации","Руководства по быстрому началу и туториалы","Центральные концепции и руководства по выполнению задач","Проверка и переструктуризация существующей документации","Интеграция с фреймворком Diataxis"],"ar":["هيكلة وثائق مخصصة","دليل البدء السريع وتعليمات","مفاهيم أساسية ودلائل كيفية","مراجعة وإعادة هيكلة الوثائق الحالية","التكامل مع إطار دياتاكس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ark 文档","Diataxis 框架","文档结构","开发者文档","技术文档","文档创建","文档管理"],"ja":["Ark ドキュメント","Diataxis フレームワーク","ドキュメント構造","開発者ドキュメント","テクニカルドキュメント","ドキュメント作成","ドキュメント管理"],"ko":["Ark 문서","Diataxis 프레임워크","문서 구조","개발자 문서","기술 문서","문서 생성","문서 관리"],"es":["documentación de Ark","Diataxis","desarrollo de software","estructuración de contenido","guías para desarrolladores","linear learning paths"],"fr":["documentation Ark","Diataxis","développement de logiciels","structuration de contenu","guides pour les développeurs","linear learning paths"],"de":["Ark-Dokumentation","Diataxis","Softwareentwicklung","Inhaltsstrukturierung","Anleitungen für Entwickler","linearer Lernpfad"],"pt":["ark documentation","diataxis","estrutura de documentação","guias de início rápido","tutoriais","conceitos centrais","guia de como fazer","revisão de documentação","reestruturação de documentação"],"ru":["документация арк","диатаксис","структура документации","руководства по быстрому началу","туториалы","центральные концепции","руководства по выполнению задач","проверка документации","переструктуризация документации"],"ar":["وثائق آرك","دياتاكس","هيكلة الوثائق","دليل البدء السريع","تعليمات","مفاهيم أساسية","دلائل كيفية","مراجعة الوثائق","إعادة هيكلة الوثائق"]}},"owner":"vishalpatel2890","repo":"slides","repoPath":"vishalpatel2890/slides","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ark-documentation","description":"Guidance for structuring Ark documentation using the Diataxis framework. Use this skill when creating new docs, deciding where content belongs, reviewing documentation PRs, or restructuring existing documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├──","body":"# Ark Documentation\n\nGuidance for structuring Ark documentation using Diataxis adapted for Ark''s needs.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Creating new documentation\n- Deciding where content belongs\n- Reviewing documentation PRs\n- Restructuring existing documentation\n\n## ARK''s Diataxis structure\n\n```\ndocs/content/\n├── Introduction\n├── Quickstart\n├── Tutorials          → Linear learning paths\n├── How-to Guides      → Task-oriented, by persona\n├── Core Concepts      → Understanding \"why\" and \"how\"\n├── Reference          → Factual lookup material\n├── Marketplace        → External link\n└── Disclaimer\n```\n\n### Terminology\n\n| Diataxis | Ark Term | Why |\n|----------|----------|-----|\n| Explanation | **Core Concepts** | More accessible |\n\n## The four quadrants\n\n### 1. Tutorials (learning-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Hands-on lessons for newcomers.\n\n**Characteristics**:\n- Linear, numbered paths (1, 2, 3...)\n- Single prescribed path - no choices\n- Frequent visible results\n- Ends with \"Next step\" → How-to Guides\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Use \"we\" language\n- Don''t explain - link to Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It teaches a skill through doing\n- Reader is studying, not working\n- Success requires following steps in order\n\n**Examples**: Quickstart, Running the Dashboard, Starting a New Project, Complete Worked Example\n\n---\n\n### 2. How-to guides (task-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Help competent users complete specific tasks.\n\n**Organized by persona**:\n\n#### Build with ARK (application developers)\n- Configure models, create agents, coordinate teams, run queries, add tools.\n\n#### Extend ARK (contributors)\n- Build services locally, implement APIs, build A2A servers, add tests.\n\n#### Operate ARK (operators / SRE / security)\n- **Platform operations**: Provisioning, deploying\n- **CI/CD and supply chain**: Build pipelines\n- **Security & assurance**: Pen testing, code analysis\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Goal-oriented: \"If you want X, do Y\"\n- Assumes competence\n- Don''t teach - link to Tutorials or Core Concepts\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- Reader has a specific task to complete\n- Reader is working, not studying\n\n---\n\n### 3. Core concepts (understanding-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Explain what ARK is, how it''s designed, and why.\n\n**Topics**:\n- What ARK is and how it works.\n- Design effective agentic systems.\n- Platform architecture concepts.\n- Extensibility concepts.\n- Security and identity concepts.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Discursive: \"The reason for X is...\"\n- Make connections between concepts\n- Provide design decision context\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It answers \"why\" or \"how does this work\"\n- Reader is deciding how to design/extend/operate\n- Content provides context, not procedures\n\n---\n\n### 4. Reference (information-oriented)\n\n**Purpose**: Factual lookup material.\n\n**Organized by type**:\n- **Interfaces**: ARK APIs.\n- **Kubernetes API**: CRDs, resources.\n- **Evaluations**: Guides, event-based evaluations.\n- **System behavior**: Query execution, relationships.\n- **Operations**: Upgrading, troubleshooting.\n- **Project**: Contributors.\n\n**Writing style**:\n- Austere, factual, neutral\n- Structure mirrors product\n- No instruction, explanation, or opinion\n\n**Content belongs here if**:\n- It describes what something IS\n- Reader needs to look up specific details\n- Content is consulted, not read cover-to-cover\n\n---\n\n## Decision guide\n\n```\nIs the reader LEARNING or WORKING?\n│\n├─ LEARNING (studying)\n│   ├─ Hands-on, step-by-step? → TUTORIALS\n│   └─ Understanding concepts? → CORE CONCEPTS\n│\n└─ WORKING (applying)\n    ├─ Completing a task? → HOW-TO GUIDES\n    └─ Looking up facts? → REFERENCE\n```\n\n## Hub pages\n\nHub pages link to content without moving files:\n\n- `tutorials.mdx` - Lists tutorials in order.\n- `how-to-guides.mdx` - Groups by persona.\n- `core-concepts.mdx` - Groups by topic.\n- `reference/index.mdx` - Groups by type.\n\nHub pages should:\n- Explain purpose in one sentence.\n- Group links logically.\n- Not duplicate content.\n\n## Personas\n\n| Persona | Sections |\n|---------|----------|\n| End users | Quickstart, Tutorials |\n| Agent builders | Tutorials, How-to (Build) |\n| Platform engineers | How-to (Operate), Reference |\n| Contributors | How-to (Extend), Core Concepts |\n\n## Writing guidelines\n\n### Lexicon\n- The product is known as ARK rather than Ark.\n\n\n### General style\n- Be concise and direct.\n- Use simple language.\n- Keep descriptions to 1-2 sentences.\n- Use active voice: \"Creates agent\" not \"Agent is created\".\n- Write \"ARK\" not \"Ark\".\n- Use US English.\n- Use Oxford commas in lists.\n\n### Bullets\n- Capitalize the first word and end with a period.\n- Use numbered lists only for sequences of instructions or when referencing items later.\n\n### Capitalization\n- Capitalize only proper nouns (product names, tools, services).\n- Use sentence case for titles: \"An introduction to data visualization\" not \"An Introduction to Data Visualization\".\n- Don''t capitalize: cloud, internet, machine learning, advanced analytics.\n\n### Headings\n- Avoid gerunds: \"Get started\" not \"Getting started,\" \"Customize a layout\" not \"Customizing a layout\".\n- Keep titles short and descriptive for search discoverability.\n\n### Instructions\n- Use imperatives: \"Complete the configuration steps\".\n- Don''t use \"please\".\n- Don''t use passive tense: \"Complete the steps\" not \"The steps should be completed\".\n\n### Links\n- Make hyperlinks descriptive: `Learn how to [contribute to ARK](url)`.\n- Don''t write: `To contribute, see [here](url)`.\n\n### Avoid\n- Gerunds in headings.\n- Colloquialisms (may not translate across regions/languages).\n- Business speak: \"leverage\", \"utilize\", \"facilitate\".\n\n### What not to mix\n\n| Don''t put in... | This content... |\n|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Tutorials | Explanations, choices. |\n| How-to guides | Teaching, complete reference. |\n| Core concepts | Instructions, reference. |\n| Reference | Instructions, explanations. |\n\n## References\n\n- [Diataxis Framework](https://diataxis.fr/)\n- [Issue #338](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/issues/338)\n- [PR #620](https://github.com/mckinsey/agents-at-scale-ark/pull/620)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:30.352Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing structured content organization using Diataxis framework.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Diataxis 框架进行结构化内容组织的文档代理。","ja":"Diataxis フレームワークを使用した構造化されたコンテンツの整理が必要なドキュメント エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Diataxis 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화된 콘텐츠를 조직하는 문서 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Documentación que necesitan una organización de contenido estructurada utilizando el marco Diataxis.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de documentation ayant besoin d''une organisation de contenu structurée utilisant le cadre Diataxis.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die eine strukturierte Inhaltsorganisation unter Verwendung des Diataxis-Frameworks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de organização de conteúdo estruturada usando o framework Diataxis.","ru":"Идеально для документальных агентов, которым требуется организация структурированного контента с использованием фреймворка Diataxis.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوثائق الذي يحتاج إلى تنظيم المحتوى المنظم باستخدام إطار Diataxis."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage documentation using a standardized Diataxis structure, incorporating Introduction, Quickstart, Tutorials, How-to Guides, and Core Concepts, all within a docs/content/ directory.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理文档的能力，使用标准化的 Diataxis 结构，包括介绍、快速入门、教程、操作指南和核心概念，都在 docs/content/ 目录中。","ja":"エージェントが Diataxis 構造を標準化してドキュメントを作成、管理できるようにすることで、導入、クイックスタート、チュートリアル、ハウツーガイド、コアコンセプトをすべて、docs/content/ ディレクトリ内に組み込むことができます。","ko":"대리자가 표준화된 Diataxis 구조를 사용하여 문서를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록empowers 하여 소개,快速入门, 튜토리얼, 사용 방법 가이드 및 핵심 개념을 모두 docs/content/ 디렉토리 내에 포함할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar documentación utilizando una estructura Diataxis estandarizada, que incorpora Introducción, Inicio rápido, Tutoriales, Guías prácticas y Conceptos básicos, todo dentro de un directorio docs/content/","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer la documentation en utilisant une structure Diataxis standardisée, qui intègre Introduction, Démarrage rapide, Tutorials, Guides pratiques et Concepts de base, le tout dans un répertoire docs/content/","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokumentationen zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie eine standardisierte Diataxis-Struktur verwenden, die Einführung, Schnellstart, Tutorials, Anleitungen und Kernkonzepte umfasst, alles innerhalb eines Verzeichnisses docs/content/","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar documentação usando uma estrutura Diataxis padronizada, incorporando Introdução, Início Rápido, Tutoriais, Guias de Como Fazer e Conceitos Centrais, todos dentro de um diretório docs/content/","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять документацией, используя стандартизированную структуру Diataxis, включающую Введение, Быстрый старт, Уроки, Руководства по действию и Основные понятия, все внутри директории docs/content/","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من إنشاء وتحديث الوثائق باستخدام هيكل Diataxis مع