s TDD pour mettre en œuvre des conceptions approuvées de manière efficace.","de":"Das Tool sdd-tasks generiert umfassende TDD-basierte Aufgaben für die Implementierung genehmigter Designs auf effektive Weise.","pt":"O skill sdd-tasks gera tarefas SDD baseadas em TDD para implementar designs aprovados","ru":"Навык sdd-tasks создает задачи SDD на основе TDD для реализации утвержденных дизайнов","ar":"مهارة sdd-tasks تإنشاء مهام SDD باستخدام TDD لتنفيذ التصاميم المعتمدة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动生成可实施的工作项","支持TDD-based任务分解","设计审批后自动生成任务","集成sdd-status MCP工具","支持多语言"],"ja":["実装可能な作業項目を自動生成","TDD-basedタスク分解をサポート","設計承認後自動的にタスクを生成","sdd-status MCPツールと統合","多言語をサポート"],"ko":["구현 가능한 작업 항목을 자동 생성","TDD-based 태스크 분해를 지원","디자인 승인 후 자동으로 태스크를 생성","sdd-status MCP 도구와 통합","다국어를 지원"],"es":["Generación de desgloses de tareas TDD","Integración con herramientas de diseño","Verificación de requisitos previos","Compatibilidad con flujos de trabajo personalizados","Documentación de diseño en formato Markdown","Soporte para múltiples idiomas"],"fr":["Génération de décompositions de tâches TDD","Intégration avec des outils de conception","Vérification des prérequis","Compatibilité avec des flux de travail personnalisés","Documentation de conception au format Markdown","Prise en charge de plusieurs langues"],"de":["Erstellung von TDD-basierten Aufgaben","Integrierung mit Design-Tools","Überprüfung von Voraussetzungen","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Workflows","Design-Dokumentation im Markdown-Format","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen"],"pt":["Geração de tarefas SDD baseadas em TDD","Verificação de pré-requisitos","Aprovação de designs","Revisão de documentos de design","Integração com ferramentas MCP"],"ru":["Создание задач SDD на основе TDD","Проверка предварительных условий","Утверждение дизайнов","Просмотр документов дизайна","Интеграция с инструментами MCP"],"ar":["إنشاء مهام SDD باستخدام TDD","التحقق من المتطلبات المسبقة","الموافقة على التصاميم","استعراض وثائق التصميم","التكامل مع أدوات MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SDD任务分解生成","自动生成工作项","TDD-based任务分解","设计审批","sdd-status MCP工具","多语言支持"],"ja":["SDDタスク分解生成","自動生成作業項目","TDD-basedタスク分解","設計承認","sdd-status MCPツール","多言語サポート"],"ko":["SDD 태스크 분해 생성","자동 생성 작업 항목","TDD-based 태스크 분해","디자인 승인","sdd-status MCP 도구","다국어 지원"],"es":["sdd-tasks","desglose de tareas TDD","diseño de software","desarrollo de software","herramientas de diseño","flujos de trabajo personalizados"],"fr":["sdd-tasks","décomposition de tâches TDD","conception de logiciel","développement de logiciel","outils de conception","flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["sdd-tasks","TDD-basierte Aufgaben","Software-Design","Software-Entwicklung","Design-Tools","benutzerdefinierte Workflows"],"pt":["sdd-tasks","tdd","design","desenvolvimento","ferramentas MCP","geração de tarefas","pré-requisitos","aprovação de designs"],"ru":["sdd-tasks","tdd","дизайн","разработка","инструменты MCP","создание задач","предварительные условия","утверждение дизайнов"],"ar":["sdd-tasks","tdd","تصميم","تنمية","أدوات MCP","إنشاء مهام","المتطلبات المسبقة","الموافقة على التصاميم"]}},"owner":"yi-john-huang","repo":"acmg-amp-classifier-mcp","repoPath":"yi-john-huang/acmg-amp-classifier-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sdd-tasks","description":"Generate TDD task breakdown for SDD workflow. Use when breaking down design into implementable tasks with test-first approach. Invoked via /sdd-tasks <feature-name>.","bodyPreview":"# SDD Task Breakdown Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive TDD-based task breakdowns that translate approved designs into implementable work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore generating tasks:\n1. Design must be generated using `/sdd-design`\n2. Design phase should be approved (use `sdd-approve design` MCP tool)\n3. Review the design document in `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Verify Prerequisites\n\nUse `sdd-status` MCP tool to verify:\n- `design.generated: true`\n- `design.app","body":"# SDD Task Breakdown Generation\n\nGenerate comprehensive TDD-based task breakdowns that translate approved designs into implementable work items.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore generating tasks:\n1. Design must be generated using `/sdd-design`\n2. Design phase should be approved (use `sdd-approve design` MCP tool)\n3. Review the design document in `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Verify Prerequisites\n\nUse `sdd-status` MCP tool to verify:\n- `design.generated: true`\n- `design.approved: true` (recommended before tasks)\n\n### Step 2: Review Design\n\n1. Read `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`\n2. Identify all components to implement\n3. Note interfaces and data models\n4. Understand dependencies between components\n\n### Step 3: Apply TDD Workflow\n\nFor each task, follow the Red-Green-Refactor cycle:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    TDD CYCLE                                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                             │\n│   1. RED    ──────>  Write failing test first              │\n│                      (Test describes expected behavior)     │\n│                                                             │\n│   2. GREEN  ──────>  Write minimal code to pass            │\n│                      (Just enough to make test green)       │\n│                                                             │\n│   3. REFACTOR ────>  Clean up, maintain tests passing      │\n│                      (Improve design without breaking)      │\n│                                                             │\n│   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────    │\n│                      REPEAT                                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply Test Pyramid\n\nStructure tests following the 70/20/10 ratio:\n\n```\n                    ╱╲\n                   ╱  ╲\n                  ╱ E2E╲         10% - Critical user journeys\n                 ╱──────╲\n                ╱        ╲\n               ╱Integration╲    20% - Component interactions\n              ╱────────────╲\n             ╱              ╲\n            ╱   Unit Tests   ╲  70% - Individual functions\n           ╱──────────────────╲\n```\n\n| Level | Coverage | Scope | Speed |\n|-------|----------|-------|-------|\n| **Unit** | 70% | Single function/class | Fast (ms) |\n| **Integration** | 20% | Component interactions | Medium (s) |\n| **E2E** | 10% | Full user journeys | Slow (min) |\n\n### Step 5: Generate Task Breakdown\n\nStructure tasks hierarchically:\n\n```markdown\n# Tasks: {Feature Name}\n\n## Overview\n{Summary of implementation approach}\n\n## Task Groups\n\n### 1. {Component/Layer Name}\n\n#### 1.1 {Task Name}\n**Type:** Unit | Integration | E2E\n**Estimated Effort:** S | M | L | XL\n**Dependencies:** {Task IDs}\n\n**TDD Steps:**\n1. RED: Write test for {specific behavior}\n   ```typescript\n   describe(''{Component}'', () => {\n     it(''should {expected behavior}'', () => {\n       // Arrange\n       // Act\n       // Assert\n     });\n   });\n   ```\n2. GREEN: Implement {minimal solution}\n3. REFACTOR: {Specific improvements}\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Test passes\n- [ ] Code coverage >= 80%\n- [ ] No lint errors\n\n#### 1.2 {Next Task}\n...\n\n### 2. {Next Component}\n...\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n```\n[1.1] ──> [1.2] ──> [2.1]\n              │\n              └──> [1.3] ──> [2.2]\n```\n\n## Definition of Done\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Code coverage >= 80%\n- [ ] No lint/type errors\n- [ ] Code reviewed\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n### Step 6: Task Sizing Guidelines\n\n| Size | Description | Test Count | Time |\n|------|-------------|------------|------|\n| **S** | Single function, 1-2 tests | 1-2 | < 1 hour |\n| **M** | Multiple functions, 3-5 tests | 3-5 | 1-4 hours |\n| **L** | Component with integration | 5-10 | 4-8 hours |\n| **XL** | Complex component, many edge cases | 10+ | 1-2 days |\n\n### Step 7: Test-First Task Template\n\nFor each implementation task:\n\n```markdown\n#### Task {X.Y}: {Task Name}\n\n**Component:** {ComponentName}\n**Type:** Unit Test → Implementation\n\n**Test Scenarios:**\n1. Happy path: {Expected behavior when inputs are valid}\n2. Edge case: {Boundary conditions}\n3. Error case: {Invalid inputs, failures}\n\n**Test Code (RED):**\n```typescript\nimport { {Component} } from ''./{component}'';\n\ndescribe(''{Component}'', () => {\n  describe(''{method}'', () => {\n    it(''should {happy path behavior}'', async () => {\n      // Arrange\n      const input = { /* valid input */ };\n\n      // Act\n      const result = await component.method(input);\n\n      // Assert\n      expect(result).toEqual({ /* expected */ });\n    });\n\n    it(''should throw when {error condition}'', async () => {\n      // Arrange\n      const invalidInput = { /* invalid */ };\n\n      // Act & Assert\n      await expect(component.method(invalidInput))\n        .rejects.toThrow(''{ErrorType}'');\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n**Implementation (GREEN):**\n{Brief description of minimal implementation}\n\n**Refactor:**\n- Extract {helper function} if needed\n- Apply {specific pattern}\n```\n\n### Step 8: Save and Execute\n\n1. Save tasks to `.spec/specs/{feature}/tasks.md`\n2. Use `sdd-approve tasks` MCP tool to mark phase complete\n3. Use `sdd-spec-impl` MCP tool to execute tasks with TDD\n\n## MCP Tool Integration\n\n| Tool | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `sdd-status` | Verify design phase complete |\n| `sdd-approve` | Mark tasks phase as approved |\n| `sdd-spec-impl` | Execute tasks using TDD methodology |\n| `sdd-quality-check` | Validate code quality during implementation |\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- [ ] All design components have corresponding tasks\n- [ ] Tasks follow TDD (test first)\n- [ ] Test pyramid ratio maintained (70/20/10)\n- [ ] Dependencies between tasks are clear\n- [ ] Each task has specific acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Tasks are sized appropriately (avoid XL when possible)\n- [ ] Implementation order respects dependencies\n- [ ] Definition of Done is clear\n\n## Steering Document References\n\nApply these steering documents during task breakdown:\n\n| Document | Purpose | Key Application |\n|----------|---------|-----------------|\n| `.spec/steering/tdd-guideline.md` | Test-Driven Development | Structure all tasks using Red-Green-Refactor cycle, follow test pyramid (70/20/10) |\n\n**Key TDD Principles for Tasks:**\n1. **RED**: Every task starts with writing a failing test\n2. **GREEN**: Implement minimal code to pass the test\n3. **REFACTOR**: Clean up while keeping tests green\n4. **Test Pyramid**: 70% unit, 20% integration, 10% E2E\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|--------------|---------|----------|\n| **Test After** | Missing edge cases | Always write test first |\n| **Ice Cream Cone** | Too many E2E tests | Follow pyramid (70/20/10) |\n| **Big Tasks** | Hard to track progress | Break into S/M sizes |\n| **No Dependencies** | Blocked work | Map dependencies explicitly |\n| **Vague Criteria** | Unclear completion | Specific, measurable criteria |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:06:35.001Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring structured task breakdowns from approved designs.","zh":"适用于需要从已批准的设计中分解结构化任务的开发代理。","ja":"承認されたデザインから構造化されたタスクのブレークダウンを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"승인된 디자인에서 구조화된 태스크 분해가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una descomposición de tareas estructurada a partir de diseños aprobados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une décomposition de tâches structurée à partir de conceptions approuvées.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenzerlegung aus genehmigten Entwürfen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem desmembramento de tarefas estruturadas a partir de designs aprovados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих структурированного разбиения задач из утвержденных дизайнов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون تحليل مهام منظم من التصاميم المعتمدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive TDD-based task breakdowns using design documents in .md format, leveraging MCP tools like `sdd-status` and `sdd-approve` for verification and approval.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `.md` 格式的设计文档生成全面的 TDD 基础任务分解，利用 `sdd-status` 和 `sdd-approve` 等 MCP 工具进行验证和批准。","ja":"エージェントが `.md` 形式のデザインドキュメントを使用して、`sdd-status` および `sdd-approve` などの MCP ツールを使用して検証および承認を行うことで、包括的な TDD ベースのタスク分解を生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `.md` 형식의 디자인 문서를 사용하여 TDD 기반의 toàn面的 태스크 분해를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `sdd-status`와 `sdd-approve`와 같은 MCP 도구를 사용하여 검증 및 승인을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar descomposiciones de tareas TDD completas utilizando documentos de diseño en formato .md, aprovechando herramientas MCP como `sdd-status` y `sdd-approve` para verificación y aprobación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des décompositions de tâches TDD complètes en utilisant des documents de conception au format .md, en exploitant les outils MCP tels que `sdd-status` et `sdd-approve` pour la vérification et l''approbation.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende TDD-basierte Aufgabenzerlegungen zu generieren, indem sie Designdokumente im .md-Format verwenden und MCP-Tools wie `sdd-status` und `sdd-approve` für Verifizierung und Genehmigung nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem desmembramentos de tarefas abrangentes baseados em TDD usando documentos de design no formato .md, aproveitando ferramentas do MCP como `sdd-status` e `sdd-approve` para verificação e aprovação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать всесторонние разбиения задач на основе TDD, используя документы дизайна в формате .md, используя инструменты MCP, такие как `sdd-status` и `sdd-approve`, для верификации и утверждения.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية توليد تحليل مهام شاملة قائم على TDD باستخدام وثائق التصميم بتنسيق .md، واستخدام أدوات MCP مثل `sdd-status` و `sdd-approve` للتحقق والموافقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating implementable work items from approved designs","Verifying design prerequisites using `sdd-status`","Breaking down designs into actionable tasks"],"zh":["从已批准的设计中生成可实施的工作项","使用 `sdd-status` 验证设计先决条件","将设计分解为可执行的任务"],"ja":["承認されたデザインから実施可能な作業項目を生成する","`sdd-status` を使用してデザインの前提条件を検証する","デザインを実行可能なタスクに分解する"],"ko":["승인된 디자인에서 수행 가능한 작업 항목을 생성한다","`sdd-status`를 사용하여 디자인의 사전 조건을 검증한다","디자인을 수행 가능한 태스크로 분해한다"],"es":["Generar elementos de trabajo implementables a partir de diseños aprobados","Verificar los requisitos previos del diseño utilizando `sdd-status`","Descomponer diseños en tareas realizables"],"fr":["Générer des éléments de travail implementables à partir de conceptions approuvées","Vérifier les conditions préalables de conception en utilisant `sdd-status`","Décomposer les conceptions en tâches réalisables"],"de":["Erzeugen von umsetzbaren Arbeitspunkten aus genehmigten Entwürfen","Verifizieren der Designvoraussetzungen mit `sdd-status`","Zerlegen von Entwürfen in handhabbare Aufgaben"],"pt":["Gerar itens de trabalho implementáveis a partir de designs aprovados","Verificar pré-requisitos de design usando `sdd-status`","Desmembrar designs em tarefas realizáveis"],"ru":["Генерировать реализуемые элементы работы из утвержденных дизайнов","Проверять предварительные условия дизайна, используя `sdd-status`","Разбивать дизайны на действенные задачи"],"ar":["توليد عناصر عمل قابلة للتطبيق من التصاميم المعتمدة","التحقق من متطلبات التصميم باستخدام `sdd-status`","تقسيم التصاميم إلى مهام قابلة للتنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires approved design generated using `/sdd-design`","Design phase must be approved using `sdd-approve` MCP tool","Dependent on `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md` file format"],"zh":["需要使用 `/sdd-design` 生成的已批准设计","设计阶段必须使用 `sdd-approve` MCP 工具进行批准","依赖于 `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md` 文件格式"],"ja":[" `/sdd-design` で生成された承認されたデザインが必要","デザイン段階は `sdd-approve` MCP ツールを使用して承認する必要がある"," `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md` ファイル形式に依存する"],"ko":["`/sdd-design`으로 생성된 승인된 디자인을 필요로 함","디자인 단계는 `sdd-approve` MCP 도구를 사용하여 승인해야 함"," `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md` 파일 형식에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere un diseño aprobado generado mediante `/sdd-design`","La fase de diseño debe ser aprobada mediante la herramienta MCP `sdd-approve`","Dependiente del formato de archivo `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"],"fr":["Nécessite une conception approuvée générée à l''aide de `/sdd-design`","La phase de conception doit être approuvée à l''aide de l''outil MCP `sdd-approve`","Dépendant du format de fichier `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"],"de":["Benötigt einen genehmigten Entwurf, der mit `/sdd-design` erstellt wurde","Die Designphase muss mit dem MCP-Tool `sdd-approve` genehmigt werden","Abhängig vom Dateiformat `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"],"pt":["Exige design aprovado gerado usando `/sdd-design`","Fase de design deve ser aprovada usando a ferramenta MCP `sdd-approve`","Dependente do formato de arquivo `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"],"ru":["Требует утвержденного дизайна, сгенерированного с помощью `/sdd-design`","Фаза дизайна должна быть утверждена с помощью инструмента MCP `sdd-approve`","Зависит от формата файла `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"],"ar":["يتطلب تصميمًا معتمدًا تم إنشاؤه باستخدام `/sdd-design`","يجب موافقة مرحلة التصميم باستخدام أداة MCP `sdd-approve`","يعتمد على تنسيق ملف `.spec/specs/{feature}/design.md`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
