 e JavaScript para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Сравнение ERB и JavaScript для Разработчиков","ar":"مقارنة ERB و JavaScript لمطوري البرامج","en":"compare-erb-js"},"description":{"zh":"compare-erb-js工具用于比较ERB模板和JavaScript转换输出，确保offline scoring SPA的准确性和一致性","ja":"compare-erb-jsツールは、ERBテンプレートとJavaScript変換出力を比較し、offline scoring SPAの正確性と一貫性を確保します","ko":"compare-erb-js 도구는 ERB 템플릿과 JavaScript 변환 출력을 비교하여 offline scoring SPA의 정확성과 일관성을 보장합니다","es":"La herramienta compare-erb-js permite a los desarrolladores comparar la salida de plantillas ERB y JavaScript para asegurar la compatibilidad en aplicaciones...","fr":"L''outil compare-erb-js permet aux développeurs de comparer la sortie de modèles ERB et JavaScript pour assurer la compatibilité dans les applications hors ligne","de":"Das Tool compare-erb-js ermöglicht es Entwicklern, die Ausgabe von ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagen zu vergleichen, um die Kompatibilität in Offline-Anwendungen ...","pt":"O compare-erb-js é uma ferramenta para garantir a consistência entre templates ERB e JavaScript. Use scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb para comparar saídas.","ru":"Compare-erb-js - это инструмент для обеспечения согласованности между шаблонами ERB и JavaScript. Используйте scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb для сравнения вывода.","ar":"compare-erb-js هو أداة لتضمن الاتساق بين قوالب ERB و JavaScript. استخدم scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb لمقارنة المخرجات.","en":"Ballroom Dance Showcase Scheduler"},"definition":{"en":"Ballroom Dance Showcase Scheduler"},"features":{"zh":["比较ERB模板和JavaScript转换输出","确保offline scoring SPA的准确性","支持命令行运行","简单易用"],"ja":["ERBテンプレートとJavaScript変換出力を比較","offline scoring SPAの精度を確保","コマンドラインで実行可能","簡単に使用可能"],"ko":["ERB 템플릿과 JavaScript 변환 출력을 비교","offline scoring SPA의 정확성을 보장","명령줄에서 실행 가능","간단하고 사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Comparación de plantillas ERB y JavaScript","Verificación de la compatibilidad en aplicaciones offline","Uso de scripts de Ruby para la comparación","Soporte para bases de datos SQLite","Comparación de listas y calor individuales"],"fr":["Comparaison de modèles ERB et JavaScript","Vérification de la compatibilité dans les applications hors ligne","Utilisation de scripts Ruby pour la comparaison","Prise en charge des bases de données SQLite","Comparaison de listes et de chaleur individuelles"],"de":["Vergleich von ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagen","Überprüfung der Kompatibilität in Offline-Anwendungen","Verwendung von Ruby-Skripten für den Vergleich","Unterstützung von SQLite-Datenbanken","Vergleich von Listen und individueller Hitze"],"pt":["Comparação de saídas de templates ERB e JavaScript","Uso de scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb para verificar a consistência","Essencial para o aplicativo de pontuação offline","Suporte a comparação de listas e calor individuais","Fácil de usar e integrar ao fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Сравнение вывода шаблонов ERB и JavaScript","Использование scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb для проверки согласованности","Необходимо для автономного приложения для подсчета очков","Поддержка сравнения списков и отдельных элементов","Легко использовать и интегрировать в рабочий процесс разработки"],"ar":["مقارنة مخرجات قوالب ERB و JavaScript","استخدام scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb للتحقق من الاتساق","ضروري لتطبيق تسجيل النقاط ngoại tuyến","دعم لمقارنة القوائم والعناصر الفردية","سهل الاستخدام والدمج في تدفق العمل التطويري"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ERB","JavaScript","模板输出比较","offline scoring SPA","命令行工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["ERB","JavaScript","テンプレート出力比較","offline scoring SPA","コマンドラインツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["ERB","JavaScript","템플릿 출력 비교","offline scoring SPA","명령줄 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["compare-erb-js","plantillas ERB","JavaScript","compatibilidad","aplicaciones offline","Ruby","SQLite"],"fr":["compare-erb-js","modèles ERB","JavaScript","compatibilité","applications hors ligne","Ruby","SQLite"],"de":["compare-erb-js","ERB-Vorlagen","JavaScript","Kompatibilität","Offline-Anwendungen","Ruby","SQLite"],"pt":["compare-erb-js","templates ERB","JavaScript","desenvolvimento web","aplicativo de pontuação offline","consistência de saída","ferramenta de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["compare-erb-js","шаблоны ERB","JavaScript","веб-разработка","автономное приложение для подсчета очков","согласованность вывода","инструмент разработки"],"ar":["compare-erb-js","قوالب ERB","JavaScript","تطوير الويب","تطبيق تسجيل النقاط ngoại tuyến","اتساق المخرجات","أداة تطوير"]}},"owner":"rubys","repo":"showcase","repoPath":"rubys/showcase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compare-erb-js","description":"Compare ERB and JavaScript template outputs for the offline scoring SPA. Use when working on ERB-to-JS conversion, debugging template parity issues, or verifying that changes to scoring views work correctly in both ERB and SPA modes.","bodyPreview":"# Compare ERB vs JavaScript Template Output\n\nUse `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` to verify that ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted equivalents produce matching output. This is essential for the offline scoring SPA which uses auto-converted ERB templates.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Compare heat list\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83\n\n# Compare individual heat\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3","body":"# Compare ERB vs JavaScript Template Output\n\nUse `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` to verify that ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted equivalents produce matching output. This is essential for the offline scoring SPA which uses auto-converted ERB templates.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Compare heat list\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83\n\n# Compare individual heat\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83 1\n\n# With style parameter\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83 1 radio\n```\n\nOr using environment variable:\n```bash\nRAILS_APP_DB=2025-barcelona-november bundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb 83 1\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. Renders the ERB template via Rails routing (extracts `<main>` content)\n2. Fetches converted JavaScript templates from `/templates/scoring.js`\n3. Fetches normalized data from `/scores/:judge/heats/data`\n4. Hydrates the data using `heat_hydrator.js` (for individual heats)\n5. Renders using the JavaScript template\n6. Compares row counts and saves both outputs for diff analysis\n\n## Output Files\n\nAll files are saved to `/tmp/` for analysis:\n\n- `/tmp/erb_rendered.html` - ERB template output (main content only)\n- `/tmp/js_rendered.html` - JavaScript template output\n- `/tmp/scoring_templates.js` - Converted templates from `/templates/scoring.js`\n- `/tmp/heats_data.json` - Raw normalized data from server\n- `/tmp/js_template_data.json` - Hydrated data passed to JS template\n\n## Analyzing Differences\n\n```bash\n# Quick diff\ndiff /tmp/erb_rendered.html /tmp/js_rendered.html\n\n# Side-by-side comparison\ndiff -y /tmp/erb_rendered.html /tmp/js_rendered.html | less\n\n# Compare specific attributes\ndiff <(grep -o ''href=\"[^\"]*\"'' /tmp/erb_rendered.html | sort) \\\n     <(grep -o ''href=\"[^\"]*\"'' /tmp/js_rendered.html | sort)\n```\n\n## Common Differences\n\nSome differences are expected due to ERB-to-JS conversion limitations:\n\n- **HTML entity encoding**: ERB uses `&quot;` while JS uses `\"`\n- **link_to blocks**: Block form of `link_to` may render differently\n- **Whitespace**: Minor whitespace differences are normal\n\n## Architecture\n\nThis tool supports the \"Server computes, hydration joins, templates filter\" principle:\n\n- **Server**: Computes derived values and paths (respects RAILS_APP_SCOPE)\n- **Hydration**: `heat_hydrator.js` joins normalized data by resolving IDs\n- **Templates**: ERB and JS templates filter/format data identically\n\n## Key Source Files\n\n### Server-side (Rails)\n\n- `app/controllers/scores_controller.rb`\n  - `heats_data` action: Returns normalized JSON data for SPA\n  - `heat` action: Sets instance variables for ERB templates\n  - Computes `paths:` hash with server-computed URLs\n\n- `app/controllers/templates_controller.rb`\n  - `scoring` action: Converts ERB templates to JavaScript on-the-fly\n  - Defines path helper stubs for JS templates\n  - Uses `ErbPrismConverter` for conversion\n\n- `lib/erb_prism_converter.rb`\n  - Converts ERB templates to JavaScript functions using Ruby''s Prism parser\n  - Handles Ruby-to-JS translation (loops, conditionals, method calls)\n\n### Client-side (JavaScript)\n\n- `app/javascript/lib/heat_hydrator.js`\n  - `buildLookupTables()`: Creates Maps for O(1) entity lookup\n  - `hydrateHeat()`: Resolves IDs to full objects\n  - `buildHeatTemplateData()`: Prepares complete data for templates\n\n- `app/javascript/controllers/heat_app_controller.js`\n  - Main Stimulus controller for the offline scoring SPA\n  - Loads templates and data, handles navigation\n  - Manages offline/online state transitions\n\n### ERB Templates (source of truth)\n\n- `app/views/scores/heat.html.erb` - Main heat view\n- `app/views/scores/heatlist.html.erb` - Heat list view\n- `app/views/scores/_heat_header.html.erb` - Heat header partial\n- `app/views/scores/_info_box.html.erb` - Info box with feedback errors\n- `app/views/scores/_navigation_footer.html.erb` - Prev/next navigation\n- `app/views/scores/_table_heat.html.erb` - Standard heat table\n- `app/views/scores/_rank_heat.html.erb` - Finals ranking view\n- `app/views/scores/_solo_heat.html.erb` - Solo heat view\n- `app/views/scores/_cards_heat.html.erb` - Card-based scoring view\n\n### Scripts\n\n- `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` - This comparison tool\n- `scripts/hydrate_heats.mjs` - Node.js script for hydrating data (used by comparison tool)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:07:14.460Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby-based AI Agents needing to verify ERB template output against JavaScript-converted equivalents.","zh":"非常适合需要验证ERB模板输出与JavaScript转换等效的Ruby 기반AI代理。","ja":"RubyベースのAIエージェントがERBテンプレートの出力とJavaScriptに変換された等価物を検証する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"ERB 템플릿 출력과 자바스크립트로 변환된 동일한 것을 확인해야 하는 루비 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Ruby que necesitan verificar la salida de plantillas ERB contra equivalentes convertidos a JavaScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Ruby ayant besoin de vérifier la sortie de modèles ERB contre des équivalents convertis en JavaScript.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-basierte KI-Agents, die die Ausgabe von ERB-Vorlagen gegen JavaScript-konvertierte Äquivalente überprüfen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Ruby que precisam verificar a saída de modelos de template ERB contra equivalentes convertidos para JavaScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Ruby, которым необходимо проверить вывод шаблонов ERB с эквивалентными преобразованными в JavaScript.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الإي الأي الذكية المبنية على روبي التي تحتاج إلى التحقق من إخراج قوالب ERB مقابل المتماثلات المحولة إلى جافا سكريبت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compare ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted counterparts, ensuring matching output for offline scoring SPAs using auto-converted ERB templates, leveraging Ruby and SQLite databases.","zh":"赋予代理比较ERB模板及其JavaScript转换的对应物，确保离线评分单页应用程序使用自动转换的ERB模板的输出匹配，利用Ruby和SQLite数据库。","ja":"ERBテンプレートとそのJavaScriptに変換された対应物を比較することで、オフラインスコアリングSPAで自動変換されたERBテンプレートを使用して出力の一致を確保し、RubyとSQLiteデータベースを利用するエージェントに権限を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 ERB 템플릿과 자바스크립트로 변환된 대응물을 비교하여 오프라인 평가 SPA에서 자동으로 변환된 ERB 템플릿을 사용하여 출력이 일치하는지 확인하고 루비와 SQLite 데이터베이스를 활용하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comparar plantillas ERB y sus contrapartes convertidas a JavaScript, garantizando una salida coincidente para SPAs de puntuación offline que utilizan plantillas ERB autoconvertidas, aprovechando bases de datos Ruby y SQLite.","fr":"Permet aux agents de comparer des modèles ERB et leurs équivalents convertis en JavaScript, garantissant une sortie correspondante pour les SPAs de notation hors ligne utilisant des modèles ERB auto-convertis, en exploitant les bases de données Ruby et SQLite.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, ERB-Vorlagen und deren JavaScript-konvertierte Gegenstücke zu vergleichen, um eine übereinstimmende Ausgabe für Offline-Scoring-SPAs zu gewährleisten, die auto-konvertierte ERB-Vorlagen verwenden, indem Ruby- und SQLite-Datenbanken genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compararem modelos de template ERB e seus equivalentes convertidos para JavaScript, garantindo saída correspondente para aplicativos de página única offline que usam modelos de template ERB autoconvertidos, aproveitando bancos de dados Ruby e SQLite.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сравнивать шаблоны ERB и их эквивалентные преобразованные в JavaScript аналоги, обеспечивая соответствующий вывод для автономных веб-приложений, использующих автоматически преобразованные шаблоны ERB, используя базы данных Ruby и SQLite.","ar":"يمنح العمال القدرة على مقارنة قوالب ERB ومقابلاتها المحولة إلى جافا سكريبت، مما يضمن إخراجًا متطابقًا للتطبيقات تکتيكية صفحة واحدة ngoại tuyến التي تستخدم قوالب ERB المحولة تلقائيًا، مستفيدة من قواعد بيانات روبي وSQLite."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying heat list output for Ballroom Dance Showcase Schedulers","Comparing individual heat outputs for accuracy","Debugging discrepancies between ERB and JavaScript template renderings"],"zh":["验证舞厅舞蹈展示调度器的热度列表输出","比较个别热度输出以确保准确性","调试ERB和JavaScript模板渲染之间的差异"],"ja":["ボールルームダンスショーケーススケジューラーのヒートリスト出力を検証する","個々のヒート出力を比較して精度を確保する","ERBとJavaScriptテンプレートのレンダリング間の差異をデバッグする"],"ko":["발룸 댄스 쇼케이스 스케줄러의 열 목록 출력을 확인하는 것","개별 열 출력을 비교하여 정확성을 보장하는 것","ERB와 자바스크립트 템플릿 렌더링 간의 불일치를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Verificar la salida de la lista de calor para programadores de showcase de baile de salón","Comparar salidas de calor individuales para garantizar la precisión","Depurar discrepancias entre renderizados de plantillas ERB y JavaScript"],"fr":["Vérifier la sortie de la liste de chaleur pour les programmeurs de showcase de danse de salon","Comparer les sorties de chaleur individuelles pour l''exactitude","Déboguer les écarts entre les rendus de modèles ERB et JavaScript"],"de":["Überprüfen der Ausgabe der Hitliste für Ballroom-Tanz-Showcase-Planer","Vergleichen von Einzelausgaben für Genauigkeit","Fehlerbehebung bei Abweichungen zwischen ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagenergebnissen"],"pt":["Verificar a saída da lista de calor para agendadores de showcase de dança de salão","Comparar saídas de calor individuais para precisão","Depurar discrepâncias entre renderizações de modelos de template ERB e JavaScript"],"ru":["Проверить вывод списка тепла для планировщиков шоу балльного танца","Сравнить индивидуальные тепловые выходы для точности","Отладить несоответствия между рендерингами шаблонов ERB и JavaScript"],"ar":["التحقق من إخراج قائمة الحرارة لمجدولي عروض الرقص في قاعة الرقص","مقارنة الإخراجات الحرارية الفردية لضمان الدقة","تصحيح الأخطاء بين عمليات تحويل قوالب ERB وجافا سكريبت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby environment","Dependent on SQLite database files (e.g., .sqlite3)","Limited to ERB and JavaScript template comparison"],"zh":["需要Ruby环境","依赖于SQLite数据库文件（例如.sqlite3）","仅限于ERB和JavaScript模板比较"],"ja":["Ruby環境が必要","SQLiteデータベースファイル（例：.sqlite3）に依存","ERBとJavaScriptテンプレートの比較のみ"],"ko":["루비 환경이 필요함","SQLite 데이터베이스 파일(.sqlite3 등)에 의존함","ERB와 자바스크립트 템플릿 비교에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Ruby","Dependiente de archivos de base de datos SQLite (por ejemplo, .sqlite3)","Limitado a la comparación de plantillas ERB y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Ruby","Dépendant des fichiers de base de données SQLite (par exemple, .sqlite3)","Limité à la comparaison de modèles ERB et JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby-Umgebung","Abhängig von SQLite-Datenbankdateien (z.B. .sqlite3)","Begrenzt auf den Vergleich von ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Ruby","Depende de arquivos de banco de dados SQLite (por exemplo, .sqlite3)","Limitado à comparação de modelos de template ERB e JavaScript"],"ru":["Требует среды Ruby","Зависит от файлов базы данных SQLite (например, .sqlite3)","Ограничен сравнением шаблонов ERB и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة روبي","يعتمد على ملفات قاعدة بيانات SQLite (على سبيل المثال .sqlite3)","محدود بمقارنة قوالب ERB وجافا سكريبت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('longbridge/gpui-component/generate-component-story', 'community', 'longbridge', 'gpui-component', 'longbridge/gpui-component', 'generate-component-story', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.403Z', '2026-02-18T03:07:14.356Z', NULL, '{"id":"longbridge/gpui-component/generate-component-story","name":"generate-component-story","description":{"zh":"Rust GUI组件用于构建跨平台桌面应用，提供组件故事和示例，帮助开发者快速上手","ja":"Rust GUIコンポーネントは、クロスプラットフォームデスクトップアプリケーションを構築するために使用され、コンポーネントのストーリーと例を提供して開発者が迅速に始めることができるようにします","ko":"Rust GUI 컴포넌트는 크로스 플랫폼 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 사용되며 컴포넌트의 스토리와 예시를 제공하여 개발자가 빠르게 시작할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"GPUI permite crear componentes de GUI para aplicaciones de escritorio cross-platform con Rust. Sigue patrones existentes y utiliza secciones para organizar tus historias de componentes.","fr":"GPUI vous permet de générer des composants GUI pour des applications de bureau cross-platform avec Rust. Suivez les modèles existants et utilisez des sections pour organiser vos histoires de composants.","de":"GPUI ermöglicht das Erstellen von GUI-Komponenten für cross-plattformige Desktop-Anwendungen mit Rust. Befolgen Sie bestehende Muster und verwenden Sie Abschnitte, um Ihre Komponenten-Geschichten zu organisieren.","pt":"O GPUI permite criar componentes GUI para aplicativos desktop cross-plataforma. Siga os padrões e exemplos para uma experiência de usuário incrível.","ru":"GPUI позволяет создавать GUI-компоненты для кроссплатформенных приложений. Следуйте шаблонам и примерам для фантастического пользовательского опыта.","ar":"يسمح GPUI بإنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم الرسومية للتطبيقات المكتبية متعددة المنصات. اتبع الأنماط والأمثلة للحصول على تجربة مستخدم رائعة.","en":"Rust GUI components for building fantastic cross-platform desktop application by using GPUI."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rust跨平台GUI组件生成","ja":"RustクロスプラットフォームGUIコンポーネント生