obleme"],"pt":["Integração de prompts correta","Fluxos de depuração","Melhores práticas aprendidas com falhas reais de benchmark","Suporte a múltiplos modelos de AILANG","Análise de benchmarks de avaliação"],"ru":["Правильная интеграция промптов","Отладка","Лучшие практики, полученные из реальных сбоев эталонных тестов","Поддержка нескольких моделей AILANG","Анализ эталонных тестов оценки"],"ar":["دمج البرومبتات بشكل صحيح","عمليات التصحيح","أفضل الممارسات المكتسبة من فشل اختبارات الأداء الفعلي","دعم لأكثر من نموذج من AILANG","تحليل اختبارات الأداء لتقييم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI语言评估","基准管理","调试工作流","最佳实践","AILANG","benchmark","调试"],"ja":["AI言語評価","基準管理","デバッグワークフロー","ベストプラクティス","AILANG","ベンチマーク","デバッグ"],"ko":["AI 언어 평가","基準 관리","디버깅 워크플ロー","최佳实践","AILANG","벤치마크","디버깅"],"es":["AILANG","Administrador de Benchmark","evaluación de lenguaje","depuración de benchmarks","integración de solicitudes","mejores prácticas","modelos de lenguaje","evaluación de modelos"],"fr":["AILANG","Gestionnaire de Benchmark","évaluation de langage","débogage de benchmarks","intégration de requêtes","meilleures pratiques","modèles de langage","évaluation de modèles"],"de":["AILANG","Benchmark-Manager","Sprachbewertung","Fehlersuche bei Benchmarks","Prompt-Integration","Best Practices","Sprachmodelle","Modellbewertung"],"pt":["Gerenciador de Benchmark","AILANG","avaliação de AILANG","benchmarks de avaliação","integração de prompts","fluxos de depuração","melhores práticas de benchmark"],"ru":["Менеджер эталонных тестов","AILANG","оценка AILANG","эталонные тесты оценки","интеграция промптов","отладка","лучшие практики эталонных тестов"],"ar":["مدير اختبار الأداء","AILANG","تقييم AILANG","اختبارات الأداء لتقييم","دمج البرومبتات","عمليات التصحيح","أفضل الممارسات لاختبار الأداء"]}},"owner":"sunholo-data","repo":"ailang","repoPath":"sunholo-data/ailang","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Benchmark Manager","description":"Create and manage AILANG eval benchmarks. Use when user asks to create benchmarks, fix benchmark issues, debug failing benchmarks, or analyze benchmark results.","bodyPreview":"# Benchmark Manager\n\nManage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with correct prompt integration, debugging workflows, and best practices learned from real benchmark failures.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Debugging a failing benchmark:**\n```bash\n# 1. Show the full prompt that models see\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n\n# 2. Test a benchmark with a specific model\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks json_parse\n\n# 3. Check benchmark YAML for common issues","body":"# Benchmark Manager\n\nManage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with correct prompt integration, debugging workflows, and best practices learned from real benchmark failures.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Debugging a failing benchmark:**\n```bash\n# 1. Show the full prompt that models see\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n\n# 2. Test a benchmark with a specific model\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks json_parse\n\n# 3. Check benchmark YAML for common issues\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/json_parse.yml\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- User asks to create a new benchmark\n- User asks to debug/fix a failing benchmark\n- User wants to understand why models generate wrong code\n- User asks about benchmark YAML format\n- Benchmarks show 0% pass rate despite language support\n\n## CRITICAL: prompt vs task_prompt\n\n**This is the most important concept for benchmark management.**\n\n### The Problem (v0.4.8 Discovery)\n\nBenchmarks have TWO different prompt fields with VERY different behavior:\n\n| Field | Behavior | Use When |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| `prompt:` | **REPLACES** the teaching prompt entirely | Testing raw model capability (rare) |\n| `task_prompt:` | **APPENDS** to teaching prompt | Normal benchmarks (99% of cases) |\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n```yaml\n# BAD - Model never sees AILANG syntax!\nprompt: |\n  Write a program that prints \"Hello\"\n\n# GOOD - Model sees teaching prompt + task\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write a program that prints \"Hello\"\n```\n\nWith `prompt:`, models generate Python/pseudo-code because they never learn AILANG syntax.\n\n### How Prompts Combine\n\nFrom `internal/eval_harness/spec.go` (lines 91-93):\n```go\nfullPrompt := basePrompt  // Teaching prompt from prompts/v0.4.x.md\nif s.TaskPrompt != \"\" {\n    fullPrompt = fullPrompt + \"\\n\\n## Task\\n\\n\" + s.TaskPrompt\n}\n```\n\nThe teaching prompt teaches AILANG syntax; `task_prompt` adds the specific task.\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### `scripts/show_full_prompt.sh`\n\nShows the complete prompt that models receive for a benchmark.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh <benchmark_id>\n\n# Example:\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n```\n\n### `scripts/check_benchmark.sh`\n\nValidates a benchmark YAML file for common issues.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/<name>.yml\n```\n\n**Checks for:**\n- Using `prompt:` instead of `task_prompt:` (warning)\n- Missing required fields\n- Invalid capability names\n- Syntax errors in YAML\n\n### `scripts/test_benchmark.sh`\n\nRuns a quick single-model test of a benchmark.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh <benchmark_id> [model]\n\n# Examples:\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh json_parse\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh json_parse claude-haiku-4-5\n```\n\n## Benchmark YAML Format\n\n### Required Fields\n\n```yaml\nid: my_benchmark              # Unique identifier (snake_case)\ndescription: \"Short description of what this tests\"\nlanguages: [\"python\", \"ailang\"]\nentrypoint: \"main\"            # Function to call\ncaps: [\"IO\"]                  # Required capabilities\ndifficulty: \"easy|medium|hard\"\nexpected_gain: \"low|medium|high\"\ntask_prompt: |                # ALWAYS use task_prompt, not prompt!\n  Write a program in <LANG> that:\n  1. Does something\n  2. Prints the result\n\n  Output only the code, no explanations.\nexpected_stdout: |            # Exact expected output\n  expected output here\n```\n\n### Capability Names\n\nValid capabilities: `IO`, `FS`, `Clock`, `Net`\n\n```yaml\n# File I/O\ncaps: [\"IO\"]\n\n# HTTP requests\ncaps: [\"Net\", \"IO\"]\n\n# File system operations\ncaps: [\"FS\", \"IO\"]\n```\n\n## Creating New Benchmarks\n\n### Step 1: Determine Requirements\n\n- What language feature/capability is being tested?\n- Can models solve this with just the teaching prompt?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### Step 2: Write the Benchmark\n\n```yaml\nid: my_new_benchmark\ndescription: \"Test feature X capability\"\nlanguages: [\"python\", \"ailang\"]\nentrypoint: \"main\"\ncaps: [\"IO\"]\ndifficulty: \"medium\"\nexpected_gain: \"medium\"\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write a program in <LANG> that:\n  1. Clear description of task\n  2. Another step\n  3. Print the result\n\n  Output only the code, no explanations.\nexpected_stdout: |\n  exact expected output\n```\n\n### Step 3: Validate and Test\n\n```bash\n# Check for issues\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/my_new_benchmark.yml\n\n# Test with cheap model first\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks my_new_benchmark\n```\n\n## Debugging Failing Benchmarks\n\n### Symptom: 0% Pass Rate Despite Language Support\n\n**Check 1: Is it using `task_prompt:`?**\n```bash\ngrep -E \"^prompt:\" benchmarks/failing_benchmark.yml\n# If this returns a match, change to task_prompt:\n```\n\n**Check 2: What prompt do models see?**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh failing_benchmark\n```\n\n**Check 3: Is the teaching prompt up to date?**\n```bash\n# After editing prompts/v0.x.x.md, you MUST rebuild:\nmake quick-install\n```\n\n### Symptom: Models Copy Template Instead of Solving Task\n\nThe teaching prompt includes a template structure. If models copy it verbatim:\n\n1. Make sure task is clearly different from examples in teaching prompt\n2. Check that `task_prompt` explicitly describes what to do\n3. Consider if the task description is ambiguous\n\n### Symptom: compile_error on Valid Syntax\n\nCommon AILANG-specific issues models get wrong:\n\n| Wrong | Correct | Notes |\n|-------|---------|-------|\n| `print(42)` | `print(show(42))` | print expects string |\n| `a % b` | `mod_Int(a, b)` | No % operator |\n| `def main()` | `export func main()` | Wrong keyword |\n| `for x in xs` | `match xs { ... }` | No for loops |\n\nIf models consistently make these mistakes, the teaching prompt needs improvement (use prompt-manager skill).\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### 1. Using `prompt:` Instead of `task_prompt:`\n\n```yaml\n# WRONG - Models never see AILANG syntax\nprompt: |\n  Write code that...\n\n# CORRECT - Teaching prompt + task\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that...\n```\n\n### 2. Forgetting to Rebuild After Prompt Changes\n\n```bash\n# After editing prompts/v0.x.x.md:\nmake quick-install  # REQUIRED!\n```\n\n### 3. Putting Hints in Benchmarks\n\n```yaml\n# WRONG - Hints in benchmark\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that prints 42.\n  Hint: Use print(show(42)) in AILANG.\n\n# CORRECT - No hints; if models fail, fix the teaching prompt\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that prints 42.\n```\n\nIf models need AILANG-specific hints, the teaching prompt is incomplete. Use the prompt-manager skill to fix it.\n\n### 4. Testing Too Many Models at Once\n\n```bash\n# WRONG - Expensive and slow for debugging\nailang eval-suite --full --benchmarks my_test\n\n# CORRECT - Use one cheap model first\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks my_test\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Reference Guide\nSee [`resources/reference.md`](resources/reference.md) for:\n- Complete list of valid benchmark fields\n- Capability reference\n- Example benchmarks\n\n### Related Skills\n- **prompt-manager**: When benchmark failures indicate teaching prompt issues\n- **eval-analyzer**: For analyzing results across many benchmarks\n- **use-ailang**: For writing correct AILANG code\n\n## Notes\n\n- Benchmarks live in `benchmarks/` directory\n- Eval results go to `eval_results/` directory\n- Teaching prompt is embedded in binary - rebuild after changes\n- Use `<LANG>` placeholder in task_prompt - it''s replaced with \"AILANG\" or \"Python\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:09:08.859Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents needing advanced benchmark evaluation and debugging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级基准评估和调试功能的语言模型代理。","ja":"高度なベンチマーク評価およびデバッグ機能を必要とする言語モデルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 벤치마크 평가 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje que necesitan una evaluación de referencia avanzada y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Modèle de Langage ayant besoin d''une évaluation de référence avancée et de capacités de débogage.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachmodell-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Benchmarkbewertung und Debugging-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que precisam de avaliação de benchmark avançada e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, которым требуются продвинутые возможности оценки и отладки бенчмарков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نموذج اللغة الذي يحتاج إلى تقييم بENCHMARK متقدم وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with correct prompt integration, utilizing scripts like show_full_prompt.sh and ailang eval-suite, and applying best practices learned from real benchmark failures to optimize model performance.","zh":"使代理能够使用正确的提示集成来管理AILANG评估基准，利用诸如show_full_prompt.sh和ailang eval-suite之类的脚本，并应用从真实基准故障中学习到的最佳实践来优化模型性能。","ja":"エージェントが、show_full_prompt.shやailang eval-suiteなどのスクリプトを使用して、AILANG評価ベンチマークを正しくプロンプト統合で管理し、ベンチマークの実際の障害から学んだベストプラクティスを適用してモデルパフォーマンスを最適化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 AILANG 평가 벤치마크를 올바른 프롬프트 통합으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, show_full_prompt.sh 및 ailang eval-suite와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 모델 성능을 최적화하기 위해 실제 벤치마크 실패에서 학습된 모범 사례를 적용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar las referencias de evaluación de AILANG con una integración correcta de solicitudes, utilizando scripts como show_full_prompt.sh y ailang eval-suite, y aplicando las mejores prácticas aprendidas de fallos de referencia reales para optimizar el rendimiento del modelo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les références d''évaluation AILANG avec une intégration correcte de invites, en utilisant des scripts tels que show_full_prompt.sh et ailang eval-suite, et en appliquant les meilleures pratiques apprises de défaillances de référence réelles pour optimiser les performances du modèle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AILANG-Bewertungsreferenzen mit korrekter Prompt-Integration zu verwalten, indem Skripte wie show_full_prompt.sh und ailang eval-suite verwendet werden, und bewährte Verfahren aus realen Benchmark-Fehlern anzuwenden, um die Modellleistung zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar benchmarks de avaliação AILANG com integração correta de prompts, utilizando scripts como show_full_prompt.sh e conjunto de avaliação ailang, e aplicando as melhores práticas aprendidas com falhas reais de benchmarks para otimizar o desempenho do modelo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять бенчмарками оценки AILANG с правильной интеграцией промптов, используя скрипты типа show_full_prompt.sh и набор оценки ailang, и применяя лучшие практики, полученные из реальных неудач бенчмарков, для оптимизации производительности модели.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إدارة معايير تقييم AILANG مع دمج الإشارات الصحيحة ، باستخدام نصوص مثل show_full_prompt.sh و مجموعة تقييم ailang ، وتطبيق أفضل الممارسات المكتسبة من فشل Benchmarks الحقيقي لتحسين أداء النموذج."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging failing benchmarks with specific models like claude-haiku-4-5","Testing benchmarks with custom models and evaluating their performance","Validating benchmark YAML for common issues to ensure seamless model integration"],"zh":["使用特定模型（如claude-haiku-4-5）调试失败的基准","使用自定义模型测试基准并评估其性能","验证基准YAML以确保与模型集成无缝"],"ja":["特定のモデル（例：claude-haiku-4-5）を使用して失敗したベンチマークをデバッグする","カスタムモデルを使用してベンチマークをテストし、そのパフォーマンスを評価する","ベンチマークのYAMLを検証して、モデルとの統合がスムーズになるようにする"],"ko":["특정 모델(claude-haiku-4-5 등)을 사용하여 실패한 벤치마크를 디버깅하는 것","사용자 지정 모델을 사용하여 벤치마크를 테스트하고 성능을 평가하는 것","모델 통합을 무결하게 유지하기 위해 벤치마크 YAML을 확인하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de referencias fallidas con modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5","Pruebas de referencias con modelos personalizados y evaluación de su rendimiento","Validación de YAML de referencia para problemas comunes para garantizar una integración de modelo sin problemas"],"fr":["Débogage des références défaillantes avec des modèles spécifiques comme claude-haiku-4-5","Tests de références avec des modèles personnalisés et évaluation de leurs performances","Validation du YAML de référence pour les problèmes courants afin de garantir une intégration de modèle sans problème"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei fehlgeschlagenen Benchmarks mit spezifischen Modellen wie claude-haiku-4-5","Testen von Benchmarks mit benutzerdefinierten Modellen und Bewertung ihrer Leistung","Validierung der Benchmark-YAML für häufige Probleme, um eine reibungslose Modellintegration zu gewährleisten"],"pt":["Depuração de benchmarks com falha com modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5","Testar benchmarks com modelos personalizados e avaliar seu desempenho","Validar benchmark YAML para problemas comuns para garantir integração de modelo sem problemas"],"ru":["Отладка неудачных бенчмарков с конкретными моделями, такими как claude-haiku-4-5","Тестирование бенчмарков с пользовательскими моделями и оценка их производительности","Валидация бенчмарка YAML на общие проблемы для обеспечения бесперебойной интеграции модели"],"ar":["فحص أخطاء Benchmarks مع نماذج محددة مثل claude-haiku-4-5","اختبار Benchmarks مع نماذج مخصصة وتقييم أدائها","التحقق من صحة YAML Benchmark لمشاكل شائعة لضمان تكامل نموذجية بدون مشاكل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AILANG evaluation suite setup","Limited to specific model support, such as claude-haiku-4-5","Dependent on bash scripts like show_full_prompt.sh for prompt analysis"],"zh":["需要AILANG评估套件设置","仅限于特定模型支持，如claude-haiku-4-5","依赖于bash脚本（如show_full_prompt.sh）进行提示分析"],"ja":["AILANG評価スイートの設定が必要","特定のモデル（例：claude-haiku-4-5）のみをサポート","プロンプト分析にはbashスクリプト（例：show_full_prompt.sh）に依存"],"ko":["AILANG 평가套件 설정이 필요함","특정 모델(claude-haiku-4-5 등)만 지원함","프롬프트 분석을 위해 bash 스크립트(show_full_prompt.sh 등)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del conjunto de evaluación de AILANG","Limitado a soporte de modelos específicos, como claude-haiku-4-5","Dependiente de scripts de bash como show_full_prompt.sh para el análisis de solicitudes"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du jeu d''évaluation AILANG","Limité à la prise en charge de modèles spécifiques, tels que claude-haiku-4-5","Dépendant de scripts bash tels que show_full_prompt.sh pour l''analyse d''invites"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des AILANG-Bewertungssets","Begrenzt auf Unterstützung spezifischer Modelle, wie z.B. claude-haiku-4-5","Abhängig von Bash-Skripten wie show_full_prompt.sh für die Prompt-Analyse"],"pt":["Exige configuração do conjunto de avaliação AILANG","Limitado ao suporte de modelos específicos, como claude-haiku-4-5","Dependente de scripts bash como show_full_prompt.sh para análise de prompts"],"ru":["Требует настройки набора оценки AILANG","Ограничен поддержкой конкретных моделей, таких как claude-haiku-4-5","Зависит от скриптов bash, таких как show_full_prompt.sh, для анализа промптов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مجموعة تقييم AILANG","محدود بدع