ラットフォームがコンテンツを理解、索引、表示できるようにします","ko":"SEO 최적화기는 코드베이스를 분석하고 포괄적인 SEO 최적화를 구현하여 검색 엔진과 소셜 플랫폼이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 색인 및 표시할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"El optimizador SEO transforma tu aplicación web en descubrible. Analiza tu base de código e implementa optimizaciones SEO integrales","fr":"L''optimiseur SEO transforme votre application web en découverte. Il analyse votre base de code et implémente des optimisations SEO complètes","de":"Der SEO-Optimizer verwandelt Ihre Webanwendung in eine entdeckbare. Er analysiert Ihren Codebestand und implementiert umfassende SEO-Optimierungen","pt":"O SEO Optimizer analisa seu código e implementa otimizações de SEO abrangentes para melhorar a visibilidade","ru":"SEO Оптимизатор анализирует ваш код и реализует комплексные оптимизации SEO для улучшения видимости","ar":"مُحسّن تحسين محرّكات البحث يقوم بتحليل كودك وتنفيذ تحسينات شاملة لتحسين الرؤية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码库分析","全面的 SEO 优化","搜索引擎可见度提高","社交平台可见度提高","内容索引和显示"],"ja":["コードベース分析","包括的な SEO 最適化","検索エンジンの可視性向上","ソーシャルプラットフォームの可視性向上","コンテンツの索引と表示"],"ko":["코드베이스 분석","포괄적인 SEO 최적화","검색 엔진 가시성 향상","소셜 플랫폼 가시성 향상","콘텐츠 색인 및 표시"],"es":["Análisis de código","Optimización integral de SEO","Mejora de la visibilidad en buscadores","Indexación en plataformas sociales","Comunicación semántica con máquinas"],"fr":["Analyse de code","Optimisation complète de SEO","Amélioration de la visibilité sur les moteurs de recherche","Indexation sur les plateformes sociales","Communication sémantique avec les machines"],"de":["Code-Analyse","Umfassende SEO-Optimierung","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen","Indexierung auf sozialen Plattformen","Semantische Kommunikation mit Maschinen"],"pt":["Análise de código","Otimização de SEO abrangente","Melhoria da visibilidade","Comunicação semântica com máquinas","Indexação e superfície de conteúdo"],"ru":["Анализ кода","Комплексная оптимизация SEO","Улучшение видимости","Семантическая коммуникация с машинами","Индексация и поверхность контента"],"ar":["تحليل الكود","تحسين شامل لتحسين محركات البحث","تحسين الرؤية","التواصل الدلالي مع الآلات","فهرسة وتسليط المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 优化","代码库分析","搜索引擎可见度","社交平台可见度","内容索引","网站可见度","SEO 工具","代码优化"],"ja":["SEO 最適化","コードベース分析","検索エンジンの可視性","ソーシャルプラットフォームの可視性","コンテンツの索引","ウェブサイトの可視性","SEO ツール","コード最適化"],"ko":["SEO 최적화","코드베이스 분석","검색 엔진 가시성","소셜 플랫폼 가시성","콘텐츠 색인","웹사이트 가시성","SEO 도구","코드 최적화"],"es":["optimización SEO","desarrollo web","visibilidad en buscadores","indexación en plataformas sociales","comunicación semántica","análisis de código","mejora de la visibilidad"],"fr":["optimisation SEO","développement web","visibilité sur les moteurs de recherche","indexation sur les plateformes sociales","communication sémantique","analyse de code","amélioration de la visibilité"],"de":["SEO-Optimierung","Webentwicklung","Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen","Indexierung auf sozialen Plattformen","semantische Kommunikation","Code-Analyse","Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit"],"pt":["otimização de seo","visibilidade na web","análise de código","comunicação semântica","indexação de conteúdo","superfície de conteúdo"],"ru":["оптимизация seo","видимость в сети","анализ кода","семантическая коммуникация","индексация контента","поверхность контента"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث","الرؤية على الويب","تحليل الكود","التواصل الدلالي","فهرسة المحتوى","تسليط المحتوى"]}},"owner":"chongdashu","repo":"cc-skills","repoPath":"chongdashu/cc-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-optimizer","description":">","bodyPreview":"# SEO Optimizer\n\nTransform your web application from invisible to discoverable. This skill analyzes your codebase and implements comprehensive SEO optimizations that help search engines and social platforms understand, index, and surface your content.\n\n## Philosophy: SEO as Semantic Communication\n\nSEO is not about gaming algorithms—it''s about **clearly communicating what your content IS** to machines (search engines, social platforms, AI crawlers) so they can properly understand and surface it.","body":"# SEO Optimizer\n\nTransform your web application from invisible to discoverable. This skill analyzes your codebase and implements comprehensive SEO optimizations that help search engines and social platforms understand, index, and surface your content.\n\n## Philosophy: SEO as Semantic Communication\n\nSEO is not about gaming algorithms—it''s about **clearly communicating what your content IS** to machines (search engines, social platforms, AI crawlers) so they can properly understand and surface it.\n\n**Before optimizing, ask**:\n- What is this page actually about? (not what keywords we want to rank for)\n- Who is the intended audience and what are they searching for?\n- What unique value does this content provide?\n- How should machines categorize and understand this content?\n\n**Core Principles**:\n\n1. **Accuracy Over Optimization**: Describe what IS, not what you wish would rank\n2. **User Intent First**: Match content to what searchers actually want\n3. **Semantic Clarity**: Use structured data to make meaning machine-readable\n4. **Progressive Enhancement**: Basic SEO for all pages, rich optimization for key pages\n5. **Framework-Native**: Use each framework''s idioms, not generic hacks\n\n**The SEO Hierarchy** (prioritize in order):\n```\n1. Content Quality      ← Foundation: Valuable, accurate, unique content\n2. Technical Access     ← Can crawlers find and index your pages?\n3. Semantic Structure   ← Do machines understand your content''s meaning?\n4. Meta Optimization    ← Are your titles/descriptions compelling?\n5. Structured Data      ← JSON-LD for rich search results\n6. Performance          ← Core Web Vitals affect rankings\n```\n\n---\n\n## Codebase Analysis Workflow\n\n**ALWAYS analyze before implementing.** Different codebases need different approaches.\n\n### Step 1: Discover Framework and Structure\n\nIdentify the framework and routing pattern:\n- **Next.js**: Look for `next.config.js`, `app/` or `pages/` directory\n- **Astro**: Look for `astro.config.mjs`, `src/pages/`\n- **React Router**: Look for route configuration, `react-router-dom`\n- **Gatsby**: Look for `gatsby-config.js`, `gatsby-node.js`\n- **Static HTML**: Look for `.html` files in root or `public/`\n\n### Step 2: Audit Current SEO State\n\nCheck for existing implementations:\n- [ ] Meta tags in `<head>` (title, description, viewport)\n- [ ] Open Graph tags (`og:title`, `og:image`, etc.)\n- [ ] Twitter Card tags (`twitter:card`, `twitter:image`)\n- [ ] Structured data (`<script type=\"application/ld+json\">`)\n- [ ] Sitemap (`sitemap.xml` or generation config)\n- [ ] Robots.txt file\n- [ ] Canonical URLs\n- [ ] Alt text on images\n\n### Step 3: Identify Page Types\n\nDifferent pages need different SEO approaches:\n\n| Page Type | Priority | Key Optimizations |\n|-----------|----------|-------------------|\n| Landing/Home | Critical | Brand keywords, comprehensive structured data |\n| Product/Service | High | Product schema, reviews, pricing |\n| Blog/Article | High | Article schema, author, publish date |\n| Documentation | Medium | HowTo/FAQ schema, breadcrumbs |\n| About/Contact | Medium | Organization schema, local business |\n| Legal/Privacy | Low | Basic meta only, often noindex |\n\n### Step 4: Generate Implementation Plan\n\nBased on analysis, prioritize:\n1. **Quick wins**: Missing meta tags, viewport, basic structure\n2. **High impact**: Structured data for key pages, sitemap\n3. **Refinement**: Performance, advanced schema, social optimization\n\nSee `references/analysis-checklist.md` for detailed audit procedures.\n\n---\n\n## Meta Tags Implementation\n\n### Essential Meta Tags (Every Page)\n\n```html\n<!-- Required -->\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>{Page Title} | {Site Name}</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"{150-160 char description}\">\n\n<!-- Recommended -->\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"{full canonical URL}\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\n```\n\n### Title Tag Best Practices\n\n**Format**: `{Primary Content} | {Brand}` or `{Primary Content} - {Brand}`\n\n**Guidelines**:\n- 50-60 characters (Google truncates at ~60)\n- Front-load important keywords\n- Unique for every page\n- Accurately describe page content\n- Include brand for recognition (usually at end)\n\n**Title Patterns by Page Type**:\n```\nHomepage:     {Brand} - {Value Proposition}\nProduct:      {Product Name} - {Key Benefit} | {Brand}\nArticle:      {Article Title} | {Brand}\nCategory:     {Category} Products | {Brand}\nSearch:       Search Results for \"{Query}\" | {Brand}\n```\n\n### Meta Description Best Practices\n\n**Guidelines**:\n- 150-160 characters (Google may truncate at ~155)\n- Include a call to action when appropriate\n- Accurately summarize page content\n- Unique for every page\n- Include primary keyword naturally\n\n**DO NOT**:\n- Stuff keywords unnaturally\n- Use the same description across pages\n- Write descriptions that don''t match content\n- Start with \"Welcome to...\" or similar filler\n\n### Open Graph Tags (Social Sharing)\n\n```html\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"{canonical URL}\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"{title}\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"{description}\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"{1200x630 image URL}\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"{Site Name}\">\n```\n\n### Twitter Card Tags\n\n```html\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@{handle}\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"{title}\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"{description}\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"{image URL}\">\n```\n\nSee `references/meta-tags-complete.md` for comprehensive tag reference.\n\n---\n\n## Structured Data (JSON-LD)\n\nStructured data enables rich search results (star ratings, prices, FAQs, etc.).\n\n### When to Use Which Schema\n\n| Content Type | Schema | Rich Result |\n|--------------|--------|-------------|\n| Organization info | Organization | Knowledge panel |\n| Products | Product | Price, availability, reviews |\n| Articles/Blog | Article | Headline, image, date |\n| How-to guides | HowTo | Step-by-step in search |\n| FAQs | FAQPage | Expandable Q&A |\n| Events | Event | Date, location, tickets |\n| Recipes | Recipe | Image, time, ratings |\n| Local business | LocalBusiness | Maps, hours, contact |\n| Breadcrumbs | BreadcrumbList | Navigation path |\n\n### Implementation Pattern\n\n```html\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"name\": \"Company Name\",\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://example.com/logo.png\",\n  \"sameAs\": [\n    \"https://twitter.com/company\",\n    \"https://linkedin.com/company/company\"\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Multiple Schemas Per Page\n\nUse `@graph` to combine schemas:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nSee `references/structured-data-schemas.md` for complete schema examples.\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO\n\n### Sitemap Generation\n\n**XML Sitemap Requirements**:\n- Include all indexable pages\n- Exclude noindex pages, redirects, error pages\n- Update `<lastmod>` when content changes\n- Submit to Google Search Console\n\n**Framework implementations**: See `references/framework-implementations.md`\n\n### Robots.txt\n\n**Standard Template**:\n```txt\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\n# Block admin/private areas\nDisallow: /admin/\nDisallow: /api/\nDisallow: /private/\n\n# Point to sitemap\nSitemap: https://yourdomain.com/sitemap.xml\n```\n\n### Canonical URLs\n\n**Always set canonical URLs to**:\n- Prevent duplicate content issues\n- Consolidate link equity\n- Specify preferred URL version\n\n**Handle**:\n- www vs non-www\n- http vs https\n- Trailing slashes\n- Query parameters\n\n### Performance (Core Web Vitals)\n\nCore Web Vitals affect rankings. Monitor:\n\n| Metric | Target | What It Measures |\n|--------|--------|------------------|\n| LCP | < 2.5s | Largest Contentful Paint (loading) |\n| INP | < 200ms | Interaction to Next Paint (interactivity) |\n| CLS | < 0.1 | Cumulative Layout Shift (visual stability) |\n\n**Quick wins**:\n- Optimize images (WebP, lazy loading, proper sizing)\n- Minimize JavaScript bundles\n- Use efficient fonts (display: swap)\n- Implement proper caching\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **Keyword Stuffing**\n```html\n<!-- BAD -->\n<title>Best Shoes | Buy Shoes | Cheap Shoes | Shoes Online | Shoe Store</title>\n\n<!-- GOOD -->\n<title>Running Shoes for Marathon Training | SportShop</title>\n```\nWhy bad: Search engines penalize unnatural keyword repetition. Users don''t click spammy titles.\n\n❌ **Duplicate Descriptions**\nUsing the same meta description across multiple pages.\nWhy bad: Misses opportunity for page-specific relevance. Google may ignore and auto-generate.\n\n❌ **Description/Content Mismatch**\nWriting descriptions for keywords rather than actual content.\nWhy bad: High bounce rates signal low quality. Users feel deceived.\n\n❌ **Missing Alt Text**\n```html\n<!-- BAD -->\n<img src=\"product.jpg\">\n\n<!-- GOOD -->\n<img src=\"product.jpg\" alt=\"Blue Nike Air Max running shoe, side view\">\n```\nWhy bad: Accessibility violation. Missed image search opportunity.\n\n❌ **Blocking Crawlers Unintentionally**\n```txt\n# Accidentally blocking everything\nUser-agent: *\nDisallow: /\n```\nWhy bad: Complete deindexing. Check robots.txt carefully.\n\n❌ **Ignoring Mobile**\nNot having responsive design or mobile-specific considerations.\nWhy bad: Google uses mobile-first indexing. Most traffic is mobile.\n\n❌ **Over-Optimization**\nAdding structured data for content that doesn''t exist.\nWhy bad: Schema violations can result in penalties. Trust erosion.\n\n❌ **Generic Auto-Generated Content**\n```html\n<!-- BAD: Template without customization -->\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Welcome to our website. We offer great products and services.\">\n```\nWhy bad: Provides no value. Won''t rank. Won''t get clicks.\n\n---\n\n## Variation Guidance\n\n**IMPORTANT**: SEO implementation should vary based on context.\n\n**Vary based on**:\n- **Industry**: E-commerce needs Product schema; SaaS needs Software schema\n- **Content type**: Blog posts vs landing pages vs documentation\n- **Audience**: B2B vs B2C affects tone and keywords\n- **Competition**: Highly competitive niches need more sophisticated optimization\n- **Framework**: Use native patterns (Next.js metadata API vs manual tags)\n\n**Avoid converging on**:\n- Same title format for all page types\n- Generic descriptions that could apply to any site\n- Identical structured data without page-specific content\n- One-size-fits-all sitemap configuration\n\n---\n\n## Framework Quick Reference\n\n### Next.js (App Router)\n\n```typescript\n// app/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from ''next''\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: ''Page Title | Brand'',\n  description: ''Page description'',\n  openGraph: {\n    title: ''Page Title'',\n    description: ''Page description'',\n    images: [''/og-image.png''],\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Next.js (Pages Router)\n\n```typescript\n// pages/index.tsx\nimport Head from ''next/head''\n\nexport default function Page() {\n  return (\n    <Head>\n      <title>Page Title | Brand</title>\n      <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Page description\" />\n    </Head>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Astro\n\n```astro\n---\n// src/pages/index.astro\nimport Layout from ''../layouts/Layout.astro'';\n---\n<Layout\n  title=\"Page Title | Brand\"\n  description=\"Page description\"\n  ogImage=\"/og-image.png\"\n/>\n```\n\n### React (react-helmet)\n\n```jsx\nimport { Helmet } from ''react-helmet'';\n\nfunction Page() {\n  return (\n    <Helmet>\n      <title>Page Title | Brand</title>\n      <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Page description\" />\n    </Helmet>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nSee `references/framework-implementations.md` for complete guides.\n\n---\n\n## Scripts\n\n### analyze_seo.py\n\nAnalyzes a codebase for SEO issues and opportunities:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/analyze_seo.py <path-to-project>\n```\n\n**Output**:\n- Current SEO state (what''s implemented)\n- Missing elements by priority\n- Page-by-page recommendations\n- Structured data opportunities\n\n### generate_sitemap.py\n\nGenerates sitemap.xml from project routes:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_sitemap.py <path-to-project> --domain https://example.com\n```\n\n---\n\n## Remember\n\n**SEO is semantic communication, not algorithm manipulation.**\n\nThe best SEO:\n- Accurately describes what content IS\n- Helps machines understand meaning through structured data\n- Prioritizes user value over keyword optimization\n- Uses framework-native patterns\n- Implements progressively based on page importance\n\nFocus on making your content findable and understandable. The rankings follow from genuine value clearly communicated.\n\n**Claude is capable of comprehensive SEO analysis and implementation. These guidelines illuminate the path—they don''t fence it.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:10:54.907Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"高度なSEO分析および最適化機能を必要とするWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan capacidades de análisis y optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et d''optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de análise e capacidades de otimização de SEO avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون الويب وهم بحاجة إلى تحليل وتحسين متقدمين لقدرات تحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to clearly communicate content semantics to search engines and social platforms through comprehensive SEO optimizations, utilizing semantic communication protocols to properly index and surface content.","zh":"使代理能够通过综合的SEO优化，清晰地将内容语义传达给搜索引擎和社交平台，利用语义通信协议正确地索引和显示内容。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なSEO最適化を通じて、コンテンツの意味を検索エンジンやソーシャルプラットフォームに明確に伝えることを可能にし、意味的コミュニケーションプロトコルを使用してコンテンツを適切に索引して表示します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 SEO 최적화를 통해 콘텐츠 의미를 검색 엔진 및 소셜 플랫폼에 명확하게 전달할 수 있도록 하며, 의미적 통신 규약을 사용하여 콘텐츠를 적절하게 색인하고 표시합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comunicar claramente la semántica del contenido a los motores de búsqueda y plataformas sociales a través de optimizaciones de SEO completas, utilizando protocolos de comunicación semántica para indexar y mostrar correctamente el contenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de communiquer clairement la sémantique du contenu aux moteurs de recherche et aux plateformes sociales grâce à des optimisations de SEO complètes, en utilisant des protocoles de communication sémantique pour indexer et afficher correctement le contenu.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Semantik des Inhalts klar an Suchmaschinen und soziale Plattformen zu kommunizieren, durch umfassende SEO-Optimierungen, die semantische Kommunikationsprotokolle nutzen, um den Inhalt richtig zu indizieren und anzuzeigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se comunicar claramente a semântica do conteúdo para mecanismos de busca e plataformas sociais por meio de otimizações de SEO abrangentes, utilizando protocolos de comunicação semântica para indexar e exibir corretamente o conteúdo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью четко общаться семантикой контента с поисковыми системами и социальными платформами посредством комплексных оптимизаций SEO, используя протоколы семантической коммуникации для правильного индексирования и представления контента.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التواصل بوضوح مع семантиك المحتوى لمحركات البحث والمنصات الاجتماعية من خلال تحسينات شاملة لتحسين محركات البحث، باستخدام بروتوكولات التواصل الدلالي لتحسين وفهرسة المحتوى بشكل صحيح."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing codebases for SEO improvements","Implementing semantic metadata for enhanced discoverability","Optimizing content for AI crawlers and social media platforms"],"zh":["分析代码库以进行SEO改进","实施语义元数据以增强发现性","优化内容以适应AI爬虫和社交媒体平台"],"ja":["SEO改善のためのコードベースの分析","発見性の向上のためのセマンティックメタデータの実装","AIクローラーおよびソーシャルメディアプラットフォーム向けのコンテンツ最適化"],"ko":["SEO 개선을 위한 코드베이스 분석","발견성을 향상시키기 위한 의미 메타데이터 구현","AI 크롤러 및 소셜 미디어 플랫폼을 위한 콘텐츠 최적화"],"es":["Análisis de bases de código para mejoras de SEO","Implementación de metadatos semánticos para una mayor capacidad de descubrimiento","Optimización de contenido para rastreadores de IA y plataformas de redes sociales"],"fr":["Analyse de bases de code pour améliorer le SEO","Mise en œuvre de métadonnées sémantiques pour une meilleure découverte","Optimisation du contenu pour les crawlers d''IA et les plateformes de réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Analyse von Codebasen für SEO-Verbesserungen","Implementierung semantischer Metadaten für verbesserte Auffindbarkeit","Optimierung von Inhalten für KI-Crawler und soziale Medienplattformen"],"pt":["Analisar bases de código para melhorias de SEO","Implementar metadados semânticos para descoberta aprimorada","Otimizar conteúdo para rastreadores de IA e plataformas de mídia social"],"ru":["Анализ кодовых баз для улучшения SEO","Реализация семантических метаданных для улучшения обнаружения","Оптимизация контента для ИИ-поисковых систем и социальных платформ"],"ar":["تحليل قواعد البيانات للتحسينات في تحسين محركات البحث","تنفيذ البيانات الوصفية الدلالية لاكتشاف محسن","تحسين المحتوى لمحركات البحث بالذكاء الاصطناعي والمنصات الاجتماعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase and content","Limited to web application optimization"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和内容","仅限于Web应用程序优化"],"ja":["コードベースおよびコンテンツへのアクセスが必要","Webアプリケーション最適化に限定される"],"ko":["코드베이스 및 콘텐츠에 대한 액세스가 필요","웹 애플리케이션 최적화에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código y al contenido","Limitado a la optimización de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code et au contenu","Limité à l''optimisation des applications Web"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Codebasis und den Inhalt","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código e ao conteúdo","Limitado à otimização de aplicativos web"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе и контенту","Ограничен оптимизацией веб-приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة والمحتوى","محدود بتحسين تطبيقات الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
