 Conoce más sobre esta estructura y cómo funci...","fr":"La structure de MPN de Cyntec suit un modèle spécifique qui aide à identifier les composants électroniques. En savoir plus sur cette structure et son fonctio...","de":"Die MPN-Struktur von Cyntec folgt einem bestimmten Muster, das bei der Identifizierung von elektronischen Komponenten hilft. Erfahren Sie mehr über diese Str...","pt":"A estrutura de MPN da Cyntec segue um padrão específico, permitindo que os desenvolvedores decodifiquem facilmente os códigos de produtos","ru":"Структура MPN Cyntec следует определенному шаблону, что позволяет разработчикам легко декодировать коды продукции","ar":"تتبع بنية MPN لشركة Cyntec نمطًا محددًا، مما يسمح للمطورين بفك شفرة رموز المنتجات بسهولة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["MPN","Cyntec","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC"],"ja":["MPN","Cyntec","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC"],"ko":["MPN","Cyntec","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC"],"es":["Estructura de MPN única","Identificación de componentes electrónicos","Código de inducción","Variante de tipo","Código de tamaño","Empaquetado"],"fr":["Structure de MPN unique","Identification des composants électroniques","Code d''induction","Variante de type","Code de taille","Emballage"],"de":["Einzigartige MPN-Struktur","Identifizierung von elektronischen Komponenten","Induktionscode","Typvariant","Größencode","Verpackung"],"pt":["Estrutura de MPN personalizada","Decodificação de códigos de produtos","Tipos de embalagem variados","Códigos de indutância específicos","Variações de tipo de produto","Tolerâncias de valor precisas"],"ru":["Пользовательская структура MPN","Декодирование кодов продукции","Различные типы упаковки","Конкретные коды индуктивности","Варианты типа продукта","Точные допуски значения"],"ar":["بنية MPN مخصصة","فك شفرة رموز المنتجات","أنواع عدة من التعبئة","رموز محددة للحث","متغيرات نوع المنتج","تسامح دقيقة للقيمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cyntec","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","","MPN"],"ja":["Cyntec","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","","MPN"],"ko":["Cyntec","MPN","PCMC","VCMD","MCPA","CMC","","MPN"],"es":["Cyntec","MPN","componentes electrónicos","estructura de MPN","código de inducción","variante de tipo","código de tamaño","empaquetado","electrónica"],"fr":["Cyntec","MPN","composants électroniques","structure de MPN","code d''induction","variante de type","code de taille","emballage","électronique"],"de":["Cyntec","MPN","elektronische Komponenten","MPN-Struktur","Induktionscode","Typvariant","Größencode","Verpackung","Elektronik"],"pt":["Cyntec","MPN","desenvolvedores","códigos de produtos","estrutura de MPN","decodificação","embalagem","indutância","tipo de produto","tolerância de valor"],"ru":["Cyntec","MPN","разработчики","коды продукции","структура MPN","декодирование","упаковка","индуктивность","тип продукта","допуск значения"],"ar":["Cyntec","MPN","مطورين","رموز المنتجات","بنية MPN","فك الشفرة","التعبئة","الحث","نوع المنتج","تسامح القيمة"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cyntec","description":"Cyntec power inductor MPN encoding patterns, value decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Cyntec inductors or CyntecHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPC","body":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPCMC063T-1R0MN\n|   |  |  |  ||\n|   |  |  |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |  |  |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |  |  +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   |  +-- Type variant (T)\n|   +-- Size (063 = 6.3mm)\n+-- PCMC = Power Inductor series\n\nMCPA0504-1R0MN\n|   |    |  ||\n|   |    |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |    +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   +-- Size (0504 = 5.0mm x 4.0mm)\n+-- MCPA = Automotive Power Inductor series\n\nCMC0503-471M\n|  |    |  |\n|  |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|  |    +-- Impedance (471 = 470 ohm)\n|  +-- Size (0503 = 5.0mm x 3.0mm)\n+-- CMC = Common Mode Choke series\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### PCMC - Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^PCMC[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | General power conversion |\n\n### VCMD - Molded Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Molded power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^VCMD[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | High current, shielded |\n\n### MCPA - Automotive Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Automotive-grade power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^MCPA[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | AEC-Q200 qualified |\n\n### CMC - Common Mode Chokes\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Common mode choke |\n| Pattern | `^CMC[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | EMI/EMC filtering |\n\n---\n\n## Inductance Encoding\n\nCyntec uses standard R-notation:\n\n### R-Notation (Decimal Point)\n\n| Code | Value | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| R47 | 0.47uH | R at start = sub-1uH |\n| R68 | 0.68uH | R at start |\n| 1R0 | 1.0uH | R in middle |\n| 2R2 | 2.2uH | R in middle |\n| 4R7 | 4.7uH | R in middle |\n| 6R8 | 6.8uH | R in middle |\n\n### 3-Digit Multiplier Code\n\n| Code | Value | Calculation |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 100 | 10uH | 10 x 10^0 |\n| 101 | 100uH | 10 x 10^1 |\n| 220 | 22uH | 22 x 10^0 |\n| 470 | 47uH | 47 x 10^0 |\n| 471 | 470uH | 47 x 10^1 |\n\n### Decoding Algorithm\n\n```java\n// R at start (R47, R68)\nif (code.startsWith(\"R\")) {\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(\"0.\" + code.substring(1));\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// R in middle (1R0, 2R2)\nif (code.contains(\"R\")) {\n    String[] parts = code.split(\"R\");\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(parts[0] + \".\" + parts[1]);\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// 3-digit code\nif (code.matches(\"\\\\d{3}\")) {\n    int mantissa = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(0, 2));\n    int exponent = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(2, 3));\n    double microhenries = mantissa * Math.pow(10, exponent);\n    return formatInductance(microhenries);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Size Code Formats\n\n### 3-Digit Size (PCMC, VCMD)\n\n| Code | Dimension |\n|------|-----------|\n| 063 | 6.3mm |\n| 050 | 5.0mm |\n| 040 | 4.0mm |\n\n### 4-Digit Size (MCPA, CMC)\n\n| Code | Dimensions |\n|------|------------|\n| 0504 | 5.0mm x 4.0mm |\n| 0403 | 4.0mm x 3.0mm |\n| 0503 | 5.0mm x 3.0mm |\n\n---\n\n## Tolerance Codes\n\n| Code | Tolerance |\n|------|-----------|\n| K | +/- 10% |\n| M | +/- 20% |\n\n---\n\n## Package Type by Series\n\n| Series | Package Type |\n|--------|--------------|\n| PCMC | Power Inductor |\n| VCMD | Molded Power Inductor |\n| MCPA | Automotive Power Inductor |\n| CMC | Common Mode Choke |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns series + size + type as the full identifier\n// PCMC063T-1R0MN -> \"PCMC063T\"\n// MCPA0504-1R0MN -> \"MCPA0504\"\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\nm = VCMD_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\n// MCPA and CMC don''t have type suffix\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2);\n}\n```\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns the package type description based on series\nString series = extractSeriesPrefix(mpn);\nreturn SERIES_PACKAGE_MAP.get(series);\n// Returns: \"Power Inductor\", \"Molded Power Inductor\", etc.\n```\n\n### Value Extraction\n\n```java\n// Value code position varies by series\n// PCMC/VCMD: group(4) after type\n// MCPA/CMC: group(3) directly after size\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(4);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(3);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern Details\n\n### PCMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(PCMC)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Groups: (1)series (2)size (3)type (4)value (5)tolerance+options\n```\n\n### VCMD Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(VCMD)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Same structure as PCMC\n```\n\n### MCPA Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(MCPA)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// No type field, 4-digit size only\n```\n\n### CMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(CMC)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Numeric-only value (impedance), no R-notation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Types\n\nCyntec products map to:\n- `INDUCTOR` - All inductor and choke products\n- `IC` - Also registered for pattern matching compatibility\n\n---\n\n## CMC Impedance Encoding\n\nCommon mode chokes use 3-digit impedance code (like ferrite beads):\n\n| Code | Impedance |\n|------|-----------|\n| 471 | 470 ohm |\n| 102 | 1000 ohm |\n| 222 | 2200 ohm |\n\n---\n\n## Common Part Numbers\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PCMC063T-1R0MN | 1.0uH power inductor, 6.3mm |\n| VCMD063T-2R2MN | 2.2uH molded inductor, 6.3mm |\n| MCPA0504-1R0MN | 1.0uH automotive inductor |\n| CMC0503-471M | 470 ohm common mode choke |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/CyntecHandler.java`\n- Supported types: `INDUCTOR`, `IC`\n- No manufacturer-specific ComponentType enum entries\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Variable size digit count**: PCMC/VCMD can have 3 OR 4 digit size codes (063 vs 0504). MCPA/CMC always have 4.\n- **Type field presence**: PCMC/VCMD have optional type letter (T, S). MCPA/CMC don''t have this field.\n- **CMC uses impedance**: Common mode chokes encode impedance, not inductance. No R-notation allowed.\n- **Series included in package code**: Unlike other handlers, Cyntec returns the package TYPE name (e.g., \"Power Inductor\") not size.\n- **Dash is optional**: The dash before value code may be present or absent.\n- **N suffix = tape and reel**: Standard packaging suffix.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:10:36.241Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronic Component Analysis Agents needing to decipher Cyntec MPN structures.","zh":"非常适合需要解析Cyntec MPN结构的电子元件分析代理","ja":"Cyntec MPN構造を解読する必要がある電子部品分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Cyntec MPN 구조를 해석해야 하는 전자 부품 분석 에이전트에게 완벽한 솔루션","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Componentes Electrónicos que necesitan descifrar estructuras de MPN de Cyntec.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de composants électroniques ayant besoin de déchiffrer les structures de MPN de Cyntec.","de":"Perfekt für Electronic Component Analysis Agents, die Cyntec MPN-Strukturen entschlüsseln müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Componentes Eletrônicos que precisam decifrar estruturas de MPN da Cyntec.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа электронных компонентов, которым необходимо расшифровать структуры MPN Cyntec.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المكونات الإلكترونية الذي يحتاج إلى فك تشفير هياكل MPN من Cyntec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decode Cyntec part numbers, extracting vital information such as series, size, type, inductance code, tolerance, and packaging using regular expressions and string manipulation, facilitating seamless integration with inventory management systems and component databases.","zh":"使代理能够使用正则表达式和字符串操作来解码Cyntec零件号，提取系列、尺寸、类型、电感代码、公差和包装等重要信息，从而实现与库存管理系统和部品数据库的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントが正規表現と文字列操作を使用してCyntec部品番号を解読し、シリーズ、サイズ、タイプ、インダクタンスコード、公差、パッケージなどの重要な情報を抽出することを可能にし、在庫管理システムおよび部品データベースとのシームレスな統合を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 정규식과 문자열 조작을 사용하여 Cyntec 부품 번호를 해석하고 시리즈, 크기, 유형, 인덕턴스 코드, 허용오차, 패키징 등의 중요한 정보를 추출하여 재고 관리 시스템 및 부품 데이터베이스와의 무중단 통합을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes decodificar números de piezas de Cyntec, extrayendo información vital como serie, tamaño, tipo, código de inductancia, tolerancia y embalaje utilizando expresiones regulares y manipulación de cadenas, lo que facilita una integración fluida con sistemas de gestión de inventario y bases de datos de componentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de décoder les numéros de pièces Cyntec, en extrayant des informations vitales telles que la série, la taille, le type, le code d''inductance, la tolérance et l''emballage en utilisant des expressions régulières et une manipulation de chaînes, ce qui facilite une intégration fluide avec les systèmes de gestion d''inventaire et les bases de données de composants.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Cyntec-Teilenummern zu entschlüsseln und dabei wichtige Informationen wie Serie, Größe, Typ, Induktivitätscode, Toleranz und Verpackung mithilfe von regulären Ausdrücken und Zeichenmanipulation zu extrahieren, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Inventarverwaltungssystemen und Komponentendatenbanken ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decodificar números de peças Cyntec, extrair informações vitais como série, tamanho, tipo, código de indutância, tolerância e embalagem usando expressões regulares e manipulação de strings, facilitando a integração perfeita com sistemas de gerenciamento de estoque e bancos de dados de componentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью декодировать номера деталей Cyntec, извлекая важную информацию, такую как серия, размер, тип, код индуктивности, допуск и упаковка, используя регулярные выражения и манипуляции со строками, что облегчает беспрепятственную интеграцию с системами управления запасами и базами данных компонентов.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من فك تشفير أرقام قطع سيونتك، واستخراج المعلومات الحيوية مثل السلسلة، والحجم، والنوع، ورمز الحث، والتسامح، والتعبئة باستخدام التعبيرات العادية وعمليات السلاسل، مما يسهل التكامل السلس مع أنظمة إدارة المخزون وقواعد بيانات المكونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding Cyntec MPNs for inventory management","Extracting component specifications from part numbers","Validating Cyntec part numbers against a database of known components"],"zh":["为库存管理解码Cyntec MPN","从部品号中提取部品规格","验证Cyntec部品号与已知部品数据库"],"ja":["在庫管理のためのCyntec MPNの解読","部品番号から部品仕様を抽出","Cyntec部品番号を既知の部品データベースに対して検証"],"ko":["재고 관리를 위한 Cyntec MPN 해석","부품 번호에서 부품 사양 추출","Cyntec 부품 번호를 알려진 부품 데이터베이스에 대해 검증"],"es":["Decodificación de MPN de Cyntec para la gestión de inventario","Extracción de especificaciones de componentes de números de piezas","Validación de números de piezas de Cyntec contra una base de datos de componentes conocidos"],"fr":["Décodage de MPN Cyntec pour la gestion d''inventaire","Extraction de spécifications de composants à partir de numéros de pièces","Validation de numéros de pièces Cyntec contre une base de données de composants connus"],"de":["Entschlüsselung von Cyntec-MPN für das Inventarmanagement","Extraktion von Komponentenspezifikationen aus Teilenummern","Validierung von Cyntec-Teilenummern gegen eine Datenbank bekannter Komponenten"],"pt":["Decodificação de MPNs da Cyntec para gerenciamento de estoque","Extração de especificações de componentes de números de peças","Validação de números de peças da Cyntec contra um banco de dados de componentes conhecidos"],"ru":["Декодирование MPN Cyntec для управления запасами","Извлечение спецификаций компонентов из номеров деталей","Проверка номеров деталей Cyntec против базы данных известных компонентов"],"ar":["فك تشفير MPN من Cyntec لإدارة المخزون","استخراج مواصفات المكونات من أرقام القطع","التحقق من أرقام قطع سيونتك مقابل قاعدة بيانات للمكونات المعروفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Cyntec Corporation manufacturer parts","Requires understanding of Cyntec MPN structure","May not work with non-standard or custom part numbers"],"zh":["仅限于Cyntec Corporation生产的零件","需要了解Cyntec MPN结构","可能不适用于非标准或自定义零件号"],"ja":["Cyntec Corporation製の部品のみに限定","Cyntec MPN構造の理解が必要","非標準またはカスタム部品番号では機能しない可能性がある"],"ko":["Cyntec Corporation에서 생산한 부품만 해당","Cyntec MPN 구조를 이해해야 함","비표준 또는 사용자 정의 부품 번호에서는 작동하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Limitado a partes del fabricante Cyntec Corporation","Requiere comprensión de la estructura de MPN de Cyntec","Puede no funcionar con números de piezas personalizados o no estándar"],"fr":["Limité aux pièces du fabricant Cyntec Corporation","Nécessite une compréhension de la structure de MPN de Cyntec","Peut ne pas fonctionner avec des numéros de pièces personnalisés ou non standard"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Teile des Herstellers Cyntec Corporation","Benötigt Verständnis der Cyntec-MPN-Struktur","Kann möglicherweise nicht mit maßgeschneiderten oder nicht standardmäßigen Teilenummern funktionieren"],"pt":["Limitado a peças do fabricante Cyntec Corporation","Exige compreensão da estrutura de MPN da Cyntec","Pode não funcionar com números de peças não padrão ou personalizados"],"ru":["Ограничен деталей корпорации Cyntec","Требует понимания структуры MPN Cyntec","Может не работать с нестандартными или пользовательскими номерами деталей"],"ar":["محدود بالقطع من شركة سيونتك","يتطلب فهم هيكل MPN من سيونتك","قد لا يعمل مع أرقام قطع غير стандартية أو مخصصة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('reporails/rules/implement-rule', 'community', 'reporails', 'rules', 'reporails/rules', 'implement-rule', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z', '2026-02-18T03:10:16.630Z', NULL, '{"id":"reporails/rules/implement-rule","name":"implement-rule","description":{"zh":"Implement-rule 技能提供 evidence-backed 规则来验证 AI 编码代理指令，确保代码结构、内容、效率、治理和维护的合理性","ja":"Implement-rule スキルは、AI コーディングエージェントの指令を検証するためのエビデンスに基づくルールを提供し、コードの構造、内容、効率、ガバナンス、メンテナンスの妥当性を確保します","ko":"Implement-rule 스킬은 AI 코딩 에이전트의 지시를 검증하기 위한 증거 기반 규칙을 제공하여 코드의 구조, 내용, 효율성, 거버넌스, 유지 보수를 합리적으로 관리합니다","es":"El conjunto de herramientas de implementación de reglas proporciona un marco para validar instrucciones de agentes de codificación AI","fr":"L''ensemble d''outils de mise en œuvre de règles fournit un cadre pour valider les instructions des agents de codage AI","de":"Das Toolkit zur Implementierung von Regeln bietet einen Rahmen für die Validierung von Anweisungen für AI-Coding-Agenten","pt":"O skill implement-rule fornece regras de validação de código para agentes de IA, melhorando a estrutura, conteúdo, eficiência, governança e manutenção do código.","ru":"Навык implement-rule предоставляет правила проверки кода для агентов ИИ, улучшая структуру, содержание, эффективность, управление и обслуживание кода.","ar":"المهارة implement-rule توفر قواعد التحقق من صحة التعليمات البرمجية للوكلاء الذكيين، وتحسين الهيكل والمحتوى والكفاءة والإدارة والصيانة للتعليمات البرمجية.","en":"Evidence-backed rules for validating AI coding agent instructions. Core rules for structure, content, efficiency, governance, and maintenance."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 编码规则实施","ja":"AI コーディングルールの実装","ko":"AI 코딩 규칙 구현","es":"Implementar Reglas de Validación para Agentes de Codifica...","fr":"Mettre en œuvre des règles de validation pour les agents ...","de":"Implementieren von Validierungsregeln für AI-Coding-Agenten","pt":"Implemente Regras de Validação de Código para Agentes de IA","ru":"Реализуйте правила проверки кода для агентов ИИ","ar":"تنفيذ قواعد التحقق من صحة التعليمات البرمجية للوكلاء الذكيين","en":"implement-rule"},"description":{"zh":"Implement-rule 技能提供 evidence-backed 规则来验证 AI 编码代理指令，确保代码结构、内容、效率、治理和维护的合理性","ja":"Implement-rule スキルは、AI コーディングエージェントの指令を検証するためのエビデンスに基づくルールを提供し、コードの構造、内容、効率、ガバナンス、メンテナンスの妥当性を確保します","ko":"Implement-rule 스킬은 AI 코딩 에이전트의 지시를 검증하기 위한 증거 기반 규칙을 제공하여 코드의 구조, 내용, 효율성, 거버넌스, 유지 보수를 합리적으로 관리합니다","es":"El conjunto de herramientas de implementación de reglas proporciona un marco para validar instrucciones de agentes de codificación AI","fr":"L''ensemble d''outils de mise en œuvre de règles fournit un cadre pour valider les instructions des agents de codage AI","de":"Das Toolkit zur Implementierung von Regeln bietet einen Rahmen für die Validierung von Anweisungen für AI-Coding-Agenten","pt":"O skill implement-rule fornece regras de validação de código para agentes de IA, melhorando a estrutura, conteúdo, eficiência, governança e manutenção do cód...","ru":"Навык implement-rule предоставляет правила проверки кода для агентов ИИ, улучшая структуру, содержание, эффективность, управление и обслуживание кода.","ar":"المهارة implement-rule توفر قواعد التحقق من صحة التعليمات البرمجية للوكلاء الذكيين، وتحسين الهيكل والمحتوى والكفاءة والإدارة والصيانة للتعليمات البرمجية.","en":"Evidence-backed rules for validating AI coding agent instructions. Core rules for structure, content, efficiency, governance, and maintenance."},"definition":{"en":"Evidence-backed rules for validating AI coding agent instructions. Core rules for structure, content, efficiency, governance, and maintenance."},"features":{"zh":["提供 evidence-backed 规则","验证 AI 编码代理指令","确保代码结构、内容、效率、治理和维护的合理性","支持 OpenGrep 模式和测试固定","可选的 dry-run 模式"],"ja":["エビデンスに基づくルールを提供","AI コーディングエージェントの指令を検証","コードの構造、内容、効率、ガバナンス、メンテナンスの妥当性を確保","OpenGrep パターンとテスト固定をサポート","dry-run モードをオプションで