화 프로젝트의 실현 가능성을 평가합니다"],"es":["Planificación de proyectos de automatización","Integración de múltiples servicios","Toma de decisiones de arquitectura","Evaluación de la viabilidad","Asesoramiento estratégico para la automatización"],"fr":["Planification de projets d''automatisation","Intégration de plusieurs services","Prise de décisions d''architecture","Évaluation de la viabilité","Conseils stratégiques pour l''automatisation"],"de":["Planung von Automatisierungsprojekten","Integration mehrerer Dienste","Architektenentscheidungen","Bewertung der Machbarkeit","Strategische Beratung für die Automatisierung"],"pt":["Planejamento de projetos de automação","Integração de múltiplos serviços","Tomada de decisões arquiteturais","Avaliação de viabilidade"],"ru":["Планирование проектов автоматизации","Интеграция нескольких сервисов","Принятие архитектурных решений","Оценка целесообразности"],"ar":["تخطيط مشاريع أتمتة","دمج خدمات متعددة","إتخاذ قرارات معمارية","تقييم الجدوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["n8n自动化","工作流架构师","自动化系统","战略性指导","多服务集成","架构决策","自动化项目","可行性评估"],"ja":["n8n自動化","ワークフローアーキテクト","自動化システム","戦略的な指針","複数サービス統合","アーキテクチャの決定","自動化プロジェクト","実行可能性評価"],"ko":["n8n 자동화","워크플로우 아키텍트","자동화 시스템","전략적 지침","다수의 서비스 통합","아키텍처 결정을","自動화 프로젝트","실현 가능성 평가"],"es":["automatización n8n","arquitecto de flujo de trabajo","integración de servicios","tomar decisiones de arquitectura","evaluación de viabilidad","asesoramiento estratégico","desarrollo de automatización"],"fr":["automatisation n8n","architecte de workflow","intégration de services","prise de décisions d''architecture","évaluation de la viabilité","conseils stratégiques","développement d''automatisation"],"de":["n8n-Automatisierung","Workflow-Architekt","Integration von Diensten","Architektenentscheidungen","Bewertung der Machbarkeit","strategische Beratung","Automatisierungsentwicklung"],"pt":["n8n","automação","arquitetura de automação","fluxo de trabalho","integração de serviços","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["n8n","автоматизация","архитектура автоматизации","рабочий процесс","интеграция сервисов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["n8n","أتمتة","هياكل أتمتة","تدفق العمل","دمج الخدمات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"promptadvisers","repo":"n8n-powerhouse","repoPath":"promptadvisers/n8n-powerhouse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"n8n-workflow-architect","description":"Strategic automation architecture advisor. Use when users want to plan automation solutions, evaluate their tech stack (Shopify, Zoho, HubSpot, etc.), decide between n8n vs Python/Claude Code, or need guidance on production-ready automation design. Invokes plan mode for complex architectural decisions.","bodyPreview":"# n8n Workflow Architect\n\nThe Intelligent Automation Architect (IAA) - Strategic guidance for building automation systems that survive production.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when users:\n\n1. **Want to plan an automation project** - \"I need to automate my sales pipeline\"\n2. **Have multiple services to integrate** - \"I use Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion\"\n3. **Need architecture decisions** - \"Should I use n8n or Python for this?\"\n4. **Are evaluating feasibility** - \"Can I autom","body":"# n8n Workflow Architect\n\nThe Intelligent Automation Architect (IAA) - Strategic guidance for building automation systems that survive production.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when users:\n\n1. **Want to plan an automation project** - \"I need to automate my sales pipeline\"\n2. **Have multiple services to integrate** - \"I use Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion\"\n3. **Need architecture decisions** - \"Should I use n8n or Python for this?\"\n4. **Are evaluating feasibility** - \"Can I automate X with my current stack?\"\n5. **Want production-ready guidance** - \"How do I make this reliable?\"\n\n---\n\n## The Core Philosophy\n\n> **Viability over Possibility**\n\nThe gap between what''s technically possible and what''s actually viable in production is enormous. This skill helps users build systems that:\n\n- Won''t break at 3 AM on a Saturday\n- Don''t require a PhD to maintain\n- Respect data security, scale, and state management\n- Deliver actual business value, not just technical cleverness\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Decision Framework\n\n### Step 1: Stack Analysis\n\nWhen a user mentions their tools, evaluate each for:\n\n| Tool Category | Common Examples | n8n Native Support | Auth Complexity |\n|---------------|-----------------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| E-commerce | Shopify, WooCommerce, BigCommerce | Yes | OAuth |\n| CRM | HubSpot, Salesforce, Zoho CRM | Yes | OAuth |\n| Marketing | Klaviyo, Mailchimp, ActiveCampaign | Yes | API Key/OAuth |\n| Productivity | Notion, Airtable, Google Sheets | Yes | OAuth |\n| Communication | Slack, Discord, Teams | Yes | OAuth |\n| Payments | Stripe, PayPal, Square | Yes | API Key |\n| Support | Zendesk, Intercom, Freshdesk | Yes | API Key/OAuth |\n\n**Action**: Use `search_nodes` from n8n MCP to verify node availability.\n\n### Step 2: Tool Selection Matrix\n\nApply these decision rules:\n\n#### Use n8n When:\n\n| Condition | Why |\n|-----------|-----|\n| OAuth authentication required | n8n manages token lifecycle automatically |\n| Non-technical maintainers | Visual workflows are self-documenting |\n| Multi-day processes with waits | Built-in Wait node handles suspension |\n| Standard SaaS integrations | Pre-built nodes eliminate boilerplate |\n| < 5,000 records per execution | Within memory limits |\n| < 20 nodes of business logic | Maintains visual clarity |\n\n#### Use Python/Claude Code When:\n\n| Condition | Why |\n|-----------|-----|\n| > 5,000 records to process | Stream processing, memory management |\n| > 20MB files | Chunked processing capabilities |\n| Complex algorithms | Code is more maintainable than 50+ nodes |\n| Cutting-edge AI libraries | Access to latest packages |\n| Heavy data transformation | Pandas, NumPy optimization |\n| Custom ML models | Full Python ecosystem access |\n\n#### Use Hybrid (Recommended for Complex Systems):\n\n```\nn8n (Orchestration Layer)\n├── Webhooks & triggers\n├── OAuth authentication\n├── User-facing integrations\n├── Flow coordination\n│\n└── Calls Python Service (Processing Layer)\n    ├── Heavy computation\n    ├── Complex logic\n    ├── AI/ML operations\n    └── Returns results to n8n\n```\n\n---\n\n## Business Stack Quick Assessment\n\nWhen user describes their stack, respond with this analysis:\n\n### Template Response:\n\n```markdown\n## Stack Analysis: [User''s Business Type]\n\n### Services Identified:\n1. **[Service 1]** - [Category] - n8n Support: [Yes/Partial/No]\n2. **[Service 2]** - [Category] - n8n Support: [Yes/Partial/No]\n...\n\n### Recommended Approach: [n8n / Python / Hybrid]\n\n**Rationale:**\n- [Key decision factor 1]\n- [Key decision factor 2]\n- [Key decision factor 3]\n\n### Integration Complexity: [Low/Medium/High]\n- Auth complexity: [Simple API keys / OAuth required]\n- Data volume: [Estimate based on use case]\n- Processing needs: [Simple transforms / Complex logic]\n\n### Next Steps:\n1. [Specific action using other n8n skills]\n2. [Pattern to follow from n8n-workflow-patterns]\n3. [Validation approach from n8n-validation-expert]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Business Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: E-commerce Automation\n**Stack**: Shopify + Klaviyo + Slack + Google Sheets\n\n**Verdict**: Pure n8n\n- All services have native nodes\n- OAuth handled automatically\n- Standard webhook patterns\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → webhook_processing\n\n### Scenario 2: AI-Powered Lead Qualification\n**Stack**: Typeform + HubSpot + OpenAI + Custom Scoring\n\n**Verdict**: Hybrid\n- n8n: Typeform webhook, HubSpot sync, notifications\n- Python/Code Node: Complex scoring algorithm, AI prompts\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → ai_agent_workflow\n\n### Scenario 3: Data Pipeline / ETL\n**Stack**: PostgreSQL + BigQuery + 50k+ daily records\n\n**Verdict**: Python with n8n Trigger\n- n8n: Schedule trigger, success/failure notifications\n- Python: Batch processing, streaming, transformations\n- Reason: Memory limits in n8n for large datasets\n\n### Scenario 4: Multi-Step Approval Workflow\n**Stack**: Slack + Notion + Email + 3-day wait periods\n\n**Verdict**: Pure n8n\n- Built-in Wait node for delays\n- Native Slack/Notion integrations\n- Human approval patterns built-in\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → scheduled_tasks\n\n---\n\n## Production Readiness Checklist\n\nBefore any automation goes live, verify:\n\n### Observability\n- [ ] Error notification workflow exists\n- [ ] Execution logging to database\n- [ ] Health check workflow for critical paths\n- [ ] Structured alerting by severity\n\n### Idempotency\n- [ ] Duplicate webhook handling\n- [ ] Check-before-create patterns\n- [ ] Idempotency keys for payments\n- [ ] Safe re-run capability\n\n### Cost Awareness\n- [ ] AI API costs calculated and approved\n- [ ] Rate limits documented\n- [ ] Caching strategy for repeated calls\n- [ ] Model right-sizing (Haiku vs Sonnet vs Opus)\n\n### Operational Control\n- [ ] Kill switch accessible to non-technical staff\n- [ ] Approval queues for high-stakes actions\n- [ ] Audit trail for all actions\n- [ ] Configuration externalized\n\nUse `n8n-validation-expert` skill to validate workflows before deployment.\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other n8n Skills\n\nThis skill works as the **planning layer** that coordinates other skills:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  n8n-workflow-architect                      │\n│            (Strategic Decisions & Planning)                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n         ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n         ▼                    ▼                    ▼\n┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐\n│ n8n-workflow-   │  │ n8n-node-       │  │ n8n-validation- │\n│ patterns        │  │ configuration   │  │ expert          │\n│ (Architecture)  │  │ (Node Setup)    │  │ (Quality)       │\n└─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘\n         │                    │                    │\n         └────────────────────┼────────────────────┘\n                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     n8n MCP Tools                            │\n│    (search_nodes, validate_workflow, create_workflow, etc.) │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Skill Handoff Guide:\n\n| After Architect Decides... | Hand Off To |\n|---------------------------|-------------|\n| Pattern type identified | `n8n-workflow-patterns` for detailed structure |\n| Specific nodes needed | `n8n-node-configuration` for setup |\n| Code node required | `n8n-code-javascript` or `n8n-code-python` |\n| Expressions needed | `n8n-expression-syntax` for correct syntax |\n| Ready to validate | `n8n-validation-expert` for pre-deploy checks |\n| Need node info | n8n MCP → `get_node_essentials`, `search_nodes` |\n\n---\n\n## Plan Mode Activation\n\nFor complex architectural decisions, enter plan mode to:\n\n1. **Analyze the full business context**\n2. **Evaluate all integration points**\n3. **Design the data flow architecture**\n4. **Identify failure modes and mitigations**\n5. **Create implementation roadmap**\n\n### Trigger Plan Mode When:\n\n- User has 3+ services to integrate\n- Unclear whether n8n or Python is better\n- High-stakes automation (payments, customer data)\n- Complex multi-step processes\n- AI/ML components involved\n\n### Plan Mode Output Structure:\n\n```markdown\n## Automation Architecture Plan\n\n### 1. Business Context\n[What problem are we solving?]\n\n### 2. Stack Analysis\n[Each service, its role, integration complexity]\n\n### 3. Recommended Architecture\n[n8n / Python / Hybrid with rationale]\n\n### 4. Data Flow Design\n[Visual representation of the flow]\n\n### 5. Implementation Phases\nPhase 1: [Core workflow]\nPhase 2: [Error handling & observability]\nPhase 3: [Optimization & scaling]\n\n### 6. Risk Assessment\n[What could go wrong, how we prevent it]\n\n### 7. Maintenance Plan\n[Who maintains, what skills needed]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Decision Tree\n\n```\nSTART: User wants to automate something\n  │\n  ├─► Does it involve OAuth? ────────────────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Will non-developers maintain it? ──────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Does it need to wait days/weeks? ──────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Processing > 5000 records? ────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Files > 20MB? ─────────────────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Cutting-edge AI/ML? ───────────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Complex algorithm (would need 20+ nodes)? ─► Use Python\n  │\n  └─► Mix of above? ─────────────────────────────► Use Hybrid\n```\n\n---\n\n## MCP Tool Integration\n\nUse these n8n MCP tools during architecture planning:\n\n| Planning Phase | MCP Tools to Use |\n|----------------|------------------|\n| Stack analysis | `search_nodes` - verify node availability |\n| Pattern selection | `list_node_templates` - find similar workflows |\n| Feasibility check | `get_node_essentials` - understand capabilities |\n| Complexity estimate | `get_node_documentation` - auth & config needs |\n| Template reference | `get_template` - study existing patterns |\n\n---\n\n## Red Flags to Watch For\n\nWarn users when you see these patterns:\n\n| Red Flag | Risk | Recommendation |\n|----------|------|----------------|\n| \"I want AI to do everything\" | Cost explosion, unpredictability | Scope AI to specific tasks, cache results |\n| \"It needs to process millions of rows\" | Memory crashes | Python with streaming, not n8n loops |\n| \"The workflow has 50 nodes\" | Unmaintainable | Consolidate to code blocks or split workflows |\n| \"We''ll add error handling later\" | Silent failures | Build error handling from day one |\n| \"It should work on any input\" | Fragile system | Define and validate expected inputs |\n| \"The intern will maintain it\" | Single point of failure | Use n8n for visual clarity, document thoroughly |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n**This skill answers**: \"Given my business stack and requirements, what''s the smartest way to build this automation?\"\n\n**Key outputs**:\n1. Stack compatibility analysis\n2. n8n vs Python vs Hybrid recommendation\n3. Pattern and skill handoffs\n4. Production readiness guidance\n5. Implementation roadmap via plan mode\n\n**Works with**:\n- All n8n-* skills for implementation details\n- n8n MCP tools for node discovery and workflow creation\n- Plan mode for complex architectural decisions\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- [tool-selection-matrix.md](tool-selection-matrix.md) - Detailed decision criteria\n- [business-stack-analysis.md](business-stack-analysis.md) - Common SaaS integration guides\n- [production-readiness.md](production-readiness.md) - Pre-launch checklist details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:10:09.805Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing strategic guidance on n8n workflow architecture and integration with services like Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion.","zh":"非常适合需要有关n8n工作流架构和与Shopify、Klaviyo和Notion等服务集成的战略指导的自动化代理。","ja":"n8nワークフロー・アーキテクチャおよびShopify、Klaviyo、Notionなどのサービスとの統合に関する戦略的ガイダンスが必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"n8n 워크플로 아키텍처 및 Shopify, Klaviyo, Notion 등의 서비스와의 통합에 대한 전략적 가이드가 필요한 자동화 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan orientación estratégica sobre la arquitectura de flujo de trabajo de n8n y la integración con servicios como Shopify, Klaviyo y Notion.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin d''orientation stratégique sur l''architecture de workflow n8n et l''intégration avec des services tels que Shopify, Klaviyo et Notion.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die strategische Anleitung zur n8n-Workflow-Architektur und Integration mit Diensten wie Shopify, Klaviyo und Notion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de orientação estratégica sobre arquitetura de fluxo de trabalho n8n e integração com serviços como Shopify, Klaviyo e Notion.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуется стратегическое руководство по архитектуре рабочих процессов n8n и интеграции с сервисами như Shopify, Klaviyo и Notion.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات التأهيل التي تحتاج إلى توجيه استراتيجي بشأن هندسة تدفق العمل n8n والتكامل مع الخدمات مثل Shopify وKlaviyo وNotion."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to architect automation systems that survive production, providing expert decisions on workflow design, service integration, and feasibility evaluation using n8n, and informing choices between n8n and alternative automation tools like Python.","zh":"赋予代理商设计能够在生产中生存的自动化系统的能力，提供有关工作流设计、服务集成和可行性评估的专家决策，使用n8n，并在n8n和Python等替代自动化工具之间进行选择。","ja":"エージェントに、n8nを使用して、生産環境で稼働する自動化システムを設計する能力を与え、ワークフローの設計、サービス統合、実行可能性の評価に関する専門家の決定を提供し、n8nとPythonなどの代替自動化ツール之间で選択を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 n8n을 사용하여 생산에서 살아남는 자동화 시스템을 설계할 수 있도록 해주며, 워크플로우 디자인, 서비스 통합 및 실현 가능성 평가에 대한 전문가 의사 결정을 제공하고, n8n과 Python 등의 대체 자동화 도구 사이에서 선택을 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a arquitectar sistemas de automatización que sobreviven a la producción, proporcionando decisiones expertas sobre el diseño de flujo de trabajo, la integración de servicios y la evaluación de viabilidad utilizando n8n, e informando las elecciones entre n8n y herramientas de automatización alternativas como Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes d''automatisation qui survivent à la production, en fournissant des décisions d''experts sur la conception de workflow, l''intégration de services et l''évaluation de la faisabilité en utilisant n8n, et en éclairant les choix entre n8n et des outils d''automatisation alternatifs comme Python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Automatisierungssysteme zu entwerfen, die die Produktion überstehen, indem sie Expertenentscheidungen über die Workflow-Design, die Serviceintegration und die Machbarkeitsbewertung unter Verwendung von n8n treffen und die Auswahl zwischen n8n und alternativen Automatisierungstools wie Python treffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquitetar sistemas de automação que sobrevivem à produção, fornecendo decisões especializadas sobre design de fluxo de trabalho, integração de serviços e avaliação de viabilidade usando n8n, e informando escolhas entre n8n e ferramentas de automação alternativas como Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать системы автоматизации, способные выдержать производство, обеспечивая экспертные решения по проектированию рабочих процессов, интеграции сервисов и оценке осуществимости с помощью n8n, и информируя выбор между n8n и альтернативными инструментами автоматизации, такими как Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من تصميم أنظمة أوتوماتيكية يمكنها النجاة في الإنتاج، وتقديم قرارات خبيرة بشأن تصميم تدفق العمل والتكامل مع الخدمات وتقييم الإمكانية باستخدام n8n، وإبلاغ الاختيارات بين n8n وأدوات أوتوماتيكية بديلة مثل Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Planning automation projects for sales pipelines","Integrating multiple services through n8n workflows","Evaluating the feasibility of automation projects","Making architecture decisions for automation systems"],"zh":["规划销售管道的自动化项目","通过n8n工作流集成多个服务","评估自动化项目的可行性","为自动化系统做出架构决策"],"ja":["セールスパイプラインの自動化プロジェクトを計画する","n8nワークフローを介して複数のサービスを統合する","自動化プロジェクトの実行可能性を評価する","自動化システムのアーキテクチャに関する決定を下す"],"ko":["판매 파이프라인의 자동화 프로젝트를 계획하는 것","n8n 워크플로우를 통해 여러 서비스를 통합하는 것","자동화 프로젝트의 실현 가능성을 평가하는 것","자동화 시스템의 아키텍처에 대한 결정"],"es":["Planificación de proyectos de automatización para tuberías de ventas","Integración de varios servicios a través de flujos de trabajo de n8n","Evaluación de la viabilidad de los proyectos de automatización","Toma de decisiones de arquitectura para sistemas de automatización"],"fr":["Planification de projets d''automatisation pour les tubes de vente","Intégration de plusieurs services via des flux de travail n8n","Évaluation de la faisabilité des projets d''automatisation","Prise de décisions d''architecture pour les systèmes d''automatisation"],"de":["Planung von Automatisierungsprojekten für Vertriebspipelines","Integration mehrerer Dienste über n8n-Workflows","Bewertung der Machbarkeit von Automatisierungsprojekten","Architekturentscheidungen für Automatisierungssysteme"],"pt":["Planejamento de projetos de automação para pipelines de vendas","Integração de vários serviços por meio de fluxos de trabalho n8n","Avaliação da viabilidade de projetos de automação","Tomada de decisões de arquitetura para sistemas de automação"],"ru":["Планирование проектов автоматизации для продажных трубопроводов","Интеграция нескольких сервисов посредством рабочих процессов n8n","Оценка осуществимости проектов автоматизации","Принятие решений по архитектуре для систем автоматизации"],"ar":["تخطيط مشاريع أوتوماتيكية لأنابيب المبيعات","التكامل بين خدمات متعددة من خلال تدفقات عمل n8n","تقييم إمكانية مشاريع الأتمتة","اتخاذ قرارات هندسية لأنظمة الأتمتة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of n8n workflow concepts","Specific to n8n automation platform"],"zh":["需要了解n8n工作流概念","特定于n8n自动化平台"],"ja":["n8nワークフロー概念の理解が必要","n8n自動化プラットフォームに特有"],"ko":["n8n 워크플로우 개념을 이해해야 함","n8n 자동화 플랫폼에 특정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los conceptos de flujo de trabajo de n8n","Específico de la plataforma de automatización n8n"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de flux de travail n8n","Spécifique à la plate-forme d''automatisation n8n"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der n8n-Workflow-Konzepte","Spezifisch für die n8n-Automatisierungsplattform"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de conceitos de fluxo de trabalho n8n","Específico para plataforma de automação n8n"],"ru":["Требует понимания концепций рабочих процессов n8n","Специфичен для платформы автоматизации n8n"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مفاهيم تدفق العمل n8n","محدد لمنصة الأتمتة n8n"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jkomoros/community-patterns/git-workflow', 'community', 'jkomoros', 'community-patterns', 'jkomoros/community-patterns', 'git-workflow', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z', '2026-02-18T03:11:25.096Z', NULL, '{"id":"jkomoros/community-patterns/git-workflow","name":"git-workflow","description":{"zh":"Git 工作流程是一套社区创建的模式，用于管理代码仓库","ja":"Git ワークフローは、コミュニティによって作成されたコードリポジトリを管理するためのパターン集です","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 코드 저장소를 관리하기 위한 커뮤니티가 만든 패턴입니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es una recopilación de patrones creados por la comunidad para trabajar de manera efectiva con Git.","fr":"Le workflow Git est une collection de modèles créés par la communauté pour travailler de manière efficace avec Git.","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist eine Sammlung von Mustern, die von der Community erstellt wurden, um effektiv mit Git zu arbeiten.","en":"A repo for patterns created by the communtiy"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 工作流程指南","ja":"Git ワークフロー ガイド","ko":"Git 작업 흐름 가이드","es":"Flujo de trabajo Git: patrones de la comunidad","fr":"Workflow Git : modèles de la communauté","de":"Git-Workflow: Muster der Community","en":"git-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"Git 工作流程是一套社区创建的模式，用于管理代码仓库","ja":"Git ワークフローは、コミュニティによって作成されたコードリポジトリを管理するためのパターン集です","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 코드 저장소를 관리하기 위한 커뮤니티가 만든 패턴입니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es una recopilación de patrones creados por la comunidad para trabajar de manera efectiva con Git.","fr":"Le workflow Git est une collection de modèles créés par la communauté pour travailler de manière efficace avec Git.","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist eine Sammlung von Mustern, die von der Community erstellt wurden, um effektiv mit Git zu arbeiten.","en":"A repo for patterns created by the communtiy"},"definition":{"en":"A repo for patterns created by the communtiy"},"features":{"zh":["提交工作","获取更新","共享工作","创建拉取请求","管理代码仓库"],"ja":["作業のコミット","更新の取得","作業の共有","プルリクエストの作成","コードリポジトリの管理"],"ko":["작업 커밋","업데이트 가져오기","작업 공유","풀 리퀘스트 생성","코드 저장소 관리"],"es":["Commit de cambios en Git","Actualización de repositorios","Creación de solicitudes de extracción","Colaboración en proyectos de código abierto","Gestión de ramas y fusiones","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Commit de modifications dans Git","Mise à jour de dépôts","Création de demandes d''extraction","Collaboration sur des projets de code ouvert","Gestion de branches et de fusions","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Commit von Änderungen in Git","Aktualisierung von Repositories","Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Zusammenarbeit an Open-Source-Projekten","Verwaltung von Branches und Merge","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 工作流程","版本控制","代码管理","社区模式","Git 教程","代码仓库管理"],"ja":["Git ワークフロー","バージョン管理","コード管理","コミュニティパターン","Git ガイド","コードリポジトリ管理"],"ko":["Git 작업 흐름","버전 관리","코드 관리","커뮤니티 패턴","Git 가이드","코드 저장소 관리"],"es":["flujo de trabajo Git","patrones de la comunidad","commit","actualización","solicitudes de extracción","colaboración en código abierto","ramas y fusiones","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["workflow Git","modèles de la communauté","commit","mise à jour","demandes d''extraction","collaboration sur du code ouvert","branches et fusions","outils de développement"],"de":["Git-Workflow","Community-Muster","Commit","Aktualisierung","Pull-Requests","Zusammenarbeit an Open-Source-Code","Branches und Merge","Entwicklungstools"]}},"owner":"jkomoros","repo":"community-patterns","repoPath":"jkomoros/community-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow\n\n## Committing Work\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\n\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/pattern.tsx\ngit commit -m \"Add pattern: description\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Getting Updates (Already done in Step 1)\n\n```bash\ngit fetch upstream\ngit pull --rebase upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Sharing Work Upstream (Creating Pull Requests)\n\n**IMPORTANT: Wait for user to tell you to create a PR.** Don''t push or create PRs automatically.\n\n**Before creating any PR, you MUST upd","body":"# Git Workflow\n\n## Committing Work\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\n\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/pattern.tsx\ngit commit -m \"Add pattern: description\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Getting Updates (Already done in Step 1)\n\n```bash\ngit fetch upstream\ngit pull --rebase upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Sharing Work Upstream (Creating Pull Requests)\n\n**IMPORTANT: Wait for user to tell you to create a PR.** Don''t push or create PRs automatically.\n\n**Before creating any PR, you MUST update from main and rebase your branch:**\n\n### Step 0: Update and Rebase Before Creating PR\n\n**Use cached repository type from workspace config:**\n\n```bash\n# Read IS_FORK from .claude-workspace (set during Step 2)\nIS_FORK=$(grep \"^is_fork=\" .claude-workspace | cut -d= -f2)\n\n# Determine which remote to use\nif [ \"$IS_FORK\" = \"true\" ]; then\n  echo \"Working on fork - will fetch from upstream\"\n  MAIN_REMOTE=\"upstream\"\nelse\n  echo \"Working on main repo - will fetch from origin\"\n  MAIN_REMOTE=\"origin\"\nfi\n```\n\n**Then fetch latest main and rebase your branch:**\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest main\ngit fetch $MAIN_REMOTE\n\n# Rebase current branch on top of main\ngit rebase $MAIN_REMOTE/main\n\n# If rebase succeeds, push (force-with-lease if on feature branch)\nif [ \"$(git branch --show-current)\" != \"main\" ]; then\n  git push origin $(git branch --show-current) --force-with-lease\nelse\n  git push origin main\nfi\n```\n\n**If rebase has conflicts:**\n1. Show conflict files: `git status`\n2. Help resolve conflicts\n3. Continue: `git rebase --continue`\n4. Then push\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Ensures your PR is based on the latest main\n- Avoids merge conflicts during PR review\n- Makes PR review easier\n\n---\n\n### If User Has Their Own Fork (Most Common)\n\nWhen user wants to contribute patterns from their fork to upstream:\n\n**Step 1: Ensure changes are committed and pushed to their fork**\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\ngit status  # Verify all changes are committed\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n**Step 2: Update and rebase (see Step 0 above)**\n\n**Step 3: Create pull request to upstream**\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo jkomoros/community-patterns \\\n  --title \"Add: pattern name\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Brief description of the pattern\n- Key features\n- Use cases\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Pattern compiles without errors\n- [x] Tested in browser at http://localhost:8000\n- [x] All features working as expected\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### If Working Directly on jkomoros/community-patterns\n\n**CRITICAL: When working directly on the upstream repository, you MUST use branches and PRs. Direct pushes to main are NOT allowed.**\n\n**Step 1: Create feature branch**\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\ngit checkout -b username/feature-name\n```\n\n**Step 2: Commit and push branch**\n```bash\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/\ngit commit -m \"Add: pattern name\"\ngit push origin username/feature-name\n```\n\n**Step 3: Update and rebase (see Step 0 above)**\n\n**Step 4: Create pull request**\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"Add: pattern name\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Brief description\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested and working\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**Step 5: Merge with rebase (when approved)**\n```bash\ngh pr merge PR_NUMBER --rebase --delete-branch\n```\n\n### Important Notes\n\n- **Always wait for user permission** before creating PRs\n- **All PRs are merged with `--rebase`** (NOT `--squash` or `--merge`)\n- This preserves individual commit history\n- Commit frequently locally, but only create PR when user asks\n- PRs will be reviewed before merging to upstream\n- After merge, everyone gets your patterns automatically on next update\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:11:25.096Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined git workflow automation and collaboration capabilities.","zh":"适合需要简化git工作流自动化和协作功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたgitワークフロー自動化とコラボレーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 스트림 라인화 된 git 워크 플로 자동화 및 협업 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una automatización de flujo de trabajo de git y capacidades de colaboración optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une automatisation du flux de travail Git et des capacités de collaboration rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Git-Arbeitsabläufe und Kollaborationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho do git e capacidades de colaboração simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированный рабочий процесс git и возможности сотрудничества.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تلقيم عملية عمل جيت وتسهيلات التعاون"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage git repositories using bash commands, facilitating seamless commits, updates, and pull requests with protocols like git fetch and git push, while handling files like pattern.tsx.","zh":"赋予代理管理git仓库使用bash命令的能力，实现无缝的提交、更新和拉取请求，使用git fetch和git push等协议，并处理pattern.tsx等文件。","ja":"エージェントがbashコマンドを使用してgitリポジトリを管理する機能を提供し、git fetchやgit pushなどのプロトコルを使用してシームレスなコミット、更新、およびプルリクエストを実現し、pattern.tsxなどのファイルを处理します。","ko":"에이전트가 bash 명령을 사용하여 git 리포지토리를 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 git fetch나 git push와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 무결점의 커밋, 업데이트, 풀 리퀘스트를 구현하며 pattern.tsx와 같은 파일을 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar repositorios de git utilizando comandos bash, facilitando commits, actualizaciones y solicitudes de extracción sin problemas con protocolos como git fetch y git push, mientras maneja archivos como pattern.tsx.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les référentiels Git en utilisant des commandes bash, facilitant ainsi les validations, les mises à jour et les demandes d''extraction avec des protocoles tels que git fetch et git push, tout en gérant des fichiers tels que pattern.tsx.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Git-Repositorys mit Bash-Befehlen zu verwalten, wodurch Commits, Updates und Pull-Anfragen mit Protokollen wie git fetch und git push nahtlos möglich sind, während Dateien wie pattern.tsx gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar repositórios git usando comandos bash, facilitando commits, atualizações e solicitações de pull sem interrupções com protocolos como git fetch e git push, enquanto lida com arquivos como pattern.tsx.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять репозиториями git с помощью команд bash, обеспечивая бесперебойные коммиты, обновления и запросы на вытягивание с протоколами như git fetch и git push, при работе с файлами типа pattern.tsx.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإدارة مستودعات جيت باستخدام أوامر باش، ويسهم في الالتزامات السلسة والتحديثات والطلبات السحابية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل جيت فتش وجيت بوش، مع التعامل مع الملفات مثل نمط.tsx"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit messages with descriptive headers","Updating local repositories with git fetch and git pull --rebase","Creating pull requests for community patterns after manual review"],"zh":["使用描述性标题自动化提交消息","使用git fetch和git pull --rebase更新本地仓库","在手动审查后为社区模式创建拉取请求"],"ja":["記述的なヘッダーを使用してコミットメッセージを自動化する","git fetchとgit pull --rebaseを使用してローカルリポジトリを更新する","手動レビュー後、コミュニティパターン用にプルリクエストを作成する"],"ko":["설명적인 제목을 사용하여 커밋 메시지를 자동화하는","git fetch와 git pull --rebase를 사용하여 로컬 리포지토리를 업데이트하는","수동 리뷰 후에 커뮤니티 패턴을 위한 풀 리퀘스트를 생성하는"],"es":["Automatizar mensajes de commit con encabezados descriptivos","Actualizar repositorios locales con git fetch y git pull --rebase","Crear solicitudes de extracción para patrones de la comunidad después de una revisión manual"],"fr":["Automatiser les messages de validation avec des en-têtes descriptifs","Mettre à jour les référentiels locaux avec git fetch et git pull --rebase","Créer des demandes d''extraction pour les modèles de la communauté après une révision manuelle"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit-Nachrichten mit beschreibenden Headern","Aktualisieren von lokalen Repositorys mit git fetch und git pull --rebase","Erstellen von Pull-Anfragen für Community-Muster nach manueller Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar mensagens de commit com cabeçalhos descritivos","Atualizar repositórios locais com git fetch e git pull --rebase","Criar solicitações de pull para padrões da comunidade após revisão manual"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сообщения о коммитах с описательными заголовками","Обновлять локальные репозитории с git fetch и git pull --rebase","Создавать запросы на вытягивание для шаблонов сообщества после ручного обзора"],"ar":["تلقيم رسائل الالتزام مع العناوين الوصفية","تحديث مستودعات محلية مع جيت فتش وجيت بول -- ريبايس","إنشاء طلبات سحابية لأنماط المجتمع بعد المراجعة اليدوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation and configuration","Needs manual intervention for creating pull requests","Limited to git workflow management"],"zh":["需要git安装和配置","需要手动干预来创建拉取请求","仅限git工作流管理"],"ja":["gitのインストールと構成が必要","プルリクエストの作成には手動介入が必要","gitワークフローマネジメントのみ"],"ko":["git 설치 및 구성이 필요","풀 리퀘스트 생성을 위해 수동 개입이 필요","git 워크 플로우 관리에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de git","Necesita intervención manual para crear solicitudes de extracción","Limitado a la gestión del flujo de trabajo de git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Nécessite une intervention manuelle pour créer des demandes d''extraction","Limité à la gestion du flux de travail Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Benötigt manuelle Eingriffe zur Erstellung von Pull-Anfragen","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Git-Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do git","Necessita intervenção manual para criar solicitações de pull","Limitado ao gerenciamento do fluxo de trabalho do git"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки git","Требует ручного вмешательства для создания запросов на вытягивание","Ограничен управлением рабочим процессом git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت جيت وتفصيله","يحتاج إلى تدخل يدوي لإنشاء طلبات سحابية","محدود بإدارة عملية جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Cantara/lib-electronic-components/macronix', 'community', 'Cantara', 'lib-electronic-components', 'Cantara/lib-electronic-components', 'macronix', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z', '2026-02-18T03:10:41.758Z', NULL, '{"id":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components/macronix","name":"macronix","description":{"zh":"麦克朗尼克斯（Macronix）是一家专门从事闪存芯片制造的台湾公司，主要产品包括串行NOR Flash、并行NOR Flash、SLC NAND Flash和ROM IC","ja":"マクロニクス（Macronix）はフラッシュメモリICの製造を専門とする台湾の企業で、主な製品にはシリアルNOR Flash、パラレルNOR Flash、SLC NAND Flash、ROM ICが含まれる","ko":"마크로닉스(Macronix)는 플래시 메모리芯片을 전문으로하는 台湾企業으로, 주요 제품에는 시리얼 NOR 플래시, 병렬 NOR 플래시, SLC NAND 플래시 및 ROM IC가 포함","es":"Macronix es un fabricante taiwanés especializado en memoria Flash ICs para sistemas embebidos y aplicaciones industriales","fr":"Macronix est un fabricant taïwanais spécialisé dans les mémoires Flash ICs pour les systèmes embarqués et les applications industrielles","de":"Macronix ist ein taiwanesischer Hersteller von Flash-Speicher-ICs für eingebettete Systeme und industrielle Anwendungen","pt":"A Macronix é uma fabricante taiwanesa de memória Flash de alta confiabilidade para sistemas incorporados e aplicações industriais.","ru":"Макроникс - тайваньский производитель высоконадежной флеш-памяти для встроенных систем и промышленных применений.","ar":"ماكرونيكس هي شركة تصنيع تايوانية لذاكرة الفلاش عالية الموثوقية لأنظمة المضمنة والتطبيقات الصناعية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"麦克朗尼克斯（Macronix）闪存芯片解决方案","ja":"マクロニクス（Macronix）フラッシュメモリICソリューション","ko":"마크로닉스(Macronix) 플래시 메모리 솔루션","es":"Macronix: Fabricante de Memoria Flash","fr":"Macronix: Fabricant de Mémoire Flash","de":"Macronix: Hersteller von Flash-Speicher","pt":"Memória Flash Macronix","ru":"Макроникс Флеш Память","ar":"ذاكرة فلاش ماكرونيكس","en":"macronix"},"description":{"zh":"麦克朗尼克斯（Macronix）是一家专门从事闪存芯片制造的台湾公司，主要产品包括串行NOR Flash、并行NOR Flash、SLC NAND Flash和ROM IC","ja":"マクロニクス（Macronix）はフラッシュメモリICの製造を専門とする台湾の企業で、主な製品にはシリアルNOR Flash、パラレルNOR Flash、SLC NAND Flash、ROM ICが含まれる","ko":"마크로닉스(Macronix)는 플래시 메모리芯片을 전문으로하는 台湾企業으로, 주요 제품에는 시리얼 NOR 플래시, 병렬 NOR 플래시, SLC NAND 플래시 및 ROM IC가 포함","es":"Macronix es un fabricante taiwanés especializado en memoria Flash ICs para sistemas embebidos y aplicaciones industriales","fr":"Macronix est un fabricant taïwanais spécialisé dans les mémoires Flash ICs pour les systèmes embarqués et les applications industrielles","de":"Macronix ist ein taiwanesischer Hersteller von Flash-Speicher-ICs für eingebettete Systeme und industrielle Anwendungen","pt":"A Macronix é uma fabricante taiwanesa de memória Flash de alta confiabilidade para sistemas incorporados e aplicações industriais.","ru":"Макроникс - тайваньский производитель высоконадежной флеш-памяти для встроенных систем и промышленных применений.","ar":"ماكرونيكس هي شركة تصنيع تايوانية لذاكرة الفلاش عالية الموثوقية لأنظمة المضمنة والتطبيقات الصناعية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["串行NOR Flash","并行NOR Flash","SLC NAND Flash","ROM IC","高可靠性闪存解决方案","适用于嵌入式系统、物联网设备、汽车和工业应用"],"ja":["シリアルNOR Flash","パラレルNOR Flash","SLC NAND Flash","ROM IC","高信頼性フラッシュメモリソリューション","組み込みシステム、IoTデバイス、自動車、産業用途向け"],"ko":["시리얼 NOR 플래시","병렬 NOR 플래시","SLC NAND 플래시","ROM IC","고신뢰성 플래시 메모리 솔루션","내장 시스템, IoT 장치, 자동차 및 산업 분야용"],"es":["Memoria Flash NOR en serie","Memoria Flash NOR en paralelo","Memoria Flash NAND SLC","ICs de solo lectura","Alta confiabilidad","Aplicaciones industriales y de IoT"],"fr":["Mémoire Flash NOR série","Mémoire Flash NOR parallèle","Mémoire Flash NAND SLC","ICs de lecture seule","Fiabilité élevée","Applications industrielles et IoT"],"de":["Flash-Speicher NOR-Serie","Flash-Speicher NOR-Parallel","Flash-Speicher SLC-NAND","Nur-Lese-ICs","Hohe Zuverlässigkeit","Industrielle und IoT-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Memória Flash Serial NOR","Memória Flash Paralela NOR","Memória Flash SLC NAND","Circuitos Integrados de ROM","Alta confiabilidade","Aplicação em sistemas incorporados e industriais"],"ru":["Серийная флеш-память NOR","Параллельная флеш-память NOR","Флеш-память SLC NAND","Интегральные схемы ROM","Высокая надежность","Применение во встроенных и промышленных системах"],"ar":["ذاكرة فلاش NOR التسلسلي","ذاكرة فلاش NOR المتوازي","ذاكرة فلاش NAND SLC","دوائر متكاملة ROM","موثوقية عالية","التطبيق في الأنظمة المضمنة والصناعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["麦克朗尼克斯","闪存芯片","高可靠性闪存","嵌入式系统","物联网设备","汽车电子","工业应用","串行NOR Flash","并行NOR Flash","SLC NAND Flash"],"ja":["マクロニクス","フラッシュメモリIC","高信頼性フラッシュメモリ","組み込みシステム","IoTデバイス","自動車電子","産業用途","シリアルNOR Flash","パラレルNOR Flash","SLC NAND Flash"],"ko":["마크로닉스","플래시 메모리芯片","고신뢰성 플래시 메모리","내장 시스템","IoT 장치","자동차 전자","산업 분야","시리얼 NOR 플래시","병렬 NOR 플래시","SLC NAND 플래시"],"es":["memoria flash","sistemas embebidos","IoT","aplicaciones industriales","Macronix","fabricante de memoria flash","alta confiabilidad","ICs de memoria flash"],"fr":["mémoire flash","systèmes embarqués","IoT","applications industrielles","Macronix","fabricant de mémoire flash","fiabilité élevée","ICs de mémoire flash"],"de":["Flash-Speicher","eingebettete Systeme","IoT","industrielle Anwendungen","Macronix","Hersteller von Flash-Speicher","hohe Zuverlässigkeit","Flash-Speicher-ICs"],"pt":["memória flash","sistemas incorporados","IoT","aplicações industriais","Macronix","alta confiabilidade","Flash memory","NOR","NAND"],"ru":["флеш-память","встроенные системы","IoT","промышленные применения","Макроникс","высокая надежность","Flash-память","NOR","NAND"],"ar":["ذاكرة فلاش","نظم مضمنة","أجهزة الإنترنت","تطبيقات صناعية","ماكرونيكس","موثوقية عالية","ذاكرة الفلاش","NOR","NAND"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"macronix","description":"Macronix International MPN encoding patterns, density decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Macronix Flash memory components or MacronixHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Macronix International Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nMacronix International Co., Ltd. is a Taiwan-based manufacturer specializing in Flash memory ICs. The company produces:\n\n- **Serial NOR Flash** (MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L series)\n- **Parallel NOR Flash** (MX29GL, MX29LV series)\n- **SLC NAND Flash** (MX30LF series)\n- **ROM ICs**\n\nMacronix is known for high-reliability Flash memory used in embedded systems, IoT devices, automotive, and industrial applications.\n\n---\n\n## MPN Structure","body":"# Macronix International Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nMacronix International Co., Ltd. is a Taiwan-based manufacturer specializing in Flash memory ICs. The company produces:\n\n- **Serial NOR Flash** (MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L series)\n- **Parallel NOR Flash** (MX29GL, MX29LV series)\n- **SLC NAND Flash** (MX30LF series)\n- **ROM ICs**\n\nMacronix is known for high-reliability Flash memory used in embedded systems, IoT devices, automotive, and industrial applications.\n\n---\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nMacronix MPNs follow this general structure:\n\n### Serial NOR Flash (MX25L/U/R/V, MX66L)\n\n```\nMX25 L 6433 F MI - 08 G\n│    │ │    │ │    │  │\n│    │ │    │ │    │  └── Grade: G=Green/RoHS\n│    │ │    │ │    └───── Speed: 08=80MHz, 10=104MHz\n│    │ │    │ └────────── Package code (see table below)\n│    │ │    └──────────── Feature: F=Fast Read, E=Extended Temp\n│    │ └───────────────── Density code (see density decoding)\n│    └─────────────────── Series: L=Standard, U=Ultra Low Power, R=Wide Voltage, V=Very Low Voltage\n└──────────────────────── Family prefix\n```\n\n### Parallel NOR Flash (MX29GL, MX29LV)\n\n```\nMX29 GL 256 F HT 2 I - 90 Q\n│    │  │   │ │  │ │   │  │\n│    │  │   │ │  │ │   │  └── Qualifier\n│    │  │   │ │  │ │   └───── Speed: 90=90ns\n│    │  │   │ │  │ └───────── Temperature: I=Industrial\n│    │  │   │ │  └─────────── Version: 2=Version 2\n│    │  │   │ └────────────── Package: HT=TSOP-48\n│    │  │   └──────────────── Feature: F=Fast\n│    │  └──────────────────── Density: 256=256Mbit\n│    └─────────────────────── Series: GL=High Density, LV=Low Voltage\n└──────────────────────────── Family prefix\n```\n\n### SLC NAND Flash (MX30LF)\n\n```\nMX30 LF 1G 18 AC\n│    │  │  │  │\n│    │  │  │  └── Package: AC=TSOP-48\n│    │  │  └───── Bus width: 18=x8\n│    │  └──────── Density: 1G=1Gbit, 2G=2Gbit\n│    └─────────── Series: LF=SLC NAND Flash\n└──────────────── Family prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### Serial NOR Flash\n\n| Series | Description | Voltage Range | Features |\n|--------|-------------|---------------|----------|\n| MX25L | Standard Serial NOR | 2.7V-3.6V | SPI/QSPI, standard power |\n| MX25U | Ultra Low Power | 1.65V-1.95V | SPI/QSPI, low power mode |\n| MX25R | Wide Voltage Range | 1.65V-3.6V | Flexible voltage operation |\n| MX25V | Very Low Voltage | 2.3V-3.6V | Optimized for low voltage |\n| MX66L | High Performance | 2.7V-3.6V | High speed, large density |\n\n### Parallel NOR Flash\n\n| Series | Description | Voltage | Features |\n|--------|-------------|---------|----------|\n| MX29GL | High Density | 3.3V | Large capacity, burst read |\n| MX29LV | Low Voltage | 3.0V | Low power consumption |\n\n### NAND Flash\n\n| Series | Description | Technology |\n|--------|-------------|------------|\n| MX30LF | SLC NAND | Single-Level Cell, high endurance |\n\n---\n\n## Density Decoding\n\n### Serial NOR Flash Density Codes\n\nMacronix serial flash uses a special encoding where the first 2-4 digits represent density:\n\n| Code | Density | Bytes |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| 6433, 6435 | 64 Mbit | 8 MB |\n| 12833, 12835 | 128 Mbit | 16 MB |\n| 25635, 25645 | 256 Mbit | 32 MB |\n| 51235, 51245 | 512 Mbit | 64 MB |\n| 1G | 1 Gbit | 128 MB |\n| 2G | 2 Gbit | 256 MB |\n\n### Parallel NOR Flash Density Codes\n\n| Raw Code | Actual Density | Notes |\n|----------|----------------|-------|\n| 256 | 256 Mbit | Direct encoding (MX29GL) |\n| 128 | 128 Mbit | Direct encoding (MX29GL) |\n| 640 | 64 Mbit | Scaled encoding (MX29LV) |\n| 320 | 32 Mbit | Scaled encoding (MX29LV) |\n| 160 | 16 Mbit | Scaled encoding (MX29LV) |\n| 800 | 8 Mbit | Scaled encoding (MX29LV) |\n\n**Important**: MX29LV series uses scaled encoding (multiply by 0.1 for Mbits), while MX29GL uses direct encoding.\n\n---\n\n## Package Codes\n\n| Code | Package | Pin Count | Notes |\n|------|---------|-----------|-------|\n| MI | SOP-8 | 8 | Standard SOIC, 150mil body |\n| MN | DFN-8 | 8 | Dual Flat No-lead |\n| ZI | WSON-8 | 8 | Very thin package |\n| SI | SOIC-8 | 8 | Standard SOIC |\n| SS | SOIC-8 | 8 | SOIC variant |\n| DI | SOIC-16 | 16 | Wide body SOIC |\n| TI | TSOP-8 | 8 | Thin Small Outline |\n| BH | BGA | Various | Ball Grid Array |\n| FH | FBGA | Various | Fine-pitch BGA |\n| HT | TSOP-48 | 48 | Parallel flash standard |\n| AC | TSOP-48 | 48 | NAND standard package |\n| ZB | WSON-8 | 8 | WSON variant |\n| EB | BGA | Various | BGA variant |\n| LI | WLCSP | Various | Wafer-Level CSP |\n\n---\n\n## Supported Component Types\n\nThe `MacronixHandler` supports:\n\n```java\nComponentType.MEMORY\nComponentType.MEMORY_FLASH\n```\n\nNote: Unlike some handlers, MacronixHandler does not define manufacturer-specific types like `MEMORY_FLASH_MACRONIX`. Both patterns register to `MEMORY` and `MEMORY_FLASH` base types.\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\nThe handler extracts package codes differently based on the flash family:\n\n**Serial NOR (MX25L/U/R/V, MX66L)**:\n1. Find position of ''F'' or ''E'' (feature letter)\n2. Extract 2 characters after the feature letter\n3. Map to package name if known, otherwise return empty\n\n```java\n// Example: MX25L6433FMI-08G\n// F is at index 10, MI is at 11-12\n// Returns \"SOP-8\"\n```\n\n**Parallel NOR (MX29GL, MX29LV)**:\n1. Use regex pattern to find 2-letter code after density\n2. Map to package name\n\n```java\n// Example: MX29GL256FHT2I-90Q\n// HT follows density and F\n// Returns \"TSOP-48\"\n```\n\n**NAND (MX30LF)**:\n1. Extract last 2 characters before hyphen\n2. Map to package or return raw suffix\n\n```java\n// Example: MX30LF1G18AC\n// AC is the suffix\n// Returns \"TSOP-48\"\n```\n\n### Series Extraction\n\nReturns the family prefix including the series letter:\n\n| MPN | Series |\n|-----|--------|\n| MX25L6433FMI-08G | MX25L |\n| MX25U12835FMI-10G | MX25U |\n| MX66L1G45GMI-10G | MX66L |\n| MX29GL256FHT2I-90Q | MX29GL |\n| MX29LV640EBTI-70Q | MX29LV |\n| MX30LF1G18AC | MX30LF |\n\n### Density Extraction\n\nThe `extractDensity()` method (Macronix-specific helper) returns the decoded density:\n\n| MPN | Extracted Density |\n|-----|-------------------|\n| MX25L6433F | 64 |\n| MX25L12835F | 128 |\n| MX29GL256 | 256 |\n| MX29LV640 | 64 |\n| MX30LF1G18AC | 1G |\n\n### Replacement Logic\n\n`isOfficialReplacement()` returns true when:\n1. Both parts are in the same series (e.g., both MX25L)\n2. Both parts have the same density\n\nPackage and speed differences are acceptable for replacements.\n\n---\n\n## Example MPNs with Full Decoding\n\n### MX25L6433FMI-08G\n\n| Field | Value | Meaning |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| Family | MX25 | Serial NOR Flash |\n| Series | L | Standard voltage (2.7V-3.6V) |\n| Density | 6433 | 64 Mbit |\n| Feature | F | Fast Read supported |\n| Package | MI | SOP-8 |\n| Speed | 08 | 80 MHz |\n| Grade | G | RoHS compliant |\n\n### MX25L12835FMI-10G\n\n| Field | Value | Meaning |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| Family | MX25 | Serial NOR Flash |\n| Series | L | Standard voltage |\n| Density | 12835 | 128 Mbit |\n| Feature | F | Fast Read |\n| Package | MI | SOP-8 |\n| Speed | 10 | 104 MHz |\n| Grade | G | RoHS compliant |\n\n### MX29GL256FHT2I-90Q\n\n| Field | Value | Meaning |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| Family | MX29 | Parallel NOR Flash |\n| Series | GL | High density 3.3V |\n| Density | 256 | 256 Mbit |\n| Feature | F | Fast |\n| Package | HT | TSOP-48 |\n| Version | 2 | Version 2 |\n| Temp | I | Industrial (-40 to +85C) |\n| Speed | 90 | 90ns access time |\n\n### MX30LF1G18AC\n\n| Field | Value | Meaning |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| Family | MX30 | NAND Flash |\n| Series | LF | SLC NAND |\n| Density | 1G | 1 Gbit |\n| Bus | 18 | x8 data bus |\n| Package | AC | TSOP-48 |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/MacronixHandler.java`\n- Memory skill: `.claude/skills/memory/SKILL.md`\n- Winbond handler (similar memory manufacturer): `manufacturers/WinbondHandler.java`\n- Component types: `MEMORY`, `MEMORY_FLASH`\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n### Density Code Complexity\n- Serial NOR uses complex density encoding (6433 = 64Mb, not 6.4Gb)\n- Parallel NOR LV series uses scaled encoding (640 = 64Mb, 160 = 16Mb)\n- NAND uses explicit Gbit notation (1G, 2G)\n\n### Package Code Position Varies\n- Serial NOR: Package comes after feature letter (F or E)\n- Parallel NOR: Package is part of the middle segment\n- NAND: Package is the last 2 characters before hyphen\n\n### No Manufacturer-Specific Types\n- Unlike TI (OPAMP_TI) or Winbond (MEMORY_FLASH_WINBOND), Macronix does not have manufacturer-specific ComponentTypes\n- All patterns map to base `MEMORY` and `MEMORY_FLASH` types\n- This simplifies matching but loses manufacturer specificity\n\n### Speed Grades\n- Serial NOR: -08 = 80MHz, -10 = 104MHz, -12 = 120MHz\n- Parallel NOR: -55 = 55ns, -70 = 70ns, -90 = 90ns\n\n### Voltage Series Selection Guide\n- MX25L: Standard applications, 2.7V-3.6V\n- MX25U: Battery-powered, ultra-low power\n- MX25R: Designs needing voltage flexibility\n- MX25V: Legacy 3.3V systems needing lower threshold\n- MX66L: High-performance, large storage needs\n\n### Cross-Manufacturer Equivalents\n- MX25L series competes with Winbond W25Q series\n- MX30LF NAND competes with Micron MT29F series\n- Serial NOR from different manufacturers often pin-compatible\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:10:41.758Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Embedded Systems Agents requiring high-reliability Flash memory solutions from Macronix.","zh":"非常适合需要高可靠性Flash存储解决方案的嵌入式系统代理，特别是使用宏晶（Macronix）产品。","ja":"マクロニクスの高信頼性フラッシュメモリソリューションを必要とする組み込みシステムエージェントに最適です。","ko":"매크로닉스의 고신뢰성 플래시 메모리 솔루션을 필요로 하는 임베디드 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de sistemas embebidos que requieren soluciones de memoria Flash de alta confiabilidad de Macronix.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de systèmes intégrés nécessitant des solutions de mémoire Flash haute fiabilité de Macronix.","de":"Perfekt für Embedded-System-Agents, die hochzuverlässige Flash-Speicherlösungen von Macronix erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas Incorporados que exigem soluções de memória Flash de alta confiabilidade da Macronix.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов встроенных систем, требующих высоконадежных решений флеш-памяти от Macronix.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأنظمة المضمنة التي تتطلب حلول ذاكرة فلاش عالية الموثوقية من Macronix."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate Macronix''s Serial NOR Flash, Parallel NOR Flash, SLC NAND Flash, and ROM ICs into automotive, industrial, and IoT applications using MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL, and MX30LF series.","zh":"赋予代理集成宏晶的串行NOR Flash、并行NOR Flash、SLC NAND Flash和ROM IC到汽车、工业和物联网应用中，使用MX25L、MX25U、MX25R、MX25V、MX66L、MX29GL和MX30LF系列。","ja":"マクロニクスのシリアルNORフラッシュ、パラレルNORフラッシュ、SLC NANDフラッシュ、ROM ICを、MX25L、MX25U、MX25R、MX25V、MX66L、MX29GL、MX30LFシリーズを使用して、自動車、工業、IoTアプリケーションに統合するエージェントをEmpowersします。","ko":"에이전트가 매크로닉스의 시리얼 NOR 플래시, 병렬 NOR 플래시, SLC NAND 플래시 및 ROM IC를 MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL 및 MX30LF 시리즈를 사용하여 자동차, 산업 및 IoT 애플리케이션에 통합하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar los Flash Serial NOR, Flash NOR Paralelo, Flash NAND SLC y ICs ROM de Macronix en aplicaciones automotrices, industriales e IoT mediante las series MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL y MX30LF.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer les Flash NOR série, Flash NOR parallèle, Flash NAND SLC et les circuits intégrés ROM de Macronix dans les applications automobiles, industrielles et IoT en utilisant les séries MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL et MX30LF.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Macronix'' Seriell-NOR-Flash, Parallel-NOR-Flash, SLC-NAND-Flash und ROM-ICs in automotive-, industrielle- und IoT-Anwendungen mithilfe der Serien MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL und MX30LF zu integrieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes integrem a memória Flash Serial NOR, Parallel NOR Flash, SLC NAND Flash e ICs ROM da Macronix em aplicações automotivas, industriais e IoT usando as séries MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL e MX30LF.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрировать серийную флеш-память NOR, параллельную флеш-память NOR, флеш-память SLC NAND и ИС ПЗУ от Macronix в автомобильные, промышленные и приложения IoT, используя серии MX25L, MX25U, MX25R, MX25V, MX66L, MX29GL и MX30LF.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من دمج ذاكرة فلاش NOR التسلسلي وذاكرة فلاش NOR المتوازي وذاكرة فلاش SLC NAND وICs ROM من Macronix في التطبيقات السيارات والصناعية وإنترنت الأشياء باستخدام السلاسل MX25L و MX25U و MX25R و MX25V و MX66L و MX29GL و MX30LF."},"useCases":{"en":["Specifying Macronix Flash memory for embedded system designs","Validating MX25L series compatibility for industrial applications","Integrating SLC NAND Flash into IoT devices for reliable data storage"],"zh":["为嵌入式系统设计指定宏晶Flash存储","验证MX25L系列在工业应用中的兼容性","将SLC NAND Flash集成到IoT设备中以实现可靠的数据存储"],"ja":["組み込みシステム設計のためのマクロニクスフラッシュメモリの指定","工業アプリケーションでのMX25Lシリーズの互換性の検証","IoTデバイスへのSLC NANDフラッシュの統合による信頼性の高いデータストレージ"],"ko":["임베디드 시스템 설계를 위한 매크로닉스 플래시 메모리 지정","산업 애플리케이션에서 MX25L 시리즈의 호환성 검증","IoT 기기에 대한 SLC NAND 플래시 통합을 통한 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 저장"],"es":["Especificar la memoria Flash de Macronix para diseños de sistemas embebidos","Validar la compatibilidad de la serie MX25L para aplicaciones industriales","Integrar el Flash NAND SLC en dispositivos IoT para un almacenamiento de datos confiable"],"fr":["Spécifier la mémoire Flash de Macronix pour les conceptions de systèmes intégrés","Valider la compatibilité de la série MX25L pour les applications industrielles","Intégrer le Flash NAND SLC dans les appareils IoT pour un stockage de données fiable"],"de":["Spezifizierung des Macronix-Flash-Speichers für Embedded-System-Designs","Überprüfung der Kompatibilität der MX25L-Serie für industrielle Anwendungen","Integration von SLC-NAND-Flash in IoT-Geräte für zuverlässigen Datenspeicher"],"pt":["Especificar a memória Flash da Macronix para projetos de sistemas incorporados","Validar a compatibilidade da série MX25L para aplicações industriais","Integrar a memória Flash SLC NAND em dispositivos IoT para armazenamento de dados confiável"],"ru":["Указание флеш-памяти Macronix для проектов встроенных систем","Проверка совместимости серии MX25L для промышленных применений","Интеграция флеш-памяти SLC NAND в устройства IoT для надежного хранения данных"],"ar":["تحديد ذاكرة فلاش Macronix لتصاميم الأنظمة المضمنة","التحقق من توافق سلسلة MX25L للتطبيقات الصناعية","دمج ذاكرة فلاش SLC NAND في أجهزة إنترنت الأشياء لتخزين البيانات الموثوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Flash memory ICs","Specific to Macronix products","Limited to high-reliability applications"],"zh":["需要Flash存储IC的知识","特定于宏晶产品","仅限高可靠性应用"],"ja":["フラッシュメモリICの知識が必要","マクロニクス製品に特有","高信頼性アプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["플래시 메모리 IC에 대한 지식이 필요","매크로닉스 제품에 특정","고신뢰성 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ICs de memoria Flash","Específico de los productos de Macronix","Limitado a aplicaciones de alta confiabilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de circuits intégrés de mémoire Flash","Spécifique aux produits de Macronix","Limité aux applications haute fiabilité"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Flash-Speicher-ICs","Spezifisch für Macronix-Produkte","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen mit hoher Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de ICs de memória Flash","Específico para produtos da Macronix","Limitado a aplicações de alta confiabilidade"],"ru":["Требует знания ИС флеш-памяти","Конкретно для продуктов Macronix","Ограничен высоконадежными приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ICs ذاكرة الفلاش","محدد لمنتجات Macronix","محدود للتطبيقات عالية الموثوقية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shibayu36/config-file/clarify-message', 'community', 'shibayu36', 'config-file', 'shibayu36/config-file', 'clarify-message', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z', '2026-02-18T03:11:31.227Z', NULL, '{"id":"shibayu36/config-file/clarify-message","name":"clarify-message","description":{"zh":"clarify-message 技术是一种对话式整理工具，帮助开发者构建清晰的配置案","ja":"clarify-message スキルは、対話的に進めて構成案を確定するためのツールです","ko":"clarify-message 기술은 대화형으로 구성안을 만들기 위한 도구입니다","es":"La técnica de clarificar mensajes es un enfoque interactivo para organizar y estructurar contenido de manera efectiva.","fr":"La technique de clarifier les messages est une approche interactive pour organiser et structurer du contenu de manière efficace.","de":"Die Technik des Nachrichten-Klarstellens ist ein interaktiver Ansatz, um Inhalte effektiv zu organisieren und zu strukturieren.","pt":"O recurso Clarify Message ajuda a organizar mensagens de forma interativa, criando um plano de comunicação eficaz.","ru":"Инструмент Clarify Message помогает организовать сообщения интерактивным образом, создавая план эффективной коммуникации.","ar":"ميزة توضيح الرسالة تساعد في تنظيم الرسائل بطريقة تفاعلية، وإنشاء خطة اتصال فعالة.","en":"config-file"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"clarify-message 技术","ja":"clarify-message スキル","ko":"clarify-message 기술","es":"Clarificar Mensajes: Técnica de Comunicación Efectiva","fr":"Clarifier les Messages: Technique de Communication Efficace","de":"Nachrichten Klarstellen: Effektive Kommunikationstechnik","pt":"Clarifique Sua Mensagem com Este Recurso","ru":"Ясность сообщения с помощью этого инструмента","ar":" 澄م رسالتك مع هذا الأداة","en":"clarify-message"},"description":{"zh":"clarify-message 技术是一种对话式整理工具，帮助开发者构建清晰的配置案","ja":"clarify-message スキルは、対話的に進めて構成案を確定するためのツールです","ko":"clarify-message 기술은 대화형으로 구성안을 만들기 위한 도구입니다","es":"La técnica de clarificar mensajes es un enfoque interactivo para organizar y estructurar contenido de manera efectiva.","fr":"La technique de clarifier les messages est une approche interactive pour organiser et structurer du contenu de manière efficace.","de":"Die Technik des Nachrichten-Klarstellens ist ein interaktiver Ansatz, um Inhalte effektiv zu organisieren und zu strukturieren.","pt":"O recurso Clarify Message ajuda a organizar mensagens de forma interativa, criando um plano de comunicação eficaz.","ru":"Инструмент Clarify Message помогает организовать сообщения интерактивным образом, создавая план эффективной коммуникации.","ar":"ميزة توضيح الرسالة تساعد في تنظيم الرسائل بطريقة تفاعلية، وإنشاء خطة اتصال فعالة.","en":"config-file"},"definition":{"en":"config-file"},"features":{"zh":["对话式整理","实时反馈","用户语言优先","构建清晰的配置案"],"ja":["対話的に進める","フィードバックをもらいつつ進める","ユーザーの言葉を大切にする","構成案を確定する"],"ko":["대화형으로 진행","실시간 피드백","사용자 언어 우선","구성안을 확정"],"es":["Enfoque interactivo para la clarificación de mensajes","Identificación del público objetivo y sus necesidades","Estructuración efectiva del contenido","Mejora de la comprensión y el impacto de los mensajes","Flexibilidad y adaptabilidad en el proceso de clarificación"],"fr":["Approche interactive pour la clarification des messages","Identification du public cible et de ses besoins","Structuration efficace du contenu","Amélioration de la compréhension et de l''impact des messages","Flexibilité et adaptabilité dans le processus de clarification"],"de":["Interaktiver Ansatz für die Klarstellung von Nachrichten","Identifizierung des Zielpublikums und seiner Bedürfnisse","Effektive Strukturierung des Inhalts","Verbesserung des Verständnisses und der Wirkung von Nachrichten","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit im Klarstellungsprozess"],"pt":["Organização interativa de mensagens","Criação de plano de comunicação eficaz","Consideração do público-alvo e do objetivo da mensagem","Coleta de informações e esclarecimento de dúvidas","Desenvolvimento de uma estrutura clara para a mensagem"],"ru":["Интерактивная организация сообщений","Создание плана эффективной коммуникации","Учет целевой аудитории и цели сообщения","Сбор информации и разъяснение сомнений","Разработка ясной структуры для сообщения"],"ar":["تنظيم تفاعلي للرسائل","إنشاء خطة اتصال فعالة","الاعتبار الجمهور المستهدف وغرض الرسالة","جمع المعلومات وتوضيح الشكوك","تطوير هيكل واضح للرسالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["clarify-message 技术","对话式整理","配置案构建","开发工具","开发效率","技术文档"],"ja":["clarify-message スキル","対話的に進める","構成案を確定","開発ツール","開発効率","テクニカルドキュメント"],"ko":["clarify-message 기술","대화형으로 진행","구성안을 만드는","개발 도구","개발 효율","기술 문서"],"es":["clarificar mensajes","técnica de comunicación","comunicación efectiva","estructuración de contenido","comprensión de mensajes","impacto de los mensajes","enfoque interactivo","publico objetivo"],"fr":["clarifier les messages","technique de communication","communication efficace","structuration de contenu","compréhension des messages","impact des messages","approche interactive","public cible"],"de":["Nachrichten klarstellen","Kommunikationstechnik","effektive Kommunikation","Inhaltsstrukturierung","Verständnis von Nachrichten","Wirkung von Nachrichten","interaktiver Ansatz","Zielpublikum"],"pt":["clarify message","organização de mensagens","comunicação eficaz","plano de comunicação","interação","publico-alvo","objetivo da mensagem"],"ru":["clarify message","организация сообщений","эффективная коммуникация","план коммуникации","интерактивность","целевая аудитория","цель сообщения"],"ar":["توضيح الرسالة","تنظيم الرسائل","اتصال فعال","خطة الاتصال","التفاعل","الجمهور المستهدف","غرض الرسالة"]}},"owner":"shibayu36","repo":"config-file","repoPath":"shibayu36/config-file","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clarify-message","description":"伝えたいことを明確にし、構成案を一緒に作り上げるファシリテーター。記事、プレゼン、ドキュメントなどコンテンツの種類を問わず汎用的に使える。ユーザーが「伝えたいことを整理したい」「構成を考えたい」「アウトラインを作りたい」「メッセージを明確にしたい」と言った時に使う。実際の執筆・ドラフト作成は行わず、構成案の確定までを担当する。","bodyPreview":"# Clarify Message\n\n伝えたいことを対話的に整理し、構成案を一緒に作り上げる。\n\n## 重要な原則\n\n- **対話的に進める**: 一方的に提案せず、常にフィードバックをもらいながら進める\n- **ユーザーの言葉を大切にする**: ユーザーの表現をそのまま活かす\n- **実際の執筆はしない**: このスキルは構成案を確定するところまで\n\n## ワークフロー\n\n### フェーズ1: 目的ヒアリング（必須・最初に必ず行う）\n\n以下の2点を必ず確認する：\n\n1. **誰に向けた内容か**（読者・聞き手のペルソナ）\n   - どんな人？背景知識は？立場は？\n2. **読後/聞いた後にどんなアクションを起こしてほしいか**\n   - 理解してほしい？行動してほしい？考えを変えてほしい？\n\n### フェーズ2: 素材ヒアリング\n\n- ユーザーに伝えたいことを自由に話してもらう\n- 足りない情報や曖昧な点を質問で深掘りする\n- 理解できない固有名詞や概念については、ユーザーに質問して理解を深める\n- 「他に伝えたいことはありますか？」で漏れを確認\n\n### フェーズ3: 構成案ヒアリ","body":"# Clarify Message\n\n伝えたいことを対話的に整理し、構成案を一緒に作り上げる。\n\n## 重要な原則\n\n- **対話的に進める**: 一方的に提案せず、常にフィードバックをもらいながら進める\n- **ユーザーの言葉を大切にする**: ユーザーの表現をそのまま活かす\n- **実際の執筆はしない**: このスキルは構成案を確定するところまで\n\n## ワークフロー\n\n### フェーズ1: 目的ヒアリング（必須・最初に必ず行う）\n\n以下の2点を必ず確認する：\n\n1. **誰に向けた内容か**（読者・聞き手のペルソナ）\n   - どんな人？背景知識は？立場は？\n2. **読後/聞いた後にどんなアクションを起こしてほしいか**\n   - 理解してほしい？行動してほしい？考えを変えてほしい？\n\n### フェーズ2: 素材ヒアリング\n\n- ユーザーに伝えたいことを自由に話してもらう\n- 足りない情報や曖昧な点を質問で深掘りする\n- 理解できない固有名詞や概念については、ユーザーに質問して理解を深める\n- 「他に伝えたいことはありますか？」で漏れを確認\n\n### フェーズ3: 構成案ヒアリング（対話的に）\n\n1. 大まかな構成の方向性を2〜3案提案 → フィードバックをもらう\n2. 選ばれた方向性で、各セクションの内容を一緒に詰めていく\n3. 順番や強調点を調整\n4. 「この構成でいいですか？」と確認しながら進める\n\n### フェーズ4: 構成案確定\n\n最終的な構成案を以下の形式でまとめて提示する：\n\n```markdown\n# 構成案: [タイトル]\n\n## 目的\n- **対象読者**: [誰に向けた内容か]\n- **期待するアクション**: [読後にどうなってほしいか]\n\n## 構成\n### 1. [セクション名]\n- 伝えること: ...\n- ポイント: ...\n\n### 2. [セクション名]\n- 伝えること: ...\n- ポイント: ...\n\n（以下続く）\n\n## 補足メモ\n- [執筆時に気をつけること、トーンなど]\n```\n\n## 注意事項\n\n- 各フェーズで十分な確認を取ってから次に進む\n- ユーザーが「もう十分」と言ったらフェーズをスキップしてよい\n- 構成案は押し付けず、複数案から選んでもらう形で進める\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:11:31.227Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude or LangChain requiring advanced dialogue management and content clarification capabilities.","zh":"适用于像 Claude 或 LangChain 这样的对话式代理，需要高级对话管理和内容阐明能力。","ja":"Claude または LangChain のような会話エージェントに適しており、対話管理とコンテンツの明確化の高度な機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude 또는 LangChain과 같은 대화형 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 대화 관리 및 콘텐츠澄清 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversación como Claude o LangChain que requieren capacidades avanzadas de gestión de diálogo y clarificación de contenido.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de conversation comme Claude ou LangChain nécessitant une gestion de dialogue avancée et des capacités de clarification de contenu.","de":"Ideal für Conversational Agents wie Claude oder LangChain, die erweiterte Dialogverwaltungs- und Inhaltsklärungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conversação como Claude ou LangChain que exigem capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de diálogo e esclarecimento de conteúdo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разговорных агентов, таких как Claude или LangChain, требующих продвинутых возможностей управления диалогами и уточнения контента.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المتحدثين مثل Claude أو LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانات متقدمة لإدارة الحوار وتوضيح المحتوى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to engage in interactive message clarification, utilizing protocols like feedback loops and user-centric dialogue, to craft compelling content proposals in config-file formats.","zh":"赋予代理以交互式消息阐明的能力，利用反馈循环和用户中心对话等协议，来制作格式为配置文件的有力的内容提案。","ja":"エージェントにフィードバックループやユーザーセントリックな対話などのプロトコルを使用して、対話形式のメッセージの明確化を可能にし、コンフィグファイル形式の強力なコンテンツ提案を作成する。","ko":"피드백 루프와 사용자 중심 대화와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 대화형 메시지 澄清을 가능하게 하여, config-file 형식의 강력한 콘텐츠 제안을 제작할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes participar en la clarificación interactiva de mensajes, utilizando protocolos como bucles de retroalimentación y diálogo centrado en el usuario, para elaborar propuestas de contenido atractivas en formatos de archivo de configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''engager dans une clarification de message interactive, en utilisant des protocoles tels que des boucles de rétroaction et un dialogue centré sur l''utilisateur, pour élaborer des propositions de contenu attrayantes au format de fichier de configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, an interaktiver Nachrichtenklärung teilzunehmen, indem Protokolle wie Rückkopplungsschleifen und benutzerzentrierter Dialog verwendet werden, um überzeugende Inhaltsvorschläge in Konfigurationsdateiformaten zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se engajarem em esclarecimento interativo de mensagens, utilizando protocolos como laços de feedback e diálogo centrado no usuário, para criar propostas de conteúdo atraentes em formatos de arquivo de configuração.","ru":"Позволяет агентам участвовать в интерактивном уточнении сообщений, используя протоколы, такие как петли обратной связи и пользовательский диалог, для создания убедительных предложений контента в форматах файлов конфигурации.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من المشاركة في توضيح رسائل تفاعلية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل حلقات التغذية الراجعة والحوار المرتكز على المستخدم، لإنشاء مقترحات محتوى مقنعة في تنسيقات ملفات التكوين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating purpose hearing for tailored content","Generating structured message outlines","Facilitating user feedback integration for refined content proposals"],"zh":["自动化定制内容的目的听取","生成结构化消息大纲","促进用户反馈集成以完善内容提案"],"ja":["カスタマイズされたコンテンツの目的の聴取を自動化する","構造化メッセージアウトラインを生成する","ユーザーフィードバックの統合を促進してコンテンツ提案を洗練する"],"ko":["맞춤형 콘텐츠 목적의 청취를 자동화하는 것","구조화된 메시지 아웃라인을 생성하는 것","사용자 피드백 통합을 촉진하여 콘텐츠 제안을 정련하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la audiencia con fines para contenido personalizado","Generación de esquemas de mensaje estructurados","Facilitación de la integración de retroalimentación del usuario para propuestas de contenido refinadas"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''audience à des fins de contenu personnalisé","Génération de plans de message structurés","Facilitation de l''intégration de la rétroaction utilisateur pour des propositions de contenu raffinées"],"de":["Automatisierung des Zweckhörens für personalisiertes Inhaltsmaterial","Erzeugung von strukturierten Nachrichtenübersichten","Erleichterung der Integration von Benutzerfeedback für verfeinerte Inhaltsvorschläge"],"pt":["Automatizar a audição de propósito para conteúdo personalizado","Gerar esboços estruturados de mensagens","Facilitar a integração de feedback do usuário para propostas de conteúdo refinadas"],"ru":["Автоматизация слушания цели для контента на заказ","Генерация структурированных черновиков сообщений","Облегчение интеграции обратной связи пользователя для усовершенствования предложений контента"],"ar":["تحسين سماع الغرض لإنشاء محتوى مخصص","توليد مسودات رسائل منظم","تسهيل دمج ملاحظات المستخدم لتقديم مقترحات محتوى محسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires iterative user feedback","Limited to content proposal generation, not actual content creation"],"zh":["需要迭代的用户反馈","仅限于内容提案的生成，而非实际内容的创建"],"ja":["ユーザーの反復的なフィードバックが必要","コンテンツ提案の生成に限定され、実際のコンテンツの作成には対応していない"],"ko":["반복적인 사용자 피드백이 필요","콘텐츠 제안의 생성에만 국한되어 실제 콘텐츠의 생성에는対応하지 않는다"],"es":["Requiere retroalimentación iterativa del usuario","Limitado a la generación de propuestas de contenido, no a la creación real de contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite une rétroaction iterative de l''utilisateur","Limité à la génération de propositions de contenu, et non à la création réelle de contenu"],"de":["Erfordert iteratives Benutzerfeedback","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Inhaltsvorschlägen, nicht auf die tatsächliche Erstellung von Inhalten"],"pt":["Exige feedback iterativo do usuário","Limitado à geração de propostas de conteúdo, não à criação real de conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует итеративной обратной связи пользователя","Ограничен генерацией предложений контента, а не реальным созданием контента"],"ar":["يتطلب ملاحظات مستخدم متكررة","محدود بالمقترحات لإنشاء المحتوى، وليس إنشاء المحتوى الفعلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
