間でコンセンサスを達成するための投票プロトコルとコンフリクト解決アルゴリズムを実装","ko":"합의 투표 스킬은 다중 에이전트 간의 합의를 달성하기 위한 투표 규약과 충돌 해결 알고리즘을 구현","es":"El Skill de Votación de Consenso implementa protocolos de votación y algoritmos de resolución de conflictos para alcanzar un consenso entre agentes","fr":"Le Skill de Vote de Consensus met en œuvre des protocoles de vote et des algorithmes de résolution de conflits pour atteindre un consensus entre agents","de":"Der Konsensabstimmung-Skill implementiert Abstimmungsprotokolle und Konfliktlösungsalgorithmen, um einen Konsens zwischen Agenten zu erreichen","pt":"A votação por consenso é uma habilidade que implementa protocolos de votação e algoritmos de resolução de conflitos para alcançar consenso entre múltiplos ag...","ru":"Консенсус-голосование - это навык, который реализует протоколы голосования и алгоритмы разрешения конфликтов для достижения консенсуса между множеством агентов","ar":"التصويت بالإجماع هو مهارة تنفذ بروتوكولات التصويت وخوارزميات حل النزاعات للوصول إلى إجماع بين وكلاء متعددين","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["收集多个代理的投票","基于专长的加权投票","冲突检测和解决","法定人数验证","决策文档"],"ja":["複数のエージェントからの投票を収集","専門知識に基づく加重投票","コンフリクトの検出と解決","法定人数の検証","意思決定文書"],"ko":["다중 에이전트의 투표 수집","전문 지식 기반의 가중치 투표","충돌 감지 및 해결","법정인원 검증","의사 결정 문서"],"es":["Recopilación de votos de múltiples agentes","Votación ponderada basada en la experiencia","Detección y resolución de conflictos","Verificación de quórum","Documentación de decisiones"],"fr":["Collecte de votes de plusieurs agents","Vote pondéré basé sur l''expertise","Détection et résolution de conflits","Vérification du quorum","Documentation des décisions"],"de":["Sammlung von Stimmen von mehreren Agenten","Gewichtete Abstimmung basierend auf der Expertise","Konflikt-Erkennung und -Lösung","Quorum-Überprüfung","Dokumentation von Entscheidungen"],"pt":["Coleta de votos de múltiplos agentes","Votação ponderada com base em expertise","Detecção e resolução de conflitos","Verificação de quórum","Documentação de decisões"],"ru":["Сбор голосов от множества агентов","Взвешенное голосование на основе экспертизы","Обнаружение и разрешение конфликтов","Проверка кворума","Документирование решений"],"ar":["جمع الأصوات من وكلاء متعددين","التصويت الموزون بالاعتماد على الخبرة","اكتشاف وحل النزاعات","التحقق من النصاب","توثيق القرارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["共识投票","投票协议","冲突解决算法","多个代理","加权投票","法定人数验证"],"ja":["コンセンサス投票","投票プロトコル","コンフリクト解決アルゴリズム","複数のエージェント","加重投票","法定人数の検証"],"ko":["합의 투표","투표 규약","충돌 해결 알고리즘","다중 에이전트","가중치 투표","법정인원 검증"],"es":["votación de consenso","protocolos de votación","resolución de conflictos","agentes autónomos","sistemas de votación","algoritmos de consenso"],"fr":["vote de consensus","protocoles de vote","résolution de conflits","agents autonomes","systèmes de vote","algorithmes de consensus"],"de":["Konsensabstimmung","Abstimmungsprotokolle","Konfliktlösung","autonome Agenten","Abstimmungssysteme","Konsens-Algorithmen"],"pt":["votação por consenso","protocolos de votação","algoritmos de resolução de conflitos","desenvolvimento de software","tomada de decisões","coleta de votos","votação ponderada","detecção de conflitos","verificação de quórum"],"ru":["консенсус-голосование","протоколы голосования","алгоритмы разрешения конфликтов","разработка программного обеспечения","принятие решений","сбор голосов","взвешенное голосование","обнаружение конфликтов","проверка кворума"],"ar":["التصويت بالإجماع","بروتوكولات التصويت","خوارزميات حل النزاعات","تطوير البرمجيات","اتخاذ القرارات","جمع الأصوات","التصويت الموزون","اكتشاف النزاعات","التحقق من النصاب"]}},"owner":"oimiragieo","repo":"agent-studio","repoPath":"oimiragieo/agent-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"consensus-voting","description":"Byzantine consensus voting for multi-agent decision making. Implements voting protocols, conflict resolution, and agreement algorithms for reaching consensus among multiple agents.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Consensus Voting Skill\n\n<identity>\nConsensus Voting Skill - Implements voting protocols and conflict resolution algorithms for reaching consensus among multiple agents with potentially conflicting recommendations.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Collecting votes from multiple agents\n- Weighted voting based on expertise\n- Conflict detection and resolution\n- Quorum verification\n- Decision documentation\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n<execution_process>\n\n### Step 1: Define Voting Parameters\n\nSet u","body":"# Consensus Voting Skill\n\n<identity>\nConsensus Voting Skill - Implements voting protocols and conflict resolution algorithms for reaching consensus among multiple agents with potentially conflicting recommendations.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Collecting votes from multiple agents\n- Weighted voting based on expertise\n- Conflict detection and resolution\n- Quorum verification\n- Decision documentation\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n<execution_process>\n\n### Step 1: Define Voting Parameters\n\nSet up the voting session:\n\n```yaml\nvoting_session:\n  topic: ''Which database to use for the new service''\n  options:\n    - PostgreSQL\n    - MongoDB\n    - DynamoDB\n  quorum: 3 # Minimum votes required\n  threshold: 0.6 # 60% agreement needed\n  weights:\n    database-architect: 2.0 # Expert gets 2x weight\n    security-architect: 1.0\n    devops: 1.5\n```\n\n### Step 2: Collect Votes\n\nGather agent recommendations:\n\n```markdown\n## Vote Collection\n\n### database-architect (weight: 2.0)\n\n- Vote: PostgreSQL\n- Rationale: Strong ACID guarantees, mature ecosystem\n- Confidence: 0.9\n\n### security-architect (weight: 1.0)\n\n- Vote: PostgreSQL\n- Rationale: Better encryption at rest, audit logging\n- Confidence: 0.8\n\n### devops (weight: 1.5)\n\n- Vote: DynamoDB\n- Rationale: Managed service, auto-scaling\n- Confidence: 0.7\n```\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Consensus\n\nApply weighted voting:\n\n```\nPostgreSQL: (2.0 * 0.9) + (1.0 * 0.8) = 2.6\nDynamoDB:   (1.5 * 0.7) = 1.05\nMongoDB:    0\n\nTotal weight: 4.5\nPostgreSQL: 2.6 / 4.5 = 57.8%\nDynamoDB:   1.05 / 4.5 = 23.3%\n\nThreshold: 60% → No clear consensus\n```\n\n### Step 4: Resolve Conflicts\n\nWhen no consensus is reached:\n\n**Strategy 1: Expert Override**\n\n- If domain expert has strong opinion (>0.8 confidence), defer to expert\n\n**Strategy 2: Discussion Round**\n\n- Ask dissenting agents to respond to majority arguments\n- Re-vote after discussion\n\n**Strategy 3: Escalation**\n\n- Present options to user with pros/cons from each agent\n- Let user make final decision\n\n### Step 5: Document Decision\n\nRecord the final decision:\n\n```markdown\n## Decision Record\n\n### Topic\n\nWhich database to use for the new service\n\n### Decision\n\nPostgreSQL\n\n### Voting Summary\n\n- PostgreSQL: 57.8% (2 votes)\n- DynamoDB: 23.3% (1 vote)\n- Consensus: NOT REACHED (below 60% threshold)\n\n### Resolution Method\n\nExpert override - database-architect (domain expert)\nhad 0.9 confidence in PostgreSQL\n\n### Dissenting Opinion\n\nDevOps preferred DynamoDB for operational simplicity.\nMitigation: Will use managed PostgreSQL (RDS) to\nreduce operational burden.\n\n### Decision Date\n\n2026-01-23\n```\n\n</execution_process>\n\n<best_practices>\n\n1. **Quorum Required**: Don''t decide without minimum participation\n2. **Weight by Expertise**: Domain experts get more influence\n3. **Document Dissent**: Record minority opinions for future reference\n4. **Clear Thresholds**: Define what constitutes consensus upfront\n5. **Escalation Path**: Have a process for unresolved conflicts\n\n</best_practices>\n</instructions>\n\n<examples>\n<usage_example>\n**Conflict Resolution Request**:\n\n```\nThe architect wants microservices but the developer prefers monolith.\nResolve this conflict.\n```\n\n**Voting Process**:\n\n```markdown\n## Voting: Architecture Style\n\n### Votes\n\n- architect: Microservices (weight 1.5, confidence 0.8)\n- developer: Monolith (weight 1.0, confidence 0.9)\n- devops: Microservices (weight 1.0, confidence 0.6)\n\n### Calculation\n\nMicroservices: (1.5 _ 0.8) + (1.0 _ 0.6) = 1.8\nMonolith: (1.0 \\* 0.9) = 0.9\n\nMicroservices: 66.7% → CONSENSUS REACHED\n\n### Decision\n\nMicroservices, with modular monolith as migration path\n\n### Dissent Mitigation\n\nStart with modular monolith, extract services incrementally\nto address developer''s maintainability concerns.\n```\n\n</usage_example>\n</examples>\n\n## Rules\n\n- Always require quorum before deciding\n- Weight votes by domain expertise\n- Document dissenting opinions for future reference\n\n## Related Workflow\n\nThis skill has a corresponding workflow for complex multi-agent scenarios:\n\n- **Workflow**: `.claude/workflows/consensus-voting-skill-workflow.md`\n- **When to use workflow**: For critical multi-agent decisions requiring Byzantine fault-tolerant consensus with Queen/Worker topology (architectural decisions, security reviews, technology selection)\n- **When to use skill directly**: For simple voting scenarios or when integrating consensus into other workflows\n\n## Workflow Integration\n\nThis skill enables decision-making in multi-agent orchestration:\n\n**Router Decision:** `.claude/workflows/core/router-decision.md`\n\n- Router spawns multiple reviewers, then uses consensus to resolve conflicts\n- Planning Orchestration Matrix triggers consensus voting for review phases\n\n**Artifact Lifecycle:** `.claude/workflows/core/skill-lifecycle.md`\n\n- Consensus voting determines artifact deprecation decisions\n- Multiple maintainers vote on breaking changes\n\n**Related Workflows:**\n\n- `swarm-coordination` skill for parallel agent spawning before voting\n- Enterprise workflows use consensus for design reviews\n- Security reviews in `.claude/workflows/enterprise/` require security-architect consensus\n\n---\n\n## Memory Protocol (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before starting:**\n\n```bash\ncat .claude/context/memory/learnings.md\n```\n\n**After completing:**\n\n- New pattern -> `.claude/context/memory/learnings.md`\n- Issue found -> `.claude/context/memory/issues.md`\n- Decision made -> `.claude/context/memory/decisions.md`\n\n> ASSUME INTERRUPTION: Your context may reset. If it''s not in memory, it didn''t happen.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:11:45.120Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent Systems needing robust conflict resolution and decision-making capabilities through consensus voting protocols.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的冲突解决和决策能力的多智能体系统，通过共识投票协议实现决策。","ja":"マルチエージェントシステムで強力な紛争解決と意思決定能力を必要とする場合に適しています。コンセンサス投票プロトコルを通じて意思決定を行います。","ko":"강력한 충돌 해결 및 의사 결정 능력이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 시스템에 적합합니다. 합의 투표 프로토콜을 통해 의사 결정이 이루어집니다.","es":"Perfecto para Sistemas de Multiagentes que necesitan una resolución de conflictos robusta y capacidades de toma de decisiones a través de protocolos de votación por consenso.","fr":"Parfait pour les Systèmes Multi-Agents ayant besoin d''une résolution de conflits robuste et de capacités de prise de décision via des protocoles de vote par consensus.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agenten-Systeme, die eine robuste Konfliktlösung und Entscheidungskapazitäten durch Konsens-Abstimmungsprotokolle benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que necessitam de resolução de conflitos robusta e capacidades de tomada de decisão por meio de protocolos de votação por consenso.","ru":"Идеально подходит для систем с несколькими агентами, требующих устойчивого разрешения конфликтов и возможностей принятия решений посредством протоколов голосования по согласию.","ar":"مثالي لنظم العامل المتعدد التي تحتاج إلى حل الصراعات بشكل قوي وقدرات اتخاذ القرارات من خلال بروتوكولات التصويت بالإجماع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to collect votes from multiple sources, apply weighted voting based on expertise, detect conflicts, and resolve them through sophisticated algorithms, ensuring quorum verification and thorough decision documentation using protocols like weighted voting and conflict detection.","zh":"赋予智能体从多个来源收集投票、根据专业知识应用加权投票、检测冲突并通过复杂算法解决冲突，确保过半数验证和彻底的决策文档记录，使用加权投票和冲突检测等协议。","ja":"エージェントに複数の情報源から投票を収集し、専門知識に基づいた加重投票を適用し、紛争を検知し、洗練されたアルゴリズムを通じて紛争を解決し、過半数の検証と徹底的な意思決定文書化を確実に行うことができます。加重投票や紛争検知などのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 정보源에서 투표를 수집하고 전문 지식에 기반한 가중 투표를 적용하며 충돌을 탐지하고 고도화된 알고리즘을 통해 충돌을 해결하고 과반수 검증 및 철저한 의사 결정 문서화를 보장합니다. 가중 투표 및 충돌 탐지 등의 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recopilar votos de múltiples fuentes, aplicar votación ponderada basada en la experiencia, detectar conflictos y resolverlos a través de algoritmos sofisticados, garantizando la verificación del quórum y la documentación exhaustiva de las decisiones utilizando protocolos como la votación ponderada y la detección de conflictos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de collecter des votes provenant de plusieurs sources, d''appliquer un vote pondéré en fonction de l''expertise, de détecter les conflits et de les résoudre grâce à des algorithmes sophistiqués, en garantissant la vérification du quorum et la documentation approfondie des décisions en utilisant des protocoles tels que le vote pondéré et la détection de conflits.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Stimmen von mehreren Quellen zu sammeln, gewichtete Abstimmung basierend auf der Expertise anzuwenden, Konflikte zu erkennen und durch fortschrittliche Algorithmen zu lösen, wodurch die Quoren-Verifizierung und eine gründliche Dokumentation der Entscheidungen unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie gewichteter Abstimmung und Konflikt-Erkennung sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar votos de múltiplas fontes, aplicar votação ponderada com base na especialização, detectar conflitos e resolvê-los por meio de algoritmos sofisticados, garantindo verificação do quórum e documentação minuciosa da decisão usando protocolos como votação ponderada e detecção de conflitos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью собирать голоса из нескольких источников, применять взвешенное голосование на основе экспертизы, обнаруживать конфликты и разрешать их посредством сложных алгоритмов, обеспечивая верификацию кворума и тщательную документацию решений с использованием протоколов, таких как взвешенное голосование и обнаружение конфликтов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية جمع الأصوات من مصادر متعددة، وتطبيق التصويت المرجح بالاستناد إلى الخبرة، وكشف النزاعات وحلها من خلال خوارزميات متقدمة، مما يضمن التحقق من النصاب القانوني والتوثيق الشامل للقرار باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التصويت المرجح وكشف النزاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating decision-making processes among multiple agents with potentially conflicting recommendations","Implementing weighted voting systems based on agent expertise for more informed decisions","Resolving conflicts and verifying quorum in multi-agent consensus voting scenarios"],"zh":["自动化具有潜在冲突建议的多个智能体之间的决策过程","基于智能体专业知识的加权投票系统的实施，以实现更明智的决策","在多智能体共识投票场景中解决冲突并验证过半数"],"ja":["潜在的な相反する提案を持つ複数のエージェント間の意思決定プロセスを自動化する","エージェントの専門知識に基づいた加重投票システムを実装し、より情報に基づいた意思決定を行う","マルチエージェントのコンセンサス投票シナリオで紛争を解決し、過半数を検証する"],"ko":["潜在적인 충돌이 있는 여러 에이전트 간의 의사 결정 과정을 자동화하는 것","에이전트의 전문 지식에 기반한 가중 투표 시스템을 구현하여 더 정보에 근거한 의사 결정を行う","멀티 에이전트의 합의 투표 시나리오에서 충돌을 해결하고 과반수를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de toma de decisiones entre múltiples agentes con recomendaciones potencialmente contradictorias","Implementar sistemas de votación ponderada basados en la experiencia del agente para tomar decisiones mejor informadas","Resolver conflictos y verificar el quórum en escenarios de votación por consenso en sistemas multiagentes"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de prise de décision entre plusieurs agents ayant des recommandations potentiellement contradictoires","Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de vote pondéré basés sur l''expertise de l''agent pour prendre des décisions mieux éclairées","Résoudre les conflits et vérifier le quorum dans les scénarios de vote par consensus dans les systèmes multi-agents"],"de":["Automatisieren von Entscheidungsprozessen zwischen mehreren Agenten mit potenziell widersprüchlichen Empfehlungen","Implementieren von gewichteten Abstimmungssystemen basierend auf der Expertise des Agenten für fundiertere Entscheidungen","Lösen von Konflikten und Überprüfen des Quorums in Konsens-Abstimmungsszenarien in Multi-Agenten-Systemen"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de tomada de decisão entre vários agentes com recomendações potencialmente conflitantes","Implementar sistemas de votação ponderada com base na especialização do agente para decisões mais informadas","Resolver conflitos e verificar quórum em cenários de votação por consenso em sistemas de múltiplos agentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы принятия решений между несколькими агентами с потенциально конфликтными рекомендациями","Реализовать системы взвешенного голосования на основе экспертизы агента для более обоснованных решений","Разрешать конфликты и верифицировать кворум в сценариях голосования по согласию в системах с несколькими агентами"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات اتخاذ القرارات بين وكلاء متعددين مع توصيات قد تكون متضاربة","تنفيذ أنظمة التصويت المرجح بالاستناد إلى خبرة الوكيل لاتخاذ قرارات أكثر إطلاعًا","حل النزاعات والتحقق من النصاب القانوني في سناريوهات التصويت بالإجماع في نظم العامل المتعدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with multiple agent systems","Dependent on accurate expertise weighting for effective decision-making","Conflict resolution algorithms may require customization for specific use cases"],"zh":["需要与多智能体系统集成","有效的决策需要准确的专业知识加权","冲突解决算法可能需要针对特定使用场景进行自定义"],"ja":["マルチエージェントシステムとの統合が必要","有効な意思決定には、正確な専門知識の加重が必要","紛争解決アルゴリズムは、特定のユースケースに合わせてカスタマイズが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 시스템과의 통합이 필요","유효한 의사 결정에는 정확한 전문 지식의 가중치가 필요","충돌 해결 알고리즘은 특정 유즈 케이스에 맞게 사용자 지정할 필요가 있을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere integración con múltiples sistemas de agentes","Depende de un pesaje preciso de la experiencia para una toma de decisiones efectiva","Los algoritmos de resolución de conflictos pueden requerir personalización para casos de uso específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec plusieurs systèmes d''agents","Dépend d''un pesage précis de l''expertise pour une prise de décision efficace","Les algorithmes de résolution de conflits peuvent nécessiter une personnalisation pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit mehreren Agentensystemen","Hängt von einer genauen Gewichtung der Expertise für eine effektive Entscheidungsfindung ab","Konfliktlösungsalgorithmen können eine Anpassung für spezifische Anwendungsfälle erfordern"],"pt":["Exige integração com sistemas de múltiplos agentes","Depende de ponderação precisa da especialização para tomada de decisão eficaz","Algoritmos de resolução de conflitos podem exigir personalização para casos de uso específicos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с системами с несколькими агентами","Зависит от точного взвешивания экспертизы для эффективного принятия решений","Алгоритмы разрешения конфликтов могут требовать настройки для конкретных случаев использования"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع نظم العامل المتعدد","يعتمد على وزن دقيق للخبرة لاتخاذ قرارات فعالة","خوارزميات حل النزاعات قد تتطلب تخصيصًا لحالات استخدام محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
